(45, 'ILN-3031', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAOAY', 'SANTA RITA', 2009, 18.04647408, '18° 2\' 47.306688\"', 120.52311370, '120° 31\' 23.209320\"', 'ILN-3031 Is located at Brgy. Sta. Rita adjacent to the approach of the bridge going to Brgy. Sideg. It is intervisible to ILN-3032. This monument was constructed together with the appearance of Kagawad Agapito Alogado. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; \"ILN-3031 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.04649006, '18° 2\' 47.364220\"', 120.52311840, '120° 31\' 23.226170\"', 0.0200, '2', 47.6040, 0.0400, '2', 10.9723, 237793.16150, 1997085.56000, '51', 18.04821898, '18° 2\' 53.588310\"', 120.52183890, '120° 31\' 18.620080\"', 15.7610, 1996164.13600, 449375.46100, '3', 237656.41900, 1997158.53100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(46, 'ILN-3033', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAOAY', 'BACSIL', 2009, 18.08873045, '18° 5\' 19.429620\"', 120.49918960, '120° 29\' 57.082560\"', 'ILN-3033 Is located at the southeast portion of Brgy. Bacsil Primary School Compound. It is just beside the fence of the said school. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; ILN-3033 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.08874725, '18° 5\' 19.490090\"', 120.49919420, '120° 29\' 57.099220\"', 0.0200, '2', 50.3110, 0.0400, '2', 13.9253, 235322.58510, 2001798.50700, '51', 18.09047916, '18° 5\' 25.724980\"', 120.49791570, '120° 29\' 52.496530\"', 18.6631, 2000847.91900, 446855.29100, '3', 235185.96900, 2001871.58600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(47, 'ILN-3034', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAOAY', 'SUBA', 2009, 18.12509936, '18° 7\' 30.357696\"', 120.51844590, '120° 31\' 6.405240\"', 'ILN-3034 Is located on the top of a hill at Brgy. Suba. It is inside the lot of Mr. Bartolome Cagat. It is approximately 200m away from the Timpuyog Learning Center. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; ILN-3034 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.12511582, '18° 7\' 30.416960\"', 120.51845060, '120° 31\' 6.422160\"', 0.0200, '2', 74.3120, 0.0400, '2', 37.9426, 237415.89680, 2005797.75200, '51', 18.12684947, '18° 7\' 36.658090\"', 120.51717290, '120° 31\' 1.822600\"', 42.7367, 2004867.70500, 448904.21800, '3', 237279.41600, 2005870.79500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(48, 'ILN-3035', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAOAY', 'NAGBACALAN', 2009, 18.11364801, '18° 6\' 49.132836\"', 120.52301660, '120° 31\' 22.859760\"', 'ILN-3035 Is located in front of welcome arc of Purok Pasaranay along provincial road. It is mounted at the center island. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; ILN-3035 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.11366464, '18° 6\' 49.192700\"', 120.52302140, '120° 31\' 22.877210\"', 0.0200, '2', 76.0170, 0.0400, '2', 39.5890, 237882.74660, 2004523.34100, '51', 18.11539751, '18° 6\' 55.431050\"', 120.52174350, '120° 31\' 18.276720\"', 44.3933, 2003599.01500, 449384.62500, '3', 237746.23100, 2004596.36100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(49, 'ILN-3036', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAOAY', 'CAYUBOG', 2009, 18.06224429, '18° 3\' 44.079444\"', 120.49502480, '120° 29\' 42.089280\"', 'ILN-3036 Is located at Brgy. Cayubog. It is inside the lot of Mr. Avelino Abuce, from the intersection, it is about 40m west of second electric post. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the insscription; ILN-3036 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.06226120, '18° 3\' 44.140330\"', 120.49502980, '120° 29\' 42.107420\"', 0.0200, '2', 42.9090, 0.0400, '2', 6.4734, 234841.80450, 1998871.87800, '51', 18.06399164, '18° 3\' 50.369910\"', 120.49375070, '120° 29\' 37.502500\"', 11.1847, 1997917.66100, 446406.38600, '3', 234705.09600, 1998944.95100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(50, 'ILN-3037', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAOAY', 'SURGUI', 2009, 18.08235600, '18° 4\' 56.481600\"', 120.53935370, '120° 32\' 21.673320\"', 'ILN-3037 Is located before the welcome arc of Brgy. Surgui, northern portion of welcome arc. It is intervisible to ILN-3038. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; \"ILN-3037 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.08237273, '18° 4\' 56.541830\"', 120.53935850, '120° 32\' 21.690720\"', 0.0200, '2', 48.2890, 0.0400, '2', 11.6768, 239566.17490, 2001035.51000, '51', 18.08410342, '18° 5\' 2.772310\"', 120.53807990, '120° 32\' 17.087690\"', 16.5240, 2000131.19200, 451104.91100, '3', 239429.56400, 2001108.45500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(51, 'ILN-3038', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAOAY', 'PASIL', 2009, 18.08851200, '18° 5\' 18.643200\"', 120.54222250, '120° 32\' 32.001000\"', 'ILN-3038 Is located within the Brgy. Pasil, It is around 15m North of the bridge and also around 10m away from the welcome marker of Surgui. It is intervisible to ILN-3037. Kgd. Roy Saducos witness the construction of monument. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm, with the incription; \"ILN-3038 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.08852868, '18° 5\' 18.703250\"', 120.54222720, '120° 32\' 32.018020\"', 0.0200, '2', 50.1850, 0.0400, '2', 13.5779, 239879.03050, 2001713.04600, '51', 18.09025967, '18° 5\' 24.934820\"', 120.54094880, '120° 32\' 27.415520\"', 18.4332, 2000811.76400, 451410.28400, '3', 239742.44300, 2001785.98700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(52, 'ILN-3040', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAOAY', 'NANGUYUDAN', 2009, 18.11489445, '18° 6\' 53.620020\"', 120.55491550, '120° 33\' 17.695800\"', 'ILN-3040 Is located on the southern portion of the waiting shed within the barangay boundary of Baay, Batac and Brgy. Nanguyudan, Paoay. It is inside the center island. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; \"ILN-3040 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.11491107, '18° 6\' 53.679840\"', 120.55492030, '120° 33\' 17.712960\"', 0.0200, '2', 75.2060, 0.0400, '2', 38.6164, 241261.83080, 2004616.21600, '51', 18.11664334, '18° 6\' 59.916030\"', 120.55364240, '120° 33\' 13.112740\"', 43.5100, 2003728.42400, 452760.97600, '3', 241125.34100, 2004689.13500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(53, 'ILN-3204', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CITY OF LAOAG', 'BGY. NO. 47, BENGCAG', 2007, 18.18774966, '18° 11\' 15.898776\"', 120.55632530, '120° 33\' 22.771080\"', 'ILN-3204 From Laoag City going to Vigan City, turn right after Gilbert Bridge and travel for about 3 km. to reach Brgy. Bengcag. Station is located N of Km. Post No. 489. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3204 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.18776552, '18° 11\' 15.955880\"', 120.55632960, '120° 33\' 22.786520\"', 0.0200, '2', 45.2800, 0.0400, '2', 8.9044, 241518.28070, 2012680.64700, '51', 18.18950207, '18° 11\' 22.207450\"', 120.55505340, '120° 33\' 18.192340\"', 13.8188, 2011791.58900, 452929.81800, '3', 241382.03600, 2012753.61500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(54, 'ILN-3209', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CITY OF LAOAG', 'BGY. NO. 52-A, SAN MATEO', 2007, 18.17349461, '18° 10\' 24.580596\"', 120.63204910, '120° 37\' 55.376760\"', 'ILN-3209 From Laoag City proper, travel E along the Nat\'l. Highway for about 5 km until reaching Km. Post No. 492 at Brgy. San Mateo. From the said Km. post, turn left and continue traveling for about 50 m until reaching the station. Station is located at the NW corner of a bridge, 3 m from station ILN-3208. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm x 20 cm x 2 cm cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILN-3209 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.17351065, '18° 10\' 24.638330\"', 120.63205370, '120° 37\' 55.393300\"', 0.0200, '2', 55.5510, 0.0400, '2', 18.6922, 249511.46830, 2010997.33100, '51', 18.17524475, '18° 10\' 30.881110\"', 120.63077730, '120° 37\' 50.798320\"', 23.8618, 2010195.92300, 460937.45200, '3', 249375.22800, 2011070.04500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(55, 'ILN-3211', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CITY OF LAOAG', 'BGY. NO. 39, SANTA ROSA', 2007, 18.16940773, '18° 10\' 9.867828\"', 120.54308330, '120° 32\' 35.099880\"', 'ILN-3211 From Laoag City Proper, travel along the Nat\'l. Highway for about 1 km. going to the Mun. of San Nicolas then turn left going to the direction of the Laoag Int\'l. Airport. Continue traveling for about 1 km. and take a left turn taking the route going to Fort Ilocandia then turn right until reaching Brgy. Santa Rosa. Station is located 1 m. NE of the basketball court, 3 m. NE of the brgy. road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3211 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.16942373, '18° 10\' 9.925420\"', 120.54308780, '120° 32\' 35.116200\"', 0.0200, '2', 42.7030, 0.0400, '2', 6.3465, 240089.74100, 2010668.54900, '51', 18.17115948, '18° 10\' 16.174110\"', 120.54181120, '120° 32\' 30.520420\"', 11.2135, 2009764.98900, 451523.85800, '3', 239953.42500, 2010741.54600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(56, 'ILN-3217', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAOAY', 'SUBA', 2007, 18.13390754, '18° 8\' 2.067144\"', 120.54276560, '120° 32\' 33.956160\"', 'ILN-3217 From Paoay Town Proper, travel N for about 10 km. to reach Brgy. Suba. Station is located 15 m. NE of Suba Brgy. Welcome Arch, 9 m. NW of a waiting shed. In addition, it is also situated at the W corner of the junction approx. 400 m. from station ILN-3216. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3217 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.13392354, '18° 8\' 2.124760\"', 120.54277030, '120° 32\' 33.973210\"', 0.0200, '2', 82.6470, 0.0400, '2', 46.1864, 240003.58900, 2006738.40200, '51', 18.13565719, '18° 8\' 8.365900\"', 120.54149290, '120° 32\' 29.374510\"', 51.0422, 2005835.90700, 451480.38400, '3', 239867.15500, 2006811.37300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(57, 'ILN-3223', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAOAY', 'SANTA RITA', 2007, 18.05587413, '18° 3\' 21.146868\"', 120.52172110, '120° 31\' 18.195960\"', 'ILN-3223 From Paoay Town Proper going to the direction of the Mun. of Currimao before reaching the Evangelista Elem. School, turn left and travel for about 150 m. to reach the station. Station is located about 6 m. S the Day Care Center and the Santa Rita Brgy. Hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3223 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.05589053, '18° 3\' 21.205890\"', 120.52172560, '120° 31\' 18.212270\"', 0.0200, '2', 44.8680, 0.0400, '2', 8.2710, 237659.60690, 1998128.36500, '51', 18.05762003, '18° 3\' 27.432090\"', 120.52044640, '120° 31\' 13.606950\"', 13.0589, 1997204.95700, 449230.72400, '3', 237522.89500, 1998201.34800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(58, 'ILN-3226', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CITY OF BATAC', 'BIL-LOCA', 2007, 18.08849088, '18° 5\' 18.567168\"', 120.56784750, '120° 34\' 4.251000\"', 'ILN-3226 From Batac Town Proper, travel for about 4 km. to reach Brgy. Bil-loca. Station is located inside the Bil-loca Elem. School, N of the basketball court. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3226 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.08850713, '18° 5\' 18.625670\"', 120.56785200, '120° 34\' 4.267050\"', 0.0200, '2', 56.1180, 0.0400, '2', 19.3585, 242592.35040, 2001674.68800, '51', 18.09023758, '18° 5\' 24.855280\"', 120.56657350, '120° 33\' 59.664680\"', 24.3047, 2000802.75900, 454122.65500, '3', 242455.78000, 2001747.54600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(59, 'ILN-3232', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CITY OF BATAC', 'NAGBACALAN', 2007, 18.01806008, '18° 1\' 5.016288\"', 120.53683810, '120° 32\' 12.617160\"', 'ILN-3231 From Batac Town Proper, travel S for about 4 km. until reaching Brgy. Magnuang. Station is located 500 m. from the Magnuang Brgy. Welcome Arch and station ILN-3230, NE corner of the bridge and 4 m. N from the brgy. road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3231 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.09127786, '18° 5\' 28.600280\"', 120.59517190, '120° 35\' 42.618740\"', 0.0200, '2', 68.3070, 0.0400, '2', 31.3862, 245489.15600, 2001943.51800, '51', 18.09300789, '18° 5\' 34.828390\"', 120.59389350, '120° 35\' 38.016750\"', 36.4373, 2001102.77700, 457015.14100, '3', 245352.61500, 2002016.28900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(60, 'ILS-3012', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 'CALAY-AB', 2007, 17.64516798, '17° 38\' 42.604728\"', 120.35835790, '120° 21\' 30.088440\"', 'ILS-3012 From Vigan, travel north along the national highway to reach San Ildefonso town proper. Travel past the municipal hall then turn left at the road in between the town market and gym. Continue traveling to reach barangay Calay-ab. Station is located near the end of the former pier about 5m SW of Tersing store and videoke. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3012, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 17.57520433, '17° 34\' 30.735590\"', 120.38703510, '120° 23\' 13.326470\"', 0.0200, '2', 50.2240, 0.0300, '2', 14.0663, 222650.79040, 1945099.41500, '51', 17.57690811, '17° 34\' 36.869180\"', 120.38574460, '120° 23\' 8.680450\"', 17.1855, 1944045.76900, 434795.22200, '3', 222512.36500, 1945172.47400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(61, 'ILS-3050', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF VIGAN', 'RUGSUANAN', 2010, 17.56563598, '17° 33\' 56.289528\"', 120.41742250, '120° 25\' 2.721000\"', 'ILS-3050 Constructed approximately 45 meters back of barangay plaza around 15 meters west of electric post at barangay Rugsuanan, Vigan City. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3050, PRS-92, DENR-FNSP R-1.', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 17.56564988, '17° 33\' 56.339580\"', 120.41742530, '120° 25\' 2.731170\"', 0.0200, '2', 44.0170, 0.0300, '2', 7.5792, 225863.91610, 1943997.29200, '51', 17.56735244, '17° 34\' 2.468780\"', 120.41613460, '120° 24\' 58.084500\"', 10.8748, 1942978.06900, 438018.04000, '3', 225725.48100, 1944070.24600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(62, 'ILS-3088', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF VIGAN', 'CABALANGEGAN', 2008, 17.56270821, '17° 33\' 45.749556\"', 120.39503190, '120° 23\' 42.114840\"', 'ILS-3088 Constructed along a Paddy Farm road around 30m from a crossing beside the house of Andres Pinol inside the lot of barangay Captain Manayan of Barangay Cabalangegan, Vigan City, Ilocos Sur. Mark in the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; ILS-3088 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 17.56272243, '17° 33\' 45.800760\"', 120.39503440, '120° 23\' 42.123850\"', 0.0200, '2', 42.1480, 0.0300, '2', 5.9090, 223481.36300, 1943705.66200, '51', 17.56442529, '17° 33\' 51.931050\"', 120.39374360, '120° 23\' 37.476820\"', 9.0503, 1942661.57500, 435639.94900, '3', 223342.90100, 1943778.68600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(63, 'ILS-3089', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF VIGAN', 'PANTAY LAUD', 2008, 17.56694883, '17° 34\' 1.015788\"', 120.35425030, '120° 21\' 15.301080\"', 'ILS-3089 Constructed along a barangay road beside a fishpond around 4m behind a nipa hut on a Paddy rice field at Barangay Pantay Laud Vigan City, Ilocos Sur. Mark in the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; ILS-3089 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 17.56696368, '17° 34\' 1.069240\"', 120.35425250, '120° 21\' 15.309010\"', 0.0200, '2', 39.4130, 0.0300, '2', 3.5155, 219156.37480, 1944235.22100, '51', 17.56866766, '17° 34\' 7.203580\"', 120.35296170, '120° 21\' 10.662140\"', 6.4269, 1943145.36800, 431312.00900, '3', 219017.89800, 1944308.38000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(64, 'ILS-3090', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF VIGAN', 'PANTAY DAYA', 2010, 17.58028064, '17° 34\' 49.010304\"', 120.37607220, '120° 22\' 33.859920\"', 'ILS-3090 Constructed approximate 65m from south approach of Vigan City & Sta. Catalina Bridge located at Pantay Daya Vigan City, Ilocos Sur. Mark in the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30 cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; ILS-3090 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 17.58029519, '17° 34\' 49.062680\"', 120.37607460, '120° 22\' 33.868650\"', 0.0200, '2', 41.7040, 0.0300, '2', 5.6475, 221494.53760, 1945679.18500, '51', 17.58199950, '17° 34\' 55.198210\"', 120.37478420, '120° 22\' 29.223000\"', 8.7081, 1944613.03300, 433633.56700, '3', 221356.12200, 1945752.28400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(65, 'ILS-3092', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF VIGAN', 'PONG-OL', 2008, 17.54742798, '17° 32\' 50.740728\"', 120.36505850, '120° 21\' 54.210600\"', 'ILS-3092 Constructed beside an electric light of a basketball court at barangay Pong-ol Vigan City. Mark in the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; ILS-3092 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 17.54744241, '17° 32\' 50.792660\"', 120.36506070, '120° 21\' 54.218490\"', 0.0200, '2', 40.3550, 0.0300, '2', 4.3601, 220274.31340, 1942057.70000, '51', 17.54914499, '17° 32\' 56.921960\"', 120.36376950, '120° 21\' 49.570040\"', 7.2804, 1940980.92400, 432452.13400, '3', 220135.77900, 1942130.81000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(66, 'ILS-3093', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF VIGAN', 'SAN PEDRO', 2010, 17.55136994, '17° 33\' 4.931784\"', 120.35359260, '120° 21\' 12.933360\"', 'ILS-3093 Contructed behind a bleacher of a basketball court approximately 4m from foot of post of a basketball board located at Barangay San Pedro Sur, Vigan City. Mark in the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; ILS-3093 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 17.55138454, '17° 33\' 4.984340\"', 120.35359470, '120° 21\' 12.941010\"', 0.0200, '2', 40.1580, 0.0300, '2', 4.2532, 219062.45610, 1942511.14200, '51', 17.55308760, '17° 33\' 11.115370\"', 120.35230360, '120° 21\' 8.292840\"', 7.1236, 1941421.36500, 431236.25900, '3', 218923.92600, 1942584.29200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(67, 'ILN-3225', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CITY OF BATAC', 'PAYAO', 2007, 18.06796595, '18° 4\' 4.677420\"', 120.56134600, '120° 33\' 40.845600\"', 'BM LN-168 Station is located 40m. S of kilometer post KM 471; 10 m. E of national road centerline 20m. NE of Park 30m. SE of Petron Gasoline Station. Station is located NE approach of Bantay Bridge top of conc. approach set 0.25m. above the ground. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set on a drilled hole and cemented on top of a 15x15 cm. cement putty with the inscription LN-168, 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Gravity', 2015.83, 18.00857530, '18° 0\' 30.871090\"', 120.57449900, '120° 34\' 28.196290\"', 0.0200, '2', 114.6760, 0.0400, '2', 77.6278, 243180.03990, 1992815.57800, '51', 18.01030087, '18° 0\' 37.083130\"', 120.57321870, '120° 34\' 23.587350\"', 82.5864, 1991954.36100, 454805.62700, '3', 243043.20700, 1992888.35500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(68, 'ILN-1', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PASUQUIN', 'CARUAN', 1991, 18.39475961, '18° 23\' 41.134596\"', 120.59695140, '120° 35\' 49.025040\"', 'ILN-1 Is on an open ground NE of Pasuquin town. Travel time from Pasuquin town proper is approx. 5 min. It is approx. 200 m. N 45° W of Caraun concrete bridge; 75 m. W of the national highway and NW of the 2 aroma trees; about 8.2 km. N of Pasuquin Municipal Hall. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in standard concrete block, 0.7 m. deep, flushed with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. Sub-surface mark is a bottle set in concrete block, 0.806 m. below station mark. Reference marks is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in concrete blocks, 0.6 m. deep, flushed with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name.', 2015, 'Zero Order', 2015.75, 18.39477591, '18° 23\' 41.193260\"', 120.59695540, '120° 35\' 49.039570\"', 0.0100, '1', 41.9470, 0.0200, '0', 6.0664, 246119.45650, 2035543.66500, '51', 18.39652375, '18° 23\' 47.485500\"', 120.59568410, '120° 35\' 44.462780\"', 11.0689, 2034693.68500, 457278.88200, '3', 245983.93500, 2035616.65100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2015-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(69, 'ARA-25', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'DINGALAN', 'IBONA', 2006, 15.28791448, '15° 17\' 16.492128\"', 121.37842930, '121° 22\' 42.345480\"', 'ARA-25 From Dingalan Proper, travel S for about 30 min. (16 km.) to Brgy. Ibona. Station is located inside the brgy. plaza beside the NE side of the solar drier. It is about 8.6 m. SE of the N corner, about 11.8 m. NW of the S corner, about 60 m. NE of the mun. extension office, about 30 m. SE from the road centerline and NW of the basketball court. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block and flushed with the said drier, with inscriptions \"ARA-25 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Zero Order', 2015.75, 15.28791655, '15° 17\' 16.499590\"', 121.37842900, '121° 22\' 42.344360\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.6670, 0.0100, '0', 8.0707, 325884.30530, 1690821.02500, '51', 15.28945731, '15° 17\' 22.046320\"', 121.37708640, '121° 22\' 37.511040\"', 10.2049, 1690865.02700, 540499.52900, '3', 325739.03800, 1690888.98700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2015-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(70, 'ARA-26', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'DINALUNGAN', 'POBLACION', 2006, 16.14028573, '16° 8\' 25.028628\"', 121.95676450, '121° 57\' 24.352200\"', 'ARA-26 Is located at the Dinalungan Municipal Hall compound, between the mun. hall/bldg. and M. L. Quezon St. It is situated 20 m. W of the said hall, 10 m. NW of the flagpole and 1 m. N of the concrete pavement fronting the flagpole. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"ARA-26 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Zero Order', 2015.75, 16.14028886, '16° 8\' 25.039890\"', 121.95676330, '121° 57\' 24.348010\"', 0.0100, '1', 51.9580, 0.0100, '0', 8.5498, 388455.43580, 1784735.76900, '51', 16.14187077, '16° 8\' 30.734780\"', 121.95544170, '121° 57\' 19.590230\"', 10.6476, 1785381.31500, 602192.97400, '3', 388313.46500, 1784802.64400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2015-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(71, 'ZBS-3', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SANTA CRUZ', 'GAMA', 1989, 15.80564066, '15° 48\' 20.306376\"', 119.92470530, '119° 55\' 28.939080\"', 'ZBS-3 Is accessible for all types of vehicles. It\'s about 5 min. drive from Sta. Cruz proper to Gama Elementary School and from this school, drive for about 350 m., then turn rigth eastward. Station is approx. 1.2 km. SE of the national road and barrio road intersection. It is at the SE end of E irrigation canal headwall. Station mark is a cross-cut on top of 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. x 0.70 m. concrete block flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. Sub-surface mark ZBS-3 with 7-up bottle neck embedded on 15 cm. concrete foundation of irrigation canal covered with sand; 0.01 cm. deep. Reference mark RM-1, RM-3 & RM-4 are 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. brass rods with cement patties embedded on top of irrigation canal headwall. RM-2 is a concrete monument 25 cm. x 25 cm. x 60 cm. dia.', 2015, 'Zero Order', 2015.75, 15.80564317, '15° 48\' 20.315420\"', 119.92470510, '119° 55\' 28.938200\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.5010, 0.0100, '0', 4.9001, 813336.16410, 1749616.51500, '50', 15.80724874, '15° 48\' 26.095460\"', 119.92337270, '119° 55\' 24.141580\"', 9.1027, 1748414.80200, 384652.40300, '3', 813195.11600, 1749685.55000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2015-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(72, 'ZBS-67', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN NARCISO', 'DALLIPAWEN', 2007, 14.99363062, '14° 59\' 37.070232\"', 120.12069880, '120° 7\' 14.515680\"', 'ZBS-67 The mark is located in Barangay DALLIPAWEN, San Narciso, Zambales. It is situated 2 m S of the bridge and 3 m E of the Barangay Road, The bridge is about 300 m N of the National Road leading to San Marcelino, Zambales. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-67, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Zero Order', 2015.75, 14.99363199, '14° 59\' 37.075180\"', 120.12070290, '120° 7\' 14.530270\"', 0.0300, '3', 67.1730, 0.1000, '0', 23.6814, 190331.23060, 1659635.91200, '51', 14.99518199, '14° 59\' 42.655170\"', 120.11935160, '120° 7\' 9.665710\"', 26.9124, 1658460.10200, 405283.93000, '3', 190183.88200, 1659707.68800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2015-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(73, 'CGY-117', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANTA ANA', 'SAN VICENTE', 2007, 18.50892958, '18° 30\' 32.146488\"', 122.15013350, '122° 9\' 0.480600\"', 'CGY-117 From Santa Ana Proper, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Brgy. San Vicente. Follow the road until reaching Santa Ana Mun. Fishport, which is at the end of the road and right side after the Naval forces compound. Station is located on the NE corner of the port bldg.\'s platform. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-117 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Zero Order', 2015.75, 18.50895063, '18° 30\' 32.222260\"', 122.15014740, '122° 9\' 0.530790\"', 0.0100, '1', 39.5230, 0.0200, '0', 3.5701, 410291.35980, 2046706.56800, '51', 18.51067256, '18° 30\' 38.421200\"', 122.14888120, '122° 8\' 55.972420\"', 5.3115, 2047665.64800, 621319.45700, '3', 410157.27700, 2046774.73000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(74, 'CGY-60', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUAO', 'ANGANG', 2007, 17.68097098, '17° 40\' 51.495528\"', 121.49413820, '121° 29\' 38.897520\"', 'CGY-60 Is located on the NE corner of the Brgy. Angang solar dryer. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-60 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2015, 'Zero Order', 2015.75, 17.68098644, '17° 40\' 51.551180\"', 121.49414600, '121° 29\' 38.925670\"', 0.0200, '0', 78.3640, 0.0200, '0', 39.5340, 340287.06350, 1955529.24300, '51', 17.68267296, '17° 40\' 57.622640\"', 121.49285960, '121° 29\' 34.294380\"', 43.0064, 1955712.96400, 552287.50800, '3', 340149.79600, 1955598.84100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(75, 'PNG-2', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'ARNEDO', 1989, 16.39322867, '16° 23\' 35.623212\"', 119.88169360, '119° 52\' 54.096960\"', 'PNG-2 Is approx. 900 m. W of Bolinao Port; about 1.3 km. W from the intersection of national road and A. Celina St. Station is located at the middle W end of concrete fishpond dike in the School of Fisheries compound. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. brass rod set on top of the middle W end of concrete fishpond dike with cement patty. Inscribed on top PNG-2 1989 NAMRIA. RMs 1, 2, 3 & 4 are 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods with cement patties and arrows pointing to the station, set on top of concrete fishpond dike. RM 3 set on the NW corner of building with cement patty with arrow pointing to PNG-2 station.', 2015, 'Zero Order', 2015.75, 16.39323379, '16° 23\' 35.641650\"', 119.88169110, '119° 52\' 54.088090\"', 0.0100, '1', 41.7520, 0.0200, '0', 2.8800, 807816.27910, 1814619.50700, '50', 16.39487672, '16° 23\' 41.556200\"', 119.88037240, '119° 52\' 49.340800\"', 6.2333, 1813469.34800, 380397.42700, '3', 807676.99900, 1814689.07000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(76, 'PNG-4', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ROSALES', 'CARMAY EAST', 1989, 15.91126435, '15° 54\' 40.551660\"', 120.64172020, '120° 38\' 30.192720\"', 'PNG-4 Station was set on top W irrigation canal headwall; about 3 kms. E of Rosales town proper; 500 m. NW of Brgy. Carmay East and 10 km. W of Sta. Maria. It is accessible for all types of vehicles. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set on top center of W irrigation canal headwall with cement patty and inscribed on top \"PNG-004 1989 NAMRIA\". Reference marks (RM) is 4, RMs are 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods set in drilled holes with cement patty and inscribed with RM numbers.', 2015, 'Zero Order', 2015.75, 15.91126808, '15° 54\' 40.565100\"', 120.64172360, '120° 38\' 30.204900\"', 0.0100, '1', 74.9810, 0.0200, '0', 33.3246, 247512.25080, 1760545.48600, '51', 15.91286449, '15° 54\' 46.312150\"', 120.64039460, '120° 38\' 25.420490\"', 36.1604, 1759838.61200, 461494.40100, '3', 247368.43200, 1760616.37300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2015-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(77, 'ILS-3038', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF CANDON', 'CATERMAN', 2010, 17.22134009, '17° 13\' 16.824324\"', 120.42092150, '120° 25\' 15.317400\"', 'ILS-3038 It is located along southern part of barangay road going to barangay Cabaroan near the welcome arc of barangay Cabaroan around 5 meters east of marker. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3038, PRS-92, DENR-FNS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.17, 17.22135203, '17° 13\' 16.867300\"', 120.42092220, '120° 25\' 15.319800\"', 0.0100, '1', 42.9560, 0.0300, '2', 5.1561, 225721.99550, 1905870.88200, '51', 17.22303380, '17° 13\' 22.921690\"', 120.41962340, '120° 25\' 10.644380\"', 8.7102, 1904872.29600, 438273.02300, '3', 225582.40300, 1905943.56100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(78, 'ILS-3039', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF CANDON', 'TALOGTOG', 2007, 17.20548154, '17° 12\' 19.733544\"', 120.43218030, '120° 25\' 55.849080\"', 'ILS-3039 It is located on the northern part of the basketball court of barangay Talogtog inside the lot of barangay hall of Candon City. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3039, PRS-92, DENR-FNS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.17, 17.20549334, '17° 12\' 19.776010\"', 120.43218100, '120° 25\' 55.851490\"', 0.0100, '1', 43.8170, 0.0300, '2', 5.7670, 226896.70270, 1904099.07200, '51', 17.20717391, '17° 12\' 25.826080\"', 120.43088190, '120° 25\' 51.174800\"', 9.4940, 1903113.61100, 439465.30900, '3', 226757.06500, 1904171.70200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(79, 'ILS-3040', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF CANDON', 'DARAPIDAP', 2007, 17.19707389, '17° 11\' 49.466004\"', 120.42582120, '120° 25\' 32.956320\"', 'ILS-3040 It is located along barangay road going to Candon Beach Resort around 2 kilometers from national highway beside a digital post about 40 meters from an entrance of a house with Indian tree at barangay Darapidap, Candon City, Ilocos Sur. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3040, PRS-92, DENR-FNS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.17, 17.19708563, '17° 11\' 49.508270\"', 120.42582190, '120° 25\' 32.958780\"', 0.0100, '1', 42.3670, 0.0300, '2', 4.3712, 226207.62040, 1903177.15900, '51', 17.19876583, '17° 11\' 55.557000\"', 120.42452260, '120° 25\' 28.281360\"', 8.0327, 1902185.13300, 438786.11500, '3', 226067.95000, 1903249.80300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(80, 'ILS-3042', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF CANDON', 'PATPATA PRIMERO', 2007, 17.15520766, '17° 9\' 18.747576\"', 120.43303700, '120° 25\' 58.933200\"', 'ILS-3042 It is located beside barangay road and Patpata 2nd Day Care Center. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3042, PRS-92, DENR-FNS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.17, 17.15521906, '17° 9\' 18.788610\"', 120.43303700, '120° 25\' 58.933160\"', 0.0100, '1', 42.5250, 0.0400, '2', 4.2272, 226914.08340, 1898531.53200, '51', 17.15689658, '17° 9\' 24.827670\"', 120.43173670, '120° 25\' 54.252270\"', 8.0412, 1897549.44100, 439539.93600, '3', 226774.27700, 1898604.11900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(81, 'ILS-3044', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF CANDON', 'OAIG-DAYA', 2007, 17.17727757, '17° 10\' 38.199252\"', 120.45958200, '120° 27\' 34.495200\"', 'It is located about 150 meters east of Oaig Daya Elementary School at a crossing of barangay road and feeder going to barangay Parioc beside electric post on top of a culvert box of an irrigation canal at barangay Oaig Daya, Candon City, Ilocos Sur. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3044, PRS-92, DENR-FNS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.17, 17.17728923, '17° 10\' 38.241220\"', 120.45958200, '120° 27\' 34.495180\"', 0.0100, '1', 49.3370, 0.0300, '2', 10.7462, 229771.61490, 1900937.91000, '51', 17.17896751, '17° 10\' 44.283030\"', 120.45828230, '120° 27\' 29.816270\"', 14.8589, 1899983.82100, 442371.12500, '3', 229631.90300, 1901010.42800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(82, 'ILS-3046', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF CANDON', 'BAGANI TOCGO', 2007, 17.18486027, '17° 11\' 5.496972\"', 120.46353410, '120° 27\' 48.722760\"', 'ILS-3046 It is located along provincial highway/road going to Municipality of Galimuyod about 35 meters west of the Municipal Boundary of Galimuyod and Candon City at Bagani Togo, Candon City, Ilocos Sur. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3046, PRS-92, DENR-FNSP R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.17, 17.18487200, '17° 11\' 5.539190\"', 120.46353420, '120° 27\' 48.723100\"', 0.0100, '1', 53.5780, 0.0300, '2', 14.9603, 230203.23120, 1901771.94500, '51', 17.18655065, '17° 11\' 11.582340\"', 120.46223470, '120° 27\' 44.044840\"', 19.1143, 1900821.83000, 442793.92300, '3', 230063.54800, 1901844.45600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(83, 'ILS-3049', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF CANDON', 'CALAOAAN', 2007, 17.16542643, '17° 9\' 55.535148\"', 120.44104190, '120° 26\' 27.750840\"', 'ILS-3049 It is located inside the compound of the City Hall of Candon City around 12 meters east of the entrance gate. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3049, PRS-92, DENR-FNS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.17, 17.16543802, '17° 9\' 55.576870\"', 120.44104190, '120° 26\' 27.750710\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.4860, 0.0300, '2', 7.1154, 227781.07170, 1899651.71000, '51', 17.16711598, '17° 10\' 1.617530\"', 120.43974190, '120° 26\' 23.070710\"', 11.0152, 1898677.88600, 440394.92300, '3', 227641.30600, 1899724.28000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(84, 'CGY-22 (BLLM-1)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PEÑABLANCA', 'CENTRO', 1995, 17.62531935, '17° 37\' 31.149660\"', 121.78665330, '121° 47\' 11.951880\"', 'CGY-22 (BLLM-1) Is in the island of Luzon, province of Cagayan, municipality of Peñablanca, Brgy. Centro. It is about 100 m. ESE of Peñablanca Municipal Hall and 0.70 m. NW of the E corner of the road junction national highway and Taguinod St. Mark is the center of 1/2\" sq. x 8\" steel bolt set flush on the concrete pavement with inscription, \"BLLM No. 1\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.62533477, '17° 37\' 31.205160\"', 121.78666230, '121° 47\' 11.984360\"', 0.0100, '1', 83.5950, 0.0100, '2', 44.3159, 371276.45940, 1949147.57200, '51', 17.62701170, '17° 37\' 37.242110\"', 121.78537500, '121° 47\' 7.350170\"', 47.3559, 1949657.88900, 583347.40900, '3', 371139.22500, 1949216.20300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(85, 'CGY-3201', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PEÑABLANCA', 'CABBO', 2007, 17.59265767, '17° 35\' 33.567612\"', 121.80747060, '121° 48\' 26.894160\"', 'CGY-3201 From Tuguegarao, follow the road leading to Peñablanca. From the junction fronting the Tuguegarao Capitol bldg., turn right and travel for about 800 m. to reach the power station. Turn left and follow the main rough road. Travel for about 8 km. to reach Brgy. Cabbo. Take the road to the right going to Brgy. Bical and travel until reaching the Y-road. Turn left and travel for about 150 m. to reach the first street and turn left again. Station is located at the basketball court, which is about 100 m. from the minor road. It is about 14 m. N of the S side and about 7 m. E of the W side of the basketball court. Mark is the head of a copper nail flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3201 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.59267267, '17° 35\' 33.621610\"', 121.80747970, '121° 48\' 26.927080\"', 0.0100, '1', 85.4670, 0.0100, '2', 45.9627, 373462.49430, 1945519.42100, '51', 17.59434719, '17° 35\' 39.649870\"', 121.80619180, '121° 48\' 22.290300\"', 49.0726, 1946052.08500, 585572.07700, '3', 373325.16800, 1945587.96100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(86, 'CGY-3208', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'BASI WEST', 2007, 17.66945152, '17° 40\' 10.025472\"', 121.69516210, '121° 41\' 42.583560\"', 'CGY-3208 From Buntun Bridge, turn right at the junction going to the Mun. of Solana. Upon reaching another junction, turn right and travel for about 6 km. to reach Brgys. Basi East and Basi West. Station is located inside Basi Elem. School, about 20 m. N of the shed, which is on the N edge of the school gate. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-3208 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.66946721, '17° 40\' 10.081970\"', 121.69517050, '121° 41\' 42.613890\"', 0.0100, '1', 60.5620, 0.0100, '2', 21.8490, 361602.44330, 1954095.68400, '51', 17.67114876, '17° 40\' 16.135530\"', 121.69388410, '121° 41\' 37.982820\"', 24.6848, 1954504.65100, 573619.64200, '3', 361465.28600, 1954164.63800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(87, 'CGY-3731', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PEÑABLANCA', 'CABBO', 2007, 17.60413060, '17° 36\' 14.870160\"', 121.80372700, '121° 48\' 13.417200\"', 'CGY-3731 From junction fronting Tuguegarao Capital Bldg., turn left on barangay road leading to Brgy. Cabbo about 8 Km. Take road to the right leading to Brgy. Bical. The station is in Brgy. Cabbo, Peñablanca, Cagayan. It is located 3.8 m SW of shed, 2.5 m from electric post. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete block set 0.20 m above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3731, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.60414519, '17° 36\' 14.922690\"', 121.80373690, '121° 48\' 13.452670\"', 0.0100, '1', 77.6940, 0.0100, '2', 38.2467, 373073.30580, 1946791.37500, '51', 17.60582048, '17° 36\' 20.953740\"', 121.80244910, '121° 48\' 8.816810\"', 41.3456, 1947320.18700, 585169.42100, '3', 372936.01400, 1946859.93600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2020-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(88, 'CGY-3732', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PEÑABLANCA', 'SISIM', 2007, 17.62752598, '17° 37\' 39.093528\"', 121.81333220, '121° 48\' 47.995920\"', 'CGY-3732 Station is located at the left side of the road going to Brgy. San Roque, Peñablanca, 60 m SW of Sisim Elem. school, and Community center. From the junction Provincial road leading to Brgy. Cabbo which is beside the Napocor compound, travel about 5.50 Km. up to the junction at Brgy. Cabbo, about 100 m after Cabbo nat\'l High School, turn left and the brgy. road will lead to Brgy. Sisim. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete block set, 0.20 m above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3732, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.62754139, '17° 37\' 39.149000\"', 121.81334130, '121° 48\' 48.028850\"', 0.0100, '1', 86.6540, 0.0100, '2', 47.2107, 374108.71730, 1949373.78300, '51', 17.62921788, '17° 37\' 45.184380\"', 121.81205420, '121° 48\' 43.395010\"', 50.3580, 1949914.01000, 586177.81900, '3', 373971.51000, 1949442.33200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(89, 'CGY-3747', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ENRILE', 'BARANGAY III', 2007, 17.55797136, '17° 33\' 28.696896\"', 121.69054340, '121° 41\' 25.956240\"', 'CGY-3747 Travel along Nat\'l Road going to N direction, turn right to the junction of Enrile, follow the Mun. Road upon reaching the first intersection after the bridge turn right. The station is along the road SE of Mr. Eduardo Cahocom residence, in front of Trinidad Basabas residence and 1 block away NW of Brgy. Capt. Juan Aggabao residence. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block set, 20 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3747, 2007, NAMRIA\"', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.55798627, '17° 33\' 28.750570\"', 121.69055170, '121° 41\' 25.986200\"', 0.0100, '1', 62.1750, 0.0100, '2', 23.1826, 361027.15090, 1941763.09500, '51', 17.55966119, '17° 33\' 34.780300\"', 121.68926270, '121° 41\' 21.345790\"', 25.9496, 1942164.39700, 573174.22300, '3', 360889.62300, 1941831.97800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
