(90, 'CGY-3748', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ENRILE', 'LANNA', 2007, 17.54366069, '17° 32\' 37.178484\"', 121.72090700, '121° 43\' 15.265200\"', 'CGY-3748 Station is in Brgy. Naruang, Enrile, Cagayan. It is located 50 m W of Rangho residence. Travel along Mun. Road going to Brgy. Lanna take right road that leads to Brgy. Naruang. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument set, 20 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3748, 2007, NAMRIA\"', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.54367566, '17° 32\' 37.232380\"', 121.72091560, '121° 43\' 15.296100\"', 0.0100, '1', 69.1650, 0.0100, '2', 30.0097, 364239.47740, 1940157.60600, '51', 17.54534907, '17° 32\' 43.256660\"', 121.71962630, '121° 43\' 10.654680\"', 32.8207, 1940592.41700, 576403.85000, '3', 364101.92500, 1940226.38100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(91, 'CGY-3749', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ENRILE', 'LANNA', 2007, 17.54636989, '17° 32\' 46.931604\"', 121.71855740, '121° 43\' 6.806640\"', 'CGY-3749 Station is in Brgy. Naruang, Enrile, Cagayan. Travel along Mun. Road going to Brgy. Lanna, take the road going to right direction that leads to the station. Station is 15 m NW of bridge and approx. 4 Km. from Mun. Hall. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block set, 20 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3749, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.54638465, '17° 32\' 46.984730\"', 121.71856560, '121° 43\' 6.836300\"', 0.0100, '1', 59.9920, 0.0100, '2', 20.8550, 363992.04420, 1940459.04600, '51', 17.54805828, '17° 32\' 53.009790\"', 121.71727640, '121° 43\' 2.195090\"', 23.6620, 1940891.30400, 576153.21600, '3', 363854.49900, 1940527.83100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(92, 'CGY-3751', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ENRILE', 'MARRACURU', 2007, 17.55906469, '17° 33\' 32.632884\"', 121.75993790, '121° 45\' 35.776440\"', 'CGY-3751 From Enrile Mun. Bldg. follow Mun. Road going to left direction passing Brgy. Lanna, Magalalag until you reach Brgy. Maracuru. Station is located at Maracuru Elem. School 3 m away from the flagpole. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete block set, 0.20 m above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3751, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.55907995, '17° 33\' 32.687830\"', 121.75994650, '121° 45\' 35.807430\"', 0.0100, '1', 63.7080, 0.0100, '2', 24.4008, 368393.84220, 1941834.66800, '51', 17.56075346, '17° 33\' 38.712460\"', 121.75865760, '121° 45\' 31.167530\"', 27.3195, 1942313.36700, 580541.25500, '3', 368256.37000, 1941903.33200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(93, 'CGY-3752', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ENRILE', 'LEMU SUR', 2007, 17.52682958, '17° 31\' 36.586488\"', 121.77155500, '121° 46\' 17.598000\"', 'CGY-3752 Station is in Brgy. Lemu Sur, Enrile, Cagayan. It is located at Lemu Sur Nat\'l High School, N of flagpole and NW of basketball court. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block set, 20 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3752, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.52684446, '17° 31\' 36.640060\"', 121.77156390, '121° 46\' 17.630060\"', 0.0100, '1', 65.9610, 0.0100, '2', 26.5064, 369603.89130, 1938259.73400, '51', 17.52851578, '17° 31\' 42.656790\"', 121.77027430, '121° 46\' 12.987540\"', 29.4410, 1938750.52300, 581789.03400, '3', 369466.32100, 1938328.33700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(94, 'CGY-3753', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ENRILE', 'LEMU SUR', 2007, 17.53347198, '17° 32\' 0.499128\"', 121.77116050, '121° 46\' 16.177800\"', 'CGY-3753 From Enrile Town Hall, travel along MUn. Road passing Brgy. Lanna, Magalalag, Maracuru, Inga, Lemu Norte, until you reach the station. Station is in the compound of JHS Chapel. Approx. 12 m from the gate, 3 m NE of basketball court. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 1.00 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete block set, 0.20 m above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3753, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.53348707, '17° 32\' 0.553450\"', 121.77116920, '121° 46\' 16.209290\"', 0.0100, '1', 66.8200, 0.0100, '2', 27.3842, 369566.74270, 1938995.02100, '51', 17.53515879, '17° 32\' 6.571650\"', 121.76987980, '121° 46\' 11.567330\"', 30.3223, 1939485.54900, 581744.16700, '3', 369429.19500, 1939063.63000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(95, 'CGY-3758', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'BASI EAST', 2007, 17.66681403, '17° 40\' 0.530508\"', 121.69408350, '121° 41\' 38.700600\"', 'CGY-3758 Station is located at the E of Provincial Road going to Amulung West, 300 m S of Basi East Elem. school or CGY-3208 and 15 m NW of the shed. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block set, 20 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3758, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.66682981, '17° 40\' 0.587320\"', 121.69409200, '121° 41\' 38.731260\"', 0.0100, '1', 60.3210, 0.0100, '2', 21.6049, 361486.01520, 1953804.63000, '51', 17.66851122, '17° 40\' 6.640390\"', 121.69280550, '121° 41\' 34.099960\"', 24.4379, 1954212.32900, 573506.27400, '3', 361348.84800, 1953873.58600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(96, 'CGY-4510 (AIC-11)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUGUEGARAO CITY', 'CARIG', 2010, 17.64666756, '17° 38\' 48.003216\"', 121.75948830, '121° 45\' 34.157880\"', 'CGY-4510-AIC-11 From Tuguegarao City travel along Pan-Philippine highway towards Iguig upon reaching Linao-Carig road turn right on the next national road heading to the Provincial Capitol of Cagayan where the station is located.Station mark is the head of an umbrella nail flushed at the center of a 10cm. x 10cm. x 30 cm concrete monument with inscription \"AIC-11; 2010; DENR/LMS-11.\"', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.64668250, '17° 38\' 48.057000\"', 121.75949770, '121° 45\' 34.191570\"', 0.0100, '1', 100.8470, 0.0100, '2', 61.7892, 368409.67900, 1951528.46000, '51', 17.64836129, '17° 38\' 54.100650\"', 121.75821080, '121° 45\' 29.559010\"', 64.7420, 1952008.94800, 580455.01000, '3', 368272.49500, 1951597.19400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(97, 'CGY-4851 (BLLM-31)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'IGUIG', 'BAYO', 2012, 17.69030091, '17° 41\' 25.083276\"', 121.75115680, '121° 45\' 4.164480\"', 'CGY-4851 (BLLM-31) From the national road going to Aparri turn and the monument is located 2 m east portion of the Brgy. Arc. Station mark is the head of a silver zinc rod set at the center of 25cm x 25cm x 130cm monument with inscription \"IGUIG CGY, BLLM-31, CAD 1283-D, DENR 2012.\"', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.69031652, '17° 41\' 25.139460\"', 121.75116580, '121° 45\' 4.196740\"', 0.0100, '1', 59.8400, 0.0100, '2', 20.9486, 367557.67720, 1956362.55900, '51', 17.69199813, '17° 41\' 31.193250\"', 121.74987990, '121° 44\' 59.567740\"', 23.8959, 1956834.83900, 579551.77500, '3', 367420.62900, 1956431.35300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(98, 'CGY-4854 (BLLM-34)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'IGUIG', 'SANTA TERESA', 2012, 17.70335724, '17° 42\' 12.086064\"', 121.74850430, '121° 44\' 54.615480\"', 'CGY-4854 (BLLM-34) The station is located 2 m south of waiting shed. It is also 3 m north of m post 0490. Station mark is the head of a silver zinc rod set at the center of 25cm x 25cm x 130cm monument with inscription \"IGUIG CGY, BLLM-34, CAD 1283-D, DENR 2012.\"', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.70337276, '17° 42\' 12.141950\"', 121.74851340, '121° 44\' 54.648330\"', 0.0100, '1', 61.2360, 0.0100, '2', 22.3913, 367285.94710, 1957809.15500, '51', 17.70505521, '17° 42\' 18.198760\"', 121.74722790, '121° 44\' 50.020410\"', 25.3404, 1958278.79100, 579264.68800, '3', 367148.94000, 1957877.96800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(99, 'CGY-56', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUGUEGARAO CITY', 'DADDA', 2007, 17.56871662, '17° 34\' 7.379832\"', 121.77518450, '121° 46\' 30.664200\"', 'CGY-56 Is located near the NE concrete corner fence of Brgy. Dadda Catholic Church and at the intersection of the nat\'l. highway and Cagurangan St. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-56 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.56873148, '17° 34\' 7.433310\"', 121.77519330, '121° 46\' 30.695900\"', 0.0100, '1', 74.3350, 0.0100, '2', 34.9665, 370019.07060, 1942892.12400, '51', 17.57040524, '17° 34\' 13.458860\"', 121.77390470, '121° 46\' 26.056910\"', 37.9410, 1943388.08400, 582155.65100, '3', 369881.64100, 1942960.74800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(100, 'CGY-62', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PEÑABLANCA', 'DODAN', 2007, 17.64585318, '17° 38\' 45.071448\"', 121.79767310, '121° 47\' 51.623160\"', 'CGY-62 Station is located inside the compound of Dodan Elem. School. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-62 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.64586830, '17° 38\' 45.125880\"', 121.79768220, '121° 47\' 51.655800\"', 0.0100, '1', 74.2870, 0.0100, '2', 34.9986, 372460.14830, 1951412.18400, '51', 17.64754624, '17° 38\' 51.166450\"', 121.79639540, '121° 47\' 47.023390\"', 38.0877, 1951935.41000, 584507.42500, '3', 372322.98900, 1951480.79700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(101, 'CGY-64', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'IGUIG', 'GAMMAD', 2007, 17.70797148, '17° 42\' 28.697328\"', 121.74447110, '121° 44\' 40.095960\"', 'CGY-64 (BLLM 35) Station is located inside the school compound of Gammad Annex of Iguig National High School approximately 4.5 km south from Iguig municipal hall. It is adjacent to a concrete walkway about 30 m from the western concrete fence of the school, approximately 20 m north of the of the southwest (SW) classroom and 15 m south of the northwest (NW) classroom. Station is the head of a 3\" copper nail set at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete protruding about 20 cm above the ground and with inscription \"CGY64, 2007 , NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.33, 17.70798707, '17° 42\' 28.753450\"', 121.74448000, '121° 44\' 40.127880\"', 0.0100, '1', 60.3350, 0.0100, '2', 21.5198, 366861.56570, 1958322.59600, '51', 17.70966988, '17° 42\' 34.811570\"', 121.74319450, '121° 44\' 35.500320\"', 24.4640, 1958787.81900, 578834.80100, '3', 366724.57100, 1958391.42500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(102, 'LUN-12', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'CARLATAN', 1997, 16.63375051, '16° 38\' 1.501836\"', 120.31035110, '120° 18\' 37.263960\"', 'LUN-12 To reach the station, travel N along the national road from San Fernando town proper to Brgy. Carlatan and turn left on a service road leading to the Philippine National Police Headquarters (CAMP DIEGO SILANG). Station is located within the PNP Headquarters, about 15.0 m. S of the Provincial Director\'s House and 13.0 m. SW of their cadet training center. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 0.1 m. x 0.1 m. cement putty with inscription \"LUN-12 1996 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.17, 16.63375829, '16° 38\' 1.529850\"', 120.31035230, '120° 18\' 37.268190\"', 0.0100, '1', 44.4550, 0.0300, '2', 4.5684, 213066.22530, 1840969.14700, '51', 16.63540668, '16° 38\' 7.464060\"', 120.30903970, '120° 18\' 32.543010\"', 8.6392, 1839881.96300, 426282.89400, '3', 212924.56800, 1841041.71500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(103, 'LUN-23', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'APALENG', 2001, 16.60780574, '16° 36\' 28.100664\"', 120.36549750, '120° 21\' 55.791000\"', 'LUN-23 Is in the province of La Union, municipality of San Fernando, Brgy. Apaleng. Station mark is the head of 2\" copper nail embedded on a 0.30 m. x 0.30 m. x 1.0 m. standard concrete monument with inscriptions \"LUN-23 NAMRIA\". Station is intervisible to station LUN-22.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.17, 16.60781350, '16° 36\' 28.128600\"', 120.36549960, '120° 21\' 55.798710\"', 0.0100, '1', 281.3660, 0.0300, '2', 240.8168, 218915.10990, 1838018.20400, '51', 16.60945904, '16° 36\' 34.052560\"', 120.36418660, '120° 21\' 51.071790\"', 245.3371, 1836991.11100, 432157.49600, '3', 218773.41400, 1838090.56600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(104, 'LUN-24', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'SIBOAN-OTONG', 2001, 16.56894705, '16° 34\' 8.209380\"', 120.37690490, '120° 22\' 36.857640\"', 'LUN-24 Is in the province of La Union, municipality of Naguillan, Brgy. Masicong. Station mark is the head of 4\" concrete nail drilled and centered on a 8\" x 8\" concrete monument set on a ground surface with inscription \"NAMRIA, LUN-24. Note: Station is intervisible to station LUN-25.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.17, 16.56895429, '16° 34\' 8.235440\"', 120.37690680, '120° 22\' 36.864320\"', 0.0100, '1', 98.2390, 0.0300, '2', 57.3798, 220076.62200, 1833699.79600, '51', 16.57059725, '16° 34\' 14.150090\"', 120.37559280, '120° 22\' 32.134050\"', 62.0624, 1832686.88500, 433361.21700, '3', 219934.80000, 1833772.09500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(105, 'LUN-25', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'MASICONG', 2001, 16.56948399, '16° 34\' 10.142364\"', 120.37868230, '120° 22\' 43.256280\"', 'LUN-25 From San Fernando city, travel S direction up to Bauang Junction, then travel SE going to Naguillan, turn left after Luguit Bridge going to Masicong passing thru Brgy. Lablaban accessible only by 4 wheel drive vehicle. Station mark is the head of a 4\" concrete nail drilled and centered on a 8\" x 8\" standard concrete monument set on the ground surface with inscription \"NAMRIA, LUN-25\"', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.17, 16.56949156, '16° 34\' 10.169620\"', 120.37868360, '120° 22\' 43.260910\"', 0.0100, '1', 93.0420, 0.0300, '2', 52.1664, 220267.12470, 1833756.80400, '51', 16.57113451, '16° 34\' 16.084250\"', 120.37736960, '120° 22\' 38.530690\"', 56.8628, 1832745.75000, 433551.03900, '3', 220125.30600, 1833829.09700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(106, 'LUN-7', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'PORO', 1994, 16.62157256, '16° 37\' 17.661216\"', 120.28231400, '120° 16\' 56.330400\"', 'LUN-7 (PCP-124) From the Municipality of San Fernando, travel W to Brgy. Poro for about 5 km. up to the Wallace Air Station. Ask for permission to enter the compound since it is a restricted area for civilians. The station is located at the Province of La Union, Municipality of San Fernando, Brgy. Poro, inside the Wallace Air Station compound. The station is on the SE corner of the intersection of V-shaped concrete canal and pathwalk, SW of the Medical/Infirmary building. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on a drilled hole and flushed to a cement putty with inscription \"LUN-7, 1994, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.17, 16.62158021, '16° 37\' 17.688750\"', 120.28231600, '120° 16\' 56.337520\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.4050, 0.0300, '2', 12.6734, 210055.09600, 1839661.17500, '51', 16.62322846, '16° 37\' 23.622460\"', 120.28100310, '120° 16\' 51.611190\"', 16.6193, 1838544.84600, 423286.75700, '3', 209913.37600, 1839733.82500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(107, 'PNG-3026', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'M. SORIANO', 2007, 15.92577886, '15° 55\' 32.803896\"', 120.34759540, '120° 20\' 51.343440\"', 'PNG-3026 The station is located at the Poblacion Plaza about 3 meters west on the fountain. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3026; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.92578198, '15° 55\' 32.815130\"', 120.34759770, '120° 20\' 51.351810\"', 0.0100, '1', 51.9510, 0.0200, '2', 9.2385, 216024.04230, 1762530.34900, '51', 15.92738576, '15° 55\' 38.588720\"', 120.34626870, '120° 20\' 46.567210\"', 13.8870, 1761521.78800, 430004.29700, '3', 215880.03000, 1762602.20600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(108, 'PNG-3032', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'POBLACION', 2007, 16.11800275, '16° 7\' 4.809900\"', 120.00995610, '120° 0\' 35.841960\"', 'PNG-3032 The station is located inside the Cabatuan Elementary School about 5 meters N of the stage and 1 meter from the gate. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3032; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.11800672, '16° 7\' 4.824190\"', 120.00995590, '120° 0\' 35.841380\"', 0.0100, '1', 60.7930, 0.0200, '2', 19.0777, 180155.28750, 1784307.12200, '51', 16.11962985, '16° 7\' 10.667450\"', 120.00863100, '120° 0\' 31.071480\"', 24.1269, 1782938.23200, 393952.12900, '3', 180011.65000, 1784380.24400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(109, 'PNG-3121', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGALDAN', 'LANAS', 2008, 16.07340871, '16° 4\' 24.271356\"', 120.38258550, '120° 22\' 57.307800\"', 'PNG-3121 The station is situated on the right shoulder of the road going to Brgy. Lanas proper coming from Brgy. Maasin. It is approximately 40m NE of the waiting shed. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm, with inscription \"PNG-3121 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.07341429, '16° 4\' 24.291460\"', 120.38258480, '120° 22\' 57.305410\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.9630, 0.0200, '2', 4.1044, 219978.08610, 1778827.84000, '51', 16.07502650, '16° 4\' 30.095410\"', 120.38125930, '120° 22\' 52.533420\"', 8.2593, 1777847.19500, 433799.54100, '3', 219834.59900, 1778899.70800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(110, 'PNG-3179', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'PANTAL', 2008, 15.99079881, '15° 59\' 26.875716\"', 120.20775510, '120° 12\' 27.918360\"', 'From Bugallon town proper, travel northward and then turn left from the intersection going to Alaminos road, approximately 2 km. from the intersection, turn right until reaching the barangay police outpost of Pantal, Bugallon. It is located in front of the barangay tanod outpost, 11.66 meters SW of the flagpole and 5 meters NW of CENPELCO electric post. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3179, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.99080138, '15° 59\' 26.884970\"', 120.20775650, '120° 12\' 27.923340\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.0580, 0.0100, '2', 4.1509, 201138.78040, 1769925.18000, '51', 15.99241228, '15° 59\' 32.684200\"', 120.20642880, '120° 12\' 23.143580\"', 9.5286, 1768769.24200, 415058.15100, '3', 200994.87200, 1769997.54900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(111, 'PNG-3181', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'BANAGA', 2008, 15.99138625, '15° 59\' 28.990500\"', 120.22869310, '120° 13\' 43.295160\"', 'From Municipal Hall of Bugallon travel along the highway northward and turn right upon reaching the crossing, just after the Bugallon bridge, turn right at the crossing with approximately 400 meter from the national road where the PRS-92 monument is located, just in front of the main gate of Paaralang Elementarya ng Banaga. On the opposite side of the road and 6.53 meters NW of concrete post and electric post. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3181, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.99138905, '15° 59\' 29.000590\"', 120.22869470, '120° 13\' 43.300840\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.4000, 0.0100, '2', 4.5426, 203382.21680, 1769960.23200, '51', 15.99299953, '15° 59\' 34.798300\"', 120.22736700, '120° 13\' 38.521220\"', 9.8216, 1768825.78400, 417299.68500, '3', 203238.32800, 1770032.53300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(112, 'PNG-3229', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'ANTIPANGOL', 2008, 15.93162579, '15° 55\' 53.852844\"', 120.27248940, '120° 16\' 20.961840\"', 'PNG-3229 Station mark is located inside Antipangol Barangay plaza. The mark is 8 m S of the barangay Chapel and 30 cm from the concrete fence. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3229, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.93162842, '15° 55\' 53.862310\"', 120.27249120, '120° 16\' 20.968250\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.9490, 0.0200, '2', 4.9144, 207986.19880, 1763281.40500, '51', 15.93323421, '15° 55\' 59.643150\"', 120.27116220, '120° 16\' 16.183790\"', 10.0846, 1762195.57100, 421964.47200, '3', 207842.14400, 1763353.51100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(113, 'PNG-3230', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'ILANG', 2008, 15.92496564, '15° 55\' 29.876304\"', 120.34884480, '120° 20\' 55.841280\"', 'PNG-3230 Station mark is located at the southern part of CABA bridge 2.5 m from the edge, 1.5 m S from the signboard and 30 cm W of the flower box. It can be found in front of the disco bar.Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m cement putty with inscription \"PNG-3230 PRS\'92 2008 DENR-LMS R-1\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.92496898, '15° 55\' 29.888330\"', 120.34884650, '120° 20\' 55.847530\"', 0.0100, '1', 51.3780, 0.0200, '2', 8.6691, 216156.68260, 1762438.63700, '51', 15.92657268, '15° 55\' 35.661630\"', 120.34751750, '120° 20\' 51.062860\"', 13.3085, 1761431.40100, 430137.73100, '3', 216012.66800, 1762510.48900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(114, 'PNG-3232', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'TARECE', 2008, 15.94633331, '15° 56\' 46.799916\"', 120.37208530, '120° 22\' 19.507080\"', 'PNG-3232 A 10-15 MINUTES TRAVEL WESTWARD GOING TO BRGY. TARECE FROM SAN CARLOS TOWN PROPER ON ANY KIND OF VEHICLE. THE STATION MARK IS LOCATED S OF THE WAITING SHED. IT IS ABOUT 1 M SE OF THE STREET LIGHT AND 10 M S FROM THE SOUTHERN STRIP OF THE SAID SHED. STATION MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4\" COPPER NAIL ON A 0.40 M X 0.40 M CONCRETE MONUMENT WITH INSCRIPTION PNG-3232, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.94633643, '15° 56\' 46.811140\"', 120.37208700, '120° 22\' 19.513040\"', 0.0100, '1', 50.8160, 0.0200, '2', 8.3481, 218676.20730, 1764772.80500, '51', 15.94794095, '15° 56\' 52.587410\"', 120.37075840, '120° 22\' 14.730280\"', 12.7544, 1763788.20600, 432633.39100, '3', 218532.28400, 1764844.59900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(115, 'PNG-3233', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'ANO', 2008, 15.95439123, '15° 57\' 15.808428\"', 120.38815760, '120° 23\' 17.367360\"', 'PNG-3233 Starting at San Carlos Municipal Hall travel westward the route going to Sta. Barbara or Calasiao. The station is located near the bridge. It\'s just in between the polcie community precinct no. 3 and waiting shed. It is about 3 m SW from the eastern fence of PCP # 3 and 4 m NE from the western edge of the waiting shed. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3233, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.95439471, '15° 57\' 15.820940\"', 120.38815920, '120° 23\' 17.373230\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.1510, 0.0200, '2', 9.8227, 220408.98500, 1765643.31200, '51', 15.95599938, '15° 57\' 21.597750\"', 120.38683090, '120° 23\' 12.591230\"', 14.0747, 1764674.76000, 434356.79100, '3', 220265.10200, 1765715.06100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(116, 'PNG-3235', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'SAPINIT', 2008, 15.91322874, '15° 54\' 47.623464\"', 120.37844250, '120° 22\' 42.393000\"', 'PNG-3235 To reach the station travel 10-20 minutes eastward routing to Malasiqui beginning at San Carlos city proper. Turn right after reaching the junction going to Brgy. Mapinit. The station is located near the barangay hall. It is about 15 m E of the said hall and 3 m W from the centerline of the road. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3235, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.91323189, '15° 54\' 47.634790\"', 120.37844420, '120° 22\' 42.399230\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.4900, 0.0200, '2', 9.9068, 219311.11560, 1761099.13300, '51', 15.91483420, '15° 54\' 53.403120\"', 120.37711490, '120° 22\' 37.613710\"', 14.3135, 1760122.83800, 433303.01000, '3', 219167.08600, 1761170.87800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(117, 'PNG-3236', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'MALACAÑANG', 2008, 15.88514957, '15° 53\' 6.538452\"', 120.33573570, '120° 20\' 8.648520\"', 'PNG-3236 From San Carlos City proper, travel SW along the provincial road going to Urbiztondo. Turn left at barangay Malacañang going to Brgy. Balite Sur. Stop at Malacañang bridge, it is located at the left shoulder of the bridge. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3236, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.88515247, '15° 53\' 6.548880\"', 120.33573770, '120° 20\' 8.655720\"', 0.0100, '1', 51.4470, 0.0200, '2', 8.4658, 214696.11730, 1758048.20500, '51', 15.88675396, '15° 53\' 12.314270\"', 120.33440770, '120° 20\' 3.867630\"', 13.2897, 1757029.79400, 428719.96400, '3', 214551.95800, 1758120.06600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(118, 'PNG-3275', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINMALEY', 'SABANGAN', 2008, 15.98571523, '15° 59\' 8.574828\"', 120.26867990, '120° 16\' 7.247640\"', 'PNG-3275 From the municipal town plaza travel NW around 4-6 km about 150 minutes on any kind of vehicle, turn right at the intersection to reach the barangay Buenlag and then turn left to reach Sabangan Elementary School. The station is located in front of the concrete fence and 12 m SE of the electric post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3275, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.05735540, '16° 3\' 26.479440\"', 120.30401780, '120° 18\' 14.463930\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.5730, 0.0200, '2', 3.2900, 211544.27330, 1777157.85900, '51', 16.05896833, '16° 3\' 32.285990\"', 120.30269170, '120° 18\' 9.690220\"', 8.0111, 1776097.01700, 425387.10300, '3', 211400.66800, 1777229.97000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(119, 'PNG-3280', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'BALOCOC', 2008, 15.99712991, '15° 59\' 49.667676\"', 120.22426260, '120° 13\' 27.345360\"', 'PNG-3280 Travel SE around 6-8 km at about 15-20 minutes any kind of vehicle (route going to Bugallon) from Lingayen town proper to reach Barangay Balococ. The station is located along the national road and near a church. It is about 15 m W of the church and 8 m E of the centerline of the road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3280, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.99713279, '15° 59\' 49.678040\"', 120.22426420, '120° 13\' 27.351060\"', 0.0100, '1', 49.1590, 0.0100, '2', 6.3208, 202916.19270, 1770602.54200, '51', 15.99874372, '15° 59\' 55.477380\"', 120.22293660, '120° 13\' 22.571910\"', 11.6087, 1769463.17900, 416827.82300, '3', 202772.31900, 1770674.86200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(120, 'PNG-3282', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'CAPANDANAN', 2008, 16.02395095, '16° 1\' 26.223420\"', 120.19983760, '120° 11\' 59.415360\"', 'PNG-3282 From the municipal town plaza travel westward on the route going to Alaminos City, just after the Domalandan bridge, turn right going to Barangay Balangobong, just go ahead and turn right to reach the barangay hall, straight ahead and turn left until reaching the intersection wherein a tricycle waiting area will be reach, turn left for a 100 m from the intersection and reach the Capandanan Barangay Auditorium, it is located on the left side of the corner of the CHB fence of barangay lot and exactly 2 m SW of a concrete post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3282, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.02395434, '16° 1\' 26.235610\"', 120.19983890, '120° 11\' 59.419970\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.7930, 0.0100, '2', 4.0466, 200340.27630, 1773607.53000, '51', 16.02556747, '16° 1\' 32.042890\"', 120.19851190, '120° 11\' 54.642970\"', 9.3827, 1772441.32500, 414224.86000, '3', 200196.47400, 1773679.95200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(121, 'PNG-3283', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'BALANGOBONG', 2008, 16.01769267, '16° 1\' 3.693612\"', 120.20108580, '120° 12\' 3.908880\"', 'PNG-3283 From the municipal hall of Lingayen travel westward on the way to Alaminos, just after Domalandan bridge, there is a road on the left going to Barangay Balangobong, Lingayen, upon reaching the intersection of the barangay road, turn right to reach the barangay hall of Balangobong, the GPS point is located west of the barangay hall just beside the box culvert 3 m wide and exactly 10.60 m W of the CENPELCO electric post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3283, PRS-92, 2008 DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.01769592, '16° 1\' 3.705320\"', 120.20108700, '120° 12\' 3.913210\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.9490, 0.0100, '2', 4.1715, 200464.58470, 1772912.74800, '51', 16.01930864, '16° 1\' 9.511100\"', 120.19975990, '120° 11\' 59.135690\"', 9.5168, 1771748.23000, 414355.75600, '3', 200320.76200, 1772985.16100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(122, 'PNG-3287', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'PUGARO SUIT', 2008, 16.06444386, '16° 3\' 51.997896\"', 120.31957680, '120° 19\' 10.476480\"', 'PNG-3287 Beginning at Dagupan City town proper travel NE throught Dagupan City-Lingayen road on any kind of vehicle, turn left at the intersection going to Lingayen gulf, then turn right passing Sabangan bridge. The station is located near the public toilet and set about 15 m SW from the said toilet.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.06444741, '16° 3\' 52.010660\"', 120.31957800, '120° 19\' 10.480860\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.8410, 0.0200, '2', 5.6610, 213220.34720, 1777921.43900, '51', 16.06606044, '16° 3\' 57.817570\"', 120.31825220, '120° 19\' 5.707820\"', 10.2629, 1776876.24600, 427054.74200, '3', 213076.77800, 1777993.50500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(123, 'PNG-3288', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'CARAEL', 2008, 16.03455925, '16° 2\' 4.413300\"', 120.30863050, '120° 18\' 31.069800\"', 'PNG-3288 From Dagupan City town proper follow the route going to Binmaley to reach the intersection going to Barangay Carael. The left side is the route going to Bugallon, take the right side to reach the station. The station is located at Lourdes Church basketball court 10 m from the centerline of the road and located at the SE edge of the concrete fence of the said court about 1.5 m W of the edge. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3288, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.03456278, '16° 2\' 4.426010\"', 120.30863190, '120° 18\' 31.074720\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.5820, 0.0200, '2', 3.2011, 212005.47820, 1774627.85400, '51', 16.03617419, '16° 2\' 10.227090\"', 120.30730530, '120° 18\' 26.299110\"', 7.9401, 1773573.08800, 425872.35300, '3', 211861.80000, 1774699.93000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(124, 'PNG-3290', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'CARANGLAAN', 2008, 16.03041147, '16° 1\' 49.481292\"', 120.35542040, '120° 21\' 19.513440\"', 'PNG-3290 Travel SE going to Calasiao from Dagupan City town hall about 15-25 minutes, turn left at the intersection to reach the Brgy. Caranglaan. The station is located near the box culvert and welcome arch of Tebeng. It is about 4 m S of the centerline of the road and 30 m W of the said welcome arch. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3290, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.03041488, '16° 1\' 49.493580\"', 120.35542190, '120° 21\' 19.518840\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.3250, 0.0200, '2', 4.1491, 217009.52920, 1774104.13300, '51', 16.03202501, '16° 1\' 55.290040\"', 120.35409530, '120° 21\' 14.743100\"', 8.5572, 1773097.80800, 430878.26900, '3', 216865.87500, 1774176.05300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(125, 'PNG-3291', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'PANTAL', 2008, 16.05736839, '16° 3\' 26.526204\"', 120.33987380, '120° 20\' 23.545680\"', 'PNG-3291 From Dagupan City town plaza travel NW going to Binmaley to reach barangay Pantal. The station is located within the center of elongated road island along the national road. It is about 3 m S of the said road and 1 m N of the signboard. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3921, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.05737141, '16° 3\' 26.537090\"', 120.33987520, '120° 20\' 23.550610\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.5320, 0.0200, '2', 4.4057, 215383.21470, 1777109.96400, '51', 16.05898356, '16° 3\' 32.340810\"', 120.33854920, '120° 20\' 18.777070\"', 8.8833, 1776086.11600, 429224.05300, '3', 215239.63900, 1777181.95800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(126, 'PNG-3292', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'BONUAN GUESET', 2008, 16.07172521, '16° 4\' 18.210756\"', 120.33678190, '120° 20\' 12.414840\"', 'PNG-3292 From the municipal hall of Dagupan drive NE on the route going to San Fabian to reach Brgy. Bonuan Gueset on any kind of vehicle. The station is located along the national road and near PCG Naval detachment. It is about 1 m W of the entrance gate of the said detachment and also near a waiting shed. It is at the NW of the entry access of the Caltex Gasoline Station. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3292, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.07172878, '16° 4\' 18.223610\"', 120.33678240, '120° 20\' 12.416520\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.1380, 0.0200, '2', 4.0683, 215072.56220, 1778703.82700, '51', 16.07334189, '16° 4\' 24.030790\"', 120.33545670, '120° 20\' 7.644170\"', 8.5402, 1777675.98200, 428898.24200, '3', 214929.03200, 1778775.84300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(127, 'PNG-3293', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'SALISAY', 2008, 16.04507230, '16° 2\' 42.260280\"', 120.37513360, '120° 22\' 30.480960\"', 'PNG-3293 At Dagupan City proper travel SE just the road going to Mangaldan, turn right at the intersection going to Barangay Maguin, before reaching the bridge turn left to Barangay Salisay. The station is located in front of Salisay Water District and about 3 m SE of the Western fence of the said water district. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3293, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.04507605, '16° 2\' 42.273770\"', 120.37513490, '120° 22\' 30.485660\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.4560, 0.0200, '2', 4.4470, 219140.79740, 1775700.50500, '51', 16.04668666, '16° 2\' 48.071960\"', 120.37380870, '120° 22\' 25.711240\"', 8.6847, 1774713.69600, 432992.87500, '3', 218997.20800, 1775772.37400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(128, 'PNG-3307', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'PANGAPISAN', 2008, 16.21267667, '16° 12\' 45.636012\"', 119.95979820, '119° 57\' 35.273520\"', 'PNG-3307 From City hall, drive eastward on the way to 100 islands, turn left at the intersection at Brgy. Magsaysay, just go ahead until reaching the bridge (Fishport Area) of Brgy. Pangapisan, the point is located SE of Brgy. plaza on the right side of the road and corner of the fish port and brgy. road. The station is exactly 13.20 m W of the electric post approximately 150-170 m S of the barangay plaza. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3307, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.21267938, '16° 12\' 45.645750\"', 119.95979810, '119° 57\' 35.273060\"', 0.0100, '1', 44.9810, 0.0200, '2', 4.2527, 816455.91640, 1794744.62700, '50', 16.21430947, '16° 12\' 51.514080\"', 119.95847530, '119° 57\' 30.510910\"', 8.7233, 1793442.31900, 388639.46200, '3', 816316.13500, 1794813.83700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(129, 'PNG-3311', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'LUCAP', 2008, 16.19339814, '16° 11\' 36.233304\"', 120.00112960, '120° 0\' 4.066560\"', 'PNG-3311 From city hall of Alaminos City drive eastward on the way to 100 islands, it\'s just 3 minutes travel from the town proper, turn left on the intersection on the way to the fishport. It is located on the curve line of the road on the left side. The station is exactly 9.90 m N of the concrete lamp post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3311, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.19340114, '16° 11\' 36.244090\"', 120.00112980, '120° 0\' 4.067270\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.0850, 0.0200, '2', 3.9619, 179332.13510, 1792670.40300, '51', 16.19502913, '16° 11\' 42.104870\"', 119.99980660, '119° 59\' 59.303680\"', 8.6687, 1791286.70000, 393048.63000, '3', 820769.85700, 1792743.01300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(130, 'PNG-3312', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'SABANGAN', 2008, 16.16393647, '16° 9\' 50.171292\"', 120.00786240, '120° 0\' 28.304640\"', 'PNG-3312 Starting at City Hall of Alaminos travel westward until reaching Video City, turn left which is the road going to Victoria about 10-15 minutes, just drive ahead then turn left going to Iglesia ni Cristo. The station is located outside Linda Dela Cruz Property and near barangay road. It is about 30 cm NE of the NE edge of a concrete post, 60 m SE of the said church and 80 m SE of a waiting shed.Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3312, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.16393954, '16° 9\' 50.182350\"', 120.00786270, '120° 0\' 28.305860\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.6990, 0.0200, '2', 5.3159, 180005.12310, 1789397.17400, '51', 16.16556557, '16° 9\' 56.036040\"', 120.00653880, '120° 0\' 23.539810\"', 10.1770, 1788022.67800, 393752.82100, '3', 179861.63900, 1789470.34200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(131, 'PNG-3313', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'VICTORIA', 2008, 16.16672715, '16° 10\' 0.217740\"', 120.06585140, '120° 3\' 57.065040\"', 'PNG-3313 From Alaminos City Hall drive westward turn left until reaching video city, travel about 15-25 minutes going to Brgy. Victoria, the point is located on the right side of the Brgy. road. The station is located 20 m SW of the street light and 30 m NE of the waiting shed. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3313, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.16673014, '16° 10\' 0.228520\"', 120.06584330, '120° 3\' 57.035940\"', 0.0100, '1', 51.6270, 0.0200, '2', 10.0096, 186214.93790, 1789616.78300, '51', 16.16835507, '16° 10\' 6.078260\"', 120.06451960, '120° 3\' 52.270380\"', 14.9731, 1788302.30200, 399955.54100, '3', 186071.51000, 1789689.76300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(132, 'PNG-3315', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'ALOS', 2008, 16.12505672, '16° 7\' 30.204192\"', 120.00228010, '120° 0\' 8.208360\"', 'PNG-3315 From town proper travel S on the national road for almost 4 minutes, the point is located on the highway boundary of Brgy. Bolaney and it is located at the right side of the national road. The station is exactly 2.93 m S of a concrete welcome sign of Alos, 19.30 m N of electric post and 18.50 m W of BBM # 46. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3315, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.10877988, '16° 6\' 31.607560\"', 119.96664400, '119° 57\' 59.918250\"', 0.0100, '1', 70.0410, 0.0200, '2', 28.5714, 817354.39030, 1783249.14000, '50', 16.11040338, '16° 6\' 37.452170\"', 119.96531870, '119° 57\' 55.147400\"', 33.4519, 1781939.94600, 389313.43100, '3', 817214.29700, 1783318.25900, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(133, 'PNG-3316', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'ALOS', 2008, 16.15244973, '16° 9\' 8.819028\"', 119.92412260, '119° 55\' 26.841360\"', 'PNG-3316 From Alaminos municipal hall travel northward until you reach intersection to Brgy. Landoc which is located left side of the road. Enter to that road which leads to Brgy. Sta. Maria. Around 25-30 minutes travel time. The mark is located at the Sta. Maria Brgy. Hall. Facing north, it is located near the south west edge of the basketball court near the concrete fence, 3 m left of the stage and 6 m right of the south east corner of the court. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3316, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.15245121, '16° 9\' 8.824350\"', 119.92412120, '119° 55\' 26.836310\"', 0.0300, '3', 55.7480, 0.1100, '2', 14.8860, 812733.53090, 1788020.25000, '50', 16.15407835, '16° 9\' 14.682060\"', 119.92279690, '119° 55\' 22.068950\"', 19.3941, 1786796.50700, 384789.40300, '3', 812593.54300, 1788089.52500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(134, 'PNG-3537', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'POGO', 2008, 16.16585454, '16° 9\' 57.076344\"', 119.95580030, '119° 57\' 20.881080\"', 'PNG-3537 Station mark is in the City of Alaminos, Brgy. of Pogo. From the City Proper travel NW direction to Brgy. of Pogo until reaching the school site. Station mark is located on the intersection or concrete walk way of the school 2 m N of Pogo Elem. School flag pole and about 60 m S of Alaminos-Bani Provincial Road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on a concrete of footing of flag pole. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3537, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.16585810, '16° 9\' 57.089150\"', 119.95579880, '119° 57\' 20.875630\"', 0.0100, '1', 61.0480, 0.0200, '2', 20.0138, 816102.64410, 1789553.38900, '50', 16.16748538, '16° 10\' 2.947350\"', 119.95447490, '119° 57\' 16.109530\"', 24.6580, 1788262.72200, 388185.32900, '3', 815962.71700, 1789622.57900, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
