(135, 'PNG-3543', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'DULACAC', 2008, 16.14051440, '16° 8\' 25.851840\"', 119.92421750, '119° 55\' 27.183000\"', 'PNG-3543 Station mark is in the City of Alaminos, Brgy. Dulacac. To reach the station from the City Proper travel SW direction towards Mabini, then turn right at the road junction going to Brgy. Dulacac. Then continue travel passing through Brgy. Amandiego and Brgy. Bisocol until reaching Brgy. Proper of Dulacac. Station mark is located inside the compound of Dulacac Elem. School. 5 m N of the school bldg. with \"Dulacac Elem. School\" sign board. About 25 m of Brgy. Hall. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3543, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.14051762, '16° 8\' 25.863430\"', 119.92421610, '119° 55\' 27.177990\"', 0.0100, '1', 65.6000, 0.0200, '2', 24.6678, 812762.46210, 1786698.88500, '50', 16.14214402, '16° 8\' 31.718460\"', 119.92289160, '119° 55\' 22.409630\"', 29.2097, 1785475.73900, 384792.61900, '3', 812622.43800, 1786768.15100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(136, 'PNG-3547', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'BOLANEY', 2008, 16.11743972, '16° 7\' 2.782992\"', 119.97591910, '119° 58\' 33.308760\"', 'PNG-3547 Station mark is in the City of Alaminos, Brgy. of Bolaney. To reach the station from the City Proper travel SW direction towards Mabini until reaching the Brgy. Proper then turn left follow the Brgy. Road going to the NIA Irrigation Canal. about 50 m after the bridge turn left follow the road E direction until the dead end of the rough road. Station mark is located along the curve of irrigation canal, 6 m N of the dead end of the rough road. 6 m SW of electric post. About 50 m NE of the residential area. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3547, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.11744306, '16° 7\' 2.795010\"', 119.97591830, '119° 58\' 33.305830\"', 0.0100, '1', 56.5960, 0.0300, '2', 15.1091, 818333.42070, 1784222.82400, '50', 16.11906690, '16° 7\' 8.640830\"', 119.97459330, '119° 58\' 28.535740\"', 20.0107, 1782893.72900, 390310.44200, '3', 818193.35900, 1784291.92200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(137, 'PNG-3578', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'LIBSONG WEST', 2008, 16.03457801, '16° 2\' 4.480836\"', 120.24209830, '120° 14\' 31.553880\"', 'PNG-3578 Station mark is in Mun. of Lingayen, Brgy. of Libsong W to reach the station from the Town Proper travel to the ATO Air Field. Station mark is located inside the Lingayen Air Field, on top of the triangular concrete foudation of Air Field signal light. About 200 m SW of the public Cemetery and about 650 m NE of the Air Field Office and S of the run way. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on a concrete triangle slab with inscriptions, \"PNG-3578, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.03458163, '16° 2\' 4.493880\"', 120.24209960, '120° 14\' 31.558600\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.5290, 0.0100, '2', 3.9234, 204881.47140, 1774723.58800, '51', 16.03619450, '16° 2\' 10.300210\"', 120.24077300, '120° 14\' 26.782690\"', 9.0484, 1773600.25900, 418752.16600, '3', 204737.73900, 1774795.88200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(138, 'PNG-3596', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'GUELEW', 2008, 15.86348382, '15° 51\' 48.541752\"', 120.29747160, '120° 17\' 50.897760\"', 'PNG-3596 Station mark is in Mun. of san Carlos. Begy. of Guelew. From the town Proper travel S direction going to Mun. of Urbiztondo, until reaching the road intersection to Brgy. Guelew, turn right then travel W direction until reaching the Guelew Elem. School, then contine travel about 200 m until reaching the dike, turn right then travel about 500 m N direction until reaching the waiting shed. Station mark is located at the levee of confield. Station mark is the head of a 4 in.copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3596, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.86348638, '15° 51\' 48.550970\"', 120.29747400, '120° 17\' 50.906230\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.0280, 0.0200, '2', 8.7559, 210565.06900, 1755701.96500, '51', 15.86508736, '15° 51\' 54.314510\"', 120.29614340, '120° 17\' 46.116140\"', 13.8985, 1754645.72900, 424613.91000, '3', 210420.80500, 1755773.93200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
