(152, 'PNG-3627', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BASISTA', 'DUMPAY', 2008, 15.88722654, '15° 53\' 14.015544\"', 120.38655610, '120° 23\' 11.601960\"', 'PNG-3627 Station mark is in Mun. of Basista, Brgy. of Dumpay. From Town Proper travel NW direction to San Carlos City until reaching the Dumpay National High School, then continue travel of about 1 Km. until reaching the T intersection, turn right then travel about 200 m. Station mark is located at the levee of rice field about 20 m N of rough road and about 200 m NE of Nat\'l Road intersection. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail cenetered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3627, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.88722894, '15° 53\' 14.024190\"', 120.38655840, '120° 23\' 11.610350\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.2100, 0.0200, '2', 9.5604, 220144.41570, 1758209.40000, '51', 15.88882945, '15° 53\' 19.786030\"', 120.38522850, '120° 23\' 6.822670\"', 13.9357, 1757242.80200, 434163.36300, '3', 220000.30500, 1758281.09700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(153, 'PNG-3629', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'BALITE SUR', 2008, 15.87405888, '15° 52\' 26.611968\"', 120.35883900, '120° 21\' 31.820400\"', 'PNG-3629 Station mark is in City of San Carlos, Brgy. of Balite Sur. From City Proper travel about 5.5 Km. E direction to Mun. of Basista until reaching the Basista boundary welcome arc, turn right then travel about 250 m S direction until reaching the welcome arc of Brgy. Mapolopolo, turn right then travel about 2.3 Km. W direction to brgy. Balite Sur, until reaching the Balite Sur Bridge. Station mark is located at the Balite Sur Bridge and approx. 20 m NW of waiting shed. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and set on a center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a bridge. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3629, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.87406170, '15° 52\' 26.622130\"', 120.35884150, '120° 21\' 31.829330\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.4280, 0.0200, '2', 9.5341, 217156.20550, 1756788.91000, '51', 15.87566200, '15° 52\' 32.383200\"', 120.35751120, '120° 21\' 27.040410\"', 14.1814, 1755794.71700, 431190.50800, '3', 217012.02800, 1756860.68600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(154, 'PNG-3630', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'PALOSPOS', 2008, 15.87130065, '15° 52\' 16.682340\"', 120.36050690, '120° 21\' 37.824840\"', 'PNG-3630 STATION MARK IS IN CITY OF SAN CARLOS, BRGY. OF BALITE SUR. FROM CITY PROPER TRAVEL ABOUT 5.5 KM. E DIRECTION TO MUN. OF BASISTA UNTIL REACHING THE BASISTA BOUNDARY WELCOME ARC, TURN RIGHT THEN TRAVEL ABOUT 250 M S DIRECTION UNTIL REACHING THE WELCOME ARC OF BRGY. MAPOLOPOLO, TURN RIGHT THEN TRAVEL ABOUT 2.5 KM. W DIRECTION TO BRGY. PALOSPOS, UNTIL REACHING THE POLOSPOS BOUNDARY WELCOME ARC. STATION MARK IS LOCATED ABOUT 130 M S OF PALOSPOS BOUNDARY WELCOME ARC. AND ABOUT 20 M NW OF WAITING SHED. STATION MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4 IN. COPPER NAIL CENTERED ON A 0.20 M X 0.20 M CONCRETE MONUMENT WITH A PROJECTION OF 0.20 M ABOVE THE GROUND SURFACE. INSCRIPTIONS, \"PNG-3630, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.87130341, '15° 52\' 16.692260\"', 120.36050940, '120° 21\' 37.833770\"', 0.0100, '1', 50.9730, 0.0200, '2', 8.0758, 217331.08000, 1756481.27400, '51', 15.87290349, '15° 52\' 22.452570\"', 120.35917910, '120° 21\' 33.044630\"', 12.7141, 1755488.93600, 431368.20400, '3', 217186.89500, 1756553.04200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(155, 'PNG-3707', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'DILAN PAURIDO', 2008, 15.96848948, '15° 58\' 6.562128\"', 120.58545080, '120° 35\' 7.622880\"', 'PNG-3707 Station mark is in the City of Urdaneta, Brgy. of Dilan. From the City Proper travel E direction towards Asingan until reaching Brgy. Dilan for about 2 Km. at Brgy. Dilan just after the bridge turn right at the waiting shed with Yakult billboard on top, follow the Dilan-Paurido Brgy. Road for approx. 800 m until reaching the ricefield area. Station mark is located left side of the road or 6 m E from the center line, about 30 m S of the rough road going to the center of the ricefield area. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a 0.20 m projection above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3707, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.96849372, '15° 58\' 6.577390\"', 120.58545450, '120° 35\' 7.636170\"', 0.0100, '1', 70.2300, 0.0200, '2', 28.6711, 241558.16960, 1766949.10400, '51', 15.97009494, '15° 58\' 12.341770\"', 120.58412680, '120° 35\' 2.856310\"', 31.7181, 1766182.27800, 455481.93000, '3', 241414.49600, 1767020.22300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(156, 'PNG-3711', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'LABIT PROPER', 2008, 15.95330775, '15° 57\' 11.907900\"', 120.52936480, '120° 31\' 45.713280\"', 'PNG-3711 Station mark is in the City of Urdaneta, Brgy. of Labit. To reach the station, from the City Proper travel S direction to Brgy. Nancayasan, about 300 m before reching Isuzu Motors, turn right follow the alternative route to Dagupan City passing through Brgy. Palina E and W. Continue travel to Brgy. Labit until reaching T intersection of the road, then turn left. Station mark is located at the dead end of a riprap 5 m SE of the concrete centerline of the road, about 200 m SW of T road intersection and about 140 m SW of weak bridge. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3711, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.95331152, '15° 57\' 11.921460\"', 120.52936820, '120° 31\' 45.725550\"', 0.0100, '1', 63.5990, 0.0200, '2', 21.9876, 235531.86750, 1765338.89200, '51', 15.95491302, '15° 57\' 17.686860\"', 120.52804000, '120° 31\' 40.944140\"', 25.1772, 1764515.20000, 449474.08900, '3', 235388.09700, 1765410.18000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(157, 'PNG-3712', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'LABIT PROPER', 2008, 15.94936924, '15° 56\' 57.729264\"', 120.52745690, '120° 31\' 38.844840\"', 'PNG-3712 Station mark is in City of Urdaneta, Brgy. of Labit. To reach the station, from the City Proper travel S direction to Brgy. Nancayasan, about 300 m before reaching the Isuzu Motors, turn right follow the alternative route to Dagupan City passing through Brgy. Palina East and West, continue travel to Brgy. Labit until reaching the T road intersection, then turn left. Station mark is located 12 m NW of the Welcome Arc of Brgy. Cabaruan, 10 m N of concrete road centerline, 500 m SW of Labit Brgy. Proper and about 500 m NE of Cabaruan Brgy. Proper. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3712, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.94937311, '15° 56\' 57.743180\"', 120.52746020, '120° 31\' 38.856860\"', 0.0100, '1', 64.1530, 0.0200, '2', 22.5291, 235322.34710, 1764905.32600, '51', 15.95097440, '15° 57\' 3.507840\"', 120.52613200, '120° 31\' 34.075100\"', 25.7240, 1764079.85700, 449268.82600, '3', 235178.56200, 1764976.61700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(158, 'PNG-3733', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'BACTAD EAST', 2008, 15.97719105, '15° 58\' 37.887780\"', 120.61963570, '120° 37\' 10.688520\"', 'PNG-3733 Station mark is in the City of Urdaneta, Brgy. of Bactad East. From the City Proper going to Asingan and travel about 3.2 Km. to reach the junction at Brgy Bactad East, then turn right follow the Brgy. Road going S direction and travel about 120 m until reaching the school plaza. Station mark is located left side of Brgy. Road along the concrete fence of school plaza and about 15 m S of house and 7 m S of school gate. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3733, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.97719531, '15° 58\' 37.903130\"', 120.61963950, '120° 37\' 10.702240\"', 0.0100, '1', 76.7740, 0.0200, '2', 35.1199, 245230.00710, 1767870.16700, '51', 15.97879632, '15° 58\' 43.666760\"', 120.61831200, '120° 37\' 5.923290\"', 38.2055, 1767138.06900, 459143.18200, '3', 245086.39100, 1767941.18300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(159, 'PNG-4072 (BBM-86)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'CAMANTILES', 2007, 15.98770259, '15° 59\' 15.729324\"', 120.55533170, '120° 33\' 19.194120\"', 'PNG-4072 (BBM-86) The station is located insode the property of Mr. Manny Magay, 50-100 meters away from Barangay road of Camantilis and San Vicente. Station mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm. x 30cm. x 100cm. standard concrete monument protruding about 20cm. with inscription, BBM-86.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.98770679, '15° 59\' 15.744440\"', 120.55533500, '120° 33\' 19.206100\"', 0.0100, '1', 65.9680, 0.0200, '2', 24.4153, 238357.65540, 1769113.64700, '51', 15.98930987, '15° 59\' 21.515520\"', 120.55400770, '120° 33\' 14.427720\"', 27.5870, 1768315.07600, 452262.27200, '3', 238214.02200, 1769184.88100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(160, 'PNG-4073 (BBM-26)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'PALINA WEST', 2007, 15.94960173, '15° 56\' 58.566228\"', 120.55442950, '120° 33\' 15.946200\"', 'PNG-4073 (BBM-26) The station is locted at the back of Palina west 1 meter along the barangay road approximately 7-10 meters eastward of Palina West Arc. Station mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm. x 30cm. x 100cm. standard concrete monument protruding about 20cm. with inscription, BBM-26.', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.94960326, '15° 56\' 58.571720\"', 120.55443430, '120° 33\' 15.963490\"', 0.0100, '1', 66.4800, 0.0200, '2', 24.9093, 238211.64270, 1764896.71100, '51', 15.95120397, '15° 57\' 4.334300\"', 120.55310610, '120° 33\' 11.181890\"', 27.9863, 1764098.88200, 452156.71500, '3', 238067.88000, 1764967.91500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(161, 'PNG-54', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'ANONAS', 2007, 16.00363318, '16° 0\' 13.079448\"', 120.57619470, '120° 34\' 34.300920\"', 'PNG-54 Is located inside the new Urdaneta City Hall Complex in Brgy. Anonas. It is 2.5 m. SE of the flagpole and about 20 m. S of the fountain. mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"PNG-54 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.00364060, '16° 0\' 13.106150\"', 120.57619900, '120° 34\' 34.316330\"', 0.0100, '1', 74.1550, 0.0200, '2', 32.5861, 240612.35460, 1770851.34300, '51', 16.00524421, '16° 0\' 18.879150\"', 120.57487210, '120° 34\' 29.539400\"', 35.7715, 1770073.52800, 454499.17400, '3', 240468.79200, 1770922.52300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(162, 'PNG-65', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'CAOAYAN-KILING', 2008, 15.85553565, '15° 51\' 19.928340\"', 120.32320840, '120° 19\' 23.550240\"', 'PNG-65 From San Carlos Mun. Hall, travel along the nat\'l. highway going to Urbiztondo until reaching the Caoayn-Kiling Plaza. Station is located inside the public plaza, situated along the E corner of the concrete pavement about 2.5 m. NW of the SE wall and approx. 8 m. NNE of the second gate. It is beside the concrete bench nearest to the said gate. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-65 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.85552585, '15° 51\' 19.893060\"', 120.32320110, '120° 19\' 23.524090\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.0140, 0.0200, '2', 8.8248, 213310.86110, 1754785.19900, '51', 15.85712577, '15° 51\' 25.652770\"', 120.32187040, '120° 19\' 18.733440\"', 13.7983, 1753755.67500, 427366.64900, '3', 213166.59100, 1754857.07500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(163, 'PNG-66', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'CALOMBOYAN', 2007, 15.94486786, '15° 56\' 41.524296\"', 120.30050300, '120° 18\' 1.810800\"', 'PNG-66 From San Carlos Mun. Hall, travel along the highway going to Binmaley. Then turn left to the brgy. road going to Brgy. Pangalangan. Station is located inside the compound of Calomboyan Elem. School. It is situated along and beside the SE side of the concrete base of the flagpole, which is about 20 m. NW of the gate. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. ìabove ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-66 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.94487436, '15° 56\' 41.547690\"', 120.30050700, '120° 18\' 1.825270\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.7010, 0.0200, '2', 4.8395, 211006.53980, 1764708.93300, '51', 15.94648036, '15° 56\' 47.329290\"', 120.29917840, '120° 17\' 57.042060\"', 9.8086, 1763651.02900, 424969.17600, '3', 210862.55300, 1764780.96000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(164, 'PNG-67', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'LIBSONG WEST', 2007, 16.03316033, '16° 1\' 59.377188\"', 120.23679930, '120° 14\' 12.477480\"', 'PNG-67 Is located in Brgy. Libsong West, Lingayaen, inside the compound of the Air Transportation Office (ATO) - Lingayen Airport. It is ìsituated 15 m. N of the flagpole, 5 m. E of the bounding wire ìfence and about 150 m. SW of the runway. Mark is the head of a 4 ìin. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 ìcm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-67 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.03316712, '16° 1\' 59.401620\"', 120.23680330, '120° 14\' 12.491880\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.5080, 0.0100, '2', 3.8836, 204312.25910, 1774574.52000, '51', 16.03478001, '16° 2\' 5.208050\"', 120.23547660, '120° 14\' 7.715820\"', 9.0359, 1773445.82000, 418184.77700, '3', 204168.51800, 1774646.82900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(165, 'PNG-74', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'TANAYTAY', 2007, 16.14487351, '16° 8\' 41.544636\"', 119.98958110, '119° 59\' 22.491960\"', 'PNG-74 Is located on the N end of the Alaminos-Mabini By-Pass Rd. in Brgy. Tanaytay, Alaminos. It is situated on the elongated road island, 2.5 m. S of ALA-30A and 1.5 m. S of the island marker. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-74 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 16.14487954, '16° 8\' 41.566360\"', 119.98958400, '119° 59\' 22.502410\"', 0.0100, '1', 51.3600, 0.0200, '2', 9.9563, 819752.27840, 1787282.41400, '50', 16.14650479, '16° 8\' 47.417230\"', 119.98825960, '119° 59\' 17.734680\"', 14.8246, 1785922.87400, 391787.38800, '3', 819612.30900, 1787351.49100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(166, 'PNG-76', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'CATABLAN', 2007, 15.96598686, '15° 57\' 57.552696\"', 120.48871880, '120° 29\' 19.387680\"', 'PNG-76 From Urdaneta City, travel 30 km. W to Pauling then go 250 m. S until reaching the boundary of Brgys. Catablan (Sitio Nambacuran) and Lunec. Station is located NE of the arc of Brgy. Lunec, 12 m. E of the road and at the SW corner of Mr. Ferdinand Frianeza\'s residence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"PNG-76 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Gravity', 2016.58, 15.96599417, '15° 57\' 57.579000\"', 120.48872340, '120° 29\' 19.404220\"', 0.0100, '0', 64.7140, 0.0200, '2', 22.9910, 231195.62350, 1766794.97400, '51', 15.96759735, '15° 58\' 3.350460\"', 120.48739550, '120° 29\' 14.623680\"', 26.4289, 1765929.00400, 445126.22200, '3', 231051.86200, 1766866.40500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(167, 'ILN-12 (BBM-13)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'DINGRAS', 'CALI', 2005, 18.06483535, '18° 3\' 53.407260\"', 120.69362750, '120° 41\' 37.059000\"', 'ILN-12 From Dingras Municipal Hall, travel S along the national highway for about 10 min. until reaching the road going W leading to Brgy. Parado. Follow this for about 200 m. until reaching the boundary of Brgys. Cali and Parado. Station is situated at the N side of the rough road near the NW end of the irrigation canal. Mark is the head of a CW nail centered and embedded on a standard BBM monument, 17 cm. x 17 cm. top base, 30 cm. x 30 cm. bottom base, set 30 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"BBM No. 13\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 18.06485079, '18° 3\' 53.462860\"', 120.69363310, '120° 41\' 37.079140\"', 0.0300, '3', 73.4430, 0.1000, '1', 35.7013, 255877.73610, 1998884.60700, '51', 18.06657718, '18° 3\' 59.677850\"', 120.69235430, '120° 41\' 32.475450\"', 41.2511, 1998157.49900, 467432.06600, '3', 255741.17400, 1998957.04400, '51', 18.06489598, '18° 3\' 53.625510\"', 120.69362460, '120° 41\' 37.048480\"', 0.0271, 72.2850, 0.0933, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(168, 'ILN-14', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CARASI', 'BARBAQUESO', 2004, 18.14586878, '18° 8\' 45.127608\"', 120.82485610, '120° 49\' 29.481960\"', 'ILN-14 From Piddig town proper, travel NE along the general direction of the national highway leading to the municipality of Carasi. Follow this rough dirt road for about an hour until reaching the municipal hall located adjacent to the PNP Office-Carasi. Station is situated on top of the watertank about 700 m. NE of a Globe antenna tower and about 1.3 km. N of the municipal hall. The watertank is visible at the front of the municipal hall. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail cemented and embedded on top of a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty set flushed on top of a watertank, with inscriptions \"ILN-14, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 18.14588456, '18° 8\' 45.184420\"', 120.82486200, '120° 49\' 29.503100\"', 0.0300, '3', 241.7890, 0.1100, '1', 203.0443, 269879.40850, 2007686.61100, '51', 18.14761292, '18° 8\' 51.406510\"', 120.82358530, '120° 49\' 24.906960\"', 209.5477, 2007107.57600, 481333.04600, '3', 269743.21300, 2007758.68200, '51', 18.14592977, '18° 8\' 45.347170\"', 120.82485350, '120° 49\' 29.472660\"', 0.0275, 240.6380, 0.0943, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(169, 'ILN-15', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'VINTAR', 'SAN NICOLAS', 2005, 18.22409833, '18° 13\' 26.753988\"', 120.64803820, '120° 38\' 52.937520\"', 'ILN-15 From Laoag City, travel N for about 6 km. and turn right just before reaching the bridge (Km. Post 493) and travel for about 5 km. to reach the station. Station is located along the road, with rice field on both sides, going to Sarat. It is about 200 m. S of the Globe tower, SE of the Smart tower, 4.7 m. SSW of a Camachile tree, about 3.8 m. SE of the centerline of the provincial road and 2.3 m. NNE of the N end of the culvert on the SE side of the road. Mark is the head of an iron spike, centered on a concrete block 19 cm. x 19 cm. and 42 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"BBM No. 8\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 18.22411364, '18° 13\' 26.809090\"', 120.64804340, '120° 38\' 52.956120\"', 0.0300, '3', 63.2540, 0.1100, '1', 26.4363, 251275.54390, 2016578.03700, '51', 18.22585038, '18° 13\' 33.061380\"', 120.64676820, '120° 38\' 48.365430\"', 31.6923, 2015793.27200, 462640.03500, '3', 251139.48400, 2016650.73600, '51', 18.22415885, '18° 13\' 26.971870\"', 120.64803480, '120° 38\' 52.925320\"', 0.0276, 62.1170, 0.0950, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(170, 'ILN-16', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BACARRA', 'SAN ANDRES II', 2004, 18.25107106, '18° 15\' 3.855816\"', 120.60796060, '120° 36\' 28.658160\"', 'ILN-16 From the Bacarra Municipal Hall Bldg., proceed to Bacarra Central Elem. School about 50 m. SW. Station is situated near the SW corner of the boundary lot of the school. It is 4 m. and 4.75 m. perpendicular distance from its W and S wall fence, respectively. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail ceneterd and embedded on top of a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument set 5 cm. protruding above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILN-16, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 18.25108630, '18° 15\' 3.910690\"', 120.60796530, '120° 36\' 28.674950\"', 0.0300, '3', 51.9800, 0.1100, '1', 15.4950, 247074.26210, 2019619.30000, '51', 18.25282548, '18° 15\' 10.171740\"', 120.60669060, '120° 36\' 24.086290\"', 20.6027, 2018787.34700, 458407.55200, '3', 246938.26600, 2019692.14700, '51', 18.25113152, '18° 15\' 4.073480\"', 120.60795670, '120° 36\' 28.644080\"', 0.0276, 50.8470, 0.0947, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(171, 'ILN-18', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'VINTAR', 'TAMDAGAN', 2004, 18.32367489, '18° 19\' 25.229604\"', 120.73339170, '120° 44\' 0.210120\"', 'ILN-18 From Vintar proper, travel N for about 18 km. or 1 hr. up to Brgy. Tamdagan. Station is located on the NE corner of the basketball court (known as the sports complex) E of the barangay community. It is about 10 m. N of the NW corner of the stage and the flagpole. Mark is a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 10 cm. x 10 cm. cement putty and flushed with the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILN-18, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 18.32369092, '18° 19\' 25.287320\"', 120.73339680, '120° 44\' 0.228480\"', 0.0300, '3', 131.0410, 0.1000, '1', 94.0138, 260442.55800, 2027488.28600, '51', 18.32543171, '18° 19\' 31.554140\"', 120.73212400, '120° 43\' 55.646560\"', 99.6022, 2026798.94500, 471684.01600, '3', 260306.89200, 2027560.78000, '51', 18.32373617, '18° 19\' 25.450210\"', 120.73338830, '120° 44\' 0.197810\"', 0.0271, 129.9130, 0.0937, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(172, 'ILN-2 (PASEAR-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CURRIMAO', 'COMCOMLOONG', 1978, 17.96802407, '17° 58\' 4.886652\"', 120.51394600, '120° 30\' 50.205600\"', 'ILN-2 (PASEAR-2) Travel N along the highway from Manila going to Currimao town. Before reaching the town proper, at the right side of the highway is the United Church of Christ of the Philippines (UCCP), NE of Km Post No. 459. Few meters after UCCP is a dirt road leading to Brgy. Cumcumloong. Travel SE along this dirt road for about 3 km., passing by the Brgy. Cumcumloong boundary marker and turning left upon reaching the basketball court until reaching the end of the dirt road. Then travel along the foot trail (right side of the dirt road) in SSE direction for about 400 m. or 5 mins. up to the station. Station is located on the W edge on top of the bare hill called Lablabaga, the highest hill in the vicinity. It is 3.9 m. N of a Duhat tree on the SW of a bare hill and 11.2 m. S of a Duhat tree on the NW of a bare hill. It is 15.5 m. SE of ILN-2. Mark is a 4 in. copper nail centered on a concrete block, 25 cm. x 25 cm., and 5 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"PASEAR 2, 1978, PCGS, MND\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.96803864, '17° 58\' 4.939100\"', 120.51395090, '120° 30\' 50.223210\"', 0.0300, '3', 137.3460, 0.1100, '1', 100.5773, 236705.59500, 1988412.37100, '51', 17.96976308, '17° 58\' 11.147090\"', 120.51266960, '120° 30\' 45.610610\"', 105.2698, 1987483.77300, 448381.82400, '3', 236568.58400, 1988485.31200, '51', 17.96808378, '17° 58\' 5.101610\"', 120.51394230, '120° 30\' 50.192260\"', 0.0301, 136.1810, 0.0996, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(173, 'ILN-20', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BANGUI', 'SAN LORENZO', 2004, 18.53939387, '18° 32\' 21.817932\"', 120.76337500, '120° 45\' 48.150000\"', 'ILN-20 From Laoag City, travel for about 65 km. or 1-1/3 hrs. up to the municipal town hall of Bangui then turn left on the NE side of the municipal town hall and travel for about 300 m. Station is located on the N corner of Bangui Elem. School compound. It is about 100 m. SE of the shoreline, about 8.5 m. SW of the road centerline, 3.7 m. SW of the NE concrete fence, 4.2 m. SE of the NW barbed wire fence and 4.9 m. S of the N corner fence. Mark is a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete block and 4 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILN-20, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 18.53941086, '18° 32\' 21.879090\"', 120.76337950, '120° 45\' 48.166310\"', 0.0300, '3', 42.3150, 0.1100, '1', 6.6068, 263907.65410, 2051331.24200, '51', 18.54116366, '18° 32\' 28.189190\"', 120.76211180, '120° 45\' 43.602380\"', 11.5173, 2050670.63300, 474885.24700, '3', 263772.72900, 2051403.79600, '51', 18.53945616, '18° 32\' 22.042180\"', 120.76337100, '120° 45\' 48.135620\"', 0.0278, 41.2140, 0.0952, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
