(174, 'ILN-21', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'DUMALNEG', 'CABARITAN', 2004, 18.52543072, '18° 31\' 31.550592\"', 120.80670320, '120° 48\' 24.131520\"', 'ILN-21 From Laoag City, travel for about 65 km. to the town of Bangui, then travel for about 3 km. to Brgy. Lanao and then travel again for about 3 km. up to Dumalneg proper. Station is located in So. Cristalina Sanjera Sta. Maria, on the SW corner of a lot owned by Ms. Erlinda Aguinaldo. It is about 150 m. N of the provincial road and the welcome marker of Cristalina, about 20 m. E of the house of Mr. Rafael Aguinaldo and 2 m. E of the dirt road. Mark is a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete block and 4 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILN-21, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 18.52544761, '18° 31\' 31.611390\"', 120.80670790, '120° 48\' 24.148320\"', 0.0300, '3', 75.1680, 0.1100, '1', 38.9872, 268464.28540, 2049729.13800, '51', 18.52719868, '18° 31\' 37.915260\"', 120.80543990, '120° 48\' 19.583480\"', 44.2205, 2049119.56000, 479457.90300, '3', 268329.34300, 2049801.54400, '51', 18.52549291, '18° 31\' 31.774480\"', 120.80669940, '120° 48\' 24.117710\"', 0.0278, 74.0640, 0.0954, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(175, 'ILN-3', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'SOLSONA', 'MANALPAC', 1991, 18.08456284, '18° 5\' 4.426224\"', 120.81469570, '120° 48\' 52.904520\"', 'ILN-3 From Laoag City, travel S along the national highway for about 2 km. towards San Nicolas. Turn left on a concrete road and head towards Solsona town passing through the Municipality of Dingras and travel for about 37 km. From Solsona town, travel farther E for about 5 km. and turn right towards Brgy. Manalpac, then to Solsona Diversion Dam. Station is on top of the NE end of the bridge concrete railings. It is 15 m. S of National Irrigation Administration Office. Station mark is a cross cut on top of a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in a drilled hole centered on a cement putty on top of the concrete railings of the bridge and inscribed with station name. RM Nos. 1, 2 and 3 are cross cuts on top of a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in drilled holes centered on a cement putty, 0.05 m. above the surface of the concrete retaining wall. Inscribed on top with the station name and RM nos.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 18.08457870, '18° 5\' 4.483310\"', 120.81470200, '120° 48\' 52.927230\"', 0.0300, '3', 158.8520, 0.1100, '1', 119.9211, 268723.58060, 2000912.62900, '51', 18.08630367, '18° 5\' 10.693210\"', 120.81342390, '120° 48\' 48.325870\"', 126.4345, 2000323.49300, 480250.96400, '3', 268587.17100, 2000984.69000, '51', 18.08462389, '18° 5\' 4.646010\"', 120.81469360, '120° 48\' 52.896790\"', 0.0276, 157.6930, 0.0950, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(176, 'ILN-3023', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CURRIMAO', 'GAANG', 2009, 17.99533816, '17° 59\' 43.217376\"', 120.50271370, '120° 30\' 9.769320\"', 'ILN-3023 It is located within a triangular park named Elizabeth Imelda Keon Park along the national highway going to Currimao town Proper and Basic at San Simon Currimao, Ilocos Norte about 30m away from the bridge. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; ILN-3023 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.99535308, '17° 59\' 43.271070\"', 120.50271870, '120° 30\' 9.787270\"', 0.0300, '3', 44.2670, 0.1100, '1', 7.6285, 235556.11280, 1991452.64600, '51', 17.99707940, '17° 59\' 49.485830\"', 120.50143800, '120° 30\' 5.176820\"', 12.3064, 1990510.08800, 447200.26700, '3', 235419.18400, 1991525.64600, '51', 17.99539822, '17° 59\' 43.433600\"', 120.50271010, '120° 30\' 9.756290\"', 0.0286, 43.1050, 0.0967, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(177, 'ILN-3249', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BADOC', 'GABUT NORTE', 2007, 17.96545270, '17° 57\' 55.629720\"', 120.47380110, '120° 28\' 25.683960\"', 'ILN-3249 From Badoc Town Proper, travel W along the Nat\'l. Highway until reaching the concrete waiting shed and the \"Gabut Elem. School\" concrete monument marker. Station is located NW of Gabut Elem. School, on top of the watertank. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 2 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILN-3249 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.96546673, '17° 57\' 55.680210\"', 120.47380680, '120° 28\' 25.704500\"', 0.0300, '3', 49.2910, 0.1100, '1', 12.7563, 232447.88030, 1988185.03500, '51', 17.96719189, '17° 58\' 1.890800\"', 120.47252540, '120° 28\' 21.091420\"', 17.3027, 1987210.83100, 444128.83500, '3', 232310.83100, 1988258.10600, '51', 17.96551186, '17° 57\' 55.842700\"', 120.47379820, '120° 28\' 25.673470\"', 0.0301, 48.1260, 0.0992, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(178, 'ILN-3436 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PASUQUIN', 'CARUSIKIS', 2009, 18.33714383, '18° 20\' 13.717788\"', 120.67868170, '120° 40\' 43.254120\"', 'ILN-3436 (LMS) The station is located on a hilly porton of land in Barangay Carusikis about 150 meters northwest from the mango tree along barangay road going to Tadao. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILN 3436', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 18.33715938, '18° 20\' 13.773770\"', 120.67868650, '120° 40\' 43.271390\"', 0.0300, '3', 275.4880, 0.1100, '1', 238.8283, 254676.70660, 2029052.27700, '51', 18.33890207, '18° 20\' 20.047450\"', 120.67741400, '120° 40\' 38.690410\"', 244.2247, 2028299.13700, 465903.45400, '3', 254541.05200, 2029124.95200, '51', 18.33720463, '18° 20\' 13.936650\"', 120.67867800, '120° 40\' 43.240620\"', 0.0278, 274.3640, 0.0964, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(179, 'ILN-19', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BURGOS', 'POBLACION', 2014, 18.51515629, '18° 30\' 54.562644\"', 120.70293140, '120° 42\' 10.553040\"', 'ILN-3536 (PBB-08) The station is located approximately 5 m from the centerline of the Pan-Philippine National Highway. It is near a cylindrical plantbox, about 513 meters WSW from ILN-3017. It is inside the compound of the barangay hall and 80 meters WNW from project control PBB-7. Mark is a 10 x 1 cm dia. brass rod with cross cut on top centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 60 cm concrete monument prpotruding 10 cm above the ground with inscription , \"PBB - 8 EDC-PWP\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 18.51223075, '18° 30\' 44.030690\"', 120.64004700, '120° 38\' 24.169350\"', 0.0300, '3', 92.0950, 0.1100, '1', 56.8897, 250843.80320, 2048488.13000, '51', 18.51398454, '18° 30\' 50.344340\"', 120.63877850, '120° 38\' 19.602570\"', 61.5021, 2047684.18000, 461858.34900, '3', 250708.70600, 2048561.05800, '51', 18.51227603, '18° 30\' 44.193710\"', 120.64003850, '120° 38\' 24.138440\"', 0.0278, 90.9930, 0.0955, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(180, 'ILN-6', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CITY OF LAOAG', 'BGY. NO. 51-A, NANGALISAN EAST', 1996, 18.18778287, '18° 11\' 16.018332\"', 120.58925270, '120° 35\' 21.309720\"', 'ILN-6 Is in Laoag City, Brgy. Nangalisan. It is located at the SW end of the NW side of Gilbert Bridge, at about 1 km. from Laoag City Hall. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail cemented in a drilled hole on top of the bridge abutment with inscriptions on the cement putty around the mark thus \"ILN-6, 1996, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 18.18779810, '18° 11\' 16.073170\"', 120.58925740, '120° 35\' 21.326740\"', 0.0300, '3', 52.6200, 0.1100, '1', 16.0736, 245002.98150, 2012638.15000, '51', 18.18953396, '18° 11\' 22.322240\"', 120.58798130, '120° 35\' 16.732730\"', 21.0800, 2011786.98600, 456413.26500, '3', 244866.76000, 2012711.01100, '51', 18.18784330, '18° 11\' 16.235890\"', 120.58924880, '120° 35\' 21.295850\"', 0.0273, 51.4790, 0.0942, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(181, 'ILN-9', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'NUEVA ERA', 'POBLACION', 2004, 17.90542903, '17° 54\' 19.544508\"', 120.65835610, '120° 39\' 30.081960\"', 'ILN-9 From Banna town proper, travel SSE along the general direction of the national highway for about 7 km. Before reaching Bongo Bridge, there is a road going SW leading to Pinili. Turn right and follow this road until reaching the Y-intersection road. Turn left and follow the dirt rough road passing the breeding station at the left side of the road. At the left side of the road is a small hill where the station is situated on its central top. On top of each of these two hills is an electric pole, where the SW pole is the termination of the electrical lines. Duration of travel from the national highway to the station is approx. 8 min. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail centered and embedded on top of a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, set 5 cm. above the ground surface, with inscription \"ILN-9, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.90544395, '17° 54\' 19.598220\"', 120.65836190, '120° 39\' 30.102790\"', 0.0300, '3', 199.4640, 0.1100, '1', 161.4735, 251919.87100, 1981283.47800, '51', 17.90716160, '17° 54\' 25.781770\"', 120.65707940, '120° 39\' 25.485750\"', 166.8383, 1980521.48400, 463665.15700, '3', 251782.75300, 1981355.90700, '51', 17.90548909, '17° 54\' 19.760710\"', 120.65835340, '120° 39\' 30.072130\"', 0.0287, 198.2880, 0.0974, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(182, 'ILS-12', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SINAIT', 'RANG-AY', 2005, 17.86442488, '17° 51\' 51.929568\"', 120.45686630, '120° 27\' 24.718680\"', 'ILS-12 Is in the town proper of Sinait, inside the compound of Sinait Municipal Park, Brgy. Poblacion, Sinait, Ilocos Sur. It is located at about 6 m. infront of Jose Rizal monument and about 15 m. S of the barangay hall. The municipal park is located on the right side of the national highway going to Laoag City, infront of Sinait Elem. School. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed in a drilled hole and centered on a 8\" x 8\" cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILS-12, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.86443936, '17° 51\' 51.981680\"', 120.45687090, '120° 27\' 24.735080\"', 0.0300, '3', 44.8630, 0.1100, '1', 8.2732, 230500.38590, 1977023.36900, '51', 17.86615889, '17° 51\' 58.171990\"', 120.45558710, '120° 27\' 20.113510\"', 12.5878, 1976034.47600, 442301.96600, '3', 230362.98500, 1977096.42000, '51', 17.86448447, '17° 51\' 52.144080\"', 120.45686220, '120° 27\' 24.704050\"', 0.0287, 43.6870, 0.0987, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(183, 'ILS-13', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CABUGAO', 'BONIFACIO', 2005, 17.78759359, '17° 47\' 15.336924\"', 120.45777240, '120° 27\' 27.980640\"', 'ILS-13 Is located inside the compound of Cabugao South Central School, Brgy. Bonifacio, Cabugao, Ilocos Sur. It is situated on a dike of an uncultivated farm owned by the municipality. It is located about 30 m. SE of the school oval and about 20 m. SE of a concrete shed. It is reached by traveling N coming from Vigan City. The school is on the left side of the highway, opposite Cabugao National High School. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, about 60 cm. deep, protruding by 5 cm., with inscriptions \"ILS-13, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.78760799, '17° 47\' 15.388770\"', 120.45777660, '120° 27\' 27.995740\"', 0.0300, '3', 57.1770, 0.1100, '1', 20.5066, 230480.79270, 1968515.04000, '51', 17.78932293, '17° 47\' 21.562560\"', 120.45649110, '120° 27\' 23.367780\"', 24.6513, 1967530.68100, 442373.07600, '3', 230343.13400, 1968588.03100, '51', 17.78765308, '17° 47\' 15.551100\"', 120.45776800, '120° 27\' 27.964750\"', 0.0281, 55.9910, 0.0957, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(184, 'ILS-14', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN JUAN', 'PANDAYAN', 2005, 17.74766766, '17° 44\' 51.603576\"', 120.45607430, '120° 27\' 21.867480\"', 'ILS-14 From Vigan City, travel N along the national highway for about 22 km. until reaching the Brgy. Lapting welcome marker on the E side of Km. Post 427 + 166 infront of the vulcanizing shop. Turn W and travel S along the municipal road for about 150 m. to reach the San Juan North Central School. It is located inside the compound on the NW corner fence of the school. It is 2.9 m. SE of the NW corner fence, 2.3 m. S of the N fence and 1.9 m. E of the W fence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 10 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-14, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.74768233, '17° 44\' 51.656400\"', 120.45607760, '120° 27\' 21.879430\"', 0.0200, '2', 51.7650, 0.1200, '1', 15.0718, 230240.63970, 1964096.80200, '51', 17.74939494, '17° 44\' 57.821770\"', 120.45479110, '120° 27\' 17.248130\"', 19.1146, 1963112.35600, 442180.00200, '3', 230102.84500, 1964169.76900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(185, 'ILS-15', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'MAGSINGAL', 'SANTA MONICA', 2005, 17.68949524, '17° 41\' 22.182864\"', 120.42793430, '120° 25\' 40.563480\"', 'ILS-15 From Vigan City, travel N for about 14 km. until reaching the Magsingal Bridge at Km. Post 419 + 575. Right after the bridge on the NW side is the Magsingal Health Office and Hospital. It is located inside the hospital compound. It is about 13 m. NE of the NE corner of the front hospital bldg. and about 13 m. NW of the NE concrete fence. It is about 22 m. NW from the centerline of the national highway. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 30 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-15, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.68950911, '17° 41\' 22.232800\"', 120.42793780, '120° 25\' 40.576190\"', 0.0300, '3', 43.7740, 0.1100, '1', 7.3070, 227166.98090, 1957696.26400, '51', 17.69121884, '17° 41\' 28.387840\"', 120.42665000, '120° 25\' 35.939900\"', 11.0039, 1956682.87200, 439175.90900, '3', 227028.97000, 1957769.27800, '51', 17.68955418, '17° 41\' 22.395040\"', 120.42792920, '120° 25\' 40.545170\"', 0.0292, 42.5770, 0.0990, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(186, 'ILS-16', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 'POBLACION', 2005, 17.63792680, '17° 38\' 16.536480\"', 120.40909350, '120° 24\' 32.736600\"', 'ILS-16 From Vigan City, travel N along the national highway for about 8 km. until reaching the Santo Domingo Park on the SE side of the national highway. The park is located infront of the municipal hall. It is located inside the park. It is about 8 m. NE (right hand side) of the Benito Soliven monument, about 30 m. SE of the national highway, about 3.3 m. NE of the first step of the NE stair and 0.4 m. NE of the NE portion of the circular concrete base. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and flush with the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-16, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.63794108, '17° 38\' 16.587870\"', 120.40909610, '120° 24\' 32.745890\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.7400, 0.0300, '1', 10.4335, 225088.81690, 1952013.77600, '51', 17.63964813, '17° 38\' 22.733270\"', 120.40780700, '120° 24\' 28.105210\"', 13.8495, 1950981.72000, 437158.98600, '3', 224950.61900, 1952086.81200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(187, 'ILS-18', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA', 'QUIRINO', 2005, 17.48608355, '17° 29\' 9.900780\"', 120.43290600, '120° 25\' 58.461600\"', 'ILS-18 From Vigan City, travel S along the national highway for about 19 km. until reaching the Santa Municipal Hall. It is located about 150 m. W (back side) of the municipal hall along the center of the municipal road. It is about 11 m. SW of the SW corner of the basketball court and on the E end of the second plant box from the municipal hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty about 1 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-18, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.48609706, '17° 29\' 9.949410\"', 120.43290760, '120° 25\' 58.467200\"', 0.0100, '1', 43.3120, 0.0300, '1', 6.6016, 227389.31430, 1935166.70000, '51', 17.48779452, '17° 29\' 16.060260\"', 120.43161500, '120° 25\' 53.813960\"', 9.8783, 1934168.56000, 439635.14800, '3', 227250.62200, 1935239.54400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(188, 'ILS-19', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'NARVACAN', 'QUINARAYAN', 2005, 17.44189346, '17° 26\' 30.816456\"', 120.46886910, '120° 28\' 7.928760\"', 'ILS-19 Is located in Brgy. Quinarayan, Narvacan, Ilocos Sur. It is situated in the W side of the highway junction going to Vigan City, Bangued and Manila. It is near the concrete step, about 6 m. SW of the monument of Andres Bonifacio. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"ILS-19, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.44190584, '17° 26\' 30.861020\"', 120.46887010, '120° 28\' 7.932360\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.9520, 0.0300, '1', 8.6812, 231145.48720, 1930222.76700, '51', 17.44359988, '17° 26\' 36.959550\"', 120.46757660, '120° 28\' 3.275610\"', 12.2909, 1929266.65300, 443440.86900, '3', 231006.67300, 1930295.46000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(189, 'ILS-2', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA LUCIA', 'CATAYAGAN', 1991, 17.13110330, '17° 7\' 51.971880\"', 120.44372290, '120° 26\' 37.402440\"', 'ILS-2 Is in an open ground, right side of the road dike leading to the cemetery. Travel time from Sta. Lucia proper is 3 min. Accessible by 2-wheel drive vehicle. Mark is a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in standard concrete block, 1 m. deep, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. Reference mark (RM) is a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in concrete blocks, 0.6 m. deep, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. RM No. 2 is a brass rod in a drilled hole.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.13111508, '17° 7\' 52.014270\"', 120.44372560, '120° 26\' 37.412300\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.6460, 0.0400, '1', 8.0788, 228016.70240, 1895847.76900, '51', 17.13279090, '17° 7\' 58.047240\"', 120.44242480, '120° 26\' 32.729440\"', 12.0605, 1894878.52300, 440669.46900, '3', 227876.82300, 1895920.30200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(190, 'ILS-21', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTIAGO', 'POBLACION SUR', 2005, 17.29464513, '17° 17\' 40.722468\"', 120.44617730, '120° 26\' 46.238280\"', 'ILS-21 Is in Brgy. Poblacion, Santiago, Ilocos Sur. From Vigan City, travel S to the town of Santiago. On the town proper, turn left on the street before reaching the Santiago Municipal Hall. This road leads to Santiago South Central School and the municipal concrete water tank. It is located on top of the concrete water tank. The water tank is located beside a mini-park, 20 m. E of Santiago South Central School, about 40 m. NNW of the gymnasium and Santiago Municipal Hall. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILS-21, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.29465767, '17° 17\' 40.767620\"', 120.44617830, '120° 26\' 46.241890\"', 0.0100, '1', 61.2640, 0.0300, '1', 23.5240, 228516.80130, 1913951.54800, '51', 17.29634333, '17° 17\' 46.835980\"', 120.44488130, '120° 26\' 41.572740\"', 27.1894, 1912977.20400, 440982.76300, '3', 228377.47500, 1914024.20100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(191, 'ILS-22', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'LIDLIDDA', 'POBLACION NORTE', 2005, 17.26876030, '17° 16\' 7.537080\"', 120.52043410, '120° 31\' 13.562760\"', 'ILS-22 From Candon City, travel N along the national highway for about 6 km. then turn E at the junction and travel for about 8 km. until reaching the Lidlidda Public Market. Turn NW and travel for about 4 km. to reach the North Central School. It is located inside the school compound on the science park near the NE corner of the concrete stage. It is 1.5 m. NNW of the E corner of the concrete stage and 0.8 m. NNE of the NE side of the stage. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 10 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-22, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.26877251, '17° 16\' 7.581020\"', 120.52043510, '120° 31\' 13.566400\"', 0.0100, '1', 87.8580, 0.0300, '1', 48.7867, 236377.92670, 1910982.49700, '51', 17.27045500, '17° 16\' 13.638000\"', 120.51913760, '120° 31\' 8.895460\"', 53.5227, 1910091.07600, 448870.31700, '3', 236238.56800, 1911054.88900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(192, 'ILS-23', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN EMILIO', 'CABAROAN', 2005, 17.23629737, '17° 14\' 10.670532\"', 120.57852090, '120° 34\' 42.675240\"', 'ILS-23 From Candon City, travel N along the national highway for about 6 km. then turn E at the junction and travel for about 17 km. until reaching the San Emilio West Central School. It is located inside the school compound on the Math Park. It is on the E corner of the park, about 17 m. WNW of the N corner of the school office and about 23 m. W of Acacia tree no. 8. It is SSE of the municipal hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 30 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-23, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.23630936, '17° 14\' 10.713690\"', 120.57852210, '120° 34\' 42.679680\"', 0.0100, '1', 283.2130, 0.0300, '1', 242.9487, 242511.62620, 1907310.01300, '51', 17.23798859, '17° 14\' 16.758940\"', 120.57722400, '120° 34\' 38.006460\"', 248.6352, 1906483.78500, 455038.82900, '3', 242372.20600, 1907382.18700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(193, 'ILS-27', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'GREGORIO DEL PILAR', 'POBLACION NORTE', 2005, 17.14814178, '17° 8\' 53.310408\"', 120.60993210, '120° 36\' 35.755560\"', 'ILS-27 Is in So. Cobcobuan, Brgy. Poblacion Norte, Gregorio del Pilar, Ilocos Sur. The town of Gregorio del Pilar can be reached by taking the provincial road passing through the towns of Galimuyod and Salcedo. Continue traveling this road, series of rough/dirt, crossing a river by about ten times until reaching the town proper. Public transportation is difficult and scheduled only once a day. Upon reaching the town proper, take the road to the left, leading to So. Cobcobuan and Tangaoan. Then turn left upon reaching an intersection, an uphill climb with an outpost opposite the road to the left. Continue traveling passing through Gregorio del Pilar High School on the right side. Then stop upon reaching a vacant lot on the left side of the road. Follow the trail going to the hill and ask for the house of Municipal Coun. Domingo Burgos in the area. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, about 60 cm. deep, protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"ILS-27, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.14815327, '17° 8\' 53.351780\"', 120.60993330, '120° 36\' 35.759990\"', 0.0100, '1', 363.3990, 0.0400, '1', 322.1516, 245732.95670, 1897508.90700, '51', 17.14982648, '17° 8\' 59.375320\"', 120.60863320, '120° 36\' 31.079620\"', 328.4671, 1896720.55700, 458359.46500, '3', 245593.26700, 1897580.90800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(194, 'ILS-28', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'TAGUDIN', 'DARDARAT', 2005, 16.96182221, '16° 57\' 42.559956\"', 120.43999550, '120° 26\' 23.983800\"', 'ILS-28 From Candon City, travel S for about 26 km. until reaching a group of restaurants along the national highway in Brgy. Dardarat, Tagudin. A few meters S of Amie\'s Restaurant is a waiting shed on the NW corner of the street going to Seaside Park. Travel NW along the street for about 400 m. passing by a small bridge to reach the station. It is located inside the resthouse compound of Mayor Roque Verzosa. It is about 19 m. SW of the stairs on the SW side of the house, about 12 m. NW of the river, 3.6 m. N of the S corner fence, 3.1 m. NE of the SW fence and 0.95 m. NW of the SE fence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 30 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-28, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 16.96183181, '16° 57\' 42.594500\"', 120.43999680, '120° 26\' 23.988490\"', 0.0100, '1', 44.6800, 0.0500, '1', 5.3967, 227374.08460, 1877110.35300, '51', 16.96349743, '16° 57\' 48.590760\"', 120.43869210, '120° 26\' 19.291440\"', 9.5718, 1876145.19900, 440218.45000, '3', 227233.63300, 1877182.76500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(195, 'ILS-3018', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'NARVACAN', 'SULVEC', 2007, 17.44698074, '17° 26\' 49.130664\"', 120.45185090, '120° 27\' 6.663240\"', 'ILS-3018 Station is located and established along the national highway, NW corner of a triangle park beside a jetmatic pump, in front of Sulvec Elementary School and an outpost at Brgy. Sulvec, Narvacan Ilocos Sur. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm with inscription ILS-3018,2007, PRS-92, DENR FNSP R-1.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.44699417, '17° 26\' 49.179010\"', 120.45185240, '120° 27\' 6.668710\"', 0.0100, '1', 42.4620, 0.0300, '1', 5.4256, 229344.41840, 1930810.19300, '51', 17.44868888, '17° 26\' 55.279950\"', 120.45055900, '120° 27\' 2.012300\"', 8.8580, 1929834.95300, 441634.67100, '3', 229205.60800, 1930882.94500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(196, 'ILS-3019', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'NARVACAN', 'NAGUNEG', 2007, 17.40183241, '17° 24\' 6.596676\"', 120.47138100, '120° 28\' 16.971600\"', 'ILS-3019 Station is established and located along the barangay road beside a river inside the lot of Edmund Soliven, 150 m from the national hghway going to Brgy. San Pedro, Narvacan, Ilocos Sur after a bridge. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm with inscription ILS-3019 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.40184516, '17° 24\' 6.642570\"', 120.47138290, '120° 28\' 16.978410\"', 0.0100, '1', 41.2550, 0.0300, '1', 3.7728, 231353.89010, 1925783.76400, '51', 17.40353673, '17° 24\' 12.732240\"', 120.47008840, '120° 28\' 12.318320\"', 7.4602, 1924832.27100, 443695.43100, '3', 231214.94200, 1925856.41900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(197, 'ILS-3022', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'NARVACAN', 'CODOOG', 2007, 17.44469444, '17° 26\' 40.899984\"', 120.51273410, '120° 30\' 45.842760\"', 'ILS-3022 The monument is located along the national road going to the municipality of Nagbukel Ilocos Sur around 50 m west of the barangay hall and chapel of Codoog and 80 m from a crossing going to Codoog Elementary School at Brgy. Codoog, Narvacan, Ilocos Sur. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by abut 20 cm with inscription ILS-3022 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.44470779, '17° 26\' 40.948040\"', 120.51273600, '120° 30\' 45.849470\"', 0.0100, '1', 53.9420, 0.0200, '1', 16.0909, 235811.36120, 1930471.75300, '51', 17.44640105, '17° 26\' 47.043790\"', 120.51144250, '120° 30\' 41.193170\"', 20.1843, 1929564.20200, 448101.62500, '3', 235672.58800, 1930544.30700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(198, 'ILS-3054', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA LUCIA', 'DAMACUAG', 2007, 17.10753892, '17° 6\' 27.140112\"', 120.46327090, '120° 27\' 47.775240\"', 'ILS-3054 Station is located along the intersection of barangay road, 300 meters east of an national highway following the road going to barangay Damacuag, near a duhat tree at the intersection of an irrigation canal at barangay Damacuag, Sta. Lucia, Ilocos Sur. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3054, PRS-92, DENR-FNSP R-1.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.10755286, '17° 6\' 27.190290\"', 120.46327580, '120° 27\' 47.793040\"', 0.0100, '1', 50.9350, 0.0400, '1', 11.9490, 230063.92560, 1893211.77500, '51', 17.10922683, '17° 6\' 33.216600\"', 120.46197450, '120° 27\' 43.108310\"', 16.2282, 1892264.99100, 442742.55700, '3', 229923.98200, 1893284.22700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(199, 'ILS-3120 (BLLM-21)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CABUGAO', 'SALOMAGUE', 2013, 17.78149481, '17° 46\' 53.381316\"', 120.41339380, '120° 24\' 48.217680\"', 'ILS-3120 (BLLM-21) The station is located at Barangay Salomague, Cabugao, Ilocos Sur at the left side of farm to market roaf going to National road about 10 meters East of the road and 200 meters SW of Cabugao South Central School. Station mark is the head of 4\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 x 0.25m. concrete monument protruding 0.20 meters above the ground surface with inscription \'CABUGAO, I.S.; BLLM-21; CAD 1345-D; DENR, R-1; 2013.\"', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.78150946, '17° 46\' 53.434040\"', 120.41339780, '120° 24\' 48.232250\"', 0.0300, '3', 40.4930, 0.1100, '1', 4.1735, 225763.97260, 1967904.18300, '51', 17.78322498, '17° 46\' 59.609930\"', 120.41211210, '120° 24\' 43.603550\"', 8.0542, 1966870.00700, 437665.43900, '3', 225626.26100, 1967977.31200, '51', 17.78155454, '17° 46\' 53.596350\"', 120.41338920, '120° 24\' 48.201180\"', 0.0282, 39.3080, 0.0957, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(200, 'ILS-3437', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SALCEDO', 'CALANGCUASAN', 2009, 17.16529673, '17° 9\' 55.068228\"', 120.52742960, '120° 31\' 38.746560\"', 'ILS-3437 From Santa Lucia Town Proper travel northward following the cemented provincial road to reach Barangay Calancuasan. The station is located along provincial road within the Victory Bridge near Victory Elementary School 5 meters and 60 meters south of the road and the said school. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3437; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.16530668, '17° 9\' 55.104030\"', 120.52743320, '120° 31\' 38.759540\"', 0.0100, '1', 107.9550, 0.0400, '1', 68.1802, 236975.92150, 1899517.93500, '51', 17.16698276, '17° 10\' 1.137920\"', 120.52613330, '120° 31\' 34.080000\"', 73.2757, 1898638.66000, 449586.14400, '3', 236836.22100, 1899590.22300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(201, 'ILS-3481', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CERVANTES', 'ROSARIO', 2009, 16.98088176, '16° 58\' 51.174336\"', 120.74036710, '120° 44\' 25.321560\"', 'ILS-3481 From Cervantes Municipal Hall drive southeast to any king of vehicle going to Mankayan, at the intersection passing ISPSC (Cervantes Campus) just go straight for 300-500 meters going to Cervantes National High School. The station is located 100 meters southeast of ISPSC and 100 meters northeast of Cervanes National High School and 250 meters southwest of Globe Cellsite. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3481; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 16.98088609, '16° 58\' 51.189930\"', 120.74036610, '120° 44\' 25.317780\"', 0.0100, '1', 588.5050, 0.0400, '1', 544.9586, 259400.78860, 1878826.68600, '51', 16.98254627, '16° 58\' 57.166560\"', 120.73906230, '120° 44\' 20.624230\"', 552.7329, 1878186.13700, 472212.17900, '3', 259260.64200, 1878898.12800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(202, 'ILS-6', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN JUAN', 'SURNGIT', 1995, 17.76254603, '17° 45\' 45.165708\"', 120.40750050, '120° 24\' 27.001800\"', 'ILS-6 Is located on the coastal barangay at Brgy. Surngit, San Juan. Station is placed on locally known as \"Raois Point\" whose locality is a fishpond area and set on top corner edge of a fishpond dike, being 5 m. from the high water line. Mark is head of a 4\" copper nail on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument with inscription \"ILS-6, 1995, NAMRIA\", and about 0.5 m. from the dike edge. Fishpond owner is Mr. Criscencio Vite. No reference marks. To reach the station from the national road of poblacion of San Juan take the road going W. There is a concrete monument marker that points to the said Brgy. Surngit along the national road, distance is about 5.1 km. Just follow the road and upon reaching a wooden small bridge then the steel arch of Brgy. Surngit straight then and take the road going left and follow again the road until reach the NW extremity of the coast. *Note: Station upgraded to 2nd Order (by: LTSG. Custodio G. Armengol, May 2005).', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.76256094, '17° 45\' 45.219380\"', 120.40750380, '120° 24\' 27.013610\"', 0.0100, '1', 42.0210, 0.0300, '1', 5.7458, 225109.72770, 1965814.71800, '51', 17.76427546, '17° 45\' 51.391660\"', 120.40621760, '120° 24\' 22.383310\"', 9.5352, 1964774.80900, 437033.78300, '3', 224971.94900, 1965887.85300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(203, 'ILS-9', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN JUAN', 'BACSIL', 2000, 17.72624089, '17° 43\' 34.467204\"', 120.45389200, '120° 27\' 14.011200\"', 'ILS-9 Is located in Bo. Bacsil, San Juan, Ilocos Sur at the hilly portion of Bacsil National High School compound, 10 m. W from the school building. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 8 in. x 8 in. cement putty set at the edge of a concrete road with inscribe station name \"ILS-9, NAMRIA, 2000\". *Note: Station upgraded to 2nd Order (by: LTSG. Custodio G. Armengol, May 2005).', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 17.72625557, '17° 43\' 34.520050\"', 120.45389530, '120° 27\' 14.023120\"', 0.0100, '1', 87.4830, 0.0300, '1', 50.7936, 229976.96210, 1961727.50900, '51', 17.72796693, '17° 43\' 40.680950\"', 120.45260830, '120° 27\' 9.390050\"', 54.7689, 1960741.58900, 441941.60500, '3', 229839.09500, 1961800.46500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(204, 'ILN-11', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CITY OF BATAC', 'BIL-LOCA', 2004, 18.10118535, '18° 6\' 4.267260\"', 120.58442780, '120° 35\' 3.940080\"', 'Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set on a 20cm x 20cm concrete frustum with inscription \"LNGS-2279; 2015; NAMRIA\". The station is in Brgy. Dariwdiw, Batac, Ilocos Norte. It is located right side along the road going to Brgy. Nagbacalan.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.42, 18.05574986, '18° 3\' 20.699500\"', 120.56514960, '120° 33\' 54.538540\"', 0.0300, '3', 72.9780, 0.1100, '1', 36.1247, 242258.36310, 1998051.63800, '51', 18.05747843, '18° 3\' 26.922330\"', 120.56387040, '120° 33\' 49.933450\"', 41.0644, 1997177.89800, 453827.96900, '3', 242121.68200, 1998124.48000, '51', 18.05579503, '18° 3\' 20.862100\"', 120.56514100, '120° 33\' 54.507660\"', 0.0274, 71.8220, 0.0941, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(205, 'ARA-11', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'SAN LUIS', 'BARANGAY III', 2006, 15.72167074, '15° 43\' 18.014664\"', 121.51987230, '121° 31\' 11.540280\"', 'ARA-11 Is inside the compound of Paaralang Sentral ng San Luis, situated on the plant box parallel, approx. 6 m. S, to the abandoned school hall. The L-shaped plant box, where the station is located, is about 0.44 m. high, 0.84 m. wide and E of the flagpole and the Manuel L. Quezon Monument. It is also 11.2 m. E of the corner of the plant box. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding 10 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"ARA-11 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.72167371, '15° 43\' 18.025370\"', 121.51987100, '121° 31\' 11.535610\"', 0.0200, '1', 66.0330, 0.0800, '1', 21.2956, 341406.15590, 1738704.02700, '51', 15.72323887, '15° 43\' 23.659940\"', 121.51853890, '121° 31\' 6.739860\"', 24.5148, 1738892.48000, 555575.87100, '3', 341262.44300, 1738771.92400, '51', 15.72171833, '15° 43\' 18.185990\"', 121.51986310, '121° 31\' 11.507240\"', 0.0197, 64.5690, 0.0739, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(206, 'ARA-12 (DPL-12)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'DIPACULAO', 'DITALE', 2006, 15.92268353, '15° 55\' 21.660708\"', 121.57370980, '121° 34\' 25.355280\"', 'ARA-12 (DPL-12) Is located on the school grounds of Ditale Elem. School, situated 7 m. E of the entrance gate, 7 m. N of the stage and 35 m. W of the flagpole of the said school. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete block flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"DPL-12 2006 NAMRIA DENR\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.92268666, '15° 55\' 21.671960\"', 121.57370840, '121° 34\' 25.350230\"', 0.0200, '1', 56.1410, 0.0800, '1', 11.1284, 347326.78780, 1760904.83700, '51', 15.92426331, '15° 55\' 27.347900\"', 121.57238100, '121° 34\' 20.571770\"', 15.0969, 1761150.70900, 561286.12400, '3', 347183.78200, 1760972.73900, '51', 15.92273134, '15° 55\' 21.832810\"', 121.57370050, '121° 34\' 25.321900\"', 0.0201, 54.7010, 0.0739, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(207, 'ARA-13', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'DIPACULAO', 'BORLONGAN', 2006, 15.98553556, '15° 59\' 7.928016\"', 121.65068240, '121° 39\' 2.456640\"', 'ARA-13 Is located on the grounds of Borlongan Brgy. Plaza, situated on the E side of the S end of the second plant box from the main entrance arc of the said plaza, about 30 m. N of the main entrance arc. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded and centered in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 20 cm. concrete block flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"ARA-13 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.98553876, '15° 59\' 7.939540\"', 121.65068100, '121° 39\' 2.451540\"', 0.0200, '2', 53.7520, 0.0800, '1', 9.0824, 355612.45590, 1767804.03500, '51', 15.98711767, '15° 59\' 13.623620\"', 121.64935520, '121° 38\' 57.678840\"', 12.7117, 1768129.82100, 569506.53800, '3', 355469.72200, 1767871.74700, '51', 15.98558347, '15° 59\' 8.100480\"', 121.65067320, '121° 39\' 2.423340\"', 0.0208, 52.3170, 0.0749, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(208, 'ARA-14', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'DIPACULAO', 'DINADIAWAN', 2006, 16.07693070, '16° 4\' 36.950520\"', 121.77055850, '121° 46\' 14.010600\"', 'ARA-14 Is located on the school grounds of Dinadiawan Elem School, 51 km. drive from Dipaculao Municipal Hall along the road leading to Casiguran. It is situated 1.5 km. S of the flagpole, 7 m. SE of the DepEd marker and 40 m. N of the stage of the said school. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block flushed and leveled on the ground, with inscriptions \"ARA-14 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 16.07693382, '16° 4\' 36.961750\"', 121.77055700, '121° 46\' 14.005230\"', 0.0200, '2', 57.5790, 0.0900, '1', 13.2495, 368501.80850, 1777836.13900, '51', 16.07851584, '16° 4\' 42.657020\"', 121.76923360, '121° 46\' 9.240970\"', 16.5260, 1778287.32000, 582301.33900, '3', 368359.47500, 1777903.54900, '51', 16.07697856, '16° 4\' 37.122820\"', 121.77054920, '121° 46\' 13.977220\"', 0.0224, 56.1520, 0.0804, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(209, 'ARA-15', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'DINALUNGAN', 'ABULEG', 2006, 16.11895457, '16° 7\' 8.236452\"', 121.85887060, '121° 51\' 31.934160\"', 'ARA-15 Is located on the NW corner of Abuleg Brgy. Plaza, situated 1 m. from each of the N and W fences, about 7 m. SE of the intersection of the roads bounding the N and W side of the plaza and 15 m. W of the stage. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 20 cm. concrete block flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"ARA-15 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 16.11895780, '16° 7\' 8.248080\"', 121.85886900, '121° 51\' 31.928260\"', 0.0200, '2', 55.4350, 0.0900, '1', 11.3523, 377974.22230, 1782431.29800, '51', 16.12054052, '16° 7\' 13.945870\"', 121.85754670, '121° 51\' 27.168080\"', 14.2963, 1782974.86800, 591731.34300, '3', 377832.10000, 1782498.46400, '51', 16.11900256, '16° 7\' 8.409220\"', 121.85886120, '121° 51\' 31.900400\"', 0.0207, 54.0110, 0.0764, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(210, 'ARA-16', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'MARIA AURORA', 'GALINTUJA', 2006, 15.78830568, '15° 47\' 17.900448\"', 121.31687720, '121° 19\' 0.757920\"', 'ARA-16 Is located on top of the concrete water tank in Aurora Animal Breeding Station in Brgy. Galintuja. It is situated 40 m. S of the nat\'l. road leading to Baler, 15 m. S of the sleeping quarters of the said breeding station, 0.5 m. from the E edge and 1 m. from the S edge of the water tank. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty flushed on top of the said water tank, with inscriptions \"ARA-16 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.78830849, '15° 47\' 17.910570\"', 121.31687610, '121° 19\' 0.753970\"', 0.0200, '2', 348.8580, 0.0800, '1', 303.5086, 319709.30120, 1746240.13000, '51', 15.78988226, '15° 47\' 23.576130\"', 121.31554530, '121° 18\' 55.962920\"', 308.0319, 1746223.38600, 533808.17900, '3', 319565.64300, 1746308.72700, '51', 15.78835311, '15° 47\' 18.071190\"', 121.31686810, '121° 19\' 0.725200\"', 0.0206, 347.4070, 0.0757, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(211, 'ARA-17', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'MARIA AURORA', 'DIANAWAN', 2006, 15.73972851, '15° 44\' 23.022636\"', 121.38885340, '121° 23\' 19.872240\"', 'ARA-17 Is located on the school grounds of Francisco Q. Dagyapen Memorial Elem. School in Brgy. Dianawan, Maria Aurora. It is attached on the W side of the concrete stand of the flagpole of the said school. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embbedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 20 cm. concrete block flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"ARA-17 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.73973139, '15° 44\' 23.032990\"', 121.38885210, '121° 23\' 19.867500\"', 0.0200, '2', 145.8670, 0.0900, '1', 100.6003, 327379.84060, 1740804.75900, '51', 15.74130056, '15° 44\' 28.682000\"', 121.38752020, '121° 23\' 15.072590\"', 104.7206, 1740860.85200, 541529.69200, '3', 327236.07800, 1740873.08900, '51', 15.73977600, '15° 44\' 23.193590\"', 121.38884410, '121° 23\' 19.838880\"', 0.0218, 144.4080, 0.0844, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(212, 'ARA-19 (MBM-5)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'DINGALAN', 'TANAWAN', 2007, 15.42196063, '15° 25\' 19.058268\"', 121.36121750, '121° 21\' 40.383000\"', 'ARA-19 (MBM-5) From Dingalan Proper, travel NW going to Gabaldon for about 10 mins. (7 km.). Station is located at the boundary of Brgys. Pinamalisan, Gabaldon, Nueva Ecija and Tanawan, Dingalan, Aurora. It is on the E corner of the waiting shed beside house no. 30, about 40 m. S of Pinamalisan Primary School, about 7 m. SW of the road centerline. It is also 3.5 m. SW of the km. post indicating \"7 km. to Dingalan and 5 km. to Gabaldon\". Mark is a 10 mm. rebar, set on top of the municipal boundary monument 28 cm. x 28 cm. x 70 cm. from the ground, inscribed on top with \"MBM No. 5\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.42196222, '15° 25\' 19.063990\"', 121.36121540, '121° 21\' 40.375540\"', 0.0200, '2', 316.7220, 0.0700, '1', 271.8431, 324147.93360, 1705666.66000, '51', 15.42351183, '15° 25\' 24.642590\"', 121.35987600, '121° 21\' 35.553690\"', 274.6972, 1705693.99900, 538626.42100, '3', 324003.10000, 1705734.79200, '51', 15.42200673, '15° 25\' 19.224230\"', 121.36120750, '121° 21\' 40.346970\"', 0.0168, 315.2260, 0.0640, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(213, 'ARA-20', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'SAN LUIS', 'DIBAYABAY', 2006, 15.63451261, '15° 38\' 4.245396\"', 121.58305090, '121° 34\' 58.983240\"', 'ARA-20 From Brgy. Sabang, Baler, travel by banca going to San Luis. Station is located on Dibayabay Brgy. Proper, about 15 m. NW from the back of the stage near the basketball court, 17 m. W from the brgy. hall and about 10 m. NE from the Health Care. It is also situated inside the wooden fence surrounding the resthouse of the Brgy. Tanod about 0.5 m. S from the N corner of the fence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscription \"ARA-20 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.63451571, '15° 38\' 4.256560\"', 121.58304970, '121° 34\' 58.978980\"', 0.0200, '2', 50.6230, 0.0900, '1', 6.7889, 348112.42450, 1729014.45200, '51', 15.63607397, '15° 38\' 9.866280\"', 121.58171560, '121° 34\' 54.176200\"', 8.6911, 1729265.42300, 562373.67300, '3', 347968.47700, 1729082.07100, '51', 15.63456031, '15° 38\' 4.417100\"', 121.58304190, '121° 34\' 58.950760\"', 0.0207, 49.1480, 0.0806, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(214, 'ARA-21', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'SAN LUIS', 'DIKAPINISAN', 2006, 15.57665359, '15° 34\' 35.952924\"', 121.54385730, '121° 32\' 37.886280\"', 'ARA-21 From Brgy. Sabang, Baler, travel by banca going to San Luis. Station is located inside the compound of Paaralang Elementarya ng Dikapinisan, about 28 m. SE of the flagpole. Station is situated beside the plantbox, with one attached to the W end of the main gate of the school. It is 0.93 m. W of the plantbox and 11.4 m. N of the W end of the gate. It is also situated between the 5th and 6th, starting from the gate, small ornamental plants. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"ARA-21 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.57665650, '15° 34\' 35.963400\"', 121.54385600, '121° 32\' 37.881650\"', 0.0200, '2', 51.5470, 0.0900, '1', 7.4597, 343866.57760, 1722641.24000, '51', 15.57821196, '15° 34\' 41.563040\"', 121.54252050, '121° 32\' 33.073750\"', 9.5376, 1722852.03600, 558187.22600, '3', 343722.40600, 1722708.93300, '51', 15.57670108, '15° 34\' 36.123870\"', 121.54384820, '121° 32\' 37.853370\"', 0.0204, 50.0650, 0.0786, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
