(232, 'ARA-4213', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'SAN LUIS', 'DIMANAYAT', 2012, 15.48968276, '15° 29\' 22.857936\"', 121.47796830, '121° 28\' 40.685880\"', 'ARA-4213 The station is located at Barangay Dimanayat, San Luis, Aurora established in between Barangay Hall and Basketball Court near the flagpole. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on top of a concrete monument 30cm. x 30cm. with inscriptions \"ARA-4213; 2012; 4th Order; DENR.\"', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.48968564, '15° 29\' 22.868320\"', 121.47796720, '121° 28\' 40.681930\"', 0.0200, '2', 68.7950, 0.0800, '1', 24.3198, 336731.85030, 1713067.81900, '51', 15.49123703, '15° 29\' 28.453320\"', 121.47662950, '121° 28\' 35.866290\"', 26.6871, 1713211.76800, 551141.48000, '3', 336587.33600, 1713135.64400, '51', 15.48973019, '15° 29\' 23.028680\"', 121.47795930, '121° 28\' 40.653560\"', 0.0186, 67.3040, 0.0722, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(233, 'ARA-5', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'MARIA AURORA', 'BARANGAY III', 2006, 15.79710567, '15° 47\' 49.580412\"', 121.47532060, '121° 28\' 31.154160\"', 'ARA-5 Is located on the school grounds of Maria Aurora Central School. It is situated 5 m. from the E side of the said grounds, 35 m. NE of the flagpole and 50 m. S of the multi-purpose hall of the said school. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block flushed and leveled on the ground, with inscriptions \"ARA-5 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.79710861, '15° 47\' 49.591000\"', 121.47531930, '121° 28\' 31.149370\"', 0.0200, '2', 75.4090, 0.0800, '1', 30.3324, 336691.88160, 1747084.49800, '51', 15.79867951, '15° 47\' 55.246240\"', 121.47398880, '121° 28\' 26.359750\"', 34.2251, 1747228.61400, 550782.23900, '3', 336548.38000, 1747152.60300, '51', 15.79715325, '15° 47\' 49.751690\"', 121.47531140, '121° 28\' 31.120900\"', 0.0194, 73.9560, 0.0724, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(234, 'ARA-6', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'DIPACULAO', 'NORTH POBLACION', 2006, 15.84907422, '15° 50\' 56.667192\"', 121.53697090, '121° 32\' 13.095240\"', 'ARA-6 Is located on the compound of Dipaculao Municipal Hall, situated 1 m. W of the volleyball court, 10 m. NW of the polygonal multi-purpose hall and 30 m. W of the municipal hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 20 cm. concrete block flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"ARA-6 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.84907729, '15° 50\' 56.678250\"', 121.53696960, '121° 32\' 13.090510\"', 0.0200, '2', 52.8730, 0.0800, '1', 7.9708, 343336.52970, 1752787.60700, '51', 15.85065012, '15° 51\' 2.340420\"', 121.53564050, '121° 32\' 8.305620\"', 11.6960, 1752994.97300, 557372.97000, '3', 343193.25100, 1752855.56200, '51', 15.84912195, '15° 50\' 56.839010\"', 121.53696170, '121° 32\' 13.062130\"', 0.0198, 51.4250, 0.0743, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(235, 'ARA-7', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'SAN LUIS', 'L.PIMINTEL', 2006, 15.68483710, '15° 41\' 5.413560\"', 121.50033600, '121° 30\' 1.209600\"', 'ARA-7 Is inside the compound of L. Pimintel Brgy. Hall, 2.7 m. S of the ESE corner of the basketball court, 10 m. NE of the NE corner of the stage and about 9 m. NNE of the NE corner of the Health Care. It is situated along the imaginary line extending the N side of the said hall E. It is also 3.2 m. SE of the lamp post and 2.4 m. W of the E concrete wall of the compound. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"ARA-7 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.68483994, '15° 41\' 5.423770\"', 121.50033470, '121° 30\' 1.204850\"', 0.0200, '1', 117.2420, 0.0800, '1', 72.3487, 339283.57930, 1734643.34700, '51', 15.68640319, '15° 41\' 11.051470\"', 121.49900160, '121° 29\' 56.405910\"', 75.6610, 1734811.66200, 553491.47700, '3', 339139.72900, 1734711.27300, '51', 15.68488454, '15° 41\' 5.584340\"', 121.50032680, '121° 30\' 1.176450\"', 0.0189, 115.7740, 0.0710, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(236, 'ARA-9', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'AURORA', 'MARIA AURORA', 'DIPAWAN', 2006, 15.69594888, '15° 41\' 45.415968\"', 121.36223130, '121° 21\' 44.032680\"', 'ARA-9 Is located on the center of the concrete pavement on top of a small mountain (former military camp), about 1.5 km. from Dipawan Bridge going to Bongabong. It is situated approx. 30 m. S of the small wooden chapel, which is about 400 m. from Km. Post 190. The access to the top is the ruins of a concrete stair W of the nat\'l. road. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"ARA-9 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.92, 15.69595171, '15° 41\' 45.426170\"', 121.36223020, '121° 21\' 44.028870\"', 0.0200, '2', 495.1800, 0.0800, '1', 449.7859, 324489.36350, 1735982.47000, '51', 15.69751862, '15° 41\' 51.067030\"', 121.36089730, '121° 21\' 39.230370\"', 453.9675, 1736011.50000, 538684.81300, '3', 324345.44100, 1736050.83700, '51', 15.69599631, '15° 41\' 45.586700\"', 121.36222230, '121° 21\' 44.000220\"', 0.0191, 493.7180, 0.0725, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(237, 'BLN-3006', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'NORZAGARAY', 'BANGKAL', 2007, 14.92682297, '14° 55\' 36.562692\"', 121.10585430, '121° 6\' 21.075480\"', 'BLN-3006 From Norzagaray municipal hall travel for about 9 km to Brgy. Bangkal passing Brgys. Matictic and Coral. Station is about 700 m past Brgy. Bangkal Elementary School located at the SE corner of the road going to So. Loren and Brgy. Baraka. It is about 4 m from the road centerline, 30 m WSW of the brgy. hall and about 12 m N of the day care center. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete monument protruding about 20 cm above the ground with inscriptions BLN-3006 2007 NAMRIA.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.92682408, '14° 55\' 36.566700\"', 121.10585230, '121° 6\' 21.068340\"', 0.0100, '1', 245.3090, 0.0500, '1', 200.7424, 296263.47860, 1651100.13100, '51', 14.92834777, '14° 55\' 42.051960\"', 121.10450080, '121° 6\' 16.202980\"', 202.4570, 1650880.08900, 511242.44200, '3', 296116.77900, 1651168.63600, '51', 14.92686842, '14° 55\' 36.726300\"', 121.10584430, '121° 6\' 21.039430\"', 0.0123, 243.7590, 0.0469, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(238, 'BLN-3062', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'CALUMPIT', 'SAPANG BAYAN', 2008, 14.91392496, '14° 54\' 50.129856\"', 120.77721320, '120° 46\' 37.967520\"', 'BLN-3062 Station is located in the Province of Bulacan, Mun. of Calumpit, Brgy. Sapang Bayan. From Pungo Boundary travel 30 m W past the Smart Tower. Then, travel 450 m N towards Sapang Bayan. Station is situated at the left side of the road about 480 m from Pugong Boundary, about 280 m from BLN-3061 and about 250 m from the concrete road going to BLN-3061. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions, \"BLN-3062, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.91392455, '14° 54\' 50.128390\"', 120.77721010, '120° 46\' 37.956500\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.7210, 0.0100, '1', 3.8804, 260885.76740, 1649999.86600, '51', 14.91545480, '14° 54\' 55.637290\"', 120.77585780, '120° 46\' 33.088200\"', 3.6315, 1649463.16100, 475884.78500, '3', 260738.72900, 1650069.42800, '51', 14.91396886, '14° 54\' 50.287900\"', 120.77720190, '120° 46\' 37.926980\"', 0.0088, 44.1780, 0.0171, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(239, 'BLN-3120', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'PAOMBONG', 'SAN ISIDRO II', 2008, 14.84627379, '14° 50\' 46.585644\"', 120.76352550, '120° 45\' 48.691800\"', 'BLN-3120 Station is located in the Province of Bulacan, Mun. of Paombong, Brgy. Abulalas. It is situated about 1 m SE of the welcome arch of Abulalas. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions, \"BLN-3120, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.84627330, '14° 50\' 46.583870\"', 120.76352330, '120° 45\' 48.683860\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.2390, 0.0100, '1', 3.4277, 259337.67730, 1642527.19100, '51', 14.84779951, '14° 50\' 52.078250\"', 120.76216940, '120° 45\' 43.809740\"', 2.9878, 1641979.53800, 474404.07100, '3', 259190.40100, 1642596.73500, '51', 14.84631758, '14° 50\' 46.743300\"', 120.76351510, '120° 45\' 48.654340\"', 0.0087, 43.6880, 0.0168, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(240, 'BLN-3337', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'SAN MIGUEL', 'CALUMPANG', 2009, 15.18398516, '15° 11\' 2.346576\"', 121.03361120, '121° 2\' 1.000320\"', 'BLN-3337 Station is located in the Province of Bulacan, Municipality of San Miguel, Barangay Purok 3 Calumpang, From Welcome Arch of Calumpang travel West then turn Northwest towards Purok 3, Calumpang until reaching the Barangay Hall and the Day Care Center. BLN-3337 is located at about 20m. Southwest of the Chapel and approximately 80m. Southwest of BLN-3338. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail centered on a 0.20m x 0.20m x 1.00 concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"BLN-3337;2009;LMS-III\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 15.18398478, '15° 11\' 2.345220\"', 121.03359540, '121° 2\' 0.943590\"', 0.0100, '1', 94.8060, 0.0100, '1', 51.1907, 288742.63340, 1679625.47300, '51', 15.18552657, '15° 11\' 7.895650\"', 121.03224990, '121° 1\' 56.099600\"', 52.8773, 1679331.31800, 503465.35600, '3', 288596.72100, 1679694.45000, '51', 15.18402919, '15° 11\' 2.505100\"', 121.03358740, '121° 2\' 0.914480\"', 0.0085, 93.2890, 0.0163, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(241, 'BLN-3419 (NZR BLN-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'NORZAGARAY', 'MATICTIC', 2009, 14.90449578, '14° 54\' 16.184808\"', 121.07088370, '121° 4\' 15.181320\"', 'BLN-3419 (NZR BLN 2) The station is located along the road found at Palad\'s Land of Sitio Gulod, near the kawayan trees of Brgy. Matictic, Norzagaray, Bulacan, 300m away from the other monument found in the Day Care Center and the other going to Holcim. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"NZR BLN 2; CAD 350-D; DENR-11 EXTN; 2009\"', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.90449665, '14° 54\' 16.187940\"', 121.07088180, '121° 4\' 15.174360\"', 0.0100, '1', 117.3830, 0.0400, '1', 73.1918, 292479.35870, 1648661.76300, '51', 14.90601971, '14° 54\' 21.670970\"', 121.06952970, '121° 4\' 10.306820\"', 74.5514, 1648408.32700, 507480.93400, '3', 292332.55100, 1648730.36300, '51', 14.90454098, '14° 54\' 16.347520\"', 121.07087370, '121° 4\' 15.145390\"', 0.0115, 115.8300, 0.0354, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(242, 'BLN-3420 (NZR BLN-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'NORZAGARAY', 'MATICTIC', 2009, 14.90339621, '14° 54\' 12.226356\"', 121.07156010, '121° 4\' 17.616360\"', 'BLN-3420 (NZR BLN 3) The station is located along the road going to Holcim found near Cruz resident nea the Ipil-Ipil tree and along side the road is the Land Property of Santos in Brgy. Matictic, Norzagaray, Bulacan. 300m away from the other monument. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"NZR BLN 3; CAD 350-D; DENR-111; EXTN; 2009\"', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.90339731, '14° 54\' 12.230310\"', 121.07155780, '121° 4\' 17.607930\"', 0.0100, '1', 118.0120, 0.0300, '1', 73.8136, 292551.04750, 1648539.48100, '51', 14.90492029, '14° 54\' 17.713030\"', 121.07020560, '121° 4\' 12.740300\"', 75.1756, 1648286.71300, 507553.70200, '3', 292404.23700, 1648608.07900, '51', 14.90344164, '14° 54\' 12.389890\"', 121.07154970, '121° 4\' 17.578970\"', 0.0114, 116.4600, 0.0315, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(243, 'BLN-3470 (PND-048)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'PANDI', 'BUNSURAN I', 2009, 14.86419786, '14° 51\' 51.112296\"', 120.94913260, '120° 56\' 56.877360\"', 'BLN-3470 (PND-048) It is located in the province of Bulacan, Bunsuran 1st, Pandi. From Municipality of Baliuag travel SE towrds Brgy. Bunsuran 1st until reaching the Iglesia ni Cristo. PND-048 is situated about 2m. NE of the left corner of the Iglesia ni Cristo about 60m. SW of the boundary arc. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered on a 0.30m. x 0.30m. x 1.20m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscription \"PND-048; 2009; DENR-III.\"', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.86420671, '14° 51\' 51.144140\"', 120.94914170, '120° 56\' 56.910080\"', 0.0100, '1', 65.1810, 0.0300, '1', 22.2653, 279337.68310, 1644320.14600, '51', 14.86572992, '14° 51\' 56.627700\"', 120.94778850, '120° 56\' 52.038440\"', 22.5295, 1643950.32200, 494381.34000, '3', 279190.63300, 1644389.10400, '51', 14.86425101, '14° 51\' 51.303640\"', 120.94913360, '120° 56\' 56.880890\"', 0.0100, 63.6280, 0.0271, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(244, 'BLN-3623 (BLLM-44)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'CITY OF BALIWAG', 'TARCAN', 2014, 14.93289012, '14° 55\' 58.404432\"', 120.87826320, '120° 52\' 41.747520\"', 'STATION MARK : Mark is the head of a 3 inches copper nail centered on a 25 x 25 cm concrete monument, set 100 cm on the ground and protruding 20 cm above the ground surface, with inscription \"BLG,BLN,BLLM-44,CAD-215,2014\". ACCESS : BLLM-44 is located at the left of national going to manila, about 20 m to Bulalo Republic Restaurant.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.93289049, '14° 55\' 58.405750\"', 120.87826070, '120° 52\' 41.738530\"', 0.0100, '1', 57.7150, 0.0100, '1', 15.4129, 271780.64370, 1651992.66000, '51', 14.93441969, '14° 56\' 3.910880\"', 120.87690900, '120° 52\' 36.872370\"', 15.4343, 1651552.88800, 486757.95200, '3', 271633.75900, 1652061.91100, '51', 14.93293481, '14° 55\' 58.565310\"', 120.87825260, '120° 52\' 41.709190\"', 0.0082, 56.1710, 0.0161, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(245, 'BLN-3700', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'ANGAT', 'SANTA CRUZ', 2012, 14.91791668, '14° 55\' 4.500048\"', 121.02865360, '121° 1\' 43.152960\"', 'The station is located at brgy. Santa Cruz, near Angat New Cockpit Arena, left side. Marked is the head of 4 inches copper nail centered on 30 x 30 x 120 centimeter concrete monument, with an inscription of \"BLN-3700, 2012, CAD-349\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.91791734, '14° 55\' 4.502430\"', 121.02865110, '121° 1\' 43.144080\"', 0.0100, '1', 87.1330, 0.0200, '1', 43.4019, 287948.09580, 1650186.70800, '51', 14.91944222, '14° 55\' 9.991980\"', 121.02729930, '121° 1\' 38.277440\"', 44.4429, 1649892.35200, 502937.04100, '3', 287801.29500, 1650255.45800, '51', 14.91796167, '14° 55\' 4.662010\"', 121.02864310, '121° 1\' 43.115030\"', 0.0092, 85.5840, 0.0218, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(246, 'BLN-3709', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'ANGAT', 'BAYBAY', 2012, 14.94055196, '14° 56\' 25.987056\"', 121.04057010, '121° 2\' 26.052360\"', 'The station is located at Bay-Bay Elementary School. Approximately 3 meters N\'E of Flagpole. Marked is the head of 4 inches copper nail centered on 30 x 30 x 120 centimeter concrete monument, with an inscription of \"BLN-3709, 2012, CAD-349\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.94055261, '14° 56\' 25.989410\"', 121.04056770, '121° 2\' 26.043820\"', 0.0100, '1', 78.8790, 0.0200, '1', 35.0152, 289252.44230, 1652680.20500, '51', 14.94207868, '14° 56\' 31.483240\"', 121.03921640, '121° 2\' 21.179160\"', 36.2254, 1652396.95700, 504218.72500, '3', 289105.72700, 1652748.93800, '51', 14.94059695, '14° 56\' 26.149020\"', 121.04055970, '121° 2\' 26.014780\"', 0.0107, 77.3320, 0.0228, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(247, 'BLN-3710', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'ANGAT', 'BAYBAY', 2012, 14.93715944, '14° 56\' 13.773984\"', 121.04418940, '121° 2\' 39.081840\"', 'The station is located at the boudary of brgy. Bay-Bay and Laog near side rice field. Marked is the head of 4 inches copper nail centered on 30 x 30 x 120 centimeter concrete monument, with an inscription of \"BLN-3710, 2012, CAD-349\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.93716018, '14° 56\' 13.776660\"', 121.04418710, '121° 2\' 39.073620\"', 0.0100, '1', 80.1990, 0.0200, '1', 36.2955, 289638.55450, 1652301.36700, '51', 14.93868595, '14° 56\' 19.269410\"', 121.04283570, '121° 2\' 34.208690\"', 37.5268, 1652021.67000, 504608.14700, '3', 289491.83100, 1652370.08500, '51', 14.93720452, '14° 56\' 13.936270\"', 121.04417910, '121° 2\' 39.044590\"', 0.0090, 78.6510, 0.0200, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(248, 'BLN-3714', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'ANGAT', 'BANABAN', 2012, 14.94162335, '14° 56\' 29.844060\"', 121.04667480, '121° 2\' 48.029280\"', 'The station is located at brgy. Banaban along national road right side of waiting shed. Marked is the head of 4 inches copper nail centered on 30 x 30 x 120 centimeter concrete monument, with an inscription of \"BLN-3714, 2012, CAD-349\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.94162392, '14° 56\' 29.846110\"', 121.04667250, '121° 2\' 48.020880\"', 0.0100, '1', 87.6850, 0.0200, '1', 43.7529, 289910.30490, 1652792.97200, '51', 14.94314991, '14° 56\' 35.339690\"', 121.04532120, '121° 2\' 43.156350\"', 45.0196, 1652515.60000, 504875.42500, '3', 289763.59900, 1652861.68500, '51', 14.94166826, '14° 56\' 30.005720\"', 121.04666440, '121° 2\' 47.991860\"', 0.0109, 86.1380, 0.0227, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(249, 'BLN-3811 (BLLM-93)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'CITY OF MEYCAUAYAN', 'SALUYSOY', 2014, 14.74996533, '14° 44\' 59.875188\"', 120.95273710, '120° 57\' 9.853560\"', 'BLN 3811 (BLLM93) STA. MARK Mark is the head of 3 inches copper nail centered on a 25 x 25 centimeters concrete monument, set 100 centimeters on the ground and protruding 20 centimeters above the ground surface, with inscription \'\'MYN BLN, BLLM 93, CAD - 337, 2014\'\' ACCESS BLLM 93 is located 2 meters away to barangay road and 300 meters away to Villaricas Residence.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.74996602, '14° 44\' 59.877660\"', 120.95273610, '120° 57\' 9.850000\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.3530, 0.0200, '1', 3.4447, 279609.07270, 1631674.21800, '51', 14.75148181, '14° 45\' 5.334500\"', 120.95138020, '120° 57\' 4.968630\"', 3.3642, 1631310.38400, 494765.11500, '3', 279461.64500, 1631743.05900, '51', 14.75001029, '14° 45\' 0.037040\"', 120.95272800, '120° 57\' 9.820850\"', 0.0094, 44.7850, 0.0196, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(250, 'BLN-48', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'CITY OF SAN JOSE DEL MONTE', 'POBLACION', 2007, 14.80858939, '14° 48\' 30.921804\"', 121.05119810, '121° 3\' 4.313160\"', 'BLN-48 From San Jose Del Monte municipal hall, travel W until reaching San Jose Del Monte High School. Station is located about 2 m S of the N end of the dike, which is situated at the NE side of the said school. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty with inscription BLN-8 2007 NAMRIA.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.80859023, '14° 48\' 30.924820\"', 121.05119650, '121° 3\' 4.307260\"', 0.0100, '1', 88.5670, 0.0700, '1', 44.6257, 290268.45450, 1638067.29800, '51', 14.81010757, '14° 48\' 36.387260\"', 121.04984210, '121° 2\' 59.431430\"', 45.5068, 1637796.46400, 505365.04300, '3', 290121.31100, 1638135.87400, '51', 14.80863453, '14° 48\' 31.084290\"', 121.05118840, '121° 3\' 4.278280\"', 0.0147, 87.0030, 0.0698, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(251, 'BLN-49', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'GUIGUINTO', 'POBLACION', 2007, 14.82833745, '14° 49\' 42.014820\"', 120.87899030, '120° 52\' 44.365080\"', 'BLN-49 Is located inside the compound of Paaralang Sentral ng Guiguinto, about 18 m W of the Rizal monument and about 0.3 m E of the center of the plant box. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 0.2 m x 0.2 m x 1 m concrete monument with inscription BLN-49 2007 NAMRIA.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.82833733, '14° 49\' 42.014380\"', 120.87898820, '120° 52\' 44.357410\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.8650, 0.0200, '1', 3.5661, 271748.87240, 1640421.06200, '51', 14.82985981, '14° 49\' 47.495310\"', 120.87763400, '120° 52\' 39.482340\"', 3.2810, 1639984.75900, 486829.60100, '3', 271601.63900, 1640490.21500, '51', 14.82838162, '14° 49\' 42.173820\"', 120.87898000, '120° 52\' 44.328100\"', 0.0090, 44.3080, 0.0186, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(252, 'BLN-54', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'NORZAGARAY', 'SAN MATEO', 2007, 14.87771024, '14° 52\' 39.756864\"', 121.12911120, '121° 7\' 44.800320\"', 'BLN-54 From San Mateo Brgy. Hall, travel NW for about 300 m along the road going to Bitbit until reaching the San Mateo watertank at the right side of the road. Station is located at the top center of the cube-shaped watertank. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 0.2 m x 0.2 m cement putty with inscriptions BLN-54 2007 NAMRIA.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.87771143, '14° 52\' 39.761150\"', 121.12910910, '121° 7\' 44.792590\"', 0.0100, '1', 287.8410, 0.0100, '1', 243.0508, 298720.12600, 1645644.38400, '51', 14.87923143, '14° 52\' 45.233150\"', 121.12775640, '121° 7\' 39.923210\"', 244.7905, 1645447.35000, 513747.45600, '3', 298573.28600, 1645712.76800, '51', 14.87775575, '14° 52\' 39.920710\"', 121.12910100, '121° 7\' 44.763740\"', 0.0080, 286.8230, 0.0147, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(253, 'BLN-55', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'SAN RAFAEL', 'LICO', 2007, 14.95891146, '14° 57\' 32.081256\"', 120.95557980, '120° 57\' 20.087280\"', 'BLN-55 Is located on the concrete pavement of Bustos Dam, about 36 m E of the pavillion and about 24 m S of the concrete stairs. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 0.2 m x 0.2 m cement putty with inscriptions BLN-55 2007 NAMRIA.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 14.95891197, '14° 57\' 32.083080\"', 120.95557740, '120° 57\' 20.078590\"', 0.0100, '1', 57.4300, 0.0300, '1', 14.4637, 280126.66360, 1654794.36000, '51', 14.96044111, '14° 57\' 37.588000\"', 120.95422640, '120° 57\' 15.215040\"', 15.0364, 1654428.64700, 495076.30300, '3', 279979.93400, 1654863.38500, '51', 14.95895630, '14° 57\' 32.242690\"', 120.95556930, '120° 57\' 20.049400\"', 0.0105, 55.8870, 0.0288, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(254, 'BLN-56', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'SAN ILDEFONSO', 'CASALAT', 2007, 15.02262531, '15° 1\' 21.451116\"', 121.05474650, '121° 3\' 17.087400\"', 'BLN-56 From San Ildefonos municipal hall travel for about 15 km SE towards Brgy. Casalat via Brgys. Alagao and Akle. Station is located within Casalat Elementary School, about 24 m SSW of the main gate and about 0.5 m E of the concrete fence. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete monument protruding about 20 cm above the ground with inscriptions BLN-56 2007 NAMRIA.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 15.02262625, '15° 1\' 21.454510\"', 121.05474390, '121° 3\' 17.077980\"', 0.0100, '1', 130.2540, 0.0100, '1', 86.2188, 290857.42100, 1661749.06000, '51', 15.02415725, '15° 1\' 26.966090\"', 121.05339460, '121° 3\' 12.220420\"', 87.8038, 1661478.18500, 505741.75600, '3', 290710.99200, 1661817.82000, '51', 15.02267062, '15° 1\' 21.614220\"', 121.05473580, '121° 3\' 17.048950\"', 0.0080, 128.7170, 0.0154, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(255, 'BLN-58', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'SAN ILDEFONSO', 'POBLACION', 2007, 15.07909812, '15° 4\' 44.753232\"', 120.94456960, '120° 56\' 40.450560\"', 'BLN-58 The station is located in San Ildefonso Elementary School North District, about 10 m S of Gusaling Gabaldon and about 6 m NE of the SW corner of Math area. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m x 1 m concrete monument flushed on the ground with inscriptions BLN-58 2007 NAMRIA.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.10, 15.07909902, '15° 4\' 44.756460\"', 120.94456670, '120° 56\' 40.439970\"', 0.0100, '1', 65.8070, 0.0300, '1', 22.9846, 279065.74330, 1668106.00700, '51', 15.08063610, '15° 4\' 50.289950\"', 120.94321850, '120° 56\' 35.586580\"', 23.7889, 1667726.95300, 493895.63800, '3', 278919.40400, 1668175.17700, '51', 15.07914339, '15° 4\' 44.916200\"', 120.94455850, '120° 56\' 40.410720\"', 0.0101, 64.2790, 0.0263, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(256, 'BTN-3001', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'ABUCAY', 'GABON', 2007, 14.71148973, '14° 42\' 41.363028\"', 120.51474060, '120° 30\' 53.066160\"', 'BTN-3001 From San Fernando City proper, travel for about 1 hr to reach Brgy. Gabon. Station is located at the intersection of the roads going to Letran College, Manila, Balanga and Abucay town proper. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty flushed on the ground with inscriptions BTN-3001 2007 NAMRIA.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.75, 14.71149060, '14° 42\' 41.366160\"', 120.51473920, '120° 30\' 53.061040\"', 0.0400, '4', 71.0410, 0.1400, '1', 28.2527, 232387.42910, 1627890.58000, '51', 14.71301373, '14° 42\' 46.849420\"', 120.51338170, '120° 30\' 48.174250\"', 29.0094, 1627110.44900, 447596.19100, '3', 232239.48000, 1627960.80800, '51', 14.71153483, '14° 42\' 41.525380\"', 120.51473090, '120° 30\' 53.031090\"', 0.0361, 69.4810, 0.1227, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(257, 'BTN-3077', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'BAGAC', 'BANAWANG', 2008, 14.62369614, '14° 37\' 25.306104\"', 120.37990570, '120° 22\' 47.660520\"', 'BTN-3077 From Bagac town proper, travel NW direction along the Nat\'l Road bound to Morong, up to Mallari Farm in Brgy. Banawang for about 4 Km.. Station is situated along the Bagac-Morong Highway in Brgy. Banawang, approx. 300 m SE of BTN-3076. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail flushed in a cement block 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm embedded 1 m in the ground with inscriptions \"BTN-3077, 2008, NAMRIA\". The monument is made 20 cm above the ground surface with reference mark 1, and 2. RM-1 = 25 m N 45 deg W of steel electrical post. RM-2 = 15 m S 45 deg W of Camachile tree.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.75, 14.62369819, '14° 37\' 25.313490\"', 120.37990610, '120° 22\' 47.662030\"', 0.0400, '4', 73.8740, 0.1600, '1', 30.5464, 217747.35880, 1618336.19100, '51', 14.62521870, '14° 37\' 30.787310\"', 120.37854640, '120° 22\' 42.767140\"', 31.9207, 1617432.52100, 433048.68100, '3', 217598.99500, 1618406.77800, '51', 14.62374238, '14° 37\' 25.472580\"', 120.37989770, '120° 22\' 47.631850\"', 0.0384, 72.3080, 0.1457, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(258, 'BTN-3093', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'ORION', 'PUTING BUHANGIN', 2008, 14.58800809, '14° 35\' 16.829124\"', 120.58524980, '120° 35\' 6.899280\"', 'BTN-3093 From Orion town proper, travel S towards Mariveles up to Brgy. Puting Buhangin junction for about 3.9 Km.. Station is situated at Brgy. Puting Buhangin junction, along Roman Highway, E side of Km. post 31. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail flushed in a cement block 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm embedded 1 m in the ground with inscriptions \"BTN-3093, 2008, NAMRIA\". The monument is made 20 cm above the ground surface with reference mark 1, 2, and 3. RM-1 = 10 m E of Roman Highway centerline. RM-2 = 6 m N of Puting Buhangin Arc. RM-3 = 30 m NW of Mango tree.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.75, 14.58800792, '14° 35\' 16.828520\"', 120.58525080, '120° 35\' 6.903000\"', 0.0500, '5', 46.9270, 0.1900, '1', 4.3677, 239838.34150, 1614140.06200, '51', 14.58952152, '14° 35\' 22.277480\"', 120.58389060, '120° 35\' 2.006000\"', 4.3713, 1613432.56100, 455164.29900, '3', 239690.04200, 1614209.94600, '51', 14.58805212, '14° 35\' 16.987620\"', 120.58524260, '120° 35\' 6.873220\"', 0.0479, 45.3510, 0.1652, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(259, 'BTN-3116', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'BIAAN', 2008, 14.46320533, '14° 27\' 47.539188\"', 120.45520150, '120° 27\' 18.725400\"', 'BTN-3116 From Mariveles town proper, travel NW direction going to Brgy. Upper Biaan until reaching Liloc Farm for about 10 Km.. Station is situated along Mariveles-Bagac Nat\'l Road in front of Liloc Farm. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail flushed in a cement block 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm embedded 1 m in the ground with inscriptions \"BTN-3116, 2008, NAMRIA\". The monument is made 20 cm above the ground surface with reference mark 1, and 2. RM-1 = 30 m SE of Dita tree. RM-2 = 10 m NW of Mango tree.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.75, 14.46320602, '14° 27\' 47.541680\"', 120.45520070, '120° 27\' 18.722440\"', 0.0500, '5', 257.9660, 0.1800, '1', 215.0976, 225665.02740, 1600477.91400, '51', 14.46471445, '14° 27\' 52.972010\"', 120.45383730, '120° 27\' 13.814340\"', 215.3739, 1599653.95200, 441117.74500, '3', 225516.19700, 1600548.10000, '51', 14.46325017, '14° 27\' 47.700600\"', 120.45519230, '120° 27\' 18.692450\"', 0.0471, 256.3790, 0.1615, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(260, 'BTN-3130', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'SISIMAN', 2008, 14.42887344, '14° 25\' 43.944384\"', 120.52843910, '120° 31\' 42.380760\"', 'BTN-3130 From Mariveles town proper, travel E going to Brgy. Sisiman for about 5.5 Km.. Station is situated at Brgy. Sisiman along the brgy. road, approx. 350 m W of Agwawan Beach. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail flushed in a cement block 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm embedded 1 m in the ground with inscriptions \"BTN-3130, 2008, NAMRIA\". The monument is made 20 cm above the ground surface with reference mark 1 and 2. RM-1 = 25 m S 20 deg E to concrete electrical post. RM-2 = 5 m S of the road centerline.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.75, 14.42887328, '14° 25\' 43.943790\"', 120.52843820, '120° 31\' 42.377690\"', 0.0500, '5', 50.2760, 0.1900, '1', 7.5677, 233523.65660, 1596591.20000, '51', 14.43037788, '14° 25\' 49.360360\"', 120.52707410, '120° 31\' 37.466840\"', 7.4079, 1595837.58800, 449005.81300, '3', 233374.77300, 1596661.12000, '51', 14.42891741, '14° 25\' 44.102690\"', 120.52843000, '120° 31\' 42.347850\"', 0.0485, 48.6820, 0.1684, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
