(351, 'BTS-3032 (BLLM-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'MAHATAO', 'UVOY', 2009, 20.41602126, '20° 24\' 57.676536\"', 121.94721510, '121° 56\' 49.974360\"', 'BTS-3032 (BBM-4) The station is located at brgy. Poblacion, Mahatao. It is located about 8 m SE of Mahatao Elementary School and about 50 m W of Mahatao Police Station. Station mark is the head of a 4\" cw nail embedded on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m x 1.00 m sq. conc. monument with inscription \"BLLM No. 2, CAD-914\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.41605382, '20° 24\' 57.793740\"', 121.94723260, '121° 56\' 50.037320\"', 0.0100, '1', 36.4050, 0.0200, '1', 6.0347, 390162.54130, 2257874.94500, '51', 20.41788906, '20° 25\' 4.400620\"', 121.94600980, '121° 56\' 45.635100\"', 9.2319, 2258666.98100, 598733.29800, '3', 390034.55800, 2257945.01700, '51', 20.41609973, '20° 24\' 57.959020\"', 121.94722460, '121° 56\' 50.008720\"', 0.0164, 35.4970, 0.0270, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
