(352, 'BTS-3034 (BBM-5)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'MAHATAO', 'HAÑIB', 2009, 20.41097776, '20° 24\' 39.519936\"', 121.94796190, '121° 56\' 52.662840\"', 'BTS-3034 (BBM-5) The station is intact on ground located at the left side of road and about 15 m . South of electric post from municipality town hall turn left on Beateria St. going to said site. Can be reach thru Mr. Victor Atunay and FNSP Team. \"BBM No. 5\" is inscribed on top of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.0 m sq. conc. moument with a text screw centering and 0.20 m protruding above the ground elevation.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.41101017, '20° 24\' 39.636610\"', 121.94797920, '121° 56\' 52.724990\"', 0.0100, '1', 129.9070, 0.0100, '1', 99.5387, 390236.86430, 2257316.21800, '51', 20.41284509, '20° 24\' 46.242330\"', 121.94675620, '121° 56\' 48.322430\"', 102.7144, 2258109.01300, 598814.43100, '3', 390108.86700, 2257386.28100, '51', 20.41105608, '20° 24\' 39.801880\"', 121.94797120, '121° 56\' 52.696390\"', 0.0157, 128.9990, 0.0251, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(353, 'BTS-3035 (BBM-7)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'MAHATAO', 'PANATAYAN', 2009, 20.40868833, '20° 24\' 31.277988\"', 121.94365470, '121° 56\' 37.156920\"', 'BTS-3035 (BBM-7) The station is intact on ground and located on mountain left side of road going to tower. From municipality town hall turn left on Beateria Street. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail, set flushed on a drilled hole and centered concrete monument on a 15 cm x 15 cm cement putty with inscriptions \"BBM , CAD 914 , No. 7\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.40867889, '20° 24\' 31.244010\"', 121.94367210, '121° 56\' 37.219470\"', 0.0100, '1', 164.7910, 0.0100, '1', 134.4029, 389785.78410, 2257061.07800, '51', 20.41051376, '20° 24\' 37.849540\"', 121.94244910, '121° 56\' 32.816720\"', 137.6003, 2257848.32700, 598366.33800, '3', 389657.77800, 2257131.15100, '51', 20.40872480, '20° 24\' 31.409270\"', 121.94366410, '121° 56\' 37.190860\"', 0.0157, 163.8820, 0.0247, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(354, 'BTS-3037 (BLLM-7)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'BASCO', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2009, 20.45466617, '20° 27\' 16.798212\"', 121.98782800, '121° 59\' 16.180800\"', 'BTS-3037 (BLLM-7) The station is located south west of Mt. Iraya and north east of the airport. From the \"dirt road\" about 150 m walk going to the hill (BLLM 7), the land is owned by Mr. Valdimor. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail, set flushed on a drilled hole and centered concrete monument on a 15 cm x 15 cm cement putty with incriptions \"BLLM 7\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.45469856, '20° 27\' 16.914800\"', 121.98782790, '121° 59\' 16.180610\"', 0.0100, '1', 182.0860, 0.0200, '1', 152.0263, 394424.66800, 2262125.46300, '51', 20.45653508, '20° 27\' 23.526280\"', 121.98660610, '121° 59\' 11.781930\"', 154.9542, 2262970.46100, 602944.84800, '3', 394296.83800, 2262195.42900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(355, 'BTS-3040 (MBM-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'MAHATAO', 'KAUMBAKAN', 2009, 20.42636505, '20° 25\' 34.914180\"', 121.96583530, '121° 57\' 57.007080\"', 'BTS-3040 (MBM-2) From Basco town proper take the road to Mahatao. Upon reaching Tamarong bridge turn left until reaching PAGASA office, then turn left into the road intersection. Station is about 500 m from the PAGASA office, located at the corner of the rectangle plantation, on its foot walk, 15 m from the road. Station mark is a text screw centering on top of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with inscriptions of \"MBM No. 2 CAD 914\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.42639774, '20° 25\' 35.031870\"', 121.96585280, '121° 57\' 57.069930\"', 0.0100, '1', 195.4170, 0.0100, '1', 165.1633, 392112.59610, 2259007.45700, '51', 20.42823314, '20° 25\' 41.639290\"', 121.96463020, '121° 57\' 52.668800\"', 168.2367, 2259823.48500, 600670.09200, '3', 391984.66100, 2259077.47200, '51', 20.42644367, '20° 25\' 35.197200\"', 121.96584480, '121° 57\' 57.041350\"', 0.0156, 194.5100, 0.0237, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(356, 'BTS-3041 (MBM-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'MAHATAO', 'KAUMBAKAN', 2009, 20.42626777, '20° 25\' 34.563972\"', 121.96782400, '121° 58\' 4.166400\"', 'BTS-3041 (MBM-3) From Basco town proper take the road to Mahatao. Upon reaching Tamarong bridge turn left until reaching PAGASA office, then turn left into the road intersection. Station is about 300 m from the PAGASA office located on top of a soil formation about 200 m to BTS -3040 (MBM 2). Station mark is a text screw centering on top of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with inscriptions of \"MBM No. 3 CAD 914\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.42630040, '20° 25\' 34.681450\"', 121.96784130, '121° 58\' 4.228820\"', 0.0100, '1', 191.9290, 0.0100, '1', 161.6885, 392320.00420, 2258995.37800, '51', 20.42813575, '20° 25\' 41.288710\"', 121.96661880, '121° 57\' 59.827690\"', 164.7437, 2259813.92400, 600877.70200, '3', 392192.07000, 2259065.38700, '51', 20.42634633, '20° 25\' 34.846790\"', 121.96783340, '121° 58\' 4.200250\"', 0.0156, 191.0220, 0.0237, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(357, 'BTS-3062 (BBM-21)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'SABTANG', 'MALAKDANG', 2012, 20.33412977, '20° 20\' 2.867172\"', 121.84628220, '121° 50\' 46.615920\"', 'BTS-3062 (BBM 21) From Sabtang proper, travel west along the national road for about 11 minutes until you reach the junction of the old provincial road, then turn left on the old provincial road. The station is located on the left side of the road and approximately 331m SE of BTS-3063 (BBM No. 22) Mark is the head of a text screw set flushed and centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete monument, protruding 0.20 m above ground with inscriptions \"BBM No. 21\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.33416186, '20° 20\' 2.982710\"', 121.84629960, '121° 50\' 46.678410\"', 0.0100, '1', 244.2050, 0.0200, '1', 213.6408, 379567.39430, 2248881.74100, '51', 20.33599455, '20° 20\' 9.580370\"', 121.84507470, '121° 50\' 42.268980\"', 216.9808, 2249543.22700, 588244.84200, '3', 379439.09000, 2248952.06700, '51', 20.33420775, '20° 20\' 3.147900\"', 121.84629160, '121° 50\' 46.649650\"', 0.0158, 243.2900, 0.0258, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(358, 'BTS-3063 (BBM-22)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'SABTANG', 'MALAKDANG', 2012, 20.33688740, '20° 20\' 12.794640\"', 121.84509300, '121° 50\' 42.334800\"', 'BTS-3063 (BBM 22) From Sabtang Proper, travel west along the national road for about 11 minutes until you reach the junction of the old provincial road, then turn left on the old provincial road. The station is located on the left side of the road and approximately 4m from the edge of the provincial road. Mark is the head of a text screw set flushed and centered on a 0.20m x 0.20m x 1.00m concrete monument, protruding 0.2m above ground with inscriptions \"BBM No. 22\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.33691963, '20° 20\' 12.910660\"', 121.84511040, '121° 50\' 42.397320\"', 0.0100, '1', 210.6650, 0.0200, '1', 180.1034, 379445.38240, 2249187.84400, '51', 20.33875250, '20° 20\' 19.509000\"', 121.84388560, '121° 50\' 37.988090\"', 183.4533, 2249847.91400, 588119.10000, '3', 379317.08600, 2249258.17600, '51', 20.33696551, '20° 20\' 13.075850\"', 121.84510240, '121° 50\' 42.368560\"', 0.0158, 209.7510, 0.0259, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(359, 'BTS-3065 (BLLM-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'SABTANG', 'SINAKAN', 2012, 20.33125674, '20° 19\' 52.524264\"', 121.87570270, '121° 52\' 32.529720\"', 'BTS-3065 (BLLM No.2) From Sabtang port travel west for approximately 250 m along the national road then turn right to the last corner before the barangay welcome arc, then turn left to the first corner until reaching a small bridge. Follow the trail going up the globe cell site tower. Station is located upt o the hill near the cell site tower. Mark is the head of a text screw set flushed and centered on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m x 1.00 m concrete monument, protruding 0.20 m above ground with inscriptions \"BLLM No. 2 CAD 940\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.33128910, '20° 19\' 52.640770\"', 121.87572010, '121° 52\' 32.592250\"', 0.0100, '1', 79.1310, 0.0200, '1', 48.5506, 382636.68270, 2248542.56300, '51', 20.33312108, '20° 19\' 59.235880\"', 121.87449520, '121° 52\' 28.182640\"', 51.8270, 2249241.13600, 591318.86800, '3', 382508.38200, 2248612.80100, '51', 20.33133499, '20° 19\' 52.805970\"', 121.87571210, '121° 52\' 32.563550\"', 0.0158, 78.2150, 0.0257, '2017-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(360, 'BTS-3068 (BBM-5)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'SABTANG', 'SAVIDUG', 2012, 20.31561877, '20° 18\' 56.227572\"', 121.87751660, '121° 52\' 39.059760\"', 'BTS-3068 (BBM 5) From municipal hall travel east along national road, upon reaching the bgy. Savidug, turn right at E. Hontomin street going to provincial road, following the provinical road, about 30 min. hiking leading to said BBM 5 station is located at the left side and 4 m from road going to barangay Sumnanga. BBM 5 =BTS 3068. \"BBM No. 5\" is inscribed on top of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.0 m sq. concrete monument with a text screw centering and 0. 20 m protruding above ground elevation.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.31565104, '20° 18\' 56.343730\"', 121.87753400, '121° 52\' 39.122390\"', 0.0100, '1', 159.4410, 0.0200, '1', 128.8880, 382814.27820, 2246810.44700, '51', 20.31748208, '20° 19\' 2.935490\"', 121.87630880, '121° 52\' 34.711570\"', 132.0776, 2247510.79300, 591517.46100, '3', 382685.92900, 2246880.66800, '51', 20.31569692, '20° 18\' 56.508910\"', 121.87752600, '121° 52\' 39.093700\"', 0.0158, 158.5230, 0.0259, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(361, 'BTS-3070 (BBM-13)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'SABTANG', 'SUMNANGA', 2012, 20.30661504, '20° 18\' 23.814144\"', 121.85555230, '121° 51\' 19.988280\"', 'BTS-3070 (BBM 13) From the barangay proper, hike along the barangay road for about 1 hour. The station is located on a ridge of a mountain at the right side of the road and about 5 m from the edge. The station is 320 m above mean sea level. Mark is the head of a text screw set flushed and centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete monument, protruding 0.20 m above ground with inscriptions \"BBM No. 13\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.30664719, '20° 18\' 23.929900\"', 121.85556960, '121° 51\' 20.050390\"', 0.0100, '1', 315.2640, 0.0200, '1', 284.7146, 380514.04360, 2245829.64800, '51', 20.30847814, '20° 18\' 30.521310\"', 121.85434410, '121° 51\' 15.638820\"', 287.9209, 2246501.96800, 589228.60700, '3', 380385.65600, 2245899.92600, '51', 20.30669308, '20° 18\' 24.095070\"', 121.85556160, '121° 51\' 20.021660\"', 0.0158, 314.3450, 0.0260, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(362, 'BTS-3071 (BLLM-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'SABTANG', 'CHAVAYAN', 2012, 20.28446205, '20° 17\' 4.063380\"', 121.87180710, '121° 52\' 18.505560\"', 'BTS-3071 (BLLM 3) From town poper taking national road then passing through barangay of Savidug at about 30 minutes ride upon reaching barangay Chavayan. Station is located about 2 m from te center of the road, about 30 m SW from Chavayan welcome marker. BLLM 3=BTS 3071. Mark is the head of a text screw set flushed and centered on a 0.40m x 0.40m x 1.00m concrete monument, protruding 0.20 m above ground with inscriptions \"BLLM No. 3\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.28449441, '20° 17\' 4.179870\"', 121.87182440, '121° 52\' 18.567660\"', 0.0100, '1', 42.9730, 0.0200, '1', 12.4593, 382194.57050, 2243366.09100, '51', 20.28632387, '20° 17\' 10.765930\"', 121.87059840, '121° 52\' 14.154160\"', 15.5131, 2244058.21300, 590939.24700, '3', 382066.11400, 2243436.31500, '51', 20.28454029, '20° 17\' 4.345030\"', 121.87181640, '121° 52\' 18.538970\"', 0.0160, 42.0510, 0.0273, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(363, 'BTS-3072 (BLLM-4)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'SABTANG', 'CHAVAYAN', 2012, 20.28378266, '20° 17\' 1.617576\"', 121.87052460, '121° 52\' 13.888560\"', 'BTS-3072 (BLLM 4) From Sabtang town proper travel south taking the national road passing through barangay of Savidug at about 30 minutes ride until reaching barangay Chavayan. Station is located inside the compound of Chavayan Elementary School at the right side of its gate, about 3 m from the road centerline and approximately 20 m from the barangay chapel. \"BLLM No. 4\" is inscribed on top of a 0.40 m x 0.40 m x 1.0 m sq. concrete monument with text screw centering and protruding 0.20 m above the ground elevation.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.28381502, '20° 17\' 1.734070\"', 121.87054190, '121° 52\' 13.950760\"', 0.0100, '1', 41.2690, 0.0200, '1', 10.7558, 382060.12610, 2243291.81100, '51', 20.28564447, '20° 17\' 8.320090\"', 121.86931590, '121° 52\' 9.537190\"', 13.8097, 2243982.29300, 590805.67100, '3', 381931.66600, 2243362.03800, '51', 20.28386090, '20° 17\' 1.899230\"', 121.87053390, '121° 52\' 13.922060\"', 0.0159, 40.3470, 0.0268, '2017-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(364, 'BTS-5 (BLLM-1)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'BASCO', 'IHUBOK II', 1995, 20.44955889, '20° 26\' 58.412004\"', 121.96920310, '121° 58\' 9.131160\"', 'BTS-5 (BLLM-1) Station is located on the concrete pavement in front of the provincial capitol building. It is about 50 m E of Rizal monument, 35 m W of Batanes provincial capitol, 25 m S of Basco municipal hall, and 1 m km post 0. Mark is the head of a 4\" CW nail set flushed on the concrete pavement with inscriptions, \"BLLM No. 1\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 20.44959125, '20° 26\' 58.528490\"', 121.96922080, '121° 58\' 9.194870\"', 0.0100, '1', 49.5510, 0.0100, '1', 19.3597, 392480.12400, 2261572.28400, '51', 20.45142790, '20° 27\' 5.140440\"', 121.96799880, '121° 58\' 4.795550\"', 22.4448, 2262393.46400, 601006.51100, '3', 392352.26400, 2261642.30800, '51', 20.44963718, '20° 26\' 58.693840\"', 121.96921290, '121° 58\' 9.166290\"', 0.0156, 48.6470, 0.0233, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(365, 'CGY-10', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CLAVERIA', 'TAGGAT NORTE', 1989, 18.61648452, '18° 36\' 59.344272\"', 121.04990270, '121° 2\' 59.649720\"', 'CGY-10 Is located on the highest peak of Babatquen Pt., locally known as Lakay-Lakay Pt.; about 1.7 km. N of the barangay proper of Taggat Norte. From the N to the S side of Lakay-Lakay Pt. is a slippery slope protruding to the China Sea. To reach the station by motor boat from Brgy. Taggat Norte, travel N to the S shoreline of Lakay-Lakay Pt. for about 20 min. Then from the shoreline follow the existing foot trail that leads to the station; about 500 m. from the shoreline to the station. The other way to the station is by following the existing foot trail going N from Brgy. Taggat Norte up to the 15 m. high cliff. It will take about 40 min. climb from the base of the cliff to the station. Old station mark was refurbished; 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in standard concrete block, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. Reference marks is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in concrete block, 0.6 m. deep, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.61650206, '18° 36\' 59.407400\"', 121.04990870, '121° 2\' 59.671240\"', 0.0500, '5', 129.6650, 0.1800, '1', 93.8091, 294255.63320, 2059513.16000, '51', 18.61825333, '18° 37\' 5.712000\"', 121.04864310, '121° 2\' 55.115300\"', 98.4390, 2059186.70600, 505133.11900, '3', 294121.15800, 2059584.85400, '51', 18.61654739, '18° 36\' 59.570600\"', 121.04990030, '121° 2\' 59.641020\"', 0.0427, 128.5810, 0.1578, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(366, 'CGY-101', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'GONZAGA', 'IPIL', 2007, 18.30165993, '18° 18\' 5.975748\"', 122.06188680, '122° 3\' 42.792480\"', 'CGY-101 From Gonzaga Proper, travel for about 10 km. NE along the nat\'l. highway to Brgy. Ipil (Santa Ana bound). Upon passing Ipil Elem. School and a bridge, turn right to the boundary marker with a sign to \"San Francisco Prim. School\". Follow the road up to So. San Francisco passing the primary school. Go straight to the basketball court/solar dryer. Station is located at the N midline edge of the court. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-101 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.30167881, '18° 18\' 6.043700\"', 122.06189970, '122° 3\' 42.839080\"', 0.0400, '4', 85.2140, 0.1600, '1', 47.5199, 400856.90620, 2023817.52000, '51', 18.30339033, '18° 18\' 12.205180\"', 122.06062860, '122° 3\' 38.262960\"', 50.5252, 2024664.72600, 612133.40100, '3', 400722.08600, 2023885.80300, '51', 18.30172417, '18° 18\' 6.207000\"', 122.06189190, '122° 3\' 42.810870\"', 0.0370, 84.0450, 0.1451, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(367, 'CGY-102', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANTA ANA', 'CASAMBALANGAN', 2007, 18.36939269, '18° 22\' 9.813684\"', 122.11286490, '122° 6\' 46.313640\"', 'CGY-102 From Gonzaga, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Santa Ana. Station is located about 2 m. from the S corner of the triangular isalnd at the intersection of the nat\'l. highway and the road to Port Irene. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-102 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.36941194, '18° 22\' 9.883000\"', 122.11287870, '122° 6\' 46.363300\"', 0.0400, '4', 55.4770, 0.1600, '1', 18.3476, 406281.48060, 2031285.28600, '51', 18.37112641, '18° 22\' 16.055090\"', 122.11160920, '122° 6\' 41.793110\"', 20.8907, 2032194.50800, 617478.01400, '3', 406146.91700, 2031353.46100, '51', 18.36945733, '18° 22\' 10.046370\"', 122.11287090, '122° 6\' 46.335160\"', 0.0367, 54.3150, 0.1443, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(368, 'CGY-103', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANTA ANA', 'DIORA-ZINUNGAN', 2007, 18.44172639, '18° 26\' 30.215004\"', 122.13371020, '122° 8\' 1.356720\"', 'CGY-103 From Gonzaga, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Santa Ana. Station is located on the SW corner of the basketball court/solar dryer at Km. Post 633, across the Church of the Living God Worship Center of the brgy., about 600 m. NE of Diora Bridge. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-103 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.44174626, '18° 26\' 30.286520\"', 122.13372430, '122° 8\' 1.407550\"', 0.0400, '4', 41.6130, 0.1600, '1', 5.0804, 408522.03240, 2039278.52800, '51', 18.44346456, '18° 26\' 36.472430\"', 122.13245650, '122° 7\' 56.843490\"', 7.2170, 2040215.30100, 619631.46700, '3', 408387.71900, 2039346.69200, '51', 18.44179166, '18° 26\' 30.449970\"', 122.13371650, '122° 8\' 1.379420\"', 0.0365, 40.4590, 0.1437, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(369, 'CGY-104', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANTA ANA', 'MAREDE', 2007, 18.45354752, '18° 27\' 12.771072\"', 122.17704850, '122° 10\' 37.374600\"', 'CGY-104 From Santa Ana Proper, turn right after Km. Post 637 leading to Brgys. Parada, Bato and Marede. Follow this road until reaching Marede Brgy. Hall. Station is located inside the brgy. hall compound, beside the flower box, about 3 m. from the compound\'s NE corner. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-104 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.45356751, '18° 27\' 12.843020\"', 122.17706310, '122° 10\' 37.427290\"', 0.0400, '1', 44.3410, 0.1600, '1', 7.9487, 413104.77980, 2040565.21100, '51', 18.45528560, '18° 27\' 19.028160\"', 122.17579570, '122° 10\' 32.864500\"', 9.8809, 2041552.99000, 624201.77800, '3', 412970.53600, 2040633.24800, '51', 18.45361291, '18° 27\' 13.006490\"', 122.17705530, '122° 10\' 37.399240\"', 0.0370, 43.1870, 0.1447, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(370, 'CGY-105', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'APARRI', 'PADDAYA', 2007, 18.32579561, '18° 19\' 32.864196\"', 121.73295240, '121° 43\' 58.628640\"', 'CGY-105 From Aparri Proper, travel S along the nat\'l. highway to Tuguegarao. Turn left at the corner of Km. Post 580 going to Brgy. Gaddang. Turn left upon reaching Tallungan Elem. School, then right, opposite the direction of Gaddang Elem. School. Follow the road then turn left after the third floodgate. For about 300 m., turn right and follow the rough road until reaching Brgy. Paddaya. Station is located on the W edge of the third concrete bench (from the W) of the brgy.\'s basketball court/solar dryer. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-105 2007 NAMRIA.\"', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.32581550, '18° 19\' 32.935790\"', 121.73296280, '121° 43\' 58.666020\"', 0.0400, '4', 41.3610, 0.1600, '1', 3.9169, 366107.79030, 2026698.64700, '51', 18.32753539, '18° 19\' 39.127400\"', 121.73169160, '121° 43\' 54.089820\"', 7.5382, 2027166.25300, 577344.42500, '3', 365972.81800, 2026767.97900, '51', 18.32586083, '18° 19\' 33.099000\"', 121.73295480, '121° 43\' 58.637190\"', 0.0357, 40.2030, 0.1424, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(371, 'CGY-108', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BALLESTEROS', 'SANTA CRUZ', 2007, 18.40127323, '18° 24\' 4.583628\"', 121.52647800, '121° 31\' 35.320800\"', 'CGY-108 From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos. After Km. Post 677 (on the left side of the road), turn right at the junction of Brgy. Zitanga. Follow this road and upon reaching the rotunda turn right leading to Brgy. Sta. Cruz. Station is located inside Sta. Cruz Elem. School, about 2meters of the flagpole. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered end flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-108 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.40129397, '18° 24\' 4.658300\"', 121.52648700, '121° 31\' 35.353230\"', 0.0400, '4', 43.4970, 0.1600, '1', 6.3396, 344352.86020, 2035215.96700, '51', 18.40302266, '18° 24\' 10.881580\"', 121.52521720, '121° 31\' 30.782070\"', 10.4175, 2035445.67200, 555494.05800, '3', 344217.99300, 2035286.00300, '51', 18.40133931, '18° 24\' 4.821510\"', 121.52647890, '121° 31\' 35.324000\"', 0.0363, 42.3530, 0.1434, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(372, 'CGY-109 (CGN-239)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ABULUG', 'CENTRO', 2005, 18.44618312, '18° 26\' 46.259232\"', 121.45315700, '121° 27\' 11.365200\"', 'CGY-109 (CGN-239) From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos. After Km. Post 677 (on the left side of the road), turn right at the junction of Brgy. Zitanga. Follow this road and upon reaching the rotunda turn left leading to Abulug. Upon reaching Brgy. Centro Day Care Center, turn right until reaching the brgy. hall, which is on the left side before the brgy. public market. Station is located beside a canal, about 1 m. SW of the wall of the said market and 4 m. NE of the brgy. hall. Mark is the head of a concrete nail centered and flushed on a 35 cm. x 35 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGN-239 2005 FNSP\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.44620397, '18° 26\' 46.334280\"', 121.45316530, '121° 27\' 11.395110\"', 0.0400, '4', 44.0270, 0.1600, '1', 7.1411, 336648.82840, 2040250.78100, '51', 18.44793684, '18° 26\' 52.572620\"', 121.45189650, '121° 27\' 6.827250\"', 11.2716, 2040395.76900, 547734.50700, '3', 336514.05900, 2040321.08000, '51', 18.44624931, '18° 26\' 46.497510\"', 121.45315710, '121° 27\' 11.365720\"', 0.0373, 42.8890, 0.1462, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(373, 'CGY-110 (BLLM-1A)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'CENTRO', 2007, 18.46463632, '18° 27\' 52.690752\"', 121.33990870, '121° 20\' 23.671320\"', 'CGY-110 (BLLM 1A) From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos until reaching Pamplona Central School, which is across Pamplona Mun. Hall. Station is located inside the school compound, behind the first school bldg. to the left of the entrance gate. Mark is the head of a steel bolt centered and flushed on a 35 cm. x 35 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"BLLM No. 1A\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.46465739, '18° 27\' 52.766620\"', 121.33991620, '121° 20\' 23.698200\"', 0.0400, '1', 46.6380, 0.1700, '1', 9.5987, 324705.45650, 2042399.13700, '51', 18.46639373, '18° 27\' 59.017420\"', 121.33864760, '121° 20\' 19.131220\"', 14.2145, 2042412.38500, 535767.90100, '3', 324570.67100, 2042469.80700, '51', 18.46470273, '18° 27\' 52.929820\"', 121.33990790, '121° 20\' 23.668590\"', 0.0384, 45.5110, 0.1512, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
