(384, 'CGY-3876', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'GATTARAN', 'NASSIPING', 2007, 17.96943414, '17° 58\' 9.962904\"', 121.64950210, '121° 38\' 58.207560\"', 'CGY-3876 Station is located at the right side of walkway of Nalbu Bridge. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3876, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.96945142, '17° 58\' 10.025110\"', 121.64951110, '121° 38\' 58.240060\"', 0.0400, '4', 56.8540, 0.1600, '1', 18.5633, 356998.31420, 1987325.77400, '51', 17.97115191, '17° 58\' 16.146880\"', 121.64823160, '121° 38\' 53.633720\"', 22.0603, 1987689.58900, 568660.86000, '3', 356862.11100, 1987395.10200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(385, 'CGY-3891', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'STA. MARIA', 2007, 18.13403334, '18° 8\' 2.520024\"', 121.69420700, '121° 41\' 39.145200\"', 'CGY-3891 Station is in Brgy. Sta. Maria, Lal-lo, Cagayan. It is located at the basketball court, approx. 10 m NW of Zamora bldg. and approx. 20 m from administrative bldg.. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, set 2 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3891, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.13405176, '18° 8\' 2.586330\"', 121.69421650, '121° 41\' 39.179460\"', 0.0400, '1', 104.6090, 0.1600, '1', 66.3862, 361861.45260, 2005506.59700, '51', 18.13576109, '18° 8\' 8.739920\"', 121.69294090, '121° 41\' 34.587130\"', 70.2471, 2005925.00400, 573328.37600, '3', 361725.82400, 2005575.90700, '51', 18.13409704, '18° 8\' 2.749360\"', 121.69420850, '121° 41\' 39.150620\"', 0.0357, 103.4330, 0.1429, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(386, 'CGY-3896', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'CABAYABASAN', 2007, 18.11314650, '18° 6\' 47.327400\"', 121.55755930, '121° 33\' 27.213480\"', 'CGY-3896 Station is in Brgy. Cabayabasan, Lasam, Cagayan. It is located at the NW corner of solar drier owned by Mr. Eduardo Catchola. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, set 2 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3896, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.11316510, '18° 6\' 47.394350\"', 121.55756780, '121° 33\' 27.244130\"', 0.0400, '4', 61.6760, 0.1800, '1', 23.1505, 347384.94860, 2003303.09800, '51', 18.11487609, '18° 6\' 53.553910\"', 121.55629140, '121° 33\' 22.649210\"', 27.5727, 2003564.49000, 558874.43100, '3', 347249.15300, 2003372.82400, '51', 18.11321036, '18° 6\' 47.557310\"', 121.55755970, '121° 33\' 27.215050\"', 0.0389, 60.4970, 0.1614, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(387, 'CGY-3932', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'SANTA ISABEL', 2007, 18.23356619, '18° 14\' 0.838284\"', 121.83010620, '121° 49\' 48.382320\"', 'CGY-3932 Station is located on the SW corner of Sta. Isabel Elem. School, flagpole. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3932, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.23358503, '18° 14\' 0.906090\"', 121.83011740, '121° 49\' 48.422520\"', 0.0400, '4', 50.7600, 0.1600, '1', 12.7503, 376310.28020, 2016423.94300, '51', 18.23529741, '18° 14\' 7.070670\"', 121.82884420, '121° 49\' 43.839260\"', 16.4004, 2017001.18900, 587660.94500, '3', 376175.07300, 2016492.90100, '51', 18.23363035, '18° 14\' 1.069250\"', 121.83010940, '121° 49\' 48.393910\"', 0.0364, 49.5890, 0.1438, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(388, 'CGY-4005', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'BIDDUANG', 2007, 18.51712468, '18° 31\' 1.648848\"', 121.30841020, '121° 18\' 30.276720\"', 'CGY-4005 Station is located at the NE side of brgy. marker Sitio Dubeng. From the centerline of the Nat\'l Road is approx. 6 m. Travel along Nat\'l Road going to NW direction passing Magapit Bridge, Logac junction, Allacapan, Luna junction, until you reach Pamplona Town Proper continue travel along Nat\'l Road passing Brgy. Allassitan until you reach Brgy. Bidduang abpit 3.1 Km. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4005, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.51714587, '18° 31\' 1.725130\"', 121.30841730, '121° 18\' 30.302280\"', 0.0400, '4', 43.9300, 0.1700, '1', 7.2893, 321433.01430, 2048239.41900, '51', 18.51888594, '18° 31\' 7.989400\"', 121.30714990, '121° 18\' 25.739470\"', 11.7559, 2048216.07400, 532431.21300, '3', 321298.38100, 2048310.22700, '51', 18.51719120, '18° 31\' 1.888330\"', 121.30840900, '121° 18\' 30.272570\"', 0.0402, 42.8270, 0.1522, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(389, 'CGY-45 (PMP-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'GATTU', 2005, 18.47475618, '18° 28\' 29.122248\"', 121.31119940, '121° 18\' 40.317840\"', 'CGY-45 (PMP-03) To reach the station, travel for 10 mins. starting from the town proper following the natl. road until reaching the junction going to Casitan. Follow the brgy. road until reaching Sitio San Jose. Station is located at the intersection of an irrigation canal and a service road (private), at the property of former S.B. Galano. It is also situated 3 kms. NW of Pamplona proper. Mark is the head of a concrete nail centered and embedded in a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. monument protruding 0.1 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"PMP 03, CAD 1204, 2005 FNSP\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.47477538, '18° 28\' 29.191350\"', 121.31121110, '121° 18\' 40.359960\"', 0.0400, '4', 45.3530, 0.1700, '1', 8.2898, 321684.13910, 2043547.06700, '51', 18.47651291, '18° 28\' 35.446460\"', 121.30994270, '121° 18\' 35.793650\"', 13.0316, 2043526.89700, 532734.15200, '3', 321549.36700, 2043617.83500, '51', 18.47482071, '18° 28\' 29.354560\"', 121.31120290, '121° 18\' 40.330290\"', 0.0386, 44.2310, 0.1493, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(390, 'CGY-4517 (BLLM-1)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANTA PRAXEDES', 'CENTRO I', 2012, 18.56348361, '18° 33\' 48.540996\"', 120.99067070, '120° 59\' 26.414520\"', 'CGY-4517 (BL-01) The station is located at Barangay Centro 1, Sta. Praxedes, Cagayan along Provincial road about 15 meters from Municipal Gymnasium and 50 meters from Municipal building. Station Mark is the head of 0.004m x 0.10m Brass Rod centered on a 0. 30m x 0.30m cement putty with inscription \"Sta. Praxedes Cagayan, BLLM NO. 1, CAD 1193-D, DENR/LMS-II.\"', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.56350178, '18° 33\' 48.606400\"', 120.99067500, '120° 59\' 26.430170\"', 0.0100, '1', 96.5960, 0.0300, '1', 60.0250, 287938.54580, 2053715.14300, '51', 18.56525121, '18° 33\' 54.904360\"', 120.98940820, '120° 59\' 21.869480\"', 65.3352, 2053319.98700, 498881.94200, '3', 287803.85400, 2053786.98900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(391, 'CGY-46 (PMP-4)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'GATTU', 2005, 18.47669555, '18° 28\' 36.103980\"', 121.31012280, '121° 18\' 36.442080\"', 'CGY-46 (PMP-04) To reach the station, travel for 10 mins. starting from the town proper following the natl. road until reaching the junction going to Casitan. Follow the brgy. road until reaching Sitio San Jose. Station is located NW of BLLM-3 beside a nipa hut, at the property of former S.B. Galano. It is also situated 3 kms. NW of Pamplona proper. Mark is the head of a concrete nail centered and embedded in a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. monument protruding 0.1 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"PMP 04, CAD 1204, 2005, FNSP\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.47671482, '18° 28\' 36.173350\"', 121.31013420, '121° 18\' 36.483240\"', 0.0400, '4', 45.0820, 0.1700, '1', 8.0336, 321572.41530, 2043762.78800, '51', 18.47845249, '18° 28\' 42.428950\"', 121.30886590, '121° 18\' 31.917090\"', 12.7696, 2043741.36700, 532620.05700, '3', 321437.64900, 2043833.56100, '51', 18.47676015, '18° 28\' 36.336530\"', 121.31012600, '121° 18\' 36.453560\"', 0.0391, 43.9640, 0.1498, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(392, 'CGY-49 (CGN-194)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'BIDDUANG', 2005, 18.51340839, '18° 30\' 48.270204\"', 121.31427990, '121° 18\' 51.407640\"', 'CGY-49 (CGN-194) To reach the station, travel for 5 mins. starting from Pamplona town proper in the direction to the Municipality of Sanchez Mira until reaching Bidduang Elem. School. Station is located inside the said school, situated 3 m. from the NW corner of the circumferential concrete fence of the school compound. It is also situated 6 kms. NE of Pamplona proper. Mark is the head of a concrete nail centered and embedded in a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. monument protruding 0.1 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"CGN-194, 2005 FNSP\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.51342802, '18° 30\' 48.340870\"', 121.31429110, '121° 18\' 51.448080\"', 0.0400, '4', 43.7180, 0.1700, '1', 7.0629, 322049.36670, 2047822.11800, '51', 18.51516775, '18° 30\' 54.603910\"', 121.31302360, '121° 18\' 46.885000\"', 11.5176, 2047805.62500, 533052.12800, '3', 321914.72500, 2047892.90500, '51', 18.51347336, '18° 30\' 48.504080\"', 121.31428290, '121° 18\' 51.418380\"', 0.0404, 42.6170, 0.1522, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(393, 'CGY-51 (PMP-9)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'CABAGGAN', 2005, 18.49310289, '18° 29\' 35.170404\"', 121.34660500, '121° 20\' 47.778000\"', 'CGY-51 (PMP-09) To reach the station, travel for 5 mins. starting from Pamplona proper going to the direction of the Municipality of Sanchez Mira. Upon reaching the junction of Cabaggan, turn right until reaching the Cabaggan Elem. School. Station is located inside the said school. It is also situated 4 kms. NW of Pamplona proper. Mark is the head of a concrete nail centered and embedded in a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. monument protruding 0.1 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"PMP 09, CAD 1204, 2005, FNSP\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.49312255, '18° 29\' 35.241190\"', 121.34661690, '121° 20\' 47.820800\"', 0.0400, '4', 42.0670, 0.1700, '1', 5.3320, 325441.99330, 2045543.14100, '51', 18.49486042, '18° 29\' 41.497500\"', 121.34534900, '121° 20\' 43.256220\"', 9.7219, 2045564.30800, 536469.68800, '3', 325307.30700, 2045613.81000, '51', 18.49316790, '18° 29\' 35.404440\"', 121.34660870, '121° 20\' 47.791200\"', 0.0384, 40.9310, 0.1492, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(394, 'CGY-5315 (BLLM-9)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CLAVERIA', 'CENTRO V', 2014, 18.60945436, '18° 36\' 34.035696\"', 121.09035730, '121° 5\' 25.286280\"', 'CGY-5315 (BLLM-9) STATION MARK: Mark is a monument, 25x25 cm plastered on a concrete road and protruding 1 cm with a copper nail embedded at the center with the inscription of \'\'CLAVERIA, CAG., BLLM No. 09, Pb-02-0161,LMS-2, 2014\'\'. ACCESS: the monument is located more or less 0.75 m. away near the wharf of the river control plastered on the concrete road and in front of the old fishport almost 15 m. away.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.60947407, '18° 36\' 34.106660\"', 121.09036540, '121° 5\' 25.315360\"', 0.0500, '5', 39.1270, 0.1800, '1', 3.1124, 298517.01890, 2058689.28800, '51', 18.61122412, '18° 36\' 40.406820\"', 121.08909970, '121° 5\' 20.758990\"', 7.7809, 2058410.37700, 509402.73200, '3', 298382.54600, 2058760.85100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(395, 'CGY-54 (CGN-186)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'SANTA CRUZ', 2005, 18.41675661, '18° 25\' 0.323796\"', 121.37195860, '121° 22\' 19.050960\"', 'CGY-54 (CGN-186) To reach the station, travel for 7 mins. starting from Pamplona proper going to the direction of the Municipality of Abulug until reaching Sta. Cruz Brgy. Hall. Station is located inside the compound of the brgy. hall and community center, 6 m. SE from the gate of the compound and opposite the Iglesia ni Cristo Chapel. It is also situated 8 kms. SE of Pamplona proper. Mark is the head of a concrete nail centered and embedded in a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. monument protruding 0.1 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"CGN-186, 2005, FNSP\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.41677542, '18° 25\' 0.391500\"', 121.37197100, '121° 22\' 19.095490\"', 0.0400, '4', 44.0380, 0.1600, '1', 6.6812, 328043.34000, 2037068.91800, '51', 18.41850826, '18° 25\' 6.629750\"', 121.37070130, '121° 22\' 14.524710\"', 11.3791, 2037119.25300, 539164.29700, '3', 327908.41800, 2037139.45300, '51', 18.41682074, '18° 25\' 0.554670\"', 121.37196280, '121° 22\' 19.065950\"', 0.0373, 42.9000, 0.1465, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', '');
