(396, 'CGY-56', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUGUEGARAO CITY', 'DADDA', 2007, 17.56871662, '17° 34\' 7.379832\"', 121.77518450, '121° 46\' 30.664200\"', 'CGY-56 Is located near the NE concrete corner fence of Brgy. Dadda Catholic Church and at the intersection of the nat\'l. highway and Cagurangan St. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-56 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.56873114, '17° 34\' 7.432110\"', 121.77519360, '121° 46\' 30.697010\"', 0.0400, '4', 74.1150, 0.1600, '1', 34.7465, 370019.10310, 1942892.08700, '51', 17.57040491, '17° 34\' 13.457660\"', 121.77390500, '121° 46\' 26.058020\"', 37.7210, 1943388.04800, 582155.68300, '3', 369881.67400, 1942960.71100, '51', 17.56877629, '17° 34\' 7.594640\"', 121.77518570, '121° 46\' 30.668520\"', 0.0354, 72.8690, 0.1410, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(397, 'CGY-58', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'UBONG', 2007, 17.60599168, '17° 36\' 21.570048\"', 121.60844410, '121° 36\' 30.398760\"', 'CGY-58 Station is located 15 m. E of the junction of the road leading to Brgy. Ubong and the road leading to Brgy. Karilukud. It is situated 10 m. SE of Brgy. Ubong welcome monument. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-58 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.60600673, '17° 36\' 21.624210\"', 121.60845230, '121° 36\' 30.428150\"', 0.0400, '4', 74.8610, 0.1600, '1', 36.1749, 352351.48880, 1947138.93300, '51', 17.60768629, '17° 36\' 27.670660\"', 121.60716420, '121° 36\' 25.791270\"', 38.9873, 1947449.55000, 564441.09700, '3', 352214.05800, 1947208.11200, '51', 17.60605187, '17° 36\' 21.786720\"', 121.60844430, '121° 36\' 30.399330\"', 0.0346, 73.6240, 0.1386, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(398, 'CGY-59', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUAO', 'TARIBUBU', 2007, 17.60439802, '17° 36\' 15.832872\"', 121.50926630, '121° 30\' 33.358680\"', 'CGY-59 Is located inside the compound of Taribubu Elem. School. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-59 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.60441329, '17° 36\' 15.887860\"', 121.50927390, '121° 30\' 33.385870\"', 0.0400, '4', 108.1790, 0.1600, '1', 69.2514, 341825.00510, 1947042.69100, '51', 17.60609488, '17° 36\' 21.941550\"', 121.50798560, '121° 30\' 28.748300\"', 72.5383, 1947242.44300, 553915.04500, '3', 341687.49700, 1947112.18200, '51', 17.60445843, '17° 36\' 16.050340\"', 121.50926580, '121° 30\' 33.356870\"', 0.0348, 106.9440, 0.1393, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(399, 'CGY-6', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BAGGAO', 'IMURUNG', 1990, 17.84681625, '17° 50\' 48.538500\"', 121.90237290, '121° 54\' 8.542440\"', 'CGY-6 From Tuguegarao, travel N along national highway towards Alcala town, 26 m. up to Alcala-Baggao road junction. Turn right, travel for 9 km. up to Baggao town proper. Then turn right again and travel for 30 km. up to Brgy. San Jose, where the municipal building is located. From Brgy. San Jose, travel NE along the provincial highway for 5 km. up to Brgy. Imurung. Upon reaching the barangay proper of Imurung proceed farther for 500 m. or up to where the lateral canal of irrigation meets. The station is located on the concrete flood gate W of the road. Travel time from Tuguegarao to the station is 2 hrs. Accessible by 2-wheel drive vehicle. Station mark is a cross cut on top of 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in a drill hole, centered on a 0.30 m. x 0.30 m. cement patty; 0.02 m. above the concrete surface of irrigation flood gate. Inscribed with the station name. Sub-surface mark; none. Reference marks: RM-1, RM-2, and RM-3 are cross cuts on top of 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in drill holes centered on cement patty 0.02 m. above concrete surface of irrigation flood gate. Inscribed with the reference mark numbers.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.84683224, '17° 50\' 48.596070\"', 121.90238350, '121° 54\' 8.580440\"', 0.0400, '1', 72.5570, 0.1600, '1', 33.5077, 383697.71370, 1973581.23200, '51', 17.84852003, '17° 50\' 54.672110\"', 121.90110150, '121° 54\' 3.965440\"', 36.7579, 1974228.54900, 595512.10600, '3', 383561.29100, 1973649.67100, '51', 17.84687747, '17° 50\' 48.758900\"', 121.90237560, '121° 54\' 8.552090\"', 0.0355, 71.3410, 0.0140, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(400, 'CGY-61', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'MAGUIRIG', 2007, 17.68549901, '17° 41\' 7.796436\"', 121.64483650, '121° 38\' 41.411400\"', 'CGY-61 From Tuguegarao, cross Cagayan River via Buntun Bridge and turn right at the junction leading to the Mun. of Solana. Upon reaching another junction, turn left and follow the road until a junction leading to Brgy. Maguirig is reached. Turn right and travel for about 2 km. to reach Brgy. Pacu. Station is located inside the property of a certain Judge Lasam, about 30 m. from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-61 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.68551437, '17° 41\' 7.851720\"', 121.64484510, '121° 38\' 41.442400\"', 0.0400, '4', 67.7860, 0.1600, '1', 29.2314, 356276.60010, 1955909.04800, '51', 17.68719795, '17° 41\' 13.912610\"', 121.64355900, '121° 38\' 36.812370\"', 32.0814, 1956261.91200, 568274.00200, '3', 356139.45800, 1955978.17400, '51', 17.68555953, '17° 41\' 8.014320\"', 121.64483710, '121° 38\' 41.413630\"', 0.0344, 66.5570, 0.1381, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(401, 'CGY-62', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PEÑABLANCA', 'DODAN', 2007, 17.64585318, '17° 38\' 45.071448\"', 121.79767310, '121° 47\' 51.623160\"', 'CGY-62 Station is located inside the compound of Dodan Elem. School. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-62 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.64586823, '17° 38\' 45.125610\"', 121.79768260, '121° 47\' 51.657400\"', 0.0400, '4', 74.1220, 0.1600, '1', 34.8336, 372460.19540, 1951412.17600, '51', 17.64754616, '17° 38\' 51.166180\"', 121.79639580, '121° 47\' 47.024990\"', 37.9227, 1951935.40200, 584507.47200, '3', 372323.03600, 1951480.78900, '51', 17.64591339, '17° 38\' 45.288210\"', 121.79767470, '121° 47\' 51.628920\"', 0.0353, 72.8840, 0.1409, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(402, 'CGY-63', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PEÑABLANCA', 'QUIBAL', 2007, 17.71811645, '17° 43\' 5.219220\"', 121.81021080, '121° 48\' 36.758880\"', 'CGY-63 Station is located inside the compound of Quibal Elem. School, near the school flagpole. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-63 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.71813193, '17° 43\' 5.274930\"', 121.81022050, '121° 48\' 36.793650\"', 0.0400, '4', 124.6140, 0.1600, '1', 85.4494, 373840.78770, 1959399.88800, '51', 17.71981393, '17° 43\' 11.330150\"', 121.80893540, '121° 48\' 32.167380\"', 88.6182, 1959939.24500, 585803.84200, '3', 373703.87600, 1959468.51600, '51', 17.71817711, '17° 43\' 5.437600\"', 121.81021250, '121° 48\' 36.765170\"', 0.0344, 123.3860, 0.1379, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(403, 'CGY-64', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'IGUIG', 'GAMMAD', 2007, 17.70797148, '17° 42\' 28.697328\"', 121.74447110, '121° 44\' 40.095960\"', 'CGY-64 (BLLM 35) Station is located inside the school compound of Gammad Annex of Iguig National High School approximately 4.5 km south from Iguig municipal hall. It is adjacent to a concrete walkway about 30 m from the western concrete fence of the school, approximately 20 m north of the of the southwest (SW) classroom and 15 m south of the northwest (NW) classroom. Station is the head of a 3\" copper nail set at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete protruding about 20 cm above the ground and with inscription \"CGY64, 2007 , NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.70798689, '17° 42\' 28.752810\"', 121.74448030, '121° 44\' 40.129140\"', 0.0400, '4', 60.0810, 0.1700, '1', 21.2658, 366861.60270, 1958322.57600, '51', 17.70966970, '17° 42\' 34.810930\"', 121.74319490, '121° 44\' 35.501580\"', 24.2100, 1958787.80000, 578834.83800, '3', 366724.60800, 1958391.40500, '51', 17.70803207, '17° 42\' 28.915460\"', 121.74447240, '121° 44\' 40.100540\"', 0.0351, 58.8520, 0.1466, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(404, 'CGY-65', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'BAUAN WEST', 2007, 17.72108250, '17° 43\' 15.897000\"', 121.67841480, '121° 40\' 42.293280\"', 'CGY-65 Brg. Bauan West is accessible via the provincial road, about 10 km. from Solana Centro heading N past Brgys. Natapian, Lanna, Bangag and Bauan East. Station is located inside the lot of Mr. Averer Baliuag, about 60 m. SE of a house owned by Mr. Leo Bambalan. Monumentation is witnessed by both the lot owner and Bauan West Brgy. Capt. Joseph Frogoso. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding about 20 cm. above the ground, with inscriptions \"CGY-65 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.72109815, '17° 43\' 15.953340\"', 121.67842340, '121° 40\' 42.324290\"', 0.0400, '4', 57.3240, 0.1500, '1', 18.7774, 359865.95640, 1959821.36000, '51', 17.72278316, '17° 43\' 22.019370\"', 121.67713820, '121° 40\' 37.697420\"', 21.6539, 1960212.67100, 571822.33300, '3', 359728.95600, 1959890.40800, '51', 17.72114333, '17° 43\' 16.115980\"', 121.67841540, '121° 40\' 42.295570\"', 0.0341, 56.0980, 0.1373, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
