(407, 'CGY-68', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PIAT', 'MAGUILLING', 2007, 17.79460596, '17° 47\' 40.581456\"', 121.52506840, '121° 31\' 30.246240\"', 'CGY-68 From Piat, head 2.5 km. SE along the Nat\'l. Highway towards Solana and head NE along the Piat-Sto. Niño provincial road, past Piat District Hospital. Station is located along the provincial road, within the sugarcane plantation of Piat campus of Cagayan State University, approx. 700 m. NE of its main gate, about 6 m. NW from the road and 2 m. SW from the E lot fence of the said campus. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding about 20 cm. above the ground, with inscriptions \"CGY-68 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.79462230, '17° 47\' 40.640280\"', 121.52507620, '121° 31\' 30.274390\"', 0.0400, '4', 81.2260, 0.1500, '1', 42.5983, 343666.81060, 1968078.62400, '51', 17.79631498, '17° 47\' 46.733910\"', 121.52379240, '121° 31\' 25.652760\"', 46.1619, 1968298.54400, 555534.22000, '3', 343529.94100, 1968148.21100, '51', 17.79466748, '17° 47\' 40.802940\"', 121.52506820, '121° 31\' 30.245350\"', 0.0336, 80.0140, 0.1364, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
