(417, 'CGY-82', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'GATTARAN', 'CAPISSAYAN SUR', 2007, 18.05024042, '18° 3\' 0.865512\"', 121.82487570, '121° 49\' 29.552520\"', 'CGY-82 Is located along Gattaran-Baggao provincial road about 25 km. from Gattaran, adjacent to the concrete riprap, 2.2 m. from the SW end of Capissayan Bridge and approx. 4 m. from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding about 20 cm. above ground, with inscriptions \"CGY-82 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.05025817, '18° 3\' 0.929400\"', 121.82488600, '121° 49\' 29.589750\"', 0.0400, '4', 71.0400, 0.1600, '1', 32.5570, 375627.54910, 1996141.15300, '51', 18.05195976, '18° 3\' 7.055130\"', 121.82360870, '121° 49\' 24.991220\"', 36.0905, 1996706.89600, 587198.02400, '3', 375491.73700, 1996209.99000, '51', 18.05030344, '18° 3\' 1.092390\"', 121.82487810, '121° 49\' 29.561190\"', 0.0359, 69.8480, 0.1426, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
