(422, 'CGY-89', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'LOGAC', 2007, 18.15498366, '18° 9\' 17.941176\"', 121.60899900, '121° 36\' 32.396400\"', 'CGY-89 From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos. Logac Nat\'l. High School is across Km. Post 705. Station is located on the left side of the access road to the entrance of the said school, about 8 m. S of the gate entrance. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-89 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.15500260, '18° 9\' 18.009360\"', 121.60900850, '121° 36\' 32.430760\"', 0.0400, '4', 47.8460, 0.1600, '1', 9.5388, 352863.45810, 2007891.15400, '51', 18.15671499, '18° 9\' 24.173960\"', 121.60773320, '121° 36\' 27.839620\"', 13.7568, 2008212.23200, 564303.57900, '3', 352727.83700, 2007960.74900, '51', 18.15504789, '18° 9\' 18.172390\"', 121.60900050, '121° 36\' 32.401750\"', 0.0356, 46.6960, 0.1426, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(423, 'CGY-91', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'CENTRO WEST', 2007, 18.22602481, '18° 13\' 33.689316\"', 121.55601900, '121° 33\' 21.668400\"', 'CGY-91 From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos. Turn left to Allacapan Mun. Hall, which is between Km. Posts 695 and 694 (on the left side of the road). Station is located inside the town plaza\'s circle ground, on the N pathwalk, near the center of the grounds. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-91 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.22604392, '18° 13\' 33.758110\"', 121.55602780, '121° 33\' 21.699990\"', 0.0400, '4', 45.7950, 0.1600, '1', 7.5586, 347320.17070, 2015796.28600, '51', 18.22776164, '18° 13\' 39.941900\"', 121.55475400, '121° 33\' 17.114440\"', 12.0662, 2016057.62600, 558673.98800, '3', 347184.74600, 2015866.10000, '51', 18.22608922, '18° 13\' 33.921180\"', 121.55601970, '121° 33\' 21.670870\"', 0.0364, 44.6280, 0.1438, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(424, 'CGY-92', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'CENTRO', 2007, 18.20145923, '18° 12\' 5.253228\"', 121.66298080, '121° 39\' 46.730880\"', 'CGY-92 Is located inside the Lal-lo Nat\'l. High School, about 5 m. W of the flagpole. Said school is 95 m. E of the Tuguegarao-Aparri nat\'l. road, between Km Posts 562 and 563 and about 40 m. N of Lal-lo Mun. Hall. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-92 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.20147711, '18° 12\' 5.317590\"', 121.66299090, '121° 39\' 46.767170\"', 0.0400, '4', 46.1670, 0.1600, '1', 8.0648, 358611.91720, 2012991.77300, '51', 18.20319112, '18° 12\' 11.488020\"', 121.66171670, '121° 39\' 42.180220\"', 12.1014, 2013375.79100, 569997.17500, '3', 358476.48700, 2013061.23200, '51', 18.20152241, '18° 12\' 5.480670\"', 121.66298280, '121° 39\' 46.738250\"', 0.0358, 44.9990, 0.1423, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(425, 'CGY-93', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'DAGUPAN', 2007, 18.18255855, '18° 10\' 57.210780\"', 121.75492880, '121° 45\' 17.743680\"', 'CGY-93 From Aparri Proper, travel for about 30 km. S until reaching the junction at Brgy. Magapit, Lal-lo. Turn left/E and travel for about 12 km. leading to Brgy. Dagupan. Station is located on the SE corner of the basketball court, across Dagupan Brgy. Hall. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-93 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.18257493, '18° 10\' 57.269740\"', 121.75493520, '121° 45\' 17.766760\"', 0.0400, '4', 59.9870, 0.1600, '1', 21.8472, 368322.08010, 2010831.61200, '51', 18.18428587, '18° 11\' 3.429130\"', 121.75366080, '121° 45\' 13.178800\"', 25.6393, 2011320.90900, 579732.14600, '3', 368186.65300, 2010900.76800, '51', 18.18262023, '18° 10\' 57.432830\"', 121.75492720, '121° 45\' 17.738030\"', 0.0358, 58.8000, 0.1422, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(426, 'CGY-94', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BALLESTEROS', 'NARARAGAN', 2007, 18.29716528, '18° 17\' 49.795008\"', 121.48688150, '121° 29\' 12.773400\"', 'CGY-94 From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos. After Km. Post 675 (on the left side of the road), turn left leading to Brgy. Nararagan and for about 4 km. stop at the Y-junction. Station is located on the NW side of the irrigation canal gate. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-94 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.29718516, '18° 17\' 49.866590\"', 121.48688990, '121° 29\' 12.803580\"', 0.0400, '4', 49.5050, 0.1600, '1', 11.5017, 340073.63120, 2023728.53800, '51', 18.29890854, '18° 17\' 56.070760\"', 121.48561770, '121° 29\' 8.223540\"', 16.1761, 2023911.05900, 551340.66000, '3', 339938.39300, 2023798.62300, '51', 18.29723047, '18° 17\' 50.029700\"', 121.48688180, '121° 29\' 12.774310\"', 0.0364, 48.3490, 0.1435, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(427, 'CGY-95', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'APARRI', 'BANGAG', 2007, 18.29633079, '18° 17\' 46.790844\"', 121.57035640, '121° 34\' 13.283040\"', 'CGY-95 From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos. Turn right leading to Brgy. Bukig. Travel for about 1 km. until reaching the first bridge. Station is located on the SW corner walkway of the bridge. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-95 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 18.29635077, '18° 17\' 46.862770\"', 121.57036540, '121° 34\' 13.315450\"', 0.0400, '4', 43.9700, 0.1600, '1', 6.1160, 348897.27700, 2023565.03800, '51', 18.29807234, '18° 17\' 53.060440\"', 121.56909330, '121° 34\' 8.735830\"', 10.4387, 2023844.01600, 560166.41000, '3', 348762.09400, 2023634.85900, '51', 18.29639608, '18° 17\' 47.025900\"', 121.57035730, '121° 34\' 13.286330\"', 0.0359, 42.8110, 0.1425, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(428, 'ABR-12', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LAGANGILANG', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2007, 17.57696653, '17° 34\' 37.079508\"', 120.76853590, '120° 46\' 6.729240\"', 'ABR-12 From Lagangilang town proper, travel towards Brgy. San Isidro. Bio Street of San Isidro is about 4.6 km. from town proper. In a road interseciton near the waiting shed, turn right and it will lead to the Bio Bridge which is about 1.85 km. from the road intersection. The station is located on the lot owned by Mr. Renato Alvarez which is 150 m away from Bio Bridge. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-12, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.57698031, '17° 34\' 37.129130\"', 120.76854110, '120° 46\' 6.747850\"', 0.0300, '3', 129.9350, 0.1000, '1', 89.8890, 263165.77340, 1944778.53900, '51', 17.57867604, '17° 34\' 43.233740\"', 120.76725110, '120° 46\' 2.103940\"', 95.9853, 1944151.01800, 475293.68500, '3', 263027.63200, 1944850.36900, '51', 17.57702538, '17° 34\' 37.291360\"', 120.76853260, '120° 46\' 6.717500\"', 0.0273, 128.7160, 0.0935, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(429, 'ABR-14 (BLLM-1)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'BUCAY', 'NORTH POBLACION', 2007, 17.53831339, '17° 32\' 17.928204\"', 120.71846830, '120° 43\' 6.485880\"', 'ABR-14 (BLLM-1) From the town proper of Bangued, travel towards Narvacan in Ilocos Sur which is about 2.5 km. to reach the road intersection located before Sinalang Bridge. At the road intersection, turn left and continue travel towards the Municipal Hall of Bucay, Abra which is about 14 km. from the said intersection. The station is located at the plaza of Bucay which is about 40 m in front of the municipal hall building. Mark is the head of a 4 in. nail flushed at the center of a 40 cm x 40 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"BLLM No. 1\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.53832684, '17° 32\' 17.976640\"', 120.71847340, '120° 43\' 6.504170\"', 0.0300, '3', 134.5720, 0.1100, '1', 94.7764, 257798.16020, 1940562.72900, '51', 17.54002132, '17° 32\' 24.076740\"', 120.71718240, '120° 43\' 1.856780\"', 100.6188, 1939880.51300, 469972.49000, '3', 257659.85300, 1940634.69000, '51', 17.53837189, '17° 32\' 18.138820\"', 120.71846490, '120° 43\' 6.473740\"', 0.0277, 133.3500, 0.0944, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(430, 'ABR-15', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN QUINTIN', 'POBLACION', 2007, 17.53946665, '17° 32\' 22.079940\"', 120.51627780, '120° 30\' 58.600080\"', 'ABR-15 From the Junction of Navarcan, travel towards Abra for about 40 mins. to reach San Quintin. At San Quintin, turn left and travel for about 2.9 km. to reach the road intersection which is 50 m before reaching the Municipal Hall of San Quintin. From the municipal hall, turn left, travel for about 350 m and walk to the SW direction for about 200 m to reach the farm lot owned by Municipal Assessor Rodolfo Ponio where the station is located, about 50 m SW of Mr. Rudy Ramos residence. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-15, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.53947999, '17° 32\' 22.127950\"', 120.51628240, '120° 30\' 58.616810\"', 0.0300, '3', 62.2050, 0.1100, '1', 24.7175, 236325.05580, 1940959.66500, '51', 17.54117886, '17° 32\' 28.243900\"', 120.51499120, '120° 30\' 53.968450\"', 28.7414, 1940051.96700, 448505.29200, '3', 236186.60400, 1941032.27900, '51', 17.53952502, '17° 32\' 22.290070\"', 120.51627390, '120° 30\' 58.586010\"', 0.0283, 60.9880, 0.0966, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(431, 'ABR-17', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'DAGUIOMAN', 'TUI', 2007, 17.45846247, '17° 27\' 30.464892\"', 120.92547130, '120° 55\' 31.696680\"', 'ABR-17 From the town proper of Sallapadan, travel towards Bucloc and Daguioman. In about 24 km., you will reach the Municipal Hall of Daguioman. Sallapadan is about 34.7 km. from Bangued. The station is located in the compound of Daguioman Elementary School, SW of the municipal bldg. and 40 m NW of the flagpole. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-17, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.45847548, '17° 27\' 30.511730\"', 120.92547580, '120° 55\' 31.713030\"', 0.0300, '3', 515.9060, 0.1100, '1', 473.1450, 279685.12570, 1931472.01200, '51', 17.46016063, '17° 27\' 36.578270\"', 120.92418340, '120° 55\' 27.060340\"', 481.2002, 1931022.13300, 491946.85700, '3', 279546.71200, 1931543.23600, '51', 17.45852053, '17° 27\' 30.673890\"', 120.92546750, '120° 55\' 31.683010\"', 0.0286, 514.6680, 0.0976, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(432, 'ABR-18', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'BOLINEY', 'BAO-YAN', 2007, 17.37331183, '17° 22\' 23.922588\"', 120.76975030, '120° 46\' 11.101080\"', 'ABR-18 From Bangued, Abra town proper, travel towards Narvacan, Ilocos Sur for about 2.5 km. Turn left to the intersection road before Sinalang Bridge and continue travel for about 29.6 km. until reaching Abra River. Pass through the river by riding a ferry, and continue travel towards Boliney for about 2.1 km. Turn left to the intersection road after the boundary of Poblacion and San Ramon West at the town of Manabo until reaching the open field. The station is located at the open field near Brgy. Capt. Roberto Maggonga\'s residence. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-18, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.37332490, '17° 22\' 23.969650\"', 120.76975570, '120° 46\' 11.120610\"', 0.0300, '3', 617.8460, 0.1100, '1', 575.9509, 263031.08750, 1922232.49000, '51', 17.37500823, '17° 22\' 30.029620\"', 120.76846110, '120° 46\' 6.460070\"', 583.2432, 1921612.21700, 475394.77700, '3', 262892.27700, 1922304.14500, '51', 17.37336991, '17° 22\' 24.131680\"', 120.76974730, '120° 46\' 11.090330\"', 0.0283, 616.6020, 0.0968, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(433, 'ABR-19', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LUBA', 'LUZONG', 2007, 17.36556049, '17° 21\' 56.017764\"', 120.69624570, '120° 41\' 46.484520\"', 'ABR-19 The station is located on the Northern right corner of Lusong Nationall High School compound. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross-cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-19, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.36557329, '17° 21\' 56.063840\"', 120.69625080, '120° 41\' 46.502970\"', 0.0300, '3', 302.7700, 0.1100, '1', 261.6971, 255207.27890, 1921466.72400, '51', 17.36725780, '17° 22\' 2.128080\"', 120.69495590, '120° 41\' 41.841170\"', 268.3191, 1920765.45300, 467582.08800, '3', 255068.38100, 1921538.61800, '51', 17.36561829, '17° 21\' 56.225840\"', 120.69624240, '120° 41\' 46.472560\"', 0.0279, 301.5270, 0.0949, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(434, 'ABR-20', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'PILAR', 'DINTAN', 2007, 17.36318491, '17° 21\' 47.465676\"', 120.58612470, '120° 35\' 10.048920\"', 'ABR-20 From Piddigan, Abra, travel towards SE direction for about 25.6 km. until reaching the Municipal Hall of Pilar. From the municipal hall, travel towards Brgy. Narnara for about 2.9 km. Turn right to the intersection road of the brgy. going to Brgy. Dintan. The station is located on the lot owned by Mrs. Gladys Dizon Vineza, about 60 m NW of Mr. Caesar Ramirez\'s residence. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-20, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.36319775, '17° 21\' 47.511900\"', 120.58613010, '120° 35\' 10.068180\"', 0.0300, '3', 196.5650, 0.1000, '1', 156.9925, 243497.11310, 1921347.65900, '51', 17.36488450, '17° 21\' 53.584210\"', 120.58483490, '120° 35\' 5.405540\"', 162.3714, 1920524.77000, 455878.49800, '3', 243358.12300, 1921419.91000, '51', 17.36324274, '17° 21\' 47.673880\"', 120.58612150, '120° 35\' 10.037560\"', 0.0270, 195.3240, 0.0919, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(435, 'ABR-21', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'TUBO', 'POBLACION', 2007, 17.25778293, '17° 15\' 28.018548\"', 120.72505810, '120° 43\' 30.209160\"', 'ABR-21 The station is located inside the compound of Tubo Central School, 3 m SE of the stage, 50 m SE of the Catholic Church, and 70 m E of the Municipal Hall. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-21, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.25779545, '17° 15\' 28.063630\"', 120.72506340, '120° 43\' 30.228170\"', 0.0300, '3', 355.2620, 0.1200, '1', 313.1205, 258129.15370, 1909499.09700, '51', 17.25947283, '17° 15\' 34.102170\"', 120.72376600, '120° 43\' 25.557540\"', 320.3996, 1908833.09100, 470626.72700, '3', 257989.91700, 1909570.81400, '51', 17.25784043, '17° 15\' 28.225540\"', 120.72505500, '120° 43\' 30.197840\"', 0.0291, 354.0050, 0.1045, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(436, 'ABR-23', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LACUB', 'GUINGUINABANG', 2007, 17.65749285, '17° 39\' 26.974260\"', 120.90191410, '120° 54\' 6.890760\"', 'ABR-23 From Bangued, Abra town proper, travel towards E along Abra-Kalinga road for about 45.7 km. Turn left and travel towards Municipality of Lacub for about 11.7 km. until reaching Guinguinabang Creek. Station is located at the big rock, about 15 m S of the road, and about 32 m SE of the waiting shed. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 02 cm cement putty with inscriptions, \"ABR-23, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.65750666, '17° 39\' 27.023970\"', 120.90191950, '120° 54\' 6.910350\"', 0.0300, '3', 517.7110, 0.1100, '1', 476.7421, 277426.00670, 1953530.57000, '51', 17.65920426, '17° 39\' 33.135350\"', 120.90063170, '120° 54\' 2.274150\"', 483.7000, 1953050.26000, 489456.74500, '3', 277288.24000, 1953602.02200, '51', 17.65755175, '17° 39\' 27.186300\"', 120.90191120, '120° 54\' 6.880220\"', 0.0274, 516.4990, 0.0944, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(437, 'ABR-24', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LAGANGILANG', 'PAGANAO', 2007, 17.67713314, '17° 40\' 37.679304\"', 120.78962380, '120° 47\' 22.645680\"', 'ABR-24 From Bangued, travel on the NE direction towards Dolores. In about 15.4 km., you will reach a crossroad. At the crossing, turn left and travel towards Dolores town proper. Continue travelling towards Brgy. Paganao of Lagangilang which is about 14.4 km. The station is located 70 m E of the day care center, and 35 m NE of Ms. Felomena Unpana\'s residence. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with isncriptions, \"ABR-24, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.67714714, '17° 40\' 37.729710\"', 120.78962910, '120° 47\' 22.664660\"', 0.0300, '3', 158.1580, 0.1100, '1', 118.5828, 265534.45470, 1955840.74500, '51', 17.67884841, '17° 40\' 43.854270\"', 120.78834150, '120° 47\' 18.029240\"', 124.4795, 1955234.00500, 477544.83900, '3', 265396.66500, 1955912.58200, '51', 17.67719223, '17° 40\' 37.892040\"', 120.78962060, '120° 47\' 22.634320\"', 0.0273, 156.9500, 0.0949, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(438, 'ABR-26', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LAGAYAN', 'POBLACION', 2007, 17.72075051, '17° 43\' 14.701836\"', 120.70598130, '120° 42\' 21.532680\"', 'ABR-26 The station is located beside the plant box, about 10 m in front of Lagayan Municipal Hall, about 30 m NE of BLLM NO. 1. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-26, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.72076479, '17° 43\' 14.753260\"', 120.70598610, '120° 42\' 21.550110\"', 0.0300, '3', 145.6250, 0.1100, '1', 107.0461, 256716.99900, 1960775.46300, '51', 17.72247045, '17° 43\' 20.893630\"', 120.70469940, '120° 42\' 16.917880\"', 112.2879, 1960073.43600, 468678.64400, '3', 256579.29400, 1960847.60200, '51', 17.72080989, '17° 43\' 14.915610\"', 120.70597770, '120° 42\' 21.519590\"', 0.0299, 144.4250, 0.1022, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(439, 'ABR-27', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LA PAZ', 'SAN GREGORIO', 2007, 17.64678366, '17° 38\' 48.421176\"', 120.64346020, '120° 38\' 36.456720\"', 'ABR-27 From Bangued, Abra town proper, travel towards E-NW direction for about 3.3 km. until reaching Abra River. Pass through the river by riding a ferry and continue travel to La Paz, for about 4.5 km. until reaching San Gregorio Elementary School. Turn right and continue travel towards San Gregorio for about 180 m. The station is located about 15 m SE of the stage. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-27, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.64679739, '17° 38\' 48.470590\"', 120.64346500, '120° 38\' 36.474030\"', 0.0300, '3', 104.3400, 0.1100, '1', 66.0764, 249981.16190, 1952668.56300, '51', 17.64849996, '17° 38\' 54.599870\"', 120.64217650, '120° 38\' 31.835290\"', 70.9149, 1951898.84000, 462031.48900, '3', 249843.16400, 1952740.84800, '51', 17.64684246, '17° 38\' 48.632850\"', 120.64345650, '120° 38\' 36.443420\"', 0.0281, 103.1330, 0.0971, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(440, 'ABR-28', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'DOLORES', 'POBLACION', 2007, 17.64870564, '17° 38\' 55.340304\"', 120.70830810, '120° 42\' 29.909160\"', 'ABR-28 From Bangued town proper, travel to the NE direction towards the town of Dolores. In about 15.4 km., you will reach the Talogtog junction. At the junction, turn left and continue travelling towards Dolores Municipal Hall which is about 5.2 km. from the said junction. The station was established inside the compound of Dolores Civic Center. Station is located 50 m front of Municipal Hall. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-28, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.64871950, '17° 38\' 55.390200\"', 120.70831300, '120° 42\' 29.926760\"', 0.0300, '3', 115.8730, 0.1100, '1', 77.0591, 256866.91040, 1952796.66300, '51', 17.65042081, '17° 39\' 1.514910\"', 120.70702460, '120° 42\' 25.288520\"', 82.2984, 1952099.56500, 468912.88100, '3', 256728.96600, 1952868.74100, '51', 17.64876458, '17° 38\' 55.552480\"', 120.70830450, '120° 42\' 29.896270\"', 0.0293, 114.6640, 0.0994, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(441, 'ABR-30', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'TAYUM', 'BUDAC', 2007, 17.59348271, '17° 35\' 36.537756\"', 120.68620560, '120° 41\' 10.340160\"', 'ABR-30 From the town proper of Bangued, travel towards the town of Lagangilang. In about 5.2 Km., you will reach a road intersection. Turn right and continue travelling towards the Mun. Hall of Tayum. From the Mun. Hall, travel towards Wayya Street in Budac, Tayum. Station was established on the farm owned by Mr. Joseph Millare. It is located 150 m SE of the brgy. clinic. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-30, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.67, 17.59349632, '17° 35\' 36.586750\"', 120.68621090, '120° 41\' 10.359240\"', 0.0300, '3', 110.5510, 0.1100, '1', 71.5918, 254446.20140, 1946711.72400, '51', 17.59519479, '17° 35\' 42.701260\"', 120.68492120, '120° 41\' 5.716270\"', 76.8521, 1945991.69500, 466557.33300, '3', 254308.05500, 1946783.83100, '51', 17.59354138, '17° 35\' 36.748970\"', 120.68620240, '120° 41\' 10.328730\"', 0.0284, 109.3360, 0.0967, '2022-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
