(485, 'LUN-69', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'CALLIAT', 2007, 16.82680041, '16° 49\' 36.481476\"', 120.44341580, '120° 26\' 36.296880\"', 'LUN-69 From Balaoan town proper, travel 2.3 km. N to Pantar Norte, then turn right and travel 3.3 km. E to Brgy. Caliat. Station is located on the foot of the bridge going to Brgy. Caliat proper. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. monument leveled with the road surface, with inscriptions \"LUN-69 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.82680950, '16° 49\' 36.514190\"', 120.44341740, '120° 26\' 36.302550\"', 0.0100, '1', 58.6350, 0.0300, '1', 18.6878, 227544.58030, 1862156.46600, '51', 16.82846682, '16° 49\' 42.480550\"', 120.44210950, '120° 26\' 31.594210\"', 23.0969, 1861201.54500, 440540.14300, '3', 227403.67700, 1862228.75900, '51', 16.82685429, '16° 49\' 36.675430\"', 120.44340890, '120° 26\' 36.272150\"', 0.0168, 57.3970, 0.0354, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(486, 'LUN-71', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BANGAR', 'BANGAOILAN WEST', 2007, 16.89766297, '16° 53\' 51.586692\"', 120.44243570, '120° 26\' 32.768520\"', 'LUN-71 From Bangar Town Hall, travel 2.5 km. NE to Brgy. Bangaoilan. Turn right at the brgy. welcome arc. Station is located about 100 m. from the said arc, situated beside the irrigation canal at the right intersection of the brgy. roads. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. monument protruding 0.2 m. from the ground, with inscriptions \"LUN-71 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.89767196, '16° 53\' 51.619060\"', 120.44243730, '120° 26\' 32.774140\"', 0.0100, '1', 54.3320, 0.0400, '1', 14.7650, 227541.72610, 1870003.41500, '51', 16.89933363, '16° 53\' 57.601060\"', 120.44113100, '120° 26\' 28.071730\"', 19.0173, 1869044.00500, 440458.04700, '3', 227401.06000, 1870075.76700, '51', 16.89771677, '16° 53\' 51.780370\"', 120.44242880, '120° 26\' 32.743710\"', 0.0170, 53.1030, 0.0375, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(487, 'LUN-72', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'AGOO', 'SAN AGUSTIN NORTE', 2007, 16.33602179, '16° 20\' 9.678444\"', 120.36532230, '120° 21\' 55.160280\"', 'LUN-72 From Agoo Mun. Hall, travel towards San Fernando, about 1 km. after passing the first bridge. Travel for about 200 m. and turn left. Continue traveling for about 80 m. where the station is located. Station is situated in the right edge of the road and is about 20 m. SW of the San Agustin Norte Day Care Center. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"LUN-72 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.33602950, '16° 20\' 9.706200\"', 120.36532570, '120° 21\' 55.172340\"', 0.0100, '1', 54.4720, 0.0400, '1', 13.1904, 218503.90770, 1807927.00900, '51', 16.33765837, '16° 20\' 15.570120\"', 120.36400620, '120° 21\' 50.422400\"', 17.6084, 1806914.31500, 432043.57100, '3', 218361.29100, 1807999.15400, '51', 16.33607415, '16° 20\' 9.866940\"', 120.36531720, '120° 21\' 55.141950\"', 0.0180, 53.1770, 0.0410, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(488, 'LUN-74', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SUDIPEN', 'OLD CENTRAL', 2007, 16.90006830, '16° 54\' 0.245880\"', 120.49180000, '120° 29\' 30.480000\"', 'LUN-74 Is located in Brgy. Old Central, between Brgys. Ilocano and Namaltugan. It is situated on the middle of a dike E of a steel bridge and an irrigation bridge and is 8 m. N of the S end of the dike. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"LUN-74 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.90007753, '16° 54\' 0.279090\"', 120.49180160, '120° 29\' 30.485670\"', 0.0100, '1', 71.3420, 0.0300, '1', 31.0762, 232806.75790, 1870202.08700, '51', 16.90173827, '16° 54\' 6.257770\"', 120.49049550, '120° 29\' 25.783710\"', 35.9158, 1869295.84800, 445718.14800, '3', 232666.13800, 1870274.28200, '51', 16.90012234, '16° 54\' 0.440410\"', 120.49179310, '120° 29\' 30.455330\"', 0.0169, 70.1120, 0.0366, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(489, 'PNG-3002', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN QUINTIN', 'CASANTAMARIAN', 2007, 15.98411334, '15° 59\' 2.808024\"', 120.81896370, '120° 49\' 8.269320\"', 'PNG-3002 From San Quintin Town Proper, along Dpalo Road, travel for about 1.5 kilometers to reach Barangay Casantamarian. The station is located at the SW corner of the basketball court inside Barangay Hall compound. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3002; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.98411842, '15° 59\' 2.826310\"', 120.81896860, '120° 49\' 8.286880\"', 0.0200, '1', 153.9610, 0.0800, '1', 110.7316, 266581.43880, 1768402.45600, '51', 15.98571547, '15° 59\' 8.575680\"', 120.81764150, '120° 49\' 3.509570\"', 114.9305, 1767874.74200, 480480.66900, '3', 266438.01200, 1768472.83000, '51', 15.98416305, '15° 59\' 2.986990\"', 120.81896030, '120° 49\' 8.257130\"', 0.0192, 152.5470, 0.0688, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(490, 'PNG-3043', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN MANUEL', 'SAN JUAN', 2007, 16.04716567, '16° 2\' 49.796412\"', 120.66841680, '120° 40\' 6.300480\"', 'PNG-3043 The station is located at the back of waiting shed along the road going to Municipality of Asingan. Marked is the head of a 3 inches concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm. x 30cm. x 100cm. standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm. with inscriptions \"PNG-3043; 2007; LMS DENR I.\"', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.04717156, '16° 2\' 49.817610\"', 120.66842020, '120° 40\' 6.312870\"', 0.0200, '1', 98.3920, 0.0800, '1', 56.2748, 250540.49330, 1775556.87600, '51', 16.04877586, '16° 2\' 55.593090\"', 120.66709450, '120° 40\' 1.540080\"', 59.9166, 1774872.25300, 464377.43900, '3', 250397.15200, 1775627.79300, '51', 16.04721620, '16° 2\' 49.978320\"', 120.66841190, '120° 40\' 6.282820\"', 0.0196, 96.9900, 0.0701, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(491, 'PNG-3117', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGALDAN', 'INLAMBO', 2008, 16.09966065, '16° 5\' 58.778340\"', 120.41239880, '120° 24\' 44.635680\"', 'PNG-3117 The station is situated along the eastern side of the barangay road beside the electric lamp post and around 10m NE of the marker of the United Methodist Church. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm, with inscription \"PNG-3117 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.09966462, '16° 5\' 58.792640\"', 120.41239990, '120° 24\' 44.639530\"', 0.0200, '2', 47.7160, 0.0800, '1', 6.0485, 223206.07460, 1781693.88800, '51', 16.10127781, '16° 6\' 4.600120\"', 120.41107500, '120° 24\' 39.869890\"', 10.0195, 1780742.66900, 436997.96100, '3', 223062.70000, 1781765.68100, '51', 16.09970926, '16° 5\' 58.953340\"', 120.41239140, '120° 24\' 44.608990\"', 0.0201, 46.3270, 0.0717, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(492, 'PNG-3155', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA BARBARA', 'BANZAL', 2008, 16.00754759, '16° 0\' 27.171324\"', 120.43632660, '120° 26\' 10.775760\"', 'PNG-3155 The station along the barangay road going to Brgy. Efre, approximately 25m from the SW corner of Banzal Elementary School. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm, with inscription \"PNG-3155 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.00755015, '16° 0\' 27.180530\"', 120.43633010, '120° 26\' 10.788270\"', 0.0200, '2', 52.8810, 0.0800, '1', 11.0338, 225641.06600, 1771463.99300, '51', 16.00915708, '16° 0\' 32.965470\"', 120.43500310, '120° 26\' 6.010980\"', 14.8482, 1770542.15900, 439530.01200, '3', 225497.40100, 1771535.63100, '51', 16.00759476, '16° 0\' 27.341140\"', 120.43632160, '120° 26\' 10.757800\"', 0.0210, 51.4800, 0.0759, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(493, 'PNG-3172', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LABRADOR', 'TOBUAN', 2008, 16.05558452, '16° 3\' 20.104272\"', 120.10984250, '120° 6\' 35.433000\"', 'From Sual route to Labrador until you reach barangay Tuboan, turn right to the road before the Tuboan Elem. School. About 100 meters from the national road, the mark is located at the east of the road. From electric post 2.22 meters SW of the post. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3172, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.05558743, '16° 3\' 20.114740\"', 120.10984360, '120° 6\' 35.437040\"', 0.0200, '2', 46.9230, 0.0800, '1', 4.3495, 190751.41930, 1777242.63800, '51', 16.05720450, '16° 3\' 25.936200\"', 120.10851730, '120° 6\' 30.662310\"', 9.8263, 1775981.53100, 404608.07200, '3', 190607.65100, 1777315.38100, '51', 16.05563203, '16° 3\' 20.275300\"', 120.10983500, '120° 6\' 35.405950\"', 0.0213, 45.5360, 0.0742, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(494, 'PNG-3188', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'BOLAOEN', 2008, 15.93169659, '15° 55\' 54.107724\"', 120.23541510, '120° 14\' 7.494360\"', 'From Bugallon town proper travel 5 minutes westward of any kind of vehicle going to Barangay Bolaoen. At Bolaoen intersection turn right going to the station. The station is located 6 m S of w. shed near C.V.O. outpost. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3188, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.93169912, '15° 55\' 54.116840\"', 120.23541720, '120° 14\' 7.501830\"', 0.0200, '2', 51.8530, 0.0800, '1', 8.7082, 204014.45190, 1763341.52600, '51', 15.93330588, '15° 55\' 59.901180\"', 120.23408790, '120° 14\' 2.716330\"', 14.2177, 1762217.71700, 417994.81700, '3', 203870.34100, 1763413.77100, '51', 15.93174370, '15° 55\' 54.277310\"', 120.23540860, '120° 14\' 7.471010\"', 0.0202, 50.4480, 0.0722, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(495, 'PNG-3195', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'LAOAG', 2008, 15.86964823, '15° 52\' 10.733628\"', 120.24268030, '120° 14\' 33.649080\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel northward until you reach the barangay Cabugay municipality of Aguilar. The mark is located at Cabugay bridge about 4 m from the North side edge of the bridge and 7 m from the centerline of the road. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3195, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.86965072, '15° 52\' 10.742600\"', 120.24268250, '120° 14\' 33.656840\"', 0.0200, '2', 65.6680, 0.0800, '1', 22.2337, 204702.15950, 1756461.03200, '51', 15.87125329, '15° 52\' 16.511850\"', 120.24135200, '120° 14\' 28.867030\"', 27.6899, 1755348.49000, 418747.70000, '3', 204557.87200, 1756533.18300, '51', 15.86969528, '15° 52\' 10.903010\"', 120.24267390, '120° 14\' 33.626060\"', 0.0211, 64.2550, 0.0737, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(496, 'PNG-3262', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'POLONG NORTE', 2008, 15.90623061, '15° 54\' 22.430196\"', 120.41874160, '120° 25\' 7.469760\"', 'PNG-3262 A 5-10 minutes travel SE (route going to Bayambang) on any kind of vehicle about 2-3 km in order to reach Brgy. Polong Norte. The station is located near Gomez bridge. It is about 22 m SE of welcome arch (Polong Norte) and 19 m NW of the upper NW side of the said bridge. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3262, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.90623391, '15° 54\' 22.442080\"', 120.41874370, '120° 25\' 7.477440\"', 0.0200, '2', 53.3750, 0.0800, '1', 11.0376, 223618.90920, 1760270.60700, '51', 15.90783490, '15° 54\' 28.205650\"', 120.41741430, '120° 25\' 2.691520\"', 15.0798, 1759335.91100, 437616.14100, '3', 223474.88900, 1760342.21500, '51', 15.90627849, '15° 54\' 22.602570\"', 120.41873530, '120° 25\' 7.446970\"', 0.0207, 51.9620, 0.0743, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(497, 'PNG-3769 (BLLM-1)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'POBLACION WEST', 2013, 15.98031738, '15° 58\' 49.142568\"', 120.69852760, '120° 41\' 54.699360\"', 'PNG-3769 (BLLM-1) Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay Poblacion West. From Tayug, Pangasinan travel South West Towards Pobalcion West, Sta Maria, Pangasinan, until reaching the plaza, then travel North West until reaching the market. BLLM No. 1 is located about 200m. NW of the east side of the plaza, about 170m. SE of the Welcome Arc of San Patricio and about 150 m. SE of BLLM No. 2. Mark is the head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. .25m. x 120 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"STA. MARIA PNG, BLLM NO.1, CAD-487-D, DENR LMS-R1, 2013\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.98032187, '15° 58\' 49.158740\"', 120.69853180, '120° 41\' 54.714570\"', 0.0200, '2', 87.3240, 0.0800, '1', 45.2392, 253681.62720, 1768121.18900, '51', 15.98192134, '15° 58\' 54.916830\"', 120.69720450, '120° 41\' 49.936280\"', 48.5738, 1767469.96000, 467588.60700, '3', 253538.08700, 1768191.95200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(498, 'PNG-3770 (BLLM-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'POBLACION WEST', 2013, 15.98081078, '15° 58\' 50.918808\"', 120.69721100, '120° 41\' 49.959600\"', 'PNG-3770 (BLLM-2) Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay Poblacion West. From Tayug, Pangasinan travel South West Towards Pobalcion West, Sta Maria, Pangasinan, until reaching the plaza, then travel North West until reaching the market. BLLM No. 2 is located about 150m. NW of BLLM No. 1 in front of the market, about 20m. East of the Welcome Arc of San Patricio.Mark is the head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. .25m. x 120 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"STA. MARIA PNG, BLLM NO.2, CAD-487-D, DENR LMS-R1, 2013\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.98081535, '15° 58\' 50.935270\"', 120.69721530, '120° 41\' 49.975140\"', 0.0200, '2', 86.8540, 0.0800, '1', 44.7764, 253541.26570, 1768177.37300, '51', 15.98241488, '15° 58\' 56.693580\"', 120.69588800, '120° 41\' 45.196890\"', 48.1084, 1767524.77500, 467447.76700, '3', 253397.72600, 1768248.14100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(499, 'PNG-3771 (BLLM-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'PATAQUID', 2013, 15.96048682, '15° 57\' 37.752552\"', 120.74010840, '120° 44\' 24.390240\"', 'PNG-3771 (BLLM-3) Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay Pataquid fromPoblacion West travel SE towards Sta. Cruz then travel NE towards Pataquid, until reaching the barangay hall of Pataquid. Bllm No.3 is located at the SE side of the Barangay Hall of Pataquid and about 110m. NW of BLLM No. 4.Mark is the head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. .25m. x 120 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"STA. MARIA PNG, BLLM NO.3, CAD-487-D, DENR LMS-R1, 2013\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.96049145, '15° 57\' 37.769230\"', 120.74011300, '120° 44\' 24.406960\"', 0.0200, '1', 92.5640, 0.0800, '1', 50.2254, 258110.08150, 1765877.38900, '51', 15.96208877, '15° 57\' 43.519570\"', 120.73878530, '120° 44\' 19.627210\"', 53.6532, 1765269.49900, 472036.71600, '3', 257966.50900, 1765948.00000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(500, 'PNG-3772 (BLLM-4)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'PATAQUID', 2013, 15.95970666, '15° 57\' 34.943976\"', 120.74089950, '120° 44\' 27.238200\"', 'PNG-3772 (BLLM-4) Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, Municipality of Sta. Maria Barangay Pataquid. From Poblacion West travel SE towards Sta. Cruz. then travel NE Towards Pataquid. until reaching the Barangay Hall of Pataquid. Then travel SE until reaching a bridge BLLM No. 4 is located West of the bridge about 110m. SE of BLLM No.3 and the Brgy. Hall of Pataquid.Mark is the head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. .25m. x 120 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"STA. MARIA PNG, BLLM NO.4, CAD-487-D, DENR LMS-R1, 2013\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.95971117, '15° 57\' 34.960200\"', 120.74090410, '120° 44\' 27.254580\"', 0.0200, '2', 94.5200, 0.0800, '1', 52.1778, 258193.84850, 1765790.10200, '51', 15.96130842, '15° 57\' 40.710300\"', 120.73957630, '120° 44\' 22.474770\"', 55.6049, 1765183.04900, 472121.28400, '3', 258050.27400, 1765860.71000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(501, 'PNG-3773 (BLLM-5)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'SANTA CRUZ', 2013, 15.94377259, '15° 56\' 37.581324\"', 120.72076630, '120° 43\' 14.758680\"', 'PNG-3773 (BLLM-5) Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay Sta. Cruz. From Poblacion West travel SE towards Sta. Cruz Elementary School. BLLM No. 5 is located beside the house of the barangay captain near Sta. Cruz Elementary School, about 100m. NE of BLLM No. 6.Mark is the head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. .25m. x 120 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"STA. MARIA PNG, BLLM NO.5, CAD-487-D, DENR LMS-R1, 2013\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.94377707, '15° 56\' 37.597460\"', 120.72077080, '120° 43\' 14.774810\"', 0.0200, '2', 85.3430, 0.0800, '1', 43.1913, 256018.59010, 1764049.86700, '51', 15.94537377, '15° 56\' 43.345570\"', 120.71944270, '120° 43\' 9.993550\"', 46.4287, 1763422.71600, 469963.56000, '3', 255874.94600, 1764120.52600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(502, 'PNG-3774 (BLLM-6)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'SANTA CRUZ', 2013, 15.94339929, '15° 56\' 36.237444\"', 120.71938700, '120° 43\' 9.793200\"', 'PNG-3774 ( BLLM-6) Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay Sta. Cruz from Poblacion West travel SE Towards Sta. Cruz. Elementary School BLLM No 6 is located between Sta. Cruz Elementary School and the waiting shade near Sta. Cruz Brangay Hall about 100m. SW of BLLM No. 5.Mark is the head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. .25m. x 120 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"STA. MARIA PNG, BLLM NO.6, CAD-487-D, DENR LMS-R1, 2013\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.94340374, '15° 56\' 36.253480\"', 120.71939130, '120° 43\' 9.808730\"', 0.0200, '2', 84.6540, 0.0800, '1', 42.5136, 255870.40560, 1764010.16000, '51', 15.94500045, '15° 56\' 42.001620\"', 120.71806320, '120° 43\' 5.027430\"', 45.7419, 1763381.60800, 469815.81600, '3', 255726.75900, 1764080.82300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(503, 'PNG-3775 (BLLM-7)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'PILAR', 2013, 15.95075218, '15° 57\' 2.707848\"', 120.66548810, '120° 39\' 55.757160\"', 'PNG-3775 (BLLM-7) Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay Pilar. From Tayug travel SE towards Zone 3 until reaching the waiting shade then travel NE until reaching a bridge. BLLM No. 7 is located at the west side of the bridge , about 300 m. NW of the waiting shade and 300 m. SE of BLLM No. 8. Mark is the head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. .25m. x 120 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"STA. MARIA PNG, BLLM NO.7, CAD-487-D, DENR LMS-R1, 2013\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.95075633, '15° 57\' 2.722800\"', 120.66549200, '120° 39\' 55.771370\"', 0.0200, '2', 81.1200, 0.0800, '1', 39.3144, 250107.13290, 1764887.93000, '51', 15.95235468, '15° 57\' 8.476850\"', 120.66416400, '120° 39\' 50.990420\"', 42.3607, 1764203.88600, 464046.62500, '3', 249963.46600, 1764958.77400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(504, 'PNG-3778 (BLLM-8)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'PILAR', 2013, 15.95384344, '15° 57\' 13.836384\"', 120.66461790, '120° 39\' 52.624440\"', 'PNG-3778 ( BLLM-8) Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay Pilar. From Tayug travel SE towards Zone 3 until reaching the waiting shade then travel NE until reaching the corn land. BLLM No. 8 is located about 600 m. NW of the waiting shed and 300 m. NW of BLLM No.7.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.95384756, '15° 57\' 13.851230\"', 120.66462180, '120° 39\' 52.638470\"', 0.0200, '2', 79.7600, 0.0800, '1', 37.9530, 250017.76990, 1765231.15000, '51', 15.95544613, '15° 57\' 19.606050\"', 120.66329380, '120° 39\' 47.857770\"', 41.0121, 1764546.09900, 463954.01800, '3', 249874.11300, 1765302.00000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(505, 'PNG-46', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'POBLACION WEST', 2007, 16.07472246, '16° 4\' 29.000856\"', 120.75510720, '120° 45\' 18.385920\"', 'PNG-46 From Urdaneta, travel towards Asingan then to Sta. Maria. Proceed to Tayug then travel NE until reaching San Nicolas town proper. From the town proper, travel towards San Felipe until reaching a long bridge of Ambayoan River. Station is located on top of the NE end of the long bridge at Brgy. Poblacion West. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 20 cm. x 20 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-46 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.07473053, '16° 4\' 29.029890\"', 120.75511130, '120° 45\' 18.400730\"', 0.0200, '1', 130.3050, 0.0900, '1', 87.2626, 259852.92210, 1778504.81100, '51', 16.07633464, '16° 4\' 34.804690\"', 120.75378630, '120° 45\' 13.630720\"', 91.7031, 1777908.63100, 473657.58400, '3', 259709.74500, 1778575.47000, '51', 16.07477518, '16° 4\' 29.190650\"', 120.75510300, '120° 45\' 18.370830\"', 0.0218, 128.9040, 0.0768, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(506, 'PNG-47', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN QUINTIN', 'LAGASIT', 2007, 16.00241486, '16° 0\' 8.693496\"', 120.78360690, '120° 47\' 0.984840\"', 'PNG-47 From Urdaneta, travel towards Asingan then to Tayug. Proceed ahead until reaching the San Quintin \"welcome sign\" arc. From the said arc, travel towards San Quintin proper for about 350 m., where the station is located. Station is located 3.3 m. E of the concrete \"Thank You\" sign and 1.5 m. S from the road edge. Mark is a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"PNG-47 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.00242281, '16° 0\' 8.722120\"', 120.78361160, '120° 47\' 1.001730\"', 0.0200, '2', 116.4490, 0.0800, '1', 73.5387, 262817.46510, 1770468.50200, '51', 16.00402179, '16° 0\' 14.478440\"', 120.78228490, '120° 46\' 56.225750\"', 77.5594, 1769903.93200, 476698.26500, '3', 262674.06900, 1770539.00700, '51', 16.00246745, '16° 0\' 8.882820\"', 120.78360330, '120° 47\' 0.971900\"', 0.0199, 115.0380, 0.0705, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(507, 'PNG-49', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'UMINGAN', 'GONZALES', 2007, 15.91355128, '15° 54\' 48.784608\"', 120.76545950, '120° 45\' 55.654200\"', 'PNG-49 From Umingan Town Hall, travel for about 9 km. S going to Capas, Tarlac until reaching Carayungan Bridge (Km. 192 + 144). Station is located on the NE end of the said bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embbedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-49 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.91355916, '15° 54\' 48.812970\"', 120.76546430, '120° 45\' 55.671610\"', 0.0200, '2', 103.9360, 0.0800, '1', 61.4975, 260769.11500, 1760653.36100, '51', 15.91515298, '15° 54\' 54.550730\"', 120.76413560, '120° 45\' 50.888030\"', 64.8224, 1760072.94900, 474744.62500, '3', 260625.40700, 1760723.84900, '51', 15.91360377, '15° 54\' 48.973560\"', 120.76545600, '120° 45\' 55.641770\"', 0.0196, 102.5150, 0.0701, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(508, 'PNG-50', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ASINGAN', 'POBLACION EAST', 2007, 16.00429940, '16° 0\' 15.477840\"', 120.66922540, '120° 40\' 9.211440\"', 'PNG-50 Is located at the center of Asingan Mun. Auditorium, about 30 m. N of the mun. hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-50 NAMRIA 2007.\"', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.00430701, '16° 0\' 15.505230\"', 120.66922990, '120° 40\' 9.227510\"', 0.0200, '2', 87.7760, 0.0800, '1', 45.8179, 250573.84100, 1770811.10200, '51', 16.00590862, '16° 0\' 21.271030\"', 120.66790310, '120° 40\' 4.451100\"', 49.1691, 1770128.90200, 464456.37600, '3', 250430.35700, 1770881.98000, '51', 16.00435164, '16° 0\' 15.665890\"', 120.66922150, '120° 40\' 9.197470\"', 0.0203, 86.3680, 0.0724, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(509, 'PNG-52', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SISON', 'ASAN SUR', 2007, 16.15914741, '16° 9\' 32.930676\"', 120.53643880, '120° 32\' 11.179680\"', 'PNG-52 From San Fabian, travel towards San Fernando, La Union until reaching the junction road going to Sison Mun. Hall. From there, travel along the nat\'l. highway until reaching the intersection road, which measures about 2.5 km. Then proceed towards the Northern Cement Corp. until reaching the third bridge (10 m. in length). Station is located 0.7 m. from the SW corner of the said bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 m. concrete monument protruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-52 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.15915463, '16° 9\' 32.956670\"', 120.53644260, '120° 32\' 11.193430\"', 0.0200, '1', 123.7540, 0.0800, '1', 81.8268, 236560.70600, 1788117.21400, '51', 16.16076878, '16° 9\' 38.767620\"', 120.53511930, '120° 32\' 6.429460\"', 85.9376, 1787291.58800, 450283.09900, '3', 236417.63400, 1788188.65300, '51', 16.15919929, '16° 9\' 33.117460\"', 120.53643420, '120° 32\' 11.163100\"', 0.0207, 122.3680, 0.0733, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(510, 'PNG-53', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'POZZORUBIO', 'AMAGBAGAN', 2007, 16.09528458, '16° 5\' 43.024488\"', 120.53324190, '120° 31\' 59.670840\"', 'PNG-53 Is located in Brgy. Amagbagan, Pozorrubio. It is situated along the farm-to-market road, which is between Amagbagan Brgy. Hall and Ama-Talo Elem. School. It is 50 m. N of the intersection of the provincial road and the farm-to-market road, 0.4 m. W of the road and 0.5 m. N of the irrigation canal. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embbedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"PNG-53 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.09529191, '16° 5\' 43.050890\"', 120.53324590, '120° 31\' 59.685320\"', 0.0200, '2', 82.9600, 0.0800, '1', 41.3105, 236134.08920, 1781051.51300, '51', 16.09690218, '16° 5\' 48.847830\"', 120.53192110, '120° 31\' 54.915920\"', 44.9577, 1780225.42600, 449925.02100, '3', 235990.79900, 1781122.91000, '51', 16.09533656, '16° 5\' 43.211610\"', 120.53323750, '120° 31\' 59.655000\"', 0.0206, 80.5670, 0.0730, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(511, 'PNG-54', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'ANONAS', 2007, 16.00363318, '16° 0\' 13.079448\"', 120.57619470, '120° 34\' 34.300920\"', 'PNG-54 Is located inside the new Urdaneta City Hall Complex in Brgy. Anonas. It is 2.5 m. SE of the flagpole and about 20 m. S of the fountain. mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"PNG-54 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.00364040, '16° 0\' 13.105440\"', 120.57619920, '120° 34\' 34.316940\"', 0.0200, '2', 74.1900, 0.0800, '1', 32.6211, 240612.37250, 1770851.32100, '51', 16.00524401, '16° 0\' 18.878440\"', 120.57487220, '120° 34\' 29.540010\"', 35.8065, 1770073.50600, 454499.19200, '3', 240468.80900, 1770922.50000, '51', 16.00368502, '16° 0\' 13.266080\"', 120.57619080, '120° 34\' 34.286730\"', 0.0196, 72.7840, 0.0701, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(512, 'PNG-55', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'ESMERALDA', 2007, 15.86449527, '15° 51\' 52.182972\"', 120.71438370, '120° 42\' 51.781320\"', 'PNG-55 From Urdaneta town proper, travel towards Balungao. From Balungao town proper, travel E for about 4 km. until reaching the intersection then turn right and continue traveling for about 4.8 km. towards Brgy. Esmeralda. Station is located on top of the bridge sidewalk, at the NW edge. Mark is a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-55 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.86450288, '15° 51\' 52.210350\"', 120.71438860, '120° 42\' 51.799100\"', 0.0200, '2', 101.3420, 0.0800, '1', 59.3621, 255239.12840, 1755282.58600, '51', 15.86609475, '15° 51\' 57.941090\"', 120.71305860, '120° 42\' 47.011120\"', 62.2048, 1754651.64100, 469268.04400, '3', 255095.21400, 1755353.19700, '51', 15.86454747, '15° 51\' 52.370880\"', 120.71438030, '120° 42\' 51.769190\"', 0.0196, 99.9160, 0.0692, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(513, 'PNG-56', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTO TOMAS', 'SALVACION', 2007, 15.87803539, '15° 52\' 40.927404\"', 120.58321830, '120° 34\' 59.585880\"', 'PNG-56 From Urdaneta, travel S until reaching Villasis then pass the Carmen Bridge. Then turn right until reaching Sto. Tomas Mun. Hall, about 2 km. from the intersection of Brgy. Carmen. Station is located in the town plaza fronting the mun. hall. It is situated 8.6 m. from the NE column of the waiting shed and 8.2 m. from the S entrance road. Mark is a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 m. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"PNG-56 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.87804248, '15° 52\' 40.952940\"', 120.58322330, '120° 34\' 59.603730\"', 0.0200, '2', 68.3170, 0.0800, '1', 26.7238, 241203.28760, 1756939.12000, '51', 15.87963809, '15° 52\' 46.697140\"', 120.58189340, '120° 34\' 54.816220\"', 29.5384, 1756173.81900, 455222.81100, '3', 241059.30900, 1757010.17000, '51', 15.87808707, '15° 52\' 41.113450\"', 120.58321490, '120° 34\' 59.573580\"', 0.0192, 66.8970, 0.0695, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(514, 'PNG-60', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN JACINTO', 'LOBONG', 2007, 16.07751237, '16° 4\' 39.044532\"', 120.45495240, '120° 27\' 17.828640\"', 'PNG-60 From San Jacinto Mun. Hall, travel along the provincial road going to Brgy. Lobong for about 2 km. until reaching the welcome sign of the said brgy. Station is located on the NW end of Gonogong Bridge, about 10 m. NW of the welcome sign and about 4 m. NE from the centerline of the road. It is also situated on the concrete sidewalk of the said bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-60 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.07751930, '16° 4\' 39.069490\"', 120.45495640, '120° 27\' 17.843030\"', 0.0200, '2', 55.8560, 0.0800, '1', 14.2369, 227730.69210, 1779185.60200, '51', 16.07913018, '16° 4\' 44.868650\"', 120.45363100, '120° 27\' 13.071730\"', 17.9894, 1778279.47500, 441544.17000, '3', 227587.27800, 1779257.23800, '51', 16.07756394, '16° 4\' 39.230170\"', 120.45494790, '120° 27\' 17.812570\"', 0.0206, 54.4630, 0.0725, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(515, 'PNG-62', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BASISTA', 'PALMA', 2007, 15.86460515, '15° 51\' 52.578540\"', 120.39622940, '120° 23\' 46.425840\"', 'PNG-62 From Basista Mun. Hall, travel 300 m. N until reaching Palma Bridge. Station is located at the SW end of the said bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-62 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.86461163, '15° 51\' 52.601880\"', 120.39623410, '120° 23\' 46.442830\"', 0.0200, '2', 55.9280, 0.0800, '1', 13.2421, 221149.98060, 1755692.48600, '51', 15.86621052, '15° 51\' 58.357860\"', 120.39490370, '120° 23\' 41.653290\"', 17.5624, 1754736.97300, 435192.29100, '3', 221005.80200, 1755764.13100, '51', 15.86465620, '15° 51\' 52.762330\"', 120.39622560, '120° 23\' 46.412320\"', 0.0208, 54.5110, 0.0743, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(516, 'PNG-64', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'BARACBAC', 2007, 15.72448184, '15° 43\' 28.134624\"', 120.34261840, '120° 20\' 33.426240\"', 'PNG-64 From Mangatarem town proper, travel towards San Clemente until reaching Baracbac Bridge, which is about 200 m. from the Andangin Cemetery. Station is located at the top of the concrete shoulder/approach of the bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embbedded in a cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-64 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.72448801, '15° 43\' 28.156850\"', 120.34262360, '120° 20\' 33.445130\"', 0.0200, '2', 64.5620, 0.0800, '1', 20.7249, 215209.09350, 1740250.93500, '51', 15.72607930, '15° 43\' 33.885470\"', 120.34128990, '120° 20\' 28.643510\"', 25.9074, 1739248.60300, 429401.34600, '3', 215064.39900, 1740322.63400, '51', 15.72453254, '15° 43\' 28.317130\"', 120.34261520, '120° 20\' 33.414570\"', 0.0202, 63.1290, 0.0726, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(517, 'PNG-65', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'CAOAYAN-KILING', 2008, 15.85553565, '15° 51\' 19.928340\"', 120.32320840, '120° 19\' 23.550240\"', 'PNG-65 From San Carlos Mun. Hall, travel along the nat\'l. highway going to Urbiztondo until reaching the Caoayn-Kiling Plaza. Station is located inside the public plaza, situated along the E corner of the concrete pavement about 2.5 m. NW of the SE wall and approx. 8 m. NNE of the second gate. It is beside the concrete bench nearest to the said gate. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-65 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.85552581, '15° 51\' 19.892910\"', 120.32320160, '120° 19\' 23.525600\"', 0.0200, '2', 51.8050, 0.0800, '1', 8.6158, 213310.90600, 1754785.19400, '51', 15.85712573, '15° 51\' 25.652620\"', 120.32187080, '120° 19\' 18.734950\"', 13.5893, 1753755.67000, 427366.69400, '3', 213166.63600, 1754857.07000, '51', 15.85557037, '15° 51\' 20.053330\"', 120.32319300, '120° 19\' 23.494960\"', 0.0200, 50.3890, 0.0720, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(518, 'PNG-66', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'CALOMBOYAN', 2007, 15.94486786, '15° 56\' 41.524296\"', 120.30050300, '120° 18\' 1.810800\"', 'PNG-66 From San Carlos Mun. Hall, travel along the highway going to Binmaley. Then turn left to the brgy. road going to Brgy. Pangalangan. Station is located inside the compound of Calomboyan Elem. School. It is situated along and beside the SE side of the concrete base of the flagpole, which is about 20 m. NW of the gate. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. ìabove ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-66 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.94487425, '15° 56\' 41.547290\"', 120.30050750, '120° 18\' 1.826880\"', 0.0200, '2', 47.5390, 0.0800, '1', 4.6775, 211006.58760, 1764708.92000, '51', 15.94648025, '15° 56\' 47.328890\"', 120.29917880, '120° 17\' 57.043670\"', 9.6466, 1763651.01600, 424969.22400, '3', 210862.60000, 1764780.94700, '51', 15.94491883, '15° 56\' 41.707790\"', 120.30049890, '120° 18\' 1.796180\"', 0.0209, 46.1340, 0.0742, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(519, 'PNG-67', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'LIBSONG WEST', 2007, 16.03316033, '16° 1\' 59.377188\"', 120.23679930, '120° 14\' 12.477480\"', 'PNG-67 Is located in Brgy. Libsong West, Lingayaen, inside the compound of the Air Transportation Office (ATO) - Lingayen Airport. It is ìsituated 15 m. N of the flagpole, 5 m. E of the bounding wire ìfence and about 150 m. SW of the runway. Mark is the head of a 4 ìin. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 ìcm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-67 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.03316703, '16° 1\' 59.401290\"', 120.23680360, '120° 14\' 12.492920\"', 0.0200, '1', 46.2760, 0.0800, '1', 3.6516, 204312.28990, 1774574.50900, '51', 16.03477992, '16° 2\' 5.207720\"', 120.23547690, '120° 14\' 7.716860\"', 8.8039, 1773445.80900, 418184.80800, '3', 204168.54800, 1774646.81900, '51', 16.03321163, '16° 1\' 59.561860\"', 120.23679500, '120° 14\' 12.462080\"', 0.0205, 44.8830, 0.0724, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(520, 'PNG-68', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'POLONG', 2007, 15.97742866, '15° 58\' 38.743176\"', 120.20329890, '120° 12\' 11.876040\"', 'PNG-68 From Bugallon Mun. Hall, travel N along the nat\'l. road until reaching the Alaminos-Lingayen Crossing. Then turn left to the road going to Alaminos until reaching Polong Elem. School. Station is located inside the said school compound, approx. 20 m. NE from the flagpole, about 5 m. W from the third pillar (starting from the N end of the gate) of the wall, about 6 m. N from the plant box and approx. 0.2 m. SE from the SE corner of the court. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"PNG-68 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.97743500, '15° 58\' 38.766000\"', 120.20330330, '120° 12\' 11.891710\"', 0.0200, '2', 47.2160, 0.0800, '1', 4.2345, 200641.90690, 1768451.57600, '51', 15.97904516, '15° 58\' 44.562580\"', 120.20197520, '120° 12\' 7.110800\"', 9.6572, 1767291.91400, 414575.75400, '3', 200497.95000, 1768523.94800, '51', 15.97747959, '15° 58\' 38.926510\"', 120.20329470, '120° 12\' 11.860810\"', 0.0215, 45.8170, 0.0751, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(521, 'PNG-70', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'POBLACION', 2007, 16.06562598, '16° 3\' 56.253528\"', 120.09547870, '120° 5\' 43.723320\"', 'PNG-70 IS LOCATED ON THE ROOFTOP OF SUAL MUN. HALL, AT THE CENTER OF THE S WING OF THE SAID ROOFTOP. MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4 IN. COPPER NAIL CENTERED AND EMBEDDED IN A 30 CM. X 30 CM. CEMENT PUTTY, WITH INSCRIPTIONS \"PNG-70 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.06563212, '16° 3\' 56.275640\"', 120.09548250, '120° 5\' 43.736880\"', 0.0200, '2', 55.4130, 0.0800, '1', 12.9387, 189229.25990, 1778376.47600, '51', 16.06725013, '16° 4\' 2.100470\"', 120.09415640, '120° 5\' 38.962940\"', 18.3814, 1777099.84200, 403076.15400, '3', 189085.51400, 1778449.27400, '51', 16.06567673, '16° 3\' 56.436210\"', 120.09547380, '120° 5\' 43.705760\"', 0.0224, 54.0280, 0.0752, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(522, 'PNG-71', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'PAITAN EAST', 2007, 16.08411329, '16° 5\' 2.807844\"', 120.02724570, '120° 1\' 38.084520\"', 'PNG-71 Is located on the E approach of the old bridge connecting Brgys. Paitan East and Paitan West. It is about 10 m. N of the centerline of the new bridge and 1 m. E of the edge of the approach. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 20 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-71 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.08411929, '16° 5\' 2.829450\"', 120.02724940, '120° 1\' 38.097760\"', 0.0200, '2', 74.9030, 0.0800, '1', 32.8604, 181952.53410, 1780527.57900, '51', 16.08573994, '16° 5\' 8.663770\"', 120.02592360, '120° 1\' 33.325090\"', 38.0926, 1779179.10600, 395784.41300, '3', 181808.79600, 1780600.61600, '51', 16.08416389, '16° 5\' 2.990020\"', 120.02724070, '120° 1\' 38.066520\"', 0.0215, 73.5220, 0.0751, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(523, 'PNG-72', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'TORITORI', 2007, 16.23398537, '16° 14\' 2.347332\"', 119.99593380, '119° 59\' 45.361680\"', 'PNG-72 From Alaminos proper, travel N for about 29 km. then turn right and travel for about 6 km. up to Anda proper. Then travel for about 12 km. to Brgy. Toritori. Station is located along the N side of the concrete brgy. road going to Sitio Mangasen. It is about 120 m. SE of the brgy. plaza, about 65 m. E of the Kingdom Hall of Jehova\'s Witnesses, about 55 m. E of a waiting shed, about 30 m. SW of an unfinished concrete house and 0.9 m. N of the N side of the road. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 20 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-72 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 14 2.35458 E 119 59 45.37526 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 55.565 m.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.23399166, '16° 14\' 2.369980\"', 119.99593710, '119° 59\' 45.373380\"', 0.0300, '2', 54.6530, 0.0900, '1', 13.8810, 820288.28950, 1797161.02700, '50', 16.23562228, '16° 14\' 8.240200\"', 119.99461480, '119° 59\' 40.613190\"', 18.3725, 1795781.60000, 392515.43300, '3', 820148.59700, 1797230.14500, '50', 16.23403630, '16° 14\' 2.530690\"', 119.99592830, '119° 59\' 45.342030\"', 0.0234, 53.2910, 0.0785, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(524, 'PNG-73', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'POBLACION', 2007, 16.28609418, '16° 17\' 9.939048\"', 119.95371180, '119° 57\' 13.362480\"', 'PNG-73 From Alaminos proper, travel N for about 35 km. to Anda proper. Station is located about 300 m. SE of the mun. hall. It is situated inside the nursery compound, about 10 m. SW of the W corner of the Material Recovery Facility (MRF) Bldg. of Anda. It is also on the SSW side of the pit. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 20 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-73 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 17 9.94540 E 119 57 13.37692 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 67.745 m.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.28610032, '16° 17\' 9.961150\"', 119.95371470, '119° 57\' 13.372960\"', 0.0300, '1', 66.8390, 0.0900, '1', 26.6989, 815687.61110, 1802866.01600, '50', 16.28773507, '16° 17\' 15.846260\"', 119.95239360, '119° 57\' 8.616980\"', 30.8192, 1801571.30100, 388030.72900, '3', 815548.05000, 1802935.29300, '50', 16.28614498, '16° 17\' 10.121910\"', 119.95370600, '119° 57\' 13.341510\"', 0.0235, 65.4840, 0.0792, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(525, 'PNG-76', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'CATABLAN', 2007, 15.96598686, '15° 57\' 57.552696\"', 120.48871880, '120° 29\' 19.387680\"', 'PNG-76 From Urdaneta City, travel 30 km. W to Pauling then go 250 m. S until reaching the boundary of Brgys. Catablan (Sitio Nambacuran) and Lunec. Station is located NE of the arc of Brgy. Lunec, 12 m. E of the road and at the SW corner of Mr. Ferdinand Frianeza\'s residence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"PNG-76 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.96599381, '15° 57\' 57.577710\"', 120.48872340, '120° 29\' 19.404140\"', 0.0200, '2', 64.8180, 0.0800, '1', 23.0950, 231195.62060, 1766794.93400, '51', 15.96759699, '15° 58\' 3.349170\"', 120.48739540, '120° 29\' 14.623600\"', 26.5329, 1765928.96400, 445126.22000, '3', 231051.85900, 1766866.36500, '51', 15.96603841, '15° 57\' 57.738290\"', 120.48871490, '120° 29\' 19.373780\"', 0.0207, 63.4110, 0.0755, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(526, 'PNG-78', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'EGUIA', 2007, 15.90766103, '15° 54\' 27.579708\"', 119.88328430, '119° 52\' 59.823480\"', 'PNG-78 From dasol Mun. Hall, travel for 15 mins. along the nat\'l. highway going to Infanta until reaching Eguia Elem. School. Station is located inside the school compound. It is situated at the backyard of the said school about 30 m. S of the water tank, approx. 6 m. NE of the small rectangular concrete plant box. It is also about 80 m. W of the E wall, along the imaginary line connecting the cellular network antenna and the plant box. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-78 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 54 27.59247 E 119 52 59.83858 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 46.102 m.', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 15.90766649, '15° 54\' 27.599370\"', 119.88328820, '119° 52\' 59.837410\"', 0.0200, '2', 45.4900, 0.0800, '1', 4.4188, 808740.29180, 1760852.51000, '50', 15.90927933, '15° 54\' 33.405590\"', 119.88195810, '119° 52\' 55.049230\"', 8.4974, 1759729.02800, 380275.07600, '3', 808599.52800, 1760921.73800, '50', 15.90771103, '15° 54\' 27.759710\"', 119.88327940, '119° 52\' 59.805950\"', 0.0206, 44.0920, 0.0728, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(527, 'PNG-80', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'DON MATIAS', 2007, 16.06435996, '16° 3\' 51.695856\"', 119.86729650, '119° 52\' 2.267400\"', 'PNG-80 Is located on the open ground W of the academics compound of Burgos Nat\'l. High School. It is situated 15 m. S of a Mango tree, which is 125 m. W of BBM No. 14. The boundary marker is about 150 m. N of the cemented brgy. road of Don Matias bounding the E side of the said school. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-80 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.06436545, '16° 3\' 51.715630\"', 119.86730000, '119° 52\' 2.280070\"', 0.0200, '2', 123.7370, 0.0800, '1', 83.0961, 806787.71930, 1778180.61900, '50', 16.06598836, '16° 3\' 57.558100\"', 119.86597360, '119° 51\' 57.505100\"', 87.2546, 1777080.52000, 378657.74900, '3', 806647.42600, 1778250.00000, '50', 16.06441004, '16° 3\' 51.876140\"', 119.86729130, '119° 52\' 2.248530\"', 0.0213, 122.3580, 0.0742, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(528, 'PNG-89', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'SAN FELIPE WEST', 2007, 16.11868199, '16° 7\' 7.255164\"', 120.69925680, '120° 41\' 57.324480\"', 'PNG-89 To locate the station, cross the bridge for about 1 km. N of San Roque Power Corp. office and choose the dirt road that leads to the \"Spillway Power Intake\". On the second Y-intersection, choose the road that forks to the right, which leads all the way up to Sitio Moging. About 150 m. before reaching Cristobal Rodrigo Elem. School of Sitio Pakulang, turn right on a trail entering a deadend. A small trail that branches to the left leads to the ricefield. Follow the trail for about 50 m. Station is located on a ricefield dike maintained by a certain Mr. Ludivico Pacetes of Sitio Moging, Brgy. San Felipe West. It is situated 5 m. off the trail. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-89 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016, 'Reobs 2016', 2016.33, 16.11868974, '16° 7\' 7.283080\"', 120.69926100, '120° 41\' 57.339500\"', 0.0200, '2', 180.3990, 0.0800, '1', 137.5569, 253929.82860, 1783436.40800, '51', 16.12029781, '16° 7\' 13.072100\"', 120.69793690, '120° 41\' 52.572960\"', 142.0657, 1782781.04500, 467689.32500, '3', 253786.75400, 1783507.28400, '51', 16.11873441, '16° 7\' 7.443870\"', 120.69925260, '120° 41\' 57.309480\"', 0.0199, 179.0050, 0.0712, '2017-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `hgcp_stations_new` (`id`, `station_name`, `island_group`, `region`, `province`, `city_or_municipality`, `barangay`, `year_established`, `latitude`, `latitude_dms`, `longitude`, `longitude_dms`, `description`, `year_surveyed`, `project`, `epoch`, `latitude_wgs84`, `latitude_wgs84_dms`, `longitude_wgs84`, `longitude_wgs84_dms`, `error_ellipse`, `accuracy_class`, `ellipsoidal_ht_wgs84`, `height_error`, `order_of_accuracy_wgs84`, `egm2008_elevation`, `utm_x_wgs84`, `utm_y_wgs84`, `utm_zone_wgs84`, `latitude_prs92`, `latitude_prs92_dms`, `longitude_prs92`, `longitude_prs92_dms`, `ellipsoidal_ht_prs92`, `northing_ptm`, `easting_ptm`, `ptm_zone`, `utm_x_prs92`, `utm_y_prs92`, `utm_zone_prs92`, `latitude_itrf`, `latitude_itrf_dms`, `longitude_itrf`, `longitude_itrf_dms`, `error_ellipse_itrf`, `ellipsoidal_ht_itrf`, `height_error_itrf`, `year_computed`, `encoder`, `date_updated`, `reference_file`) VALUES
(529, 'ILN-1', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PASUQUIN', 'CARUAN', 1991, 18.39475961, '18° 23\' 41.134596\"', 120.59695140, '120° 35\' 49.025040\"', 'ILN-1 Is on an open ground NE of Pasuquin town. Travel time from Pasuquin town proper is approx. 5 min. It is approx. 200 m. N 45° W of Caraun concrete bridge; 75 m. W of the national highway and NW of the 2 aroma trees; about 8.2 km. N of Pasuquin Municipal Hall. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in standard concrete block, 0.7 m. deep, flushed with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. Sub-surface mark is a bottle set in concrete block, 0.806 m. below station mark. Reference marks is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in concrete blocks, 0.6 m. deep, flushed with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.39477589, '18° 23\' 41.193200\"', 120.59695500, '120° 35\' 49.038100\"', 0.0100, '1', 42.0160, 0.0100, '2', 6.1354, 246119.41330, 2035543.66400, '51', 18.39652373, '18° 23\' 47.485440\"', 120.59568370, '120° 35\' 44.461310\"', 11.1379, 2034693.68300, 457278.83900, '3', 245983.89200, 2035616.64900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(530, 'ILN-16', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BACARRA', 'SAN ANDRES II', 2004, 18.25107106, '18° 15\' 3.855816\"', 120.60796060, '120° 36\' 28.658160\"', 'ILN-16 From the Bacarra Municipal Hall Bldg., proceed to Bacarra Central Elem. School about 50 m. SW. Station is situated near the SW corner of the boundary lot of the school. It is 4 m. and 4.75 m. perpendicular distance from its W and S wall fence, respectively. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail ceneterd and embedded on top of a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument set 5 cm. protruding above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILN-16, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.25108716, '18° 15\' 3.913790\"', 120.60796470, '120° 36\' 28.672940\"', 0.0100, '1', 51.8550, 0.0100, '2', 15.3700, 247074.20430, 2019619.39600, '51', 18.25282634, '18° 15\' 10.174840\"', 120.60669010, '120° 36\' 24.084280\"', 20.4777, 2018787.44300, 458407.49300, '3', 246938.20800, 2019692.24300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(531, 'ILN-18', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'VINTAR', 'TAMDAGAN', 2004, 18.32367489, '18° 19\' 25.229604\"', 120.73339170, '120° 44\' 0.210120\"', 'ILN-18 From Vintar proper, travel N for about 18 km. or 1 hr. up to Brgy. Tamdagan. Station is located on the NE corner of the basketball court (known as the sports complex) E of the barangay community. It is about 10 m. N of the NW corner of the stage and the flagpole. Mark is a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 10 cm. x 10 cm. cement putty and flushed with the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILN-18, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.32369173, '18° 19\' 25.290240\"', 120.73339640, '120° 44\' 0.227130\"', 0.0100, '1', 130.9860, 0.0100, '2', 93.9588, 260442.51950, 2027488.37600, '51', 18.32543252, '18° 19\' 31.557070\"', 120.73212370, '120° 43\' 55.645210\"', 99.5472, 2026799.03500, 471683.97600, '3', 260306.85400, 2027560.87100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(532, 'ILN-3400', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BURGOS', 'ABLAN SARAT', 2009, 18.51221488, '18° 30\' 43.973568\"', 120.64004290, '120° 38\' 24.154440\"', 'ILN-19 From Laoag City, travel for about 48 km. or 1 hr. up to the catholic cemetery of Burgos near Km. Post 535 and about a kilometer before reaching the town proper. A municipal road on the NE side, few meters after Km. Post 535, leads to the station. It is located infront of the catholic cemetery altar, about 120 m. NE of the national highway, about 150 m. N of Iglesia ni Cristo (INC). Station is located on the intersection of the dike of a rice paddy owned by Astrophel I. Caliva. It is about 30 m. E of the second concrete electric post from the national highway, about 22 m. SE of the altar and about 16 m. SE of the municipal road centerline. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete block and 4 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILN-19, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.52452854, '18° 31\' 28.302730\"', 120.61121400, '120° 36\' 40.370500\"', 0.0100, '1', 44.7420, 0.0100, '2', 9.9328, 247816.33810, 2049889.82900, '51', 18.52628366, '18° 31\' 34.621190\"', 120.60994570, '120° 36\' 35.804550\"', 14.2587, 2049051.74900, 458816.78100, '3', 247681.26200, 2049962.86000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(533, 'ILN-21', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'DUMALNEG', 'CABARITAN', 2004, 18.52543072, '18° 31\' 31.550592\"', 120.80670320, '120° 48\' 24.131520\"', 'ILN-21 From Laoag City, travel for about 65 km. to the town of Bangui, then travel for about 3 km. to Brgy. Lanao and then travel again for about 3 km. up to Dumalneg proper. Station is located in So. Cristalina Sanjera Sta. Maria, on the SW corner of a lot owned by Ms. Erlinda Aguinaldo. It is about 150 m. N of the provincial road and the welcome marker of Cristalina, about 20 m. E of the house of Mr. Rafael Aguinaldo and 2 m. E of the dirt road. Mark is a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete block and 4 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILN-21, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.52544838, '18° 31\' 31.614150\"', 120.80670740, '120° 48\' 24.146540\"', 0.0100, '1', 75.0630, 0.0100, '2', 38.8822, 268464.23430, 2049729.22300, '51', 18.52719945, '18° 31\' 37.918020\"', 120.80543940, '120° 48\' 19.581700\"', 44.1155, 2049119.64500, 479457.85100, '3', 268329.29200, 2049801.62900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(534, 'ILN-3004', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'SOLSONA', 'LAURETA', 2007, 18.09253683, '18° 5\' 33.132588\"', 120.77247440, '120° 46\' 20.907840\"', 'ILN-3004 Station is located at the park of the Solsona Municipal Hall, about 2m W of the fountain and about 15m S of the Rizal monument.Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILN 3004 2007,NAMRIA\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.09255300, '18° 5\' 33.190810\"', 120.77247990, '120° 46\' 20.927810\"', 0.0100, '1', 88.4740, 0.0100, '2', 50.0773, 264263.94620, 2001848.89000, '51', 18.09427936, '18° 5\' 39.405680\"', 120.77120190, '120° 46\' 16.326840\"', 56.1836, 2001211.19800, 475782.85900, '3', 264127.53200, 2001921.09300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(535, 'ILN-3006', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'SARRAT', 'SAN FELIPE', 2007, 18.11509730, '18° 6\' 54.350280\"', 120.63972330, '120° 38\' 23.003880\"', 'ILN-3006 Station is located inside Ruiz Elementary School. It is on a plant box, about 15m SW of the stage at the back of the school.Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILN 3006 2007,NAMRIA\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.11511309, '18° 6\' 54.407130\"', 120.63972820, '120° 38\' 23.021350\"', 0.0100, '1', 75.7910, 0.0100, '2', 38.6565, 250240.67980, 2004521.44700, '51', 18.11684359, '18° 7\' 0.636910\"', 120.63845040, '120° 38\' 18.421570\"', 43.8924, 2003730.90800, 461736.55000, '3', 250104.24900, 2004594.09300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(536, 'ILN-3009', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAOAY', 'SAN ROQUE', 2007, 18.07514079, '18° 4\' 30.506844\"', 120.51159450, '120° 30\' 41.740200\"', 'ILN-3009 From Vigan, along the National Highway, travel N to reach Paoay toen proper. Continue traveling going to Laoag City to reach Brgy San Roque, past Brgy brgy Laoa. Station is located E of the marker. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILN 3009 2007,NAMRIA\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.20605453, '18° 12\' 21.796310\"', 120.69065860, '120° 41\' 26.370930\"', 0.0100, '1', 97.5230, 0.0100, '2', 60.3202, 255758.98690, 2014521.30100, '51', 18.20778931, '18° 12\' 28.041500\"', 120.68938310, '120° 41\' 21.778990\"', 65.8000, 2013786.23500, 467143.89700, '3', 255622.89700, 2014593.84800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(537, 'ILN-3012', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BACARRA', 'MACUPIT', 2007, 18.29368453, '18° 17\' 37.264308\"', 120.64142690, '120° 38\' 29.136840\"', 'ILN-3012 Station is located inside Macupit Elementary School, about 0.5m of te E side of the basketball court and about 3m SE of the grotto. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILN 3012 2007,NAMRIA\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.29370082, '18° 17\' 37.322940\"', 120.64143110, '120° 38\' 29.152040\"', 0.0100, '1', 71.8700, 0.0100, '2', 35.3057, 250675.38840, 2024291.37900, '51', 18.29544179, '18° 17\' 43.590450\"', 120.64015750, '120° 38\' 24.567110\"', 40.5526, 2023496.57500, 461956.00300, '3', 250539.55800, 2024364.14900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(538, 'ILN-3014', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PASUQUIN', 'SAPAT', 2007, 18.39279709, '18° 23\' 34.069524\"', 120.65556680, '120° 39\' 20.040480\"', 'ILN-3014 From Pasuquin town proper, travel N along the Nat\'l highway for about 10 km. After km post 506, turn right leading to Sapat Radar Station and travel for about 12 km. Station is located N of the welcome marker. Mark is the head with a copper nail centered and embedded on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete monument with inscriptions ILNG-3014, 2007, NAMRIA.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.39281366, '18° 23\' 34.129180\"', 120.65557090, '120° 39\' 20.055160\"', 0.0100, '1', 568.2480, 0.0100, '2', 531.9077, 252312.16620, 2035245.37000, '51', 18.39456002, '18° 23\' 40.416070\"', 120.65429970, '120° 39\' 15.478910\"', 537.2237, 2034463.55500, 463472.01700, '3', 252176.68900, 2035318.15000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(539, 'ILN-3015', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PASUQUIN', 'DAVILA', 2007, 18.46731758, '18° 28\' 2.343288\"', 120.57785370, '120° 34\' 40.273320\"', 'ILN-3015 From Pasuquin town proper, along the national road, travel N for about 16 kms to reach brgy Davila. Station is located inside the brgy plaza, at its W center edge and on the NE corner of the path way leading to the Day Care Center, about 20m N of the brgy hall and about 8m of commercial building. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILN 3015 2007,NAMRIA\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.46733415, '18° 28\' 2.402940\"', 120.57785710, '120° 34\' 40.285700\"', 0.0100, '1', 43.3910, 0.0100, '2', 8.2292, 244208.20510, 2043604.20900, '51', 18.46908664, '18° 28\' 8.711900\"', 120.57658750, '120° 34\' 35.714840\"', 12.7982, 2042729.28700, 455279.81500, '3', 244072.91400, 2043677.30700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(540, 'ILN-3017', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BANGUI', 'BARUYEN', 2007, 18.51640798, '18° 30\' 59.068728\"', 120.70761400, '120° 42\' 27.410400\"', 'ILN-3017 From Bangui town proper, along the national road, travel NW for about NW for about 8km to reach Brgy. Baruyen. Station is located inside the Baruyen Brgy. Hall compound, at the SE center side of the basketball court, about 17m E of the Brgy. Hall, 16m NE of the stage and about 20m S of the national road. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILN 3017, 2007, NAMRIA.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.51642525, '18° 30\' 59.130910\"', 120.70761800, '120° 42\' 27.424890\"', 0.0100, '1', 43.2810, 0.0100, '2', 7.6793, 257986.73770, 2048860.46500, '51', 18.51817789, '18° 31\' 5.440390\"', 120.70634970, '120° 42\' 22.858760\"', 12.5404, 2048135.33600, 468994.05100, '3', 257851.69800, 2048933.18200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(541, 'ILN-3360', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAGUDPUD', 'AGGASI', 2007, 18.60230480, '18° 36\' 8.297280\"', 120.85359670, '120° 51\' 12.948120\"', 'ILN-3019 From Pagudpud town proper, travel along the national road to reach Brgy. Balaoi, which is in between KM Post 569 and KM Post 570. Station is located inside Balaoi Primary School, at the N center side of the basketball court, and about 8m SE of the school building. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILN 3019, 2007, NAMRIA.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.55025661, '18° 33\' 0.923790\"', 120.81127010, '120° 48\' 40.572520\"', 0.0100, '1', 58.8920, 0.0100, '2', 22.9809, 268979.46610, 2052469.81600, '51', 18.55200904, '18° 33\' 7.232540\"', 120.81000270, '120° 48\' 36.009750\"', 28.0159, 2051864.95100, 479942.55600, '3', 268844.60900, 2052542.22500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
