(559, 'ILN-3240', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PINILI', 'AGLIPAY', 2007, 17.94986368, '17° 56\' 59.509248\"', 120.53347860, '120° 32\' 0.522960\"', 'ILN-3240 From Pinili Town Proper, travel E along the prov\'l. road for about 2 km. to reach Brgy. Aglipay. Station is located at the W edge of the concrete foundation of the sixth lightpost along the prov\'l. road, approx. 100 m. N of Aglipay Shrine compound. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 2 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILN-3240 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 17.94987867, '17° 56\' 59.563220\"', 120.53348400, '120° 32\' 0.542490\"', 0.0100, '1', 74.4930, 0.0100, '2', 37.5587, 238748.66600, 1986374.10000, '51', 17.95160164, '17° 57\' 5.765910\"', 120.53220230, '120° 31\' 55.928430\"', 42.3109, 1985468.49900, 450445.71400, '3', 238611.60700, 1986446.96700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(560, 'ILN-3254', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PINILI', 'PUGAOAN', 2007, 17.92769273, '17° 55\' 39.693828\"', 120.53498390, '120° 32\' 5.942040\"', 'ILN-3254 Is located at about 4 km. from Pinili Town Proper, situated 50 m. S the Pugaoan Brgy. Welcome Arch, top of a concrete boulder, 5 m. E of the brgy. road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 2 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILN-3254 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 17.92770621, '17° 55\' 39.742350\"', 120.53498990, '120° 32\' 5.963530\"', 0.0100, '1', 85.7030, 0.0100, '2', 48.6979, 238875.69370, 1983917.06900, '51', 17.92942783, '17° 55\' 45.940180\"', 120.53370770, '120° 32\' 1.347640\"', 53.4454, 1983014.09400, 450599.02700, '3', 238738.56100, 1983989.91400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(561, 'ILN-3256', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BADOC', 'NAGREBCAN', 2007, 17.90982956, '17° 54\' 35.386416\"', 120.53045680, '120° 31\' 49.644480\"', 'ILN-3256 From Pinili Town Proper, travel for about 7 km. until reaching Brgy. Nagrebcan, Mun. of Badoc. Station is located 1 m. W of Nagrebcan Brgy. Welcome Arch, 4 m. S of the brgy. road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3256 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 17.90984384, '17° 54\' 35.437820\"', 120.53046120, '120° 31\' 49.660420\"', 0.0100, '1', 67.4130, 0.0100, '2', 30.3879, 238369.47900, 1981945.73000, '51', 17.91156450, '17° 54\' 41.632200\"', 120.52917860, '120° 31\' 45.043010\"', 35.1083, 1981038.34800, 450114.19100, '3', 238232.28300, 1982018.57700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(562, 'ILN-3260', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'SARRAT', 'SAN LORENZO', 2007, 18.13608385, '18° 8\' 9.901860\"', 120.63170770, '120° 37\' 54.147720\"', 'ILN-3260 From San Nicolas Town Proper, travel for about 6 km. until reaching Brgy. San Miguel, Mun. of Sarrat. Then turn left and continue traveling for about 1.2 km. until reaching the station. Station is located at San Antonio Elem. School, SW of the basketball court. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3260 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.13609964, '18° 8\' 9.958720\"', 120.63171250, '120° 37\' 54.164850\"', 0.0100, '1', 57.1790, 0.0100, '2', 20.1863, 249421.97880, 2006855.85300, '51', 18.13783155, '18° 8\' 16.193590\"', 120.63043520, '120° 37\' 49.566760\"', 25.3682, 2006055.37800, 460892.93600, '3', 249285.61300, 2006928.54000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(563, 'ILN-3268', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'SARRAT', 'SAN PEDRO', 2007, 18.08442636, '18° 5\' 3.934896\"', 120.63031780, '120° 37\' 49.144080\"', 'ILN-3268 From San Nicolas Town Proper, travel for about 6 km. to reach Brgy. San Miguel, Mun. of Sarrat then turn right until reaching the station. Station is located on top of the concrete foundation of San Pedro Brgy. Welcome Arch, approx. 200 m. S of station ILN-32680 and about 4 m. W from the brgy. road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 2 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILN-3268 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.08444199, '18° 5\' 3.991180\"', 120.63032260, '120° 37\' 49.161180\"', 0.0100, '1', 90.5690, 0.0100, '2', 53.3796, 249201.28040, 2001138.50800, '51', 18.08617087, '18° 5\' 10.215140\"', 120.62904410, '120° 37\' 44.558810\"', 58.5928, 2000338.27600, 460734.22200, '3', 249064.74100, 2001211.16200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(564, 'ILN-3277', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PIDDIG', 'DUPITAC', 2007, 18.16682617, '18° 10\' 0.574212\"', 120.75254220, '120° 45\' 9.151920\"', 'ILN-3277 From Piddig Town Proper, travel for about 4 km. to reach Brgy. Dupitac. Station is located W of the \"Thanksgiving\" marker, E of a bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3277 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.16684233, '18° 10\' 0.632370\"', 120.75254730, '120° 45\' 9.170250\"', 0.0100, '1', 82.9220, 0.0100, '2', 45.0363, 262254.05560, 2010098.82400, '51', 18.16857349, '18° 10\' 6.864560\"', 120.75127090, '120° 45\' 4.575350\"', 50.9223, 2009436.15800, 473684.36200, '3', 262117.87600, 2010171.14600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(565, 'ILN-3173', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BANNA', 'MACAYEPYEP', 2009, 17.94526603, '17° 56\' 42.957708\"', 120.66016850, '120° 39\' 36.606600\"', 'ILN-3282 From Banna Town Proper, travel for about 3.5 km. going to the Mun. of Nueva Era until reaching Brgy. Macayepyep. Station is located 10 m. S of \"BM 45, DPWH\", 500 m. N of station ILN-3281 and 7 m. E of the centerline of the Nat\'l. Highway. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3282 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 17.94258288, '17° 56\' 33.298350\"', 120.65951880, '120° 39\' 34.267550\"', 0.0100, '1', 133.0840, 0.0100, '2', 95.2257, 252094.20910, 1985393.61000, '51', 17.94430273, '17° 56\' 39.489810\"', 120.65823710, '120° 39\' 29.653560\"', 100.5760, 1984631.65600, 463795.37400, '3', 251957.21500, 1985466.06400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(566, 'ILN-3294', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'SOLSONA', 'NAGPATPATAN', 2007, 18.06946198, '18° 4\' 10.063128\"', 120.77968220, '120° 46\' 46.855920\"', 'ILN-3294 From Solsona Town Proper, travel along the mun. road for about 4.1 km. until reaching Brgy. Nagpatpatan. Station is located 10 m. N of a rice mill and 0.2 m. S of Sitio Kabainbainan marker. It is also 4 m. W of the brgy. road centerline and 100 m. N of station ILN-3293. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 2 cm. concrete cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILN-3294 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.06947816, '18° 4\' 10.121390\"', 120.77968790, '120° 46\' 46.876390\"', 0.0100, '1', 92.3260, 0.0100, '2', 53.7377, 264996.32690, 1999285.19600, '51', 18.07120300, '18° 4\' 16.330800\"', 120.77840930, '120° 46\' 42.273540\"', 59.9430, 1998656.39200, 476542.66500, '3', 264859.84100, 1999357.36000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(567, 'ILN-3295', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'SOLSONA', 'MANALPAC', 2007, 18.08412178, '18° 5\' 2.838408\"', 120.81381200, '120° 48\' 49.723200\"', 'ILN-3295 From Solsona Town Proper, travel E for about 5 km. until reaching Brgy. Manalpac. Station is located 30 m. W of the SW approach of a bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 2 cm. concrete cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILN-3295 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.08413808, '18° 5\' 2.897070\"', 120.81381700, '120° 48\' 49.741240\"', 0.0100, '1', 157.1440, 0.0100, '2', 118.2218, 268629.30380, 2000864.96100, '51', 18.08586304, '18° 5\' 9.106940\"', 120.81253880, '120° 48\' 45.139840\"', 124.7271, 2000274.82300, 480157.23700, '3', 268492.89200, 2000937.02400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(568, 'ILN-3296', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'SOLSONA', 'SANTIAGO', 2007, 18.09783532, '18° 5\' 52.207152\"', 120.73034470, '120° 43\' 49.240920\"', 'ILN-3296 From Solsona Town Proper, travel along the Nat\'l. Highway for about 4 km. until going to Dingras Town Proper until reaching Brgy. Santiago. Station is located 1 m. W of Solsona Welcome Arch, E of Km. Post No. 507. It is also 6 m. S of the brgy. road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3296 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.09785157, '18° 5\' 52.265640\"', 120.73035010, '120° 43\' 49.260380\"', 0.0100, '1', 69.6460, 0.0100, '2', 31.7007, 259810.73350, 2002489.87300, '51', 18.09957913, '18° 5\' 58.484860\"', 120.72907210, '120° 43\' 44.659620\"', 37.4739, 2001803.76900, 471324.46700, '3', 259674.30800, 2002562.21600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(569, 'ILN-3301', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'VINTAR', 'NAMOROC', 2007, 18.21286466, '18° 12\' 46.312776\"', 120.71229460, '120° 42\' 44.260560\"', 'ILN-3301 From Vintar Town Proper, travel along the prov\'l. road for about 5 km. until reaching Brgy. Namoroc. Station is located at the compound of Namoroc Brgy. Hall, situated 25 m. NE of the said brgy. hall and 1 m. from the W portion of the foundation of the Namoroc Brgy. Welcome Arch. It is also about 4 m. from the brgy. road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3301 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.21288104, '18° 12\' 46.371760\"', 120.71229940, '120° 42\' 44.277920\"', 0.0100, '1', 103.1480, 0.0100, '2', 65.7925, 258058.19390, 2015248.34900, '51', 18.21461576, '18° 12\' 52.616750\"', 120.71102410, '120° 42\' 39.686660\"', 71.3956, 2014537.99400, 469434.22400, '3', 257922.14200, 2015320.83200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(570, 'ILN-3311', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BACARRA', 'NAMBARAN', 2007, 18.27444716, '18° 16\' 28.009776\"', 120.63990050, '120° 38\' 23.641800\"', 'ILN-3311 From Bacarra Town Proper, travel NE along the prov\'l. road for about 5 km. until reaching Brgy. Bugas. Station is located at the recrop about 6 m. from the irrigation gate valve. It is also 3 m. from the brgy. road centerline and 200 m. S of station ILN-3310. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 100 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3311 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.27446364, '18° 16\' 28.069090\"', 120.63990480, '120° 38\' 23.657170\"', 0.0100, '1', 62.3000, 0.0100, '2', 25.6881, 250486.42400, 2022163.61600, '51', 18.27620352, '18° 16\' 34.332660\"', 120.63863070, '120° 38\' 19.070620\"', 30.9230, 2021367.71600, 461790.36800, '3', 250350.52800, 2022236.37700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(571, 'ILN-3196', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAGUDPUD', 'CAUNAYAN', 2009, 18.60060176, '18° 36\' 2.166336\"', 120.87701860, '120° 52\' 37.266960\"', 'ILN-3336 From Pagudpud Town Proper, travel for about 15 km. until reaching Brgy. Balaoi. Station is located 15 m. NE of Km. Post No. 573. It is also 7 m. away from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 100 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3336 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.60480523, '18° 36\' 17.298820\"', 120.83299100, '120° 49\' 58.767590\"', 0.0100, '1', 67.7790, 0.0100, '2', 32.5244, 271345.78580, 2058480.94500, '51', 18.60656038, '18° 36\' 23.617380\"', 120.83172490, '120° 49\' 54.209460\"', 37.0322, 2057900.20100, 482241.35300, '3', 271211.12600, 2058553.32300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(572, 'ILN-3353', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BANGUI', 'PAYAC', 2007, 18.48698151, '18° 29\' 13.133436\"', 120.72021840, '120° 43\' 12.786240\"', 'ILN-3353 From Bangui Town Proper, travel for about 6.5 km. to reach Brgy. Banban then continue traveling again for about 4.1 km. to reach Sitio Alaoao, Brgy. Payac. Station is located W of the basketball court, NE of Payac Brgy. Hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 100 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3353; 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.48699837, '18° 29\' 13.194120\"', 120.72022220, '120° 43\' 12.799910\"', 0.0100, '1', 72.9540, 0.0100, '2', 36.9403, 259276.80360, 2045585.66800, '51', 18.48874901, '18° 29\' 19.496430\"', 120.71895320, '120° 43\' 8.231430\"', 42.0858, 2044876.14800, 470319.76900, '3', 259141.67500, 2045658.32300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(573, 'ILN-3377', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BANGUI', 'MASIKIL', 2009, 18.52679043, '18° 31\' 36.445548\"', 120.74534370, '120° 44\' 43.237320\"', 'ILN-3377 The station is located beside barangay road going to China Sea 5 meters easward of the bridge at Barangay Masikil east of 3rd windmill. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail centered and embedded on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 100 cm. standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm. with inscriptions \"ILN-3377; 2009; NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.52680814, '18° 31\' 36.509300\"', 120.74534780, '120° 44\' 43.251960\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.4370, 0.0100, '2', 9.7106, 261986.01680, 2049959.72200, '51', 18.52856059, '18° 31\' 42.818110\"', 120.74407970, '120° 44\' 38.686890\"', 14.6406, 2049278.38300, 472979.54300, '3', 261851.03700, 2050032.32600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(574, 'ILN-3383', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BANGUI', 'BANBAN', 2009, 18.50538764, '18° 30\' 19.395504\"', 120.72150720, '120° 43\' 17.425920\"', 'ILN-3383 The station is located at the back of Banban basketball court approximately 50 meters southwest from the house of the Barangay Captain Ruben Alipay. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail centered and embedded on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 100 cm. standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm. with inscriptions \"ILN-3383; 2009; NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.50540509, '18° 30\' 19.458310\"', 120.72151110, '120° 43\' 17.440080\"', 0.0100, '1', 51.1010, 0.0100, '2', 15.2734, 259438.68380, 2047621.79900, '51', 18.50715678, '18° 30\' 25.764420\"', 120.72024250, '120° 43\' 12.873120\"', 20.2907, 2046913.23300, 470459.09000, '3', 259303.61700, 2047694.46300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
