(575, 'ILN-3386', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BANGUI', 'SAN LORENZO', 2009, 18.53523623, '18° 32\' 6.850428\"', 120.76726770, '120° 46\' 2.163720\"', 'ILN-3386 The station is located along barangay road approximately 100 meters before a welcome arc of Barangay Bacsil around 500 meters from national highway going to barangay Bacsil, 20 meters from the crossing going to Barangay Poblacion. Mark on the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILN 3386', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.53525347, '18° 32\' 6.912500\"', 120.76727220, '120° 46\' 2.180000\"', 0.0100, '1', 44.4910, 0.0100, '2', 8.7061, 264313.01950, 2050865.87800, '51', 18.53700595, '18° 32\' 13.221430\"', 120.76600440, '120° 45\' 57.615740\"', 13.6702, 2050209.93600, 475295.60800, '3', 264178.08300, 2050938.41700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(576, 'ILN-3389', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BANGUI', 'TAGUIPORO', 2009, 18.52538550, '18° 31\' 31.387800\"', 120.71484410, '120° 42\' 53.438760\"', 'ILN-3389 The station is located beside DAR concrete marker along right side of barangay road fronting windmill post tower. Mark on the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILN 3389', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.52540287, '18° 31\' 31.450320\"', 120.71484800, '120° 42\' 53.452790\"', 0.0100, '1', 41.4400, 0.0100, '2', 5.9020, 258762.95120, 2049844.71000, '51', 18.52715587, '18° 31\' 37.761140\"', 120.71357980, '120° 42\' 48.887440\"', 10.7119, 2049127.75700, 469759.05500, '3', 258627.94700, 2049917.41000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(577, 'ILN-3427 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BURGOS', 'AGAGA', 2009, 18.50528616, '18° 30\' 19.030176\"', 120.57678020, '120° 34\' 36.408720\"', 'ILN-3393 The station is located on an open ground owned by the military, 60 meters southwest of abandond house fronting military reservation lot. Mark on the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILN 3393', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.44490211, '18° 26\' 41.647590\"', 120.64074980, '120° 38\' 26.699450\"', 0.0100, '1', 199.6300, 0.0100, '2', 163.7063, 250820.69360, 2041032.72400, '51', 18.44665193, '18° 26\' 47.946930\"', 120.63947980, '120° 38\' 22.127170\"', 168.8128, 2040231.90500, 461917.53500, '3', 250685.37300, 2041105.60000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(578, 'ILN-3409 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BURGOS', 'BUDUAN', 2009, 18.51058921, '18° 30\' 38.121156\"', 120.63122430, '120° 37\' 52.407480\"', 'ILN-3409 (LMS) The station is located on the left shoulder of the road going to Barangay Buduan approximately 50-60 meters northeast from the abridge.Mark on the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILN 3409', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.51058921, '18° 30\' 38.121150\"', 120.63122430, '120° 37\' 52.407560\"', 0.0100, '1', 86.7550, 0.0100, '2', 51.5911, 249909.51620, 2048318.59900, '51', 18.51234309, '18° 30\' 44.435130\"', 120.62995570, '120° 37\' 47.840590\"', 56.1778, 2047504.39700, 460926.36300, '3', 249774.40700, 2048391.55400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(579, 'ILN-3393', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BURGOS', 'PAAYAS', 2009, 18.47136407, '18° 28\' 16.910652\"', 120.63536160, '120° 38\' 7.301760\"', 'ILN-3425 (LMS) The staton is located on the western side ofthe road going to Kaangrian Falls, 20 meters north of duhat tree. Mark is the head of a 3 \" copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 100 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3425; 2009; NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.50530312, '18° 30\' 19.091240\"', 120.57678340, '120° 34\' 36.420350\"', 0.0100, '1', 42.5230, 0.0100, '2', 7.7847, 244151.17150, 2047809.70600, '51', 18.50705785, '18° 30\' 25.408260\"', 120.57551460, '120° 34\' 31.852630\"', 12.0584, 2046932.09600, 455176.37500, '3', 244016.00800, 2047882.83300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(580, 'ILN-3437 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PASUQUIN', 'SAN JUAN', 2009, 18.33620630, '18° 20\' 10.342680\"', 120.64705580, '120° 38\' 49.400880\"', 'ILN-3437 (LMS) The station is located along barangay road, 30 meters east of the box culvert and 25 meters from the mango tree at Barangay San Juan. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILN 3437', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.33622270, '18° 20\' 10.401710\"', 120.64706010, '120° 38\' 49.416450\"', 0.0100, '1', 174.4580, 0.0100, '2', 137.9812, 251331.48980, 2028991.50800, '51', 18.33796602, '18° 20\' 16.677680\"', 120.64578750, '120° 38\' 44.835160\"', 143.2672, 2028201.75200, 462560.38100, '3', 251195.80800, 2029064.28700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(581, 'ILN-3020', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAGUDPUD', 'PASALENG', 2007, 18.63208239, '18° 37\' 55.496604\"', 120.85941390, '120° 51\' 33.890040\"', 'ILN-3512 (PGD-7) The station is located along the gravel road lining the beaches of the famous Pagudpud beach. It is near the approach of a Bailey bridge, approximately 2 m from its centerline , and is about 15 m, south from project control \"PGD-8\". Mark is a 10 cm x 1 cm dia. brass rod with cross cut on top , centered on a 30 x 30 x 60 cm concrete monument protruding 10 cm above the ground with inscription, \"PGD-7 EDC -PWP\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.54923975, '18° 32\' 57.263100\"', 120.93881460, '120° 56\' 19.732700\"', 0.0100, '1', 54.8690, 0.0100, '2', 18.2626, 282445.31330, 2052198.27900, '51', 18.55098945, '18° 33\' 3.562020\"', 120.93754740, '120° 56\' 15.170520\"', 23.6847, 2051742.67000, 493407.03200, '3', 282310.53800, 2052270.28100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(582, 'ILN-3345 (BLLM-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAGUDPUD', 'POBLACION 1', 2008, 18.63824112, '18° 38\' 17.668032\"', 120.84980440, '120° 50\' 59.295840\"', 'ILN-3518 (PGD-13) The station is located along the gentle slopes on the hills of Brgy. Balaoi. It is approximately 800 m. West from the Dos Hermanos group of islets, and is surrounded by bushes and mountain grasses. It is about 171 m. West from project control \"PGD-14\". Mark is a 10 x 1 cm dia. brass rod with cross cut on top, centered on a 30 x 30 x 60 cm concrete monument protruding 10 cm above the ground with inscription , PGD-13 EDC-PWP\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.55959221, '18° 33\' 34.531940\"', 120.78693580, '120° 47\' 12.968900\"', 0.0100, '1', 43.3390, 0.0100, '2', 7.7295, 266422.66480, 2053534.76600, '51', 18.56134569, '18° 33\' 40.844500\"', 120.78566850, '120° 47\' 8.406760\"', 12.5520, 2052901.17900, 477374.89200, '3', 266287.82300, 2053607.25900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(583, 'ILN-3186', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAGUDPUD', 'SAUD', 2009, 18.64592334, '18° 38\' 45.324024\"', 120.85160740, '120° 51\' 5.786640\"', 'ILN-3522 (PGD-18) Ths station is located 500m west from the coast. It is approximately 760 m south of Maira-ira point and is about 262 m. north from project control \"PGD-17\". Mark is 10 x 1 cm dia brass rod with cross cut on top, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 60 cm concrete monument protruding 10 cm above the ground with inscription, \"PGD-18 EDC-PWP\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.58824979, '18° 35\' 17.699240\"', 120.78698650, '120° 47\' 13.151460\"', 0.0100, '1', 43.1680, 0.0100, '2', 7.9639, 266467.07200, 2056707.35200, '51', 18.59000495, '18° 35\' 24.017820\"', 120.78571990, '120° 47\' 8.591700\"', 12.4761, 2056073.07400, 477384.09400, '3', 266332.32600, 2056779.86600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(584, 'ILN-3421 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BURGOS', 'POBLACION', 2014, 18.51408224, '18° 30\' 50.696064\"', 120.59534930, '120° 35\' 43.257480\"', 'ILN-3549 (BAY-3) The station is located along the corner of the Pan-Philippine National Highway and the barangay towards the famous Cape Bojeador Lightouse. It is below a street signboard and is approximately 225 m SW from a NAMRIA GPS point. ILN -3398. It is also about 243 m. NE from project control. \"BAY-4\". Mark is 10 x1 cm dia. brass rod with cross cut on top, centered on a 30 cm x 30 x 60 cm concrete monument protruding 10 cm above the ground with inscription, \"BAY-3 EDC-PWP\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.51002168, '18° 30\' 36.078030\"', 120.64569310, '120° 38\' 44.495060\"', 0.0100, '1', 96.8360, 0.0100, '2', 61.5610, 251436.97030, 2048235.75300, '51', 18.51177522, '18° 30\' 42.390790\"', 120.64442450, '120° 38\' 39.928120\"', 66.2223, 2047438.47500, 462454.03700, '3', 251301.86900, 2048308.66200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(585, 'ILN-3404 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BURGOS', 'SAOIT', 2014, 18.54227333, '18° 32\' 32.183988\"', 120.63671880, '120° 38\' 12.187680\"', 'ILN-3558 (PGL-4) THE STATION IS LOCATED NEAR THE GRASSLANDS AND ROCKY TERRAIN AROUND 705 M FROM THE COAST OF SAOIT. IT IS APPROXIMATELY 385 M FROM THE NEAREST BARANGY ROAD WHERE A NAMRIA GPS POINT (ILN-3324) HAS BEEN ESTABLISHED. IT IS ALSO 160 M SOUTH FROM PROJECT CONTROL \"PGL-3\". MARK IS A 10 CM X 1 CM DIA. BRASS ROD WITH CROSS CUT ON TOP , CENTERED ON A 30 X 30 X 60 CM CONCRETE MONUMENT PROTRUDING 10 CM ABOVE TH GROUND WITH INSCRIPTION , \"PGL-4 EDC-PWP\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 18.53477336, '18° 32\' 5.184090\"', 120.62664930, '120° 37\' 35.937530\"', 0.0100, '1', 49.4310, 0.0100, '2', 14.6225, 249461.53020, 2051002.58300, '51', 18.53652876, '18° 32\' 11.503530\"', 120.62538130, '120° 37\' 31.372510\"', 18.9448, 2050182.19100, 460448.89200, '3', 249326.49800, 2051075.57200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(586, 'ILS-12', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SINAIT', 'RANG-AY', 2005, 17.86442488, '17° 51\' 51.929568\"', 120.45686630, '120° 27\' 24.718680\"', 'ILS-12 Is in the town proper of Sinait, inside the compound of Sinait Municipal Park, Brgy. Poblacion, Sinait, Ilocos Sur. It is located at about 6 m. infront of Jose Rizal monument and about 15 m. S of the barangay hall. The municipal park is located on the right side of the national highway going to Laoag City, infront of Sinait Elem. School. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed in a drilled hole and centered on a 8\" x 8\" cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILS-12, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 17.86443980, '17° 51\' 51.983270\"', 120.45687020, '120° 27\' 24.732730\"', 0.0100, '0', 44.9540, 0.0200, '2', 8.3642, 230500.31740, 1977023.41900, '51', 17.86615933, '17° 51\' 58.173580\"', 120.45558640, '120° 27\' 20.111160\"', 12.6788, 1976034.52500, 442301.89700, '3', 230362.91600, 1977096.47000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(587, 'ILS-16', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 'POBLACION', 2005, 17.63792680, '17° 38\' 16.536480\"', 120.40909350, '120° 24\' 32.736600\"', 'ILS-16 From Vigan City, travel N along the national highway for about 8 km. until reaching the Santo Domingo Park on the SE side of the national highway. The park is located infront of the municipal hall. It is located inside the park. It is about 8 m. NE (right hand side) of the Benito Soliven monument, about 30 m. SE of the national highway, about 3.3 m. NE of the first step of the NE stair and 0.4 m. NE of the NE portion of the circular concrete base. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and flush with the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-16, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 17.63794100, '17° 38\' 16.587590\"', 120.40909590, '120° 24\' 32.745300\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.6840, 0.0100, '2', 10.3775, 225088.79940, 1952013.76700, '51', 17.63964805, '17° 38\' 22.732990\"', 120.40780680, '120° 24\' 28.104620\"', 13.7935, 1950981.71200, 437158.96800, '3', 224950.60100, 1952086.80300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(588, 'ILS-22', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'LIDLIDDA', 'POBLACION NORTE', 2005, 17.26876030, '17° 16\' 7.537080\"', 120.52043410, '120° 31\' 13.562760\"', 'ILS-22 From Candon City, travel N along the national highway for about 6 km. then turn E at the junction and travel for about 8 km. until reaching the Lidlidda Public Market. Turn NW and travel for about 4 km. to reach the North Central School. It is located inside the school compound on the science park near the NE corner of the concrete stage. It is 1.5 m. NNW of the E corner of the concrete stage and 0.8 m. NNE of the NE side of the stage. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 10 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-22, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 17.26877220, '17° 16\' 7.579910\"', 120.52043520, '120° 31\' 13.566660\"', 0.0100, '1', 87.8080, 0.0200, '2', 48.7367, 236377.93400, 1910982.46300, '51', 17.27045469, '17° 16\' 13.636890\"', 120.51913770, '120° 31\' 8.895720\"', 53.4727, 1910091.04200, 448870.32500, '3', 236238.57600, 1911054.85500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(589, 'ILS-23', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN EMILIO', 'CABAROAN', 2005, 17.23629737, '17° 14\' 10.670532\"', 120.57852090, '120° 34\' 42.675240\"', 'ILS-23 From Candon City, travel N along the national highway for about 6 km. then turn E at the junction and travel for about 17 km. until reaching the San Emilio West Central School. It is located inside the school compound on the Math Park. It is on the E corner of the park, about 17 m. WNW of the N corner of the school office and about 23 m. W of Acacia tree no. 8. It is SSE of the municipal hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 30 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-23, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 17.23630912, '17° 14\' 10.712840\"', 120.57852220, '120° 34\' 42.679910\"', 0.0100, '1', 283.1920, 0.0200, '2', 242.9277, 242511.63260, 1907309.98700, '51', 17.23798836, '17° 14\' 16.758090\"', 120.57722410, '120° 34\' 38.006690\"', 248.6142, 1906483.75900, 455038.83600, '3', 242372.21300, 1907382.16100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(590, 'ILS-29 (BLLM-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SUYO', 'POBLACION', 2006, 16.98347909, '16° 59\' 0.524724\"', 120.51161010, '120° 30\' 41.796360\"', 'ILS-29 (BLLM 2) From Candon City, travel S for about 26 km. then turn SW at Bitalag Junction and travel for about 12 km. or about 30 mins. to reach the station at Poblacion, Suyo. It is located about 200 m. W of the municipal hall, about 100 m. WNW of Kimpusa Br. 1 (331 + 805), about 9 m. S from the road centerline, about 3 m. W of the concrete irrigation canal and about 6 m. S of DPWH Km. Post 331 + 700. It is elevated about a meter from the ricefield. Mark is the head of a 4 in. common nail, centered on a concrete block 40 cm. x 40 cm. and flush with the ground surface, with inscription \"BLLM No. 2\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 16.98348939, '16° 59\' 0.561800\"', 120.51161100, '120° 30\' 41.799700\"', 0.0100, '1', 115.8580, 0.0200, '2', 75.5066, 235035.07850, 1879409.96800, '51', 16.98515477, '16° 59\' 6.557180\"', 120.51030690, '120° 30\' 37.104860\"', 80.6450, 1878521.40600, 447851.86500, '3', 234894.75500, 1879482.16400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(591, 'ILS-30 (BLLM-2A)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SUYO', 'MAN-ATONG', 2002, 16.95135203, '16° 57\' 4.867308\"', 120.60229200, '120° 36\' 8.251200\"', 'ILS-30 (BLLM 2A) From Candon City, travel S for about 26 km. then turn SW at Bitalag Junction and travel along the mostly rough road for about 25 km. or about 1 hr. and 30 mins. to reach the station. A four wheel drive vehicle or vehicle with high profile tires is recommended. It is located about 100 m. SE of Butac Elem. School. It is on the S top of the rock on the S side of the road. Mark is the head of a 3 in. concrete nail, centered on a 28 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, protruding 6 cm. on top of the rock about 9 m. x 15 m. with a height of about 5 m. from the ground, with inscriptions \"BLLM-2A, 2002, PRS 92, FNSP-DENR\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 16.95136161, '16° 57\' 4.901800\"', 120.60229330, '120° 36\' 8.256010\"', 0.0100, '1', 314.1740, 0.0200, '2', 272.1677, 244652.31120, 1875732.84800, '51', 16.95302303, '16° 57\' 10.882920\"', 120.60098860, '120° 36\' 3.559080\"', 278.6419, 1874943.84200, 457501.61300, '3', 244511.95400, 1875804.71900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(592, 'ILS-3002', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA CRUZ', 'SEVILLA', 2007, 17.00845539, '17° 0\' 30.439404\"', 120.45583080, '120° 27\' 20.990880\"', 'ILS-3002 Station is located inside the school and barangay hall compound of Sevilla. It is about 2m W of the W side of the basketball court, about 4m E of the W wall of the compound, about 5m NNW of the W goal of the court and about 10m SW of the multipurpose hall. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3002, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 17.00846657, '17° 0\' 30.479660\"', 120.45583030, '120° 27\' 20.988980\"', 0.0200, '2', 47.8200, 0.0200, '2', 8.4692, 229128.20810, 1882251.62700, '51', 17.01013469, '17° 0\' 36.484900\"', 120.45452660, '120° 27\' 16.295920\"', 12.8198, 1881301.40800, 441919.29500, '3', 228987.92500, 1882324.02500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(593, 'ILS-3003', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA CRUZ', 'SAOAT', 2007, 17.05363984, '17° 3\' 13.103424\"', 120.45515620, '120° 27\' 18.562320\"', 'ILS-3003 From Sta. Cruz town proper, travel along the highway going to Tagudin to reach the second welcome arc of barangay Sagat at the left side of the road. Turn left to reach the culvert about 60m W of the welcome arc. Station is located at the NE corner of the culvert about 0.5m E of the said corner and 3m N of the road centerline. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3003, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 17.05365125, '17° 3\' 13.144490\"', 120.45515600, '120° 27\' 18.561650\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.0730, 0.0200, '2', 7.9421, 229121.50530, 1887255.24500, '51', 17.05532213, '17° 3\' 19.159670\"', 120.45385340, '120° 27\' 13.872370\"', 12.2162, 1886302.15100, 441861.57400, '3', 228981.37400, 1887327.68100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(594, 'ILS-3004', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'BANTAY', 'TALEB', 2007, 17.58308447, '17° 34\' 59.104092\"', 120.44814460, '120° 26\' 53.320560\"', 'ILS-3004 From Vigan, travel along the highway going to Santa to reach the barangay plaza of Taleb at the SW side of the highway. Station is located inside the plaza of Taleb on the corner of the elevated concrete pavement about 20m SW of the NW end of the gate, 11m SE of the NW wall of the plaza and about 2m NE of the NE side of the basketball court. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3004, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 17.62549382, '17° 37\' 31.777740\"', 120.44010160, '120° 26\' 24.365630\"', 0.0100, '1', 62.8420, 0.0100, '2', 26.2332, 228361.84010, 1950590.71800, '51', 17.62719946, '17° 37\' 37.918070\"', 120.43881220, '120° 26\' 19.724070\"', 29.8371, 1949594.00200, 440445.13100, '3', 228223.62300, 1950663.64400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(595, 'ILS-3012', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 'CALAY-AB', 2007, 17.64516798, '17° 38\' 42.604728\"', 120.35835790, '120° 21\' 30.088440\"', 'ILS-3012 From Vigan, travel north along the national highway to reach San Ildefonso town proper. Travel past the municipal hall then turn left at the road in between the town market and gym. Continue traveling to reach barangay Calay-ab. Station is located near the end of the former pier about 5m SW of Tersing store and videoke. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3012, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 17.57520387, '17° 34\' 30.733940\"', 120.38703480, '120° 23\' 13.325230\"', 0.0100, '1', 50.2110, 0.0100, '2', 14.0533, 222650.75310, 1945099.36400, '51', 17.57690765, '17° 34\' 36.867530\"', 120.38574420, '120° 23\' 8.679210\"', 17.1725, 1944045.71900, 434795.18500, '3', 222512.32800, 1945172.42400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(596, 'ILS-3019', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'NARVACAN', 'NAGUNEG', 2007, 17.40183241, '17° 24\' 6.596676\"', 120.47138100, '120° 28\' 16.971600\"', 'ILS-3019 Station is established and located along the barangay road beside a river inside the lot of Edmund Soliven, 150 m from the national hghway going to Brgy. San Pedro, Narvacan, Ilocos Sur after a bridge. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm with inscription ILS-3019 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 17.40184489, '17° 24\' 6.641620\"', 120.47138300, '120° 28\' 16.978850\"', 0.0100, '1', 41.1970, 0.0200, '2', 3.7148, 231353.90270, 1925783.73500, '51', 17.40353647, '17° 24\' 12.731290\"', 120.47008850, '120° 28\' 12.318760\"', 7.4022, 1924832.24200, 443695.44300, '3', 231214.95500, 1925856.39000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(597, 'ILS-3023', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA MARIA', 'AG-AGRAO', 2007, 17.38363026, '17° 23\' 1.068936\"', 120.51186690, '120° 30\' 42.720840\"', 'ILS-3023 It is located along barangay road to barangay Ag-agrao proper beside a \"Diwa\" Marker on the crossing to Col. Colejo St. and to Pinsal Falls at barangay Ag-agrao, Santa Maria, Ilocos Sur. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3023, PRS-92, DENR-FNS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 17.38364279, '17° 23\' 1.114030\"', 120.51186820, '120° 30\' 42.725500\"', 0.0100, '1', 51.5470, 0.0200, '2', 13.3677, 235631.21870, 1923712.09500, '51', 17.38533240, '17° 23\' 7.196630\"', 120.51057340, '120° 30\' 38.064100\"', 17.5969, 1922806.23500, 447992.01300, '3', 235492.24000, 1923784.60400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(598, 'ILS-3024', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA MARIA', 'PACANG', 2007, 17.35954877, '17° 21\' 34.375572\"', 120.50500980, '120° 30\' 18.035280\"', 'ILS-3024 It is located south of the welcome arc of barangay Paccang along barangay road going to barangay Silag proper about 1 kilometer east of the look like dam bridge, Silag, Sta. Maria, Ilocos Sur. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3024, PRS-92, DENR-FNS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 17.35956104, '17° 21\' 34.419760\"', 120.50501100, '120° 30\' 18.039540\"', 0.0100, '1', 51.5400, 0.0200, '2', 13.3255, 234867.55960, 1921055.34000, '51', 17.36124935, '17° 21\' 40.497670\"', 120.50371560, '120° 30\' 13.376090\"', 17.5298, 1920142.95200, 447256.37500, '3', 234728.49400, 1921127.85400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
