(604, 'ILS-3110 (BLLM-11)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CABUGAO', 'BONIFACIO', 2013, 17.78546201, '17° 47\' 7.663236\"', 120.45736490, '120° 27\' 26.513640\"', 'ILS-3110 (BLLM-11) The station is located at Barangay Bonifacio, Cabugao, Ilocos Sur at the left side of the farm to market road going to National road about 10 meters East of the road, 200 meters SW of Cabugao South Central School (CSC). Station mark is the head of 4\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 x 0.25m. concrete monument protruding 0.20 meters above the ground surface with inscription \'CABUGAO, I.S.; BLLM-11; CAD 1345-D; DENR, R-1; 2013.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.25, 17.78547676, '17° 47\' 7.716320\"', 120.45736860, '120° 27\' 26.527040\"', 0.0100, '1', 56.7190, 0.0200, '2', 20.0499, 230434.31630, 1968279.65100, '51', 17.78719158, '17° 47\' 13.889690\"', 120.45608300, '120° 27\' 21.898900\"', 24.1874, 1967294.92800, 442329.12900, '3', 230296.65000, 1968352.64100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
