(693, 'CGY-3555', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CLAVERIA', 'MALILITAO', 2010, 18.56212933, '18° 33\' 43.665588\"', 121.11403970, '121° 6\' 50.542920\"', 'CGY-3555 From Claveria Town Proper, travel Northeast passing through National Highway, about 1 kilometer until reaching the intersection of Claveria-Calanasan rd., from the intersection turn right and continue travel for about 4.8 kms until reaching the barangay access road, turn left and travel about 200 meters after thebridge, CGY-3555 is located beside the Welcome Arc of Barangay Malilitao and irrigation canal, about 10 meters from the centerline of the road. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument with inscription \"CGY-3555,2010 LMS.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.56214903, '18° 33\' 43.736500\"', 121.11404750, '121° 6\' 50.571150\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.7530, 0.0100, '2', 9.0141, 300961.44280, 2053424.40300, '51', 18.56389581, '18° 33\' 50.024920\"', 121.11278080, '121° 6\' 46.010990\"', 14.1929, 2053173.67400, 511905.09800, '3', 300826.82800, 2053495.85800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
