(721, 'CGY-3732', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PEÑABLANCA', 'SISIM', 2007, 17.62752598, '17° 37\' 39.093528\"', 121.81333220, '121° 48\' 47.995920\"', 'CGY-3732 Station is located at the left side of the road going to Brgy. San Roque, Peñablanca, 60 m SW of Sisim Elem. school, and Community center. From the junction Provincial road leading to Brgy. Cabbo which is beside the Napocor compound, travel about 5.50 Km. up to the junction at Brgy. Cabbo, about 100 m after Cabbo nat\'l High School, turn left and the brgy. road will lead to Brgy. Sisim. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete block set, 0.20 m above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3732, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.81811362, '17° 49\' 5.209020\"', 121.44900260, '121° 26\' 56.409370\"', 0.0100, '1', 68.3310, 0.0100, '2', 29.2248, 335623.40990, 1970743.43800, '51', 17.81980932, '17° 49\' 11.313540\"', 121.44771920, '121° 26\' 51.789250\"', 33.5255, 1970877.75100, 547462.32600, '3', 335486.56300, 1970813.28400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
