(750, 'CGY-3904', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LASAM', 'BATTALAN', 2007, 18.07416063, '18° 4\' 26.978268\"', 121.55264500, '121° 33\' 9.522000\"', 'CGY-3904 From Lasam Town Proper, travel E for about 3 Km. to reach Brgy. Battalan. Station is located inside the Battalan Elem. School beside the flagpole. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, set 2 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3904, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.07417933, '18° 4\' 27.045580\"', 121.55265300, '121° 33\' 9.550850\"', 0.0100, '1', 57.9020, 0.0200, '2', 19.3128, 346830.99830, 1998992.78300, '51', 18.07588811, '18° 4\' 33.197180\"', 121.55137570, '121° 33\' 4.952660\"', 23.6827, 1999247.96200, 558367.06700, '3', 346695.07100, 1999062.49500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(751, 'CGY-3933', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'GONZAGA', 'IPIL', 2007, 18.29954393, '18° 17\' 58.358148\"', 122.06364950, '122° 3\' 49.138200\"', 'CGY-3933 From Camalaniugan junction travel on Provincial Road on E direction passing Pattao junction, Sta. Teresita Town Proper, Gonzaga Town proper, Brgy. Cagayan Tapel, Balabat, until you reach Brgy. Ipil, Gonzaga, Cagayan, from the junction at Brgy. Ipil, turn right at the junction with marker of San Francisco Primary School. continue travel about 4.5 Km. to reach the station at Sition San Francisco. Station is located at the solar drier. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3933, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.29956208, '18° 17\' 58.423480\"', 122.06366290, '122° 3\' 49.186300\"', 0.0100, '1', 91.4170, 0.0100, '2', 53.7036, 401042.05250, 2023582.34400, '51', 18.30127344, '18° 18\' 4.584370\"', 122.06239170, '122° 3\' 44.610020\"', 56.7170, 2024431.49700, 612321.18100, '3', 400907.22700, 2023650.61900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(752, 'CGY-3938', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'GONZAGA', 'REBECCA', 2007, 18.24452831, '18° 14\' 40.301916\"', 121.95451890, '121° 57\' 16.268040\"', 'CGY-3938 From Camalaniugan junction travel along Provincial Road going to E direction passing Pattao junction, Sta. Teresita, until you reach Brgy. Rebecca, Gonzaga about 35 Km.. Station is located about 30 cm N of Rizal statue inside the Rebecca Elem. School campus. Station is marked by a 2 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3938, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.24454730, '18° 14\' 40.370280\"', 121.95453090, '121° 57\' 16.311330\"', 0.0100, '1', 53.5100, 0.0100, '2', 15.4190, 389472.49720, 2017557.37300, '51', 18.24625771, '18° 14\' 46.527750\"', 121.95325830, '121° 57\' 11.729750\"', 18.8891, 2018278.36500, 600813.93000, '3', 389337.41400, 2017625.95000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(753, 'CGY-3957', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANTA ANA', 'PALAWIG', 2007, 18.47168332, '18° 28\' 18.059952\"', 122.14926480, '122° 8\' 57.353280\"', 'CGY-3957 Station is located on top of riprap 4 m from bridge, and approx. 315 m from CGY-3958. Travel along Provincial Road going to San Vicente for about 2 Km. from Sta. Ana Public Market. Station is located at the right side of Provincial Road after the intersection going to Brgy. Marede. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.0 m concrete monument, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3957, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.47170298, '18° 28\' 18.130720\"', 122.14927940, '122° 8\' 57.405880\"', 0.0100, '1', 43.1630, 0.0100, '2', 6.8910, 410180.31760, 2042585.48800, '51', 18.47342273, '18° 28\' 24.321820\"', 122.14801230, '122° 8\' 52.844410\"', 8.8296, 2043541.78500, 621253.90100, '3', 410046.11300, 2042653.62600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(754, 'CGY-3959', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANTA ANA', 'BATU-PARADA', 2007, 18.46573577, '18° 27\' 56.648772\"', 122.17078890, '122° 10\' 14.840040\"', 'CGY-3959 Station is located on top of NIA water gate, approx. 20 m N of Cagayan waiting shed, travel along Provincial Road going to San Vicente about 2 Km. from Sta. Ana Town Proper turn right on the junction Brgy. Palawig continue travel until you reach the intersectin of Brgy. Parada Batu to Brgy. Casagan. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3959, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.46575532, '18° 27\' 56.719150\"', 122.17080390, '122° 10\' 14.893860\"', 0.0100, '1', 43.0300, 0.0100, '2', 6.7255, 412449.99500, 2041916.81800, '51', 18.46747427, '18° 28\' 2.907360\"', 122.16953670, '122° 10\' 10.332040\"', 8.6254, 2042897.90400, 623531.82800, '3', 412315.78600, 2041984.88400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(755, 'CGY-3962', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'BICUD', 2007, 18.12812450, '18° 7\' 41.248200\"', 121.57925810, '121° 34\' 45.329160\"', 'CGY-3962 Travel along Nat\'l Road, turn left on Logac junction continue travel until you reach Brgy. Bicud for about 8 Km.. Station is in Brgy. Bicud, Lal-lo, Cagayan and putty at the NW corner of basketball court beside the brgy. hall. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3962, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.12814292, '18° 7\' 41.314510\"', 121.57926650, '121° 34\' 45.359230\"', 0.0100, '1', 74.6220, 0.0200, '2', 36.1919, 349693.92170, 2004942.78000, '51', 18.12985434, '18° 7\' 47.475610\"', 121.57799050, '121° 34\' 40.765700\"', 40.5159, 2005229.27600, 561165.78100, '3', 349558.19100, 2005012.44800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(756, 'CGY-3978', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'CATARATAN', 2007, 18.23844852, '18° 14\' 18.414672\"', 121.50604150, '121° 30\' 21.749400\"', 'CGY-3978 Station is located at the center of pavement property of Brgy. Capt. Virgilio Dalire, SW of entrance of the property. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3978, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.23846791, '18° 14\' 18.484490\"', 121.50604940, '121° 30\' 21.777750\"', 0.0100, '1', 57.4310, 0.0100, '2', 19.1386, 342045.92050, 2017213.63200, '51', 18.24018742, '18° 14\' 24.674710\"', 121.50477580, '121° 30\' 17.192950\"', 23.8627, 2017417.56200, 553384.09800, '3', 341910.50200, 2017283.61300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(757, 'CGY-3985', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'TUBEL', 2007, 18.27100700, '18° 16\' 15.625200\"', 121.59821600, '121° 35\' 53.577600\"', 'CGY-3985 Station is located in front of Tubel Elem. School flagpole. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3985, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.27102622, '18° 16\' 15.694400\"', 121.59822520, '121° 35\' 53.610630\"', 0.0100, '1', 59.4530, 0.0100, '2', 21.5139, 351820.83140, 2020739.61900, '51', 18.27274571, '18° 16\' 21.884550\"', 121.59695250, '121° 35\' 49.029080\"', 25.7715, 2021050.34700, 563121.02700, '3', 351685.58500, 2020809.33300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
