(758, 'CGY-3986', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'APARRI', 'BUKIG', 2007, 18.30990457, '18° 18\' 35.656452\"', 121.60551110, '121° 36\' 19.839960\"', 'CGY-3986 From the junction of Brgy. Bangag, travel E for about 5 Km. to reach Brgy. Bukig, which is about 315 m from brgy. hall of Aparri West Central School. Station is located at the N side of the flagpole of Aparri West Central School, approx. 310 m from CGY-3249. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3986, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.30992419, '18° 18\' 35.727100\"', 121.60552020, '121° 36\' 19.872580\"', 0.0100, '1', 53.2050, 0.0100, '2', 15.5216, 352624.98170, 2025038.39800, '51', 18.31164583, '18° 18\' 41.924980\"', 121.60424840, '121° 36\' 15.294300\"', 19.6344, 2025358.24400, 563878.25800, '3', 352489.86800, 2025108.11800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(759, 'CGY-4000', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ABULUG', 'CENTRO', 2007, 18.44184362, '18° 26\' 30.637032\"', 121.45740110, '121° 27\' 26.643960\"', 'CGY-4000 Station is located at the compound od Abulug Central Elem. School, at the triangular landscape of Ornamental Plants, about 15 m NW side of the principal\'s office, and approx. 20 m N of the Nat\'l Road centerline. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4000, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.44186481, '18° 26\' 30.713320\"', 121.45740890, '121° 27\' 26.672040\"', 0.0100, '1', 44.0830, 0.0100, '2', 7.1665, 337092.96230, 2039766.72700, '51', 18.44359734, '18° 26\' 36.950420\"', 121.45614000, '121° 27\' 22.103840\"', 11.3031, 2039916.61100, 548183.97100, '3', 336958.18200, 2039837.01000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(760, 'CGY-4003', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ABULUG', 'SANTO TOMAS', 2007, 18.45388080, '18° 27\' 13.970880\"', 121.40498730, '121° 24\' 17.954280\"', 'CGY-4003 Travel along Nat\'l Road going to NW direction passing Magapit Bridge, Logac junction, continue travel about 6 Km. to reach the marker of Dana-ili just after Brgy. Curva, turn right at the access road leading to Dana-ili, from Dana-ili marke a left turn at the intersection road leading to Brgy. Tayak after the lodging site at brgy. Dana-ili. The station is located at the flagpole of Tayak Elementary School. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4003, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.45390202, '18° 27\' 14.047270\"', 121.40499450, '121° 24\' 17.980210\"', 0.0100, '1', 40.3090, 0.0100, '2', 3.3873, 331568.28790, 2041146.92100, '51', 18.45563636, '18° 27\' 20.290880\"', 121.40372580, '121° 24\' 13.412710\"', 7.6942, 2041235.90100, 542644.19000, '3', 331433.51100, 2041217.37800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(761, 'CGY-4008', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANCHEZ-MIRA', 'CENTRO I', 2007, 18.55999519, '18° 33\' 35.982684\"', 121.23791050, '121° 14\' 16.477800\"', 'CGY-4008 Station is located at the solar drier, approx. 300 m away along the Nat\'l Road. Travel along Nat\'l Road going to NW direction passing Magapit Bridge, Logac junction, Allacapan, junction Lunha, Pamplona until you reach Sanchez Mira. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4008, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.56001755, '18° 33\' 36.063170\"', 121.23791690, '121° 14\' 16.500760\"', 0.0100, '1', 42.8720, 0.0100, '2', 6.4116, 314035.40860, 2053055.91800, '51', 18.56176161, '18° 33\' 42.341800\"', 121.23665030, '121° 14\' 11.941110\"', 11.0089, 2052950.16300, 524981.06400, '3', 313900.87000, 2053126.97900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(762, 'CGY-4111 (BLLM-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALCALA', 'CENTRO SUR', 2012, 17.90108476, '17° 54\' 3.905136\"', 121.65772070, '121° 39\' 27.794520\"', 'Mark is the head of 4\" brass rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"ALCALA,CAG., BLLM NO.3, CAD 1306-D, LMS, 2012\". The newly established Bureau of Land Location Monument is to be found in Brgy. Centro Sur, Municipality of Alcala, Province of Cagayan. The monument is along the northeast side of the intersection of barangay roads across the barangay chapel.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.90110201, '17° 54\' 3.967220\"', 121.65772930, '121° 39\' 27.825430\"', 0.0100, '1', 66.8920, 0.0100, '2', 28.6134, 357814.08060, 1979755.90700, '51', 17.90279824, '17° 54\' 10.073660\"', 121.65644820, '121° 39\' 23.213450\"', 31.8558, 1980127.66100, 569557.88900, '3', 357677.65800, 1979825.15700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(763, 'CGY-4119 (BLLM-11)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALCALA', 'CALANTAC', 2012, 17.90621919, '17° 54\' 22.389084\"', 121.72748170, '121° 43\' 38.934120\"', 'Mark is the head of 4\" brass rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"ALCALA,CAG., BLLM NO.11, CAD 1306-D, LMS, 2012\". The newly established Bureau of Land Location Monument is said to be found in Brgy. Calantac, Municipality of Alcala, Province of Cagayan. The monument is to be found along Alcala-Baggao Road, approximately 530 m. west of the Barangay Hall of Calantac.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.90623665, '17° 54\' 22.451940\"', 121.72749040, '121° 43\' 38.965550\"', 0.0100, '1', 56.5170, 0.0100, '2', 18.1897, 365208.73580, 1980272.24600, '51', 17.90793171, '17° 54\' 28.554160\"', 121.72620960, '121° 43\' 34.354410\"', 21.3303, 1980723.22900, 576947.96600, '3', 365072.38000, 1980341.28100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(764, 'CGY-4132 (BLLM-24)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALCALA', 'CABULUAN', 2012, 17.84330686, '17° 50\' 35.904696\"', 121.60778350, '121° 36\' 28.020600\"', 'Mark is the head of 4\" brass rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"ALCALA,CAG., BLLM NO.24, CAD 1306-D, LMS, 2012\". The newly established Bureau of Land Location Monument is said to be found in Brgy. Cabuluan, Municipality of Alcala, Province of Cagayan. The monument is to be found on the northeast corner of concrete pavement along the barangay road.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.84332364, '17° 50\' 35.965120\"', 121.60779180, '121° 36\' 28.050550\"', 0.0100, '1', 64.8300, 0.0100, '2', 26.4696, 352475.71080, 1973400.88900, '51', 17.84501748, '17° 50\' 42.062930\"', 121.60650930, '121° 36\' 23.433460\"', 29.7256, 1973714.98700, 564286.92500, '3', 352339.06200, 1973470.25200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(765, 'CGY-4135 (BLLM-27)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALCALA', 'AFUSING DAGA', 2012, 17.86147736, '17° 51\' 41.318496\"', 121.63100800, '121° 37\' 51.628800\"', 'CGY-4135 (BLLM-27) Mark is the head of 4\" brass rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"ALCALA,CAG., BLLM NO.27, CAD 1306-D, LMS, 2012\". The newly established Bureau of Land Location Monument is to be found in Brgy. Afusing Daga, Municipality of Alcala, Province of Cagayan. The monument is located along the barangay road going to Malalatan and near the boundary marker of Afusing Daga and Malalatan. (NOTE:nail was removed)', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.86149448, '17° 51\' 41.380140\"', 121.63101590, '121° 37\' 51.657210\"', 0.0100, '1', 53.6620, 0.0100, '2', 15.3479, 354951.75010, 1975393.50200, '51', 17.86318892, '17° 51\' 47.480100\"', 121.62973380, '121° 37\' 47.041760\"', 18.5609, 1975734.20800, 566741.91000, '3', 354815.17700, 1975462.80700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(766, 'CGY-4138 (BLLM-30)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALCALA', 'TAMBAN', 2012, 17.88963212, '17° 53\' 22.675632\"', 121.63546550, '121° 38\' 7.675800\"', 'CGY-4138 (BLLM-30) Mark is the head of 4\" brass rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"ALCALA,CAG., BLLM NO.30, CAD 1306-D, LMS, 2012\". The newly established Bureau of Land Location Monument is to be found in Brgy. Tamban, Municipality of Alcala, Province of Cagayan. The monument is along the barangay road located beside the \"Welcome to Zone 4\" marker.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.88964921, '17° 53\' 22.737170\"', 121.63547390, '121° 38\' 7.705880\"', 0.0100, '1', 54.8960, 0.0100, '2', 16.5887, 355446.93880, 1978505.65700, '51', 17.89134524, '17° 53\' 28.842850\"', 121.63419240, '121° 38\' 3.092810\"', 19.8758, 1978851.95400, 567203.88100, '3', 355310.46200, 1978574.96900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
