(789, 'CGY-4712 (BLLM-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'RIZAL', 'ANAGGUAN', 2012, 17.85652333, '17° 51\' 23.483988\"', 121.33951800, '121° 20\' 22.264800\"', 'CGY-4712 (BLLM-3) From Municipal Hall. travel along the road going to Brgy. Anagguan, it is located at the farm lot of Eddie Pagay. Station is marked on top with 8\" bronze rod centered on a 25x25cm conc. Blk. Protruding 20cm from the ground surface with inscriptions RZL. CGY.,BLLM No. 3, CAD. 1309-D, DENR 2012', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.85654000, '17° 51\' 23.544010\"', 121.33952460, '121° 20\' 22.288620\"', 0.0100, '1', 130.7770, 0.0100, '2', 90.8556, 324055.99200, 1975095.72200, '51', 17.85824031, '17° 51\' 29.665110\"', 121.33824200, '121° 20\' 17.671120\"', 96.3588, 1975106.49800, 535848.91700, '3', 323919.19400, 1975165.94200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
