(799, 'CGY-4831 (BLLM-10)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'IGUIG', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2012, 17.77154379, '17° 46\' 17.557644\"', 121.71375580, '121° 42\' 49.520880\"', 'CGY-4831 (BLLM-10) From the national road going to Aparri turn left after CIADP and travel approximately 2 km passing Brgy. Sta. Rosa at the last block of the road turn right then travel for 150 m to reach Brgy. San Isidro, then turn right at the first block before the brgy. hall, from the brgy. hall about 50 m turn left. The monument is located inside a private property along brgy. road going to Sa Vicente. Station mark is the head of a silver zinc rod set at the center of 25cm. x 25cm. x 130cm. monument with inscription \"IGUIG CGY, BLLM-10, CAD 1283-D, DENR 2012.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.77156017, '17° 46\' 17.616600\"', 121.71376500, '121° 42\' 49.553970\"', 0.0100, '1', 58.5820, 0.0100, '2', 20.0565, 363652.15700, 1965379.32300, '51', 17.77324745, '17° 46\' 23.690830\"', 121.71248100, '121° 42\' 44.931520\"', 22.9906, 1965811.55000, 575550.03800, '3', 363515.34900, 1965448.29800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
