(801, 'CGY-4843 (BLLM-23)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'IGUIG', 'CAMPO', 2012, 17.75295184, '17° 45\' 10.626624\"', 121.75941090, '121° 45\' 33.879240\"', 'CGY-4843 (BLLM-23) Travel the road going to the town hall to Brgy. Manaoag upon reaching the Manaoag Brgy. , take the left road then travel approximately 2 km to reach the brgy. proper of Campo. The monument is located 150 m north of the brgy. hall and basketball court near the municipal housing project. Station mark is the head of a silver zinc rod set at the center of 25cm x 25cm x 130cm monument with inscription \"IGUIG CGY, BLLM-23, CAD 1283-D, DENR 2012.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.75296836, '17° 45\' 10.686090\"', 121.75942000, '121° 45\' 33.911900\"', 0.0100, '1', 83.9000, 0.0100, '2', 45.1224, 368478.87090, 1963289.47000, '51', 17.75465355, '17° 45\' 16.752780\"', 121.75813560, '121° 45\' 29.288200\"', 48.1389, 1963772.65200, 580399.69500, '3', 368342.03600, 1963358.28600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(802, 'CGY-4858 (BLLM-39)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'IGUIG', 'MALABBAC', 2012, 17.71761852, '17° 43\' 3.426672\"', 121.74035380, '121° 44\' 25.273680\"', 'CGY-4858 (BLLM-39) The station is located at Barangay Malabbac, Iguig, Cagayan infront of Malabbac Elementary School about 5 meters before the entrance gate. Station mark is the head of a silver zinc rod set at the center of 25cm x 25cm x 130cm monument with inscription \"IGUIG CGY, BLLM-39, CAD 1283-D, DENR 2012.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.71763453, '17° 43\' 3.484300\"', 121.74036290, '121° 44\' 25.306480\"', 0.0100, '1', 65.6470, 0.0100, '2', 26.8740, 366432.06710, 1959393.04900, '51', 17.71931801, '17° 43\' 9.544820\"', 121.73907770, '121° 44\' 20.679700\"', 29.8171, 1959853.89000, 578393.89400, '3', 366295.10100, 1959461.89800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(803, 'CGY-4863 (BLLM-45)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'IGUIG', 'NATTANZAN', 2012, 17.74295738, '17° 44\' 34.646568\"', 121.73596450, '121° 44\' 9.472200\"', 'CGY-4863 (BLLM-45) From the national road going to Aparri turn left after the Brgy. Arc boundary marker and center the covered gym travel the road west for approximately 150m to the double basketball court . The monument is located north of the basketball court left side of the DAR stone tablet. Station mark is the head of a silver zinc rod set at the center of 25cm. x 25cm. x 130cm. monument with inscription \"IGUIG CGY, BLLM-45, CAD 1283-D, DENR 2012.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.74297382, '17° 44\' 34.705750\"', 121.73597350, '121° 44\' 9.504670\"', 0.0100, '1', 57.6200, 0.0100, '2', 18.9291, 365985.40930, 1962200.09200, '51', 17.74465892, '17° 44\' 40.772100\"', 121.73468890, '121° 44\' 4.879970\"', 21.8827, 1962656.63100, 577917.39800, '3', 365848.52300, 1962268.97500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
