(804, 'CGY-5003 (BBM-13)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUAO', 'MUNGO', 2013, 17.73133307, '17° 43\' 52.799052\"', 121.45716340, '121° 27\' 25.788240\"', 'CGY-5003 (BBM-13) STATION MARK: Mark is the head of brass rod, set at the center of 20x20x120 cm monument with side markings and top markings of BBM NO.13,Pb-02-0141. ACCESS: From Tuao West Municipal Hall, travel southward along national road until reaching the welcome marker of Barangay Bagumbayan then turn left. Monument is located at the third intersection road about 200 meters southwest of Centro 2 Barangay Hall.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.73134900, '17° 43\' 52.856390\"', 121.45717060, '121° 27\' 25.814310\"', 0.0100, '1', 77.5230, 0.0100, '2', 38.5052, 336410.29030, 1961134.35300, '51', 17.73303932, '17° 43\' 58.941560\"', 121.45588530, '121° 27\' 21.187010\"', 42.4169, 1961277.06900, 548351.34400, '3', 336273.16300, 1961204.10700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(805, 'CGY-5028 (BBM-38)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUAO', 'BUGNAY', 2013, 17.68101322, '17° 40\' 51.647592\"', 121.55532460, '121° 33\' 19.168560\"', 'CGY-5028 (BBM-38) STATION MARK: Mark is the head of brass rod, set at the center of 20x20x120 cm monument with side markings and top markings of BBM NO.38, Pb-02-0141. ACCESS: From Tuguegarao City, travel northwestward along national road until reaching the junction of Palca of Tuao then turn left and move southward until reaching the welcome marker of Barangay Villa Laida then turn left and move eastward. Monument is established at the foot of the hill.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.68102864, '17° 40\' 51.703120\"', 121.55533230, '121° 33\' 19.196420\"', 0.0100, '1', 121.5500, 0.0100, '2', 82.9688, 346777.75760, 1955483.14400, '51', 17.68271385, '17° 40\' 57.769850\"', 121.55404600, '121° 33\' 14.565530\"', 86.0458, 1955735.50400, 558778.92400, '3', 346640.53700, 1955552.54700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(806, 'CGY-5059 (BBM-69)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUAO', 'MALUMMIN', 2013, 17.67314271, '17° 40\' 23.313756\"', 121.47962360, '121° 28\' 46.644960\"', 'CGY-5059 (BBM-69) STATION MARK: Mark is the head of brass rod, set at the center of 20x20x120 cm monument with side markings and top markings of BBM NO. 69, Pb-02-0141. ACCESS: From junction Palca of Tuao, the main entry to Tuao East Proper, travel southwestward along national road and route barangay of Villa Laida, Dagupan Palca and Angang. Upon reaching the bridge connecting Angang and Malummin, continue travelling westwardly about 1 kilometer. The station is established 20 meters near the welcome marker of Barangay San Luis.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.67315859, '17° 40\' 23.370920\"', 121.47963150, '121° 28\' 46.673220\"', 0.0100, '1', 80.9150, 0.0100, '2', 41.9841, 338740.35140, 1954675.33100, '51', 17.67484494, '17° 40\' 29.441790\"', 121.47834480, '121° 28\' 42.041190\"', 45.5670, 1954842.68600, 550749.80100, '3', 338603.04800, 1954744.96900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(807, 'CGY-5083 (BBM-93)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUAO', 'CULUNG', 2013, 17.67215890, '17° 40\' 19.772040\"', 121.50870100, '121° 30\' 31.323600\"', 'CGY-5083 (BBM-93) STATION MARK: Mark is the head of brass rod, set at the center of 20x20x120 cm monument with side markings and top markings of BBM NO.93, Pb-02-0141. ACCESS: From Tuguegarao City of junction at Palca of Tuao, the main entry to Tuao East proper, turn left along the national road in a southwestward direction until reaching Tuao East Public market at about 4.5 kilometers. Station established 500 meters south of the market and 2 meters at a corner of road going to Naruangan proper and to extreme south barangay of Tuao East.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.67217444, '17° 40\' 19.827990\"', 121.50870870, '121° 30\' 31.351460\"', 0.0100, '1', 82.1200, 0.0100, '2', 43.3536, 341824.18470, 1954541.80400, '51', 17.67386012, '17° 40\' 25.896420\"', 121.50742210, '121° 30\' 26.719520\"', 46.6990, 1954741.75400, 553835.10400, '3', 341686.89900, 1954611.34900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(808, 'CGY-58', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'UBONG', 2007, 17.60599168, '17° 36\' 21.570048\"', 121.60844410, '121° 36\' 30.398760\"', 'CGY-58 Station is located 15 m. E of the junction of the road leading to Brgy. Ubong and the road leading to Brgy. Karilukud. It is situated 10 m. SE of Brgy. Ubong welcome monument. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-58 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.60600702, '17° 36\' 21.625260\"', 121.60845230, '121° 36\' 30.428180\"', 0.0100, '1', 74.9540, 0.0100, '2', 36.2679, 352351.49000, 1947138.96500, '51', 17.60768659, '17° 36\' 27.671710\"', 121.60716430, '121° 36\' 25.791300\"', 39.0803, 1947449.58300, 564441.09800, '3', 352214.06000, 1947208.14400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(809, 'CGY-59', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUAO', 'TARIBUBU', 2007, 17.60439802, '17° 36\' 15.832872\"', 121.50926630, '121° 30\' 33.358680\"', 'CGY-59 Is located inside the compound of Taribubu Elem. School. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-59 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.60441375, '17° 36\' 15.889510\"', 121.50927410, '121° 30\' 33.386720\"', 0.0100, '1', 108.2810, 0.0100, '2', 69.3534, 341825.03050, 1947042.74200, '51', 17.60609533, '17° 36\' 21.943200\"', 121.50798590, '121° 30\' 28.749150\"', 72.6403, 1947242.49300, 553915.07000, '3', 341687.52200, 1947112.23200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(810, 'CGY-61', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'MAGUIRIG', 2007, 17.68549901, '17° 41\' 7.796436\"', 121.64483650, '121° 38\' 41.411400\"', 'CGY-61 From Tuguegarao, cross Cagayan River via Buntun Bridge and turn right at the junction leading to the Mun. of Solana. Upon reaching another junction, turn left and follow the road until a junction leading to Brgy. Maguirig is reached. Turn right and travel for about 2 km. to reach Brgy. Pacu. Station is located inside the property of a certain Judge Lasam, about 30 m. from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-61 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.68551449, '17° 41\' 7.852170\"', 121.64484410, '121° 38\' 41.438750\"', 0.0100, '1', 67.8090, 0.0100, '2', 29.2544, 356276.49270, 1955909.06300, '51', 17.68719807, '17° 41\' 13.913060\"', 121.64355800, '121° 38\' 36.808720\"', 32.1044, 1956261.92600, 568273.89400, '3', 356139.35100, 1955978.18900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(811, 'CGY-65', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'BAUAN WEST', 2007, 17.72108250, '17° 43\' 15.897000\"', 121.67841480, '121° 40\' 42.293280\"', 'CGY-65 Brg. Bauan West is accessible via the provincial road, about 10 km. from Solana Centro heading N past Brgys. Natapian, Lanna, Bangag and Bauan East. Station is located inside the lot of Mr. Averer Baliuag, about 60 m. SE of a house owned by Mr. Leo Bambalan. Monumentation is witnessed by both the lot owner and Bauan West Brgy. Capt. Joseph Frogoso. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding about 20 cm. above the ground, with inscriptions \"CGY-65 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.72109843, '17° 43\' 15.954330\"', 121.67842330, '121° 40\' 42.323860\"', 0.0100, '1', 57.3290, 0.0100, '2', 18.7824, 359865.94400, 1959821.39100, '51', 17.72278343, '17° 43\' 22.020360\"', 121.67713810, '121° 40\' 37.696990\"', 21.6589, 1960212.70200, 571822.32000, '3', 359728.94400, 1959890.43800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(812, 'CGY-71', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PEÑABLANCA', 'NANGUILATTAN', 2007, 17.79726498, '17° 47\' 50.153928\"', 121.83635730, '121° 50\' 10.886280\"', 'CGY-71 The station is located 10 meters Northeast of the intersection of the national road and barangay road leading to Baranagy Bitag Pequeño. It is approximately 1 meter from the Barangay Marker and waiting shed. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-71 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.79727997, '17° 47\' 50.207880\"', 121.83636750, '121° 50\' 10.922880\"', 0.0100, '1', 140.4590, 0.0100, '2', 101.4299, 376667.87800, 1968140.44900, '51', 17.79896617, '17° 47\' 56.278200\"', 121.83508430, '121° 50\' 6.303390\"', 104.6571, 1968711.59800, 588538.66800, '3', 376531.24600, 1968209.05500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(813, 'CGY-7626', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PIAT', 'AQUIB', 2012, 17.81000825, '17° 48\' 36.029700\"', 121.48145230, '121° 28\' 53.228280\"', 'CGY-7626 ACCESS: From Poblacion Piat, the station is located at Barangay Aquib approximately 2 km. It is located to the NE of a farm lot on the left side of the road and a trail. STATION MARK: The station is marked by a 0.004 ø m x 0.10 m copper nail centered and flushed in a 0.30 m x 0.30 m concrete block, set 0.20 m above the ground with inscription CGY 7626, 2012 NAMRIA, 3RD ORDER, LMS 2.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.81002478, '17° 48\' 36.089190\"', 121.48146000, '121° 28\' 53.255980\"', 0.0100, '1', 64.3990, 0.0100, '2', 25.5151, 339056.69020, 1969820.07200, '51', 17.81171930, '17° 48\' 42.189490\"', 121.48017650, '121° 28\' 48.635370\"', 29.4894, 1969990.95600, 550905.45100, '3', 338919.84000, 1969889.80900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(814, 'CGY-7644 (CGY-66)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PIAT', 'WARAT', 2012, 17.71390300, '17° 42\' 50.050800\"', 121.58188010, '121° 34\' 54.768360\"', 'CGY-7644 ACCESS: The station is located in Barangay Warat, Piat, Cagayan approximately 30 m S Barangay Hall and at the western center part of the multi-purpose pavement along G. Cusipag St. STATION MARK: The station is marked by a 0.004 ø m x 0.10 m copper nail centered and flushed in a 0.30 m x 0.30 m concrete block, set 0.20 m above the ground with inscription CGY 7644, 2012 NAMRIA, 3RD ORDER, LMS 2.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.71391889, '17° 42\' 50.108010\"', 121.58188800, '121° 34\' 54.796840\"', 0.0100, '1', 85.7030, 0.0100, '2', 47.2232, 349622.13400, 1959101.41700, '51', 17.71560551, '17° 42\' 56.179850\"', 121.58060250, '121° 34\' 50.168820\"', 50.2413, 1959384.10400, 561585.17200, '3', 349485.04000, 1959170.76200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(815, 'CGY-7745', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANTO NIÑO', 'MASICAL', 2012, 17.83627513, '17° 50\' 10.590468\"', 121.56978530, '121° 34\' 11.227080\"', 'CGY-7745 The station is located in brgy. Masical,Sto Niño Cagayan. It is located along Provincial Road , 2.5 m from the electric post, and 25m from the creek or bridge. The station is marked by a 0.004m x 0.10m Brass Rod centered in 0.30m x 0.30m x 1.20m concrete block, set 0.20 on the ground, with inscriptions \"CGY 7745, 2012, 3RD ORDER, LMS 2\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.83629206, '17° 50\' 10.651400\"', 121.56979340, '121° 34\' 11.256140\"', 0.0100, '1', 62.6100, 0.0100, '2', 24.1488, 348442.60720, 1972653.15500, '51', 17.83798628, '17° 50\' 16.750610\"', 121.56851060, '121° 34\' 6.638240\"', 27.5738, 1972924.17600, 560261.51100, '3', 348305.90800, 1972722.63300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(816, 'CGY-7748', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANTO NIÑO', 'TABANG', 2012, 17.81788434, '17° 49\' 4.383624\"', 121.55208600, '121° 33\' 7.509600\"', 'CGY-7748 The station is located along brgy Tabang, Sto Niño, Cagayan. It is located along Provincial Road, 20m from the chapel. The station is marked by a 0.004m x 0.10m Brass Rod centered in 0.30m x 0.30m x 1.20m concrete block, set 0.20 on the ground, with inscriptions \"CGY 7748, 2012, 3RD ORDER, LMS 2\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.50, 17.81790107, '17° 49\' 4.443860\"', 121.55209380, '121° 33\' 7.537590\"', 0.0100, '1', 63.0990, 0.0100, '2', 24.5787, 346550.92730, 1970632.38700, '51', 17.81959457, '17° 49\' 10.540460\"', 121.55081060, '121° 33\' 2.918050\"', 28.0456, 1970883.12900, 558391.26800, '3', 346414.15400, 1970701.90800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(817, 'CGY-7996', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'BINAG', 2012, 18.18394677, '18° 11\' 2.208372\"', 121.69002980, '121° 41\' 24.107280\"', 'CGY-7996 Is located near the waiting shed beside the brgy. road. Is a Quadrilateral concrete monument 25cmx25cm top and 35cmx35cm at bottom with variable depth (100cm) and 20cm above the ground inscribe name \"CGY 7996, 2012, LMS-2 and copper nail embedded in the center.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.18396523, '18° 11\' 2.274830\"', 121.69003930, '121° 41\' 24.141320\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.6160, 0.0200, '2', 9.4947, 361458.84280, 2011033.23200, '51', 18.18567763, '18° 11\' 8.439460\"', 121.68876470, '121° 41\' 19.553070\"', 13.4281, 2011447.97300, 572865.73100, '3', 361323.37400, 2011102.59400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
