(819, 'CGY-8022', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'FABRICA', 2012, 18.20334038, '18° 12\' 12.025368\"', 121.64546360, '121° 38\' 43.668960\"', 'CGY-8022 Is located inside the brgy. nursery at the northern portion. Is a Quadrilateral concrete monument 25cmx25cm top and 35cmx35cm at bottom with variable depth (100cm) and 20cm above the ground inscribe name \"CGY 8022, 2012, LMS-2 and copper nail embedded in the center', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.20335917, '18° 12\' 12.093010\"', 121.64547310, '121° 38\' 43.703310\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.9670, 0.0200, '2', 8.8395, 356760.68500, 2013213.64400, '51', 18.20507366, '18° 12\' 18.265170\"', 121.64419900, '121° 38\' 39.116410\"', 12.9496, 2013577.54800, 568143.33300, '3', 356625.24800, 2013283.16000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(820, 'CGY-8179', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BALLESTEROS', 'PAYAGAN EAST', 2012, 18.35644811, '18° 21\' 23.213196\"', 121.54599310, '121° 32\' 45.575160\"', 'CGY-8179 The monument is located infront of the house of Brgy. Captain Giovanni Quiambao. The monument is marked of a 4\" copper nail flush in a conc. mon. 25 x 25 x 100 block embaded on the ground with inscription of CGY-8179 2012 3rd order LMS-02', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.35646986, '18° 21\' 23.291480\"', 121.54600360, '121° 32\' 45.612910\"', 0.0100, '1', 41.8590, 0.0100, '2', 4.3775, 346375.05450, 2030238.68500, '51', 18.35819549, '18° 21\' 29.503770\"', 121.54473280, '121° 32\' 41.038140\"', 8.5845, 2030490.39500, 557570.98200, '3', 346240.05300, 2030308.62700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(821, 'CGY-8198', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BALLESTEROS', 'CABARITAN WEST', 2012, 18.42405373, '18° 25\' 26.593428\"', 121.48733000, '121° 29\' 14.388000\"', 'CGY-8198 The monument is located near the Brgy. Boundary Marker of Cabaritan West & East along the Provincial Road. The monument is marked of a 4\" copper nail flush in a conc. mon. 25 x 25 x 100 block embaded on the ground with inscription of \"CGY-8198 2012 3rd Order LMS-02.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.42407324, '18° 25\' 26.663680\"', 121.48733730, '121° 29\' 14.414280\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.2130, 0.0100, '2', 8.1832, 340237.74050, 2037771.02600, '51', 18.42580410, '18° 25\' 32.894750\"', 121.48606800, '121° 29\' 9.844780\"', 12.3026, 2037955.52800, 551350.73800, '3', 340102.92200, 2037841.20200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(822, 'CGY-93', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'DAGUPAN', 2007, 18.18255855, '18° 10\' 57.210780\"', 121.75492880, '121° 45\' 17.743680\"', 'CGY-93 From Aparri Proper, travel for about 30 km. S until reaching the junction at Brgy. Magapit, Lal-lo. Turn left/E and travel for about 12 km. leading to Brgy. Dagupan. Station is located on the SE corner of the basketball court, across Dagupan Brgy. Hall. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-93 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.58, 18.18257475, '18° 10\' 57.269100\"', 121.75493470, '121° 45\' 17.765070\"', 0.0100, '1', 59.9040, 0.0100, '2', 21.7642, 368322.03030, 2010831.59200, '51', 18.18428569, '18° 11\' 3.428490\"', 121.75366030, '121° 45\' 13.177110\"', 25.5563, 2011320.88900, 579732.09600, '3', 368186.60300, 2010900.74800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(823, 'LUN-179', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'LUNA', 'CANTORIA NO. 4', 2004, 16.84473022, '16° 50\' 41.028792\"', 120.41758260, '120° 25\' 3.297360\"', 'LUN-179 (FNSP-DENR) From Candon City, Ilocos Sur, travel S to the province of La Union until reaching Km. Post No. 302 on the left side of the highway on the town of Balaoan. It is about 2 m. SE of Km. Post No. 302, after passing through a concrete culvert with the sign DPWH Km. 302 + 033 marker on the left side of the highway, near an irrigation canal. It is about 7 m. from the highway centerline. Mark is the head of a 3 in. CW nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 10 cm., with inscriptions \"LUN-179, 2004, PRS-92, FNSP-DENR\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.84473936, '16° 50\' 41.061680\"', 120.41758470, '120° 25\' 3.305020\"', 0.0100, '1', 48.7480, 0.0100, '2', 9.2392, 224815.96840, 1864177.39800, '51', 16.84639833, '16° 50\' 47.033990\"', 120.41627720, '120° 24\' 58.598050\"', 13.3281, 1863193.80100, 437792.72300, '3', 224675.10500, 1864249.78900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(824, 'LUN-195', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BANGAR', 'BANGAOILAN WEST', 2005, 16.89735416, '16° 53\' 50.474976\"', 120.43960600, '120° 26\' 22.581600\"', 'LUN-195 (FNSP-DENR) Is in Brgy. Bangaoilan West, Bangar. Station is reached by taking the concrete farm road on the right side of the highway going to Candon City, Ilocos Sur, with the brgy. hall, basketball court and chapel on the corner, before reaching Bangaoilan East Elem. School on the left side. Then turn right and travel for about 100 m. Station is located on the right side of the road, beside an irrigation canal, near a concrete walk connecting the road and the irrigation dike. It is about 30 m. SW of a concrete walk bridge just before reaching a road curve. Mark is the head of a 3 in. roofing nail embbedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"LUN-195 2005 PRS-92 FNSP-DENR\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.89736374, '16° 53\' 50.509470\"', 120.43960840, '120° 26\' 22.590100\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.6850, 0.0100, '2', 13.1564, 227239.75080, 1869973.20700, '51', 16.89902545, '16° 53\' 56.491620\"', 120.43830210, '120° 26\' 17.887650\"', 17.3762, 1869010.75800, 440156.54900, '3', 227099.08200, 1870045.56800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(825, 'LUN-3005 (REG-I)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SANTO TOMAS', 'BAIL', 2007, 16.26906695, '16° 16\' 8.641020\"', 120.41964840, '120° 25\' 10.734240\"', 'LUN-3005 Is located in frotnt of Iglesia ni Cristo beside the entrance gate at Bail Sto. Tomas La Union. Mark in the head of a 3 inches concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription LUN-3005 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.26885110, '16° 16\' 7.863960\"', 120.41959640, '120° 25\' 10.547190\"', 0.0100, '1', 72.8140, 0.0200, '2', 31.2447, 224211.62070, 1800415.18400, '51', 16.27047462, '16° 16\' 13.708640\"', 120.41827550, '120° 25\' 5.791860\"', 35.6141, 1799462.75900, 437821.27400, '3', 224068.82200, 1800487.09600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(826, 'LUN-3005', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'ALMEIDA', 2007, 16.80863819, '16° 48\' 31.097484\"', 120.33190970, '120° 19\' 54.874920\"', 'LUN-3005 From Bacnotan municipal hall, travel along the highway going to Laoag, Ilocos Norte to reach Brgy. Bitalag. Turn left at the road crossing. Upon reaching the end of the road, turn right to reach the boundary bridge of Brgys. Paraoir and Almeida. Continue travelling for about 80 m then turn left at the road going to Almeida Elementary School. Station is located inside the flower box (where the Rizal monument is situated), about 1.3 m W of the said monument and 8 m S of the flagpole. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered and emebedded on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete monument with inscriptions LUN-3005 2007 NAMRIA.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.80864697, '16° 48\' 31.129090\"', 120.33190940, '120° 19\' 54.873780\"', 0.0100, '1', 42.9250, 0.0100, '2', 4.2122, 215626.99190, 1860302.49200, '51', 16.81030559, '16° 48\' 37.100140\"', 120.33060090, '120° 19\' 50.163380\"', 7.5995, 1859228.63900, 428648.37300, '3', 215485.94200, 1860375.13300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
