(831, 'LUN-3011', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'TUBAO', 'GARCIA', 2007, 16.35432168, '16° 21\' 15.558048\"', 120.40956220, '120° 24\' 34.423920\"', 'LUN-3011 Is located at the back of Barangay hall of barangay Garcia, Tubao, La Union. It is on top of a dike. Mark in the head of a 3 inches concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription LUN-3011 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.35426977, '16° 21\' 15.371180\"', 120.40967730, '120° 24\' 34.838190\"', 0.0100, '1', 63.4710, 0.0100, '2', 21.8729, 223271.03250, 1809885.60800, '51', 16.35589880, '16° 21\' 21.235670\"', 120.40835830, '120° 24\' 30.090000\"', 26.5559, 1808918.43900, 436788.64300, '3', 223128.51300, 1809957.62400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(832, 'LUN-3016', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'ROSARIO', 'GUMOT-NAGCOLARAN', 2007, 16.21001011, '16° 12\' 36.036396\"', 120.44257040, '120° 26\' 33.253440\"', 'LUN-3016 Is situated at Barangay Gumot, Rosario, La Union. It is erected in front of Gumot Elementary School & calonge store. Mark in the head of a 3 inches concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription LUN-3016 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.21001574, '16° 12\' 36.056650\"', 120.44257240, '120° 26\' 33.260760\"', 0.0100, '1', 80.3000, 0.0200, '2', 38.7008, 226587.27790, 1793870.60600, '51', 16.21163511, '16° 12\' 41.886390\"', 120.44125020, '120° 26\' 28.500590\"', 42.8654, 1792945.08300, 440259.27100, '3', 226444.29900, 1793942.39400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(833, 'LUN-3021', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SUDIPEN', 'POBLACION', 2007, 16.90683609, '16° 54\' 24.609924\"', 120.46455510, '120° 27\' 52.398360\"', 'LUN-3021 Is situated at Poblacion, Sudipen, La Union. The station is located at the junction of national hi-way & provincial road going Alilem. It is approximately 10 m west of the welcome arc of Barangay Ipet, Sudipen, La Union. Mark in the head of a 3 inches concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription LUN-3021 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.90684552, '16° 54\' 24.643870\"', 120.46455640, '120° 27\' 52.403180\"', 0.0100, '1', 62.0550, 0.0100, '2', 22.2112, 229912.46020, 1870988.58400, '51', 16.90850727, '16° 54\' 30.626160\"', 120.46325050, '120° 27\' 47.701650\"', 26.7156, 1870052.61600, 442817.47600, '3', 229771.84200, 1871060.87200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
