(844, 'LUN-3084', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BURGOS', 'BILIS', 2009, 16.50658688, '16° 30\' 23.712768\"', 120.47005950, '120° 28\' 12.214200\"', 'LUN-3084 It is established along southern part of national road going to Baguio City approximately 30 meters from Benguet Highway boundary marker and 30 meters. Also from the welcome arc of Burgos, La Union and beside Ashley Pure Purified Station. Mark in the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; LUN - 3084 PRS - 92 DENR - FNSP R-1', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.50659339, '16° 30\' 23.736210\"', 120.47006040, '120° 28\' 12.217360\"', 0.0100, '1', 479.5910, 0.0100, '2', 437.4483, 229936.22480, 1826668.11800, '51', 16.50823039, '16° 30\' 29.629420\"', 120.46874520, '120° 28\' 7.482580\"', 442.9976, 1825756.97800, 443284.78800, '3', 229794.27400, 1826740.05200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(845, 'LUN-3088', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BURGOS', 'NEW POBLACION', 2009, 16.52371162, '16° 31\' 25.361832\"', 120.45439080, '120° 27\' 15.806880\"', 'LUN-3088 It is established inside lot of Mr. Lomboy beside Burgos National High School around 50 meters from boundary Burgos National High School around 50 meters from BLLM no. 1. Mark in the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm., with the inscription; LUN - 3088 PRS - 92 DENR - FNSP R-1', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.52371806, '16° 31\' 25.385030\"', 120.45439220, '120° 27\' 15.811940\"', 0.0100, '1', 344.2870, 0.0100, '2', 302.3957, 228286.72720, 1828585.09800, '51', 16.52535649, '16° 31\' 31.283380\"', 120.45307730, '120° 27\' 11.078420\"', 307.7841, 1827656.56800, 441617.23800, '3', 228144.81900, 1828657.10100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(846, 'LUN-3111', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SANTOL', 'POBLACION', 2008, 16.77011892, '16° 46\' 12.428112\"', 120.46463010, '120° 27\' 52.668360\"', 'LUN-3111 From the municipal hall of Santol travel SE going to Brgy. Poblacion Este. It takes 5 minutes to reach the station. The mark is located at the SE edge of the western part of the basketball court. It is approximately 6 m SW of the basketball field goal. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription LUN-3111, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.77012623, '16° 46\' 12.454420\"', 120.46463230, '120° 27\' 52.676210\"', 0.0100, '1', 112.0900, 0.0100, '2', 71.5154, 229726.38830, 1855851.73500, '51', 16.77177961, '16° 46\' 18.406610\"', 120.46332310, '120° 27\' 47.963260\"', 76.3244, 1854922.30900, 442784.16000, '3', 229585.31200, 1855923.91200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(847, 'LUN-3112', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SANTOL', 'CORROOY', 2008, 16.79642998, '16° 47\' 47.147928\"', 120.45143960, '120° 27\' 5.182560\"', 'LUN-3112 From Balaoan municipal hall travel E going to Municipality of Santol. It takes 10 minutes to reach Brgy. Corro-oy (Sitio Killo). The mark is located at the northern side of the waiting shed 2 m away. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription LUN-3112, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.79643845, '16° 47\' 47.178410\"', 120.45144140, '120° 27\' 5.188930\"', 0.0100, '1', 90.0470, 0.0100, '2', 49.8116, 228356.88430, 1858782.90100, '51', 16.79809373, '16° 47\' 53.137430\"', 120.45013280, '120° 27\' 0.478100\"', 54.3950, 1857838.06700, 441385.95600, '3', 228215.88600, 1858855.14300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(848, 'LUN-3127 (BBM-4)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BACNOTAN', 'BACQUI', 2008, 16.74569380, '16° 44\' 44.497680\"', 120.37324590, '120° 22\' 23.685240\"', 'LUN-3127 (BBM-4) The station is located beside the Welcome Arc of Barangay Bacqui along national road going to Municipality of Balaoan, boundary of Barangays Bacqui, Pangpang and Sta. Rita. Station mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm. x 30cm. x 100 cm. standard concrete monument protruding about 20cm. with inscription \"BBM No. 4\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.74570146, '16° 44\' 44.525270\"', 120.37324730, '120° 22\' 23.690350\"', 0.0100, '1', 57.3490, 0.0100, '2', 17.6894, 219943.22720, 1853274.20600, '51', 16.74735535, '16° 44\' 50.479250\"', 120.37193750, '120° 22\' 18.974870\"', 21.7281, 1852248.08100, 433032.56500, '3', 219801.99700, 1853346.66100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(849, 'LUN-3130 (BLLM-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BACNOTAN', 'QUIRINO', 2008, 16.76400207, '16° 45\' 50.407452\"', 120.33953970, '120° 20\' 22.342920\"', 'LUN-3130 (BLLM-3) The station is located at Barangay Quirino Day Care Center and east of Barangay Hall. Station mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm. x 30cm. x 100 cm. standard concrete monument protruding about 20cm. with inscription \"LUN-3130 (BLLM-3); 2008; DENR/LMS I.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.76401104, '16° 45\' 50.439740\"', 120.33953940, '120° 20\' 22.341960\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.9510, 0.0100, '2', 6.8066, 216374.39130, 1855349.32800, '51', 16.76566677, '16° 45\' 56.400380\"', 120.33823000, '120° 20\' 17.627850\"', 10.4683, 1854286.10400, 429445.10500, '3', 216233.19600, 1855421.90700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(850, 'LUN-3204', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'TUBAO', 'LEONES EAST', 2007, 16.36248686, '16° 21\' 44.952696\"', 120.39665640, '120° 23\' 47.963040\"', 'LUN-3204 From Tubao Proper, travel for about 2.9 km. until reaching Brgy. Leones East. Station is located 120 m. SW of Leones East Brgy. Hall, about 4 m. W of a box culvert and about 3.5 m. away from the brgy. road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 100 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"LUN-3204 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.42, 16.36243771, '16° 21\' 44.775750\"', 120.39663840, '120° 23\' 47.898300\"', 0.0100, '1', 69.6080, 0.0100, '2', 28.1099, 221888.83770, 1810807.72000, '51', 16.36406752, '16° 21\' 50.643070\"', 120.39531970, '120° 23\' 43.150740\"', 32.7494, 1809826.45300, 435398.22600, '3', 221746.33500, 1810879.78500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
