(900, 'PNG-3151', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA BARBARA', 'BALINGUEO', 2008, 15.96902176, '15° 58\' 8.478336\"', 120.45242290, '120° 27\' 8.722440\"', 'PNG-3151 The station is located approximately 15m N of a waiting shed under an acacia tree with an electric post beside it at a barangay road going to Brgy. Coblong. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm, with inscription \"PNG-3151 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.96902394, '15° 58\' 8.486200\"', 120.45242850, '120° 27\' 8.742540\"', 0.0100, '1', 54.4300, 0.0100, '2', 12.5457, 227312.58800, 1767177.62700, '51', 15.97062812, '15° 58\' 14.261220\"', 120.45110060, '120° 27\' 3.962080\"', 16.2420, 1766274.26300, 441241.67800, '3', 227168.80700, 1767249.17900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(901, 'PNG-3152', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA BARBARA', 'SAPANG', 2008, 15.98725216, '15° 59\' 14.107776\"', 120.40571520, '120° 24\' 20.574720\"', 'PNG-3152 The station is located along the national highway going to the Municipality of Malasique, beside the boundary marker of Brgy. Sapang and Brgy. Maronong, and approximately 10m S of BBM 4. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20cm, with inscription \"PNG-3152 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.98725241, '15° 59\' 14.108690\"', 120.40571890, '120° 24\' 20.588060\"', 0.0100, '1', 49.9230, 0.0100, '2', 7.8416, 222335.15740, 1769257.52000, '51', 15.98885875, '15° 59\' 19.891490\"', 120.40439140, '120° 24\' 15.808910\"', 11.9031, 1768305.25900, 436247.19800, '3', 222191.39900, 1769329.23900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(902, 'PNG-3162', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'SIOASIO WEST', 2008, 16.04340779, '16° 2\' 36.268044\"', 120.03716090, '120° 2\' 13.779240\"', 'PNG-3162 From Sual town proper go NW, follow the national road until you reach the signboard marked with to Sioasio, located at the left shoulder of the road, about 30 to 40 minutes traveling uphill with a rocky road for any kind of vehicle to reach Siaosio west, the mark is located between a waiting shed and electric post. The waiting shed is at the left side of the road. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3162, PRS-92, 2008 DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.04341065, '16° 2\' 36.278340\"', 120.03716170, '120° 2\' 13.782100\"', 0.0100, '1', 121.8750, 0.0100, '2', 79.5139, 182949.27140, 1776004.20700, '51', 16.04502854, '16° 2\' 42.102740\"', 120.03583500, '120° 2\' 9.006080\"', 84.9177, 1774668.96900, 396823.92700, '3', 182805.40400, 1776077.17600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(903, 'PNG-3172', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LABRADOR', 'TOBUAN', 2008, 16.05558452, '16° 3\' 20.104272\"', 120.10984250, '120° 6\' 35.433000\"', 'From Sual route to Labrador until you reach barangay Tuboan, turn right to the road before the Tuboan Elem. School. About 100 meters from the national road, the mark is located at the east of the road. From electric post 2.22 meters SW of the post. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3172, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.05558765, '16° 3\' 20.115530\"', 120.10984330, '120° 6\' 35.435890\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.8550, 0.0100, '2', 4.2816, 190751.38550, 1777242.66200, '51', 16.05720472, '16° 3\' 25.936990\"', 120.10851700, '120° 6\' 30.661160\"', 9.7583, 1775981.55500, 404608.03800, '3', 190607.61700, 1777315.40600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(904, 'PNG-3195', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'LAOAG', 2008, 15.86964823, '15° 52\' 10.733628\"', 120.24268030, '120° 14\' 33.649080\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel northward until you reach the barangay Cabugay municipality of Aguilar. The mark is located at Cabugay bridge about 4 m from the North side edge of the bridge and 7 m from the centerline of the road. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3195, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.86965066, '15° 52\' 10.742370\"', 120.24268220, '120° 14\' 33.655890\"', 0.0100, '1', 65.6990, 0.0100, '2', 22.2647, 204702.13110, 1756461.02600, '51', 15.87125323, '15° 52\' 16.511620\"', 120.24135170, '120° 14\' 28.866080\"', 27.7209, 1755348.48300, 418747.67100, '3', 204557.84300, 1756533.17600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(905, 'PNG-3199', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'CALSIB', 2008, 15.84641036, '15° 50\' 47.077296\"', 120.26806170, '120° 16\' 5.022120\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel northward until you reach the barangay Calsib. The mark is loacted at barangay Calsib (purok 2), in front of Vic Stabillo\'s House, facing north it is located on the right side concrete fence of their house, near the basketball court of barangay Calsib purok 2. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3199, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.84641277, '15° 50\' 47.085960\"', 120.26806390, '120° 16\' 5.030080\"', 0.0100, '1', 55.4000, 0.0100, '2', 11.9331, 207388.63670, 1753852.45200, '51', 15.84801333, '15° 50\' 52.847980\"', 120.26673290, '120° 16\' 0.238410\"', 17.2907, 1752767.23100, 421457.17000, '3', 207244.29100, 1753924.49900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(906, 'PNG-3200', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'POGONSILI', 2008, 15.82152484, '15° 49\' 17.489424\"', 120.24979490, '120° 14\' 59.261640\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel northward until you reach barangay Bayaos. Enter on that barangay until you reach the boundary of barangay Pogonsili. The mark is located nearly at the base of barangay Pogonsili and barangay Bayaos Sitio Kasagatan marker. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3200, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.82152716, '15° 49\' 17.497760\"', 120.24979710, '120° 14\' 59.269450\"', 0.0100, '1', 72.8030, 0.0100, '2', 29.1410, 205394.71930, 1751122.66300, '51', 15.82312656, '15° 49\' 23.255610\"', 120.24846540, '120° 14\' 54.475610\"', 34.6635, 1750020.34800, 419490.52700, '3', 205250.27500, 1751194.74800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(907, 'PNG-3201', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'BUENLAG', 2008, 15.80379924, '15° 48\' 13.677264\"', 120.25177340, '120° 15\' 6.384240\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel westward around 6 kms to barangay Quetegan. Turn left and travel again 2 kms until reaching barangay Buenlag. The mark is located at the center of the eastern part of the stepping line of the basketball court. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3201, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.80380124, '15° 48\' 13.684480\"', 120.25177560, '120° 15\' 6.392060\"', 0.0100, '1', 68.6880, 0.0100, '2', 24.9331, 205581.12620, 1749157.24300, '51', 15.80539950, '15° 48\' 19.438190\"', 120.25044350, '120° 15\' 1.596730\"', 30.4907, 1748058.03400, 419695.45000, '3', 205436.62400, 1749229.30800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(908, 'PNG-3207', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'BUNAGAN', 2008, 15.76864310, '15° 46\' 7.115160\"', 120.26832190, '120° 16\' 5.958840\"', 'From Municipal town hall of Mangatarem travel NW along the provincial road approximately 5 kms. The GPS station is located 8.98 m S form the center of the ring of the basketball and 14.75 m SW of CENPELCO post and it is located on the top of the rip rap of the irrigation canal and 10.68 m W of the waiting shed. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m cement putty with inscription “PNG-3207, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.76864530, '15° 46\' 7.123070\"', 120.26832440, '120° 16\' 5.967820\"', 0.0100, '1', 73.9160, 0.0100, '2', 29.9892, 207304.64070, 1745241.64900, '51', 15.77024098, '15° 46\' 12.867540\"', 120.26699160, '120° 16\' 1.169600\"', 35.5735, 1744161.40500, 421454.88200, '3', 207160.03300, 1745313.62900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(909, 'PNG-3208', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'TORRE 1ST', 2008, 15.78950824, '15° 47\' 22.229664\"', 120.29346180, '120° 17\' 36.462480\"', 'The station is located at municipal town plaza. It can be found at Amor Park (Children\'s Playground). It is about 50 cm SW of the concrete post of the SW side of the said park. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3208, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.78951069, '15° 47\' 22.238490\"', 120.29346420, '120° 17\' 36.471020\"', 0.0100, '1', 58.3780, 0.0100, '2', 14.6953, 210029.75890, 1747517.03800, '51', 15.79110713, '15° 47\' 27.985680\"', 120.29213190, '120° 17\' 31.674660\"', 20.0368, 1746461.08000, 424156.65400, '3', 209885.24200, 1747588.95300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(910, 'PNG-3209', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'DORONGAN PUNTA', 2008, 15.81041273, '15° 48\' 37.485828\"', 120.31468950, '120° 18\' 52.882200\"', 'From municipal town hall of Mangatarem travel east along the provincial road going to Urbiztondo. You will reach first the welcome arc of baranagay Dorungan Punta and the Canatan bridge and another old bridge ahed and you reach the intersection of the provincial road and barangay road at the right side. It is exactly located 11.70 m SW on the post exactly oposite of the waiting shed. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3209, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.81041526, '15° 48\' 37.494920\"', 120.31469170, '120° 18\' 52.890200\"', 0.0100, '1', 54.1450, 0.0100, '2', 10.6823, 212335.00710, 1749802.36200, '51', 15.81201254, '15° 48\' 43.245150\"', 120.31335990, '120° 18\' 48.095700\"', 15.8148, 1748766.76700, 426438.74300, '3', 212190.57800, 1749874.22700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(911, 'PNG-3216', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'PEANIA PEDANIA', 2008, 15.76295204, '15° 45\' 46.627344\"', 120.37145910, '120° 22\' 17.252760\"', 'Travel approximately 4 kms of any kind of vehicle beginning at town hall of Mangatarem. After reaching the intersection turn left and travel again 4 kms going to barangay Bedania. The station is located at Bedani Elem. School. It can be found beside the center of the plant box of the said school. It is about 70 cm W of the plant box. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3216, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.76295466, '15° 45\' 46.636770\"', 120.37146180, '120° 22\' 17.262310\"', 0.0100, '1', 55.7480, 0.0100, '2', 12.3549, 218354.59470, 1744470.95900, '51', 15.76454772, '15° 45\' 52.371800\"', 120.37012890, '120° 22\' 12.464070\"', 17.1383, 1743495.71800, 432505.04000, '3', 218210.05400, 1744542.59800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(912, 'PNG-3217', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'URBIZTONDO', 'POBLACION', 2008, 15.82201917, '15° 49\' 19.269012\"', 120.32935780, '120° 19\' 45.688080\"', 'PNG-3217 The mark is located with in the pemises of the municipal park. It is on the est of the lagoon, 13.75 east of lagoon and 8.4 m N of the steeping line of the basketball court and s of the passageway. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3217, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.82202196, '15° 49\' 19.279070\"', 120.32936000, '120° 19\' 45.695820\"', 0.0100, '1', 53.7900, 0.0100, '2', 10.4599, 213923.66400, 1751067.36900, '51', 15.82361965, '15° 49\' 25.030750\"', 120.32802840, '120° 19\' 40.902370\"', 15.4590, 1750046.03600, 428014.38300, '3', 213779.28700, 1751139.19600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(913, 'PNG-3219', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'URBIZTONDO', 'GALARIN', 2008, 15.79463954, '15° 47\' 40.702344\"', 120.35960910, '120° 21\' 34.592760\"', 'PNG-3219 The station vicinity is on the bridge going to Brgy. Don Martin Palisoc Elementary School. As described on the sketch it is approximately 30 m SE from the entrance gate of the said school. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3219, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.79464234, '15° 47\' 40.712430\"', 120.35961150, '120° 21\' 34.601340\"', 0.0100, '1', 56.2020, 0.0100, '2', 12.9111, 217128.07380, 1747995.07800, '51', 15.79623765, '15° 47\' 46.455540\"', 120.35827940, '120° 21\' 29.805720\"', 17.7157, 1747006.05900, 431245.91700, '3', 216983.62900, 1748066.78300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(914, 'PNG-3240', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BASISTA', 'CABELDATAN', 2008, 15.88337816, '15° 53\' 0.161376\"', 120.40075330, '120° 24\' 2.711880\"', 'PNG-3240 From the municipal hall of Basista, Pangasinan, travel NW on the way to San Carlos City, turn right on the intersection at Brgy. Dumpay, Basista, Pangasinan, a lot tricycle park on the intersection area, just go ahead to reach the Cabeldatan Elementary School, it is located on the right side of the road, exactly 8.65 m on the opposite side of E CHB post of the school. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3240, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.88338121, '15° 53\' 0.172370\"', 120.40075550, '120° 24\' 2.719780\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.8440, 0.0100, '2', 10.2777, 221660.28420, 1757764.46000, '51', 15.88498117, '15° 53\' 5.932220\"', 120.39942550, '120° 23\' 57.931840\"', 14.5238, 1756812.57100, 435682.56300, '3', 221516.17200, 1757836.10700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(915, 'PNG-3251', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BAYAMBANG', 'TATARAC', 2008, 15.77443763, '15° 46\' 27.975468\"', 120.42262930, '120° 25\' 21.465480\"', 'PNG-3251 From Urbiztondo town proper travel along the dike road going to Bayambang then turn left to reach Bryg. Tatarac. The station is located 150 m N of the dike road 5 m NE of a waiting shed. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3251, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.77444046, '15° 46\' 27.985650\"', 120.42263190, '120° 25\' 21.474690\"', 0.0100, '1', 55.3040, 0.0100, '2', 12.3886, 223856.18410, 1745674.77800, '51', 15.77603311, '15° 46\' 33.719210\"', 120.42129940, '120° 25\' 16.677660\"', 16.6044, 1744750.85800, 437991.95500, '3', 223711.72400, 1745746.25900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(916, 'PNG-3255', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BAYAMBANG', 'TELBANG', 2008, 15.79765009, '15° 47\' 51.540324\"', 120.45369670, '120° 27\' 13.308120\"', 'PNG-3255 Starting at Bayambang town proper travel 20-30 minutes going to Brgy. Telbang. The station is located near the entrance gate of Telbang Elementary School. It was set about 7 m Nw of the said gate. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3255, PRS-92, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.79765324, '15° 47\' 51.551660\"', 120.45369930, '120° 27\' 13.317610\"', 0.0100, '1', 64.8090, 0.0100, '2', 22.2774, 227217.79070, 1748204.06100, '51', 15.79924666, '15° 47\' 57.287990\"', 120.45236740, '120° 27\' 8.522690\"', 26.1035, 1747310.52100, 441327.68200, '3', 227073.43500, 1748275.46200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(917, 'PNG-3261', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'LAREG-LAREG', 2008, 15.91569025, '15° 54\' 56.484900\"', 120.50184570, '120° 30\' 6.644520\"', 'PNG-3261 Starting from Malasiqui municipal hall travel SW around 12-15 km (route going to Villasis) at about 20-35 minutes on any kind of vehicle to reach Brgy. Lareg-Lareg. The station is located along the national road and within the area of Mendoza Memorial School. It is set about 30 m W of the entrance gate of the said school and 8 m NE of the electric post. It is also 2.5 m N of the concrete fence. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3261, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.91569368, '15° 54\' 56.497230\"', 120.50184800, '120° 30\' 6.652630\"', 0.0100, '1', 114.7880, 0.0100, '2', 73.0042, 232534.50100, 1761209.60700, '51', 15.91729342, '15° 55\' 2.256300\"', 120.50051890, '120° 30\' 1.867950\"', 76.3198, 1760359.45900, 446517.77200, '3', 232390.58300, 1761280.95200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(918, 'PNG-3265', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'PAMARANUM', 2008, 15.89288458, '15° 53\' 34.384488\"', 120.48289770, '120° 28\' 58.431720\"', 'PNG-3265 From the municipal town plaza travel SE around 5-6 km to reach Bryg. Pamoranum. The station is located within the area of Pamonarum Elementary School and near Pamonarum Brgy. hall. It is about 30 m S of the concrete fence and 15 m NW of the said barangay hall. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3265, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.89288785, '15° 53\' 34.396270\"', 120.48289990, '120° 28\' 58.439730\"', 0.0100, '1', 76.8110, 0.0100, '2', 34.8492, 230474.29760, 1758709.27000, '51', 15.89448659, '15° 53\' 40.151740\"', 120.48157030, '120° 28\' 53.653000\"', 38.3202, 1757840.82900, 444482.53500, '3', 230330.28600, 1758780.65700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(919, 'PNG-3301', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CALASIAO', 'DINALAOAN', 2008, 15.99655065, '15° 59\' 47.582340\"', 120.34276930, '120° 20\' 33.969480\"', 'PNG-3301 From Calasiano town proper travel S going to Malasiqui, turn right at the intersection after the culvert just go ahead after reaching the another box culvert turn left just follow the road, the point is located at the box culvert near Dinalaoan Sentro Chapel. It is set on the SW side of the said culvert. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3301, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.99655375, '15° 59\' 47.593510\"', 120.34277100, '120° 20\' 33.975760\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.7460, 0.0100, '2', 5.3429, 215606.96410, 1770372.47700, '51', 15.99816205, '15° 59\' 53.383370\"', 120.34144360, '120° 20\' 29.197100\"', 9.9067, 1769355.01200, 429512.41400, '3', 215463.18500, 1770444.41000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(920, 'PNG-3321', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MABINI', 'MAGALONG', 2008, 16.09153709, '16° 5\' 29.533524\"', 119.91009160, '119° 54\' 36.329760\"', 'PNG-3321 From Mabini municipal hall travel westward, just follow the provincial road around 20 minutes travel time to Brgy. Magalong. The mark is located near Don Guillermo Orbos Sport Center, it is located left of the road, 10 m NW side and 4 m west of the signboard. It is located also near at the foundation of the railings. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3321, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.09153984, '16° 5\' 29.543420\"', 119.91009220, '119° 54\' 36.332000\"', 0.0100, '1', 51.1010, 0.0100, '2', 10.0523, 811327.25240, 1781253.80600, '50', 16.09316351, '16° 5\' 35.388650\"', 119.90876650, '119° 54\' 31.559440\"', 14.5968, 1780063.24400, 383252.98800, '3', 811187.06900, 1781323.08100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(921, 'PNG-3324', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MABINI', 'VILLACORTA', 2008, 16.04792958, '16° 2\' 52.546488\"', 119.97857930, '119° 58\' 42.885480\"', 'PNG-3324 At Mabini town proper travel N going to Alaminos, turn right at the intersection after passing Iglesia ni Cristo, follow the road to reach Brgy. Villacorta (30-40 minutes travel and accessible only of light vehicles). The station is located near Villacorta SK Basketball court, it is about 10 m SE of the basketball fieldgoal, 30 cm SE from the centerline of the said court and 20 m SW from the SK Brgy. hall. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3324, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.04793248, '16° 2\' 52.556930\"', 119.97858020, '119° 58\' 42.888670\"', 0.0100, '1', 128.6170, 0.0100, '2', 86.7245, 818729.34250, 1776529.14500, '50', 16.04955193, '16° 2\' 58.386950\"', 119.97725360, '119° 58\' 38.112790\"', 91.8153, 1775199.58700, 390556.99600, '3', 818589.07300, 1776598.18500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(922, 'PNG-3327', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'SAN VICENTE', 2008, 16.08041654, '16° 4\' 49.499544\"', 119.86190030, '119° 51\' 42.841080\"', 'PNG-3327 From Burgos town proper travel westward going to the municipal hall, turn right at the intersection going to Burgos National High School, turn left at the next intersection going to San Vicente about 6-10 km. The station is located outside the property of Feliciano Bruto and near the barangay road. It is about 6 m E of the entrance gate of the said property and 4 m S of the centerline of the barangay road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3327, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.08041932, '16° 4\' 49.509540\"', 119.86190100, '119° 51\' 42.843630\"', 0.0100, '1', 92.6230, 0.0100, '2', 52.0972, 806185.03650, 1779950.30500, '50', 16.08204335, '16° 4\' 55.356050\"', 119.86057500, '119° 51\' 38.069960\"', 56.2021, 1778860.44100, 378089.80700, '3', 806044.78800, 1780019.71400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(923, 'PNG-3331', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'PAPALLASEN', 2008, 16.03964447, '16° 2\' 22.720092\"', 119.86945180, '119° 52\' 10.026480\"', 'PNG-3331 From Burgos municipal hall travel southward around 10 minutes travel time. The mark is located at Brgy. Papalasengan in front of the house of Arnel de Guzman. 3 m from the SW edge fence of their house. 10 m from the centerline of the road. About 700 m north of Papalasengan Elementary School and it is along the provincial road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3331, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.03964680, '16° 2\' 22.728480\"', 119.86945250, '119° 52\' 10.028990\"', 0.0100, '1', 126.9250, 0.0100, '2', 86.1889, 807056.12510, 1775446.63500, '50', 16.04126813, '16° 2\' 28.565260\"', 119.86812550, '119° 52\' 5.251940\"', 90.3628, 1774343.57100, 378873.08400, '3', 806915.75800, 1775515.99300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(924, 'PNG-3333', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'SAPA PEQUEÑA', 2008, 16.03098413, '16° 1\' 51.542868\"', 119.84584110, '119° 50\' 45.027960\"', 'PNG-3333 From Burgos municipal hall travel southward until you reach the poblacion Catholic cemetery. Just follow that barangay road until you reach Brgy. Sapa Pequeña, travel time is around 10 minutes. The mark is located at Sapa Pequeña sitio Patat marker. It is 3 m south of the new marker and 0.50 m from the base of the old marker. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3333, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.03098626, '16° 1\' 51.550540\"', 119.84584180, '119° 50\' 45.030580\"', 0.0100, '1', 127.1520, 0.0100, '2', 86.7367, 804540.96880, 1774452.77100, '50', 16.03260757, '16° 1\' 57.387240\"', 119.84451460, '119° 50\' 40.252710\"', 90.6209, 1773399.07600, 376340.74700, '3', 804400.56000, 1774522.19300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(925, 'PNG-3334', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'SAPA GRANDE', 2008, 15.99611723, '15° 59\' 46.022028\"', 119.84043910, '119° 50\' 25.580760\"', 'PNG-3334 From Burgos municipal hall travel southward until you reach the poblacion catholic cemetery. Just follow that barangay road until you reach Brgy. Sapa Grande, travel time is around 20 minutes. The mark is located at Sapa Grande Sitio Maligay Basketball court and near the sun drying area. Facing north it is located at the center of the basketball court and the sun drying area. About 10 m from the southwest edge of sun drying area. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3334, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.99611932, '15° 59\' 46.029560\"', 119.84043960, '119° 50\' 25.582380\"', 0.0100, '1', 90.4780, 0.0100, '2', 50.0970, 804015.29730, 1770583.99800, '50', 15.99773859, '15° 59\' 51.858930\"', 119.83911150, '119° 50\' 20.801520\"', 53.8550, 1769543.47500, 375740.86900, '3', 803874.77700, 1770653.41200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(926, 'PNG-3335', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'CONCORDIA', 2008, 15.97502859, '15° 58\' 30.102924\"', 119.80588210, '119° 48\' 21.175560\"', 'PNG-3335 From Burgos municipal hall travel southward until you reach the poblacion catholic cemetery. Just follow that barangay road until you reach Brgy. Concordia, travel time is around 30-40 minutes. You will pass by Brgy. Sapa Grande and Sapa Pequeña. The mark is located at Brgy. Concordia plaza. At the back of their barangay hall, also in front of the church. It is outside of the concrete fence of the church left of the main entrance of the church. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3335, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.97503084, '15° 58\' 30.111020\"', 119.80588310, '119° 48\' 21.179160\"', 0.0100, '1', 80.2850, 0.0100, '2', 40.4309, 800345.66080, 1768198.62200, '50', 15.97664956, '15° 58\' 35.938410\"', 119.80455450, '119° 48\' 16.396370\"', 43.6824, 1767230.57300, 372028.09500, '3', 800205.05300, 1768268.12500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(927, 'PNG-3340', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'SAN VICENTE', 2008, 15.97745479, '15° 58\' 38.837244\"', 119.89580980, '119° 53\' 44.915280\"', 'PNG-3340 From Dasol town proper drive westward going to San Vicente about 10-25 minutes, the point is located near Tomas Bonilla Elementary School. The station is set about 40 cm N of NE portion of the concrete post of the said school and 40 m E of the entrance gate. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3340, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.97745744, '15° 58\' 38.846790\"', 119.89581080, '119° 53\' 44.918930\"', 0.0100, '1', 61.3810, 0.0100, '2', 20.1926, 809974.80190, 1768599.35500, '50', 15.97907434, '15° 58\' 44.667640\"', 119.89448240, '119° 53\' 40.136700\"', 24.5676, 1767445.69200, 381657.32100, '3', 809834.26000, 1768668.59300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(928, 'PNG-3341', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'MALIMPIN', 2008, 15.99840006, '15° 59\' 54.240216\"', 119.90785350, '119° 54\' 28.272600\"', 'PNG-3341 From Dasol town proper travel westward going to Brgy. Malimpin about 5-8 km to reach Malimpin Brgy. Hall. The station is located inside the said brgy. hall and just near the basketball court. It is set about 40 cm N of the NE edge of the basketball court and 50 m NE of the main entrance gate. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3341, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.99840236, '15° 59\' 54.248500\"', 119.90785450, '119° 54\' 28.276250\"', 0.0100, '1', 90.6890, 0.0100, '2', 49.3720, 811232.48310, 1770936.71400, '50', 16.00002029, '16° 0\' 0.073060\"', 119.90652660, '119° 54\' 23.495860\"', 53.9095, 1769756.84500, 382958.94300, '3', 811092.01400, 1771005.93100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(929, 'PNG-3343', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'VIGA', 2008, 15.91673061, '15° 55\' 0.230196\"', 119.92703840, '119° 55\' 37.338240\"', 'PNG-3343 From Dasol Public market travel southward. Just follow the provincial road until you reach the Magunao bridge which is located at the Brgy. Macalang. Before that bridge enter on the road which is located at the left side of the provincial road. Enter into that road which is the only way going to Brgy. Viga. It takes around 45 m to 1 hour trave time in going their. The mark is located at Brgy. Viga bridge on the south east edge of the bridge. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3343, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.91673301, '15° 55\' 0.238830\"', 119.92703970, '119° 55\' 37.342740\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.7080, 0.0100, '2', 11.0449, 813414.55320, 1761921.72300, '50', 15.91834545, '15° 55\' 6.043620\"', 119.92570990, '119° 55\' 32.555510\"', 15.6365, 1760707.73400, 384965.84600, '3', 813273.84700, 1761990.82700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(930, 'PNG-3349', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'INFANTA', 'MAYA', 2008, 15.81045766, '15° 48\' 37.647576\"', 119.91292140, '119° 54\' 46.517040\"', 'PNG-3349 From Municipal hall of Infanta, Pangasinan drive along the national road southward about 5-10 minutes going Dasol to reach Brgy. Maya. The point can be found near Maya Barangay hall. It is about 60 cm E of the railing and 8 m E from the centerline of the said road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3349, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.81045997, '15° 48\' 37.655900\"', 119.91292310, '119° 54\' 46.523310\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.4210, 0.0100, '2', 5.9801, 812065.58920, 1750132.36200, '50', 15.81206610, '15° 48\' 43.437950\"', 119.91159080, '119° 54\' 41.727050\"', 10.0656, 1748954.39900, 383392.75400, '3', 811924.54800, 1750201.43400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(931, 'PNG-3354', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'INFANTA', 'DOLIMAN', 2008, 15.81343014, '15° 48\' 48.348504\"', 119.97468270, '119° 58\' 28.857720\"', 'PNG-3354 From the municipal town plaza of Infanta drive NE along the municipal road going to Brgy. Nangalisan for about 3 minutes, just follow the road going to Brgy. Doliman Centro. The station can be found near Doliman Elementary School. It is about 3 m NW from the edge of a basketball court and 10 m from the centerline of the barangay road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3354, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.81343252, '15° 48\' 48.357060\"', 119.97468460, '119° 58\' 28.864380\"', 0.0100, '1', 58.8400, 0.0100, '2', 16.5971, 818682.55960, 1750554.31800, '50', 15.81503747, '15° 48\' 54.134880\"', 119.97335240, '119° 58\' 24.068640\"', 21.3437, 1749249.92700, 390011.83900, '3', 818541.56900, 1750623.21000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(932, 'PNG-3355', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'INFANTA', 'BAMBAN', 2008, 15.84455788, '15° 50\' 40.408368\"', 119.96231940, '119° 57\' 44.349840\"', 'PNG-3355 At Bamban Elementary School turn right passing Pangasinan State University (Infanta Campus), straight ahead until reaching Sawang Dam. The station is located on the lower left shoulder of the said dam site. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3355, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.84456042, '15° 50\' 40.417510\"', 119.96232110, '119° 57\' 44.355820\"', 0.0100, '1', 73.0520, 0.0100, '2', 30.9632, 817308.36880, 1753982.67400, '50', 15.84616758, '15° 50\' 46.203290\"', 119.96098960, '119° 57\' 39.562670\"', 35.6788, 1752701.32000, 388704.29400, '3', 817167.46600, 1754051.62300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(933, 'PNG-3357', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'BARUAN', 2008, 16.01842994, '16° 1\' 6.347784\"', 119.77350540, '119° 46\' 24.619440\"', 'PNG-3357 The station is located near Brgy. hall of Baruan. It is about 70 m W from the centerline of the road going to Brgy. Allabon. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3357, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.01843184, '16° 1\' 6.354620\"', 119.77350610, '119° 46\' 24.621900\"', 0.0100, '1', 44.8120, 0.0100, '2', 5.5100, 796813.49570, 1772957.69400, '50', 16.02005397, '16° 1\' 12.194290\"', 119.77217850, '119° 46\' 19.842610\"', 8.4184, 1772054.26200, 368590.18100, '3', 796672.99900, 1773027.32300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(934, 'PNG-3359', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'TUPA', 2008, 16.07515119, '16° 4\' 30.544284\"', 119.78975290, '119° 47\' 23.110440\"', 'PNG-3359 From the municipal hall of Agno, Pangasinan travel along the national road going to Brgy. Tupa. The station is located 20 m N of a waiting shed and about 30 m E from the residential house. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3359, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.07515327, '16° 4\' 30.551780\"', 119.78975350, '119° 47\' 23.112480\"', 0.0100, '1', 103.5620, 0.0100, '2', 64.0510, 798468.81940, 1779261.60600, '50', 16.07677855, '16° 4\' 36.402790\"', 119.78842720, '119° 47\' 18.338080\"', 67.3000, 1778321.67500, 370366.15800, '3', 798328.50800, 1779331.22500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(935, 'PNG-3361', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'MAGSAYSAY', 2008, 16.09681751, '16° 5\' 48.543036\"', 119.79418680, '119° 47\' 39.072480\"', 'PNG-3361 From Agno municipal town proper of Agno, travel on dirt rap road uphill going to Brgy. Magsaysay, turn right on the waiting shed of Magsaysay and approximately 100 m from the W of shed and there is the barangay hall fenced by chicken wire. The GPS point is located on the N corner of the barangay hall fence. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3361, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.09682000, '16° 5\' 48.552010\"', 119.79418710, '119° 47\' 39.073480\"', 0.0100, '1', 129.3780, 0.0100, '2', 89.8375, 798911.03660, 1781667.11900, '50', 16.09844652, '16° 5\' 54.407480\"', 119.79286140, '119° 47\' 34.300940\"', 93.1707, 1780716.87000, 370854.65500, '3', 798770.79500, 1781736.73800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(936, 'PNG-3374', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'DACAP SUR', 2008, 16.23157321, '16° 13\' 53.663556\"', 119.80394840, '119° 48\' 14.214240\"', 'PNG-3374 From the municipal hall of Bani, Pangasinan, travel northward on the way to Bolinao, turn left at Brgy. Tiep, just follow the road and turn left at Brgy. Centro Toma until reaching Dacap Sur Brgy. Plaza. The station is located on the SE side of the CHB fence of the barangay lot. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3374, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.23157593, '16° 13\' 53.673360\"', 119.80394840, '119° 48\' 14.214180\"', 0.0100, '1', 194.0100, 0.0100, '2', 154.7069, 799752.51870, 1796602.65800, '50', 16.23321056, '16° 13\' 59.558000\"', 119.80262590, '119° 48\' 9.453080\"', 158.1872, 1795625.03300, 371986.22600, '3', 799612.69800, 1796672.33800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(937, 'PNG-3375', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'MACABIT', 2008, 16.25439253, '16° 15\' 15.813108\"', 119.83442210, '119° 50\' 3.919560\"', 'PNG-3375 From the municipal hall of Bani, travel northward on the way to Bolinao, turn left at Brgy. tiep, just go ahead turn right on the way to Macabit, the point is located on the NW of the Brgy. hall, left side of the barangay road. It is exactly 25.60 m N of an old Mango tree and 13.40 m SE of Bulala tree. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3375, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.25439557, '16° 15\' 15.824060\"', 119.83442140, '119° 50\' 3.916950\"', 0.0100, '1', 167.6750, 0.0100, '2', 128.1427, 802977.44640, 1799174.39400, '50', 16.25603095, '16° 15\' 21.711410\"', 119.83309940, '119° 49\' 59.157880\"', 131.8477, 1798131.74900, 375258.99500, '3', 802837.71400, 1799244.00000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(938, 'PNG-3376', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'COLAYO', 2008, 16.27440866, '16° 16\' 27.871176\"', 119.80989930, '119° 48\' 35.637480\"', 'PNG-3376 From the municipal hall of Bani, travel for almost 20 minutes in the place, turn left at the intersection of at Brgy. Tiep, just go ahead and follow the cemented road going to Brgy. Colayo. The point is located in front of the covered court of Colayo, at the boundary of 2 agricultural lots. The station is exactly 10.30 m NE of CHB fence post of the Brgy. lot. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3376, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.27441153, '16° 16\' 27.881510\"', 119.80989930, '119° 48\' 35.637420\"', 0.0100, '1', 184.6130, 0.0100, '2', 145.4485, 800323.96760, 1801354.57200, '50', 16.27604867, '16° 16\' 33.775210\"', 119.80857780, '119° 48\' 30.879940\"', 148.9060, 1800362.21800, 372650.23300, '3', 800184.28100, 1801424.26300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(939, 'PNG-3377', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'MACALEENG', 2008, 16.24735636, '16° 14\' 50.482896\"', 120.00830540, '120° 0\' 29.899440\"', 'PNG-3377 From Anda town proper travel SE along the provincial road about 15-25 minutes going to Brgy. Sablig, just straight ahead and travel again 2-4 km, turn left to reach Brgy. Macaleeng. The station can be found near the box culvert and set about 3 m W of theSW strip of the said culvert. It is alos 26 m E of the waiting shed. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3377, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.24735958, '16° 14\' 50.494490\"', 120.00830540, '120° 0\' 29.899350\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.7980, 0.0100, '2', 12.0731, 180187.24700, 1798634.82200, '51', 16.24899076, '16° 14\' 56.366720\"', 120.00698340, '120° 0\' 25.140340\"', 16.5282, 1797254.55600, 393845.03700, '3', 180044.04600, 1798708.05800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(940, 'PNG-3381', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'MAL-ONG', 2008, 16.29815971, '16° 17\' 53.374956\"', 119.94004790, '119° 56\' 24.172440\"', 'PNG-3381 From Anda town plaza travel NW going to Brgy. Mal-ong about 2-3 km along the provincial road. The station is located near the house of Mr. & Mrs. Raymundo Razote. It is 15 m SW of the said house and also 6 m SE of the electric post. It is also about 30 cm E of the concrete fence. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3381, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.29816252, '16° 17\' 53.385070\"', 119.94004760, '119° 56\' 24.171520\"', 0.0100, '1', 67.3040, 0.0100, '2', 27.3262, 814206.56370, 1804180.69400, '50', 16.29979832, '16° 17\' 59.273940\"', 119.93872680, '119° 56\' 19.416500\"', 31.3541, 1802913.83600, 386576.80400, '3', 814067.03100, 1804250.02000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(941, 'PNG-3383', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'TONDOL', 2008, 16.31421857, '16° 18\' 51.186852\"', 120.01420000, '120° 0\' 51.120000\"', 'PNG-3383 Starting from Anda town plaza drive 2-3 km along the municipal road going to Brgy. San Jose, turn right at the intersection going to Brgy. Namagbagan straight ahead then turn left at the next intersection going to Brgy. Tondol. the station is located within the walking area of the Ecotourism Park. It is about 7 m S of the lamp post and 23 m from the lighthouse. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3383, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.31422214, '16° 18\' 51.199690\"', 120.01419960, '120° 0\' 51.118490\"', 0.0100, '1', 43.3130, 0.0100, '2', 3.1040, 180926.10070, 1806030.29700, '51', 16.31585731, '16° 18\' 57.086320\"', 120.01287920, '120° 0\' 46.365120\"', 7.2325, 1804651.22300, 394511.10400, '3', 180783.13100, 1806103.56900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `hgcp_stations_new` (`id`, `station_name`, `island_group`, `region`, `province`, `city_or_municipality`, `barangay`, `year_established`, `latitude`, `latitude_dms`, `longitude`, `longitude_dms`, `description`, `year_surveyed`, `project`, `epoch`, `latitude_wgs84`, `latitude_wgs84_dms`, `longitude_wgs84`, `longitude_wgs84_dms`, `error_ellipse`, `accuracy_class`, `ellipsoidal_ht_wgs84`, `height_error`, `order_of_accuracy_wgs84`, `egm2008_elevation`, `utm_x_wgs84`, `utm_y_wgs84`, `utm_zone_wgs84`, `latitude_prs92`, `latitude_prs92_dms`, `longitude_prs92`, `longitude_prs92_dms`, `ellipsoidal_ht_prs92`, `northing_ptm`, `easting_ptm`, `ptm_zone`, `utm_x_prs92`, `utm_y_prs92`, `utm_zone_prs92`, `latitude_itrf`, `latitude_itrf_dms`, `longitude_itrf`, `longitude_itrf_dms`, `error_ellipse_itrf`, `ellipsoidal_ht_itrf`, `height_error_itrf`, `year_computed`, `encoder`, `date_updated`, `reference_file`) VALUES
(942, 'PNG-3384', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'CABUNGAN', 2008, 16.33184344, '16° 19\' 54.636384\"', 119.99249340, '119° 59\' 32.976240\"', 'PNG-3384 From the municipal town plaza of Anda drive NE along the municipal road going to Brgy. Cabungan approximately 6-8 km. The station is located at the upper right shoulder of the box culvert. It is also 200 m NE of Cabungan Water tank. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3384, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.33184758, '16° 19\' 54.651270\"', 119.99249280, '119° 59\' 32.974050\"', 0.0100, '1', 43.1460, 0.0100, '2', 3.1777, 819760.94310, 1807992.73800, '50', 16.33348431, '16° 20\' 0.543520\"', 119.99117280, '119° 59\' 28.222070\"', 7.1718, 1806613.26800, 392200.89800, '3', 819621.54600, 1808061.93300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(943, 'PNG-3385', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'CAROT', 2008, 16.34541179, '16° 20\' 43.482444\"', 119.97980540, '119° 58\' 47.299440\"', 'PNG-3385 From the municipal town proper of Anda travel NE 2-3 km to reach Brgy. San Jose, turn left at the intersection going to Brgy. Carot straight ahead for about 3-5 km to reach the station. The said station is located on the open ground of Carot Elementary School. It is exactly 27.70 m W of the school\'s stage. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3385, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.34541536, '16° 20\' 43.495310\"', 119.97980490, '119° 58\' 47.297670\"', 0.0100, '1', 42.7460, 0.0100, '2', 2.9489, 818382.14580, 1809475.39700, '50', 16.34705321, '16° 20\' 49.391570\"', 119.97848520, '119° 58\' 42.546780\"', 6.8439, 1808121.63400, 390852.56700, '3', 818242.78200, 1809544.63900, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(944, 'PNG-3389', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'LUCIENTE 2.0', 2008, 16.35366012, '16° 21\' 13.176432\"', 119.91598030, '119° 54\' 57.529080\"', 'PNG-3389 From town proper travel along the national highway going to Alaminos turn left at barangay Cabuyao going to Barangay Luciente II, it will pass the barangay hall and few meters will reach Luciente II Elementary School. The GPS point is located at the corner of the road SW of the CHB fence post of the school and N of the main gate. It is about 3.20 m SW of the post of the said school and 14.50 m N of the post of the main gate. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3389, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.35366371, '16° 21\' 13.189350\"', 119.91597940, '119° 54\' 57.525990\"', 0.0100, '1', 73.4370, 0.0100, '2', 34.0175, 811544.46800, 1810289.91000, '50', 16.35530345, '16° 21\' 19.092420\"', 119.91465990, '119° 54\' 52.775540\"', 37.7145, 1809069.96500, 384037.11700, '3', 811405.08900, 1810359.34400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(945, 'PNG-3391', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'TARA', 2008, 16.28353869, '16° 17\' 0.739284\"', 119.88838750, '119° 53\' 18.195000\"', 'PNG-3391 From Bani town proper drive N along the provincial road about 5-10 minutes to reach Brgy. Tara. The station is located along the provincial road and beside basketball court 1.5 m E from the western edge and approximately 13 m W from the center of the provincial road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3391, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.28354195, '16° 17\' 0.751030\"', 119.88838720, '119° 53\' 18.193950\"', 0.0100, '1', 121.7130, 0.0100, '2', 81.9289, 808704.46050, 1802482.72700, '50', 16.28517796, '16° 17\' 6.640650\"', 119.88706600, '119° 53\' 13.437520\"', 85.8437, 1801325.24100, 381046.17800, '3', 808564.85100, 1802552.19400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(946, 'PNG-3392', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'TUPA', 2008, 16.32538042, '16° 19\' 31.369512\"', 119.84940840, '119° 50\' 57.870240\"', 'PNG-3392 From the municipal town proper of Bolinao travel southward on the national road and turn right at Barangay Samang Norte then pass through an uphill dirt road going to the place. It takes 30 minutes drive on the way passing the Samang Norte Barangay Hall and next is the Tupa Elementary School just go ahead and reach Iglesia ni Cristo Church, straight ahead uphill for about 150 m on an open ground on the right side of the road. The station is located approximately 20 m NE of an electric post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3392, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.32538357, '16° 19\' 31.380840\"', 119.84940800, '119° 50\' 57.868820\"', 0.0100, '1', 145.0770, 0.0100, '2', 105.8821, 804470.77230, 1807057.42200, '50', 16.32702300, '16° 19\' 37.282790\"', 119.84808770, '119° 50\' 53.115770\"', 109.4295, 1805979.29400, 376905.73700, '3', 804331.26600, 1807127.03200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(947, 'PNG-3394', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'ESTANZA', 2008, 16.36023756, '16° 21\' 36.855216\"', 119.84567860, '119° 50\' 44.442960\"', 'PNG-3394 From the municipal town plaza of Bolinao, travel SW along the provincial road, it will pass Barangay Balingasay, the boundary of Balingasay and Stanza is the center of the bridge wherein before reaching the place it will turn right go ahead for 1 km. The point is located in an open area, it was placed on top of breakwater concrete dike just 25 m NW of an electric post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3394, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.36024070, '16° 21\' 36.866520\"', 119.84567810, '119° 50\' 44.441060\"', 0.0100, '1', 42.2700, 0.0100, '2', 3.3779, 804017.94790, 1810911.70400, '50', 16.36188238, '16° 21\' 42.776580\"', 119.84435860, '119° 50\' 39.690840\"', 6.7377, 1809839.42800, 376529.09200, '3', 803878.54400, 1810981.35100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(948, 'PNG-3506', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'LIWA-LIWA', 2008, 16.36694156, '16° 22\' 0.989616\"', 119.89082560, '119° 53\' 26.972160\"', 'PNG-3506 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. of Liwa-liwa. To reach the station, from Bani Town Proper, travel N direction to Bolinao Town Proper until reaching Liwa-liwa Elem. School. Continue trave about 340 m from the shcool. Station mark is located at the vacan lot right side of the Provincial Road for about 30 m, about 340 m NE of Liwa-liwa Elem. School and about 25 m SE of \"right thinking leads to right living\" sign board. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3506, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.36694641, '16° 22\' 1.007080\"', 119.89082340, '119° 53\' 26.964360\"', 0.0100, '1', 91.9750, 0.0100, '2', 52.8189, 808833.92680, 1811722.39400, '50', 16.36858751, '16° 22\' 6.915050\"', 119.88950420, '119° 53\' 22.214940\"', 56.3540, 1810554.59700, 381357.10600, '3', 808694.57300, 1811791.91100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(949, 'PNG-3509', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'ESTANZA', 2008, 16.34512434, '16° 20\' 42.447624\"', 119.84257690, '119° 50\' 33.276840\"', 'PNG-3509 From Bolinao Town Proper, travel SW direction to Estanza Elem. School. for about 10 Km. turn left at Estanza-Ilogmolino junction until reaching the Brgy. Proper. Station mark is in Mun. of Bolino, Brgy. of Estanza. It is located at the open ground NE of Coconut Tree cluster. About 110 m N of Brgy. Road going to Brgy. Tupa. About 100 m N of Brgy. Sports Complex, and about 150 m NE of Estanza Elem. School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3509, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.34512900, '16° 20\' 42.464410\"', 119.84257450, '119° 50\' 33.268090\"', 0.0100, '1', 92.9480, 0.0100, '2', 53.9590, 803709.53770, 1809233.69000, '50', 16.34676981, '16° 20\' 48.371320\"', 119.84125460, '119° 50\' 28.516630\"', 57.3772, 1808168.80900, 376187.89700, '3', 803570.08600, 1809303.33500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(950, 'PNG-3510', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'LUNA', 2008, 16.33101282, '16° 19\' 51.646152\"', 119.89477830, '119° 53\' 41.201880\"', 'PNG-3510 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. Luna. To reach the station, from Bani Town Proper, travel to Bolino Town Proper until reaching Brgy. Luna. It is located at the center of the farm lot owned by Mr. Nestor Carranza. 50 m E of Provincial Road to Bolinao Town Proper, about 180 m N of Brgy. Hall, about 160 m N of basketball court and 30 m SE fo the 3 storey newly construct residential house no. 068. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3510, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.33101776, '16° 19\' 51.663950\"', 119.89477600, '119° 53\' 41.193490\"', 0.0100, '1', 95.4190, 0.0100, '2', 55.9417, 809313.12230, 1807749.75400, '50', 16.33265657, '16° 19\' 57.563640\"', 119.89345590, '119° 53\' 36.441060\"', 59.6788, 1806575.88200, 381757.72000, '3', 809173.66100, 1807819.23500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(951, 'PNG-3513', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'TUPA', 2008, 16.30644068, '16° 18\' 23.186448\"', 119.85814290, '119° 51\' 29.314440\"', 'PNG-3513 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. to Tupa and Sitio Malumanat. It is located N or left side of the unpaved Brgy. Road going to Brgy. Samang Norte. About 40 M SW of Mango Tree, 50 m W of the rice field. 100 m NW of 3 houses. Station Mark is intervisible to PNG-3514. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3513, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.30644529, '16° 18\' 23.203060\"', 119.85814070, '119° 51\' 29.306420\"', 0.0100, '1', 116.8760, 0.0100, '2', 77.4732, 805433.96210, 1804973.38700, '50', 16.30808338, '16° 18\' 29.100150\"', 119.85681990, '119° 51\' 24.551790\"', 81.1496, 1803878.00900, 377827.22400, '3', 805294.40300, 1805042.95900, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(952, 'PNG-3517', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'TARA', 2007, 16.29300402, '16° 17\' 34.814472\"', 119.91358320, '119° 54\' 48.899520\"', 'PNG-3517 Station mark is in Mun. of Anda, Brgy. Catubig. To reach the station travel from Bani Town Proper to Brgy. Catubig at the Bolinao-Anda junction, turn right then continue travel until reaching the Brgy. Proper, then turn left follow the newly construct concrete road going to the \"Little Sister of the Poor\" (St. Joseph Home for Elderly). Station mark is located at the right side of ascending concrete road about 12 m E of about 6 m high riprap S of the school bldg. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3517, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.29300852, '16° 17\' 34.830680\"', 119.91358160, '119° 54\' 48.893810\"', 0.0100, '1', 60.3630, 0.0100, '2', 20.4854, 811384.17940, 1803569.33200, '50', 16.29464458, '16° 17\' 40.720480\"', 119.91226060, '119° 54\' 44.138240\"', 24.4614, 1802358.37800, 383744.91700, '3', 811244.61400, 1803638.73300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(953, 'PNG-3519', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'ROXAS', 2007, 16.28501263, '16° 17\' 6.045468\"', 119.95352220, '119° 57\' 12.679920\"', 'PNG-3519 Station mark is in Mun. of Anda, Brgy. of Roxas. To reach the station travel to Anda Proper, upon approaching town proper turn right then follow Brgy. Road to Brgy. Roxas welcome arc, then turn right about 80 m. Station mark is located at the left side of unpaved road S of Mun. Sanitary Land Fill. It is about 15 m NW of cell site tower, about 95 m SW of Brgy. Roxas welcome arc. and about 10 m N of piggery area. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3519, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.28501714, '16° 17\' 6.061700\"', 119.95352080, '119° 57\' 12.674910\"', 0.0100, '1', 69.8860, 0.0100, '2', 29.7387, 815668.60710, 1802745.76200, '50', 16.28665183, '16° 17\' 11.946590\"', 119.95219970, '119° 57\' 7.918840\"', 33.8634, 1801451.53000, 388009.38500, '3', 815529.04300, 1802815.04000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(954, 'PNG-3520', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'NAMAGBAGAN', 2007, 16.29247285, '16° 17\' 32.902260\"', 119.98612760, '119° 59\' 10.059360\"', 'PNG-3520 Station mark is in Mun. of Anda, Brgy. of Namagbagan, to reach the station, from Anda Town Proper travel to Brgy. Namagbagan Proper until reaching the school site then turn right continue travel for about 400 m. Station mark is located at the center of rice field about 75 m right of the Brgy. Road, 80 m NE of concrete bongalow house. It is also about 240 m SE of Brgy. Public Market and about 350 SE of Namagbagan Elem. School. Station is the head of a 4 in. coppernail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3520, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.29247775, '16° 17\' 32.919900\"', 119.98612600, '119° 59\' 10.053570\"', 0.0100, '1', 64.2800, 0.0100, '2', 24.0267, 819143.98210, 1803622.72300, '50', 16.29411219, '16° 17\' 38.803890\"', 119.98480510, '119° 59\' 5.298270\"', 28.2012, 1802259.53100, 391498.72100, '3', 819004.46200, 1803691.91000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(955, 'PNG-3523', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'SABLIG', 2007, 16.26791941, '16° 16\' 4.509876\"', 119.98144390, '119° 58\' 53.198040\"', 'PNG-3523 Station mark is in Mun. of Anda, Brgy. of Sablig. To reach the station travel towards Anda Town Proper, upon approaching town proper turn right then follow Brgy. Road to Brgy. Sablig Proper. Station mark is located at the open ground SW portion of the rice field about 100 m right side or SW of the road, going to Brgy. Proper. It is about 110 m S of 10 m long concrete bridge and about 150 m SE of Brgy. Sablig Welcome Arc. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3523, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.26792450, '16° 16\' 4.528210\"', 119.98144260, '119° 58\' 53.193260\"', 0.0100, '1', 53.0180, 0.0100, '2', 12.5945, 818682.75710, 1800896.26000, '50', 16.26955753, '16° 16\' 10.407120\"', 119.98012110, '119° 58\' 48.435860\"', 16.8758, 1799544.68800, 390984.50100, '3', 818543.15900, 1800965.44500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(956, 'PNG-3530', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'RANAO', 2008, 16.18639472, '16° 11\' 11.020992\"', 119.81669020, '119° 49\' 0.084720\"', 'PNG-3530 Station mark is in Mun. of Bani, Brgy. of Ranao, Sitio of Quitdalen. To reach the station, travel from Bani Town proper to Sitio Mangga junction or to the road intersection going to Brgy. of Patar Mun. of Agno. Then turn right, continue travel SW direction follow the unpaved road, upon approaching the second road intersection at the E of waiting shed and rice mill, turn left until reaching Sitio Quitdalen. Station mark is located E of Brgy. Road going to Brgy. Patar, and at the center of the uncultivated farm lot about NW of the house of Antonio de Guzman. About 40 m E of 3 Lomboy Tree. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3530, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.18639833, '16° 11\' 11.033970\"', 119.81668830, '119° 49\' 0.077940\"', 0.0100, '1', 181.4520, 0.0100, '2', 141.8459, 801184.09960, 1791618.83000, '50', 16.18802988, '16° 11\' 16.907580\"', 119.81536470, '119° 48\' 55.313080\"', 145.4613, 1790617.00200, 373319.46800, '3', 801044.14800, 1791688.44200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(957, 'PNG-3540', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'CAYUNGNAN', 2008, 16.15142908, '16° 9\' 5.144688\"', 119.84186340, '119° 50\' 30.708240\"', 'PNG-3540 Station mark is in Mun. of Agno, Brgy. of Cayungnan and Sitio of Bacsil. To reach the station from Bani travel SW direction towards Agno until reaching Brgy. Cayungnan, Sitio Bacsil. Station mark is located at the right side of the Nat\'l Road for about 20 m from the road centerline. and about 100 m S of \"Naranjita Plaza\". Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3540, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.15143254, '16° 9\' 5.157130\"', 119.84186190, '119° 50\' 30.702750\"', 0.0100, '1', 94.4810, 0.0100, '2', 54.4562, 803931.26040, 1787784.10800, '50', 16.15306140, '16° 9\' 11.021050\"', 119.84053750, '119° 50\' 25.934980\"', 58.3233, 1786731.75200, 375989.85200, '3', 803791.21600, 1787853.62400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(958, 'PNG-3542', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'VIGA', 2008, 16.12710123, '16° 7\' 37.564428\"', 119.86915220, '119° 52\' 8.947920\"', 'PNG-3542 Station mark is in Mun. of Agno, Brgy. of Viga Sitio of Pangaw. To reach the station from Mabini Town Proper travel to the junction going to Bani then turn right follow asphalt road until reaching Brgy. Cabanatan Mun. of Mabini. At Cabanatan Brgy. Hall, turn left and follow Brgy. Road to Sitio Pangaw. Station mark is located at the right side of the road going to the Brgy. Proper for about 1 Km. and about 150 m SW of the residential area of Sitio Pangaw. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3542, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.12710466, '16° 7\' 37.576770\"', 119.86915070, '119° 52\' 8.942560\"', 0.0100, '1', 117.6280, 0.0100, '2', 77.1846, 806889.34210, 1785130.70900, '50', 16.12873142, '16° 7\' 43.433100\"', 119.86782580, '119° 52\' 4.172880\"', 81.3306, 1784022.98600, 378894.00300, '3', 806749.24200, 1785200.12700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(959, 'PNG-3549', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'PAITAN EAST', 2008, 16.08404488, '16° 5\' 2.561568\"', 120.02784580, '120° 1\' 40.244880\"', 'PNG-3549 Station mark is in Mun. of Sual, Brgy. of Paitan East. To reach the station from Sual Town Proper travel NW direction towards Alaminos City for about 10 mins. until reaching Brgy. Paitan East. Station mark is located 8 m S of Provincial Road to Alaminos City. About 50 m SE of Paitan Bridge. Station is intervisible to PNG-71. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3549, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.08404836, '16° 5\' 2.574110\"', 120.02784540, '120° 1\' 40.243580\"', 0.0100, '1', 75.3580, 0.0100, '2', 33.3111, 182016.24100, 1780518.80600, '51', 16.08566899, '16° 5\' 8.408370\"', 120.02651970, '120° 1\' 35.470910\"', 38.5459, 1779170.95400, 395848.15300, '3', 181872.50300, 1780591.84100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(960, 'PNG-3553', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'BANGAN-ODA', 2008, 16.10284697, '16° 6\' 10.249092\"', 119.83894240, '119° 50\' 20.192640\"', 'PNG-3553 Station mark is in Mun. of Agno, Brgy. of Labang. To reach the station, from Mabini Town Proper travel SW direction for about6.7 Km. until reaching the road junction or intersection going to Mun. of Agno, then turn right follow the road leading to Agno for about 7 Km. until reaching Brgy. Labang. Station mark is located at the right side of Provincial Road, 8 m from the center line of the road, SE of sharp curve sign board. About 200 m SE of the sharp curve and about 860 m SW of Bangan-Oda High School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on top of a RCPC with inscriptions, \"PNG-3553, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.10285016, '16° 6\' 10.260560\"', 119.83894090, '119° 50\' 20.187260\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.3970, 0.0100, '2', 6.2427, 803692.75300, 1782400.19700, '50', 16.10447609, '16° 6\' 16.113920\"', 119.83761540, '119° 50\' 15.415350\"', 10.0994, 1781356.68700, 375646.97400, '3', 803552.55700, 1782469.69000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(961, 'PNG-3559', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'SAN MIGUEL', 2008, 16.03985751, '16° 2\' 23.487036\"', 119.90085280, '119° 54\' 3.070080\"', 'PNG-3559 Station mark is in Mun. of Burgos, Brgy. of San Miguel. To reach the station from the Town Proper travel SE direction for about 4.5 Km. until reaching Brgy. Proper. Station mark is located in front of the San Miguel Elem. School between the Brgy. Road and perimeter fence of the school. About 160 m SW of the Brgy. Hall. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3559, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.03986021, '16° 2\' 23.496740\"', 119.90085190, '119° 54\' 3.066700\"', 0.0100, '1', 113.5990, 0.0100, '2', 72.4681, 810418.23260, 1775517.09000, '50', 16.04148086, '16° 2\' 29.331100\"', 119.89952490, '119° 53\' 58.289790\"', 76.9613, 1774349.02000, 382233.75600, '3', 810277.88600, 1775586.35500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(962, 'PNG-3563', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'POGORUAC', 2008, 15.96809705, '15° 58\' 5.149380\"', 119.78008430, '119° 46\' 48.303480\"', 'PNG-3563 Station mark is in Mun. of Burgos, Brgy. of Pogoruac. To reach the station from the Town Proper travel SW direction to Brgy. Pogoruac and Ilio-ilio Road junction for about 8.6 Km., then turn left towards Brgy. Ilio-ilio for about 3.3 Km. or about 300 m before the sharp curve. Station mark is located at the left side or south end of reinforce concrete culvert. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on top of RCPC with inscriptions, \"PNG-5363, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.96809918, '15° 58\' 5.157030\"', 119.78008300, '119° 46\' 48.298740\"', 0.0100, '1', 67.3710, 0.0100, '2', 27.9389, 797592.37530, 1767394.00500, '50', 15.96971803, '15° 58\' 10.984910\"', 119.77875420, '119° 46\' 43.515250\"', 30.8101, 1766479.51000, 369261.32900, '3', 797451.72900, 1767463.58000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(963, 'PNG-3567', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'EGUIA', 2008, 15.90783508, '15° 54\' 28.206288\"', 119.88416690, '119° 53\' 3.000840\"', 'PNG-3567 Station mark is in Mun. of Dasol, Brgy. of Eguia. To reach the station from the Town Proper travel S direction towards infanta for about 9.6 Km. until reaching the school site of Brgy. Eguia. Station mark is located in front of Eguia Elem. School between the drainage canal and the perimeter fence of the school. 20 m S of main gate of the school. 30 m E of the school bldg. and about 100 m SW of the cell site tower. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3567, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.90783718, '15° 54\' 28.213860\"', 119.88416670, '119° 53\' 3.000010\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.1360, 0.0100, '2', 5.0526, 808834.16790, 1760872.71100, '50', 15.90945001, '15° 54\' 34.020050\"', 119.88283660, '119° 52\' 58.211850\"', 9.1418, 1759747.41400, 380369.26100, '3', 808693.40600, 1760941.93700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(964, 'PNG-3571', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'INFANTA', 'CATO', 2008, 15.83892061, '15° 50\' 20.114196\"', 119.91541930, '119° 54\' 55.509480\"', 'PNG-3571 Station mark is in Mun. of Infanta, Brgy. of Cato. To reach the station from the Town Proper travel N direction towards Dasol until reaching the school site of Brgy. Cato for about 2.4 Km. Station mark is located inside the compound of Cato Elem. School. 10 m E of the school bldg., 6 m SE of the flag pole, 12 m SW of main entrace of the school and about 20 meter W of Nat\'l Road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3571, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.83892234, '15° 50\' 20.120430\"', 119.91541930, '119° 54\' 55.509390\"', 0.0100, '1', 45.5530, 0.0100, '2', 4.0596, 812289.42960, 1753287.86700, '50', 15.84053019, '15° 50\' 25.908680\"', 119.91408770, '119° 54\' 50.715540\"', 8.2766, 1752102.91700, 383676.56100, '3', 812148.47700, 1753356.95100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(965, 'PNG-3572', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'INFANTA', 'MAYA', 2008, 15.82072320, '15° 49\' 14.603520\"', 119.93216110, '119° 55\' 55.779960\"', 'PNG-3572 Station mark is in Mun. of Infanta, Brgy. of Maya. To reach the station from the town proper travel N direction towards Brgy. Cato until reaching the road intersection going to Brgy. Maya, turn right follow Brgy. Road until reaching the road intersection to Brgy. Bamban and Nangalisan. Station mark is located at the Y intersection to Brgy. Bamban and Nangalisan 15 m SW of Brgy. Bamban Boundary Welcome Arc, and 25 m NW of Brgy. Nangalisan Boundary Welcome Arc. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3572, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.82072490, '15° 49\' 14.609650\"', 119.93216120, '119° 55\' 55.780150\"', 0.0100, '1', 78.5640, 0.0100, '2', 36.8604, 814112.25380, 1751297.75600, '50', 15.82233124, '15° 49\' 20.392460\"', 119.93082910, '119° 55\' 50.984860\"', 41.1927, 1750079.78000, 385459.84200, '3', 813971.25800, 1751366.77800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(966, 'PNG-3573', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LABRADOR', 'UYONG', 2008, 16.04935853, '16° 2\' 57.690708\"', 120.12141960, '120° 7\' 17.110560\"', 'PNG-3573 Station mark is in Mun. of Labrador, Brgy. of Uyong. To reach the station from the Town Proper travel NW direction to Brgy. Uyong for about 3.7 Km. until reaching the school site. Station mark is located at left side or S of the Nat\'l Road to Sual. About 30 m S or opposite side of the Uyong Elem. School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3573, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.04936195, '16° 2\' 57.703010\"', 120.12142020, '120° 7\' 17.112680\"', 0.0100, '1', 48.6640, 0.0100, '2', 6.0234, 191981.42470, 1776535.99100, '51', 16.05097838, '16° 3\' 3.522160\"', 120.12009370, '120° 7\' 12.337480\"', 11.5204, 1775287.25900, 405843.95000, '3', 191837.64400, 1776608.69100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(967, 'PNG-3579', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'POLONG', 2008, 15.97823919, '15° 58\' 41.661084\"', 120.20276870, '120° 12\' 9.967320\"', 'PNG-3579 Station mark is in Mun. of Bugallon, Brgy. of Pulong, from the Town Proper travel N direction for about 2.1 Km. to the road junction to Lingayen and Labrador, then turn left continue travel until reaching the school site of Brgy. Pulong. Station mark is located N of the Nat\'l Road in front or opposite of the main bldg. of Pulong Nat\'l High School. 30 m NE of the compound of Pulong Elem. School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptons, \"PNG-3579, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.97824206, '15° 58\' 41.671400\"', 120.20276990, '120° 12\' 9.971620\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.9530, 0.0100, '2', 3.9748, 200585.97940, 1768541.70700, '51', 15.97985228, '15° 58\' 47.468210\"', 120.20144190, '120° 12\' 5.190780\"', 9.3979, 1767381.44600, 414519.00200, '3', 200442.02500, 1768614.08200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(968, 'PNG-3580', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'POBLACION', 2008, 15.95040900, '15° 57\' 1.472400\"', 120.20596320, '120° 12\' 21.467520\"', 'PNG-3580 Station mark is in Mun. of Bugallon, Brgy. of Ornu, from the town, travel S direction towards Mun. of Aguilar until reaching the UNC Church, then turn right travel W direction about 1.2 Km. to Brgy. Ornu until reaching the Roman Catholic Chapel of Brgy. Ornu. Station mark is located along the concrete road near the road intersection going to the Brgy. Proper. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3580, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.95041176, '15° 57\' 1.482330\"', 120.20596460, '120° 12\' 21.472590\"', 0.0100, '1', 52.1620, 0.0100, '2', 9.0472, 200886.80760, 1765455.55600, '51', 15.95202018, '15° 57\' 7.272640\"', 120.20463600, '120° 12\' 16.689420\"', 14.5154, 1764300.35400, 414849.16700, '3', 200742.76200, 1765527.89500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(969, 'PNG-3582', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'CAYANGA', 2008, 15.92369353, '15° 55\' 25.296708\"', 120.21415930, '120° 12\' 50.973480\"', 'PNG-3582 Station mark is in Mun. of Bugallon, Brgy. of Cayanga. From the Town Proper travel S direction until reaching the intersection fo the road to Brgy. Cayanga, turn right then travel W direction until reaching the Brgy. Proper. Station mark is located N side of the basketball court and SW corner of the stage. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on a concrete pavement with inscriptions, \"PNG-3582, 2008, NAMRIA\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.92369601, '15° 55\' 25.305650\"', 120.21416070, '120° 12\' 50.978590\"', 0.0100, '1', 56.8820, 0.0200, '2', 13.6483, 201725.30300, 1762485.67900, '51', 15.92530259, '15° 55\' 31.089310\"', 120.21283140, '120° 12\' 46.193200\"', 19.1352, 1761340.57900, 415715.46000, '3', 201581.17400, 1762557.96900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(970, 'PNG-3607', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINMALEY', 'BALAGAN', 2008, 15.98035281, '15° 58\' 49.270116\"', 120.29789720, '120° 17\' 52.429920\"', 'PNG-3607 Station mark is in Mun. of Binmaley, Brgy. of Balagan. From Town Proper travel about 7.4 Km. S direction to City of San Carlos until reaching the T intersection going to Brgy. Balagan Proper, turn right to Brgy. Balagan Proper, turn right to Brgy. Balagan Proper 150 m before reaching Balagan Elem. School. Station mark is located about 150 m N of Balagan Elem. School and 1 m W of concrete canal. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3607, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.98035606, '15° 58\' 49.281800\"', 120.29789900, '120° 17\' 52.436240\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.7250, 0.0100, '2', 4.0259, 210778.14710, 1768641.06000, '51', 15.98196433, '15° 58\' 55.071570\"', 120.29657110, '120° 17\' 47.656010\"', 8.9457, 1767578.40300, 424703.28900, '3', 210634.27700, 1768713.12500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(971, 'PNG-3634', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BAYAMBANG', 'ALINGGAN', 2008, 15.84185744, '15° 50\' 30.686784\"', 120.41145840, '120° 24\' 41.250240\"', 'PNG-3634 Station mark is in Mun. of Bayambang, Brgy. of Alinggan. From Town Proper travel about 5.5 Km. W direction until reaching the T intersection road of Brgy. Alinggan, then continue travel of about 40 m. Station mark is located about 40 m W of waiting shed, and about 520 m E of Basista boundary welcome arc. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and set on center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a concrete pavement. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3634, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.84185985, '15° 50\' 30.695470\"', 120.41146160, '120° 24\' 41.261770\"', 0.0100, '1', 54.0160, 0.0100, '2', 11.3377, 222750.61120, 1753153.41800, '51', 15.84345698, '15° 50\' 36.445120\"', 120.41013070, '120° 24\' 36.470380\"', 15.5453, 1752214.63200, 436816.11500, '3', 222606.36900, 1753224.99400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(972, 'PNG-3642', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BAYAMBANG', 'MANAMBONG SUR', 2008, 15.77822115, '15° 46\' 41.596140\"', 120.46117830, '120° 27\' 40.241880\"', 'PNG-3642 Station mark is in Mun. of Bayambang, Brgy. of Manambong Sur. From Brgy. Hall of Manambong Norte going S direction by Brgy. Road travel about 1.6 Km. approaching junction of Brgy. Manambong Parte and brgy. Manambong Sur. Station mark is located at the boundary of Manambong Sur, Manambong Norte and Manambong Parte, and about 16 S of Brgy. Welcome Arc. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3642, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.77822345, '15° 46\' 41.604410\"', 120.46118200, '120° 27\' 40.255210\"', 0.0100, '1', 60.1320, 0.0100, '2', 17.5736, 227993.90120, 1746043.38100, '51', 15.77981549, '15° 46\' 47.335770\"', 120.45984960, '120° 27\' 35.458680\"', 21.3502, 1745158.40800, 442123.81800, '3', 227849.48600, 1746114.74100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(973, 'PNG-3644', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BAUTISTA', 'DIAZ', 2008, 15.79365992, '15° 47\' 37.175712\"', 120.50837540, '120° 30\' 30.151440\"', 'PNG-3644 Station mark is in Mun. of Bautista, Brgy. of Diaz. From Nat\'l Road at Hector Bridge turn right and follow the flood control going S direction about 5 Km. until reaching the Old Manila railroad and 2 m for Brgy. Road and turn left follow the Brgy. Road going to Brgy. Pupunto and about 1.36 Km. until reaching the Evacuation Center. Station mark is located at the back of Evacuation Center and about 20 m SE of Evacuation Center. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3644, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.79366246, '15° 47\' 37.184840\"', 120.50837940, '120° 30\' 30.165710\"', 0.0100, '1', 60.5420, 0.0100, '2', 18.4132, 233073.56690, 1747692.07800, '51', 15.79525443, '15° 47\' 42.915940\"', 120.50704740, '120° 30\' 25.370710\"', 21.6919, 1746854.30100, 447185.09000, '3', 232929.24300, 1747763.29700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(974, 'PNG-3660', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'LASIP', 2008, 15.90807395, '15° 54\' 29.066220\"', 120.45057030, '120° 27\' 2.053080\"', 'PNG-3660 Station mark is in Mun. of Malasiqui, Brgy. of Lasip Melag. From Lareg-lareg Road junction going S and follow the Brgy. Road to Lasip Melag of about 1.2 Km. until reaching the junction of Brgy. Lasip Melag and Brgy. Mallaga, turn right and by walking about 100 m SE direction until reaching the Dizon compound. Station mark is located at the Dizon compound establish at stock file and about 100 m SE of junction. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copepr nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3660, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.90807683, '15° 54\' 29.076580\"', 120.45057350, '120° 27\' 2.064710\"', 0.0100, '1', 55.3720, 0.0100, '2', 13.2614, 227031.42570, 1760432.75900, '51', 15.90967723, '15° 54\' 34.838040\"', 120.44924420, '120° 26\' 57.279100\"', 17.0051, 1759530.52500, 441025.14700, '3', 226887.43800, 1760504.26500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(975, 'PNG-3674', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGALDAN', 'MALABAGO', 2008, 16.05994605, '16° 3\' 35.805780\"', 120.39223770, '120° 23\' 32.055720\"', 'PNG-3674 Station mark is in Mun. of Mangaldan, Brgy. of Malabago. From Town Proper travel about 150 m W direction until reaching the intersection, turn right then travel about 200 m N direction until reaching the intersection going to Brgy. Malabago, turn left then travel about 1.2 Km. W direction until reaching the Maple Terra Ville Subdivision or factory bldg. of Joseph Lee, after the factory bldg. turn left by walking about 170 m on the ricefield. Station mark is located at the levee of the cornfield and about 100 m W of factory bldg. of Joseph Lee and about 170 m S of the road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3674, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.05995004, '16° 3\' 35.820140\"', 120.39224000, '120° 23\' 32.064170\"', 0.0100, '1', 46.7040, 0.0100, '2', 4.8321, 220992.85980, 1777324.11600, '51', 16.06156120, '16° 3\' 41.620310\"', 120.39091420, '120° 23\' 27.291090\"', 8.9362, 1776354.15300, 434828.19100, '3', 220849.33500, 1777395.94200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(976, 'PNG-3683', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SISON', 'ASAN NORTE', 2008, 16.17931084, '16° 10\' 45.519024\"', 120.51830920, '120° 31\' 5.913120\"', 'PNG-3683 STATION MARK IS IN MUN. OF SISON, BRGY. OF ASAN NORTE. FROM THE TOWN PROPER TRAVEL TO BRGY. ASAN NORTE UNTIL REACHING 6 M CONCRET BRIDGE. STATION MARK IS LOCATED 3 M NW OF THE NW OF THE N WING OF BRIDGE, 250 M E OF NAT\'L ROAD ABOUT 350 M SE PARTAS BUS STOP OVER AREA. STATION MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4 IN. COPPER NAIL CENTERED ON A 0.20 M X 0.20 M CONCRETE MONUMENT WITH A PROJECTION OF 0.20 M ABOVE THE GROUND SURFACE. INSCRIPTIONS, \"PNG-3683, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.17931606, '16° 10\' 45.537810\"', 120.51831220, '120° 31\' 5.924060\"', 0.0100, '1', 141.5840, 0.0100, '2', 99.6650, 234647.85320, 1790372.48700, '51', 16.18093186, '16° 10\' 51.354680\"', 120.51698940, '120° 31\' 1.161710\"', 103.8728, 1789527.14000, 448349.38500, '3', 234504.83400, 1790444.00100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(977, 'PNG-3687', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SISON', 'PALDIT', 2008, 16.16024186, '16° 9\' 36.870696\"', 120.53878640, '120° 32\' 19.631040\"', 'PNG-3687 Station mark is in. Mun. of Sison, Brgy. of Paldit and Sitio of Gorgordion. To reach the station, from the NCC entrance marker along Nat\'l Road, travel E direction towards NCC Plant until reaching Sitio Gorgordion, Brgy. of Paldit. Station mark is located 10 m N of road and at the start of ascending zigzag road and 25 m E of waiting shed. Station mark is intervisible to PNG-52, 2007, NAMRIA\". Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3687, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.16024712, '16° 9\' 36.889620\"', 120.53878920, '120° 32\' 19.641250\"', 0.0100, '1', 128.9780, 0.0100, '2', 87.0323, 236813.21850, 1788235.15100, '51', 16.16186129, '16° 9\' 42.700630\"', 120.53746590, '120° 32\' 14.877380\"', 91.1593, 1787411.91000, 450534.33900, '3', 236670.15200, 1788306.58300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(978, 'PNG-3692', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN JACINTO', 'AWAI', 2008, 16.09324847, '16° 5\' 35.694492\"', 120.48308760, '120° 28\' 59.115360\"', 'PNG-3692 Station mark is in Mun. of San Jancinto, Brgy. of Awai. From Town Proper travel about 4 Km. SE direction to Brgy. Lobong until reaching the intersection going to Brgy. Awai, turn left to Brgy. Awai travel about 1 Km. E direction until reaching the basketball court. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3692, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.09325331, '16° 5\' 35.711920\"', 120.48309020, '120° 28\' 59.124610\"', 0.0100, '1', 101.3670, 0.0100, '2', 59.7765, 230763.32300, 1780890.59100, '51', 16.09486454, '16° 5\' 41.512340\"', 120.48176520, '120° 28\' 54.354810\"', 63.4800, 1780012.76400, 444558.67300, '3', 230619.98500, 1780962.14900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(979, 'PNG-3693', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LAOAC', 'TURKO', 2008, 16.07298111, '16° 4\' 22.731996\"', 120.53821860, '120° 32\' 17.586960\"', 'PNG-3693 Station mark is in Mun. of Laoac, Brgy of Turko. From Town Proper travel SW direction towards Manaoag, upon reaching Maraboc Brgy. Hall turn right follow the road to Brgy. Turko upon approaching Brgy. Proper turn left follow the rough road to Sitio Cabuan. Station mark is located 15 m right side of E of the rough road, and 40 m W of the cluster of tree\'s NW of Brgy. Proper. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3693, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.07298547, '16° 4\' 22.747700\"', 120.53822180, '120° 32\' 17.598530\"', 0.0100, '1', 75.1000, 0.0100, '2', 33.5000, 236637.22100, 1778575.78400, '51', 16.07459424, '16° 4\' 28.539260\"', 120.53689650, '120° 32\' 12.827260\"', 37.0181, 1777755.83200, 450451.76700, '3', 236493.85900, 1778647.14500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(980, 'PNG-3696', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LAOAC', 'CASANESTEBANAN', 2008, 16.04292142, '16° 2\' 34.517112\"', 120.52549740, '120° 31\' 31.790640\"', 'PNG-3696 Station mark is in Mun. of Laoac, Brgy. of Casanestebanan. To reach the station, from the Town Proper travel W direction towards Manaoag, until reaching Brgy. Talodtod. Upon arriving Brgy. Talodtod boundary welcome arc, turn left passing through Brgy. Inanduyan, until reaching Brgy. Casanestebanan. Station mark is located 30 m W of Brgy. Road and 30 m S of Brgy. boundary welcome arc and about 40 m S of NIA irrigation canal. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3696, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.04292566, '16° 2\' 34.532370\"', 120.52550050, '120° 31\' 31.801940\"', 0.0100, '1', 65.2540, 0.0100, '2', 23.6974, 235235.79160, 1775264.32100, '51', 16.04453283, '16° 2\' 40.318200\"', 120.52417450, '120° 31\' 27.028070\"', 27.1120, 1774432.59900, 449082.95000, '3', 235092.31900, 1775335.69800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
