(981, 'PNG-3697', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINALONAN', 'SANTIAGO', 2008, 16.03065069, '16° 1\' 50.342484\"', 120.57014520, '120° 34\' 12.522720\"', 'PNG-3697 Station mark is in Mun. of Binalonan, Brgy. of Santiago. From Binalonan-Laoac junction, travel S direction towards Urdaneta City, about 400 m after the Bimeg plant at NIA lateral irrigation canal, turn right W direction follow the rough access road of NIA lateral irrigation canal until reaching Brgy. Santiago, until the NIA irrigation canal and Brgy. Road intersection then turn left S direction for about 150 m. Station mark is located along the road 60 m S of concrete waithing shed along the intersection of Brgy. Road, and 50 m W of the gate of Fuster Garden Subdivision. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3697, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.03065476, '16° 1\' 50.357150\"', 120.57014860, '120° 34\' 12.535080\"', 0.0100, '1', 74.1360, 0.0100, '2', 32.5438, 239999.54890, 1773849.36900, '51', 16.03226019, '16° 1\' 56.136700\"', 120.56882230, '120° 34\' 7.760400\"', 35.8487, 1773064.17800, 453857.87800, '3', 239856.07200, 1773920.59100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(982, 'PNG-3700', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANAOAG', 'LELEMAAN', 2008, 16.00943703, '16° 0\' 33.973308\"', 120.52133700, '120° 31\' 16.813200\"', 'PNG-3700 Station mark is in Mun. of Manaoag, Brgy. of Lelemaan. From Urdaneta City travel NW direction to Manaoag until reaching Brgy. Lelemaan, at Km. post 189 approaching box culvert, turn left follow the road to Brgy. Proper until reaching sharp curve road and the intersection of NIA lateral irrigation canal a the intersection continue travel W direction follow NIA main farm ditch canal for about 250 m. Station mark is located at the left side or S of the main farm ditch embankment, about 200 m SW of first cell site antena and about 300 m S of pyramid compound of Manaoag. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3700, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.00944040, '16° 0\' 33.985430\"', 120.52134040, '120° 31\' 16.825470\"', 0.0100, '1', 63.0610, 0.0100, '2', 21.4915, 234746.13210, 1771562.72300, '51', 16.01104558, '16° 0\' 39.764070\"', 120.52001350, '120° 31\' 12.048750\"', 24.8279, 1770728.23900, 448629.11900, '3', 234602.54300, 1771634.08600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(983, 'PNG-3713', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTO TOMAS', 'POBLACION EAST', 2008, 15.87775192, '15° 52\' 39.906912\"', 120.58430850, '120° 35\' 3.510600\"', 'PNG-3713 Station mark is in Mun. of Sto. Tomas, Brgy. of Poblacion. It is located inside the compound of Sto. Tomas Central School, bet. the two school bldg. beside the school nursery about 35 m SE of the flag pole and about 30 m S of the Provincial Road to Mun. of Alcala. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3713, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.87775501, '15° 52\' 39.918030\"', 120.58431250, '120° 35\' 3.525010\"', 0.0100, '1', 68.0010, 0.0100, '2', 26.4078, 241319.61950, 1756905.95000, '51', 15.87935058, '15° 52\' 45.662080\"', 120.58298260, '120° 34\' 58.737490\"', 29.2189, 1756141.77300, 455339.40200, '3', 241175.64100, 1756976.99600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(984, 'PNG-3714', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ROSALES', 'ZONE I', 2008, 15.89356458, '15° 53\' 36.832488\"', 120.63206890, '120° 37\' 55.448040\"', 'PNG-3714 Station mark is in Mun. of Rosales, Brgy. of Poblacion. It is located at the SE corner of Rizal Monument Foundation about 25 m E of the road intersection to Mun. of Sta. Maria and Balungao. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and set on a center of 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a concrete pavement. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3714, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.89356782, '15° 53\' 36.844160\"', 120.63207310, '120° 37\' 55.463160\"', 0.0100, '1', 74.0710, 0.0100, '2', 32.4535, 246456.32410, 1758597.86300, '51', 15.89516333, '15° 53\' 42.587990\"', 120.63074370, '120° 37\' 50.677210\"', 35.2206, 1757881.81700, 460457.53600, '3', 246312.43800, 1758668.76700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(985, 'PNG-3720', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'UMINGAN', 'SAN ANDRES', 2008, 15.88613198, '15° 53\' 10.075128\"', 120.74355330, '120° 44\' 36.791880\"', 'PNG-3720 Station mark is in Mun. of Umingan, Brgy. of San Andres. From the highway junction of Brgy. San Andres travel S direction follow the Brgy. Road to Sta. Rosa continue travel about 2 Km. until reaching the Sta. Rosa Boundary Welcome Arc. Station mark is located about 3 m NW of Brgy. Sta. Rosa Boundary Welcome Arc. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3720, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.88613568, '15° 53\' 10.088430\"', 120.74355800, '120° 44\' 36.808890\"', 0.0100, '1', 107.3350, 0.0100, '2', 65.1181, 258390.01180, 1757643.16900, '51', 15.88772826, '15° 53\' 15.821730\"', 120.74222860, '120° 44\' 32.022890\"', 68.1921, 1757041.25800, 472395.16400, '3', 258246.19400, 1757713.70400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(986, 'PNG-3737', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ASINGAN', 'POBLACION EAST', 2008, 16.00355155, '16° 0\' 12.785580\"', 120.66970420, '120° 40\' 10.935120\"', 'PNG-3737 Station mark is in Mun. of Asingan, Brgy. of Poblacion East. It is located infront of Mun. Town Hall going to City of Urdaneta at the E end of concrete island of the road, 15 m W of the fountain. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and set on a center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a concrete pavement. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3737, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.00355560, '16° 0\' 12.800150\"', 120.66970830, '120° 40\' 10.949940\"', 0.0100, '1', 88.1260, 0.0100, '2', 46.1673, 250624.13330, 1770727.35200, '51', 16.00515715, '16° 0\' 18.565740\"', 120.66838150, '120° 40\' 6.173470\"', 49.5157, 1770045.67100, 464507.44900, '3', 250480.64700, 1770798.22800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(987, 'PNG-3743', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN MANUEL', 'STO. DOMINGO', 2008, 16.09642998, '16° 5\' 47.147928\"', 120.64053980, '120° 38\' 25.943280\"', 'PNG-3743 Station mark is in Mun. of San Manuel, Brgy. of Sto Domingo. From the highway junction follow the Brgy. Road towards Sitio Cabatuan and travel about 1.2 Km. to reach Sitio Proper then continue travel N direction about 1.8 Km. to reach Sitio Tacmen. Station mark is located at Sitio Tacmen Elem. School compound, NE corner portion of School Plaza, 7 m S of the school stage. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3743, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.09643487, '16° 5\' 47.165520\"', 120.64054380, '120° 38\' 25.957710\"', 0.0100, '1', 152.2670, 0.0100, '2', 110.0593, 247618.72330, 1781043.87200, '51', 16.09804283, '16° 5\' 52.954200\"', 120.63921920, '120° 38\' 21.188980\"', 114.0083, 1780328.61900, 461404.11400, '3', 247475.52600, 1781114.91900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(988, 'PNG-3747', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'SAN FELIPE EAST', 2008, 16.10715985, '16° 6\' 25.775460\"', 120.72482640, '120° 43\' 29.375040\"', 'PNG-3747 Station mark is in Mun. of San Nicolas, Brgy. of San Felipe East. From the Town Proper follow the road going N towards Brgy. San Felipe and travel about 2.1 Km. to reach the junction going to San Soro and going to San Felipe, turn right going to San Felipe and travel about 2.9 Km. to reach the junction. Station mark is located about 10 m N of the road junction of Brgy. San Felipe West and Brgy. Agpay and 20 m N of waiting shed. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3747, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.10716495, '16° 6\' 25.793810\"', 120.72483090, '120° 43\' 29.391230\"', 0.0100, '1', 135.0950, 0.0100, '2', 92.1091, 256651.76520, 1782130.38100, '51', 16.10877174, '16° 6\' 31.578270\"', 120.72350660, '120° 43\' 24.623810\"', 96.6648, 1781501.85900, 470422.73800, '3', 256508.67200, 1782201.16500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(989, 'PNG-3750', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'CASARATAN', 2008, 16.06933792, '16° 4\' 9.616512\"', 120.75615790, '120° 45\' 22.168440\"', 'PNG-3750 Station mark is in Mun. of San Nicolas, Brgy. of Casaratan. From the Town Proper going NW and follow the road towards San Manuel and travel about 800 m to reach the San Nicolas Bridge, turn left follow the Brgy. Road SE about 250 m until reaching the Solar Dryer Plaza. Station mark is located at the NE corner 250 of the Solar Dryer Plaza and about 250 m W of the S portion of San Nicolas Bridge. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3750, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.06934295, '16° 4\' 9.634620\"', 120.75616270, '120° 45\' 22.185680\"', 0.0100, '1', 124.1420, 0.0100, '2', 81.1241, 259958.97330, 1777907.25300, '51', 16.07094670, '16° 4\' 15.408130\"', 120.75483760, '120° 45\' 17.415220\"', 85.5213, 1777312.33000, 473769.35200, '3', 259815.77900, 1777977.90400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(990, 'PNG-3754', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ASINGAN', 'ARISTON ESTE', 2008, 16.01855098, '16° 1\' 6.783528\"', 120.69837020, '120° 41\' 54.132720\"', 'PNG-3754 Station mark is in Mun. of Asingan, Brgy. of Ariston East. From Brgy. Bantog intersection travel East direction and follow the road then travel about 2 Km. to reach the junction, about 200 m before Brgy. Health Center turn left and follow the Brgy. road and continue travel about 350 m. Station mark is located about 350 m N of Brgy. Health Center along Brgy. road going to Sitio Pao and 15 m E of bamboo tree. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3754, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.01855548, '16° 1\' 6.799710\"', 120.69837470, '120° 41\' 54.148770\"', 0.0100, '1', 91.8740, 0.0100, '2', 49.6585, 253711.68290, 1772353.47800, '51', 16.02015733, '16° 1\' 12.566400\"', 120.69704830, '120° 41\' 49.373710\"', 53.2396, 1771700.73400, 467578.04700, '3', 253568.27000, 1772424.27400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(991, 'PNG-3763', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'UMINGAN', 'LUBONG', 2008, 15.92270247, '15° 55\' 21.728892\"', 120.80606660, '120° 48\' 21.839760\"', 'PNG-3763 Station mark is in Mun. of Umingan, Brgy. of Macawas. From Town Proper travel about 2.2 Km. towards Mun. of Balungao until reaching the Brgy. Lubong boundary welcome arc, then continue travel about 400 m to reach RROW sign. Station mark is located at 1 m W of the post of RROW marking sign. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3763, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.92270689, '15° 55\' 21.744790\"', 120.80607190, '120° 48\' 21.858680\"', 0.0100, '1', 123.0980, 0.0100, '2', 80.2771, 265129.05650, 1761619.75000, '51', 15.92430038, '15° 55\' 27.481380\"', 120.80474340, '120° 48\' 17.076090\"', 83.9136, 1761080.59300, 479093.70000, '3', 264985.41300, 1761690.11400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(992, 'PNG-3765', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN QUINTIN', 'CARAYACAN', 2008, 15.95399839, '15° 57\' 14.394204\"', 120.80033490, '120° 48\' 1.205640\"', 'PNG-3765 Station mark is in Mun. of San Quintin, Brgy. of Carayacan. From the Town Proper of San Quintin going to Brgy. Calumboyan travel 230 m E direction until reaching the intersection, turn left then travel about 1.7 Km. SW direction to reach the junction going to Sitio Saiz and follow the road about 1.2 Km. SW direction until reaching the residential house of Mr. Florencio Lagyo. Station mark is located bet. the box culvert and the corner of concrete fence, and infront of house of Mr. Florencio Lagyo. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3765, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.95400263, '15° 57\' 14.409450\"', 120.80034030, '120° 48\' 1.225160\"', 0.0100, '1', 124.6680, 0.0100, '2', 81.7916, 264551.74590, 1765090.13200, '51', 15.95559821, '15° 57\' 20.153540\"', 120.79901260, '120° 47\' 56.445190\"', 85.5918, 1764544.18500, 478483.43100, '3', 264408.20200, 1765160.54200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(993, 'PNG-3767', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'UMINGAN', 'NANCALABASAAN', 2008, 15.93748616, '15° 56\' 14.950176\"', 120.83801590, '120° 50\' 16.857240\"', 'PNG-3767 Station mark is in Mun. of Umingan, Brgy. of Nankalabasaan. From the Town Proper travel about 600 m towards San Quintin until reaching the Banela Bridge, turn left follow the flood control access road to Brgy. Barat and travel about 600 m until reaching the property of Mr. Alex Macatdon. Station mark is located at the land property of Mr. Alex Macatdon and 25 m N of the lower ground of flood control. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3767, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.93749076, '15° 56\' 14.966740\"', 120.83802150, '120° 50\' 16.877340\"', 0.0100, '1', 146.0420, 0.0100, '2', 102.8404, 268567.77680, 1763220.34400, '51', 15.93908448, '15° 56\' 20.704110\"', 120.83669340, '120° 50\' 12.096180\"', 106.8247, 1762713.46700, 482515.90500, '3', 268424.21000, 1763290.61700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(994, 'PNG-3769 (BLLM-1)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'POBLACION WEST', 2013, 15.98031738, '15° 58\' 49.142568\"', 120.69852760, '120° 41\' 54.699360\"', 'PNG-3769 (BLLM-1) Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay Poblacion West. From Tayug, Pangasinan travel South West Towards Pobalcion West, Sta Maria, Pangasinan, until reaching the plaza, then travel North West until reaching the market. BLLM No. 1 is located about 200m. NW of the east side of the plaza, about 170m. SE of the Welcome Arc of San Patricio and about 150 m. SE of BLLM No. 2. Mark is the head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. .25m. x 120 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"STA. MARIA PNG, BLLM NO.1, CAD-487-D, DENR LMS-R1, 2013\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.98032151, '15° 58\' 49.157420\"', 120.69853220, '120° 41\' 54.715860\"', 0.0100, '1', 87.3370, 0.0100, '2', 45.2522, 253681.66510, 1768121.14800, '51', 15.98192098, '15° 58\' 54.915510\"', 120.69720490, '120° 41\' 49.937570\"', 48.5868, 1767469.91900, 467588.64600, '3', 253538.12500, 1768191.91100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(995, 'PNG-3771 (BLLM-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'PATAQUID', 2013, 15.96048682, '15° 57\' 37.752552\"', 120.74010840, '120° 44\' 24.390240\"', 'PNG-3771 (BLLM-3) Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay Pataquid fromPoblacion West travel SE towards Sta. Cruz then travel NE towards Pataquid, until reaching the barangay hall of Pataquid. Bllm No.3 is located at the SE side of the Barangay Hall of Pataquid and about 110m. NW of BLLM No. 4.Mark is the head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. .25m. x 120 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"STA. MARIA PNG, BLLM NO.3, CAD-487-D, DENR LMS-R1, 2013\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.96049106, '15° 57\' 37.767800\"', 120.74011330, '120° 44\' 24.407810\"', 0.0100, '1', 92.5850, 0.0100, '2', 50.2464, 258110.10630, 1765877.34500, '51', 15.96208837, '15° 57\' 43.518140\"', 120.73878560, '120° 44\' 19.628060\"', 53.6742, 1765269.45500, 472036.74100, '3', 257966.53400, 1765947.95600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(996, 'PNG-3773 (BLLM-5)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'SANTA CRUZ', 2013, 15.94377259, '15° 56\' 37.581324\"', 120.72076630, '120° 43\' 14.758680\"', 'PNG-3773 (BLLM-5) Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay Sta. Cruz. From Poblacion West travel SE towards Sta. Cruz Elementary School. BLLM No. 5 is located beside the house of the barangay captain near Sta. Cruz Elementary School, about 100m. NE of BLLM No. 6.Mark is the head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. .25m. x 120 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"STA. MARIA PNG, BLLM NO.5, CAD-487-D, DENR LMS-R1, 2013\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.94377661, '15° 56\' 37.595780\"', 120.72077100, '120° 43\' 14.775650\"', 0.0100, '1', 85.4210, 0.0100, '2', 43.2693, 256018.61450, 1764049.81500, '51', 15.94537330, '15° 56\' 43.343890\"', 120.71944290, '120° 43\' 9.994390\"', 46.5067, 1763422.66400, 469963.58500, '3', 255874.97000, 1764120.47400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(997, 'PNG-3822 (MBM-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'SAN VICENTE', 2014, 15.98915160, '15° 59\' 20.945760\"', 120.71152710, '120° 42\' 41.497560\"', 'Mark is head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. x 1.20 m. x 0.35 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"MUN. OF STA MARIA, CAD-487-D, MBM NO. 2, PROV. OF PANGASINAN\" Station is located in the province of Pangasinan, Municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay San Vicente. From Rosales travel North towards the Welcome Arch of Tayug. It is located beside the Welcome Arch of Tayug.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.98915580, '15° 59\' 20.960890\"', 120.71153160, '120° 42\' 41.513660\"', 0.0100, '1', 89.4390, 0.0100, '2', 47.2388, 255084.34110, 1769083.65600, '51', 15.99075554, '15° 59\' 26.719940\"', 120.71020450, '120° 42\' 36.736180\"', 50.6839, 1768445.46600, 468981.50300, '3', 254940.84100, 1769154.38400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(998, 'PNG-3830 (MBM-11)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'SAN PABLO', 2014, 15.93827864, '15° 56\' 17.803104\"', 120.69867290, '120° 41\' 55.222440\"', 'Mark is head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. x 1.20 m. x 0.35 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"MUN. OF STA MARIA, CAD-487-D, MBM NO. 11, PROV. OF PANGASINAN\" Station is located in the province of Pangasinan, Municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay San Pablo. From Balungao travel North towards San Pablo, passing a steel bridge, until reaching the Welcome Singage of San Pablo. It is located about 20 m. North of the steel bridge near the Welcome Signage of San Pablo.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.93828253, '15° 56\' 17.817110\"', 120.69867760, '120° 41\' 55.239460\"', 0.0100, '1', 82.1060, 0.0100, '2', 40.1198, 253645.82070, 1763467.67000, '51', 15.93987937, '15° 56\' 23.565730\"', 120.69734930, '120° 41\' 50.457620\"', 43.2287, 1762818.08000, 467597.35200, '3', 253502.14000, 1763538.39600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(999, 'PNG-3976', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'DALAYAP', 2010, 15.96237654, '15° 57\' 44.555544\"', 120.69698210, '120° 41\' 49.135560\"', 'PNG-3976 The station is located at Barangay Dalayap, Sta. Maria, Pangasinan along barangay road about 2.5 meters from barangay marker and 3 meters from the arc. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered on a 0.30m. x 0.30m concrete monument with inscription \"PNG-3976, PRS-92, 2010, DENR-LMS-1.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.96238039, '15° 57\' 44.569410\"', 120.69698640, '120° 41\' 49.151190\"', 0.0100, '1', 84.2270, 0.0100, '2', 42.2018, 253494.17730, 1766137.06900, '51', 15.96397878, '15° 57\' 50.323590\"', 120.69565870, '120° 41\' 44.371380\"', 45.4264, 1765484.89100, 467420.24000, '3', 253350.57600, 1766207.82200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1000, 'PNG-4', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ROSALES', 'CARMAY EAST', 1989, 15.91126435, '15° 54\' 40.551660\"', 120.64172020, '120° 38\' 30.192720\"', 'PNG-4 Station was set on top W irrigation canal headwall; about 3 kms. E of Rosales town proper; 500 m. NW of Brgy. Carmay East and 10 km. W of Sta. Maria. It is accessible for all types of vehicles. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set on top center of W irrigation canal headwall with cement patty and inscribed on top \"PNG-004 1989 NAMRIA\". Reference marks (RM) is 4, RMs are 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods set in drilled holes with cement patty and inscribed with RM numbers.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.91126770, '15° 54\' 40.563710\"', 120.64172390, '120° 38\' 30.205860\"', 0.0100, '1', 75.0360, 0.0100, '2', 33.3796, 247512.27890, 1760545.44300, '51', 15.91286410, '15° 54\' 46.310760\"', 120.64039480, '120° 38\' 25.421450\"', 36.2154, 1759838.56900, 461494.42900, '3', 247368.46000, 1760616.33000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1001, 'PNG-4000', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'ANGAYAN NORTE', 2009, 15.90199564, '15° 54\' 7.184304\"', 120.70033100, '120° 42\' 1.191600\"', 'PNG-4000 Station mark is located in the Municipality of Balungao, Brgy of Angayan Norte. from Balungao Municipal Hall. travel east along the National Highway towards the Municipality of Umingan for about 3.2 km. until reaching Kay-Chinette Eatery on the right. Station mark is located inside the well-fenced residential lot in front (other side of the road) of the eatery. The station is located 6 meters to the left (west) of the main concrete house. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set in a drilled hole and cemented flushed at he top 20 m x 20 cms. concrete monument set 0.20 m above the ground with Inscriptions, \"PNG 4000;2009 DENR\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.90199929, '15° 54\' 7.197440\"', 120.70033570, '120° 42\' 1.208650\"', 0.0100, '1', 85.1460, 0.0100, '2', 43.2099, 253779.16110, 1759449.52400, '51', 15.90359382, '15° 54\' 12.937760\"', 120.69900660, '120° 41\' 56.423760\"', 46.1555, 1758802.91700, 467768.99800, '3', 253635.36000, 1759520.21400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1002, 'PNG-4006', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'RAJAL', 2009, 15.90180527, '15° 54\' 6.498972\"', 120.70492900, '120° 42\' 17.744400\"', 'PNG-4006 From bulangao Municiipal Hall, travel east along the National Highway towards the Municipality of Umingan for about 120 m. up to the Plaza Basketball Court and just before reaching a bridge. Station mark is located on the right (west) side of the road outside the basketball court and about 60 cm. away from the concrete fence surrounding the Plaza Basketball Court. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set in a drilled hole and cemented flushed at he top 20 m x 20 cms. concrete monument set 0.20 m above the ground with Inscriptions, \"PNG 4006;2009 DENR\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.02242110, '16° 1\' 20.715970\"', 120.64169080, '120° 38\' 30.086710\"', 0.0100, '1', 85.4830, 0.0100, '2', 43.6224, 247648.12490, 1772849.51800, '51', 16.02402445, '16° 1\' 26.488010\"', 120.64036440, '120° 38\' 25.311690\"', 46.9976, 1772138.30700, 461512.40400, '3', 247504.67900, 1772920.50100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1003, 'PNG-4024 (BBM-26)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'SAN JULIAN', 2010, 15.93435118, '15° 56\' 3.664248\"', 120.67444280, '120° 40\' 27.994080\"', 'PNG-4024 From Balungao Municipal Hall, travel east along the National Highway towards the Municipality of Umingan for about 600 m. until reaching the Brgy. Road leading to Brgy. San Raymundo and San Julian. Turn left and folllow the road until reaching the junction leading to Brgy San Marcelino (about 4 km) Travel for another 2 km up to the welcome arc of brgy. San Marcelino. Station mark is located on the left side of the road about 1 meter south from the left foot of the arc. Station mark is the head of Steel rod 1 cm diameter set in a drilled hole and cementerd flushed at the top of 30 x 30 cms. concrete monument set 30 cm. above the ground with inscription \"BBM-26\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.93435484, '15° 56\' 3.677410\"', 120.67444750, '120° 40\' 28.010920\"', 0.0100, '1', 79.4470, 0.0100, '2', 37.6169, 251045.94870, 1763061.69500, '51', 15.93595196, '15° 56\' 9.427070\"', 120.67311910, '120° 40\' 23.228620\"', 40.6166, 1762387.43500, 465002.48500, '3', 250902.23400, 1763132.49600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1004, 'PNG-4039 (BBM-15)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'IMBO', 2008, 16.30718526, '16° 18\' 25.866936\"', 119.97593110, '119° 58\' 33.351960\"', 'PNG-4039 (BBM-15) The sttion is located along the road in going to Barangay Dolaoan boundary of San Jose and Namagbagan. Station mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm. x 30cm. x 100cm. standard concrete monument protruding about 20cm. with inscription, BBM-15.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.30719010, '16° 18\' 25.884370\"', 119.97592980, '119° 58\' 33.347270\"', 0.0100, '1', 48.3320, 0.0100, '2', 8.2455, 818029.65190, 1805236.09800, '50', 16.30882568, '16° 18\' 31.772440\"', 119.97460920, '119° 58\' 28.593150\"', 12.3227, 1803893.24700, 390417.09700, '3', 817890.17000, 1805305.32500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1005, 'PNG-4043 (BBM-16)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BAYAMBANG', 'NALSIAN SUR', 2007, 15.83978770, '15° 50\' 23.235720\"', 120.45266610, '120° 27\' 9.597960\"', 'PNG-4043 (BBM-16) The station is located inside the compound of Nalsian Elementary School on the southwest side of Welcome Arc of Barangay Nalsian Norte, bounary of alsian Norte and Sur. Station mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm. x 30cm. x 100cm. standard concrete monument protruding about 20cm. with inscription, BBM-16.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.83979057, '15° 50\' 23.246040\"', 120.45266950, '120° 27\' 9.610330\"', 0.0100, '1', 59.1060, 0.0100, '2', 16.7450, 227163.98030, 1752870.26700, '51', 15.84138666, '15° 50\' 28.991960\"', 120.45133860, '120° 27\' 4.818960\"', 20.5291, 1751973.57800, 441229.62700, '3', 227019.76500, 1752941.70700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1006, 'PNG-4054 (BBM-4)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'CONCORDIA', 2007, 16.38413198, '16° 23\' 2.875128\"', 119.88809320, '119° 53\' 17.135520\"', 'PNG-4054 (BBM-4) The station is located under the mango tree boundary of barangay. Station mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm. x 30cm. x 100cm. standard concrete monument protruding about 20cm. with inscription, BBM-4.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.38413715, '16° 23\' 2.893730\"', 119.88809090, '119° 53\' 17.127280\"', 0.0100, '1', 50.0020, 0.0100, '2', 11.0107, 808514.71840, 1813621.89700, '50', 16.38577938, '16° 23\' 8.805760\"', 119.88677200, '119° 53\' 12.379260\"', 14.4401, 1812458.79500, 381075.60500, '3', 808375.41500, 1813691.43500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
