(1009, 'PNG-4061 (BLLM-4)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'INFANTA', 'BATANG', 2007, 15.86397463, '15° 51\' 50.308668\"', 119.90975720, '119° 54\' 35.125920\"', 'PNG-4061 (BLLM-4) The station is about 150 meters from barangay hall eastward at Barangay Batang, Infanta, Pangasinan. Station mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30cm. x 30cm. x 100cm. standard concrete monument protruding about 20cm. with inscription, BLLM-4.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.86397659, '15° 51\' 50.315710\"', 119.90975710, '119° 54\' 35.125710\"', 0.0100, '1', 53.9150, 0.0100, '2', 12.4860, 811643.95590, 1756053.82400, '50', 15.86558612, '15° 51\' 56.110030\"', 119.90842610, '119° 54\' 30.333960\"', 16.7274, 1754878.82000, 383084.46200, '3', 811503.07700, 1756122.94300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
