(1012, 'PNG-4692', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'STA. ROSA', 2013, 15.97104601, '15° 58\' 15.765636\"', 120.68333050, '120° 40\' 59.989800\"', 'PNG-4692 The station is located at Barangay Sta. Rosa, Sta. Maria. Pangasinan about 500 meters North of Paitan Barangay Hall and 150 meters North of PNG-4691. Station mark is the head of 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.30 x 0.30 x 1.20m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions PNG-4692, 2013, 3RD ORDER, DENR/LMS-1.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.97104974, '15° 58\' 15.779080\"', 120.68333480, '120° 41\' 0.005150\"', 0.0100, '1', 82.5800, 0.0100, '2', 40.6184, 252042.95420, 1767112.90800, '51', 15.97264897, '15° 58\' 21.536290\"', 120.68200720, '120° 40\' 55.226000\"', 43.8386, 1766446.41500, 465960.29900, '3', 251899.37000, 1767183.71200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1013, 'PNG-47', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN QUINTIN', 'LAGASIT', 2007, 16.00241486, '16° 0\' 8.693496\"', 120.78360690, '120° 47\' 0.984840\"', 'PNG-47 From Urdaneta, travel towards Asingan then to Tayug. Proceed ahead until reaching the San Quintin \"welcome sign\" arc. From the said arc, travel towards San Quintin proper for about 350 m., where the station is located. Station is located 3.3 m. E of the concrete \"Thank You\" sign and 1.5 m. S from the road edge. Mark is a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"PNG-47 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.00242273, '16° 0\' 8.721810\"', 120.78361170, '120° 47\' 1.002020\"', 0.0100, '1', 116.5210, 0.0200, '2', 73.6107, 262817.47360, 1770468.49200, '51', 16.00402170, '16° 0\' 14.478130\"', 120.78228500, '120° 46\' 56.226040\"', 77.6314, 1769903.92300, 476698.27400, '3', 262674.07800, 1770538.99800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1014, 'PNG-4700', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'PUGOT', 2013, 15.98555629, '15° 59\' 8.002644\"', 120.73080120, '120° 43\' 50.884320\"', 'PNG-4700 The station is located at Barangay Pugot, Sta. Maria. Pangasinan, front of Jackie Jacob house and about 200 meters South of Pugot Elementary School and 10 meters South of outpost. Station mark is the head of 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.30 x 0.30 x 1.20m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions PNG-4700, 2013, 3RD ORDER, DENR/LMS-1.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.98556053, '15° 59\' 8.017910\"', 120.73080620, '120° 43\' 50.902390\"', 0.0100, '1', 93.2320, 0.0100, '2', 50.8866, 257143.72750, 1768663.08000, '51', 15.98715962, '15° 59\' 13.774620\"', 120.72947910, '120° 43\' 46.124710\"', 54.4194, 1768044.80500, 471044.07100, '3', 257000.23100, 1768733.74200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1015, 'PNG-4706', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'BAL-LOY', 2013, 15.96556438, '15° 57\' 56.031768\"', 120.71519330, '120° 42\' 54.695880\"', 'PNG-4706 The station is located at Barangay Balloy, Sta. Maria. Pangasinan near the bridge and 200 meters West of Welcome Arc of Cabuloan. Station mark is the head of 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.30 x 0.30 x 1.20m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions PNG-4706, 2013, 3RD ORDER, DENR/LMS-1.\"', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.96556841, '15° 57\' 56.046280\"', 120.71519790, '120° 42\' 54.712280\"', 0.0100, '1', 86.6660, 0.0100, '2', 44.5061, 255448.21680, 1766468.46500, '51', 15.96716659, '15° 58\' 1.799740\"', 120.71387020, '120° 42\' 49.932830\"', 47.8309, 1765834.85300, 469370.28300, '3', 255304.64100, 1766539.16100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1016, 'PNG-49', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'UMINGAN', 'GONZALES', 2007, 15.91355128, '15° 54\' 48.784608\"', 120.76545950, '120° 45\' 55.654200\"', 'PNG-49 From Umingan Town Hall, travel for about 9 km. S going to Capas, Tarlac until reaching Carayungan Bridge (Km. 192 + 144). Station is located on the NE end of the said bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embbedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-49 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.91355886, '15° 54\' 48.811880\"', 120.76546470, '120° 45\' 55.672770\"', 0.0100, '1', 104.0300, 0.0100, '2', 61.5915, 260769.14920, 1760653.32700, '51', 15.91515268, '15° 54\' 54.549630\"', 120.76413590, '120° 45\' 50.889190\"', 64.9164, 1760072.91500, 474744.66000, '3', 260625.44100, 1760723.81500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1017, 'PNG-72', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'TORITORI', 2007, 16.23398537, '16° 14\' 2.347332\"', 119.99593380, '119° 59\' 45.361680\"', 'PNG-72 From Alaminos proper, travel N for about 29 km. then turn right and travel for about 6 km. up to Anda proper. Then travel for about 12 km. to Brgy. Toritori. Station is located along the N side of the concrete brgy. road going to Sitio Mangasen. It is about 120 m. SE of the brgy. plaza, about 65 m. E of the Kingdom Hall of Jehova\'s Witnesses, about 55 m. E of a waiting shed, about 30 m. SW of an unfinished concrete house and 0.9 m. N of the N side of the road. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 20 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-72 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 14 2.35458 E 119 59 45.37526 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 55.565 m.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.23399207, '16° 14\' 2.371440\"', 119.99593680, '119° 59\' 45.372420\"', 0.0100, '1', 54.5990, 0.0100, '2', 13.8270, 820288.26030, 1797161.07200, '50', 16.23562268, '16° 14\' 8.241660\"', 119.99461450, '119° 59\' 40.612230\"', 18.3185, 1795781.64500, 392515.40400, '3', 820148.56800, 1797230.19000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1018, 'PNG-81', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'ARWAS', 2007, 16.19713792, '16° 11\' 49.696512\"', 119.86289980, '119° 51\' 46.439280\"', 'PNG-81 Is located in Brgy. Arwas, Bani, on a dike of the rice paddies 20 m. E of the Materials Recovery Facility compound, about 300 m. W of the road leading to Bolinao and 25 m. NW of a water pump. Mark ìis the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-81 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 11 49.70440 E 119 51 46.45525 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 50.680 m.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.19714420, '16° 11\' 49.719120\"', 119.86290420, '119° 51\' 46.454990\"', 0.0100, '1', 49.7550, 0.0100, '2', 9.6918, 806112.76350, 1792877.14600, '50', 16.19877544, '16° 11\' 55.591600\"', 119.86158090, '119° 51\' 41.691130\"', 13.6848, 1791778.24900, 378268.80500, '3', 805972.87200, 1792946.63200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1019, 'PNG-82', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'SAMPALOC', 2007, 16.26489508, '16° 15\' 53.622288\"', 119.87655490, '119° 52\' 35.597640\"', 'PNG-82 From Bani proper, travel N going to Bolinao for about 11 km. to reach the station. It is about 14 km. from Bolinao proper. Station is located at the SE corner of the culvert along the road to Sampaloc Nat\'l. High School. It is about 50 m. E of the said school and about 25 m. W of the nat\'l. highway. Mark is the head ìof a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-82 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 15 53.62903 E 119 52 35.61359 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 135.131 m.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.26490159, '16° 15\' 53.645720\"', 119.87655720, '119° 52\' 35.605860\"', 0.0100, '1', 134.2390, 0.0100, '2', 94.4126, 807468.25620, 1800400.71000, '50', 16.26653670, '16° 15\' 59.532120\"', 119.87523550, '119° 52\' 30.847820\"', 98.3416, 1799269.17600, 379770.21200, '3', 807328.58200, 1800470.20000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1020, 'PNG-86', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'GAYUSAN', 2007, 16.05373063, '16° 3\' 13.430268\"', 119.78467880, '119° 47\' 4.843680\"', 'PNG-86 Is located on the open backyard of Gayusan Elem. School. It is ìsituated about 25 m. E of the cemented pathway leading to the ìBoy\'s CR of the said school. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper ìnail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block, ìwith inscriptions \"PNG-86 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 3 13.44051 E 119 47 4.86059 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 75.977 m.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 16.05373647, '16° 3\' 13.451300\"', 119.78468180, '119° 47\' 4.854380\"', 0.0100, '1', 75.2230, 0.0100, '2', 35.7664, 797957.76540, 1776882.87800, '50', 16.05536054, '16° 3\' 19.297950\"', 119.78335500, '119° 47\' 0.078130\"', 38.9087, 1775954.55100, 369809.44900, '3', 797817.38500, 1776952.49700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1021, 'PNG-87', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'ULI', 2007, 15.96011995, '15° 57\' 36.431820\"', 119.82045360, '119° 49\' 13.632960\"', 'PNG-87 From Dasol Mun. Hall, travel along the nat\'l. highway going to ìBurgos until reaching the brgy. road going to Brgy. Bobonot. Turn ìleft to the said road until reaching the Y-road. Turn right until ìreaching Uli Elem. School. Station is located inside the school ìcompound, about 1.3 m. S from the N wall and approx. 8 m. E of ìthe E end of the gate. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail ìcentered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument ìprotruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-87 ì2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 57 36.44368 E 119 49 13.64919 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 44.913 m.', 2017, 'Gravity', 2017.33, 15.96012562, '15° 57\' 36.452220\"', 119.82045700, '119° 49\' 13.645170\"', 0.0100, '1', 44.1580, 0.0100, '2', 4.0605, 801929.11260, 1766569.29900, '50', 15.96174310, '15° 57\' 42.275150\"', 119.81912810, '119° 49\' 8.861150\"', 7.4752, 1765572.01600, 373579.02100, '3', 801788.46800, 1766638.74900, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1022, 'MMA-3', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF TAGUIG', 'FORT BONIFACIO', 2014, 14.53501543, '14° 32\' 6.055560\"', 121.04028510, '121° 2\' 25.026370\"', 'MMA-3 From the south super highway/E. de los Santos interchange, travel northeast for 1 kilometer towards Nichols/Fort Bonifacio gate, (Gate 3). Then turn left to enter the gate of Fort Bonifacio. Continue travelling on northwest direction for 2 kilometers up to the National Mapping and Resource Information Authority building; (NAMRIA). Station is located at the sidewalk about 10 meters north of the western gate and approximately 10 meters from the guard house. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. in diameter brass rod centered in a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. x 0.65 m concrete block, flush level with the ground surface with inscription \"MMA-3 1989 NAMRIA\"', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.53501545, '14° 32\' 6.055620\"', 121.04028520, '121° 2\' 25.026690\"', 0.0100, '1', 71.5290, 0.0100, '1', 27.8110, 288831.41150, 1607804.28000, '51', 14.53651537, '14° 32\' 11.455340\"', 121.03892430, '121° 2\' 20.127450\"', 27.5760, 1607527.69500, 504195.05300, '3', 288683.34900, 1607872.63600, '51', 14.53505963, '14° 32\' 6.214670\"', 121.04027710, '121° 2\' 24.997690\"', 0.0095, 69.9160, 0.0151, '2017-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1023, 'MMA-3045', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF NAVOTAS', 'NBBS PROPER', 2014, 14.64121256, '14° 38\' 28.365220\"', 120.95830000, '120° 57\' 29.879860\"', 'MMA-3045 From Luneta going to Navotas/Caloocan take Road 10 Highway then turn to C3 Road going to Caloocan go to the U-turn Slot where the GCP of LMS-NCR is located. Station is located on the center island of a U-turn slot facing the route going to Caloocan Area. The station is about 50 to 60 cm. higher above the ground. Station is marked with a head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded on the center of a 0.25 m x 0.25 cm x 30 cm cement putty with inscriptions, \"MMA-3045, 2007, LMS-NCR\".', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.64121262, '14° 38\' 28.365420\"', 120.95829850, '120° 57\' 29.874640\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.6590, 0.0500, '1', 4.7304, 280099.25400, 1619633.78100, '51', 14.64272127, '14° 38\' 33.796570\"', 120.95694000, '120° 57\' 24.984030\"', 4.3454, 1619277.64900, 495361.44700, '3', 279951.46900, 1619702.50300, '51', 14.64125679, '14° 38\' 28.524430\"', 120.95829040, '120° 57\' 29.845470\"', 0.0125, 46.0170, 0.0305, '2017-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
