(1024, 'MMA-3055 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MANDALUYONG', 'POBLACION', 1999, 14.57802853, '14° 34\' 40.902700\"', 121.03441970, '121° 2\' 3.910750\"', 'MMA-3055 From EDSA take Boni Ave. to Mandaluyong City Hall. Turn right at the round about & enter the Entrance gate of the City Hall opposite M. Martinez Ave. look for the GCP of LMS-NCR just beside the Gate. The station was marked with a head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA-3055, 2008 LMS-NCR\".', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.57802874, '14° 34\' 40.903450\"', 121.03441900, '121° 2\' 3.908230\"', 0.0100, '1', 48.6200, 0.0300, '1', 4.9610, 288240.13490, 1612569.46100, '51', 14.57953160, '14° 34\' 46.313750\"', 121.03305910, '121° 1\' 59.012630\"', 4.9407, 1612286.59400, 503562.24000, '3', 288092.20900, 1612637.87700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1025, 'MMA-3077', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'PATEROS', 'TABACALERA', 2014, 14.54848077, '14° 32\' 54.530770\"', 121.06942450, '121° 4\' 9.928060\"', 'MMA-3077 From C-5 to Buting road, turn left ot Pateros cemetery then turn right to F. C. Cruz where the station is located at Tabacalera Learning center compound. Mark is a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty with inscription MMA-3077 2008 LMS-NCR. Note: No inscription only cooper nail', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.54848106, '14° 32\' 54.531800\"', 121.06942430, '121° 4\' 9.927510\"', 0.0100, '1', 49.5950, 0.0200, '1', 5.5899, 291984.95950, 1609267.54900, '51', 14.54998120, '14° 32\' 59.932330\"', 121.06806380, '121° 4\' 5.029720\"', 5.6122, 1609018.19000, 507335.11300, '3', 291836.96800, 1609335.82400, '51', 14.54852524, '14° 32\' 54.690880\"', 121.06941630, '121° 4\' 9.898560\"', 0.0094, 47.9830, 0.0180, '2017-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1026, 'MMA-3135 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF SAN JUAN', 'BALONG-BATO', 1999, 14.60753146, '14° 36\' 27.113270\"', 121.02683410, '121° 1\' 36.602750\"', 'MMA-3135 STA. MARK: The station was marked with a head of a 4\'\' copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty with inscriptions that read \'\' MMA 3135 ; 2008 ; LMS-NCR\'\'. The station is located at Pinaglabanan Monument. ACCESS: From Cubao Aurora Blvd., turn left at N. Domingo and stop at the front of Pinaglabanan Monument between Capt. Manzano St. and Pinaglabanan St. where the GCP of LMS-NCR is located.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.60753177, '14° 36\' 27.114380\"', 121.02683300, '121° 1\' 36.598810\"', 0.0100, '1', 64.6300, 0.0400, '1', 21.0359, 287450.92520, 1615841.29000, '51', 14.60903671, '14° 36\' 32.532140\"', 121.02547380, '121° 1\' 31.705700\"', 21.0533, 1615550.72800, 502744.53400, '3', 287303.09100, 1615909.75800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1027, 'MMA-3161', 'Luzon', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'COMMONWEALTH', 2014, 14.69636835, '14° 41\' 46.926070\"', 121.07908790, '121° 4\' 44.716330\"', 'The station was marked with a head of 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read; \"MMA 3161, 2009; LMS-NCR\". It\'s located within the compound of NGC Plaza in front of NGC office. From Commonwealth Ave. near Commonwealth Market turn left to Pitot Drive going to Mabuting Pastol Parish near NGCHP office where the GCP of LMS-NCR is located.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.69636893, '14° 41\' 46.928130\"', 121.07908690, '121° 4\' 44.712790\"', 0.0100, '1', 115.9720, 0.0300, '1', 71.8079, 293164.97900, 1625623.35000, '51', 14.69787840, '14° 41\' 52.362230\"', 121.07772990, '121° 4\' 39.827650\"', 72.5288, 1625380.88700, 508371.20600, '3', 293017.48800, 1625691.73100, '51', 14.69641316, '14° 41\' 47.087380\"', 121.07907880, '121° 4\' 44.683820\"', 0.0110, 114.3780, 0.0251, '2017-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1028, 'MMA-3222', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF VALENZUELA', 'PASO DE BLAS', 1999, 14.70658601, '14° 42\' 23.709640\"', 120.99048080, '120° 59\' 25.730730\"', 'MMA-3222 STA. MARK : THE STATION WAS MARKED WITH A HEAD OF 8MM STAINLESS STEEL BOLT EMBEDDED ON THE CENTER OF A 25 CM X 25 CM CEMENT PUTTY WITH INSCRIPTIONS THAT READ \"MMA-3222; 2009; LMS-NCR\". THIS IS LOCATED AT NLEX WEST SERVICE ROAD AT THE CORNER OF THE SIDEWALK. ACCESS: FROM VALENZUELA CITY HALL TRAVEL TO MAYSAN ROAD GOING TO PASO DE BLAS AND STOP AT THE CORNER OF WEST SERVICE ROAD NEAR PUREGOLD WHERE THE GCP OF LMS-NCR IS LOCATED.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.70658648, '14° 42\' 23.711340\"', 120.99047940, '120° 59\' 25.725880\"', 0.0100, '1', 54.1790, 0.0300, '1', 10.9080, 283630.83890, 1626837.12400, '51', 14.70809864, '14° 42\' 29.155100\"', 120.98912240, '120° 59\' 20.840800\"', 10.9689, 1626510.18100, 498828.58500, '3', 283483.30100, 1626905.80200, '51', 14.70663072, '14° 42\' 23.870590\"', 120.99047130, '120° 59\' 25.696740\"', 0.0108, 52.5880, 0.0268, '2017-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1029, 'MMA-3234', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF TAGUIG', 'FORT BONIFACIO', 1999, 14.52969083, '14° 31\' 46.887000\"', 121.02604520, '121° 1\' 33.762870\"', 'MMA-3234 STA. MARK : The station was marked with a head of 8mm stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA-3234; 2009; LMS-NCR\". This is located at Pasong Tamo Extension near Gate 10 of Fort Bonifacio. ACCESS: From Lawton Avenue go to Pasong Tamo Extension stop at Mini Park after Petron Gas Station and look for the GCP of LMS-NCR at the sidewalk near Gate 10 of Fort Bonifacio.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.52969095, '14° 31\' 46.887410\"', 121.02604520, '121° 1\' 33.762750\"', 0.0100, '1', 53.4710, 0.0100, '1', 9.8849, 287291.35640, 1607228.31600, '51', 14.53119089, '14° 31\' 52.287210\"', 121.02468410, '121° 1\' 28.862930\"', 9.5396, 1606938.42100, 502660.39000, '3', 287143.26300, 1607296.71400, '51', 14.52973513, '14° 31\' 47.046450\"', 121.02603710, '121° 1\' 33.733730\"', 0.0090, 51.8580, 0.0147, '2017-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1030, 'MMA-3289', 'Luzon', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'MATANDANG BALARA', 2014, 14.65715851, '14° 39\' 25.770640\"', 121.07462720, '121° 4\' 28.657890\"', 'Access:The station is located along Katipunan Avenue in front of MWSS Compound, from LRT- Katipunan station go straight along Katipunan Avenue going to UP stop in front of MWSS compound near the Gate of UP at Magsaysay Ave where you will see the GCP of LMS-NCR. The station was marked with a head of a 4\" stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 20cm. x 20cm. cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA 3289; 2010 ; LMS-NCR\".', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.65715902, '14° 39\' 25.772480\"', 121.07462660, '121° 4\' 28.655710\"', 0.0100, '1', 116.1750, 0.0300, '1', 72.0779, 292647.59800, 1621288.62700, '51', 14.65866608, '14° 39\' 31.197870\"', 121.07326860, '121° 4\' 23.767120\"', 72.6235, 1621042.51500, 507892.15100, '3', 292499.97300, 1621356.98500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1031, 'MMA-3309', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MAKATI', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2014, 14.56605419, '14° 33\' 57.795100\"', 121.01168830, '121° 0\' 42.077920\"', 'Access:The station is located at Kamagong St. corner of St. Paul St. from Makati City Hall go to Chino Roces Avenue turn right at Kamagong St. and stop at the corner of St. Paul where you can see the GCP of LMS-NCR.The station was marked with a head of a 4\" stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 20cm. x 20cm. cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA 3309; 2010 ; LMS-NCR\".', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.56605426, '14° 33\' 57.795320\"', 121.01168760, '121° 0\' 42.075330\"', 0.0100, '1', 48.4910, 0.0400, '1', 5.0530, 285778.76120, 1611265.66200, '51', 14.56755685, '14° 34\' 3.204670\"', 121.01032740, '121° 0\' 37.178590\"', 4.8330, 1610961.56100, 501112.87500, '3', 285630.77500, 1611334.14100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1032, 'MMA-3390', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MUNTINLUPA', 'ALABANG', 1999, 14.42466803, '14° 25\' 28.804910\"', 121.03104440, '121° 1\' 51.759660\"', 'STATION MARK: The station was marked with a head of 8 mm stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA 3390 2011 LMS-NCR\". ACCESS: From Alabang going to Alabang - Zapote Road, the GCP of LMS NCR MMA-3390 is located along Alabang - Zapote Road at the center island in front of DSWD Office.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.42466809, '14° 25\' 28.805130\"', 121.03104500, '121° 1\' 51.762170\"', 0.0100, '1', 67.2350, 0.0400, '1', 23.4754, 287730.43520, 1595602.14500, '51', 14.42616109, '14° 25\' 34.179930\"', 121.02968150, '121° 1\' 46.853470\"', 23.1287, 1595318.83800, 503200.49800, '3', 287581.99800, 1595670.42700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1033, 'MMA-3417', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF TAGUIG', 'UPPER BICUTAN', 1999, 14.49694851, '14° 29\' 49.014620\"', 121.05042540, '121° 3\' 1.531500\"', 'STATION MARK:The station was marked with a head of 8 mm stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA 3417 2011 ; LMS-NCR\". This is located along A. Bonifacio Avenue corner Mindanao Avenue. ACCESS: From East Service Road DBP Avenue to FTI Ave. turn right at Cucumber Road, then turn right again to A. Bonifacio St. straight ahead to Lapu-Lapu St. on the right side of the road near fire hdyrant, the GCP of LMS-NCR-MMA-3417 is located.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.49694899, '14° 29\' 49.016370\"', 121.05042540, '121° 3\' 1.531300\"', 0.0200, '2', 67.5810, 0.0500, '1', 23.7474, 289888.49580, 1603582.63000, '51', 14.49844624, '14° 29\' 54.406460\"', 121.04906360, '121° 2\' 56.628870\"', 23.6322, 1603316.23000, 505288.71600, '3', 289740.31600, 1603650.91800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1034, 'MMA-3425', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF LAS PIÑAS', 'TALON UNO', 1999, 14.44474929, '14° 26\' 41.097460\"', 120.99386010, '120° 59\' 37.896420\"', 'STATION MARK: The station was marked with a head of 8 mm stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA 3425 2011 ; LMS-NCR\". This is located along Alabang Zapote Road corner J. Aguilar Ave. ACCESS: From Alabang, take the Alabang-Zapote Road, straight ahead then proceed to Las Piñas Commercial Complex, on the right side of the road near URC townhomes and fronting Jollibee where the GCP of LMS-NCR-MMA-3425 is located.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.44474910, '14° 26\' 41.096760\"', 120.99386030, '120° 59\' 37.897160\"', 0.0100, '1', 61.7610, 0.0400, '1', 18.3411, 283739.58700, 1597858.95400, '51', 14.44624424, '14° 26\' 46.479270\"', 120.99249720, '120° 59\' 32.989980\"', 17.8022, 1597540.47400, 499191.06300, '3', 283591.18200, 1597927.37600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1035, 'MMA-3494', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PASIG', 'MANGGAHAN', 1999, 14.59718329, '14° 35\' 49.859850\"', 121.08987030, '121° 5\' 23.532970\"', 'STATION MARK: The station was marked with a head of 8 mm stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA 3494 2011 ; LMS-NCR\". This is located along E. Amang Rodriguez Avenue near Manggahan Bridge. ACCESS: From Marcos Hi-way, proceed to E. Amang Rodriguez Avenue going to Manggahan Village, after reaching Manggahan Bridge on the end is where the GCP of LMS-NCR-MMA-3494 is located.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.59718376, '14° 35\' 49.861520\"', 121.08987060, '121° 5\' 23.534300\"', 0.0100, '1', 55.2450, 0.0300, '1', 11.0251, 294233.94420, 1614638.15800, '51', 14.59868661, '14° 35\' 55.271780\"', 121.08851130, '121° 5\' 18.640630\"', 11.4851, 1614407.36700, 509536.60700, '3', 294086.13300, 1614706.41200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1036, 'MMA-3554', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PARAÑAQUE', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2014, 14.46560843, '14° 27\' 56.190360\"', 121.01790460, '121° 1\' 4.456460\"', 'MMA-3554 The station is located on the island along Dr. A Santos Avenue, in front of Office Warehouse and Mercury Drug. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on a cement putty with inscriptions \"MMA-3554; 2011; LMS-NCR; PRS-92\".', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.46560832, '14° 27\' 56.189960\"', 121.01790430, '121° 1\' 4.455440\"', 0.0100, '1', 60.5690, 0.0400, '1', 16.9898, 286352.36720, 1600144.66600, '51', 14.46710427, '14° 28\' 1.575380\"', 121.01654170, '121° 0\' 59.550160\"', 16.6106, 1599848.30500, 501783.33300, '3', 286204.05300, 1600213.02900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1037, 'MMA-3649', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'PASAY CITY', 'BARANGAY 194', 2014, 14.52428743, '14° 31\' 27.434750\"', 121.00062360, '121° 0\' 2.244980\"', 'MMA-3649 FROM PASAY CITY HALL, HEAD SOUTH ON F.B. HARRISON ST. TOWARD JOE FAGG RD. TURN RIGHT ONTO EPIFANIO DE LOS SANTOS AVE. TURN LEFT TOWARD ROXAS BLVD AND THEN TURN LEFT ONTO AIRPORT RD. AT THE ROUND ABOUT TAKE THE 5TH EXIT ONTO DOMESTIC ROAD. THE STATION IS LOCATED INFRONT OF EMISSION TESTING ABOUT 85 CM. FROM THE POST. MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4\" COPPER NAIL SET FLUSHED AND CENTERED ON A CEMENT PUTTY WITH INSCRIPTION \"MMA-3649 2011 LMS-NCR', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.52428779, '14° 31\' 27.436060\"', 121.00062320, '121° 0\' 2.243640\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.7510, 0.0200, '1', 4.4002, 284545.73850, 1606654.25300, '51', 14.52578794, '14° 31\' 32.836580\"', 120.99926200, '120° 59\' 57.343270\"', 4.0012, 1606340.53500, 499920.46100, '3', 284397.60300, 1606722.72800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1038, 'MMA-3819', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'PORT AREA', 'BARANGAY 650', 2014, 14.58865416, '14° 35\' 19.154960\"', 120.96855690, '120° 58\' 6.804990\"', 'MMA-3819 The station is located at the plant box near Velco Center Wall about 3 meters NE of BPI Building and 2 meters SW corner edge of Delgado and Roberto Oca Street. Station mark is the head of 4\" stainless bolt flushed in a 20cm. x 20cm. cement putty with inscription \'MMA-3819; 2011; LMS-NCR, FLS.\"', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.58865416, '14° 35\' 19.154960\"', 120.96855670, '120° 58\' 6.804120\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.5070, 0.0300, '1', 4.4802, 281152.46140, 1613807.63000, '51', 14.59015918, '14° 35\' 24.573060\"', 120.96719700, '120° 58\' 1.909080\"', 4.0185, 1613462.35100, 496465.51800, '3', 281004.51100, 1613876.26900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1039, 'MMA-3827', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'BARANGAY 281', 2014, 14.60122279, '14° 36\' 4.402030\"', 120.97228650, '120° 58\' 20.231510\"', 'MMA-3827 The station is located at the foot of street light footing at the sidewalk of Muelle de Binondo near Estero de Vitas. Station mark is the head of 4\" stainless bolt flushed in a 20cm. x 20cm. cement putty with inscription \'MMA-3827; 2011; LMS-NCR, FLS.\"', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.60122290, '14° 36\' 4.402430\"', 120.97228630, '120° 58\' 20.230550\"', 0.0200, '2', 46.7360, 0.1000, '1', 3.6740, 281566.80400, 1615194.91800, '51', 14.60272865, '14° 36\' 9.823150\"', 120.97092680, '120° 58\' 15.336600\"', 3.2742, 1614852.89500, 496867.58400, '3', 281418.89900, 1615263.55700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1040, 'MMA-39 (W-2)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'U.P. CAMPUS', 1994, 14.65523094, '14° 39\' 18.831380\"', 121.05970700, '121° 3\' 34.945110\"', 'MMA-39 (W-2) Station is located at the University of the Philippines (UP) compound at Diliman, along University Ave., about 500 m. from Commonwealth Ave and about 50m north from the centerline of University Avenue. Station is the easternmost of seven aligned concrete monuments also known as the \"UP Baseline\". It is near an Acacia Tree for about 9 m.Mark is the head of a 1\" dia. brass rod with cross cut on top center of an 18\" square concrete monument, protruding about 18\" above the ground inside the vacant lot at UP. No inscription was made to the station.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.65523082, '14° 39\' 18.830940\"', 121.05970670, '121° 3\' 34.944170\"', 0.0100, '1', 97.6300, 0.0300, '1', 53.6833, 291038.44150, 1621088.98300, '51', 14.65673809, '14° 39\' 24.257110\"', 121.05834870, '121° 3\' 30.055320\"', 54.1094, 1620828.74800, 506285.10000, '3', 290890.79600, 1621157.38900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1041, 'MMA-3951', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF LAS PIÑAS', 'PULANG LUPA UNO', 2014, 14.47003653, '14° 28\' 12.131500\"', 120.97142860, '120° 58\' 17.142840\"', 'MMA-3951 The station is located at the SE portion of light post along Quirino Avenue near Galls Furniture about 60 meters NE of Zapote Builders Inc., and 30 meters SE of Dents Clear Water Refilling Station. Station mark is the head of 8mm. stainless bolt flushed in a 20cm. x 20cm. cement putty with inscription \'MMA-3951; 2011; LMS-NCR, FLS.\"', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.47003600, '14° 28\' 12.129590\"', 120.97142830, '120° 58\' 17.141850\"', 0.0100, '1', 47.2320, 0.0300, '1', 4.0446, 281345.28400, 1600678.46600, '51', 14.47153328, '14° 28\' 17.519790\"', 120.97006570, '120° 58\' 12.236520\"', 3.2825, 1600338.44000, 496772.90000, '3', 281196.94200, 1600746.98400, '51', 14.47008015, '14° 28\' 12.288550\"', 120.97142020, '120° 58\' 17.112740\"', 0.0112, 45.6130, 0.0317, '2017-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1042, 'MMA-4238', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MUNTINLUPA', 'POBLACION', 2014, 14.38803149, '14° 23\' 16.913350\"', 121.04576030, '121° 2\' 44.736900\"', 'MMA-4238 From Susana Heights Exit, turn left at the National Highway going to Muntinlupa City Hall until you reach Poblacion Bridge over the Magdaong River. The station is located 2.5m S of the Caltex Gasoline Station, 10m SE of the foot of Poblacion Bridge and 1m N of the protection wall of Magdaong River. Mark is the head of a 8m stainless bolt flushed at the top center of a 25cm x 25cm x 120cm concrete monument with inscriptions \"MUNTINLUPA, MMA-4238, CAD. 593-D, 2012, LMS-NCR, FLS\".', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.38782700, '14° 23\' 16.177190\"', 121.04560250, '121° 2\' 44.169030\"', 0.0100, '1', 59.1910, 0.0400, '1', 15.2521, 289265.77760, 1591512.07800, '51', 14.38931728, '14° 23\' 21.542200\"', 121.04423810, '121° 2\' 39.257250\"', 14.9450, 1591243.01300, 504770.89100, '3', 289117.23100, 1591580.27800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1043, 'MMA-4398', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BALINGASA', 2014, 14.65312968, '14° 39\' 11.266840\"', 120.99793640, '120° 59\' 52.571150\"', 'STATION MARK : Mark is the head of 8 mm stainless bolt flushed at the top center of a 25x25x120 cm. concrete monument with inscription of \" QUEZON CITY,MMA-4398, Cad. 1331-D,2012,LMS-NCR,FLS\".The monument is located at brgy. Balingasa,Quezon city. RM-1= 20 m SW of shell Gasoline Station RM-2= 15 m. SE of the centerline of A. Bonifacio Avenue RM-3= 15 m SW of Pan de Manila Access : Travel along A. Bonifacio Avenue going to NLEX near the corner of Binuang street infront of shell Gasoline station is where the monument is located.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.65313002, '14° 39\' 11.268080\"', 120.99793560, '120° 59\' 52.567980\"', 0.0100, '1', 66.3980, 0.0300, '1', 23.0717, 284381.54150, 1620914.45600, '51', 14.65463854, '14° 39\' 16.698760\"', 120.99657740, '120° 59\' 47.678460\"', 22.9969, 1620595.66100, 499631.32200, '3', 284233.83300, 1620983.06000, '51', 14.65317424, '14° 39\' 11.427260\"', 120.99792750, '120° 59\' 52.538870\"', 0.0129, 64.8000, 0.0308, '2017-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1044, 'MMA-44', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF NAVOTAS', 'NBBS PROPER', 1995, 14.63953411, '14° 38\' 22.322790\"', 120.95323890, '120° 57\' 11.660010\"', 'MMA-44 STATION IS IN THE CITY OF NAVOTAS, INSIDE THE NAVOTAS FISHPORT COMPLEX, ON THE S PORTION OF THE COMPLEX. IT IS ABOUT 300 M. S FROM THE FISH MARKET, ON THE N CORNER OF THE STREET LEADING TO PETRON BULK PLANT. THIS CORNER IS ABOUT 50 M. NE OF THE PLANT\'S MAIN GATE AND ABOUT 70 M. S OF INGLENOOK FOOD CORP. MAIN GATE. INGLENOOK FOOD CORP. IS ABOUT 200 M. FROM THE MARKET. ACROSS THE ROAD, THERE IS A 2 VISIBLE FUEL TANK NEAR THE STATION.MARK IS THE HEAD OF A COPPER NAIL EMBEDDED IN A 6 IN. X 6 IN. CEMENT PUTTY, WITH NO INSCRIPTIONS', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.63953446, '14° 38\' 22.324040\"', 120.95323860, '120° 57\' 11.658870\"', 0.0200, '2', 45.8460, 0.0400, '1', 2.9634, 279552.42880, 1619453.00500, '51', 14.64104326, '14° 38\' 27.755740\"', 120.95188030, '120° 57\' 6.769230\"', 2.5719, 1619092.11500, 494816.36500, '3', 279404.63400, 1619521.74200, '51', 14.63957866, '14° 38\' 22.483190\"', 120.95323050, '120° 57\' 11.629680\"', 0.0146, 44.2470, 0.0327, '2017-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1045, 'MMA-4598', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PASIG', 'MALINAO', 2014, 14.55858484, '14° 33\' 30.905420\"', 121.08034720, '121° 4\' 49.249950\"', 'Access: Monument is located in Barangay Malinao, City of Pasig. From Pasig City Hall travel along F. Manalo St. to Iglesia ni Cristo in front of Iglesia ni Cristo were the MMA-4598 is located. Station is the head of a 4\" copper nail set at the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete monument proturing about 20 cm. above ground and with inscriptions \"PASIG MMA 4598, CAD 579 D, GEOLINK, LMS DENR 2013\".', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.55858504, '14° 33\' 30.906160\"', 121.08034680, '121° 4\' 49.248620\"', 0.0100, '1', 49.5220, 0.0300, '1', 5.4062, 293171.63750, 1610375.66500, '51', 14.56008561, '14° 33\' 36.308210\"', 121.07898660, '121° 4\' 44.351600\"', 5.6754, 1610136.44800, 508511.85000, '3', 293023.68900, 1610443.91400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1046, 'MMA-5074', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MANDALUYONG', 'ADDITION HILLS', 1999, 14.59070200, '14° 35\' 26.527210\"', 121.04443590, '121° 2\' 39.969260\"', 'STATION MARK : Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nails flushed in a cement embedded in the ground with inscription: \"MANDALUYONG MMA 5074;CAD 586-D; DLSS DENR-NCR 2013\". ACCESS : The station is at the corner of Ideal St. and Col. A Buenaventura St. It is 10 m across an electric post at the other corner of the street.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.59070230, '14° 35\' 26.528280\"', 121.04443510, '121° 2\' 39.966290\"', 0.0100, '1', 69.4290, 0.0200, '1', 25.6677, 289331.63930, 1613962.58000, '51', 14.59220575, '14° 35\' 31.940700\"', 121.04307550, '121° 2\' 35.071840\"', 25.7614, 1613688.95400, 504641.28500, '3', 289183.76500, 1614030.97600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1047, 'MMA-62', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'PASONG TAMO', 2014, 14.68629978, '14° 41\' 10.679210\"', 121.06478530, '121° 3\' 53.227150\"', 'MMA-62 From Quezon City Memorial Circle, travel northward along Commonwealth Ave. until reaching intersection near Ever Gotesco Commonwealth. Turn left and proceed along Holy Spirit Drive, at approximately 1.7 km. distance turn left at Sampaguita Ave. then proceed until reaching the gate of Far Eastern University (FEU) QC Campus. The station is located at the bridge outside the gate of the University. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt on the location of the station,\"MMA-62, 2000\".', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.68630027, '14° 41\' 10.680960\"', 121.06478420, '121° 3\' 53.223030\"', 0.0100, '1', 97.9080, 0.0400, '1', 53.8933, 291614.86710, 1624522.34200, '51', 14.68780943, '14° 41\' 16.113930\"', 121.06342690, '121° 3\' 48.336860\"', 54.4638, 1624266.43500, 506831.14100, '3', 291467.33000, 1624590.76100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1048, 'MMA-63 (MM-8)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'FAIRVIEW', 2014, 14.71499463, '14° 42\' 53.980650\"', 121.05714690, '121° 3\' 25.728920\"', 'MMA-63 Is in Fairview Park Subdivision, Quezon City along Commonwealth Avenue. Mark is situated on the S abutment of a bridge near the intersection of Commonwealth Avenue., and Yakal St. It is 16 m SW of the centerline of Commonwealth Avenue., and 363 m from the S end of the abutment. Mark is the top of a concrete nail set flush in a triangular cement putty with inscription PCGS MM-8 1983.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.71499510, '14° 42\' 53.982370\"', 121.05714610, '121° 3\' 25.725860\"', 0.0100, '1', 94.0720, 0.0400, '1', 50.1189, 290819.45020, 1627704.69900, '51', 14.71650629, '14° 42\' 59.422630\"', 121.05578950, '121° 3\' 20.842090\"', 50.7286, 1627441.06900, 506007.79700, '3', 290672.00100, 1627773.16900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1049, 'MMA-64', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 2014, 14.70987198, '14° 42\' 35.539110\"', 121.11010190, '121° 6\' 36.366900\"', 'MMA-64 From Ever Gotesco Commonwealth, travel N and turn right near Sandiganbayan Bldg. and proceed along Constitutional Road reaching Batasang Pambansa Complex. Infront of the N gate of the said complex is an access road bound to Violago Homes and Brgy. Bagong Silangan. Proceed along the road until reaching two opposite guard posts of Filinvest II. Take the left post leading to Vicente St., and turn right on an uphill drive to the entry point to Filinvest Heights. Straight ahead, right at Matthew St., and left at the entrance gate of Spring Heights and Spring Country. Straight up until reaching a mini-elliptical road on Spring Country. Approx. 500 m., from this point, downhill, is a bridge where the station is marked. It is on the footway, W end of the bridge, few meters from the second post from that end. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the said location of the station,with inscription \"MMA-64 2002 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.70987251, '14° 42\' 35.541050\"', 121.11010070, '121° 6\' 36.362630\"', 0.0100, '1', 72.8270, 0.0400, '1', 28.3496, 296517.98890, 1627089.38900, '51', 14.71138218, '14° 42\' 40.975860\"', 121.10874410, '121° 6\' 31.478690\"', 29.3399, 1626876.24700, 511710.59500, '3', 296370.57000, 1627157.68300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1050, 'MMA-65', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'HOLY SPIRIT', 2014, 14.72924320, '14° 43\' 45.275510\"', 121.06112680, '121° 3\' 40.056580\"', 'MMA-65 From Q.C. Memorial Circle, travel N along Commonwealth Ave. until reaching Regalado Ave. in Fairview. Turn left at Regalado Ave. then proceed to the direction of SM City Fairview. A road intersecting Regalado Ave. before reaching SM is Mindanao St., in which the station is located at the SW corner of the intersection. It is established at the concrete curb of the sidewalk . It is approximately 40m from U-A Island Plaza. Mark is the head of a hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station with inscription \"MMA-65 2002 NAMRIA\".', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.72924358, '14° 43\' 45.276880\"', 121.06112550, '121° 3\' 40.051920\"', 0.0100, '1', 117.1620, 0.0300, '1', 73.1611, 291261.61340, 1629277.70900, '51', 14.73075560, '14° 43\' 50.720150\"', 121.05976930, '121° 3\' 35.169400\"', 73.8188, 1629017.64100, 506435.95300, '3', 291114.21600, 1629346.17900, '51', 14.72928782, '14° 43\' 45.436160\"', 121.06111750, '121° 3\' 40.022910\"', 0.0110, 115.5720, 0.0247, '2017-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1051, 'MMA-66 (BM-1)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF CALOOCAN', 'BARANGAY 78', 2014, 14.65707347, '14° 39\' 25.464490\"', 120.98408570, '120° 59\' 2.708610\"', 'MMA-66 (BM RI-3) Location is in Caloocan City, at the intersection of Rizal Ave. Ext. and EDSA. It is situated on the East side of Bonifacio Monument, at the SE corner of the pool.Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded in a cement putty with inscription \"BM-1 DPWH\"', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.65716379, '14° 39\' 25.789630\"', 120.98414800, '120° 59\' 2.932670\"', 0.0100, '1', 61.9330, 0.0500, '1', 18.7426, 282900.08870, 1621374.01900, '51', 14.65867288, '14° 39\' 31.222380\"', 120.98278990, '120° 58\' 58.043570\"', 18.6020, 1621042.06200, 498146.20800, '3', 282752.38100, 1621442.67100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1052, 'MMA-94', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'CULIAT', 2014, 14.66148982, '14° 39\' 41.363340\"', 121.04472350, '121° 2\' 41.004430\"', 'Station is approximately 850 m from the Eliptical Road trough Visayas Avenue. It is located at a bridge E of Visayas Ave. about 25 cm from the road. The road through the bridge connects to Commonwealth by passing through Iglesia ni Cristo at the N side of UP Asian Institute of Tourism. The bolt is drlled approximately at the midline or 0.5 m from the edges of the sidewalk of the bridge. Mark is the center of the head of a hexagonal bolt (stainless steel) placed at the southern side at the western foot of the bridge crossing the Culiat river.', 2017, 'Reobs 2017', 2017.42, 14.66149027, '14° 39\' 41.364960\"', 121.04472220, '121° 2\' 40.999950\"', 0.0100, '1', 84.0270, 0.0300, '1', 40.2267, 289430.10830, 1621795.53000, '51', 14.66299828, '14° 39\' 46.793800\"', 121.04336430, '121° 2\' 36.111550\"', 40.5607, 1621520.97300, 504670.90700, '3', 289282.47000, 1621863.99000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2017-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1053, 'ABR-3206', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LICUAN-BAAY', 'BONGLO', 2008, 17.62238814, '17° 37\' 20.597304\"', 120.86216470, '120° 51\' 43.792920\"', 'ABR-3206 From Benguet take the Prov\'l Road going to Mun. of Licuan at the intersection going to licuan ABR-3206 is located opposite of the road towards licuan near the Bdry of Brgy Bunglo and Lenneng. The monument is marked of 4\" conc. nail flush in a conc. mon. 20 x 20 x 100 block embedded on the ground with inscription of ABR-3206; 2008, NAMRIA, The Station point is located at Brgy. Bunglo, Licuan Baay, Abra.', 2018, 'GNSS/Leveling', 2018.67, 17.62240231, '17° 37\' 20.648320\"', 120.86217010, '120° 51\' 43.812340\"', 0.0100, '1', 544.8530, 0.0600, '2', 504.0477, 273163.65200, 1949692.00200, '51', 17.62409865, '17° 37\' 26.755150\"', 120.86088140, '120° 51\' 39.173020\"', 510.8246, 1949167.95600, 485236.26100, '3', 273025.74000, 1949763.55400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2018-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1054, 'NGW-100', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF HIMAMAYLAN', 'NABALI-AN', 2007, 10.16232678, '10° 9\' 44.376390\"', 122.87375550, '122° 52\' 25.519930\"', 'NGW-100 From Bacolod-Kabankalan road turn left leading to Barangay Bambanan. It is about 1.2 kms. from the junction. The station is located on the SW tip of the headwall. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete headwall with inscriptions \"NGW-100; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.99, 10.16230597, '10° 9\' 44.301490\"', 122.87375970, '122° 52\' 25.534850\"', 0.0100, '1', 67.1732, 0.0300, '1', 5.2596, 486171.53840, 1123360.38700, '51', 10.16346617, '10° 9\' 48.478200\"', 122.87229620, '122° 52\' 20.266280\"', 7.6215, 1123811.59600, 486006.21000, '4', 486011.10800, 1123418.24200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1055, 'NGW-101', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF HIMAMAYLAN', 'CARABALAN', 2007, 10.10358384, '10° 6\' 12.901830\"', 122.90324750, '122° 54\' 11.691130\"', 'NGW-101 The station is located on the NW corner of the bridge. The station is made level with the sidewalk. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete pavement of the bridge windwall with inscriptions \"NGW-101; 2007; NAMRIA\". From Kabankalan-Bacolod road turn right leading to Barangay Carabalan.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.10356288, '10° 6\' 12.826380\"', 122.90325140, '122° 54\' 11.705190\"', 0.0200, '2', 84.0360, 0.0500, '1', 21.6691, 489400.16250, 1116864.37400, '51', 10.10471820, '10° 6\' 16.985520\"', 122.90178660, '122° 54\' 6.431630\"', 24.2774, 1117313.14600, 489235.81100, '4', 489239.57800, 1116922.06700, '51', 10.10360548, '10° 6\' 12.979720\"', 122.90324430, '122° 54\' 11.679410\"', 0.0172, 81.9910, 0.0421, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1056, 'NGW-106', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CAUAYAN', 'POBLACION', 2007, 9.97231717, '9° 58\' 20.341810\"', 122.62732060, '122° 37\' 38.354040\"', 'NGW-106 The station is located on the NE sidewalk of Cauayan bridge which is at the kilometer 112+763. The station is made level with the top of the bridge sidewalk. The station is about 2.2 km from Cauayan town proper. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete of the bridge\'s sidewalk with inscriptions \"NGW-106; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 9.97229778, '9° 58\' 20.272020\"', 122.62732240, '122° 37\' 38.360650\"', 0.0100, '1', 69.6760, 0.0300, '1', 7.7629, 459152.48190, 1102372.64500, '51', 9.97345049, '9° 58\' 24.421770\"', 122.62585370, '122° 37\' 33.073490\"', 10.3023, 1102817.06800, 458976.80000, '4', 458991.15900, 1102431.06300, '51', 9.97234027, '9° 58\' 20.424970\"', 122.62731540, '122° 37\' 38.335260\"', 0.0099, 67.6430, 0.0286, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
