(1058, 'NGW-109', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CAUAYAN', 'ISIO', 2007, 9.97517911, '9° 58\' 30.644780\"', 122.57606650, '122° 34\' 33.839400\"', 'NGW-109 The station is located on the NW of the RCBC and NE of the basketball court. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 x 40 cm. block cast on top of the riprap with inscriptions \"NGW-109; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is about 5.3 km from Cauayan town proper.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 9.97515999, '9° 58\' 30.575950\"', 122.57606820, '122° 34\' 33.845490\"', 0.0100, '1', 68.4550, 0.0300, '1', 6.8317, 453535.05230, 1102695.87100, '51', 9.97631414, '9° 58\' 34.730910\"', 122.57459950, '122° 34\' 28.558230\"', 9.2146, 1103140.57400, 453357.35400, '4', 453373.68000, 1102754.45600, '51', 9.97520247, '9° 58\' 30.728890\"', 122.57606110, '122° 34\' 33.820010\"', 0.0096, 66.4240, 0.0257, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
