(1067, 'NGW-121', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF SIPALAY', 'CARTAGENA', 2007, 9.82818367, '9° 49\' 41.461210\"', 122.40292660, '122° 24\' 10.535650\"', 'NGW-121 Is in the Province of Negros Occidental, City of Sipalay, Barangay Cartagena along the provincial road. The station is located on the SW corner of Cartagena Bridge 2 and NE of Purok Kakahuyan Signage. Mark is the head of a 4 in copper nail set flush on a 15 cm x 15 cm cement putty with inscriptions \"NGW-121, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 9.82816488, '9° 49\' 41.393560\"', 122.40292660, '122° 24\' 10.535920\"', 0.0100, '1', 68.7300, 0.0300, '1', 8.0261, 434528.23130, 1086472.12400, '51', 9.82931282, '9° 49\' 45.526140\"', 122.40145400, '122° 24\' 5.234430\"', 9.5879, 1086911.52800, 434343.20500, '4', 434366.18600, 1086531.09000, '51', 9.82820729, '9° 49\' 41.546250\"', 122.40291950, '122° 24\' 10.510160\"', 0.0099, 66.6860, 0.0308, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1068, 'NGW-122', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CANDONI', 'POBLACION WEST', 2007, 9.82971334, '9° 49\' 46.968020\"', 122.63656110, '122° 38\' 11.619880\"', 'NGW-122 The station is located on the SW end of the riprap which is on the SW end of the steel road railing. The station is along the Candoni-Sipalay provincial road. It is about 600 m. from Candoni town proper. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed in a cement putty embedded on top of the riprap with inscriptions \"NGW-122; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 9.82969339, '9° 49\' 46.896200\"', 122.63656250, '122° 38\' 11.624930\"', 0.0100, '1', 231.2230, 0.0300, '1', 168.2121, 460148.06120, 1086604.46600, '51', 9.83083572, '9° 49\' 51.008590\"', 122.63509030, '122° 38\' 6.325250\"', 171.5061, 1087043.16900, 459972.28400, '4', 459986.29400, 1086662.68500, '51', 9.82973586, '9° 49\' 47.049090\"', 122.63655510, '122° 38\' 11.598410\"', 0.0108, 229.1530, 0.0272, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1069, 'NGW-123', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CANDONI', 'CANINGAY', 2007, 9.83741789, '9° 50\' 14.704390\"', 122.66815630, '122° 40\' 5.362520\"', 'NGW-123 The station is located on the NE corner of the Caningay bridge, SE of the house adjacent to the bridge. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed, drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the bridge\'s sidewalk with inscriptions \"NGW-123; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 9.83739787, '9° 50\' 14.632340\"', 122.66815780, '122° 40\' 5.368050\"', 0.0200, '2', 221.0330, 0.0400, '1', 157.9312, 463613.45640, 1087452.71800, '51', 9.83853998, '9° 50\' 18.743930\"', 122.66668590, '122° 40\' 0.069270\"', 161.2551, 1087891.62600, 463438.95400, '4', 463451.75100, 1087510.84500, '51', 9.83744034, '9° 50\' 14.785220\"', 122.66815050, '122° 40\' 5.341800\"', 0.0197, 218.9650, 0.0334, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
