(1070, 'NGW-124', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF KABANKALAN', 'TAPI', 2007, 9.82594969, '9° 49\' 33.418900\"', 122.75353540, '122° 45\' 12.727600\"', 'NGW-124 Located in the Province of Negros Occidental, City of Kabankalan, Barangay Tapi along the provincial road. The station is located atop the headwall of a box culvert, 5.50 m from the road centerline and 150 m from San Lazaro Ruiz Chapel. It is also 350 m from Tapi Rotonda and 700 m from km post 114. Mark is the head of a 4 in copper nail set on a 15 cmx 15 cm cement putty with inscriptions \"NGW-124, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 9.82592935, '9° 49\' 33.345670\"', 122.75353740, '122° 45\' 12.734530\"', 0.0400, '4', 293.3580, 0.0800, '1', 230.0742, 472974.47170, 1086176.64700, '51', 9.82706856, '9° 49\' 37.446800\"', 122.75206540, '122° 45\' 7.435370\"', 233.3432, 1086614.82200, 472803.31000, '4', 472812.83000, 1086234.48800, '51', 9.82597182, '9° 49\' 33.498550\"', 122.75353010, '122° 45\' 12.708450\"', 0.0378, 291.2860, 0.0730, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1071, 'NGW-125', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF SIPALAY', 'BARANGAY 3', 2007, 9.74929021, '9° 44\' 57.444760\"', 122.41093240, '122° 24\' 39.356540\"', 'NGW-125 The station is located on the SE tip of the headwall which is on the SW of the wooden electric post. The station is about 0.4 km. from the Sipalay town hall. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the headwall with inscriptions \"NGW-125; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 9.74927063, '9° 44\' 57.374250\"', 122.41093250, '122° 24\' 39.357050\"', 0.0700, '7', 65.5240, 0.1700, '2', 4.8517, 435390.89210, 1077747.41800, '51', 9.75041277, '9° 45\' 1.485960\"', 122.40945790, '122° 24\' 34.048570\"', 6.1861, 1078183.65000, 435205.92200, '4', 435228.60100, 1077806.26600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2018-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1072, 'NGW-126', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF SIPALAY', 'MARICALUM', 2007, 9.69777880, '9° 41\' 52.003680\"', 122.44421810, '122° 26\' 39.185130\"', 'NGW-126 The station is located on the SW corner of Maricalum bridge which is at the KM 177+175. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the bridge sidewalk with inscriptions \"NGW-126; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 9.69775965, '9° 41\' 51.934750\"', 122.44421810, '122° 26\' 39.185290\"', 0.0100, '1', 82.1550, 0.0400, '1', 21.2221, 439032.45050, 1072045.84600, '51', 9.69889732, '9° 41\' 56.030340\"', 122.44274230, '122° 26\' 33.872450\"', 22.6203, 1072479.91300, 438848.62900, '4', 438870.03300, 1072104.52600, '51', 9.69780204, '9° 41\' 52.087340\"', 122.44421090, '122° 26\' 39.159140\"', 0.0132, 80.0900, 0.0362, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1073, 'NGW-127', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF KABANKALAN', 'BANTAYAN', 2007, 9.72411732, '9° 43\' 26.822340\"', 122.78977010, '122° 47\' 23.172320\"', 'NGW-127 The station is located on the NW grass lawn in front of Barangay Bantayan Peoples Hall. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 x 120 cm. cement block cast on the ground with inscriptions \"NGW-127; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 9.72409653, '9° 43\' 26.747520\"', 122.78977100, '122° 47\' 23.175710\"', 0.0300, '3', 263.5580, 0.0700, '1', 200.0974, 476940.62960, 1074915.02800, '51', 9.72522761, '9° 43\' 30.819400\"', 122.78829660, '122° 47\' 17.867700\"', 203.2263, 1075349.02500, 476770.57100, '4', 476778.70200, 1074972.63400, '51', 9.72413899, '9° 43\' 26.900380\"', 122.78976370, '122° 47\' 23.149250\"', 0.0237, 261.4790, 0.0582, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1074, 'NGW-129', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'HINOBA-AN', 'BARANGAY I', 2007, 9.60461898, '9° 36\' 16.628310\"', 122.46612660, '122° 27\' 58.055870\"', 'NGW-129 The station is located on the NE corner of Hinoba-an bridge at the KM 188+982. The station is made level with the sidewalk and is about 400 m. North of Hinobaan town center. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed, drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the sidewalk with inscriptions \"NGW-129; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 9.60459937, '9° 36\' 16.557720\"', 122.46612620, '122° 27\' 58.054270\"', 0.0100, '1', 68.9830, 0.0400, '1', 8.2983, 441419.67220, 1061741.65400, '51', 9.60572987, '9° 36\' 20.627520\"', 122.46464810, '122° 27\' 52.733250\"', 9.1879, 1062171.93300, 441236.41200, '4', 441256.98000, 1061800.15500, '51', 9.60464172, '9° 36\' 16.710200\"', 122.46611890, '122° 27\' 58.028150\"', 0.0118, 66.9080, 0.0311, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1075, 'NGW-132', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'HINOBA-AN', 'BULWANGAN', 2007, 9.51689302, '9° 31\' 0.814870\"', 122.53464790, '122° 32\' 4.732290\"', 'NGW-132 The station is located on the roof top of the Barangay Bulwangan Peoples Hall. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete rooftop with inscriptions \"NGW-132; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 9.51687289, '9° 31\' 0.742410\"', 122.53464710, '122° 32\' 4.729620\"', 0.0100, '1', 73.0540, 0.0400, '1', 11.9636, 448925.34670, 1052031.31200, '51', 9.51799546, '9° 31\' 4.783660\"', 122.53316700, '122° 31\' 59.401220\"', 12.8962, 1052457.86900, 448744.51200, '4', 448762.45200, 1052089.49000, '51', 9.51691521, '9° 31\' 0.894770\"', 122.53463990, '122° 32\' 4.703670\"', 0.0119, 70.9660, 0.0311, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1076, 'NGW-133', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'HINOBA-AN', 'SANGKE', 2007, 9.45541889, '9° 27\' 19.508010\"', 122.57326200, '122° 34\' 23.743360\"', 'NGW-133 The station is located SE of the basketball court which is on the right side of the road heading to Bayawan City from Hinobaan. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement block cast on the ground with inscriptions \"NGW-133; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.99, 9.45539786, '9° 27\' 19.432300\"', 122.57325310, '122° 34\' 23.711100\"', 0.0200, '2', 67.4640, 0.3100, '1', 6.3160, 453154.26640, 1045228.98700, '51', 9.45651510, '9° 27\' 23.454360\"', 122.57177150, '122° 34\' 18.377460\"', 7.0759, 1045652.96600, 452974.76000, '4', 452991.21900, 1045286.96900, '51', 9.45544019, '9° 27\' 19.584700\"', 122.57324560, '122° 34\' 23.684170\"', 0.0154, 65.3510, 0.2765, '2019-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1077, 'NGW-134', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF KABANKALAN', 'PINAGUINPINAN', 2007, 9.77275550, '9° 46\' 21.919810\"', 122.85070170, '122° 51\' 2.526180\"', 'NGW-134 It is located in the Province of Negros Occidental, City of Kabankalan, Barangay Pinaguinpinan along the barangay road. The station is a concrete monument located on the top of the ground, beside the basketball court and 18 m from the stage. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm protruding 25 cm above the ground with inscriptions \"NGW-134; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 9.77273456, '9° 46\' 21.844420\"', 122.85070370, '122° 51\' 2.533390\"', 0.0100, '1', 231.3640, 0.0300, '1', 167.8699, 483626.53910, 1080289.01500, '51', 9.77386762, '9° 46\' 25.923440\"', 122.84923060, '122° 50\' 57.230120\"', 170.9898, 1080724.75800, 483459.04800, '4', 483464.83800, 1080346.48500, '51', 9.77277703, '9° 46\' 21.997310\"', 122.85069640, '122° 51\' 2.506860\"', 0.0110, 229.2780, 0.0254, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1078, 'NGW-3001', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF CADIZ', 'BARANGAY 3 POB.', 2007, 10.95663235, '10° 57\' 23.876460\"', 123.31002490, '123° 18\' 36.089680\"', 'NGW-3001 Station is located at the intersection of Cabahug St. and Villa Beach St., NW of Cadiz East Elem. School, and NE of Seaoil gasoline station. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled at the center of a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty embedded on top of the concrete gutter with inscriptions, \"NGW-3001, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.95661269, '10° 57\' 23.805700\"', 123.31003270, '123° 18\' 36.117770\"', 0.0400, '4', 66.2850, 0.0800, '1', 5.0928, 533874.26290, 1211199.50500, '51', 10.95781838, '10° 57\' 28.146160\"', 123.30858960, '123° 18\' 30.922660\"', 7.5158, 1211681.00000, 533728.67100, '4', 533716.86500, 1211256.89000, '51', 10.95665564, '10° 57\' 23.960290\"', 123.31002580, '123° 18\' 36.092740\"', 0.0348, 64.3390, 0.0672, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1079, 'NGW-3087', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'MURCIA', 'DAMSITE', 2007, 10.54538665, '10° 32\' 43.391930\"', 123.00443780, '123° 0\' 15.976010\"', 'NGW-3087 Station is about 480 m SW of Damsite Bridge. Station is located on the NW of Bago-Murcia Road. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty embedded on top of the headwall with inscriptions, \"NGW-3087, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.54536630, '10° 32\' 43.318680\"', 123.00444310, '123° 0\' 15.995040\"', 0.0200, '2', 113.5960, 0.0600, '1', 52.1798, 500486.10630, 1165711.11700, '51', 10.54655039, '10° 32\' 47.581420\"', 123.00298930, '123° 0\' 10.761400\"', 54.6070, 1166177.18100, 500327.16800, '4', 500327.05300, 1165768.99900, '51', 10.54540907, '10° 32\' 43.472640\"', 123.00443600, '123° 0\' 15.969590\"', 0.0215, 111.6020, 0.0494, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1080, 'NGW-3102', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF BAGO', 'MA-AO BARRIO', 2008, 10.49208571, '10° 29\' 31.508570\"', 122.99489880, '122° 59\' 41.635830\"', 'NGW-3102 Station is located on the right side of the road along Ma-ao and Hilado brgy. road. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty embedded on the W corner of the concrete block with inscriptions, \"NGW-3102, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.49206541, '10° 29\' 31.435480\"', 122.99490380, '122° 59\' 41.653510\"', 0.0200, '2', 121.3800, 0.0600, '1', 59.8132, 499442.33500, 1159817.79600, '51', 10.49324598, '10° 29\' 35.685510\"', 122.99344860, '122° 59\' 36.415090\"', 62.2902, 1160281.76500, 499282.84900, '4', 499283.10100, 1159875.64700, '51', 10.49210806, '10° 29\' 31.589010\"', 122.99489700, '122° 59\' 41.629050\"', 0.0216, 119.4430, 0.0476, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1081, 'NGW-3114', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'LA CASTELLANA', 'BIAKNABATO', 2007, 10.34315903, '10° 20\' 35.372510\"', 123.15029850, '123° 9\' 1.074520\"', 'NGW-3114 Station is about 21.8 Km. from Moises Padella town proper via Moises Padilla-Cabacungan road and 3.3 Km. from Cabacungan brgy. hall. Station is located 32 m SE of gemilina tree, 38 m SW of electric post, 8 m NE of Siniguelas tree and 12 m NE of nipa hut. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail flushed at the center of a 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm concrete monument casted on the ground on the left side of the road going to Cabacungan with inscriptions, \"NGW-3114, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.34313752, '10° 20\' 35.295070\"', 123.15030400, '123° 9\' 1.094460\"', 0.0200, '2', 416.7490, 0.0500, '1', 354.4162, 516455.08720, 1143355.25400, '51', 10.34430376, '10° 20\' 39.493550\"', 123.14884560, '123° 8\' 55.844200\"', 356.9300, 1143812.78900, 516301.26500, '4', 516295.55900, 1143412.43500, '51', 10.34318023, '10° 20\' 35.448810\"', 123.15029700, '123° 9\' 1.069060\"', 0.0193, 414.7270, 0.0453, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1082, 'NGW-3142', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'MOISES PADILLA', 'CROSSING MAGALLON', 2007, 10.25995871, '10° 15\' 35.851350\"', 123.02141930, '123° 1\' 17.109310\"', 'NGW-3142 Station is about 6.3 Km. from Moises Padilla town proper. Station is about 28 m E of WEP, 30 m SE of Mahogany tree and 28 m SW of WEP. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail flushed at the center of a 20 cm x 20 cm x 120 cm concrete monument casted on the ground on the side of SW wing wall of box culvert with inscriptions, \"NGW-3142, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.25993743, '10° 15\' 35.774730\"', 123.02142450, '123° 1\' 17.128150\"', 0.0300, '4', 87.0910, 0.0800, '1', 24.9753, 502346.13740, 1134152.39200, '51', 10.26110096, '10° 15\' 39.963450\"', 123.01996370, '123° 1\' 11.869320\"', 27.3982, 1134607.02500, 502186.95400, '4', 502186.18900, 1134209.89200, '51', 10.25998007, '10° 15\' 35.928260\"', 123.02141740, '123° 1\' 17.102530\"', 0.0302, 85.0710, 0.0721, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1083, 'NGW-3143', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'HINIGARAN', 'CAMALOBALO', 2007, 10.27878039, '10° 16\' 43.609390\"', 122.96282650, '122° 57\' 46.175470\"', 'NGW-3143 Station is 11.1 Km. from Isabela town proper. From Isabela, travel SW, turn right to Brgy. Aranda passing by Camalobalo Brgy. Hall to Brgy. Calapi. It is about 1.3 Km. from Camalobalo Brgy. Hall. Station is located 21 m SW of Bamboo tree, 20 m NW of Bamboo tree and 39 m E of WEP. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and grouted at center of 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty embedded on the concrete pavement of bridge NW wing with inscriptions, \"NGW-3143, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.27875959, '10° 16\' 43.534530\"', 122.96282960, '122° 57\' 46.186700\"', 0.0700, '7', 81.2130, 0.1300, '2', 19.2883, 495929.81510, 1136233.62900, '51', 10.27992587, '10° 16\' 47.733140\"', 122.96136920, '122° 57\' 40.929110\"', 21.7083, 1136689.19700, 495768.37900, '4', 495769.86000, 1136291.33600, '51', 10.27880226, '10° 16\' 43.688150\"', 122.96282250, '122° 57\' 46.160970\"', 0.0640, 79.1880, 0.1192, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1084, 'NGW-3162', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF HIMAMAYLAN', 'SU-AY', 2007, 10.04895240, '10° 2\' 56.228650\"', 122.84095020, '122° 50\' 27.420620\"', 'NGW-3162 Station is about 3.6 Km. from Himamaylan City plaza. Station is located 3 m from NW corner of concrete drier, 10 m on the SW corner of rice mill, 20 m N of Brgy. Su-ay landmark and 14 m E of steel gate. Mark is the of a 4 in. copper nail flushed at the center of a 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm concrete monument casted on the ground at the right side of the road going to Brgy. Su-ay proper with inscriptions, \"NGW-3162, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.04893158, '10° 2\' 56.153700\"', 122.84095400, '122° 50\' 27.434310\"', 0.0200, '2', 69.9350, 0.0400, '1', 7.6396, 482571.86300, 1110826.76800, '51', 10.05008454, '10° 3\' 0.304340\"', 122.83948760, '122° 50\' 22.155440\"', 10.2063, 1111273.56100, 482404.87300, '4', 482411.03200, 1110884.59600, '51', 10.04897415, '10° 2\' 56.306950\"', 122.84094680, '122° 50\' 27.408430\"', 0.0167, 67.8850, 0.0381, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1085, 'NGW-3166', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF KABANKALAN', 'SALONG', 2007, 9.96713435, '9° 58\' 1.683660\"', 122.78421790, '122° 47\' 3.184440\"', 'NGW-3166 Station is about 6.1 Km. from Kabankalan City Hall on the way to Bantayan. Station is located 6 m NE of the waiting shed, 7 m NE of CEP and 14 m SW of Guava tree. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty embedded on the top of the riprap on the left side of the road going to Kabankalan, about 5 m from the intersection with inscriptions, \"NGW-3166, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.99, 9.96711369, '9° 58\' 1.609270\"', 122.78422080, '122° 47\' 3.194710\"', 0.0200, '2', 74.3310, 0.0400, '1', 11.7349, 476349.13680, 1101784.17700, '51', 9.96826221, '9° 58\' 5.743970\"', 122.78275230, '122° 46\' 57.908170\"', 14.5574, 1102227.88800, 476179.64100, '4', 476187.97800, 1101842.08900, '51', 9.96715621, '9° 58\' 1.762370\"', 122.78421360, '122° 47\' 3.169010\"', 0.0192, 72.2740, 0.0315, '2019-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
