(1100, 'NGW-49', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF VICTORIAS', 'BARANGAY XIV', 2007, 10.87734926, '10° 52\' 38.457320\"', 123.11877420, '123° 7\' 7.587030\"', 'NGW-49 The station is located on the middle NW side of the concrete basketball court. The station is west of Brgy. Capt. Fudillo\'s house. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete flooring of the court with inscriptions \"NGW-49; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is about 5.1 km from Victoria\'s City proper.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.87732858, '10° 52\' 38.382890\"', 123.11877970, '123° 7\' 7.606990\"', 0.0100, '1', 123.8270, 0.0300, '1', 63.0452, 512981.29750, 1202418.19100, '51', 10.87853327, '10° 52\' 42.719760\"', 123.11733430, '123° 7\' 2.403510\"', 65.3398, 1202897.12400, 512827.92500, '4', 512823.43500, 1202476.08900, '51', 10.87737148, '10° 52\' 38.537320\"', 123.11877270, '123° 7\' 7.581700\"', 0.0114, 121.8720, 0.0247, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
