(1102, 'NGW-51', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF ESCALANTE', 'HACIENDA FE', 2007, 10.86503102, '10° 51\' 54.111670\"', 123.47724500, '123° 28\' 38.082130\"', 'The station is about 110 m. from Vito wharf junction and about 3.9 km. from Escalante City proper. The station is located SW of the Escalante-Bacolod national highway, on the NW tip of the headwall. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the concrete headwall with inscriptions \"NGW-51; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.86501161, '10° 51\' 54.041780\"', 123.47725220, '123° 28\' 38.107750\"', 0.0300, '3', 94.0290, 0.0600, '1', 32.9350, 552161.00180, 1201094.71900, '51', 10.86620685, '10° 51\' 58.344660\"', 123.47580720, '123° 28\' 32.905870\"', 34.6288, 1201572.04400, 552021.70800, '4', 552003.49900, 1201151.47300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1103, 'NGW-53', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'ENRIQUE B. MAGALONA', 'TUBURAN', 2007, 10.87850472, '10° 52\' 42.617000\"', 122.95849770, '122° 57\' 30.591770\"', 'NGW-53 The station is at the midsection of the east side of the 30 m. length pier. The pier is about 1.0 km. south of E.B. Magalona town plaza. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete pier with inscriptions \"NGW-53; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.87848587, '10° 52\' 42.549130\"', 122.95850420, '122° 57\' 30.615260\"', 0.0100, '1', 64.7130, 0.0300, '1', 4.8916, 495464.99670, 1202543.92300, '51', 10.87969448, '10° 52\' 46.900140\"', 122.95705850, '122° 57\' 25.410680\"', 6.6238, 1203023.41000, 495305.31500, '4', 495306.95800, 1202602.33000, '51', 10.87852876, '10° 52\' 42.703530\"', 122.95849710, '122° 57\' 30.589670\"', 0.0124, 62.7620, 0.0239, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1104, 'NGW-55', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'ENRIQUE B. MAGALONA', 'TANZA', 2007, 10.84904095, '10° 50\' 56.547430\"', 123.00082370, '123° 0\' 2.965480\"', 'NGW-55 The station is on the SW side of the road heading to sugar central. It is about 9.0 km. from the junction of national highway and the road heading to sugar central. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the concrete headwall with inscriptions \"NGW-55; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.84902164, '10° 50\' 56.477920\"', 123.00083050, '123° 0\' 2.989880\"', 0.0100, '1', 72.6790, 0.0300, '1', 12.5052, 500090.77530, 1199285.76900, '51', 10.85022718, '10° 51\' 0.817840\"', 122.99938420, '122° 59\' 57.783010\"', 14.4152, 1199763.94700, 499932.66600, '4', 499932.69000, 1199344.00900, '51', 10.84906452, '10° 50\' 56.632280\"', 123.00082340, '123° 0\' 2.964380\"', 0.0116, 70.7230, 0.0248, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1105, 'NGW-57', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF ESCALANTE', 'PAITAN', 2007, 10.79665404, '10° 47\' 47.954540\"', 123.46902310, '123° 28\' 8.483200\"', 'NGW-57 The station is on the NE side of the dirt road leading to the barangay proper. The barangay hall is about 900 m. west of the station. The station is about 3 km. from Crossing Caing, Brgy. Mabini and is on top of an outcrop stone which is harder than the fine stone predominant in the area. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the stone outcrop with inscriptions \"NGW-57; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.79663387, '10° 47\' 47.881930\"', 123.46903050, '123° 28\' 8.509800\"', 0.0500, '5', 135.7820, 0.0900, '2', 74.5858, 551274.03260, 1193532.60800, '51', 10.79782449, '10° 47\' 52.168180\"', 123.46758380, '123° 28\' 3.301850\"', 76.2393, 1194007.23300, 551134.20200, '4', 551116.30400, 1193589.31000, '51', 10.79667677, '10° 47\' 48.036370\"', 123.46902360, '123° 28\' 8.485070\"', 0.0464, 133.8000, 0.0802, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1106, 'NGW-58', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF ESCALANTE', 'JONOBJONOB', 2007, 10.82003938, '10° 49\' 12.141780\"', 123.48797740, '123° 29\' 16.718710\"', 'NGW-58 THE STATION IS ON THE NE SIDEWALK OF DANAO BRIDGE. IT IS ABOUT 2.4 KM. FROM ESCALANTE CITY PROPER. MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4\" COPPER NAIL FLUSHED AT THE CENTER OF AN EXISTING BENCHMARK EMBEDDED ON THE CONCRETE SIDEWALK WITH INSCRIPTIONS \"NW-100; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.82001949, '10° 49\' 12.070160\"', 123.48798500, '123° 29\' 16.745920\"', 0.0200, '2', 70.8130, 0.0400, '1', 9.7313, 553342.03670, 1196121.66500, '51', 10.82121132, '10° 49\' 16.360740\"', 123.48653890, '123° 29\' 11.540130\"', 11.2791, 1196597.16400, 553203.02400, '4', 553184.40200, 1196178.33400, '51', 10.82006240, '10° 49\' 12.224630\"', 123.48797820, '123° 29\' 16.721390\"', 0.0185, 68.8320, 0.0356, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1107, 'NGW-6', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF SAGAY', 'OLD SAGAY', 1989, 10.90688791, '10° 54\' 24.796490\"', 123.41742610, '123° 25\' 2.734080\"', 'NGW-6 From Bacolod City Capitol building, travel northward along the national highway towards New Sagay, about 81.7 km. or 1.20 hours up to Sagay municipal building. From there, proceed for about 100 meters, then turn left towards Old Sagay. At this junction the water tank is already visible. Travel northward for about 900 meters up to the base of the water tank. The station is located on the center top of a 30.52 meters high concrete water tank inside the compound of Sagay Water District. Station mark is a cross cut on top of a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m diameter brass rod set in a drill hole, centered on a cement patty level to the concrete surface, center top of water tank and inscribed with station name and number. Sub-surface mark; none. Reference marks; none.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.90686831, '10° 54\' 24.725930\"', 123.41743370, '123° 25\' 2.761480\"', 0.0100, '1', 128.5330, 0.0200, '1', 67.3158, 545616.69890, 1205713.29300, '51', 10.90806793, '10° 54\' 29.044530\"', 123.41598970, '123° 24\' 57.562850\"', 69.3802, 1206192.47100, 545475.18000, '4', 545459.26300, 1205770.28200, '51', 10.90691124, '10° 54\' 24.880480\"', 123.41742690, '123° 25\' 2.736660\"', 0.0090, 126.5810, 0.0180, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1108, 'NGW-60', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF TALISAY', 'DOS HERMANAS', 2007, 10.74210960, '10° 44\' 31.594550\"', 123.02228930, '123° 1\' 20.241320\"', 'NGW-60 The station is 6 m. SW of the concrete bridge, 18 m. NW of a house, 5 km. from Talisay City Hall, and 5.7 km. from the Talisay-Silay junction. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the concrete headwall with inscriptions \"NGW-60; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.99, 10.74209006, '10° 44\' 31.524210\"', 123.02229500, '123° 1\' 20.261830\"', 0.0100, '1', 98.0611, 0.0200, '1', 37.4004, 502437.67920, 1187462.53900, '51', 10.74328757, '10° 44\' 35.835240\"', 123.02084600, '123° 1\' 15.045690\"', 39.4907, 1187936.38700, 502280.07400, '4', 502279.27500, 1187520.58900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1109, 'NGW-61', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'TOBOSO', 'POBLACION', 2007, 10.71234695, '10° 42\' 44.449020\"', 123.51650250, '123° 30\' 59.409130\"', 'NGW-61 The station is located at the tip of Toboso wharf, at the back of Toboso Public Market. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete wharf with inscriptions \"NGW-61; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.71232636, '10° 42\' 44.374880\"', 123.51650980, '123° 30\' 59.435340\"', 0.0500, '5', 65.4850, 0.0800, '1', 4.3673, 556480.24030, 1184218.84400, '51', 10.71350992, '10° 42\' 48.635710\"', 123.51506120, '123° 30\' 54.220260\"', 5.6253, 1184689.96300, 556342.01500, '4', 556322.29500, 1184275.30100, '51', 10.71236923, '10° 42\' 44.529210\"', 123.51650300, '123° 30\' 59.410890\"', 0.0412, 63.4910, 0.0749, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1110, 'NGW-63', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CALATRAVA', 'LEMERY', 2007, 10.64053760, '10° 38\' 25.935350\"', 123.48994300, '123° 29\' 23.794910\"', 'NGW-63 The station is on the NE end of the sidewalk. It is located at Daan-Lunsod bridge at km.124+077 along San Carlos-Bacolod national highway. The station is about 10.1 km. from Calatrava town proper. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the concrete sidewalk with inscriptions \"NGW-63; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.64051718, '10° 38\' 25.861860\"', 123.48994970, '123° 29\' 23.818940\"', 0.0400, '4', 72.6600, 0.0800, '1', 11.3426, 553588.40870, 1176274.02200, '51', 10.64169632, '10° 38\' 30.106750\"', 123.48849930, '123° 29\' 18.597320\"', 12.6963, 1176742.36100, 553448.91300, '4', 553430.20500, 1176330.48100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2018-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1111, 'NGW-66', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'MURCIA', 'BUENAVISTA', 2007, 10.61141089, '10° 36\' 41.079210\"', 123.09564380, '123° 5\' 44.317580\"', 'NGW-66 The station is NE of the box culvert. It is about 11 m. SW of concrete electric post and 5.8 km. from the Murcia-S. Benedicto national highway. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm.cement putty embedded on top of the concrete irrigation canal retaining wall with inscriptions \"NGW-66; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.61139056, '10° 36\' 41.006010\"', 123.09564960, '123° 5\' 44.338690\"', 0.0100, '1', 298.8240, 0.0300, '1', 237.0760, 510462.58640, 1173012.85600, '51', 10.61257708, '10° 36\' 45.277470\"', 123.09419770, '123° 5\' 39.111690\"', 239.7648, 1173481.26000, 510307.45900, '4', 510303.85100, 1173070.52100, '51', 10.61143335, '10° 36\' 41.160070\"', 123.09564260, '123° 5\' 44.313410\"', 0.0127, 296.8350, 0.0234, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1112, 'NGW-67 (SCC-2)', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'PALAMPAS', 2007, 10.50721960, '10° 30\' 25.990550\"', 123.42636040, '123° 25\' 34.897570\"', 'NGW-67 Station is located at the NW end of Vascoña Bridge at KM 141 + 882 of C.L. Ledesma Sr. Avenue(National Highway) and is about 850 meters SE of San Carlos Bio Energy Incorporated. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of existing cement putty embedded on top of the concrete side with inscriptions\"PRS-92; SCC-2\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.50719839, '10° 30\' 25.914190\"', 123.42636700, '123° 25\' 34.921150\"', 0.0100, '1', 69.7510, 0.0200, '1', 8.0583, 546654.02850, 1161522.65300, '51', 10.50836964, '10° 30\' 30.130700\"', 123.42491310, '123° 25\' 29.687240\"', 9.6315, 1161985.87500, 546511.60900, '4', 546495.32900, 1161579.15900, '51', 10.50724117, '10° 30\' 26.068220\"', 123.42636020, '123° 25\' 34.896660\"', 0.0109, 67.7330, 0.0217, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1113, 'NGW-70', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'MURCIA', 'LOPEZ JAENA', 2007, 10.56732279, '10° 34\' 2.362060\"', 123.08934990, '123° 5\' 21.659600\"', 'NGW-70 The station is on the SW corner of the Poncian bridge, which is at the SE of a waiting shed along Murcia -San Carlos National Road. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm cement putty embedded on the SW wingwall of Poncian bridge with inscriptions \"NGW-70; 2007; NAMRIA\". From Murcia town proper, the station is about 7.1 kilometer by land travel on any type of vehicle on a well paved road.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.56730224, '10° 34\' 2.288070\"', 123.08935570, '123° 5\' 21.680440\"', 0.0300, '3', 200.2380, 0.0900, '1', 138.4157, 509775.52150, 1168137.90900, '51', 10.56848582, '10° 34\' 6.548960\"', 123.08790260, '123° 5\' 16.449420\"', 141.0909, 1168604.57800, 509620.00300, '4', 509616.63600, 1168195.54600, '51', 10.56734502, '10° 34\' 2.442080\"', 123.08934870, '123° 5\' 21.655140\"', 0.0254, 198.2450, 0.0780, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1114, 'NGW-74', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF BAGO', 'TABUNAN', 2007, 10.56893834, '10° 34\' 8.178010\"', 122.94931880, '122° 56\' 57.547540\"', 'NGW-74 The station is at the SW edge of the headwall, above an RCPC on the SW side of the gravel road. From Sum-ag-Atipuluan road junction, it is about 800 meters to the station. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the headwall with inscriptions \"NGW-74; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.99, 10.56891891, '10° 34\' 8.108080\"', 122.94932360, '122° 56\' 57.565020\"', 0.0100, '1', 80.1852, 0.0300, '1', 19.1183, 494456.02820, 1168315.71200, '51', 10.57010600, '10° 34\' 12.381590\"', 122.94787030, '122° 56\' 52.333040\"', 21.3874, 1168782.89100, 494294.99100, '4', 494296.98800, 1168373.79600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1115, 'NGW-76', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF BAGO', 'SAMPINIT', 2007, 10.54591061, '10° 32\' 45.278200\"', 122.85778820, '122° 51\' 28.037610\"', 'NGW-76 The Station is about 0.8 kilometer from Bago City Hall. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm cement putty embedded on the concrete gutter inscription \"NGW-76; 2007; NAMIRA\". The station is behind the SW side of the concrete welcome landmark.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.54589096, '10° 32\' 45.207450\"', 122.85779330, '122° 51\' 28.055900\"', 0.0200, '3', 67.4480, 0.0700, '1', 6.6718, 484441.48560, 1165772.65700, '51', 10.54707863, '10° 32\' 49.483060\"', 122.85633920, '122° 51\' 22.821220\"', 8.8223, 1166239.21000, 484276.76400, '4', 484282.26800, 1165831.00600, '51', 10.54593373, '10° 32\' 45.361430\"', 122.85778610, '122° 51\' 28.029930\"', 0.0217, 65.4590, 0.0615, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1116, 'NGW-77', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF BAGO', 'MALINGIN', 2007, 10.48776100, '10° 29\' 15.939610\"', 122.93269550, '122° 55\' 57.703890\"', 'NGW-77 The station is on the headwall of the intersection of the main and the supply canal, and is about 3 m. NE of the control gate. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the concrete headwall with inscriptions \"NGW-77; 2007; NAMRIA\". From Malingin barangay proper, it is about 1.2 km. to the station.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.48774086, '10° 29\' 15.867080\"', 122.93270030, '122° 55\' 57.721160\"', 0.0500, '5', 87.7190, 0.1200, '2', 26.4152, 492635.52080, 1159340.42600, '51', 10.48892262, '10° 29\' 20.121430\"', 122.93124500, '122° 55\' 52.481880\"', 28.7726, 1159804.42200, 492473.56700, '4', 492476.20100, 1159398.47000, '51', 10.48778361, '10° 29\' 16.020990\"', 122.93269320, '122° 55\' 57.695340\"', 0.0452, 85.1820, 0.1049, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
