(1117, 'NGW-78', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF BAGO', 'MA-AO BARRIO', 2007, 10.49101317, '10° 29\' 27.647400\"', 122.99388040, '122° 59\' 37.969490\"', 'NGW-78 From Ma-ao barangay proper the station is about 200 m. It can be reached from the junction of the Maao-Ilijan road going to Sitio Pandan. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the concrete pavement with inscriptions \"NGW-78; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is on the NW edge of the spillway, on the downstream side of the river.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.49099267, '10° 29\' 27.573620\"', 122.99388560, '122° 59\' 37.988090\"', 0.0200, '2', 117.3390, 0.0600, '1', 55.7734, 499330.85890, 1159699.17500, '51', 10.49217306, '10° 29\' 31.823020\"', 122.99242990, '122° 59\' 32.747630\"', 58.0082, 1160163.10500, 499171.33000, '4', 499171.62000, 1159757.02700, '51', 10.49103543, '10° 29\' 27.727550\"', 122.99387840, '122° 59\' 37.962380\"', 0.0201, 115.3400, 0.0566, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1118, 'NGW-80', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF BAGO', 'MA-AO BARRIO', 2007, 10.49211297, '10° 29\' 31.606690\"', 122.94695400, '122° 56\' 49.034250\"', 'NGW-80 From Ma-ao Provincial Road, turn right on the road heading to Sum-ag. The Quezon Bridge is at Km 33+188. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"NGW-80; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is on the SW sidewalk of the Quezon Bridge.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.49209274, '10° 29\' 31.533880\"', 122.94695910, '122° 56\' 49.052860\"', 0.0200, '2', 92.1720, 0.0700, '1', 30.8245, 494195.91710, 1159821.30300, '51', 10.49327447, '10° 29\' 35.788100\"', 122.94550390, '122° 56\' 43.814070\"', 33.2006, 1160285.42600, 494034.54000, '4', 494036.62800, 1159879.30600, '51', 10.49213550, '10° 29\' 31.687800\"', 122.94695200, '122° 56\' 49.027060\"', 0.0207, 90.1740, 0.0595, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1119, 'NGW-82', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF BAGO', 'ILIJAN', 2007, 10.42698575, '10° 25\' 37.148690\"', 123.08645590, '123° 5\' 11.241310\"', 'NGW-82 From Ilijan-Araal barangay road, turn left leading to Rafael M. Salas Park. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"NGW-82; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is in front of the Rafael M. Salas monument, located at the compound of Kanlaon Natures Park, Administration site.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.42696477, '10° 25\' 37.073160\"', 123.08646100, '123° 5\' 11.259670\"', 0.0200, '2', 958.2090, 0.0600, '1', 895.8172, 509463.11130, 1152621.12400, '51', 10.42813837, '10° 25\' 41.298140\"', 123.08500470, '123° 5\' 6.016770\"', 898.7425, 1153082.19200, 509307.04900, '4', 509303.79100, 1152678.59300, '51', 10.42700761, '10° 25\' 37.227410\"', 123.08645400, '123° 5\' 11.234230\"', 0.0196, 956.2000, 0.0504, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1120, 'NGW-83', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF LA CARLOTA', 'AYUNGON', 2007, 10.45320339, '10° 27\' 11.532190\"', 122.92874690, '122° 55\' 43.488920\"', 'NGW-83 From the station, it is about 2.9 kilometers from La Carlota City public market/town center. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the concrete headwall with inscriptions \"NGW-83; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is on the NE top of the headwall, which is located on the NW side of the La Carlota-Ma-ao road. recomputed 3/19/2014', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.45320357, '10° 27\' 11.532860\"', 122.92874820, '122° 55\' 43.493540\"', 0.0400, '4', 87.4510, 0.1300, '1', 26.0585, 492202.18480, 1155521.84500, '51', 10.45438300, '10° 27\' 15.778790\"', 122.92729200, '122° 55\' 38.251180\"', 28.4340, 1155984.47600, 492039.96400, '4', 492042.75000, 1155579.86100, '51', 10.45324631, '10° 27\' 11.686730\"', 122.92874100, '122° 55\' 43.467720\"', 0.0321, 85.4500, 0.1134, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1121, 'NGW-84', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'SAN ENRIQUE', 'BAGONAWA', 2007, 10.41247754, '10° 24\' 44.919130\"', 122.86127540, '122° 51\' 40.591320\"', 'NGW-84 From Bacolod-Kabankalan road, turn left on the road leading to La Carlota City. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete sidewalk with inscriptions \"NGW-84; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is on the NE sidewalk of the Banawang Bridge, NE side of the San Enrique-La Carlota highway.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.41245734, '10° 24\' 44.846440\"', 122.86127990, '122° 51\' 40.607520\"', 0.0200, '3', 67.8260, 0.0700, '1', 6.6254, 484816.44640, 1151019.12100, '51', 10.41363553, '10° 24\' 49.087890\"', 122.85982250, '122° 51\' 35.361050\"', 8.8810, 1151480.34400, 484651.43200, '4', 484656.80400, 1151077.30600, '51', 10.41250006, '10° 24\' 45.000230\"', 122.86127270, '122° 51\' 40.581580\"', 0.0208, 65.8210, 0.0646, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1122, 'NGW-85', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'PONTEVEDRA', 'SAN JUAN', 2007, 10.40373306, '10° 24\' 13.439000\"', 122.89308520, '122° 53\' 35.106570\"', 'NGW-85 The station can be reached via San Enrique -Pontevedra-La Carlota junction. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the concrete sidewalk with inscriptions \"NGW-85; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is on the SW corner of the Candaquit bridge.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.40371281, '10° 24\' 13.366110\"', 122.89308980, '122° 53\' 35.123230\"', 0.0200, '2', 74.2980, 0.0700, '1', 12.9338, 488297.86620, 1150050.92000, '51', 10.40488960, '10° 24\' 17.602570\"', 122.89163230, '122° 53\' 29.876220\"', 15.2542, 1150511.69200, 488134.07900, '4', 488138.23200, 1150108.99300, '51', 10.40375553, '10° 24\' 13.519900\"', 122.89308260, '122° 53\' 35.097350\"', 0.0211, 72.2910, 0.0599, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1123, 'NGW-86', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF LA CARLOTA', 'LA GRANJA', 2007, 10.40942694, '10° 24\' 33.937000\"', 122.97104750, '122° 58\' 15.771040\"', 'NGW-86 The station is located along the Antipolo-La Castillana-La Carlota road. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the concrete sidewalk with inscriptions \"NGW-86; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is on the SE corner of the Najalin Bridge. recomputed 3/19/2014', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.99, 10.40940497, '10° 24\' 33.857900\"', 122.97105190, '122° 58\' 15.786800\"', 0.1000, '10', 133.4740, 0.2800, '2', 71.7937, 496831.46870, 1150678.45400, '51', 10.41058028, '10° 24\' 38.089000\"', 122.96959470, '122° 58\' 10.540890\"', 74.2509, 1151139.20400, 496670.77700, '4', 496671.94300, 1150736.28600, '51', 10.40944770, '10° 24\' 34.011710\"', 122.97104470, '122° 58\' 15.761070\"', 0.0849, 131.4670, 0.2465, '2019-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1124, 'NGW-87', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'LA CASTELLANA', 'CABACUNGAN', 2007, 10.34115316, '10° 20\' 28.151380\"', 123.14953010, '123° 8\' 58.308510\"', 'NGW-87 The station is at the SE side of Moises Padilla-Canlaon road. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the headwall with inscriptions \"NGW-87; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is on the SE side of the road, NE of the wooden electric post.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.34113182, '10° 20\' 28.074540\"', 123.14953510, '123° 8\' 58.326330\"', 0.0200, '2', 395.7280, 0.0600, '1', 333.4044, 516371.01000, 1143133.45100, '51', 10.34229794, '10° 20\' 32.272590\"', 123.14807660, '123° 8\' 53.075870\"', 335.9062, 1143590.91000, 516217.15000, '4', 516211.47400, 1143190.63300, '51', 10.34117453, '10° 20\' 28.228290\"', 123.14952800, '123° 8\' 58.300940\"', 0.0180, 393.7080, 0.0498, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1125, 'NGW-88', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'PONTEVEDRA', 'MIRANDA', 2007, 10.33526026, '10° 20\' 6.936940\"', 122.86618460, '122° 51\' 58.264410\"', 'NGW-88 From Bacolod-Kabankalan road, turn right to the barangay road, the station is on the NE side of the barangay road. The station is between the 2nd and 3rd street light post. It is about 80 m. from the NE corner of the national high school. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"NGW-88; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.99, 10.33523997, '10° 20\' 6.863890\"', 122.86618880, '122° 51\' 58.279800\"', 0.0200, '2', 67.5590, 0.0600, '1', 6.2022, 485350.16580, 1142481.24900, '51', 10.33641258, '10° 20\' 11.085290\"', 122.86472960, '122° 51\' 53.026530\"', 8.4232, 1142939.37700, 485185.09600, '4', 485190.28200, 1142539.32800, '51', 10.33528266, '10° 20\' 7.017580\"', 122.86618160, '122° 51\' 58.253890\"', 0.0201, 65.5450, 0.0566, '2019-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1126, 'NGW-91', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'PONTEVEDRA', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2007, 10.32248649, '10° 19\' 20.951360\"', 122.90369930, '122° 54\' 13.317360\"', 'NGW-91 From the municipal hall of Pontevedra travel south to Hinigaran then turn left on the road leading to barangay San Isidro. The station is about 200 m. from San Isidro Elementary School and about 4.6 km. from Bacolod-Kabankalan road. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete pavement with inscriptions \"NGW-91; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is on the SW corner of the basketball court, which is in front of the house of Nestor Estoles.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.32246583, '10° 19\' 20.876990\"', 122.90370380, '122° 54\' 13.333740\"', 0.0200, '2', 75.1840, 0.0600, '1', 13.5993, 489456.93750, 1141067.38500, '51', 10.32363663, '10° 19\' 25.091870\"', 122.90224430, '122° 54\' 8.079600\"', 15.9261, 1141524.88400, 489293.30800, '4', 489297.05500, 1141125.33100, '51', 10.32250852, '10° 19\' 21.030670\"', 122.90369660, '122° 54\' 13.307830\"', 0.0178, 73.1680, 0.0528, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1127, 'NGW-94', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'MOISES PADILLA', 'MAGALLON CADRE', 2007, 10.29031121, '10° 17\' 25.120340\"', 123.09697610, '123° 5\' 49.113800\"', 'NGW-94 The station is located approximately 10 kms from La Castellana-Isabela junction in Barangay Crossing Magallon and about 3.2 kms from Moises Padilla Town Hall. It is on the SW edge of the riprap, which is NW of the flood control gate. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the riprap with inscriptions \"NGW-94; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.99, 10.29028975, '10° 17\' 25.043100\"', 123.09698080, '123° 5\' 49.131030\"', 0.0100, '1', 131.8993, 0.0300, '1', 69.7255, 510619.10030, 1137509.83600, '51', 10.29145360, '10° 17\' 29.232950\"', 123.09552100, '123° 5\' 43.875480\"', 72.0897, 1137965.43800, 510462.99800, '4', 510459.33600, 1137567.13100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1128, 'NGW-95', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'HINIGARAN', 'BARANGAY I', 2007, 10.27653497, '10° 16\' 35.525880\"', 122.85216860, '122° 51\' 7.806970\"', 'NGW-95 The station is located along the Bacolod-Kabankalan national highway. The station is on the SE corner of Hinigaran Bridge which is at KM 53+535. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete pavement with inscriptions \"NGW-95; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.99, 10.27653498, '10° 16\' 35.525910\"', 122.85216990, '122° 51\' 7.811570\"', 0.0100, '1', 67.8090, 0.0300, '1', 6.4072, 483812.35200, 1135991.15300, '51', 10.27770378, '10° 16\' 39.733600\"', 122.85070920, '122° 51\' 2.552990\"', 8.5725, 1136446.98600, 483646.54000, '4', 483652.26400, 1136049.21000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1129, 'NGW-96', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'ISABELA', 'BARANGAY 4', 2007, 10.20903776, '10° 12\' 32.535930\"', 122.99044620, '122° 59\' 25.606260\"', 'NGW-96 The station is about 0.6 km. from Isabela town proper, along the Isabela-La Castellana Provincial Road. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete pavement with inscriptions \"NGW-96; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is on the east side of the road on top of riprap, SW of km. post 81.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.20901664, '10° 12\' 32.459910\"', 122.99045140, '122° 59\' 25.625170\"', 0.0900, '9', 86.2000, 0.1500, '2', 24.0039, 498954.19600, 1128522.26900, '51', 10.21017732, '10° 12\' 36.638350\"', 122.98898930, '122° 59\' 20.361600\"', 26.4668, 1128974.96900, 498793.62700, '4', 498794.04900, 1128579.80800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2018-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1130, 'NGW-97', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'HINIGARAN', 'PALAYOG', 2007, 10.21948026, '10° 13\' 10.128950\"', 122.90418610, '122° 54\' 15.069840\"', 'NGW-97 From Kabankalan-Bacolod national road turn right to Barangay Cambusa, then turn right leading to Barangay Palayog. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. in a cement block cast on the ground with inscriptions \"NGW-97; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is about 11.0 m. NE of barangay hall of Palayog.', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.83, 10.21945974, '10° 13\' 10.055080\"', 122.90419040, '122° 54\' 15.085550\"', 0.0200, '2', 70.7700, 0.0600, '1', 8.9326, 489506.81920, 1129678.45100, '51', 10.22062325, '10° 13\' 14.243700\"', 122.90272840, '122° 54\' 9.822280\"', 11.2739, 1130131.84200, 489342.87700, '4', 489346.60700, 1129736.27600, '51', 10.21950239, '10° 13\' 10.208610\"', 122.90418320, '122° 54\' 15.059680\"', 0.0189, 68.7420, 0.0541, '2018-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1131, 'NGW-98', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'BINALBAGAN', 'SAN JOSE', 2007, 10.19989703, '10° 11\' 59.629290\"', 122.88373310, '122° 53\' 1.439040\"', 'NGW-98 The station is at the west corner of the triangular shaped island, where the welcome signage is located. The station is made level with the sidewalk pavement.Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete sidewalk with inscriptions \"NGW-98; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.99, 10.19987620, '10° 11\' 59.554320\"', 122.88373730, '122° 53\' 1.454210\"', 0.0100, '1', 70.0265, 0.0300, '1', 8.2163, 487265.98380, 1127513.92900, '51', 10.20103881, '10° 12\' 3.739730\"', 122.88227470, '122° 52\' 56.189050\"', 10.5361, 1127966.60400, 487101.17100, '4', 487105.68600, 1127571.79600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1132, 'NGW-99', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'BINALBAGAN', 'PAYAO', 2007, 10.16660865, '10° 9\' 59.791150\"', 122.94515860, '122° 56\' 42.570820\"', 'NGW-99 The station is about 3.5 kilometers from Binalbagan-Isabela-Payao junction, 1.1 kilometers SE of Payao Barangay Hall, and about 500 m. from Payao Public Market. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on top of the concrete headwall with inscriptions \"NGW-99; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2018, 'Reobs 2018', 2018.99, 10.16658741, '10° 9\' 59.714660\"', 122.94516280, '122° 56\' 42.586240\"', 0.0100, '1', 93.5609, 0.0300, '1', 31.3612, 493993.17950, 1123831.58100, '51', 10.16774617, '10° 10\' 3.886220\"', 122.94369960, '122° 56\' 37.318580\"', 33.8425, 1124282.73300, 493830.68600, '4', 493832.84500, 1123889.21500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1133, 'BLN-12', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'BULACAN', 'MAYSANTOL', 1995, 14.79681350, '14° 47\' 48.528600\"', 120.87479300, '120° 52\' 29.254800\"', 'BLN-12 Is located in the Province of Bulacan, Municipality of Bulacan, Brgy. Maysantol also known as Cupang. On the N sidewalk of the Cupang concrete bridge, 3.14 m. SE of the NW corner. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set in a drilled hole and centered on a cement putty with inscription \"BLN-12, NAMRIA, 1995\".', 2019, 'Reobs 2019', 2019.54, 14.79681523, '14° 47\' 48.534830\"', 120.87479020, '120° 52\' 29.244800\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.9120, 0.0000, '2', 4.6450, 271263.83570, 1636936.82400, '51', 14.79833578, '14° 47\' 54.008810\"', 120.87343530, '120° 52\' 24.367030\"', 4.2476, 1636497.33900, 486375.72000, '3', 271116.49400, 1637005.96100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1134, 'BLN-14', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'PAOMBONG', 'SAN ISIDRO I', 1995, 14.83579287, '14° 50\' 8.854332\"', 120.78020440, '120° 46\' 48.735840\"', 'BLN-14 Is located in the Province of Bulacan, Municipality of Paombong, Brgy. San Isidro I, on San Isidro I concrete bridge. It is situated on the NW sidewalk of the bridge, 4.3 m. SW of the NE corner. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set in a drilled hole and centered on a cement putty with inscription \"BLN-14, NAMRIA, 1995\".', 2019, 'Reobs 2019', 2019.54, 14.83579402, '14° 50\' 8.858480\"', 120.78020230, '120° 46\' 48.728170\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.1830, 0.0000, '2', 6.3464, 261121.73840, 1641349.49100, '51', 14.83731919, '14° 50\' 14.349090\"', 120.77884810, '120° 46\' 43.853240\"', 5.8610, 1640818.19400, 476197.94200, '3', 260974.44200, 1641418.97100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'RCG', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1135, 'BLN-3138', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'NORZAGARAY', 'SAN MATEO', 2008, 14.87395867, '14° 52\' 26.251212\"', 121.13031200, '121° 7\' 49.123200\"', 'BLN-3138 Station is located in the Province of Bulacan, Mun. of Norzagaray, Brgy. San Mateo. From San Mateo Brgy. Hall travel 200 m N until reaching the Christian Int\'l School. Station is situated at the NE side of Christian Int\'l School and about 200 m N of San Mateo Brgy. Hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions, \"BLN-3138, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2019, 'Reobs 2019', 2019.54, 14.87395975, '14° 52\' 26.255110\"', 121.13030990, '121° 7\' 49.115780\"', 0.0100, '1', 262.9760, 0.0100, '2', 218.1754, 298845.88430, 1645228.16000, '51', 14.87547949, '14° 52\' 31.726160\"', 121.12895720, '121° 7\' 44.246070\"', 219.9117, 1645032.32400, 513876.90900, '3', 298699.03200, 1645296.53600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1136, 'ILS-14', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN JUAN', 'PANDAYAN', 2005, 17.74766766, '17° 44\' 51.603576\"', 120.45607430, '120° 27\' 21.867480\"', 'ILS-14 From Vigan City, travel N along the national highway for about 22 km. until reaching the Brgy. Lapting welcome marker on the E side of Km. Post 427 + 166 infront of the vulcanizing shop. Turn W and travel S along the municipal road for about 150 m. to reach the San Juan North Central School. It is located inside the compound on the NW corner fence of the school. It is 2.9 m. SE of the NW corner fence, 2.3 m. S of the N fence and 1.9 m. E of the W fence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 10 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-14, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.74768166, '17° 44\' 51.653960\"', 120.45607810, '120° 27\' 21.881180\"', 0.0400, '4', 51.6410, 0.1400, '1', 14.9478, 230240.69030, 1964096.72600, '51', 17.74939426, '17° 44\' 57.819330\"', 120.45479160, '120° 27\' 17.249880\"', 18.9906, 1963112.28100, 442180.05300, '3', 230102.89600, 1964169.69300, '51', 17.74772674, '17° 44\' 51.816260\"', 120.45606950, '120° 27\' 21.850200\"', 0.0338, 50.4510, 0.1217, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1137, 'ILS-16', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 'POBLACION', 2005, 17.63792680, '17° 38\' 16.536480\"', 120.40909350, '120° 24\' 32.736600\"', 'ILS-16 From Vigan City, travel N along the national highway for about 8 km. until reaching the Santo Domingo Park on the SE side of the national highway. The park is located infront of the municipal hall. It is located inside the park. It is about 8 m. NE (right hand side) of the Benito Soliven monument, about 30 m. SE of the national highway, about 3.3 m. NE of the first step of the NE stair and 0.4 m. NE of the NE portion of the circular concrete base. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and flush with the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-16, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.63794051, '17° 38\' 16.585820\"', 120.40909650, '120° 24\' 32.747440\"', 0.0300, '3', 46.6860, 0.1100, '1', 10.3795, 225088.86170, 1952013.71200, '51', 17.63964756, '17° 38\' 22.731220\"', 120.40780740, '120° 24\' 28.106760\"', 13.7955, 1950981.65700, 437159.03100, '3', 224950.66400, 1952086.74800, '51', 17.63798556, '17° 38\' 16.748000\"', 120.40908790, '120° 24\' 32.716410\"', 0.0283, 45.4840, 0.0960, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1138, 'ILS-18', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA', 'QUIRINO', 2005, 17.48608355, '17° 29\' 9.900780\"', 120.43290600, '120° 25\' 58.461600\"', 'ILS-18 From Vigan City, travel S along the national highway for about 19 km. until reaching the Santa Municipal Hall. It is located about 150 m. W (back side) of the municipal hall along the center of the municipal road. It is about 11 m. SW of the SW corner of the basketball court and on the E end of the second plant box from the municipal hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty about 1 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-18, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.48609651, '17° 29\' 9.947420\"', 120.43290800, '120° 25\' 58.468760\"', 0.0300, '3', 43.2970, 0.1100, '1', 6.5866, 227389.35950, 1935166.63800, '51', 17.48779396, '17° 29\' 16.058270\"', 120.43161540, '120° 25\' 53.815520\"', 9.8633, 1934168.49800, 439635.19400, '3', 227250.66700, 1935239.48200, '51', 17.48614152, '17° 29\' 10.109460\"', 120.43289940, '120° 25\' 58.437820\"', 0.0283, 42.0750, 0.0964, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1139, 'ILS-19', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'NARVACAN', 'QUINARAYAN', 2005, 17.44189346, '17° 26\' 30.816456\"', 120.46886910, '120° 28\' 7.928760\"', 'ILS-19 Is located in Brgy. Quinarayan, Narvacan, Ilocos Sur. It is situated in the W side of the highway junction going to Vigan City, Bangued and Manila. It is near the concrete step, about 6 m. SW of the monument of Andres Bonifacio. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"ILS-19, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.44190527, '17° 26\' 30.858960\"', 120.46887050, '120° 28\' 7.933970\"', 0.0300, '3', 45.9140, 0.1100, '1', 8.6432, 231145.53390, 1930222.70300, '51', 17.44359930, '17° 26\' 36.957490\"', 120.46757700, '120° 28\' 3.277220\"', 12.2529, 1929266.59000, 443440.91600, '3', 231006.71900, 1930295.39600, '51', 17.44195027, '17° 26\' 31.020980\"', 120.46886200, '120° 28\' 7.903110\"', 0.0282, 44.6860, 0.0956, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1140, 'ILS-2', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA LUCIA', 'CATAYAGAN', 1991, 17.13110330, '17° 7\' 51.971880\"', 120.44372290, '120° 26\' 37.402440\"', 'ILS-2 Is in an open ground, right side of the road dike leading to the cemetery. Travel time from Sta. Lucia proper is 3 min. Accessible by 2-wheel drive vehicle. Mark is a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in standard concrete block, 1 m. deep, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. Reference mark (RM) is a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in concrete blocks, 0.6 m. deep, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. RM No. 2 is a brass rod in a drilled hole.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.13111447, '17° 7\' 52.012090\"', 120.44372600, '120° 26\' 37.413660\"', 0.0300, '3', 46.4880, 0.1100, '1', 7.9208, 228016.74170, 1895847.70100, '51', 17.13279029, '17° 7\' 58.045060\"', 120.44242520, '120° 26\' 32.730800\"', 11.9025, 1894878.45600, 440669.50900, '3', 227876.86200, 1895920.23500, '51', 17.13115939, '17° 7\' 52.173800\"', 120.44371750, '120° 26\' 37.382860\"', 0.0289, 45.2230, 0.0984, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1141, 'ILS-21', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTIAGO', 'POBLACION SUR', 2005, 17.29464513, '17° 17\' 40.722468\"', 120.44617730, '120° 26\' 46.238280\"', 'ILS-21 Is in Brgy. Poblacion, Santiago, Ilocos Sur. From Vigan City, travel S to the town of Santiago. On the town proper, turn left on the street before reaching the Santiago Municipal Hall. This road leads to Santiago South Central School and the municipal concrete water tank. It is located on top of the concrete water tank. The water tank is located beside a mini-park, 20 m. E of Santiago South Central School, about 40 m. NNW of the gymnasium and Santiago Municipal Hall. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILS-21, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.29465706, '17° 17\' 40.765410\"', 120.44617870, '120° 26\' 46.243450\"', 0.0300, '1', 61.1700, 0.1100, '1', 23.4300, 228516.84650, 1913951.47900, '51', 17.29634271, '17° 17\' 46.833770\"', 120.44488180, '120° 26\' 41.574300\"', 27.0954, 1912977.13600, 440982.80900, '3', 228377.52000, 1914024.13300, '51', 17.29470202, '17° 17\' 40.927280\"', 120.44617020, '120° 26\' 46.212600\"', 0.0281, 59.9250, 0.0956, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1142, 'ILS-22', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'LIDLIDDA', 'POBLACION NORTE', 2005, 17.26876030, '17° 16\' 7.537080\"', 120.52043410, '120° 31\' 13.562760\"', 'ILS-22 From Candon City, travel N along the national highway for about 6 km. then turn E at the junction and travel for about 8 km. until reaching the Lidlidda Public Market. Turn NW and travel for about 4 km. to reach the North Central School. It is located inside the school compound on the science park near the NE corner of the concrete stage. It is 1.5 m. NNW of the E corner of the concrete stage and 0.8 m. NNE of the NE side of the stage. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 10 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-22, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.26877193, '17° 16\' 7.578940\"', 120.52043550, '120° 31\' 13.567930\"', 0.0300, '3', 87.6000, 0.1100, '1', 48.5287, 236377.97110, 1910982.43200, '51', 17.27045442, '17° 16\' 13.635920\"', 120.51913810, '120° 31\' 8.896990\"', 53.2647, 1910091.01200, 448870.36200, '3', 236238.61300, 1911054.82500, '51', 17.26881689, '17° 16\' 7.740810\"', 120.52042700, '120° 31\' 13.537220\"', 0.0282, 86.3500, 0.0966, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1143, 'ILS-23', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN EMILIO', 'CABAROAN', 2005, 17.23629737, '17° 14\' 10.670532\"', 120.57852090, '120° 34\' 42.675240\"', 'ILS-23 From Candon City, travel N along the national highway for about 6 km. then turn E at the junction and travel for about 17 km. until reaching the San Emilio West Central School. It is located inside the school compound on the Math Park. It is on the E corner of the park, about 17 m. WNW of the N corner of the school office and about 23 m. W of Acacia tree no. 8. It is SSE of the municipal hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 30 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-23, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.23630879, '17° 14\' 10.711630\"', 120.57852260, '120° 34\' 42.681290\"', 0.0300, '3', 283.1180, 0.1100, '1', 242.8537, 242511.67300, 1907309.94900, '51', 17.23798802, '17° 14\' 16.756880\"', 120.57722450, '120° 34\' 38.008070\"', 248.5402, 1906483.72200, 455038.87600, '3', 242372.25300, 1907382.12300, '51', 17.23635374, '17° 14\' 10.873480\"', 120.57851410, '120° 34\' 42.650700\"', 0.0281, 281.8620, 0.0959, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1144, 'ILS-27', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'GREGORIO DEL PILAR', 'POBLACION NORTE', 2005, 17.14814178, '17° 8\' 53.310408\"', 120.60993210, '120° 36\' 35.755560\"', 'ILS-27 Is in So. Cobcobuan, Brgy. Poblacion Norte, Gregorio del Pilar, Ilocos Sur. The town of Gregorio del Pilar can be reached by taking the provincial road passing through the towns of Galimuyod and Salcedo. Continue traveling this road, series of rough/dirt, crossing a river by about ten times until reaching the town proper. Public transportation is difficult and scheduled only once a day. Upon reaching the town proper, take the road to the left, leading to So. Cobcobuan and Tangaoan. Then turn left upon reaching an intersection, an uphill climb with an outpost opposite the road to the left. Continue traveling passing through Gregorio del Pilar High School on the right side. Then stop upon reaching a vacant lot on the left side of the road. Follow the trail going to the hill and ask for the house of Municipal Coun. Domingo Burgos in the area. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, about 60 cm. deep, protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"ILS-27, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.14815264, '17° 8\' 53.349500\"', 120.60993370, '120° 36\' 35.761490\"', 0.0300, '3', 363.1170, 0.1100, '1', 321.8695, 245733.00020, 1897508.83600, '51', 17.14982584, '17° 8\' 59.373040\"', 120.60863360, '120° 36\' 31.081120\"', 328.1851, 1896720.48700, 458359.50900, '3', 245593.31000, 1897580.83700, '51', 17.14819758, '17° 8\' 53.511270\"', 120.60992530, '120° 36\' 35.730990\"', 0.0288, 361.8490, 0.0985, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1145, 'ILS-28', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'TAGUDIN', 'DARDARAT', 2005, 16.96182221, '16° 57\' 42.559956\"', 120.43999550, '120° 26\' 23.983800\"', 'ILS-28 From Candon City, travel S for about 26 km. until reaching a group of restaurants along the national highway in Brgy. Dardarat, Tagudin. A few meters S of Amie\'s Restaurant is a waiting shed on the NW corner of the street going to Seaside Park. Travel NW along the street for about 400 m. passing by a small bridge to reach the station. It is located inside the resthouse compound of Mayor Roque Verzosa. It is about 19 m. SW of the stairs on the SW side of the house, about 12 m. NW of the river, 3.6 m. N of the S corner fence, 3.1 m. NE of the SW fence and 0.95 m. NW of the SE fence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 30 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-28, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 16.96183118, '16° 57\' 42.592250\"', 120.43999700, '120° 26\' 23.989320\"', 0.0300, '3', 44.5740, 0.1100, '1', 5.2907, 227374.10830, 1877110.28400, '51', 16.96349681, '16° 57\' 48.588510\"', 120.43869230, '120° 26\' 19.292270\"', 9.4658, 1876145.13000, 440218.47500, '3', 227233.65600, 1877182.69600, '51', 16.96187606, '16° 57\' 42.753800\"', 120.43998850, '120° 26\' 23.958560\"', 0.0297, 43.2890, 0.1019, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1146, 'ILS-29 (BLLM-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SUYO', 'POBLACION', 2006, 16.98347909, '16° 59\' 0.524724\"', 120.51161010, '120° 30\' 41.796360\"', 'ILS-29 (BLLM 2) From Candon City, travel S for about 26 km. then turn SW at Bitalag Junction and travel for about 12 km. or about 30 mins. to reach the station at Poblacion, Suyo. It is located about 200 m. W of the municipal hall, about 100 m. WNW of Kimpusa Br. 1 (331 + 805), about 9 m. S from the road centerline, about 3 m. W of the concrete irrigation canal and about 6 m. S of DPWH Km. Post 331 + 700. It is elevated about a meter from the ricefield. Mark is the head of a 4 in. common nail, centered on a concrete block 40 cm. x 40 cm. and flush with the ground surface, with inscription \"BLLM No. 2\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 16.98348904, '16° 59\' 0.560560\"', 120.51161150, '120° 30\' 41.801450\"', 0.0300, '3', 115.7260, 0.1100, '1', 75.3746, 235035.12980, 1879409.93000, '51', 16.98515443, '16° 59\' 6.555940\"', 120.51030740, '120° 30\' 37.106610\"', 80.5130, 1878521.36800, 447851.91700, '3', 234894.80700, 1879482.12500, '51', 16.98353393, '16° 59\' 0.722150\"', 120.51160300, '120° 30\' 41.770820\"', 0.0295, 114.4410, 0.0999, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1147, 'ILS-30 (BLLM-2A)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SUYO', 'MAN-ATONG', 2002, 16.95135203, '16° 57\' 4.867308\"', 120.60229200, '120° 36\' 8.251200\"', 'ILS-30 (BLLM 2A) From Candon City, travel S for about 26 km. then turn SW at Bitalag Junction and travel along the mostly rough road for about 25 km. or about 1 hr. and 30 mins. to reach the station. A four wheel drive vehicle or vehicle with high profile tires is recommended. It is located about 100 m. SE of Butac Elem. School. It is on the S top of the rock on the S side of the road. Mark is the head of a 3 in. concrete nail, centered on a 28 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, protruding 6 cm. on top of the rock about 9 m. x 15 m. with a height of about 5 m. from the ground, with inscriptions \"BLLM-2A, 2002, PRS 92, FNSP-DENR\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 16.95136150, '16° 57\' 4.901390\"', 120.60229370, '120° 36\' 8.257340\"', 0.0300, '3', 313.9150, 0.1100, '1', 271.9087, 244652.35040, 1875732.83500, '51', 16.95302292, '16° 57\' 10.882510\"', 120.60098900, '120° 36\' 3.560410\"', 278.3829, 1874943.82900, 457501.65200, '3', 244511.99300, 1875804.70600, '51', 16.95140638, '16° 57\' 5.062970\"', 120.60228520, '120° 36\' 8.226890\"', 0.0295, 312.6240, 0.0999, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1148, 'ILS-3018', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'NARVACAN', 'SULVEC', 2007, 17.44698074, '17° 26\' 49.130664\"', 120.45185090, '120° 27\' 6.663240\"', 'ILS-3018 Station is located and established along the national highway, NW corner of a triangle park beside a jetmatic pump, in front of Sulvec Elementary School and an outpost at Brgy. Sulvec, Narvacan Ilocos Sur. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm with inscription ILS-3018,2007, PRS-92, DENR FNSP R-1.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.44699360, '17° 26\' 49.176950\"', 120.45185280, '120° 27\' 6.670170\"', 0.0300, '3', 42.3950, 0.1100, '1', 5.3586, 229344.46060, 1930810.12900, '51', 17.44868830, '17° 26\' 55.277890\"', 120.45055940, '120° 27\' 2.013760\"', 8.7910, 1929834.89000, 441634.71400, '3', 229205.65100, 1930882.88100, '51', 17.44703860, '17° 26\' 49.338960\"', 120.45184420, '120° 27\' 6.639280\"', 0.0283, 41.1680, 0.0957, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1149, 'ILS-3019', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'NARVACAN', 'NAGUNEG', 2007, 17.40183241, '17° 24\' 6.596676\"', 120.47138100, '120° 28\' 16.971600\"', 'ILS-3019 Station is established and located along the barangay road beside a river inside the lot of Edmund Soliven, 150 m from the national hghway going to Brgy. San Pedro, Narvacan, Ilocos Sur after a bridge. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by about 20 cm with inscription ILS-3019 PRS-92 DENR-FNSP R-1.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.40184456, '17° 24\' 6.640430\"', 120.47138330, '120° 28\' 16.980050\"', 0.0300, '3', 41.1810, 0.1100, '1', 3.6988, 231353.93760, 1925783.69800, '51', 17.40353614, '17° 24\' 12.730100\"', 120.47008890, '120° 28\' 12.319960\"', 7.3862, 1924832.20500, 443695.47900, '3', 231214.99000, 1925856.35300, '51', 17.40188956, '17° 24\' 6.802420\"', 120.47137480, '120° 28\' 16.949210\"', 0.0282, 39.9480, 0.0958, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1150, 'ILS-3022', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'NARVACAN', 'CODOOG', 2007, 17.44469444, '17° 26\' 40.899984\"', 120.51273410, '120° 30\' 45.842760\"', 'ILS-3022 The monument is located along the national road going to the municipality of Nagbukel Ilocos Sur around 50 m west of the barangay hall and chapel of Codoog and 80 m from a crossing going to Codoog Elementary School at Brgy. Codoog, Narvacan, Ilocos Sur. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard concrete monument protruding by abut 20 cm with inscription ILS-3022 PRS-92 DENR FNSP R-1.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.44470723, '17° 26\' 40.946020\"', 120.51273640, '120° 30\' 45.851100\"', 0.0300, '3', 53.8710, 0.1100, '1', 16.0198, 235811.40850, 1930471.69000, '51', 17.44640049, '17° 26\' 47.041770\"', 120.51144300, '120° 30\' 41.194800\"', 20.1133, 1929564.14000, 448101.67300, '3', 235672.63500, 1930544.24400, '51', 17.44475224, '17° 26\' 41.108050\"', 120.51272790, '120° 30\' 45.820320\"', 0.0278, 52.6420, 0.0947, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1151, 'ILS-3054', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA LUCIA', 'DAMACUAG', 2007, 17.10753892, '17° 6\' 27.140112\"', 120.46327090, '120° 27\' 47.775240\"', 'ILS-3054 Station is located along the intersection of barangay road, 300 meters east of an national highway following the road going to barangay Damacuag, near a duhat tree at the intersection of an irrigation canal at barangay Damacuag, Sta. Lucia, Ilocos Sur. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3054, PRS-92, DENR-FNSP R-1.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.10755219, '17° 6\' 27.187880\"', 120.46327620, '120° 27\' 47.794460\"', 0.0300, '3', 50.7230, 0.1100, '1', 11.7370, 230063.96660, 1893211.70100, '51', 17.10922616, '17° 6\' 33.214190\"', 120.46197490, '120° 27\' 43.109730\"', 16.0162, 1892264.91700, 442742.59900, '3', 229924.02300, 1893284.15300, '51', 17.10759711, '17° 6\' 27.349580\"', 120.46326770, '120° 27\' 47.763700\"', 0.0296, 49.4550, 0.0993, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1152, 'ILS-32 (BLLM-1)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SUGPON', 'BALBALAYANG', 2006, 16.84133615, '16° 50\' 28.810140\"', 120.51484630, '120° 30\' 53.446680\"', 'ILS-32 (BLLM 1) From Bangar, La Union, on the corner of the rural bank and E of the town plaza, travel SE along the road going to Sugpon for about 40 mins. then cross the Amburayan River via banca for about 2 mins. to reach Sugpon town proper. From the police station, walk along the concrete road for about 15 mins. going uphill to the cemetery and Sugpon Nat\'l. High School. It is located in the N side of the cemetery about 15 m. E of a Narra tree, about 12 m. SW of a Duhat tree, about 8 m. W of a rock outcrop (90 cm. x 140 cm. protruding about 30 cm.), 1.3 m. NNE of the NE corner of the niche of Mr. Ronald T. Latong and 1.1 m. N of the N side of the same niche. Mark is the head of a 3 in. concrete nail, centered on a concrete monument 40 cm. x 40 cm. and flush with the ground surface, with inscription \"BLLM No. 1\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 16.84134545, '16° 50\' 28.843620\"', 120.51484810, '120° 30\' 53.453190\"', 0.0400, '4', 166.0890, 0.1400, '1', 125.2484, 235181.25120, 1863668.67800, '51', 16.84300209, '16° 50\' 34.807520\"', 120.51354070, '120° 30\' 48.746490\"', 130.4240, 1862789.91900, 448157.38500, '3', 235040.45400, 1863740.74900, '51', 16.84139030, '16° 50\' 29.005070\"', 120.51483960, '120° 30\' 53.422610\"', 0.0336, 164.7870, 0.1209, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1153, 'ILS-33 (BLLM-2A)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA LUCIA', 'ANGKILENG', 2006, 17.11503261, '17° 6\' 54.117396\"', 120.44774280, '120° 26\' 51.874080\"', 'ILS-33 (BLLM 2A) Is located along the municipal road, infront of the Santa Lucia South Central School Principal\'s Office. It is 11 m. SSW of the school gate, about 7 m. W of the municipal road centerline and 1.1 m. E of the E school fence. Mark is a crosscut on a reinforced bar centered on a 40 cm. x 40 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"FNSP-A BLLM No. 2A\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.11504365, '17° 6\' 54.157140\"', 120.44774260, '120° 26\' 51.873510\"', 0.0300, '1', 43.1100, 0.1100, '1', 4.4045, 228420.98730, 1894062.75800, '51', 17.11671842, '17° 7\' 0.186300\"', 120.44644150, '120° 26\' 47.189330\"', 8.4642, 1893098.66700, 441091.82200, '3', 228281.05700, 1894135.26600, '51', 17.11508857, '17° 6\' 54.318840\"', 120.44773410, '120° 26\' 51.842720\"', 0.0298, 41.8430, 0.0994, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1154, 'ILS-3437', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SALCEDO', 'CALANGCUASAN', 2009, 17.16529673, '17° 9\' 55.068228\"', 120.52742960, '120° 31\' 38.746560\"', 'ILS-3437 From Santa Lucia Town Proper travel northward following the cemented provincial road to reach Barangay Calancuasan. The station is located along provincial road within the Victory Bridge near Victory Elementary School 5 meters and 60 meters south of the road and the said school. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3437; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.16530605, '17° 9\' 55.101770\"', 120.52743370, '120° 31\' 38.761170\"', 0.0300, '3', 107.8060, 0.1100, '1', 68.0312, 236975.96880, 1899517.86500, '51', 17.16698213, '17° 10\' 1.135660\"', 120.52613380, '120° 31\' 34.081630\"', 73.1267, 1898638.59000, 449586.19200, '3', 236836.26900, 1899590.15300, '51', 17.16535098, '17° 9\' 55.263540\"', 120.52742510, '120° 31\' 38.730510\"', 0.0287, 106.5430, 0.0978, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1155, 'ILS-3481', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CERVANTES', 'ROSARIO', 2009, 16.98088176, '16° 58\' 51.174336\"', 120.74036710, '120° 44\' 25.321560\"', 'ILS-3481 From Cervantes Municipal Hall drive southeast to any king of vehicle going to Mankayan, at the intersection passing ISPSC (Cervantes Campus) just go straight for 300-500 meters going to Cervantes National High School. The station is located 100 meters southeast of ISPSC and 100 meters northeast of Cervanes National High School and 250 meters southwest of Globe Cellsite. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3481; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 16.98088540, '16° 58\' 51.187430\"', 120.74036650, '120° 44\' 25.319520\"', 0.0300, '3', 588.2860, 0.1100, '1', 544.7396, 259400.83920, 1878826.60900, '51', 16.98254557, '16° 58\' 57.164060\"', 120.73906280, '120° 44\' 20.625970\"', 552.5139, 1878186.06000, 472212.23000, '3', 259260.69200, 1878898.05100, '51', 16.98093030, '16° 58\' 51.349070\"', 120.74035810, '120° 44\' 25.289320\"', 0.0292, 586.9950, 0.0993, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1156, 'ILS-6', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN JUAN', 'SURNGIT', 1995, 17.76254603, '17° 45\' 45.165708\"', 120.40750050, '120° 24\' 27.001800\"', 'ILS-6 Is located on the coastal barangay at Brgy. Surngit, San Juan. Station is placed on locally known as \"Raois Point\" whose locality is a fishpond area and set on top corner edge of a fishpond dike, being 5 m. from the high water line. Mark is head of a 4\" copper nail on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument with inscription \"ILS-6, 1995, NAMRIA\", and about 0.5 m. from the dike edge. Fishpond owner is Mr. Criscencio Vite. No reference marks. To reach the station from the national road of poblacion of San Juan take the road going W. There is a concrete monument marker that points to the said Brgy. Surngit along the national road, distance is about 5.1 km. Just follow the road and upon reaching a wooden small bridge then the steel arch of Brgy. Surngit straight then and take the road going left and follow again the road until reach the NW extremity of the coast. *Note: Station upgraded to 2nd Order (by: LTSG. Custodio G. Armengol, May 2005).', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.76256031, '17° 45\' 45.217130\"', 120.40750430, '120° 24\' 27.015380\"', 0.0300, '3', 41.9420, 0.1100, '1', 5.6668, 225109.77890, 1965814.64800, '51', 17.76427484, '17° 45\' 51.389410\"', 120.40621810, '120° 24\' 22.385080\"', 9.4562, 1964774.74000, 437033.83500, '3', 224972.00000, 1965887.78300, '51', 17.76260539, '17° 45\' 45.379420\"', 120.40749560, '120° 24\' 26.984310\"', 0.0282, 40.7550, 0.0957, '2020-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1157, 'ILS-9', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN JUAN', 'BACSIL', 2000, 17.72624089, '17° 43\' 34.467204\"', 120.45389200, '120° 27\' 14.011200\"', 'ILS-9 Is located in Bo. Bacsil, San Juan, Ilocos Sur at the hilly portion of Bacsil National High School compound, 10 m. W from the school building. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 8 in. x 8 in. cement putty set at the edge of a concrete road with inscribe station name \"ILS-9, NAMRIA, 2000\". *Note: Station upgraded to 2nd Order (by: LTSG. Custodio G. Armengol, May 2005).', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.83, 17.72625495, '17° 43\' 34.517810\"', 120.45389580, '120° 27\' 14.024900\"', 0.0300, '3', 87.3640, 0.1100, '1', 50.6746, 229977.01370, 1961727.43900, '51', 17.72796631, '17° 43\' 40.678710\"', 120.45260880, '120° 27\' 9.391830\"', 54.6499, 1960741.52000, 441941.65700, '3', 229839.14600, 1961800.39600, '51', 17.72630002, '17° 43\' 34.680080\"', 120.45388720, '120° 27\' 13.993920\"', 0.0281, 86.1710, 0.0958, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1158, 'MMA-100', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'NORTH FAIRVIEW', 2014, 14.71802180, '14° 43\' 4.878490\"', 121.04855630, '121° 2\' 54.802540\"', 'The station is approximately 500 m SW from the intersectiion of MIndanao and Commonwealth Avenues. It is drilled tot he concrete pavement of the road of the Northeastern tip of the 3rd island SW from the intersection. Mark is N 50 deg E from the concrete signboard containing \"Cresta Verde Executive Village\". It is also N 65 deg E from the intersection of Cresta Verde Avenue and Mindanao Avenue, about 30 m. Station mark is the center of a hexagonal stainless steel bolt located at the Northeastern tip of a road island.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.71802180, '14° 43\' 4.878490\"', 121.04855630, '121° 2\' 54.802540\"', 0.0000, '1', 96.6150, 0.0100, '1', 52.7474, 289897.20020, 1628047.61700, '51', 14.71953337, '14° 43\' 10.320140\"', 121.04719970, '121° 2\' 49.918990\"', 53.3012, 1627775.75700, 505082.72300, '3', 289749.75300, 1628116.11700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1159, 'MMA-105', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'TANDANG SORA', 1902, 14.67372450, '14° 40\' 25.408210\"', 121.04349430, '121° 2\' 36.579400\"', 'MMA-105 (TS-01) The station is located at the 1st island S from the intersection of Tandang Sora Ave. and Visayas Ave. From the Elliptical road it is approximately 2.30 km. It is S 75° E from the main gate of Far East Asia Village and N 5° W from the Visayas Ave. Market Wet and Dry. Station mark is the center of the head of a stainless steel bolt drilled to the gutter of the road island.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.67372450, '14° 40\' 25.408210\"', 121.04349430, '121° 2\' 36.579400\"', 0.0000, '1', 83.6500, 0.0100, '1', 39.8554, 289309.53390, 1623150.48700, '51', 14.67523333, '14° 40\' 30.840000\"', 121.04213670, '121° 2\' 31.692030\"', 40.2217, 1622874.55800, 504538.42100, '3', 289161.93500, 1623218.96300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `hgcp_stations_new` (`id`, `station_name`, `island_group`, `region`, `province`, `city_or_municipality`, `barangay`, `year_established`, `latitude`, `latitude_dms`, `longitude`, `longitude_dms`, `description`, `year_surveyed`, `project`, `epoch`, `latitude_wgs84`, `latitude_wgs84_dms`, `longitude_wgs84`, `longitude_wgs84_dms`, `error_ellipse`, `accuracy_class`, `ellipsoidal_ht_wgs84`, `height_error`, `order_of_accuracy_wgs84`, `egm2008_elevation`, `utm_x_wgs84`, `utm_y_wgs84`, `utm_zone_wgs84`, `latitude_prs92`, `latitude_prs92_dms`, `longitude_prs92`, `longitude_prs92_dms`, `ellipsoidal_ht_prs92`, `northing_ptm`, `easting_ptm`, `ptm_zone`, `utm_x_prs92`, `utm_y_prs92`, `utm_zone_prs92`, `latitude_itrf`, `latitude_itrf_dms`, `longitude_itrf`, `longitude_itrf_dms`, `error_ellipse_itrf`, `ellipsoidal_ht_itrf`, `height_error_itrf`, `year_computed`, `encoder`, `date_updated`, `reference_file`) VALUES
(1160, 'MMA-123 (MMA-3002)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PASIG', 'KAPASIGAN', 2014, 14.56022231, '14° 33\' 36.800330\"', 121.07932980, '121° 4\' 45.587170\"', 'MMA-123 (MMA-3002) Is located at Brgy. Kapasigan, Pasig City, along the elevated center island of Caruncho Ave. It is also situated at about 2 m. from an electrical light post near the pedestrian lane, about 15 m. NE of the entrance gate of La Immaculada Concepcion School. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscription \"MMA-3002\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.56022231, '14° 33\' 36.800330\"', 121.07932980, '121° 4\' 45.587170\"', 0.0000, '1', 50.4340, 0.0100, '1', 6.3281, 293063.54710, 1610557.76100, '51', 14.56172301, '14° 33\' 42.202840\"', 121.07796950, '121° 4\' 40.690280\"', 6.5945, 1610317.56000, 508402.18900, '3', 292915.60300, 1610626.01500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1161, 'MMA-124 (MMA-3003)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF TAGUIG', 'USUSAN', 2014, 14.53169743, '14° 31\' 54.110730\"', 121.06835330, '121° 4\' 6.071830\"', 'MMA-124 (MMA-3003) IS LOCATED AT THE N SIDE, W END OF COMMANDO BRIDGE APPROX. 400 M. GOING N FROM THE TAGUIG TOWN HALL LEADING TO BASES CONVERSION DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY (BCDA) OR C-5. THE BRIDGE IS ALONG C. P. GARCIA AVE. AND CAN BE REACHED WHEN GOING N ALONG GEN. LUNA ST. FROM THE TAGUIG TOWN HALL. MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4 IN. COPPER NAIL EMBEDDED ON A 25 CM. X 25 CM. CEMENT PUTTY, WITH INSCRIPTIONS \"MMA-3003, 2005, LMS-NCR\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.53169744, '14° 31\' 54.110780\"', 121.06835340, '121° 4\' 6.072180\"', 0.0100, '1', 51.5040, 0.0100, '1', 7.5088, 291853.79100, 1607411.32900, '51', 14.53319652, '14° 31\' 59.507480\"', 121.06699230, '121° 4\' 1.172450\"', 7.5421, 1607161.22400, 507220.18800, '3', 291705.74200, 1607479.59200, '51', 14.53174162, '14° 31\' 54.269840\"', 121.06834530, '121° 4\' 6.043240\"', 0.0090, 49.8900, 0.0155, '2021-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1162, 'MMA-3018', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PARAÑAQUE', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2014, 14.46896659, '14° 28\' 8.279740\"', 121.02117650, '121° 1\' 16.235320\"', 'MMA-3018 From Sucat Road, turn right to Valley I Subdivision going to San Antonio de Padua Parish Church Brgy. San Antonio Parañaque City. Station is located infront of San Antonio de Padua Parish Church. Station is marked with a head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded on the center of a 0.25 m x 0.25 m cement putty with inscriptions, \"MMA-3018, 2007, LMS-NCR\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.46896604, '14° 28\' 8.277740\"', 121.02117670, '121° 1\' 16.236280\"', 0.0000, '0', 63.4440, 0.0100, '1', 19.8411, 286708.43210, 1600513.17500, '51', 14.47046213, '14° 28\' 13.663680\"', 121.01981430, '121° 1\' 11.331310\"', 19.4871, 1600219.81900, 502136.10800, '3', 286560.13300, 1600581.53000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1163, 'MMA-3023', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF CALOOCAN', 'BARANGAY 177', 2014, 14.75049441, '14° 45\' 1.779880\"', 121.05375650, '121° 3\' 13.523220\"', 'MMA-3023 From SM Fairview, take Maligaya Park going to Camarin Road to Caloocan City Hall II. Station is located infront of Caloocan City Hall in the rearleft of the flagpole. Station is marked with a head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded on the center of a 0.25 m x 0.25 m red cement putty with inscriptions, \"MMA-3023, 2007, LMS-NCR\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.75049514, '14° 45\' 1.782490\"', 121.05375490, '121° 3\' 13.517690\"', 0.0000, '0', 119.3800, 0.0200, '1', 75.4438, 290488.16100, 1631636.20500, '51', 14.75200868, '14° 45\' 7.231240\"', 121.05239920, '121° 3\' 8.636950\"', 76.1467, 1631368.76600, 505641.79100, '3', 290340.82700, 1631704.71800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1164, 'MMA-3035', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MARIKINA', 'SAN ROQUE', 2014, 14.63363600, '14° 38\' 1.089600\"', 121.09942770, '121° 5\' 57.939620\"', 'MMA-3035 From Cubao Aurora Blvd. to Sumulong Highway turn right to Sports Complex to Shoe Ave. then going to Marikina City Hall, The station is located corner Mayor U. de Guzman and Mc Donald Street infront of Marikina City Hall. Station is marked with a head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded on the center of a 0.25 m x 0.25 m x 1.0 m cement block and 2 in. higher on the ground with inscriptions, \"MMA-3035, 2007, LMS-NCR\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.63363669, '14° 38\' 1.092090\"', 121.09942710, '121° 5\' 57.937430\"', 0.0000, '1', 56.3060, 0.0100, '1', 11.9752, 295297.50450, 1618663.19500, '51', 14.63514168, '14° 38\' 6.510060\"', 121.09806860, '121° 5\' 53.046920\"', 12.6268, 1618440.93700, 510564.61200, '3', 295149.82300, 1618731.45400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1165, 'MMA-3037', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF TAGUIG', 'CENTRAL BICUTAN', 2014, 14.48917799, '14° 29\' 21.040780\"', 121.05447870, '121° 3\' 16.123440\"', 'MMA-3037 FROM TAGUIG CITY HALL GO TO GEN. SANTOS AVE. INFRONT OF TAGUIG CITY HALL OF JUSTICE ALONG PARKING AREA WHERE THE GEODETIC CONTROL POINT IS LOCATED. STATION IS LOCATED INFRONT OF THE HALL OF JUSTICE ALONG PARKING AREA. STATION IS MARKED WITH A HEAD OF A 4 IN. COPPER NAIL EMBEDDED ON THE CENTER OF A 0.25 M X 0.25 M X 1.0 M CEMENT BLOCK WITH INSCRIPTIONS, \"LMS-NCR\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.48917797, '14° 29\' 21.040680\"', 121.05447930, '121° 3\' 16.125390\"', 0.0000, '1', 75.4990, 0.0100, '1', 31.6210, 290318.23610, 1602719.00100, '51', 14.49067462, '14° 29\' 26.428620\"', 121.05311730, '121° 3\' 11.222330\"', 31.5182, 1602456.53600, 505725.88100, '3', 290170.03400, 1602787.26800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
