(1167, 'MMA-3044', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PASIG', 'PINAGBUHATAN', 2014, 14.54958868, '14° 32\' 58.519230\"', 121.10247070, '121° 6\' 8.894400\"', 'MMA-3044 From Raymundo Ave. turn to Mercedes Ave. before the bridge turn right to Sandoval Ave. towards the Slaughter House going to the front gate of Pag-asa Steel Corp. where the GCP of LMS-NCR is located. Station is located near the gate of Pag-asa Steel Corp. along Sandoval Ave. Station is marked with a head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded on the center of a 0.25 m x 0.25 m x 30 cm cement putty with inscriptions, \"MMA-3044, 2007, LMS-NCR\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.54958859, '14° 32\' 58.518910\"', 121.10247050, '121° 6\' 8.893950\"', 0.0000, '1', 49.7270, 0.0100, '1', 5.4026, 295547.78530, 1609360.20200, '51', 14.55108808, '14° 33\' 3.917070\"', 121.10111010, '121° 6\' 3.996280\"', 5.8008, 1609141.96700, 510896.39700, '3', 295399.82700, 1609428.37100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1168, 'MMA-3055 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MANDALUYONG', 'POBLACION', 1999, 14.57802853, '14° 34\' 40.902700\"', 121.03441970, '121° 2\' 3.910750\"', 'MMA-3055 From EDSA take Boni Ave. to Mandaluyong City Hall. Turn right at the round about & enter the Entrance gate of the City Hall opposite M. Martinez Ave. look for the GCP of LMS-NCR just beside the Gate. The station was marked with a head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA-3055, 2008 LMS-NCR\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.57802869, '14° 34\' 40.903290\"', 121.03441910, '121° 2\' 3.908660\"', 0.0100, '1', 48.7130, 0.0200, '1', 5.0540, 287143.27440, 1599704.50700, '51', 14.46318814, '14° 27\' 47.477300\"', 121.02391120, '121° 1\' 26.080460\"', 22.7005, 1599415.12600, 502577.87400, '3', 286994.95400, 1599772.84300, '51', 14.57807289, '14° 34\' 41.062400\"', 121.03441100, '121° 2\' 3.879640\"', 0.0114, 47.1050, 0.0238, '2021-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1169, 'MMA-3055', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PARAÑAQUE', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2014, 14.46169390, '14° 27\' 42.098040\"', 121.02527350, '121° 1\' 30.984730\"', 'From Paranaque City in the Province of Metro Manila, trvel along Dr. Abad Santos Avenue formerly known as Sucat Road, until reaching the intersection of Sampaguita Avenue where the station is established. Mark is the center of a brass rod with cross-cut on top set flush at the center of a 20 x 20 centimeter cement putty with inscription \"MMA-3055, 2008, NAMRIA\". The station is located on the road gutter about 5 meters from the signboard of Manila Memorial Park & La Funeraria Paz-Sucat.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.46169261, '14° 27\' 42.093390\"', 121.02527390, '121° 1\' 30.986030\"', 0.0000, '1', 66.6880, 0.0100, '1', 23.0402, 287143.27440, 1599704.50700, '51', 14.46318814, '14° 27\' 47.477300\"', 121.02391120, '121° 1\' 26.080460\"', 22.7005, 1599415.12600, 502577.87400, '3', 286994.95400, 1599772.84300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1170, 'MMA-3060 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MUNTINLUPA', 'POBLACION', 1999, 14.38128877, '14° 22\' 52.639570\"', 121.02679420, '121° 1\' 36.459090\"', 'From the National Highway (Provincial Road) take E. Rodriguez Sr. Ave. going to New Bilibid Prison compound alight near the Max Security Compound & look for the GCP of LMS-NCR at the siewalk. The station was marked with a head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA-3060, 2008 LMS-NCR\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.38128786, '14° 22\' 52.636300\"', 121.02679480, '121° 1\' 36.461140\"', 0.0000, '1', 101.4470, 0.0200, '1', 57.6311, 287230.92200, 1590805.76400, '51', 14.38277813, '14° 22\' 58.001280\"', 121.02543020, '121° 1\' 31.548730\"', 57.2285, 1590519.27500, 502742.61700, '3', 287082.33700, 1590874.01800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1171, 'MMA-3061 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MARIKINA', 'TUMANA', 1999, 14.65654960, '14° 39\' 23.578550\"', 121.09421460, '121° 5\' 39.172470\"', 'From Bayan-Bayanan Rd. Concepcion turn right at J.P Rizal St. then left going to Tumana Bridge, look for the GCP of LMS-NCR at the right side of the bridge about after crossing Marikina River. The station was marked with a head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA-3061, 2008 LMS-NCR\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.65655060, '14° 39\' 23.582160\"', 121.09429480, '121° 5\' 39.461140\"', 0.0000, '1', 57.1220, 0.0100, '1', 12.8297, 294765.87770, 1621203.37100, '51', 14.65805719, '14° 39\' 29.005870\"', 121.09293680, '121° 5\' 34.572560\"', 13.5208, 1620975.92900, 510010.74400, '3', 294618.26700, 1621271.66700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
