(1174, 'MMA-3067 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'ESCOPA III', 1999, 14.62887485, '14° 37\' 43.949470\"', 121.07399060, '121° 4\' 26.366100\"', 'From Aurora Blvd. walk off along C-5 road going to Libis & look for the GCP of LMS-NCR at the sidewalk near the Sampaloc Tree. The station was marked with a head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA-3067, 2008 LMS-NCR\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.54945632, '14° 32\' 58.042760\"', 121.07264440, '121° 4\' 21.519970\"', 0.0000, '1', 51.7520, 0.0000, '1', 7.7147, 292332.94390, 1609372.53200, '51', 14.55095647, '14° 33\' 3.443300\"', 121.07128390, '121° 4\' 16.622130\"', 7.8982, 1609126.19300, 507682.10500, '3', 292184.95800, 1609440.79800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1175, 'MMA-3091 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MALABON', 'TUGATOG', 1999, 14.66801373, '14° 40\' 4.849410\"', 120.96584600, '120° 57\' 57.045440\"', 'From Monumento go straight at Mc Arthur Highway then to Gov. W. Pascual Ave. and stop at the corner of M. H Del Pilar St where the GCP of LMS-NCR is located. The station was marked with a head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA-3091, 2008 LMS-NCR\".', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.66801385, '14° 40\' 4.849860\"', 120.96584380, '120° 57\' 57.037730\"', 0.0000, '1', 46.8810, 0.0100, '1', 3.8706, 280938.86930, 1622592.35600, '51', 14.66952406, '14° 40\' 10.286630\"', 120.96448600, '120° 57\' 52.149440\"', 3.6256, 1622242.79800, 496174.78400, '3', 280791.18000, 1622661.07900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1176, 'MMA-3107 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MAKATI', 'POBLACION', 1999, 14.56922724, '14° 34\' 9.218080\"', 121.02596030, '121° 1\' 33.457220\"', 'From EDSA Guadalupe take J.P Rizal Street and then stop at Makati City in front of J.P Rizal Monument where the GCP of LMS-NCR is located. The station was marked a head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm. cmenet putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA-3107; 2008; LMS-NCR\". The station is located at Makati City in front of Jose Rizal monument.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.56922732, '14° 34\' 9.218350\"', 121.02595960, '121° 1\' 33.454730\"', 0.0000, '1', 49.0660, 0.0100, '1', 5.4894, 287320.01690, 1611603.40500, '51', 14.57072980, '14° 34\' 14.627280\"', 121.02459950, '121° 1\' 28.558330\"', 5.3823, 1611312.71100, 502650.79900, '3', 287172.05400, 1611671.84000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
