(1178, 'MMA-3135 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF SAN JUAN', 'BALONG-BATO', 1999, 14.60753146, '14° 36\' 27.113270\"', 121.02683410, '121° 1\' 36.602750\"', 'MMA-3135 STA. MARK: The station was marked with a head of a 4\'\' copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty with inscriptions that read \'\' MMA 3135 ; 2008 ; LMS-NCR\'\'. The station is located at Pinaglabanan Monument. ACCESS: From Cubao Aurora Blvd., turn left at N. Domingo and stop at the front of Pinaglabanan Monument between Capt. Manzano St. and Pinaglabanan St. where the GCP of LMS-NCR is located.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.60753171, '14° 36\' 27.114150\"', 121.02683300, '121° 1\' 36.598950\"', 0.0100, '1', 64.6790, 0.0300, '1', 21.0849, 287450.93420, 1615841.29300, '51', 14.60903674, '14° 36\' 32.532260\"', 121.02547390, '121° 1\' 31.706000\"', 21.1903, 1615550.73200, 502744.54300, '3', 287303.10000, 1615909.76100, '51', 14.60757591, '14° 36\' 27.273280\"', 121.02682500, '121° 1\' 36.569910\"', 0.0107, 63.0750, 0.0263, '2021-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1179, 'MMA-3186', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MAKATI', 'SAN LORENZO', 1999, 14.55034549, '14° 33\' 1.243750\"', 121.02951900, '121° 1\' 46.268320\"', 'MMA-3186 From MRT Ayala station walk off along EDSA toward ayala avenue. Stop and use the pedestrian crossing to go to the foot of the center island where the GCP of LMS-NCR is located. The station was marked with a head of a 8mm stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 25x25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA-3186 2009 LMS-NCR', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.55034541, '14° 33\' 1.243490\"', 121.02951870, '121° 1\' 46.267390\"', 0.0000, '1', 61.7830, 0.0100, '1', 18.1715, 287685.52710, 1609510.65300, '51', 14.55184659, '14° 33\' 6.647730\"', 121.02815820, '121° 1\' 41.369410\"', 18.0369, 1609223.65600, 503034.52900, '3', 287537.50500, 1609579.05800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
