(1206, 'MMA-3390', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MUNTINLUPA', 'ALABANG', 1999, 14.42466803, '14° 25\' 28.804910\"', 121.03104440, '121° 1\' 51.759660\"', 'STATION MARK: The station was marked with a head of 8 mm stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA 3390 2011 LMS-NCR\". ACCESS: From Alabang going to Alabang - Zapote Road, the GCP of LMS NCR MMA-3390 is located along Alabang - Zapote Road at the center island in front of DSWD Office.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.42466807, '14° 25\' 28.805040\"', 121.03104510, '121° 1\' 51.762280\"', 0.0100, '1', 67.3010, 0.0200, '1', 23.5414, 287730.43160, 1595602.11900, '51', 14.42616085, '14° 25\' 34.179070\"', 121.02968150, '121° 1\' 46.853360\"', 23.1567, 1595318.81200, 503200.49500, '3', 287581.99400, 1595670.40100, '51', 14.42471221, '14° 25\' 28.963970\"', 121.03103700, '121° 1\' 51.733300\"', 0.0103, 65.6750, 0.0236, '2021-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1207, 'MMA-3393', 'Luzon', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MUNTINLUPA', 'POBLACION', 1999, 14.38934337, '14° 23\' 21.636140\"', 121.01969010, '121° 1\' 10.884220\"', 'STATION MARK: The station was marked with a head of 8 mm stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA 3393 2011 ; LMS-NCR\". This is located along C. Arellano St. ACCESS: From Alabang Town Center Straight ahead to Daan Hari Road going to Cavite, Near Camp Sampaguita, turn right to C. Arellano main road of Katarungan Village, the GCP of LMS-NCR -MMA-3393 is located beside the Meralco post at the corner of L. Mediadea St. and C. Arellano St.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.38934298, '14° 23\' 21.634710\"', 121.01969100, '121° 1\' 10.887620\"', 0.0000, '1', 97.9520, 0.0200, '1', 54.2053, 286472.31820, 1591703.68700, '51', 14.39083393, '14° 23\' 27.002150\"', 121.01832660, '121° 1\' 5.975860\"', 53.7735, 1591410.42300, 501976.43400, '3', 286323.75300, 1591771.97200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1208, 'MMA-3399', 'Luzon', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF LAS PIÑAS', 'TALON DOS', 1999, 14.42712721, '14° 25\' 37.657970\"', 120.98638080, '120° 59\' 10.970800\"', 'STATION MARK: The station was marked with a head of 8 mm stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA 3399 2011 ; LMS-NCR\". This is located along Vatican City Drive. ACCESS: From Alabang-Zapote Road, turn right straight ahead to BF Resort Avenue, then straight ahead to Judge Bienvenido Tan Sr. Ave, then upon reaching Vatican City Drive before turning left to BF Vista Grande there was a roundabout and a meter beside it, is where the GCP of LMS-NCR-MMA-3399 is located.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.42712658, '14° 25\' 37.655700\"', 120.98638100, '120° 59\' 10.971440\"', 0.0000, '1', 58.6070, 0.0200, '1', 15.2033, 282915.93190, 1595915.92000, '51', 14.42862075, '14° 25\' 43.034700\"', 120.98501740, '120° 59\' 6.062710\"', 14.6166, 1595590.80000, 498384.47700, '3', 282767.46100, 1595984.34900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1209, 'MMA-3410', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PARAÑAQUE', 'MOONWALK', 1999, 14.48890980, '14° 29\' 20.075270\"', 121.00174790, '121° 0\' 6.292500\"', 'STATION MARK: THE STATION WAS MARKED WITH A HEAD OF 8 MM STAINLESS STEEL BOLT EMBEDDED ON THE CENTER OF A 25 CM X 25 CM CEMENT PUTTY WITH INSCRIPTIONS THAT READ \"MMA 3410 2011 ; LMS-NCR\". THIS IS LOCATED ALONG MULTINATIONAL AVE. INSIDE MULTINATIONAL VILLAGE. ACCESS: FROM BACLARAN TURN LEFT TO MIA ROAD, PROCEED TO NINOY AQUINO AVE. (IMELDA AVENUE) THEN TURN LEFT TO MULTINATIONAL AVENUE, ON THE LEFT SIDE OF THE ROAD BEFORE REACHING JERUSALEM ST. IS WHERE THE GCP OF LMS-NCR-MMA-3410 IS LOCATED.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.48890991, '14° 29\' 20.075690\"', 121.00174760, '121° 0\' 6.291280\"', 0.0000, '1', 49.2870, 0.0200, '1', 5.8855, 284632.72670, 1602738.31300, '51', 14.49040774, '14° 29\' 25.467870\"', 121.00038550, '121° 0\' 1.387900\"', 5.4341, 1602426.34700, 500041.55900, '3', 284484.47500, 1602806.75100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1210, 'MMA-3411', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PARAÑAQUE', 'MOONWALK', 1999, 14.49982131, '14° 29\' 59.356700\"', 121.00887080, '121° 0\' 31.934980\"', 'STATION MARK: The station was marked with a head of 8 mm stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA 3411 2011 ; LMS-NCR\". This is located along E. Rodriguez Avenue, at the Brdige abutment. Approximately 35 m near Brgy. Moonwalk Arc. ACCESS: From Baclaran turn left to MIA Road going to Ninoy Aquino Ave. (Imelda Avenue) then turn left to Multinational Avenue, turn left to Kaingin Rd. then turn right to E. Rodriguez Ave. on the left side of the Bridge abutment the GCP of LMS-NCR-MMA-3411 is located.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.49982143, '14° 29\' 59.357130\"', 121.00887040, '121° 0\' 31.933370\"', 0.0000, '1', 51.0320, 0.0200, '1', 7.5835, 285411.18610, 1603939.07200, '51', 14.50131980, '14° 30\' 4.751270\"', 121.00750860, '121° 0\' 27.030960\"', 7.1927, 1603633.58400, 500809.36500, '3', 285262.97700, 1604007.49700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1211, 'MMA-3417', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF TAGUIG', 'UPPER BICUTAN', 1999, 14.49694851, '14° 29\' 49.014620\"', 121.05042540, '121° 3\' 1.531500\"', 'STATION MARK:The station was marked with a head of 8 mm stainless steel bolt embedded on the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA 3417 2011 ; LMS-NCR\". This is located along A. Bonifacio Avenue corner Mindanao Avenue. ACCESS: From East Service Road DBP Avenue to FTI Ave. turn right at Cucumber Road, then turn right again to A. Bonifacio St. straight ahead to Lapu-Lapu St. on the right side of the road near fire hdyrant, the GCP of LMS-NCR-MMA-3417 is located.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.49694895, '14° 29\' 49.016230\"', 121.05042540, '121° 3\' 1.531500\"', 0.0100, '1', 67.7010, 0.0300, '1', 23.8674, 289888.50550, 1603582.61300, '51', 14.49844608, '14° 29\' 54.405900\"', 121.04906370, '121° 2\' 56.629200\"', 23.7562, 1603316.21200, 505288.72600, '3', 289740.32600, 1603650.90000, '51', 14.49699313, '14° 29\' 49.175250\"', 121.05041740, '121° 3\' 1.502530\"', 0.0111, 66.0820, 0.0264, '2021-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
