(1253, 'MMA-39 (W-2)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'U.P. CAMPUS', 1994, 14.65523094, '14° 39\' 18.831380\"', 121.05970700, '121° 3\' 34.945110\"', 'MMA-39 (W-2) Station is located at the University of the Philippines (UP) compound at Diliman, along University Ave., about 500 m. from Commonwealth Ave and about 50m north from the centerline of University Avenue. Station is the easternmost of seven aligned concrete monuments also known as the \"UP Baseline\". It is near an Acacia Tree for about 9 m.Mark is the head of a 1\" dia. brass rod with cross cut on top center of an 18\" square concrete monument, protruding about 18\" above the ground inside the vacant lot at UP. No inscription was made to the station.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.65523083, '14° 39\' 18.830980\"', 121.05970670, '121° 3\' 34.944210\"', 0.0100, '1', 97.7120, 0.0200, '1', 53.7653, 291038.44180, 1621088.98200, '51', 14.65673808, '14° 39\' 24.257080\"', 121.05834870, '121° 3\' 30.055330\"', 54.0894, 1620828.74700, 506285.10000, '3', 290890.79700, 1621157.38800, '51', 14.65527505, '14° 39\' 18.990180\"', 121.05969870, '121° 3\' 34.915210\"', 0.0102, 96.1130, 0.0206, '2021-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
