(1261, 'MMA-3988 (BBM-74)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF LAS PIÑAS', 'TALON TRES', 2014, 14.44589693, '14° 26\' 45.228930\"', 121.00784470, '121° 0\' 28.241070\"', 'MMA-3988 STATION MARK: Mark is the head of 8 mm stainless bolt flushed on the top of 20x20 cm and 30 cm above the ground with inscription of BBM No. 74, MCad. 592-D, Las Piñas Cadastre: City of Las Piñas boundary of Brgy. CAA BF International and Brgy. Talon Tres . Monument is located at the corner of Suttgard and Tel Aviv. ACCESS: Travel J. Aguilar Avenue to Tropical Avenue bound to Palace of Golden Gate Subdivision and South Land Estate upon reaching Stuttgard before entering the gate/guard house at the corner of Tel Aviv and Suttgard in where the monument is located.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.44589679, '14° 26\' 45.228440\"', 121.00784480, '121° 0\' 28.241400\"', 0.0000, '1', 64.7080, 0.0200, '1', 21.1777, 285248.74680, 1597972.82400, '51', 14.44739169, '14° 26\' 50.610080\"', 121.00648180, '121° 0\' 23.334390\"', 20.7183, 1597667.41400, 500698.85000, '3', 285100.35800, 1598041.20200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
