(1263, 'MMA-3999 (PB-3)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'TONDO I/II', 'BARANGAY 54', 2014, 14.61718007, '14° 37\' 1.848240\"', 120.97396820, '120° 58\' 26.285600\"', 'MMA-3999 Station Mark: is the head of 8mm, stainless bolt flushed on the top on concrete monument 30x30cm. protruding 30 cm, above the ground with inscription \"Binondo, Cad-13, Pb No. 3, City of Manila\". The monument is the Administrative District Boundary of Tondo and Binondo with ref. mark 1. RM-1 = 3m SE corner of Tayuman St., and Dagupan. Access: Travel along Rizal Ave. goin gto LRT Station going to west along Antipolo St., reaching Estero de Salazaro 10m SE the monument is located.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.61717788, '14° 37\' 1.840360\"', 120.97397550, '120° 58\' 26.311790\"', 0.1000, '10', 46.7510, 0.1200, '2', 3.6724, 281764.59530, 1616958.89500, '51', 14.61868463, '14° 37\' 7.264660\"', 120.97261640, '120° 58\' 21.419210\"', 3.3306, 1616618.13200, 497049.84000, '3', 281616.74500, 1617027.54400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1264, 'MMA-4042 (BBM-15)', 'Luzon', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF VALENZUELA', 'COLOONG', 1999, 14.73680391, '14° 44\' 12.494060\"', 120.94134540, '120° 56\' 28.843320\"', 'MMA-4042 (BBM-15) BBM-15 is located between the boundary of Barangay Coloong and Meycauayan City. From M.H. del Pilar Road going to Mc Arthur Highway turn to Collong 1 Road passing through Villarica Road then turn to Geronimo Street up to the end of the road then walk along the pathwalk of a fishpond upon reaching the NE portion at the intersection of Coloong and Meycauayan River. Mark is the head of 8mm stainless bolt at the top center of a 20x20x100cm concrete monument protruding 30cm. above the ground with inscription \"CAD 338-D, BBM No. 15, VALENZUELA CITY.\'', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.73680547, '14° 44\' 12.499690\"', 120.94134340, '120° 56\' 28.836260\"', 0.0000, '1', 46.7650, 0.0200, '1', 3.9645, 278368.84700, 1630229.00900, '51', 14.73832067, '14° 44\' 17.954400\"', 120.93998710, '120° 56\' 23.953710\"', 3.7662, 1629854.60500, 493538.04200, '3', 278221.36500, 1630297.87500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
