(1267, 'MMA-4146', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF VALENZUELA', 'MALANDAY', 2014, 14.71967412, '14° 43\' 10.826840\"', 120.95366090, '120° 57\' 13.179100\"', 'MMA-4146 From McArthur Highway travel along M.H. Del Pilar going to Marcelo St. then travel up to Brgy. Malanday St. upon reaching the barangay Basketball court where the monument is located. It is about 2m NW of the barangay basketball court and 10m SW of the barangay basketball court stage. Mark is the head of a 8 mm. stainless bolt flushed at the top of a 25 x 25 x 120 cm. concrete monument with inscription of \"VALENZUELA, MMA-4146, CAD-338-D, LMS NCR, 2012, FLS\". The station is located at Brgy. Malanday, Valenzuela City.', 2020, 'Reobs 2020', 2020.99, 14.71967616, '14° 43\' 10.834190\"', 120.95365640, '120° 57\' 13.163090\"', 0.0000, '1', 45.6310, 0.0200, '1', 2.7232, 279677.71870, 1628321.32700, '51', 14.72118998, '14° 43\' 16.283930\"', 120.95229980, '120° 57\' 8.279140\"', 2.5531, 1627959.04600, 494863.41700, '3', 279530.19100, 1628390.13700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
