(1344, 'ILN-3008', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'SAN PEDRO', 2007, 18.13667752, '18° 8\' 12.039072\"', 120.58381830, '120° 35\' 1.745880\"', 'ILN-3008 STATION IS LOCATED INSIDE SAN NICOLAS NATIONAL HIGH SCHOOL (BINGAO CAMPUS), ON THE NE SIDE OF THE BASKETBALL COURT, ABOUT 5M E OF THE COURT STAND AND ABOUT 8M W OF AN ELECTRIC POST. MARK IS THE HEAD OF A COPPER NAIL EMBEDDED AT THE CENTER OF A 25CM X 25CM CONCRETE MONUMENT WITH INSCRIPTIONS \"ILN 3008 2007,NAMRIA\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.13667752, '18° 8\' 12.039060\"', 120.58381830, '120° 35\' 1.746050\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.8170, 0.0000, '3', 28.1441, 244352.94070, 2006985.76300, '51', 18.13841046, '18° 8\' 18.277660\"', 120.58254110, '120° 34\' 57.147820\"', 33.1230, 2006130.28400, 455824.89000, '3', 244216.54500, 2007058.60400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2007-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1345, 'ILN-3009', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAOAY', 'SAN ROQUE', 2007, 18.07514079, '18° 4\' 30.506844\"', 120.51159450, '120° 30\' 41.740200\"', 'ILN-3009 From Vigan, along the National Highway, travel N to reach Paoay toen proper. Continue traveling going to Laoag City to reach Brgy San Roque, past Brgy brgy Laoa. Station is located E of the marker. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILN 3009 2007,NAMRIA\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.07514079, '18° 4\' 30.506830\"', 120.51159450, '120° 30\' 41.740180\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.2760, 0.0000, '3', 11.7874, 236615.34170, 2000274.21100, '51', 18.07687164, '18° 4\' 36.737890\"', 120.51031570, '120° 30\' 37.136410\"', 16.5540, 1999338.40300, 448163.83600, '3', 236478.68800, 2000347.24100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2007-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
