(1475, 'ILN-3232', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CITY OF BATAC', 'NAGBACALAN', 2007, 18.01806008, '18° 1\' 5.016288\"', 120.53683810, '120° 32\' 12.617160\"', 'ILN-3231 From Batac Town Proper, travel S for about 4 km. until reaching Brgy. Magnuang. Station is located 500 m. from the Magnuang Brgy. Welcome Arch and station ILN-3230, NE corner of the bridge and 4 m. N from the brgy. road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3231 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.09126209, '18° 5\' 28.543530\"', 120.59516720, '120° 35\' 42.601770\"', 0.0000, '0', 70.3030, 0.0000, '4', 33.3822, 245488.63410, 2001941.77900, '51', 18.09299212, '18° 5\' 34.771630\"', 120.59388880, '120° 35\' 37.999780\"', 38.4333, 2001101.03300, 457014.63800, '3', 245352.09300, 2002014.55000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1476, 'ILN-3233', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CITY OF BATAC', 'NAGBACALAN', 2007, 18.09127786, '18° 5\' 28.600296\"', 120.59517190, '120° 35\' 42.618840\"', 'ILN-3232 Is located at Brgy. Nagbacalan, Mun. of Batac, at the compound of Nagbacalan Elem. School. It is situated 25 m. SE of the flagpole, 30 m. W of the school stage and 20 m. NE of the main gate. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3232 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.09041017, '18° 5\' 25.476620\"', 120.59511790, '120° 35\' 42.424360\"', 0.0000, '0', 72.2200, 0.0000, '4', 35.2961, 245482.18600, 2001847.52500, '51', 18.09214015, '18° 5\' 31.704550\"', 120.59383950, '120° 35\' 37.822300\"', 40.3476, 2001006.75500, 457009.21200, '3', 245345.64200, 2001920.29700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
