(1574, 'ILN-3507 (PGD-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAGUDPUD', 'CAUNAYAN', 2014, 18.55467853, '18° 33\' 16.842708\"', 120.79290850, '120° 47\' 34.470600\"', 'ILN-3346 Is located at Brgy. Ligaya, Pagudpud Town, W of an RCBC headwall. It is also about 7 m. E from the centerline of the Nat\'l. Highway and 100 m. NE of station ILN-3345. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 100 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILN-3346 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.61871997, '18° 37\' 7.391890\"', 120.84134000, '120° 50\' 28.824050\"', 0.0000, '0', 60.1830, 0.0000, '3', 25.1074, 272245.60780, 2060010.77400, '51', 18.62047576, '18° 37\' 13.712740\"', 120.84007420, '120° 50\' 24.267120\"', 29.4625, 2059439.50100, 483123.86200, '3', 272111.00000, 2060083.13500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2015-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
