(1733, 'ILN-3568 (PGL-14 )', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BURGOS', 'SAOIT', 2014, 18.51841439, '18° 31\' 6.291804\"', 120.62827940, '120° 37\' 41.805840\"', 'ILN-3567 (PGL-13) The station is located along the Kapurpurawan rock formation access road. It is also 180 m NE from a NAMRIA GPS point (ILN-3406) and is approximately 6 m NW from thecenterline of the concrete pavement . It is about 145 m. East from project control \"PGL-14\". Mark ia 10 x 1 cm diameter brass rod with cross cut on top, centered on a 30 x 30 x 60 cm concrete monument protruding 10 cm above the ground with inscription, \"PGL- 13 EDC-PWP\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.51848393, '18° 31\' 6.542160\"', 120.62690250, '120° 37\' 36.848900\"', 0.0000, '0', 112.6980, 0.0000, '3', 77.6703, 249464.51740, 2049198.69000, '51', 18.52023836, '18° 31\' 12.858100\"', 120.62563410, '120° 37\' 32.282580\"', 82.1573, 2048379.16200, 460471.83800, '3', 249329.43300, 2049271.66500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2015-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1734, 'ILS-3405 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BURGOS', 'SAOIT', 2014, 18.51848393, '18° 31\' 6.542148\"', 120.62690250, '120° 37\' 36.849000\"', 'ILN-3568 (PGL-14) The station is located about 150 m NE from the mighty Pan-Philippine National Highway and 105 m . NW from the Kapurpurawanrock formation access road . It is also 145 m. N-NW from a NAMRIA GPS point (ILN-3406) and is about 145 m. West from project control \"PGL-13\". Mark is a 10 x 1cm dia. brass rod with cross cut on top , centered on a 30 x 30 x 60 cm concrete monument protruding 10 cm above the ground with inscription, \"PGL-14 EDC-PWP\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.53355894, '18° 32\' 0.812170\"', 120.63024160, '120° 37\' 48.869840\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.2830, 0.0000, '4', 19.4321, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 18.53531419, '18° 32\' 7.131080\"', 120.62897350, '120° 37\' 44.304750\"', 23.7840, 2050046.98100, 460827.88300, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Ma. Luisa Tornea', '1999-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1735, 'ILN-5', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'BADOC', 'GABUT NORTE', 1995, 17.96577144, '17° 57\' 56.777184\"', 120.47163350, '120° 28\' 17.880600\"', 'ILN-5 From the national road going to Laoag City, travel West at a barangay road leading to Gabot Elementary School. Follow the road passing the elementary school and turn right going to the shoreline for about 200m to reach the station. The station is set on top of a 25cm width solid concrete wall, about 35cm above the sand ground and 19.3m NW from the offshore end of the wall. Station mark is a head of 4\" copper nail cemented flushed with inscription \"ILN-5, 1995, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.96577144, '17° 57\' 56.777200\"', 120.47163350, '120° 28\' 17.880760\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.3200, 0.0000, '2', 6.7988, 232218.04540, 1988221.91000, '51', 17.96749667, '17° 58\' 2.988020\"', 120.47035210, '120° 28\' 13.267690\"', 11.3379, 1987245.21800, 443898.73000, '3', 232080.99600, 1988294.98800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2006-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1736, 'ILN-6', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CITY OF LAOAG', 'BGY. NO. 51-A, NANGALISAN EAST', 1996, 18.18778287, '18° 11\' 16.018332\"', 120.58925270, '120° 35\' 21.309720\"', 'ILN-6 Is in Laoag City, Brgy. Nangalisan. It is located at the SW end of the NW side of Gilbert Bridge, at about 1 km. from Laoag City Hall. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail cemented in a drilled hole on top of the bridge abutment with inscriptions on the cement putty around the mark thus \"ILN-6, 1996, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.18778287, '18° 11\' 16.018320\"', 120.58925270, '120° 35\' 21.309590\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.4830, 0.0000, '2', 17.9366, 245002.45520, 2012636.47000, '51', 18.18951872, '18° 11\' 22.267380\"', 120.58797660, '120° 35\' 16.715580\"', 22.9430, 2011785.30100, 456412.75700, '3', 244866.23300, 2012709.33100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2005-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1737, 'ILN-66', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'VINTAR', 'PARPAROROC', 2004, 18.23739367, '18° 14\' 14.617212\"', 120.67656830, '120° 40\' 35.645880\"', 'ILN-66 (FNSP-DENR) Is in Sitio. Bucana, Brgy. Parparoroc, Vintar, Ilocos Norte. From Laoag City proper, take the national road leading to the municipality of Bacarra. Then take the road on the right after passing Tamucalao-1 Bridge. This road is near the building of the Cooperative Development Authority Regional Training Center, before reaching Tamucalao-1 and Bacarra Bridges. Continue traveling this road until reaching the end, near Vintar Central School. Turn right to Gen. Luna St., then turn left to Mariano Marcos Ave. Follow this road until reaching the rough road, a crossing with a waiting shed facing the avenue. Take the road on the left of this crossing passing through a concrete bridge and Brgy. Parparoroc welcome sign. Continue traveling this rough road until reaching Bucana welcome sign. It is located along the SE end of the concrete dike connected to the old Vintar Dam. It is near a series of nipa huts, on the left side of the rough road going to sitio proper and about 150 m. SW of So. Bucana welcome sign. Mark is the head of a 3 in. concrete nail embedded and centered on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"ILN-66, 2004, PRS-92, FNSP-DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.23739367, '18° 14\' 14.617200\"', 120.67656830, '120° 40\' 35.645980\"', 0.0000, '0', 73.0110, 0.0000, '3', 36.0305, 254312.13000, 2018009.77300, '51', 18.23913059, '18° 14\' 20.870130\"', 120.67529350, '120° 40\' 31.056550\"', 41.4246, 2017257.45100, 465659.68100, '3', 254176.13500, 2018082.38900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2006-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1738, 'ILN-67', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'VINTAR', 'PARPAROROC', 2004, 18.23835916, '18° 14\' 18.092976\"', 120.67745910, '120° 40\' 38.852760\"', 'ILN-67 (FNSP-DENR) Is in Sitio. Bucana, Brgy. Parparoroc, Vintar, Ilocos Norte. From Laoag City proper, take the national road leading to the municipality of Bacarra. Then take the road on the right after passing Tamucalao-1 Bridge. This road is near the building of the Cooperative Development Authority Regional Training Center, before reaching Tamucalao-1 and Bacarra Bridges. Continue traveling this road until reaching the end, near Vintar Central School. Turn right to Gen. Luna St., then turn left to Mariano Marcos Ave. Follow this road until reaching the rough road, a crossing with a waiting shed facing the avenue. Take the road on the left of this crossing passing through a concrete bridge and Brgy. Parparoroc welcome sign. Continue traveling this rough road until reaching the Bucana welcome sign. It is located inside the old Vintar Dam, on top of the highest remaining structure. It is located on the SE side near the edge, behind the steel portions, about 20 m. SW of an old headquarters bldg. The dam is located on a hill, near the welcome sign of So. Bucana. Mark is the head of a 3 in. concrete nail embedded and centered on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"ILN-67, 2004, PRS-92, FNSP-DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.23835916, '18° 14\' 18.092980\"', 120.67745910, '120° 40\' 38.852640\"', 0.0000, '0', 85.8910, 0.0000, '3', 48.9070, 254407.71850, 2018115.46900, '51', 18.24009612, '18° 14\' 24.346030\"', 120.67618430, '120° 40\' 34.263300\"', 54.3056, 2017364.14200, 465754.07600, '3', 254271.72700, 2018188.08300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2006-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1739, 'ILN-7', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'CITY OF LAOAG', 'BGY. NO. 8, SAN VICENTE', 1996, 18.19401569, '18° 11\' 38.456484\"', 120.59202720, '120° 35\' 31.297920\"', 'ILN-7 IS IN LAOAG CITY, BRGY. SAN JOSE. IT IS LOCATED AT THE NE END OF THE NW SIDE OF GILBERT BRIDGE, AT ABOUT 100 M. FROM LAOAG CITY HALL. MARK IS THE HEAD OF 3\" COPPER NAIL SET AND CEMENTED ON A DRILLED HOLE ON TOP OF THE BRIDGE ABUTMENT, WITH INSCRIPTIONS ON THE CEMENT PUTTY AROUND THE MARK THUS \"ILN-7, 1996, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.19401569, '18° 11\' 38.456470\"', 120.59202720, '120° 35\' 31.298040\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.4910, 0.0000, '3', 17.9450, 245305.13570, 2013322.69600, '51', 18.19575184, '18° 11\' 44.706640\"', 120.59075130, '120° 35\' 26.704560\"', 22.9648, 2012474.48600, 456707.83200, '3', 245168.93700, 2013395.55300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1740, 'ILN-8', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PASUQUIN', 'CARUAN', 1996, 18.39257164, '18° 23\' 33.257904\"', 120.59785500, '120° 35\' 52.278000\"', 'ILN-8 Is in Ilocos Norte, Mun. of Pasuquin, at Brgy. Caruan, which is about 5 min. travel from the town proper. It is located at the W side of the road going to Burgos town. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set and cemented in a drilled hole on top of the W retaining wall of the bridge and 15 m. S of the S end of the concrete bridge railing. Inscription on the cement putty around the mark are: \"ILN-8 1996 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.39257164, '18° 23\' 33.257920\"', 120.59785500, '120° 35\' 52.278010\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.4660, 0.0000, '3', 7.5659, 246211.30970, 2035298.35300, '51', 18.39431934, '18° 23\' 39.549630\"', 120.59658360, '120° 35\' 47.701040\"', 12.5785, 2034449.49900, 457373.38600, '3', 246075.78100, 2035371.33300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1741, 'ILN-9', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'NUEVA ERA', 'POBLACION', 2004, 17.90542903, '17° 54\' 19.544508\"', 120.65835610, '120° 39\' 30.081960\"', 'ILN-9 From Banna town proper, travel SSE along the general direction of the national highway for about 7 km. Before reaching Bongo Bridge, there is a road going SW leading to Pinili. Turn right and follow this road until reaching the Y-intersection road. Turn left and follow the dirt rough road passing the breeding station at the left side of the road. At the left side of the road is a small hill where the station is situated on its central top. On top of each of these two hills is an electric pole, where the SW pole is the termination of the electrical lines. Duration of travel from the national highway to the station is approx. 8 min. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail centered and embedded on top of a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, set 5 cm. above the ground surface, with inscription \"ILN-9, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.90542903, '17° 54\' 19.544500\"', 120.65835610, '120° 39\' 30.081780\"', 0.0000, '0', 201.5060, 0.0000, '2', 163.5155, 251919.23170, 1981281.83400, '51', 17.90714668, '17° 54\' 25.728050\"', 120.65707350, '120° 39\' 25.464740\"', 168.8803, 1980519.83400, 463664.53600, '3', 251782.11300, 1981354.26200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2005-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1742, 'ILS-1', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'BANTAY', 'BALALENG', 1991, 17.59644948, '17° 35\' 47.218128\"', 120.39107000, '120° 23\' 27.852000\"', 'ILS-1 Is on an open ground along the national highway, about 250 m. from the road curve going to Balaleng approx. 120 m. NW from the small hill, about 10 min. travel from Vigan. Accessible by 2-wheel drive vehicle; about 101 m. NW of Km. Post no. 408. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in a standard concrete block, 0.7 m. deep, flushed with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. Sub-surface mark is a bottle set in concrete block, top of bottle is 0.821 m. below station mark. Reference marks is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods set in concrete blocks, 0.6 m. deep, flushed with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name and RM number.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.59644948, '17° 35\' 47.218140\"', 120.39107000, '120° 23\' 27.852060\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.8063, 0.0000, '1', 9.6307, 223111.69690, 1947445.90200, '51', 17.59815443, '17° 35\' 53.355960\"', 120.38978000, '120° 23\' 23.207880\"', 12.8260, 1946395.70600, 435231.17000, '3', 222973.34800, 1947518.96400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1743, 'ILS-10', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CAOAYAN', 'FUERTE', 2000, 17.53313168, '17° 31\' 59.274048\"', 120.36945350, '120° 22\' 10.032600\"', 'ILS-10 Is in Brgy. Fuerte, Caoayan, Ilocos Sur. It is located on the NW corner of an artesian well about 5 m. N of Brgy. Fuerte\'s Lighthouse, and about 25 m. W of the concrete stage. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 6\" x 6\" cement putty with inscription \"ILS-10 2000 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.53313168, '17° 31\' 59.274040\"', 120.36945350, '120° 22\' 10.032470\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.7453, 0.0000, '3', 8.7067, 220718.98010, 1940466.64700, '51', 17.53483331, '17° 32\' 5.399920\"', 120.36816190, '120° 22\' 5.382850\"', 11.6144, 1939395.50500, 432913.22600, '3', 220580.40000, 1940539.73200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1744, 'ILS-12', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SINAIT', 'RANG-AY', 2005, 17.86442488, '17° 51\' 51.929568\"', 120.45686630, '120° 27\' 24.718680\"', 'ILS-12 Is in the town proper of Sinait, inside the compound of Sinait Municipal Park, Brgy. Poblacion, Sinait, Ilocos Sur. It is located at about 6 m. infront of Jose Rizal monument and about 15 m. S of the barangay hall. The municipal park is located on the right side of the national highway going to Laoag City, infront of Sinait Elem. School. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed in a drilled hole and centered on a 8\" x 8\" cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILS-12, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.86442488, '17° 51\' 51.929580\"', 120.45686630, '120° 27\' 24.718820\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.8980, 0.0000, '2', 10.3082, 230499.88520, 1977021.77400, '51', 17.86614441, '17° 51\' 58.119890\"', 120.45558260, '120° 27\' 20.097250\"', 14.6227, 1976032.87600, 442301.48300, '3', 230362.48400, 1977094.82400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1745, 'ILS-13', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CABUGAO', 'BONIFACIO', 2005, 17.78759359, '17° 47\' 15.336924\"', 120.45777240, '120° 27\' 27.980640\"', 'ILS-13 Is located inside the compound of Cabugao South Central School, Brgy. Bonifacio, Cabugao, Ilocos Sur. It is situated on a dike of an uncultivated farm owned by the municipality. It is located about 30 m. SE of the school oval and about 20 m. SE of a concrete shed. It is reached by traveling N coming from Vigan City. The school is on the left side of the highway, opposite Cabugao National High School. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, about 60 cm. deep, protruding by 5 cm., with inscriptions \"ILS-13, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.78759359, '17° 47\' 15.336910\"', 120.45777240, '120° 27\' 27.980670\"', 0.0000, '0', 59.2670, 0.0000, '2', 22.5966, 230480.32700, 1968513.45100, '51', 17.78930853, '17° 47\' 21.510700\"', 120.45648690, '120° 27\' 23.352710\"', 26.7413, 1967529.08800, 442372.62700, '3', 230342.66800, 1968586.44200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1746, 'ILS-14', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN JUAN', 'PANDAYAN', 2005, 17.74766766, '17° 44\' 51.603576\"', 120.45607430, '120° 27\' 21.867480\"', 'ILS-14 From Vigan City, travel N along the national highway for about 22 km. until reaching the Brgy. Lapting welcome marker on the E side of Km. Post 427 + 166 infront of the vulcanizing shop. Turn W and travel S along the municipal road for about 150 m. to reach the San Juan North Central School. It is located inside the compound on the NW corner fence of the school. It is 2.9 m. SE of the NW corner fence, 2.3 m. S of the N fence and 1.9 m. E of the W fence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 10 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-14, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.74766766, '17° 44\' 51.603580\"', 120.45607430, '120° 27\' 21.867420\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.6480, 0.0000, '2', 16.9548, 230240.26380, 1964095.18200, '51', 17.74938026, '17° 44\' 57.768940\"', 120.45478780, '120° 27\' 17.236120\"', 20.9976, 1963110.73300, 442179.64300, '3', 230102.46900, 1964168.14900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1747, 'ILS-15', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'MAGSINGAL', 'SANTA MONICA', 2005, 17.68949524, '17° 41\' 22.182864\"', 120.42793430, '120° 25\' 40.563480\"', 'ILS-15 From Vigan City, travel N for about 14 km. until reaching the Magsingal Bridge at Km. Post 419 + 575. Right after the bridge on the NW side is the Magsingal Health Office and Hospital. It is located inside the hospital compound. It is about 13 m. NE of the NE corner of the front hospital bldg. and about 13 m. NW of the NE concrete fence. It is about 22 m. NW from the centerline of the national highway. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 30 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-15, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.68949524, '17° 41\' 22.182880\"', 120.42793430, '120° 25\' 40.563640\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.8470, 0.0000, '2', 9.3800, 227166.58990, 1957694.73400, '51', 17.69120498, '17° 41\' 28.337920\"', 120.42664650, '120° 25\' 35.927350\"', 13.0769, 1956681.33800, 439175.53500, '3', 227028.57900, 1957767.74800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1748, 'ILS-16', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 'POBLACION', 2005, 17.63792680, '17° 38\' 16.536480\"', 120.40909350, '120° 24\' 32.736600\"', 'ILS-16 From Vigan City, travel N along the national highway for about 8 km. until reaching the Santo Domingo Park on the SE side of the national highway. The park is located infront of the municipal hall. It is located inside the park. It is about 8 m. NE (right hand side) of the Benito Soliven monument, about 30 m. SE of the national highway, about 3.3 m. NE of the first step of the NE stair and 0.4 m. NE of the NE portion of the circular concrete base. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and flush with the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-16, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.63792680, '17° 38\' 16.536480\"', 120.40909350, '120° 24\' 32.736440\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.5800, 0.0000, '2', 12.2735, 225088.51650, 1952012.19900, '51', 17.63963386, '17° 38\' 22.681880\"', 120.40780440, '120° 24\' 28.095760\"', 15.6895, 1950980.14100, 437158.70200, '3', 224950.31900, 1952085.23500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1749, 'ILS-18', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA', 'QUIRINO', 2005, 17.48608355, '17° 29\' 9.900780\"', 120.43290600, '120° 25\' 58.461600\"', 'ILS-18 From Vigan City, travel S along the national highway for about 19 km. until reaching the Santa Municipal Hall. It is located about 150 m. W (back side) of the municipal hall along the center of the municipal road. It is about 11 m. SW of the SW corner of the basketball court and on the E end of the second plant box from the municipal hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty about 1 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-18, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.48608355, '17° 29\' 9.900790\"', 120.43290600, '120° 25\' 58.461680\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.1640, 0.0000, '2', 8.4536, 227389.13120, 1935165.20700, '51', 17.48778101, '17° 29\' 16.011640\"', 120.43161350, '120° 25\' 53.808440\"', 11.7303, 1934167.06500, 439634.98100, '3', 227250.43900, 1935238.05100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1750, 'ILS-19', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'NARVACAN', 'QUINARAYAN', 2005, 17.44189346, '17° 26\' 30.816456\"', 120.46886910, '120° 28\' 7.928760\"', 'ILS-19 Is located in Brgy. Quinarayan, Narvacan, Ilocos Sur. It is situated in the W side of the highway junction going to Vigan City, Bangued and Manila. It is near the concrete step, about 6 m. SW of the monument of Andres Bonifacio. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"ILS-19, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.44189346, '17° 26\' 30.816460\"', 120.46886910, '120° 28\' 7.928600\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.5500, 0.0000, '2', 10.2792, 231145.35800, 1930221.39800, '51', 17.44358750, '17° 26\' 36.914990\"', 120.46757550, '120° 28\' 3.271850\"', 13.8888, 1929265.28400, 443440.75400, '3', 231006.54300, 1930294.09200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2015-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1751, 'ILS-2', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA LUCIA', 'CATAYAGAN', 1991, 17.13110330, '17° 7\' 51.971880\"', 120.44372290, '120° 26\' 37.402440\"', 'ILS-2 Is in an open ground, right side of the road dike leading to the cemetery. Travel time from Sta. Lucia proper is 3 min. Accessible by 2-wheel drive vehicle. Mark is a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in standard concrete block, 1 m. deep, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. Reference mark (RM) is a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in concrete blocks, 0.6 m. deep, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. RM No. 2 is a brass rod in a drilled hole.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.13110330, '17° 7\' 51.971870\"', 120.44372290, '120° 26\' 37.402390\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.1426, 0.0000, '1', 9.5754, 228016.39220, 1895846.46800, '51', 17.13277911, '17° 7\' 58.004800\"', 120.44242210, '120° 26\' 32.719580\"', 13.5570, 1894877.21900, 440669.17300, '3', 227876.51400, 1895919.00100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1752, 'ILS-21', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTIAGO', 'POBLACION SUR', 2005, 17.29464513, '17° 17\' 40.722468\"', 120.44617730, '120° 26\' 46.238280\"', 'ILS-21 Is in Brgy. Poblacion, Santiago, Ilocos Sur. From Vigan City, travel S to the town of Santiago. On the town proper, turn left on the street before reaching the Santiago Municipal Hall. This road leads to Santiago South Central School and the municipal concrete water tank. It is located on top of the concrete water tank. The water tank is located beside a mini-park, 20 m. E of Santiago South Central School, about 40 m. NNW of the gymnasium and Santiago Municipal Hall. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"ILS-21, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.29464513, '17° 17\' 40.722480\"', 120.44617730, '120° 26\' 46.238140\"', 0.0000, '0', 62.9900, 0.0000, '2', 25.2499, 228516.67210, 1913950.16100, '51', 17.29633079, '17° 17\' 46.790830\"', 120.44488030, '120° 26\' 41.568990\"', 28.9154, 1912975.81700, 440982.64900, '3', 228377.34600, 1914022.81400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1753, 'ILS-22', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'LIDLIDDA', 'POBLACION NORTE', 2005, 17.26876030, '17° 16\' 7.537080\"', 120.52043410, '120° 31\' 13.562760\"', 'ILS-22 From Candon City, travel N along the national highway for about 6 km. then turn E at the junction and travel for about 8 km. until reaching the Lidlidda Public Market. Turn NW and travel for about 4 km. to reach the North Central School. It is located inside the school compound on the science park near the NE corner of the concrete stage. It is 1.5 m. NNW of the E corner of the concrete stage and 0.8 m. NNE of the NE side of the stage. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 10 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-22, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.26876030, '17° 16\' 7.537080\"', 120.52043410, '120° 31\' 13.562690\"', 0.0000, '0', 89.6470, 0.0000, '2', 50.5757, 236377.79970, 1910981.14700, '51', 17.27044279, '17° 16\' 13.594050\"', 120.51913660, '120° 31\' 8.891750\"', 55.3116, 1910089.72500, 448870.20400, '3', 236238.44100, 1911053.53900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1754, 'ILS-23', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN EMILIO', 'CABAROAN', 2005, 17.23629737, '17° 14\' 10.670532\"', 120.57852090, '120° 34\' 42.675240\"', 'ILS-23 From Candon City, travel N along the national highway for about 6 km. then turn E at the junction and travel for about 17 km. until reaching the San Emilio West Central School. It is located inside the school compound on the Math Park. It is on the E corner of the park, about 17 m. WNW of the N corner of the school office and about 23 m. W of Acacia tree no. 8. It is SSE of the municipal hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 30 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-23, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.23629737, '17° 14\' 10.670530\"', 120.57852090, '120° 34\' 42.675170\"', 0.0000, '0', 285.0300, 0.0000, '2', 244.7657, 242511.47630, 1907308.68800, '51', 17.23797660, '17° 14\' 16.715770\"', 120.57722280, '120° 34\' 38.001950\"', 250.4522, 1906482.45900, 455038.69300, '3', 242372.05600, 1907380.86100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1755, 'ILS-24', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CITY OF CANDON', 'DARAPIDAP', 2004, 17.19450210, '17° 11\' 40.207560\"', 120.42042130, '120° 25\' 13.516680\"', 'ILS-24 From the national highway of Candon City proper going to Vigan City, turn left on the road fronted by Jollibee. Continue traveling this road passing through the City Wet Market and University of Northern Philippines (UNP) Annex on the left side until reaching its end, which is a \"T\" intersection. Take the road to the left passing through Darapidap Beach Resort until reaching the E gate of Ilocos Sur Polytechnic State College (ISPSC). It is located on the right side of the concrete road, approx. 10 m. SSE of the campus\' E gate, about 75 m. S of the main entrance. It is also about 15 m. ESE of the campus\' concrete water tank. Mark is the head of an umbrella type G.I. roofing nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"CANDON-1, 2004, PRS-92, FNSP-LMS-DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.19450210, '17° 11\' 40.207570\"', 120.42042130, '120° 25\' 13.516590\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.6160, 0.0000, '2', 8.6878, 225629.07370, 1902898.75800, '51', 17.19618226, '17° 11\' 46.256150\"', 120.41912190, '120° 25\' 8.838930\"', 12.2866, 1901900.93800, 438210.76900, '3', 225489.39100, 1902971.41700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1756, 'ILS-27', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'GREGORIO DEL PILAR', 'POBLACION NORTE', 2005, 17.14814178, '17° 8\' 53.310408\"', 120.60993210, '120° 36\' 35.755560\"', 'ILS-27 Is in So. Cobcobuan, Brgy. Poblacion Norte, Gregorio del Pilar, Ilocos Sur. The town of Gregorio del Pilar can be reached by taking the provincial road passing through the towns of Galimuyod and Salcedo. Continue traveling this road, series of rough/dirt, crossing a river by about ten times until reaching the town proper. Public transportation is difficult and scheduled only once a day. Upon reaching the town proper, take the road to the left, leading to So. Cobcobuan and Tangaoan. Then turn left upon reaching an intersection, an uphill climb with an outpost opposite the road to the left. Continue traveling passing through Gregorio del Pilar High School on the right side. Then stop upon reaching a vacant lot on the left side of the road. Follow the trail going to the hill and ask for the house of Municipal Coun. Domingo Burgos in the area. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, about 60 cm. deep, protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"ILS-27, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.14814178, '17° 8\' 53.310420\"', 120.60993210, '120° 36\' 35.755410\"', 0.0000, '0', 365.0840, 0.0000, '2', 323.8365, 245732.80560, 1897507.63700, '51', 17.14981499, '17° 8\' 59.333950\"', 120.60863200, '120° 36\' 31.075040\"', 330.1521, 1896719.28600, 458359.32700, '3', 245593.11500, 1897579.63800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `hgcp_stations_new` (`id`, `station_name`, `island_group`, `region`, `province`, `city_or_municipality`, `barangay`, `year_established`, `latitude`, `latitude_dms`, `longitude`, `longitude_dms`, `description`, `year_surveyed`, `project`, `epoch`, `latitude_wgs84`, `latitude_wgs84_dms`, `longitude_wgs84`, `longitude_wgs84_dms`, `error_ellipse`, `accuracy_class`, `ellipsoidal_ht_wgs84`, `height_error`, `order_of_accuracy_wgs84`, `egm2008_elevation`, `utm_x_wgs84`, `utm_y_wgs84`, `utm_zone_wgs84`, `latitude_prs92`, `latitude_prs92_dms`, `longitude_prs92`, `longitude_prs92_dms`, `ellipsoidal_ht_prs92`, `northing_ptm`, `easting_ptm`, `ptm_zone`, `utm_x_prs92`, `utm_y_prs92`, `utm_zone_prs92`, `latitude_itrf`, `latitude_itrf_dms`, `longitude_itrf`, `longitude_itrf_dms`, `error_ellipse_itrf`, `ellipsoidal_ht_itrf`, `height_error_itrf`, `year_computed`, `encoder`, `date_updated`, `reference_file`) VALUES
(1757, 'ILS-28', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'TAGUDIN', 'DARDARAT', 2005, 16.96182221, '16° 57\' 42.559956\"', 120.43999550, '120° 26\' 23.983800\"', 'ILS-28 From Candon City, travel S for about 26 km. until reaching a group of restaurants along the national highway in Brgy. Dardarat, Tagudin. A few meters S of Amie\'s Restaurant is a waiting shed on the NW corner of the street going to Seaside Park. Travel NW along the street for about 400 m. passing by a small bridge to reach the station. It is located inside the resthouse compound of Mayor Roque Verzosa. It is about 19 m. SW of the stairs on the SW side of the house, about 12 m. NW of the river, 3.6 m. N of the S corner fence, 3.1 m. NE of the SW fence and 0.95 m. NW of the SE fence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. and 30 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"ILS-28, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.96182221, '16° 57\' 42.559950\"', 120.43999550, '120° 26\' 23.983660\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.7850, 0.0000, '2', 6.5016, 227373.92780, 1877109.29300, '51', 16.96348784, '16° 57\' 48.556210\"', 120.43869070, '120° 26\' 19.286610\"', 10.6768, 1876144.13800, 440218.30400, '3', 227233.47600, 1877181.70500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1758, 'ILS-29 (BLLM-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SUYO', 'POBLACION', 2006, 16.98347909, '16° 59\' 0.524724\"', 120.51161010, '120° 30\' 41.796360\"', 'ILS-29 (BLLM 2) From Candon City, travel S for about 26 km. then turn SW at Bitalag Junction and travel for about 12 km. or about 30 mins. to reach the station at Poblacion, Suyo. It is located about 200 m. W of the municipal hall, about 100 m. WNW of Kimpusa Br. 1 (331 + 805), about 9 m. S from the road centerline, about 3 m. W of the concrete irrigation canal and about 6 m. S of DPWH Km. Post 331 + 700. It is elevated about a meter from the ricefield. Mark is the head of a 4 in. common nail, centered on a concrete block 40 cm. x 40 cm. and flush with the ground surface, with inscription \"BLLM No. 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.98347909, '16° 59\' 0.524740\"', 120.51161010, '120° 30\' 41.796180\"', 0.0000, '0', 117.4740, 0.0000, '2', 77.1226, 235034.95980, 1879408.83000, '51', 16.98514448, '16° 59\' 6.520120\"', 120.51030590, '120° 30\' 37.101350\"', 82.2610, 1878520.26800, 447851.75800, '3', 234894.63700, 1879481.02600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1759, 'ILS-30 (BLLM-2A)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SUYO', 'MAN-ATONG', 2002, 16.95135203, '16° 57\' 4.867308\"', 120.60229200, '120° 36\' 8.251200\"', 'ILS-30 (BLLM 2A) From Candon City, travel S for about 26 km. then turn SW at Bitalag Junction and travel along the mostly rough road for about 25 km. or about 1 hr. and 30 mins. to reach the station. A four wheel drive vehicle or vehicle with high profile tires is recommended. It is located about 100 m. SE of Butac Elem. School. It is on the S top of the rock on the S side of the road. Mark is the head of a 3 in. concrete nail, centered on a 28 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, protruding 6 cm. on top of the rock about 9 m. x 15 m. with a height of about 5 m. from the ground, with inscriptions \"BLLM-2A, 2002, PRS 92, FNSP-DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.95135203, '16° 57\' 4.867290\"', 120.60229200, '120° 36\' 8.251340\"', 0.0000, '0', 315.1300, 0.0000, '2', 273.1237, 244652.16010, 1875731.78900, '51', 16.95301345, '16° 57\' 10.848410\"', 120.60098730, '120° 36\' 3.554410\"', 279.5979, 1874942.78200, 457501.47300, '3', 244511.80300, 1875803.66000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1760, 'ILS-3001', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SALCEDO', 'PIAS', 2007, 17.11629910, '17° 6\' 58.676760\"', 120.51293050, '120° 30\' 46.549800\"', 'ILS-3001 From Sta. Lucia town proper, travel along the road going to Salcedo to reach the steel bridge at the left side of the road. Not crossing the bridge, travel straight ahead to reach the dam. Station is located on the center of the old concrete platform, formerly used as floodgate. The platform is about 10m S of the concrete footing of the hanging bridge. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3001, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.11629910, '17° 6\' 58.676750\"', 120.51293050, '120° 30\' 46.549760\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.9600, 0.0000, '3', 30.1787, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 17.11797253, '17° 7\' 4.701110\"', 120.51162950, '120° 30\' 41.866020\"', 35.1611, 1893218.88400, 448029.44400, '3', 235223.03000, 1894184.17200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2015-01-01', 'Rcg', '2015-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1761, 'ILS-3002', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA CRUZ', 'SEVILLA', 2007, 17.00845539, '17° 0\' 30.439404\"', 120.45583080, '120° 27\' 20.990880\"', 'ILS-3002 Station is located inside the school and barangay hall compound of Sevilla. It is about 2m W of the W side of the basketball court, about 4m E of the W wall of the compound, about 5m NNW of the W goal of the court and about 10m SW of the multipurpose hall. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3002, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.00845539, '17° 0\' 30.439390\"', 120.45583080, '120° 27\' 20.990860\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.5370, 0.0000, '4', 10.1861, 229128.24770, 1882250.38800, '51', 17.01012351, '17° 0\' 36.444630\"', 120.45452720, '120° 27\' 16.297800\"', 14.5367, 1881300.17000, 441919.34700, '3', 228987.96500, 1882322.78600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2010-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1762, 'ILS-3003', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTA CRUZ', 'SAOAT', 2007, 17.05363984, '17° 3\' 13.103424\"', 120.45515620, '120° 27\' 18.562320\"', 'ILS-3003 From Sta. Cruz town proper, travel along the highway going to Tagudin to reach the second welcome arc of barangay Sagat at the left side of the road. Turn left to reach the culvert about 60m W of the welcome arc. Station is located at the NE corner of the culvert about 0.5m E of the said corner and 3m N of the road centerline. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3003, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.05363984, '17° 3\' 13.103420\"', 120.45515620, '120° 27\' 18.562440\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.8120, 0.0000, '3', 9.6810, 229121.51220, 1887253.98200, '51', 17.05531071, '17° 3\' 19.118560\"', 120.45385370, '120° 27\' 13.873200\"', 13.9550, 1886300.88700, 441861.59500, '3', 228981.38200, 1887326.41700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1763, 'ILS-3003 (FNSP)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 'BOROBOR', 2007, 17.65138389, '17° 39\' 4.982004\"', 120.44066760, '120° 26\' 26.403360\"', 'ILS-3003 (FNSP) From the Municipality of Sto. Domingo, travel eastward to barangay Borobor about 3 kilometers. The station is located on the eastern side of the barangay road approximately 18 meters infront of the Bible Baptist Church and 4 meters southward of barangay road. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3003, PRS-92, DENR-FNS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.65138389, '17° 39\' 4.981990\"', 120.44066760, '120° 26\' 26.403190\"', 0.0000, '0', 65.2710, 0.0000, '4', 28.6696, 228460.75770, 1953456.52600, '51', 17.65309107, '17° 39\' 11.127850\"', 120.43937880, '120° 26\' 21.763800\"', 32.3479, 1952459.22700, 440513.75800, '3', 228322.62800, 1953529.47000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1764, 'ILS-3004', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'BANTAY', 'TALEB', 2007, 17.58308447, '17° 34\' 59.104092\"', 120.44814460, '120° 26\' 53.320560\"', 'ILS-3004 From Vigan, travel along the highway going to Santa to reach the barangay plaza of Taleb at the SW side of the highway. Station is located inside the plaza of Taleb on the corner of the elevated concrete pavement about 20m SW of the NW end of the gate, 11m SE of the NW wall of the plaza and about 2m NE of the NE side of the basketball court. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3004, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.58308447, '17° 34\' 59.104100\"', 120.44814460, '120° 26\' 53.320380\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.6890, 0.0000, '3', 21.9657, 229152.47530, 1945883.53100, '51', 17.58478741, '17° 35\' 5.234660\"', 120.44685430, '120° 26\' 48.675370\"', 25.5290, 1944897.80100, 441284.89000, '3', 229014.12200, 1945956.39800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1765, 'ILS-3004 (FNSP)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 'BINONGAN', 2007, 17.62547993, '17° 37\' 31.727748\"', 120.44009890, '120° 26\' 24.356040\"', 'ILS-3004 (FNSP) From the municipality of Sto. Domingo, travel eastward to barangay Nagbettedan about 3 kilometers then you reach the crossing going to barangay Nagbettedan and barangay Binongan. The station is located at the back of a welcome marker within the crossing. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3004, PRS-92, DENR-FNS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.62547993, '17° 37\' 31.727760\"', 120.44009890, '120° 26\' 24.355990\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.7380, 0.0000, '4', 28.1293, 228361.53500, 1950589.18500, '51', 17.62718558, '17° 37\' 37.868090\"', 120.43880960, '120° 26\' 19.714430\"', 31.7331, 1949592.46600, 440444.84300, '3', 228223.31800, 1950662.11100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1766, 'ILS-3005', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'GALIMUYOD', 'PAGANGPANG', 2007, 17.18118464, '17° 10\' 52.264704\"', 120.50248250, '120° 30\' 8.937000\"', 'ILS-3005 From Galimuyod town proper, travel along the road going to Salcedo to reach the welcome arc going to barangay Pagangpang. Follow the road to reach the culvert, which is about 40m from the welcome arc. Station is located on the riprap at the NW corner of the culvert about 8cm W from the headwall and about 3.5m from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3005, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.18118464, '17° 10\' 52.264710\"', 120.50248250, '120° 30\' 8.937080\"', 0.0000, '0', 78.2050, 0.0000, '3', 38.9426, 234342.99310, 1901309.86700, '51', 17.18286223, '17° 10\' 58.304020\"', 120.50118300, '120° 30\' 4.258720\"', 43.6359, 1900402.58200, 446936.18200, '3', 234203.32700, 1901382.24900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1767, 'ILS-3005 (FNSP)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 'PADU GRANDE', 2007, 17.63847889, '17° 38\' 18.524004\"', 120.37763770, '120° 22\' 39.495720\"', 'ILS-3005 (FNSP) From the town proper of sto. Domingo, travel towards municipality of San Ildefonso until reaching the provincial road going to Puerto Beach, travel more about 2 kilometers upon reaching the crossing going to Padu Grande then turn right travel about 150 meters from the crossing. The station is located beside an electric post southwest of the waiting shed along a curve of barangay road. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3005, PRS-92, DENR-FNSP R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.63847889, '17° 38\' 18.523990\"', 120.37763770, '120° 22\' 39.495710\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.5070, 0.0000, '4', 10.4844, 221749.80670, 1952119.39800, '51', 17.64018664, '17° 38\' 24.671920\"', 120.37634860, '120° 22\' 34.854920\"', 13.6939, 1951052.05200, 433820.84300, '3', 221611.58800, 1952192.53500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1768, 'ILS-3006', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'BANAYOYO', 'MONTERO', 2007, 17.22021410, '17° 13\' 12.770760\"', 120.50139280, '120° 30\' 5.014080\"', 'ILS-3006 From Banayoyo town proper, travel along the road going to Lidlidda just before reaching the bridge, turn right,then turn left. Follow the road passing through barangay Lintic to reach Banlo Elementary School. Station is located inside the school compound about 6m E of the door of the principal\'s office about 20m W of the flagpole and 1m E of the W canal. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3006, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.22021410, '17° 13\' 12.770770\"', 120.50139280, '120° 30\' 5.014180\"', 0.0000, '0', 70.7690, 0.0000, '3', 31.7309, 234282.78430, 1905632.49300, '51', 17.22189408, '17° 13\' 18.818670\"', 120.50009420, '120° 30\' 0.339080\"', 36.3258, 1904722.27900, 446831.50100, '3', 234143.24800, 1905704.90900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1769, 'ILS-3006 (FNSP)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN ILDEFONSO', 'BELEN', 2007, 17.62279551, '17° 37\' 22.063836\"', 120.42524540, '120° 25\' 30.883440\"', 'ILS-3006 (FNSP) From the town proper of Sto. Domingo, travel towards municipality of San Ildefonso until reaching the barangay road going to Philippine Science High School, from there travel more about 3 kilometers to barangay Bungro. The station is located eastern side of barangay road 50 meters east of the house of barangay captain Vicente Palomares and 40 meters south of an irrigation bridge. Mark is the head of a 3 inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 100 cm standard monument protruding by about 20 cm, with the inscription; ILS-3006, PRS-92, DENR-FNS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.62279551, '17° 37\' 22.063830\"', 120.42524540, '120° 25\' 30.883600\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.5470, 0.0000, '4', 17.0811, 226780.47680, 1950313.36600, '51', 17.62450131, '17° 37\' 28.204710\"', 120.42395610, '120° 25\' 26.241780\"', 20.5690, 1949300.13700, 438867.59700, '3', 226642.24100, 1950386.33800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1770, 'ILS-3007', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SANTIAGO', 'CABURAO', 2007, 17.23774466, '17° 14\' 15.880776\"', 120.45255510, '120° 27\' 9.198360\"', 'ILS-3007 From Santiago town proper, travel along the road going to Candon to reach the road junction at barangay Caburao. Turn left at the road going to Banayoyo to reach the first bridge. Station is located on the riprap about 1m SE of the SE corner of the bridge and about 0.5m S of the first concrete pillar of the railing. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3007, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.23774466, '17° 14\' 15.880770\"', 120.45255510, '120° 27\' 9.198250\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.3830, 0.0000, '3', 15.2088, 229111.84020, 1907641.23400, '51', 17.23942674, '17° 14\' 21.936250\"', 120.45125680, '120° 27\' 4.524400\"', 19.1130, 1906676.59500, 441642.67800, '3', 228972.32800, 1907713.82200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
