(1778, 'ILS-3011', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'NAGBUKEL', 'POBLACION EAST', 2007, 17.44656652, '17° 26\' 47.639472\"', 120.52489930, '120° 31\' 29.637480\"', 'ILS-3011 From Vigan, travel S along the national highway to reach Narvacan town proper. At the main intersection, turn left following the road leading to Narvacan Municipal Hall. Upon reaching the church, turn right, then left, and left again. Follow the road to reach Nagbukel town proper. Station is located inside St. Joseph Parish Church compound about 2 meters NE of the gate near the church. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm x 25cm cement putty with inscription \"ILS-3011, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.44656652, '17° 26\' 47.639480\"', 120.52489930, '120° 31\' 29.637370\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.4870, 0.0000, '3', 20.4714, 237106.63800, 1930660.75200, '51', 17.44825964, '17° 26\' 53.734700\"', 120.52360590, '120° 31\' 24.981290\"', 24.7060, 1929766.62200, 449394.25000, '3', 236967.88000, 1930733.26800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
