(1937, 'ILS-32 (BLLM-1)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SUGPON', 'BALBALAYANG', 2006, 16.84133615, '16° 50\' 28.810140\"', 120.51484630, '120° 30\' 53.446680\"', 'ILS-32 (BLLM 1) From Bangar, La Union, on the corner of the rural bank and E of the town plaza, travel SE along the road going to Sugpon for about 40 mins. then cross the Amburayan River via banca for about 2 mins. to reach Sugpon town proper. From the police station, walk along the concrete road for about 15 mins. going uphill to the cemetery and Sugpon Nat\'l. High School. It is located in the N side of the cemetery about 15 m. E of a Narra tree, about 12 m. SW of a Duhat tree, about 8 m. W of a rock outcrop (90 cm. x 140 cm. protruding about 30 cm.), 1.3 m. NNE of the NE corner of the niche of Mr. Ronald T. Latong and 1.1 m. N of the N side of the same niche. Mark is the head of a 3 in. concrete nail, centered on a concrete monument 40 cm. x 40 cm. and flush with the ground surface, with inscription \"BLLM No. 1\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.84133615, '16° 50\' 28.810140\"', 120.51484630, '120° 30\' 53.446740\"', 0.0000, '0', 167.3420, 0.0000, '2', 126.5014, 235181.04720, 1863667.65100, '51', 16.84299279, '16° 50\' 34.774030\"', 120.51353890, '120° 30\' 48.740040\"', 131.6769, 1862788.89000, 448157.19100, '3', 235040.25000, 1863739.72100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(1938, 'ILS-3200', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SINAIT', 'CABARAMBANAN', 2007, 17.88765898, '17° 53\' 15.572328\"', 120.49631730, '120° 29\' 46.742280\"', 'ILS-3200 From Sinait Town Proper, travel N for about 2 km. then turn right just before the checkpoint leading to Sapriana Elem. School. Continue traveling for 3 km. until reaching Brgy. Cabarambanan. Station is located on the E midside of the basketball court about 8 m. SW of Cabarambanan Brgy. Hall and about 3 m. from the brgy. road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"ILS-3200 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.88765898, '17° 53\' 15.572320\"', 120.49631730, '120° 29\' 46.742290\"', 0.0000, '0', 79.3470, 0.0000, '4', 42.5091, 234717.29010, 1979537.72700, '51', 17.88937904, '17° 53\' 21.764550\"', 120.49503410, '120° 29\' 42.122870\"', 47.0523, 1978592.52900, 446489.69300, '3', 234579.99600, 1979610.66700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
