(1968, 'ILS-3401', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SUYO', 'BARINGCUCURONG', 2009, 16.96224045, '16° 57\' 44.065620\"', 120.46700970, '120° 28\' 1.234920\"', 'ILS-3401 From Bitalag Public Market travel eastward to Suyo-Cervantes road. Travel for 3 minutes from the crossing of National road going to Bitalag, the station is located about 100 meters after the Suyo gasoline station. It is exactly 2.80 meters north of the irrigational gate and 5.50 meters from the western post of the bridge and 8.70 meters south of the concrete fence of God\'s Victorious Church. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3401; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.96224045, '16° 57\' 44.065620\"', 120.46700970, '120° 28\' 1.235070\"', 0.0000, '0', 66.8560, 0.0000, '4', 27.1606, 230252.96860, 1877118.25100, '51', 16.96390552, '16° 57\' 50.059860\"', 120.46570510, '120° 27\' 56.538200\"', 31.6840, 1876182.33200, 443095.63600, '3', 230112.53900, 1877190.57600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
