(1972, 'ILS-3405', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SUYO', 'POBLACION', 2009, 16.98218923, '16° 58\' 55.881228\"', 120.50543330, '120° 30\' 19.559880\"', 'ILS-3405 From Suyo Municipal Hall travel northwest then turn right uphill on the cemented road of barangay road stop at the end of cemented road. The station is located on top of the mountain at the leftside of barangay road. It is 30 meters west of the center of barangay road and 20 meters west of the mango tree and 5 meters south of the swamp. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3405; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.98218923, '16° 58\' 55.881230\"', 120.50543330, '120° 30\' 19.559750\"', 0.0000, '0', 243.4780, 0.0000, '4', 203.2303, 234375.08860, 1879274.39000, '51', 16.98385464, '16° 59\' 1.876690\"', 120.50412910, '120° 30\' 14.864870\"', 208.2760, 1878379.18500, 447193.60700, '3', 234234.75900, 1879346.60100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
