(1975, 'ILS-3407', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SUYO', 'URZADAN', 2009, 16.98326471, '16° 58\' 59.752956\"', 120.52592290, '120° 31\' 33.322440\"', 'ILS-3407 From Suyo Municipal Hall travel southeast along provincial road for 15 minutes until reaching Barangay Urzadan. The station is located at the top of the old footbridge 7 meters northeast of waiting shed and 7.5 east of the center of provincial road. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3407; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.98326471, '16° 58\' 59.752950\"', 120.52592290, '120° 31\' 33.322590\"', 0.0000, '0', 129.6000, 0.0000, '4', 88.9995, 236559.49770, 1879365.79400, '51', 16.98492977, '16° 59\' 5.747160\"', 120.52461880, '120° 31\' 28.627820\"', 94.3518, 1878492.75700, 449375.93300, '3', 236419.18500, 1879437.94300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
