(2029, 'ILS-3466', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'BURGOS', 'PADUROS', 2009, 17.31431926, '17° 18\' 51.549336\"', 120.48999980, '120° 29\' 23.999280\"', 'ILS-3466 From Burgos Town Proper travel southeast for 5 minutes going to barangay Callitong, turn right at the intersection, then turn left going to Barangay Dirdirig. The station is located 5 meters southwest of the electrical post and 200 southwest of basketball court of Paduros and about 30 meters southwest of the centerline of the road. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3466; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.31431926, '17° 18\' 51.549320\"', 120.48999980, '120° 29\' 23.999210\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.0890, 0.0000, '4', 29.8187, 233206.10570, 1916067.13500, '51', 17.31600516, '17° 18\' 57.618560\"', 120.48870330, '120° 29\' 19.331920\"', 33.9713, 1915140.18400, 445647.56600, '3', 233066.87800, 1916139.66100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2030, 'ILS-3467', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'BURGOS', 'MACAOAYAN', 2009, 17.32656268, '17° 19\' 35.625648\"', 120.49538390, '120° 29\' 43.382040\"', 'ILS-3467 From Poblacion-Callitong road going to Barangay Macaoayan travel for 2-3 minutes until reaching the intersection after the Macaoayan welcome arc turn right to reach Macaoayan Barangay Plaza. The station is located on top of the waiting shed 2.3 meters high and about 10 meters southwest of Welcome Arc of Barangay Callitong. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3467; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.32656268, '17° 19\' 35.625630\"', 120.49538390, '120° 29\' 43.381900\"', 0.0000, '0', 76.0890, 0.0000, '4', 37.8180, 233796.34760, 1917415.21600, '51', 17.32824919, '17° 19\' 41.697100\"', 120.49408770, '120° 29\' 38.715660\"', 41.9972, 1916493.65600, 446223.51600, '3', 233657.16500, 1917487.73500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2031, 'ILS-3468', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'BURGOS', 'AMBUGAT', 2009, 17.33101944, '17° 19\' 51.669984\"', 120.49961940, '120° 29\' 58.629840\"', 'ILS-3468 Travel westward for 1 minute to reach the bridge connecting Barangay Ambugat, Bangbangar etc., begining at town proper. The station is located at the right shoulder of the bridge on the railings about 1 meter southeast of the 8th steel post. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3468; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.33101944, '17° 19\' 51.670000\"', 120.49961940, '120° 29\' 58.629880\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.0760, 0.0000, '4', 17.7707, 234253.17880, 1917902.78900, '51', 17.33270614, '17° 19\' 57.742110\"', 120.49832340, '120° 29\' 53.964060\"', 21.9880, 1916985.70500, 446675.04700, '3', 234114.01500, 1917975.29700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2032, 'ILS-3469', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'BURGOS', 'NAGPANAOAN', 2009, 17.33710191, '17° 20\' 13.566876\"', 120.49582620, '120° 29\' 44.974320\"', 'ILS-3469 From Burgos Town Proper travel for about 2-3 minutes routing to Barangay Nagpanaoan. The station is located at the concrete pavement of irrigation canal about 200 meters northwest of Smart Cellsite and 100 meters north of the Welcome Arc and 3 meters from the center of barangay road. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3469; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.33710191, '17° 20\' 13.566860\"', 120.49582620, '120° 29\' 44.974430\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.8870, 0.0000, '4', 18.6779, 233858.59240, 1918581.46700, '51', 17.33878906, '17° 20\' 19.640600\"', 120.49453030, '120° 29\' 40.309060\"', 22.8276, 1917659.92600, 446273.63100, '3', 233719.44500, 1918653.99200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
