(2047, 'ILS-3484', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CERVANTES', 'SAN JUAN', 2009, 16.97614345, '16° 58\' 34.116420\"', 120.71638360, '120° 42\' 58.980960\"', 'ILS-3484 From Municipal Plaza of Cervantes travel westward going to Barangay San Juan for 5 minutes to reach San Juan Barangay Hall, at the intersection turn left and follow an uphill cemented road, the station is located on top of a water reservoir , 15 meters west of the center of barangay road and 4.80 meters west of electric post. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3484; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.97614345, '16° 58\' 34.116410\"', 120.71638360, '120° 42\' 58.981060\"', 0.0000, '0', 599.2710, 0.0000, '4', 555.9465, 256839.97340, 1878331.28100, '51', 16.97780385, '16° 58\' 40.093850\"', 120.71507970, '120° 42\' 54.286990\"', 563.5418, 1877664.90100, 469657.44500, '3', 256699.79200, 1878402.79600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2048, 'ILS-3485', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CERVANTES', 'CONCEPCION', 2009, 16.99037744, '16° 59\' 25.358784\"', 120.73602360, '120° 44\' 9.684960\"', 'ILS-3485 The station is located inside the school premises of Cervantes Central School (main campus) west of Cervantes Municipal plaza, about 16 meters northwest of flagpole and 20 meters east of main entrance gate. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3485; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.99037744, '16° 59\' 25.358770\"', 120.73602360, '120° 44\' 9.685110\"', 0.0000, '0', 545.0490, 0.0000, '4', 501.5921, 258950.35530, 1879882.68500, '51', 16.99203829, '16° 59\' 31.337830\"', 120.73472010, '120° 44\' 4.992340\"', 509.3170, 1879237.13000, 471751.18800, '3', 258810.23700, 1879954.14900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2049, 'ILS-3486', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CERVANTES', 'CONCEPCION', 2009, 16.99018886, '16° 59\' 24.679896\"', 120.73517260, '120° 44\' 6.621360\"', 'ILS-3486 The station is located within Cervantes Municipal Plaza. in between Municipal Hall and Health Office. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3486; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.99018886, '16° 59\' 24.679910\"', 120.73517260, '120° 44\' 6.621510\"', 0.0000, '0', 545.0710, 0.0000, '4', 501.6219, 258859.46720, 1879862.85800, '51', 16.99184972, '16° 59\' 30.659000\"', 120.73386910, '120° 44\' 1.928710\"', 509.3400, 1879216.38700, 471660.53800, '3', 258719.34700, 1879934.32500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2050, 'ILS-3487', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CERVANTES', 'REMEDIOS', 2009, 17.00665706, '17° 0\' 23.965416\"', 120.71873590, '120° 43\' 7.449240\"', 'ILS-3487 Travel for 10-15 kilometers along Cervantes-Quirino road to reach public cemetery of Barangay Remedios. The station is located on top of the mausoleum of Francisca del Rosario 2 meters high, 4 meters and 50 meters southeast of the burial chamber of Felipe Sanchez and the residencial property of Reynalda Itong. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3487; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.00665706, '17° 0\' 23.965430\"', 120.71873590, '120° 43\' 7.449110\"', 0.0000, '0', 582.8670, 0.0000, '4', 539.6645, 257129.87330, 1881706.16500, '51', 17.00831928, '17° 0\' 29.949390\"', 120.71743270, '120° 43\' 2.757600\"', 547.2279, 1881041.33800, 469912.89000, '3', 256989.79600, 1881777.69700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2051, 'ILS-3489', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CERVANTES', 'REMEDIOS', 2009, 17.04423197, '17° 2\' 39.235092\"', 120.71473210, '120° 42\' 53.035560\"', 'ILS-3489 Travel for 40-50 minutes using any 4 wheel light vehicle northwest going to Quirino to reach Barangy Libang Welcome Arc. The station is located within the concrete riprap along Cervantes-Quirino road near the Welcome Arc of Libang about 7 meters southeast of electrical post and 10 meters southeast of the Welcome Marker of Libang. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3489; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.04423197, '17° 2\' 39.235090\"', 120.71473210, '120° 42\' 53.035490\"', 0.0000, '0', 850.8910, 0.0000, '4', 807.9133, 256752.03220, 1885870.63200, '51', 17.04589649, '17° 2\' 45.227350\"', 120.71342980, '120° 42\' 48.347310\"', 815.3799, 1885200.21900, 469492.76200, '3', 256612.08300, 1885942.19900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2052, 'ILS-3490', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CERVANTES', 'LIBANG', 2009, 17.04595931, '17° 2\' 45.453516\"', 120.71399630, '120° 42\' 50.386680\"', 'ILS-3490 Travel for 40-50 minutes using any 4 wheel light vehiclenorthwet going to Quirino to reach Barangay Libang welcome sign. The station is located within the concrete riprap along Cervantes-Quirino road near the welcome marker of Libang, about 22.80 meters southeast of electric post and 150 meters northwest of the waiting shed. Station is mark by the head of 4\" copper nail on 0.30 m x 0.30 m cement putty with inscription \" ILS-3490, PRS-92, 2009, DENR-LMS R-1 \".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.04595931, '17° 2\' 45.453510\"', 120.71399630, '120° 42\' 50.386760\"', 0.0000, '0', 876.6140, 0.0000, '4', 833.6522, 256675.91960, 1886062.76300, '51', 17.04762394, '17° 2\' 51.446180\"', 120.71269410, '120° 42\' 45.698740\"', 841.1101, 1885391.49300, 469414.72100, '3', 256535.97700, 1886134.33300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2053, 'ILS-3491', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'QUIRINO', 'LEGLEG', 2009, 17.13707424, '17° 8\' 13.467264\"', 120.67857120, '120° 40\' 42.856320\"', 'ILS-3491 From Quirino Municipal Hall travel southward going to Cervantes for 50-100 meters to reach the station just beside Topmart Hadware. The station is located 70 meters south of the said municipal hall and 7 meters south of the waiting shed. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3491; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.13707424, '17° 8\' 13.467250\"', 120.67857120, '120° 40\' 42.856350\"', 0.0000, '0', 343.7540, 0.0000, '4', 301.5773, 253023.70970, 1896193.82200, '51', 17.13874530, '17° 8\' 19.483070\"', 120.67727090, '120° 40\' 38.175380\"', 308.6218, 1895480.88600, 465660.39700, '3', 252884.03300, 1896265.59400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'JHO', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2054, 'ILS-3493', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'QUIRINO', 'NAMITPIT', 2009, 17.10688018, '17° 6\' 24.768648\"', 120.69564230, '120° 41\' 44.312280\"', 'ILS-3493 By taking Quirino-Cervantes road travel southward starting at Quirino Town Proper to reach Barangay Namitpit for about 10-20 minutes. At the first intersection straight ahead going to Barangay Suagayan for another 2-3 minutes. The station is located 20 meters south of Philippine Bethel Church and on the center of the rooftop of a 2.5 meters high waiting shed. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3493; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.10688018, '17° 6\' 24.768660\"', 120.69564230, '120° 41\' 44.312370\"', 0.0000, '0', 418.5600, 0.0000, '4', 376.0663, 254801.12080, 1892829.69200, '51', 17.10854903, '17° 6\' 30.776500\"', 120.69434140, '120° 41\' 39.629010\"', 383.2916, 1892136.42000, 467471.52400, '3', 254661.35800, 1892901.38200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2055, 'ILS-3495', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SUGPON', 'CAOAYAN', 2009, 16.81372696, '16° 48\' 49.417056\"', 120.54176530, '120° 32\' 30.355080\"', 'ILS-3495 From Bangar Municipal Hall travel 3 kilometers with narrow ditches going southeastern until you reach Amburayan River, follow the rough road until you reach the intersection follow the road in going to Barangay Caoayan. The station is located on top of a boulder around 15 meters away below the residence of Benigno Dagsa. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3495; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.81372696, '16° 48\' 49.417060\"', 120.54176530, '120° 32\' 30.354930\"', 0.0000, '0', 306.2160, 0.0000, '4', 264.8408, 238013.03550, 1860575.18700, '51', 16.81538129, '16° 48\' 55.372660\"', 120.54045730, '120° 32\' 25.646160\"', 270.4001, 1859726.57200, 451018.87500, '3', 237872.16900, 1860647.14400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2056, 'ILS-3497', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'GREGORIO DEL PILAR', 'CONCEPCION', 2009, 17.12903196, '17° 7\' 44.515056\"', 120.60871340, '120° 36\' 31.368240\"', 'ILS-3497 From Salcedo Municipal Hall travel eastward along barangay road, series of rough, dirt, crossing a river by about 10 times until reaching Barangay Conceprion. The station is located inside Concepcion Elementary School, 6 meters southeast of C. V. O. Outpost and 7 meters northwest of Gregorio del Pilar Monument. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3497; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.12903196, '17° 7\' 44.515050\"', 120.60871340, '120° 36\' 31.368060\"', 0.0000, '0', 339.5490, 0.0000, '4', 298.2098, 245577.05610, 1895393.64800, '51', 17.13070404, '17° 7\' 50.534530\"', 120.60741280, '120° 36\' 26.686060\"', 304.5597, 1894604.70300, 458225.33900, '3', 245437.30000, 1895465.63800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2057, 'ILS-3498', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'GREGORIO DEL PILAR', 'BUSSOT', 2009, 17.12470410, '17° 7\' 28.934760\"', 120.61343140, '120° 36\' 48.353040\"', 'ILS-3498 From Salcedo Municipal Hall travel eastward along barangay road, series of rough, dirt, crossing a river by about 10 times until reaching Barangay Concepcion. The station is located inside Bussot Primary School, 8.80 meters northwest of the entrance gate and 3 meters south of concrete fence. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3498; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.12470410, '17° 7\' 28.934770\"', 120.61343140, '120° 36\' 48.353130\"', 0.0000, '0', 446.2960, 0.0000, '4', 404.8604, 246073.40100, 1894908.35600, '51', 17.12637579, '17° 7\' 34.952840\"', 120.61213080, '120° 36\' 43.670870\"', 411.2818, 1894124.72600, 458726.42600, '3', 245933.63600, 1894980.32500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2058, 'ILS-3499', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'GREGORIO DEL PILAR', 'POBLACION SUR', 2009, 17.14232490, '17° 8\' 32.369640\"', 120.60752220, '120° 36\' 27.079920\"', 'ILS-3499 From Gregorio MunicipalHall travel westward for about 1 kilometer until reaching the concrete Welcome Arc of Poblacion Sur. The station is located at northern side of barangay road at the top of a rip-rap. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3499; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.14232490, '17° 8\' 32.369630\"', 120.60752220, '120° 36\' 27.079790\"', 0.0000, '0', 316.2900, 0.0000, '4', 275.0456, 245468.37360, 1896866.82600, '51', 17.14399781, '17° 8\' 38.392120\"', 120.60622190, '120° 36\' 22.398880\"', 281.3455, 1896076.06700, 458101.59600, '3', 245328.66100, 1896938.83100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2059, 'ILS-3500', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'GREGORIO DEL PILAR', 'POBLACION SUR', 2009, 17.14546596, '17° 8\' 43.677456\"', 120.60978700, '120° 36\' 35.233200\"', 'ILS-3500 From Gregorio Del Pilar Municipal Hall travel westward for about 0.20 kilometers until reaching the motor pool of the town. The station is located at the southern side of barangay road near Eva Gasatang\'s house. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3500; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.14546596, '17° 8\' 43.677460\"', 120.60978700, '120° 36\' 35.233070\"', 0.0000, '0', 336.7960, 0.0000, '4', 295.5353, 245713.71680, 1897211.59500, '51', 17.14713901, '17° 8\' 49.700420\"', 120.60848680, '120° 36\' 30.552490\"', 301.8560, 1896423.18900, 458343.28600, '3', 245574.01800, 1897283.59500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2060, 'ILS-3501', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'GREGORIO DEL PILAR', 'POBLACION NORTE', 2009, 17.14961482, '17° 8\' 58.613352\"', 120.60932570, '120° 36\' 33.572520\"', 'ILS-3501 From Gregorio Del Pilar Municipal Hall travel northward for about 1.5 kilometers until reaching the basketball court of Sitio Cobcobuan at Barangay Poblacion Norte. The station is located at the eastern side of basketball court in front of the stage. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.30m. x 0.30m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"ILS-3491; PRS-92; 2009; DENR/LMS R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.14961482, '17° 8\' 58.613340\"', 120.60932570, '120° 36\' 33.572580\"', 0.0000, '0', 367.2320, 0.0000, '4', 326.0023, 245670.27640, 1897671.50600, '51', 17.15128812, '17° 9\' 4.637240\"', 120.60802560, '120° 36\' 28.892330\"', 332.3062, 1896882.43500, 458295.14500, '3', 245530.59100, 1897743.51000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2061, 'ILS-5', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'CABUGAO', 'SALOMAGUE', 1995, 17.79071262, '17° 47\' 26.565432\"', 120.38746580, '120° 23\' 14.876880\"', 'ILS-5 (DESTROYED) Is located in Salomague Island, Brgy. Salomague, Cabugao, Ilocos Sur. Station is on the SSW coast of Salomague Island on the SE top of big rock made of coral. The rock is the biggest in the locality of about 7 m. dia., 6 m. high, and has a cave from ting the sea with rectangular opening of 2 m. high and 5 m. wide. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a concrete monument 25 cm. x 25 cm. placed on top of a protruding 0.6 m. dia. coral rock with inscription \"ILS-5, 1995, NAMRIA\", and about 0.2 m. above the rock ground. Reference marks, RM-1 is 3.1 m. WNW and RM-2 is SSE from the station. RM\'s is cemented flash on top of a coral rock is ahead of 4\" copper nail with an arrow pointing to the station. *Note: Reported DESTROYED by LTSG. Custodio G. Armengol - 13 Feb 2006', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.79071262, '17° 47\' 26.565440\"', 120.38746580, '120° 23\' 14.876870\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.2826, 0.0000, '3', 10.1842, 223027.26250, 1968961.37300, '51', 17.79242924, '17° 47\' 32.745280\"', 120.38618020, '120° 23\' 10.248820\"', 13.9357, 1967897.46600, 434919.09700, '3', 222889.56400, 1969034.59300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2062, 'ILS-6', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN JUAN', 'SURNGIT', 1995, 17.76254603, '17° 45\' 45.165708\"', 120.40750050, '120° 24\' 27.001800\"', 'ILS-6 Is located on the coastal barangay at Brgy. Surngit, San Juan. Station is placed on locally known as \"Raois Point\" whose locality is a fishpond area and set on top corner edge of a fishpond dike, being 5 m. from the high water line. Mark is head of a 4\" copper nail on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument with inscription \"ILS-6, 1995, NAMRIA\", and about 0.5 m. from the dike edge. Fishpond owner is Mr. Criscencio Vite. No reference marks. To reach the station from the national road of poblacion of San Juan take the road going W. There is a concrete monument marker that points to the said Brgy. Surngit along the national road, distance is about 5.1 km. Just follow the road and upon reaching a wooden small bridge then the steel arch of Brgy. Surngit straight then and take the road going left and follow again the road until reach the NW extremity of the coast. *Note: Station upgraded to 2nd Order (by: LTSG. Custodio G. Armengol, May 2005).', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.76254603, '17° 45\' 45.165710\"', 120.40750050, '120° 24\' 27.001730\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.9000, 0.0000, '2', 7.6248, 225109.35480, 1965813.07200, '51', 17.76426055, '17° 45\' 51.337990\"', 120.40621430, '120° 24\' 22.371430\"', 11.4142, 1964773.16000, 437033.42800, '3', 224971.57600, 1965886.20700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1998-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2063, 'ILS-9', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS SUR', 'SAN JUAN', 'BACSIL', 2000, 17.72624089, '17° 43\' 34.467204\"', 120.45389200, '120° 27\' 14.011200\"', 'ILS-9 Is located in Bo. Bacsil, San Juan, Ilocos Sur at the hilly portion of Bacsil National High School compound, 10 m. W from the school building. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 8 in. x 8 in. cement putty set at the edge of a concrete road with inscribe station name \"ILS-9, NAMRIA, 2000\". *Note: Station upgraded to 2nd Order (by: LTSG. Custodio G. Armengol, May 2005).', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.72624089, '17° 43\' 34.467210\"', 120.45389200, '120° 27\' 14.011020\"', 0.0000, '0', 89.2910, 0.0000, '2', 52.6016, 229976.58350, 1961725.88900, '51', 17.72795224, '17° 43\' 40.628080\"', 120.45260500, '120° 27\' 9.377990\"', 56.5770, 1960739.96500, 441941.24500, '3', 229838.71700, 1961798.84400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2064, 'ILN-3363', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'ILOCOS NORTE', 'PAGUDPUD', 'TARRAG', 2009, 18.56725236, '18° 34\' 2.108496\"', 120.96573860, '120° 57\' 56.658960\"', 'BM LN-107 Along the National Road and about 13.65m. Northeast of kilometer post no. 588, it is embedded in a hole drilled on top of a concrete railings about 14cm. above the level of the surface of the road and it is located at the right side of the National Road going to Laoag City about 5.40m. Northeast of the centerline of national road. Mark is a 1/2\" x 2\" brass rod embedded in a drilled hole with an inscription on the cement putty placed around the mark as shown: LN-107; 2007; NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.54946129, '18° 32\' 58.060640\"', 120.78475440, '120° 47\' 5.115830\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.4350, 0.0000, '4', 9.7025, 266178.53080, 2052416.01700, '51', 18.55121423, '18° 33\' 4.371240\"', 120.78348690, '120° 47\' 0.552840\"', 14.6196, 2051780.14400, 477143.24600, '3', 266043.65300, 2052488.51100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2010-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
