(2739, 'BLN-3039', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'PLARIDEL', 'BULIHAN', 2008, 14.87955135, '14° 52\' 46.384860\"', 120.90190110, '120° 54\' 6.843960\"', 'BLN-3039 Station is located in the Province of Bulacan, Municipality of Plaridel, Brgy. Bulihan. From Malinta take a right turn going to Bulihan, Plaridel. 1,200 m away from the gasoline station at the McArthur Highway is NLEX. From NLEX to Bunsuran Road 2 Km. From Bunsuran to Bulihan Road about 3.5 Km., turn right at the basketball court before reaching Bulihan Elem. School. Station is situated at the left side of the road 150 m after the basketball court. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions, \"BLN 3039, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.87955135, '14° 52\' 46.384870\"', 120.90190110, '120° 54\' 6.843960\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.5470, 0.0000, '4', 10.0526, 274268.83010, 1646065.55700, '51', 14.88107661, '14° 52\' 51.875790\"', 120.90054820, '120° 54\' 1.973370\"', 10.0547, 1645649.94200, 489298.40500, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
