(2971, 'BLN-3364', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'PLARIDEL', 'LALANGAN', 2011, 14.87645593, '14° 52\' 35.241348\"', 120.84632590, '120° 50\' 46.773240\"', 'BLN-3364 Station is located in the Province of Bulacan, Municipality of Plaridel, Barangay of Lalangan. From Plaridel Town Proper travel West until reaching the boundary of Lalangan, then travel South untilreaching the barangay hall of Lalangan. BLN-3364 is located 300 m. NW of the Lalangan Barangay Hall and 200 m. NW of BLN-3363. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail on a 0.20 m. x 0.20 m. 1.00 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscription \"BLN-3364; 2011; LMS III\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.87645593, '14° 52\' 35.241340\"', 120.84632590, '120° 50\' 46.773090\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.3250, 0.0000, '3', 9.2352, 268283.83900, 1645780.00000, '51', 14.87798223, '14° 52\' 40.736020\"', 120.84497280, '120° 50\' 41.901960\"', 8.9591, 1645311.00200, 483317.92200, '3', 268136.73700, 1645849.30300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
