(2979, 'BLN-3405 (BBM-5)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'PLARIDEL', 'BULIHAN', 2009, 14.89104677, '14° 53\' 27.768372\"', 120.89694200, '120° 53\' 48.991200\"', 'BLN-3405 From the town proper of Plaridel take national road leading to bustos then turn right to province road going to Balagtas. upon reaching the welcome arch of Brgy. Pulilan turn right to Narra road and take a walk towards riceland. Passing through some private properties monument is in the middle of ricefield about 300, 400m. From Narra road monument is a standard size BBM.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.89104677, '14° 53\' 27.768360\"', 120.89694200, '120° 53\' 48.991110\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.9120, 0.0000, '4', 11.4576, 273747.07730, 1647342.76400, '51', 14.89257287, '14° 53\' 33.262330\"', 120.89558930, '120° 53\' 44.121480\"', 11.4650, 1646922.08600, 488765.39800, '3', 273600.06900, 1647411.91600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(2980, 'BLN-3406 (BBM-8)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'PLARIDEL', 'BINTOG', 2009, 14.89399669, '14° 53\' 38.388084\"', 120.88899720, '120° 53\' 20.389920\"', 'BLN-3406 From province road starting from welcome arc of Bintog turn right to first corner road then turn to corner road of Brgy. Hall then turn left to irrigation road, after passing by a poultry for about 150m walk eastward for about 250m on the ricefield. Mark is the head of a 30 inch copper nail centered on a 30x30x60 concrete monument inscription BBM 8.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.89399669, '14° 53\' 38.388070\"', 120.88899720, '120° 53\' 20.390020\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.0820, 0.0000, '4', 11.6930, 272895.11430, 1647677.31300, '51', 14.89552315, '14° 53\' 43.883350\"', 120.88764460, '120° 53\' 15.520630\"', 11.6630, 1647248.90900, 487910.71300, '3', 272748.11000, 1647746.49300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
