(3466, 'BLN-4', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'SAN MIGUEL', 'CALUMPANG', 1990, 15.18994423, '15° 11\' 23.799228\"', 121.04432040, '121° 2\' 39.553440\"', 'BLN-4 From the municipal building of San Miguel, travel N towards Gapan for 2 km. then turn right, travel E for 8 km. up to \"Mansion Hotel and Resort\" in Brgy. Tartaro. Travel further E for 300 m., and then turn left and travel N for 3 km. on a dirt road that traverses the abandoned Camp of Marines, Camp Tecson; passing by the public cemetery at the road intersection. The station is located on top of a concrete water tank of Aseabrid Farm Corp. Station mark is cross cut on top of a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. in dia. brass rod set in a drill hole; centered in a cement patty on top of a 14.80 m. high concrete water tank. Inscribed on top with station name. Reference mark; none.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.18994423, '15° 11\' 23.799210\"', 121.04432040, '121° 2\' 39.553390\"', 0.0000, '0', 121.0174, 0.0000, '1', 77.2976, 289901.13890, 1680274.62100, '51', 15.19148614, '15° 11\' 29.350100\"', 121.04297500, '121° 2\' 34.710020\"', 79.0801, 1679990.87600, 504617.67600, '3', 289755.25800, 1680343.56700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
