(3594, 'BLN-54', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'NORZAGARAY', 'SAN MATEO', 2007, 14.87771024, '14° 52\' 39.756864\"', 121.12911120, '121° 7\' 44.800320\"', 'BLN-54 From San Mateo Brgy. Hall, travel NW for about 300 m along the road going to Bitbit until reaching the San Mateo watertank at the right side of the road. Station is located at the top center of the cube-shaped watertank. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 0.2 m x 0.2 m cement putty with inscriptions BLN-54 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.87771024, '14° 52\' 39.756850\"', 121.12911120, '121° 7\' 44.800160\"', 0.0000, '0', 287.9950, 0.0000, '2', 243.2048, 298720.35110, 1645644.25000, '51', 14.87923023, '14° 52\' 45.228830\"', 121.12775860, '121° 7\' 39.930820\"', 244.9440, 1645447.21700, 513747.68300, '3', 298573.51200, 1645712.63300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3595, 'BLN-55', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'SAN RAFAEL', 'LICO', 2007, 14.95891146, '14° 57\' 32.081256\"', 120.95557980, '120° 57\' 20.087280\"', 'BLN-55 Is located on the concrete pavement of Bustos Dam, about 36 m E of the pavillion and about 24 m S of the concrete stairs. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 0.2 m x 0.2 m cement putty with inscriptions BLN-55 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.95891146, '14° 57\' 32.081240\"', 120.95557980, '120° 57\' 20.087430\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.8200, 0.0000, '2', 14.8537, 280126.92730, 1654794.30100, '51', 14.96044060, '14° 57\' 37.586160\"', 120.95422890, '120° 57\' 15.223880\"', 15.4263, 1654428.59000, 495076.56700, '3', 279980.19700, 1654863.32600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jho', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3596, 'BLN-56', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'SAN ILDEFONSO', 'CASALAT', 2007, 15.02262531, '15° 1\' 21.451116\"', 121.05474650, '121° 3\' 17.087400\"', 'BLN-56 From San Ildefonos municipal hall travel for about 15 km SE towards Brgy. Casalat via Brgys. Alagao and Akle. Station is located within Casalat Elementary School, about 24 m SSW of the main gate and about 0.5 m E of the concrete fence. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete monument protruding about 20 cm above the ground with inscriptions BLN-56 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.02262531, '15° 1\' 21.451130\"', 121.05474650, '121° 3\' 17.087310\"', 0.0000, '0', 130.4460, 0.0000, '2', 86.4108, 290857.69890, 1661748.95300, '51', 15.02415631, '15° 1\' 26.962710\"', 121.05339720, '121° 3\' 12.229750\"', 87.9960, 1661478.08100, 505742.03500, '3', 290711.27000, 1661817.71400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3597, 'BLN-58', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'SAN ILDEFONSO', 'POBLACION', 2007, 15.07909812, '15° 4\' 44.753232\"', 120.94456960, '120° 56\' 40.450560\"', 'BLN-58 The station is located in San Ildefonso Elementary School North District, about 10 m S of Gusaling Gabaldon and about 6 m NE of the SW corner of Math area. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m x 1 m concrete monument flushed on the ground with inscriptions BLN-58 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.07909812, '15° 4\' 44.753230\"', 120.94456960, '120° 56\' 40.450540\"', 0.0000, '0', 66.2360, 0.0000, '2', 23.4136, 279066.05810, 1668105.90400, '51', 15.08063520, '15° 4\' 50.286720\"', 120.94322140, '120° 56\' 35.597150\"', 24.2180, 1667726.85400, 493895.95400, '3', 278919.71800, 1668175.07400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3598, 'BLN-59', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'SAN MIGUEL', 'POBLACION', 2007, 15.14312872, '15° 8\' 35.263392\"', 120.97490790, '120° 58\' 29.668440\"', 'BLN-59 IS LOCATED AT SAN MIGUEL ELEMENTARY SCHOOL, ABOUT 0.6 M E OF IT\'S FLAGPOLE. MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4 INCHES COPPER NAIL CENTERED ON A 30 CM X 30 CM CONCRETE PUTTY FLUSHED ON THE GROUND WITH INSCRIPTIONS BLN-59 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.14312872, '15° 8\' 35.263400\"', 120.97490790, '120° 58\' 29.668390\"', 0.0000, '0', 60.4130, 0.0000, '2', 17.3479, 282393.56740, 1675161.65900, '51', 15.14466921, '15° 8\' 40.809150\"', 120.97356130, '120° 58\' 24.820640\"', 18.5080, 1674810.83500, 497158.52800, '3', 282247.46900, 1675230.78800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3599, 'BLN-9', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'OBANDO', 'TAWIRAN', 2003, 14.74647604, '14° 44\' 47.313744\"', 120.91068140, '120° 54\' 38.453040\"', 'BLN-9 IS IN BRGY. TAWIRAN, MUNICIPALITY OF OBANDO, PROVINCE OF BULACAN.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.74647604, '14° 44\' 47.313750\"', 120.91068140, '120° 54\' 38.452950\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.0923, 0.0000, '3', 6.5576, 275076.49130, 1631329.63700, '51', 14.74799241, '14° 44\' 52.772680\"', 120.90932530, '120° 54\' 33.571180\"', 6.1960, 1630925.73800, 490236.92200, '3', 274929.01700, 1631398.59600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3600, 'BTN-1 (ORION 1903)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'ORION', 'DAANG PARE', 1903, 14.58372129, '14° 35\' 1.396644\"', 120.57596870, '120° 34\' 33.487320\"', 'BTN-1 Station is located on the highest point of a small hill locally known as \"Barbarin\". It could be reached by using motor vehicle for about 2 km. along the narrow gravel road on the western slope of the hill leading to Sitio Damulog of Brgy. Daang Pari; on to the highway near Km. 13, where the road branches off from the main highway at Barrio Pandan. A trail in the northeasterly direction through the mango and bamboo groves leads to the top of the hill. Approximately 4.6 km. from the town proper of Orion to the foot of Barbarin hill; and approximately 10 minutes walk from the goot of the hill to the station. Orion town proper is approximately 2 hours travel from Quezon City. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set 0.10 m. deep in a drilled hole in a rock, with non-standard cement putty as shown on the reverse side (rock is 0.90 m. above the ground). Reference mark is RM-6 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in a drilled hole in a rock, 0.30 m. in dia. and 0.20 m. above the ground. RM-7 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in a drilled hole in a rock 0.80 m. in dia. and 0.40 m. above the ground. RM-3 is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in a drilled hole in a rock 0.40 m. in dia. and 0.35 m. above the ground. RM 8 is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in a drilled hole in a rock, 0.30 m. in dia. and 0.15 m. above the ground.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.58372129, '14° 35\' 1.396650\"', 120.57596870, '120° 34\' 33.487480\"', 0.0000, '0', 194.6172, 0.0000, '1', 151.9868, 238832.72060, 1613676.23400, '51', 14.58523478, '14° 35\' 6.845220\"', 120.57460840, '120° 34\' 28.590220\"', 152.0720, 1612960.14600, 454163.24400, '3', 238684.40200, 1613746.14000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3601, 'BTN-13', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'LIMAY', 'LAMAO', 1993, 14.51400739, '14° 30\' 50.426604\"', 120.61102000, '120° 36\' 39.672000\"', 'BTN-13 Station is located at Lamao Pier approximately 600 meters from Bataan Expressway road junction leading to Bo. Lamao. It is about 124 m. from the pier\'s gate and 10.6 m. N of the SE corner of the small jetty at the south side of the pier. Station mark is a 3\" copper nail set flushed on center of a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty with inscription \" BTN-13, 1993, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.51400739, '14° 30\' 50.426600\"', 120.61102000, '120° 36\' 39.672100\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.0530, 0.0000, '3', 5.5351, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.51551564, '14° 30\' 55.856290\"', 120.60965800, '120° 36\' 34.768910\"', 5.2240, 1605240.00900, 457926.76200, '3', 242381.72300, 1605989.71600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1993-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2016-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3602, 'BTN-14', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'LIMAY', 'LAMAO', 1993, 14.51038458, '14° 30\' 37.384488\"', 120.61097960, '120° 36\' 39.526560\"', 'BTN-14 Station is located at Lamao Point about 500 meters south of Lamao Pier. It is about 35 m. south of the south bank of Lamao River mouth and 12.4 m SE and 9.6 m. NEE of the two nipa houses nearest corners respectively, located close to Lamao Point. Station mark is a 3\" copper nail set flushed on center of a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument with inscription \"BTN-14, 1993, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.51038458, '14° 30\' 37.384480\"', 120.61097960, '120° 36\' 39.526390\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.8390, 0.0000, '3', 0.3183, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.51189259, '14° 30\' 42.813330\"', 120.60961750, '120° 36\' 34.622890\"', 0.0001, 1604839.18300, 457921.70500, '3', 242373.15400, 1605588.76900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2016-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3603, 'BTN-16', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'BATANGAS II', 1993, 14.50219676, '14° 30\' 7.908336\"', 120.61062590, '120° 36\' 38.253240\"', 'BTN-16 Station is located on top of a small hill of Tobong Point and can be reached from Bataan Expressway thru the dirt road leading to Brgy. Pita,, Batangas II about 1.3 kms. from the expressway road junction. It is set on the concrete block which is part of the remains of Mr. Johnny Delgado\'s former rest house. It is 9.7 m. west of Tobong Point and can be accessed by passing thru the concrete stair of the hill. Station mark is a 3\" copper nail set flushed on center of a 30 cm x 30 cm cement putty with inscription \"BTN-16, 1993, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.50219676, '14° 30\' 7.908350\"', 120.61062590, '120° 36\' 38.253090\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.8620, 0.0000, '3', 0.3339, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.50370426, '14° 30\' 13.335330\"', 120.60926360, '120° 36\' 33.348890\"', 0.0010, 1603933.33600, 457882.01200, '3', 242325.51500, 1604682.89800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1993-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2016-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3604, 'BTN-17', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'SABANG', 1996, 14.70294826, '14° 42\' 10.613736\"', 120.27769930, '120° 16\' 39.717480\"', 'BTN-17 Station is located in Philippine Refugee Processing Center at barangay Sabang, Morong, Bataan. On the S side of the center\'s main asphalt road, about 58 meters SE of the Regional Resettlement Transit marker. Situated about 400 meters NE of the center\'s checkpoint and is 4.5 m. SE of the center of the road intersection. Mark is the center of the head of a 4 in. cu. nail set flushed and centered on a 0.30 m. x 0.30 m. concrete block with its top protruding 2 in. above the ground and inscripted \"NAMRIA, BTN-17, 1996.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.70294826, '14° 42\' 10.613740\"', 120.27769930, '120° 16\' 39.717580\"', 0.0000, '0', 101.6000, 0.0000, '3', 58.1639, 206835.47910, 1627239.81100, '51', 14.70447615, '14° 42\' 16.114130\"', 120.27634140, '120° 16\' 34.829000\"', 60.1219, 1626234.31500, 422065.34600, '3', 206687.29100, 1627310.80500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3605, 'BTN-18', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'SABANG', 1996, 14.70473959, '14° 42\' 17.062524\"', 120.28342650, '120° 17\' 0.335400\"', 'BTN-18 Station is in the island of Luzon, province of Bataan, municipality of Morong, barangay Sabang, inside the Philippine Refugee Processing Center. It is about 80 meters north northeast of Lowman Youth Center steel gate, 60 meters north of the intersection going to the Vietnamese Cemetery, on top of a concrete box culvert about 1.360 meters east of its west edge and about 9.00 meters northeast of another gate. Station mark is the center of a copper nail set flushed on a drilled hole on the concrete culvert with inscription. \"BTN-18, 1996, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.70473959, '14° 42\' 17.062530\"', 120.28342650, '120° 17\' 0.335250\"', 0.0000, '0', 107.2190, 0.0000, '3', 63.7410, 207455.02800, 1627430.69000, '51', 14.70626746, '14° 42\' 22.562870\"', 120.28206860, '120° 16\' 55.446850\"', 65.7320, 1626430.54000, 422682.79500, '3', 207306.85100, 1627501.66700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3606, 'BTN-19', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'SABANG', 1996, 14.70715489, '14° 42\' 25.757604\"', 120.28172360, '120° 16\' 54.204960\"', 'BTN-19 Station is located in the Philippine Refugee Processing Center compound at barangay Sabang, Morong, Bataan. On the N side of the asphalt main road, 7 meters NW of its centerline. Situated about 95 meters W of the ruined center\'s outpost, about 200 meters SW of the powerhouse, the first one to be found upon entering the premises and is about 1 km. away from checkpoint. Mark is the center of the head of a 4 in. cu. nail set flushed and centered on a 0.30 m. x 0.30 m. concrete block which is 2 in. protruding above the ground and is inscripted with \"BTN-19, NAMRIA, 1996\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.70715489, '14° 42\' 25.757600\"', 120.28172360, '120° 16\' 54.204920\"', 0.0000, '0', 108.4780, 0.0000, '3', 64.9941, 207274.75010, 1627700.30000, '51', 14.70868295, '14° 42\' 31.258630\"', 120.28036580, '120° 16\' 49.316720\"', 67.0021, 1626698.37700, 422500.25600, '3', 207126.57900, 1627771.28500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3607, 'BTN-20', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'SABANG', 1996, 14.70718359, '14° 42\' 25.860924\"', 120.28727450, '120° 17\' 14.188200\"', 'BTN-20 Station is in the island of Luzon, province of Bataan, municipality of Morong, barangay Sabang, inside the Philippine Refugee Processing Center. It is about 60 meters north of the United Evangelical Chapel, 50 meters north of a Chinese Marker, 11 meters east of street crossing set flushed on the concrete pavement of the concrete box culvert and 0.845 m. northwest of the southeast edge of the culvert. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set flushed in a drilled hole on the culvert with inscription, \"BTN - 20, 1996, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.70718359, '14° 42\' 25.860930\"', 120.28727450, '120° 17\' 14.188370\"', 0.0000, '0', 116.1230, 0.0000, '3', 72.6095, 207872.95110, 1627696.27500, '51', 14.70871153, '14° 42\' 31.361520\"', 120.28591670, '120° 17\' 9.300210\"', 74.6340, 1626699.64000, 423098.09500, '3', 207724.78600, 1627767.24200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3608, 'BTN-21', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'SABANG', 1996, 14.71247054, '14° 42\' 44.893944\"', 120.29022890, '120° 17\' 24.824040\"', 'BTN-21 Station is located in Philippine Refugee Processing Center compound at barangay Sabang, Morong, Bataan. To be found at the Freedom Plaza, on the concrete platform supporting the Carlos P. Romulo peace marker, 1 meter NW of the middle concrete support holding the metal marker. Marker is the center of the head of a 4 in. copper nail set flushed and centered on a cement putty with an inscription, \"BTN-21, NAMRIA, 1996\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.71247054, '14° 42\' 44.893930\"', 120.29022890, '120° 17\' 24.823940\"', 0.0000, '0', 127.3100, 0.0000, '3', 83.7589, 208198.33810, 1628277.76600, '51', 14.71399875, '14° 42\' 50.395490\"', 120.28887120, '120° 17\' 19.936250\"', 85.8286, 1627283.62100, 423418.12800, '3', 208050.19300, 1628348.72800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3609, 'BTN-22', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'SABANG', 1996, 14.71503425, '14° 42\' 54.123300\"', 120.30122270, '120° 18\' 4.401720\"', 'BTN-22 Station is located in the Philipiine Refugee Processing Center compound at barangay Sabang, Morong, Bataan. Situated about 100 meters E Lao Temple, 14 meters SE of the center of intersection of the compound\'s main asphalt road and the road leading to the partially ruined Community Sports and Socio Cultural Affairs Office. Mark is the center of the head fo a 4 in. cu. nail set flushed and centered on a 0.30 m. x 0.30 m. concrete block which is 2 in. protruding above the ground and inscripted with \"BTN-22, NAMRIA, 1996\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.71503425, '14° 42\' 54.123310\"', 120.30122270, '120° 18\' 4.401810\"', 0.0000, '0', 149.9900, 0.0000, '3', 106.3890, 209386.37850, 1628547.38300, '51', 14.71656238, '14° 42\' 59.624560\"', 120.29986510, '120° 17\' 59.514400\"', 108.4891, 1627563.56100, 424603.00300, '3', 209238.25300, 1628618.31000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3610, 'BTN-23', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'SABANG', 1996, 14.71956668, '14° 43\' 10.440048\"', 120.30147950, '120° 18\' 5.326200\"', 'BTN-23 Station is located in the Philippine Refugee Processing Center compound at barangay Sabang, Morong, Bataan. Situated 0.80 m. E of the W side of the 1.83 m. x 6 m. concrete block covering of an open drainage canal, about 14 meters W of the asphalt road and between NBHD 1 and NBHD 3 refugees housing. Mark is the center of the head of a 4 in. cu. nail set flushed and centered on a cement putty with inscription, \"BTN-23, NAMRIA, 1996\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.71956668, '14° 43\' 10.440030\"', 120.30147950, '120° 18\' 5.326160\"', 0.0000, '0', 150.4880, 0.0000, '3', 106.8716, 209420.05410, 1629048.83300, '51', 14.72109508, '14° 43\' 15.942300\"', 120.30012200, '120° 18\' 0.439140\"', 108.9994, 1628064.98000, 424632.22300, '3', 209271.94400, 1629119.76300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3611, 'BTN-24', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'SABANG', 1996, 14.71845314, '14° 43\' 6.431304\"', 120.30801270, '120° 18\' 28.845720\"', 'BTN-24 Station is in the island of Luzon, province of Bataan, municipality of Morong, barangay Sabang. It is situated inside the Philippine Refugee Processing Center, on top of the slab roofing of a 24.27 m. x 112.80 m. x 4.0 meter high water reservoir, about 1.587 meters south of the northern edge, and 15.300 meters west of the eastern edge of the concrete reservoir. Mark is the center of the head of a 4\" copper nail set flushed in a drilled hole on the slab roof of the reservoir with inscription, \"BTN-24, 1996, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.71845314, '14° 43\' 6.431310\"', 120.30801270, '120° 18\' 28.845810\"', 0.0000, '0', 188.8630, 0.0000, '3', 145.2282, 210122.54260, 1628917.13500, '51', 14.71998133, '14° 43\' 11.932770\"', 120.30665520, '120° 18\' 23.958750\"', 147.3554, 1627939.57900, 425335.41800, '3', 209974.43500, 1628988.04200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3612, 'BTN-25', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'POBLACION', 1996, 14.67821838, '14° 40\' 41.586168\"', 120.26404770, '120° 15\' 50.571720\"', 'BTN-25 Station is in the island of Luzon, province of Bataan, municipality of Morong, barangay Puerte. It is situated on top of the concrete walkway of PAGSAKIAN Bridge (2-175), about 0.82 m. east of the northwest edge of the bridge, about 200 meters west of Morong municipal hall, 50 meters north east of a wooden bridge, 0.46 meter below the bridge paraphet and 0.30 m. above the asphalt pavement. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set flushed in the concrete walkway with inscription, \"BTN-25, 1996, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.67821838, '14° 40\' 41.586170\"', 120.26404770, '120° 15\' 50.571600\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.3390, 0.0000, '3', 7.1409, 205331.17350, 1624519.71100, '51', 14.67974500, '14° 40\' 47.081990\"', 120.26268910, '120° 15\' 45.680810\"', 8.8230, 1623502.77100, 420586.05800, '3', 205182.88800, 1624590.72800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3613, 'BTN-26', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'NAGBALAYONG', 1996, 14.67434082, '14° 40\' 27.626952\"', 120.27547350, '120° 16\' 31.704600\"', 'BTN-26 Station is in the island of Luzon, province of Bataan, municipality of Morong, barangay Nagbalayong. It is about 600 meters northeast of the WELCOME sign, 4.60 meters northeast of the centerline of the highway, on top of the walkway of PAGSAKIAN bridge (KM 173.43) which is across the boundary creek of Poblacion and barangay Nagbalayong, 60 cm. from the south east edge and 54 cm. from the southeast edge of the walkway. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed with concrete walkway with inscription, PC&GS, BA-163, 1987\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.67434082, '14° 40\' 27.626950\"', 120.27547350, '120° 16\' 31.704480\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.8100, 0.0000, '3', 7.5678, 206557.40020, 1624075.54100, '51', 14.67586693, '14° 40\' 33.120950\"', 120.27411480, '120° 16\' 26.813420\"', 9.2556, 1623069.71300, 421815.37500, '3', 206409.11200, 1624146.51800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `hgcp_stations_new` (`id`, `station_name`, `island_group`, `region`, `province`, `city_or_municipality`, `barangay`, `year_established`, `latitude`, `latitude_dms`, `longitude`, `longitude_dms`, `description`, `year_surveyed`, `project`, `epoch`, `latitude_wgs84`, `latitude_wgs84_dms`, `longitude_wgs84`, `longitude_wgs84_dms`, `error_ellipse`, `accuracy_class`, `ellipsoidal_ht_wgs84`, `height_error`, `order_of_accuracy_wgs84`, `egm2008_elevation`, `utm_x_wgs84`, `utm_y_wgs84`, `utm_zone_wgs84`, `latitude_prs92`, `latitude_prs92_dms`, `longitude_prs92`, `longitude_prs92_dms`, `ellipsoidal_ht_prs92`, `northing_ptm`, `easting_ptm`, `ptm_zone`, `utm_x_prs92`, `utm_y_prs92`, `utm_zone_prs92`, `latitude_itrf`, `latitude_itrf_dms`, `longitude_itrf`, `longitude_itrf_dms`, `error_ellipse_itrf`, `ellipsoidal_ht_itrf`, `height_error_itrf`, `year_computed`, `encoder`, `date_updated`, `reference_file`) VALUES
(3614, 'BTN-27', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'IPAG', 1998, 14.41761228, '14° 25\' 3.404208\"', 120.49207650, '120° 29\' 31.475400\"', 'BTN-27 It is located on an elevated ground NE of the MAFSA-PNP firing range (formerly-Camp of Presidential Guard of Marcos), about 0.50 km. E of Talaga Beach. It is situated on a cylindrical concrete pedestal, about 1.50 m in dia. and 0.30 m. high with a cylindrical base footing of about 3.20 m. in dia. and 0.40 m. high. Mark is a round gash made by a star drilled at the top center of an octagonal steel plate about 7.0 mm thick measuring 28 cm x 28 cm cemented on top of the cylindrical pedestal protruding about 5.0 cm above the top surface. \"BTN-27, 1998\" was inscripted at the surface near the plate.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.41761228, '14° 25\' 3.404197\"', 120.49207650, '120° 29\' 31.475280\"', 0.0000, '0', 102.4100, 0.0000, '3', 59.7296, 229587.44780, 1595387.19300, '51', 14.41911696, '14° 25\' 8.821050\"', 120.49071200, '120° 29\' 26.563340\"', 59.5989, 1594600.10900, 445082.15100, '3', 229438.49400, 1595457.22000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1998-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3615, 'BTN-28', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'MALIGAYA', 2001, 14.43558962, '14° 26\' 8.122632\"', 120.49659070, '120° 29\' 47.726520\"', 'BTN-28 Is in the island of Luzon, province of Bataan, municipality of Mariveles, barangay Maligaya, inside the compound of the Jet Ferry Terminal landing, about 500 m. S of the Bataan Economic Zone Building. The station is about 30 m. S of the Jet Ferry Technical Building, 6.5 m. from the W side of the landing and about 2.12 m. from the S side of the landing. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set flushed on the concrete pavement with cement putty and inscribed with \"BTN-28, 2001, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.43558962, '14° 26\' 8.122620\"', 120.49659070, '120° 29\' 47.726430\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.3710, 0.0000, '2', 5.6129, 230096.13380, 1597371.83700, '51', 14.43709537, '14° 26\' 13.543340\"', 120.49522670, '120° 29\' 42.816010\"', 5.5996, 1596588.08100, 445573.35300, '3', 229947.24400, 1597441.86700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3616, 'BTN-3', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'MALIGAYA', 1991, 14.44232382, '14° 26\' 32.365752\"', 120.49860440, '120° 29\' 54.975840\"', 'BTN-3 Is in the island of Luzon, province of Bataan, municipality of Mariveles, inside the compound of the Bataan Export Processing Zone. It is located on the rooftop of Hilltop Hotel, situated at the fourth concrete roofing, right of the entrance door when facing the facade of the hotel. Mark is a 1.5 cm. brass rod set flushed about 0.1 m. from the edge of the concrete roof with cement putty, with inscriptions \"BTN-3, 1991, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.44232382, '14° 26\' 32.365750\"', 120.49860440, '120° 29\' 54.975780\"', 0.0000, '0', 107.2100, 0.0000, '1', 64.4236, 230321.48230, 1598114.89300, '51', 14.44382995, '14° 26\' 37.787820\"', 120.49724060, '120° 29\' 50.065980\"', 64.4528, 1597332.68700, 445792.13300, '3', 230172.61800, 1598184.92100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3617, 'BTN-3001', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'ABUCAY', 'GABON', 2007, 14.71148973, '14° 42\' 41.363028\"', 120.51474060, '120° 30\' 53.066160\"', 'BTN-3001 From San Fernando City proper, travel for about 1 hr to reach Brgy. Gabon. Station is located at the intersection of the roads going to Letran College, Manila, Balanga and Abucay town proper. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty flushed on the ground with inscriptions BTN-3001 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.71148973, '14° 42\' 41.363020\"', 120.51474060, '120° 30\' 53.066150\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.7560, 0.0000, '3', 28.9677, 232387.58090, 1627890.48100, '51', 14.71301285, '14° 42\' 46.846250\"', 120.51338320, '120° 30\' 48.179400\"', 29.7250, 1627110.35200, 447596.34500, '3', 232239.63300, 1627960.70900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3618, 'BTN-3002', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'ORION', 'ARELLANO', 2007, 14.62126943, '14° 37\' 16.569948\"', 120.57691800, '120° 34\' 36.904800\"', 'BTN-3002 Is located at Orion town plaza, E part of Orion Municipal hall. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty flushed on the ground, with inscriptions BTN-3002 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.62126943, '14° 37\' 16.569950\"', 120.57691800, '120° 34\' 36.904820\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.4600, 0.0000, '3', 4.9451, 238979.38770, 1617831.25600, '51', 14.62278536, '14° 37\' 22.027310\"', 120.57555850, '120° 34\' 32.010620\"', 5.0193, 1617114.39100, 454273.38300, '3', 238831.19200, 1617901.19900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3619, 'BTN-3003', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'MT. VIEW', 2007, 14.45483693, '14° 27\' 17.412948\"', 120.57119100, '120° 34\' 16.287600\"', 'BTN-3003 Is located along the national highway at Northwing, NE of Golden Heights Subdivision and the waiting shed, approximately 30 m E of another waiting shed, about 40 m NW of Iglesia ni Cristo Church and about 50 m NW of Mt. View Brgy. Hall. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscriptions BTN-3003 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.45483693, '14° 27\' 17.412940\"', 120.57119100, '120° 34\' 16.287440\"', 0.0000, '0', 115.3920, 0.0000, '3', 72.7247, 238165.98220, 1599415.85900, '51', 14.45634223, '14° 27\' 22.832010\"', 120.56982750, '120° 34\' 11.379100\"', 72.4930, 1598701.08100, 453621.24500, '3', 238017.22700, 1599485.66100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3620, 'BTN-3004', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'BALON-ANITO', 2007, 14.44049290, '14° 26\' 25.774440\"', 120.45533820, '120° 27\' 19.217520\"', 'BTN-3004 From Mariveles Municipal Hall, travel along the road going to Porto Del Sur until reaching the rotonda at Brgy. Balon. Travel straight ahead until reaching the fifth island from the circle. Station is located on the W end of the island, about 2 m E from the said end, approximately 1 m E from the concrete footing of the lamp post and about 15 m S of the abandoned concrete house. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscriptions BTN-3004 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.44049290, '14° 26\' 25.774430\"', 120.45533820, '120° 27\' 19.217600\"', 0.0000, '0', 85.2800, 0.0000, '3', 42.5253, 225651.97730, 1597963.51100, '51', 14.44199989, '14° 26\' 31.199610\"', 120.45397430, '120° 27\' 14.307430\"', 42.6232, 1597140.86700, 441126.53400, '3', 225503.06700, 1598033.68000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3621, 'BTN-3005', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'PILAR', 'DIWA', 2007, 14.63154501, '14° 37\' 53.562036\"', 120.50358180, '120° 30\' 12.894480\"', 'BTN-3005 Is located on the bridge which is the boundary of Brgys. Liyang and Diwa in Pilar. It is situated on the SE end of the bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty flushed on the ground with inscriptions DA 97 1986 PUG 8.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.63154501, '14° 37\' 53.562040\"', 120.50358180, '120° 30\' 12.894580\"', 0.0000, '0', 76.3280, 0.0000, '3', 33.3757, 231087.62110, 1619054.40400, '51', 14.63306324, '14° 37\' 59.027680\"', 120.50222250, '120° 30\' 8.000930\"', 34.0954, 1618267.55700, 446374.96100, '3', 230939.39500, 1619124.59500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2014-01-01', 'jho', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3622, 'BTN-3006', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'BAGAC', 'BANAWANG', 2007, 14.60975086, '14° 36\' 35.103096\"', 120.38976030, '120° 23\' 23.137080\"', 'BTN-3006 Is located in Brgy. Banawang on the SW corner of Limutan bridge, the second of the three concrete bridges along the Bagac-Morong National road of the said barangay. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty flushed on the ground surface with inscriptions BTN-3006 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.60975086, '14° 36\' 35.103090\"', 120.38976030, '120° 23\' 23.137140\"', 0.0000, '0', 61.8950, 0.0000, '3', 18.6205, 218791.79700, 1616779.94900, '51', 14.61127025, '14° 36\' 40.572900\"', 120.38840030, '120° 23\' 18.241090\"', 19.8780, 1615886.39800, 434106.15100, '3', 218643.39500, 1616850.49100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3623, 'BTN-3008', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'DINALUPIHAN', 'SAN SIMON', 2008, 14.91962686, '14° 55\' 10.656696\"', 120.46983200, '120° 28\' 11.395200\"', 'BTN-3008 From Dinalupihan proper, travel N direction along Dinalupihan-Floridablanca Highway for about 6.5 Km. up to Brgy. San Simoun junction, at the junction take the NW road leading to the station for about 1.2 Km.. Station is situated at Brgy. San Simoun, along the brgy. road approx. 300 m W of BTN-3007. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail flushed in a cement block 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm embedded 80 cm in the ground with inscriptions \"BTN-3008, 2008, NAMRIA\". The monument is made 20 cm above the ground surface with reference mark 1, 2, and 3. RM-1 = 100 m S across the road of the mango tree. RM-2 = 5 m S parallel of the brgy. road. RM-3 = 300 m W of BTN-3007.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.91962686, '14° 55\' 10.656680\"', 120.46983200, '120° 28\' 11.395060\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.4390, 0.0000, '4', 21.3099, 227809.43420, 1650984.47000, '51', 14.92116433, '14° 55\' 16.191580\"', 120.46847940, '120° 28\' 6.525820\"', 23.1140, 1650150.99900, 442815.18900, '3', 227662.14500, 1651055.03600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3624, 'BTN-3009', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'DINALUPIHAN', 'DALAO', 2008, 14.90387670, '14° 54\' 13.956120\"', 120.44423870, '120° 26\' 39.259320\"', 'BTN-3009 From Dinalupihan proper, travel N direction along the Nat\'l Road towards Floridablanca for about 2.3 Km., up to Brgy. San Jose junction. Upon reaching Brgy. San Jose, travel NW direction on the road leading to Brgy. Pita, before reaching Brgy. Pita there is junction going to Brgy. Dalao, travel NW direction until reaching Brgy. Dalao for about 900 m. Station is situated beside the sugarcane plantation about 1 Km. NW of Brgy. Dalao proper. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail flushed in a cement block 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm embedded 80 cm in the ground with inscriptions \"BTN-3009, 2008, NAMRIA\". The monument is made 20 cm above the ground surface with reference mark 1, 2, and 3. RM-1 = 20 m SE of nipa house. RM-2 = 5 m S parallel of the brgy. road. RM-3 = 300 m W of BTN-3010.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.90387670, '14° 54\' 13.956110\"', 120.44423870, '120° 26\' 39.259420\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.2170, 0.0000, '4', 25.9047, 225034.54990, 1649272.43300, '51', 14.90541373, '14° 54\' 19.489440\"', 120.44288580, '120° 26\' 34.388720\"', 27.9100, 1648415.07900, 440057.20600, '3', 224887.18500, 1649343.06800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
