(3656, 'BTN-3043', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'SAMAL', 'GUGO', 2008, 14.76453519, '14° 45\' 52.326684\"', 120.48346590, '120° 29\' 0.477240\"', 'BTN-3043 From Samal town proper, travel W direction along the brgy. road leading to Brgy. Gugo at Roman Highway for about 5 Km.. At Roman Highway, Brgy. Gugo junction, travel W bound to B.N.A.S. for about 1.8 Km. then turn N direction at the intersection and travel for about 950 m until reaching the station. Station is situated beside the box culvert along the brgy. road. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail flushed in a cement block 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm embedded 80 cm in the ground with inscriptions \"BTN-3043, 2008, NAMRIA\". The monument is made 20 cm above the ground surface with reference mark 1, 2, 3, and 4. RM-1 = E side of the box culvert. RM-2 = 15 m W of nipa house. RM-3 = 5 m S parallel of the road centerline. RM-4 = 300 m NE of BTN-3044.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.76453519, '14° 45\' 52.326670\"', 120.48346590, '120° 29\' 0.477400\"', 0.0000, '0', 168.9650, 0.0000, '4', 125.9708, 229083.69640, 1633799.74800, '51', 14.76606240, '14° 45\' 57.824630\"', 120.48210970, '120° 28\' 55.595060\"', 127.1615, 1632987.16400, 444241.93700, '3', 228935.90000, 1633870.12500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
