(3734, 'BTN-3126', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'BALON-ANITO', 2008, 14.44451993, '14° 26\' 40.271748\"', 120.46032770, '120° 27\' 37.179720\"', 'BTN-3126 From Mariveles town proper, travel direction bound to Brgy. Balon for about 6 Km. until reaching rotonda. At rotonda turn W travel for about 400 m where the station is located. Station is situated at the center island of the road 1 m S of the 3rd intersection. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail flushed in a cement block 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm embedded 1 m in the ground with inscriptions \"BTN-3126, 2008, NAMRIA\". The monument is made 20 cm above the ground surface with reference mark 1, 2, and 3. RM-1 = 1 m S 3rd intersection. RM-2 = 300 m N of BTN-3125. RM-3 = 400 m N of rotonda.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.44451993, '14° 26\' 40.271760\"', 120.46032770, '120° 27\' 37.179820\"', 0.0000, '0', 121.4640, 0.0000, '4', 78.6815, 226195.15400, 1598403.32400, '51', 14.44602706, '14° 26\' 45.697410\"', 120.45896390, '120° 27\' 32.270080\"', 78.8060, 1597585.14300, 441665.58800, '3', 226046.26300, 1598473.47800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
