(3736, 'BTN-3128', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'CABCABEN', 2008, 14.44617375, '14° 26\' 46.225500\"', 120.58140840, '120° 34\' 53.070240\"', 'From mariveles town proper, travel ne direction bound to balanga, travel for about 14 km. Until reaching brgy. Cabcaben junction upon reaching brgy. Cabcaben junction turn se direction travel for about 700 m until reaching mt. View resort subd. Junction. Upon reaching the subd. Turn se direction and travel following the road direction for about 900 m until reaching the corner turn to nw direction. Station is situated 10 m nw of the road. Mark is the head of a 4 in. Copper nail flushed in a cement block 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm embedded 1 m in the ground with inscriptions \"btn-3128, 2008, namria\". The monument is made 20 cm above the ground surface with reference mark 1, 2, and 3. Rm-1 = 20 m se of a concrete electrical post. Rm-2 = 4 m sw of a wooden electrical post. Rm-3 = 1 m nw of ipil-ipil tree.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.44617375, '14° 26\' 46.225510\"', 120.58140840, '120° 34\' 53.070200\"', 0.0000, '0', 74.5080, 0.0000, '4', 31.8758, 239257.92790, 1598445.32200, '51', 14.44767828, '14° 26\' 51.641790\"', 120.58004480, '120° 34\' 48.161100\"', 31.5596, 1597740.51100, 454721.07200, '3', 239109.15100, 1598515.08400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(3737, 'BTN-3129', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'CABCABEN', 2008, 14.44413484, '14° 26\' 38.885424\"', 120.58333540, '120° 35\' 0.007440\"', 'FROM MARIVELES TOWN PROPER, TRAVEL NE DIRECTION BOUND TO BALANGA, TRAVEL FOR ABOUT 14 KM. UNTIL REACHING BRGY. CABCABEN JUNCTION. UPON REACHING BRGY. CABCABEN JUNCTION TURN SE DIRECTION TRAVEL FOR ABOUT 700 M UNTIL REACHING MT. VIEW RESORT SUBD. JUNCTION. UPON REACHING THE SUBD. TURN SE DIRECTION AND TRAVEL FOLLOWING THE ROAD DIRECTION FOR ABOUT 900 M UNTIL REACHING THE CORNER TURN TO NW DIRECTION THEN TRAVEL FOR ABOUT 300 M UNTIL REACHING THE ROAD CORNER TURN TO NE DIRECTION. STATION IS SITUATED 300 M NW OF BTN-3128. MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4 IN. COPPER NAIL FLUSHED IN A CEMENT BLOCK 20 CM X 20 CM X 100 CM EMBEDDED 1 M IN THE GROUND WITH INSCRIPTIONS \"BTN-3129, 2008, NAMRIA\". THE MONUMENT IS MADE 20 CM ABOVE THE GROUND SURFACE WITH REFERENCE MARK 1 AND 2. RM-1 = 7 M SE OF ELECTRICAL POST. RM-2 = 5 M SW OF THE ROAD CENTERLINE.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.44413484, '14° 26\' 38.885420\"', 120.58333540, '120° 35\' 0.007480\"', 0.0000, '0', 67.9360, 0.0000, '4', 25.3096, 239463.40780, 1598217.45300, '51', 14.44563919, '14° 26\' 44.301080\"', 120.58197170, '120° 34\' 55.098210\"', 24.9771, 1597514.53900, 454928.42800, '3', 239314.62600, 1598287.20800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
