(4111, 'BTN-35', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'LIMAY', 'DUALE', 2014, 14.55903506, '14° 33\' 32.526216\"', 120.58900990, '120° 35\' 20.435640\"', 'BTN-35 To reach the station from Limay town proper, travel SW towards Brgy. Duale for about 750 m. crossing Mariveles-Dinalupihan Highway. Upon crossing the highway, a steel fabricated sign identifying the said barangay is visible to which an overpass is prominent from this point. Head further E 50 m. along the barangay road until reaching the first intersecting road to a subdivision, turn left and locate the station on the E sidewalkk 5 m. from the corner. Station is located 40 m. E of the E end of the overpass and 120 m. NW of Shelltex gasoline station. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail centered and embbedded on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscription \"BTN-35, 2004, NAMRIA\". * Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, the surveyor must be equipped with a navigational grade GPS, topomap and compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.55903506, '14° 33\' 32.526200\"', 120.58900990, '120° 35\' 20.435750\"', 0.0000, '0', 67.4370, 0.0000, '2', 24.8416, 240209.57600, 1610928.85700, '51', 14.56054670, '14° 33\' 37.968120\"', 120.58764900, '120° 35\' 15.536310\"', 24.7898, 1610226.18400, 455563.46800, '3', 240061.18300, 1610998.70100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
