(4141, 'BTN-36', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'ORION', 'GENERAL LIM', 2004, 14.62078154, '14° 37\' 14.813544\"', 120.52711680, '120° 31\' 37.620480\"', 'BTN-36 To reach the station from the crossroad in Ala-uli, municipality of Pilar, travel SW to W along the general direction of the Balanga-Bagac Highway for about 4 km. until reaching a barangay intersecting road which leads to the barangay proper of General Lim. Turn left and head S following the barangay road for about 1.5 km. passing by General Lim Elem. School until reaching the poultry farm lots in the said barangay. Station is situated on the W side of the road, about 100 m. S of the N poultry farm and 3 m. W of the centerline of the road. Mark is a 4 in. copper nail centered in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement monument, with inscription \"BTN-36, 2004, NAMRIA\". *Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, the surveyor must be equipped with a navigational grade GPS, topomap and compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.62078154, '14° 37\' 14.813530\"', 120.52711680, '120° 31\' 37.620620\"', 0.0000, '0', 115.1310, 0.0000, '2', 72.3054, 233611.19220, 1617835.17700, '51', 14.62229854, '14° 37\' 20.274740\"', 120.52575730, '120° 31\' 32.726190\"', 72.8104, 1617071.15300, 448907.90200, '3', 233462.95200, 1617905.27900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2004-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4142, 'BTN-37', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'ALION', 2004, 14.49116301, '14° 29\' 28.186836\"', 120.57136430, '120° 34\' 16.911480\"', 'BTN-37 To reach the station from the main gate of Bataan Petro Chemical Corp. in Mariveles, locate an intersecting road from the national highway and travel W towards Brgy. Aleon. Thence, from the barangay hall locate Diversified Plastic Chemical Corp. compound to which a dirt road intersects this road and head for the mountain ranges. Follow the dirt road for a couple of hundred meters until reaching a Mango orchard farm. Station is located on the SE end of the orchard about 5 m. S of the centerline of the road. It is intervisible to BTN-38 about 200 m. N of the station. Mark is the head of a common wire nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument set protruding the grade line by 10 cm., with inscription \"BTN-37, 2004, NAMRIA\". *Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, the surveyor must be equipped with a navigational grade GPS, topomap of the area and compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.49116301, '14° 29\' 28.186850\"', 120.57136430, '120° 34\' 16.911620\"', 0.0000, '0', 212.3340, 0.0000, '3', 169.6207, 238227.30480, 1603436.48600, '51', 14.49267064, '14° 29\' 33.614300\"', 120.57000180, '120° 34\' 12.006420\"', 169.5375, 1602720.22500, 453647.57200, '3', 238078.67300, 1603506.32000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4143, 'BTN-38', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'ALION', 2004, 14.49066365, '14° 29\' 26.389140\"', 120.57304700, '120° 34\' 22.969200\"', 'BTN-38 To reach the station from the main gate of Bataan Petro Chemical Corp. in Mariveles, locate an intersecting road from the national highway and travel W towards Brgy. Aleon. Thence, from the barangay hall locate Diversified Plastic Chemical Corp. compound to which a dirt road intersects this road and head for the mountain ranges. Follow the dirt road for a couple of hundred meters until reaching a Mango orchard farm. Station is located on the NE end of the orchard about 8 m. S of the centerline of the road. It is intervisible to BTN-37 about 200 m. S of this station. Mark is the head of a common wire nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument set protruding the grade line by 10 cm., with inscription \"BTN-38, 2004, NAMRIA\". *Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, the surveyor must be equipped with a navigational grade GPS, topomap of the area and compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.49066365, '14° 29\' 26.389140\"', 120.57304700, '120° 34\' 22.969350\"', 0.0000, '0', 208.4320, 0.0000, '3', 165.7273, 238408.18580, 1603379.28800, '51', 14.49217121, '14° 29\' 31.816340\"', 120.57168450, '120° 34\' 18.064110\"', 165.6300, 1602664.63000, 453828.86000, '3', 238259.55300, 1603449.11600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4144, 'BTN-39', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'LIMAY', 'DUALE', 2014, 14.55806785, '14° 33\' 29.044260\"', 120.58890520, '120° 35\' 20.058720\"', 'BTN-39 To reach the station from Limay town proper, travel SW towards Brgy. Duale for about 750 m. crossing Mariveles-Dinalupihan Highway. Before crossing the highway, a steel fabricated sign identifying the said barangay is visible to which an overpass is prominent from this point. Head further E 50 m. along the barangay road until reaching the first intersecting road leading to a subdivision, turn left and proceed toward the opposite end of the road where the station is located. Station is located 50 m. E of Shelltex gasoline station, 150 m. SW of the overpass and 107 m. S of BTN-35. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail centered and embedded on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty set flushed on the concrete sidewalk set protruding 5 cm. above the surface, with inscription \"BTN-39, 2004, NAMRIA\". *Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, the surveyor must be equipped with a navigational grade GPS, topomap and compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.55806785, '14° 33\' 29.044260\"', 120.58890520, '120° 35\' 20.058620\"', 0.0000, '0', 65.5680, 0.0000, '3', 22.9702, 240197.14900, 1610821.92000, '51', 14.55957943, '14° 33\' 34.485960\"', 120.58754420, '120° 35\' 15.159100\"', 22.9183, 1610119.19100, 455551.98300, '3', 240048.75300, 1610891.76300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4145, 'BTN-40', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'SISIMAN', 2004, 14.45397153, '14° 27\' 14.297508\"', 120.52510710, '120° 31\' 30.385560\"', 'BTN-40 FROM MARIVELES TOWN PROPER, TRAVEL NE ALONG THE NATIONAL HIGHWAY FOR 7 KM. UNTIL REACHING KM. POST # 7. STATION IS SITUATED JUST ADJACENT TO THE SAID KM. POST. MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4\" COPPER NAIL CENTERED AND EMBEDDED ON A STANDARD CONCRETE MONUMENT, WITH INSCRIPTION \"BTN-40, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.45397153, '14° 27\' 14.297500\"', 120.52510710, '120° 31\' 30.385570\"', 0.0000, '0', 283.7770, 0.0000, '3', 240.9907, 233194.25190, 1599373.19600, '51', 14.45547778, '14° 27\' 19.719990\"', 120.52374360, '120° 31\' 25.477030\"', 240.9882, 1598615.25400, 448652.44500, '3', 233045.45500, 1599443.14500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'Mary', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
