(4147, 'BTN-42', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'BALON-ANITO', 2004, 14.46496236, '14° 27\' 53.864496\"', 120.46799620, '120° 28\' 4.786320\"', 'BTN-42 Is located inside the compound of the Mariveles Watershed Farmers Association (MAWAFAS) office, at the back of the Peoples Organization Bldg. It is about 1.2 km. from the pumping station of the Mariveles Water District. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"BTN-42 2004 DENR NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.46496236, '14° 27\' 53.864500\"', 120.46799620, '120° 28\' 4.786460\"', 0.0000, '0', 190.7730, 0.0000, '3', 147.8890, 227047.35780, 1600657.04900, '51', 14.46647063, '14° 27\' 59.294250\"', 120.46663290, '120° 27\' 59.878520\"', 148.1546, 1599845.00200, 442497.73700, '3', 226898.54300, 1600727.19700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4148, 'BTN-43', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'DINALUPIHAN', 'PITA', 2004, 14.89048086, '14° 53\' 25.731096\"', 120.44845930, '120° 26\' 54.453480\"', 'BTN-43 From the Dinalupihan town proper, travel W towards Brgy. Pita Sta. Lucia. It is about 1.9 km. from the intersection of the national road and the road leading to Floridablanca, Pampanga. Passing through the welcome arch of Brgy. Pita Sta. Lucia is a bridge. It is also situated at the NW end of the bridge. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"BTN-43 2004 NAMRIA. *Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, the surveyor must be equipped with a navigational grade GPS, a topomap and a compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.89048086, '14° 53\' 25.731090\"', 120.44845930, '120° 26\' 54.453570\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.9710, 0.0000, '3', 15.7337, 225471.90290, 1647784.31100, '51', 14.89201695, '14° 53\' 31.261020\"', 120.44710600, '120° 26\' 49.581700\"', 17.6145, 1646931.72200, 440507.62100, '3', 225324.49500, 1647854.92000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4149, 'BTN-44', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'DINALUPIHAN', 'PITA', 2004, 14.89147534, '14° 53\' 29.311224\"', 120.44495640, '120° 26\' 41.843040\"', 'BTN-44 From Dinalupihan town proper, travel W towards Brgy. Pita Sta. Lucia. It is about 1.9 km. from the intersection of the national road and the road leading to Floridablanca, Pampanga. Passing through the welcome arch of Brgy. Pita Sta. Lucia is a bridge, wherein BTN-43 is located. Station is located about 300 m. from BTN-43. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail embedded and centered in a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"BTN-44 2004 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.89147534, '14° 53\' 29.311220\"', 120.44495640, '120° 26\' 41.842870\"', 0.0000, '0', 60.9190, 0.0000, '3', 17.6482, 225096.05160, 1647898.72100, '51', 14.89301157, '14° 53\' 34.841660\"', 120.44360310, '120° 26\' 36.971070\"', 19.5739, 1647042.70500, 440130.96200, '3', 224948.64400, 1647969.34300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
