(4169, 'BTN-64', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'DINALUPIHAN', 'SAN PABLO', 2004, 14.85169614, '14° 51\' 6.106104\"', 120.37685910, '120° 22\' 36.692760\"', 'BTN-64 Is located at Brgy. San Pablo, Municipality of Dinalupihan. It is situated along the road leading to San Pablo Elem. School. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered in a 12 cm. x 12 cm. monument, with inscriptions \"BTN-64 2004 NAMRIA\". *Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, the surveyor must be equipped with a navigational grade GPS, a topomap and a compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.85169614, '14° 51\' 6.106110\"', 120.37685910, '120° 22\' 36.692800\"', 0.0000, '0', 82.3120, 0.0000, '3', 38.6065, 217713.09080, 1643580.17600, '51', 14.85323135, '14° 51\' 11.632850\"', 120.37550480, '120° 22\' 31.817320\"', 41.0180, 1642660.77300, 432790.94600, '3', 217565.49000, 1643650.98300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4170, 'BTN-65', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'DINALUPIHAN', 'SAN PABLO', 2004, 14.85124622, '14° 51\' 4.486392\"', 120.37382750, '120° 22\' 25.779000\"', 'BTN-65 Is located at Brgy. San Pablo, Municipality of Dinalupihan. It is situated along the road leading to San Pablo Elem. School. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered in a 12 cm. x 12 cm. monument, with inscriptions \"BTN-65 2004 NAMRIA\". *Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, the surveyor must be equipped with a navigational grade GPS, a topomap and a compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.85124622, '14° 51\' 4.486390\"', 120.37382750, '120° 22\' 25.778990\"', 0.0000, '0', 88.9240, 0.0000, '3', 45.2016, 217386.06120, 1643534.20300, '51', 14.85278146, '14° 51\' 10.013270\"', 120.37247320, '120° 22\' 20.903460\"', 47.6360, 1642611.91100, 432464.52600, '3', 217238.45600, 1643605.02000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4171, 'BTN-66', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'ABUCAY', 'GABON', 2004, 14.72715383, '14° 43\' 37.753788\"', 120.46822370, '120° 28\' 5.605320\"', 'BTN-66 From Abucay town proper, travel W along the general direction of the municipal road towards the Mariveles-Dinalupihan Highway. Thence, upon reaching the crossroad of the said thoroughfare, adjacent Abucay\'s Cafe, proceed W crossing the national highway along a dirt road which leads to Colegio San Juan de Letran about 5 mins. ride from the crossroad. Locate Gabon Elem. School further W and the irrigation canal which runs along the road. Station is situated 40 m. W of Gabon Elem. School and on the corner of the irrigation canal. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a concrete monument 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 70 cm. set protruding 20 cm. above the gradeline, with inscriptions \"BTN-66 2004 NAMRIA\". *Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, surveyors must be equipped with a navigational grade GPS, a compass and a topomap.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.72715383, '14° 43\' 37.753790\"', 120.46822370, '120° 28\' 5.605140\"', 0.0000, '0', 305.6030, 0.0000, '3', 262.4258, 227395.28970, 1629680.20200, '51', 14.72867895, '14° 43\' 43.244230\"', 120.46686660, '120° 28\' 0.719650\"', 263.7298, 1628854.94700, 442590.96100, '3', 227247.35700, 1629750.59000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4172, 'BTN-67', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'SABANG', 2007, 14.69809635, '14° 41\' 53.146860\"', 120.25476120, '120° 15\' 17.140320\"', 'BTN-67 Is located in Brgy. Sabang, 1 m N of the second bridge from the road junction going to the said Barangay proper Matico Creek. It is 4 m E of the centerline of the road leading to Olongapo City, Zambales. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete monument flushed on the ground with inscriptions BTN-67 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.69809635, '14° 41\' 53.146850\"', 120.25476120, '120° 15\' 17.140190\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.5520, 0.0000, '2', 10.2731, 204357.08100, 1626732.59800, '51', 14.69962445, '14° 41\' 58.648010\"', 120.25340310, '120° 15\' 12.251060\"', 12.1159, 1625705.55800, 419593.10000, '3', 204208.85500, 1626803.66400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4173, 'BTN-68', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'NAGBALAYONG', 2007, 14.64508082, '14° 38\' 42.290952\"', 120.32415220, '120° 19\' 26.947920\"', 'BTN-68 Is located outside the property of Bataan Nuclear Power Plant in Napot Point. It is situated on the N end of a box culvert, about 15 m E of the national highway leading to the Municipality of Bagac, 75 m S of km post 165 and about 200 m N of the main entrance of the said power plant. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm cement putty flushed on the ground with inscription BTN-68 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.64508082, '14° 38\' 42.290960\"', 120.32415220, '120° 19\' 26.948020\"', 0.0000, '0', 140.0480, 0.0000, '2', 96.7512, 211765.36220, 1620773.57200, '51', 14.64660394, '14° 38\' 47.774190\"', 120.32279300, '120° 19\' 22.054750\"', 98.2916, 1619815.77700, 427049.00300, '3', 211617.02200, 1620844.35900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4174, 'BTN-69', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'BIAAN', 2007, 14.47091226, '14° 28\' 15.284136\"', 120.39694370, '120° 23\' 48.997320\"', 'BTN-69 From Mariveles Municipal Hall, travel along the road going to Porto Del Sur. From Aplaya, travel by banca for about 45 minutes going to Aglaloma. From the shore, follow the pathway going to Sangalang residence. Station is located about 20 m N of the said residence, about 3 m N of the canal and about 5 m S of the barangay road. It is situated about 10 m S of the lot boundary monument owned by Felix Sangalang, Fernando and Domingo Malibiran. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete monument flushed on the ground with inscriptions BTN-69 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.47091226, '14° 28\' 15.284120\"', 120.39694370, '120° 23\' 48.997360\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.5770, 0.0000, '2', 10.8400, 219390.72190, 1601401.54900, '51', 14.47242254, '14° 28\' 20.721130\"', 120.39558040, '120° 23\' 44.089500\"', 11.1486, 1600522.50600, 434839.07200, '3', 219241.86000, 1601471.93800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4175, 'BTN-70', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'BATANGAS II', 2007, 14.48965869, '14° 29\' 22.771284\"', 120.60228470, '120° 36\' 8.224920\"', 'BTN-70 Is located along the national highway 20 m S from the pedestrian sign (1 km to Port Limao). It is situated NE of the hill and about 40 m N of the curve road with steel barriers. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete monument flushed on the ground BTN-70 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.48965869, '14° 29\' 22.771290\"', 120.60228470, '120° 36\' 8.224940\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.1860, 0.0000, '2', 25.6157, 241560.06470, 1603234.81600, '51', 14.49116556, '14° 29\' 28.196000\"', 120.60092210, '120° 36\' 3.319650\"', 25.3096, 1602547.67600, 456980.44400, '3', 241411.45200, 1603304.55200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4176, 'BTN-71', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'ORANI', 'MARIA FE', 2007, 14.79018966, '14° 47\' 24.682776\"', 120.53745520, '120° 32\' 14.838720\"', 'BTN-71 Is located in Brgy. Maria Fe, 30 m Sw of the Day Care Center, 20 m SE of the basketball court and 15 m NE of the chapel of the said barangay. It is also situated on the W edge of the concrete pavement used as volleyball court. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete monument flushed on the ground with inscriptions BTN-71 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.79018966, '14° 47\' 24.682770\"', 120.53745520, '120° 32\' 14.838550\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.4250, 0.0000, '2', 6.8921, 234930.19960, 1636575.05200, '51', 14.79171733, '14° 47\' 30.182390\"', 120.53609960, '120° 32\' 9.958600\"', 7.5630, 1635812.88000, 450060.67500, '3', 234782.53600, 1636645.27900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4177, 'BTN-72', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'HERMOSA', 'PANDATUNG', 2007, 14.83059328, '14° 49\' 50.135808\"', 120.46784490, '120° 28\' 4.241640\"', 'BTN-72 Is located in So. Sta. Maria, Pandatung, on the Y-intersection of the concrete barangay road and rough road leading to Brgy. Nazareno. It is 0.5 m E of the E end of the riprap and 4 m S of the centerline of the concrete road. Mark is the head of a 4 inches copper nail centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete monument flushed on the ground, with inscriptions BTN-72 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.83059328, '14° 49\' 50.135810\"', 120.46784490, '120° 28\' 4.241710\"', 0.0000, '0', 72.6820, 0.0000, '3', 29.6733, 227483.65950, 1641131.09300, '51', 14.83212510, '14° 49\' 55.650350\"', 120.46649020, '120° 27\' 59.364890\"', 31.1060, 1640300.21900, 442577.62500, '3', 227336.07000, 1641201.58300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4178, 'BTN-A', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'ORION', 'PUTING BUHANGIN', 2006, 14.58634792, '14° 35\' 10.852512\"', 120.59271500, '120° 35\' 33.774000\"', 'BTN-A Is located inside Orion Port, which is approx. 5 km. S of Orion Town Proper. It is situated 93 cm. from the E edge and 18 cm. from the S edge of the platform of the third bollard, counting from the SE corner of the port. It is elevated 27 cm. from the port\'s flooring. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in an 11 cm. x 11 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"BTN-A 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.58634792, '14° 35\' 10.852500\"', 120.59271500, '120° 35\' 33.774170\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.9380, 0.0000, '2', 5.4170, 240640.99660, 1613947.79000, '51', 14.58786124, '14° 35\' 16.300470\"', 120.59135470, '120° 35\' 28.877070\"', 5.3594, 1613247.41700, 455968.24500, '3', 240492.69900, 1614017.64800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
