(4179, 'BTN-B', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'ORION', 'PUTING BUHANGIN', 2006, 14.58698519, '14° 35\' 13.146684\"', 120.59219360, '120° 35\' 31.896960\"', 'BTN-B Is located inside Orion Port, Purok 2, Brgy. Puting Buhangin, approx. 5 km. S of Orion Town Proper. It is situated 3.23 m. from the N corner edge of the port, on top of the platform of the first bollard, counting from the NE corner of the port and elevated about 23 cm. from the port\'s flooring. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in an 11 cm. x 11 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"BTN-B 2006 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.58698519, '14° 35\' 13.146690\"', 120.59219360, '120° 35\' 31.896860\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.9850, 0.0000, '2', 5.4628, 240585.53120, 1614018.92300, '51', 14.58849857, '14° 35\' 18.594850\"', 120.59083330, '120° 35\' 26.999810\"', 5.4095, 1613318.02900, 455912.18400, '3', 240437.23500, 1614088.78300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4180, 'CTR-1 (NEJ)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'CAMPO TINIO', 2012, 15.49037093, '15° 29\' 25.335348\"', 121.03696700, '121° 2\' 13.081200\"', 'CTR 1 (NEJ) Station Mark is an iron spike centered in top of a 30x30x100 cms. Concrete monument set 60 cms. In the ground leaving a projection of 20cms. CTR 1 is about 5 meters from th round junction infront of the 7th ID Monument. From Cabanatuan City proper take N. Ecija-Aurora Rd. and travel from about 5.2 km. turn right on Bangad Ft. Magsaysay Road.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.49037093, '15° 29\' 25.335340\"', 121.03696700, '121° 2\' 13.081100\"', 0.0000, '0', 93.9540, 0.0000, '2', 50.3764, 289412.35200, 1713528.12600, '51', 15.49193212, '15° 29\' 30.955620\"', 121.03562860, '121° 2\' 8.263120\"', 52.9185, 1713232.17500, 503822.83800, '3', 289267.46200, 1713597.36700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4181, 'CTR-2 (NEJ)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'CAMPO TINIO', 2012, 15.48968946, '15° 29\' 22.882056\"', 121.03510520, '121° 2\' 6.378720\"', 'CTR-2 (NEJ) Station Mark is an iron spike centered in top of a 30x30x100 cms. Concrete monument set 60 cms. In the ground leaving a projection of 20cms. CTR 2 is about 5 meters from th round junction infront of the 7th ID Monument. From Cabanatuan City proper take N. Ecija-Aurora Rd. and travel from about 5.2 km. turn right on Bangad Ft. Magsaysay Road.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.48968946, '15° 29\' 22.882060\"', 121.03510520, '121° 2\' 6.378840\"', 0.0000, '0', 91.4450, 0.0000, '2', 47.8828, 289211.87230, 1713454.54100, '51', 15.49125065, '15° 29\' 28.502330\"', 121.03376690, '121° 2\' 1.560790\"', 50.4120, 1713156.74400, 503623.08900, '3', 289066.97800, 1713523.78700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4182, 'FMR-1 (NEJ)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF PALAYAN', 'BO. MILITAR', 2012, 15.42429072, '15° 25\' 27.446592\"', 121.08371550, '121° 5\' 1.375800\"', 'FMR-1 (NEJ) Station Mark is an iron spike centered in top of a 30x30x100 cms. Concrete monument set 60 cms. In the ground leaving a projection of 20cms. FMR 1 is about 5 meters from th round junction infront of the 7th ID Monument. From Cabanatuan City proper take N. Ecija-Aurora Rd. and travel from about 5.2 km. turn right on Bangad Ft. Magsaysay Road. and reached about 9.8 km. until reached kamagong bridge', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.42429072, '15° 25\' 27.446590\"', 121.08371550, '121° 5\' 1.375940\"', 0.0000, '0', 111.7790, 0.0000, '2', 67.8539, 294363.80820, 1706170.15700, '51', 15.42584668, '15° 25\' 33.048040\"', 121.08237570, '121° 4\' 56.552620\"', 70.4346, 1705921.75700, 508841.45300, '3', 294218.73900, 1706239.18800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4183, 'FMR-2 (NEJ)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF PALAYAN', 'BO. MILITAR', 2012, 15.42541305, '15° 25\' 31.486980\"', 121.08352410, '121° 5\' 0.686760\"', 'FMR-2 (NEJ) Station Mark is an iron spike centered in top of a 30x30x100 cms. Concrete monument set 60 cms. In the ground leaving a projection of 20cms. FMR 2 is located at the road gutter about 3 meters from the approached of Kamagong bridge. From Cabanatuan City proper take N. Ecija-Aurora Rd. and travel from about 5.2 km. turn right on Bangad Ft. Magsaysay Road. and reached about 9.8 km. until reached kamagong bridge', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.42541305, '15° 25\' 31.486970\"', 121.08352410, '121° 5\' 0.686910\"', 0.0000, '0', 105.4410, 0.0000, '2', 61.5170, 294344.36820, 1706294.53900, '51', 15.42696908, '15° 25\' 37.088700\"', 121.08218440, '121° 4\' 55.863680\"', 64.1004, 1706045.93400, 508820.86500, '3', 294199.30200, 1706363.57200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4184, 'MMA-3065', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'CITY OF SAN JOSE DEL MONTE', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2008, 14.81213926, '14° 48\' 43.701336\"', 121.12638080, '121° 7\' 34.970880\"', 'From Rodriguez Town Proper, in the province of Rizal, travel towards NW direction for about 6 KM then turn left and travel towards NW direction for about 1.7 KM until reaching municipality of San Jose Del Monte then turn right towards SE about 1 KM until reaching Brgy. San Isidro where the station is established. Mark is the center of a brass rod with cross-cut on top set flush at the center of a 20 x 20 x120 centimeter concrete monument with inscription \"MMA-3065, 2008, NAMRIA\". The station is located at Senator Manny Villar Property, about 6 meters east of the centerline of the road.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.81213926, '14° 48\' 43.701350\"', 121.12638080, '121° 7\' 34.970740\"', 0.0000, '0', 269.1979, 0.0000, '4', 224.4748, 298365.69890, 1638390.98200, '51', 14.81365515, '14° 48\' 49.158540\"', 121.12502660, '121° 7\' 30.095790\"', 225.9650, 1638192.10900, 513457.76300, '3', 298218.64000, 1638459.31800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4185, 'MMA-3066', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'CITY OF SAN JOSE DEL MONTE', 'TUNGKONG MANGGA', 2008, 14.80861706, '14° 48\' 31.021416\"', 121.12423490, '121° 7\' 27.245640\"', 'Mark is the center of a brass rod with cross-cut on top set flush at the center of a 20 x 20 x 120 centimeter concrete monument with inscription \"MMA-3066, 2008, NAMRIA\". The station is located at Manny Villar Property, about 3 meters SW of guard house. From Rodriguez Town Proper in the Province of Rizal, travel towards NW direction for about 6 KM, then turn left and travel towards NW direction for about 7.9 KM until reaching Municipality of Muzon Province of Bulacan. Turn right and continue to travel towards NE direction for about 1.7 KM until reaching Municipality of Del Monte then turn right towards SE about 1.3 KM until reaching Brgy. Tungko Mangga where the station is established.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.80861706, '14° 48\' 31.021410\"', 121.12423490, '121° 7\' 27.245790\"', 0.0000, '0', 252.4529, 0.0000, '4', 207.7538, 298131.43610, 1638003.16700, '51', 14.81013277, '14° 48\' 36.477970\"', 121.12288070, '121° 7\' 22.370520\"', 209.2150, 1637802.28100, 513226.99200, '3', 297984.36300, 1638071.50700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4186, 'NEJ-100 (NE-26)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'GENERAL LUNA', 2001, 15.70612814, '15° 42\' 22.061304\"', 121.18146680, '121° 10\' 53.280480\"', 'NEJ-100 (NE 26) To reach the station from Rizal town proper, travel southwestward along the general direction towards Bongabon until reaching brgy. Macapsing; turn left proceed northeastward passing by brgy. San Esteban until reaching Canaan East High School, turn right and continue travelling passing by Gen. Luna Brgy. Monument until reaching Mala Creek. Continue proceeding along Mala Creek and turn left on the dirt road towards the Espiritista Chapel. Station is located NE of chapel. It is situated on the left prominent hills in the said area, about 200 m. E of NE 25. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt centered and embedded on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete monument with inscriptions \"NE 26 DENR RIII\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.70612814, '15° 42\' 22.061300\"', 121.18146680, '121° 10\' 53.280600\"', 0.0000, '0', 185.6040, 0.0000, '3', 140.9214, 305122.32040, 1737266.74400, '51', 15.70769975, '15° 42\' 27.719100\"', 121.18013380, '121° 10\' 48.481730\"', 144.8599, 1737113.23300, 519307.61700, '3', 304978.27200, 1737335.70900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4187, 'NEJ-101 (NE-27)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'SANTA MONICA', 2001, 15.72107864, '15° 43\' 15.883104\"', 121.09084520, '121° 5\' 27.042720\"', 'NEJ-101 (NE 27) To reach the station from Rizal town proper, travel northwestward along the general direction towards San Jose City until reaching the irrigation canal in Sta. Monica passing by the bridge crossing the said canal and the spillway dam. Station is located along the national road about 2.0 km. from the town of Rizal. It is situated about 5.0 m. W from the centerline of the road and 10 m. W from the centerline of the canal. Note that the monument is place just adjacent to the concrete pavement of the highway. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt centered and embedded on a 12 x 12 sq. in. concrete monument with inscriptions \"NE 27 DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.72107864, '15° 43\' 15.883100\"', 121.09084520, '121° 5\' 27.042600\"', 0.0000, '0', 133.3830, 0.0000, '3', 89.1900, 295423.04040, 1739006.80500, '51', 15.72265320, '15° 43\' 21.551530\"', 121.08951240, '121° 5\' 22.244460\"', 92.9033, 1738761.55800, 509593.65800, '3', 295278.96300, 1739076.07500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4188, 'NEJ-102 (NE-28)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'SANTA MONICA', 2001, 15.72215622, '15° 43\' 19.762392\"', 121.08941360, '121° 5\' 21.888960\"', 'NEJ-102 (NE 28) To reach the station from Rizal town proper, travel northwestward along the general direction towards San Jose City for about 2 km. until reaching the irrigation canal W of the road passing 2 spillway dam. Station is located along the national road about 5 m. E of the road, 150 m. N of NE 27, about 100 m. S of the access road which leads parallel to the irrigation canal. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt embedded and centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete monument with inscription \"NE 28 DENR 3\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.72215622, '15° 43\' 19.762400\"', 121.08941360, '121° 5\' 21.888900\"', 0.0000, '0', 133.4960, 0.0000, '3', 89.3090, 295270.66700, 1739127.44200, '51', 15.72373089, '15° 43\' 25.431190\"', 121.08808080, '121° 5\' 17.090850\"', 93.0230, 1738880.73300, 509440.17800, '3', 295126.59300, 1739196.71800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4189, 'NEJ-103 (NE-29)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CARRANGLAN', 'JOSON', 2001, 15.94097647, '15° 56\' 27.515292\"', 121.01447700, '121° 0\' 52.117200\"', 'NEJ-103 (NE 29) To reach the station from San Jose City proper, travel northward ìto Sta. Fe, Nueva Vizcaya for about 20 km. until reaching brgy. ìDigdig, Carrangian. Turn right and continue travelling eastward ìalong the general direction to Carrangian until reaching the DENR ìCheckpoint, thence turn right and proceed southward until ìreaching the nipa hut and rice field just before reaching ìMaringalo River. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt ìcentered and embedded on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete monument ìwith inscription \"NE 29 DENR 3\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.94097647, '15° 56\' 27.515300\"', 121.01447700, '121° 0\' 52.117100\"', 0.0000, '0', 298.0900, 0.0000, '3', 253.5141, 287467.14450, 1763418.23300, '51', 15.94256649, '15° 56\' 33.239380\"', 121.01314920, '121° 0\' 47.337270\"', 258.4559, 1763091.94200, 501407.77100, '3', 287323.73900, 1763487.93600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4190, 'NEJ-104 (NE-30)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CARRANGLAN', 'JOSON', 2001, 15.93966942, '15° 56\' 22.809912\"', 121.01376170, '121° 0\' 49.542120\"', 'NEJ-104 (NE 30) To reach the station from San Jose City proper, travel northward ìto Sta. Fe, Nueva Vizcaya, until reaching brgy. Digdig, ìCarranglan. Turn right and proceed eastward along the general ìdirection until reaching the DENR Checkpoint in brgy. Sipanyan. ìTurn right and proceed southward until reaching the nipa hut and ìrice field just before reaching Maringalo River. Station is ìlocated about 30 m. W of the road, within the rice field W of the ìroad. About 200 m. SW from NE 29. DENR personnel at the ìcheckpoint is familiar to the station. Station mark is the head ìof a 3\" steel bolt centered and embedded on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. ìconcrete monument with inscription \"NE 30 DENR III\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.93966942, '15° 56\' 22.809900\"', 121.01376170, '121° 0\' 49.542100\"', 0.0000, '0', 296.1490, 0.0000, '3', 251.5812, 287389.17630, 1763274.31000, '51', 15.94125937, '15° 56\' 28.533740\"', 121.01243390, '121° 0\' 44.762150\"', 256.5126, 1762947.30900, 501331.19800, '3', 287245.76500, 1763344.01400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4191, 'NEJ-105 (NE-35)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN JOSE CITY', 'TAYABO', 2001, 15.86426917, '15° 51\' 51.369012\"', 121.01533510, '121° 0\' 55.206360\"', 'NEJ-105 (NE-35) To reach the station from San Jose City proper, travel northward ìtoward Sta. Fe along the general direction of the highway until ìreaching Lomboy Bukid, NE 35 is located along the highway about ì15 m west of kilometer post 170 and about 50 meters north from ìthe concrete landslide support, and about 200 meter south of the ìboundary marker of San Jose and Carranglan. Station mark is the ìhead of a 3 inches steel bolt centered and embedded on a 0.25 m x ì0.25 m concrete monument with inscription NE 35 DENR R3. WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 51 51.36900 E 121 0 55.20620 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 221.05400 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.86426917, '15° 51\' 51.369000\"', 121.01533510, '121° 0\' 55.206200\"', 0.0000, '0', 221.0540, 0.0000, '3', 176.8059, 287478.42080, 1754928.14400, '51', 15.86585429, '15° 51\' 57.075450\"', 121.01400550, '121° 0\' 50.419900\"', 181.1866, 1754604.04700, 501500.01500, '3', 287334.76000, 1754997.77000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1900-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4192, 'NEJ-106 (NE-36)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN JOSE CITY', 'TAYABO', 2001, 15.86612556, '15° 51\' 58.052016\"', 121.01456880, '121° 0\' 52.447680\"', 'NEJ-106 (NE-36) To reach the station from San Jose City proper, travel northward ìtowards Sta. Fe along the general direction of the highway until ìreaching barangay Lomboy Bukid. Station is located at the ìeastern portion of the highway near the boundary concrete marker ìof San Jose City and Carranglan. Mark is the head of a 3 inch ìsteel bolt embedded and centered on a 0.25 m x 0.25 m. concrete ìmonument with inscription NE 36 DENR-3.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.86612556, '15° 51\' 58.052000\"', 121.01456880, '121° 0\' 52.447600\"', 0.0000, '0', 222.3700, 0.0000, '3', 178.1172, 287398.28520, 1755134.36800, '51', 15.86771081, '15° 52\' 3.758930\"', 121.01323930, '121° 0\' 47.661450\"', 182.5101, 1754809.45800, 501417.93700, '3', 287254.63000, 1755203.99800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1900-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4193, 'NEJ-107 (NE-37)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN JOSE CITY', 'VILLA MARINA', 1900, 15.80978583, '15° 48\' 35.228988\"', 121.04347660, '121° 2\' 36.515760\"', 'NEJ-107 (NE-37) From San Jose City proper, travel eastward towards Rizal thence ìnortheastwards towards barangay Kalinawagan. Continue traveling ìeastwards towards Villa Marina until reaching barangay boundary ìmarker of Kaliwanagan and Villa Marina, NE 37 is located about ì5.0 m north of a the said market. Station mark is the head of a ì3 inches steel bolt centered and embedded on a 0.25 m x 0.25 m ìconcrete monument with inscription NE 37 DENR R111. WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 48 35.22900 E 121 2 36.51570 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 202.47200 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.80978583, '15° 48\' 35.229000\"', 121.04347660, '121° 2\' 36.515700\"', 0.0000, '0', 202.4720, 0.0000, '3', 158.3056, 290436.66620, 1748870.22800, '51', 15.81136701, '15° 48\' 40.921230\"', 121.04214580, '121° 2\' 31.724870\"', 162.3729, 1748575.68500, 504515.09400, '3', 290292.84600, 1748939.72600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1900-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4194, 'NEJ-108 (NE-38)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN JOSE CITY', 'VILLA MARINA', 1900, 15.80786314, '15° 48\' 28.307304\"', 121.04386160, '121° 2\' 37.901760\"', 'NEJ-108 (NE-38) From San Jose City proper, travel eastwards to Rizal thence to ìbarangay Kalinawagan. continue traveling along the barangay road ìtowards Villa Marina until reaching the barangay boundary marker ìof Kalinawagan and Villa Marina, NE 38 is located about 200 meter ìsouth of the said boundary marker. It is situated along the ìroad, east of which is a rice field and west are mango and ìvegetable plantation. Station mark is the head of a 3 inches ìsteel bolt centered and embedded on a 0.25 m x 0.25 m. concrete ìmonument with inscription NE 38 DENR R 111 WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 48 28.30730 E 121 2 37.90160 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 201.99000m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.80786314, '15° 48\' 28.307300\"', 121.04386160, '121° 2\' 37.901600\"', 0.0000, '0', 201.9900, 0.0000, '3', 157.8290, 290475.93450, 1748657.06400, '51', 15.80944418, '15° 48\' 33.999060\"', 121.04253070, '121° 2\' 33.110610\"', 161.8842, 1748362.94200, 504556.37400, '3', 290332.10800, 1748726.55900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1900-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4195, 'NEJ-109', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CUYAPO', 'DISTRICT VI', 2007, 15.77841082, '15° 46\' 42.278952\"', 120.66283820, '120° 39\' 46.217520\"', 'NEJ-109 Is located inside Cuyapo Mun. Auditorium. It is situated on the SE corner of the elevated concrete pavement and about 15 m. SW of the main entrance of the said auditorium. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"NEJ-109 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.77841082, '15° 46\' 42.278940\"', 120.66283820, '120° 39\' 46.217430\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.6150, 0.0000, '2', 27.8715, 249610.07190, 1745813.86600, '51', 15.77999843, '15° 46\' 47.994330\"', 120.66150610, '120° 39\' 41.421930\"', 30.3450, 1745133.59300, 463731.27300, '3', 249465.82700, 1745884.57000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4196, 'NEJ-110', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CUYAPO', 'BALOY', 2007, 15.80386228, '15° 48\' 13.904208\"', 120.77497540, '120° 46\' 29.911440\"', 'NEJ-110 Is located in the brgy. plaza, N of Baloy Elem. School. It is situated on top of an elevated platform, about 7 m. high, which is between the stage and the basketball court of the said plaza. It is also 1 m. from the E steel railing of the platform. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"NEJ-110 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.80386228, '15° 48\' 13.904210\"', 120.77497540, '120° 46\' 29.911500\"', 0.0000, '0', 127.7690, 0.0000, '2', 85.4494, 261658.90240, 1748500.74700, '51', 15.80544901, '15° 48\' 19.616440\"', 120.77364410, '120° 46\' 25.118720\"', 88.3030, 1747933.48300, 475749.65700, '3', 261514.83600, 1748571.10900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4197, 'NEJ-111', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CARRANGLAN', 'BURGOS', 2007, 16.02261441, '16° 1\' 21.411876\"', 121.10018300, '121° 6\' 0.658800\"', 'NEJ-111 From San Jose City, travel along the highway going to Carranglan until reaching Poblacion Carranglan. Turn left to the road across the mun. hall. Then turn left again upon reaching the crossing. Follow the road passing So. Butolan Proper, then turn right to a dirt road across the waiting shed until reaching the basketball court/solar dryer of So. San Luis. Turn left to the road parallel to Deugurug River. Follow the pathway until reaching the residence of a certain Lito Mathew. Station is located on the land owned by the Esteban Family. It is situated on the riverbank about 15 m. NW of the river, 4 m. SE of the rice paddy, about 40 m. E of Lito Mathew\'s residence and 40 m. S of a Mango tree. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. from the ground surface, with inscriptions \"NEJ-111 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.02261441, '16° 1\' 21.411860\"', 121.10018300, '121° 6\' 0.658880\"', 0.0000, '0', 347.3280, 0.0000, '2', 301.9301, 296726.67820, 1772367.30100, '51', 16.02420764, '16° 1\' 27.147520\"', 121.09885730, '121° 5\' 55.886430\"', 307.7330, 1772127.75300, 510579.48000, '3', 296583.61600, 1772436.79700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4198, 'NEJ-112', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'PANTABANGAN', 'CONVERSION', 2007, 15.89712180, '15° 53\' 49.638480\"', 121.12660880, '121° 7\' 35.791680\"', 'NEJ-112 From San Jose City, travel along the highway going to Carranglan. Upon reaching Poblacion Carranglan, travel straight ahead and follow the main road until reaching the welcome sign of Brgy. Conversion. Station is located on the brgy. plaza of Conversion, about 40 m. W from the road centerline. It is along the E side of the basketball open court, at the back of the SE concrete bench about 0.8 m. E from the N end of the bench. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. from the ground surface, with inscriptions \"NEJ-112 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89712180, '15° 53\' 49.638480\"', 121.12660880, '121° 7\' 35.791700\"', 0.0000, '0', 307.1670, 0.0000, '2', 262.2589, 299430.10350, 1758454.00300, '51', 15.89870661, '15° 53\' 55.343780\"', 121.12528020, '121° 7\' 31.008770\"', 267.1290, 1758242.98600, 513415.54700, '3', 299286.64500, 1758523.30700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4199, 'NEJ-113', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CARRANGLAN', 'PUNCAN', 2007, 15.90873967, '15° 54\' 31.462812\"', 120.98783670, '120° 59\' 16.212120\"', 'NEJ-113 From San Jose City, travel along the highway going to Carranglan until reaching Puncan Bridge I. Station is located on the NW end of the said bridge, about 0.5 m. SW from the headwall of the bridge and about 5 m. NE from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 15 cm. x 15 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"NEJ-113 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.90873967, '15° 54\' 31.462800\"', 120.98783670, '120° 59\' 16.212180\"', 0.0000, '0', 335.4900, 0.0000, '2', 291.1784, 284580.15040, 1759877.86400, '51', 15.91032824, '15° 54\' 37.181680\"', 120.98650820, '120° 59\' 11.429510\"', 295.8233, 1759524.90300, 498555.32300, '3', 284436.61600, 1759947.62400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4200, 'NEJ-114', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LUPAO', 'AGUPALO WESTE', 2007, 15.83699277, '15° 50\' 13.173972\"', 120.88628850, '120° 53\' 10.638600\"', 'NEJ-114 From Lupao Mun. Hall, travel going to Muñoz along the Lupao-Muñoz ìHighway until reaching the brgy. monument of Purok 2, Agupalo ìWest. Station is located along the NW side of the basketball ìcourt, SW of the highway. It is situated about 0.1 m. NW from the ìcenter of the NW side of the court and 30 m. NW of the said brgy. ìmonument. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a ì30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"NEJ-114 ì2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.83699277, '15° 50\' 13.173960\"', 120.88628850, '120° 53\' 10.638430\"', 0.0000, '0', 140.7950, 0.0000, '2', 97.5908, 273624.23450, 1752044.47200, '51', 15.83857912, '15° 50\' 18.884840\"', 120.88495810, '120° 53\' 5.849030\"', 101.1585, 1751589.49900, 487677.16100, '3', 273480.37200, 1752114.50300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4201, 'NEJ-115', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN JOSE CITY', 'SAN JUAN', 2007, 15.78315813, '15° 46\' 59.369268\"', 121.05367150, '121° 3\' 13.217400\"', 'NEJ-115 Is located on the SE corner of the lot owned by a certain Mario ìMatic of Zone 7, Brgy. San Juan. It is 7 m. N of the concrete ìroad leading to Pantabangan and situated on the intersection of ìthe road and the dirt road leading to Brgy. Villa Marina. Mark is ìthe head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 5 ìcm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"NEJ-115 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.78315813, '15° 46\' 59.369270\"', 121.05367150, '121° 3\' 13.217330\"', 0.0000, '0', 204.2450, 0.0000, '2', 160.1172, 291501.74260, 1745913.27700, '51', 15.78473741, '15° 47\' 5.054660\"', 121.05234010, '121° 3\' 8.424300\"', 164.0410, 1745629.49900, 505607.94400, '3', 291357.84200, 1745982.72000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jho', '2017-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4202, 'NEJ-116', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'PANTABANGAN', 'POBLACION EAST', 2007, 15.80670721, '15° 48\' 24.145956\"', 121.14500980, '121° 8\' 42.035280\"', 'NEJ-116 Is located in Poblacion East, Pantabangan. It is situated on the N side of the track oval in Pantabangan Sports Complex, 8.5 m. due S of the third drainage hole from the E. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"NEJ-116 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.80670721, '15° 48\' 24.145960\"', 121.14500980, '121° 8\' 42.035390\"', 0.0000, '0', 361.2310, 0.0000, '2', 316.5690, 301312.23990, 1748430.92200, '51', 15.80828592, '15° 48\' 29.829300\"', 121.14367920, '121° 8\' 37.244960\"', 320.8767, 1748239.58300, 515392.64200, '3', 301168.49800, 1748500.08700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4203, 'NEJ-117', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'PANTABANGAN', 'NAPON-NAPON', 2007, 15.78002764, '15° 46\' 48.099504\"', 121.23478450, '121° 14\' 5.224200\"', 'NEJ-117 Is located in Brgy. Napon Napon, Pantabangan. It is situated on the SW side of the brgy. basketball court and 4.5 m. NW of the S corner of the said basketball court. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"NEJ-117 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.78002764, '15° 46\' 48.099510\"', 121.23478450, '121° 14\' 5.224300\"', 0.0000, '0', 317.5340, 0.0000, '2', 272.4878, 310905.90820, 1745395.83200, '51', 15.78160270, '15° 46\' 53.769730\"', 121.23345340, '121° 14\' 0.432070\"', 276.8820, 1745295.82300, 525013.64700, '3', 310762.15200, 1745464.68700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mary', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4204, 'NEJ-118', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'POBLACION', 2007, 15.70681753, '15° 42\' 24.543108\"', 121.10106980, '121° 6\' 3.851280\"', 'NEJ-118 Is located in Poblacion Rizal. It is situated on the concrete beam along the irrigation bridge, 5.45 m. N of Pantabangan Rd. and about 120 m. W of the mun. hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"NEJ-118 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.70681753, '15° 42\' 24.543120\"', 121.10106980, '121° 6\' 3.851300\"', 0.0000, '0', 127.2060, 0.0000, '2', 82.9835, 296504.84370, 1737418.74600, '51', 15.70839098, '15° 42\' 30.207510\"', 121.09973670, '121° 5\' 59.052010\"', 86.6589, 1737184.01600, 510690.21400, '3', 296360.72800, 1737487.97100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mary', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4205, 'NEJ-119', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN JOSE CITY', 'SANTO TOMAS', 2007, 15.75508815, '15° 45\' 18.317340\"', 120.95173380, '120° 57\' 6.241680\"', 'NEJ-119 Is located in Brgy. Santo Tomas, San Jose City. It is situated on the NW side of the irrigation bridge and about 5 m. NW of the provincial road. It is about 1.5 km. SW of Lexber Subd. and about 2 km. NE of the boundary of San Jose City and Muñoz. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty protruding 0.03 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"NEJ-119 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.75508815, '15° 45\' 18.317350\"', 120.95173380, '120° 57\' 6.241800\"', 0.0000, '0', 127.0410, 0.0000, '2', 83.6116, 280547.70030, 1742910.31500, '51', 15.75666793, '15° 45\' 24.004530\"', 120.95040160, '120° 57\' 1.445800\"', 87.0000, 1742523.68900, 494685.08200, '3', 280403.61900, 1742980.06300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4206, 'NEJ-120', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'TALUGTUG', 'VILLA ROSARIO', 2007, 15.77110048, '15° 46\' 15.961728\"', 120.84486240, '120° 50\' 41.504640\"', 'NEJ-120 Is located inside the compound of Villa Rosario Primary School. It is situated beside the fence 15 m. S of the school bldg. and 15 m. W of the E fence of the said school. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 20 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"NEJ-120 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.77110048, '15° 46\' 15.961720\"', 120.84486240, '120° 50\' 41.504550\"', 0.0000, '0', 120.9530, 0.0000, '2', 78.2116, 269111.03350, 1744796.68800, '51', 15.77268361, '15° 46\' 21.661010\"', 120.84353040, '120° 50\' 36.709350\"', 81.2194, 1744301.33600, 483234.15800, '3', 268966.91600, 1744866.79600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4207, 'NEJ-121', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'TALAVERA', 'TAGAYTAY', 2007, 15.66649990, '15° 39\' 59.399640\"', 120.95806380, '120° 57\' 29.029680\"', 'NEJ-121 From Cabanatuan, travel along the nat\'l. road going to Talavera until reaching the Y-road going to Talavera and Rizal at Brgy. Pinagpanaan. Turn left to the road going to Talavera. Follow the road until reaching Sicsican Bridge. From the bridge, travel straight ahead for about 1.5 km. until reaching a dirt road going to the right. Follow the road until reaching the welcome sign of Brgy. Tagaytay. Station is located near the SE footing of the said welcome sign, about 0.7 m. E of the said footing. It is about 5 m. SE from the road centerline. The welcome sign is the boundary between Brgys. Basang Hamog and Tagaytay. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding 20 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"NEJ-121 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.66649990, '15° 39\' 59.399650\"', 120.95806380, '120° 57\' 29.029680\"', 0.0000, '0', 105.5150, 0.0000, '2', 62.2461, 281131.48900, 1733099.51100, '51', 15.66807396, '15° 40\' 5.066240\"', 120.95672950, '120° 57\' 24.226240\"', 65.1940, 1732721.14100, 495361.16900, '3', 280987.11900, 1733169.16200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'mara', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4208, 'NEJ-122', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GUIMBA', 'SAN MIGUEL', 2007, 15.63901830, '15° 38\' 20.465880\"', 120.68410480, '120° 41\' 2.777280\"', 'NEJ-122 Is located along the road, in Brgy. San Miguel, leading to Pura, Tarlac. It is about 300 m. E of the boundary arc between Tarlac and the said brgy., and 6 m. N of the centerline of the road. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"NEJ-122 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.63901830, '15° 38\' 20.465870\"', 120.68410480, '120° 41\' 2.777440\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.2910, 0.0000, '2', 22.3910, 251720.58410, 1730359.44800, '51', 15.64059668, '15° 38\' 26.148050\"', 120.68276950, '120° 40\' 57.970220\"', 24.5532, 1729705.87300, 465986.48800, '3', 251575.88900, 1730429.96200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4209, 'NEJ-123', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GUIMBA', 'AYOS LOMBOY', 2007, 15.70865321, '15° 42\' 31.151556\"', 120.77544350, '120° 46\' 31.596600\"', 'NEJ-123 Is located along the brgy. road of Ayos Lomboy leading to Brgy. San Andres. It is situated about 7 m. E of the centerline of the road and about 125 m. S of the welcome arc of San Andres. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"NEJ-123 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.70865321, '15° 42\' 31.151560\"', 120.77544350, '120° 46\' 31.596700\"', 0.0000, '0', 90.4420, 0.0000, '2', 48.2647, 261597.90780, 1737962.14100, '51', 15.71023396, '15° 42\' 36.842240\"', 120.77411000, '120° 46\' 26.795850\"', 50.6900, 1737398.33500, 475788.28800, '3', 261453.52300, 1738032.41900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4210, 'NEJ-124', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'MALIGAYA', 2007, 15.63799677, '15° 38\' 16.788372\"', 121.04705970, '121° 2\' 49.414920\"', 'NEJ-124 From Cabanatuan, travel along the nat\'l. road going to Talavera until reaching the Y-road going to Talavera and Rizal at Brgy. Pinagpanaan. Turn right to the road going to Rizal. Follow the road until reaching the welcome sign of Rizal at Brgy. Bicos. Turn right to the dirt road just after passing the said sign. Follow the dirt road, passing Maligaya Elem. School, until reaching DAR cooperative bldg. of the brgy. Station is located at Purok III on the intersection of the NW side of the main brgy. road and the NE side of the road going to Kag. Victor Philip\'s residence. It is situated about 30 m. NW of the said cooperative bldg. and about 50 m. SW of the elem. school. It is also along the imaginary line extending the NW side of the multipurpose concrete pavement, about 20 m. N. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"NEJ-124 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.63799677, '15° 38\' 16.788380\"', 121.04705970, '121° 2\' 49.414880\"', 0.0000, '0', 109.2110, 0.0000, '2', 65.3998, 290644.90030, 1729855.30900, '51', 15.63956707, '15° 38\' 22.441450\"', 121.04572490, '121° 2\' 44.609460\"', 68.5895, 1729567.09500, 504902.63000, '3', 290500.51000, 1729924.64800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4211, 'NEJ-125', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'BONGABON', 'SINIPIT', 2007, 15.62684276, '15° 37\' 36.633936\"', 121.14590450, '121° 8\' 45.256200\"', 'NEJ-125 From Cabanatuan, travel the NE road leading to Bongabon Mun. Hall intersection. At the said intersection, turn left and travel along the road for about 10 m. then turn left until reaching Sinipit Brgy. Hall. Station is located at the midpoint of the S edge of the basketball court. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 m. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"NEJ-125 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.62684276, '15° 37\' 36.633920\"', 121.14590450, '121° 8\' 45.256150\"', 0.0000, '0', 111.2490, 0.0000, '2', 66.8868, 301233.55890, 1728526.04200, '51', 15.62841016, '15° 37\' 42.276590\"', 121.14456950, '121° 8\' 40.450320\"', 70.3540, 1728337.40000, 515501.63500, '3', 301089.21500, 1728595.05200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4212, 'NEJ-126', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'TALAVERA', 'SAN RICARDO', 2007, 15.59459445, '15° 35\' 40.540020\"', 120.97120950, '120° 58\' 16.354200\"', 'NEJ-126 From Cabanatuan, travel along the nat\'l. road going to Talavera until reaching the Y-road going to Talavera and Rizal at Brgy. Pinagpanaan. Turn right to the road going to Rizal. Follow the road until reaching the methodist church just after passing the elem. and high school of San Ricardo. Turn left to a dirt road across the church until reaching an abandoned pump well. Walk along the pathway (riprap) at the left side of the dirt road for about 70 m. to reach the station. Station is located on a culvert at the end of the riprap about 5 m. N of the first Acacia tree. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding 20 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"NEJ-126 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.59459445, '15° 35\' 40.540030\"', 120.97120950, '120° 58\' 16.354140\"', 0.0000, '0', 92.1280, 0.0000, '2', 48.9023, 282465.08760, 1725128.18200, '51', 15.59616369, '15° 35\' 46.189270\"', 120.96987350, '120° 58\' 11.544640\"', 51.5610, 1724764.51100, 496769.15000, '3', 282320.48800, 1725197.72700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4213, 'NEJ-127', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 'MALASIN', 2007, 15.59106664, '15° 35\' 27.839904\"', 120.87815650, '120° 52\' 41.363400\"', 'NEJ-127 Is located inside the campus of Sto. Domingo Central School. It is situated on the W edge of a 20 cm. x 15 cm. concrete pavement fronting the stage and the flagpole of the said school. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"NEJ-127 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.59106664, '15° 35\' 27.839890\"', 120.87815650, '120° 52\' 41.363450\"', 0.0000, '0', 82.0070, 0.0000, '2', 39.4387, 272479.84990, 1724834.97300, '51', 15.59263770, '15° 35\' 33.495720\"', 120.87682030, '120° 52\' 36.553200\"', 41.6560, 1724377.97500, 486789.63200, '3', 272335.16000, 1724904.81500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4214, 'NEJ-128', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GUIMBA', 'MANACSAC', 2007, 15.59490347, '15° 35\' 41.652492\"', 120.79123990, '120° 47\' 28.463640\"', 'NEJ-128 Is located on the public plaza of Brgy. Manacsac, fronting the Manacsac Elem. School. It is situated about 30 m. E of the main entrance and 10 m. S of the pathway towards the chapel of the said plaza. It is on the outer circle of the oval track of the plaza. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"NEJ-128 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.59490347, '15° 35\' 41.652490\"', 120.79123990, '120° 47\' 28.463780\"', 0.0000, '0', 73.2380, 0.0000, '2', 31.1257, 263160.49900, 1725354.38700, '51', 15.59647670, '15° 35\' 47.316130\"', 120.78990370, '120° 47\' 23.653370\"', 33.1090, 1724810.02200, 477468.67400, '3', 263015.74700, 1725424.51500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4215, 'NEJ-129', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF PALAYAN', 'SINGALAT', 2007, 15.57126463, '15° 34\' 16.552668\"', 121.09586370, '121° 5\' 45.109320\"', 'NEJ-129 From Cabanatuan, travel NE towards Palayan City. At the intersection of the City Hall, turn left and travel along the concrete road until reaching Singalat Brgy. Hall. Station is located at the side of the higher elevated basketball court, measuring 12 m. from the NW corner end of the court. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 m. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"NEJ-129 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.57126463, '15° 34\' 16.552670\"', 121.09586370, '121° 5\' 45.109160\"', 0.0000, '0', 113.6850, 0.0000, '2', 69.6293, 295812.31950, 1722423.02700, '51', 15.57282963, '15° 34\' 22.186650\"', 121.09452730, '121° 5\' 40.298400\"', 72.7470, 1722184.78300, 510138.52600, '3', 295667.75000, 1722492.14900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4216, 'NEJ-130', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2007, 15.53943562, '15° 32\' 21.968232\"', 121.15464470, '121° 9\' 16.720920\"', 'NEJ-130 From Cabanatuan, travel the NE road leading to Imelda Valley intersection at Palayan City. At the intersection, turn right and travel along the road for about 5 km. then turn right at Brgy. Sagana and follow the dirt road until reaching Brgy. Bacao. Station is located at the side of the basketball court, measuring 4.5 m. from the SE edge of the said basketball court. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 m. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"NEJ-130 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.53943562, '15° 32\' 21.968230\"', 121.15464470, '121° 9\' 16.721020\"', 0.0000, '0', 130.4180, 0.0000, '2', 85.9634, 302087.11080, 1718845.44700, '51', 15.54099730, '15° 32\' 27.590290\"', 121.15330770, '121° 9\' 11.907850\"', 89.2424, 1718666.42600, 516445.55300, '3', 301942.48500, 1718914.35200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4217, 'NEJ-131', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'SAN VICENTE', 2007, 15.55843054, '15° 33\' 30.349944\"', 121.22732280, '121° 13\' 38.362080\"', 'NEJ-131 From Cabanatuan, travel the NE road leading to Imelda Valley intersection at Palayan City. At the intersection, turn right and travel along the road for about 13 km. until reaching Bato Ferry Bridge in Brgy. San Vicente. Station is located at the SE end of the said bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 m., with inscriptions \"NEJ-131 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.55843054, '15° 33\' 30.349960\"', 121.22732280, '121° 13\' 38.362230\"', 0.0000, '0', 131.4020, 0.0000, '2', 86.5245, 309901.40780, 1720881.36700, '51', 15.55999182, '15° 33\' 35.970560\"', 121.22598640, '121° 13\' 33.551060\"', 90.1064, 1720774.95400, 524239.71100, '3', 309756.90700, 1720950.05500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4218, 'NEJ-132 (BLLM-7)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LICAB', 'SAN JOSE', 2007, 15.52434119, '15° 31\' 27.628284\"', 120.79735410, '120° 47\' 50.474760\"', 'NEJ-132 (BLLM 7) From Licab Mun. Hall, travel S along the road going to Brgy. San Jose. Follow the road, passing Sta. Maria Brgy. Hall and Paaralang Elementarya ng San Jose, until reaching the welcome sign of Brgy. San Jose. Station is along the S side of the road about 4 m. S from the road centerline, about 100 m. E of the welcome sign and about 10 m. W of the third electric post. It is situated about 30 m. SE from Brgy. Sec. Lagmay\'s residence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding 40 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"BLLM No. 7\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.52434119, '15° 31\' 27.628290\"', 120.79735410, '120° 47\' 50.474630\"', 0.0000, '0', 66.3780, 0.0000, '2', 24.3237, 263735.80260, 1717537.73200, '51', 15.52590984, '15° 31\' 33.275410\"', 120.79601620, '120° 47\' 45.658270\"', 26.0249, 1717001.64700, 478116.73800, '3', 263590.82000, 1717607.77800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4219, 'NEJ-133', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'KALIKID SUR', 2007, 15.48236624, '15° 28\' 56.518464\"', 121.05518050, '121° 3\' 18.649800\"', 'NEJ-133 From Cabanatuan, travel NE for about 6 km. then, at the intersection of Brgy. Bangad, turn right and travel for about 4.6 km. until reaching the intersection road of South Calikid then turn left and proceed until reaching the brgy. boundary between North and South Calikid. Station is located 26 m. E from the concrete hollow block wall welcome sign. Mark is the head of a 4 in copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 m. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"NEJ-133 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.48236624, '15° 28\' 56.518450\"', 121.05518050, '121° 3\' 18.649730\"', 0.0000, '0', 108.9110, 0.0000, '2', 65.1927, 291358.85580, 1712624.48400, '51', 15.48392651, '15° 29\' 2.135440\"', 121.05384200, '121° 3\' 13.831180\"', 67.8080, 1712346.82800, 505777.29400, '3', 291213.95500, 1712693.65900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4220, 'NEJ-134', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GENERAL TINIO', 'NAZARETH', 2007, 15.39580978, '15° 23\' 44.915208\"', 121.08979190, '121° 5\' 23.250840\"', 'NEJ-134 Is located in Brgy. Nazareth, 75 S of Brgy. Bago welcome sign and 2 m. E of the road. It is also situated on the NE corner of the irrigation bridge. mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"NEJ-134 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.39580978, '15° 23\' 44.915200\"', 121.08979190, '121° 5\' 23.250930\"', 0.0000, '0', 127.3900, 0.0000, '2', 83.4231, 294988.14130, 1703012.61400, '51', 15.39736378, '15° 23\' 50.509620\"', 121.08845150, '121° 5\' 18.425280\"', 85.9470, 1702770.63700, 509494.86000, '3', 294842.98400, 1703081.59900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
