(4221, 'NEJ-135', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SANTA ROSA', 'SOLEDAD', 2007, 15.42842064, '15° 25\' 42.314304\"', 121.00384900, '121° 0\' 13.856400\"', 'NEJ-135 From Cabanatuan, travel S towards Sta. Rosa. At the intersection, turn left and travel along the rough road for about 7 km. until reaching Brgy. Soledad main irrigation canal. Station is located at the NW end of the irrigation bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"NEJ-135 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.42842064, '15° 25\' 42.314320\"', 121.00384900, '121° 0\' 13.856390\"', 0.0000, '0', 83.8120, 0.0000, '2', 40.5484, 285794.64120, 1706705.08500, '51', 15.42997864, '15° 25\' 47.923110\"', 121.00250920, '121° 0\' 9.032980\"', 42.6738, 1706377.23400, 500269.30500, '3', 285649.51600, 1706774.37800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4222, 'NEJ-136', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'SUMACAB ESTE', 2007, 15.44506695, '15° 26\' 42.241020\"', 120.94450860, '120° 56\' 40.230960\"', 'NEJ-136 Is located inside the compound of Paaralang Elementarya ng Sumacab Este. The school is located N and adjacent to the brgy. hall and covered basketball court, along the brgy. road parallel to Maharlika Highway. It is situated N of the N school bldg., about 10 m. S of the N fence and 15 m. E of the W fence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"NEJ-136 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.44506695, '15° 26\' 42.241030\"', 120.94450860, '120° 56\' 40.231100\"', 0.0000, '0', 70.3210, 0.0000, '2', 27.5329, 279442.14690, 1708607.28000, '51', 15.44662732, '15° 26\' 47.858350\"', 120.94316910, '120° 56\' 35.408810\"', 29.3760, 1708220.06900, 493900.90300, '3', 279297.02700, 1708676.78000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4223, 'NEJ-137', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'ZARAGOZA', 'CARMEN', 2007, 15.43563205, '15° 26\' 8.275380\"', 120.82904240, '120° 49\' 44.552640\"', 'NEJ-137 From Maharlika Highway in Sta. Rosa, turn W heading to the Mun. of Zaragoza. Upon reaching Brgy. Carmen, turn S on the road junction leading to Mun. of Jaen. Station is located on the bridge connecting Brgy. Carmen, Zaragoza and Jaen. It is situated on the NE end corner of the said bridge crossing the creek. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"NEJ-137 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.43563205, '15° 26\' 8.275390\"', 120.82904240, '120° 49\' 44.552640\"', 0.0000, '0', 63.9630, 0.0000, '2', 21.9060, 267036.88880, 1707684.85200, '51', 15.43719438, '15° 26\' 13.899760\"', 120.82770250, '120° 49\' 39.728960\"', 23.2710, 1707182.99100, 481508.15600, '3', 266891.63800, 1707754.71600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4224, 'NEJ-138', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN ANTONIO', 'SAN FRANCISCO', 2007, 15.35326121, '15° 21\' 11.740356\"', 120.84325260, '120° 50\' 35.709360\"', 'NEJ-138 From San Antonio Mun. Hall, travel along the road going to Zaragoza until reaching the Y-road going to Along-Along River and San Francisco at Brgy. Papaya. Turn right to the road going to San Francisco. Then turn right to the road junction until reaching San Francisco Brgy. Hall. Station is located along the ESE side of the multipurpose concrete pavement, about 18 m. SE of the brgy. hall, about 3 m. SSW of the ENE corner of the pavement and approx. 8 m. NNE of the shed. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding 40 cm. above the ground surface, with inscriptions \"NEJ-138 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.35326121, '15° 21\' 11.740370\"', 120.84325260, '120° 50\' 35.709400\"', 0.0000, '0', 59.4020, 0.0000, '2', 17.3437, 268471.25430, 1698553.02700, '51', 15.35481801, '15° 21\' 17.344830\"', 120.84191080, '120° 50\' 30.878770\"', 18.4323, 1698067.59900, 483026.38800, '3', 268325.74000, 1698622.77200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4225, 'NEJ-139', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN LEONARDO', 'RIZAL DISTRICT', 2007, 15.36328116, '15° 21\' 47.812176\"', 120.95701240, '120° 57\' 25.244640\"', 'NEJ-139 Is located in Brgy. rizal, on the E end of the first irrigation bridge N of the public cemetery. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"NEJ-139 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.36328116, '15° 21\' 47.812180\"', 120.95701240, '120° 57\' 25.244480\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.6640, 0.0000, '2', 28.8375, 280698.54640, 1699543.32000, '51', 15.36483607, '15° 21\' 53.409840\"', 120.95567090, '120° 57\' 20.415290\"', 30.4474, 1699170.28900, 495240.73800, '3', 280553.16400, 1699612.70700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4226, 'NEJ-140', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GENERAL TINIO', 'PIAS', 2007, 15.34775735, '15° 20\' 51.926460\"', 121.06377960, '121° 3\' 49.606560\"', 'NEJ-140 Is located in Brgy. Pias, 20 m. SE of the S corner of Pias Bridge and 2.2 m. W of the S concrete block. It is also situated 20 m. SE of the welcome sign of Brgy. Pias. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"NEJ-140 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.34775735, '15° 20\' 51.926450\"', 121.06377960, '121° 3\' 49.606690\"', 0.0000, '0', 90.1620, 0.0000, '2', 46.4098, 292147.82220, 1697719.89600, '51', 15.34930889, '15° 20\' 57.511990\"', 121.06243800, '121° 3\' 44.776790\"', 48.6410, 1697452.83400, 506703.96800, '3', 292002.48200, 1697788.92300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4227, 'NEJ-141', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF GAPAN', 'KAPALANGAN', 2007, 15.26529546, '15° 15\' 55.063656\"', 120.99276830, '120° 59\' 33.965880\"', 'NEJ-141 Is located on a concrete beam of the irrigation bridge in Brgy. Kapalangan. It is 5 m. NE of the intersection of NIA Rd. and Dela Cruz St. and 100 m. W of Bagong Silang Primary School. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"NEJ-141 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.26529546, '15° 15\' 55.063650\"', 120.99276830, '120° 59\' 33.965860\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.6160, 0.0000, '2', 26.4662, 284437.71080, 1688663.63200, '51', 15.26684334, '15° 16\' 0.636030\"', 120.99142460, '120° 59\' 29.128540\"', 28.0246, 1688327.90000, 499078.89800, '3', 284292.03300, 1688732.81500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4228, 'NEJ-142', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN ISIDRO', 'MALAPIT', 2007, 15.30163026, '15° 18\' 5.868936\"', 120.92025070, '120° 55\' 12.902520\"', 'NEJ-142 Is located in Villegas Subd., Brgy. Malapit. It is situated on ìthe NW end of the irrigation bridge S of the said subd. Mark is ìthe head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 ìm. concrete monument protruding 0.1 m. above the ground, with ìinscriptions \"NEJ-142 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.30163026, '15° 18\' 5.868940\"', 120.92025070, '120° 55\' 12.902480\"', 0.0000, '0', 63.4870, 0.0000, '2', 20.9738, 276685.41720, 1692758.00900, '51', 15.30318207, '15° 18\' 11.455440\"', 120.91890770, '120° 55\' 8.067860\"', 22.1785, 1692350.01500, 491291.21300, '3', 276539.79700, 1692827.45900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4229, 'NEJ-143', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN ANTONIO', 'PAPAYA', 2007, 15.32286972, '15° 19\' 22.330992\"', 120.78903400, '120° 47\' 20.522400\"', 'NEJ-143 From san Antonio Mun. Hall, travel along the road going to Zaragoza until reaching the Y-road going to Along-Along River and San Francisco at Brgy. Papaya. Turn left to the road going to the said river until reaching the last culvert about 200 m. E of Along-Along Bridge. Station is located at the NW end of the culvert, about 4 m. N from the centerline of the road and 0.06 m. S from the headwall of the culvert. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"NEJ-143 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.32286972, '15° 19\' 22.330980\"', 120.78903400, '120° 47\' 20.522490\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.5570, 0.0000, '2', 14.6649, 262614.01890, 1695248.11600, '51', 15.32442579, '15° 19\' 27.932830\"', 120.78769140, '120° 47\' 15.689000\"', 15.6297, 1694709.95800, 477201.68400, '3', 262468.35600, 1695318.01000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4230, 'NEJ-144', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CABIAO', 'CONCEPCION', 2007, 15.21850460, '15° 13\' 6.616560\"', 120.82740470, '120° 49\' 38.656920\"', 'NEJ-144 Is located in Brgy. Concepcion, on the N end of the first floodway from Cabiao Town Proper. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"NEJ-144 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.21850460, '15° 13\' 6.616560\"', 120.82740470, '120° 49\' 38.657070\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.8700, 0.0000, '2', 12.8906, 266620.10000, 1683655.71100, '51', 15.22005318, '15° 13\' 12.191460\"', 120.82605970, '120° 49\' 33.814920\"', 13.5435, 1683158.49700, 481312.56300, '3', 266474.12200, 1683725.38700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4231, 'NEJ-145', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'BONGABON', 'CALAANAN', 2007, 15.65906531, '15° 39\' 32.635116\"', 121.23104080, '121° 13\' 51.746880\"', 'NEJ-145 Is located in Purok 7, Brgy. Calaanan, along the Bongabon-Aurora Rd. in front of a lot owned by Fabros Family. It is 1.5 m. NE of the road across Km. Post 154. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"NEJ-145 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.65906531, '15° 39\' 32.635120\"', 121.23104080, '121° 13\' 51.746970\"', 0.0000, '0', 219.7030, 0.0000, '1', 174.7364, 310392.76430, 1732013.88600, '51', 15.66063285, '15° 39\' 38.278260\"', 121.22970680, '121° 13\' 46.944410\"', 178.6982, 1731910.68300, 524626.75400, '3', 310248.60200, 1732082.64900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4232, 'NEJ-146', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN JOSE CITY', 'MANICLA', 2007, 15.85077147, '15° 51\' 2.777292\"', 121.01456130, '121° 0\' 52.420680\"', 'NEJ-146 Is located in So. Palasapas, Brgy. Maniola. it is situated in the Middle E sideline of the basketball court of the said sitio. The basketball court is at the N end of the concrete road, about 10 mins. drive from Brgy. Maniola to So. Palasapas. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"NEJ-146 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.85077147, '15° 51\' 2.777300\"', 121.01456130, '121° 0\' 52.420820\"', 0.0000, '0', 283.0150, 0.0000, '2', 238.8315, 287381.39150, 1753435.14100, '51', 15.85235584, '15° 51\' 8.481020\"', 121.01323150, '121° 0\' 47.633360\"', 243.1090, 1753110.49800, 501417.20800, '3', 287237.68500, 1753504.76600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4233, 'NEJ-147', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CARRANGLAN', 'BUNGA', 2007, 16.00239615, '16° 0\' 8.626140\"', 121.04142140, '121° 2\' 29.117040\"', 'NEJ-147 From San Jose City, travel along the highway going to Carranglan until reaching Brgy. Baluarte. Turn left to the road next to the road going to DENR-RP-Japan Training Center (Forestry Project). Turn right to the road junction until reaching the irrigation canal about 300 m. NW of Bunga Elem. School. Station is located along the NE side of the brgy. road about 3 m. NE of the road centerline. It is beside the NW end of the irrigation canal, about 60 m. N of Mr. Rodrigo Pagurayan, Jr.\'s residence. Mark is the head of a 4 in copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. from the ground surface, with inscriptions \"NEJ-147 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.00239615, '16° 0\' 8.626150\"', 121.04142140, '121° 2\' 29.117080\"', 0.0000, '0', 327.2360, 0.0000, '2', 282.2841, 290416.23890, 1770188.22600, '51', 16.00398942, '16° 0\' 14.361920\"', 121.04009520, '121° 2\' 24.342600\"', 287.7220, 1769888.55900, 504291.32100, '3', 290273.06000, 1770257.89500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4234, 'NEJ-21', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SCIENCE CITY OF MUÑOZ', 'CURVA', 1989, 15.67169897, '15° 40\' 18.116292\"', 120.85354030, '120° 51\' 12.745080\"', 'NEJ - 021 From Baloc junction, proceed northwest along pave road to Guimba about 4.4 km. up to the bridge, thence, proceed northwestward about 100.0 m., thence, right turn northward along dirt road to the station, about 500.0 m. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. diameter brass rod set in conc. block, 0.60 m. deep and inscribed on top with the station name. It is 450 m. from National Road leading to Guimba, 150.0 m east of dirt road and 60.0 m. west of river bank. It is inside the property of Mr. Adriano Mamaril. Azimuth mark is S04 degrees 00\' W, 511.48 m. to NEJ - 016 - D, cyl. concrete monument 15 x 60 cm.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.67169897, '15° 40\' 18.116300\"', 120.85354030, '120° 51\' 12.745100\"', 0.0000, '0', 90.3450, 0.0000, '2', 47.7642, 269929.38140, 1733785.60600, '51', 15.67327567, '15° 40\' 23.792410\"', 120.85220600, '120° 51\' 7.941520\"', 50.2934, 1733301.72500, 484156.06900, '3', 269784.93900, 1733855.60000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4235, 'NEJ-24', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'TALAVERA', 'BANTUG HAMOG', 1989, 15.67733408, '15° 40\' 38.402688\"', 120.96636620, '120° 57\' 58.918320\"', 'NEJ - 024 To reach the station, from Calipahan Bridge, proceed northward ìalong paved road to Munoz for about 1.5 Km. up to dirt road ìleading to Bulak, thence, turn right, proceed NEward about 5.0 ìKm., thence, turn left going northward about 2.75 km. up to the ìstation location. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. diameter ìbrass rod set in concrete block 0.60 m. deep and inscribed on top ìwith the station name. It is 1.0 km. southwest of barrio proper, ì36.70 m. N 32° 34\' W to paddy dike intersection, 98.12 m. N 75° ì16\' E to cyl. culvert pipe, 5.0 m. from centerline of road. ìReference azimuth mark S 04° 40\' E, 1912.91 m. to NEJ - 024-A, 15 ìx 60 cm. cyl. conc. monument.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.67733408, '15° 40\' 38.402700\"', 120.96636620, '120° 57\' 58.918400\"', 0.0000, '0', 108.2770, 0.0000, '2', 64.9318, 282033.22180, 1734289.98700, '51', 15.67890864, '15° 40\' 44.071110\"', 120.96503220, '120° 57\' 54.115890\"', 67.9690, 1733919.76600, 496251.46000, '3', 281888.89400, 1734359.62100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4236, 'NEJ-3000', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'NAMPICUAN', 'NORTH POBLACION', 2007, 15.73345369, '15° 44\' 0.433284\"', 120.63556870, '120° 38\' 8.047320\"', 'NEJ-3000 Is located inside Nampicuan Plaza, which is in front of Nampicuan Mun. Hall. It is about 1 m. E of the third lightpost from the centerstage and about 2.5 m SE of the right stage (when facing the centerstage). Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail embedded and centered on a 0.2m x 0.2 m. cement putty, with inscription \"NEJ-3000, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.73345369, '15° 44\' 0.433280\"', 120.63556870, '120° 38\' 8.047220\"', 0.0000, '0', 62.9690, 0.0000, '3', 21.1810, 246631.36460, 1740870.06300, '51', 15.73503908, '15° 44\' 6.140700\"', 120.63423550, '120° 38\' 3.247750\"', 23.6300, 1740163.88500, 460800.64200, '3', 246486.94500, 1740940.81800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
