(4252, 'NEJ-3016', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 'BALOC', 2007, 15.64131779, '15° 38\' 28.744044\"', 120.88831000, '120° 53\' 17.916000\"', 'NEJ-3016 Is located on the concrete beam of an irrigation canal along the Maharlika Highway in Baloc. It is about 20 m. E of A.P Pascual Bldg., 30 m. E pf Petron Gasoline Station and 200 m. NE of Baloc Public Market. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail embedded and centered on a 0.3 m x 0.3 m. cement putty, with inscriptions \"NEJ-3016, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.64131779, '15° 38\' 28.744060\"', 120.88831000, '120° 53\' 17.916030\"', 0.0000, '0', 92.1770, 0.0000, '3', 49.4357, 273624.21370, 1730385.71100, '51', 15.64289181, '15° 38\' 34.410510\"', 120.88697500, '120° 53\' 13.110050\"', 51.9506, 1729937.65000, 487881.62200, '3', 273479.69900, 1730455.56500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
