(4276, 'NEJ-3041', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CABIAO', 'SAN ROQUE', 2008, 15.24397685, '15° 14\' 38.316660\"', 120.85481720, '120° 51\' 17.341920\"', 'NEJ-3041 Station is located at Brgy. San Roque, Cabiao, Nueva Ecija. It is situated near the Km. post 102. 1 Km. from town of Cabiao. To reach the station from town of San Antonio travel towards Cabiao for about 15 mins., then continue traveling passing the GT oil station, 100 m away due S of the gas station, and 100 m due S of the Methodist Church. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. concrete nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block and mark with, \"NEJ-3041, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.24397685, '15° 14\' 38.316660\"', 120.85481720, '120° 51\' 17.342080\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.5160, 0.0000, '4', 15.4204, 269593.69230, 1686445.67600, '51', 15.24552644, '15° 14\' 43.895200\"', 120.85347280, '120° 51\' 12.502230\"', 16.1974, 1685974.68400, 484259.61900, '3', 269447.82300, 1686515.28600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
