(4305, 'NEJ-3067', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'JAEN', 'LAMBAKIN', 2008, 15.35238614, '15° 21\' 8.590104\"', 121.00604260, '121° 0\' 21.753360\"', 'NEJ-3067 Station is situated at Brgy. Lambakin, Jaen, Nueva Ecija. It is located almost 15 m SW of GG Paternos Farm, about 5 m W from the centerline of the road. To reach the station travel along the Provincial Road for about 7 Km. going to town of Zaragoza until reaching Brgy. Lambakin. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. concrete nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block and mark with, \"NEJ-3067, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.35238614, '15° 21\' 8.590100\"', 121.00604260, '121° 0\' 21.753520\"', 0.0000, '0', 80.4530, 0.0000, '4', 37.2052, 285952.37390, 1698288.45100, '51', 15.35393926, '15° 21\' 14.181320\"', 121.00470100, '121° 0\' 16.923710\"', 39.0850, 1697964.17800, 500504.73800, '3', 285806.99900, 1698357.66900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
