(4310, 'NEJ-3072', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN LEONARDO', 'BURGOS DISTRICT', 2007, 15.36851077, '15° 22\' 6.638772\"', 120.94008680, '120° 56\' 24.312480\"', 'NEJ-3072 Mark is situated at Brgy. Diversion of San Leonardo. To reach the station tavel from town of San Leonardo along the Nat\'l Road until reaching the Speedway Gasoline Station and N.G. Interior Trading and Auto Center. Station mark is along the guard fence of the Nat\'l Road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. concrete nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block and mark with, \"NEJ-3072, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.36851077, '15° 22\' 6.638770\"', 120.94008680, '120° 56\' 24.312380\"', 0.0000, '0', 67.2050, 0.0000, '4', 24.5115, 278886.53630, 1700139.32900, '51', 15.37006638, '15° 22\' 12.238980\"', 120.93874540, '120° 56\' 19.483540\"', 26.0449, 1699749.41800, 493423.74700, '3', 278741.15600, 1700208.77500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
