(4354, 'NEJ-3116', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'IBABAO BANA', 2007, 15.47607288, '15° 28\' 33.862368\"', 120.91766290, '120° 55\' 3.586440\"', 'NEJ-3116 From Ibabao-Bana Elem. School, travel about 350 m E until reaching the welcome arch of Brgy. Palagay. The station is located 270 m SW of the rice seed production and 20 m SE of Brgy. Palagay welcome arch. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. concrete nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block and mark with, \"NEJ-3116, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.47607288, '15° 28\' 33.862370\"', 120.91766290, '120° 55\' 3.586280\"', 0.0000, '0', 73.1780, 0.0000, '4', 30.5624, 276593.71820, 1712066.49500, '51', 15.47763581, '15° 28\' 39.488910\"', 120.91632400, '120° 54\' 58.766450\"', 32.3899, 1711651.83900, 491021.21900, '3', 276448.67800, 1712136.10900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4355, 'NEJ-3117', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'SANTA ARCADIA', 2007, 15.46396350, '15° 27\' 50.268600\"', 120.98207320, '120° 58\' 55.463520\"', 'NEJ-3117 FROM CABANATUAN CITY PROPER, TRAVEL ABOUT 5 KM. S UNTIL REACHING THE MICROTEL IN BRGY. STA. ARCADIA. IT IS ABOUT 1 KM. OF AVIDA RESIDENCE OF STA. ARCADIA AND 1 M N OF THE KM. POST 118. STATION MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4 IN. CONCRETE NAIL CENTERED ON A 0.20 M X 0.20 M CONCRETE BLOCK AND MARK WITH, \"NEJ-3117, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.46396350, '15° 27\' 50.268610\"', 120.98207320, '120° 58\' 55.463430\"', 0.0000, '0', 76.4820, 0.0000, '4', 33.3722, 283493.97630, 1710660.33900, '51', 15.46552423, '15° 27\' 55.887230\"', 120.98073420, '120° 58\' 50.642950\"', 35.5010, 1710310.13700, 497932.57500, '3', 283348.95200, 1710729.73300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mary', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4356, 'NEJ-3118', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'SANTA ARCADIA', 2007, 15.46099198, '15° 27\' 39.571128\"', 120.98269880, '120° 58\' 57.715680\"', 'NEJ-3118 From Weslayan University of Cabanatuan City travel about 5.2 Km. S until reaching the Avida residence of Sta. Arcadia. Station is located 600 m SW of Microtel Hotel, and 500 m SE of Arcadia residence and 300 m SE of Km. post 118. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. concrete nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block and mark with, \"NEJ-3118, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.46099198, '15° 27\' 39.571140\"', 120.98269880, '120° 58\' 57.715790\"', 0.0000, '0', 76.5800, 0.0000, '4', 33.4681, 283558.03950, 1710330.85500, '51', 15.46255251, '15° 27\' 45.189040\"', 120.98135970, '120° 58\' 52.895060\"', 35.5900, 1709981.33600, 497999.67800, '3', 283413.00600, 1710400.24600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4357, 'NEJ-3119', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'ADUAS SUR', 2007, 15.49238976, '15° 29\' 32.603136\"', 120.96718200, '120° 58\' 1.855200\"', 'NEJ-3119 Station mark is situated at Brgy. Aduas Sur, Cabanatuan City, located along the road more or less 6 m from the centerline of the road, about 800 m from NEJ-44 located at the water district tank of Cabanatuan. To reach the station, from Cabanatuan City travel towards to the old Provincial Capitol of Nueva Ecija, upon reaching the welcome sign of Brgy. Aduas Sur, continue traveling for about 180 m until reaching the said point. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. concrete nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block and mark with, \"NEJ-3119, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.49238976, '15° 29\' 32.603120\"', 120.96718200, '120° 58\' 1.855210\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.5010, 0.0000, '4', 32.4823, 281925.50540, 1713821.32200, '51', 15.49395262, '15° 29\' 38.229430\"', 120.96584360, '120° 57\' 57.037020\"', 34.6410, 1713455.70200, 496335.16600, '3', 281780.56200, 1713890.79100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4358, 'NEJ-3120', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2007, 15.49298417, '15° 29\' 34.743012\"', 121.00294390, '121° 0\' 10.598040\"', 'NEJ-3120 From Cabanatuan City Proper, travel about 3.2 Km. until reaching the welcome Purok 5 sign beside the San Isidro Chapel. The station is located near the welcome sign of Purok 5. It is about 100 m E of the Sanctuary Memorial Park and 200 m SE of San Isidro Elem. School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. concrete nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block and mark with, \"NEJ-3120, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.49298417, '15° 29\' 34.743000\"', 121.00294390, '121° 0\' 10.598090\"', 0.0000, '0', 81.4910, 0.0000, '4', 38.1838, 285763.89980, 1713851.03900, '51', 15.49454627, '15° 29\' 40.366570\"', 121.00160560, '121° 0\' 5.780180\"', 40.5460, 1713521.09300, 500172.27400, '3', 285618.99000, 1713920.39100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4359, 'NEJ-3121', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2007, 15.49402037, '15° 29\' 38.473332\"', 121.00533580, '121° 0\' 19.208880\"', 'NEJ-3121 STATION IS SITUATED ABOUT 15 M W OF MICROPHIL AGRI. AND SUPPLY 135 M OF SANCTUARY MEMORIAL PARK AND 100 M NW OF SHELL IN BRGY. SAN ISIDRO. STATION MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4 IN. CONCRETE NAIL CENTERED ON A 0.20 M X 0.20 M CONCRETE BLOCK AND MARK WITH, \"NEJ-3121, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.49402037, '15° 29\' 38.473330\"', 121.00533580, '121° 0\' 19.208780\"', 0.0000, '0', 81.9570, 0.0000, '4', 38.6297, 286021.64510, 1713963.32300, '51', 15.49558249, '15° 29\' 44.096950\"', 121.00399750, '121° 0\' 14.390970\"', 41.0090, 1713635.74500, 500428.91000, '3', 285876.74100, 1714032.66900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
