(4366, 'NEJ-3128', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'BAGONG BUHAY', 2007, 15.50502682, '15° 30\' 18.096552\"', 121.06287520, '121° 3\' 46.350720\"', 'NEJ-3128 Station is located about 100 m S of the welcome sign of Brgy. Bagong Buhay. It is about 250 m N in brgy. hall of Bagong Buhay and beside the electric post near the curve road going to welcome arch of Bagong Buhay, and 250 m N of Bagong Buhay Elem. School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. concrete nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block and mark with, \"NEJ-3128, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.50502682, '15° 30\' 18.096540\"', 121.06287520, '121° 3\' 46.350860\"', 0.0000, '0', 101.0260, 0.0000, '4', 57.2336, 292207.28240, 1715124.72100, '51', 15.50658836, '15° 30\' 23.718090\"', 121.06153730, '121° 3\' 41.534260\"', 59.9710, 1714854.40000, 506602.28800, '3', 292062.46300, 1715193.89200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
