(4485, 'NEJ-3249', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SCIENCE CITY OF MUÑOZ', 'LABNEY', 2008, 15.69825415, '15° 41\' 53.714940\"', 120.84768640, '120° 50\' 51.671040\"', 'NEJ-3249 Station is located beside the Purok 5 sign board along the brgy. orad of Brgy. Labney. It is about 3 m N of waiting shed in Purok 5 of the said brgy. and 6 m NW of Mr. Cesario Sanitimole residence and 300 m SW of water tank near the covered basketball court and Labney Elem. School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. concrete nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block with inscriptions, \"NEJ-3249, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.69825415, '15° 41\' 53.714950\"', 120.84768640, '120° 50\' 51.671160\"', 0.0000, '0', 94.4840, 0.0000, '4', 51.8809, 269331.53670, 1736731.05300, '51', 15.69983265, '15° 41\' 59.397540\"', 120.84635270, '120° 50\' 46.869800\"', 54.5258, 1736240.54500, 483530.71300, '3', 269187.17800, 1736801.08900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(4486, 'NEJ-3250', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SCIENCE CITY OF MUÑOZ', 'LABNEY', 2008, 15.69952109, '15° 41\' 58.275924\"', 120.84900810, '120° 50\' 56.429160\"', 'NEJ-3250 To reach the station from Munoz proper, travel SW toward to Brgy. Calanacan passing Brgy. Gabaldon, Pandalla until you reach the irrigation control valve which is going to Naglabrahan and San Antonio, turn right and continue traveling until you reach the Labney Elem. School. Station is situated besides the waiting shed near the elem. School. It is about 30 m SE of the covered court and 20 m SW of Purok 3 sign. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. bolt screw centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block with inscriptions, \"NEJ-3250, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.69952109, '15° 41\' 58.275940\"', 120.84900810, '120° 50\' 56.429330\"', 0.0000, '0', 96.1750, 0.0000, '4', 53.5602, 269474.67020, 1736869.83500, '51', 15.70109964, '15° 42\' 3.958710\"', 120.84767450, '120° 50\' 51.628080\"', 56.2174, 1736380.62800, 483672.49100, '3', 269330.31700, 1736939.86800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
