(4555, 'NEJ-3319', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CARRANGLAN', 'GENERAL LUNA', 2008, 15.92830905, '15° 55\' 41.912580\"', 121.11998380, '121° 7\' 11.941680\"', 'NEJ-3319 To reach the station from Carranglan town proper travel E until you reach the Y sign going to Pelaway Nueva Vizcaya and Sitio Amot, turn right and travel for about 3.3 Km. forward until reaching the house of Mr. Rodolfo Maglanoc. Station is situated inside the lot of Mr. Rodolfo Maglanoc and it is besides the electric post. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. bolt screw centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block with inscriptions, \"NEJ-3319, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.92830905, '15° 55\' 41.912570\"', 121.11998380, '121° 7\' 11.941540\"', 0.0000, '0', 281.6840, 0.0000, '4', 236.6599, 298751.65270, 1761911.69100, '51', 15.92989596, '15° 55\' 47.625460\"', 121.11865590, '121° 7\' 7.161190\"', 241.7560, 1761693.56000, 512704.22500, '3', 298608.29200, 1761981.04400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
