(4560, 'NEJ-3324', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CARRANGLAN', 'R.A.PADILLA', 2008, 15.96537494, '15° 57\' 55.349784\"', 121.04788910, '121° 2\' 52.400760\"', 'NEJ-3324 From Sitio Digdig, Brgy. Joson, Carranglan, turn right and travel E along the concrete road for about 10.9 Km. up to DENR RP Japan training center in Brgy. R.A. Padilla. Turn left and continue traveling N along the concrete road going up hill for about 100 m up going to the gate of DENR. Station was established in front of campus map and 30 m NE of guard post and 30 m NW of motor pool. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. bolt screw centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete block with inscriptions, \"NEJ-3324, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.96537494, '15° 57\' 55.349770\"', 121.04788910, '121° 2\' 52.400840\"', 0.0000, '0', 307.0850, 0.0000, '4', 262.2803, 291070.11140, 1766084.60500, '51', 15.96696574, '15° 58\' 1.076680\"', 121.04656200, '121° 2\' 47.623290\"', 267.4430, 1765792.14800, 504984.37400, '3', 290926.81600, 1766154.22000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jho', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
