(4923, 'NEJ-42', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CUYAPO', 'SANTA CRUZ', 1989, 15.77910656, '15° 46\' 44.783616\"', 120.73291810, '120° 43\' 58.505160\"', 'NEJ - 42 From Cabanatuan City, travel north towards brgy. Sta. Cruz, ìmunicipality of Cuyapo. About 1-1/2 hrs. by car along Guimba - ìCuyapo road. Upon reaching brgy. Sta. Cruz, travel on foot for ìabout two (2) hours or approximately 5 kilometers uphill climb to the station which is situated on the highest peak among the three (3) peaks of Mt. Bangcay. Along the way is a very prominent 15 ìmeters high rock. Station mark is a cross-cut on top of 0.15 m. ìx 0.01 m. diameter brass rod centered on a 20 x 20 x 60 cm. concrete block flush level to the ground and inscribed with the station name. No subsurface mark. Reference mark is N 80° 00\' W., Mt. Cuyapo N 30° W. Mt. Balungao N 40° E, Mt. Amorong, S 03° E Mt. Arayat.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.77910656, '15° 46\' 44.783600\"', 120.73291810, '120° 43\' 58.505000\"', 0.0000, '0', 445.6250, 0.0000, '2', 403.6009, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.78069258, '15° 46\' 50.493280\"', 120.73158620, '120° 43\' 53.710160\"', 406.1870, 1745199.58300, 471240.31700, '3', 256978.08900, 1745879.23200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2016-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
