(5005, 'NEJ-4279', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'BAGTING', 2012, 15.53734358, '15° 32\' 14.436888\"', 121.26788790, '121° 16\' 4.396440\"', 'NEJ-4279 Mark is the head of 4\' nail set flushed and centered on top of a concrete monument 30x30 cm. with inscriptions \"NEJ 4279;2012; 4th ORDER;DENR\". To reach the station, from Gabaldon Welcome Arc, travel along the national road for about 330 m SE going to Sitio Bateria, Brgy. Bagting and upon reaching Bateria Elem. School continue traveling for about 325 m. The station is located at the left side of the road going to Brgy. Calabasa. It is marked about 10 m NW of box culvert and 6 m from the road centerline.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.53734358, '15° 32\' 14.436870\"', 121.26788790, '121° 16\' 4.396540\"', 0.0000, '0', 157.9430, 0.0000, '4', 112.8919, 314233.77440, 1718512.31500, '51', 15.53890261, '15° 32\' 20.049410\"', 121.26655110, '121° 15\' 59.583830\"', 116.4864, 1718446.58800, 528593.68500, '3', 314089.23900, 1718580.85300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
