(5007, 'NEJ-4281', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'BAGTING', 2012, 15.56038788, '15° 33\' 37.396368\"', 121.25404180, '121° 15\' 14.550480\"', 'To reach the station, form municipality of Gabaldon Welcome arc, travel South West along the national road for about 1.25 kilometers until reaching Bagting Elementary School then turn left and travel again for about 370 metes North East until reaching the house of Brgy. Bagting Kapitan Lacandosa and then walk along the foot trail for about 500 meters North West until reaching the Ranch of Judge Tolentino. Station is marked on the ground near the Alibangbang Tree, about 8.5 Meters North West of MBM-5A and 154 meters South West of NEJ-4282. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"NEJ 4281; 2012; 4TH ORDER; DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.56038788, '15° 33\' 37.396380\"', 121.25404180, '121° 15\' 14.550550\"', 0.0000, '0', 249.0960, 0.0000, '4', 204.0639, 312769.24260, 1721074.34300, '51', 15.56194867, '15° 33\' 43.015200\"', 121.25270550, '121° 15\' 9.739790\"', 207.7415, 1720994.67700, 527105.40900, '3', 312624.77400, 1721142.94400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
