(5009, 'NEJ-4283', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'BAGTING', 2012, 15.60150816, '15° 36\' 5.429376\"', 121.22782230, '121° 13\' 40.160280\"', 'To reach the station, from municipality of Gabaldon Welcome arc, travel North along the national road goint to Laur and before reaching the Bato Ferry bridge turn right on the brangay road and travel again goint to San Fernando barangeay hall for about 4.3 kilometers and then travel again for about 1.5 kilometers North East until reaching the Camomo creek and then walk again Soth for about 50 meters. The station is marked at the property lot of Lazaro Estabillo, approximately 10 meters South East of Gmelina Tree. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"NEJ 4283; 2012; 4TH ORDER; DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.60150816, '15° 36\' 5.429370\"', 121.22782230, '121° 13\' 40.160390\"', 0.0000, '0', 211.3180, 0.0000, '4', 166.4043, 309994.59910, 1725647.70800, '51', 15.60307213, '15° 36\' 11.059680\"', 121.22648690, '121° 13\' 35.352940\"', 170.1494, 1725541.56600, 524288.33700, '3', 309850.24300, 1725716.43100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
