(5018, 'NEJ-4292 (BBM-106)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'SAWMILL', 2012, 15.43432010, '15° 26\' 3.552360\"', 121.35159150, '121° 21\' 5.729400\"', 'To reach the station, from Sawmill Barangay Hall, travel West along the national road for about 260 meters and until reaching Sawmill Bridge. BBM-106 is located at the right side of the national road going to Brgy. South Poblacion. It is marked beside Brgy. Sawmill welcome arc. about 7 meters North West of Sawmill bridge, 20 meters North West of Danglan creek, 20 meters South West of house of Jun Aposaga and approximately 6 meters from the road centerline. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-106; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.43432010, '15° 26\' 3.552370\"', 121.35159150, '121° 21\' 5.729530\"', 0.0000, '0', 277.7170, 0.0000, '4', 232.7752, 323125.45130, 1707041.92000, '51', 15.43587072, '15° 26\' 9.134600\"', 121.35025240, '121° 21\' 0.908650\"', 235.7520, 1707059.72100, 537591.25800, '3', 322980.65000, 1707110.09400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5019, 'NEJ-4293 (BBM-107)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'SAWMILL', 2012, 15.43197428, '15° 25\' 55.107408\"', 121.34803940, '121° 20\' 52.941840\"', 'To reach the station, from Sawmill Barangay Hall, travel West along the national road for about 560 meters and turn left then travel along the barangay road for about 340 meters before reaching Danglan Creek. BBM-107 is located at the left side of the barangay road before reaching Danglan creek. It is marked about 40 meters North of Danglan creek, 5 meters North East of barangay road, 28 meters South West of house of Adelaida Vicencio and about 35 meters South of house of Esmeraldo Alot. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-107; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.43197428, '15° 25\' 55.107400\"', 121.34803940, '121° 20\' 52.941990\"', 0.0000, '0', 269.1010, 0.0000, '4', 224.1609, 322742.22760, 1706785.28100, '51', 15.43352483, '15° 26\' 0.689390\"', 121.34670020, '121° 20\' 48.120880\"', 227.1377, 1706799.54700, 537210.43200, '3', 322597.41500, 1706853.46500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5020, 'NEJ-4294 (BBM-108)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'CUYAPA', 2012, 15.42737513, '15° 25\' 38.550468\"', 121.35069500, '121° 21\' 2.502000\"', 'To reach the station, from Cuyapa Barangay Hall, travel North West along the national road for about 660 meters and turn left then travel along the barangay road for about 571 meters before reaching Cuyapa creek. BBM-108 is located at the left side of the barangay road befotre reaching Cuyapa creek. It is marked beside the perimeter fence of Ernesto Velasco about 15 meters North West of Cuyapa creek and 80 meters North of Santor river. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-108; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.42737513, '15° 25\' 38.550470\"', 121.35069500, '121° 21\' 2.502060\"', 0.0000, '0', 265.5170, 0.0000, '4', 220.5963, 323023.34430, 1706274.20800, '51', 15.42892533, '15° 25\' 44.131200\"', 121.34935570, '121° 20\' 57.680570\"', 223.5337, 1706291.10600, 537496.26500, '3', 322878.51900, 1706342.37900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5021, 'NEJ-4295 (BBM-117)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'BAGONG SIKAT', 2012, 15.47794321, '15° 28\' 40.595556\"', 121.30248870, '121° 18\' 8.959320\"', 'To reach the station, travel along the barangay road going to Santor River then cross along the river going to Brgy. Bugnan. The station is located between Brgy. Bagong Sikat and Bugnan beside the concrete electrical post near the Santor River. It is marked about 168 meters South West of NEJ-4267, 30 meters from Santor river. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-117; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.47794321, '15° 28\' 40.595560\"', 121.30248870, '121° 18\' 8.959360\"', 0.0000, '0', 159.4450, 0.0000, '4', 114.4212, 317893.51840, 1711909.81900, '51', 15.47949772, '15° 28\' 46.191780\"', 121.30115050, '121° 18\' 4.141810\"', 117.7282, 1711878.76000, 532314.53000, '3', 317748.81600, 1711978.19300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5022, 'NEJ-4296 (BBM-118)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'CAMACHILE', 2012, 15.46520761, '15° 27\' 54.747396\"', 121.30919720, '121° 18\' 33.109920\"', 'To reach the station, from Camachile Brgy. Hall, walk along the road going West for about 250 meters then turn right at the end corner of the road and walk again for about 535 meters going North West and turn left going to abandoned road. The station is located in front of a farm lot of Junior Estifanio and about 460 meters North West of NEJ-4256. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-118; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.46520761, '15° 27\' 54.747410\"', 121.30919720, '121° 18\' 33.109770\"', 0.0000, '0', 163.6280, 0.0000, '4', 118.6202, 318602.27480, 1710494.93400, '51', 15.46676116, '15° 28\' 0.340180\"', 121.30785870, '121° 18\' 28.291180\"', 121.8572, 1710470.57000, 533036.36600, '3', 318457.53600, 1710563.27500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5023, 'NEJ-4297 (BBM-120)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'BAGTING', 2012, 15.47353045, '15° 28\' 24.709620\"', 121.29365170, '121° 17\' 37.146120\"', 'To station is located at Brgy. Bagting near the Municipality of Gabaldon Welcome Arc. It is marked 40 meters North West of km 151 post, 91 meters North West of NEJ-4236 and 6 meters from the road centerline. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-120; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\". Note: Wrong coordinates', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.47353045, '15° 28\' 24.709630\"', 121.29365170, '121° 17\' 37.146010\"', 0.0000, '0', 151.8050, 0.0000, '4', 106.8084, 316941.37100, 1711429.06000, '51', 15.47508488, '15° 28\' 30.305560\"', 121.29231330, '121° 17\' 32.328030\"', 110.0966, 1711389.20000, 531366.92900, '3', 316796.64600, 1711497.45800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5024, 'NEJ-4298 (BBM-124)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'CALABASA', 2012, 15.45622497, '15° 27\' 22.409892\"', 121.32677690, '121° 19\' 36.396840\"', 'The station is located between Brgy. Calabasa at Bagting at the right side of the national road going to Brgy. Calabasa proper. It is marked beside the welcome arc of Brgy. Calabasa, about 305 meters South East of NEJ-4279, 38 meters South West of Pablo Gaspar house and 5 meters from the road centerline. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-124; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.45622497, '15° 27\' 22.409890\"', 121.32677690, '121° 19\' 36.396950\"', 0.0000, '0', 193.3930, 0.0000, '4', 148.3824, 320481.04570, 1709486.23500, '51', 15.45777755, '15° 27\' 27.999180\"', 121.32543830, '121° 19\' 31.577720\"', 151.5530, 1709479.37600, 534924.35700, '3', 320336.29300, 1709554.51100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5025, 'NEJ-4299 (BBM-125)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'BAGTING', 2012, 15.45145604, '15° 27\' 5.241744\"', 121.31902290, '121° 19\' 8.482440\"', 'To reach the station, from Municipality of Gabaldon welcome arc travel along the national road for about 4.5 kilometers, then turn right on the foot trail until reaching Mt. Bugton and walk again until reaching the Santor river then cross the river to reach Mt. Cupang. The station is located between Brgy. Bagting and Calabasa. It is located at the foot of Mt. Cupang, about 16 meters South West of Santor river and 400 meters West of Mt. Bugton. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-125; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.45145604, '15° 27\' 5.241750\"', 121.31902290, '121° 19\' 8.482460\"', 0.0000, '0', 165.6650, 0.0000, '4', 120.6710, 319644.78950, 1708965.04600, '51', 15.45300850, '15° 27\' 10.830600\"', 121.31768410, '121° 19\' 3.662760\"', 123.8297, 1708950.47000, 534092.99300, '3', 319500.01400, 1709033.34400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5026, 'NEJ-43', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CARRANGLAN', 'R.A.PADILLA', 1989, 15.94084936, '15° 56\' 27.057696\"', 121.04455550, '121° 2\' 40.399800\"', 'NEJ - 43 From the road intersection of Carranglan town proper and Bureau of Forestry seedling station; approx. 1.6 Km. from the steel bridge on Maringalo Village. Continue traveling on the dirt road, take right fork on road junction after 0.1 Km; take right fork again on another road junction after 0.15 Km., then take the left fork on road junction after 0.40 Km. and on the last road junction after 0.5 Km., take the left fork. There is an existing foot trail on the left side of the road that leads to the station on top of the hill, approx. 0.9 Km. from the last road junction. Turn left and travel along the dirt road to the foot of the hill for 250 meters and from the foot of the hill to the station is about 100 meters walk. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in standard conc. block, 0.70 m. deep, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with station name. Sub-surface mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. diameter brass rod set in conc. block, top of brass rod is 0.78 m. below station mark. Reference mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. diameter brass rods set in conc. blocks, 0.60 m. deep, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name and RM numbers.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.94084936, '15° 56\' 27.057710\"', 121.04455550, '121° 2\' 40.399840\"', 0.0000, '0', 439.1963, 0.0000, '1', 394.5079, 290687.73400, 1763373.73300, '51', 15.94243867, '15° 56\' 32.779220\"', 121.04322790, '121° 2\' 35.620310\"', 399.4890, 1763078.23400, 504628.02200, '3', 290544.35700, 1763443.33400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5027, 'NEJ-4300', 'Luzon', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'CALABASA', 2012, 15.52622427, '15° 31\' 34.407372\"', 121.27675430, '121° 16\' 36.315480\"', 'To reach the station, from Municipality of Gabaldon welcome arc travel along the national road for about 4.5 kilometers, then turn left on the foot trail and walk again for about 458 meters. The station is located between Brgy. Bagting and Calabasa. It is located at the foot of the mountain, about 7 meters from Imindayong creek. Mark is the head of 4\' nail set flushed and centered on top of a concrete monument 20x20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-126; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.52622427, '15° 31\' 34.407370\"', 121.27675430, '121° 16\' 36.315390\"', 0.0000, '0', 142.0150, 0.0000, '4', 96.9528, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.52778241, '15° 31\' 40.016660\"', 121.27541720, '121° 16\' 31.501820\"', 100.5040, 1717217.41600, 529546.36800, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jun Panes', '2013-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5028, 'NEJ-4300 (BBM-126)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'BAGTING', 2012, 15.45934793, '15° 27\' 33.652548\"', 121.32940560, '121° 19\' 45.860160\"', 'To reach the station, from Municipality of Gabalon welcome arc travel along the national road for about 4.5 kilometers, then turn left on the foot trail and walk again for about 458 meters. the station is located between Brgy. Bagting and Calabasa. It is located at the foot of the mountain, about 7 meters from Imindayong creek. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-126; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.45934793, '15° 27\' 33.652550\"', 121.32940560, '121° 19\' 45.860010\"', 0.0000, '0', 273.7290, 0.0000, '4', 228.7076, 320765.82470, 1709829.59500, '51', 15.46090063, '15° 27\' 39.242280\"', 121.32806700, '121° 19\' 41.041120\"', 231.8920, 1709825.35200, 535205.93300, '3', 320621.08700, 1709897.86300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5029, 'NEJ-4301 (BBM-132)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'BUGNAN', 2012, 15.49063398, '15° 29\' 26.282328\"', 121.28126870, '121° 16\' 52.567320\"', 'To reach the station, from Gabaldon Municipal Hall, travel along the national road for about 7.8 kilometers going to Brgy. Ligaya then turn left on the barangay road and travel again for about 2.6 kilometers going to Santor River and then walk again crossing the river for about 660 meters west until reaching the farm lot of Hermie Limos. The station is located at the farm lot of Hermie Limos. It is marked near the house of Mr. Limos near the Bamboo grass. It is about 410 meters South East of Santor river. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-132; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.49063398, '15° 29\' 26.282340\"', 121.28126870, '121° 16\' 52.567300\"', 0.0000, '0', 155.2970, 0.0000, '4', 110.3044, 315627.73010, 1713332.20100, '51', 15.49218977, '15° 29\' 31.883160\"', 121.27993080, '121° 16\' 47.750710\"', 113.6693, 1713279.96300, 530035.72700, '3', 315483.05200, 1713400.65500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
