(5030, 'NEJ-4302 (BBM-133)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'MALINAO', 2012, 15.50296796, '15° 30\' 10.684656\"', 121.32194710, '121° 19\' 19.009560\"', 'To reach the station, from Gabaldon Municipal Hall, travel north along the national road going to Laur until reaching the Dupinga Bridge. The station is located at the ride side of the national road after reaching the Dupinga bridge going to Barangay Ligaya. It is marked 11 meters North East of Duping Bridge, 15 meters North of Methodist Church, 15 meters East of NEJ-3176, 80 meters North of Dupinga River and 6 meters for the road centerline. NOTE: BBM-133 is offset from the road centerline. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-133; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.50296796, '15° 30\' 10.684660\"', 121.32194710, '121° 19\' 19.009590\"', 0.0000, '0', 190.6480, 0.0000, '4', 145.5020, 320003.17030, 1714662.39400, '51', 15.50452362, '15° 30\' 16.285020\"', 121.32060950, '121° 19\' 14.194290\"', 148.9582, 1714650.73200, 534398.43300, '3', 319858.56800, 1714730.72700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5031, 'NEJ-4303 (BBM-136)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'MALINAO', 2012, 15.50230685, '15° 30\' 8.304660\"', 121.32394620, '121° 19\' 26.206320\"', 'To reach the station, from Gabaldon Municipal Hall, travel along the national road going to Municipality of Laur and after reaching the Dupinga River turn right on the rough road and travel again for about 230 meters East. The station is marked at the right side of the road, it is approximately 45 meters South of Anecita Reyes Vendiola house, 50 meters South West of Dupinga river and about 229 meters East of BBM-133. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-136; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.50230685, '15° 30\' 8.304650\"', 121.32394620, '121° 19\' 26.206330\"', 0.0000, '0', 201.9910, 0.0000, '4', 156.8412, 320217.08440, 1714587.56300, '51', 15.50386241, '15° 30\' 13.904670\"', 121.32260860, '121° 19\' 21.391030\"', 160.2940, 1714577.89500, 534613.02900, '3', 320072.48300, 1714655.88800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5032, 'NEJ-4304 (BBM-137)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'PINAMALISAN', 2012, 15.43136363, '15° 25\' 52.909068\"', 121.35491950, '121° 21\' 17.710200\"', 'To reach the station, from Gabaldon Minicipal Hall, travel along the national road going to Dingalan for about 3.8 kilometers until reaching the Canonan creek. The station is located between Brgy. Cuyapa and Pinamalisan at the right side of the nationl road going to Brgy. Pinamalisan and beside the concrete barrier. It is marked near the Canonan creek approximately 75 meters North West of NEJ-4189, 12 meters South of KM 173 post and about 6 meters from the centerline of the national road. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-137; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.43136363, '15° 25\' 52.909070\"', 121.35491950, '121° 21\' 17.710360\"', 0.0000, '0', 272.9750, 0.0000, '4', 228.0488, 323480.13200, 1706712.05900, '51', 15.43291399, '15° 25\' 58.490360\"', 121.35358030, '121° 21\' 12.889240\"', 230.9932, 1706733.16300, 537948.97400, '3', 323335.32300, 1706780.22000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5033, 'NEJ-4305 (BBM-138)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'CALABASA', 2012, 15.51809178, '15° 31\' 5.130408\"', 121.28344870, '121° 17\' 0.415320\"', 'To reach the station, from Gabaldon Municipal Hall, travel North along the national road going to Brgy. Calabasa until reaching the old Concepcion Bridge. The satation is marked in front of Ponaciano Gagala farm lot beside the concrete electric post, about 122 meters South West of the old bridge, 220 meters North East of NEJ-4229 and about 9 meters from the road centerline. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-138; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.51809178, '15° 31\' 5.130400\"', 121.28344870, '121° 17\' 0.415300\"', 0.0000, '0', 147.2420, 0.0000, '4', 102.1764, 315885.98360, 1716368.59500, '51', 15.51964925, '15° 31\' 10.737300\"', 121.28211140, '121° 16\' 55.601080\"', 105.6900, 1716318.47200, 530265.70700, '3', 315741.39900, 1716437.06600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5034, 'NEJ-4306 (BBM-139)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'CALABASA', 2012, 15.51505892, '15° 30\' 54.212112\"', 121.26832540, '121° 16\' 5.971440\"', 'To reach the station, from Gabaldon Municipal Hall, travel North along the national road going to Brgy. Calabasa until reaching the old Concepcion Bridge, then walk going North West crossing the Santor River for about 1.7 kilometers. The station is marked at foot of Mt. Antipa at the corner farm lot of Joel Libunao and Domeng Flores, 8 meters North East of mango tree, 180 meters South of Antipa River and 190 meters North west Domeng Flores Nipa house. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-139; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.51505892, '15° 30\' 54.212100\"', 121.26832540, '121° 16\' 5.971320\"', 0.0000, '0', 146.4680, 0.0000, '4', 101.4670, 314260.74580, 1716046.06600, '51', 15.51661654, '15° 30\' 59.819530\"', 121.26698800, '121° 16\' 1.156720\"', 104.9442, 1715980.84300, 528643.63100, '3', 314116.13700, 1716114.58300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5035, 'NEJ-4307 (BBM-140)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'CALABASA', 2012, 15.52300711, '15° 31\' 22.825596\"', 121.28635270, '121° 17\' 10.869720\"', 'To reach the station, from Gabaldon Municipal Hall, travel North along the national road going to Brgy. Calabasa until reaching the old Concepcion Bridge, then walk going South East crossing the Inasan creek for about 586 meters. The station is marked at property lot of Renante Novilla, 30 meters North East of Nipa house, 366 meters East of Inasan creek 586 meters South East of NEJ-4229. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-140; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.52300711, '15° 31\' 22.825600\"', 121.28635270, '121° 17\' 10.869720\"', 0.0000, '0', 162.3050, 0.0000, '4', 117.2129, 316201.89610, 1716909.99100, '51', 15.52456483, '15° 31\' 28.433400\"', 121.28501550, '121° 17\' 6.055900\"', 120.7610, 1716862.76100, 530576.54700, '3', 316057.32900, 1716978.45800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5036, 'NEJ-4308 (BBM-141)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'TAGUMPAY', 2012, 15.50150043, '15° 30\' 5.401548\"', 121.30653460, '121° 18\' 23.524560\"', 'To reach the station, from Gabaldon Municipal Hall, travel North along the national road going to Brgy. Bagong Sikat until reaching the quarry site, then travel again going North East for about 1.2 kilometers until reaching the Dupinga River. The station is located near the river approximately 1.6 kilometers South West of Dupinga bridge. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-141; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.50150043, '15° 30\' 5.401540\"', 121.30653460, '121° 18\' 23.524610\"', 0.0000, '0', 170.0460, 0.0000, '4', 124.9566, 318348.24780, 1714513.01800, '51', 15.50305634, '15° 30\' 11.002810\"', 121.30519700, '121° 18\' 18.709090\"', 128.3893, 1714485.97300, 532745.02600, '3', 318203.62700, 1714581.40000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5037, 'NEJ-4309 (BBM-142)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'TAGUMPAY', 2012, 15.49398985, '15° 29\' 38.363460\"', 121.31422760, '121° 18\' 51.219360\"', 'To reach the station, from Gabaldon Municipal Hall, travel North along the national road going to Brgy. Ligaya and before reaching the Dupinga Bridge turn left on the barangay road and travel again for about 860 meters South East until reaching the Bagong Sikat cementery. The station is located at the right side of the barangay road. It is marked at the corner of the cementery. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-142; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.49398985, '15° 29\' 38.363450\"', 121.31422760, '121° 18\' 51.219200\"', 0.0000, '0', 173.7150, 0.0000, '4', 128.6225, 319167.11180, 1713675.46000, '51', 15.49554511, '15° 29\' 43.962390\"', 121.31288970, '121° 18\' 46.403090\"', 132.0173, 1713656.09600, 533571.61500, '3', 319022.47300, 1713743.81000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5038, 'NEJ-4310 (BBM-143)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'TAGUMPAY', 2012, 15.48010238, '15° 28\' 48.368568\"', 121.31100860, '121° 18\' 39.630960\"', 'To reach the station, from Gabaldon Municipal Hall, travel North along the national road going to Brgy. Tagumpay. The station is located at the corner lot of Mr. Jose Gatchalian beside the concrete electrical post. It is marked about 155 meters South West of Brgy. Tagumpay waiting shed, 11 meters North East of Iglesiang Itinayo ni Jesukristo chapel, 10 meters South East of NEJ-45220. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-143; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.48010238, '15° 28\' 48.368560\"', 121.31100860, '121° 18\' 39.631040\"', 0.0000, '0', 162.6110, 0.0000, '4', 117.5628, 318809.63120, 1712141.51900, '51', 15.48165683, '15° 28\' 53.964590\"', 121.30967050, '121° 18\' 34.813720\"', 120.8800, 1712118.95100, 533228.41700, '3', 318664.94300, 1712209.86800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5039, 'NEJ-4311 (BBM-144)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GABALDON', 'BANTUG', 2012, 15.45425027, '15° 27\' 15.300972\"', 121.31984810, '121° 19\' 11.453160\"', 'To reach the station, from Brgy. Bantug welcome arc, travel along the farm to market road or about 1 kilometer and before reaching the Brgy. Bantug Plaza turn right and travel again in barangay road passing through the Brgy. Bantug Cementery for about 2.20 kilometers until reaching the farm lot of Emetrio Figuracion. The station is located at the corner farm lot of Mr. Figuracion and Angelino Galvez. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed and centered on the top of a concrete monument 20 x 20 cm. with inscriptions \"MUN. OF; GABALDON; CAD 1330-D; BBM-144; PROV. OF; N. ECIJA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.45425027, '15° 27\' 15.300970\"', 121.31984810, '121° 19\' 11.453120\"', 0.0000, '0', 169.2580, 0.0000, '4', 124.2589, 319735.76340, 1709273.53500, '51', 15.45580289, '15° 27\' 20.890390\"', 121.31850940, '121° 19\' 6.633670\"', 127.4290, 1709259.78000, 534181.10000, '3', 319590.99800, 1709341.83200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
