(5232, 'NEJ-45', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'BONGABON', 'CALAANAN', 1990, 15.65949406, '15° 39\' 34.178616\"', 121.22034430, '121° 13\' 13.239480\"', 'NEJ-45 From Cabanatuan City, travel E along the national highway towards Bongabon town for about 28 km. From Bongabon, travel NE towards Brgy. Digmala for about 10 km. up to the road intersection that leads to the river. Turn left and proceed farther for about 150 m. Follow the foot trail that leads to the station. The station is located on top of a 0.65 m. x 0.90 m. boulder, 0.50 m. above the ground surface. It is 300 m. walk on the NW direction from Digmala Primary School located at the road and the foot trail intersection; and about 40 m. S of the river bank. Station mark is a cross cut on top of a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set on a drill hole, centered on a cement patty on top of a 0.65 m. x 0.90 m. dia. boulder; 0.050 m. above the ground surface and inscribed on top with station name. All reference marks are cross cuts on top of a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods set on drill holes, centered on cement patty on top of the irregular shaped boulders and inscribed with station name and RM numbers.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.65949406, '15° 39\' 34.178610\"', 121.22034430, '121° 13\' 13.239300\"', 0.0000, '0', 204.5807, 0.0000, '1', 159.6930, 309246.32540, 1732070.91900, '51', 15.66106185, '15° 39\' 39.822670\"', 121.21901020, '121° 13\' 8.436750\"', 163.6030, 1731956.93800, 523479.92600, '3', 309102.15700, 1732139.71500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
