(5432, 'NEJ-47', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CARRANGLAN', 'R.A.PADILLA', 1990, 15.96736608, '15° 58\' 2.517888\"', 121.04593050, '121° 2\' 45.349800\"', 'NEJ - 47 From Cabanatuan City proper, travel northward along the national highway for 70.7 kilometers or 1 hour and 45 minutes drive up to barangay Digdig junction in Carranglan town. Then turn right and travel eastward along the concrete road for 10.9 kilometers up to DENR RP-Japan Training Center (Forestry Project) in barangay Padilla. Turn left and continue traveling, northward along the dirt road-going up hill for 500 meters up to the concrete water reservoir. Station was established on the western side, on top of the 3 meters high and 5.5 meters concrete water reservoir. Station mark is 0.07 m. x 0.01 m. diameter brass rod with cross cut on top, set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 2.0 cm. cement patty on top of the concrete water reservoir, 3.0 meters high and 5.5 meters diameter.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.96736608, '15° 58\' 2.517890\"', 121.04593050, '121° 2\' 45.349850\"', 0.0000, '0', 351.4848, 0.0000, '1', 306.6800, 290862.48470, 1766306.93000, '51', 15.96895704, '15° 58\' 8.245350\"', 121.04460350, '121° 2\' 40.572500\"', 311.8540, 1766012.43200, 504774.66900, '3', 290719.19500, 1766376.55200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
