(5591, 'NEJ-4858', 'Luzon', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'PORTAL', 2014, 15.73166747, '15° 43\' 54.002892\"', 121.05231790, '121° 3\' 8.344440\"', 'NEJ - 4858 The newly established Municipal Boundary Monument is to be found in the Brgy. of Portal Municipality of Rizal, province of Nueva Ecija. The monument is to be found at the boundary of Brgy. Bagong Sikat Mun. of San Jose, Brgy. Portal Municipality of Rizal and Brgy. San Felipe Mun. of Llanera. This Monument is located 480 meters north east of the creek and 585 meters southeast of MBM No. 18-A. Mark is the head of a 4 inch brass rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions\'\' MUN. OF RIZAL, MUN. OF LLANERA, MUN. OF SAN JOSE, CAD-137, MBM NO.17-A, PROV. OF NUEVA ECIJA.\'\'', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.73166747, '15° 43\' 54.002890\"', 121.05231790, '121° 3\' 8.344590\"', 0.0000, '0', 135.4686, 0.0000, '4', 91.4823, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.73324359, '15° 43\' 59.676920\"', 121.05098530, '121° 3\' 3.547190\"', 95.1140, 1739931.95200, 505464.16700, '3', 291160.00100, 1740285.71900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', '');
