(5592, 'NEJ-4859', 'Luzon', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'PORTAL', 2014, 15.73522718, '15° 44\' 6.817848\"', 121.04828470, '121° 2\' 53.824920\"', 'NEJ - 4859 The newly established Municipal Boundary Monument is to be found in the Brgy. of Portal, Municipality of Rizal, Province of Nueva Ecija. The monument is to be found at the boundary of Brgy. Bagong Sikat Mun.of San Jose and Brgy. Portal mun. of Rizal. The monument is located 585 meters northwest of MBM no. 17-A and 340 meters northeast of the creek. Mark is the head of a 4 inch bras rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions\'\'MUN. OF RIZAL, MUN. OF SAN JOSE, CAD-137, MBM NO. 18-A, PROV. OF NUEVA ECIJA.\'\'', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.73522718, '15° 44\' 6.817850\"', 121.04828470, '121° 2\' 53.824970\"', 0.0000, '0', 137.6932, 0.0000, '4', 93.7236, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.73680361, '15° 44\' 12.493000\"', 121.04695220, '121° 2\' 49.027850\"', 97.3590, 1740325.74800, 505031.84100, '3', 290731.34200, 1740683.66700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5593, 'NEJ-4860', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'PORTAL', 2014, 15.73871637, '15° 44\' 19.378932\"', 121.05844030, '121° 3\' 30.385080\"', 'NEJ - 4860 The newly established Municipal Boundary Monument is to be found in the Brgy. of Portal, Municipality of of Rizal. Province of Nueva Ecija. The monument is to be found at boundary of Brgy. Villa joson Mun. of San Jose and Brgy. Portal Mun. of Rizal. This monument is located along the national road bound to Rizal- san Jose and near the creek. Mark is the head of a 4 inch brass rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions\'\'MUN. OF RIZAL, MUN. OF SAN JOSE, CAD-137, MBM NO. 19-A, PROV. OF NUEVA ECIJA.\'\'', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.73871637, '15° 44\' 19.378930\"', 121.05844030, '121° 3\' 30.385220\"', 0.0000, '0', 143.4843, 0.0000, '4', 99.4468, 291967.48230, 1740990.34500, '51', 15.74029279, '15° 44\' 25.054060\"', 121.05710790, '121° 3\' 25.588460\"', 103.1360, 1740712.07400, 506120.12100, '3', 291823.43800, 1741059.73900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5594, 'NEJ-4861', 'Luzon', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'SANTA MONICA', 2014, 15.74608023, '15° 44\' 45.888828\"', 121.08269190, '121° 4\' 57.690840\"', 'NEJ - 4861 The newly established Municipal Boundary Monument is to be found in the Brgy. of Sta. Monica, Municipality of Rizal, Province of Nueva Ecija. The monuiment is to be found at tri- boundary Mun. of Rizal, province of Nueva Ecija. The monument is located along the barangay road and near the mountain. Mark is the head of a 4 inch brass rod flushed in cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions \'\'MUN. OF RIZAL, MUN. OF SAN JOSE, MUN. OF PANTABANGAN, CAD-137, MBM NO. 20-A, PROV. OF NUEVA ECIJA.\'\'', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.74608023, '15° 44\' 45.888840\"', 121.08269190, '121° 4\' 57.690900\"', 0.0000, '0', 132.2481, 0.0000, '4', 88.0506, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.74765659, '15° 44\' 51.563730\"', 121.08135970, '121° 4\' 52.894880\"', 91.8630, 1741527.69000, 508718.81500, '3', 294430.20900, 1741850.83700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5595, 'NEJ-4862', 'Luzon', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'POBLACION SUR', 2014, 15.70768728, '15° 42\' 27.674208\"', 121.10208000, '121° 6\' 7.488000\"', 'NEJ -4862 The newly established Bureau of Land Location Monument is to be found in Brgy. Poblacion Sur in Southeastern in front of Muncipal Hall of Rizal, Province of Nueva Ecija. Mark is the head of a 4 inch brass rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriprtions \'\' RIZAL N.E. BLLM NO. 1-A , CAD-137, DENR R -03, 2014', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.70768728, '15° 42\' 27.674190\"', 121.10208000, '121° 6\' 7.488160\"', 0.0000, '0', 128.5720, 0.0000, '4', 84.3421, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.70926079, '15° 42\' 33.338830\"', 121.10074690, '121° 6\' 2.688990\"', 88.0250, 1737280.30600, 510798.45400, '3', 296469.89100, 1737583.25000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5596, 'NEJ-4862 (BLLM-1A)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'POBLACION SUR', 2014, 15.70768732, '15° 42\' 27.674352\"', 121.10208000, '121° 6\' 7.488000\"', 'Mark is the head of a 4 inch brass rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions \'\' RIZAL N.E., BLLM NO. 1-A, CAD-137, DENR R-03,2014\" The newly established Bureau of Land location monument is to be found in Brgy. Poblacion Sur in Southeastern portion in front of Municipal Hall of Rizal, Province of Nueva Ecija.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.70768732, '15° 42\' 27.674350\"', 121.10208000, '121° 6\' 7.488160\"', 0.0000, '0', 128.5720, 0.0000, '4', 84.3422, 296614.00150, 1737514.02800, '51', 15.70926079, '15° 42\' 33.338860\"', 121.10074690, '121° 6\' 2.688950\"', 88.0250, 1737280.30700, 510798.45300, '3', 296469.89000, 1737583.25100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'ysn', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5597, 'NEJ-4863 (BLLM-41)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'PORTAL', 2014, 15.73555993, '15° 44\' 8.015748\"', 121.06110360, '121° 3\' 39.972960\"', 'Mark is the head of a 4 inch brass rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions \'\' RIZAL N.E., BLLM NO. 41, CAD-137, DENR R-03,2014\" The newly established Bureau of Land location monument is to be found in Brgy. Portal, Municipality of Rizal, Province of Nueva Ecija. the monument is to be found inside the Brgy. Compound of Portal at the Southwestern Portion.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.73555993, '15° 44\' 8.015730\"', 121.06110360, '121° 3\' 39.972950\"', 0.0000, '0', 142.0160, 0.0000, '4', 97.9691, 292249.72900, 1740638.41000, '51', 15.73713606, '15° 44\' 13.689800\"', 121.05977110, '121° 3\' 35.175890\"', 101.6517, 1740362.87800, 506405.62600, '3', 292105.67500, 1740707.78900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5598, 'NEJ-49', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CARRANGLAN', 'JOSON', 1995, 15.95206317, '15° 57\' 7.427412\"', 120.97746220, '120° 58\' 38.863920\"', 'NEJ-49 From San Jose City travel north going to Nueva Viscaya along the National Highway for about 32 minutes. The Station is located at barangay Digdig at the junction going to Carranglan proper. It is situated on the N corner of the junction, about 10.5 m. E of national road centerline, 21 m. N of Carranglan welcome marker and 0.5 m. North of the inner corner of drainage. Station mark is a 4\" concrete nail centered in a concrete block, 0.31 m. x 0.31 m. x 0.70 m, protruding 0.10 m. above the ground surface with inscription, NEJ-49, 1995, NAMRIA. WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 57 7.42740 E 120 58 38.86396 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 325.181', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.95206317, '15° 57\' 7.427400\"', 120.97746220, '120° 58\' 38.863960\"', 0.0000, '0', 325.1810, 0.0000, '3', 280.7052, 283515.54880, 1764683.31900, '51', 15.95365469, '15° 57\' 13.156880\"', 120.97613470, '120° 58\' 34.084890\"', 285.6700, 1764318.91400, 497445.09600, '3', 283372.15000, 1764753.15000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5599, 'NEJ-50', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CARRANGLAN', 'JOSON', 1995, 15.94678734, '15° 56\' 48.434424\"', 120.97693410, '120° 58\' 36.962760\"', 'NEJ-50 To reach the station, travel N along the national highway going ìto Nueva Viscaya for about 30 min. The station is located at the ìSW end of the bridge with superstructure. It is about 2.2 m. S of ìthe SW end of the bridge and about 4 m. W from the centerline of ìthe national road. It is about 120 m. S of the Digdig Elem. ìSchool. Station mark is a 4\" concrete nail centered in a concrete ìblock, 0.31 m. x 0.31 m. x 0.7 m., protruding 0.1 m. above the ìground surface with inscription \"NEJ-50, 1995, NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 56 48.43525 E 120 58 36.94991 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 327.069 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.94678734, '15° 56\' 48.434410\"', 120.97693410, '120° 58\' 36.962590\"', 0.0000, '0', 327.2029, 0.0000, '3', 282.7565, 283453.32910, 1764099.97700, '51', 15.94837854, '15° 56\' 54.162740\"', 120.97560640, '120° 58\' 32.183070\"', 287.6773, 1763735.13300, 497388.47200, '3', 283309.91200, 1764169.80500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5600, 'NEJ-51', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN JOSE CITY', 'CALAOCAN', 1995, 15.78600580, '15° 47\' 9.620880\"', 120.99121530, '120° 59\' 28.375080\"', 'NEJ-51 From Manila travel north along the national highway for about 160 ìkms. to reach San Jose City proper. From the municipal town hall ìtravel south along Cardenas Street. The station is located inside ìthe compound of Constacio National High School. It is about 4 m. ìWest of DECS bldg., 7 m. SW of the NW corner of the said bldg. ìand about 25 m. SW from the entrance gate. Station mark is 4\" ìconcrete nail centered in a concrete block, 0.31 m. x 0.31 m. x ì0.70 m. flushed with the ground surface with inscription, NEJ-51, ì1995, NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.78600580, '15° 47\' 9.620880\"', 120.99121530, '120° 59\' 28.375040\"', 0.0000, '0', 151.2381, 0.0000, '3', 107.4620, 284811.88450, 1746291.28800, '51', 15.78758651, '15° 47\' 15.311420\"', 120.98988390, '120° 59\' 23.581980\"', 111.1941, 1745944.06600, 498916.13100, '3', 284667.94300, 1746360.92000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5601, 'NEJ-52', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN JOSE CITY', 'CALAOCAN', 1995, 15.78474951, '15° 47\' 5.098236\"', 120.98934460, '120° 59\' 21.640560\"', 'NEJ-52 To reach the station from the municipal town hall, travel S along ìCardenas St. It is located inside the compound of Constacio ìNat\'l. High School. It is about 15 m. NE of the junction of ìMolave and Yakal Sts., 40 m. W of the W side of the alumni bldg., ì10 m. SW of the SW corner of Felimon type school bldg., 4 m. N of ìthe wooden electric post and 2 m. E of the W fence of the school ìcompound. Mark is a 4\" concrete nail centered on a 0.31 m. x 0.31 ìm. x 0.70 m. concrete block protruding 0.1 m. above the ground ìsurface, with inscriptions \"NEJ-52, 1995, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.78474951, '15° 47\' 5.098230\"', 120.98934460, '120° 59\' 21.640600\"', 0.0000, '0', 149.6480, 0.0000, '3', 105.8878, 284610.09250, 1746154.16700, '51', 15.78633031, '15° 47\' 10.789130\"', 120.98801310, '120° 59\' 16.847320\"', 109.6050, 1745805.08500, 498715.68600, '3', 284466.14200, 1746223.82000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5602, 'NEJ-53', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SCIENCE CITY OF MUÑOZ', 'BANTUG', 1995, 15.73493329, '15° 44\' 5.759844\"', 120.93501750, '120° 56\' 6.063000\"', 'NEJ-53 From Manila travel north along the national highway going to ìMunoz for about 150 km. The station is located near the second ìgate of Central Luzon State University (CLSU) along the national ìhighway. It is about 50 m. SE of Academinc Affairs Bldg., 40 m. W ìof CLSU veterinary Hospital., 13 m. E of guard house, 6 m. NW of ìroad centerline, 5 m. SE of CLSU Fence and 4 m. E of electric ìpost. Station mark is 4 inches concrete nail set in a drilled ìhole with cement putty and inscribed with station name, NEJ-53, ì1995, NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.73493329, '15° 44\' 5.759840\"', 120.93501750, '120° 56\' 6.062890\"', 0.0000, '0', 120.6110, 0.0000, '3', 77.3415, 278734.21260, 1740697.17500, '51', 15.73651216, '15° 44\' 11.443790\"', 120.93368480, '120° 56\' 1.265100\"', 80.5510, 1740294.05700, 492893.01800, '3', 278590.05000, 1740766.96000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5603, 'NEJ-54', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SCIENCE CITY OF MUÑOZ', 'BANTUG', 1995, 15.72990316, '15° 43\' 47.651376\"', 120.92987150, '120° 55\' 47.537400\"', 'NEJ-54 From Manila, travel N along the national highway going to Muñoz ìfor about 149 km. Station is located along the national highway ìopposite of the Central Luzon State University (CLSU). It is ìabout 30 m. SE of the CLSU main gate, 15 m. SW of two waiting ìsheds, 11.5 m. NE from the centerline of the dirt road, 7.5 m. SE ìfrom the centerline of the national highway and 0.5 m. NE of the ìPublic Assistance Marker. Mark is a 4\" concrete nail centered in ìa 0.31 m. x 0.31 m. x 0.7 m. concrete block protruding 0.1 m. ìabove the ground surface, with inscriptions \"NEJ-54 1995 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.72990316, '15° 43\' 47.651390\"', 120.92987150, '120° 55\' 47.537240\"', 0.0000, '0', 118.3900, 0.0000, '3', 75.1658, 278177.14790, 1740145.87300, '51', 15.73148184, '15° 43\' 53.334610\"', 120.92853860, '120° 55\' 42.738990\"', 78.3270, 1739737.66000, 492341.31900, '3', 278032.96400, 1740215.67000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'ysn', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5604, 'NEJ-55', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'TALAVERA', 'PAG-ASA', 1995, 15.58457399, '15° 35\' 4.466364\"', 120.91900460, '120° 55\' 8.416560\"', 'NEJ-55 From Manila travel north along the national highway for about 130 ìkms. to reach the municipal town hall. The station is located NE ìof the NE corner of Municipal town hall. It is inside the ìmunicipal park about 13 m. N of the N corner of the church 70 m. ìW from centerline of the national road and 13 m. S from ìcenterline of A. Diaz street. It is on the west side of the ìconcrete pavement and 3 m. from its NW corner. Station mark is a ì4\" copper nail centered in a concrete block 0.31 m. x 0.031 m. x ì0.70 m., flushed with the ground surface with inscription, ìNEJ-55, 1995, NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.58457399, '15° 35\' 4.466360\"', 120.91900460, '120° 55\' 8.416480\"', 0.0000, '0', 86.3198, 0.0000, '3', 43.4951, 276854.54850, 1724073.19800, '51', 15.58614361, '15° 35\' 10.116990\"', 120.91766830, '120° 55\' 3.605960\"', 45.8498, 1723657.33800, 491170.08800, '3', 276709.87400, 1724142.88900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'mara', '2017-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5605, 'NEJ-56', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'TALAVERA', 'PAG-ASA', 1995, 15.58527923, '15° 35\' 7.005228\"', 120.91738690, '120° 55\' 2.592840\"', 'NEJ-56 From Manila travel north along the national highway for about 130 ìkms. to reach the municipal town hall. The station is located NW ìof Municipal Town Hall. It is situated on the east corner of the ì15 m. long plant box elevated about 0.6 m. from the ground ìsurface, which is near the NW corner of the intersection of Roxas ìand A. Diaz street. It is about 9 m. W of centerline of Roxas St. ìand 4.5 m. N of centerline of A. Dias street, about 90 m. NE of ìElevated steel water tank of School and 12 m. NW of barangay ìoutpost. Station mark is a 4\" copper nail centered in a concrete ìblock 0.31 m. x 0.31 m. x 0.70 m., protruding 0.1 m. above the ìsurface with inscription, NEJ-56 1995, NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.58527923, '15° 35\' 7.005240\"', 120.91738690, '120° 55\' 2.592690\"', 0.0000, '0', 86.0610, 0.0000, '3', 43.2465, 276681.77690, 1724152.94500, '51', 15.58684907, '15° 35\' 12.656650\"', 120.91605060, '120° 54\' 57.782120\"', 45.5970, 1723735.46000, 490996.62000, '3', 276537.10000, 1724222.65600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5606, 'NEJ-57', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'KAPITAN PEPE', 1995, 15.47065086, '15° 28\' 14.343096\"', 120.95481730, '120° 57\' 17.342280\"', 'NEJ-57 From Manila, travel N along the national highway going to Cabanatuan for about 2-3/4 hrs. The station is located inside the Kapitan Pepe Housing Subd. where the city hall is located. It is about 200 m. E of the city hall\'s flag pole, 50 m. NW of the centerline of the national road, 35 m. NW of the tower of Samson Motor Works, and situated at the SE end of the second island from the national road and 0.3 m. from its wall. Station mark is a 4\" concrete nail centered in a drilled hole with cement putty and inscribed with station name \"NEJ-57, 1995, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.47065086, '15° 28\' 14.343110\"', 120.95481730, '120° 57\' 17.342440\"', 0.0000, '0', 72.1080, 0.0000, '3', 29.2129, 280575.64500, 1711428.09700, '51', 15.47221263, '15° 28\' 19.965460\"', 120.95347840, '120° 57\' 12.522340\"', 31.2140, 1711050.60000, 495007.91300, '3', 280430.61800, 1711497.58700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5607, 'NEJ-58', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF CABANATUAN', 'KAPITAN PEPE', 1995, 15.47267100, '15° 28\' 21.615600\"', 120.95036340, '120° 57\' 1.308240\"', 'NEJ-58 From Manila, travel N along the national highway for about 2-3/4 hrs. The station is located 150 m. NW of the city hall which is inside the Kapitan Pepe Subd., 11 m. SE of the S end of a 15 m. bridge, 12 m. SW of the outpost, 0.4 m. SW from NE edge of the sidewalk and 0.4 m. NW from its SE edge. Station mark is a 4\" concrete nail centered in a drilled hole with cement putty and inscribed with station name \"NEJ-58, 1995, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.47267100, '15° 28\' 21.615600\"', 120.95036340, '120° 57\' 1.308400\"', 0.0000, '0', 72.4470, 0.0000, '3', 29.5839, 280099.75180, 1711656.22400, '51', 15.47423299, '15° 28\' 27.238760\"', 120.94902460, '120° 56\' 56.488450\"', 31.5694, 1711274.24500, 494530.03600, '3', 279954.72800, 1711725.73000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5608, 'NEJ-59', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SANTA ROSA', 'RIZAL', 1995, 15.42253439, '15° 25\' 21.123804\"', 120.93832040, '120° 56\' 17.953440\"', 'NEJ-59 From Manila travel N along the national highway leading to Sta. ìRosa for about 107 km. The station is located in front of the ìSta. Rosa Central School. It is 22 m. S of NE corner of the ìschool\'s concrete fence, 11 m. S of waiting shed, 12 m. W from ìthe road centerline and 0.4 m. E of concrete fence. Mark is a 4\" ìconcrete nail centered in a concrete block, 0.31 m. x 0.31 m. x ì0.70 m., protruding 0.30 m. above the ground surface with ìinscription, NEJ-59, 1995, NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.42253439, '15° 25\' 21.123800\"', 120.93832040, '120° 56\' 17.953400\"', 0.0000, '0', 70.8893, 0.0000, '3', 28.1709, 278753.99940, 1706119.94600, '51', 15.42409347, '15° 25\' 26.736480\"', 120.93698030, '120° 56\' 13.129140\"', 29.8928, 1705727.07900, 493235.99100, '3', 278608.79800, 1706189.44600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5609, 'NEJ-6', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LICAB', 'SANTA MARIA', 1989, 15.52390616, '15° 31\' 26.062176\"', 120.78018400, '120° 46\' 48.662400\"', 'NEJ - 006 From Licab, Guimba and Quezon junction, proceed SEward along the ìmunicipal road to Quezon about 950.0 m. thence, turn right SWward ìalong dirt road passing Barrio Sta. Maria proper about 4.5 km. to ìstation marked. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. diameter brass ìrod set at the SW corner bolt of deepwell pump foundation, 40.0 m ìsouth of dirt road, 700.0 m. SW of barrio proper, 2.5 km. SE of ìLicab town proper. This station is unstamped. Reference azimuth ìmark S08 degrees 00\' W about 27.0 km. to Mr. Arayat peak.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.52390616, '15° 31\' 26.062170\"', 120.78018400, '120° 46\' 48.662530\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.2337, 0.0000, '2', 22.2295, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.52547516, '15° 31\' 31.710560\"', 120.77884610, '120° 46\' 43.846040\"', 23.9210, 1716955.38200, 476274.68700, '3', 261747.79000, 1717578.72500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2016-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5610, 'NEJ-60', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SANTA ROSA', 'RIZAL', 1995, 15.42004579, '15° 25\' 12.164844\"', 120.93837270, '120° 56\' 18.141720\"', 'NEJ-60 From Manila, travel north along the national highway leading to ìSta. Rosa for about 107 km. The station is located in front of ìSta. Rosa central school near its SE corner. It is west of ìMary\'s Woods Grotto, about 9 m. W from road centerline and 0.75 ìm. N of Barangay Rizal welcome marker. Mark is a 4\" concrete ìnail centered on a concrete block, 0.31 x 0.31 x 0.70 m. ìprotruding 0.10 m. above the ground surface with inscription, ìNEJ-60, 1995, NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.42004579, '15° 25\' 12.164840\"', 120.93837270, '120° 56\' 18.141780\"', 0.0000, '0', 70.8857, 0.0000, '3', 28.1693, 278756.98060, 1705844.47800, '51', 15.42160471, '15° 25\' 17.776950\"', 120.93703260, '120° 56\' 13.317310\"', 29.8818, 1705451.71800, 493241.52100, '3', 278611.77100, 1705913.97500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5611, 'NEJ-61', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN ISIDRO', 'POBLACION', 1996, 15.30428338, '15° 18\' 15.420168\"', 120.90365190, '120° 54\' 13.146840\"', 'NEJ-61 From Manila travel north along the national highway going to ìGapan for about 2 hours then turn left and continue travelling ìalong the road going to San Isidro, upon reaching Central Luzon ìPolytechnic College which is beside the Municipal town hall, turn ìleft and continue travelling along the provincial road until ìreaching the irrigation road. Upon reaching the said road turn ìright and travel for about 500 meters. The station is located on ìthe north east end of the bridge. It is about 250 m. SE of San ìMiguel Sales Office, 100 m. SW of cemetery, 500 meters from ìprovincial road, 15 m. N of centerline of irrigation road, and 20 ìm. NE of Bldg of \"Gusaling Pulungan ng Labrador I.A.\". Station ìmark is a 4\" concrete nail centered in a concrete block 0.31 m. x ì0.31 m. x 0.70 m., protruding 0.1 m. above the ground surface ìwith inscription, NEJ-61, 1995, NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.30428338, '15° 18\' 15.420150\"', 120.90365190, '120° 54\' 13.146660\"', 0.0000, '0', 62.6961, 0.0000, '3', 20.3009, 274905.25490, 1693068.78900, '51', 15.30583558, '15° 18\' 21.008090\"', 120.90230900, '120° 54\' 8.312280\"', 21.4355, 1692644.33400, 489508.74300, '3', 274759.63200, 1693138.28000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5612, 'NEJ-62', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SAN ISIDRO', 'POBLACION', 1995, 15.30265967, '15° 18\' 9.574812\"', 120.90017150, '120° 54\' 0.617400\"', 'NEJ-62 From Manila travel north along the national highway going to ìGapan for about 2 hours then turn left and continue travelling ìalong the road going to San Isidro, upon reaching Central Luzon ìPolytechnic College which is beside the municipal town hall, turn ìleft and continue travelling along the provincial road until ìreaching the irrigation road. Upon reaching the said road turn ìright and travel for about 800 meters. The station is located ìalong the irrigation road about 300 meters from the Bldg. of ìGUSALING PULUNGAN NG LABRADOR I.A. It is on the west of two ìdistinct trees about 10 meters from each other. It is about 10 m. ìwest of the SW distinct tree and about 25 m. W of the NE distinct ìtree, 250 m. E of poultry farm and 3 m. NW of centerline ìirrigation road. Mark is a 4\" concrete nail centered in a ìconcrete block 0.31 m. x 0.31 m. x 0.70 m, protruding 0.1 m. ìabove the ground the surface with inscription, NEJ-62, 1995, ìNAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.30265967, '15° 18\' 9.574800\"', 120.90017150, '120° 54\' 0.617560\"', 0.0000, '0', 62.1516, 0.0000, '3', 19.7806, 274529.67430, 1692892.70500, '51', 15.30421198, '15° 18\' 15.163140\"', 120.89882860, '120° 53\' 55.782930\"', 20.8949, 1692464.87000, 489134.89400, '3', 274384.04100, 1692962.22100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5613, 'NEJ-63', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'CANANTONG', 1999, 15.55901479, '15° 33\' 32.453244\"', 121.18826520, '121° 11\' 17.754720\"', 'NEJ-63 Is located at about 2.8 km. S of Laur town proper and 350 m. S of ìbgy. Canantong. It is about 100 m. E of the residence of Konsehal ìDomingo. To reach the station, walk eastward from the house of ìKonsehal Domingo, which is just on the westside of barangay road ìcenterline, for about 100 m. towards the top of a small hill. ìStation mark is a nail at the center of a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. ìconcrete monument with inscription \"NEJ-63, 1999, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.55901479, '15° 33\' 32.453240\"', 121.18826520, '121° 11\' 17.754640\"', 0.0000, '0', 155.4840, 0.0000, '3', 110.8356, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.56057700, '15° 33\' 38.077200\"', 121.18692870, '121° 11\' 12.943370\"', 114.2850, 1720835.65000, 520050.24200, '3', 305567.76400, 1721049.99900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2014-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5614, 'NEJ-64', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF PALAYAN', 'MALATE', 1999, 15.54230480, '15° 32\' 32.297280\"', 121.08457600, '121° 5\' 4.473600\"', 'NEJ-64 From Cabanatuan city, travel NE for about 30 min. to Palayan city. Station is located within 1 m. radius with respect to the 0 km post and about 5 m. SW of brgy. Santolan waiting shed and is situated infront of Malate Elementary School. Station is 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument centered with 2\" copper nail and marked \"NAMRIA NEJ-64 1999\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.54230480, '15° 32\' 32.297290\"', 121.08457600, '121° 5\' 4.473580\"', 0.0000, '0', 116.9230, 0.0000, '3', 72.9499, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.54386826, '15° 32\' 37.925730\"', 121.08323900, '121° 4\' 59.660310\"', 75.9260, 1718979.91800, 508929.04100, '3', 294428.09400, 1719298.21400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2016-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5615, 'NEJ-65', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF PALAYAN', 'MALATE', 1999, 15.54431826, '15° 32\' 39.545736\"', 121.08673480, '121° 5\' 12.245280\"', 'NEJ-65 From Cabanatuan city, travel NE for about 30 min. toward Palayan city. Station is located about 5 m. from intersection between the highway and Rosal st. bgy. Caimito near Palayan public market and is about 25 m. SW from BBM No. 3. Station is 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument centered with 2\" copper nail and marked \"NAMRIA NEJ-65 1999\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.54431826, '15° 32\' 39.545740\"', 121.08673480, '121° 5\' 12.245390\"', 0.0000, '0', 119.8653, 0.0000, '3', 75.8764, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.54588170, '15° 32\' 45.174110\"', 121.08539790, '121° 5\' 7.432330\"', 78.8690, 1719202.78200, 509160.53700, '3', 294661.70500, 1719518.93900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2016-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5616, 'NEJ-66', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF PALAYAN', 'MALATE', 1999, 15.54218365, '15° 32\' 31.861140\"', 121.08575000, '121° 5\' 8.700000\"', 'NEJ-66 From Cabanatuan city, travel NE for about 30 min. toward Palayan city. Station is situated within the city plaza area. The location of the station is about 5 m. SE from NW end corner of the plaza compound and is about 125 m. NE from bgy. santolan waiting shed. Station is 20 cm. x 20 cm. cement patty centered with a 2\" copper nail and marked \"NAMRIA NEJ-66 1999\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.54218365, '15° 32\' 31.861140\"', 121.08575000, '121° 5\' 8.700040\"', 0.0000, '0', 116.2166, 0.0000, '3', 72.2353, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.54374698, '15° 32\' 37.489110\"', 121.08441300, '121° 5\' 3.886790\"', 75.2160, 1718966.54900, 509054.98400, '3', 294553.92800, 1719283.66400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2014-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5617, 'NEJ-67', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'BARANGAY IV', 1999, 15.58695674, '15° 35\' 13.044264\"', 121.18406180, '121° 11\' 2.622480\"', 'NEJ-67 From Cabanatuan city, travel NE for about 30 min. toward Palayan ìcity then continue on the same direction for about 5 km. up to ìthe junction at Imelda Valley. From the said junction, turn right ìleading to Laur. The station is located at Rizal st. and general ìTinio st. intersection brgy. 2 and is about 10 m. SW of NW cor. ìof Laur Central School concrete fence and 15.535 m. SW of ìwindmill. Station is 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument and marked ì\"NAMRIA NEJ-67 1999\". .', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.58695674, '15° 35\' 13.044280\"', 121.18406180, '121° 11\' 2.622360\"', 0.0000, '0', 111.9660, 0.0000, '3', 67.3552, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.58852079, '15° 35\' 18.674840\"', 121.18272600, '121° 10\' 57.813430\"', 70.8600, 1723927.04800, 519596.79900, '3', 305143.27400, 1724145.86400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2014-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5618, 'NEJ-68', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'BARANGAY IV', 1999, 15.59039526, '15° 35\' 25.422936\"', 121.18237980, '121° 10\' 56.567280\"', 'NEJ-68 From Cabanatuan city, travel NE for about 30 min. toward Palayan ìcity then continue on the same direction for about 5 km. up to ìthe junction at Imelda Valley. From the said junction, turn right ìleading to Laur. The station is located at the side slope of the ìearth dike road and is found at the southern side along the ìCoronel River. Moreover it is approximately 100 m. NE form the ìintersection between the Bonifacio st., and the earthdike road ìand that the station is intervisible to station NEJ-67. Station ìis 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument marked \"NAMRIA NEJ-68 1999\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.59039526, '15° 35\' 25.422920\"', 121.18237980, '121° 10\' 56.567200\"', 0.0000, '0', 112.2106, 0.0000, '3', 67.6114, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.59195949, '15° 35\' 31.054180\"', 121.18104400, '121° 10\' 51.758550\"', 71.1190, 1724307.36400, 519416.09500, '3', 304966.12700, 1724527.90300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2017-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5619, 'NEJ-69', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'CANANTONG', 1999, 15.56065963, '15° 33\' 38.374668\"', 121.19175520, '121° 11\' 30.318720\"', 'NEJ-69 Is located at about 2.8 km. SSE of Laur town proper and 500 m. ìESE of brgy. Canantong proper. To reach the station, travel along ìa trail from the SE corner of brgy. Canantong proper until you ìarrive at the top of the last prominent hill. Station mark is a ìnail on the center of a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete monument with ìinscription \"NEJ-69, 1999, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.56065963, '15° 33\' 38.374670\"', 121.19175520, '121° 11\' 30.318830\"', 0.0000, '0', 187.9094, 0.0000, '3', 143.2404, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.56222176, '15° 33\' 43.998350\"', 121.19041880, '121° 11\' 25.507770\"', 146.7070, 1721017.96200, 520424.43500, '3', 305943.69100, 1721228.81800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2014-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5620, 'NEJ-69B', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'CANANTONG', 1900, 15.55682635, '15° 33\' 24.574860\"', 121.19394330, '121° 11\' 38.195880\"', 'NEJ-69B Is located at about 3.3 Km. SSE of Laur town proper and 900 ìmeters SE of barangay Canantong proper. To reach the station ìtravel SE along a trail, from the SE corner of barangay Canantong ìproper, leading to the nearest and first and highest peak of a ìmountain range. The station is on top of this peak overlooking ìLaur town proper, barangay Canantong, barnagy Paludpod and sitio ìBato Ferry. Station mark is a nail on the center of a 0.25 m x ì0.25 m. concrete monument with inscription \"NEJ 69B, 1999, ìNAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.55682635, '15° 33\' 24.574860\"', 121.19394330, '121° 11\' 38.195900\"', 0.0000, '0', 279.7113, 0.0000, '3', 235.0279, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.55838814, '15° 33\' 30.197290\"', 121.19260680, '121° 11\' 33.384630\"', 238.4920, 1720594.00900, 520659.50600, '3', 306174.80600, 1720802.63400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1900-01-01', 'Mara', '2014-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5621, 'NEJ-70', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'CANANTONG', 1999, 15.54403521, '15° 32\' 38.526756\"', 121.18634790, '121° 11\' 10.852440\"', 'NEJ-70 Is located at about 4.5 km. S of Laur town proper inside the ìmilitary camp of the 71st Infantry Brigade P.A. To reach the ìstation from inside the camp, walk towards the engineering ìsection on the eastern side of the Grotto. Climb the first hill ìdirectly S of the camp. Station mark is a nail on the center of a ì0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete monument with inscription, \"NEJ-70, ì1999, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.54403521, '15° 32\' 38.526750\"', 121.18634790, '121° 11\' 10.852530\"', 0.0000, '0', 199.8190, 0.0000, '3', 155.1757, 305492.55990, 1719325.32200, '51', 15.54559646, '15° 32\' 44.147270\"', 121.18501110, '121° 11\' 6.039970\"', 158.5802, 1719177.98000, 519845.99100, '3', 305347.97800, 1719394.12700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5622, 'NEJ-71', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'SAGANA', 1999, 15.55800451, '15° 33\' 28.816236\"', 121.16764790, '121° 10\' 3.532440\"', 'NEJ-71 Is located at about 3.5 km. SSW of laur town proper, about 2.0 ìkm. SE of intersection between provincial road from Palayan city ìto Laur, and barangay road towards brgy. Paludpod. To reach the ìcontrol point, travel 0.7 km. S from above road intersection then ìabout 1.5 km. SE at brgy. Paludpod. Station is 20 m. from ìbarangay road at the right bank of irrigation canal. Point is a ìnail on the center of a 0.20 m. x 0.20 m. conc. monument with ìinscription \"NEJ-71, 1999\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.55800451, '15° 33\' 28.816230\"', 121.16764790, '121° 10\' 3.532560\"', 0.0000, '0', 114.4500, 0.0000, '3', 69.9256, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.55956712, '15° 33\' 34.441636\"', 121.16631140, '121° 9\' 58.721073\"', 73.2980, 1720722.08500, 517838.88100, '3', 303355.17500, 1720957.14000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2014-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5623, 'NEJ-72', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'SAN ISIDRO', 1999, 15.52741185, '15° 31\' 38.682660\"', 121.17140510, '121° 10\' 17.058360\"', 'NEJ-72 Is located at about 6.8 km. SSW of Laur town proper, about 1.75 ìkm. ENE of intersection between Matatalahib creek and barangay ìroad. To reach the control point, travel eastward along a zigzag ìroad on the left side of Matatalahib creek, continue for about ì2.5 km. and stop at the highest peak of the road and climb the ìtop of a hill left of the road. Station is about 25 m. NNE from ìsitio road. Point is a nail on the center of a 0.20 m. x 0.20 m. ìconcrete monument with inscription \"NEJ-72, 1999\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.52741185, '15° 31\' 38.682660\"', 121.17140510, '121° 10\' 17.058320\"', 0.0000, '0', 205.4109, 0.0000, '3', 160.8420, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.52897242, '15° 31\' 44.300711\"', 121.17006790, '121° 10\' 12.244320\"', 164.1590, 1717337.32000, 518244.50000, '3', 303729.15100, 1717568.31000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2014-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5624, 'NEJ-73', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'SAN ISIDRO', 1999, 15.52369762, '15° 31\' 25.311432\"', 121.17386980, '121° 10\' 25.931280\"', 'NEJ-73 Is located at about 7.1 km. SSW of Laur town proper, about 1.9 ìkm. E of intersection between Matatalahib creek and barangay ìroad. To reach the control point, travel eastward along a zigzag ìroad on the left side of Matatalahib creek at around 2.5 km. and ìstop at the highest peak of the road and climb down the trail SE ìof road centerline. Then cross the creek and climb up the nearest ìpeak of the next hill along a trail towards the station. Point is ìa nail on the center of a point 0.20 m. x 0.20 m. concrete ìmonument with inscription \"NEJ-73, 1999\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.52369762, '15° 31\' 25.311440\"', 121.17386980, '121° 10\' 25.931200\"', 0.0000, '0', 219.3579, 0.0000, '3', 174.7732, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.52525790, '15° 31\' 30.928440\"', 121.17253250, '121° 10\' 21.116910\"', 178.0890, 1716926.54800, 518509.23000, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'admin', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5625, 'NEJ-74', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF PALAYAN', 'MANACNAC', 1999, 15.54796096, '15° 32\' 52.659456\"', 121.07739250, '121° 4\' 38.613000\"', 'NEJ-74 Is located at about 1.1 km. W of Palayan city proper, about 0.85 km. N of road intersection between provincial road and road leading to the mayor\'s ranch. To reach the control point, travel NE from above intersection up to gate of ranch then turn right along the outerside of said ranch. Stop at another gate then walk at about 15 m. towards the station. Point is a bolt on the center of a 0.30 m. x 0.30 m. concrete monument with inscription \"BLLM 1A\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.54796096, '15° 32\' 52.659450\"', 121.07739250, '121° 4\' 38.613060\"', 0.0000, '0', 111.1820, 0.0000, '3', 67.2577, 293807.73090, 1719861.92600, '51', 15.54952489, '15° 32\' 58.289620\"', 121.07605560, '121° 4\' 33.800180\"', 70.2190, 1719605.49600, 508158.25800, '3', 293663.06700, 1719931.08700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mary', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5626, 'NEJ-75', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF PALAYAN', 'MARCOS VILLAGE', 1999, 15.57851627, '15° 34\' 42.658572\"', 121.13702100, '121° 8\' 13.275600\"', 'NEJ-75 Is located at about 5 km. W of Laur town proper, 200 m. N of provincial road and centerline which traverses brgy. Tagwil. To reach the station, walk northward from the intersection of Tagwil barangay road and provincial road at about 200 m. then turn right 20 m. towards an irrigation canal in which an old monument was erected. Point is a bolt on the center of a 0.20 m. x 0.20 m. concrete monument with inscription \"BBM\" (unnumbered).', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.57851627, '15° 34\' 42.658570\"', 121.13702100, '121° 8\' 13.275700\"', 0.0000, '0', 108.7450, 0.0000, '3', 64.4312, 300234.14250, 1723186.52300, '51', 15.58008082, '15° 34\' 48.290950\"', 121.13568490, '121° 8\' 8.465730\"', 67.7280, 1722989.45800, 514552.37700, '3', 300089.63100, 1723255.52000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5627, 'NEJ-76', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'BONGABON', 'PALO MARIA', 2000, 15.64197992, '15° 38\' 31.127712\"', 121.14152240, '121° 8\' 29.480640\"', 'NEJ-76 To reach the station from Bongabon town proper, travel northward along the general direction towrds the municipality of Rizal for about 200 meters until reaching Bongabon slaugter house. NEJ 76 is situated on a concrete pavement infront of the abatoir (slaugter house), about 5.0 meters east of the northwest corner of the pavement and 8 meters northeast from the slaugter house entrance. Station mark is the head of a 2 inches concrete nail, embedded and centered on a 0.15 x 0.15 m cement putty with inscription NEJ-73 2000 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.64197992, '15° 38\' 31.127700\"', 121.14152240, '121° 8\' 29.480800\"', 0.0000, '0', 114.9600, 0.0000, '3', 70.6086, 300778.29300, 1730205.23400, '51', 15.64354838, '15° 38\' 36.774160\"', 121.14018780, '121° 8\' 24.676230\"', 74.1212, 1730012.03100, 515030.69800, '3', 300633.99600, 1730274.27300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1900-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5628, 'NEJ-77', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'SANTA MONICA', 2000, 15.72275508, '15° 43\' 21.918288\"', 121.08288940, '121° 4\' 58.401840\"', 'NEJ-77 To reach station from Rizal town proper, travel northwestward ìtowads San Jose City for about 2.50 Km. until reaching a ìirrigation canal/storm drain east of the highway, proceed using ìthe access road towards the culvert bridge about 2.0 meter west ìof the southeast corner of the culvert bridge. Station mark is ìthe head of 2 inches copper nail embedded and centered on a 0.15 ìm x 0.15 m cement putty with inscription NEJ-74 2000 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.72275508, '15° 43\' 21.918300\"', 121.08288940, '121° 4\' 58.401800\"', 0.0000, '0', 132.1670, 0.0000, '3', 88.0161, 294571.94280, 1739200.04700, '51', 15.72432993, '15° 43\' 27.587740\"', 121.08155660, '121° 4\' 53.603760\"', 91.7116, 1738946.73300, 508740.91300, '3', 294427.86500, 1739269.34400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1900-01-01', 'Mary', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5629, 'NEJ-78 (NE-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GENERAL TINIO', 'PIAS', 1900, 15.31327325, '15° 18\' 47.783700\"', 121.12019660, '121° 7\' 12.707760\"', 'NEJ-78 (NE-3) To reach the station from General Tinio proper, travel E to Brgy. ìConcepcion, then cross Peñaranda River by banca to reach Brgy. ìPais. Thence, continue traveling E until reaching Kapotatang. It ìis situated along the road, about 10 m. S of the centerline of ìthe road, about 55 m. SE of NE-4 and 60 m. S of an unfinished ìcatholic church. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt, ìembedded and centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete monument, ìwith inscription \"NE 3, DENR R3\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.31327325, '15° 18\' 47.783700\"', 121.12019660, '121° 7\' 12.707600\"', 0.0000, '0', 114.4650, 0.0000, '3', 70.2336, 298172.94430, 1693850.49400, '51', 15.31482134, '15° 18\' 53.356840\"', 121.11885420, '121° 7\' 7.875060\"', 72.7049, 1693639.65500, 512763.47300, '3', 298027.53800, 1693919.30800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1900-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5630, 'NEJ-79 (NE-4)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GENERAL TINIO', 'PIAS', 2001, 15.31370894, '15° 18\' 49.352184\"', 121.11996730, '121° 7\' 11.882280\"', 'NEJ-79 (NE 4) To reach the station from Gen. Tinio proper, travel eastward to ìbrgy. Concepcion then by banca cross Peñaranda River to reach ìbrgy. Pias. Thence continue eastward until reaching brgy. ìKapotatan. Station is located 10 m. W from the unfinished ìcatholic chapel. About 20 m. N of the road and 10 m. S of a nipa ìhut and 10 m. W of the chapel. Station mark is the head of a 3 ìin. steel bolt embedded and centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. ìconcrete monument with inscription \"NE 4 DENR RIII\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.31370894, '15° 18\' 49.352200\"', 121.11996730, '121° 7\' 11.882200\"', 0.0000, '0', 115.0210, 0.0000, '3', 70.7919, 298148.73800, 1693898.92100, '51', 15.31525707, '15° 18\' 54.925460\"', 121.11862490, '121° 7\' 7.049700\"', 73.2627, 1693687.85000, 512738.82600, '3', 298003.33300, 1693967.73700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5631, 'NEJ-80 (NE-5)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GENERAL TINIO', 'NAZARETH', 2001, 15.38717342, '15° 23\' 13.824312\"', 121.12180910, '121° 7\' 18.512760\"', 'NEJ-80 (NE 5) Station is located in brgy. Nazareth, municipality of Gen. Tinio, ìprovince of Nueva Ecija, about 40 m. SE from the unfinished ìbuilding owned by Town Mayor Bote. Mark is the head of a 4 in. ìsteel bolt drilled and centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete ìmonument, 5 cm. above the ground surface with inscribe station ìname \"NE-5, DENR-3\". *note: 1. Intervisible to NE-6, approximately 200 m. apart. 2. Accessible only to 4-wheel drive vehicle on rainy season. 3. 20 min. drive from the highway junction. 4. Mr. Romeo Lacson of DENR Reg. 3 is familiar to the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.38717342, '15° 23\' 13.824300\"', 121.12180910, '121° 7\' 18.512800\"', 0.0000, '0', 169.6660, 0.0000, '3', 125.4418, 298417.12110, 1702026.73700, '51', 15.38872616, '15° 23\' 19.414180\"', 121.12046850, '121° 7\' 13.686580\"', 128.1196, 1701816.62500, 512932.27900, '3', 298271.96200, 1702095.61100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5632, 'NEJ-81 (NE-6)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GENERAL TINIO', 'NAZARETH', 2001, 15.38856317, '15° 23\' 18.827412\"', 121.12311480, '121° 7\' 23.213280\"', 'NEJ-81 (NE 6) To reach the station from Gen. Tinio town proper, travel ìnorthward along the general direction towards Fort Magsaysay ìuntil reaching brgy. Nazareth, turn right on the intersection ìwhich leads to Mayor Bote\'s farm. Proceed eastward passing by the ìmain gate of the Caretakers Bank Houses. Continue proceeding ìusing the access road which lead to the unfinished rest house. ìThe station is located on the top of the hill N of the rest house ìand W of the fishpond. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel ìbolt with inscription \"NE 6 DENR III\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.38856317, '15° 23\' 18.827400\"', 121.12311480, '121° 7\' 23.213200\"', 0.0000, '0', 169.8980, 0.0000, '3', 125.6626, 298558.63670, 1702179.30700, '51', 15.39011597, '15° 23\' 24.417490\"', 121.12177420, '121° 7\' 18.387100\"', 128.3526, 1701970.47300, 513072.35900, '3', 298413.48400, 1702248.17700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5633, 'NEJ-82 (NE-7)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GENERAL TINIO', 'PALALE', 2001, 15.41177607, '15° 24\' 42.393852\"', 121.15540900, '121° 9\' 19.472400\"', 'NEJ-82 (NE 7) Is located in brgy. Palali, Palayan City situated on the hill ìtop. To reach the station, travel eastward from the highway until ìreaching brgy. Maligaya steel signboard, turn right toward brgy. ìPalali passing brgy. Langka for about 5 km. until reaching a nipa ìhut owned by Mr. Simbrano Bernardo. Station mark is the head of a ì4 in. steel bolt embedded and centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. ìconcrete monument leveled on the ground surface with inscription ì\"NE-7 DENR-3\". Intervisible to NE-8 and can be accessed by a ì4-wheel drive vehicle.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.41177607, '15° 24\' 42.393860\"', 121.15540900, '121° 9\' 19.472380\"', 0.0000, '0', 308.2070, 0.0000, '3', 263.7193, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.41332953, '15° 24\' 47.986290\"', 121.15406910, '121° 9\' 14.648610\"', 266.6517, 1704541.06500, 516537.35800, '3', 301902.66500, 1704786.88500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2014-01-01 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `hgcp_stations_new` (`id`, `station_name`, `island_group`, `region`, `province`, `city_or_municipality`, `barangay`, `year_established`, `latitude`, `latitude_dms`, `longitude`, `longitude_dms`, `description`, `year_surveyed`, `project`, `epoch`, `latitude_wgs84`, `latitude_wgs84_dms`, `longitude_wgs84`, `longitude_wgs84_dms`, `error_ellipse`, `accuracy_class`, `ellipsoidal_ht_wgs84`, `height_error`, `order_of_accuracy_wgs84`, `egm2008_elevation`, `utm_x_wgs84`, `utm_y_wgs84`, `utm_zone_wgs84`, `latitude_prs92`, `latitude_prs92_dms`, `longitude_prs92`, `longitude_prs92_dms`, `ellipsoidal_ht_prs92`, `northing_ptm`, `easting_ptm`, `ptm_zone`, `utm_x_prs92`, `utm_y_prs92`, `utm_zone_prs92`, `latitude_itrf`, `latitude_itrf_dms`, `longitude_itrf`, `longitude_itrf_dms`, `error_ellipse_itrf`, `ellipsoidal_ht_itrf`, `height_error_itrf`, `year_computed`, `encoder`, `date_updated`, `reference_file`) VALUES
(5634, 'NEJ-83 (NE-8)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'GENERAL TINIO', 'PALALE', 2001, 15.41277811, '15° 24\' 46.001196\"', 121.15535490, '121° 9\' 19.277640\"', 'NEJ-83 (NE 8) To reach the station from Fort Magsaysay, travel N to ìnortheastward towards brgy. Palali passing by brgy. Mabahay, ìbrgy. Doña Josefa and thence brgy. Palali. Thence in brgy. ìPalali, locate the nipa hut owned by Mr. Simbrano Bernardo where ì2 prominent hills are located SW from the said hut. Station is ìlocated on the top of the first hill. NE 7 is located on the ìsecond hill S of station. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. ìsteel bolt embedded and centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete ìmonument with inscription \"NE 8 DENR III\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.41277811, '15° 24\' 46.001200\"', 121.15535490, '121° 9\' 19.277800\"', 0.0000, '0', 305.6610, 0.0000, '3', 261.1732, 302042.85440, 1704829.04300, '51', 15.41433171, '15° 24\' 51.594140\"', 121.15401500, '121° 9\' 14.454030\"', 264.1089, 1704651.94300, 516531.47700, '3', 301897.81300, 1704897.82800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5635, 'NEJ-84 (NE-9)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SANTA ROSA', 'MAPALAD', 2001, 15.44027738, '15° 26\' 24.998568\"', 121.12661120, '121° 7\' 35.800320\"', 'NEJ-84 (NE 9) To reach the station from Cabanatuan City, travel northeastward towards Palayan City until reaching Brgy. Bangad, thence turn right on the intersection and proceed southeastward to the general direction towards Fort Magsaysay for about 17 kms. until reaching Brgy. Mapalad passing by Camp Heneral Tinio and South Kalikid. Turn left and proceed along the general direction towards Brgy. Maligaya (Iglesia Ni Cristo Baluarte) and turn right towards Brgy. Doña Josefa and proceed to sitio Bacao. Station is located on a hill about 500 m. S of Bacao Elementary School and 40 m. SSE of Malou Store (being 100 m. SE of the school) and about 100 m. SW of the house owned by Mr. Juanito de Guzman. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. haxagonal steel bolt with inscription \"NE 09 - DENR RIII\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.44027738, '15° 26\' 24.998560\"', 121.12661120, '121° 7\' 35.800440\"', 0.0000, '0', 186.7890, 0.0000, '3', 142.5070, 298983.77070, 1707898.72100, '51', 15.44183338, '15° 26\' 30.600180\"', 121.12527190, '121° 7\' 30.978760\"', 145.3878, 1707692.76900, 513444.50700, '3', 298838.79300, 1707967.62700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5636, 'NEJ-84(NE-9)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SANTA ROSA', 'MAPALAD', 2001, 15.44029100, '15° 26\' 25.047600\"', 121.12660710, '121° 7\' 35.785560\"', 'NEJ-84 (NE 9) To reach the station from Cabanatuan City, travel northeastward towards Palayan City until reaching Brgy. Bangad, thence turn right on the intersection and proceed southeastward to the general direction towards Fort Magsaysay for about 17 kms. until reaching Brgy. Mapalad passing by Camp Heneral Tinio and South Kalikid. Turn left and proceed along the general direction towards Brgy. Maligaya (Iglesia Ni Cristo Baluarte) and turn right towards Brgy. Doña Josefa and proceed to sitio Bacao. Station is located on a hill about 500 m. S of Bacao Elementary School and 40 m. SSE of Malou Store (being 100 m. SE of the school) and about 100 m. SW of the house owned by Mr. Juanito de Guzman. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. haxagonal steel bolt with inscription \"NE 09 - DENR RIII\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.44029100, '15° 26\' 25.047610\"', 121.12660710, '121° 7\' 35.785620\"', 0.0000, '0', 187.1990, 0.0000, '3', 142.9170, 298983.34200, 1707900.23300, '51', 15.44184701, '15° 26\' 30.649230\"', 121.12526780, '121° 7\' 30.963940\"', 145.7978, 1707694.27600, 513444.06400, '3', 298838.36400, 1707969.13800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2023-01-01', 'RCG', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5637, 'NEJ-85 (NE-10)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SANTA ROSA', 'MAPALAD', 2001, 15.44105998, '15° 26\' 27.815928\"', 121.12676210, '121° 7\' 36.343560\"', 'NEJ-85 (NE 10) To reach the station from Cabanatuan City, travel NE towards ìPalayan City until reaching the crossing in brgy. Bangad. Turn ìright and proceed along the general direction towards Fort ìMagsaysay, passing by Camp Tinio and South Kalikid. Continue ìtravelling until reaching brgy. Mapalad turn left on the brgy. ìroad which leads to brgy. Maligaya (Iglesia Ni Cristo Baluarte). ìThence, before reaching the said barangay main entrance turn left ìtowards sitio Bacao brgy. Doña Josefa passing by sitio Alorca. ìContinue along the general direction until reaching Bacao ìElementary School. At this point 2 prominent hills are visible on ìthe E of the road. Continue further for about 500 m. passing ìMalou Store. Thence, an intersection (Y-intersection) on the ìright side leads to the station. Station is located about 10 m. S ìof the electric post, 350 m. S of Malou Store, 450 m. S of the ìschool, and 200 m. W of the house owned by Mr. Juanito and Ms. ìTess de Guzman.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.44105998, '15° 26\' 27.815910\"', 121.12676210, '121° 7\' 36.343610\"', 0.0000, '0', 180.6820, 0.0000, '3', 136.3986, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.44261594, '15° 26\' 33.417380\"', 121.12542280, '121° 7\' 31.522050\"', 139.2826, 1707779.36100, 513460.65300, '3', 298855.74600, 1708054.07800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2014-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5638, 'NEJ-86 (NE-11)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF PALAYAN', 'MALIGAYA', 2001, 15.50147631, '15° 30\' 5.314716\"', 121.11765880, '121° 7\' 3.571680\"', 'NEJ-86 (NE 11) Is in brgy. Mapaet, Palayan City, Nueva Ecija. Located at the ìfarmland owned by Mr. Danilo Fuentes along the hill side, 50 m. ìSE from the nipa hut. Station is intervisible to NE-12. It is 30 ìmin. drive from Palayan city. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. ìsteel bolt embedded and centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete ìmonument with insciption \"NE-11 DENR-3\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.50147631, '15° 30\' 5.314730\"', 121.11765880, '121° 7\' 3.571690\"', 0.0000, '0', 165.0420, 0.0000, '3', 120.8244, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.50303631, '15° 30\' 10.930710\"', 121.11632090, '121° 6\' 58.755200\"', 123.8435, 1714463.83200, 512480.19500, '3', 297937.45900, 1714748.40100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2014-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5639, 'NEJ-87 (NE-12)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'CITY OF PALAYAN', 'MALIGAYA', 2001, 15.50153306, '15° 30\' 5.519016\"', 121.11695090, '121° 7\' 1.023240\"', 'NEJ-87 (NE 12) Is in brgy. Mapaet, Palayan City situated at the hill top ìapproximately 100 m. SW from a lone nipa hut owned by Mr. Danilo ìFuentes. It is 30 min. drive from Palayan City and another 30 ìmin. walk from Mapaet Elementary School. Station mark is the head ìof a 4 in. steel bolt embedded and centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 ìm. concrete monument leveled on the ground surface with ìinscription \"NE-12 DENR-3\". Station is intervisible to NE-11.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.50153306, '15° 30\' 5.519020\"', 121.11695090, '121° 7\' 1.023170\"', 0.0000, '0', 178.7630, 0.0000, '3', 134.5509, 298006.33330, 1714686.36900, '51', 15.50309317, '15° 30\' 11.135400\"', 121.11561300, '121° 6\' 56.206620\"', 137.5665, 1714470.08200, 512404.23600, '3', 297861.55000, 1714755.36000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5640, 'NEJ-88 (NE-14)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2001, 15.52880033, '15° 31\' 43.681188\"', 121.17129120, '121° 10\' 16.648320\"', 'NEJ-88 (NE 14) From Palayan City proper, travel NE to eastward towards Laur ìpassing by Imelda Valley, until reaching brgy. Paludpud, turn ìleft and proceed southwards until reaching brgy. Mainit. Locate ìintersection which goes to brgy. Mainit (Hot Spring) resort. ìContinue proceeding using the barangay road until reaching Grassy ìHill just before reaching the said resort. Station is located on ìtop of the second hill. It is about 200 m. W of NEJ-72. Station ìmark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt centered and embedded on a ì0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete monument with inscription \"NE 14 DENR ìRIII\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.52880033, '15° 31\' 43.681200\"', 121.17129120, '121° 10\' 16.648300\"', 0.0000, '0', 216.3800, 0.0000, '3', 171.8127, 303862.89320, 1717653.21900, '51', 15.53036095, '15° 31\' 49.299430\"', 121.16995400, '121° 10\' 11.834380\"', 175.1325, 1717490.94100, 518232.16200, '3', 303718.24800, 1717722.05800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5641, 'NEJ-89 (NE-15)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'SAN JOSEF', 2001, 15.55040608, '15° 33\' 1.461888\"', 121.14287850, '121° 8\' 34.362600\"', 'NEJ-89 (NE 15) From Laur town proper, travel westward along the general ìdirection towards Palayan City until reaching brgy. San Josef. ìTurn left and proceed southwards for 3 kms. Thence, turn right ìand travel by foot or carabao trailer and proceed along the ìgeneral direction of the road which leads to the Dam. Proceed ìfurther for about 300 m., noting that the river is already ìvisible from you. Station is located on a Y-intersection (trails ìand the road). Thence continue further for about 20 m. and locate ìthe station along the road about 5 m. fast of the road. Station ìmark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt centered and embedded on a ì0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete monument with inscription \"NE 15 DENR ìIII\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.55040608, '15° 33\' 1.461900\"', 121.14287850, '121° 8\' 34.362500\"', 0.0000, '0', 116.1260, 0.0000, '3', 71.7563, 300835.35830, 1720070.36800, '51', 15.55196873, '15° 33\' 7.087410\"', 121.14154170, '121° 8\' 29.550190\"', 75.0115, 1719879.46300, 515182.58900, '3', 300690.75800, 1720139.32000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5642, 'NEJ-90 (NE-16)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'SAN JOSEF', 2001, 15.54966092, '15° 32\' 58.779312\"', 121.14327860, '121° 8\' 35.802960\"', 'NEJ-90 (NE 16) From Laur town proper, travel westward along the general ìdirection towards Palayan City for about 4 km. until reaching ìbrgy. San Josef, turn left and proceed southward for another 2 ìkm., turn right and on foot or carabao ridden railer and proceed ìalong the dirt road for 2 km. until reaching the Dam in the area, ìcontinue further for about 200 m. Station is located along the ìrice puddy W of the road, about 5 m. for the centerline of the ìroad and about 20 m. from the river. Station mark is the head of ìa 3 in. steel bolt embedded and centered on a 12 sq. in. concrete ìmonument with inscription \"NE 16 DENR RIII\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.54966092, '15° 32\' 58.779300\"', 121.14327860, '121° 8\' 35.802800\"', 0.0000, '0', 116.1110, 0.0000, '3', 71.7382, 300877.56100, 1719987.53400, '51', 15.55122350, '15° 33\' 4.404610\"', 121.14194180, '121° 8\' 30.990420\"', 74.9933, 1719797.03800, 515225.55700, '3', 300732.95900, 1720056.48500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5643, 'NEJ-91 (NE-17)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'BONGABON', 'CALAANAN', 2001, 15.65740086, '15° 39\' 26.643096\"', 121.23232940, '121° 13\' 56.385840\"', 'NEJ-91 (NE 17) To reach the station from Bongabon town proper, travel ENE towards Baler, Aurora for about 8 km. until reaching brgy. Calaanan. Station is situated along pave roads which leads to Baler, about 250 m. SE of the box culvert on the first curve in the said barangay about 70 m. SE from the kilometer post no. 154. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. hexagonal head steel bolt centered and embedded on a 12 in. x 12 in. concrete monument woth inscriptions \"NE-17 DENR III\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.65740086, '15° 39\' 26.643100\"', 121.23232940, '121° 13\' 56.385700\"', 0.0000, '0', 223.8980, 0.0000, '3', 178.9225, 310529.38060, 1731828.55300, '51', 15.65896826, '15° 39\' 32.285750\"', 121.23099530, '121° 13\' 51.583010\"', 182.8850, 1731726.65600, 524765.09500, '3', 310385.21400, 1731897.31000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5644, 'NEJ-92 (NE-18)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'BONGABON', 'CALAANAN', 2001, 15.65943472, '15° 39\' 33.964992\"', 121.23072450, '121° 13\' 50.608200\"', 'NEJ-92 (NE 18) Is located in Brgy. Calaanan, Bongabon about 5 m. S of the box culvert along the curve road which leads to Baler. It is situated along the pave road about 5 m. E of the road centerline, about 100 m. SE of DENR Field Office in the said barangay. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt embedded and centered on a 12 sq. in. concrete monument with inscription \"NE 18 DENR 3\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.65943472, '15° 39\' 33.965000\"', 121.23072450, '121° 13\' 50.608300\"', 0.0000, '0', 218.7650, 0.0000, '3', 173.8006, 310359.19330, 1732055.04600, '51', 15.66100229, '15° 39\' 39.608250\"', 121.22939050, '121° 13\' 45.805770\"', 177.7620, 1731951.52300, 524592.80100, '3', 310215.03200, 1732123.81000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5645, 'NEJ-93 (NE-19)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'SAN VICENTE', 2001, 15.57277081, '15° 34\' 21.974916\"', 121.23717970, '121° 14\' 13.846920\"', 'NEJ-93 (NE 19) To reach the station from Bongabon town proper, travel ìsoutheastward along the general direction towards San Vicente, ìLaur, passing by brgy. Antipolo, Olivete, San Fernando and ìSiclong. Thence from the Barangay Hall, travel northward for one ìblock and turn right (eastward) towards the foot of the ìmountaineous region in the said barangay until reaching the land ìowned by Mr. Peter Gaspar and Family. Station is situated on the ìNE corner of the vegetable plantation owned by the Gaspar Family, ìalong the access road which leads to the resting hut owned by the ìsaid family. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt ìembedded and centered on a 12 sq. in. concrete monument with ìinscription \"NE 19 DENR 3\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 34 21.97490 E 121 14 13.84700 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 183.4570 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.57277081, '15° 34\' 21.974900\"', 121.23717970, '121° 14\' 13.847000\"', 0.0000, '0', 183.4570, 0.0000, '3', 138.5049, 310971.83480, 1722459.43800, '51', 15.57433276, '15° 34\' 27.597940\"', 121.23584370, '121° 14\' 9.037140\"', 142.1802, 1722362.82700, 525295.27000, '3', 310827.39100, 1722528.10600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5646, 'NEJ-94 (NE-20)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'LAUR', 'SAN VICENTE', 2001, 15.57333983, '15° 34\' 24.023388\"', 121.23813010, '121° 14\' 17.268360\"', 'NEJ-94 (NE 20) Station is located in brgy. San Vicente, Laur. To reach the ìstation from Bongabon town proper, proceed southeastward along ìthe general direction toward San Vicente passing by brgy. ìAntipolo, Olivete, San Fernando and Siclong. Thence from San ìVicente\'s barangay hall, proceed backward one block to the right ì(East) towards the foot of the mountaineous region for a couple ìof kilometers until reaching the land owned by Mr. Peter Gaspar ìand Family. Proceed towards the resting hut (nipa hut) for 150 m. ìfrom the western side of their lot, thence traverse the puddy ìsouthward. Station is about 30 m. S of the said hut and 250 m. E ìof NE 19. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt centered ìand embedded on a 12 sq. in. concrete monument with inscriptions ì\"NE 20 DENR III\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 34 24.02340 E 121 14 17.26830 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 190.6380 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.57333983, '15° 34\' 24.023400\"', 121.23813010, '121° 14\' 17.268300\"', 0.0000, '0', 190.6380, 0.0000, '3', 145.6792, 311074.29020, 1722521.56200, '51', 15.57490180, '15° 34\' 29.646490\"', 121.23679400, '121° 14\' 12.458500\"', 149.3606, 1722425.90000, 525397.13200, '3', 310929.84900, 1722590.22700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5647, 'NEJ-95 (NE-21)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'PANTABANGAN', 'CADACLAN', 2001, 15.78090344, '15° 46\' 51.252384\"', 121.22642240, '121° 13\' 35.120640\"', 'NEJ-95 (NE 21) To reach the station from Pantabangan town proper, travel eastward along the barangay road towards brgy. Cadaclan, until reaching sitio Dilacay passing by a bridge in the sitio. Station is located on a prominent hill N of the road and NE of the rice field. It is situated on the top of the hill E of the footrail which leads to the hill. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt centered and embedded on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete monument with inscription \"NE 21 DENR RIII\". *note: Mr. Danny Ormelon is familiar to the location of the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.78090344, '15° 46\' 51.252400\"', 121.22642240, '121° 13\' 35.120500\"', 0.0000, '0', 330.7700, 0.0000, '3', 285.7636, 310010.70420, 1745500.27400, '51', 15.78247874, '15° 46\' 56.923470\"', 121.22509120, '121° 13\' 30.328310\"', 290.1409, 1745391.77800, 524117.56600, '3', 309866.94500, 1745569.15500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5648, 'NEJ-96 (NE-22)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'PANTABANGAN', 'CADACLAN', 2001, 15.77995897, '15° 46\' 47.852292\"', 121.22932220, '121° 13\' 45.559920\"', 'NEJ-96 (NE 22) To reach the station from Pantabangan town proper, travel eastward along the barangay road towards brgy. Cadaclan, until reaching sitio Dilacay, turn left before reaching a barangay marker. Station was located on a vacant lot near the house of Mr. Danny Ormelon. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt embedded and centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete monument with inscription \"NE-22 DENR-3\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.77995897, '15° 46\' 47.852300\"', 121.22932220, '121° 13\' 45.560000\"', 0.0000, '0', 311.1310, 0.0000, '3', 266.1114, 310320.54950, 1745393.14600, '51', 15.78153415, '15° 46\' 53.522940\"', 121.22799100, '121° 13\' 40.767730\"', 270.4920, 1745287.59700, 524428.38600, '3', 310176.78900, 1745462.01800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5649, 'NEJ-97 (NE-23)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'PANTABANGAN', 'SAN JUAN', 2001, 15.83959056, '15° 50\' 22.526016\"', 121.21133570, '121° 12\' 40.808520\"', 'NEJ-97 (NE 23) TO REACH THE STATION FROM PANTABANGAN TOWN PROPER, TRVEL EASTWARD ALONG THE GENERAL DIRECTION TOWARDS BALER PASSING BY BRGY. CADACLAN AND MARIKIT UNTIL REACHING THE INTERSECTION OF THE MAIN ROAD AND THE ROAD WHICH LEADS CP CASECNAN. TURN LEFT PROCEEDING WESTWARD FOR ABOUT 2.5 KM. STATION IS LOCATED ALONG THE ACCESS ROAD WHICH LEADS TO CP CASECNAN. STATION MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 3 IN. STEL BOLT CENTERED AND EMBEDDED ON A 0.25 M. X 0.25 M. CONCRETE MONUMENT WITH INSCRIPTION \"NE 23 DENR R3\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.83959056, '15° 50\' 22.526000\"', 121.21133570, '121° 12\' 40.808500\"', 0.0000, '0', 464.2290, 0.0000, '3', 419.1621, 308449.39530, 1752008.18500, '51', 15.84116984, '15° 50\' 28.211440\"', 121.21000590, '121° 12\' 36.021290\"', 423.8130, 1751884.02700, 522494.75000, '3', 308305.82100, 1752077.16300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5650, 'NEJ-98 (NE-24)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'PANTABANGAN', 'SAN JUAN', 2001, 15.83313925, '15° 49\' 59.301300\"', 121.20816350, '121° 12\' 29.388600\"', 'NEJ-98 (NE 24) To reach the station from Pantabangan town proper, travel eastward along the general direction towards Baler passing by brgy. Cadaclan and Marikit until reaching the intersection of the main road and the road which leads to CP Casecnan. Turn left and proceed westward for about 2.5 km. Station is located along the access road which leads to CP Casecnan. About 200 m. SW from NE 23. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt centered and embedded on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete monument with inscription \"NE 24 DENR R3\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.83313925, '15° 49\' 59.301300\"', 121.20816350, '121° 12\' 29.388600\"', 0.0000, '0', 432.7910, 0.0000, '3', 387.7694, 308103.49110, 1751297.18800, '51', 15.83471821, '15° 50\' 4.985560\"', 121.20683360, '121° 12\' 24.600800\"', 392.3631, 1751169.84300, 522155.64600, '3', 307959.89100, 1751366.17100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5651, 'NEJ-99 (NE-25)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'RIZAL', 'GENERAL LUNA', 2001, 15.70617814, '15° 42\' 22.241304\"', 121.18047570, '121° 10\' 49.712520\"', 'NEJ-99 (NE 25) To reach the station from Rizal town proper, travel southwestward along the general direction towards Bongabon until brgy. Macapsing. Turn left and proceed northeastward passing by San Esteban until reaching Canaan East High School, turn right and continue travelling passing by Gen. Luna Barangay Monument until reaching Mala Creek. Proceed along Mala Creek and turn right on the dirt road towards the Espiritista Chapel on top of the hill. Station is located on the next hill where the Espiritista Chapel is located. It is about 200 m. NW of the Espiritista Chapel and NE 26. Station mark is the head of a 3 in. steel bolt centered and embedded on 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. concrete monument with inscription \"NE-25 DENR R3\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.70617814, '15° 42\' 22.241300\"', 121.18047570, '121° 10\' 49.712400\"', 0.0000, '0', 181.6540, 0.0000, '3', 136.9773, 305016.12180, 1737273.19100, '51', 15.70774978, '15° 42\' 27.899190\"', 121.17914260, '121° 10\' 44.913520\"', 140.9124, 1737118.67800, 519201.37400, '3', 304872.07200, 1737342.15800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5652, 'PMRV', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MARIVELES', 'POBLACION', 2012, 14.43595506, '14° 26\' 9.438216\"', 120.49022550, '120° 29\' 24.811800\"', 'PMRV PMRV is located at the roof top of Mariveles Municipal Hall in Barangay Poblacion, Mariveles, Bataan. PMRV could be accessed by travelling to Mariveles baywalk in Bagac-Mariveles road, near Jollibee fast food. ITRF2014 Coordinates Latitude: 14-26-9.59604 Longitude: 120-29-24.78012 Ellipoidal Height: 61.28448 m +/-0.00067 Error Ellipse: +/- 0.00017', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.43595506, '14° 26\' 9.438210\"', 120.49022550, '120° 29\' 24.811960\"', 0.0200, '0', 62.7020, 0.0300, '0', 19.9458, 229409.93580, 1597419.78200, '51', 14.43746098, '14° 26\' 14.859520\"', 120.48886150, '120° 29\' 19.901550\"', 19.9472, 1596630.04700, 444887.11400, '3', 229261.04100, 1597489.83300, '51', 14.43599890, '14° 26\' 9.596040\"', 120.49021670, '120° 29\' 24.780120\"', 0.0002, 61.2845, 0.0007, '2022-01-01', 'Mary', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5653, 'PMSC', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'MASINLOC', 'NORTH POBLACION', 2019, 15.53792909, '15° 32\' 16.544724\"', 119.94718140, '119° 56\' 49.853040\"', 'PMSC PMSC is located on the rooftop of President Ramon, Magsaysay State University (PRMSU) - Masinloc Campus Building whcih also caters the Masinloc Municipal Extension and is owned by the LGU. PMSC could be accessed by traveling to JM Olondres St., Brgy. North Poblacion, Masinloc, Zambales. It is about 600m away from Masinloc Municipal Hall. To get there from municipal hall, travel along the Olongapo Bugallon Road until reaching the fork. Turn left on the fork (JM Olondres St.) until you reach the Masinloc Public Market. The building is on the left side of the road. The station is the fourth in the network to use a pylon-type antenna pillar,a design shared by the National Geographic Institute (IGN) of France, which allows projection of the antenna center on the ground/floor where the pillar is installed. To date, it is the westernmost AGS located in Luzon Island.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.53792909, '15° 32\' 16.544740\"', 119.94718140, '119° 56\' 49.852950\"', 0.0200, '0', 58.5480, 0.0400, '0', 16.7158, 816158.25350, 1720004.32300, '50', 15.53951739, '15° 32\' 22.262610\"', 119.94584270, '119° 56\' 45.033800\"', 20.2999, 1718775.51800, 386912.75800, '3', 816016.40300, 1720073.10100, '50', 15.53797330, '15° 32\' 16.703880\"', 119.94717200, '119° 56\' 49.819200\"', 0.0001, 57.2673, 0.0004, '2022-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5654, 'PSRF', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BULACAN', 'SAN RAFAEL', 'SAMPALOC', 2013, 14.98187267, '14° 58\' 54.741612\"', 120.92763900, '120° 55\' 39.500400\"', 'PSRF PSRF is located within the Municipal Government of San Rafael, Bulacan compound. The station is on top of the Rural Health Unit-I Building. PSRF could be accessed by any land transportation; approximately 53 kilometers (85 minutes away) from Manila. The station is included in the Mega Manila network RTK and is considered to be a Tier-3 Active Geodetic Station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.98187267, '14° 58\' 54.741620\"', 120.92763900, '120° 55\' 39.500280\"', 0.0100, '0', 71.8660, 0.0300, '0', 29.1631, 277144.56150, 1657363.24600, '51', 14.98340391, '14° 59\' 0.254070\"', 120.92628850, '120° 55\' 34.638550\"', 29.6069, 1656969.98400, 492071.96800, '3', 276997.88400, 1657432.38200, '51', 14.98191670, '14° 58\' 54.900120\"', 120.92763010, '120° 55\' 39.468360\"', 0.0001, 70.4854, 0.0003, '2022-01-01', 'Edil', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5655, 'ZBS-1', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'PALAUIG', 'BULAWEN', 1989, 15.40916271, '15° 24\' 32.985756\"', 119.95248510, '119° 57\' 8.946360\"', 'ZBS-1 Is located inside the Philippine Army Headquarters at the intersection of road inside the camp, approx. 4.35 km. from Masinloc/Palauig junction going to Iba; 0.85 km. SW from Bulawen Elementary School and 0.200 km. W from electric post No.162. Accessible by a two wheel drive vehicle. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in a standard concrete block, 0.70 m. deep, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. Sub-surface mark is a bottle set in concrete block, top of bottle is 0.78 m. below station mark. Reference marks is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods set in concrete blocks 0.60 m. deep, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name and RM numbers.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.40916271, '15° 24\' 32.985750\"', 119.95248510, '119° 57\' 8.946290\"', 0.0000, '0', 92.7655, 0.0000, '1', 50.9609, 816923.85160, 1705753.10800, '50', 15.41074276, '15° 24\' 38.673950\"', 119.95114340, '119° 57\' 4.116330\"', 54.1250, 1704522.82300, 387411.84800, '3', 816781.61300, 1705821.77700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5656, 'ZBS-10', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN FELIPE', 'STO. NINO', 1992, 15.06047626, '15° 3\' 37.714536\"', 120.06198150, '120° 3\' 43.133400\"', 'ZBS-10 Is situated on the concrete roof of Sto. Niño Barangay Hall, approx. 850 m. from San Felipe town highway junction passing thru Fucuticilla St. It is 3 m. SW of the NE roof corner, 0.80 m. from the roof E edge and 2.65 m. above the ground level. Station mark is a concrete nail set flush on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty with inscription \"ZBS-10, 1992, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.06047626, '15° 3\' 37.714520\"', 120.06198150, '120° 3\' 43.133410\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.2760, 0.0000, '2', 10.3570, 184109.45820, 1667120.75900, '51', 15.06203182, '15° 3\' 43.314550\"', 120.06063170, '120° 3\' 38.274270\"', 13.3518, 1665883.00400, 398999.42600, '3', 183962.28400, 1667192.78900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1992-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5657, 'ZBS-11', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CABANGAN', 'LOMBOY', 1992, 15.13464090, '15° 8\' 4.707240\"', 120.04313670, '120° 2\' 35.292120\"', 'ZBS-11 To reach the station from Cabangan Town Proper, travel S along the general direction of the nat\'l. road for about 2.5 km. until reaching a highway junction leading to Brgys. Camiing, Laoag Norte and Lomboy. Turn right and head W towards the coast following the general direction of the brgy. road leading to Brgy. Lomboy. Station is located within Lomboy Fisherman Coop. compound. It is situated on top of a concrete water tank of an abandoned resthouse, the water tank located adjacent to the service road and about 20 m. W of the coastline. Mark is the head of concrete nail centered and embbedded on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty set flushed on top of a concrete water tank 5.1 m. above the groundm with inscriptions \"ZBS-11 1992 NAMRIA\". Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, surveyor/s must be equipped with a navigational-grade GPS, a compass and a topomap.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.13464090, '15° 8\' 4.707230\"', 120.04313670, '120° 2\' 35.292140\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.4030, 0.0000, '2', 12.4292, 182192.22770, 1675360.40900, '51', 15.13620159, '15° 8\' 10.325730\"', 120.04178870, '120° 2\' 30.439220\"', 15.7398, 1674098.71000, 397009.01900, '3', 182045.28800, 1675432.56800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1992-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5658, 'ZBS-14', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'PALAUIG', 'LOCLOC', 1992, 15.39848917, '15° 23\' 54.561012\"', 119.91976640, '119° 55\' 11.159040\"', 'ZBS-14 to reach the station from Iba town proper, travel northward along the general direction of the national road towards the town of Palauig for about 11 kms until reaching a road intersection, the intersection being 200 m S of Km. Post 222 and reads a sign pointing the direction of the brgy. Locloc. Turn left and head westward for about 1.7 kms. and locate Radona\'s and Algaba\'s residence. ZBS-14 is situated on a farmlot own by the Radona\'s about 37 m SE of the SE corner of a residencial lot of the Radona\'s 32 m E of an Agoho tree, 16 m N of a Casuy tree and 50 m NW of Alex Algaba\'s residence. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered and embedded on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 70 cm concrete block which protrudes 5 cm above the gradeline with inscription \"ZBS-14, 1992 NAMRIA\". Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, surveyor must be equipped with a compass, a topomap and a navigational grade GPS.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.39848917, '15° 23\' 54.561000\"', 119.91976640, '119° 55\' 11.159000\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.7790, 0.0000, '2', 5.6607, 813425.15070, 1704523.29800, '50', 15.40006929, '15° 24\' 0.249460\"', 119.91842440, '119° 55\' 6.327920\"', 8.1868, 1703359.07400, 383893.39000, '3', 813282.85500, 1704592.05800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1992-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5659, 'ZBS-17', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'MABAYO', 1995, 14.75007609, '14° 45\' 0.273924\"', 120.24647290, '120° 14\' 47.302440\"', 'ZBS-17 Is in Zambales at the E coast of Subic Bay about 1.5 NM SE of Grande Island. It is located at Binanga Pt. just below the E side of the cliff. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded on a 0.15 m. x 0.15 m. cement putty with inscription ZBS-17 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.75007609, '14° 45\' 0.273910\"', 120.24647290, '120° 14\' 47.302520\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.8920, 0.0000, '3', 6.3680, 203534.24270, 1632498.35800, '51', 14.75160771, '14° 45\' 5.787750\"', 120.24511610, '120° 14\' 42.417780\"', 8.6250, 1631460.09300, 418719.82400, '3', 203386.18400, 1632569.49900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5660, 'ZBS-18', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'MABAYO', 1995, 14.76100952, '14° 45\' 39.634272\"', 120.24260770, '120° 14\' 33.387720\"', 'ZBS-18 Is in Zambales, Subic Bay. At the E coast about 1.7 km. SE of Grande Island and 4 km. SW of the western part of SBMA airport. It is located at Camayan Pt. on top of a three-sided concrete wall structure along the road. Station mark is the head of a 1/2\" steel bolt embedded on a 6\" x 6\" cement putty with inscription ZBS-18 1995 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.76100952, '14° 45\' 39.634280\"', 120.24260770, '120° 14\' 33.387580\"', 0.0000, '0', 66.8380, 0.0000, '3', 23.2901, 203132.64680, 1633713.94900, '51', 14.76254193, '14° 45\' 45.150940\"', 120.24125100, '120° 14\' 28.503760\"', 25.6110, 1632671.28800, 418307.72900, '3', 202984.62200, 1633785.11300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5661, 'ZBS-19', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'MABAYO', 1995, 14.77534319, '14° 46\' 31.235484\"', 120.22455630, '120° 13\' 28.402680\"', 'ZBS-19 Is in Zambales, Subic Bay, Grande Island. Located at the inshore end of the NW breakwater, about 300 m. W of the Pier. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail, embedded and set flush to the surrounding surface with inscription, \"ZBS-19, 1995\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.77534319, '14° 46\' 31.235470\"', 120.22455630, '120° 13\' 28.402590\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.1670, 0.0000, '3', 5.6431, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.77687692, '14° 46\' 36.756910\"', 120.22320000, '120° 13\' 23.519900\"', 8.0250, 1634264.00000, 416369.60200, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'admin', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5662, 'ZBS-2', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN NARCISO', 'SIMMINUBLAN', 1989, 14.99366531, '14° 59\' 37.195116\"', 120.12066600, '120° 7\' 14.397600\"', 'ZBS-2 to reach the station from San Antonio-San Marcelino junction in San Narciso travel eastward along the general direction of the national highway for about 4.7 kms. until reaching a road intersecting the highway which leads to sitio Dallepawen. Turn left and continue traveling for about 300 m until reaching a concrete bridge. ZBS-2 is situated on the SW corner of the said bridge. All RMs are 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods set on drilled hole in the bridge railings. Station mark is the head of a copper nail centered and embedded on a 30 cm x 30 cm cement putty with inscription \"ZBS-2, 2004, NAMRIA\". Stampings were restored after the previous markings where chipped off.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.99366531, '14° 59\' 37.195130\"', 120.12066600, '120° 7\' 14.397740\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.8135, 0.0000, '1', 25.3223, 190327.31630, 1659639.65200, '51', 14.99521531, '14° 59\' 42.775100\"', 120.11931480, '120° 7\' 9.533220\"', 28.5530, 1658463.80400, 405279.98600, '3', 190179.96900, 1659711.42800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5663, 'ZBS-20', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'MABAYO', 1995, 14.79162087, '14° 47\' 29.835132\"', 120.25723850, '120° 15\' 26.058600\"', 'ZBS-20 Is in Zambales, Olongapo city, SBMA. Located at the WSW point of SBMA Airport, situated on top of a stone riprap outside the road cement blocks. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on a 0.15 m. cement putty with inscriptions \"ZBS-20, 1995, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.79162087, '14° 47\' 29.835125\"', 120.25723850, '120° 15\' 26.058641\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.7981, 0.0000, '3', 8.0817, 204750.30550, 1637083.74300, '51', 14.79315491, '14° 47\' 35.357680\"', 120.25588260, '120° 15\' 21.177490\"', 10.6235, 1636053.13300, 419894.36900, '3', 204602.39600, 1637154.88700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5664, 'ZBS-21', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'BATAAN', 'MORONG', 'MABAYO', 1995, 14.80055180, '14° 48\' 1.986480\"', 120.28410900, '120° 17\' 2.792400\"', 'ZBS-21 Is in the province of Zambales, city of Olongapo, at the Subic Bay Metropolitan Authority. It is located outside the Subic Bay International Airport near the shoreline on the NE part of the runway. It is approx. 25 m. N of valve pit #45, 50 m. NW of valve pit #44, which are located on the side of a road leading to Cubi Point Westward and Coastal Subic Compound Eastward. Mark is a 10 cm. dia. iron plate, cross-marked at the center, placed on a concrete base, enclosed by a 20 cm. yellow-painted square, marked PWC 91, 1974.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.80055180, '14° 48\' 1.986490\"', 120.28410900, '120° 17\' 2.792310\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.3320, 0.0000, '3', 6.5392, 207656.71140, 1638037.27000, '51', 14.80208582, '14° 48\' 7.508940\"', 120.28275330, '120° 16\' 57.912030\"', 9.1170, 1637031.85100, 422790.34500, '3', 207508.85600, 1638108.33500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5665, 'ZBS-22', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CITY OF OLONGAPO', 'NEW KABABAE', 1995, 14.80760447, '14° 48\' 27.376092\"', 120.29575390, '120° 17\' 44.714040\"', 'ZBS-22 Is in Zambales, Olongapo, Subic Bay, at the E coast of the bay. At Maritan Pt., located 200 m. SE of the offshore end pier of coastal, Subic Bay Terminal Inc. Station mark is the head of a copper nail, embedded and cemented flush to the seawall, N of the defunct and abandoned pier, with inscription \"ZBS-22, 1995, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.80760447, '14° 48\' 27.376096\"', 120.29575390, '120° 17\' 44.713890\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.1410, 0.0000, '3', 5.3185, 208920.42720, 1638802.90700, '51', 14.80913868, '14° 48\' 32.899240\"', 120.29439840, '120° 17\' 39.834270\"', 7.9183, 1637808.21900, 424046.41700, '3', 208772.60600, 1638873.94100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5666, 'ZBS-23', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CITY OF OLONGAPO', 'NEW KALALAKE', 1995, 14.81271605, '14° 48\' 45.777780\"', 120.28919350, '120° 17\' 21.096600\"', 'ZBS-23 Is in Olongapo City, Zambales, at SBMA. Station is located at the E coast of the bay at Rivera Pt. Pier. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded and set flush to the concrete pier, about 2.5 m. W of the SE end corner, with inscription \"ZBS-23, 1995, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.81271605, '14° 48\' 45.777771\"', 120.28919350, '120° 17\' 21.096611\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.5959, 0.0000, '3', 5.7622, 208220.67240, 1639377.35600, '51', 14.81425059, '14° 48\' 51.302120\"', 120.28783820, '120° 17\' 16.217498\"', 8.4030, 1638376.04800, 423342.01700, '3', 208072.86500, 1639448.40000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'Mary', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5667, 'ZBS-24', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CITY OF OLONGAPO', 'BARRETO', 1995, 14.82359290, '14° 49\' 24.934440\"', 120.26816620, '120° 16\' 5.398320\"', 'ZBS-24 Is in the Province of Zambales, City of Olongapo, Brgy. Kalaklan. It is about 8 m. SW of Kalaklan Lighthouse which is situated at the N side of Kalaklan River\'s mouth. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set on the center of a cement putty on top of a concrete structure with inscription \"ZBS-24, 1995, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.82359290, '14° 49\' 24.934430\"', 120.26816620, '120° 16\' 5.398240\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.8940, 0.0000, '3', 15.0577, 205970.58350, 1640609.08400, '51', 14.82512874, '14° 49\' 30.463470\"', 120.26681110, '120° 16\' 0.519860\"', 17.7840, 1639586.94000, 421082.46400, '3', 205822.79200, 1640680.22200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5668, 'ZBS-25 (MACMANY 1908)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SUBIC', 'CAWAG', 1995, 14.77616298, '14° 46\' 34.186728\"', 120.19521930, '120° 11\' 42.789480\"', 'ZBS-25 = MACMANY, 1908 On the W side of Subic Bay, Zambales on the prominent ridge leading down to Macmany Point. The station is situated on the highest part of the knoll at the junction of these two spurs. The station is most easily reached from the Macmany Point, going up the ridge which leads directly up to the station which is always in view as the hillside is entirely bare of trees, being covered only with cogon grass black boulders. Beyond the station, the ridge drops to a sharp saddle before resuming its rise. The station is in a little circular depression about 0.6 m. deep and 1.5 m. to 2.5 m. in dia. Station mark is a drill hole in the center of a triangle about 20 cm. on a side, chiseled in the flat surface of an irregular slab of a rock about 0.6 m. long x 0.45 m. wide. Recoverd as described, slightly buried but in good condition.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.77616298, '14° 46\' 34.186740\"', 120.19521930, '120° 11\' 42.789520\"', 0.0000, '0', 270.1440, 0.0000, '3', 226.7887, 198048.11850, 1635454.90700, '51', 14.77769738, '14° 46\' 39.710550\"', 120.19386300, '120° 11\' 37.906940\"', 229.0760, 1634365.90800, 413211.33100, '3', 197900.10700, 1635526.23500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5669, 'ZBS-26', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SUBIC', 'CAWAG', 1995, 14.75083588, '14° 45\' 3.009168\"', 120.18866830, '120° 11\' 19.205880\"', 'ZBS-26 Is in Zambales, at the W coast of the Subic Bay. It is situated on a hill at Sueste Pt., on a steel cylindrical post about 0.70 m. high above the ground 30 m. SSW of the old light house. Station mark is a round gash 2 mm. deep at the center of the steel plate welded on top of the 10 mm. dia. post without inscription.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.75083588, '14° 45\' 3.009170\"', 120.18866830, '120° 11\' 19.205960\"', 0.0000, '0', 96.1890, 0.0000, '3', 53.0257, 197307.27770, 1632659.54700, '51', 14.75236884, '14° 45\' 8.527810\"', 120.18731140, '120° 11\' 14.321060\"', 55.0648, 1631565.98900, 412495.81000, '3', 197159.17100, 1632730.87800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5670, 'ZBS-28', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CITY OF OLONGAPO', 'BARRETO', 1995, 14.82932776, '14° 49\' 45.579936\"', 120.26985820, '120° 16\' 11.489520\"', 'ZBS-28 IS IN ZAMBALES, CITY OF OLONGAPO, BRGY. KALAKLAN. LOCATED AT THE HIGHEST POINT OF THE HILL OCCUPIED BY THE OLONGAPO CITY CEMETERY, ON A RECTANGULAR CONCRETE WATER TANK. STATION MARK IS THE HEAD OF A COPPER NAIL EMBEDDED AND SET FLUSH TO THE SURFACE, 0.60 M. FROM THE NW CORNER OF THE TANK WITH INSCRIPTION, \"ZBS-28, 95, NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.82932776, '14° 49\' 45.579950\"', 120.26985820, '120° 16\' 11.489347\"', 0.0000, '0', 151.1248, 0.0000, '3', 107.2689, 206160.56040, 1641241.78200, '51', 14.83086378, '14° 49\' 51.109601\"', 120.26850320, '120° 16\' 6.611641\"', 110.0274, 1640220.88700, 421266.68400, '3', 206012.79400, 1641312.90200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5671, 'ZBS-29', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SUBIC', 'CAWAG', 1995, 14.86268828, '14° 51\' 45.677808\"', 120.20234980, '120° 12\' 8.459280\"', 'ZBS-29 Is in Zambales, Subic Bay, about 1.4 km. S of Cayag pt. It is located a step below the SE corner of a fishpond owned by Mr. Felipe Delgado. Station can be reached at about 10 min. travel time via motorized pumpboat from Subic town proper. Station mark is a head of 4\" copper nai set on the center of a cement putty on top of a concrete seawall with inscription ZBS-29, 1995, NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.86268828, '14° 51\' 45.677800\"', 120.20234980, '120° 12\' 8.459340\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.1570, 0.0000, '3', 4.3783, 198936.03630, 1645025.24200, '51', 14.86422810, '14° 51\' 51.221150\"', 120.20099560, '120° 12\' 3.583990\"', 7.3201, 1643937.32000, 414013.41600, '3', 198788.31800, 1645096.63100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5672, 'ZBS-3', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SANTA CRUZ', 'GAMA', 1989, 15.80564066, '15° 48\' 20.306376\"', 119.92470530, '119° 55\' 28.939080\"', 'ZBS-3 Is accessible for all types of vehicles. It\'s about 5 min. drive from Sta. Cruz proper to Gama Elementary School and from this school, drive for about 350 m., then turn rigth eastward. Station is approx. 1.2 km. SE of the national road and barrio road intersection. It is at the SE end of E irrigation canal headwall. Station mark is a cross-cut on top of 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. x 0.70 m. concrete block flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. Sub-surface mark ZBS-3 with 7-up bottle neck embedded on 15 cm. concrete foundation of irrigation canal covered with sand; 0.01 cm. deep. Reference mark RM-1, RM-3 & RM-4 are 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. brass rods with cement patties embedded on top of irrigation canal headwall. RM-2 is a concrete monument 25 cm. x 25 cm. x 60 cm. dia.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.80564066, '15° 48\' 20.306380\"', 119.92470530, '119° 55\' 28.939170\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.6925, 0.0000, '1', 6.0916, 813336.19690, 1749616.23800, '50', 15.80724622, '15° 48\' 26.086390\"', 119.92337290, '119° 55\' 24.142590\"', 10.2940, 1748414.52300, 384652.43100, '3', 813195.15000, 1749685.27100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5673, 'ZBS-30', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN MARCELINO', 'CONSUELO NORTE', 1930, 14.98529768, '14° 59\' 7.071648\"', 120.15820050, '120° 9\' 29.521800\"', 'ZBS-30 Is in Zambales, town of San Marcelino, Brgy. Consuelo Norte. Located at the SE point of Simminublan hill, about 500 m. N of San Marcelino town proper. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded and set flush to the rocky surface of the hill about 20 m. high with some group of houses below and one just 3.0 m. E of the station. The mark is inscribed with, \"ZBS-30, 1995, NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.98529768, '14° 59\' 7.071650\"', 120.15820050, '120° 9\' 29.521890\"', 0.0000, '0', 107.7730, 0.0000, '3', 63.8981, 194355.16500, 1658660.93900, '51', 14.98684630, '14° 59\' 12.646680\"', 120.15684910, '120° 9\' 24.656820\"', 67.3970, 1657522.08200, 409313.63700, '3', 194207.82300, 1658732.58300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
