(5674, 'ZBS-3001', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SANTA CRUZ', 'TUBOTUBO NORTH', 2007, 15.75337621, '15° 45\' 12.154356\"', 119.93972880, '119° 56\' 23.023680\"', 'ZBS-3001 The mark is located E of Lupa Elementary School of Santa Cruz, Zambales. It is situated 20 m s of the water tank outside the perimeter fence of the said school and 15 m E of the school. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS 3001, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.75337621, '15° 45\' 12.154350\"', 119.93972880, '119° 56\' 23.023780\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.1670, 0.0000, '3', 26.3498, 815027.76060, 1743851.09200, '50', 15.75497817, '15° 45\' 17.921420\"', 119.93839520, '119° 56\' 18.222830\"', 30.5763, 1742622.30300, 386232.89700, '3', 814886.56400, 1743920.04500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jho', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5675, 'ZBS-3002', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SANTA CRUZ', 'LUCAPON SOUTH', 2007, 15.71204048, '15° 42\' 43.345728\"', 119.95451520, '119° 57\' 16.254720\"', 'ZBS-3002 From Iba Municipal Hall, travel along National Road going to Santa Cruz until reaching the Y-road at Barangay Lucapon South. Turn right to the road going to ACOJE Mining Company. Follow the road until reaching the lot property DAR about 5 KM from the National Highway. Station mark is on the land property of DAR along the SE side of the road going to ACOJE. It is situated about 5m E from the inetersection of the road going to ACOJE and 1.54 KM Subol Road, which is yet to be constructed by DAR. Mark is about 25 m SE of the mango tree about 2m NW of the barbwire fence. Mark is the head of a 4 inch copper nail, centere on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-3002, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.71204048, '15° 42\' 43.345720\"', 119.95451520, '119° 57\' 16.254620\"', 0.0000, '0', 89.3510, 0.0000, '3', 47.2888, 816677.56010, 1739295.81700, '50', 15.71363953, '15° 42\' 49.102290\"', 119.95318060, '119° 57\' 11.450250\"', 51.6013, 1738039.84500, 387794.86300, '3', 816536.24700, 1739364.69600, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5676, 'ZBS-3003', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'MASINLOC', 'BANI', 2007, 15.57530152, '15° 34\' 31.085472\"', 119.92777910, '119° 55\' 40.004760\"', 'ZBS-3003 The station is situated towards north NAPOCOR Compound, it is within the barangay road at a distance 6m from the centerline of the road, and about 150 m SW of Bani Barangay Hall and north of Zambales Bay. Mark is lcoated about 70 m N of the intersection of the barangay Road Entrance to NAPOCOR. Mark is the head of a 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-3003, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.57530152, '15° 34\' 31.085470\"', 119.92777910, '119° 55\' 40.004930\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.9540, 0.0000, '3', 7.4770, 814018.55170, 1724114.10800, '50', 15.57689259, '15° 34\' 36.813340\"', 119.92644140, '119° 55\' 35.188860\"', 10.8635, 1722921.78400, 384852.00900, '3', 813876.80300, 1724182.97000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'ysn', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5677, 'ZBS-3004', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'MASINLOC', 'BULINTIN', 2007, 15.52178758, '15° 31\' 18.435288\"', 119.97127910, '119° 58\' 16.604760\"', 'ZBS-3004 Station is located at Barngay Bulitin, Masinloc, Zambales about 2 KM east of Iglesi Ni Kristo Chapel. Mark is the head of a 4 inch. copper nail, centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-3004, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.52178758, '15° 31\' 18.435270\"', 119.97127910, '119° 58\' 16.604760\"', 0.0000, '0', 104.5830, 0.0000, '3', 62.2807, 818770.16320, 1718252.66800, '50', 15.52337431, '15° 31\' 24.147530\"', 119.96994010, '119° 58\' 11.784380\"', 66.2287, 1716976.56400, 389489.50500, '3', 818628.28100, 1718321.36300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5678, 'ZBS-3005', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'PALAUIG', 'SALAZA', 2007, 15.45711913, '15° 27\' 25.628868\"', 119.95725440, '119° 57\' 26.115840\"', 'ZBS-3005 From Iba Town Proper, take national road going to Palauig. After passing the 20m bridge, turn right and travel about 500 m. Station is located on the left side of Salaza Barangay Road. Mark is the head of 4 inch. copper nail, centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-3005, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.45711913, '15° 27\' 25.628860\"', 119.95725440, '119° 57\' 26.116010\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.1360, 0.0000, '3', 11.1573, 817363.18840, 1711070.64200, '50', 15.45870212, '15° 27\' 31.327630\"', 119.95591390, '119° 57\' 21.290060\"', 14.6251, 1709827.38100, 387949.71900, '3', 817221.09800, 1711139.33400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5679, 'ZBS-3006', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'PALAUIG', 'SALAZA', 2007, 15.43664715, '15° 26\' 11.929740\"', 120.01884260, '120° 1\' 7.833360\"', 'ZBS-3006 From Iba Town Proper, take National Road going to Masinloc until reaching the junction going to Palauig. Continue traveling for about 8 KM upon reaching the first Barangay Road going to Sitio Dampay. Mark is the head of a 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty on the ground with inscription \"PAL-18, DENR-III, 2004\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.43664715, '15° 26\' 11.929750\"', 120.01884260, '120° 1\' 7.833480\"', 0.0000, '0', 166.3180, 0.0000, '3', 123.0915, 180038.18860, 1708839.10000, '51', 15.43822746, '15° 26\' 17.618870\"', 120.01750170, '120° 1\' 3.006140\"', 127.5972, 1707530.58600, 394549.48800, '3', 179892.25300, 1708911.60400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5680, 'ZBS-3007', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'BOTOLAN', 'TAUGTOG', 2007, 15.30650612, '15° 18\' 23.422032\"', 120.03484380, '120° 2\' 5.437680\"', 'ZBS-3007 The station mark is located approximately 20m. from the intersection of two barangay roads namely Santiago Rd and Kinaraan Rd. It about 15 m N of a waiting shed about 50 m S of a concrete barrier. Mark is the head of a 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-3007, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.30650612, '15° 18\' 23.422030\"', 120.03484380, '120° 2\' 5.437540\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.5550, 0.0000, '3', 15.3563, 181559.00940, 1694403.99600, '51', 15.30807789, '15° 18\' 29.080390\"', 120.03349980, '120° 2\' 0.599160\"', 19.4133, 1693121.20800, 396202.27600, '3', 181412.64400, 1694476.33600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jho', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
