(5682, 'ZBS-3009', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CABANGAN', 'SAN RAFAEL', 2007, 15.18894971, '15° 11\' 20.218956\"', 120.04255440, '120° 2\' 33.195840\"', 'ZBS-3009 From Iba, travel along National Road going to Cabangan. Then turn left to the road going to Barangay San Rafael, turn right at the first crossing until reaching Barangay Hall. Station mark is centered at the top of 10 m high water tank S of the stage, E of the Barangay Hall W of Barangay Chapel. Mark is the head of a 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-3009, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.18894971, '15° 11\' 20.218940\"', 120.04255440, '120° 2\' 33.195980\"', 0.0000, '0', 61.4850, 0.0000, '3', 18.4144, 182210.85810, 1681375.09500, '51', 15.19051386, '15° 11\' 25.849890\"', 120.04120770, '120° 2\' 28.347670\"', 21.9813, 1680108.74300, 396972.87600, '3', 182064.10200, 1681447.30400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
