(5685, 'ZBS-3012', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN MARCELINO', 'SAN RAFAEL', 2007, 14.97361611, '14° 58\' 25.017996\"', 120.21136930, '120° 12\' 40.929480\"', 'ZBS-3012 From San Marcelino Municipal Hall, travel along the road going to Barangay Laoag until reaching the Y-road going to the dike and going to Barangay San Rafael. Turn right to the Y-road until reaching Barangay San Rafael. Station mark is inside the compound of San Rafael Barangay Hall. It is located about 10 m W of the west corner of the mini chapel and 0.5 m SE from the 11th pillar of the cyclone wire fence (11th pillar from the NNE corner of the compound). Mark is along the imaginary line extending the W corner of the Barangay Hall about 30m NW. Mark is the head of a 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-3012, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.97361611, '14° 58\' 25.017990\"', 120.21136930, '120° 12\' 40.929360\"', 0.0000, '0', 112.3260, 0.0000, '3', 68.1267, 200061.32940, 1657294.80900, '51', 14.97516279, '14° 58\' 30.586060\"', 120.21001760, '120° 12\' 36.063530\"', 71.7868, 1656208.27100, 415027.97700, '3', 199913.99400, 1657366.26900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5686, 'ZBS-3013', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN ANTONIO', 'BURGOS', 2007, 14.94051865, '14° 56\' 25.867140\"', 120.12240550, '120° 7\' 20.659800\"', 'ZBS-3013 From San Antonio Municipal Hall, travel along the road going to San Marcellino. Turn right to GOVIC Highway (Road going to San Antonio Valley Subdivisio) until reaching the bridge. Station mark is along the SW side of the road, about 5m from the road centerline. It is situated about 11 m NW from the W end of the bridge, about 7m NE from the riprap and 2.6 KM from the National Road. Mark is the head of a 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-3013, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.94051865, '14° 56\' 25.867140\"', 120.12240550, '120° 7\' 20.659710\"', 0.0000, '0', 63.6740, 0.0000, '3', 20.2972, 190438.13460, 1653752.50400, '51', 14.94206522, '14° 56\' 31.434800\"', 120.12105300, '120° 7\' 15.790640\"', 23.2559, 1652582.11300, 405443.64000, '3', 190290.60900, 1653824.22600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
