(5701, 'ZBS-3032', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SANTA CRUZ', 'TUBOTUBO NORTH', 2008, 15.76416205, '15° 45\' 50.983380\"', 119.94084560, '119° 56\' 27.044160\"', 'ZBS-3032 Station is located in Brgy. Tubo-tubo Norte in Sta. Cruz, Zambales. It is situated on top of the concrete riprap of an RCP, about 6 m W of the road centerline. It can be accessed by turning right just before the Sta. Cruz Bridge when heading towards the town proper then travel for about 2 Km. until reaching a left turn towards the caves, make a turn then follow the road, turning right until reaching the station. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, set in a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty flushed to the ground with inscriptions, \"ZBS-3032, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.76416205, '15° 45\' 50.983380\"', 119.94084560, '119° 56\' 27.044170\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.3210, 0.0000, '4', 14.4921, 815130.86230, 1745047.15600, '50', 15.76576467, '15° 45\' 56.752800\"', 119.93951230, '119° 56\' 22.244120\"', 18.7597, 1743815.34300, 386358.61700, '3', 814989.69900, 1745116.11300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
