(5726, 'ZBS-3057', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'MASINLOC', 'BAMBAN', 2008, 15.50730184, '15° 30\' 26.286624\"', 119.96990000, '119° 58\' 11.640000\"', 'ZBS-3057 Station is located along the National Highway in Brgy. Bamban, Masinloc, Zambales. It is situated on the N corner of the foundation of a ruin house on top of the hill, on the road intersection between the highway and a dirt road, leading to Sitio Buri. It is 20 m E of the road centerline, 7 m W of the dirt road and 80 m S of Bamban Elem. and High School. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set in a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty flushed to the ground, with inscriptions, \"ZBS-3057, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.50730184, '15° 30\' 26.286630\"', 119.96990000, '119° 58\' 11.640160\"', 0.0000, '0', 60.1900, 0.0000, '4', 17.9141, 818644.35960, 1716646.49300, '50', 15.50888771, '15° 30\' 31.995760\"', 119.96856070, '119° 58\' 6.818520\"', 21.7963, 1715374.22500, 389333.78000, '3', 818502.43100, 1716715.18300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
