(5782, 'ZBS-3114', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CABANGAN', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2008, 15.16606821, '15° 9\' 57.845556\"', 120.04729820, '120° 2\' 50.273520\"', 'ZBS-3114 Station is located inside the San Isidro Brgy. Compound. It is situated on the concrete base of the Ramon Magsaysay monument, 5 m west of the basketball court, 15 m E from the centerline of Narra Street and 10 m S of the Brgy. Health Center. Mark is the head of a 4-inch copper nail, set in a 25 by 25 cm cement putty, set flush to the surface with inscription ZBS-3114, 2007, NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.16606821, '15° 9\' 57.845550\"', 120.04729820, '120° 2\' 50.273590\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.8130, 0.0000, '4', 8.6937, 182686.77140, 1678834.43800, '51', 15.16763080, '15° 10\' 3.470880\"', 120.04595090, '120° 2\' 45.423390\"', 12.2310, 1677574.45700, 397471.56400, '3', 182539.94300, 1678906.61100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
