(5784, 'ZBS-3116', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CABANGAN', 'LOMBOY', 2008, 15.13122819, '15° 7\' 52.421484\"', 120.04731730, '120° 2\' 50.342280\"', 'ZBS-3116 Station is located on top of a spillway in Brgy. Lomboy, Cabangan, Zambales. It is situated on the south edge of the spillway, on the road heading towards the Lomboy Fishermens Cooperative by the South China Sea. It is approximately 500 m west from the beach. Mark is the head of a 4-inch copper nail, set in a 25 by 25 cm cement putty, set flush to the surface, with inscription ZBS-3116, 2007, NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.13122819, '15° 7\' 52.421490\"', 120.04731730, '120° 2\' 50.342170\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.7230, 0.0000, '4', 5.6890, 182636.81790, 1674976.44800, '51', 15.13278858, '15° 7\' 58.038880\"', 120.04596920, '120° 2\' 45.488970\"', 9.0397, 1673719.09600, 397456.74200, '3', 182489.87100, 1675048.59000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5785, 'ZBS-3117', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN FELIPE', 'MALOMA', 2008, 15.11050347, '15° 6\' 37.812492\"', 120.08478170, '120° 5\' 5.214120\"', 'Station is located along the barangay road leading to Sitio Sagpat in Barangay Maloma, San Felife, Zambales. It is on the SE end of the bridge spanning a small creek between two rice fields. Mark is the head of a 4-inch copper nail, set in a 25 by 25 cm cement putty, set flush to the surface, with inscription \"ZBS-3117, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.11050347, '15° 6\' 37.812500\"', 120.08478170, '120° 5\' 5.214170\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.0200, 0.0000, '4', 8.4646, 186636.16490, 1672627.68200, '51', 15.11206171, '15° 6\' 43.422150\"', 120.08343320, '120° 5\' 0.359370\"', 12.1854, 1671408.49600, 401474.26400, '3', 186489.18000, 1672699.68200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5786, 'ZBS-3118', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN FELIPE', 'MALOMA', 2008, 15.10040007, '15° 6\' 1.440252\"', 120.13540400, '120° 8\' 7.454400\"', 'Station is located on a lot owned by Mr. Ramon dela Cruz, Sitio Yangi, Brgy. Maloma, San Felife, Zambales. It can be accessed from the National Highway by turning right before the Maloma Brgy. Plaza then heading up until Sitio Sagpat, where a carabao can be hired to get to Sitio Yangi. Mark is the head of a 4-inch copper nail, set on a 30 by 30 cm concrete monument, set flush to the ground, marked with a 15 by 15 cm stainless steel plate with inscription \"ZBS-3118, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.10040007, '15° 6\' 1.440250\"', 120.13540400, '120° 8\' 7.454320\"', 0.0000, '0', 74.1580, 0.0000, '4', 30.0146, 192067.06540, 1671437.31300, '51', 15.10195653, '15° 6\' 7.043510\"', 120.13405530, '120° 8\' 2.598900\"', 34.1708, 1670268.29700, 406911.81800, '3', 191920.09100, 1671509.13800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Edil', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(5787, 'ZBS-3119', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN FELIPE', 'MALOMA', 2008, 15.09195873, '15° 5\' 31.051428\"', 120.06577640, '120° 3\' 56.795040\"', 'Station is located along the National Highway between the San Felife and Cabangan municipalities. It is situated on top of a concrete canal in barangay Maloma, San Felife on the S-curve between 2 hills. It is 10 m W of a nipa house and 5 m E from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4-inch copper nail, set in a 25 by 25 cm cement putty, set flush to the surface, with inscription \"ZBS-3119, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.09195873, '15° 5\' 31.051440\"', 120.06577640, '120° 3\' 56.795100\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.1370, 0.0000, '4', 5.9765, 184564.26900, 1670601.42000, '51', 15.09351621, '15° 5\' 36.658370\"', 120.06442740, '120° 3\' 51.938640\"', 9.2948, 1669365.03300, 399422.36500, '3', 184417.20500, 1670673.46600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
