(5962, 'ZBS-33', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SUBIC', 'CAWAG', 1995, 14.80004136, '14° 48\' 0.148896\"', 120.20454620, '120° 12\' 16.366320\"', 'ZBS-33 Is in Zambales, Subic Bay, about 2.1 km. S of Agusuhin pt. (locally known as Quarry). It is located at the peak of a hill 200 m. NE of Kinabuksan Elem. School. A trail from the school leads to the hill. Station can be reached by a travel time of about 30 min. via a motorized pumpboat from Subic town proper. Station mark is a head of a 4\" copper nail set on the center of a cement putty on top of a 12 cm. x 12 cm. concrete monument which protrudes 15 cm. from the ground, which inscript is ZBS-33, 1995, NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.80004136, '14° 48\' 0.148910\"', 120.20454620, '120° 12\' 16.366330\"', 0.0000, '0', 104.9740, 0.0000, '3', 61.4319, 199085.86500, 1638086.13300, '51', 14.80157711, '14° 48\' 5.677610\"', 120.20319050, '120° 12\' 11.485700\"', 63.9520, 1637004.48000, 414224.95900, '3', 198937.93900, 1638157.45700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
