(6140, 'ZBS-35', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SUBIC', 'CAWAG', 1995, 14.84603116, '14° 50\' 45.712176\"', 120.21185050, '120° 12\' 42.661800\"', 'ZBS-35 Is in Zambales, Subic town, along the shore of Manisbaso Point. Located 50 m. E of the road that leads to Cawag. The station mark was situated 50 m. E of the house of Daniel Magsinoc. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on a cement putty, 0.15 m. x 0.15 m. with inscriptions \"ZBS-35, 1995, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.84603116, '14° 50\' 45.712160\"', 120.21185050, '120° 12\' 42.661850\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.9720, 0.0000, '3', 5.2065, 199936.11730, 1643168.20200, '51', 14.84756970, '14° 50\' 51.250910\"', 120.21049590, '120° 12\' 37.785120\"', 8.0641, 1642090.52000, 415029.35700, '3', 199788.35100, 1643239.54500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
