(6141, 'ZBS-36', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CITY OF OLONGAPO', 'BARRETO', 1995, 14.84746365, '14° 50\' 50.869140\"', 120.25568390, '120° 15\' 20.462040\"', 'ZBS-36 Is in Zambales, Olongapo City, Brgy. Barreto, on a point just 50 m. E of Baloy Beach Resort. On a 5 sq. cm. rock embedded about 0.50 m. from the edge of the cliff. Station mark is a hole about 1.0 m. in dia. bounded by a lightly gashed triangle.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.84746365, '14° 50\' 50.869130\"', 120.25568390, '120° 15\' 20.461880\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.9970, 0.0000, '3', 15.0921, 204658.64090, 1643268.35700, '51', 14.84900130, '14° 50\' 56.404670\"', 120.25432930, '120° 15\' 15.585480\"', 17.9864, 1642232.72100, 419747.71300, '3', 204510.91800, 1643339.55800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6142, 'ZBS-43 (OC-22)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CITY OF OLONGAPO', 'GORDON HEIGHTS', 2001, 14.85518704, '14° 51\' 18.673344\"', 120.28842460, '120° 17\' 18.328560\"', 'ZBS-43 (OC-22) Is located along Neptune St. corner Sander St. in Brgy. Gordon Heights, Olongapo City. Station is along the SW of Neptune St., infront of No. 9 Neptune St. Station mark is a copper nail 10 cm. x 0.5 mm. in dia., set on the concrete block 30 cm. x 30 cm. in size and 40 cm. flushed below the ground with only 10 cm. protruding. Station name is inscribed at the top of the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.85518704, '14° 51\' 18.673330\"', 120.28842460, '120° 17\' 18.328450\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.9940, 0.0000, '3', 15.0260, 208194.86810, 1644080.37500, '51', 14.85672445, '14° 51\' 24.208020\"', 120.28707020, '120° 17\' 13.452850\"', 17.9258, 1643075.73800, 423274.32200, '3', 208047.20000, 1644151.47600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6143, 'ZBS-44', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'BOTOLAN', 'PORAC', 2004, 15.26176514, '15° 15\' 42.354504\"', 120.03727120, '120° 2\' 14.176320\"', 'ZBS-44 To reach the station from Olongapo City, travel along the nat\'l. highway, which leads to Iba, until reaching Bucao Bridge. Station is located on the right side of the bridge about 10 to 15 m. from the foot of the bridge.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.26176514, '15° 15\' 42.354520\"', 120.03727120, '120° 2\' 14.176340\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.4230, 0.0000, '3', 14.3131, 181752.31030, 1689446.01600, '51', 15.26333403, '15° 15\' 48.002500\"', 120.03592620, '120° 2\' 9.334180\"', 18.1450, 1688168.99200, 396440.91600, '3', 181605.79600, 1689518.30700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2017-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6144, 'ZBS-45', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'BOTOLAN', 'SAN JUAN', 2004, 15.28450986, '15° 17\' 4.235496\"', 120.08280040, '120° 4\' 58.081440\"', 'ZBS-45 to reach the station from San Juan barangay hall, travel eastward to NEward along the general direction of the road for about 1.5 kms. toward Baquilan resettlement and San Juan cemetery. Upon reaching a Y-intersection further N from the resettlement turn left and head W for about 500 m until reaching a footrail leading to a prominent hill (the E side of which is the cemetery) and hike 100 m to the station. ZBS-45 is located on the W side of the said prominent hill, about 500 m SW of the cemetery and 750 m N of ZBS-49. Station mark is the head of a copper nail centered and embedded on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 200 cm concrete monument protruding 100 cms. above the ground surface with inscription \"CORNER-52, LAT/LONG, LC MAP 645\". Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, surveyors must be equipped with a navigational grade GPS, a topomap and and a compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.28450986, '15° 17\' 4.235490\"', 120.08280040, '120° 4\' 58.081320\"', 0.0000, '0', 115.1290, 0.0000, '3', 71.1758, 186680.42240, 1691898.40700, '51', 15.28607916, '15° 17\' 9.884960\"', 120.08145590, '120° 4\' 53.241330\"', 75.8060, 1690664.62900, 401342.64500, '3', 186534.02500, 1691970.56800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6145, 'ZBS-47', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'BOTOLAN', 'MALUMBOY', 2004, 15.26531166, '15° 15\' 55.121976\"', 120.12680180, '120° 7\' 36.486480\"', 'ZBS-47 to reach the station from Botolan town proper, travel eastward along Botolan-Tarlac road for about 8 kms. passing by brgy. San Juan until reaching Baquilan river (bridge ruins exist after it was destroyed by lahar). Continue traveling by foot, by four wheel drive vehicle or by carabao drawn cart SEward to Mt. Mulbao passing by brgy. Nagpare until reaching the remains of former brgy. proper of Malumboy (90 min. walk). Continue further for a couple of meters until reaching the Botolan-Tarlac road ruins in the said brgy. where the station is situated. ZBS-47 is located 3 m SE of the W end of the road. Station mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 50 cm concrete block with inscription \"ZBS-47, 2004 NAMRIA\". Note: To facilitate easy access to station, surveyors must be equipped with a navigation grade GPS, a topomap and a compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.26531166, '15° 15\' 55.121990\"', 120.12680180, '120° 7\' 36.486390\"', 0.0000, '0', 99.4430, 0.0000, '3', 54.9514, 191381.71230, 1689709.58000, '51', 15.26687878, '15° 16\' 0.763590\"', 120.12545690, '120° 7\' 31.644950\"', 59.9570, 1688520.59100, 406060.40800, '3', 191235.28800, 1689781.58000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6146, 'ZBS-48', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CABANGAN', 'CADMANG-RESERVA', 2004, 15.25693117, '15° 15\' 24.952212\"', 120.12119000, '120° 7\' 16.284000\"', 'ZBS-48 To reach the station from Botolan town proper, travel E along the Botolan-Tarlac Rd. for about 8 kms. passing by Brgy. San Juan until reaching Baquilan River (bridge ruins exist after it was destroyed by lahar). Continue traveling by foot, by 4-wheel drive vehicle or by carabao-drawn cart SE to Mt. Mulbao in Brgy. Malumboy. Thence head SW crossing Bacao River to a small hill, elevation 50 m. directly opposite of station ZBS-47. Station is located on the top of the hill about 20 m. E of a Mango tree and 1.1 km. bearing 33° 47\' of ZBS-47. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 50 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"ZBS-48 2004 NAMRIA\". *Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, surveyors must be equipped with a navigation-grade GPS, a topomap and a compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.25693117, '15° 15\' 24.952210\"', 120.12119000, '120° 7\' 16.284150\"', 0.0000, '0', 102.3720, 0.0000, '3', 57.9769, 190766.21770, 1688789.60300, '51', 15.25849787, '15° 15\' 30.592340\"', 120.11984500, '120° 7\' 11.441980\"', 62.8753, 1687595.66800, 405453.80700, '3', 190619.76000, 1688861.61300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6147, 'ZBS-49', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'BOTOLAN', 'SAN JUAN', 2004, 15.27786548, '15° 16\' 40.315728\"', 120.08232270, '120° 4\' 56.361720\"', 'ZBS-49 To reach the station from Botolan town proper, travel E along the general direction of the road for about 5 km. until reaching San Juan Brgy. Hall, continue further for about 1 km. and locate a junkshop 385 m. E of station ZBS-51 and 400 m. E of the Caltex LPG Refilling Station. Station is located 5 m. S of the centerline of the road, 1 m. E of the NE corner of the junkshop and 8 m. N of the N side of Bucao River. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 50 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"DENR-R3 BOT-34\". *Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, surveyors must be equipped with a navigational-grade GPS, a topomap and a compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.27786548, '15° 16\' 40.315720\"', 120.08232270, '120° 4\' 56.361730\"', 0.0000, '0', 76.1230, 0.0000, '3', 32.1978, 186619.19770, 1691163.35400, '51', 15.27943438, '15° 16\' 45.963750\"', 120.08097810, '120° 4\' 51.521140\"', 36.7820, 1689929.58700, 401288.21000, '3', 186472.77700, 1691235.51100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6148, 'ZBS-5', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN NARCISO', 'LA PAZ', 1991, 15.01453309, '15° 0\' 52.319124\"', 120.06538570, '120° 3\' 55.388520\"', 'ZBS-5 Station is located at La Paz Plaza, approximately 1.4 kms. from San Narciso town highway junction passing thru Granvia Street. It is set on the stage\'s concrete roof, 3.10 m. N of the SW roof corner and 61 cm. E of the center of W roof oval-shape edge. The stage is about 50 m. from the shoreline, facing seaward and W of the La Paz lighthouse and war monument . Station mark is a concrete nail embedded on the stage\'s concrete roof with inscription TRISPO 3 and 2.7 m above the ground level. (Intervisible to ZBS-9).', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.01453309, '15° 0\' 52.319130\"', 120.06538570, '120° 3\' 55.388530\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.4226, 0.0000, '3', 10.6941, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.01608569, '15° 0\' 57.908500\"', 120.06403490, '120° 3\' 50.525550\"', 13.3570, 1660797.50100, 399343.80700, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'admin', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6149, 'ZBS-50', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'BOTOLAN', 'PORAC', 2004, 15.25793582, '15° 15\' 28.568952\"', 120.05759310, '120° 3\' 27.335160\"', 'ZBS-50 To reach the station from Bucao Bridge, the bridge being 3.5 kms. SW of the town proper, head E for about 300 m. following an access road to So. Bucao, the access road being 20 m. SW of Bucao Bridge. Continue travelling by foot following the trail for about 2.5 kms. crossing a creek, which joins Bucao River, until reaching the foot of Mt. Munti, elevation 200 m., and locate forest boundary mon. cor. 77 on the side of the trail. Mark is the exposed end of a 10 mm dia. steel bar centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 200 cm., 100 cm. of which protrudes above the ground, with inscriptions \"DENR R-3 COR 77 LAT & LONG\". *Note: To facilitate easy access to the station, the surveyor must be equipped with a navigational-grade GPS, a topomap and a compass.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.25793582, '15° 15\' 28.568950\"', 120.05759310, '120° 3\' 27.335180\"', 0.0000, '0', 62.7420, 0.0000, '3', 19.2924, 183931.16310, 1688992.32100, '51', 15.25950401, '15° 15\' 34.214430\"', 120.05624800, '120° 3\' 22.492790\"', 23.4029, 1687735.62100, 398622.18700, '3', 183784.65300, 1689064.54200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1904-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6150, 'ZBS-51', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'BOTOLAN', 'SAN JUAN', 2004, 15.28040616, '15° 16\' 49.462176\"', 120.07986420, '120° 4\' 47.511120\"', 'ZBS-51 To reach the station from Botolan town proper, travel E along the ìgeneral direction of the road for about 5 km. until reaching San ìJuan Brgy. Hall passing by a road junction in Brgy. Batonlapoc. ìContinue travelling further for about 1 km. until reaching a ìCaltex LPG Refilling Station. Station is located 15 m. E of the ìsaid refilling station\'s gate and adjacent is an irrigational ìcanal, which runs E along the brgy. road. Mark is the head of ìcopper nail centered and embedded on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 50 cm. ìconcrete block, with inscriptions \"DENR-3 BOT-33\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.28040616, '15° 16\' 49.462160\"', 120.07986420, '120° 4\' 47.511200\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.4080, 0.0000, '3', 27.5167, 186358.72180, 1691448.23800, '51', 15.28197527, '15° 16\' 55.110970\"', 120.07851970, '120° 4\' 42.670810\"', 32.0804, 1690211.86000, 401025.32400, '3', 186212.30700, 1691520.40600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2004-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6151, 'ZBS-52 (RJG-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CITY OF OLONGAPO', 'ASINAN', 2006, 14.81967159, '14° 49\' 10.817724\"', 120.27702560, '120° 16\' 37.292160\"', 'ZBS-52 (RJG-2) Is in SBMA Freeport Zone, located on the center front entrance of the boardwalk helipad, about 6 m. from the centerline of the road, opposite side of the unfinished Legenda Bldg. Mark is a bronze disk set flushed to the ground, with inscription \"RJG-2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.81967159, '14° 49\' 10.817730\"', 120.27702560, '120° 16\' 37.292170\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.7620, 0.0000, '2', 3.9261, 206919.47760, 1640163.31800, '51', 14.82120699, '14° 49\' 16.345160\"', 120.27567040, '120° 16\' 32.413490\"', 6.6196, 1639149.92200, 422034.69000, '3', 206771.68000, 1640234.42400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6152, 'ZBS-53', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SANTA CRUZ', 'SABANG', 2007, 15.72317384, '15° 43\' 23.425824\"', 119.88465650, '119° 53\' 4.763400\"', 'ZBS-53 The Mark is located in the Barngay Center of Barangay Sabang, Santa Cruz, Zambales. It is situated 1m S of the south center sideline of the basketball court of the said barangay. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm cement putty on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-53, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.72317384, '15° 43\' 23.425810\"', 119.88465650, '119° 53\' 4.763540\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.6100, 0.0000, '2', 6.6823, 809167.48340, 1740425.14600, '50', 15.72477513, '15° 43\' 29.190470\"', 119.88332220, '119° 52\' 59.959790\"', 10.0630, 1739310.43200, 380312.68200, '3', 809026.15700, 1740494.24100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6153, 'ZBS-54', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SANTA CRUZ', 'LUCAPON SOUTH', 2007, 15.71482357, '15° 42\' 53.364852\"', 119.98679860, '119° 59\' 12.474960\"', 'ZBS-54 From Iba Municipal, travel along national road going to Sta Cruz until reaching the Y-road at Barangay Lucapon South. Turn right to the road going to ACOJE Mining Company. Follow the road, pasing the wooden bridge until reaching the \"NW-SE\" chain of electric post. COntinue travelling passing a sharp curve road until reaching the 5th and 6th electric post. (NOTE: The two side by side electriv post at the left side of the road before reaching the sharp curve is considered as the 1st post.) Station mark is located along the NW side of the road going to ACOJE Mining Company, about 8 m. from the road centerline. Mark is situated on the intersection of imaginary line extending the 5th post 50 m NE and extending the 6th post 50 m NW. The station is about 1KM from the wooden bridge and 5 KM from the national highway. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-54, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.71482357, '15° 42\' 53.364850\"', 119.98679860, '119° 59\' 12.474890\"', 0.0000, '0', 195.1810, 0.0000, '2', 152.6485, 820136.15700, 1739652.68500, '50', 15.71642206, '15° 42\' 59.119400\"', 119.98546420, '119° 59\' 7.670970\"', 157.3614, 1738330.89500, 391257.02100, '3', 819994.87700, 1739721.46800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6154, 'ZBS-55', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CANDELARIA', 'BABANCAL', 2007, 15.62040477, '15° 37\' 13.457172\"', 119.95258430, '119° 57\' 9.303480\"', 'ZBS-55 The station is located SW of the barangay road approximately 6m from the centerline, about 150m NE of transmission post, about 75 m from concrete canal. Both side of the road is an idle rice field. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete monuemnt flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-55, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.62040477, '15° 37\' 13.457170\"', 119.95258430, '119° 57\' 9.303360\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.7580, 0.0000, '2', 6.7805, 816611.77380, 1729145.42100, '50', 15.62199812, '15° 37\' 19.193240\"', 119.95124760, '119° 57\' 4.491240\"', 10.7400, 1727899.87600, 387537.51000, '3', 816470.18000, 1729214.24100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2017-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6155, 'ZBS-56', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'MASINLOC', 'SANTA RITA', 2007, 15.53979537, '15° 32\' 23.263332\"', 119.96199710, '119° 57\' 43.189560\"', 'ZBS-56 Station is on an open ground of Barangay Santa Rita Hall. approximately 1.5 KM from Masinloc Town Proper and Santa Cruz Junction. Facing the stage, station is on the right side. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-56, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.53979537, '15° 32\' 23.263340\"', 119.96199710, '119° 57\' 43.189570\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.2590, 0.0000, '2', 6.1360, 817745.96070, 1720232.98100, '50', 15.54138346, '15° 32\' 28.980460\"', 119.96065850, '119° 57\' 38.370640\"', 9.9804, 1718974.23200, 388503.31200, '3', 817604.12600, 1720301.71700, '50', 15.53984139, '15° 32\' 23.429020\"', 119.96199150, '119° 57\' 43.169400\"', 0.0261, 45.9160, 0.0961, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6156, 'ZBS-57', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'PALAUIG', 'STA. MARTA', 2007, 15.48744316, '15° 29\' 14.795376\"', 120.01142200, '120° 0\' 41.119200\"', 'ZBS-57 From Iba Town Proper take the National road going to Palauig. Upon reaching Barangay Salasa turn right after the 100m bridge. Continue traveling until reaching Barangay Sta. Marta. Station mark is located top of the irrigation canal gate. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm cement putty flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-57, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.48744316, '15° 29\' 14.795370\"', 120.01142200, '120° 0\' 41.119080\"', 0.0000, '0', 179.3630, 0.0000, '2', 136.2531, 179319.41420, 1714475.26400, '51', 15.48902683, '15° 29\' 20.496590\"', 120.01008220, '120° 0\' 36.296020\"', 140.8100, 1713155.48000, 393778.99200, '3', 179173.64400, 1714547.83700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6157, 'ZBS-58', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'IBA', 'DIRITA-BALOGUEN', 2007, 15.33423882, '15° 20\' 3.259752\"', 119.97764720, '119° 58\' 39.529920\"', 'ZBS-58 The station is inside Barangay Center of Dirita, Iba, Zambales. It is approximately 1m. from the foot of the basketball court at east direction. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cmconcrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"IBA-56, 2007,DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.33423882, '15° 20\' 3.259750\"', 119.97764720, '119° 58\' 39.529760\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.6930, 0.0000, '2', 4.5285, 819741.28080, 1697493.43000, '50', 15.33581361, '15° 20\' 8.928980\"', 119.97630380, '119° 58\' 34.693530\"', 7.7710, 1696218.48600, 390073.62600, '3', 819598.83000, 1697561.97300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6158, 'ZBS-59', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'BOTOLAN', 'SAN JUAN', 2007, 15.28718956, '15° 17\' 13.882416\"', 120.06854060, '120° 4\' 6.746160\"', 'ZBS-59 From Iba, travel along National Road going to Botolan until reaching the triangular island at the junction. Travel straight ahead passing welcome sign of Barangay San Juan until reaching Barangay Hall of San Juan. Station mark is located at the top of a 10 m water tank beside the barangay hall. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm cement putty flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-59, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.28718956, '15° 17\' 13.882400\"', 120.06854060, '120° 4\' 6.746010\"', 0.0000, '0', 74.8230, 0.0000, '2', 31.1028, 185151.70900, 1692215.77700, '51', 15.28875935, '15° 17\' 19.533660\"', 120.06719620, '120° 4\' 1.906150\"', 35.5428, 1690967.72300, 399812.21300, '3', 185005.30800, 1692287.98900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6159, 'ZBS-60', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CABANGAN', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2007, 15.16197244, '15° 9\' 43.100784\"', 120.05262770, '120° 3\' 9.459720\"', 'ZBS-60 From Cabangan, travel southward along the National Road for about 300 m until reaching Barangay San Antonio Proper. Station mark is located inside the Barngay Hall compound about 6 m E of Barangay road. It is situated about 10 m S of basketball court and Children\'s Park. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-60, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.16197244, '15° 9\' 43.100780\"', 120.05262770, '120° 3\' 9.459890\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.9720, 0.0000, '2', 8.7740, 183253.84220, 1678373.17300, '51', 15.16353466, '15° 9\' 48.724770\"', 120.05128040, '120° 3\' 4.609320\"', 12.3652, 1677118.72300, 398042.38100, '3', 183107.00300, 1678445.32500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6160, 'ZBS-61', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN FELIPE', 'KAKILINGAN', 2007, 15.10443051, '15° 6\' 15.949836\"', 120.09941980, '120° 5\' 57.911280\"', 'ZBS-61 From Cabangan Proper, travel southward on National Road for about 6 to 8 KMS until reaching the junction going to Barangay Kakilingan. Turn left and head westward towards the twin river of Kakilingan and Maloma. Station mark is located along the newly constructed concrete dike approximately 300 m from the barangay proper. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm cement putty flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-61, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.10443051, '15° 6\' 15.949850\"', 120.09941980, '120° 5\' 57.911240\"', 0.0000, '0', 60.1290, 0.0000, '2', 16.4088, 188201.93900, 1671934.37900, '51', 15.10598804, '15° 6\' 21.556930\"', 120.09807110, '120° 5\' 53.056000\"', 20.2411, 1670729.93400, 403045.11700, '3', 188054.94600, 1672006.32500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6161, 'ZBS-62', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN NARCISO', 'LA PAZ', 2007, 15.01458169, '15° 0\' 52.494084\"', 120.06535920, '120° 3\' 55.293120\"', 'ZBS-62 the mark is located in the EXECUTIVE PARK of Barangay La Paz, San Narciso. It is situated on the NW corner of the stage of said plaza about 15 m W of Magsaysay Boulevard. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete block fkushed on the ground with inscription ZBS-62, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.01458169, '15° 0\' 52.494070\"', 120.06535920, '120° 3\' 55.293200\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.9420, 0.0000, '2', 7.2137, 184405.30760, 1662033.94900, '51', 15.01613425, '15° 0\' 58.083300\"', 120.06400840, '120° 3\' 50.430210\"', 9.8770, 1660802.88600, 399340.98000, '3', 184257.98300, 1662105.92600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6162, 'ZBS-63', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN MARCELINO', 'AGLAO', 2007, 14.98717341, '14° 59\' 13.824276\"', 120.26395640, '120° 15\' 50.243040\"', 'ZBS-63 From San Marcelino Municipal Hall, travel along the road going to Barangay Laoag until reaching the dike. Travel east along the dike for about 10 km until reaching the 3 m high water tank. Turn left to the road going downward until reaching the baskeball court of Sitio Dalanadan, Aglao. Station mark is located about 1.5 m N from the north side of the court, about 15 m E from the road centerline, 8m E from the NW coner of the court, and approxiamately 5m SW of the Mulit- Purpose Building. Mark is the head of a 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-63, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.98717341, '14° 59\' 13.824270\"', 120.26395640, '120° 15\' 50.243100\"', 0.0000, '0', 204.2380, 0.0000, '2', 159.8311, 205739.81040, 1658725.23700, '51', 14.98871976, '14° 59\' 19.391130\"', 120.26260520, '120° 15\' 45.378770\"', 163.6100, 1657688.79400, 420689.67000, '3', 205592.57000, 1658796.53300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6163, 'ZBS-64', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CASTILLEJOS', 'MAGSAYSAY', 2007, 14.93979642, '14° 56\' 23.267112\"', 120.19336740, '120° 11\' 36.122640\"', 'ZBS-64 From San Fernando City, travel toward Castillejos Proper via Olongapo City. The station is situated at Barangay Magsaysay which is about 1 km NW of Castillejos Municipal Hall. Mark is located at the left shoulder of the road and is measured 2m from the culvert parapet. Mark is the head of a 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-64, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.93979642, '14° 56\' 23.267110\"', 120.19336740, '120° 11\' 36.122620\"', 0.0000, '0', 92.6680, 0.0000, '2', 48.6849, 198076.36450, 1653574.76100, '51', 14.94134136, '14° 56\' 28.828880\"', 120.19201500, '120° 11\' 31.253820\"', 52.0750, 1652473.03900, 413077.83900, '3', 197928.89900, 1653646.24900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6164, 'ZBS-65', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SUBIC', 'BARACA-CAMACHILE', 2007, 14.87692537, '14° 52\' 36.931332\"', 120.23294330, '120° 13\' 58.595880\"', 'ZBS-65 From San Fernando City, travel toward Subic Municipal Proper until reaching the public market which is found at the left side of the National Highway. Station is located at the NE edge of the concrete slab of the stage in front of Subic Public Market. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm cement putty flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-65, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.87692537, '14° 52\' 36.931340\"', 120.23294330, '120° 13\' 58.595770\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.6780, 0.0000, '2', 4.7293, 202250.09550, 1646560.44600, '51', 14.87846542, '14° 52\' 42.475510\"', 120.23158940, '120° 13\' 53.721760\"', 7.8075, 1645501.04600, 417311.43500, '3', 202102.45200, 1646631.74900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6165, 'ZBS-66', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'CITY OF OLONGAPO', 'NEW CABALAN', 2007, 14.85405329, '14° 51\' 14.591844\"', 120.32283310, '120° 19\' 22.199160\"', 'ZBS-66 From San Fernando City, travel toward Olongapo CIty until reaching the \"Kalapati Monument\" located at New Cabalan junction. At the junction, turn right and follow the concrete road until reaching the second intersection road on the right side. Station mark is located at the corner of Saturn St. and Purok-2 St, and measured about 10 m N from the electric post. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete monuemnt flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-66, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.85405329, '14° 51\' 14.591850\"', 120.32283310, '120° 19\' 22.199140\"', 0.0000, '0', 169.7340, 0.0000, '2', 125.8113, 211898.59520, 1643910.15500, '51', 14.85558983, '14° 51\' 20.123390\"', 120.32147880, '120° 19\' 17.323720\"', 128.5790, 1642938.67100, 426977.15500, '3', 211750.95800, 1643981.13800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6166, 'ZBS-67', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN NARCISO', 'DALLIPAWEN', 2007, 14.99363062, '14° 59\' 37.070232\"', 120.12069880, '120° 7\' 14.515680\"', 'ZBS-67 The mark is located in Barangay DALLIPAWEN, San Narciso, Zambales. It is situated 2 m S of the bridge and 3 m E of the Barangay Road, The bridge is about 300 m N of the National Road leading to San Marcelino, Zambales. Mark is the head of 4 inch copper nail, centered on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete block flushed on the ground with inscription \"ZBS-67, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.99363062, '14° 59\' 37.070230\"', 120.12069880, '120° 7\' 14.515710\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.2000, 0.0000, '2', 24.7084, 190330.79330, 1659635.76500, '51', 14.99518061, '14° 59\' 42.650200\"', 120.11934760, '120° 7\' 9.651190\"', 27.9390, 1658459.95100, 405283.49500, '3', 190183.44600, 1659707.54100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6167, 'ZBS-8', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SUBIC', 'CAWAG', 1992, 14.87760367, '14° 52\' 39.373212\"', 120.22176220, '120° 13\' 18.343920\"', 'ZBS-8 From Subic town proper, travel N along the national highway for about 3 km. Turn left and proceed SW up to Phil. Shipyard and Engineering Corp. (PHILSECO) about 2.7 km. from the highway. The station is located on the wharf at the SW corner of PHILSECO compound. It is 22.8 m. from the wharf W end near the creek and 2.78 m. from its S edge. Mark is a 4\" copper nail set flush on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscription \"ZBS-8, 1992 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.87760367, '14° 52\' 39.373220\"', 120.22176220, '120° 13\' 18.343930\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.7670, 0.0000, '3', 5.8533, 201047.06680, 1646650.51600, '51', 14.87914401, '14° 52\' 44.918440\"', 120.22040830, '120° 13\' 13.469930\"', 8.9257, 1645580.30200, 416108.44000, '3', 200899.41600, 1646721.85600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1992-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6168, 'ZBS-9', 'LUZON', 'REGION III', 'ZAMBALES', 'SAN NARCISO', 'LA PAZ', 1992, 15.03089524, '15° 1\' 51.222864\"', 120.06369760, '120° 3\' 49.311360\"', 'ZBS-9 Is located on an open ground near the coastline which is part of the forested land owned by Mr. Gerry Fernandez, approx. 2 km. from La Paz Plaza passing northward thru Magsaysay Blvd. The plaza is about 1.4 km. W of San Narciso town and can be reached by passing thru Granvia St. at the town proper. The station is 21.5 m. from the SW fence corner of the former prawn hatchery compound and 28 m. from the W house. The caretaker of the land is Mr. Juan Arbizo. Station mark is a 4\" copper nail set flush on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument with inscription \"ZBS-9, 1992, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.03089524, '15° 1\' 51.222880\"', 120.06369760, '120° 3\' 49.311490\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.7810, 0.0000, '2', 7.0004, 184250.49960, 1663842.74700, '51', 15.03244889, '15° 1\' 56.816000\"', 120.06234720, '120° 3\' 44.449840\"', 9.7669, 1662608.85900, 399169.97500, '3', 184103.22700, 1663914.74500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1992-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6169, 'BLLM-2', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'MASI', 1905, 18.46372936, '18° 27\' 49.425696\"', 121.34016740, '121° 20\' 24.602640\"', 'BLLM-2 Mark is set on the ground inside and at the SW corner of municipal park. Mark is located approximately 28 m. SW of Rizal monument, about 29 m. W from the flagpole just in front of Pamplona town hall, about 3.5 m. NW from the centerline of the road, and 1.14 m. SW from the small cylindrical water tank. Station mark is the head of iron spike embedded on a cement block 40 cm. x 40 cm., 20 cm. above ground surface with inscription \"BLLM No. 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.46372936, '18° 27\' 49.425700\"', 121.34016740, '121° 20\' 24.602480\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.7950, 0.0000, '3', 10.7475, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 18.46546563, '18° 27\' 55.676280\"', 121.33889870, '121° 20\' 20.035420\"', 15.3680, 2042309.71700, 535794.62200, '3', 324596.25500, 2042366.84800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1905-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2016-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6170, 'BTS-2', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'ITBAYAT', 'SAN RAFAEL', 1989, 20.78227516, '20° 46\' 56.190576\"', 121.83667140, '121° 50\' 12.017040\"', 'BTS-2 Station mark is on an open ground, SW of the town proper of Itbayat; approx. 10 m. E of catholic cemetery; approx. 150 m. NW of the intersection of a provincial road going to Port Mao-yan and Port Chinapolirian. It is approx. 20 min. walk from the town proper of Itbayat. Station mark is a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set on a standard concrete block, 70 m. deep, flushed with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name. Sub-surface mark bottle set on a concrete block 0.878 m. below the sta. mark. Reference Mark is a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass bolt set on a standard concrete block, 0.60 m. deep, flushed with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name and RM number.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 20.78227516, '20° 46\' 56.190560\"', 121.83667140, '121° 50\' 12.017100\"', 0.0000, '0', 161.9397, 0.0000, '1', 132.5280, 378915.91120, 2298487.93800, '51', 20.78413277, '20° 47\' 2.877960\"', 121.83545680, '121° 50\' 7.644360\"', 136.3310, 2299151.13300, 586986.37800, '3', 378789.06900, 2298558.56300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6171, 'BTS-3', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'BASCO', 'CHANARIAN', 1989, 20.43823582, '20° 26\' 17.648952\"', 121.96276950, '121° 57\' 45.970200\"', 'BTS-3 Station mark is on an open ground on top of a small hill protruding west to West Philippine Sea. SW of the town proper of Basco, approximately 50 m west from the road ; 50 m SW of the station is a group of rocks near the shoreline. There is another hill about 200 m NE of the station. Station is about 80 m NW of the concrete bridge which is about 100 m from km post 2 from Basco. Accessible by two wheeldrive vehicle. Station Mark: 0.15 m x 0.01 m diameter brass rod set on concrete standard block, .070 m deep flushed with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name \"BTS-3 1983 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 20.43823582, '20° 26\' 17.648940\"', 121.96276950, '121° 57\' 45.970090\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.3763, 0.0000, '1', 19.1225, 391799.18660, 2260319.71600, '51', 20.44007196, '20° 26\' 24.259060\"', 121.96154720, '121° 57\' 41.569830\"', 22.2450, 2261132.27900, 600340.63800, '3', 391671.28600, 2260389.75100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6172, 'BTS-3000', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'BASCO', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2009, 20.46496203, '20° 27\' 53.863308\"', 121.96472390, '121° 57\' 53.006040\"', 'BTS-3000 From Basco town proper take the Sonsong - Iraya road gong to Diojo Pt. Upon reaching a split road take the road on the left side. SE of Rain Collector overlooking the China Sea and Mt. Iraya. \"BTS 3000, 2009, LMS 2\" is inscribed on top of a 0.40 m x 0.40 m x 1.00 m sq. conc. monument with text screw centering and 0.20 m protruding above the ground elevation.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 20.46496203, '20° 27\' 53.863320\"', 121.96472390, '121° 57\' 53.006040\"', 0.0000, '0', 144.3040, 0.0000, '3', 114.1184, 392021.76190, 2263276.47100, '51', 20.46679960, '20° 28\' 0.478570\"', 121.96350220, '121° 57\' 48.608030\"', 117.2631, 2264092.51500, 600527.27900, '3', 391893.95100, 2263346.51500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6173, 'BTS-3001', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'BASCO', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2009, 20.46506144, '20° 27\' 54.221184\"', 121.96354090, '121° 57\' 48.747240\"', 'BTS-3001 From the residence of Barangay Captain Alden Gordon taking the road going to Diojo Point, the station is located at left side of the road SE of the rain collector over looking west Philippine sa at east and Mt. Iraya at northwest. \"BTS 3001 2009 LMS 2\" is inscribed on top of 0.40 m x 0.40 m x 1.0 m sq. conc. monument with a head of brass nail at center and 0.20 m protruding above the ground elevation.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 20.46506144, '20° 27\' 54.221200\"', 121.96354090, '121° 57\' 48.747350\"', 0.0000, '0', 137.0030, 0.0000, '3', 106.8099, 391898.43870, 2263288.25400, '51', 20.46689904, '20° 28\' 0.836560\"', 121.96231930, '121° 57\' 44.349330\"', 109.9652, 2264102.79900, 600403.78000, '3', 391770.62700, 2263358.30100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6174, 'BTS-3002', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'BASCO', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2009, 20.46837525, '20° 28\' 6.150900\"', 121.96915810, '121° 58\' 8.969160\"', 'BTS-3002 From the residence of Barangay Captain Aldn Gordo taking the road to Diojo Pt. until reaching a split road take right road in going to dump site station located at the left side of a curve road about 20 meters from the shoulder.The station is inscribed on top of a 0.40m. x 0.40m. x 1.00m. sq. concrete monument with text screw centering and 0.20 protruding above the ground elevation with inscriptions \"BTS-3002; 2009; DENR/LMS II\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 20.46837525, '20° 28\' 6.150900\"', 121.96915810, '121° 58\' 8.969070\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.4530, 0.0000, '3', 19.3069, 392486.65670, 2263651.32800, '51', 20.47021294, '20° 28\' 12.766600\"', 121.96793650, '121° 58\' 4.571290\"', 22.4136, 2264473.13700, 600987.72800, '3', 392358.85700, 2263721.36300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6175, 'BTS-3003', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'BASCO', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2009, 20.46903930, '20° 28\' 8.541480\"', 121.96906290, '121° 58\' 8.626440\"', 'BTS-3003 From Basco town take the Songsong-Iraya road going to Diojo Pt. upon reaching a split road take the road on the right side going to dump site. Station is located on the left side of curve road about 20 m from shoulder. The station is incribed on top of a 0.40 m x .40 m x 1.00 m sq. concrete monument centering and 0.20 m protruding above the ground elevation with inscrptions \"BTS 3003, 2009, LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 20.46903930, '20° 28\' 8.541480\"', 121.96906290, '121° 58\' 8.626390\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.0700, 0.0000, '3', 18.9253, 392477.19050, 2263724.88700, '51', 20.47087703, '20° 28\' 15.157320\"', 121.96784130, '121° 58\' 4.228660\"', 22.0332, 2264546.60100, 600977.36300, '3', 392349.39300, 2263794.92300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6176, 'BTS-3004', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'BASCO', 'SAN JOAQUIN', 2009, 20.43897283, '20° 26\' 20.302188\"', 121.98762500, '121° 59\' 15.450000\"', 'BTS-3004 The station is located in brgy. San Joaquin sitio Valugan, Candon City. It is located about 2 m NE of a waiting shed, about 20 m S km post 3 and about 100 m S Pension Ivatan Hometel . Station mark is the head of a 4\" cw nail embedded on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m x 1.00 m sq. concrete monument with inscription \"BTS 3004 2009 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 20.43897283, '20° 26\' 20.302170\"', 121.98762500, '121° 59\' 15.449910\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.7750, 0.0000, '3', 14.6882, 394392.75070, 2260385.08900, '51', 20.44080852, '20° 26\' 26.910670\"', 121.98640270, '121° 59\' 11.049830\"', 17.5878, 2261229.22500, 602934.10000, '3', 394264.86600, 2260455.05000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6177, 'BTS-3005', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'BASCO', 'SAN JOAQUIN', 2009, 20.43983902, '20° 26\' 23.420472\"', 121.98764490, '121° 59\' 15.521640\"', 'BTS-3005 From Basco airport taking the road going to said barangay until reaching a Valugan Bay. The station is located just after a concrete road overlooking China Sea. The station is located at the left side of the road opposite Pension Ivatan Hometel. \"BTS 3005; 2009 ; LMS 2\" is inscribed on top of a 0.40 m x 0.40 m x 1.00 m sq. conc. monument with a text screw centering and 0.20 m protruding above the ground elevation.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 20.43983902, '20° 26\' 23.420480\"', 121.98764490, '121° 59\' 15.521610\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.7940, 0.0000, '3', 24.7087, 394395.42010, 2260480.94600, '51', 20.44167476, '20° 26\' 30.029140\"', 121.98642270, '121° 59\' 11.121610\"', 27.6098, 2261325.14000, 602935.60400, '3', 394267.53800, 2260550.90700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6178, 'BTS-3006', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'BASCO', 'CHANARIAN', 2009, 20.42652334, '20° 25\' 35.484024\"', 121.97289330, '121° 58\' 22.415880\"', 'BTS-3006 From town proper turn left to a road after Tamarong Bridge after the Departmentof Agriculture Office until you reach Pag-Asa office. The station is located east of the office at about 250 meters beside a post. The station is inscribed on top of a 0.40 m x 0.40 m x 1.00 m sq.concrete monument with text screw centering and 0.20 m protruding above the ground elevation with inscriptions \"BTS 3006, 2009, LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 20.42652334, '20° 25\' 35.484020\"', 121.97289330, '121° 58\' 22.415800\"', 0.0000, '0', 179.8930, 0.0000, '3', 149.6868, 392847.24540, 2259016.74600, '51', 20.42835860, '20° 25\' 42.090960\"', 121.97167080, '121° 58\' 18.014710\"', 152.6966, 2259841.70900, 601404.82300, '3', 392719.31400, 2259086.74000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2019-01-01', 'Edil', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
