(6221, 'BTS-3056', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'BATANES', 'ITBAYAT', 'RAELE', 2012, 20.72780192, '20° 43\' 40.086912\"', 121.80890170, '121° 48\' 32.046120\"', 'BTS-3056 STA. MARK: \"BTS 3056, 2012 LMS 2\" is inscribed on top of a 0.40mx0.40x1.00 m sq. conc. mon. with a text screw centering and 0.20 m protruding above the ground elevation. ACCESS: From the town proper Itbayat going south until reaching barangay Raele, then taking the road goign to airport. Station is located left side of the road at about 25 m and about 8 m infront of an old building, north-west of the airport.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 20.72780192, '20° 43\' 40.086920\"', 121.80890170, '121° 48\' 32.046060\"', 0.0000, '0', 136.5890, 0.0000, '4', 107.1590, 375980.78600, 2292479.50300, '51', 20.72965713, '20° 43\' 46.765650\"', 121.80768570, '121° 48\' 27.668620\"', 110.8511, 2293105.36000, 584124.89000, '3', 375853.74800, 2292550.18400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'edil', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
