(6266, 'CGY-3012', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'SAN MARIANO', 2007, 18.15410921, '18° 9\' 14.793156\"', 121.74133770, '121° 44\' 28.815720\"', 'CGY-3012 Is located along the Magapit Rd. going to Gonzaga Town (shortcut road), 10 m. from the road and 20 m. NE of Km. Post No. 563. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3012 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.15410921, '18° 9\' 14.793140\"', 121.74133770, '121° 44\' 28.815620\"', 0.0000, '0', 94.1740, 0.0000, '4', 55.9659, 366862.23890, 2007691.41100, '51', 18.15581873, '18° 9\' 20.947420\"', 121.74006260, '121° 44\' 24.225270\"', 59.7660, 2008164.35800, 578306.17500, '3', 366726.71000, 2007760.58700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6267, 'CGY-3017', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'CATAYAUAN', 2007, 18.17211532, '18° 10\' 19.615152\"', 121.65529550, '121° 39\' 19.063800\"', 'CGY-3017 Is located approx. 30 m. E of the nat\'l. road, 3 m. W of an irrigation canal. It is also situated at the lot of a certain Mr. Rening Julian. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3017 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.17211532, '18° 10\' 19.615150\"', 121.65529550, '121° 39\' 19.063660\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.2290, 0.0000, '4', 11.0423, 357774.20350, 2009748.46100, '51', 18.17382774, '18° 10\' 25.779860\"', 121.65402060, '121° 39\' 14.474250\"', 15.0850, 2010123.02100, 569194.62300, '3', 357638.67200, 2009817.92200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
