(6299, 'CGY-3164', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CAMALANIUGAN', 'MINANGA', 2007, 18.27891809, '18° 16\' 44.105124\"', 121.73164110, '121° 43\' 53.907960\"', 'CGY-3164 From Dugo Junction, take the road going to the Mun. of Aparri. Upon reaching Poyaoan Gen. Hospital, turn right taking the Minanga Rd. Then turn left upon reaching Minanga Elem. School and take the NIA service road until reaching an irrigation drop. Station is located beside the said irrigation drop. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3164 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.27891809, '18° 16\' 44.105140\"', 121.73164110, '121° 43\' 53.907980\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.2770, 0.0000, '4', 6.5476, 365932.02190, 2021509.88200, '51', 18.28063524, '18° 16\' 50.286870\"', 121.73036890, '121° 43\' 49.327880\"', 10.3025, 2021974.79500, 577225.37700, '3', 365796.89400, 2021579.18300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6300, 'CGY-3165', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'CAGORAN', 2007, 18.17660505, '18° 10\' 35.778180\"', 121.73109090, '121° 43\' 51.927240\"', 'CGY-3165 From Magapit Proper, travel along the road connecting Brgy. Magapit, Lal-lo Town and Brgy. Mission, Sta. Teresita passing by Magapit Proper and Brgy. san Mariano. Upon passing the boundary arch of Brgys. San Mariano and Dagupan, turn left at a junction of a trail and the Magapit-Mission Rd. Continue traveling for approx. 2 km. along the trail until reaching the house of Mr. Dominador Cabbat. Station is located SW front of the house of Mr. Cabbat. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3165 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.17660505, '18° 10\' 35.778180\"', 121.73109090, '121° 43\' 51.927100\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.9070, 0.0000, '4', 20.7656, 365795.40750, 2010188.25300, '51', 18.17831614, '18° 10\' 41.938110\"', 121.72981630, '121° 43\' 47.338500\"', 24.5967, 2010649.99700, 577212.07200, '3', 365659.94400, 2010257.47900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6301, 'CGY-3166', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'CAGORAN', 2007, 18.17626124, '18° 10\' 34.540464\"', 121.73009910, '121° 43\' 48.356760\"', 'CGY-3166 From Magapit Proper, travel along the road connecting Brgy. Magapit, Lal-lo Town and Brgy. Mission, Sta. Teresita passing by Magapit Proper and Brgy. san Mariano. Upon passing the boundary arch of Brgys. San Mariano and Dagupan, turn left at a junction of a trail and the Magapit-Mission Rd. Continue traveling for approx. 2 km. along the trail until reaching the house of Mr. Dominador Cabbat. Station is located SW of station CGY-3165, near a Coconut tree. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3166 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.17626124, '18° 10\' 34.540460\"', 121.73009910, '121° 43\' 48.356920\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.9900, 0.0000, '4', 20.8481, 365690.24280, 2010150.93200, '51', 18.17797233, '18° 10\' 40.700390\"', 121.72882450, '121° 43\' 43.768280\"', 24.6809, 2010611.52800, 577107.29700, '3', 365554.77700, 2010220.16100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
