(6304, 'CGY-3169', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'APARRI', 'DODAN', 2007, 18.30802829, '18° 18\' 28.901844\"', 121.71273480, '121° 42\' 45.845280\"', 'CGY-3169 From Dugo Junction, take the Nat\'l. Highway going to the Mun. of Aparri. Then turn right taking the road going to Brgy. Minanga until reaching a cockpit arena. From the said arena, turn left following the road and the irrigation canal traversing a wide ricefield until reaching approx. the boundary of Brgy. Minanga and Brgy. Paddaya, Appari. Station is located at the farm lot of Mr. Lazaro Rapanut. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3169 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.30802829, '18° 18\' 28.901850\"', 121.71273480, '121° 42\' 45.845390\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.4300, 0.0000, '4', 4.8636, 363956.04350, 2024745.26000, '51', 18.30974756, '18° 18\' 35.091210\"', 121.71146320, '121° 42\' 41.267590\"', 8.5968, 2025189.03500, 575213.75000, '3', 363820.99800, 2024814.64200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
