(6308, 'CGY-3174', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'APARRI', 'TALLUNGAN', 2011, 18.33740910, '18° 20\' 14.672760\"', 121.65118390, '121° 39\' 4.262040\"', 'CGY-3174 From Aparri town proper going south east direction along National high-way before reaching barangay Tallungan. Station is established beside the welcome Gaddang concrete marker at the west corner fence of Tullungan Elementary School between barangay road and ricefields. \"CGY 3174 2011 LMS 2\" is inscribed on top of a 0.40 m. x 0.40 m. x 1.00 m. sq. conc. mon. with a text screw centering and 0.20 m. protruding above the ground elevation.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.33740910, '18° 20\' 14.672770\"', 121.65118390, '121° 39\' 4.261870\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.6740, 0.0000, '3', 5.2650, 357474.17800, 2028043.69700, '51', 18.33913140, '18° 20\' 20.873040\"', 121.64991280, '121° 38\' 59.686140\"', 9.0851, 2028416.90700, 568694.99200, '3', 357339.18700, 2028113.29400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6309, 'CGY-3175', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'BALZA', 2007, 18.29663563, '18° 17\' 47.888268\"', 121.76233060, '121° 45\' 44.390160\"', 'CGY-3175 From Brgy. Balza, Mun. of Buguey, take the road leading to the first floodgate. Station is located at the left bank of Minanga Creek, right after crossing the said floodgate at the left side of the road going to Brgy. Paddaya, Mun. of Aparri. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3175 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.29663563, '18° 17\' 47.888280\"', 121.76233060, '121° 45\' 44.390330\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.2930, 0.0000, '4', 5.6703, 369189.67070, 2023448.25300, '51', 18.29835318, '18° 17\' 54.071450\"', 121.76105890, '121° 45\' 39.811890\"', 9.3036, 2023949.07000, 580462.35400, '3', 369054.62300, 2023517.47100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6310, 'CGY-3176', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'BALZA', 2007, 18.30017453, '18° 18\' 0.628308\"', 121.76126310, '121° 45\' 40.547160\"', 'CGY-3176 From station CGY-3175, which is located after the first floodgate from Brgy. Balza, Mun. of Buguey, travel along the road going to Brgy. Paddaya until reaching the house of Mrs. Catalina Cadili. Station is located at the SW corner of the lot of Mrs. Cadili, beside the resthouse of a certain Mr. Sanglay. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3176 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.30017453, '18° 18\' 0.628290\"', 121.76126310, '121° 45\' 40.547070\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.7520, 0.0000, '4', 5.1515, 369079.48260, 2023840.63400, '51', 18.30189231, '18° 18\' 6.812300\"', 121.75999140, '121° 45\' 35.968910\"', 8.7768, 2024340.31100, 580347.85700, '3', 368944.44500, 2023909.85800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6311, 'CGY-3177', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'BALZA', 2007, 18.28562497, '18° 17\' 8.249892\"', 121.77304950, '121° 46\' 22.978200\"', 'CGY-3177 Station can be reached by passing Brgys. Dalaya and Remebella, all in the Mun. of Buguey. Station is located just after the first floodgate at the right side of the road crossing the Sanka Creek when coming from Brgy. Remebella. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3177 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.28562497, '18° 17\' 8.249880\"', 121.77304950, '121° 46\' 22.978110\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.0450, 0.0000, '4', 5.3599, 370314.50320, 2022222.16200, '51', 18.28734164, '18° 17\' 14.429890\"', 121.77177750, '121° 46\' 18.398820\"', 8.9936, 2022735.06600, 581600.77700, '3', 370179.42700, 2022291.33700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
