(6313, 'CGY-3179', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'APARRI', 'DODAN', 2011, 18.33000566, '18° 19\' 48.020376\"', 121.70937150, '121° 42\' 33.737400\"', 'CGY-3179 From Aparri town proper going east direction passing barangay Maura. then follow the provincial road to reach barangay Dodan, Aparri. Station is established in between NIA road and a fishpond, about 30 meters west from Ex Barangay Captain Romeo Furugganan house within Zone 1. \"CGY 3079 2011 LMS 2\" is inscribed on top of a 0.40 m. x 0.40 m. x 1.00 m. sq. conc. mon. with a text screw centering and 0.20 m. protruding above the ground elevation.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.33000566, '18° 19\' 48.020360\"', 121.70937150, '121° 42\' 33.737480\"', 0.0000, '0', 41.9300, 0.0000, '3', 4.5074, 363617.76750, 2027179.84100, '51', 18.33172629, '18° 19\' 54.214650\"', 121.70810040, '121° 42\' 29.161490\"', 8.1775, 2027620.24700, 574848.77900, '3', 363482.79200, 2027249.25000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
