(6317, 'CGY-3184', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'APARRI', 'DODAN', 2011, 18.34921409, '18° 20\' 57.170724\"', 121.66645960, '121° 39\' 59.254560\"', 'CGY-3184 From Aparri town proper travelling eastward direction along provincial road. After passing the dumpsiteeeee before reaching Zone 6, Dodan, Aparri. Station is located approximately 20 meters south from the residential house of Luciano Tugagao and approximately 15 meters east from the house of Caridad Macutay. CGY 3184 2011 LMS 2\" is inscribed on top of a 0.40 m. x 0.40 m. x 1.00 m. sq. conc. mon. with a text screw centering and 0.20 m. protruding above the ground elevation.\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.34921409, '18° 20\' 57.170730\"', 121.66645960, '121° 39\' 59.254630\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.2640, 0.0000, '3', 4.9674, 359098.13520, 2029338.19600, '51', 18.35093677, '18° 21\' 3.372360\"', 121.66518890, '121° 39\' 54.679970\"', 8.6776, 2029729.34400, 570304.93600, '3', 358963.19300, 2029407.75400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mary', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6318, 'CGY-3185', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CAMALANIUGAN', 'TAGUM', 2007, 18.27306952, '18° 16\' 23.050272\"', 121.75584770, '121° 45\' 21.051720\"', 'CGY-3185 It is located at Brgy. Tagum, Mun. of Camalaniugan, 10 m. away from an electric post or 90 m. from the junction of the road. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3185 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.27306952, '18° 16\' 23.050280\"', 121.75584770, '121° 45\' 21.051750\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.5720, 0.0000, '4', 4.8213, 368486.62710, 2020845.07600, '51', 18.27478581, '18° 16\' 29.228920\"', 121.75457540, '121° 45\' 16.471310\"', 8.5203, 2021337.78500, 579787.63900, '3', 368351.49700, 2020914.29700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6319, 'CGY-3186 (OBSTRUCTED)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CAMALANIUGAN', 'TAGUM', 2007, 18.27438381, '18° 16\' 27.781716\"', 121.75649960, '121° 45\' 23.398560\"', 'CGY-3186 From Dugo Junction, travel along the Nat\'l. Highway going to the Mun. of Santa Ana passing Brgys. Afunan Cabayu, Luec and Abagao, all in the Mun. of Camalaniugan. Then turn left at the junction beside the irrigation canal opposite the warehouse (Bimbo Grains Trading). Station is located at the back of the waiting shed just upon approaching the brgy. proper. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.40 m. x 0.40 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3186 2007 LMS 2\". NOTE: Obstructed covered with Pomelo tree Report by Engr. Denicia Rivera (May 29, 2015)', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.27438381, '18° 16\' 27.781710\"', 121.75649960, '121° 45\' 23.398380\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.0040, 0.0000, '4', 5.2601, 368556.52880, 2020990.04600, '51', 18.27610016, '18° 16\' 33.960580\"', 121.75522720, '121° 45\' 18.818050\"', 8.9551, 2021483.54200, 579855.96800, '3', 368421.40400, 2021059.26600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6320, 'CGY-3187', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'DALAYA', 2007, 18.26343322, '18° 15\' 48.359592\"', 121.77468040, '121° 46\' 28.849440\"', 'CGY-3187 From Dugo Junction, travel along the Nat\'l. Highway going to Port Irene, Mun. of Santa Ana. Then turn left at a junction after passing Dalaya Bridge No. 1 at Km. 579+109. Station is located beside Zone Marker No. 2, Purok Rose and beside a waiting shed at a junction of the road. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3187 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.26343322, '18° 15\' 48.359590\"', 121.77468040, '121° 46\' 28.849360\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.8410, 0.0000, '4', 5.0379, 370470.43610, 2019765.27100, '51', 18.26514854, '18° 15\' 54.534750\"', 121.77340780, '121° 46\' 24.268230\"', 8.7124, 2020279.45700, 581783.56700, '3', 370335.28800, 2019834.42500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6321, 'CGY-3188', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'DALAYA', 2007, 18.26442334, '18° 15\' 51.924024\"', 121.77495760, '121° 46\' 29.847360\"', 'CGY-3188 Is located inside the Dalaya Elem. School and the Dalaya Brgy. Hall compounds. It is situated just at the back of the elevated water tank, at a junction of the road, along the plant boxes between the school and the brgy. hall, 2 m. from the fence, 4 m. from the gate of the brgy. hall. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3188 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.26442334, '18° 15\' 51.924030\"', 121.77495760, '121° 46\' 29.847500\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.8510, 0.0000, '4', 5.0531, 370500.48350, 2019874.64100, '51', 18.26613872, '18° 15\' 58.099380\"', 121.77368510, '121° 46\' 25.266460\"', 8.7250, 2020389.17400, 581812.42600, '3', 370365.33900, 2019943.79500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6322, 'CGY-3189', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'REMEBELLA', 2007, 18.27488993, '18° 16\' 29.603748\"', 121.78415430, '121° 47\' 2.955480\"', 'CGY-3189 From Dugo Junction, travel along the Nat\'l. Highway leading to Port Irene, Mun. of Santa Ana. Then turn left to a junction after passing Dalaya Bridge No. 1 at Km. 579+109. Station is located at the back of Zone 3 welcome marker situated at the junction going to Remebella Brgy. Proper and Brgy. Quinawegan. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3189 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.27488993, '18° 16\' 29.603760\"', 121.78415430, '121° 47\' 2.955550\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.9250, 0.0000, '4', 5.1824, 371480.49150, 2021026.37600, '51', 18.27660573, '18° 16\' 35.780640\"', 121.78288210, '121° 46\' 58.375430\"', 8.8116, 2021551.80900, 582780.03000, '3', 371345.38700, 2021095.50900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6323, 'CGY-3190', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'REMEBELLA', 2007, 18.27333768, '18° 16\' 24.015648\"', 121.78554070, '121° 47\' 7.946520\"', 'CGY-3190 Is located along the road to Brgy. Quinawegan from Brgy. Remebella, at the fourth post of the CAGELCO transmission line. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3190 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.27333768, '18° 16\' 24.015640\"', 121.78554070, '121° 47\' 7.946500\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.5600, 0.0000, '4', 4.8089, 371625.91250, 2020853.62900, '51', 18.27505336, '18° 16\' 30.192090\"', 121.78426840, '121° 47\' 3.366260\"', 8.4382, 2021380.62000, 582927.36400, '3', 371490.80400, 2020922.75700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
