(6324, 'CGY-3191', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'PADDAYA WESTE', 2007, 18.31432465, '18° 18\' 51.568740\"', 121.76236170, '121° 45\' 44.502120\"', 'CGY-3191 The station is located beside Barangay Marker and 450 m. fronting the Paddaya Weste Brgy. Hall, at its NE corner just opposite the Paddaya Weste Elem. School. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3191 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.31432465, '18° 18\' 51.568730\"', 121.76236170, '121° 45\' 44.502240\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.3900, 0.0000, '4', 4.8787, 369206.23920, 2025405.70600, '51', 18.31604324, '18° 18\' 57.755670\"', 121.76109040, '121° 45\' 39.925270\"', 8.4590, 2025907.02700, 580457.51400, '3', 369071.25000, 2025474.93700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6325, 'CGY-3193', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'PADDAYA WESTE', 2007, 18.30622789, '18° 18\' 22.420404\"', 121.78630800, '121° 47\' 10.708800\"', 'CGY-3193 Is located at Brgy. Paddaya Weste, Mun. of Buguey, at the lot of Mr. Antonio Mabalut, opposite of the seawall end. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3193 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.30622789, '18° 18\' 22.420400\"', 121.78630800, '121° 47\' 10.708700\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.1850, 0.0000, '4', 5.6244, 371731.22600, 2024492.70500, '51', 18.30794550, '18° 18\' 28.603800\"', 121.78503640, '121° 47\' 6.131200\"', 9.1699, 2025021.49600, 582992.92300, '3', 371596.22600, 2024561.85500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6326, 'CGY-3194', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'PADDAYA ESTE', 2007, 18.30669337, '18° 18\' 24.096132\"', 121.78482460, '121° 47\' 5.368560\"', 'CGY-3194 It is located at Brgy. Paddaya Este, Mun. of Buguey, beside the CAGELCO electric post, opposite the house of Mr. Antonio Mabalut. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3194 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.30669337, '18° 18\' 24.096140\"', 121.78482460, '121° 47\' 5.368720\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.9240, 0.0000, '4', 5.3662, 371574.78500, 2024545.25900, '51', 18.30841104, '18° 18\' 30.279750\"', 121.78355310, '121° 47\' 0.791250\"', 8.9140, 2025072.34800, 582835.87900, '3', 371439.78600, 2024614.41400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6327, 'CGY-3195', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'QUINAWEGAN', 2007, 18.26315944, '18° 15\' 47.373984\"', 121.79677950, '121° 47\' 48.406200\"', 'CGY-3195 From Dugo Junction, travel along the road leading to Port Irene, Mun. of Santa Ana. Then turn left at Ballang Junction to reach Brgy. Quinawegan, Mun. of Buguey. Station is located at the left side corner of the concrete fence (inside) of Quinawegan Elem. School. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3195 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.26315944, '18° 15\' 47.374000\"', 121.79677950, '121° 47\' 48.406290\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.5790, 0.0000, '4', 4.7675, 372806.63660, 2019719.45600, '51', 18.26487429, '18° 15\' 53.547430\"', 121.79550700, '121° 47\' 43.825270\"', 8.3967, 2020259.13100, 584120.68300, '3', 372671.50300, 2019788.54100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6328, 'CGY-3196', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'QUINAWEGAN', 2007, 18.26392352, '18° 15\' 50.124672\"', 121.79788600, '121° 47\' 52.389600\"', 'CGY-3196 Is located at Brgy. Quinawegan, Mun. of Buguey, beside the shed of the fish port, approx. 150 m. from station CGY-3195, which is located at Quinawegan Elem. School compound. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3196 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.26392352, '18° 15\' 50.124680\"', 121.79788600, '121° 47\' 52.389430\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.0880, 0.0000, '4', 5.2797, 372924.16780, 2019803.23800, '51', 18.26563838, '18° 15\' 56.298180\"', 121.79661350, '121° 47\' 47.808480\"', 8.9056, 2020344.21100, 584237.32200, '3', 372789.03700, 2019872.32000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6329, 'CGY-3198', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'FULA', 2007, 18.24978692, '18° 14\' 59.232912\"', 121.78429910, '121° 47\' 3.476760\"', 'CGY-3198 Is located at Brgy. Fula, Mun. of Buguey, inside Fula Elem. School compound. It is situated 1 m. from the perimeter fence of the school along the road. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3198 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.24978692, '18° 14\' 59.232900\"', 121.78429910, '121° 47\' 3.476710\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.1470, 0.0000, '4', 5.2689, 371477.32270, 2018248.39200, '51', 18.25150123, '18° 15\' 5.404420\"', 121.78302630, '121° 46\' 58.894510\"', 8.9504, 2018773.29800, 582807.17900, '3', 371342.13600, 2018317.50600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6330, 'CGY-3199', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'CULLIT', 2007, 18.24384947, '18° 14\' 37.858092\"', 121.75224560, '121° 45\' 8.084160\"', 'CGY-3199 From Dugo Junction, travel along the Santa Ana Highway. Then turn left upon reaching Brgy. Cullit Junction. From this junction, continue travelling until reaching Cullit Elem. School. Station is located inside the said school compound, beside the front perimeter fence along the brgy. road. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3199 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.24384947, '18° 14\' 37.858080\"', 121.75224560, '121° 45\' 8.084290\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.6860, 0.0000, '4', 14.7910, 368083.75510, 2017614.17200, '51', 18.24556410, '18° 14\' 44.030760\"', 121.75097260, '121° 45\' 3.501400\"', 18.5465, 2018101.96600, 579419.95500, '3', 367948.52700, 2017683.38300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6331, 'CGY-32 (CAG-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'PARUG-PARUG', 2001, 17.57484417, '17° 34\' 29.439012\"', 121.59522240, '121° 35\' 42.800640\"', 'CGY-32 (CAG-2) The station is located at Brgy. Parog-Parog, Solana, Cagayan. It is situated 200 m. E of the provincial road, at the NE corner of the property of Ms. Gregoria Pagulayan. The station is 12 cm. x 12 cm. x 1 m. in size and 20 cm. protruding from the ground, with the markings of \"CAG 2; DAR\" inscribed at the top and having a 10 cm. copper nail as its point in the center.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.57484417, '17° 34\' 29.439010\"', 121.59522240, '121° 35\' 42.800540\"', 0.0000, '0', 88.9320, 0.0000, '3', 50.1663, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 17.57652214, '17° 34\' 35.479700\"', 121.59393360, '121° 35\' 38.160990\"', 52.9900, 1943996.18600, 563047.63400, '3', 350784.41700, 1943770.08100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2016-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6332, 'CGY-3200', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'CULLIT', 2007, 18.24284750, '18° 14\' 34.251000\"', 121.75192290, '121° 45\' 6.922440\"', 'CGY-3200 Is located at Brgy. Cullit, Mun. of Buguey, at the Cullit Brgy. Hall compound, SE of station CGY-3199. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3200 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.24284750, '18° 14\' 34.251000\"', 121.75192290, '121° 45\' 6.922330\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.4520, 0.0000, '4', 14.5529, 368048.87070, 2017503.52700, '51', 18.24456208, '18° 14\' 40.423490\"', 121.75064980, '121° 45\' 2.339360\"', 18.3100, 2017990.92300, 579386.27100, '3', 367913.63900, 2017572.73800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6333, 'CGY-3201', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PEÑABLANCA', 'CABBO', 2007, 17.59265767, '17° 35\' 33.567612\"', 121.80747060, '121° 48\' 26.894160\"', 'CGY-3201 From Tuguegarao, follow the road leading to Peñablanca. From the junction fronting the Tuguegarao Capitol bldg., turn right and travel for about 800 m. to reach the power station. Turn left and follow the main rough road. Travel for about 8 km. to reach Brgy. Cabbo. Take the road to the right going to Brgy. Bical and travel until reaching the Y-road. Turn left and travel for about 150 m. to reach the first street and turn left again. Station is located at the basketball court, which is about 100 m. from the minor road. It is about 14 m. N of the S side and about 7 m. E of the W side of the basketball court. Mark is the head of a copper nail flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3201 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.59265767, '17° 35\' 33.567610\"', 121.80747060, '121° 48\' 26.894140\"', 0.0000, '0', 86.6670, 0.0000, '3', 47.1627, 373461.51280, 1945517.76700, '51', 17.59433219, '17° 35\' 39.595870\"', 121.80618260, '121° 48\' 22.257350\"', 50.2726, 1946050.42100, 585571.11200, '3', 373324.18600, 1945586.30800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6334, 'CGY-3203', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ENRILE', 'LIWAN NORTE', 2007, 17.54773190, '17° 32\' 51.834840\"', 121.63570090, '121° 38\' 8.523240\"', 'CGY-3203 From Tuguegarao, cross Buntun Bridge. Turn left at the junction and follow the main road. For about 11 km. from the junction, turn right leading to Brgy. Liwan Sur. The road is concrete but hilly. After the second bridge, about 1 km. farther, turn right and follow the dirt road, about 4 km. to Brgy. Liwan Norte. Station is inside the brgy. hall compound W of the main bldg. and about 8 m. SE of the concrete watertank. It is situated above the N lightpost base. Mark is the head of a copper nail and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3203 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.54773190, '17° 32\' 51.834850\"', 121.63570090, '121° 38\' 8.523360\"', 0.0000, '0', 109.2080, 0.0000, '3', 70.3427, 355196.75200, 1940669.36800, '51', 17.54940737, '17° 32\' 57.866520\"', 121.63441160, '121° 38\' 3.881800\"', 73.0814, 1941009.31600, 567354.64800, '3', 355059.15100, 1940738.41500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2009-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6335, 'CGY-3204', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'GADU', 2007, 17.62248571, '17° 37\' 20.948556\"', 121.61213250, '121° 36\' 43.677000\"', 'CGY-3204 From Tuguegarao, cross Buntun Bridge and turn right at the junction. Follow the main road leading to Piat and take a left after Km. Post 498. Brgy. Gadu is about 4 km. from the main road. Station is located on the multi-purpose drying pavement of the said brgy., about 20 m. N of the welcome arch of Brgy. Calilliaua and is behind the two concrete tablets of the Department of Agriculture. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3204 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.62248571, '17° 37\' 20.948540\"', 121.61213250, '121° 36\' 43.676860\"', 0.0000, '0', 72.3680, 0.0000, '3', 33.7216, 352755.40390, 1948959.60600, '51', 17.62416619, '17° 37\' 26.998280\"', 121.61084480, '121° 36\' 39.041380\"', 36.5385, 1949274.63200, 564825.86200, '3', 352618.03100, 1949028.78600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6336, 'CGY-3205', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'MADDARULUG', 2007, 17.61802533, '17° 37\' 4.891188\"', 121.68080190, '121° 40\' 50.886840\"', 'CGY-3205 From Tuguegarao, cross Buntun Bridge and turn right at the junction and travel until reaching the first bridge, Carag Bridge (488 + 015). Station is located at the NE foot of the said bridge. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3205 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.61802533, '17° 37\' 4.891190\"', 121.68080190, '121° 40\' 50.886670\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.6580, 0.0000, '3', 36.8570, 360038.46900, 1948413.91700, '51', 17.61970408, '17° 37\' 10.934690\"', 121.67951420, '121° 40\' 46.251230\"', 39.6493, 1948805.65400, 572115.43700, '3', 359901.13200, 1948482.87600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6337, 'CGY-3206', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PIAT', 'VILLA REY', 2007, 17.70158071, '17° 42\' 5.690556\"', 121.56475350, '121° 33\' 53.112600\"', 'CGY-3206 From Tuguegarao, cross Buntun Bridge and turn right at the junction leading to Mun. of Piat. Station is about 400 m. from Km. Post 506 along the highway, and about 8 m. E of the access (dirt) road leading to Brgy. Padul. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-3206 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.70158071, '17° 42\' 5.690560\"', 121.56475350, '121° 33\' 53.112690\"', 0.0000, '0', 124.3110, 0.0000, '3', 85.7785, 347794.46250, 1957749.82900, '51', 17.70326695, '17° 42\' 11.761010\"', 121.56346770, '121° 33\' 48.483570\"', 88.8506, 1958013.07300, 559771.70100, '3', 347657.31600, 1957819.21800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6338, 'CGY-3208', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'BASI WEST', 2007, 17.66945152, '17° 40\' 10.025472\"', 121.69516210, '121° 41\' 42.583560\"', 'CGY-3208 From Buntun Bridge, turn right at the junction going to the Mun. of Solana. Upon reaching another junction, turn right and travel for about 6 km. to reach Brgys. Basi East and Basi West. Station is located inside Basi Elem. School, about 20 m. N of the shed, which is on the N edge of the school gate. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-3208 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.66945152, '17° 40\' 10.025470\"', 121.69516210, '121° 41\' 42.583600\"', 0.0000, '0', 61.7260, 0.0000, '3', 23.0130, 361601.53880, 1954093.95300, '51', 17.67113306, '17° 40\' 16.079030\"', 121.69387570, '121° 41\' 37.952530\"', 25.8488, 1954502.91000, 573618.75600, '3', 361464.38100, 1954162.90800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6339, 'CGY-3209', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'SAMPAGUITA', 2007, 17.68251476, '17° 40\' 57.053136\"', 121.60340150, '121° 36\' 12.245400\"', 'CGY-3209 From Tuguegarao, cross Buntun Bridge and turn right at the junction. Follow the main road leading to Mun. of Piat. At the corner of Km. Post 501, turn right at the dirt/rough road leading to Sitio Damortiz, Brgy. Sampaguita. About 150 m. from the main road is a basketball court/solar dryer. Station is located on the NW corner of the court and is in front of a concrete tablet. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3209 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.68251476, '17° 40\' 57.053150\"', 121.60340150, '121° 36\' 12.245500\"', 0.0000, '0', 85.9580, 0.0000, '3', 47.4353, 351878.06350, 1955609.19000, '51', 17.68419904, '17° 41\' 3.116550\"', 121.60211530, '121° 36\' 7.614990\"', 50.3432, 1955915.50000, 563878.23500, '3', 351740.88200, 1955678.44400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6340, 'CGY-3211', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PIAT', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 2007, 17.73993807, '17° 44\' 23.777052\"', 121.50598530, '121° 30\' 21.547080\"', 'CGY-3211 From Tuguegarao, cross Buntun Bridge and turn right at the junction. Follow the main road leading to Piat. Sto. Domingo Brgy. Hall is on the E side of the road after Km. Post 514. Station is located on the W side of the solar dryer within the brgy. hall compound. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and embedded on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3211 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.73993807, '17° 44\' 23.777060\"', 121.50598530, '121° 30\' 21.546950\"', 0.0000, '0', 80.3200, 0.0000, '3', 41.6020, 341594.74570, 1962043.06100, '51', 17.74162788, '17° 44\' 29.860350\"', 121.50470020, '121° 30\' 16.920650\"', 45.1246, 1962240.77900, 553526.22200, '3', 341457.68200, 1962112.66700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6341, 'CGY-3212', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'AMULUNG', 'LA SUERTE', 2007, 17.77011140, '17° 46\' 12.401040\"', 121.59153180, '121° 35\' 29.514480\"', 'CGY-3212 From Buntun Bridge, make a right at the junction then travel until reaching another junction. Make a left and travel for about 13 km. to reach the boundary marker of Piat and Solana. Turn right at the rough road and travel for about 8 km. (past the marker of Brgy. Nabbialan but not entering it). Station is located at the SE corner of the E side of a pair of what appears to be the pedestal of a boundary marker. It is also about 400 m. S of La Suerte Elem. School. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3212 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.77011140, '17° 46\' 12.401050\"', 121.59153180, '121° 35\' 29.514350\"', 0.0000, '0', 76.8530, 0.0000, '3', 38.4312, 350691.52680, 1965312.03600, '51', 17.77180119, '17° 46\' 18.484300\"', 121.59024750, '121° 35\' 24.891070\"', 41.5500, 1965606.50900, 562588.73900, '3', 350554.62500, 1965381.39400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6342, 'CGY-3213', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BAGGAO', 'MABINI', 2007, 17.85668390, '17° 51\' 24.062040\"', 121.84505120, '121° 50\' 42.184320\"', 'CGY-3213 From Baggao Town Proper, turn right on the main access road leading to Brgy. Bitag Grande. Before reaching Brgy. San Jose Proper, turn right at the junction, and turn right again at another junction. Travel for about 1 km. and then turn left at the access road leading to Brgy. Mabini. Station is located at the side pavement of the basketball court fronting the brgy. hall. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3213 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.85668390, '17° 51\' 24.062030\"', 121.84505120, '121° 50\' 42.184400\"', 0.0000, '0', 78.5500, 0.0000, '3', 39.7245, 377628.93180, 1974707.95100, '51', 17.85837349, '17° 51\' 30.144570\"', 121.84376940, '121° 50\' 37.569870\"', 42.9203, 1975290.73600, 589429.90400, '3', 377492.50000, 1974776.57800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6343, 'CGY-3214', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'AMULUNG', 'MAGOGOD', 2007, 17.86386161, '17° 51\' 49.901796\"', 121.74925520, '121° 44\' 57.318720\"', 'CGY-3214 From Aparri along the Maharlika Highway, travel south and pass by Alcala town proper and bgy Baculud, Amulung. Turn left upon reaching the junction leading to brgy. Dadda, from this junction travel for about 6.2 kms along the access road to reach bgy. Magogod, CGY 3214-inside the Magogo Elemntary School, on a concrete pathwalk from the school gate leading to classrooms.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.86386161, '17° 51\' 49.901780\"', 121.74925520, '121° 44\' 57.318620\"', 0.0000, '0', 96.1280, 0.0000, '3', 57.6942, 367483.03870, 1975567.56600, '51', 17.86555366, '17° 51\' 55.993170\"', 121.74797340, '121° 44\' 52.704110\"', 60.7513, 1976042.14600, 579272.93500, '3', 367346.56100, 1975636.49900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6344, 'CGY-3215', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'AMULUNG', 'PALAYAG', 2007, 17.81079328, '17° 48\' 38.855808\"', 121.67594800, '121° 40\' 33.412800\"', 'CGY-3215 From Buntun Bridge, turn right at the junction going to Solana then right again on the second junction. Following the main road, travel for about 15 km. until reaching Palayag Elem. School. Station is located inside the campus, about 13 m. W of the N end of the school gate, 7 m. E of the flagpole. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3215 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.81079328, '17° 48\' 38.855800\"', 121.67594800, '121° 40\' 33.412830\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.8610, 0.0000, '3', 20.5007, 359673.43680, 1969748.65900, '51', 17.81248372, '17° 48\' 44.941390\"', 121.67466480, '121° 40\' 28.793430\"', 23.4875, 1970139.12200, 571524.31000, '3', 359536.73000, 1969817.78300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6345, 'CGY-3216', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PIAT', 'POBLACION II', 2007, 17.79418268, '17° 47\' 39.057648\"', 121.48126410, '121° 28\' 52.550760\"', 'CGY-3216 From Tuguegarao, cross Buntun Bridge and turn right at the junction. Follow the main road leading to Piat and turn right on the Y-junction leading to Piat Nat\'l. High School, just before reaching the town proper. Station is located inside the school\'s multi-purpose drying pavement, about 0.5 m. from its NW corner. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3216 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.79418268, '17° 47\' 39.057660\"', 121.48126410, '121° 28\' 52.550630\"', 0.0000, '0', 105.1130, 0.0000, '3', 66.2444, 339021.70930, 1968067.06400, '51', 17.79587626, '17° 47\' 45.154520\"', 121.47998020, '121° 28\' 47.928730\"', 70.1525, 1968237.55400, 550889.13200, '3', 338884.80700, 1968136.78900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6346, 'CGY-3218', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANTO NIÑO', 'TABANG', 2007, 17.81894162, '17° 49\' 8.189832\"', 121.54917170, '121° 32\' 57.018120\"', 'CGY-3218 From Buntun Bridge, turn right at the junction going to Solana. Travel until reaching another junction then turn left. Travel for about 35 km. until reaching a Y-road. Take the road right going to Sto. Niño and travel for about 9 km. to reach Brgy. Tabang. Turn left at the street after Tabang Elem. School leading to the ferry station. Station is located at about 250 m. S of the ferry station, situated on top of a rock outcrop on the riverside. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3218 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.81894162, '17° 49\' 8.189830\"', 121.54917170, '121° 32\' 57.018070\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.2500, 0.0000, '3', 15.7191, 346242.08270, 1970749.93500, '51', 17.82063524, '17° 49\' 14.286880\"', 121.54788850, '121° 32\' 52.398590\"', 19.2069, 1970997.39300, 558081.15500, '3', 346105.31000, 1970819.46600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6347, 'CGY-3219', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALCALA', 'ABBEG', 2007, 17.83777873, '17° 50\' 16.003428\"', 121.61567570, '121° 36\' 56.432520\"', 'CGY-3219 From Buntun Bridge, make a right at the junction then continue traveling until reaching another junction. Make a left and travel for about 13 km. to reach the boundary marker of Piat and Solana. Turn right at the rough road and travel for about 8 km. (past the marker of Brgy. Nabbialan but not entering it). From La Suerte Elem. School, travel N for about 6 km. until reaching Brgy. Abbeg. Station is located on a basketball court, about 10 m. S from the NE corner. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3219 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.83777873, '17° 50\' 16.003440\"', 121.61567570, '121° 36\' 56.432420\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.5960, 0.0000, '3', 19.2525, 353306.70780, 1972781.08000, '51', 17.83947207, '17° 50\' 22.099460\"', 121.61439300, '121° 36\' 51.814910\"', 22.4546, 1973103.99200, 565124.60400, '3', 353170.04600, 1972850.41500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6348, 'CGY-3221', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BAGGAO', 'HACIENDA INTAL', 2007, 17.88409534, '17° 53\' 2.743224\"', 121.91244840, '121° 54\' 44.814240\"', 'CGY-3221 From Aparri, travel S along Maharlika Highway going to Gattaran. Turn left on the Gattaran-Baggao access road, passing Brgys. Palagao, Calaoagan, Kumao and Capissayan. Follow the road passing Brgys. Remus, Tallang, Barsat East, Nangalinan and San Isidro. Continue following the road and turn right on the access road leading to Brgys. Santos and Hacienda Intal. Station is located inside Hacienda Intal Elem. School, about 20 m. NW of the school incinerator and about 30 m. NE of the flagpole. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-3221 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.88409534, '17° 53\' 2.743230\"', 121.91244840, '121° 54\' 44.814270\"', 0.0000, '0', 74.2230, 0.0000, '3', 35.2880, 384788.30360, 1977698.19200, '51', 17.88578515, '17° 53\' 8.826540\"', 121.91116730, '121° 54\' 40.202440\"', 38.5210, 1978358.18300, 596558.98000, '3', 384652.01000, 1977766.62800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6349, 'CGY-3222', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BAGGAO', 'BITAG GRANDE', 2007, 17.90818374, '17° 54\' 29.461464\"', 121.83671830, '121° 50\' 12.185880\"', 'CGY-3222 From the Mun. of Baggao, travel for about 15 km. along the access road leading to Brgy. Bitag Grande. Station is located on the SW corner of the solar dryer in So. Guluran, about 10 m. SE of the centerline of the road leading to Brgy. San Jose. It is situated about 150 m. SW of the United Methodist Church. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3222 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.90818374, '17° 54\' 29.461470\"', 121.83671830, '121° 50\' 12.185820\"', 0.0000, '0', 67.0520, 0.0000, '3', 28.3908, 376781.45980, 1980412.06300, '51', 17.90987660, '17° 54\' 35.555760\"', 121.83543760, '121° 50\' 7.575520\"', 31.6100, 1980986.98900, 588521.25500, '3', 376645.19000, 1980480.75600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6350, 'CGY-3223', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALCALA', 'PINOPOC', 2007, 17.91341205, '17° 54\' 48.283380\"', 121.69997300, '121° 41\' 59.902800\"', 'CGY-3223 From Tuguegarao, travel for about 40 km. N along Maharlika Highway to reach the junction at Brgy. Baybayog, Alcala. Turn right and travel for about 2.5 km. N along the provincial road, crossing the Baybayog River, to Brgy. Pinopoc. Station is located at the S edge of the basketball court, NW of the brgy. hall. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3223 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.91341205, '17° 54\' 48.283380\"', 121.69997300, '121° 41\' 59.902910\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.7530, 0.0000, '3', 18.4765, 362299.07740, 1981086.38900, '51', 17.91510813, '17° 54\' 54.389250\"', 121.69869230, '121° 41\' 55.292210\"', 21.6556, 1981506.32700, 574029.18200, '3', 362162.72600, 1981155.51600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6351, 'CGY-3228', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BAGGAO', 'BARSAT EAST', 2007, 17.93575705, '17° 56\' 8.725380\"', 121.88356530, '121° 53\' 0.835080\"', 'CGY-3228 From Brgy. San Jose, along the nat\'l. road, turn left passing a bridge, then turn left again on another junction, then straight ahead up to Barsat Este. Turn left on the service road at Zone 3 to reach the brgy. hall beside the school. Station is located on a ricefield, about 5 m. S of the basketball court situated at the back of the school. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-3228 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.93575705, '17° 56\' 8.725390\"', 121.88356530, '121° 53\' 0.835000\"', 0.0000, '0', 72.0140, 0.0000, '3', 33.2776, 381762.46460, 1983432.75300, '51', 17.93745057, '17° 56\' 14.822040\"', 121.88228540, '121° 52\' 56.227290\"', 36.5497, 1984061.72700, 593470.99000, '3', 381626.31900, 1983501.31900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6352, 'CGY-3230 (OBSTRUCTED)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'GATTARAN', 'SAN CARLOS', 2007, 18.00792691, '18° 0\' 28.536876\"', 121.86563760, '121° 51\' 56.295360\"', 'REPORTED OBSTRUCTED by Joan 2016 CGY-3230 From Aparri, travel S along Maharlika Highway. Turn left upon reaching the junction leading to Brgy. Capissayan. Follow this road to reach Brgy. San Carlos. Station is located on a solar dryer/basketball court, inside the brgy. hall compound about 18 m. NE from the centerline of the road leading to Brgy. Capissayan, and 20 m. NW from the SE corner of the said court. (NOTE: The basketball court is covered with roof) Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3230 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.00792691, '18° 0\' 28.536880\"', 121.86563760, '121° 51\' 56.295310\"', 0.0000, '0', 99.8970, 0.0000, '3', 61.3051, 379912.39740, 1991430.08500, '51', 18.00962511, '18° 0\' 34.650390\"', 121.86435930, '121° 51\' 51.693520\"', 64.7114, 1992041.01200, 591534.56200, '3', 379776.47600, 1991498.76200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
