(6354, 'CGY-3233', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'GATTARAN', 'DUMMUN', 2007, 18.03397563, '18° 2\' 2.312268\"', 121.63861750, '121° 38\' 19.023000\"', 'CGY-3233 From Aparri, travel S along the nat\'l. road going to Gattaran. Continue heading S to reach Brgy. Sta. Maria welcome arch until reaching the DPWH office. Station is located on a vacant lot inside the DPWH 3rd Area Equipment Service compound, situated about 20 m. E of the W fence, about 30 m. SW from the water tank and about 20 m. NE from the said arch. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-3233 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.03397563, '18° 2\' 2.312270\"', 121.63861750, '121° 38\' 19.023130\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.4370, 0.0000, '3', 19.1220, 355897.07060, 1994474.55000, '51', 18.03568019, '18° 2\' 8.448680\"', 121.63733950, '121° 38\' 14.422130\"', 22.8800, 1994827.23500, 567482.57200, '3', 355761.07300, 1994543.96000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'mara', '2017-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6355, 'CGY-3234', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LASAM', 'CENTRO II', 2007, 18.06360480, '18° 3\' 48.977280\"', 121.60007860, '121° 36\' 0.282960\"', 'CGY-3234 Is located inside the Centro Elem. School, about 50 m. from Lasam Mun. Hall, and is situated about 10 m. N from the flagpole. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3234 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.06360480, '18° 3\' 48.977290\"', 121.60007860, '121° 36\' 0.283100\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.4370, 0.0000, '3', 17.0222, 351841.88600, 1997783.86200, '51', 18.06531195, '18° 3\' 55.123020\"', 121.59880120, '121° 35\' 55.684300\"', 21.0695, 1998093.08500, 563391.32900, '3', 351705.95700, 1997853.41600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6356, 'CGY-3235', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LASAM', 'NABANNAGAN WEST', 2007, 18.06928163, '18° 4\' 9.413868\"', 121.53168600, '121° 31\' 54.069600\"', 'CGY-3235 From Lasam Mun. Hall, along the nat\'l. road, travel straight ahead to the direction of Brgy. Nabannagan West until reaching the Lasam Nat\'l. Agriculture College. Station is situated at the side of the school basketball court. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3235 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.06928163, '18° 4\' 9.413880\"', 121.53168600, '121° 31\' 54.069550\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.8140, 0.0000, '3', 30.1242, 344607.40980, 1998468.29500, '51', 18.07099056, '18° 4\' 15.566020\"', 121.53040860, '121° 31\' 49.470830\"', 34.6288, 1998699.43100, 556149.04600, '3', 344471.45100, 1998538.06900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
