(6359, 'CGY-3239', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'LABBEN', 2007, 18.19702199, '18° 11\' 49.279164\"', 121.56042060, '121° 33\' 37.514160\"', 'CGY-3239 From Allacapan Town Proper, travel for about 5 km. to Magapit Bridge and turn right at the dirt road leading to Alig Valley. Station is located about 50 m. from the nat\'l. highway, on the center of a solar dryer of Brgy. Labben. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3239 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.19702199, '18° 11\' 49.279180\"', 121.56042060, '121° 33\' 37.514090\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.9870, 0.0000, '3', 20.6585, 347759.50230, 2012580.86400, '51', 18.19873790, '18° 11\' 55.456440\"', 121.55914620, '121° 33\' 32.926160\"', 25.1522, 2012846.81600, 559148.33700, '3', 347623.98500, 2012650.64300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
