(6369, 'CGY-3251', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'CATARATAN', 2007, 18.24444953, '18° 14\' 40.018308\"', 121.51014170, '121° 30\' 36.510120\"', 'CGY-3251 From Allacapan Town Proper, follow the dirt road going to Brgy. Kapanikian. Turn right at the Cataratan Brgy. Hall and follow the road leading to Cataratan Integrated School. Station is located inside the school grounds, about 5 m. S of the flagpole. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-3251 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.24444953, '18° 14\' 40.018320\"', 121.51014170, '121° 30\' 36.510150\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.5730, 0.0000, '3', 20.3157, 342484.06780, 2017872.08600, '51', 18.24616931, '18° 14\' 46.209500\"', 121.50886830, '121° 30\' 31.925870\"', 25.0146, 2018080.80800, 553815.07900, '3', 342348.67200, 2017942.05800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6370, 'CGY-3252', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BALLESTEROS', 'FUGU', 2007, 18.30804618, '18° 18\' 28.966248\"', 121.51476000, '121° 30\' 53.136000\"', 'CGY-3252 From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. road to reach Brgy. Fugu. Turn left and follow the irrigation road leading to So. Calapaoan. Station is located at the junction road of So. Cabagaoan and Brgy. Nararagan. It is about 10 m. N of the waiting shed, 15 m. SE of the junction road and 80 m. N of Calapaoan Primary School. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-3252 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.30804618, '18° 18\' 28.966250\"', 121.51476000, '121° 30\' 53.136140\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.1710, 0.0000, '3', 12.2853, 343029.65960, 2024906.31500, '51', 18.30976962, '18° 18\' 35.170620\"', 121.51348810, '121° 30\' 48.557170\"', 16.8113, 2025121.18700, 554283.86900, '3', 342894.47700, 2024976.32000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6371, 'CGY-3254 (CGN-201)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ABULUG', 'LUCBAN', 2005, 18.33538465, '18° 20\' 7.384740\"', 121.43068310, '121° 25\' 50.459160\"', 'CGY-3254 (CGN-201, FNSP) From junction Luna in Abulug, take the nat\'l. road going to Magapit. Travel less than 5 km. passing through Lucban Bridge, then turn right at a brgy. road going to the Lucban Brgy. Hall compound. It is situated at the concrete pavement fronting the said brgy. hall. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 35 cm. x 35 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGN-201 2005 FNSP\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.33538465, '18° 20\' 7.384750\"', 121.43068310, '121° 25\' 50.459170\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.3340, 0.0000, '3', 13.4973, 334168.14200, 2028006.39200, '51', 18.33711147, '18° 20\' 13.601300\"', 121.42941170, '121° 25\' 45.881980\"', 18.2656, 2028124.27600, 545388.37300, '3', 334032.99100, 2028076.68200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6372, 'CGY-3256', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ABULUG', 'BANGUIAN', 2007, 18.38520629, '18° 23\' 6.742644\"', 121.44987970, '121° 26\' 59.566920\"', 'CGY-3256 From Magapit, travel along the nat\'l. highway going to Zitanga junction. About 2 km. after the said junction, past the Ballesteros-Abulug boundary marker, turn right and travel for about 3 km. to reach the solar dryer of Brgy. Bangian. Station is located on the said dryer, about 36 m. SW of the edge of the road and 20 m. from the NW side. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3256 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.38520629, '18° 23\' 6.742640\"', 121.44987970, '121° 26\' 59.566880\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.6280, 0.0000, '3', 10.2118, 336244.07490, 2033502.92000, '51', 18.38693564, '18° 23\' 12.968300\"', 121.44860940, '121° 26\' 54.993940\"', 14.6784, 2033643.50300, 547403.98800, '3', 336109.10200, 2033573.18600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6373, 'CGY-3260 (CGN-87)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CLAVERIA', 'UNION', 2005, 18.56146843, '18° 33\' 41.286348\"', 121.04931530, '121° 2\' 57.535080\"', 'CGY-3260 (CGN-87, FNSP) From Sta. Praxedes, travel 8 km. E until reaching Brgy. Union. Station is located about 10 m. from the W side of the brgy. hall. It is also situated 20 m. E of Union Elem. School. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 40 cm. x 40 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGN-87 2005 FNSP\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.56146843, '18° 33\' 41.286360\"', 121.04931530, '121° 2\' 57.535210\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.1190, 0.0000, '3', 16.3947, 294126.87160, 2053421.92800, '51', 18.56321653, '18° 33\' 47.579510\"', 121.04804850, '121° 2\' 52.974640\"', 21.7113, 2053095.44200, 505071.99900, '3', 293992.21100, 2053493.58700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6374, 'CGY-3265', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'GATTARAN', 'CASICALLAN SUR', 2007, 18.08275701, '18° 4\' 57.925236\"', 121.65248820, '121° 39\' 8.957520\"', 'CGY-3265 From Aparri, travel S along the nat\'l. highway to reach Brgy. Casicallan Sur. Station is located at the brgy. hall compound, about 20 m. SE from the centerline of the highway and about 2 m. W of the NW corner of the basketball court/solar dryer. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-3265 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.08275701, '18° 4\' 57.925240\"', 121.65248820, '121° 39\' 8.957360\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.7760, 0.0000, '3', 12.4803, 357404.86590, 1999862.03000, '51', 18.08446418, '18° 5\' 4.071060\"', 121.65121130, '121° 39\' 4.360500\"', 16.3460, 2000231.54100, 568932.36400, '3', 357269.03800, 1999931.43400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6375, 'CGY-3266', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BALLESTEROS', 'CENTRO WEST', 2007, 18.40912746, '18° 24\' 32.858856\"', 121.51460810, '121° 30\' 52.589160\"', 'CGY-3266 From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos. Take a right at Zitanga junction, after Km. Post 676, which is on the left side. Follow the main road and turn left upon reaching a rotunda. Ballesteros Mun. Hall is about 400 m. from the said rotunda. Station is located in the flower garden of the mun. hall compound, NE of the covered entrance near the marker of the Municipal Hall. Mark is the tip of a cam shaft, about 1 in. diameter, centered and protruding about 1 in. on the surface of a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-3266 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.40912746, '18° 24\' 32.858870\"', 121.51460810, '121° 30\' 52.589110\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.8000, 0.0000, '3', 9.6856, 343104.96200, 2036093.13700, '51', 18.41085686, '18° 24\' 39.084680\"', 121.51333850, '121° 30\' 48.018570\"', 13.7750, 2036309.14800, 554236.47800, '3', 342970.11400, 2036163.21600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6376, 'CGY-3267 (BLLM-15)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'CURVA', 1905, 18.38009990, '18° 22\' 48.359640\"', 121.38962130, '121° 23\' 22.636680\"', 'CGY-3267 (BLLM-15) From Pamplona proper, travel through national highway going to David Puzon Elementary School, then turn right to the Brgy. road of Pinili and travel for about 700 m. going to the station. Mark is set on the ground approximately 18 m. S of the SW corner of the basketball court. Mark is located about 6 m. S from the cotton tree and approximately 4 m. E from the centerline of the brgy. road. Station mark is head of 1\" concrete nail embedded on a concrete block 40 cm. x 40 cm., 18 cm. above ground surface with inscription \"BLLM No.15\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.38009990, '18° 22\' 48.359650\"', 121.38962130, '121° 23\' 22.636700\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.4530, 0.0000, '3', 10.8489, 329871.99430, 2032993.16800, '51', 18.38183022, '18° 22\' 54.588790\"', 121.38835080, '121° 23\' 18.062980\"', 15.6306, 2033063.78800, 541037.66200, '3', 329736.96300, 2033063.62100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1905-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6377, 'CGY-3268 (BLLM-16)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'CURVA', 1905, 18.38127296, '18° 22\' 52.582656\"', 121.38942460, '121° 23\' 21.928560\"', 'CGY-3268 (BLLM-16) From Pamplona proper travel through national highway going to David Puzon Elem. School then turn right to the brgy. road of Pinili and travel for about 625 m., then turn right to a road and travel for about 27 m. going to the station. Mark is set on the ground approximately 27 m. W from the certerline of NIA road, about 8 m. E of the southern most G-melina tree, about 80 m. NNW of the basketball court. Mark is located approximately 13 m. NNE of the canal gate and about 3.3 m. NE from the S end of the irrigation canal. Station mark is the head of 1\" concrete nail embedded on a concrete block 40 cm. x 40 cm., 18 cm. above ground surface with inscription \"BLLM No. 16\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.38127296, '18° 22\' 52.582670\"', 121.38942460, '121° 23\' 21.928680\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.6510, 0.0000, '3', 11.0560, 329852.36360, 2033123.18200, '51', 18.38300336, '18° 22\' 58.812080\"', 121.38815420, '121° 23\' 17.355060\"', 15.8329, 2033193.58100, 541016.60500, '3', 329717.33600, 2033193.63600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1905-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6378, 'CGY-3269 (BLLM-1A)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'CENTRO', 1905, 18.46463809, '18° 27\' 52.697124\"', 121.33990450, '121° 20\' 23.656200\"', 'BLLM-1A Mark is set on the ground inside Pamplona Central Elementary School. Mark is located approximately 18 m. NNW from the centerline of the national highway, about 11 m. WSW from the welcome marker, approximately 8 m. WSW from the NE corner of the roof of the school building, about 2.1 m. N from the north wall of the school building and 0.8 m. N from the N side of the roof of the school building. Station mark is the head of iron spike embedded on concrete block 41 cm. x 41 cm., 5 cm. above ground surface with inscription \"BLLM No. 1A\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.46463809, '18° 27\' 52.697130\"', 121.33990450, '121° 20\' 23.656140\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.1530, 0.0000, '3', 12.1135, 324704.20300, 2042397.01200, '51', 18.46637442, '18° 27\' 58.947920\"', 121.33863590, '121° 20\' 19.089160\"', 16.7290, 2042410.24600, 535766.67100, '3', 324569.41700, 2042467.68200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1905-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6379, 'CGY-3281', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'PATTAO', 2007, 18.25197900, '18° 15\' 7.124400\"', 121.81587250, '121° 48\' 57.141000\"', 'CGY-3281 The station is located in Brgy. Pattao, Buguey, Cagayan. It is established outside the NW corner of the concrete fence of the Iglesia Ni Cristo Chapel, 120 m. from the junction of the Nat\'l. Road and the road leading to Buguey Town Proper and 7.5 m. from the centerline of the road. It is also situated overlooking the \"Carabao\" statue located at the said junction. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3281 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.25197900, '18° 15\' 7.124400\"', 121.81587250, '121° 48\' 57.141100\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.2770, 0.0000, '4', 6.3854, 374817.19530, 2018469.06700, '51', 18.25369278, '18° 15\' 13.293990\"', 121.81459980, '121° 48\' 52.559270\"', 10.0121, 2019030.44200, 586145.26600, '3', 374682.03800, 2018538.08400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6380, 'CGY-3283', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2007, 18.29678852, '18° 17\' 48.438672\"', 121.81100610, '121° 48\' 39.621960\"', 'CGY-3283 Take the road leading to the Mun. of Gonzaga until reaching Brgy. Pattao Junction. Turn left from this junction going to Buguey Town Proper. Then turn left just after the bridge taking the road going to Brgy. San Isidro. Station is located in front of the Brgy. auditorium, at the right side of the gate 1 m. from the bleacher/fence and beside Barangay Marker. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3283 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.29678852, '18° 17\' 48.438680\"', 121.81100610, '121° 48\' 39.621820\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.4860, 0.0000, '4', 8.8549, 374334.93630, 2023430.96100, '51', 18.29850505, '18° 17\' 54.618190\"', 121.80973440, '121° 48\' 35.043690\"', 12.3807, 2023988.02900, 585608.72700, '3', 374199.92300, 2023500.02600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
