(6446, 'CGY-3374', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'LALAFUGAN', 2007, 18.13467477, '18° 8\' 4.829172\"', 121.61638340, '121° 36\' 58.980240\"', 'CGY-3374 From Magapit bridge taking the road going to Allacapan, Cagayan just after Lalafogan bridge, turn left to a junction in going to the site where the water impounding is located. The station is located before reaching the dam at about 4 m left from the edge of the road. Contact person is barangay Secretary Samuel Ceria. Mark is a 0.40 m x 0.40 m x 100 m sq. concrete monument with a bolth centering and 0.20 m protruding above the ground elevation with inscription CGY-3374 2007 LMS.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.13467477, '18° 8\' 4.829170\"', 121.61638340, '121° 36\' 58.980290\"', 0.0000, '0', 77.4740, 0.0000, '4', 39.1532, 353626.76090, 2005635.70900, '51', 18.13638579, '18° 8\' 10.988840\"', 121.61510760, '121° 36\' 54.387520\"', 43.3005, 2005964.87500, 565091.40500, '3', 353491.07800, 2005705.26400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
