(6449, 'CGY-3378', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'IRINGAN', 2007, 18.17365011, '18° 10\' 25.140396\"', 121.58245040, '121° 34\' 56.821440\"', 'CGY-3378 From Magapit Bridge, take the road going to the Mun. of Allacapan until reaching Brgy. Iringan. Station is located at the left wing portion in front of Iringan Brgy. Hall, about 8 m. from the center of the Nat\'l. Highway. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3378 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.17365011, '18° 10\' 25.140380\"', 121.58245040, '121° 34\' 56.821430\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.8830, 0.0000, '4', 15.5490, 350069.64460, 2009976.25100, '51', 18.17536416, '18° 10\' 31.310980\"', 121.58117550, '121° 34\' 52.231690\"', 19.9187, 2010267.15200, 561486.92500, '3', 349934.06600, 2010045.94300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6450, 'CGY-3379', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'LABBEN', 2007, 18.19728386, '18° 11\' 50.221896\"', 121.56132460, '121° 33\' 40.768560\"', 'CGY-3379 The station is situated along the national highway, about 7m from the center-corner of a junction going to Allig, beside welcome marker of Allig Valley. Mark is a bolt centered on top of a 0.40m x 0.40m x 1.00m concrete monument with inscriptions \"CGY-3379 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.19728386, '18° 11\' 50.221880\"', 121.56132460, '121° 33\' 40.768620\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.0560, 0.0000, '4', 18.7305, 347855.35090, 2012609.09300, '51', 18.19899975, '18° 11\' 56.399100\"', 121.56005020, '121° 33\' 36.180760\"', 23.2200, 2012876.08800, 559243.88500, '3', 347719.83600, 2012678.86900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6451, 'CGY-3381', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'CAPAGARAN', 2007, 18.16106275, '18° 9\' 39.825900\"', 121.52334070, '121° 31\' 24.026520\"', 'CGY-3381 Is located 60 m. before reaching the Capagaran Brgy. Hall, on the property of a certain Mr. Felipe Maximo beside the house of Brgy. Kag. Alfonso Agcaoili. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3381 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.16106275, '18° 9\' 39.825910\"', 121.52334070, '121° 31\' 24.026670\"', 0.0000, '0', 66.3700, 0.0000, '4', 27.8259, 343805.48070, 2008632.50400, '51', 18.16277731, '18° 9\' 45.998300\"', 121.52206540, '121° 31\' 19.435540\"', 32.5058, 2008855.32500, 555237.03800, '3', 343669.81900, 2008702.37300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6452, 'CGY-3382', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'CAPAGARAN', 2007, 18.15844881, '18° 9\' 30.415716\"', 121.52331160, '121° 31\' 23.921760\"', 'CGY-3382 From Magapit Bridge, take the road going to the Mun. of Allacapan. Then turn left to a junction going to Allig Valley. Upon reaching Capagaran Brgy. Hall, which is 8 km. from the junction, turn left to another junction. Station is located beside an electric post at about 3 m. from the center of the brgy. road before reaching the residence of Brgy. Capt. Loreto Costales and about 100 m. from the Capagaran Elem. School. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3382 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.15844881, '18° 9\' 30.415730\"', 121.52331160, '121° 31\' 23.921840\"', 0.0000, '0', 65.1490, 0.0000, '4', 26.5978, 343800.07580, 2008343.25000, '51', 18.16016321, '18° 9\' 36.587570\"', 121.52203620, '121° 31\' 19.330490\"', 31.2763, 2008566.00300, 555234.77300, '3', 343664.40600, 2008413.11700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
