(6454, 'CGY-3384', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'BESSANG', 2007, 18.17753064, '18° 10\' 39.110304\"', 121.54488770, '121° 32\' 41.595720\"', 'CGY-3384 From Magapit Bridge, take the road going to the Mun. of Allacapan. Then turn right at a junction going to Allig Valley. Station is located near elevation 49, on a hilly portion along the road going to Brgy. Capagaran and about 15 m. from the edge of the road. It is also situated where the Aetas are settled. Mark is a bolt centered on a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. sq. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above ground elevation, with inscriptions \"CGY-3384 2007 LMS 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.17753064, '18° 10\' 39.110300\"', 121.54488770, '121° 32\' 41.595860\"', 0.0000, '0', 81.9180, 0.0000, '4', 43.4905, 346099.46350, 2010436.77400, '51', 18.17924571, '18° 10\' 45.284560\"', 121.54361280, '121° 32\' 37.006240\"', 48.0563, 2010684.57500, 557511.52000, '3', 345963.87200, 2010506.58700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
