(6654, 'CGY-3727', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PEÑABLANCA', 'BICAL', 2007, 17.56302526, '17° 33\' 46.890936\"', 121.82498590, '121° 49\' 29.949240\"', 'CGY-3727 Station is located in Brgy. Bical, Peñablanca, Cagayan. It is established near the house of Brgy. Capt. Leonita Soriano, 3 m away from the post of basketball court. Station is 9 Km. from Nat\'l Road. Starting at police outpost of Brgy. Namabbalan, Tuguegarao City is 3 Km., and 1 Km. from Bical Elem. School. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete block set, 0.20 m above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3727, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.56302526, '17° 33\' 46.890950\"', 121.82498590, '121° 49\' 29.949350\"', 0.0000, '0', 116.2370, 0.0000, '4', 76.5469, 375299.95930, 1942227.31800, '51', 17.56469761, '17° 33\' 52.911390\"', 121.82369730, '121° 49\' 25.310220\"', 79.7051, 1942778.65000, 587444.53000, '3', 375162.54900, 1942295.77900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
