(6868, 'CGY-3899', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CAMALANIUGAN', 'BULALA', 2007, 18.26143326, '18° 15\' 41.159736\"', 121.68819970, '121° 41\' 17.518920\"', 'CGY-3899 Station is located at Bulala junction NE of police outpost. Travel along Nat\'l Road (Tuguegarao-Aparri) continue travel until you reach Camalaniugan junction (Dugo) turn right at the junction leading to Sta. Ana. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, set 2 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3899, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.26143326, '18° 15\' 41.159720\"', 121.68819970, '121° 41\' 17.518780\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.6260, 0.0000, '4', 9.7766, 361325.64870, 2019607.40100, '51', 18.26315028, '18° 15\' 47.341010\"', 121.68692690, '121° 41\' 12.936960\"', 13.6977, 2020021.76300, 572639.14700, '3', 361190.43300, 2019676.82500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jho', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6869, 'CGY-39', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'BALINGIT', 1905, 18.51356395, '18° 30\' 48.830220\"', 121.27132810, '121° 16\' 16.781160\"', 'CGY-39 Travelling from Pamplona town proper to the direction of Sanchez Mira, Cagayan following the national road. Upon crossing the municipal boundary arc between Pamplona and Sanchez Mira turn left at the first junction of road at Brgy. Bangan, Sanchez Mira. Follow the Brgy. road going to Marag, Luna, Apayao turn left at the 1st junction of the Brgy. road and a trail going to Brgy. Balingit. The station is located at the highest elevation of a grassy hill open space overlooking a rice field wherein the SW end of A & D of the said Brgy. is located. The station can be reach immediately thru the assistance of Brgy. Captain Rodrigo Biri & Engr. Jun Balagso.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.51356395, '18° 30\' 48.830220\"', 121.27132810, '121° 16\' 16.781270\"', 0.0000, '0', 60.0790, 0.0000, '2', 23.2347, 317513.05990, 2047880.09600, '51', 18.51530445, '18° 30\' 55.096020\"', 121.27006060, '121° 16\' 12.218050\"', 27.9820, 2047813.42400, 528515.61300, '3', 317378.39200, 2047951.00200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1905-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
