(6876, 'CGY-3908', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'PADDAYA WESTE', 2007, 18.32208707, '18° 19\' 19.513452\"', 121.74266910, '121° 44\' 33.608760\"', 'CGY-3908 Station is located at the W side of the private solar drier of Eddie Alberto, approx. 510 m from CGY-3247. From the Mun. proper of Buguey, travel approx. .5 Km. W to reach Brgy. Paddaya Weste. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, set 2 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3908, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.32208707, '18° 19\' 19.513460\"', 121.74266910, '121° 44\' 33.608630\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.6970, 0.0000, '4', 5.2317, 367130.77310, 2026278.94800, '51', 18.32380653, '18° 19\' 25.703520\"', 121.74139780, '121° 44\' 29.032210\"', 8.8390, 2026757.69100, 578372.15900, '3', 366995.79600, 2026348.24600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
