(6878, 'CGY-3911', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CAMALANIUGAN', 'CASILI NORTE', 2007, 18.28021411, '18° 16\' 48.770796\"', 121.71023950, '121° 42\' 36.862200\"', 'CGY-3911 Station is located at W midside of basketball court. approx. 650 m and 600 m away from elem. school bldg., brgy. hall compound respectively. From Camalaniugan junction travel about 500 m N then right to the intersection road leading to Brgy. Casili Camalaniugan, Cagayan. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.0 m concrete block, set 0.2 m above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3911, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.28021411, '18° 16\' 48.770800\"', 121.71023950, '121° 42\' 36.862370\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.2000, 0.0000, '4', 5.4666, 363670.54220, 2021669.14600, '51', 18.28193178, '18° 16\' 54.954400\"', 121.70896730, '121° 42\' 32.282280\"', 9.2810, 2022109.37800, 574961.83700, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
