(6880, 'CGY-3914', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LASAM', 'SICALAO', 2007, 18.04068893, '18° 2\' 26.480148\"', 121.47668780, '121° 28\' 36.076080\"', 'CGY-3914 Station is located along the Mun. Road going to Rizal, Cagayan, 11 Km. from Lasam Town Proper, beside the Km. post 739. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, set 2 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3914, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.04068893, '18° 2\' 26.480130\"', 121.47668780, '121° 28\' 36.076040\"', 0.0000, '0', 73.7130, 0.0000, '4', 34.6785, 338759.74050, 1995351.13200, '51', 18.04239731, '18° 2\' 32.630310\"', 121.47540960, '121° 28\' 31.474660\"', 39.5660, 1995519.08600, 550334.88300, '3', 338623.65000, 1995421.05800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6881, 'CGY-3915', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'QUINAWEGAN', 2007, 18.26165214, '18° 15\' 41.947704\"', 121.79650200, '121° 47\' 47.407200\"', 'CGY-3915 Station is located in front of Quinawegan brgy. hall. From Dugo, travel E until reaching the road intersecting the Nat\'l Highway, opposite is going to Brgy. Ballang. Travel N to reach Quinawegan Proper. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, set 2 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3915, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.26165214, '18° 15\' 41.947690\"', 121.79650200, '121° 47\' 47.407320\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.9280, 0.0000, '4', 5.1084, 372776.20110, 2019552.85200, '51', 18.26336689, '18° 15\' 48.120790\"', 121.79522950, '121° 47\' 42.826210\"', 8.7420, 2020092.16300, 584092.06200, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6882, 'CGY-3916', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'QUINAWEGAN', 2007, 18.25764351, '18° 15\' 27.516636\"', 121.79560550, '121° 47\' 44.179800\"', 'CGY-3916 Station is located along the road leading to Quinawegan Proper, intersection the Nat\'l Road. From Dugo, travel E until reaching the road intersecting the Nat\'l Highway, opposite of whcih is going to Brgy. Ballang. Travel N to reach Quinawegan Proper. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, set 2 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3916, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.25764351, '18° 15\' 27.516630\"', 121.79560550, '121° 47\' 44.179690\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.9530, 0.0000, '4', 5.1122, 372678.49050, 2019109.88600, '51', 18.25935804, '18° 15\' 33.688940\"', 121.79433280, '121° 47\' 39.598250\"', 8.7550, 2019648.04900, 583999.16700, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6883, 'CGY-3917', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'PATTAO', 2007, 18.25548019, '18° 15\' 19.728684\"', 121.81725040, '121° 49\' 2.101440\"', 'CGY-3917 From Camalaniugan junction, travel E to reach the town of Buguey. From Pattao junction leading to Centro, travel N to reach an irrigation canal. Station is along the left side of the road leading to Centro, Buguey on an irrigation canal. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, set 2 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3917, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.25548019, '18° 15\' 19.728690\"', 121.81725040, '121° 49\' 2.101530\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.0760, 0.0000, '4', 6.2029, 374965.38520, 2018855.56000, '51', 18.25719414, '18° 15\' 25.898900\"', 121.81597780, '121° 48\' 57.520040\"', 9.8190, 2019418.62600, 586289.27000, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6884, 'CGY-3918', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CAMALANIUGAN', 'CULLIT', 2007, 18.24676197, '18° 14\' 48.343092\"', 121.75505250, '121° 45\' 18.189000\"', 'CGY-3918 The station is located at Cullit, Camalaniugan, Cagayan. It is located 3 m S of Cullit Day Care Center and 5 m from the centerline of the road. From Camalaniugan junction, travel E along the Nat\'l Road leading to Sta. Ana, then turn right to a road leading to Cullit Proper. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, set 2 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3918, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.24676197, '18° 14\' 48.343100\"', 121.75505250, '121° 45\' 18.188980\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.4560, 0.0000, '4', 5.5724, 368382.73520, 2017934.44900, '51', 18.24847671, '18° 14\' 54.516170\"', 121.75377960, '121° 45\' 13.606390\"', 9.3200, 2018425.55400, 579715.49200, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6885, 'CGY-3919', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'CENTRO', 2007, 18.28593240, '18° 17\' 9.356640\"', 121.82908490, '121° 49\' 44.705640\"', 'CGY-3919 From Camalaniugan junction, travel E to reach the town of Buguey. From Pattao junction leading to Centro, travel N to reach a concrete bridge passing Buguey Lagoon. Station is at the SW corner of the bridge, near the fish port of Centro, Buguey. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, set 2 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3919, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.28593240, '18° 17\' 9.356630\"', 121.82908490, '121° 49\' 44.705790\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.3530, 0.0000, '4', 7.6449, 376238.20820, 2022217.28500, '51', 18.28764790, '18° 17\' 15.532430\"', 121.82781300, '121° 49\' 40.126900\"', 11.1680, 2022794.91800, 587525.64100, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6886, 'CGY-3920', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BUGUEY', 'SAN LORENZO', 2007, 18.22651578, '18° 13\' 35.456808\"', 121.82749160, '121° 49\' 38.969760\"', 'CGY-3920 Station is located in front of Sta. Isabel brgy. hall. From Camalaniugan junction, travel E until reaching Pattao Public Market, travel for approx. 15 km. until reaching the juction going to Sta. Isabel Proper. Station is located at he S part of the stage infront of brgy. hall. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail centered in a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.0 m copper nail, set 2 cm above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3920, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.22651578, '18° 13\' 35.456820\"', 121.82749160, '121° 49\' 38.969650\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.1140, 0.0000, '4', 18.0679, 376027.61910, 2015643.45400, '51', 18.22822779, '18° 13\' 41.620050\"', 121.82621830, '121° 49\' 34.385830\"', 21.7370, 2016217.46100, 587386.73200, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
