(6922, 'CGY-3964', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'MALANAO', 2007, 18.18868610, '18° 11\' 19.269960\"', 121.62957500, '121° 37\' 46.470000\"', 'CGY-3964 Station is located on the left walkway of the bridge, and approx. 500 m from Malanao welcome arch. From Magapit junction travel along Nat\'l Road going to Ilocos for about 6 Km. to reach San Lorenzo junction, from that junction turn right to the brgy. road leading to Brgy. Catugan, continue travel until you reach Brgy. Malanao. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3964, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.18868610, '18° 11\' 19.269950\"', 121.62957500, '121° 37\' 46.469930\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.2850, 0.0000, '4', 13.0951, 355067.08810, 2011602.35600, '51', 18.19040004, '18° 11\' 25.440150\"', 121.62830050, '121° 37\' 41.881760\"', 17.2570, 2011947.68600, 566467.09600, '3', 354931.59300, 2011671.91000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6923, 'CGY-3965', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'MALANAO', 2007, 18.20191081, '18° 12\' 6.878916\"', 121.64792800, '121° 38\' 52.540800\"', 'CGY-3965 From Magapit junction travel along Nat\'l Road going to Ilocos for about 6.2 Km. to reach San Lorenzo junction, turn right to the brgy. road going N continue travel and you passed by brgy. Catugan, Malanao, until you reach Brgy. Fabrica, and from Brgy. Fabrica Proper turn right on intersection road beside brgy tanod outpost to reach the station. Station is located infront of brgy. hall. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3965, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.20191081, '18° 12\' 6.878930\"', 121.64792800, '121° 38\' 52.540960\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.3140, 0.0000, '4', 9.1872, 357019.14490, 2013051.44800, '51', 18.20362516, '18° 12\' 13.050570\"', 121.64665390, '121° 38\' 47.953990\"', 13.2860, 2013418.14600, 568403.58500, '3', 356883.70600, 2013120.95400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6924, 'CGY-3966', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'MAPURAO', 2007, 18.16411318, '18° 9\' 50.807448\"', 121.49921290, '121° 29\' 57.166440\"', 'CGY-3966 Station is located at the top of plant box of the Mapurao brgy. marker, is about 50 m from the house of brgy. council Jhonny Bumanglag, approx. 5 m away to the centerline of the brgy. road. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3966, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.16411318, '18° 9\' 50.807440\"', 121.49921290, '121° 29\' 57.166480\"', 0.0000, '0', 66.7970, 0.0000, '4', 28.1819, 341255.63210, 2008990.76900, '51', 18.16582842, '18° 9\' 56.982300\"', 121.49793760, '121° 29\' 52.575490\"', 33.0000, 2009185.92100, 552683.23300, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6925, 'CGY-3967', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'CAPAGARAN', 2007, 18.16015486, '18° 9\' 36.557496\"', 121.52272320, '121° 31\' 21.803520\"', 'CGY-3967 Station is located in front of brgy. hall. From Magapit junction travel on NW direction passing Magapit Bridge, Logac junction, continue travel until you reach Labben turn left at intersection beside Alig Valley marker before Labben-Besang Elem. School, continue travel on brgy. rough road to reach Brgy. Capagaran, for about 10 Km. from the Nat\'l Road. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3967, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.16015486, '18° 9\' 36.557510\"', 121.52272320, '121° 31\' 21.803550\"', 0.0000, '0', 73.1370, 0.0000, '4', 34.5884, 343739.34140, 2008532.55500, '51', 18.16186937, '18° 9\' 42.729730\"', 121.52144790, '121° 31\' 17.212380\"', 39.2710, 2008754.65400, 555171.98300, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6926, 'CGY-3968', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'CAPAGARAN', 2007, 18.15717154, '18° 9\' 25.817544\"', 121.52355950, '121° 31\' 24.814200\"', 'CGY-3968 From Allacapan Proper travel E for about approx. 4 Km. to reach the junction of Labben, Turn right to the junction of Labben travel S for approx. 10 Km. until you reach the brgy. hall. From the brgy. hall travel SE for about 350 m leading to Capagaran Elem. school. Station is located behind the flagpole. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3968, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.15717154, '18° 9\' 25.817530\"', 121.52355950, '121° 31\' 24.814180\"', 0.0000, '0', 73.5820, 0.0000, '4', 35.0283, 343825.16440, 2008201.68600, '51', 18.15888584, '18° 9\' 31.989040\"', 121.52228410, '121° 31\' 20.222770\"', 39.7040, 2008424.70500, 555261.39900, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6927, 'CGY-3969', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'NAGATTATAN', 2007, 18.13947336, '18° 8\' 22.104096\"', 121.49608650, '121° 29\' 45.911400\"', 'CGY-3969 Travel along Nat\'l Road from Logac junction going to Allacapan Town Proper turn left of intersection road on a marker of Brgy. Alig leading to a brgy. rough road, passing Brgy. Capagaran, Mapurao, turn left on a junction at Brgy. Mapirao that will leads Brgy. Nagattatan, the station is in Brgy. Nagattatan, Allacapan, Cagayan. It is located on a open basketball court in front of Nagattatan multi-purpose hall particularly at the road to the station is 45 mins.. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3969, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.13947336, '18° 8\' 22.104100\"', 121.49608650, '121° 29\' 45.911560\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.2170, 0.0000, '4', 29.5125, 340902.57860, 2006266.61400, '51', 18.14118720, '18° 8\' 28.273930\"', 121.49481070, '121° 29\' 41.318510\"', 34.3470, 2006457.88400, 552359.72600, '3', 340766.82800, 2006336.55200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6928, 'CGY-3970', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'NAGATTATAN', 2007, 18.14418865, '18° 8\' 39.079140\"', 121.49736600, '121° 29\' 50.517600\"', 'CGY-3970 Station is located at the multi-purpose drier pavement of Brgy. Nagattatan, approx. 25 cm E of the pavement, 15 m from the NW corner of the house of Mr. Bert Danantan. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3970, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.14418865, '18° 8\' 39.079130\"', 121.49736600, '121° 29\' 50.517680\"', 0.0000, '0', 85.9600, 0.0000, '4', 47.2754, 341042.22070, 2006787.34200, '51', 18.14590274, '18° 8\' 45.249850\"', 121.49609030, '121° 29\' 45.925050\"', 52.1020, 2006980.13500, 552493.72500, '3', 340906.48700, 2006857.27900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6929, 'CGY-3971', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'LABBEN', 2007, 18.20105048, '18° 12\' 3.781728\"', 121.56115730, '121° 33\' 40.166280\"', 'CGY-3971 Station is located inside the pathway of Labben-Besang Elem. School. Approx. 20 m from Nat\'l Road to station. Travel along Nat\'l Road going to Ilocos passing Logac junction, continue travel on Nat\'l road until you reach Besang-Labben at the right side of the road. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3971, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.20105048, '18° 12\' 3.781730\"', 121.56115730, '121° 33\' 40.166290\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.7190, 0.0000, '4', 14.4039, 347840.92390, 2013026.07200, '51', 18.20276660, '18° 12\' 9.959760\"', 121.55988300, '121° 33\' 35.578730\"', 18.8960, 2013292.93200, 559224.92200, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6930, 'CGY-3972', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'CENTRO EAST', 2007, 18.22684163, '18° 13\' 36.629868\"', 121.55298610, '121° 33\' 10.749960\"', 'CGY-3972 Station is located N side of Allacapan Vocational High School, and it is located on a concrete canal, approx. 275 m from CGY-91. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3972, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.22684163, '18° 13\' 36.629870\"', 121.55298610, '121° 33\' 10.749840\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.9810, 0.0000, '4', 8.7409, 346999.19480, 2015887.10500, '51', 18.22855946, '18° 13\' 42.814040\"', 121.55171230, '121° 33\' 6.164370\"', 13.2620, 2016144.95300, 558352.00800, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6931, 'CGY-3973', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'DAGUPAN', 2007, 18.21398426, '18° 12\' 50.343336\"', 121.55572360, '121° 33\' 20.604960\"', 'CGY-3973 Travel along Nat\'l Road from Magapit Bridge going to Logac junction, Brgy. Besang, Labben, continue travel until you reach Brgy. Dagupan, Allacapan, Cagayan. Station is located at NW part of walkway bridge before the intersection of the road going to Brgy. Burot. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3973, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.21398426, '18° 12\' 50.343350\"', 121.55572360, '121° 33\' 20.605110\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.3400, 0.0000, '4', 12.0552, 347277.48630, 2014461.93200, '51', 18.21570127, '18° 12\' 56.524560\"', 121.55444960, '121° 33\' 16.018600\"', 16.5730, 2014722.73800, 558645.83100, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6932, 'CGY-3975', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'BUROT', 2007, 18.21944334, '18° 13\' 9.996024\"', 121.56897900, '121° 34\' 8.324400\"', 'CGY-3975 Station is located NW corner of basketball court fronting the brgy. hall of Burot. From Magapit junction travel NW direction about 16.5 Km. to reach the junction at Brgy. Dagupan, turn right at the access road leading to Brgy. Burot. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3975, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.21944334, '18° 13\' 9.996030\"', 121.56897900, '121° 34\' 8.324490\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.0920, 0.0000, '4', 14.8595, 348684.10930, 2015055.07200, '51', 18.22116039, '18° 13\' 16.177400\"', 121.56770510, '121° 34\' 3.738510\"', 19.3110, 2015331.22300, 560046.07400, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6933, 'CGY-3976', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'BUROT', 2007, 18.22347221, '18° 13\' 24.499956\"', 121.56979670, '121° 34\' 11.268120\"', 'CGY-3976 From Magapit Bridge travel for about 16.5 Km. until you reach the junction of Brgy. Dagupan, turn right to the access road leading to Brgy. Burot. Station is located at the pavement. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.0 m concrete monument, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3976, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.22347221, '18° 13\' 24.499970\"', 121.56979670, '121° 34\' 11.268070\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.2490, 0.0000, '4', 12.0340, 348774.06400, 2015500.25800, '51', 18.22518948, '18° 13\' 30.682130\"', 121.56852290, '121° 34\' 6.682430\"', 16.4790, 2015777.41500, 560131.18700, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6934, 'CGY-3977', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'MATUCAY', 2007, 18.26618678, '18° 15\' 58.272408\"', 121.54779740, '121° 32\' 52.070640\"', 'CGY-3977 From Magapit travel along Nat\'l Road going to Ilocos, passing Logac junction and Allacapan Town Proper, continue travel about 5 Km. to reach Brgy. Matucay. Station was established at the left side of Nat\'l Road going to Ilocos, and in front of Botika ng Brgy. at talipapa and 7 m from concrete marker of Purok Camia. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3977, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.26618678, '18° 15\' 58.272400\"', 121.54779740, '121° 32\' 52.070700\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.7850, 0.0000, '4', 9.7130, 346485.03740, 2020245.68600, '51', 18.26790704, '18° 16\' 4.465330\"', 121.54652460, '121° 32\' 47.488470\"', 14.2080, 2020498.13800, 557790.30300, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
