(6935, 'CGY-3978', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'CATARATAN', 2007, 18.23844852, '18° 14\' 18.414672\"', 121.50604150, '121° 30\' 21.749400\"', 'CGY-3978 Station is located at the center of pavement property of Brgy. Capt. Virgilio Dalire, SW of entrance of the property. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3978, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.23844852, '18° 14\' 18.414660\"', 121.50604150, '121° 30\' 21.749420\"', 0.0000, '0', 59.6370, 0.0000, '4', 21.3445, 342045.07080, 2017211.49200, '51', 18.24016801, '18° 14\' 24.604850\"', 121.50476800, '121° 30\' 17.164660\"', 26.0680, 2017415.41200, 553383.27300, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6936, 'CGY-3980', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PEÑABLANCA', 'BALIUAG', 2007, 17.55297267, '17° 33\' 10.701612\"', 121.83547830, '121° 50\' 7.721880\"', 'CGY-3980 Station is located NW of the concrete pavement, 4.30 m from wooden electric post and 6.0 m from the centerline of the road. From the junction of Maharlika Highway and road leading to Brgy. Baliuag which is located at Brgy. Namabbalan, travel E passing mountain range up to Brgy. Baliuag about 6.5 Km., upon reaching junction road leading to Brgy. Bical and road leading Brgy. Baliuag Proper, continue travel about 750 m to reach the station. Station is marked by a 0.004 m x 0.10 m copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.00 m concrete block set, 0.20 m above the ground, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3980, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.55297267, '17° 33\' 10.701600\"', 121.83547830, '121° 50\' 7.722040\"', 0.0000, '0', 93.8630, 0.0000, '4', 54.0836, 376406.78750, 1941108.13600, '51', 17.55464418, '17° 33\' 16.719040\"', 121.83418950, '121° 50\' 3.082160\"', 57.2730, 1941670.86500, 588563.34500, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6937, 'CGY-3981', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'DAAN-ILI', 2007, 18.23854767, '18° 14\' 18.771612\"', 121.55504860, '121° 33\' 18.174960\"', 'CGY-3981 From Allacapan to Ballesteros turn right and travel about 350 m until you reach the brgy. hall of Daan-ili. The Station is located at the pavement of brgy. hall, and approx. 2 m away left side of the brgy. hall, and 10 m away N of brgy. hall. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3981, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.23854767, '18° 14\' 18.771610\"', 121.55504860, '121° 33\' 18.174940\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.3010, 0.0000, '4', 10.1120, 347227.53890, 2017180.85800, '51', 18.24026614, '18° 14\' 24.958110\"', 121.55377510, '121° 33\' 13.590460\"', 14.6160, 2017441.25900, 558566.26800, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6938, 'CGY-3982', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'LOGAC', 2007, 18.15143914, '18° 9\' 5.180904\"', 121.60687690, '121° 36\' 24.756840\"', 'CGY-3982 From Magapit crossing travel along Nat\'l Road going to Ilocos. Turn left on Logac junction continue until you reach the old brgy. hall for about 300 m. The station is located on the SE corner of solar drier besides the old brgy. hall. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3982, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.15143914, '18° 9\' 5.180890\"', 121.60687690, '121° 36\' 24.756780\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.5060, 0.0000, '4', 12.1879, 352634.95090, 2007498.51300, '51', 18.15315135, '18° 9\' 11.344860\"', 121.60560150, '121° 36\' 20.165360\"', 16.4100, 2007817.07900, 564079.31400, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
