(6949, 'CGY-3998', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BALLESTEROS', 'CABARITAN EAST', 2007, 18.42002982, '18° 25\' 12.107352\"', 121.49462990, '121° 29\' 40.667640\"', 'CGY-3998 Station is located inside the compound of Cabaritan East Elem. School, at the edge of flagpole flatform. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-3998, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.42002982, '18° 25\' 12.107340\"', 121.49462990, '121° 29\' 40.667790\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.8930, 0.0000, '4', 9.8367, 341004.39120, 2037317.11900, '51', 18.42176027, '18° 25\' 18.336970\"', 121.49336060, '121° 29\' 36.098040\"', 13.9520, 2037510.05000, 552122.39600, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6950, 'CGY-3999 (CGY-243)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BALLESTEROS', 'CABARITAN EAST', 2007, 18.42100989, '18° 25\' 15.635604\"', 121.49171910, '121° 29\' 30.188760\"', 'CGY-3999 (CGY-243) Station is located inside the compound of Cabaritan East Elem. School, at the edge of flagpole flatform. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-243, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.42100989, '18° 25\' 15.635610\"', 121.49171910, '121° 29\' 30.188610\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.7470, 0.0000, '4', 9.6955, 340697.79200, 2037428.14200, '51', 18.42274047, '18° 25\' 21.865690\"', 121.49044970, '121° 29\' 25.618880\"', 13.8160, 2037617.70100, 551814.56900, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6951, 'CGY-4 (MA 1924-25)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CALAYAN', 'NAGUILLAN', 1924, 18.87586501, '18° 52\' 33.114036\"', 121.82202680, '121° 49\' 19.296480\"', 'CGY-4 1989 (Formerly MA, 1924-1925) In center of top of high bluff forming the extreme NE tip of Penon Island. At this point, the shore turns sharply to S at one side and to W on the other side. A large cogon field extends in a direction S 70° W for about a mile to edge of tree line. The smaller of the 2 Guinapac rocks stands just clear to S of the larger one, and the 3 Didicas rocks show separately and distinctly. The top of the point is nearly flat with a number of large, black boulders, scattered over the southern half, the northern half being covered with shore bristle-like grass. Station is located in a small island of Penon. It is on top of the most N boulder of the group, the boulder standing 1 m. x 1 m. x 0.60 m. with natural depression into which station mark is fitted. Some people in Brgy. Naguillan know the station in Penon Island like Mr. Hispicio Capalaran. It is accessible by pump boat. Station mark is an old station was recovered and refurbished. 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in concrete patty 25 cm. x 25 cm. on top of a boulder flush with the surface and inscribed with the station name. Reference mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in concrete cement patty on top of a boulder flush with the surface and inscribed with the station name. RM-1, RM-2 and RM-3 are 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods set on a concrete patties on top of boulders.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.87586501, '18° 52\' 33.114050\"', 121.82202680, '121° 49\' 19.296450\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.4634, 0.0000, '1', 41.2400, 375919.83820, 2087504.97500, '51', 18.87761528, '18° 52\' 39.414990\"', 121.82076850, '121° 49\' 14.766500\"', 43.2640, 2088092.03200, 586482.65300, '3', 375786.73500, 2087574.42100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6952, 'CGY-40 (CGN-113)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CLAVERIA', 'PATA WEST', 1905, 18.61941785, '18° 37\' 9.904260\"', 121.13770030, '121° 8\' 15.721080\"', 'CGY-40 The mark is set on the ground within the Brgy. proper of Pata West. Mark is located approximately 70 m. WNW from the main gate of Pata West Elementary School about 6 m. SSW from the centerline of the national highway, about 2.5 m. NNE from NW corner of the shed, and 0.52 cm. SSW from the old Brgy. mark/monument. Mark is the head of 1\" concrete nail embedded on a concrete block 40 cm x 40 cm, 10 cm above ground surface with inscription CGN 113 2005 FNSP.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.61941785, '18° 37\' 9.904250\"', 121.13770030, '121° 8\' 15.721220\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.3060, 0.0000, '2', 11.4267, 303524.11900, 2059737.47100, '51', 18.62116748, '18° 37\' 16.202930\"', 121.13643500, '121° 8\' 11.165940\"', 15.8800, 2059514.01100, 514397.21200, '3', 303389.71100, 2059808.89100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1905-01-01', 'JHO', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6953, 'CGY-4000', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ABULUG', 'CENTRO', 2007, 18.44184362, '18° 26\' 30.637032\"', 121.45740110, '121° 27\' 26.643960\"', 'CGY-4000 Station is located at the compound od Abulug Central Elem. School, at the triangular landscape of Ornamental Plants, about 15 m NW side of the principal\'s office, and approx. 20 m N of the Nat\'l Road centerline. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4000, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.44184362, '18° 26\' 30.637040\"', 121.45740110, '121° 27\' 26.643990\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.4720, 0.0000, '4', 9.5553, 337092.11940, 2039764.38900, '51', 18.44357614, '18° 26\' 36.874100\"', 121.45613220, '121° 27\' 22.075830\"', 13.6920, 2039914.26200, 548183.15500, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Abner Belmonte', '2017-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6954, 'CGY-4001', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ABULUG', 'DANA-ILI', 2007, 18.42202636, '18° 25\' 19.294896\"', 121.42331340, '121° 25\' 23.928240\"', 'CGY-4001 From Magapit junction passing Magapit Bridge travel along Nat\'l Road going to Ilocos Region passing Mun. of Allacapan junction Luna, from junction Luna to the intersection leading to Brgy. Dana-ili is about 6 Km. Station is located at the left side of brgy. road about 20 m from the first waiting shed and beside the 2nd lamp post of Dana-ili. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.0 m concrete monument, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4001, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.42202636, '18° 25\' 19.294900\"', 121.42331340, '121° 25\' 23.928380\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.3350, 0.0000, '4', 8.1768, 333472.44090, 2037602.12900, '51', 18.42375843, '18° 25\' 25.530350\"', 121.42204400, '121° 25\' 19.358380\"', 12.5700, 2037712.17800, 544587.33200, '3', 333337.57300, 2037672.50400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6955, 'CGY-4002', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'CENTRO', 2007, 18.46816394, '18° 28\' 5.390184\"', 121.34410220, '121° 20\' 38.767920\"', 'CGY-4002 Station is located at the S of waiting shed, approx. 8.5 m away from the centerline of Nat\'l Road, 2 m away from the waiting shed, and approx. 500 m from Mun. Bldg. Travel along Nat\'l Road going to Ilocos Region passing Logac junction, Allacapan, Luna junction, continue travel until you reach Centro Pamplona. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.0 m concrete monument, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4002, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.46816394, '18° 28\' 5.390170\"', 121.34410220, '121° 20\' 38.767780\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.5960, 0.0000, '4', 9.6071, 325151.12450, 2042783.18300, '51', 18.46990038, '18° 28\' 11.641370\"', 121.34283370, '121° 20\' 34.201150\"', 14.1740, 2042801.32000, 536209.30400, '3', 325016.35500, 2042853.84200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Abner Belmonte', '2017-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6956, 'CGY-4003', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ABULUG', 'SANTO TOMAS', 2007, 18.45388080, '18° 27\' 13.970880\"', 121.40498730, '121° 24\' 17.954280\"', 'CGY-4003 Travel along Nat\'l Road going to NW direction passing Magapit Bridge, Logac junction, continue travel about 6 Km. to reach the marker of Dana-ili just after Brgy. Curva, turn right at the access road leading to Dana-ili, from Dana-ili marke a left turn at the intersection road leading to Brgy. Tayak after the lodging site at brgy. Dana-ili. The station is located at the flagpole of Tayak Elementary School. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4003, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.45388080, '18° 27\' 13.970880\"', 121.40498730, '121° 24\' 17.954330\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.9250, 0.0000, '4', 6.0031, 331567.50790, 2041144.57900, '51', 18.45561513, '18° 27\' 20.214460\"', 121.40371860, '121° 24\' 13.386860\"', 10.3100, 2041233.55000, 542643.43700, '3', 331432.73200, 2041215.03600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6957, 'CGY-4004', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ABULUG', 'SANTO TOMAS', 2007, 18.45223740, '18° 27\' 8.054640\"', 121.40689880, '121° 24\' 24.835680\"', 'CGY-4004 Station is located at the edge of irrigation canal, approx. 315 m from the CGY-4003. From Allacapan going to Claveria along Nat\'l Road, turn right going to Dana-ili, approx. 4.5 Km. from Dana-ili to Brgy. Tayak. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4004, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.45223740, '18° 27\' 8.054630\"', 121.40689880, '121° 24\' 24.835630\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.5300, 0.0000, '4', 5.5988, 331767.79910, 2040960.91600, '51', 18.45397159, '18° 27\' 14.297720\"', 121.40563000, '121° 24\' 20.268040\"', 9.9060, 2041052.10100, 542845.74600, '3', 331633.01900, 2041031.36500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6958, 'CGY-4005', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'BIDDUANG', 2007, 18.51712468, '18° 31\' 1.648848\"', 121.30841020, '121° 18\' 30.276720\"', 'CGY-4005 Station is located at the NE side of brgy. marker Sitio Dubeng. From the centerline of the Nat\'l Road is approx. 6 m. Travel along Nat\'l Road going to NW direction passing Magapit Bridge, Logac junction, Allacapan, Luna junction, until you reach Pamplona Town Proper continue travel along Nat\'l Road passing Brgy. Allassitan until you reach Brgy. Bidduang abpit 3.1 Km. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4005, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.51712468, '18° 31\' 1.648850\"', 121.30841020, '121° 18\' 30.276660\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.6300, 0.0000, '4', 9.9890, 321432.24090, 2048237.08100, '51', 18.51886475, '18° 31\' 7.913110\"', 121.30714270, '121° 18\' 25.713850\"', 14.4559, 2048213.72800, 532430.46500, '3', 321297.60800, 2048307.88800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6959, 'CGY-4006', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANCHEZ-MIRA', 'BANGAN', 2007, 18.53362009, '18° 32\' 1.032324\"', 121.27424850, '121° 16\' 27.294600\"', 'CGY-4006 Station is located about 350 m away W of the welcome arch of Sanchez Mira and almost 320 m from the NW side of Sitio Tagipuro Elem. School. It is located at the riprap of Bangan Bridge # 2 at about 1 m away at the W part of the bridge, then 6 m away from the centerline of the Nat\'l Road. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.0 n concrete monument, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4006, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.53362009, '18° 32\' 1.032330\"', 121.27424850, '121° 16\' 27.294770\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.7890, 0.0000, '4', 8.1761, 317842.67660, 2050097.00700, '51', 18.53536184, '18° 32\' 7.302630\"', 121.27298140, '121° 16\' 22.733180\"', 12.7510, 2050033.76200, 528820.66800, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6960, 'CGY-4007', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'BALINGIT', 2007, 18.51717200, '18° 31\' 1.819200\"', 121.27616280, '121° 16\' 34.186080\"', 'CGY-4007 Station is located at the SE corner of concrete bridge pavement. From Sanchez Mira Town Proper, travel E leading to Pamplona Town Proper for about 7 Km. to reach the junction at Brgy. Nagattatan. Turn right at this juction and travel again for about 3 Km. to reach the bridge at Brgy. Balingit. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4007, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.51717200, '18° 31\' 1.819210\"', 121.27616280, '121° 16\' 34.186060\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.6950, 0.0000, '4', 9.9126, 318027.37100, 2048274.55800, '51', 18.51891276, '18° 31\' 8.085920\"', 121.27489530, '121° 16\' 29.623070\"', 14.5981, 2048213.54700, 529025.50500, '3', 317892.71600, 2048345.46800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6961, 'CGY-4008', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANCHEZ-MIRA', 'CENTRO I', 2007, 18.55999519, '18° 33\' 35.982684\"', 121.23791050, '121° 14\' 16.477800\"', 'CGY-4008 Station is located at the solar drier, approx. 300 m away along the Nat\'l Road. Travel along Nat\'l Road going to NW direction passing Magapit Bridge, Logac junction, Allacapan, junction Lunha, Pamplona until you reach Sanchez Mira. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4008, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.55999519, '18° 33\' 35.982670\"', 121.23791050, '121° 14\' 16.477890\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.6460, 0.0000, '4', 9.1854, 314034.71370, 2053053.45000, '51', 18.56173924, '18° 33\' 42.261260\"', 121.23664400, '121° 14\' 11.918270\"', 13.7830, 2052947.68600, 524980.39800, '3', 313900.17600, 2053124.51000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6962, 'CGY-4010', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANCHEZ-MIRA', 'MASISIT', 2007, 18.58638464, '18° 35\' 10.984704\"', 121.22026420, '121° 13\' 12.951120\"', 'CGY-4010 Station is located at he basketball court at SW side, approx. 18 m away of NW part of the brgy. hall, then 7 m from the centerline of the road. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.0 m concrete monument, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4010, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.58638464, '18° 35\' 10.984710\"', 121.22026420, '121° 13\' 12.950970\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.2100, 0.0000, '4', 10.0137, 312200.80260, 2055992.71500, '51', 18.58813061, '18° 35\' 17.270190\"', 121.21899820, '121° 13\' 8.393450\"', 14.4770, 2055866.22800, 523114.12600, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6963, 'CGY-4011', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANCHEZ-MIRA', 'NAGRANGTAYAN', 2007, 18.60370749, '18° 36\' 13.346964\"', 121.18088280, '121° 10\' 51.178080\"', 'CGY-4011 Station is located at the NW end of foot walk of Nagrangtayan Bridge. From Sanchez Mira Town Proper, travel W leading to Ilocos Region for about 7 Km. up to Nagrangtayan Bridge. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4011, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.60370749, '18° 36\' 13.346980\"', 121.18088280, '121° 10\' 51.177930\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.3010, 0.0000, '4', 10.2401, 308063.55540, 2057951.76500, '51', 18.60545530, '18° 36\' 19.639070\"', 121.17961710, '121° 10\' 46.621620\"', 14.7200, 2057779.05300, 518955.72900, '3', 307929.12500, 2058023.03600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6964, 'CGY-4012', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANCHEZ-MIRA', 'CALLUNGAN', 2007, 18.58853524, '18° 35\' 18.726864\"', 121.20004920, '121° 12\' 0.177120\"', 'CGY-4012 From Pamplona going to Claveria along Nat\'l highway, you reach Brgy. Callungan, station is located at the edge of Purok 1 and 2 marker. Approx. 405 m from CGY-4013 and 3 m from Nat\'l Highway. Station is marked by a 4 in. copper nail, set at the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m x 1.0 m concrete monument, with inscriptions, \"CGY-4012, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.58853524, '18° 35\' 18.726880\"', 121.20004920, '121° 12\' 0.177290\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.0340, 0.0000, '4', 10.8071, 310069.53300, 2056252.00900, '51', 18.59028176, '18° 35\' 25.014330\"', 121.19878330, '121° 11\' 55.619830\"', 15.3560, 2056101.83000, 520980.27800, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6965, 'CGY-41 (CGY-3555)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CLAVERIA', 'MALILITAO', 1905, 18.56212941, '18° 33\' 43.665876\"', 121.11403970, '121° 6\' 50.542920\"', 'CGY-41 From Claveria public market, travel going to the national road and upon crossing the Punton bridge, turn right at the road going to Calanasan, Apayao. The junction of the road where the Grassroot Gas station is located. Follow the road passing thru Brgy. Pinas, San Antonio and going to the direction of Brgy. Luzon. Upon reaching the intersection of the road going to Brgy. Luzon and brgy. Malilitao, turn left and follow the road to Malilitao. The station is located 20 m. from the junction of road along the road going to Malilitao and 4.0 m. after the footing of the welcome marker of Brgy. Malilitao and also located at the right side of road, 3.50 m. from the center of the road. Mark is the head of 1 inch concrete nail centered on a concrete monument, 40 cm. x 40 cm. with 15 cm. protrusion and inscribed with station name \"CGN 123, 2005, FNSP\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.56212941, '18° 33\' 43.665890\"', 121.11403970, '121° 6\' 50.543020\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.9730, 0.0000, '2', 11.2338, 300960.59510, 2053422.24100, '51', 18.56387619, '18° 33\' 49.954300\"', 121.11277300, '121° 6\' 45.982860\"', 16.4128, 2053171.50300, 511904.27500, '3', 300825.98000, 2053493.69500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1905-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6966, 'CGY-4109 (BLLM-1A)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALCALA', 'CENTRO NORTE', 2012, 17.90231341, '17° 54\' 8.328276\"', 121.65408190, '121° 39\' 14.694840\"', 'CGY-4109 (BLLM-1A) Station is marked by a copper nail centered in a cement putty, with inscriptions, \"BLLM No. 1\". The Bureau of Land Location Monument is to be found in Brgy. Centro Norte, Municipality of Alcala, Province of Cagayan. The monument is in front of the Roman Catholic Church of Alcala, located on the pathwalk.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.90231341, '17° 54\' 8.328280\"', 121.65408190, '121° 39\' 14.694790\"', 0.0000, '0', 73.2960, 0.0000, '3', 35.0126, 357428.62390, 1979892.74800, '51', 17.90400979, '17° 54\' 14.435250\"', 121.65280080, '121° 39\' 10.082900\"', 38.2725, 1980260.39100, 569170.92600, '3', 357292.20300, 1979962.01000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6967, 'CGY-4110 (BLLM-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALCALA', 'CENTRO SUR', 2012, 17.90070443, '17° 54\' 2.535948\"', 121.65580440, '121° 39\' 20.895840\"', 'CGY-4110 (BLLM-2) Mark is the head of 4\" brass rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"ALCALA,CAG., BLLM NO.2, CAD 1306-D, LMS, 2012\". The newly established Bureau of Land Location Monument is to be found in Brgy. Centro Sur, Municipality of Alcala, Province of Cagayan. The monument is along the barangay road near the basketball court and beside the barangay marker.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.90070443, '17° 54\' 2.535930\"', 121.65580440, '121° 39\' 20.896000\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.8540, 0.0000, '3', 16.5727, 357609.83540, 1979713.38000, '51', 17.90240068, '17° 54\' 8.642440\"', 121.65452330, '121° 39\' 16.283970\"', 19.8211, 1980082.94400, 569354.07700, '3', 357473.41000, 1979782.63700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(6968, 'CGY-4111 (BLLM-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALCALA', 'CENTRO SUR', 2012, 17.90108476, '17° 54\' 3.905136\"', 121.65772070, '121° 39\' 27.794520\"', 'Mark is the head of 4\" brass rod flushed in a cement block embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"ALCALA,CAG., BLLM NO.3, CAD 1306-D, LMS, 2012\". The newly established Bureau of Land Location Monument is to be found in Brgy. Centro Sur, Municipality of Alcala, Province of Cagayan. The monument is along the northeast side of the intersection of barangay roads across the barangay chapel.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.90108476, '17° 54\' 3.905120\"', 121.65772070, '121° 39\' 27.794590\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.7770, 0.0000, '3', 30.4984, 357813.15920, 1979754.00400, '51', 17.90278099, '17° 54\' 10.011550\"', 121.65643960, '121° 39\' 23.182610\"', 33.7408, 1980125.74900, 569556.98800, '3', 357676.73700, 1979823.25400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
