(7038, 'CGY-43', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SANTA PRAXEDES', 'SAN JUAN', 1905, 18.57104425, '18° 34\' 15.759300\"', 120.99014940, '120° 59\' 24.537840\"', 'CGY-43 From Sta. Praxedes municipality hall, travel north for about 1 km. until reaching km. post 594 on the west side of national highway. The station is about 100 m. north of San Juan Multipurpose pavement of waiting shed, about 150 m. south of checkpoints of police, BFAR & DENR. about 5 m. west of centerline of national highway & 0.65 m. west of km. post 594. Mark is the head of 1\" concrete nail centered on a concrete monument 40 cm. x 40 cm. with protrusion of 15 cm. and inscribed with sta. name \"CGN 92, 2005 FNSP\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.57104425, '18° 34\' 15.759290\"', 120.99014940, '120° 59\' 24.537720\"', 0.0000, '0', 107.3520, 0.0000, '2', 70.8920, 287892.37770, 2054550.69400, '51', 18.57279399, '18° 34\' 22.058370\"', 120.98888270, '120° 59\' 19.977750\"', 76.1170, 2054154.79200, 498826.52500, '3', 287757.71300, 2054622.53200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1905-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7039, 'CGY-45 (PMP-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'GATTU', 2005, 18.47475618, '18° 28\' 29.122248\"', 121.31119940, '121° 18\' 40.317840\"', 'CGY-45 (PMP-03) To reach the station, travel for 10 mins. starting from the town proper following the natl. road until reaching the junction going to Casitan. Follow the brgy. road until reaching Sitio San Jose. Station is located at the intersection of an irrigation canal and a service road (private), at the property of former S.B. Galano. It is also situated 3 kms. NW of Pamplona proper. Mark is the head of a concrete nail centered and embedded in a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. monument protruding 0.1 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"PMP 03, CAD 1204, 2005 FNSP\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.47475618, '18° 28\' 29.122250\"', 121.31119940, '121° 18\' 40.317960\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.5920, 0.0000, '2', 10.5286, 321682.88720, 2043544.95400, '51', 18.47649370, '18° 28\' 35.377330\"', 121.30993100, '121° 18\' 35.751690\"', 15.2700, 2043524.77000, 532732.92400, '3', 321548.11700, 2043615.72200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
