(7266, 'CGY-47A (BLLM-5)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'BALINGIT', 2006, 18.51277589, '18° 30\' 45.993204\"', 121.27253720, '121° 16\' 21.133920\"', 'CGY-47 (BLLM-5) To reach the station, travel for 20 mins. from the Pamplona town proper going to the Municipality of Sanchez Mira. Upon reaching Nagattatan, turn left at the junction going to Brgy. Ballingit then follow the brgy. road in the direction to Brgy. Gamara, Sanchez Mira. Station is located about 170 m. SE of CGY-39, at the property of Mr. Ilac. It is also situated 9 kms. NW of Pamplona proper. Mark is the head of a concrete nail centered and embedded in a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. monument protruding 0.1 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"BLLM No. 5, CAD-1215\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.51277589, '18° 30\' 45.993190\"', 121.27253720, '121° 16\' 21.134090\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.4940, 0.0000, '2', 11.6468, 317639.89600, 2047791.64800, '51', 18.51451645, '18° 30\' 52.259210\"', 121.27126970, '121° 16\' 16.570760\"', 16.3910, 2047726.40200, 528643.41200, '3', 317505.22500, 2047862.56500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
