(7639, 'CGY-52 (PMP-10)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'CABAGGAN', 2005, 18.49368725, '18° 29\' 37.274100\"', 121.34726160, '121° 20\' 50.141760\"', 'CGY-52 (PMP-10) To reach the station, travel for 5 mins. starting from Pamplona proper going to the direction of the Municipality of sanchez Mira. Upon reaching the junction of Cabaggan, turn right until reaching Cabaggan Elem. School. Station is located inside the said school. It is also situated 4 kms. NW of Pamplona proper. Mark is the head of a concrete nail centered and embedded in a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. monument protruding 0.1 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"PMP 10, CAD 1204, 2005, FNSP\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.49368725, '18° 29\' 37.274100\"', 121.34726160, '121° 20\' 50.141600\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.6680, 0.0000, '2', 7.9407, 325510.64200, 2045605.01700, '51', 18.49542513, '18° 29\' 43.530450\"', 121.34599360, '121° 20\' 45.577110\"', 12.3240, 2045626.93800, 536537.65000, '3', 325375.95900, 2045675.68400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '');
