(7785, 'CGY-54 (CGN-186)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'SANTA CRUZ', 2005, 18.41675661, '18° 25\' 0.323796\"', 121.37195860, '121° 22\' 19.050960\"', 'CGY-54 (CGN-186) To reach the station, travel for 7 mins. starting from Pamplona proper going to the direction of the Municipality of Abulug until reaching Sta. Cruz Brgy. Hall. Station is located inside the compound of the brgy. hall and community center, 6 m. SE from the gate of the compound and opposite the Iglesia ni Cristo Chapel. It is also situated 8 kms. SE of Pamplona proper. Mark is the head of a concrete nail centered and embedded in a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. monument protruding 0.1 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"CGN-186, 2005, FNSP\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.41675661, '18° 25\' 0.323780\"', 121.37195860, '121° 22\' 19.050900\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.4090, 0.0000, '2', 9.0520, 328042.01280, 2037066.84800, '51', 18.41848945, '18° 25\' 6.562030\"', 121.37068890, '121° 22\' 14.480130\"', 13.7501, 2037117.16800, 539162.99300, '3', 327907.09100, 2037137.38300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'JHO', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7786, 'CGY-55 (CGN-185)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PAMPLONA', 'SANTA CRUZ', 2005, 18.41734323, '18° 25\' 2.435628\"', 121.37157190, '121° 22\' 17.658840\"', 'CGY-55 (CGN-185) To reach the station, travel for 7 mins. starting from Pamplona proper going to the direction of the Municipality of Abulug until reaching Sta. Cruz Brgy. Hall. Station is located on the W side of the residence of the Brgy. Capt, beside the concrete pavement. Mark is the head of a concrete nail centered and embedded in a 0.4 m. x 0.4 m. x 1 m. monument protruding 0.1 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"CGN-185, 2005, FNSP\". NOTE: REPORTED OBSTRUCTED BY ENGR. AILA SAMPANA (JULY 29, 2015)', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.41734323, '18° 25\' 2.435630\"', 121.37157190, '121° 22\' 17.658850\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.0140, 0.0000, '2', 8.6608, 328001.74480, 2037132.14100, '51', 18.41907611, '18° 25\' 8.674010\"', 121.37030230, '121° 22\' 13.088160\"', 13.3580, 2037182.01400, 539122.00900, '3', 327866.82500, 2037202.67600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7787, 'CGY-56', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUGUEGARAO CITY', 'DADDA', 2007, 17.56871662, '17° 34\' 7.379832\"', 121.77518450, '121° 46\' 30.664200\"', 'CGY-56 Is located near the NE concrete corner fence of Brgy. Dadda Catholic Church and at the intersection of the nat\'l. highway and Cagurangan St. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-56 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.56871662, '17° 34\' 7.379840\"', 121.77518450, '121° 46\' 30.664020\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.5220, 0.0000, '2', 36.1535, 370018.12010, 1942890.48700, '51', 17.57039038, '17° 34\' 13.405360\"', 121.77389590, '121° 46\' 26.025060\"', 39.1280, 1943386.43600, 582154.71800, '3', 369880.69200, 1942959.11000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Dexter Alamar', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7788, 'CGY-57', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ENRILE', 'BARANGAY III', 2007, 17.55768084, '17° 33\' 27.651024\"', 121.68748360, '121° 41\' 14.940960\"', 'CGY-57 Station is located 4 m. S of the centerline of the access road Bunagan St., from Nat\'l. Highway No. 5, to the town proper. It is about 800 m. from the highway, 1 m. E of the S end of the E side of the irrigation canal. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-57 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.55768084, '17° 33\' 27.651030\"', 121.68748360, '121° 41\' 14.940990\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.4420, 0.0000, '2', 18.4601, 360701.24890, 1941731.54700, '51', 17.55935581, '17° 33\' 33.680910\"', 121.68619460, '121° 41\' 10.300570\"', 21.2230, 1942129.42000, 572848.61200, '3', 360563.71900, 1941800.43800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7789, 'CGY-58', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'UBONG', 2007, 17.60599168, '17° 36\' 21.570048\"', 121.60844410, '121° 36\' 30.398760\"', 'CGY-58 Station is located 15 m. E of the junction of the road leading to Brgy. Ubong and the road leading to Brgy. Karilukud. It is situated 10 m. SE of Brgy. Ubong welcome monument. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-58 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.60599168, '17° 36\' 21.570040\"', 121.60844410, '121° 36\' 30.398680\"', 0.0000, '0', 76.5900, 0.0000, '2', 37.9038, 352350.60790, 1947137.27400, '51', 17.60767124, '17° 36\' 27.616450\"', 121.60715610, '121° 36\' 25.761840\"', 40.7160, 1947447.88100, 564440.23500, '3', 352213.17900, 1947206.45200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7790, 'CGY-59', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUAO', 'TARIBUBU', 2007, 17.60439802, '17° 36\' 15.832872\"', 121.50926630, '121° 30\' 33.358680\"', 'CGY-59 Is located inside the compound of Taribubu Elem. School. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-59 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.60439802, '17° 36\' 15.832880\"', 121.50926630, '121° 30\' 33.358720\"', 0.0000, '0', 109.8530, 0.0000, '2', 70.9253, 341824.19140, 1947041.00700, '51', 17.60607959, '17° 36\' 21.886530\"', 121.50797810, '121° 30\' 28.721180\"', 74.2120, 1947240.74900, 553914.25000, '3', 341686.68400, 1947110.49700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7791, 'CGY-6', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BAGGAO', 'IMURUNG', 1990, 17.84681625, '17° 50\' 48.538500\"', 121.90237290, '121° 54\' 8.542440\"', 'CGY-6 From Tuguegarao, travel N along national highway towards Alcala town, 26 m. up to Alcala-Baggao road junction. Turn right, travel for 9 km. up to Baggao town proper. Then turn right again and travel for 30 km. up to Brgy. San Jose, where the municipal building is located. From Brgy. San Jose, travel NE along the provincial highway for 5 km. up to Brgy. Imurung. Upon reaching the barangay proper of Imurung proceed farther for 500 m. or up to where the lateral canal of irrigation meets. The station is located on the concrete flood gate W of the road. Travel time from Tuguegarao to the station is 2 hrs. Accessible by 2-wheel drive vehicle. Station mark is a cross cut on top of 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in a drill hole, centered on a 0.30 m. x 0.30 m. cement patty; 0.02 m. above the concrete surface of irrigation flood gate. Inscribed with the station name. Sub-surface mark; none. Reference marks: RM-1, RM-2, and RM-3 are cross cuts on top of 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in drill holes centered on cement patty 0.02 m. above concrete surface of irrigation flood gate. Inscribed with the reference mark numbers.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.84681625, '17° 50\' 48.538510\"', 121.90237290, '121° 54\' 8.542540\"', 0.0000, '0', 74.1383, 0.0000, '1', 35.0890, 383696.58770, 1973579.46900, '51', 17.84850403, '17° 50\' 54.614510\"', 121.90109100, '121° 54\' 3.927580\"', 38.3390, 1974226.77200, 595511.00000, '3', 383560.16600, 1973647.90700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7792, 'CGY-60', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUAO', 'ANGANG', 2007, 17.68097098, '17° 40\' 51.495528\"', 121.49413820, '121° 29\' 38.897520\"', 'CGY-60 Is located on the NE corner of the Brgy. Angang solar dryer. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-60 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.68097098, '17° 40\' 51.495530\"', 121.49413820, '121° 29\' 38.897430\"', 0.0000, '0', 80.0610, 0.0000, '2', 41.2309, 340286.21770, 1955527.53900, '51', 17.68265749, '17° 40\' 57.566960\"', 121.49285170, '121° 29\' 34.266170\"', 44.7030, 1955711.25000, 552286.68100, '3', 340148.95100, 1955597.13600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7793, 'CGY-61', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'MAGUIRIG', 2007, 17.68549901, '17° 41\' 7.796436\"', 121.64483650, '121° 38\' 41.411400\"', 'CGY-61 From Tuguegarao, cross Cagayan River via Buntun Bridge and turn right at the junction leading to the Mun. of Solana. Upon reaching another junction, turn left and follow the road until a junction leading to Brgy. Maguirig is reached. Turn right and travel for about 2 km. to reach Brgy. Pacu. Station is located inside the property of a certain Judge Lasam, about 30 m. from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-61 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.68549901, '17° 41\' 7.796430\"', 121.64483650, '121° 38\' 41.411500\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.4150, 0.0000, '2', 30.8604, 356275.67750, 1955907.35500, '51', 17.68718258, '17° 41\' 13.857290\"', 121.64355040, '121° 38\' 36.781510\"', 33.7100, 1956260.20900, 568273.09800, '3', 356138.53700, 1955976.48000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
