(7796, 'CGY-64', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'IGUIG', 'GAMMAD', 2007, 17.70797148, '17° 42\' 28.697328\"', 121.74447110, '121° 44\' 40.095960\"', 'CGY-64 (BLLM 35) Station is located inside the school compound of Gammad Annex of Iguig National High School approximately 4.5 km south from Iguig municipal hall. It is adjacent to a concrete walkway about 30 m from the western concrete fence of the school, approximately 20 m north of the of the southwest (SW) classroom and 15 m south of the northwest (NW) classroom. Station is the head of a 3\" copper nail set at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete protruding about 20 cm above the ground and with inscription \"CGY64, 2007 , NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.70797148, '17° 42\' 28.697320\"', 121.74447110, '121° 44\' 40.095980\"', 0.0000, '0', 61.7120, 0.0000, '2', 22.8968, 366860.61450, 1958320.87700, '51', 17.70965428, '17° 42\' 34.755410\"', 121.74318570, '121° 44\' 35.468450\"', 25.8410, 1958786.08900, 578833.86900, '3', 366723.62100, 1958389.70500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7797, 'CGY-65', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'SOLANA', 'BAUAN WEST', 2007, 17.72108250, '17° 43\' 15.897000\"', 121.67841480, '121° 40\' 42.293280\"', 'CGY-65 Brg. Bauan West is accessible via the provincial road, about 10 km. from Solana Centro heading N past Brgys. Natapian, Lanna, Bangag and Bauan East. Station is located inside the lot of Mr. Averer Baliuag, about 60 m. SE of a house owned by Mr. Leo Bambalan. Monumentation is witnessed by both the lot owner and Bauan West Brgy. Capt. Joseph Frogoso. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding about 20 cm. above the ground, with inscriptions \"CGY-65 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.72108250, '17° 43\' 15.897010\"', 121.67841480, '121° 40\' 42.293150\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.9710, 0.0000, '2', 20.4244, 359865.02690, 1959819.63500, '51', 17.72276750, '17° 43\' 21.963010\"', 121.67712950, '121° 40\' 37.666320\"', 23.3010, 1960210.93500, 571821.42300, '3', 359728.02800, 1959888.68200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7798, 'CGY-66', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PIAT', 'WARAT', 2007, 17.71390298, '17° 42\' 50.050728\"', 121.58187980, '121° 34\' 54.767280\"', 'CGY-66 Is located within the compound of Warat Brgy. Hall, along G. Cusupig St., approx. 15 m. S of the waiting shed. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-66 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.71390298, '17° 42\' 50.050730\"', 121.58187980, '121° 34\' 54.767350\"', 0.0000, '0', 87.3640, 0.0000, '2', 48.8842, 349621.25190, 1959099.66200, '51', 17.71558959, '17° 42\' 56.122540\"', 121.58059430, '121° 34\' 50.139360\"', 51.9020, 1959382.34000, 561584.30900, '3', 349484.15900, 1959169.00700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7799, 'CGY-67', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'RIZAL', 'MAUANAN', 2007, 17.80819950, '17° 48\' 29.518200\"', 121.42141850, '121° 25\' 17.106600\"', 'CGY-67 The station is located along Tuao-Rizal Provincial Rd., about 9.5 km. from Tuao and 150 m. SE of Mauanan Elem. School. It is at the S end of Mauanan Bridge # 1 and about 4 m. from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-67 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.80819950, '17° 48\' 29.518210\"', 121.42141850, '121° 25\' 17.106430\"', 0.0000, '0', 77.4260, 0.0000, '2', 38.1358, 332690.15820, 1969670.70100, '51', 17.80989519, '17° 48\' 35.622700\"', 121.42013480, '121° 25\' 12.485330\"', 42.6545, 1969773.78500, 544540.54300, '3', 332553.25800, 1969740.62700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7800, 'CGY-68', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'PIAT', 'MAGUILLING', 2007, 17.79460596, '17° 47\' 40.581456\"', 121.52506840, '121° 31\' 30.246240\"', 'CGY-68 From Piat, head 2.5 km. SE along the Nat\'l. Highway towards Solana and head NE along the Piat-Sto. Niño provincial road, past Piat District Hospital. Station is located along the provincial road, within the sugarcane plantation of Piat campus of Cagayan State University, approx. 700 m. NE of its main gate, about 6 m. NW from the road and 2 m. SW from the E lot fence of the said campus. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding about 20 cm. above the ground, with inscriptions \"CGY-68 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.79460596, '17° 47\' 40.581450\"', 121.52506840, '121° 31\' 30.246100\"', 0.0000, '0', 83.0690, 0.0000, '2', 44.4413, 343665.96330, 1968076.82200, '51', 17.79629863, '17° 47\' 46.675050\"', 121.52378460, '121° 31\' 25.624510\"', 48.0050, 1968296.73200, 555533.39300, '3', 343529.09500, 1968146.40800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7801, 'CGY-69', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'AMULUNG', 'CORDOVA', 2007, 17.76912691, '17° 46\' 8.856876\"', 121.65511670, '121° 39\' 18.420120\"', 'CGY-69 Brgy. Cordova is accessible via the provincial road about 20 km. from Solana Centro heading N past Brgys. Natapian, Lanna, Bangag, Bauan, Barung and Nangalasuan. Station is located approx. 20 m. SW of Cordova Brgy. Hall and 5 m. from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding about 20 cm. above the ground, with inscriptions \"CGY-69 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.76912691, '17° 46\' 8.856860\"', 121.65511670, '121° 39\' 18.420190\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.6840, 0.0000, '2', 30.2714, 357432.27940, 1965153.64600, '51', 17.77081528, '17° 46\' 14.935020\"', 121.65383260, '121° 39\' 13.797240\"', 33.2260, 1965519.74000, 569331.78600, '3', 357295.42200, 1965222.80300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7802, 'CGY-7', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'CALAYAN', 'DADAO', 1989, 19.25967779, '19° 15\' 34.840044\"', 121.48088330, '121° 28\' 51.179880\"', 'CGY-7 Is on an open ground NE of Calayan town proper, 150 m. NW of the wooden bridge which is the boundary of Brgy. Centro I and Brgy. Dadao. The station can be reached by taking a foot-trail between the bridge and the end of the concrete road at Calayan. The landowner, Mr. Gregorio Valiente is living in Brgy. Centro I. Mr. Escalante from Calayan town knows the station. Accessible by a 2-wheel drive vehicle or tricycle up to the foottrail; approx. 15 min. walk from Calayan Municipal Hall to the station. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set on a standard concrete block, 0.70 m. deep; top is flush with the ground surface and inscribed with station name. Sub-surface mark is a bottle set in a concrete block, 0.788 m. below station mark. Reference mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods set in concrete blocks, 0.6 m. deep, flush with the ground surface and inscribed with the station name.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 19.25967779, '19° 15\' 34.840060\"', 121.48088330, '121° 28\' 51.179900\"', 0.0000, '0', 40.4346, 0.0000, '1', 8.5701, 340348.04760, 2130258.86500, '51', 19.26145733, '19° 15\' 41.246380\"', 121.47963320, '121° 28\' 46.679610\"', 10.3480, 2130445.48300, 550420.84100, '3', 340215.98500, 2130329.64400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7803, 'CGY-70', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'AMULUNG', 'ESTEFANIA', 2012, 17.79686436, '17° 47\' 48.711696\"', 121.72663570, '121° 43\' 35.888520\"', 'CGY-70 CGY-70 is in the island of Luzon, province of Cagayan, municipality of Amulung, barangay Estefania inside Estefania Elementary School campus, Station is situated 1 meter E of the NE corner of the basketball court. Mark is the head of a 3\" copper nail set flushed on top of a standard concrete monument. Inscriptions read \"CGY-70, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.79686436, '17° 47\' 48.711700\"', 121.72663570, '121° 43\' 35.888590\"', 0.0000, '0', 62.4000, 0.0000, '2', 23.8885, 365035.71870, 1968170.08100, '51', 17.79855288, '17° 47\' 54.790380\"', 121.72535230, '121° 43\' 31.268370\"', 26.8590, 1968617.42500, 576904.11800, '3', 364899.00400, 1968239.03400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
