(7908, 'CGY-8 (CAG 1972)', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'TUGUEGARAO CITY', 'CENTRO 7', 1972, 17.61732642, '17° 37\' 2.375112\"', 121.72649570, '121° 43\' 35.384520\"', 'CAG 1972 = CGY-8 Is located on top of a concrete water tank of Cagayan College of Tuguegarao (CCT); 62.99 in. from its E edge, 51.97 in. from the N edge, 104.73 in. from the W edge and 52.36 in. from its S edge. To reach the station, proceed to CCT Bldg., approx. 500 m. SW of a bridge; climb at the roof top where the concrete water tank is located. Station mark is an old station, recovered and refurbished; 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in cement patty on top of a concrete water tank and inscribed \"CGY-8\". Reference mark nos. 1 & 2 are 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods with 20 cm. x 20 cm. cement patty set on the roof top of the CCT Bldg. formerly Cagayan Teachers College. RM No.1 is located on the W side of the roof top of the building and RM No.2 is located on the E side of the same building. NOTE: Reported LOST (February 10, 2025 - NAMRIA Mojon Finder)', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.61732642, '17° 37\' 2.375110\"', 121.72649570, '121° 43\' 35.384680\"', 0.0000, '0', 84.3347, 0.0000, '1', 45.3559, 364886.55230, 1948303.37000, '51', 17.61900414, '17° 37\' 8.414910\"', 121.72520820, '121° 43\' 30.749500\"', 48.2140, 1948746.18600, 576965.34600, '3', 364749.24800, 1948372.18400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
