(7975, 'CGY-85', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LASAM', 'SICALAO', 2007, 18.03786335, '18° 2\' 16.308060\"', 121.47371050, '121° 28\' 25.357800\"', 'CGY-85 Is located on top of a concrete structure in the irrigation canal, SW of the nat\'l. highway 500 m. away from Km. Post 739 (11L, 15R) going to Rizal. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail set flushed on top of a concrete putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-85 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.03786335, '18° 2\' 16.308050\"', 121.47371050, '121° 28\' 25.357720\"', 0.0000, '0', 70.7680, 0.0000, '2', 31.7111, 338441.95590, 1995041.02800, '51', 18.03957163, '18° 2\' 22.457860\"', 121.47243220, '121° 28\' 20.756080\"', 36.6180, 1995205.55300, 550020.44000, '3', 338305.85300, 1995110.96100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7976, 'CGY-86', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'CABAYABASAN', 2007, 18.10582163, '18° 6\' 20.957868\"', 121.55876830, '121° 33\' 31.565880\"', 'CGY-86 From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos. Turn left after Km. Post 705, leading to Brgy. Aringay, Lasam. Travel for about 8 km. to reach Lal-lo Nat\'l. High School. Station is located inside the school grounds, about 115 m. NW of Aringay welcome arch, 8.8 m. SE of the flagpole and 1.5 m. S of the top edge of the stair entrance. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-86 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.10582163, '18° 6\' 20.957860\"', 121.55876830, '121° 33\' 31.565950\"', 0.0000, '0', 76.6220, 0.0000, '2', 38.0919, 347505.63310, 2002489.43300, '51', 18.10753215, '18° 6\' 27.115730\"', 121.55749180, '121° 33\' 26.970480\"', 42.4920, 2002752.08800, 559003.93000, '3', 347369.81600, 2002559.14900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7977, 'CGY-87', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'GATTARAN', 'CENTRO SUR', 2007, 18.06115517, '18° 3\' 40.158612\"', 121.64537830, '121° 38\' 43.361880\"', 'CGY-87 Is located on a solar dryer at Brgy. Cabayabasan, fronting the brgy. hall. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-87 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.06115517, '18° 3\' 40.158610\"', 121.64537830, '121° 38\' 43.361930\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.6960, 0.0000, '2', 33.3904, 356634.84550, 1997477.03400, '51', 18.06286120, '18° 3\' 46.300320\"', 121.64410090, '121° 38\' 38.763260\"', 37.2120, 1997837.97800, 568188.02900, '3', 356498.94200, 1997546.44300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7978, 'CGY-89', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'LOGAC', 2007, 18.15498366, '18° 9\' 17.941176\"', 121.60899900, '121° 36\' 32.396400\"', 'CGY-89 From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos. Logac Nat\'l. High School is across Km. Post 705. Station is located on the left side of the access road to the entrance of the said school, about 8 m. S of the gate entrance. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-89 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.15498366, '18° 9\' 17.941190\"', 121.60899900, '121° 36\' 32.396570\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.9710, 0.0000, '2', 11.6638, 352862.43750, 2007889.06600, '51', 18.15669604, '18° 9\' 24.105760\"', 121.60772370, '121° 36\' 27.805460\"', 15.8820, 2008210.13200, 564302.58200, '3', 352726.81700, 2007958.66000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7979, 'CGY-9', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALCALA', 'PIGGATAN', 1989, 17.95644144, '17° 57\' 23.189184\"', 121.65953660, '121° 39\' 34.331760\"', 'Station mark is a 0.15m x 0.01m diameter brass rod set in a drilled hole on a cement patty inscribed with the station name. Station is on top of concrete rip-rap at the right side of the road going to Gattaran town. It is located about 50 meters from the SE corner of Piggatan Bridge, approximately 9.4kms from Alcala town proper.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.95644144, '17° 57\' 23.189200\"', 121.65953660, '121° 39\' 34.331880\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.9573, 0.0000, '1', 19.6849, 358049.67220, 1985878.39200, '51', 17.95814094, '17° 57\' 29.307370\"', 121.65825680, '121° 39\' 29.724550\"', 23.0970, 1986253.34200, 569727.87600, '3', 357913.43400, 1985947.67700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7980, 'CGY-91', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'ALLACAPAN', 'CENTRO WEST', 2007, 18.22602481, '18° 13\' 33.689316\"', 121.55601900, '121° 33\' 21.668400\"', 'CGY-91 From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos. Turn left to Allacapan Mun. Hall, which is between Km. Posts 695 and 694 (on the left side of the road). Station is located inside the town plaza\'s circle ground, on the N pathwalk, near the center of the grounds. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"CGY-91 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.22602481, '18° 13\' 33.689320\"', 121.55601900, '121° 33\' 21.668250\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.2930, 0.0000, '2', 9.0565, 347319.22160, 2015794.17800, '51', 18.22774252, '18° 13\' 39.873070\"', 121.55474520, '121° 33\' 17.082730\"', 13.5640, 2016055.50700, 558673.06300, '3', 347183.79800, 2015863.99200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7981, 'CGY-92', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'CENTRO', 2007, 18.20145923, '18° 12\' 5.253228\"', 121.66298080, '121° 39\' 46.730880\"', 'CGY-92 Is located inside the Lal-lo Nat\'l. High School, about 5 m. W of the flagpole. Said school is 95 m. E of the Tuguegarao-Aparri nat\'l. road, between Km Posts 562 and 563 and about 40 m. N of Lal-lo Mun. Hall. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-92 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.20145923, '18° 12\' 5.253210\"', 121.66298080, '121° 39\' 46.730840\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.5400, 0.0000, '2', 10.4377, 358610.83540, 2012989.80100, '51', 18.20317323, '18° 12\' 11.423610\"', 121.66170660, '121° 39\' 42.143920\"', 14.4740, 2013373.80700, 569996.11500, '3', 358475.40600, 2013059.26000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Edil', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7982, 'CGY-93', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'LAL-LO', 'DAGUPAN', 2007, 18.18255855, '18° 10\' 57.210780\"', 121.75492880, '121° 45\' 17.743680\"', 'CGY-93 From Aparri Proper, travel for about 30 km. S until reaching the junction at Brgy. Magapit, Lal-lo. Turn left/E and travel for about 12 km. leading to Brgy. Dagupan. Station is located on the SE corner of the basketball court, across Dagupan Brgy. Hall. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-93 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.18255855, '18° 10\' 57.210780\"', 121.75492880, '121° 45\' 17.743610\"', 0.0000, '0', 61.7280, 0.0000, '2', 23.5881, 368321.38770, 2010829.80400, '51', 18.18426948, '18° 11\' 3.370140\"', 121.75365440, '121° 45\' 13.155690\"', 27.3800, 2011319.09200, 579731.47400, '3', 368185.96100, 2010898.95900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7983, 'CGY-94', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'BALLESTEROS', 'NARARAGAN', 2007, 18.29716528, '18° 17\' 49.795008\"', 121.48688150, '121° 29\' 12.773400\"', 'CGY-94 From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos. After Km. Post 675 (on the left side of the road), turn left leading to Brgy. Nararagan and for about 4 km. stop at the Y-junction. Station is located on the NW side of the irrigation canal gate. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-94 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.29716528, '18° 17\' 49.795020\"', 121.48688150, '121° 29\' 12.773330\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.7290, 0.0000, '2', 13.7256, 340072.72470, 2023726.34500, '51', 18.29888866, '18° 17\' 55.999160\"', 121.48560930, '121° 29\' 8.193330\"', 18.4000, 2023908.85600, 551339.77800, '3', 339937.48800, 2023796.42900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7984, 'CGY-95', 'LUZON', 'REGION II', 'CAGAYAN', 'APARRI', 'BANGAG', 2007, 18.29633079, '18° 17\' 46.790844\"', 121.57035640, '121° 34\' 13.283040\"', 'CGY-95 From Magapit Bridge, travel along the nat\'l. highway to Ilocos. Turn right leading to Brgy. Bukig. Travel for about 1 km. until reaching the first bridge. Station is located on the SW corner walkway of the bridge. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and flushed on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"CGY-95 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 18.29633079, '18° 17\' 46.790850\"', 121.57035640, '121° 34\' 13.282940\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.1240, 0.0000, '2', 8.2699, 348896.30500, 2023562.83500, '51', 18.29805236, '18° 17\' 52.988480\"', 121.56908430, '121° 34\' 8.703360\"', 12.5930, 2023841.80100, 560165.46300, '3', 348761.12300, 2023632.65500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7985, 'ABR-1', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'BANGUED', 'ZONE 2 POB.', 1989, 17.60297734, '17° 36\' 10.718424\"', 120.61514920, '120° 36\' 54.537120\"', 'ABR-1 IS SITUATED IN ABRA SCHOOL OF ARTS AND TRADES (ASAT) PLAYGROUND, NE, 80 M. OF SCHOOL BUILDING IN THE MUNICIPALITY OF BANGUED, SE OF FOOT TRAIL, IT CAN BE REACHED BY 2-WHEEL DRIVE VEHICLE IN 3 MIN. FROM THE MUNICIPAL BUILDING OF BANGUED. STATION MARK IS A 0.15 M. X 0.01 M. DIA. BRASS ROD SET IN STANDARD CONCRETE BLOCK, 0.70 M. DEEP, FLUSHED WITH THE GROUND SURFACE AND INSCRIBED WITH THE STATION NAME. SUB-SURFACE MARK IS A BOTTLE SET ON CONCRETE BLOCK. TOP OF BOTTLE IS 0.781 M. BELOW STATION MARK. REFERENCE MARK IS 0.15 M. X 0.01 M. DIA. BRASS RODS SET IN CONCRETE BLOCKS, 0.75 M. DEEP FLUSHED WITH THE GROUND SURFACE AND INSCRIBED WITH THE STATION NAME AND RM NUMBER. RM-1, RM-2, RM-3 AND RM 4 ARE IN LINE TO A BRASS ROD SET ON THE CENTER OF CONCRETE BLOCK.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.60297734, '17° 36\' 10.718440\"', 120.61514920, '120° 36\' 54.537280\"', 0.0000, '0', 90.4458, 0.0000, '1', 52.2447, 246914.37920, 1947854.93700, '51', 17.60467790, '17° 36\' 16.840430\"', 120.61385970, '120° 36\' 49.894770\"', 56.9480, 1947055.10900, 459016.87000, '3', 246776.21400, 1947927.27900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7986, 'ABR-11', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LACUB', 'POBLACION', 2007, 17.66436750, '17° 39\' 51.723000\"', 120.94446670, '120° 56\' 40.080120\"', 'ABR-11 From Bangued, Abra town proper, travel towards east along Abra-Kalinga Road for about 45.7 km. Turn left and travel for about 24 km. until reaching the Municipal Hall of Lacub. The station is located 10 m in front of the municipal hall, about 14 m NW of the barangay hall. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm cement putty with inscriptions, \"ABR-11, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.66436750, '17° 39\' 51.723010\"', 120.94446670, '120° 56\' 40.080160\"', 0.0000, '0', 484.1380, 0.0000, '2', 442.8338, 281949.48260, 1954240.33700, '51', 17.66606462, '17° 39\' 57.832640\"', 120.94317910, '120° 56\' 35.444730\"', 450.0469, 1953807.59600, 493971.37200, '3', 281811.76900, 1954311.65900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7987, 'ABR-12', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LAGANGILANG', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2007, 17.57696653, '17° 34\' 37.079508\"', 120.76853590, '120° 46\' 6.729240\"', 'ABR-12 From Lagangilang town proper, travel towards Brgy. San Isidro. Bio Street of San Isidro is about 4.6 km. from town proper. In a road interseciton near the waiting shed, turn right and it will lead to the Bio Bridge which is about 1.85 km. from the road intersection. The station is located on the lot owned by Mr. Renato Alvarez which is 150 m away from Bio Bridge. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-12, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.57696653, '17° 34\' 37.079490\"', 120.76853590, '120° 46\' 6.729120\"', 0.0000, '0', 131.5110, 0.0000, '2', 91.4650, 263165.20300, 1944777.01900, '51', 17.57866225, '17° 34\' 43.184090\"', 120.76724590, '120° 46\' 2.085210\"', 97.5613, 1944149.49200, 475293.13100, '3', 263027.06200, 1944848.84900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7988, 'ABR-13', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'MALIBCONG', 'MALIBCONG', 2007, 17.56503655, '17° 33\' 54.131580\"', 120.99045940, '120° 59\' 25.653840\"', 'ABR-13 From Bangued town proper, travel towards E along Abra-Kalinga road for about 66 km. until reaching the junction going to Kalinga and Malibcong, passing through Municipality of Tayum, Lagangilang and Baay Licuan. Upon reaching the junction, continue travel towards Milibcong for about 11 km. unitl reaching the sub-office of Malibcong. The station is located in front of the health office beside the sub-office of Malibcong. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-13, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.56503655, '17° 33\' 54.131580\"', 120.99045940, '120° 59\' 25.653870\"', 0.0000, '0', 827.5220, 0.0000, '2', 785.0627, 286713.29780, 1943193.05900, '51', 17.56672664, '17° 34\' 0.215910\"', 120.98916960, '120° 59\' 21.010660\"', 793.0015, 1942813.52600, 498850.28200, '3', 286575.29400, 1943264.14900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7989, 'ABR-14 (BLLM-1)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'BUCAY', 'NORTH POBLACION', 2007, 17.53831339, '17° 32\' 17.928204\"', 120.71846830, '120° 43\' 6.485880\"', 'ABR-14 (BLLM-1) From the town proper of Bangued, travel towards Narvacan in Ilocos Sur which is about 2.5 km. to reach the road intersection located before Sinalang Bridge. At the road intersection, turn left and continue travel towards the Municipal Hall of Bucay, Abra which is about 14 km. from the said intersection. The station is located at the plaza of Bucay which is about 40 m in front of the municipal hall building. Mark is the head of a 4 in. nail flushed at the center of a 40 cm x 40 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"BLLM No. 1\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.53831339, '17° 32\' 17.928210\"', 120.71846830, '120° 43\' 6.485870\"', 0.0000, '0', 136.0760, 0.0000, '2', 96.2804, 257797.60240, 1940561.24600, '51', 17.54000786, '17° 32\' 24.028310\"', 120.71717740, '120° 43\' 1.838480\"', 102.1228, 1939879.02500, 469971.94800, '3', 257659.29500, 1940633.20700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7990, 'ABR-15', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN QUINTIN', 'POBLACION', 2007, 17.53946665, '17° 32\' 22.079940\"', 120.51627780, '120° 30\' 58.600080\"', 'ABR-15 From the Junction of Navarcan, travel towards Abra for about 40 mins. to reach San Quintin. At San Quintin, turn left and travel for about 2.9 km. to reach the road intersection which is 50 m before reaching the Municipal Hall of San Quintin. From the municipal hall, turn left, travel for about 350 m and walk to the SW direction for about 200 m to reach the farm lot owned by Municipal Assessor Rodolfo Ponio where the station is located, about 50 m SW of Mr. Rudy Ramos residence. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-15, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.53946665, '17° 32\' 22.079940\"', 120.51627780, '120° 30\' 58.600120\"', 0.0000, '0', 63.7320, 0.0000, '2', 26.2445, 236324.54410, 1940958.19500, '51', 17.54116553, '17° 32\' 28.195890\"', 120.51498660, '120° 30\' 53.951760\"', 30.2684, 1940050.49200, 448504.79600, '3', 236186.09200, 1941030.80900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7991, 'ABR-16 (BLLM-2)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SALLAPADAN', 'GANGAL', 2007, 17.45473488, '17° 27\' 17.045568\"', 120.75981880, '120° 45\' 35.347680\"', 'ABR-16 (BLLM NO. 2) The station is located inside the compound of the Catholic Church about 25 m N of the Church bldg., and 70 m S of the Municipal Hall of Sallapadan. Mark is the head of a 1.5 cm square steel with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 40 cm x 40 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"BLLM NO. 2\" = \"ABR-16\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.45473488, '17° 27\' 17.045560\"', 120.75981880, '120° 45\' 35.347550\"', 0.0000, '0', 229.4160, 0.0000, '2', 188.3626, 262080.32310, 1931256.84000, '51', 17.45642342, '17° 27\' 23.124310\"', 120.75852600, '120° 45\' 30.693460\"', 195.0963, 1930623.17800, 474350.34400, '3', 261941.76800, 1931328.60100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7992, 'ABR-17', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'DAGUIOMAN', 'TUI', 2007, 17.45846247, '17° 27\' 30.464892\"', 120.92547130, '120° 55\' 31.696680\"', 'ABR-17 From the town proper of Sallapadan, travel towards Bucloc and Daguioman. In about 24 km., you will reach the Municipal Hall of Daguioman. Sallapadan is about 34.7 km. from Bangued. The station is located in the compound of Daguioman Elementary School, SW of the municipal bldg. and 40 m NW of the flagpole. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-17, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.45846247, '17° 27\' 30.464900\"', 120.92547130, '120° 55\' 31.696730\"', 0.0000, '0', 517.6100, 0.0000, '2', 474.8490, 279684.62910, 1931470.57700, '51', 17.46014762, '17° 27\' 36.531440\"', 120.92417890, '120° 55\' 27.044040\"', 482.9042, 1931020.69400, 491946.37500, '3', 279546.21500, 1931541.80100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7993, 'ABR-18', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'BOLINEY', 'BAO-YAN', 2007, 17.37331183, '17° 22\' 23.922588\"', 120.76975030, '120° 46\' 11.101080\"', 'ABR-18 From Bangued, Abra town proper, travel towards Narvacan, Ilocos Sur for about 2.5 km. Turn left to the intersection road before Sinalang Bridge and continue travel for about 29.6 km. until reaching Abra River. Pass through the river by riding a ferry, and continue travel towards Boliney for about 2.1 km. Turn left to the intersection road after the boundary of Poblacion and San Ramon West at the town of Manabo until reaching the open field. The station is located at the open field near Brgy. Capt. Roberto Maggonga\'s residence. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-18, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.37331183, '17° 22\' 23.922590\"', 120.76975030, '120° 46\' 11.101190\"', 0.0000, '0', 619.4130, 0.0000, '2', 577.5178, 263030.49730, 1922231.05000, '51', 17.37499515, '17° 22\' 29.982550\"', 120.76845570, '120° 46\' 6.440650\"', 584.8102, 1921610.77100, 475394.20200, '3', 262891.68600, 1922302.70500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7994, 'ABR-19', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LUBA', 'LUZONG', 2007, 17.36556049, '17° 21\' 56.017764\"', 120.69624570, '120° 41\' 46.484520\"', 'ABR-19 The station is located on the Northern right corner of Lusong Nationall High School compound. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross-cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-19, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.36556049, '17° 21\' 56.017750\"', 120.69624570, '120° 41\' 46.484420\"', 0.0000, '0', 304.3420, 0.0000, '2', 263.2691, 255206.71410, 1921465.31300, '51', 17.36724500, '17° 22\' 2.081990\"', 120.69495070, '120° 41\' 41.822620\"', 269.8910, 1920764.03800, 467581.53800, '3', 255067.81600, 1921537.20800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7995, 'ABR-2', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LICUAN-BAAY', 'CAWAYAN', 1990, 17.57116175, '17° 34\' 16.182300\"', 120.90381650, '120° 54\' 13.739400\"', 'ABR-2 From Bangued town, travel E, SE, along the National Highway towards Abra/Kalinga-Apayao provincial boundary for 63 km. up to the municipal building of Baay-Licuan; passing through the municipalities of Tayum and Lagangilang. The station is located on top of a small hill, 70 m. N of the highway and 300 m. E of the municipal building. Accessible by 2-wheel drive vehicle. Station mark is a cross cut on top of 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. brass rod centered on a 0.30 m. x 0.30 m. x 0.70 m. concrete block; 0.05 m. above ground surface. Inscribed on top with station name. Sub-surface mark is 0.22 m. empty bottle centered on a 0.40 m. x 0.40 m. x 0.20 m. concrete block; 0.85 m. below ground surface. Reference mark numbers 1, 2, 3 are cross cut on top of a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in drill holes, centered on cement patty on top of irregular shape rock; 0.01 m. above ground surface. Inscribed on top with station name.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.57116175, '17° 34\' 16.182290\"', 120.90381650, '120° 54\' 13.739230\"', 0.0000, '0', 817.8117, 0.0000, '1', 776.0952, 277521.45160, 1943970.58500, '51', 17.57285405, '17° 34\' 22.274570\"', 120.90252670, '120° 54\' 9.096100\"', 783.5190, 1943494.23400, 489652.88900, '3', 277383.40600, 1944041.95500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7996, 'ABR-20', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'PILAR', 'DINTAN', 2007, 17.36318491, '17° 21\' 47.465676\"', 120.58612470, '120° 35\' 10.048920\"', 'ABR-20 From Piddigan, Abra, travel towards SE direction for about 25.6 km. until reaching the Municipal Hall of Pilar. From the municipal hall, travel towards Brgy. Narnara for about 2.9 km. Turn right to the intersection road of the brgy. going to Brgy. Dintan. The station is located on the lot owned by Mrs. Gladys Dizon Vineza, about 60 m NW of Mr. Caesar Ramirez\'s residence. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-20, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.36318491, '17° 21\' 47.465690\"', 120.58612470, '120° 35\' 10.049010\"', 0.0000, '0', 198.1810, 0.0000, '2', 158.6085, 243496.52910, 1921346.24500, '51', 17.36487167, '17° 21\' 53.538000\"', 120.58482950, '120° 35\' 5.386370\"', 163.9873, 1920523.35100, 455877.92900, '3', 243357.53900, 1921418.49600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7997, 'ABR-21', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'TUBO', 'POBLACION', 2007, 17.25778293, '17° 15\' 28.018548\"', 120.72505810, '120° 43\' 30.209160\"', 'ABR-21 The station is located inside the compound of Tubo Central School, 3 m SE of the stage, 50 m SE of the Catholic Church, and 70 m E of the Municipal Hall. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-21, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.25778293, '17° 15\' 28.018540\"', 120.72505810, '120° 43\' 30.209090\"', 0.0000, '0', 356.8670, 0.0000, '2', 314.7255, 258128.57360, 1909497.71700, '51', 17.25946030, '17° 15\' 34.057080\"', 120.72376070, '120° 43\' 25.538460\"', 322.0045, 1908831.70600, 470626.16200, '3', 257989.33700, 1909569.43400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7998, 'ABR-23', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LACUB', 'GUINGUINABANG', 2007, 17.65749285, '17° 39\' 26.974260\"', 120.90191410, '120° 54\' 6.890760\"', 'ABR-23 From Bangued, Abra town proper, travel towards E along Abra-Kalinga road for about 45.7 km. Turn left and travel towards Municipality of Lacub for about 11.7 km. until reaching Guinguinabang Creek. Station is located at the big rock, about 15 m S of the road, and about 32 m SE of the waiting shed. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 02 cm cement putty with inscriptions, \"ABR-23, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.65749285, '17° 39\' 26.974250\"', 120.90191410, '120° 54\' 6.890890\"', 0.0000, '0', 519.2210, 0.0000, '2', 478.2521, 277425.41610, 1953529.04800, '51', 17.65919045, '17° 39\' 33.085630\"', 120.90062630, '120° 54\' 2.254690\"', 485.2100, 1953048.73200, 489456.17100, '3', 277287.64900, 1953600.50000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(7999, 'ABR-24', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LAGANGILANG', 'PAGANAO', 2007, 17.67713314, '17° 40\' 37.679304\"', 120.78962380, '120° 47\' 22.645680\"', 'ABR-24 From Bangued, travel on the NE direction towards Dolores. In about 15.4 km., you will reach a crossroad. At the crossing, turn left and travel towards Dolores town proper. Continue travelling towards Brgy. Paganao of Lagangilang which is about 14.4 km. The station is located 70 m E of the day care center, and 35 m NE of Ms. Felomena Unpana\'s residence. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with isncriptions, \"ABR-24, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.67713314, '17° 40\' 37.679320\"', 120.78962380, '120° 47\' 22.645840\"', 0.0000, '0', 159.6380, 0.0000, '2', 120.0628, 265533.88180, 1955839.20200, '51', 17.67883441, '17° 40\' 43.803880\"', 120.78833620, '120° 47\' 18.010420\"', 125.9595, 1955232.45600, 477544.28300, '3', 265396.09200, 1955911.04000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8000, 'ABR-25', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN JUAN', 'POBLACION NORTH', 2007, 17.69205689, '17° 41\' 31.404804\"', 120.72848780, '120° 43\' 42.556080\"', 'ABR-25 From Dolores town proper, travel to the NE direction along the provincial road. In about 5.4 km., you will reach the town proper of San Juan. From the Municipality of San Juan, travel in a NE direction to reach the Saint John Parish School near the road intersection which is also near the church. At the intersection, turn left and continue travelling towards the farm owned by Vice-Mayor Rosalinda Ortega which is about 1.35 km. away, where the station is located. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-25, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.69205689, '17° 41\' 31.404790\"', 120.72848780, '120° 43\' 42.555940\"', 0.0000, '0', 155.5690, 0.0000, '2', 116.7266, 259066.01340, 1957568.41100, '51', 17.69376035, '17° 41\' 37.537250\"', 120.72720040, '120° 43\' 37.921440\"', 122.0854, 1956892.58300, 471060.64800, '3', 258928.22900, 1957640.45600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8001, 'ABR-26', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LAGAYAN', 'POBLACION', 2007, 17.72075051, '17° 43\' 14.701836\"', 120.70598130, '120° 42\' 21.532680\"', 'ABR-26 The station is located beside the plant box, about 10 m in front of Lagayan Municipal Hall, about 30 m NE of BLLM NO. 1. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-26, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.72075051, '17° 43\' 14.701830\"', 120.70598130, '120° 42\' 21.532810\"', 0.0000, '0', 147.1500, 0.0000, '2', 108.5711, 256716.46990, 1960773.88700, '51', 17.72245616, '17° 43\' 20.842190\"', 120.70469460, '120° 42\' 16.900580\"', 113.8128, 1960071.85600, 468678.13100, '3', 256578.76500, 1960846.02600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8002, 'ABR-27', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LA PAZ', 'SAN GREGORIO', 2007, 17.64678366, '17° 38\' 48.421176\"', 120.64346020, '120° 38\' 36.456720\"', 'ABR-27 From Bangued, Abra town proper, travel towards E-NW direction for about 3.3 km. until reaching Abra River. Pass through the river by riding a ferry and continue travel to La Paz, for about 4.5 km. until reaching San Gregorio Elementary School. Turn right and continue travel towards San Gregorio for about 180 m. The station is located about 15 m SE of the stage. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-27, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.64678366, '17° 38\' 48.421180\"', 120.64346020, '120° 38\' 36.456650\"', 0.0000, '0', 105.8140, 0.0000, '2', 67.5503, 249980.63050, 1952667.05000, '51', 17.64848624, '17° 38\' 54.550460\"', 120.64217160, '120° 38\' 31.817910\"', 72.3889, 1951897.32200, 462030.97300, '3', 249842.63200, 1952739.33500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8003, 'ABR-28', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'DOLORES', 'POBLACION', 2007, 17.64870564, '17° 38\' 55.340304\"', 120.70830810, '120° 42\' 29.909160\"', 'ABR-28 From Bangued town proper, travel to the NE direction towards the town of Dolores. In about 15.4 km., you will reach the Talogtog junction. At the junction, turn left and continue travelling towards Dolores Municipal Hall which is about 5.2 km. from the said junction. The station was established inside the compound of Dolores Civic Center. Station is located 50 m front of Municipal Hall. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-28, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.64870564, '17° 38\' 55.340290\"', 120.70830810, '120° 42\' 29.909220\"', 0.0000, '0', 117.3860, 0.0000, '2', 78.5721, 256866.37460, 1952795.13400, '51', 17.65040694, '17° 39\' 1.465000\"', 120.70701970, '120° 42\' 25.270980\"', 83.8113, 1952098.03100, 468912.36100, '3', 256728.43000, 1952867.21200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8004, 'ABR-29', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LAGANGILANG', 'LAANG', 2007, 17.60739177, '17° 36\' 26.610372\"', 120.73643340, '120° 44\' 11.160240\"', 'ABR-29 From the Municipality of Lagangilang, travel towards the direction of the Lagangilang Public Market. Station is located 20 m E of the market bldg. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-29, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.60739177, '17° 36\' 26.610380\"', 120.73643340, '120° 44\' 11.160110\"', 0.0000, '0', 110.8920, 0.0000, '2', 71.4842, 259796.81710, 1948185.57200, '51', 17.60909001, '17° 36\' 32.724030\"', 120.73514400, '120° 44\' 6.518560\"', 77.1170, 1947521.25900, 471890.20300, '3', 259658.75400, 1948257.52800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8005, 'ABR-3 (BBM-1)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'DANGLAS', 'PANGAL', 2006, 17.68583496, '17° 41\' 9.005856\"', 120.66564480, '120° 39\' 56.321280\"', 'ABR-3 (BBM 1) From Bangued City, travel N for about 15 km. or about 30 mins. passing by Abra River up to the municipality of Danglas. Station is a BBM located at the boundary of Brgys. Cabaruan and Caupasan. It is about 250 m. S of the chapel and N of the school and about 4 m. S of a culvert, about 5 m. E of the road centerline, 1.5 m. W of the E side of a riprap and 0.75 m. S of Cabaruan welcome marker. Mark is the head of a 4 in. concrete nail, centered on a concrete monument 20 cm. x 20 cm. and protruding by 35 cm. above the ground surface, with inscription \"BBM No. 1\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.68583496, '17° 41\' 9.005850\"', 120.66564480, '120° 39\' 56.321110\"', 0.0000, '0', 116.3650, 0.0000, '2', 78.0412, 252388.88340, 1956961.09500, '51', 17.68753939, '17° 41\' 15.141820\"', 120.66435720, '120° 39\' 51.685740\"', 83.0122, 1956214.88800, 464392.77600, '3', 252251.03200, 1957033.33800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2022-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8006, 'ABR-30', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'TAYUM', 'BUDAC', 2007, 17.59348271, '17° 35\' 36.537756\"', 120.68620560, '120° 41\' 10.340160\"', 'ABR-30 From the town proper of Bangued, travel towards the town of Lagangilang. In about 5.2 Km., you will reach a road intersection. Turn right and continue travelling towards the Mun. Hall of Tayum. From the Mun. Hall, travel towards Wayya Street in Budac, Tayum. Station was established on the farm owned by Mr. Joseph Millare. It is located 150 m SE of the brgy. clinic. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-30, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.59348271, '17° 35\' 36.537770\"', 120.68620560, '120° 41\' 10.340110\"', 0.0000, '0', 112.0740, 0.0000, '2', 73.1148, 254445.61880, 1946710.22400, '51', 17.59518119, '17° 35\' 42.652280\"', 120.68491590, '120° 41\' 5.697140\"', 78.3751, 1945990.19000, 466556.76600, '3', 254307.47300, 1946782.33200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8007, 'ABR-3001 (BLLM-19)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'BANGUED', 'SAPPAAC', 2005, 17.51423759, '17° 30\' 51.255324\"', 120.64378930, '120° 38\' 37.641480\"', 'ABR-3001 From the Municipality of Bangued, Abra, travel South to Brgy. Sappaac along the National Road which heads to the Municipality of Peñarrubia. BLLM No. 19 is located 3.51m., South East of the Brgy. Road and 8.64m., North West of the Basketball Court. Station is marked by a metal bolt on the center of concrete monument 40 x 40 x 100 cm., Set 80cm., below the ground 20cm., above the ground, with inscriptions ABR-3001, 2005, PRS 92, LMS DENR CAR.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.51423759, '17° 30\' 51.255310\"', 120.64378930, '120° 38\' 37.641550\"', 0.0000, '0', 203.7660, 0.0000, '4', 164.6453, 249833.19410, 1937992.64800, '51', 17.51593219, '17° 30\' 57.355880\"', 120.64249770, '120° 38\' 32.991820\"', 169.9153, 1937228.03500, 462037.92500, '3', 249694.75300, 1938064.82900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8008, 'ABR-3002 (BLLM-20)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'BANGUED', 'SAPPAAC', 2005, 17.51219237, '17° 30\' 43.892532\"', 120.64736360, '120° 38\' 50.508960\"', 'ABR-3002 From the Municipality of Bangued, Abra, travel South to Brgy. Sappaac along the National Road which heads to the Municipality of Peñarrubia. BLLM No. 20 is located 121.0m., South West of the Basketball Court and 126.23m., South West of the Brgy. Hall. Station is marked by a metal bolt on the center of concrete monument 40 x 40 x 100cm. Set 80 cm. below the ground 20cm. above the ground, with inscriptions ABR-3002, 2005, PRS 92, LMS DENR CAR.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.51219237, '17° 30\' 43.892540\"', 120.64736360, '120° 38\' 50.508900\"', 0.0000, '0', 244.1100, 0.0000, '4', 204.9283, 250210.06240, 1937761.53000, '51', 17.51388677, '17° 30\' 49.992360\"', 120.64607200, '120° 38\' 45.859050\"', 210.2442, 1937000.96900, 462417.04500, '3', 250071.61800, 1937833.69600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8009, 'ABR-3004 (BLLM-21)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'BANGUED', 'MAOAY', 2005, 17.50012785, '17° 30\' 0.460260\"', 120.63570550, '120° 38\' 8.539800\"', 'ABR-3004 From the Municipality of Bangued, Abra, travel South to Brgy. Maoay along the national road which heads to the Municipality of Peñarrubia. BLLM No. 21 is located 70.0m., South 10deg. East of Maoay Elem. School and 3.00m., South of Prov\'l Road. Station is marked by a metal bolt in the center of concrete monument 40 x 40 x 100cm. Set 80cm. below the ground 20cm. above the ground, with inscriptions ABR-3004, 2005, PRS 92, LMS DENR CAR.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.50012785, '17° 30\' 0.460260\"', 120.63570550, '120° 38\' 8.539760\"', 0.0000, '0', 266.2260, 0.0000, '4', 227.0876, 248955.10380, 1936441.23500, '51', 17.50182176, '17° 30\' 6.558340\"', 120.63441360, '120° 38\' 3.888860\"', 232.3497, 1935668.13200, 461176.48700, '3', 248816.61100, 1936513.42900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8010, 'ABR-3005 (BLLM-22)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'BANGUED', 'MAOAY', 2005, 17.49847346, '17° 29\' 54.504456\"', 120.63456200, '120° 38\' 4.423200\"', 'ABR-3005 From the Municipality of Bangued, Abra, travel South to Brgy. Maoay along the National Road which heads to the Municipality of Peñarrubia. BLLM No. 22 is located 9.00m., South 80deg., West from Maoay Elem. School and 29.0m., West of the Flag Pole. Station is marked by a metal bolt on the center of the concrete monument 40 x 40 x 100 cm. Set 80cm. below the ground 20cm., above the ground, with inscriptions ABR-3005, 2005, PRS 92, LMS DENR CAR.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.49847346, '17° 29\' 54.504460\"', 120.63456200, '120° 38\' 4.423370\"', 0.0000, '0', 274.2570, 0.0000, '4', 235.1182, 248831.35930, 1936259.58900, '51', 17.50016729, '17° 30\' 0.602240\"', 120.63327010, '120° 37\' 59.772370\"', 240.3780, 1935485.27300, 461054.70200, '3', 248692.86200, 1936331.78500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8011, 'ABR-31', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'PEÑARRUBIA', 'POBLACION', 2007, 17.56613212, '17° 33\' 58.075632\"', 120.65073320, '120° 39\' 2.639520\"', 'ABR-31 From the town proper of Bangued, travel towards Narvacan, Ilocos Sur. A road intersection will be reached in about 2.5 Km. just before Sinalang Bridge. At the intersection, turn left and continue travelling for about 6.9 Km. towards the access road leading to the compound of Peñarrubia Central School, about 100 m NW of the Mun. Hall. Station is located 150 m N of the main gate of the said school. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-31, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.56613212, '17° 33\' 58.075640\"', 120.65073320, '120° 39\' 2.639620\"', 0.0000, '0', 135.1260, 0.0000, '2', 96.3418, 250641.82680, 1943728.64700, '51', 17.56782971, '17° 34\' 4.186950\"', 120.64944280, '120° 38\' 57.994210\"', 101.4247, 1942969.92600, 462786.00400, '3', 250503.56400, 1943800.84700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8012, 'ABR-3110', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'BANGUED', 'PATUCANNAY', 2007, 17.60630282, '17° 36\' 22.690152\"', 120.63023700, '120° 37\' 48.853200\"', 'ABR-3110 From the municipality of Bangued, Abra travel south west to barangay Patucannay along the national road which heads to the municipality of Tayum. ABR-3110 is located near the intersection of the national road and the barangay road that leads to the barangay proper. Station is marked by a metal bolt on the center of concrete monument 40 x40 x100 cm. Set 80 cm below the ground 20 cm above the ground , with inscriptions \"ABR-3110 2007 PRS 92 LMS -DENR CAR\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.60630282, '17° 36\' 22.690150\"', 120.63023700, '120° 37\' 48.853190\"', 0.0000, '0', 105.0750, 0.0000, '4', 66.7555, 248520.88650, 1948202.98600, '51', 17.60800326, '17° 36\' 28.811720\"', 120.62894750, '120° 37\' 44.211000\"', 71.5517, 1947419.91300, 460618.96200, '3', 248382.74300, 1948275.28400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
