(8260, 'ABR-35', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SALLAPADAN', 'SACCAANG', 2007, 17.52669868, '17° 31\' 36.115248\"', 120.76765950, '120° 46\' 3.574200\"', 'ABR-35 From the town proper of Bangued, travel to the NE direction towards Lagangilang. In about 24 Km., a road intersection will be reached which is 50 m from Baay Bridge. At the intersection, turn right and continue travelling for about 12.4 Km. to reach the brgy. hall of Abas. Station is located 50 m SE of the brgy. hall, 45 m S of a mango tree with a diameter of 1.2 m located on the brgy. property lot. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-35, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.52669868, '17° 31\' 36.115240\"', 120.76765950, '120° 46\' 3.574260\"', 0.0000, '0', 204.3540, 0.0000, '2', 163.8654, 263006.73720, 1939213.45100, '51', 17.52839138, '17° 31\' 42.208980\"', 120.76636840, '120° 45\' 58.926200\"', 170.2454, 1938586.40100, 475193.14100, '3', 262868.42900, 1939285.24300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
