(8339, 'ABR-3595', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN JUAN', 'QUIDAOEN', 2013, 17.72802310, '17° 43\' 40.883160\"', 120.72733480, '120° 43\' 38.405280\"', 'ABR-3595 The station is located at east side of the basketball court of Quidaoen at approximately 8 meters south and 10 meters west from the stage. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30cm x 30cm x 120cm concrete monument with inscription \"ABR-3595, 2013, 3RD ORDER, LMS DENR-CAR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.72802310, '17° 43\' 40.883170\"', 120.72733480, '120° 43\' 38.405370\"', 0.0000, '0', 135.3360, 0.0000, '3', 96.5771, 258991.74030, 1961551.50000, '51', 17.72972874, '17° 43\' 47.023450\"', 120.72604830, '120° 43\' 33.773890\"', 101.9710, 1960873.26300, 470944.21900, '3', 258854.07600, 1961623.57500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8340, 'ABR-3596', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN JUAN', 'SILET', 2013, 17.71995188, '17° 43\' 11.826768\"', 120.74599000, '120° 44\' 45.564000\"', 'ABR-3596 Upon reaching Brgy. Silet, the station is located 15 meters northeast from the Barangay Hall, 1 meter north from the basketball court and 30 meters northeast from Iglesia ni Cristo church. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30cm x 30cm x 120cm concrete monument with inscription \"ABR-3596, 2013, 3RD ORDER, LMS DENR-CAR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.71995188, '17° 43\' 11.826770\"', 120.74599000, '120° 44\' 45.563930\"', 0.0000, '0', 225.9230, 0.0000, '3', 186.9878, 260960.18890, 1960634.17000, '51', 17.72165661, '17° 43\' 17.963800\"', 120.74470330, '120° 44\' 40.931940\"', 192.4870, 1959977.16500, 472921.60100, '3', 260822.51300, 1960706.17800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8341, 'ABR-3597', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN JUAN', 'SILET', 2013, 17.71902163, '17° 43\' 8.477868\"', 120.74690590, '120° 44\' 48.861240\"', 'ABR-3597 From the Barangay Hall of Silet, travel east for approximately 300 meters or follow the road going Silet Primary School until you reach the junction. The station is located 5 meters northwest of the waiting shed. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30cm x 30cm x 120cm concrete monument with inscription \"ABR-3597, 2013, 3RD ORDER, LMS DENR-CAR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.71902163, '17° 43\' 8.477860\"', 120.74690590, '120° 44\' 48.861240\"', 0.0000, '0', 234.5130, 0.0000, '3', 195.5681, 261056.13090, 1960530.02500, '51', 17.72072628, '17° 43\' 14.614610\"', 120.74561920, '120° 44\' 44.229190\"', 201.0720, 1959874.07700, 473018.60900, '3', 260918.45300, 1960602.02800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8342, 'ABR-3598', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN JUAN', 'SILET', 2013, 17.72112275, '17° 43\' 16.041900\"', 120.74735950, '120° 44\' 50.494200\"', 'ABR-3598 From Town Hall of San Juan, travel northeast to reach Barangay Silet. The station is located inside the campus of Silet Elementary School approximately 3 meters west from the flagpole, 10 meters north from the stage, and 15 meters west from the barangay road. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30cm x 30cm x 120cm concrete monument with inscription \"ABR-3598, 2013, 3RD ORDER, LMS DENR-CAR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.72112275, '17° 43\' 16.041890\"', 120.74735950, '120° 44\' 50.494330\"', 0.0000, '0', 231.9570, 0.0000, '3', 193.0114, 261107.04480, 1960762.04900, '51', 17.72282752, '17° 43\' 22.179060\"', 120.74607290, '120° 44\' 45.862450\"', 198.5210, 1960106.54900, 473067.04400, '3', 260969.37400, 1960834.05200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8343, 'ABR-3599', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN JUAN', 'ABUALAN', 2013, 17.70522368, '17° 42\' 18.805248\"', 120.74398640, '120° 44\' 38.351040\"', 'ABR-3599 From the Provincial road going to the Municipality of Tineg, travel northward for about 3 km more or less. The station is located at the intersection road going to the house of the barangay captain. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30cm x 30cm x 120cm concrete monument with inscription \"ABR-3599, 2013, 3RD ORDER, LMS DENR-CAR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.70522368, '17° 42\' 18.805260\"', 120.74398640, '120° 44\' 38.350940\"', 0.0000, '0', 174.5760, 0.0000, '3', 135.6296, 260728.07200, 1959006.25900, '51', 17.70692759, '17° 42\' 24.939320\"', 120.74269940, '120° 44\' 33.717670\"', 141.0980, 1958347.44400, 472706.81900, '3', 260590.34400, 1959078.26300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8344, 'ABR-36', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LICUAN-BAAY', 'TUMALIP', 2007, 17.54682314, '17° 32\' 48.563304\"', 120.87464180, '120° 52\' 28.710480\"', 'ABR-36 From Bangued, Abra town proper, travel towards E along Abra-Kalinga road for about 53.55 km. until reaching the intersection which is about 50 m from the Municipal Hall of Baay Licuan. Turn right and continue travel for about 7.5 km. until reaching the Barangay Hall of Tumalip. The station is located at the baseline of the basketball court, about 20 m. E of the stage, and about 60 m. NE of the church. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-36, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.54682314, '17° 32\' 48.563310\"', 120.87464180, '120° 52\' 28.710480\"', 0.0000, '0', 346.8080, 0.0000, '2', 305.1839, 274393.67280, 1941310.91700, '51', 17.54851474, '17° 32\' 54.653050\"', 120.87335130, '120° 52\' 24.064770\"', 312.5069, 1940802.57300, 486554.02800, '3', 274255.51300, 1941382.37800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8345, 'ABR-3600', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN JUAN', 'ABUALAN', 2013, 17.70315450, '17° 42\' 11.356200\"', 120.74761850, '120° 44\' 51.426600\"', 'ABR-3600 From the Town Proper of San Juan, travel in northeast direction of approximately 13 km to reach the barangay hall of Abualan. The station is located within the compound of Alimosgan Elementary School, infront of the school grotto, 5 meters away from the room of grade III, 5 meters away from the school office, 2 meters away from the basketball court and 15 meters away from the school flagpole.The said school is located near the barangay hall Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30cm x 30cm x 120cm concrete monument with inscription \"ABR-3600, 2013, 3RD ORDER, LMS DENR-CAR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.70315450, '17° 42\' 11.356190\"', 120.74761850, '120° 44\' 51.426610\"', 0.0000, '0', 179.9610, 0.0000, '3', 140.9723, 261110.71750, 1958772.58000, '51', 17.70485820, '17° 42\' 17.489530\"', 120.74633140, '120° 44\' 46.793190\"', 146.4670, 1958117.90900, 473091.78700, '3', 260972.98600, 1958844.57100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8346, 'ABR-3601', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN JUAN', 'ABUALAN', 2013, 17.70948716, '17° 42\' 34.153776\"', 120.74974320, '120° 44\' 59.075520\"', 'ABR-3601 From town proper of San Juan, travel in a northeast direction for about 20 minutes ride going to Barangay Abualan. From the Brgy. Hall of Abualan travel the road going to the Brgy. of Silet until reaching the intersection road near the waiting shed. The station is located on the left side of the road approximately 30 meters away from the waiting shed. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30cm x 30cm x 120cm concrete monument with inscription \"ABR-3601, 2013, 3RD ORDER, LMS DENR-CAR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.70948716, '17° 42\' 34.153760\"', 120.74974320, '120° 44\' 59.075450\"', 0.0000, '0', 213.1350, 0.0000, '3', 174.1480, 261344.53580, 1959470.92800, '51', 17.71119118, '17° 42\' 40.288260\"', 120.74845630, '120° 44\' 54.442600\"', 179.6560, 1958818.45600, 473318.11900, '3', 261206.82700, 1959542.91600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(8347, 'ABR-3602', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN JUAN', 'SUPI-IL', 2013, 17.66443946, '17° 39\' 51.982056\"', 120.74913580, '120° 44\' 56.888880\"', 'ABR-3602 From the Brgy. Hall of Supi-il, travel east for approximately 400 meters to reach the house of Engr. Rexel dela Quadra. The station is located approximately 4 meters northeast from the house and 4 meters northwest from a mango tree. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30cm x 30cm x 120cm concrete monument with inscription \"ABR-3602, 2013, 3RD ORDER, LMS DENR-CAR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.66443946, '17° 39\' 51.982070\"', 120.74913580, '120° 44\' 56.888990\"', 0.0000, '0', 202.4000, 0.0000, '3', 163.2426, 261220.54300, 1954484.79800, '51', 17.66614081, '17° 39\' 58.106930\"', 120.74784790, '120° 44\' 52.252370\"', 168.7780, 1953832.98600, 473246.91800, '3', 261082.68300, 1954556.75400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
