(8368, 'ABR-3623', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN JUAN', 'LAM-AG', 2013, 17.67337633, '17° 40\' 24.154788\"', 120.72902470, '120° 43\' 44.488920\"', 'ABR-3623 From the town proper of San Juan, travel the road going to Brgy. Lam-ag, Badas, and Lumobang. After passing the welcome arc of Brgy. Badas, continue travelling until reaching the catholic church located right side of the road. The church is within the Brgy. Lam-ag then turn right on a road located near the church. Continue travelling until reaching the corn field and of a riverbank. The station is located at the corn field. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30cm x 30cm x 120cm concrete monument with inscription \"ABR-3623, 2013, 3RD ORDER, LMS DENR-CAR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.67337633, '17° 40\' 24.154800\"', 120.72902470, '120° 43\' 44.489040\"', 0.0000, '0', 108.4420, 0.0000, '3', 69.5331, 259098.08270, 1955499.71400, '51', 17.67507867, '17° 40\' 30.283210\"', 120.72773690, '120° 43\' 39.853000\"', 74.8970, 1954825.06800, 471114.58200, '3', 258960.23700, 1955571.74300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
