(8546, 'ABR-38', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'BOLINEY', 'BAO-YAN', 2007, 17.38321611, '17° 22\' 59.577996\"', 120.78880570, '120° 47\' 19.700520\"', 'ABR-38 From Bangued, Abra town proper, travel towards Narvacan, Ilocos Sur for about 2.5 km. Turn left at the intersection before Sinalang Bridge, and continue travel for about 29.6 km. until reaching Abra River. Pass through the river by riding a ferry. Continue travel towards Boliney for about 2.1 km. Turn left at the intersection after the boundary of Poblacion and San Ramon West in the town of Manabo. Continue travel for about 14.8 km. until reaching the ricefield at the left side of the road. The station is located at the center part of the rice field, about 25 m from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a brass rod with cross cut on top set flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"ABR-38, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.38321611, '17° 22\' 59.577980\"', 120.78880570, '120° 47\' 19.700580\"', 0.0000, '0', 378.5070, 0.0000, '2', 336.4713, 265068.65830, 1923303.97300, '51', 17.38489968, '17° 23\' 5.638850\"', 120.78751130, '120° 47\' 15.040780\"', 343.8897, 1922704.48800, 477420.42800, '3', 264929.88900, 1923375.58100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
