(8562, 'ABR-3815 (BBM-5)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'MANABO', 'CATACDEGAN VIEJO', 2014, 17.44839381, '17° 26\' 54.217716\"', 120.73994320, '120° 44\' 23.795520\"', 'ABR-3815 (BBM-5) From Municipal Hall of Manabo travel north direction along the Provincial Road to reach the road going to Mun. of Sallapadan Abra. turn right and continue travel along the Prov\'l road for about 2kms. to reach the trail, turn left then continue travel northeast for about 70.00 meters to reach the rice field. The station was established at the rice field 5.00 meters north from mango tree. Mark is the head of 4 in. bolt, centered on a concrete monument. 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm and protruding by 50 cm above the ground surface with inscription as \'\'BBM NO. 5.\'\'', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.44839381, '17° 26\' 54.217710\"', 120.73994320, '120° 44\' 23.795450\"', 0.0000, '0', 185.7400, 0.0000, '3', 144.8633, 259960.21740, 1930579.76600, '51', 17.45008241, '17° 27\' 0.296660\"', 120.73865020, '120° 44\' 19.140700\"', 151.4478, 1929924.23700, 472238.14500, '3', 259821.62600, 1930651.58800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
