(8564, 'ABR-3816 (BBM-6)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'MANABO', 'AYYENG', 2014, 17.43829811, '17° 26\' 17.873196\"', 120.74777390, '120° 44\' 51.986040\"', 'ABR-3816 (BBM-6) From Municipal Hall of Manabo travel north direction along the Provincial Road going to Mun. of Sallapadan Abra. for about 100 meters then turn right and take the Provincial Road going to the Municipality of Sallapadan. Continue travelling along the said Road until reaching Sitio Malidom Manabo Abra. Continue travel southeast follow the trail for about 2km. until reaching Sitio Tultulao Manabo Abra. The station was established at the lot of Mr. Adam Siagan, 50.00 meters south from nipa hut 10.00 meters southwest from mango tree. Mark is the head of 4 in. bolt, centered on a concrete monument. 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm and protruding by 50 cm above the ground surface with inscription as \'\'BBM NO. 6.\'\'', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.43829811, '17° 26\' 17.873210\"', 120.74777390, '120° 44\' 51.985890\"', 0.0000, '0', 209.6380, 0.0000, '3', 168.5741, 260779.08930, 1929452.33900, '51', 17.43998593, '17° 26\' 23.949340\"', 120.74648070, '120° 44\' 47.330350\"', 175.2947, 1928805.80500, 473068.45700, '3', 260640.47000, 1929524.12600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
