(8591, 'ABR-3829', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'DANGLAS', 'ABAQUID', 2013, 17.70019692, '17° 42\' 0.708912\"', 120.66159340, '120° 39\' 41.736240\"', 'STATION MARK : Head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 cm x 30 cm x 120 cm concrete monument with inscription \"ABR-3829, 2013, 3rd Order, LMS, DENR-CAR\" ACCESS : From the Municipality of Bangued travel on National road going to Municipality of La Paz until reaching a crossing, at crossing turn left on the road going to Municipality of Danglas. Continue travel until reaching the marker of Brgy. Abaquid, turn left on the road until reaching a shed then walk on the \"pilapil\" leading to the station. The station is located approximately 80 m from the house of Judie Parinas.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.70019692, '17° 42\' 0.708910\"', 120.66159340, '120° 39\' 41.736190\"', 0.0000, '0', 119.2590, 0.0000, '3', 80.9777, 251978.68160, 1958556.41200, '51', 17.70190230, '17° 42\' 6.848280\"', 120.66030610, '120° 39\' 37.102000\"', 85.9622, 1957805.15800, 463965.87500, '3', 251840.87500, 1958628.67900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
