(8693, 'ABR-39 (BBM-15)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'MANABO', 'AYYENG', 2007, 17.42824075, '17° 25\' 41.666700\"', 120.70437680, '120° 42\' 15.756480\"', 'ABR-39 From the town proper of Bangued, travel towards Narvacan, Ilocos Sur. Just before the Sinalang Bridge and in about 2.5 Km., a road intersection will be reached. At the road intersection, turn left and continue travelling towards Abra River which is about 29.6 Km. away. Travel by ferry boat to reach the other side of the river. From the river bank, continue travelling for about 1.3 Km. to reach the Mun. Hall of Manabo. From the Mun. Hall, travel towards Luba for about 300 m to reach the boundary of Brgy. Poblacion and Brgy. San Juan East. Station is equivalent to BBM No. 15 which is located 70 m SE of the Iglesia ni Cristo bldg., 50 m from the back of Bona\'s residence. Mark is the head of a copper nail flushed at the center of a concrete monument with inscriptions, \"BBM No. 15\" = \"ABR-39\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.42824075, '17° 25\' 41.666710\"', 120.70437680, '120° 42\' 15.756520\"', 0.0000, '0', 164.4620, 0.0000, '2', 123.8246, 256154.26790, 1928393.83300, '51', 17.42992890, '17° 25\' 47.744050\"', 120.70308330, '120° 42\' 11.099890\"', 130.1910, 1927699.49400, 468456.56600, '3', 256015.58300, 1928465.75400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
