(9238, 'ABR-4471 (MBM-32)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'PEÑARRUBIA', 'NAMARABAR', 2010, 17.55512954, '17° 33\' 18.466344\"', 120.63888190, '120° 38\' 19.974840\"', 'ABR-4471 (MBM-32) MBM No. 32 is established in the Municipality of Bangued and Municipality of Peñarrubia. Approximately 5082.86 meters North 64 East from the Municipal Hall of Bangued. Station is marked by a metal bolt on the center of concrete monument 25 x 25 x 120cm set 70cm below the ground 30cm above the ground, with inscriptions \"MBM No. 32, CAD-536-D, 2010\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.55512954, '17° 33\' 18.466340\"', 120.63888190, '120° 38\' 19.974960\"', 0.0000, '0', 111.1550, 0.0000, '4', 72.4205, 249368.15650, 1942526.18900, '51', 17.55682673, '17° 33\' 24.576210\"', 120.63759130, '120° 38\' 15.328550\"', 77.4469, 1941754.63400, 461525.54300, '3', 249229.84700, 1942598.41900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9239, 'ABR-5 (BLLM-2)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'VILLAVICIOSA', 'POBLACION', 2013, 17.43793264, '17° 26\' 16.557504\"', 120.62689200, '120° 37\' 36.811200\"', 'ABR-5 (BLLM 2) Is located inside the compound of Villa Viciosa Central School, in an open ground 10 m. SE of the school stage, 30 m. W of the flagpole. The school is located in an intersection with the road leading to the municipal hall fronting the school gate. The town is reached by following the national highway going to Bangued, then taking the rough, uphill road on the right side of the highway after passing through an Iglesia Ni Cristo Church on the right side at the town of Piddigan. Travel time from that uphill road up to Villa Viciosa town proper is approx. 1 hr. Mark is a crosscut on top of the brass rod embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument, with inscription \"BLLM No. 2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.43793264, '17° 26\' 16.557500\"', 120.62689200, '120° 37\' 36.811130\"', 0.0000, '0', 222.5290, 0.0000, '2', 182.9486, 247933.16880, 1929567.34300, '51', 17.43962301, '17° 26\' 22.642820\"', 120.62559860, '120° 37\' 32.155000\"', 188.4750, 1928786.73200, 460226.86600, '3', 247794.46100, 1929639.51800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9240, 'ABR-55', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'BANGUED', 'ZONE 7 POB.', 1998, 17.59373141, '17° 35\' 37.433076\"', 120.62113570, '120° 37\' 16.088520\"', 'ABR-55 ABR-55 is located on top of Casamata Hill at Brgy. Angad, approximately 5 meters south west from the reservoir of Bangued Water District. Station is marked by metal bolt on the center of concrete monument 40 x 40 x 100 cm . Set 80 cm below the ground , with inscriptions \"ABR-55 1998 PRS-1992\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.59373141, '17° 35\' 37.433080\"', 120.62113570, '120° 37\' 16.088340\"', 0.0000, '0', 140.4860, 0.0000, '2', 102.1884, 247537.11360, 1946823.32400, '51', 17.59543128, '17° 35\' 43.552610\"', 120.61984590, '120° 37\' 11.445090\"', 106.9443, 1946030.53400, 459650.17200, '3', 247398.92200, 1946895.64000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9241, 'ABR-6', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'SAN QUINTIN', 'TANGADAN', 2005, 17.49478699, '17° 29\' 41.233164\"', 120.50485710, '120° 30\' 17.485560\"', 'ABR-6 Is in Brgy. Tangadan, San Quintin, Abra. It is located along the national highway, near the provincial road boundary of Ilocos Sur and Abra. It is located behind the steel railings of a short, expanded area of the national road leading to Bangued. It is about 200 m. E of the PNP checkpoint, about 200 m. W of the Horse Monument (Provincial Seal of Abra) and 300 m. before reaching the welcome park and tunnel. Mark is a crosscut on top of a 6 in. brass rod embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"ABR-6, 2005, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.49478699, '17° 29\' 41.233180\"', 120.50485710, '120° 30\' 17.485610\"', 0.0000, '0', 193.0390, 0.0000, '2', 155.5213, 235046.59370, 1936027.28200, '51', 17.49648340, '17° 29\' 47.340240\"', 120.50356490, '120° 30\' 12.833560\"', 159.4602, 1935108.79000, 447279.19900, '3', 234907.98600, 1936099.89600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9242, 'ABR-9 (BLLM-3)', 'LUZON', 'CAR', 'ABRA', 'LAGAYAN', 'COLLAGO', 2007, 17.75096083, '17° 45\' 3.458988\"', 120.72476790, '120° 43\' 29.164440\"', 'ABR-9 (BLLM-3) From Bangued, Abra town proper, travel towards E-NW direction for about 3.3 km. until reaching Abra River. Pass through the river by riding a ferry and continue travel for about 24.5 km. towards Brgy. Collago, passing through the Municipality of Dangla. The station is located about 130 m. SE of Collago Elementary School, and NE of the station are Balete trees. Mark is the head of a 4\" nail set at the center of a 40 cm x 40 cm concrete monument with inscriptions, \"BLLM No. 3\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 17.75096083, '17° 45\' 3.458980\"', 120.72476790, '120° 43\' 29.164330\"', 0.0000, '0', 174.6440, 0.0000, '2', 135.9273, 258750.14660, 1964094.10700, '51', 17.75266788, '17° 45\' 9.604370\"', 120.72348190, '120° 43\' 24.534740\"', 141.3592, 1963412.26900, 470675.75100, '3', 258612.55700, 1964166.20800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9243, 'LUN-1 (BALL 1902)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'SAN VICENTE', 1993, 16.58250581, '16° 34\' 57.020916\"', 120.30442700, '120° 18\' 15.937200\"', 'LUN-1 = BALL 1902 Is on top of a small hill 1.5 km. SE of San Fernando Airport 1.3 km. S of Canaoay Elem. School, and 200 m. E of Mr. Antonio Jucutan\'s house. Travel time from San Fernando, La Union town proper is 10 min. up to the foot of the hill and from the foot of the hill to the station is approx. 5 min. walk. Station mark; old station was recovered and refurbished. A 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod was set in standard concrete block protruding 15 cm. above natural ground and inscribed with station name. 4 Reference marks (RM) are brass rods set in concrete blocks and inscribed RM-1, 2, 3 & 4.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.58250581, '16° 34\' 57.020900\"', 120.30442700, '120° 18\' 15.937230\"', 0.0000, '0', 86.1467, 0.0000, '1', 46.0227, 212357.35320, 1835302.78300, '51', 16.58415117, '16° 35\' 2.944220\"', 120.30311330, '120° 18\' 11.207750\"', 50.1871, 1834212.20200, 425630.86500, '3', 212215.52000, 1835375.32900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9244, 'LUN-10', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'TANQUI', 1997, 16.62040843, '16° 37\' 13.470348\"', 120.31999640, '120° 19\' 11.987040\"', 'LUN-10 (JOCKO 1948) Is located on the concrete dome of a water district concrete tank/reservoir. To reach the station from San Fernando Town Hall, take the road leading to Zandueta St. and turn left until reaching the end of the road. Then hike uphill for about 200 m. passing by a transmitter of PHILTEL. From this point the concrete dome of the water reservoir is already visible. Follow the trail that leads to the station. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded on a 0.1 m. x 0.1 m. cement putty, with no inscription', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.62040843, '16° 37\' 13.470353\"', 120.31999640, '120° 19\' 11.986863\"', 0.0000, '0', 101.7444, 0.0000, '3', 61.6907, 214075.89750, 1839477.19200, '51', 16.62205578, '16° 37\' 19.400810\"', 120.31868350, '120° 19\' 7.260650\"', 65.8641, 1838401.02100, 427306.78300, '3', 213934.20400, 1839549.71700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9245, 'LUN-11', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'PORO', 1997, 16.61087720, '16° 36\' 39.157920\"', 120.30240170, '120° 18\' 8.646120\"', 'LUN-11 To reach the station, from San Fernando town proper travel toward Poro Pt. and turn right on a access road leading to Philex Pier. Ask permission on the main gate to have access of their private port, then continue travel and head towards the offshore end of the pier. Station is located on the offshore end of the pier, on a observation platform, W of the main pier and about 20 m. NE of San Fernando tide station and 100 m. NNE of Philex Mining Main Office. Station mark is the head of a 4.0 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 0.1 m. x 0.1 m. cement putty with inscription \"LUN-11 1996 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.61087720, '16° 36\' 39.157912\"', 120.30240170, '120° 18\' 8.645947\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.9168, 0.0000, '3', 7.9632, 212183.37200, 1838447.08500, '51', 16.61252436, '16° 36\' 45.087690\"', 120.30108860, '120° 18\' 3.918810\"', 12.0496, 1837352.73800, 425425.72800, '3', 212041.63200, 1838519.66100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9246, 'LUN-12', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'CARLATAN', 1997, 16.63375051, '16° 38\' 1.501836\"', 120.31035110, '120° 18\' 37.263960\"', 'LUN-12 To reach the station, travel N along the national road from San Fernando town proper to Brgy. Carlatan and turn left on a service road leading to the Philippine National Police Headquarters (CAMP DIEGO SILANG). Station is located within the PNP Headquarters, about 15.0 m. S of the Provincial Director\'s House and 13.0 m. SW of their cadet training center. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 0.1 m. x 0.1 m. cement putty with inscription \"LUN-12 1996 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.63375051, '16° 38\' 1.501836\"', 120.31035110, '120° 18\' 37.263958\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.1968, 0.0000, '3', 5.3102, 213066.08820, 1840968.28700, '51', 16.63539890, '16° 38\' 7.436050\"', 120.30903860, '120° 18\' 32.538780\"', 9.3810, 1839881.10200, 426282.76600, '3', 212924.43100, 1841040.85600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9247, 'LUN-14', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'PORO', 1997, 16.62479054, '16° 37\' 29.245944\"', 120.28343430, '120° 17\' 0.363480\"', 'LUN-14 From San Fernando town proper, travel westward to Poro Pt. for about 5.0 kms. up to the Walace Air Station. Ask permission to enter the Military Air Station before entering the base. Then continue travelling for about 200m and turn right towards the shore (Walace Beach resort) then continue travel westward along the rocky shore until reaching the first very prominent rocky just behind two Hangars for Helicopters. Station mark is the head of 10mm steel bar embedded and centered on a 12\" x 12\" concrete monument with inscription \"WALACE-1\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.62479054, '16° 37\' 29.245929\"', 120.28343430, '120° 17\' 0.363562\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.1169, 0.0000, '3', 6.3945, 210179.31060, 1840015.02000, '51', 16.62643896, '16° 37\' 35.180260\"', 120.28212150, '120° 16\' 55.637510\"', 10.3385, 1838899.69500, 423407.36500, '3', 210037.60300, 1840087.66900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9248, 'LUN-15', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SANTO TOMAS', 'PATAC', 1996, 16.27813021, '16° 16\' 41.268756\"', 120.39083740, '120° 23\' 27.014640\"', 'LUN-15 Is in the Island of Luzon, Province of La Union, Municipality of Sto. Tomas, Brgy. Palac. It is located at the NW corner of Palac Bridge about 500 m. S of the Municipal Hall of Sto. Tomas. Mark is the center of the head of 4\" copper nail set flush with cement putty on the sidewalk of the bridge with inscription \"LUN-15, 1996, NAMRIA. It is accessible by land transportation via the Rosario-Agoo National Road.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.27813021, '16° 16\' 41.268760\"', 120.39083740, '120° 23\' 27.014690\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.1255, 0.0000, '3', 13.6803, 221149.23850, 1801481.56400, '51', 16.27975494, '16° 16\' 47.117790\"', 120.38951670, '120° 23\' 22.259990\"', 18.0235, 1800498.63600, 434750.29900, '3', 221006.44700, 1801553.57800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9249, 'LUN-16', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SANTO TOMAS', 'PATAC', 1996, 16.28353054, '16° 17\' 0.709944\"', 120.38889230, '120° 23\' 20.012280\"', 'LUN-16 Is in the island of Luzon, province of La Union, municipality of Sto. Tomas, Brgy. Palac. It is located infront of the 3 columned waiting shed at the corner of National Road-Municipal Hall road junction. It is set at the SE edge of the concrete pavement about 10 m. away from the centerline of the national road and 15 m. from the center of Municipal Hall road. Mark is the center of the head of a 4\" copper nail set flush with the cement putty with inscription \"LUN-16, 1996 NAMRIA\". It is accessible by land transportation via Agoo-Rosario National Road.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.28353054, '16° 17\' 0.709940\"', 120.38889230, '120° 23\' 20.012190\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.4098, 0.0000, '3', 10.9744, 220948.87640, 1802082.11800, '51', 16.28515564, '16° 17\' 6.560320\"', 120.38757170, '120° 23\' 15.257940\"', 15.3290, 1801096.87500, 434544.19600, '3', 220806.10200, 1802154.14300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9250, 'LUN-17', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'PILAR', 1997, 16.48868822, '16° 29\' 19.277592\"', 120.32237720, '120° 19\' 20.557920\"', 'LUN-17 Is located at Bauang Power Plant Corp. compound, Bgy. Payocpoc, municipality of Bauang, province of La Union and is found near BPPC Pier measured about 12 m. NE of guard house no. 3 posting at jetty gate and 10 m. SE of guest house. Station is a putty cement centered by 3\" copper nail on the road edge towards the pier and marked \"LUN-17, 1997, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.48868822, '16° 29\' 19.277590\"', 120.32237720, '120° 19\' 20.557815\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.4484, 0.0000, '3', 4.7540, 214135.71460, 1824889.44500, '51', 16.49032744, '16° 29\' 25.178780\"', 120.32106130, '120° 19\' 15.820500\"', 9.1565, 1823823.17400, 427511.26300, '3', 213993.57800, 1824961.85700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1998-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9251, 'LUN-176', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'BUNGOL', 2004, 16.76899922, '16° 46\' 8.397192\"', 120.40281460, '120° 24\' 10.132560\"', 'LUN-176 (FNSP-DENR) From Candon City, Ilocos Sur, travel S to the province of La Union passing through Balaoan town proper until reaching Km. Post No. 292 on the left side of the highway. Travel more for about 300 m. until reaching a concrete waiting shed on the right side of the highway, before reaching a highway curve and the road leading to Magic Star Fireworks Factory. Beside the concrete shed is a trail, follow this trail until reaching a house with an artesian well beside a series of Coconut trees. It is located on a corner of a farm dike, about 15 m. SE of the well and about 20 m. SW of the nearest house. Mark is the head of a 3 in. concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"LUN-176, 2004, PRS-92, FNSP-DENR-I\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.76899922, '16° 46\' 8.397180\"', 120.40281460, '120° 24\' 10.132520\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.2530, 0.0000, '2', 31.4200, 223131.16300, 1855812.22400, '51', 16.77065388, '16° 46\' 14.353970\"', 120.40150530, '120° 24\' 5.419150\"', 35.6331, 1854816.57500, 436193.11400, '3', 222990.03400, 1855884.60100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9252, 'LUN-179', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'LUNA', 'CANTORIA NO. 4', 2004, 16.84473022, '16° 50\' 41.028792\"', 120.41758260, '120° 25\' 3.297360\"', 'LUN-179 (FNSP-DENR) From Candon City, Ilocos Sur, travel S to the province of La Union until reaching Km. Post No. 302 on the left side of the highway on the town of Balaoan. It is about 2 m. SE of Km. Post No. 302, after passing through a concrete culvert with the sign DPWH Km. 302 + 033 marker on the left side of the highway, near an irrigation canal. It is about 7 m. from the highway centerline. Mark is the head of a 3 in. CW nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 10 cm., with inscriptions \"LUN-179, 2004, PRS-92, FNSP-DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.84473022, '16° 50\' 41.028800\"', 120.41758260, '120° 25\' 3.297180\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.9750, 0.0000, '2', 10.4662, 224815.72300, 1864176.39000, '51', 16.84638920, '16° 50\' 47.001110\"', 120.41627510, '120° 24\' 58.590210\"', 14.5551, 1863192.79000, 437792.48800, '3', 224674.86000, 1864248.78100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9253, 'LUN-18', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'SANTIAGO', 1997, 16.48939496, '16° 29\' 21.821856\"', 120.32549110, '120° 19\' 31.767960\"', 'LUN-18 Station is located at Bauang Power PLant Corp. compound, Brgy. Poyocpoc, Municipality of Bauang, Province of La Union and is found near Black Cylindrical Fuel Tank which measured about 5m on it and 20m NE of guard house No. 2. Station is a cement putty centered by 3 copper nail on the chaplan corner of the road and marked \"LUN-18, 1997, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.48939496, '16° 29\' 21.821865\"', 120.32549110, '120° 19\' 31.767821\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.2242, 0.0000, '3', 5.5082, 214469.39660, 1824963.28400, '51', 16.49103416, '16° 29\' 27.722970\"', 120.32417520, '120° 19\' 27.030580\"', 9.9269, 1823900.26300, 427844.00300, '3', 214327.26500, 1825035.68600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1998-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9254, 'LUN-189', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BANGAR', 'LUZONG SUR', 2005, 16.85853247, '16° 51\' 30.716892\"', 120.44136100, '120° 26\' 28.899600\"', 'LUN-189 (FNSP-DENR) From Candon City, Ilocos Sur, travel S passing through Bangar town proper until reaching a road going to Sinapangan Norte. This concrete farm road is on the left side of the highway with a ricemill and a Brgy. Police Force oupost on the corner. This road is next after passing through Km. 304 + 387 marker of the DPWH and a concrete waiting shed. Follow this road passing through Brgy. Sinapangan Norte welcome sign, until reaching an intersection with a barangay outpost on the left corner. Take the road to the left until reaching another intersection. Take the road on the right, making a U-turn. Follow this road until reaching a \"T\" intersection. It is located on the right corner of the intersection, near an irrigation dike. Mark is the head of a 3 in. concrete nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"LUN-189, 2005, PRS-92, FNSP-DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.85853247, '16° 51\' 30.716890\"', 120.44136100, '120° 26\' 28.899650\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.8650, 0.0000, '2', 16.1225, 227370.78710, 1865671.53400, '51', 16.86019177, '16° 51\' 36.690380\"', 120.44005390, '120° 26\' 24.193960\"', 20.4307, 1864712.86100, 440330.99100, '3', 227229.98900, 1865743.85900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9255, 'LUN-195', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BANGAR', 'BANGAOILAN WEST', 2005, 16.89735416, '16° 53\' 50.474976\"', 120.43960600, '120° 26\' 22.581600\"', 'LUN-195 (FNSP-DENR) Is in Brgy. Bangaoilan West, Bangar. Station is reached by taking the concrete farm road on the right side of the highway going to Candon City, Ilocos Sur, with the brgy. hall, basketball court and chapel on the corner, before reaching Bangaoilan East Elem. School on the left side. Then turn right and travel for about 100 m. Station is located on the right side of the road, beside an irrigation canal, near a concrete walk connecting the road and the irrigation dike. It is about 30 m. SW of a concrete walk bridge just before reaching a road curve. Mark is the head of a 3 in. roofing nail embbedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"LUN-195 2005 PRS-92 FNSP-DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.89735416, '16° 53\' 50.474970\"', 120.43960600, '120° 26\' 22.581580\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.8850, 0.0000, '3', 14.3564, 227239.48480, 1869972.14900, '51', 16.89901587, '16° 53\' 56.457120\"', 120.43829980, '120° 26\' 17.879130\"', 18.5761, 1869009.69800, 440156.29400, '3', 227098.81600, 1870044.51100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9256, 'LUN-196', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BANGAR', 'BANGAOILAN WEST', 2005, 16.89723489, '16° 53\' 50.045604\"', 120.44239100, '120° 26\' 32.607600\"', 'LUN-196 (FNSP-DENR) Is in Brgy. Bangaoilan West, Bangar. Station is located on the right side of a concrete farm road, along a curve, about 150 m. SSW of the brgy. hall, basketball court and chapel. It also about 5 m. ESE of an electrical light post, near an irrigation canal. The concrete farm road leading to the station is on the right side of the highway going to Candon City, Ilocos Sur, with the brgy. hall, basketball court and chapel on the corner, before reaching Bangaoilan East Elem. School on the left side. Mark is the head of a 3 in. roofing nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"LUN-196 2005 PRS-92 FNSP-DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.89723489, '16° 53\' 50.045590\"', 120.44239100, '120° 26\' 32.607740\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.1140, 0.0000, '3', 15.5457, 227536.17100, 1869955.08700, '51', 16.89889653, '16° 53\' 56.027500\"', 120.44108480, '120° 26\' 27.905300\"', 19.7980, 1868995.64900, 440452.98400, '3', 227395.50400, 1870027.44000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9257, 'LUN-197', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BANGAR', 'BANGAOILAN EAST', 2005, 16.89496498, '16° 53\' 41.873928\"', 120.44686870, '120° 26\' 48.727320\"', 'LUN-197 (FNSP-DENR) Is in Brgy. Bangaoilan East, Bangar. Station is reached by taking the concrete farm road on the right side of the highway going to Candon City, Ilocos Sur. This road is on the opposite side of Bangaoilan East Elem. School compound, the next road after passing through the brgy. hall, church and basketball court. Travel this road until reaching an intersection. Take the road on the left then turn right on the road just before reaching a road curve. Continue traveling this road passing through a concrete culvert until reaching an artesian well on the right side of the road where the station is located. It is situated at the NE corner, about 2 m. from the artesian well. It is also located at about 20 m. S of a concrete culvert. Mark is the head of a 3 in. roofing nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"LUN-197 2005 PRS-92 FNSP-DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.89496498, '16° 53\' 41.873910\"', 120.44686870, '120° 26\' 48.727360\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.5580, 0.0000, '3', 15.9171, 228010.18800, 1869697.58100, '51', 16.89662638, '16° 53\' 47.854970\"', 120.44556240, '120° 26\' 44.024750\"', 20.2242, 1868743.08500, 440929.33800, '3', 227869.51700, 1869769.91700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9258, 'LUN-20', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'ROSARIO', 'RABON', 1997, 16.20834565, '16° 12\' 30.044340\"', 120.41629830, '120° 24\' 58.673880\"', 'LUN-20 Is in the island of Luzon, province of La Union, municipality of Rosario at Brgy. Rabon. It is located 350 m. NNW of Rabon Bridge; 120 m. NW of main gate of Shell LPG Rabon Depot, 50 m. NNW of a waiting shed fronting said depot, 10 m. from the centerline of the road and 5.0 m ESE of a 1.0 m. public toilet. The mark is a concrete nail driven on top of an existing 0.22 m. x 0.22 m. concrete block which is inclined with the vertical by approx. 10 and protruding from the ground by about 0.19 m. it bears the inscription, \"LUN-20 1997 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.20834565, '16° 12\' 30.044330\"', 120.41629830, '120° 24\' 58.674032\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.4543, 0.0000, '3', 10.9496, 223774.39470, 1793720.93100, '51', 16.20996550, '16° 12\' 35.875790\"', 120.41497600, '120° 24\' 53.913580\"', 15.0782, 1792768.16200, 437449.46700, '3', 223631.38900, 1793792.80400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1998-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
