(9259, 'LUN-200', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BANGAR', 'BANGAOILAN EAST', 2005, 16.89762396, '16° 53\' 51.446256\"', 120.44718300, '120° 26\' 49.858800\"', 'LUN-200 (FNSP-DENR) Is in Brgy. Bangaoilan East, Bangar. Station is reached by taking the concrete farm road on the right side of the highway going to Candon City, Ilocos Sur. This road is on the opposite side of Bangaoilan East Elem. School compound, the next road after passing through the brgy. hall, church and basketball court. Travel this road until reaching an intersection. Station is located on the W side of the intersection, about 1 m. from an electrical light post, near an irrigation canal. Mark is the head of a 3 in. roofing nail embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument protruding by about 5 cm., with inscriptions \"LUN-200 2005 PRS-92 FNSP-DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.89762396, '16° 53\' 51.446260\"', 120.44718300, '120° 26\' 49.858850\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.2980, 0.0000, '3', 16.6642, 228047.50460, 1869991.53900, '51', 16.89928552, '16° 53\' 57.427880\"', 120.44587680, '120° 26\' 45.156460\"', 20.9717, 1869037.25400, 440963.65900, '3', 227906.84200, 1870063.87600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9260, 'LUN-21', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'ROSARIO', 'RABON', 1997, 16.20613514, '16° 12\' 22.086504\"', 120.41847470, '120° 25\' 6.508920\"', 'LUN-21 Is situated at Brgy. Rabon, municipality of Rosario, province of La Union. Mark is located at the SE end of Rabon Bridge. Station mark is a 3\" copper nail centered on a cement putty on the shoulder bridge approach inscribed \"LUN-21, 1997 NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.20613514, '16° 12\' 22.086498\"', 120.41847470, '120° 25\' 6.509072\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.1846, 0.0000, '3', 7.6723, 224004.12950, 1793473.27000, '51', 16.20775481, '16° 12\' 27.917300\"', 120.41715230, '120° 25\' 1.748440\"', 11.7965, 1792522.87800, 437681.47400, '3', 223861.11800, 1793545.13400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1998-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9261, 'LUN-22', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'APALENG', 2001, 16.61028741, '16° 36\' 37.034676\"', 120.36510080, '120° 21\' 54.362880\"', 'LUN-22 Is in the province of La Union, municipality of San Fernando, Brgy. Apaleng. Station mark is the head of 2\" copper nail, embedded and centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription \"LUN-22, NAMRIA\". Note: Intervisible to station LUN-23.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.61028741, '16° 36\' 37.034669\"', 120.36510080, '120° 21\' 54.362944\"', 0.0000, '0', 281.3231, 0.0000, '3', 240.7910, 218876.13570, 1838292.67400, '51', 16.61193311, '16° 36\' 42.959210\"', 120.36378780, '120° 21\' 49.636230\"', 245.3028, 1837265.02500, 432115.81500, '3', 218734.44800, 1838365.03900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9262, 'LUN-23', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'APALENG', 2001, 16.60780574, '16° 36\' 28.100664\"', 120.36549750, '120° 21\' 55.791000\"', 'LUN-23 Is in the province of La Union, municipality of San Fernando, Brgy. Apaleng. Station mark is the head of 2\" copper nail embedded on a 0.30 m. x 0.30 m. x 1.0 m. standard concrete monument with inscriptions \"LUN-23 NAMRIA\". Station is intervisible to station LUN-22.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.60780574, '16° 36\' 28.100670\"', 120.36549750, '120° 21\' 55.791101\"', 0.0000, '0', 282.2737, 0.0000, '3', 241.7245, 218914.87300, 1838017.34800, '51', 16.60945129, '16° 36\' 34.024630\"', 120.36418450, '120° 21\' 51.064180\"', 246.2448, 1836990.25300, 432157.26800, '3', 218773.17700, 1838089.71000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9263, 'LUN-24', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'SIBOAN-OTONG', 2001, 16.56894705, '16° 34\' 8.209380\"', 120.37690490, '120° 22\' 36.857640\"', 'LUN-24 Is in the province of La Union, municipality of Naguillan, Brgy. Masicong. Station mark is the head of 4\" concrete nail drilled and centered on a 8\" x 8\" concrete monument set on a ground surface with inscription \"NAMRIA, LUN-24. Note: Station is intervisible to station LUN-25.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.56894705, '16° 34\' 8.209387\"', 120.37690490, '120° 22\' 36.857741\"', 0.0000, '0', 99.2084, 0.0000, '3', 58.3492, 220076.41640, 1833698.99800, '51', 16.57059001, '16° 34\' 14.124030\"', 120.37559100, '120° 22\' 32.127470\"', 63.0318, 1832686.08500, 433361.02000, '3', 219934.59400, 1833771.29600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9264, 'LUN-25', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'MASICONG', 2001, 16.56948399, '16° 34\' 10.142364\"', 120.37868230, '120° 22\' 43.256280\"', 'LUN-25 From San Fernando city, travel S direction up to Bauang Junction, then travel SE going to Naguillan, turn left after Luguit Bridge going to Masicong passing thru Brgy. Lablaban accessible only by 4 wheel drive vehicle. Station mark is the head of a 4\" concrete nail drilled and centered on a 8\" x 8\" standard concrete monument set on the ground surface with inscription \"NAMRIA, LUN-25\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.56948399, '16° 34\' 10.142370\"', 120.37868230, '120° 22\' 43.256350\"', 0.0000, '0', 93.9775, 0.0000, '3', 53.1019, 220266.97850, 1833755.96800, '51', 16.57112694, '16° 34\' 16.057000\"', 120.37736840, '120° 22\' 38.526130\"', 57.7983, 1832744.91300, 433550.90100, '3', 220125.15900, 1833828.26100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9265, 'LUN-27', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'NAMTUTAN', 2001, 16.62883951, '16° 37\' 43.822236\"', 120.35282970, '120° 21\' 10.186920\"', 'LUN-27 Is in the province of La Union, city of San Fernando, Brgy. Namtutan. Station mark is the head of 4\" concrete nail drilled and centered on a 10\" x 10\" standard concrete monument set at the ground surface with inscription \"NAMRIA, LUN-27\". Station is intervisible to LUN-26.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.62883951, '16° 37\' 43.822247\"', 120.35282970, '120° 21\' 10.186796\"', 0.0000, '0', 180.9504, 0.0000, '3', 140.6413, 217593.27680, 1840364.04400, '51', 16.63048665, '16° 37\' 49.751930\"', 120.35151710, '120° 21\' 5.461510\"', 145.0170, 1839322.34700, 430813.11900, '3', 217451.64000, 1840436.46700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9266, 'LUN-29', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SAN JUAN', 'NAGUITUBAN', 2001, 16.65670059, '16° 39\' 24.122124\"', 120.33678160, '120° 20\' 12.413760\"', 'LUN-29 Is located at the grassy area at the foot of the hill in Brgy. Naguituban, San Juan, La Union. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. concrete nail drilled at the center of a 10\" x 10\" standard concrete monument; 1 m. depth from the ground surface with inscription \"NAMRIA, LUN-29\". Station is intervisible to station LUN-28.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.65670059, '16° 39\' 24.122141\"', 120.33678160, '120° 20\' 12.413700\"', 0.0000, '0', 62.3303, 0.0000, '3', 22.3614, 215921.28950, 1843471.60800, '51', 16.65834982, '16° 39\' 30.059340\"', 120.33546960, '120° 20\' 7.690580\"', 26.5216, 1842411.30400, 429111.18700, '3', 215779.73100, 1843544.10900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9267, 'LUN-3001', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'PUGO', 'SAN LUIS', 2007, 16.26520781, '16° 15\' 54.748116\"', 120.49373050, '120° 29\' 37.429800\"', 'LUN-3001 Travel along Rosario going to Pugo highway to reach San Luis Plaza, about 150 m NE of the brgy. hall. Station is located along the NE side of the basketball court, about 5 m SE of the N corner of the rectangular cement pavement, 8 m S of the gate of the house, and about 25 m NE of the road centerline. Mark is the head of a copper nail centered and embedded on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete monument with inscriptions LUN-3001 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.26520781, '16° 15\' 54.748110\"', 120.49373050, '120° 29\' 37.429750\"', 0.0000, '0', 193.5080, 0.0000, '3', 151.3820, 232134.32740, 1799913.19500, '51', 16.26682945, '16° 16\' 0.586030\"', 120.49240960, '120° 29\' 32.674600\"', 156.1180, 1799038.30300, 445744.42500, '3', 231991.57900, 1799984.86000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9268, 'LUN-3001 (REG-1)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'ROSARIO', 'SUBUSUB', 2007, 16.22573201, '16° 13\' 32.635236\"', 120.49748070, '120° 29\' 50.930520\"', 'LUN-3001 (REG-1) The station is located at the northern tip of island triangle going to the Municipality of Pugo. Mark is the head of a 3\" concrete nail embedded and centered on top of a 30cm x 30cm x 100cm standard concrete monument protruding about 20cm, with inscription \"LUN-3001 2007 PRS-92 FNSP, DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.22573201, '16° 13\' 32.635230\"', 120.49748070, '120° 29\' 50.930640\"', 0.0000, '0', 192.8370, 0.0000, '4', 150.8672, 232481.93010, 1795538.05000, '51', 16.22735113, '16° 13\' 38.464060\"', 120.49615890, '120° 29\' 46.172140\"', 155.3174, 1794668.90800, 446134.44500, '3', 232339.05100, 1795609.67000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
