(9272, 'LUN-3004', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BACNOTAN', 'BITALAG', 2007, 16.75247108, '16° 45\' 8.895888\"', 120.37560490, '120° 22\' 32.177640\"', 'LUN-3004A From Bacnotan proper, travel along the highway going to Laoag, Ilocos Norte to reach barangay Bitalag. Turn left at the road crossing, passing Bitalag brgy. hall and reach Bitalag Elementary School. Station is located about 1 m SE of the center of the SE side of a volleyball court, about 50 m NE of the school gate and about 30 m SW of the flagpole. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered and embedded on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete monument, with inscriptions LUN-3004 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.75247108, '16° 45\' 8.895870\"', 120.37560490, '120° 22\' 32.177570\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.3350, 0.0000, '3', 13.7011, 220204.63200, 1854020.41300, '51', 16.75412532, '16° 45\' 14.851140\"', 120.37429520, '120° 22\' 27.462700\"', 17.7290, 1852996.45700, 433286.32500, '3', 220063.42700, 1854092.86500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
