(9274, 'LUN-3005', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'ALMEIDA', 2007, 16.80863819, '16° 48\' 31.097484\"', 120.33190970, '120° 19\' 54.874920\"', 'LUN-3005 From Bacnotan municipal hall, travel along the highway going to Laoag, Ilocos Norte to reach Brgy. Bitalag. Turn left at the road crossing. Upon reaching the end of the road, turn right to reach the boundary bridge of Brgys. Paraoir and Almeida. Continue travelling for about 80 m then turn left at the road going to Almeida Elementary School. Station is located inside the flower box (where the Rizal monument is situated), about 1.3 m W of the said monument and 8 m S of the flagpole. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered and emebedded on a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete monument with inscriptions LUN-3005 2007 NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.80863819, '16° 48\' 31.097470\"', 120.33190970, '120° 19\' 54.875060\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.0930, 0.0000, '3', 5.3801, 215627.01670, 1860301.51900, '51', 16.81029681, '16° 48\' 37.068520\"', 120.33060130, '120° 19\' 50.164660\"', 8.7674, 1859227.66700, 428648.40700, '3', 215485.96600, 1860374.16000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
