(9317, 'LUN-3098', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SAN GABRIEL', 'LIPAY PROPER', 2008, 16.70546075, '16° 42\' 19.658700\"', 120.44584780, '120° 26\' 45.052080\"', 'LUN-3098 From the municipal hall travel N approximately 14 km going to brgy. Lipay Proper, the mark is located along the brgy. road near a basketball court. It is 3.5 m N from the edge of the brgy. road and 2 m S of the basketball goal. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription LUN-3098, PR-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.70546075, '16° 42\' 19.658700\"', 120.44584780, '120° 26\' 45.052160\"', 0.0000, '0', 630.1880, 0.0000, '4', 589.3848, 227630.85460, 1848718.02000, '51', 16.70711045, '16° 42\' 25.597630\"', 120.44453720, '120° 26\' 40.334090\"', 594.2675, 1847771.57700, 440761.33700, '3', 227489.55800, 1848790.19100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9318, 'LUN-3099', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SAN GABRIEL', 'BUMBUNEG', 2008, 16.67771641, '16° 40\' 39.779076\"', 120.42562550, '120° 25\' 32.251800\"', 'LUN-3099 From town proper travel eastward on the brgy. road, turn left at Brgy. Bucao waiting shed, just go ahead and turn left across the flood gate and bridge just after the bridge on the west of a Mango tree and follow the pathway on top of the rip rap, you will pass a footbridge and a few meters about 30 m westward. The GPS point is located on the corner of the riprap. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription LUN-3099, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.67771641, '16° 40\' 39.779090\"', 120.42562550, '120° 25\' 32.251740\"', 0.0000, '0', 81.1470, 0.0000, '4', 40.3851, 225433.50570, 1845674.06600, '51', 16.67936499, '16° 40\' 45.713980\"', 120.42431410, '120° 25\' 27.530820\"', 45.1888, 1844707.41200, 438595.67200, '3', 225292.08700, 1845746.29600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
