(9322, 'LUN-3102', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SAN GABRIEL', 'BUCAO', 2008, 16.66450368, '16° 39\' 52.213248\"', 120.41971570, '120° 25\' 10.976520\"', 'LUN-3102 From the municipal hall travel SE going to Brgy. Bucao. It takes 15 minutes to reach the said brgy. The mark is located at the western side of the brgy. road. It is also found near the entrance gate of Ofelia Rilloraza\'s house 5 m N from the entrance gate. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription LUN-3102, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.66450368, '16° 39\' 52.213260\"', 120.41971570, '120° 25\' 10.976420\"', 0.0000, '0', 74.1530, 0.0000, '4', 33.3680, 224783.93250, 1844219.35500, '51', 16.66615158, '16° 39\' 58.145700\"', 120.41840400, '120° 25\' 6.254360\"', 38.1682, 1843247.05700, 437961.00400, '3', 224642.46500, 1844291.59300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
