(9352, 'LUN-3214', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SANTO TOMAS', 'NAMONITAN', 2007, 16.25426344, '16° 15\' 15.348384\"', 120.40349830, '120° 24\' 12.593880\"', 'LUN-3214 From Santo Tomas Proper, travel for about 3.2 km. until reaching the station. Station is located 10 m. N of a box culvert at Km. 226+811, 1 m. W of a DIGITEL post and about 6 m. away from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 100 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"LUN-3214 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.25426344, '16° 15\' 15.348370\"', 120.40349830, '120° 24\' 12.594000\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.4810, 0.0000, '4', 9.9912, 222469.58120, 1798821.93400, '51', 16.25588641, '16° 15\' 21.191080\"', 120.40217700, '120° 24\' 7.837350\"', 14.2756, 1797853.46500, 436095.78800, '3', 222326.72000, 1798893.88600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mary', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9353, 'LUN-3215', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SANTO TOMAS', 'NAMONITAN', 2007, 16.25722853, '16° 15\' 26.022708\"', 120.40196290, '120° 24\' 7.066440\"', 'LUN-3215 From Santo Tomas Proper, travel for about 2.9 km. until reaching TJD Baech View Subd. Station is located 20 m. NE of the guardhouse and 5 m. S of the waiting shed. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 100 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"LUN-3215 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.25722853, '16° 15\' 26.022690\"', 120.40196290, '120° 24\' 7.066270\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.9570, 0.0000, '4', 11.4710, 222309.53360, 1799152.29500, '51', 16.25885172, '16° 15\' 31.866180\"', 120.40064160, '120° 24\' 2.309860\"', 15.7644, 1798182.07100, 435932.61600, '3', 222166.68100, 1799224.25500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9354, 'LUN-3216', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SANTO TOMAS', 'UBAGAN', 2007, 16.26754680, '16° 16\' 3.168480\"', 120.38481540, '120° 23\' 5.335440\"', 'LUN-3216 From Santo Tomas Town Hall, travel for about 2.8 km. until reaching Brgy. Ubagan. Station is located at Ubagan Elem. School, NW of the basketball court and E of a waiting shed. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 100 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"LUN-3216 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.26754680, '16° 16\' 3.168470\"', 120.38481540, '120° 23\' 5.335310\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.3560, 0.0000, '4', 5.9337, 220490.26410, 1800318.05500, '51', 16.26917101, '16° 16\' 9.015620\"', 120.38349440, '120° 23\' 0.579690\"', 10.2363, 1799329.39900, 434103.07000, '3', 220347.43200, 1800390.08000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9355, 'LUN-3217', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SANTO TOMAS', 'UBAGAN', 2007, 16.27295081, '16° 16\' 22.622916\"', 120.38266070, '120° 22\' 57.578520\"', 'LUN-3217 From Santo Tomas Town Hall, travel for about 2.8 km. until reaching Brgy. Ubagan. Station is located at the S of the footing of Ubagan Brgy. Welcome Arch, 7 m. N of old Km. Post No. 231. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 100 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"LUN-3217 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.27295081, '16° 16\' 22.622900\"', 120.38266070, '120° 22\' 57.578370\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.2970, 0.0000, '4', 5.8860, 220267.49700, 1800919.31100, '51', 16.27457539, '16° 16\' 28.471420\"', 120.38133980, '120° 22\' 52.823190\"', 10.1990, 1799928.11900, 433874.57300, '3', 220124.68100, 1800991.34700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9356, 'LUN-3218', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SANTO TOMAS', 'PATAC', 2007, 16.28181279, '16° 16\' 54.526044\"', 120.38936830, '120° 23\' 21.725880\"', 'LUN-3218 From Rosario Proper going to Mun. of Santo Tomas at Km. Post No. 230, travel for about 200 m. until reaching the station at Brgy. Patac. Station is located NW of a box culvert and NW of station LUN-15. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 100 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"LUN-3218 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.28181279, '16° 16\' 54.526060\"', 120.38936830, '120° 23\' 21.725830\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.1520, 0.0000, '4', 10.7141, 220997.34670, 1801891.28700, '51', 16.28343778, '16° 17\' 0.376020\"', 120.38804760, '120° 23\' 16.971430\"', 15.0648, 1800906.63200, 434594.50000, '3', 220854.56600, 1801963.30900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9357, 'LUN-3219', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'AGOO', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2007, 16.30766188, '16° 18\' 27.582768\"', 120.34293620, '120° 20\' 34.570320\"', 'LUN-3219 From Agoo Town Proper, travel for about 4.3 km. to the W part of Agoo until reaching Brgy. San Isidro. Station is located 10 m. NW of San Isidro Brgy. Hall, about 4.5 m. away from the road centerline. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 100 cm. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"LUN-3219 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.30766188, '16° 18\' 27.582750\"', 120.34293620, '120° 20\' 34.570380\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.5200, 0.0000, '4', 6.3010, 216069.34620, 1804817.29600, '51', 16.30928948, '16° 18\' 33.442120\"', 120.34161610, '120° 20\' 29.817940\"', 10.6240, 1803782.71200, 429640.94200, '3', 215926.61600, 1804889.49000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mary', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9358, 'LUN-3220', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'AGOO', 'SAN ISIDRO', 2007, 16.30151849, '16° 18\' 5.466564\"', 120.34240010, '120° 20\' 32.640360\"', 'LUN-3220 From Agoo Town Proper, travel for about 4.3 km. to the W part of Agoo until reaching Brgy. San Isidro Proper. Then continue traveling for about 0.9 km. to reach the flood control canal. Station is located NW of one of the gate valve of the said control canal. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded on a 20 cm. x 20 cm. x 2 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"LUN-3220 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.30151849, '16° 18\' 5.466550\"', 120.34240010, '120° 20\' 32.640410\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.6990, 0.0000, '4', 6.4697, 216003.16020, 1804137.85600, '51', 16.30314571, '16° 18\' 11.324570\"', 120.34107990, '120° 20\' 27.887490\"', 10.7860, 1803103.05000, 429581.43900, '3', 215860.41000, 1804210.04600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9359, 'LUN-3221 (P-01 = BLLM-1A)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'CENTRAL EAST', 2009, 16.52088249, '16° 31\' 15.176964\"', 120.33000320, '120° 19\' 48.011520\"', 'LUN-3221 (P-01) Travel along National road from Bauang Town Proper going southward for about 2-3 kilometers to reach Bauang Fire Station. The station is located infront of the said fire station. It is between two bridges North of the telephone post and 4.30 meers southeast of of the concrete post pf Bauang Fire Station and 6.50 meters west from the center of the highway. Station mark is the head of 4\" copper nail on 0.40 x .40 meters concrete monument with inscriptions \"BLLM NO. 1-A, PRS-92, CAD 474-D\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.52088249, '16° 31\' 15.176980\"', 120.33000320, '120° 19\' 48.011420\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.2750, 0.0000, '4', 11.6497, 214997.59460, 1828443.23400, '51', 16.52252353, '16° 31\' 21.084700\"', 120.32868800, '120° 19\' 43.276860\"', 16.0637, 1827383.23000, 428337.44800, '3', 214855.57300, 1828515.64700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9360, 'LUN-3222 (BBM-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'CENTRAL EAST', 2009, 16.53082551, '16° 31\' 50.971836\"', 120.32980100, '120° 19\' 47.283600\"', 'BBM-2=LUN-3222 A 10-20 minutes travel going southward taking Bauang-Caba road to reach the crossing going to Brgy. Bagbag, upon reaching the said intersection turn left and just keep on traveling to reach Brgy. Casilagan. The station is located W of Casilagan Elementary School and S of the waiting shed and road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription BBM-2 CAD 474-D.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.53082551, '16° 31\' 50.971820\"', 120.32980100, '120° 19\' 47.283620\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.6280, 0.0000, '4', 10.0472, 214990.60630, 1829544.42400, '51', 16.53246716, '16° 31\' 56.881760\"', 120.32848610, '120° 19\' 42.549890\"', 14.4478, 1828483.65400, 428319.55900, '3', 214848.61800, 1829616.84600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9361, 'LUN-3222 (P-02 = BLLM-2)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'CENTRAL EAST', 2009, 16.52575884, '16° 31\' 32.731824\"', 120.32999270, '120° 19\' 47.973720\"', 'LUN-3222 (P-02) The station is located inside Bauang Municipal Town Plaza exactly 25.30 meters southwest of flagpole and 5.20 meters east of the concrete house of the power voltage Station mark is the head of 4\" copper nail on 0.40 x .40 meters concrete monument with inscriptions \"BLLM NO. 2, PRS-92, CAD 474-D\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.52575884, '16° 31\' 32.731840\"', 120.32999270, '120° 19\' 47.973890\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.6970, 0.0000, '4', 13.0928, 215003.64210, 1828983.16500, '51', 16.52740018, '16° 31\' 38.640640\"', 120.32867770, '120° 19\' 43.239740\"', 17.5007, 1827922.87900, 428338.14500, '3', 214861.63700, 1829055.58200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9362, 'LUN-3223 (P-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'QUINAVITE', 2009, 16.53563764, '16° 32\' 8.295504\"', 120.33392330, '120° 20\' 2.123880\"', 'LUN-3223 (P-03) At Bauang Public Market travel northward along the national highway for about 2-3 minutes to reach Quinavite Outpost travel following the road going uphill to reach the two houses on top of the hill. The station is located on the east side of the houses. Station mark is the head of 4\" copper nail on cylindrical concrete monument 10 cm x 60 cm with inscription \"P-3\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.53563764, '16° 32\' 8.295520\"', 120.33392330, '120° 20\' 2.123720\"', 0.0000, '0', 134.1670, 0.0000, '4', 93.5721, 215437.93210, 1830071.39200, '51', 16.53727948, '16° 32\' 14.206120\"', 120.33260850, '120° 19\' 57.390480\"', 97.9917, 1829014.71700, 428761.38300, '3', 215295.96500, 1830143.80200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9363, 'LUN-3223B (BBM-4)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'CENTRAL WEST', 2009, 16.52447874, '16° 31\' 28.123464\"', 120.32441730, '120° 19\' 27.902280\"', 'LUN-3223-B (BBM-04) Travel southward for 5-10 minutes from Bauang Municipal Plaza along the national road then turn left at the intersection going to Bucayab before the bridge turn right the station is located 30 meters southeast of Napoleon Realina\'s house and 15 meters southwest of the other house. Station mark is the head of 4\" copper nail on 0.40m. x 0.40m. concrete monument with inscription \"BBM-04; 2009; CAD 474-D.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.52447874, '16° 31\' 28.123460\"', 120.32441730, '120° 19\' 27.902170\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.8260, 0.0000, '4', 6.2617, 214406.26740, 1828849.33700, '51', 16.52612011, '16° 31\' 34.032410\"', 120.32310220, '120° 19\' 23.167880\"', 10.6392, 1827783.22000, 427742.47500, '3', 214264.25300, 1828921.77100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9364, 'LUN-3224 (P-4)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'PUGO', 2009, 16.52687288, '16° 31\' 36.742368\"', 120.31734180, '120° 19\' 2.430480\"', 'LUN-3224 (P-04) From Bauang Public Market travel northward going to San Fernando for about 2-5 minutes to reach the intersection going to Barangay Pugo. The station is located North of Marju Mission Center east of the waiting shed intersection interversible with P-5. Station mark is the head of 4\" copper nail on cylindrical concrete monument 10 cm x 60 cm with inscription \"P-4\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.52687288, '16° 31\' 36.742380\"', 120.31734180, '120° 19\' 2.430550\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.4400, 0.0000, '4', 4.9440, 213654.09630, 1829124.48000, '51', 16.52851456, '16° 31\' 42.652420\"', 120.31602680, '120° 18\' 57.696420\"', 9.2777, 1828050.74000, 426988.05900, '3', 213512.08400, 1829196.93900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9365, 'LUN-3224B (BBM-9)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'BACCUIT SUR', 2009, 16.53733036, '16° 32\' 14.389296\"', 120.32632280, '120° 19\' 34.762080\"', 'LUN-3224-B (BBM-09) From Bauang Town Proper travel southward for about 10-15 minutes just follow the road then turn right at the junction the station is located at the lot of Enrique Galvan Sr., on top of the hill. Station mark is the head of 4\" copper nail on 0.40m. x 0.40m. concrete monument with inscription \"BBM 9; CAD 474-D.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.53733036, '16° 32\' 14.389290\"', 120.32632280, '120° 19\' 34.762230\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.4830, 0.0000, '4', 6.9591, 214628.70150, 1830269.58500, '51', 16.53897248, '16° 32\' 20.300940\"', 120.32500810, '120° 19\' 30.029030\"', 11.3312, 1829204.76900, 427950.69900, '3', 214486.73200, 1830342.02400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9366, 'LUN-3225 (P-5)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'PUGO', 2009, 16.53035887, '16° 31\' 49.291932\"', 120.31787360, '120° 19\' 4.344960\"', 'LUN-3225 (P-05) From Bauang Public market travel northward going to San Fernando for about-2-5 minutes to reach the intersection going to Barangay Pugo just follow the road to reach the next intersection then turn right at the waiting shed near Marju Mission Center. The station is located near a fishpond north of the abandoned building. Station mark is the head of 4\" copper nail on cylindrical concrete monument 10 cm x 60 cm with inscription \"P-5\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.53035887, '16° 31\' 49.291940\"', 120.31787360, '120° 19\' 4.344810\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.4710, 0.0000, '4', 4.9861, 213716.03310, 1829509.70000, '51', 16.53200075, '16° 31\' 55.202710\"', 120.31655860, '120° 18\' 59.610980\"', 9.3181, 1828436.32600, 427046.14000, '3', 213574.03400, 1829582.16000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9367, 'LUN-3225B (BBM-10)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'QUINAVITE', 2009, 16.54049745, '16° 32\' 25.790820\"', 120.32586860, '120° 19\' 33.126960\"', 'LUN-3225-B (BBM-10) From Bauang Town Proper, travel approximately 1-2 km along the national road going to San San Fernando until you reach the boundary of Brgy. Quinavite and Disso-or. The station is situated E of Bunah Vita Garden and the the national road. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.4m x 0.4m concrete monument with inscriptions \"BBM No. 10, CAD 474-D\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.54049745, '16° 32\' 25.790810\"', 120.32586860, '120° 19\' 33.126960\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.7840, 0.0000, '4', 7.2776, 214584.85140, 1830620.89600, '51', 16.54213978, '16° 32\' 31.703200\"', 120.32455390, '120° 19\' 28.394020\"', 11.6430, 1829555.42200, 427903.39500, '3', 214442.89200, 1830693.33800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
