(9371, 'LUN-3227B (BBM-13)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'CABALAYANGAN', 2009, 16.54660849, '16° 32\' 47.790564\"', 120.32455990, '120° 19\' 28.415640\"', 'LUN-3227 (BBM-13) Travel 3-5 kilometers southward along the national highway to reach the intersection going to Cabalayangan. Upon reaching the intersection turn left and travel again for 10-15 minutes going to uphill cemented road to reach Cabalayangan Barangay Hall. The station is approximately 60-80cm. projection exposed to the ground surface and 977.29 meters northeast of P-34 identical to BLLM 8 AND BBM-97. Station mark is the head of 4\" copper nail on 0.40m. x 0.40m. concrete monument with inscription \"BBM No.13; CAD 474-D.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.54660849, '16° 32\' 47.790550\"', 120.32455990, '120° 19\' 28.415730\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.7670, 0.0000, '4', 6.3002, 214454.09160, 1831299.38100, '51', 16.54825122, '16° 32\' 53.704390\"', 120.32324540, '120° 19\' 23.683300\"', 10.6480, 1830232.17900, 427765.99300, '3', 214312.15200, 1831371.83200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
