(9440, 'LUN-3279 (BLLM-11)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'PARAOIR', 2013, 16.80177438, '16° 48\' 6.387768\"', 120.32980950, '120° 19\' 47.314200\"', 'From the Municipal Hall of Balaoan La Union, travel towards West direction until you reach the Municipality of Luna, La Union. From Luna Municipal Hall, continue travel South direction along the Prov\'l road until reaching the brgy. 25.00 meters before the brgy. hall of brgy. Paraoir. Continue travel towards east direction along the brgy. road for about 60.00 meters to reach the house of Mr. Edwin Nocis where the station was established. The station is located at the lot property of Mrs. Eulanda Cabala, 35.00 meters South East from the house of Mr. Edwin Nocis. Mark is the head of 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete monument 25 cm x 25 cm. x 120 cm and protruding by 20 cm. above the ground surface with inscription \"BAL-LUN, BLLM, 2013, CAD 496-D, LMS DENR R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.80177438, '16° 48\' 6.387770\"', 120.32980950, '120° 19\' 47.314220\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.7520, 0.0000, '3', 5.0102, 215392.78420, 1859544.55300, '51', 16.80343263, '16° 48\' 12.357480\"', 120.32850090, '120° 19\' 42.603230\"', 8.4102, 1858468.82100, 428421.94200, '3', 215251.70900, 1859617.19500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9441, 'LUN-3280 (BLLM-12)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'PARAOIR', 2013, 16.80363277, '16° 48\' 13.077972\"', 120.33205250, '120° 19\' 55.389000\"', 'From the Municipal Hall of Balaoan La Union, travel toward west direction until you reach the Municipality of Luna, La Union. From Luna Municipal Hall, continue travel South direction along the Prov\'l road until reaching the Brgy. road 25.00 meters before the brgy. hall of brgy. Paraoir. Continue travel towards east direction along the brgy road for about 60.00 meters to reach the house of Mr. Edwin Nocis, from the house of Mr. Edwin Nocis continue travel toward northeast direction for about 150.00 meters to reach the Paraoir creek and the piggery owned by Mr. Jonel Nigrillo where the station was established. The station is located at the lot property of Mr. Esper Visco, 90.00 meters northeast from the piggery of Mr. Jonel Nigrillo. Mark is the head of 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete monument 25 cm x 25 cm. x 120 cm and protruding by 20 cm. above the ground surface with inscription \"BAL-LUN, BLLM-12, 2013, CAD 496-D, LMS DENR R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.80363277, '16° 48\' 13.077970\"', 120.33205250, '120° 19\' 55.388870\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.5610, 0.0000, '3', 4.8091, 215634.77080, 1859747.09700, '51', 16.80529109, '16° 48\' 19.047910\"', 120.33074390, '120° 19\' 50.678050\"', 8.2195, 1858673.67200, 428661.73700, '3', 215493.70400, 1859819.73300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9442, 'LUN-3281 (P-3)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'DR. CAMILO OSIAS POB.', 2013, 16.82224607, '16° 49\' 20.085852\"', 120.40469710, '120° 24\' 16.909560\"', 'From the Municipal Hall of Balaoan La Union, travel towards NE direction along the national road until reaching Rodriguez street. Turn right to Rodriguez street then continue travel until reaching corner Rodriguez and Lopez street where the station was established. The station is located at the corner Rodriguez and Lopez street, 10.00 meters east of mrs. Lucrecia Conception\'s house and 2.00 meters south of electric post. Mark is the head of 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete monument 25 cm x 25 cm. x 120 cm and protruding by 20 cm. above the ground surface with inscription \"BAL-LUN, P-3, 2013, CAD 496-D, LMS DENR R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.82224607, '16° 49\' 20.085860\"', 120.40469710, '120° 24\' 16.909610\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.8670, 0.0000, '3', 13.3792, 223409.17920, 1861704.98300, '51', 16.82390395, '16° 49\' 26.054230\"', 120.40338910, '120° 24\' 12.200700\"', 17.4081, 1860708.65200, 436411.68500, '3', 223268.23100, 1861777.39800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9443, 'LUN-3282 (P-4)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'NAPASET', 2013, 16.83857456, '16° 50\' 18.868416\"', 120.42215000, '120° 25\' 19.740000\"', 'From the Municipal Hall of Balaoan La Union, travel towards NE direction along Nat;l road until reaching brgy. Pantar norte welcome arc. Turn right and continue travel along Provincial road until reaching brgy. Napaset welcome arc, continue travel towards north direction along the barangay road going to brgy. Napaset Luna for for about 3 minutes to reachthe station. The station is located at the left side of barangay road, 15.00 meters north of camachili tree and 25.00 meters east of bamboo. Mark is the head of 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete monument 25 cm x 25 cm. x 120 cm and protruding by 20 cm. above the ground surface with inscription \"BAL-LUN, P-4, 2013, CAD 496-D, LMS DENR R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.83857456, '16° 50\' 18.868420\"', 120.42215000, '120° 25\' 19.740130\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.8810, 0.0000, '3', 13.2769, 225293.82280, 1863488.49300, '51', 16.84023306, '16° 50\' 24.839020\"', 120.42084240, '120° 25\' 15.032670\"', 17.4309, 1862510.11600, 438277.24800, '3', 225152.94300, 1863560.86500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9444, 'LUN-3283 (P-6)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'AR-ARAMPANG', 2013, 16.77973228, '16° 46\' 47.036208\"', 120.41547170, '120° 24\' 55.698120\"', 'From the Municipal Hall of Balaoan La Union, travel toward south direction along Nat\'l road going to San Fernando City until reaching the welcomearc of brgy. Ar-arampang, continue travel toward south direction along the Nat\'l road for about 600.00 meters to reach the lot of Mrs. Lydia Otanez left side from the Nat\'l road where the station was established. The station is located 15.00 meters east from blackberry tree 50.00 meters south west from the house of Mrs. Lydia Otanez. Mark is the head of 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete monument 25 cm x 25 cm. x 120 cm and protruding by 20 cm. above the ground surface with inscription \"BAL-LUN, P-6, 2013, CAD 496-D, LMS DENR R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.77973228, '16° 46\' 47.036210\"', 120.41547170, '120° 24\' 55.698230\"', 0.0000, '0', 88.6580, 0.0000, '3', 48.7506, 224496.70840, 1856982.93100, '51', 16.78138732, '16° 46\' 52.994360\"', 120.41416270, '120° 24\' 50.985830\"', 53.0409, 1856000.31500, 437546.09500, '3', 224355.62600, 1857055.27600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9445, 'LUN-3284 (P-7)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'NAGSABARAN NORTE', 2013, 16.81871892, '16° 49\' 7.388112\"', 120.39562430, '120° 23\' 44.247480\"', 'From the Municipal Hall of Balaoan La Union, travel toward south direction along Nat\'l road until reaching the welcome arc of brgy. Nagsabaran Norte, turn right and continue travel SW to reach the Nagsabaran Norte Brgy. Hall. Continue travel west along the brgy road going to brgy of Nagsabaran Sur where the station was established. The station is located at the property of Mrs. Ferny Omo, near of irrigation canal and brgy road before you go up to brgy. Nagsabaran Sur. 20.00 meters west from the madre de cacao tree.Mark is the head of 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete monument 25 cm x 25 cm. x 120 cm and protruding by 20 cm. above the ground surface with inscription \"BAL-LUN, P-7, 2013, CAD 496-D, LMS DENR R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.81871892, '16° 49\' 7.388110\"', 120.39562430, '120° 23\' 44.247600\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.7620, 0.0000, '3', 14.3633, 222436.56260, 1861327.17400, '51', 16.82037678, '16° 49\' 13.356410\"', 120.39431620, '120° 23\' 39.538350\"', 18.3141, 1860321.26800, 435443.45100, '3', 222295.59500, 1861399.61500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
