(9461, 'LUN-33', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SAN JUAN', 'CATDONGAN', 2001, 16.66809145, '16° 40\' 5.129220\"', 120.36503280, '120° 21\' 54.118080\"', 'LUN-33 Is in Brgy. Catdungan, municipality of San Juan, province of La Union, about 600 m. from the concrete road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. concrete nail embedded and centered on a 8 in. x 8 in. standard concrete monument with inscription \"LUN-33, NAMRIA\". Station is intervisible to station LUN-32.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.66809145, '16° 40\' 5.129227\"', 120.36503280, '120° 21\' 54.118166\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.0276, 0.0000, '3', 15.8553, 218953.21710, 1844692.81200, '51', 16.66974076, '16° 40\' 11.066740\"', 120.36372110, '120° 21\' 49.396130\"', 20.1859, 1843662.01500, 432129.04300, '3', 218811.71900, 1844765.23100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9462, 'LUN-3300 (S-15)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'ALMEIDA', 2013, 16.81419066, '16° 48\' 51.086376\"', 120.33632930, '120° 20\' 10.785480\"', 'From the Municipal Hall of Balaoan La Union, travel toward West direction until you reach the Municipality of Luna La Union, from Luna Municipal Hall, continue travel South direction along the Prov\'l road until reaching the brgy. Almeida Balaoan La Union, along the Prov\'l road there is a road intersection going to Brgy. Pitpitac Luna, La Union, continue travel East along the Mun. road going to brgy. Pitpita until reaching Garefez house where the station was established. The station is located 30.00 meters SW from the house of Mrs. Lucrecia Garefez, near at the Mun. road. Mark is the head of 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete monument 25 cm x 25 cm. x 120 cm and protruding by 20 cm. above the ground surface with inscription \"BAL-LUN, S-15, 2013, CAD 496-D, LMS DENR R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.81419066, '16° 48\' 51.086390\"', 120.33632930, '120° 20\' 10.785310\"', 0.0000, '0', 62.2430, 0.0000, '3', 23.5213, 216106.61880, 1860909.96100, '51', 16.81584953, '16° 48\' 57.058300\"', 120.33502090, '120° 20\' 6.075410\"', 26.9241, 1859840.55400, 429121.58100, '3', 215965.59100, 1860982.59100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9463, 'LUN-3301 (S-16)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'ALMEIDA', 2013, 16.81383810, '16° 48\' 49.817160\"', 120.33844840, '120° 20\' 18.414240\"', 'From the Municipal Hall of Balaoan La Union, travel toward West direction until you reach the Municipality of Luna La Union, from Luna Municipal hall, continue travel South direction along the Prov\'l road until reaching the brgy. Almeida Balaoan La Union, along the Prov\'l road there is a road intersection going to Brgy. Pitpitac Luna La Union, continue travel East along the Mun. road going to brgy. Pitpitac. The station is located for about 200.00 meters before the welcome arc of Brgy. Pitpitac, 15.00 meters from the baliti tree and left side from the Mun. road. Mark is the head of 4 in. copper nail, centered on a concrete monument 25 cm x 25 cm. x 120 cm and protruding by 20 cm. above the ground surface with inscription \"BAL-LUN, S-16, 2013, CAD 496-D, LMS DENR R-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.81383810, '16° 48\' 49.817160\"', 120.33844840, '120° 20\' 18.414120\"', 0.0000, '0', 60.6510, 0.0000, '3', 21.9018, 216332.08480, 1860867.88400, '51', 16.81549690, '16° 48\' 55.788830\"', 120.33714010, '120° 20\' 13.704200\"', 25.3259, 1859800.77400, 429347.32900, '3', 216191.05700, 1860940.50700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9464, 'LUN-36', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'ARINGAY', 'MANGA', 2001, 16.42498822, '16° 25\' 29.957592\"', 120.44368970, '120° 26\' 37.282920\"', 'LUN-36 Station is located at Mt. Galano, 2 1/2 hrs. travel from Aringay proper, the mountain is about 550 m. high. Station mark is the head of a 4-inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 8\" x 8\" concrete monument with inscription \"LUN-36 NAMRIA\". Station is intervisible to station LUN-37.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.42498822, '16° 25\' 29.957600\"', 120.44368970, '120° 26\' 37.282835\"', 0.0000, '0', 479.0005, 0.0000, '3', 437.0072, 227005.32850, 1817668.96000, '51', 16.42662077, '16° 25\' 35.834770\"', 120.44237250, '120° 26\' 32.541070\"', 442.2202, 1816733.95500, 440444.33300, '3', 226863.08300, 1817740.91300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9465, 'LUN-37', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'ARINGAY', 'MANGA', 2001, 16.42329781, '16° 25\' 23.872116\"', 120.44768880, '120° 26\' 51.679680\"', 'LUN-37 Station is in the province of La Union, town of Aringay, barangay Mangga. Station mark is the head of a 4-inch concrete nail embedded and centered on a 8\" x 8\" standard concrete monument with station name \"LUN-37, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.42329781, '16° 25\' 23.872126\"', 120.44768880, '120° 26\' 51.679599\"', 0.0000, '0', 557.6396, 0.0000, '3', 515.5988, 227430.28280, 1817476.42200, '51', 16.42493015, '16° 25\' 29.748530\"', 120.44637160, '120° 26\' 46.937770\"', 520.8445, 1816545.70600, 440870.94300, '3', 227288.03600, 1817548.35800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9466, 'LUN-39', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SAN GABRIEL', 'BUMBUNEG', 2001, 16.67707450, '16° 40\' 37.468200\"', 120.42499060, '120° 25\' 29.966160\"', 'LUN-39 From San Fernando city, travel northeast towards the municipality of San Gabriel Upon reaching the public market of San Gabriel, turn right leading to brgy. Bumbuneg/ Sitio Elat. Station is located in the northwest corner of a lot owned by Estolas Family near their garage. Station mark is a 4\" copper nailset on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription on top with the station name.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.67707450, '16° 40\' 37.468201\"', 120.42499060, '120° 25\' 29.966054\"', 0.0000, '0', 83.0273, 0.0000, '3', 42.2683, 225364.83440, 1845603.87100, '51', 16.67872305, '16° 40\' 43.402990\"', 120.42367920, '120° 25\' 25.245080\"', 47.0687, 1844636.57100, 438527.74100, '3', 225223.41300, 1845676.10200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9467, 'LUN-4 (PCP-125)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SAN JUAN', 'BALBALLOSA', 1994, 16.65049414, '16° 39\' 1.778904\"', 120.41777450, '120° 25\' 3.988200\"', 'LUN-4 (PCP-125) From San Fernando, travel N up to the Municipality of San Juan, then travel E going to San Gabriel for about 6 km. On a Y-intersection, 2 km. before reaching San Gabriel, turn left and travel 4 km. up to the station. The station is accessible only with a 4-wheel drive vehicle esp. during rainy season. The station was established in the Province of La Union, Municipality of San Juan, Brgy. Balbal-losa on an intersection of rice paddies about 50 m. from the barangay road. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on top center of a 10\" x 10\" concrete monument set flush to the ground with inscription \"LUN-4, 1994, NAMRIA.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.65049414, '16° 39\' 1.778887\"', 120.41777450, '120° 25\' 3.988338\"', 0.0000, '0', 78.3662, 0.0000, '3', 37.5155, 224556.71910, 1842670.95300, '51', 16.65214122, '16° 39\' 7.708380\"', 120.41646250, '120° 24\' 59.265090\"', 42.3427, 1841697.29000, 437749.37400, '3', 224415.20300, 1842743.18600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1994-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9468, 'LUN-40', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SAN GABRIEL', 'BUMBUNEG', 2001, 16.67752602, '16° 40\' 39.093672\"', 120.42626030, '120° 25\' 34.537080\"', 'LUN-40 From San Fernando City, travel northeast towards the municipality of San Gabriel. Upon reaching the public market of San Gabriel, turn right leading to brgy Bumbuneg/ Sitio Elat. Station is located about 120 m. northeast of SRN-39. It is located about 20 m. leftside of the northend corner of the floodgate across Bumbuneg River. Both stations are intervisible with each other. Station mark is a head of 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription on top with the station name.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.67752602, '16° 40\' 39.093660\"', 120.42626030, '120° 25\' 34.537095\"', 0.0000, '0', 83.0315, 0.0000, '3', 42.2608, 225500.97810, 1845652.11200, '51', 16.67917457, '16° 40\' 45.028450\"', 120.42494890, '120° 25\' 29.816160\"', 47.0712, 1844686.14400, 438663.32400, '3', 225359.56000, 1845724.33900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9469, 'LUN-41', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SANTOL', 'POBLACION', 2000, 16.76883157, '16° 46\' 7.793652\"', 120.45965880, '120° 27\' 34.771680\"', 'LUN-41 From San Fernando city travel north towards the municipality of Balaoan. Then travel southeast towards the municipality of Santol up to barangay Poblacion, proceed about 300 m. southeast until reaching the Santol Rural Health Office. Station is lcoated about 15 m. north of the health office. It is inside the compound of the health office. Station mark is a head of 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription on top with the station name \"LUN-41 2000 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.76883157, '16° 46\' 7.793662\"', 120.45965880, '120° 27\' 34.771760\"', 0.0000, '0', 112.6073, 0.0000, '3', 72.0870, 229194.08480, 1855715.18200, '51', 16.77048499, '16° 46\' 13.745950\"', 120.45834960, '120° 27\' 30.058670\"', 76.8497, 1854780.48600, 442253.52500, '3', 229053.00000, 1855787.37400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9470, 'LUN-42', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SANTOL', 'POBLACION', 2000, 16.76784639, '16° 46\' 4.247004\"', 120.46081050, '120° 27\' 38.917800\"', 'LUN-42 From San Fernando city travel north towards the municipality of Balaoan. Then travel southeast towards the municipality of Santol up to barangay Poblacion, proceed about 300 m. southeast until reaching the Santol Rural Health Office. Station is located about 150 m. northeast of the entrance of the health office and is about 3 m. from the left side of the road leading to brgy. Mangaan. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set on a 30cm x 30cm x 1.0m concrete monument with inscription on top \"LUN-42 2000 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.76784639, '16° 46\' 4.246986\"', 120.46081050, '120° 27\' 38.917650\"', 0.0000, '0', 107.6248, 0.0000, '3', 67.0833, 229315.52370, 1855604.53700, '51', 16.76949971, '16° 46\' 10.198970\"', 120.45950120, '120° 27\' 34.204480\"', 71.8613, 1854671.12200, 442376.00700, '3', 229174.43600, 1855676.72400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9471, 'LUN-43', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SUDIPEN', 'SAN JOSE', 2000, 16.84015405, '16° 50\' 24.554580\"', 120.46400800, '120° 27\' 50.428800\"', 'LUN-43 From San Fernando city travel north up to the junction of brgy. Pantar, Luna town, then turn right and travel a zigzag road for about 7 km. leading to barangay San Jose, Sudipen town. Station is located about 100 m. southeast of the brgy. San Jose Elem. School and is situated about 3m. on the left side of the road leading to sitio Immayos. Station is the head of 4\" copper nail set on top of a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription \"LUN-43 2000 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.84015405, '16° 50\' 24.554595\"', 120.46400800, '120° 27\' 50.428863\"', 0.0000, '0', 88.2482, 0.0000, '3', 48.1099, 229759.08420, 1863605.63200, '51', 16.84181174, '16° 50\' 30.522260\"', 120.46270050, '120° 27\' 45.721760\"', 52.7020, 1862672.22100, 442738.79200, '3', 229618.24200, 1863677.86800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9472, 'LUN-44', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SUDIPEN', 'SAN JOSE', 2000, 16.83971959, '16° 50\' 22.990524\"', 120.46499420, '120° 27\' 53.979120\"', 'LUN-44 From San Fernando city travel north upto the junction of brgy. Pantar, Luna town, then trun right and travel a zigzag road for about 7 km. leading to barangay San Jose, sudipen town. Station is located about 120 m. southeast of barangay San Jose Elem. School and is about 3 m. from the right side of the road leading to Sitio immayos. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set on top of a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription \"LUN-44 2000 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.83971959, '16° 50\' 22.990529\"', 120.46499420, '120° 27\' 53.979239\"', 0.0000, '0', 92.9534, 0.0000, '3', 52.7996, 229863.61800, 1863556.18200, '51', 16.84137723, '16° 50\' 28.958010\"', 120.46368670, '120° 27\' 49.272110\"', 57.4035, 1862623.85200, 442843.76600, '3', 229722.77500, 1863628.41400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9473, 'LUN-45', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SUDIPEN', 'OLD CENTRAL', 2000, 16.89957244, '16° 53\' 58.460784\"', 120.49044710, '120° 29\' 25.609560\"', 'LUN-45 From San Fernando city travel north towards the municipality of Sudipen town proper. Then travel east towards barangay Old Central for about 3 km. from the highway. Station is located about 1 m. from the south end corner of the barangay basketball court. Station mark is a head of a 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm x 30 cm x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription \'LUN-45 2000 NAMRIA\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.89957244, '16° 53\' 58.460771\"', 120.49044710, '120° 29\' 25.609712\"', 0.0000, '0', 72.9194, 0.0000, '3', 32.6715, 232661.68330, 1870148.00600, '51', 16.90123318, '16° 54\' 4.439440\"', 120.48914100, '120° 29\' 20.907710\"', 37.4948, 1869240.32800, 445573.70000, '3', 232521.06100, 1870220.20500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9474, 'LUN-46', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SUDIPEN', 'OLD CENTRAL', 2000, 16.90010522, '16° 54\' 0.378792\"', 120.49212410, '120° 29\' 31.646760\"', 'LUN-46 From San Fernando City, travel N towards Sudipen town proper. Then travel E towards Brgy. Old Central for about 3 km. from the highway. It is located about 120 m. NE of LUN-45. It is about 20 m. SE of the irrigation cannal. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 m. concrete monument, with inscription \"LUN-46, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.90010522, '16° 54\' 0.378781\"', 120.49212410, '120° 29\' 31.646895\"', 0.0000, '0', 73.0468, 0.0000, '3', 32.7764, 232841.17720, 1870204.71500, '51', 16.90176596, '16° 54\' 6.357440\"', 120.49081800, '120° 29\' 26.944940\"', 37.6199, 1869298.82300, 445752.52200, '3', 232700.55800, 1870276.90900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9475, 'LUN-47', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CABA', 'SOBREDILLO', 2000, 16.42769883, '16° 25\' 39.715788\"', 120.36185170, '120° 21\' 42.666120\"', 'LUN-47 From San Fernando city travel south towards the municipality pf Caba. Then trun left towards barangay Sobredillo for about 2 km. until Sobredillo Bridge. Station is located at the northeast corner of Sobredillo Bridge and about 50 m. north of brgy waiting shed. Station mark is a head of 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription \"LUN-47 2000 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.42769883, '16° 25\' 39.715800\"', 120.36185170, '120° 21\' 42.665973\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.0934, 0.0000, '3', 29.9193, 218264.41210, 1818081.23900, '51', 16.42933343, '16° 25\' 45.600350\"', 120.36053440, '120° 21\' 37.923740\"', 34.5188, 1817059.95400, 431704.52500, '3', 218122.10200, 1818153.47100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9476, 'LUN-48', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CABA', 'SOBREDILLO', 2000, 16.42461399, '16° 25\' 28.610364\"', 120.36373780, '120° 21\' 49.456080\"', 'LUN-48 From San Fernando city travel south towards the municipality of Caba. Then trun left towards barangay Sobredillo for about 2 km. until Sobredillo Bridge. Station is located about 200 m. southeast of LUN-47. Travel by foot uphill of about 90 m. high from the road. It is located 10 m. west of sampaloc and mango trees on a partly open area on the slope of the mountain. Station mark is a head of 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription \"LUN-48 2000 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.42461399, '16° 25\' 28.610367\"', 120.36373780, '120° 21\' 49.456135\"', 0.0000, '0', 174.7495, 0.0000, '3', 133.5555, 218461.51340, 1817737.06700, '51', 16.42624833, '16° 25\' 34.493990\"', 120.36242050, '120° 21\' 44.713730\"', 138.1610, 1816717.93000, 431904.89600, '3', 218319.19600, 1817809.28700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9477, 'LUN-49', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CABA', 'SAN JOSE', 2000, 16.42277822, '16° 25\' 22.001592\"', 120.40207040, '120° 24\' 7.453440\"', 'LUN-49 From San Fernando city travel south towards the municipality of Caba. Then travel east for about 6 km. towards barangay San Jose from the junction of barangay Sobredillo. Travel east for about 100 m. befroe the Chico River. Station is located on a lot owned by Jerry Bautista. It is about 20 m. southeast of the house. It is located on the southern portion of a ricefieled owned by Leonora Aromin and is about 50 m. west of the river. Station mark is a head of 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription on top with \"LUN-49 NAMRIA 2000\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.42277822, '16° 25\' 22.001603\"', 120.40207040, '120° 24\' 7.453527\"', 0.0000, '0', 66.5504, 0.0000, '3', 25.0046, 222555.01110, 1817480.88000, '51', 16.42441164, '16° 25\' 27.881910\"', 120.40075310, '120° 24\' 2.711060\"', 29.8635, 1816502.19100, 435998.44300, '3', 222412.71600, 1817552.97700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9478, 'LUN-5 (PCP-123)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'PUGO', 1995, 16.52627877, '16° 31\' 34.603572\"', 120.32083230, '120° 19\' 14.996280\"', 'LUN-5 (PCP-123) From the Municipality of Bauang, turn W to de Guzman St. and head to Brgy. Pugo. Travel for about 2 km. until you reach the L.A.M.A. House Rehabilitation Center compound which is on the left side of the road. The station is on the NE corner of the compound along the road. The station is located at the province of La Union, Municipality of Bauang, Brgy. Pugo. The station was established on the SW corner of the intersection of the barangay road and an unnamed street, 60 m. E of the concrete basketball court. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail placed on top center of a 9\" x 9\" concrete monument set flush to the ground with inscription \"LUN-5, 1994, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.52627877, '16° 31\' 34.603561\"', 120.32083230, '120° 19\' 14.996283\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.4942, 0.0000, '3', 4.9670, 214026.02270, 1829053.73300, '51', 16.52792033, '16° 31\' 40.513200\"', 120.31951730, '120° 19\' 10.262120\"', 9.3216, 1827983.72100, 427360.44800, '3', 213884.01200, 1829126.18000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1994-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
