(9479, 'LUN-50', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CABA', 'SAN JOSE', 2000, 16.42302852, '16° 25\' 22.902672\"', 120.40514260, '120° 24\' 18.513360\"', 'LUN-50 From San Fernando city travel south towards the municipality of Caba. Then travel east for about 6 km. towards brgy San Jose from the junction of barangay Sobredillo. Travel east for about 100 m. before the Chico River. Station is located about 100 m. east of LUN-49 and is accross the Chico river and is about 15 m. of the foottrail and is about 5 m. from the edge of the cliff. Station mark is a head of a 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription on top with \"LUN-50 NAMRIA 2000\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.42302852, '16° 25\' 22.902686\"', 120.40514260, '120° 24\' 18.513290\"', 0.0000, '0', 205.5468, 0.0000, '3', 163.9718, 222883.64600, 1817504.38300, '51', 16.42466186, '16° 25\' 28.782690\"', 120.40382530, '120° 24\' 13.770970\"', 168.8534, 1816528.91200, 436326.65500, '3', 222741.35700, 1817576.46700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9480, 'LUN-51', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'AGOO', 'MACALVA SUR', 2000, 16.33256960, '16° 19\' 57.250560\"', 120.39054530, '120° 23\' 25.963080\"', 'LUN-51 From San Fernando city travel south towards the municipality of Agoo. Turn to the Marcos Highway towards the barangay Macalva Sur for about 10 mins. ride. Station is located 3 m. leftside of the east end corner of Macalva Bridge. It is about 50 m. from km. post No.239. Station mark is a head of 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription on top with \"LUN-51 2000 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.33256960, '16° 19\' 57.250561\"', 120.39054530, '120° 23\' 25.962937\"', 0.0000, '0', 73.9582, 0.0000, '3', 32.5135, 221195.11920, 1807509.21700, '51', 16.33419770, '16° 20\' 3.111720\"', 120.38922580, '120° 23\' 21.212830\"', 37.0231, 1806523.12400, 434737.24100, '3', 221052.51100, 1807581.27600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9481, 'LUN-52', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'AGOO', 'MACALVA SUR', 2000, 16.33427657, '16° 20\' 3.395652\"', 120.39339290, '120° 23\' 36.214440\"', 'LUN-52 From San Fernando city travel south towards the municipality of Agoo. Turn to the Marcos Highway towards the barangay Macalva sur for about 10 mins. ride. Station mark is located about 200 m. east of LUN-51. It is about 20 m. northeast of Marcos highway and is about 15 m. north of waiting shed. It is situated east of Little Baguio barangay road. Station mark is a head of 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription on top with \"LUN-52 2000 NAMRI\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.33427657, '16° 20\' 3.395642\"', 120.39339290, '120° 23\' 36.214375\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.4894, 0.0000, '3', 34.0241, 221501.96850, 1807694.30400, '51', 16.33590471, '16° 20\' 9.256950\"', 120.39207350, '120° 23\' 31.464430\"', 38.5526, 1806711.10400, 435042.09500, '3', 221359.36900, 1807766.35500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9482, 'LUN-53', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'AGOO', 'AMBITACAY', 2000, 16.29969586, '16° 17\' 58.905096\"', 120.41159910, '120° 24\' 41.756760\"', 'LUN-53 From San Fernando city travel south towards the municipality of Agoo. Turn left at the junction at brgy Nambuongan and travel for about 5 km. on a dirt road towards brgy. Capas. Station is located on elevated hill and about 30 m. from the road. It is about 150 m. south of the waiting shed. Station mark is a head 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription on top with \"LUN-53 2000 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.29969586, '16° 17\' 58.905091\"', 120.41159910, '120° 24\' 41.756693\"', 0.0000, '0', 98.7733, 0.0000, '3', 57.2142, 223399.67450, 1803840.92000, '51', 16.30132146, '16° 18\' 4.757250\"', 120.41027890, '120° 24\' 37.003940\"', 61.6869, 1802878.56400, 436976.36400, '3', 223256.97300, 1803912.88300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9483, 'LUN-54', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'AGOO', 'AMBITACAY', 2000, 16.30265288, '16° 18\' 9.550368\"', 120.41308400, '120° 24\' 47.102400\"', 'LUN-54 From San Fernando city travel south towards the municipality of Agoo. Turn left at the junction at brgy Nambuongan and travel for about 5 km. on a dirt road towards brgy. Capas. Station is located east of the brgy. boundary monument of Capas. It is about 70 m. north of creek and is about 300 m. north of LUN-53. It is about 2 m. east of the brgy monument. Station is a head of 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription on top with \"LUN-53 2000 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.30265288, '16° 18\' 9.550361\"', 120.41308400, '120° 24\' 47.102280\"', 0.0000, '0', 97.6750, 0.0000, '3', 56.1043, 223562.59480, 1804166.28800, '51', 16.30427863, '16° 18\' 15.403060\"', 120.41176380, '120° 24\' 42.349780\"', 60.5940, 1803205.33200, 437136.00900, '3', 223419.90500, 1804238.24800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9484, 'LUN-55', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAGULIN', 'SUYO', 2000, 16.60803341, '16° 36\' 28.920276\"', 120.43782930, '120° 26\' 16.185480\"', 'LUN-55 From San Fernando city travel southeast towards the municipality of Naguillan. Then travel north towards the municipality of Bagulin. The station is located on the roof top of the municipal town hall of Bagulin situated on the southeast corner of the roof top. Station mark is a head of 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription on top with \"LUN-55 2000 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.60803341, '16° 36\' 28.920285\"', 120.43782930, '120° 26\' 16.185455\"', 0.0000, '0', 121.9321, 0.0000, '3', 80.5990, 226636.94220, 1837942.39700, '51', 16.60967744, '16° 36\' 34.838790\"', 120.43651630, '120° 26\' 11.458770\"', 85.7290, 1836992.18800, 439875.50600, '3', 226495.30000, 1838014.52900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9485, 'LUN-56', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAGULIN', 'SUYO', 2000, 16.60686921, '16° 36\' 24.729156\"', 120.43832850, '120° 26\' 17.982600\"', 'LUN-56 From San Fernando city travel southeast towards the municipality of Naguillan. Then travel north towards the municipality of Bagulin. Station is located about 120 m. east of the town hall. It is located on a lot owned by a certain Fidel Estera Jr. and about 3 m. from the left side of the road towards brgy. Tambili. Station mark is a head of 4\" copper nail set on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1.0 m. concrete monument with inscription on top with \"LUN-56 2000 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.60686921, '16° 36\' 24.729157\"', 120.43832850, '120° 26\' 17.982546\"', 0.0000, '0', 118.4008, 0.0000, '3', 77.0559, 226688.58370, 1837812.82200, '51', 16.60851316, '16° 36\' 30.647370\"', 120.43701550, '120° 26\' 13.255770\"', 82.1929, 1836863.20200, 439928.40800, '3', 226546.93800, 1837884.95200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9486, 'LUN-59', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'NAGUILIAN', 'AL-ALINAO SUR', 2007, 16.49088477, '16° 29\' 27.185172\"', 120.43850890, '120° 26\' 18.632040\"', 'LUN-59 From San Fernando town proper, travel towards Naguilian town then proceed SE until reaching Brgy. Angin intersection. Then turn right and proceed towards Brgy. Alalinao junction, then turn left at the \"Welcome to Brgy. Alalinao\" sign arc and follow the rough road until reaching the ricemill site. Station is located at the top of the hill, which is about 30 m. SW of the ricemill of Sitio Sinapangan. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 m. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"LUN-59 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.49088477, '16° 29\' 27.185170\"', 120.43850890, '120° 26\' 18.632120\"', 0.0000, '0', 236.2870, 0.0000, '2', 194.4666, 226544.21890, 1824971.53900, '51', 16.49252155, '16° 29\' 33.077590\"', 120.43719320, '120° 26\' 13.895680\"', 199.7213, 1824027.82600, 439911.45900, '3', 226402.18500, 1825043.57000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9487, 'LUN-6 (PCP-122)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'NAGUILIAN', 'SILI', 1994, 16.51228346, '16° 30\' 44.220456\"', 120.42518810, '120° 25\' 30.677160\"', 'LUN-6 (PCP-122) From Bauang municipal proper, turn W along the national road going to Baguio City. Upon reaching Brgy. Ribsuan, turn right to the barangay road leading to Brgy. Sili. The station was approx. 50 m. ahead. The station is located at the Province of La Union, Municipality of Naguilian, Brgy. Sili. It was established on the intersection of a rice paddy and the E side of the road. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set on top center of a 9\" x 9\" square concrete monument set flush to the ground, with inscription \"LUN-6, 1994, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.51228346, '16° 30\' 44.220440\"', 120.42518810, '120° 25\' 30.677150\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.9696, 0.0000, '3', 30.3653, 225151.58950, 1827358.79000, '51', 16.51392189, '16° 30\' 50.118790\"', 120.42387290, '120° 25\' 25.942320\"', 35.5018, 1826399.93700, 438496.02200, '3', 225009.61400, 1827430.88600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1994-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9488, 'LUN-61', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BAUANG', 'PAYOCPOC SUR', 2007, 16.49186942, '16° 29\' 30.729912\"', 120.32963150, '120° 19\' 46.673400\"', 'LUN-61 From Agoo town proper, travel towards Bauang until reaching the Brgy. Payocpoc Sur Police Station, then turn left and travel towards BPPC of about 40 m. from the intersection. Station is located at the right side of the road, situated near the BPPC Housing and is infront of the fourth street light. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"LUN-61 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.49186942, '16° 29\' 30.729910\"', 120.32963150, '120° 19\' 46.673450\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.7410, 0.0000, '2', 12.0013, 214915.32920, 1825231.39900, '51', 16.49350868, '16° 29\' 36.631230\"', 120.32831570, '120° 19\' 41.936450\"', 16.4413, 1824172.61400, 428287.00300, '3', 214773.20900, 1825303.78900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9489, 'LUN-62', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'NAGUILIAN', 'BARAOAS NORTE', 2007, 16.55390809, '16° 33\' 14.069124\"', 120.39263480, '120° 23\' 33.485280\"', 'LUN-62 From Naguilian Town Hall, travel N to Brgy. Baraoas Norte until reaching the rough road and the river control. Station is located 15 m. S from the first access ladder of the river control and about 100 m. N from the end. It is also situated 300 m. S of a hanging bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty, with inscriptions \"LUN-62 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.55390809, '16° 33\' 14.069110\"', 120.39263480, '120° 23\' 33.485250\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.1470, 0.0000, '2', 28.0523, 221734.39510, 1832012.05200, '51', 16.55554978, '16° 33\' 19.979220\"', 120.39132050, '120° 23\' 28.753770\"', 32.8860, 1831016.60800, 435034.74000, '3', 221592.53400, 1832084.28800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9490, 'LUN-64', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SAN JUAN', 'ILI NORTE', 2007, 16.67058844, '16° 40\' 14.118384\"', 120.34178670, '120° 20\' 30.432120\"', 'LUN-64 From San Juan Catholic Church, turn right on the next street going to San Gabriel. Travel 500 m. E until reaching San Juan Bridge. Station is located on the NW end of the said bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty, with inscriptions \"LUN-64 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.67058844, '16° 40\' 14.118390\"', 120.34178670, '120° 20\' 30.431960\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.3820, 0.0000, '2', 5.4601, 216475.96240, 1845002.17600, '51', 16.67223841, '16° 40\' 20.058280\"', 120.34047500, '120° 20\' 25.710020\"', 9.6042, 1843946.45000, 429650.23200, '3', 216334.45400, 1845074.67300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9491, 'LUN-65', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SAN GABRIEL', 'LIPAY SUR', 2007, 16.69865836, '16° 41\' 55.170096\"', 120.42663580, '120° 25\' 35.888880\"', 'LUN-65 From San Gabriel town proper, turn left before reaching Brgy. Bumbuneg Bridge. Travel N until reaching Brgy. Lipay Sur. Station is located about 500 m. from the Y-intersection adjacent to the brgy. waiting shed. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty on top of the riprap, with inscriptions \"LUN-65 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.69865836, '16° 41\' 55.170100\"', 120.42663580, '120° 25\' 35.888760\"', 0.0000, '0', 460.1760, 0.0000, '2', 419.5518, 225571.24180, 1847991.27300, '51', 16.70030811, '16° 42\' 1.109180\"', 120.42532500, '120° 25\' 31.169890\"', 424.2807, 1847024.64500, 438710.17100, '3', 225429.90300, 1848063.50600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9492, 'LUN-67', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BACNOTAN', 'QUIRINO', 2007, 16.76169760, '16° 45\' 42.111360\"', 120.34100420, '120° 20\' 27.615120\"', 'LUN-67 From Bacnotan town proper, travel 5.5 km. NE until reaching Brgy. Quirino. Station is located on the SE end of Maragayap West Bridge, about 300 m. S of Union Cement Plant. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty, with inscriptions \"LUN-67 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.76169760, '16° 45\' 42.111360\"', 120.34100420, '120° 20\' 27.615090\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.4850, 0.0000, '2', 7.3061, 216527.20900, 1855091.08500, '51', 16.76335316, '16° 45\' 48.071380\"', 120.33969470, '120° 20\' 22.900790\"', 10.9916, 1854029.55700, 429600.41900, '3', 216386.00700, 1855163.65800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9493, 'LUN-69', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BALAOAN', 'CALLIAT', 2007, 16.82680041, '16° 49\' 36.481476\"', 120.44341580, '120° 26\' 36.296880\"', 'LUN-69 From Balaoan town proper, travel 2.3 km. N to Pantar Norte, then turn right and travel 3.3 km. E to Brgy. Caliat. Station is located on the foot of the bridge going to Brgy. Caliat proper. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. monument leveled with the road surface, with inscriptions \"LUN-69 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.82680041, '16° 49\' 36.481490\"', 120.44341580, '120° 26\' 36.296950\"', 0.0000, '0', 59.4040, 0.0000, '2', 19.4567, 227544.40150, 1862155.46300, '51', 16.82845773, '16° 49\' 42.447840\"', 120.44210790, '120° 26\' 31.588610\"', 23.8659, 1861200.54000, 440539.97400, '3', 227403.49800, 1862227.75500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9494, 'LUN-7', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'PORO', 1994, 16.62157256, '16° 37\' 17.661216\"', 120.28231400, '120° 16\' 56.330400\"', 'LUN-7 (PCP-124) From the Municipality of San Fernando, travel W to Brgy. Poro for about 5 km. up to the Wallace Air Station. Ask for permission to enter the compound since it is a restricted area for civilians. The station is located at the Province of La Union, Municipality of San Fernando, Brgy. Poro, inside the Wallace Air Station compound. The station is on the SE corner of the intersection of V-shaped concrete canal and pathwalk, SW of the Medical/Infirmary building. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on a drilled hole and flushed to a cement putty with inscription \"LUN-7, 1994, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.62157256, '16° 37\' 17.661217\"', 120.28231400, '120° 16\' 56.330420\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.3407, 0.0000, '3', 13.6091, 210054.87390, 1839660.33100, '51', 16.62322081, '16° 37\' 23.594920\"', 120.28100110, '120° 16\' 51.604090\"', 17.5550, 1838544.00000, 423286.54300, '3', 209913.15400, 1839732.98100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1994-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9495, 'LUN-71', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BANGAR', 'BANGAOILAN WEST', 2007, 16.89766297, '16° 53\' 51.586692\"', 120.44243570, '120° 26\' 32.768520\"', 'LUN-71 From Bangar Town Hall, travel 2.5 km. NE to Brgy. Bangaoilan. Turn right at the brgy. welcome arc. Station is located about 100 m. from the said arc, situated beside the irrigation canal at the right intersection of the brgy. roads. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. monument protruding 0.2 m. from the ground, with inscriptions \"LUN-71 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.89766297, '16° 53\' 51.586700\"', 120.44243570, '120° 26\' 32.768410\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.0120, 0.0000, '2', 15.4450, 227541.54350, 1870002.42100, '51', 16.89932464, '16° 53\' 57.568700\"', 120.44112940, '120° 26\' 28.066000\"', 19.6973, 1869043.01000, 440457.87400, '3', 227400.87800, 1870074.77400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9496, 'LUN-72', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'AGOO', 'SAN AGUSTIN NORTE', 2007, 16.33602179, '16° 20\' 9.678444\"', 120.36532230, '120° 21\' 55.160280\"', 'LUN-72 From Agoo Mun. Hall, travel towards San Fernando, about 1 km. after passing the first bridge. Travel for about 200 m. and turn left. Continue traveling for about 80 m. where the station is located. Station is situated in the right edge of the road and is about 20 m. SW of the San Agustin Norte Day Care Center. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"LUN-72 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.33602179, '16° 20\' 9.678460\"', 120.36532230, '120° 21\' 55.160430\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.1840, 0.0000, '2', 13.9024, 218503.54300, 1807926.16000, '51', 16.33765066, '16° 20\' 15.542380\"', 120.36400290, '120° 21\' 50.410490\"', 18.3204, 1806913.46300, 432043.21500, '3', 218360.92600, 1807998.30500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mary', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9497, 'LUN-74', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'SUDIPEN', 'OLD CENTRAL', 2007, 16.90006830, '16° 54\' 0.245880\"', 120.49180000, '120° 29\' 30.480000\"', 'LUN-74 Is located in Brgy. Old Central, between Brgys. Ilocano and Namaltugan. It is situated on the middle of a dike E of a steel bridge and an irrigation bridge and is 8 m. N of the S end of the dike. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"LUN-74 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.90006830, '16° 54\' 0.245870\"', 120.49180000, '120° 29\' 30.479830\"', 0.0000, '0', 72.0200, 0.0000, '2', 31.7542, 232806.57200, 1870201.06800, '51', 16.90172904, '16° 54\' 6.224540\"', 120.49049390, '120° 29\' 25.777870\"', 36.5937, 1869294.82700, 445717.97300, '3', 232665.95200, 1870273.26200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9498, 'LUN-8 (TAM-1974)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'BACNOTAN', 'TAMMOCALAO', 1974, 16.74924257, '16° 44\' 57.273252\"', 120.34212970, '120° 20\' 31.666920\"', 'LUN-8 (TAM, 1974) Is in the Island of Luzon, Province of La Union, Municipality of Bacnotan, about 2 km. NW of the town\'s center, on a hill at Bo. Tamocalao, E of the municipal road running parallel to the shore. This road passes at the NW foot of the hill. The station is located on a slope about 64 m. SE of the SE peak of the hill. Mark is a cross cut on a 5/8\" dia. brass rod set on top center of a 1\" x 1\" concrete monument set flush on the ground with inscriptions \"TAM, 1974, NAMRIA\". RM-1 is the head of a 3\" C.W. nail set on a 6\" x 6\" concrete monument flush with the ground with inscription \"RM-1\" and an arrow pointing towards the station, distance 6.52 m., 137° 47\' azimuth. RM-2 is a similar mark with inscription \"RM-2\" and an arrow pointing the station, distance 7.62 m. 246° 37\' in azimuth. RM-3 with inscriptions \"RM-3\" and an arrow pointing to the station, distance 7.01 m. and 51° 14\' in azimuth.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.74924257, '16° 44\' 57.273265\"', 120.34212970, '120° 20\' 31.667075\"', 0.0000, '0', 108.7817, 0.0000, '3', 69.4921, 216628.81930, 1853710.42700, '51', 16.75089733, '16° 45\' 3.230400\"', 120.34081990, '120° 20\' 26.951790\"', 73.2469, 1852650.78200, 429715.82500, '3', 216487.57800, 1853782.98500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1994-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9499, 'LUN-9', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'LA UNION', 'NAGUILIAN', 'SUGUIDAN NORTE', 1994, 16.53073765, '16° 31\' 50.655540\"', 120.39142720, '120° 23\' 29.137920\"', 'LUN-9 From Bauang town proper, turn right to Naguilian road and travel for about 7 km. up to Naguilian town plaza. The station is located at the right side of the national road going to Baguio City and is accessible by 2-wheel drive vehicles. The station was established in the province of La Union, municipality of Naguilian inside the town plaza. It is located at the concrete pavement of the children\'s playground, about 20 m. W of the basketball court and about 10 m. SW of the gate. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on hole and cemented flush to the concrete pavement with inscription \"LUN-9, 1994, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.53073765, '16° 31\' 50.655540\"', 120.39142720, '120° 23\' 29.137909\"', 0.0000, '0', 63.4097, 0.0000, '3', 22.2306, 221572.16400, 1829448.36800, '51', 16.53237795, '16° 31\' 56.560630\"', 120.39011240, '120° 23\' 24.404470\"', 27.0803, 1828452.84900, 434898.01700, '3', 221430.22400, 1829520.58900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1994-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9500, 'PLGY', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'POBLACION', 2023, 16.03324856, '16° 1\' 59.694816\"', 120.23302680, '120° 13\' 58.896480\"', 'PLGY is located on the roof-deck of Pangasinan Provincial Engineering Office, Capitol Complex, Brgy. Poblacion, Lingayen, Pangasinan. The antenna pillar is mounted on one of the building\'s column and approximately 15 m from the ground. It is readily accessible as there\'s an access ladder leading to the roof deck of the building. The station location is accessible to all types of Land vehicles as well as airplanes, it is just adjacent to Lingayen Airport. The Provincial Engineering Office is within the Pangasinan Provincial Capitol complex. This station is the second Active Geodetic Station established in Pangasinan next to PURD station in Urdaneta, Pangasinan. The station is equipped with velocity and displacement autonomous solution engine (VADASE) which detects fast movement in real time, and interference detection and mitigation feature for spectrum protection against different radio frequency interferences.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.03324856, '16° 1\' 59.694800\"', 120.23302680, '120° 13\' 58.896390\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.4190, 0.0000, '0', 15.7868, 203907.98830, 1774588.93200, '51', 16.03486154, '16° 2\' 5.501540\"', 120.23170010, '120° 13\' 54.120330\"', 20.9564, 1773456.33400, 417780.64600, '3', 203764.24400, 1774661.25300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2023-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9501, 'PNG-2', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'ARNEDO', 1989, 16.39322867, '16° 23\' 35.623212\"', 119.88169360, '119° 52\' 54.096960\"', 'PNG-2 Is approx. 900 m. W of Bolinao Port; about 1.3 km. W from the intersection of national road and A. Celina St. Station is located at the middle W end of concrete fishpond dike in the School of Fisheries compound. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. brass rod set on top of the middle W end of concrete fishpond dike with cement patty. Inscribed on top PNG-2 1989 NAMRIA. RMs 1, 2, 3 & 4 are 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods with cement patties and arrows pointing to the station, set on top of concrete fishpond dike. RM 3 set on the NW corner of building with cement patty with arrow pointing to PNG-2 station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.39322867, '16° 23\' 35.623200\"', 119.88169360, '119° 52\' 54.096830\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.7328, 0.0000, '1', 3.8608, 807816.54670, 1814618.94300, '50', 16.39487159, '16° 23\' 41.537720\"', 119.88037490, '119° 52\' 49.349580\"', 7.2140, 1813468.77800, 380397.68500, '3', 807677.26800, 1814688.50500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9502, 'PNG-23 (SUAL-1993)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'POBLACION', 1993, 16.06724072, '16° 4\' 2.066592\"', 120.09816280, '120° 5\' 53.386080\"', 'PNG-23 (SUAL 1993) Is located inside the Sual Fishing Port complex. To reach the port, proceed directly to Sual Town Proper and upon reaching the corner of gymnasium, turn right to reach the port gate which is infront of the church. The station is about 300 m. from the gate leading to the pier. It is on the W end and S side of the pier and located about 2 m. S of the first lamp post of the pier. Mark is a 4 in. copper nail set on a curb of pier landing with cement putty and with inscription \"SUAL 1993 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.06724072, '16° 4\' 2.066580\"', 120.09816280, '120° 5\' 53.385990\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.1172, 0.0000, '3', 4.6474, 189518.74940, 1778550.57700, '51', 16.06885863, '16° 4\' 7.891070\"', 120.09683670, '120° 5\' 48.612290\"', 10.0837, 1777276.58500, 403363.74600, '3', 189375.01300, 1778623.35300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9503, 'PNG-24', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'PANGASCASAN', 1995, 16.12270419, '16° 7\' 21.735084\"', 120.10182740, '120° 6\' 6.578640\"', 'PNG-24 From Sual Municipal Town Hall, drive for about 8 km. or 5 min. along the national highway going to Alaminos to reach Brgy. Caoayan then turn right, a 4-wheel drive can travel along the dirt road for about 14 km. or 20 min. to reach the Sual Power Plant then proceed to Bangayao Pt. The station is located on top of the hill and on its E edge. It is about 8 min. hike from the base of the hill. On its SW side is the Cabalatian Island and on the NE side the Bangar Pt. Mark is a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 0.07 m. concrete block protruding 0.1 m. from the groud surface with inscription \"PNG-24 1995 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.12270419, '16° 7\' 21.735080\"', 120.10182740, '120° 6\' 6.578634\"', 0.0000, '0', 92.1389, 0.0000, '3', 50.0658, 189997.33150, 1784686.88300, '51', 16.12432559, '16° 7\' 27.572130\"', 120.10050270, '120° 6\' 1.809560\"', 55.2645, 1783412.83100, 403782.73600, '3', 189853.78400, 1784759.70800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9504, 'PNG-25', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'PANGASCASAN', 1995, 16.12738746, '16° 7\' 38.594856\"', 120.09693950, '120° 5\' 48.982200\"', 'PNG-25 From Sual Municipal Town Hall, drive for about 8 km. or 5 min. along the national highway going to Alaminos to reach Bgy. Caoayan then turn right, a 4-wheel drive can travel along the dirt road for about 14 km. or 20 min. to reach the gate of Sual Power Plant. Then travel along the dirt road for about 2 min. to reach the communication building which is on top of the hill. On its E side is the Cabalatian Island and on its NE side is the Bangar Pt. The station is located about 10 m. SE of Communication Bldg. Mark is a 3 in. copper nail centered on a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 0.7 m. concrete block protruding 0.1 m. from the ground surface with inscription \"PNG-25 1995 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.12738746, '16° 7\' 38.594850\"', 120.09693950, '120° 5\' 48.982091\"', 0.0000, '0', 91.2829, 0.0000, '3', 49.2573, 189481.41850, 1785212.85500, '51', 16.12900926, '16° 7\' 44.433330\"', 120.09561480, '120° 5\' 44.213390\"', 54.4345, 1783933.41200, 403262.13200, '3', 189337.88300, 1785285.69900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9505, 'PNG-26', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'TONDOL', 1996, 16.31622976, '16° 18\' 58.427136\"', 120.02400950, '120° 1\' 26.434200\"', 'PNG-26 To reach the station, travel NW from the municipal hall along the national road leading to Brgy. Tondol. Then by motorized boat/banca head NW to Tondoyong Island. Station is located approx. 10 m. from the S tip of the island and about 400 m. SSE of a ruin concrete house and about 15 m. S from the group of aroma trees. WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 18 58.42714 E 120 01 26.43412 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 43.80099 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.31622976, '16° 18\' 58.427140\"', 120.02400950, '120° 1\' 26.434120\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.8010, 0.0000, '3', 3.5647, 181978.47120, 1806237.28300, '51', 16.31786471, '16° 19\' 4.312950\"', 120.02268920, '120° 1\' 21.681060\"', 7.7026, 1804868.32000, 395560.60100, '3', 181835.51900, 1806310.51000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9506, 'PNG-27', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'TONDOL', 1996, 16.31887028, '16° 19\' 7.933008\"', 120.02489000, '120° 1\' 29.604000\"', 'PNG-27 To reach the station, travel N along the national road until you reach Brgy. Tondol, travel time is approx. 50 min. Then by ìmotorized banca head NW to Tondoyong Island. Station is located approx. 100 m. SW from a lone ruin concrete house and about 350 m. NNE of the S tip of the island and is approx. 5 m. N of the S coconut tree. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. x 0.7 m. concrete monument and protruding 0.1 m. above the grade line with inscription \"PNG-27 1996, NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 19 07.93302 E 120 01 29.60398 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 44.35931 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.31887028, '16° 19\' 7.933020\"', 120.02489000, '120° 1\' 29.603980\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.3593, 0.0000, '3', 4.1407, 182076.90710, 1806528.33100, '51', 16.32050538, '16° 19\' 13.819350\"', 120.02356980, '120° 1\' 24.851150\"', 8.2668, 1805160.09600, 395656.11100, '3', 181933.96400, 1806601.55700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9507, 'PNG-28', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'TONDOL', 1996, 16.32659592, '16° 19\' 35.745312\"', 120.03084360, '120° 1\' 51.036960\"', 'PNG-28 From the municipal hall of Anda, travel N along the national road leading to Brgy. Tondol. Then by a motorized banca head NNW to Cory Island. Cory Island, a newly form islet is formed or composed by wash ashore dead coral reefs about 350 sq. m. Station is about 30 m. N from the S tip of the said islet and is on the highest point of the island. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded and centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. x 1.0 m. concrete monument and protruding about 0.2 m. above the ground with inscription \"PNG-28, 1996, NAMRIA. WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 19 35.74532 E 120 01 51.03683 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 44.67723 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.32659592, '16° 19\' 35.745320\"', 120.03084360, '120° 1\' 51.036830\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.6772, 0.0000, '3', 4.4956, 182726.06660, 1807374.60900, '51', 16.32823136, '16° 19\' 41.632900\"', 120.02952350, '120° 1\' 46.284670\"', 8.5939, 1806012.04500, 396296.46700, '3', 182583.15500, 1807447.82200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9508, 'PNG-29', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'TONDOL', 1996, 16.31403429, '16° 18\' 50.523444\"', 120.01412490, '120° 0\' 50.849640\"', 'PNG-29 From Anda municipal hall, travel N along the national road until you reach Tondol white sand beach. Station is located 3 m. W from the W side of the jetty, 35 m. SSW from the NW corner of the jetty and 10 m. NW of the SW corner of jetty. Station is approx. 25 m. from Tondol white sand beach cottages and 5 m. N of a lone tree. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded and ìcentered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. x 0.7 m. concrete monument and protruding about 0.1 m. above the ground surface with inscription \"PNG-29 1996, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.31403429, '16° 18\' 50.523450\"', 120.01412490, '120° 0\' 50.849460\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.6160, 0.0000, '3', 3.4057, 180917.80380, 1806009.61100, '51', 16.31566932, '16° 18\' 56.409550\"', 120.01280450, '120° 0\' 46.096170\"', 7.5348, 1804630.45800, 394503.01900, '3', 180774.83600, 1806082.86800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9509, 'PNG-30', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'TONDOL', 1996, 16.30684411, '16° 18\' 24.638796\"', 120.01204250, '120° 0\' 43.353000\"', 'PNG-30 From Anda town proper, travel N along the national road leading to Brgy. Tondol. Station is located near the house of Mr. Dionisio Torino and is located on the W side of the 8 m. wide road and is located 400 m. S from the Bureau of Land Location Monument (BLLM-8). Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 0.25 m. x 0.25 x 0.7 m. concrete monument with inscription \"PNG-30 1996 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 18 24.63881 E 120 00 43.35294 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 44.66414 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.30684411, '16° 18\' 24.638810\"', 120.01204250, '120° 0\' 43.352940\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.6641, 0.0000, '3', 4.4047, 180683.43010, 1805216.59700, '51', 16.30847874, '16° 18\' 30.523480\"', 120.01072200, '120° 0\' 38.599040\"', 8.5661, 1803835.79700, 394276.59000, '3', 180540.43600, 1805289.85500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9510, 'PNG-3001', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'UMINGAN', 'ALO-O', 2007, 15.90774172, '15° 54\' 27.870192\"', 120.88681590, '120° 53\' 12.537240\"', 'PNG-3001 From Umingan Town Proper, travel for about 5 kilometers SE to reach Barangay Alo-o. The station is located at the NE ege of the basketball court inside the Barangay Hall compound. I tis about 8 meters SE of Barangay Hall. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3001; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.90774172, '15° 54\' 27.870180\"', 120.88681590, '120° 53\' 12.537190\"', 0.0000, '0', 203.6650, 0.0000, '3', 160.1302, 273759.76520, 1759874.22400, '51', 15.90933248, '15° 54\' 33.596920\"', 120.88548720, '120° 53\' 7.753850\"', 164.2400, 1759418.03700, 487738.11700, '3', 273616.14200, 1759944.31200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9511, 'PNG-3002', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN QUINTIN', 'CASANTAMARIAN', 2007, 15.98411334, '15° 59\' 2.808024\"', 120.81896370, '120° 49\' 8.269320\"', 'PNG-3002 From San Quintin Town Proper, along Dpalo Road, travel for about 1.5 kilometers to reach Barangay Casantamarian. The station is located at the SW corner of the basketball court inside Barangay Hall compound. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3002; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.98411334, '15° 59\' 2.808040\"', 120.81896370, '120° 49\' 8.269330\"', 0.0000, '0', 155.1830, 0.0000, '3', 111.9537, 266580.91100, 1768401.90000, '51', 15.98571039, '15° 59\' 8.557390\"', 120.81763670, '120° 49\' 3.492060\"', 116.1520, 1767874.18000, 480480.14800, '3', 266437.48500, 1768472.27300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9512, 'PNG-3003 (BLLM-1)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'NATIVIDAD', 'SALUD', 2007, 16.04315031, '16° 2\' 35.341116\"', 120.79725420, '120° 47\' 50.115120\"', 'PNG-3003 (BLLM-1) From the Municipality of Tayug, travel for about 5 kilometers NE to reach the Municipality of Natividad. The station is located at the edge of the E part of the Andres Bonifacio monument inside the Municipal Hall compound. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3003; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.04315031, '16° 2\' 35.341100\"', 120.79725420, '120° 47\' 50.115020\"', 0.0000, '0', 134.0510, 0.0000, '3', 90.7434, 264325.87580, 1774960.86700, '51', 16.04475152, '16° 2\' 41.105460\"', 120.79592850, '120° 47\' 45.342610\"', 95.2510, 1774409.10800, 478162.95400, '3', 264182.62900, 1775031.36200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9513, 'PNG-3004 (BBM-50) (FNSP)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'SAN FELIPE EAST', 2007, 16.10917024, '16° 6\' 33.012864\"', 120.72974750, '120° 43\' 47.091000\"', 'PNG-3004 (BBM-50 FNSP) From San Nicolas Town Proper, along the San Felipe-San Nicolas road, travel N crossing the Ambayaoan river and passing through Barangays Lungao, Meleleon and Salpad to reach the barangay boundary marker of San Felipe East. The station is located at the NE edge of the NIA culvert over the Tanggal Mayor Creek. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3004; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.10917024, '16° 6\' 33.012850\"', 120.72974750, '120° 43\' 47.091120\"', 0.0000, '0', 142.8160, 0.0000, '3', 99.7674, 257180.31650, 1782346.55300, '51', 16.11077704, '16° 6\' 38.797340\"', 120.72842330, '120° 43\' 42.323930\"', 104.3800, 1781723.04600, 470948.98700, '3', 257037.23500, 1782417.32200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Denicia B. Rivera', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9514, 'PNG-3005', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'TAYUG', 'BARANGAY B', 2007, 16.02729998, '16° 1\' 38.279928\"', 120.74516620, '120° 44\' 42.598320\"', 'PNG-3005 From San Carlos City Proper, travel N then E passing through Municipalities of Calasiao, Santa Barbara, Urdaneta City and Asingan to reach Tayug. The station is located approximately 8 meters E of the Jose Rizal Monument inside the Municipal Hall Compound and approximately 4 meters from the centerline of the driveway. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3005; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.02729998, '16° 1\' 38.279940\"', 120.74516620, '120° 44\' 42.598490\"', 0.0000, '0', 104.5940, 0.0000, '3', 61.9481, 258731.42480, 1773266.39600, '51', 16.02890135, '16° 1\' 44.044870\"', 120.74384010, '120° 44\' 37.824450\"', 65.8730, 1772661.50100, 472586.94700, '3', 258588.08100, 1773337.04600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9515, 'PNG-3006', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN QUINTIN', 'BOLINTAGUEN', 2007, 15.97045372, '15° 58\' 13.633392\"', 120.77726640, '120° 46\' 38.159040\"', 'PNG-3006 From San Quintin Town Proper travel for about 3 kilometers SW then turn left going to the solar dryer. The station is located about 3 meters NW of the center of the solar drier and 150 meters NW of the centerline of Sta. Maria-San Quintin road. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3006; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.97045372, '15° 58\' 13.633390\"', 120.77726640, '120° 46\' 38.159190\"', 0.0000, '0', 112.6670, 0.0000, '3', 69.9554, 262100.33500, 1766937.24800, '51', 15.97205083, '15° 58\' 19.383000\"', 120.77593900, '120° 46\' 33.380520\"', 73.6960, 1766367.14400, 476015.26000, '3', 261956.82800, 1767007.74600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9516, 'PNG-3007', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN QUINTIN', 'BALIGAYAN', 2007, 15.95439854, '15° 57\' 15.834744\"', 120.72851200, '120° 43\' 42.643200\"', 'PNG-3007 From Santa Maria Town Proper travel for about 4 kilometers SE to reach Balingao-San Quintin road junction at Barangay Libsong, Sta. Maria. About 80 meters farther is the bridge between the boundary of Barangay Libsong, Ma. Aurora and Baligayan. The staton is locate at the SE corner of the bridge. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3007; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.95439854, '15° 57\' 15.834730\"', 120.72851200, '120° 43\' 42.643260\"', 0.0000, '0', 90.3200, 0.0000, '3', 48.0867, 256860.44130, 1765216.49000, '51', 15.95599572, '15° 57\' 21.584590\"', 120.72718420, '120° 43\' 37.862970\"', 51.4190, 1764596.90900, 470793.90800, '3', 256716.84000, 1765287.13200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9517, 'PNG-3008', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'SAN PATRICIO', 2007, 15.98087674, '15° 58\' 51.156264\"', 120.69962000, '120° 41\' 58.632000\"', 'PNG-3008 From Rosales Town Proper, travel N to reach the Municipality of Sta. Maria. The station is located about 4 meters E of the Municipal flagpole. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3008; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.98087674, '15° 58\' 51.156270\"', 120.69962000, '120° 41\' 58.632150\"', 0.0000, '0', 88.5230, 0.0000, '3', 46.4295, 253798.82810, 1768181.31900, '51', 15.98247622, '15° 58\' 56.914380\"', 120.69829280, '120° 41\' 53.853950\"', 49.7720, 1767531.18700, 467705.18300, '3', 253655.29100, 1768252.07800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9518, 'PNG-3009', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'ANGAYAN SUR', 2007, 15.89756687, '15° 53\' 51.240732\"', 120.69000380, '120° 41\' 24.013680\"', 'PNG-3009 From Balungao Town Proper along the Balungao-Umingan road, travel for about 2 kilometers E . The station is located on top of the rip-rap merging with the SW corner of San Aurelio Bridge approximately 80 meters SE of KM POST 201. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3009; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89756687, '15° 53\' 51.240740\"', 120.69000380, '120° 41\' 24.013730\"', 0.0000, '0', 88.3500, 0.0000, '3', 46.4798, 252667.00740, 1758971.10300, '51', 15.89916135, '15° 53\' 56.980850\"', 120.68867460, '120° 41\' 19.228450\"', 49.3710, 1758314.09600, 466661.88400, '3', 252523.18400, 1759041.82200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9519, 'PNG-3010', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINALONAN', 'CAMANGAAN', 2007, 16.08463244, '16° 5\' 4.676784\"', 120.60334650, '120° 36\' 12.047400\"', 'PNG-3010 From Binalonan Town Proper travel along the highway going to Pozzorubio, then turn right to the road going to Barangays Moreno, Sta. Catalina and Camangaan. Follow the road then turn right to the road going to Sta. Catalina crossing and concrete bridge to reach the waiting shed near the intersection. Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3010; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.08463244, '16° 5\' 4.676800\"', 120.60334650, '120° 36\' 12.047450\"', 0.0000, '0', 95.6570, 0.0000, '3', 53.7706, 243622.76460, 1779783.20400, '51', 16.08624050, '16° 5\' 10.465790\"', 120.60202150, '120° 36\' 7.277540\"', 57.4520, 1779029.99400, 457422.19200, '3', 243479.49700, 1779854.36300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9520, 'PNG-3011', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'POZZORUBIO', 'VILLEGAS', 2007, 16.12877841, '16° 7\' 43.602276\"', 120.55916280, '120° 33\' 32.986080\"', 'PNG-3011Travel along Binalonan going to Pozzorubio highway, upon reaching the Y road going to the Municipal Hall of Pozzorubio and national highway, continue travelling along the national highway for about 900 meters then turn right at the road going to Barangay Imbalbalatong. Follow the road to reach Villegas Elementary School. The station is inside then school compound on a vacant lot at the back of the school building, about 6 meters SE of the 11th pillar of the NW concrete wall.Station mark is the head of a copper nail embedded at the center of a 25cm. x 25cm. cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-3011; 2007; NAMRIA.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.12877841, '16° 7\' 43.602260\"', 120.55916280, '120° 33\' 32.986050\"', 0.0000, '0', 120.4500, 0.0000, '3', 78.5577, 238951.67670, 1784725.55200, '51', 16.13039017, '16° 7\' 49.404610\"', 120.55783880, '120° 33\' 28.219660\"', 82.4860, 1783924.80000, 452705.67600, '3', 238808.52200, 1784796.89100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
