(9628, 'PNG-3161', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'CAMAGSINGALAN', 2008, 16.06883579, '16° 4\' 7.808844\"', 120.01462240, '120° 0\' 52.640640\"', 'PNG-3161 From Sual town proper go NW, follow the national road travelling about 20 to 30 minutes until you reach the route to Brgy. Camagsingalan. About 500 m from the national road. The mark is located before the Camagsingalan barangay Plaza, 2 meters from the north side of a waiting shed and 0.5 m west of the irrigation canal. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3161, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.06883579, '16° 4\' 7.808860\"', 120.01462240, '120° 0\' 52.640790\"', 0.0000, '0', 85.3400, 0.0000, '4', 43.2867, 180576.12480, 1778854.52600, '51', 16.07045576, '16° 4\' 13.640730\"', 120.01329630, '120° 0\' 47.866830\"', 48.5140, 1777494.13700, 394425.24900, '3', 180432.32600, 1778927.59100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9629, 'PNG-3162', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'SIOASIO WEST', 2008, 16.04340779, '16° 2\' 36.268044\"', 120.03716090, '120° 2\' 13.779240\"', 'PNG-3162 From Sual town proper go NW, follow the national road until you reach the signboard marked with to Sioasio, located at the left shoulder of the road, about 30 to 40 minutes traveling uphill with a rocky road for any kind of vehicle to reach Siaosio west, the mark is located between a waiting shed and electric post. The waiting shed is at the left side of the road. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3162, PRS-92, 2008 DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.04340779, '16° 2\' 36.268050\"', 120.03716090, '120° 2\' 13.779100\"', 0.0000, '0', 124.9190, 0.0000, '4', 82.5579, 182949.17760, 1776003.89200, '51', 16.04502568, '16° 2\' 42.092430\"', 120.03583420, '120° 2\' 9.003120\"', 87.9620, 1774668.65200, 396823.83800, '3', 182805.31200, 1776076.86000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9630, 'PNG-3163', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'SANTO DOMINGO', 2008, 16.07508446, '16° 4\' 30.304056\"', 120.02977370, '120° 1\' 47.185320\"', 'From Sual town proper go NW, follow the national road until you reach the signboard marked with \"To SIOASIO\", located at the left shoulder of the road, about 150 meters from the national road to STO. DOMINGO Elem. School. The mark is located inside the school at a few step west beginning at the entrance, nearly at the base of the old flag pole. Station is mark by the head of 4\" copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription \"PNG -3163, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07508446, '16° 4\' 30.304040\"', 120.02977370, '120° 1\' 47.185250\"', 0.0000, '0', 90.5910, 0.0000, '4', 48.4764, 182208.43030, 1779523.15600, '51', 16.07670448, '16° 4\' 36.136110\"', 120.02844770, '120° 1\' 42.411880\"', 53.7470, 1778177.95800, 396049.79000, '3', 182064.66500, 1779596.17600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
