(9641, 'PNG-3179', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'PANTAL', 2008, 15.99079881, '15° 59\' 26.875716\"', 120.20775510, '120° 12\' 27.918360\"', 'From Bugallon town proper, travel northward and then turn left from the intersection going to Alaminos road, approximately 2 km. from the intersection, turn right until reaching the barangay police outpost of Pantal, Bugallon. It is located in front of the barangay tanod outpost, 11.66 meters SW of the flagpole and 5 meters NW of CENPELCO electric post. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3179, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99079881, '15° 59\' 26.875710\"', 120.20775510, '120° 12\' 27.918240\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.0840, 0.0000, '4', 4.1768, 201138.62480, 1769924.89800, '51', 15.99240970, '15° 59\' 32.674910\"', 120.20642740, '120° 12\' 23.138520\"', 9.5550, 1768768.95700, 415057.99900, '3', 200994.71800, 1769997.26500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9642, 'PNG-3180', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'MAGTAKING', 2008, 15.98616106, '15° 59\' 10.179816\"', 120.18245490, '120° 10\' 56.837640\"', 'From Municipal Hall of Bugallon travel along the national highway going to Alaminos for about 3 minutes and upon reaching the barangay hall of Magtaquing, facing the barangay hall, it is exactly 5.50 meters from the left concrete fence of the barangay hall and approximately 60 meters west of gymnasium on the opposite side of the national road. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3180, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.98616106, '15° 59\' 10.179830\"', 120.18245490, '120° 10\' 56.837600\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.2050, 0.0000, '4', 5.2375, 198421.86240, 1769447.94100, '51', 15.98777222, '15° 59\' 15.979990\"', 120.18112700, '120° 10\' 52.057370\"', 10.7230, 1768266.29000, 412347.74100, '3', 198277.91900, 1769520.38800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9643, 'PNG-3181', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'BANAGA', 2008, 15.99138625, '15° 59\' 28.990500\"', 120.22869310, '120° 13\' 43.295160\"', 'From Municipal Hall of Bugallon travel along the highway northward and turn right upon reaching the crossing, just after the Bugallon bridge, turn right at the crossing with approximately 400 meter from the national road where the PRS-92 monument is located, just in front of the main gate of Paaralang Elementarya ng Banaga. On the opposite side of the road and 6.53 meters NW of concrete post and electric post. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3181, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99138625, '15° 59\' 28.990510\"', 120.22869310, '120° 13\' 43.295210\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.3790, 0.0000, '4', 4.5216, 203382.04510, 1769959.92400, '51', 15.99299672, '15° 59\' 34.788200\"', 120.22736550, '120° 13\' 38.515640\"', 9.8000, 1768825.47500, 417299.51800, '3', 203238.15700, 1770032.22400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9644, 'PNG-3182', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'CABAYAOASAN', 2008, 15.96183836, '15° 57\' 42.618096\"', 120.23228070, '120° 13\' 56.210520\"', 'From Bugallon town plaza travel eastward going to barangay Cabayoasan. The station is located E of the barangay plaza. It is 4 m E of the barangay road. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3182, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.96183836, '15° 57\' 42.618080\"', 120.23228070, '120° 13\' 56.210520\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.1530, 0.0000, '4', 4.1536, 203722.75180, 1766683.12700, '51', 15.96344691, '15° 57\' 48.408860\"', 120.23095240, '120° 13\' 51.428470\"', 9.4770, 1765554.20700, 417671.38600, '3', 203578.76700, 1766755.39000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9645, 'PNG-3183', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'SAN FRANCISCO', 2008, 15.96729633, '15° 58\' 2.266788\"', 120.19804020, '120° 11\' 52.944720\"', 'From Bugallon town plaza travel north along the highway and turn left at the crossing, turn left to \"Welcome to Balabac West\", staright ahead to Brgy. Bacabac, continue travel westward and reach the Bdry. of Bacabac and San Francisco w/c is the bridge, w/ approximately 500 meters from the bridge. It is located at the left of the dirt road, it is opposite of the lagoon. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3183, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.96729633, '15° 58\' 2.266770\"', 120.19804020, '120° 11\' 52.944670\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.2590, 0.0000, '4', 4.2188, 200063.04620, 1767336.53700, '51', 15.96890596, '15° 58\' 8.061470\"', 120.19671190, '120° 11\' 48.162920\"', 9.6830, 1766172.11900, 414007.98500, '3', 199919.05200, 1767408.91600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9646, 'PNG-3184', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'LAGUIT CENTRO', 2008, 15.93084289, '15° 55\' 51.034404\"', 120.16687810, '120° 10\' 0.761160\"', 'From Bugallon town plaza travel westward going to Laguit Centro approximately 2.1 kilometer upon reaching the concrete fence of elementary school, it is located 3.5 meters SW of the concrete fence and approximately 60 meters east of the main gate of the school. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3184, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.93084289, '15° 55\' 51.034410\"', 120.16687810, '120° 10\' 0.760980\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.9460, 0.0000, '4', 13.6913, 196670.08200, 1763345.25700, '51', 15.93245094, '15° 55\' 56.823390\"', 120.16554890, '120° 9\' 55.976030\"', 19.3350, 1762151.25100, 410655.63800, '3', 196525.93900, 1763417.70700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9647, 'PNG-3186', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'LAGUIT PADILLA', 2008, 15.94387193, '15° 56\' 37.938948\"', 120.17967430, '120° 10\' 46.827480\"', 'From Bugallon town plaza travel westward going to Laguit Padilla, before reaching the place, brgy. Laguit Centro the first brgy. To reach just go ahead and you reach the bridge turn left and another intersection will take place, just turn left until you reach the barangay hall, it is located 7.60 meters NE of the concrete fence of the barangay plaza and approximately 80 meters SW of Laguit Padilla Elementary School. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3186, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.94387193, '15° 56\' 37.938930\"', 120.17967430, '120° 10\' 46.827330\"', 0.0000, '0', 61.3740, 0.0000, '4', 18.1950, 198060.57980, 1764769.36100, '51', 15.94548050, '15° 56\' 43.729810\"', 120.17834540, '120° 10\' 42.043540\"', 23.7710, 1763587.61500, 412031.51700, '3', 197916.49200, 1764841.78000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9648, 'PNG-3187', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'UMANDAY', 2008, 15.93756278, '15° 56\' 15.226008\"', 120.21974440, '120° 13\' 11.079840\"', 'At Bugallon municipal hall travel westward going to Aguilar town. The station will be located upon reaching Sapang bridge near Umanday barangay hall. It is located 4 m W of the said bridge. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m cement putty with inscription “PNG-3187, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.93756278, '15° 56\' 15.225990\"', 120.21974440, '120° 13\' 11.079890\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.9170, 0.0000, '4', 13.7662, 202344.00650, 1764013.10000, '51', 15.93917008, '15° 56\' 21.012300\"', 120.21841550, '120° 13\' 6.295730\"', 19.1980, 1762872.84300, 416319.13800, '3', 202199.92900, 1764085.38300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
