(9651, 'PNG-3190', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'PORTIC', 2008, 15.91219873, '15° 54\' 43.915428\"', 120.19275010, '120° 11\' 33.900360\"', 'To reach Gomoloc river irrigation system (dam site) travel northward from national road going to Barangay Portic. The station is located 20 cm S of the concrete pavement of the water reservoir. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3190, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.91219873, '15° 54\' 43.915420\"', 120.19275010, '120° 11\' 33.900350\"', 0.0000, '0', 74.3090, 0.0000, '4', 30.9912, 199414.22320, 1761243.36000, '51', 15.91380504, '15° 54\' 49.698150\"', 120.19142050, '120° 11\' 29.113960\"', 36.5800, 1760077.07300, 413417.87500, '3', 199270.03800, 1761315.70900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9652, 'PNG-3192', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'BAYBAY', 2008, 15.89317389, '15° 53\' 35.426004\"', 120.23688000, '120° 14\' 12.768000\"', 'At municipal town proper travel north going to barangay Baybay approximately 4 kms. The station is located on the open lot with concrete posts along the national highway. It is about 5 m E from the centerline of the national road. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3192, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89317389, '15° 53\' 35.426020\"', 120.23688000, '120° 14\' 12.768100\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.2610, 0.0000, '4', 8.9286, 204114.72920, 1759073.79600, '51', 15.89477806, '15° 53\' 41.201010\"', 120.23555010, '120° 14\' 7.980280\"', 14.3680, 1757953.86400, 418135.78500, '3', 203970.51700, 1759145.98500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
