(9655, 'PNG-3195', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'LAOAG', 2008, 15.86964823, '15° 52\' 10.733628\"', 120.24268030, '120° 14\' 33.649080\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel northward until you reach the barangay Cabugay municipality of Aguilar. The mark is located at Cabugay bridge about 4 m from the North side edge of the bridge and 7 m from the centerline of the road. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3195, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.86964823, '15° 52\' 10.733620\"', 120.24268030, '120° 14\' 33.648990\"', 0.0000, '0', 65.9420, 0.0000, '4', 22.5077, 204701.92210, 1756460.75900, '51', 15.87125079, '15° 52\' 16.502840\"', 120.24134980, '120° 14\' 28.859210\"', 27.9640, 1755348.21400, 418747.46600, '3', 204557.63500, 1756532.90900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'ysn', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9656, 'PNG-3196', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'SAN JOSE', 2008, 15.86446811, '15° 51\' 52.085196\"', 120.27831510, '120° 16\' 41.934360\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel northward until you reach the barangay Bocacliw. This is the way going to barangay San Jose. The mark is located at barangay San Jose Purok 3 near the basketball court. Facing north, start at the NW edge of the court then make 15 normal steps. Follow the straight side of the road after that face west. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3196, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.86446811, '15° 51\' 52.085200\"', 120.27831510, '120° 16\' 41.934280\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.5290, 0.0000, '4', 8.1867, 208513.28870, 1755837.24900, '51', 15.86606957, '15° 51\' 57.850450\"', 120.27698450, '120° 16\' 37.144220\"', 13.4490, 1754761.39800, 422562.19600, '3', 208369.01300, 1755909.27800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9657, 'PNG-3197', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'NIÑOY', 2008, 15.86149447, '15° 51\' 41.380092\"', 120.23566780, '120° 14\' 8.404080\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel northward until you reach the barangay Ninoy west. Ninoy west is also known as river side, where the mark is located. The mark is located at Bargas Dam. From Cabugay bridge travel westward on a rocky road about 15 minutes until you reach Sitio Bargas. Facing South, start from left side of the concrete part of the dam measure about 60 meters, just follow the concrete retaining wall of the dam. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3197, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.86149447, '15° 51\' 41.380080\"', 120.23566780, '120° 14\' 8.404110\"', 0.0000, '0', 80.6190, 0.0000, '4', 37.1291, 203938.49900, 1755567.85700, '51', 15.86309667, '15° 51\' 47.148010\"', 120.23433710, '120° 14\' 3.613630\"', 42.6330, 1754448.65900, 417993.06500, '3', 203794.17900, 1755640.02200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9658, 'PNG-3199', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'CALSIB', 2008, 15.84641036, '15° 50\' 47.077296\"', 120.26806170, '120° 16\' 5.022120\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel northward until you reach the barangay Calsib. The mark is loacted at barangay Calsib (purok 2), in front of Vic Stabillo\'s House, facing north it is located on the right side concrete fence of their house, near the basketball court of barangay Calsib purok 2. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3199, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.84641036, '15° 50\' 47.077290\"', 120.26806170, '120° 16\' 5.022140\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.6430, 0.0000, '4', 12.1761, 207388.39680, 1753852.18800, '51', 15.84801091, '15° 50\' 52.839290\"', 120.26673070, '120° 16\' 0.230510\"', 17.5330, 1752766.96500, 421456.93400, '3', 207244.05200, 1753924.23500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9659, 'PNG-32', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'POBLACION', 1996, 15.99038898, '15° 59\' 25.400328\"', 119.87998140, '119° 52\' 47.933040\"', 'PNG-32 Is located on top of a water tank within the Municipal Park about 20 m. S of the Municipal Bldg. and 15 m. SW of the Municipal Library. Station mark is the head of a 2\" copper nail embedded on a 6 x 6\" cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-32, 1996, NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES : N 15 59 25.40033 E 119 52 47.93291 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 71.88200 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99038898, '15° 59\' 25.400330\"', 119.87998140, '119° 52\' 47.932910\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.8820, 0.0000, '3', 30.9213, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 15.99200703, '15° 59\' 31.225310\"', 119.87865330, '119° 52\' 43.151710\"', 35.1459, 1768885.95400, 379970.38300, '3', 808118.80600, 1770077.06000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1997-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2016-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9660, 'PNG-3200', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'POGONSILI', 2008, 15.82152484, '15° 49\' 17.489424\"', 120.24979490, '120° 14\' 59.261640\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel northward until you reach barangay Bayaos. Enter on that barangay until you reach the boundary of barangay Pogonsili. The mark is located nearly at the base of barangay Pogonsili and barangay Bayaos Sitio Kasagatan marker. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3200, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.82152484, '15° 49\' 17.489440\"', 120.24979490, '120° 14\' 59.261660\"', 0.0000, '0', 73.0420, 0.0000, '4', 29.3800, 205394.48400, 1751122.41000, '51', 15.82312424, '15° 49\' 23.247270\"', 120.24846330, '120° 14\' 54.467860\"', 34.9030, 1750020.09200, 419490.29500, '3', 205250.04100, 1751194.49500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9661, 'PNG-3201', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'BUENLAG', 2008, 15.80379924, '15° 48\' 13.677264\"', 120.25177340, '120° 15\' 6.384240\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel westward around 6 kms to barangay Quetegan. Turn left and travel again 2 kms until reaching barangay Buenlag. The mark is located at the center of the eastern part of the stepping line of the basketball court. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3201, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.80379924, '15° 48\' 13.677260\"', 120.25177340, '120° 15\' 6.384160\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.9030, 0.0000, '4', 25.1480, 205580.88810, 1749157.02500, '51', 15.80539749, '15° 48\' 19.430950\"', 120.25044140, '120° 15\' 1.588870\"', 30.7050, 1748057.81300, 419695.21500, '3', 205436.38700, 1749229.08800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
