(9662, 'PNG-3202', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'QUETEGAN', 2008, 15.82342760, '15° 49\' 24.339360\"', 120.27117840, '120° 16\' 16.242240\"', 'From Mangatarem town plaza travel westward going to Quetegan Elem. School around 5 kms of any kind of vehicle. The station is located east of the signboard. It is about 30 cm E of the said signboard. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3202, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.82342760, '15° 49\' 24.339350\"', 120.27117840, '120° 16\' 16.242370\"', 0.0000, '0', 59.0730, 0.0000, '4', 15.4981, 207689.34370, 1751303.18000, '51', 15.82502665, '15° 49\' 30.095930\"', 120.26984690, '120° 16\' 11.448810\"', 20.8870, 1750222.52200, 421781.89100, '3', 207544.92400, 1751375.19700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9663, 'PNG-3203', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'CALUMBOYAN NORTE', 2008, 15.83846680, '15° 50\' 18.480480\"', 120.28319420, '120° 16\' 59.499120\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel westward going to Quetegan Elem. School about 5 kms after reaching the said school turn left going to Calomboyan Norte. The station is loacted at the Calomboyan Norte-Linmansangan road. It is about 2 m W of the road. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3203, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.83846680, '15° 50\' 18.480470\"', 120.28319420, '120° 16\' 59.499170\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.2540, 0.0000, '4', 10.8022, 208998.85500, 1752951.60800, '51', 15.84006652, '15° 50\' 24.239480\"', 120.28186300, '120° 16\' 54.706940\"', 16.0840, 1751882.28800, 423074.87700, '3', 208854.49600, 1753023.59800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9664, 'PNG-3204', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'DORONGAN VALERIO', 2008, 15.82298768, '15° 49\' 22.755648\"', 120.31161760, '120° 18\' 41.823360\"', 'From Managtarem municipal hall travel westward going to Quetegan Elem school about 5 kms after reaching the said school turn right and travel again 2 kms going to barangay Dor Valerio. The mark is located at the NW strip of the basketball court. It is about 1 m W of the said court. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3204, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.82298768, '15° 49\' 22.755630\"', 120.31161760, '120° 18\' 41.823380\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.7060, 0.0000, '4', 9.2969, 212023.29880, 1751198.55600, '51', 15.82458581, '15° 49\' 28.508910\"', 120.31028610, '120° 18\' 37.029970\"', 14.4210, 1750159.10300, 426113.99100, '3', 211878.91100, 1751270.44100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9665, 'PNG-3205', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'BOGTONG SILAG', 2008, 15.81198998, '15° 48\' 43.163928\"', 120.27928530, '120° 16\' 45.427080\"', 'From Mangatarem town plaza travel approximately 3 kms westward going to barangay Bogtong Silag. Turn right at the waiting shed going to Bogtong Silag Elem School. The station is located eastern side of the road intersection. It is about 2 m NE of the road. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m cement putty with inscription “PNG-3205, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.81198998, '15° 48\' 43.163920\"', 120.27928530, '120° 16\' 45.427080\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.3220, 0.0000, '4', 11.7127, 208541.90550, 1750025.53500, '51', 15.81358813, '15° 48\' 48.917280\"', 120.27795350, '120° 16\' 40.632600\"', 17.0830, 1748953.81800, 422646.00700, '3', 208397.45400, 1750097.51600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9666, 'PNG-3207', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'BUNAGAN', 2008, 15.76864310, '15° 46\' 7.115160\"', 120.26832190, '120° 16\' 5.958840\"', 'From Municipal town hall of Mangatarem travel NW along the provincial road approximately 5 kms. The GPS station is located 8.98 m S form the center of the ring of the basketball and 14.75 m SW of CENPELCO post and it is located on the top of the rip rap of the irrigation canal and 10.68 m W of the waiting shed. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m cement putty with inscription “PNG-3207, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.76864310, '15° 46\' 7.115170\"', 120.26832190, '120° 16\' 5.958880\"', 0.0000, '0', 74.1510, 0.0000, '4', 30.2242, 207304.37130, 1745241.41000, '51', 15.77023878, '15° 46\' 12.859610\"', 120.26698910, '120° 16\' 1.160690\"', 35.8090, 1744161.16200, 421454.61600, '3', 207159.76500, 1745313.38800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9667, 'PNG-3208', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'TORRE 1ST', 2008, 15.78950824, '15° 47\' 22.229664\"', 120.29346180, '120° 17\' 36.462480\"', 'The station is located at municipal town plaza. It can be found at Amor Park (Children\'s Playground). It is about 50 cm SW of the concrete post of the SW side of the said park. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3208, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.78950824, '15° 47\' 22.229660\"', 120.29346180, '120° 17\' 36.462510\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.6730, 0.0000, '4', 14.9903, 210029.50200, 1747516.76900, '51', 15.79110468, '15° 47\' 27.976830\"', 120.29212950, '120° 17\' 31.666190\"', 20.3320, 1746460.80800, 424156.40100, '3', 209884.98700, 1747588.68400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9668, 'PNG-3209', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'DORONGAN PUNTA', 2008, 15.81041273, '15° 48\' 37.485828\"', 120.31468950, '120° 18\' 52.882200\"', 'From municipal town hall of Mangatarem travel east along the provincial road going to Urbiztondo. You will reach first the welcome arc of baranagay Dorungan Punta and the Canatan bridge and another old bridge ahed and you reach the intersection of the provincial road and barangay road at the right side. It is exactly located 11.70 m SW on the post exactly oposite of the waiting shed. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3209, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.81041273, '15° 48\' 37.485840\"', 120.31468950, '120° 18\' 52.882030\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.3490, 0.0000, '4', 10.8862, 212334.76020, 1749802.08600, '51', 15.81201001, '15° 48\' 43.236050\"', 120.31335770, '120° 18\' 48.087570\"', 16.0190, 1748766.48900, 426438.50100, '3', 212190.33300, 1749873.95000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9669, 'PNG-3210', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'DORONGAN SAWAT', 2008, 15.79157698, '15° 47\' 29.677128\"', 120.33389760, '120° 20\' 2.031360\"', 'From municipal town hall of Mangatarem travel east along the provincial road going to Urbiztondo. You will reach first the welcome arc of barangay Dorongan Punta and the Canatan bridge and another old bridge ahead, turn right at the first waiting shed going to the place, ahead of this place is barangay Dorongan Ketakit just go ahead and reach the dministration building of Dorongan Sawat, turn left and it is located at the front of the lot of Francisco Geronimo, it is located more or less SE of CENPELCO post. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3210, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.79157698, '15° 47\' 29.677140\"', 120.33389760, '120° 20\' 2.031460\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.8890, 0.0000, '4', 11.4183, 214367.28090, 1747690.46700, '51', 15.79317266, '15° 47\' 35.421580\"', 120.33256540, '120° 19\' 57.235500\"', 16.4560, 1746675.48300, 428489.73800, '3', 214222.80600, 1747762.25200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9670, 'PNG-3211', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'CASILAGAN', 2008, 15.74301241, '15° 44\' 34.844676\"', 120.32786030, '120° 19\' 40.297080\"', 'From town proper travel 7 kms going to barangay Casilagan. The station is located near the signboard of angatarem District Hospital. It is about 4 m & 10 m NW of the signboard and waiting shed respectively. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3211, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.74301241, '15° 44\' 34.844690\"', 120.32786030, '120° 19\' 40.296950\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.3270, 0.0000, '4', 13.5162, 213651.87610, 1742321.83500, '51', 15.74460518, '15° 44\' 40.578650\"', 120.32652690, '120° 19\' 35.496860\"', 18.7630, 1741303.49300, 427825.56800, '3', 213507.23300, 1742393.59800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9671, 'PNG-3212', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'CAVIERNESAN', 2008, 15.76462261, '15° 45\' 52.641396\"', 120.28351910, '120° 17\' 0.668760\"', 'From municipal town hall of Mangatarem travel westward and turn left going to barangay Caviernesan, It is approximately 2.5 kms from town proper. The PRS points is located in front of the concrete fence of the barangay post of the main gate of barangay plaza and 3.21 m W of the concrete post of the barangay lot, and 12.5 m SE of the eastern edge of the bridge. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3212, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.76462261, '15° 45\' 52.641380\"', 120.28351910, '120° 17\' 0.668840\"', 0.0000, '0', 67.9830, 0.0000, '4', 24.0877, 208928.04300, 1744775.19600, '51', 15.76621770, '15° 45\' 58.383720\"', 120.28218620, '120° 16\' 55.870380\"', 29.5920, 1743710.61800, 423081.61500, '3', 208783.43600, 1744847.12200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9672, 'PNG-3213', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'CAVIERNESAN', 2008, 15.73313313, '15° 43\' 59.279268\"', 120.28387220, '120° 17\' 1.939920\"', 'At the town plaza travel approximately 6 kms SE of any vehicle going to barangay Bogtong Bolo. Turn right going to Calomboyan Sur and travel again 2-3 kms. The mark is located at the basketball court. It is about 4 m S of the southern edge of the stage. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m cement putty with inscription “PNG-3213, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.73313313, '15° 43\' 59.279260\"', 120.28387220, '120° 17\' 1.939810\"', 0.0000, '0', 119.1490, 0.0000, '4', 75.0108, 208921.00240, 1741288.23700, '51', 15.73472623, '15° 44\' 5.014420\"', 120.28253850, '120° 16\' 57.138730\"', 80.6630, 1740225.89800, 423107.52500, '3', 208776.29000, 1741360.13300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9673, 'PNG-3215', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'CABALUYAN 2ND', 2008, 15.69370268, '15° 41\' 37.329648\"', 120.33914600, '120° 20\' 20.925600\"', 'From Mangatarem town proper travel approximately 10 kms going to barangay Macarang. Turn right going to Cabaluyan 2nd and travel about 4 kms again. It is located near the rice mill and transformer post. It is about 40 m SW and 23 m NE of the electric post. It is also 30 m SE of the riverbank. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3215, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.69370268, '15° 41\' 37.329630\"', 120.33914600, '120° 20\' 20.925730\"', 0.0000, '0', 76.2030, 0.0000, '4', 32.1286, 214793.28000, 1736847.26100, '51', 15.69529209, '15° 41\' 43.051540\"', 120.33781150, '120° 20\' 16.121540\"', 37.4650, 1735843.15100, 429017.87300, '3', 214648.48000, 1736918.94300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9674, 'PNG-3216', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'PEANIA PEDANIA', 2008, 15.76295204, '15° 45\' 46.627344\"', 120.37145910, '120° 22\' 17.252760\"', 'Travel approximately 4 kms of any kind of vehicle beginning at town hall of Mangatarem. After reaching the intersection turn left and travel again 4 kms going to barangay Bedania. The station is located at Bedani Elem. School. It can be found beside the center of the plant box of the said school. It is about 70 cm W of the plant box. Station is mark by the head of 4” copper nail on 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription “PNG-3216, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.76295204, '15° 45\' 46.627360\"', 120.37145910, '120° 22\' 17.252930\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.9320, 0.0000, '4', 12.5388, 218354.31170, 1744470.67300, '51', 15.76454510, '15° 45\' 52.362370\"', 120.37012630, '120° 22\' 12.454720\"', 17.3230, 1743495.42900, 432504.76000, '3', 218209.77200, 1744542.31100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
