(9696, 'PNG-3244', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BASISTA', 'PATACBO', 2008, 15.84785382, '15° 50\' 52.273752\"', 120.42583490, '120° 25\' 33.005640\"', 'PNG-3244 At Basista Public Market travel eastward going to Brgy. Patacbo taking Basista-Malasiqui road about 10-20 minutes. The station is located at the concrete pavement area near Patacbo Barangay Hall. It is about 4 m NE of the NE edge of the said pavement and 15 m E of the barangay Hall. It is also about 5 m S from the centerline of the barangay road. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3244, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.84785382, '15° 50\' 52.273740\"', 120.42583490, '120° 25\' 33.005590\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.2110, 0.0000, '4', 12.6709, 224299.11940, 1753798.04300, '51', 15.84945099, '15° 50\' 58.023580\"', 120.42450410, '120° 25\' 28.214810\"', 16.7230, 1752873.59600, 438357.59300, '3', 224154.91000, 1753869.57700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9697, 'PNG-3245', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BASISTA', 'OSMENA SR.', 2008, 15.84540835, '15° 50\' 43.470060\"', 120.40163770, '120° 24\' 5.895720\"', 'PNG-3245 From Basista Municipal Hall travel 5-10 minutes going to Bayambang. Turn right after reaching welcome arch ( Bryg. Malimpec) straight ahead turn right reaching the intersection. The station is located near Osmeña Barangay Hall. It is about 60 m SE of the said barangay hall and 5 m SE of the centerline of the provincial road. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3245, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.84540835, '15° 50\' 43.470070\"', 120.40163770, '120° 24\' 5.895710\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.3430, 0.0000, '4', 11.6073, 221702.65720, 1753559.29200, '51', 15.84700591, '15° 50\' 49.221270\"', 120.40030680, '120° 24\' 1.104610\"', 15.9070, 1752610.30600, 435764.92500, '3', 221558.42000, 1753630.90200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
