(9707, 'PNG-3257', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'CAWAYAN BOGTONG', 2008, 15.93707428, '15° 56\' 13.467408\"', 120.40576710, '120° 24\' 20.761560\"', 'PNG-3257 At Malasiqui town proper travel NE aroung 1-2 km going to Brgy. Bogtong on any kind of vehicle (the route going to Calasiao). The station is located within the box culvert along the national road going to Calasiao. It is set about 4 m and 10 m SW of the said culvert CHB fence and welcome signboard of Tambac respectively. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3257, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.93707428, '15° 56\' 13.467390\"', 120.40576710, '120° 24\' 20.761670\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.1710, 0.0000, '4', 10.8800, 222271.10220, 1763702.18400, '51', 15.93867747, '15° 56\' 19.238890\"', 120.40443840, '120° 24\' 15.978330\"', 15.0000, 1762752.59800, 436236.36100, '3', 222127.17600, 1763773.86000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9708, 'PNG-3258', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'LOQUEB NORTE', 2008, 15.94258468, '15° 56\' 33.304848\"', 120.43205130, '120° 25\' 55.384680\"', 'PNG-3258 From Malasiqui town plaza travel NE around 15-30 minutes (route going to Urdaneta city about 6-8 km on any kind of vehicle. Turn left going to Brgy. Loqueb Norte 3-4 km straight ahead. The station is located within the right shoulder of the bridge and set on the upper NW side. It is about 100 m W of Loqueb Norte Brgy. Plaza.Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3258, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.94258468, '15° 56\' 33.304850\"', 120.43205130, '120° 25\' 55.384520\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.6770, 0.0000, '4', 13.5771, 225094.11590, 1764277.38400, '51', 15.94418764, '15° 56\' 39.075510\"', 120.43072270, '120° 25\' 50.601770\"', 17.4590, 1763354.44800, 439052.22600, '3', 224950.23000, 1764348.98000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9709, 'PNG-3259', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'CALBUEG', 2008, 15.94767757, '15° 56\' 51.639252\"', 120.45485950, '120° 27\' 17.494200\"', 'PNG-3259 Starting at Malasiqui Municipal Hall travel NE (route going to Urdaneta City) around 10-12 km on any kind of vehicle at about 20-30 minutes to reach Brgy. Calbeg. The station is located at junction (the road going to Brgy. Asin West) near waiting shed. It is about 5 m NE of the said shed. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3259, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.94767757, '15° 56\' 51.639260\"', 120.45485950, '120° 27\' 17.494320\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.1010, 0.0000, '4', 12.1608, 227544.06830, 1764811.24200, '51', 15.94928035, '15° 56\' 57.409260\"', 120.45353110, '120° 27\' 12.712110\"', 15.8430, 1763911.42900, 441495.67600, '3', 227400.21800, 1764882.76700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9710, 'PNG-3260', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'NANSANGAAN', 2008, 15.91428652, '15° 54\' 51.431472\"', 120.46261470, '120° 27\' 45.412920\"', 'PNG-3260 Travel SE aroung 8-10 km at about 15-25 minutes at any kind of vehicle (route going to Villasis) from Malaisiqui town proper to reach Brgy. Nansangaan. The station is located near Barangobong bridge. It is set about 3 m SE of the SE side of the said bridge and also 10 m SE of the signboard of the bridge. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3260, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.91428652, '15° 54\' 51.431470\"', 120.46261470, '120° 27\' 45.412930\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.1180, 0.0000, '4', 15.1082, 228329.75570, 1761104.50500, '51', 15.91588704, '15° 54\' 57.193350\"', 120.46128550, '120° 27\' 40.627930\"', 18.7400, 1760214.28200, 442316.33600, '3', 228185.80000, 1761175.97600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9711, 'PNG-3261', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'LAREG-LAREG', 2008, 15.91569025, '15° 54\' 56.484900\"', 120.50184570, '120° 30\' 6.644520\"', 'PNG-3261 Starting from Malasiqui municipal hall travel SW around 12-15 km (route going to Villasis) at about 20-35 minutes on any kind of vehicle to reach Brgy. Lareg-Lareg. The station is located along the national road and within the area of Mendoza Memorial School. It is set about 30 m W of the entrance gate of the said school and 8 m NE of the electric post. It is also 2.5 m N of the concrete fence. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3261, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.91569025, '15° 54\' 56.484900\"', 120.50184570, '120° 30\' 6.644460\"', 0.0000, '0', 114.9980, 0.0000, '4', 73.2142, 232534.25340, 1761209.23100, '51', 15.91728998, '15° 55\' 2.243940\"', 120.50051660, '120° 30\' 1.859820\"', 76.5300, 1760359.08000, 446517.52900, '3', 232390.33600, 1761280.57500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9712, 'PNG-3262', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'POLONG NORTE', 2008, 15.90623061, '15° 54\' 22.430196\"', 120.41874160, '120° 25\' 7.469760\"', 'PNG-3262 A 5-10 minutes travel SE (route going to Bayambang) on any kind of vehicle about 2-3 km in order to reach Brgy. Polong Norte. The station is located near Gomez bridge. It is about 22 m SE of welcome arch (Polong Norte) and 19 m NW of the upper NW side of the said bridge. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3262, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.90623061, '15° 54\' 22.430180\"', 120.41874160, '120° 25\' 7.469790\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.7760, 0.0000, '4', 11.4385, 223618.67700, 1760270.24400, '51', 15.90783159, '15° 54\' 28.193720\"', 120.41741220, '120° 25\' 2.683910\"', 15.4800, 1759335.54500, 437615.91400, '3', 223474.65800, 1760341.85100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9713, 'PNG-3263', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'SAN JULIAN', 2008, 15.87765357, '15° 52\' 39.552852\"', 120.43453520, '120° 26\' 4.326720\"', 'PNG-3263 Travel 6-8 km from Malasiqui town proper (route going to Bayambang) at about 10-20 minutes on any kind of vehicle going to Brgy. San Julian. The station is located beside irrigation canal along the national road and near welcome arch of San Julian. It is set about 10 m SE of the said welcome arch. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3263, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.87765357, '15° 52\' 39.552850\"', 120.43453520, '120° 26\' 4.326610\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.7000, 0.0000, '4', 13.3543, 225271.88450, 1757085.68800, '51', 15.87925242, '15° 52\' 45.308710\"', 120.43320510, '120° 25\' 59.538390\"', 17.2800, 1756168.59400, 439298.51600, '3', 225127.78300, 1757157.21900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9714, 'PNG-3264', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'AMACALAN', 2008, 15.88684992, '15° 53\' 12.659712\"', 120.43975020, '120° 26\' 23.100720\"', 'PNG-3264 From Malasiqui town proper it take 10-15 minutes to travel 4-6 km Se on any kind of vehicle, turn right going to Brgy. Amacalan. The station is located at the concrete pavement area near Brgy. Hall. It is about 3 m SE of the stepping line of the Brgy. Hall and 15 m SE of the barangay Hall. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3264, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.88684992, '15° 53\' 12.659710\"', 120.43975020, '120° 26\' 23.100720\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.3700, 0.0000, '4', 13.0998, 225843.12380, 1758096.95300, '51', 15.88844923, '15° 53\' 18.417230\"', 120.43842040, '120° 26\' 18.313300\"', 16.9650, 1757184.72000, 439859.79400, '3', 225699.05700, 1758168.47500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9715, 'PNG-3265', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'PAMARANUM', 2008, 15.89288458, '15° 53\' 34.384488\"', 120.48289770, '120° 28\' 58.431720\"', 'PNG-3265 From the municipal town plaza travel SE around 5-6 km to reach Bryg. Pamoranum. The station is located within the area of Pamonarum Elementary School and near Pamonarum Brgy. hall. It is about 30 m S of the concrete fence and 15 m NW of the said barangay hall. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3265, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89288458, '15° 53\' 34.384480\"', 120.48289770, '120° 28\' 58.431710\"', 0.0000, '0', 77.0670, 0.0000, '4', 35.1052, 230474.05460, 1758708.91000, '51', 15.89448331, '15° 53\' 40.139920\"', 120.48156810, '120° 28\' 53.645020\"', 38.5760, 1757840.46600, 444482.29700, '3', 230330.04400, 1758780.29700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9716, 'PNG-3266', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'UMANDO', 2008, 15.86757559, '15° 52\' 3.272124\"', 120.46085860, '120° 27\' 39.090960\"', 'PNG-3266 A 23-35 minutes of travel SE starting from Malasiqui Municipal Hall 12-15 km, turn left at the intersection going to Brgy. Umando. The station is located near Umando Brgy. hall, it is about 1 m S of the electric post and 2.5 m N of the centerline of the brgy. road. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3266, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.86757559, '15° 52\' 3.272120\"', 120.46085860, '120° 27\' 39.090860\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.8730, 0.0000, '4', 16.6816, 228078.83700, 1755935.59600, '51', 15.86917323, '15° 52\' 9.023630\"', 120.45952830, '120° 27\' 34.301920\"', 20.3590, 1755045.87900, 442114.82200, '3', 227934.72300, 1756007.03400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9717, 'PNG-3267', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINMALEY', 'PARAYAO', 2008, 15.97878900, '15° 58\' 43.640400\"', 120.31359610, '120° 18\' 48.945960\"', 'PNG-3267 At Binmaley town proper travel SE around 6-8 km about 15-25 minutes on any kind of vehicle (the route going to San Carlos), turn left going to Pallas. The station can be found near Pallas-Papagueyan Elementary School. It is set about 1 m N of the said flagpole. Station is mark by head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3267, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.97878900, '15° 58\' 43.640410\"', 120.31359610, '120° 18\' 48.945960\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.4400, 0.0000, '4', 3.8062, 212457.11900, 1768445.77700, '51', 15.98039682, '15° 58\' 49.428560\"', 120.31226830, '120° 18\' 44.165710\"', 8.6180, 1767399.33700, 426383.04500, '3', 212313.25800, 1768517.78900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9718, 'PNG-3268', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINMALEY', 'BASING', 2008, 16.05735209, '16° 3\' 26.467524\"', 120.30401600, '120° 18\' 14.457600\"', 'PNG-3268 From Binmaley town plaza drive SE approximately 4-6 km around 10-15 minutes (road going to San Carlos), turn right at the intersection to reach barangay Basing. The station is located inside the concrete fence where the waiting shed was built. It is 7 m NE of the deep well and 7 m S facing the waiting shed. It is also 25 cm W of the said fence. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3268, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.05735209, '16° 3\' 26.467530\"', 120.30401600, '120° 18\' 14.457650\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.9200, 0.0000, '4', 3.6370, 211544.08180, 1777157.49600, '51', 16.05896501, '16° 3\' 32.274050\"', 120.30269000, '120° 18\' 9.683980\"', 8.3580, 1776096.65100, 425386.91600, '3', 211400.47800, 1777229.60600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9719, 'PNG-3269', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINMALEY', 'BALOGO', 2008, 15.99120985, '15° 59\' 28.355460\"', 120.28660820, '120° 17\' 11.789520\"', 'PNG-3269 Starting at Binmaley Municipal Hall travel SE (route going to San Carlos City) around 4-6 km on any kind of vehicle at about 10-15 minutes, turn right going to Barangay Balogo. The station can be located along the barangay road. It is 15 m NE of the electric post and 7 m SE of Cruz-Fernandez entrance gate. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3269, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99120985, '15° 59\' 28.355460\"', 120.28660820, '120° 17\' 11.789390\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.4940, 0.0000, '4', 3.8032, 209584.54190, 1769858.54000, '51', 15.99281904, '15° 59\' 34.148530\"', 120.28528060, '120° 17\' 7.010060\"', 8.7750, 1768783.64200, 423498.79600, '3', 209440.70100, 1769930.65100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9720, 'PNG-3271', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINMALEY', 'LINOC', 2008, 16.02450832, '16° 1\' 28.229952\"', 120.30224100, '120° 18\' 8.067600\"', 'PNG-3271 From Binmaley Municipal Hall travel SE around 4-6 km S of any vehicle going to Barangay Manat, turn left to reach Barangay Linoc and it takes 10 m to travel from the provincial road. The station is located at W shoulder of the bridge and it is 6 m E of the welcome arch. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3271 2008 DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.02450832, '16° 1\' 28.229960\"', 120.30224100, '120° 18\' 8.067670\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.1670, 0.0000, '4', 5.7075, 211306.69910, 1773523.52600, '51', 16.02611924, '16° 1\' 34.029270\"', 120.30091420, '120° 18\' 3.291220\"', 10.5100, 1772462.75900, 425184.64300, '3', 211162.98300, 1773595.61400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9721, 'PNG-3272', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINMALEY', 'NAGPALANGAN', 2008, 16.02955411, '16° 1\' 46.394796\"', 120.26926670, '120° 16\' 9.360120\"', 'PNG-3272 At Binmaley Municipal Plaza drive 2-4 km about 10-15 minutes (route going to San Carlos City), turn right straight ahead around 1-2 km to reach Nagpalangan. The station is located at E shoulder of the bridge beside the barangay road. It is also about 10 m E from the eastern edge of the bridge, and 7 m S of the concrete fence. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3272, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.02955411, '16° 1\' 46.394800\"', 120.26926670, '120° 16\' 9.359960\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.8870, 0.0000, '4', 4.3343, 207783.12840, 1774128.41500, '51', 16.03116607, '16° 1\' 52.197840\"', 120.26793990, '120° 16\' 4.583790\"', 9.3250, 1773033.38400, 421657.58300, '3', 207639.40200, 1774200.61500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9722, 'PNG-3273', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINMALEY', 'SAN ISIDRO SUR', 2008, 16.00770598, '16° 0\' 27.741528\"', 120.26743390, '120° 16\' 2.762040\"', 'PNG-3273 The station can be found near the premises of Binmaley town proper. It can be found in front of Our Lady of Purification Doctor\'s Hospital. It is set about 20 m S from the entrance of the said hospital and 4 m S of the water fountain. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3273, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.00770598, '16° 0\' 27.741520\"', 120.26743390, '120° 16\' 2.761970\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.6020, 0.0000, '4', 3.9321, 207555.01440, 1771711.93000, '51', 16.00931661, '16° 0\' 33.539800\"', 120.26610670, '120° 15\' 57.983940\"', 8.9790, 1770616.32600, 421452.83400, '3', 207411.21300, 1771784.11700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9723, 'PNG-3274', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINMALEY', 'CALOOCAN DUPO', 2008, 16.04286910, '16° 2\' 34.328760\"', 120.30098990, '120° 18\' 3.563640\"', 'PNG-3274 At Binmaley Municipal Hall turn right and travel 20-30 minutes eastward around 3 km going to Barangay Dupo on any kind of vehicle. The station is located near the entrance gate of the basketball court facing the basketball court facing the barangay hall. It is 30 cm S of the concrete fence and approximately 8 m N from the entrance gate of the barangay hall. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3274, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.04286910, '16° 2\' 34.328770\"', 120.30098990, '120° 18\' 3.563690\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.9860, 0.0000, '4', 3.6133, 211199.20080, 1775558.16600, '51', 16.04448119, '16° 2\' 40.132290\"', 120.29966360, '120° 17\' 58.788780\"', 8.3880, 1774495.04200, 425057.65200, '3', 211055.54500, 1775630.27400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9724, 'PNG-3275', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINMALEY', 'SABANGAN', 2008, 15.98571523, '15° 59\' 8.574828\"', 120.26867990, '120° 16\' 7.247640\"', 'PNG-3275 From the municipal town plaza travel NW around 4-6 km about 150 minutes on any kind of vehicle, turn right at the intersection to reach the barangay Buenlag and then turn left to reach Sabangan Elementary School. The station is located in front of the concrete fence and 12 m SE of the electric post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3275, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.98571523, '15° 59\' 8.574810\"', 120.26867990, '120° 16\' 7.247600\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.0080, 0.0000, '4', 4.2312, 207656.43940, 1769275.31900, '51', 15.98732446, '15° 59\' 14.368060\"', 120.26735210, '120° 16\' 2.467720\"', 9.3160, 1768182.32000, 421577.56700, '3', 207512.56500, 1769347.48300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9725, 'PNG-3279', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'WAWA', 2008, 15.95906893, '15° 57\' 32.648148\"', 120.26384450, '120° 15\' 49.840200\"', 'PNG-3279 Drive SW beginning at Lingayen Town Hall (Lingayen-Bugallon road), upon reaching the bridge turn right from the dike road then drive again to reach Barangay Wawa. The station is located 5 m E of the waiting shed. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3279, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.95906893, '15° 57\' 32.648130\"', 120.26384450, '120° 15\' 49.840290\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.6640, 0.0000, '4', 8.7373, 207099.75630, 1766331.79800, '51', 15.96067661, '15° 57\' 38.435780\"', 120.26251620, '120° 15\' 45.058150\"', 13.9030, 1765235.44200, 421049.45300, '3', 206955.78800, 1766403.95600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9726, 'PNG-3280', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'BALOCOC', 2008, 15.99712991, '15° 59\' 49.667676\"', 120.22426260, '120° 13\' 27.345360\"', 'PNG-3280 Travel SE around 6-8 km at about 15-20 minutes any kind of vehicle (route going to Bugallon) from Lingayen town proper to reach Barangay Balococ. The station is located along the national road and near a church. It is about 15 m W of the church and 8 m E of the centerline of the road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3280, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99712991, '15° 59\' 49.667670\"', 120.22426260, '120° 13\' 27.345370\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.1100, 0.0000, '4', 6.2718, 202916.01910, 1770602.22500, '51', 15.99874083, '15° 59\' 55.466990\"', 120.22293510, '120° 13\' 22.566260\"', 11.5600, 1769462.86000, 416827.65400, '3', 202772.14700, 1770674.54400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9727, 'PNG-3282', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'CAPANDANAN', 2008, 16.02395095, '16° 1\' 26.223420\"', 120.19983760, '120° 11\' 59.415360\"', 'PNG-3282 From the municipal town plaza travel westward on the route going to Alaminos City, just after the Domalandan bridge, turn right going to Barangay Balangobong, just go ahead and turn right to reach the barangay hall, straight ahead and turn left until reaching the intersection wherein a tricycle waiting area will be reach, turn left for a 100 m from the intersection and reach the Capandanan Barangay Auditorium, it is located on the left side of the corner of the CHB fence of barangay lot and exactly 2 m SW of a concrete post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3282, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.02395095, '16° 1\' 26.223430\"', 120.19983760, '120° 11\' 59.415430\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.8500, 0.0000, '4', 4.1036, 200340.13620, 1773607.15700, '51', 16.02556408, '16° 1\' 32.030690\"', 120.19851070, '120° 11\' 54.638470\"', 9.4400, 1772440.95100, 414224.72500, '3', 200196.33500, 1773679.57900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9728, 'PNG-3283', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'BALANGOBONG', 2008, 16.01769267, '16° 1\' 3.693612\"', 120.20108580, '120° 12\' 3.908880\"', 'PNG-3283 From the municipal hall of Lingayen travel westward on the way to Alaminos, just after Domalandan bridge, there is a road on the left going to Barangay Balangobong, Lingayen, upon reaching the intersection of the barangay road, turn right to reach the barangay hall of Balangobong, the GPS point is located west of the barangay hall just beside the box culvert 3 m wide and exactly 10.60 m W of the CENPELCO electric post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3283, PRS-92, 2008 DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.01769267, '16° 1\' 3.693620\"', 120.20108580, '120° 12\' 3.908730\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.0130, 0.0000, '4', 4.2355, 200464.44660, 1772912.39000, '51', 16.01930538, '16° 1\' 9.499380\"', 120.19975870, '120° 11\' 59.131250\"', 9.5810, 1771747.87000, 414355.62300, '3', 200320.62500, 1772984.80200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9729, 'PNG-3285', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'DOMALANDAN WEST', 2008, 16.00533935, '16° 0\' 19.221660\"', 120.18261340, '120° 10\' 57.408240\"', 'PNG-3285 From Lingayen Municipal town hall travel westward on the national highway, reach first the Domalandan bridge and Domalandan East Elementary School. Go ahead and stop on the intersection on the right going to Barangay Estanza, the GPS point is located just before the bridge going to Alaminos and exactly 3.80 m E of CENPELCO electric post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3285, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.00533935, '16° 0\' 19.221660\"', 120.18261340, '120° 10\' 57.408410\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.8520, 0.0000, '4', 5.9822, 198467.64430, 1771571.29700, '51', 16.00695170, '16° 0\' 25.026110\"', 120.18128610, '120° 10\' 52.629810\"', 11.4270, 1770388.56000, 412373.12000, '3', 198323.76600, 1771643.75900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9730, 'PNG-3287', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'PUGARO SUIT', 2008, 16.06444386, '16° 3\' 51.997896\"', 120.31957680, '120° 19\' 10.476480\"', 'PNG-3287 Beginning at Dagupan City town proper travel NE throught Dagupan City-Lingayen road on any kind of vehicle, turn left at the intersection going to Lingayen gulf, then turn right passing Sabangan bridge. The station is located near the public toilet and set about 15 m SW from the said toilet.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.06444386, '16° 3\' 51.997880\"', 120.31957680, '120° 19\' 10.476350\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.0210, 0.0000, '4', 5.8410, 213220.20800, 1777921.04800, '51', 16.06605688, '16° 3\' 57.804760\"', 120.31825090, '120° 19\' 5.703350\"', 10.4430, 1776875.85300, 427054.60800, '3', 213076.64000, 1777993.11300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9731, 'PNG-3288', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'CARAEL', 2008, 16.03455925, '16° 2\' 4.413300\"', 120.30863050, '120° 18\' 31.069800\"', 'PNG-3288 From Dagupan City town proper follow the route going to Binmaley to reach the intersection going to Barangay Carael. The left side is the route going to Bugallon, take the right side to reach the station. The station is located at Lourdes Church basketball court 10 m from the centerline of the road and located at the SE edge of the concrete fence of the said court about 1.5 m W of the edge. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3288, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.03455925, '16° 2\' 4.413300\"', 120.30863050, '120° 18\' 31.069700\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.7400, 0.0000, '4', 3.3591, 212005.32380, 1774627.46500, '51', 16.03617065, '16° 2\' 10.214350\"', 120.30730390, '120° 18\' 26.294130\"', 8.0980, 1773572.69700, 425872.20300, '3', 211861.64700, 1774699.54000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9732, 'PNG-3290', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'CARANGLAAN', 2008, 16.03041147, '16° 1\' 49.481292\"', 120.35542040, '120° 21\' 19.513440\"', 'PNG-3290 Travel SE going to Calasiao from Dagupan City town hall about 15-25 minutes, turn left at the intersection to reach the Brgy. Caranglaan. The station is located near the box culvert and welcome arch of Tebeng. It is about 4 m S of the centerline of the road and 30 m W of the said welcome arch. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3290, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.03041147, '16° 1\' 49.481280\"', 120.35542040, '120° 21\' 19.513420\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.4090, 0.0000, '4', 4.2330, 217009.36320, 1774103.75600, '51', 16.03202159, '16° 1\' 55.277720\"', 120.35409380, '120° 21\' 14.737710\"', 8.6410, 1773097.43000, 430878.10800, '3', 216865.71000, 1774175.67600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mary', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9733, 'PNG-3291', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'PANTAL', 2008, 16.05736839, '16° 3\' 26.526204\"', 120.33987380, '120° 20\' 23.545680\"', 'PNG-3291 From Dagupan City town plaza travel NW going to Binmaley to reach barangay Pantal. The station is located within the center of elongated road island along the national road. It is about 3 m S of the said road and 1 m N of the signboard. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3921, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.05736839, '16° 3\' 26.526220\"', 120.33987380, '120° 20\' 23.545550\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.7000, 0.0000, '4', 4.5737, 215383.06000, 1777109.63200, '51', 16.05898053, '16° 3\' 32.329910\"', 120.33854780, '120° 20\' 18.772040\"', 9.0510, 1776085.78100, 429223.90200, '3', 215239.48500, 1777181.62500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9734, 'PNG-3292', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'BONUAN GUESET', 2008, 16.07172521, '16° 4\' 18.210756\"', 120.33678190, '120° 20\' 12.414840\"', 'PNG-3292 From the municipal hall of Dagupan drive NE on the route going to San Fabian to reach Brgy. Bonuan Gueset on any kind of vehicle. The station is located along the national road and near PCG Naval detachment. It is about 1 m W of the entrance gate of the said detachment and also near a waiting shed. It is at the NW of the entry access of the Caltex Gasoline Station. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3292, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07172521, '16° 4\' 18.210740\"', 120.33678190, '120° 20\' 12.414790\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.3630, 0.0000, '4', 4.2933, 215072.50570, 1778703.43200, '51', 16.07333830, '16° 4\' 24.017890\"', 120.33545620, '120° 20\' 7.642480\"', 8.7650, 1777675.58600, 428898.19100, '3', 214928.97700, 1778775.44700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9735, 'PNG-3293', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'SALISAY', 2008, 16.04507230, '16° 2\' 42.260280\"', 120.37513360, '120° 22\' 30.480960\"', 'PNG-3293 At Dagupan City proper travel SE just the road going to Mangaldan, turn right at the intersection going to Barangay Maguin, before reaching the bridge turn left to Barangay Salisay. The station is located in front of Salisay Water District and about 3 m SE of the Western fence of the said water district. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3293, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.04507230, '16° 2\' 42.260290\"', 120.37513360, '120° 22\' 30.481120\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.5500, 0.0000, '4', 4.5410, 219140.65710, 1775700.09200, '51', 16.04668291, '16° 2\' 48.058460\"', 120.37380740, '120° 22\' 25.706740\"', 8.7790, 1774713.28100, 432992.74000, '3', 218997.06900, 1775771.96100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9736, 'PNG-3297', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CALASIAO', 'NALSIAN', 2008, 16.02114534, '16° 1\' 16.123224\"', 120.34617920, '120° 20\' 46.245120\"', 'PNG-3297 FROM CALASIAO TOWN PROPER DRIVE NORTHWARD GOING TO DAGUPAN, AFTER REACHING THE JUNCTION TURN LEFT GOING TO DAGUPAN VIA BINMALEY, THE POINT IS LOCATED NEAR THE BRIDGE AND ON THE RIGHT SHOULDER OF THE BRIDGE. STATION IS MARK BY THE HEAD OF A 4\" COPPER NAIL ON A 0.40 M X 0.40 M CONCRETE MONUMENT WITH INSCRIPTION PNG-3297, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.02114534, '16° 1\' 16.123220\"', 120.34617920, '120° 20\' 46.245070\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.8130, 0.0000, '4', 6.5450, 216006.75160, 1773090.49100, '51', 16.02275508, '16° 1\' 21.918300\"', 120.34485240, '120° 20\' 41.468540\"', 11.0400, 1772075.16000, 429885.85900, '3', 215863.06000, 1773162.43300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9737, 'PNG-3299', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CALASIAO', 'AMBONAO', 2008, 16.03326246, '16° 1\' 59.744856\"', 120.37268490, '120° 22\' 21.665640\"', 'PNG-3299 From the municipal hall of Calasiao, Pangasinan travel NE to reach the intersection going to Santa Barbara, turn left going to Brgy. Ambonao, the point is located near Ambonao bridge. The station is about 15-20 m E of the said bridge. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3299, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.03326246, '16° 1\' 59.744870\"', 120.37268490, '120° 22\' 21.665670\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.3020, 0.0000, '4', 5.2291, 218861.90950, 1774395.90000, '51', 16.03487238, '16° 2\' 5.540580\"', 120.37135840, '120° 22\' 16.890290\"', 9.5010, 1773407.20300, 432726.70600, '3', 218718.28000, 1774467.76600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9738, 'PNG-33', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'POBLACION EAST', 1996, 16.11629647, '16° 6\' 58.667292\"', 119.79936940, '119° 47\' 57.729840\"', 'PNG-33 Is located within the Municipal Park just behind the municipal bldg. It is approx. 15 m. S of the Agno Church and 20 m. W of Manang Letty\'s Park. Station is on the SE corner of the platform of the stage. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on a cement putty with inscriptions \"PNG-33, 1996 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES : N 16 06 58.66729 E 119 47 57.72999 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 46.84162 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.11629647, '16° 6\' 58.667290\"', 119.79936940, '119° 47\' 57.729990\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.8416, 0.0000, '3', 7.2684, 799436.54580, 1783831.22500, '50', 16.11792410, '16° 7\' 4.526760\"', 119.79804420, '119° 47\' 52.959050\"', 10.6805, 1782869.19900, 371421.75400, '3', 799296.36500, 1783900.84300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1997-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9739, 'PNG-3300', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CALASIAO', 'GABON', 2008, 16.01619030, '16° 0\' 58.285080\"', 120.36819820, '120° 22\' 5.513520\"', 'PNG-3300 From Calasiano town proper drive NE approximately 1.5 km of the provincial road going to Barangay Gabon, the point is located on the right shoulder of Gabon bridge. It is set about 8 m NW of the said bridge and 6 m SW of the centerline of provincial road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3300, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.01619030, '16° 0\' 58.285080\"', 120.36819820, '120° 22\' 5.513520\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.7550, 0.0000, '4', 7.5828, 218357.53350, 1772511.86100, '51', 16.01779926, '16° 1\' 4.077320\"', 120.36687130, '120° 22\' 0.736680\"', 11.9130, 1771519.47000, 432240.74300, '3', 218213.84300, 1772583.72700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9740, 'PNG-3301', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CALASIAO', 'DINALAOAN', 2008, 15.99655065, '15° 59\' 47.582340\"', 120.34276930, '120° 20\' 33.969480\"', 'PNG-3301 From Calasiano town proper travel S going to Malasiqui, turn right at the intersection after the culvert just go ahead after reaching the another box culvert turn left just follow the road, the point is located at the box culvert near Dinalaoan Sentro Chapel. It is set on the SW side of the said culvert. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3301, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99655065, '15° 59\' 47.582330\"', 120.34276930, '120° 20\' 33.969400\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.0610, 0.0000, '4', 5.6578, 215606.77050, 1770372.13600, '51', 15.99815893, '15° 59\' 53.372160\"', 120.34144190, '120° 20\' 29.190780\"', 10.2210, 1769354.66900, 429512.22500, '3', 215462.99300, 1770444.06800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9741, 'PNG-3302', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CALASIAO', 'NAGSAING', 2008, 15.97614183, '15° 58\' 34.110588\"', 120.34084870, '120° 20\' 27.055320\"', 'PNG-3302 Starting at Calasiao town proper drive S going to San Carlos, turn right at the intersection just after the bridge, drive ahead to reach Brgy. Nagsaing. The station is located at Nagsaing Elementary School. It can be found 4 m E of the electric post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3302, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.97614183, '15° 58\' 34.110580\"', 120.34084870, '120° 20\' 27.055220\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.4870, 0.0000, '4', 6.9758, 215372.18640, 1768115.18300, '51', 15.97774889, '15° 58\' 39.895990\"', 120.33952080, '120° 20\' 22.274880\"', 11.5910, 1767096.88400, 429299.42500, '3', 215228.33900, 1768187.10400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9742, 'PNG-3303', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CALASIAO', 'MANCUP', 2008, 16.00214924, '16° 0\' 7.737264\"', 120.35955690, '120° 21\' 34.404840\"', 'PNG-3303 From Calasiao municipal hall drive eastward about 200 m going to Brgy. Mancup, the point is located near a welcome arc of Brgy. Mancup. The station is set 3 m E of the electric post and also approximately 20 m W of the said arc. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3303, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.00214924, '16° 0\' 7.737250\"', 120.35955690, '120° 21\' 34.404930\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.3230, 0.0000, '4', 6.0402, 217412.45680, 1770969.06100, '51', 16.00375751, '16° 0\' 13.527020\"', 120.35822970, '120° 21\' 29.626860\"', 10.4600, 1769968.54700, 431311.05900, '3', 217268.71200, 1771040.94400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9743, 'PNG-3304', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CALASIAO', 'TALIBAEW', 2008, 16.00537923, '16° 0\' 19.365228\"', 120.37304830, '120° 22\' 22.973880\"', 'PNG-3304 Travel eastward (road going to Malasiqui), turn left after reaching Maros bridge; follow the road going to Talibaew Elementary School. The station is located near the flagpole of the said school and set about 2.5 m S of the flagpole. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3304, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.00537923, '16° 0\' 19.365220\"', 120.37304830, '120° 22\' 22.973880\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.6410, 0.0000, '4', 5.4477, 218861.73080, 1771308.34500, '51', 16.00698740, '16° 0\' 25.154650\"', 120.37172120, '120° 22\' 18.196150\"', 9.7550, 1770321.53100, 432756.18700, '3', 218718.00800, 1771380.18600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9744, 'PNG-3305', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CALASIAO', 'DOYONG', 2008, 15.97083512, '15° 58\' 15.006432\"', 120.35346620, '120° 21\' 12.478320\"', 'PNG-3305 Travel SW around 10-15 minutes following the road going to San Carlos, until reaching Brgy. Doyong, the point is located near Alibaba Garden Inn and Sun ridge apartment. The station can be found upper right side of the box culvert facing north. It is set about 11 m SW of the electric post, 6 m NE from the street light and 2 m SW from the box culvert. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3305, PRS-92, 2008, R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.97083512, '15° 58\' 15.006440\"', 120.35346620, '120° 21\' 12.478290\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.0580, 0.0000, '4', 6.5950, 216716.07780, 1767510.41700, '51', 15.97244157, '15° 58\' 20.789660\"', 120.35213820, '120° 21\' 7.697550\"', 11.1150, 1766505.37000, 430648.27000, '3', 216572.22300, 1767582.29200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9745, 'PNG-3306', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CALASIAO', 'MACABITO', 2008, 15.96225210, '15° 57\' 44.107560\"', 120.38997260, '120° 23\' 23.901360\"', 'PNG-3306 From the municipal hall of Calasiao, travel southward following the road going to Malasiqui about 5-10 minutes to reach Barangay Macabito. The station can be found near Macabito Elementary School, San Roque Chapel and provincial road. It is set about 20 m SW from the fence of school and 10 m N from the waiting shed. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3306, PRS-92, 2008, MACABITO.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.96225210, '15° 57\' 44.107570\"', 120.38997260, '120° 23\' 23.901310\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.1960, 0.0000, '4', 8.9141, 220614.11780, 1766510.78700, '51', 15.96385722, '15° 57\' 49.885980\"', 120.38864450, '120° 23\' 19.120020\"', 13.1390, 1765543.67600, 434553.50000, '3', 220470.26400, 1766582.53600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9746, 'PNG-3307', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'PANGAPISAN', 2008, 16.21267667, '16° 12\' 45.636012\"', 119.95979820, '119° 57\' 35.273520\"', 'PNG-3307 From City hall, drive eastward on the way to 100 islands, turn left at the intersection at Brgy. Magsaysay, just go ahead until reaching the bridge (Fishport Area) of Brgy. Pangapisan, the point is located SE of Brgy. plaza on the right side of the road and corner of the fish port and brgy. road. The station is exactly 13.20 m W of the electric post approximately 150-170 m S of the barangay plaza. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3307, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.21267667, '16° 12\' 45.636020\"', 119.95979820, '119° 57\' 35.273360\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.4460, 0.0000, '4', 5.7176, 816455.92970, 1794744.32700, '50', 16.21430676, '16° 12\' 51.504320\"', 119.95847530, '119° 57\' 30.511250\"', 10.1880, 1793442.01900, 388639.47100, '3', 816316.14900, 1794813.53700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9747, 'PNG-3311', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'LUCAP', 2008, 16.19339814, '16° 11\' 36.233304\"', 120.00112960, '120° 0\' 4.066560\"', 'PNG-3311 From city hall of Alaminos City drive eastward on the way to 100 islands, it\'s just 3 minutes travel from the town proper, turn left on the intersection on the way to the fishport. It is located on the curve line of the road on the left side. The station is exactly 9.90 m N of the concrete lamp post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3311, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.19339814, '16° 11\' 36.233310\"', 120.00112960, '120° 0\' 4.066490\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.4300, 0.0000, '4', 5.3068, 179332.10710, 1792670.07200, '51', 16.19502613, '16° 11\' 42.094070\"', 119.99980640, '119° 59\' 59.302940\"', 10.0140, 1791286.36800, 393048.60600, '3', 820769.84000, 1792742.68000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9748, 'PNG-3312', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'SABANGAN', 2008, 16.16393647, '16° 9\' 50.171292\"', 120.00786240, '120° 0\' 28.304640\"', 'PNG-3312 Starting at City Hall of Alaminos travel westward until reaching Video City, turn left which is the road going to Victoria about 10-15 minutes, just drive ahead then turn left going to Iglesia ni Cristo. The station is located outside Linda Dela Cruz Property and near barangay road. It is about 30 cm NE of the NE edge of a concrete post, 60 m SE of the said church and 80 m SE of a waiting shed.Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3312, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.16393647, '16° 9\' 50.171300\"', 120.00786240, '120° 0\' 28.304570\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.1610, 0.0000, '4', 6.7779, 180005.07980, 1789396.83500, '51', 16.16556249, '16° 9\' 56.024970\"', 120.00653850, '120° 0\' 23.538570\"', 11.6390, 1788022.33800, 393752.78200, '3', 179861.59700, 1789470.00200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mary', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9749, 'PNG-3313', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'VICTORIA', 2008, 16.16672715, '16° 10\' 0.217740\"', 120.06585140, '120° 3\' 57.065040\"', 'PNG-3313 From Alaminos City Hall drive westward turn left until reaching video city, travel about 15-25 minutes going to Brgy. Victoria, the point is located on the right side of the Brgy. road. The station is located 20 m SW of the street light and 30 m NE of the waiting shed. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3313, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.16672715, '16° 10\' 0.217740\"', 120.06585140, '120° 3\' 57.065140\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.0700, 0.0000, '4', 11.4526, 186215.80120, 1789616.43900, '51', 16.16835207, '16° 10\' 6.067460\"', 120.06451930, '120° 3\' 52.269620\"', 16.4160, 1788301.97000, 399955.51700, '3', 186071.48200, 1789689.43100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9750, 'PNG-3314', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'TANAYTAY', 2008, 16.10877721, '16° 6\' 31.597956\"', 119.96664360, '119° 57\' 59.916960\"', 'PNG-3314 From Alaminos City Hall travel westward going to Brgy. Tanaytay, about 3-5 minutes, the point is located near WELCOME ARC of Alaminos. The station is about 500 m NW of the said welcome arc, 40 m NW of welcome sign of Cabatuan, 15 m SE and 40 cm NW of a plant boxes. The station is set between the two respectively. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3314, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.10877721, '16° 6\' 31.597960\"', 119.96664360, '119° 57\' 59.916800\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.4580, 0.0000, '4', 29.9883, 817354.35140, 1783248.84400, '50', 16.11040071, '16° 6\' 37.442540\"', 119.96531830, '119° 57\' 55.145990\"', 34.8690, 1781939.65100, 389313.38700, '3', 817214.25900, 1783317.96200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
