(9751, 'PNG-3315', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'ALOS', 2008, 16.12505672, '16° 7\' 30.204192\"', 120.00228010, '120° 0\' 8.208360\"', 'PNG-3315 From town proper travel S on the national road for almost 4 minutes, the point is located on the highway boundary of Brgy. Bolaney and it is located at the right side of the national road. The station is exactly 2.93 m S of a concrete welcome sign of Alos, 19.30 m N of electric post and 18.50 m W of BBM # 46. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3315, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.12505672, '16° 7\' 30.204190\"', 120.00228010, '120° 0\' 8.208440\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.0640, 0.0000, '4', 16.4378, 179344.92220, 1785099.80300, '51', 16.12668045, '16° 7\' 36.049610\"', 120.00095530, '120° 0\' 3.439140\"', 21.4380, 1783722.43000, 393134.76400, '3', 179201.30300, 1785172.95600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9752, 'PNG-3316', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'ALOS', 2008, 16.15244973, '16° 9\' 8.819028\"', 119.92412260, '119° 55\' 26.841360\"', 'PNG-3316 From Alaminos municipal hall travel northward until you reach intersection to Brgy. Landoc which is located left side of the road. Enter to that road which leads to Brgy. Sta. Maria. Around 25-30 minutes travel time. The mark is located at the Sta. Maria Brgy. Hall. Facing north, it is located near the south west edge of the basketball court near the concrete fence, 3 m left of the stage and 6 m right of the south east corner of the court. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3316, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.15244973, '16° 9\' 8.819020\"', 119.92412260, '119° 55\' 26.841270\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.5760, 0.0000, '4', 16.7140, 812733.68070, 1788020.08800, '50', 16.15407686, '16° 9\' 14.676710\"', 119.92279830, '119° 55\' 22.073950\"', 21.2220, 1786796.34200, 384789.55100, '3', 812593.69400, 1788089.36200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9753, 'PNG-3317', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MABINI', 'CABANAETAN', 2008, 16.12123823, '16° 7\' 16.457628\"', 119.89001640, '119° 53\' 24.059040\"', 'PNG-3317 From Mabini municipal hall travel SW until you reach the intersection on the Brgy. Carangalaan. Turn right and follow that road which is also the road to the municipality of Bani. Travel around 30 minutes until you reach Brgy. Cabanaetan. The mark is located inside Cabanaetan Elementary School beside the SW of the basketball court. Facing north, from that edge measure 6 m, facing south measure 2 m from the lamp post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3317, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.12123823, '16° 7\' 16.457610\"', 119.89001640, '119° 53\' 24.058960\"', 0.0000, '0', 93.2020, 0.0000, '4', 52.5056, 809131.88380, 1784512.29100, '50', 16.12286416, '16° 7\' 22.310980\"', 119.88869140, '119° 53\' 19.288890\"', 56.8360, 1783361.53900, 381122.68500, '3', 808991.78000, 1784581.64400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9754, 'PNG-3318', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MABINI', 'LUNA', 2008, 16.10730828, '16° 6\' 26.309808\"', 119.93468730, '119° 56\' 4.874280\"', 'PNG-3318 From Mabini municipal hall travel about 25 to 30 minutes until you reach Brgy. Luna. Just turn right to Brgy. Caabiangan. Follow that road which leads you to Brgy. Luna. The mark is located at Brgy. Luna Chapel ground. At the right side of the main gate measure 18 m from the right side of the entrance near at the concrete fence of the chapel, 0.50 m from the concrete fence of the chapel and located also at the SW and SE edge of the cemented ground of the chapel. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3318, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.10730828, '16° 6\' 26.309820\"', 119.93468730, '119° 56\' 4.874170\"', 0.0000, '0', 107.5420, 0.0000, '4', 66.3366, 813935.60630, 1783037.24900, '50', 16.10893238, '16° 6\' 32.156560\"', 119.93336200, '119° 56\' 0.103130\"', 71.0260, 1781794.55800, 385893.63800, '3', 813795.49000, 1783106.46000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9755, 'PNG-3319', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MABINI', 'CARANGLAAN', 2008, 16.08969550, '16° 5\' 22.903800\"', 119.90340930, '119° 54\' 12.273480\"', 'PNG-3319 From Mabini municipal hall travel west ward, just follow the national road. Also road to municipality of Burgos. It takes 20 minutes travel time. The mark is located at the right side of the provincial road. About 10 m from the centerline of the road and it is on the culvert. It is on the left side of the road entrance to the Caranglaan auditorium, around 6 m from the SW side of the road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3319, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.08969550, '16° 5\' 22.903810\"', 119.90340930, '119° 54\' 12.273450\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.1550, 0.0000, '4', 11.1721, 810614.64850, 1781039.50100, '50', 16.09131920, '16° 5\' 28.749130\"', 119.90208350, '119° 54\' 7.500740\"', 15.6610, 1779862.93000, 382536.84300, '3', 810474.45600, 1781108.79400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9756, 'PNG-3320', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MABINI', 'CAABIANGAAN', 2008, 16.09385951, '16° 5\' 37.894236\"', 119.92285490, '119° 55\' 22.277640\"', 'PNG-3320 From Mabini Municipal hall travel westward, follow the provincial road until you reach the Baracbac bridge which is in Brgy. Caabiangan around 15 minutes travel time to get you their. The mark is located at the left side of Baracbac bridge, at the southwest corner of the bridge measure 2 meters from that corner and 10 corners meters from the centerline of the road. Another 20 m from the signboard left of the bridge. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3320, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.09385951, '16° 5\' 37.894220\"', 119.92285490, '119° 55\' 22.277510\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.5190, 0.0000, '4', 13.3518, 812689.99590, 1781529.97600, '50', 16.09548304, '16° 5\' 43.738930\"', 119.92152920, '119° 55\' 17.505240\"', 17.9910, 1780312.76500, 384619.90200, '3', 812549.82900, 1781599.21400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9757, 'PNG-3321', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MABINI', 'MAGALONG', 2008, 16.09153709, '16° 5\' 29.533524\"', 119.91009160, '119° 54\' 36.329760\"', 'PNG-3321 From Mabini municipal hall travel westward, just follow the provincial road around 20 minutes travel time to Brgy. Magalong. The mark is located near Don Guillermo Orbos Sport Center, it is located left of the road, 10 m NW side and 4 m west of the signboard. It is located also near at the foundation of the railings. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3321, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.09153709, '16° 5\' 29.533510\"', 119.91009160, '119° 54\' 36.329860\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.8910, 0.0000, '4', 11.8423, 811327.19310, 1781253.50000, '50', 16.09316076, '16° 5\' 35.378720\"', 119.90876590, '119° 54\' 31.557350\"', 16.3870, 1780062.93900, 383252.92400, '3', 811187.01100, 1781322.77400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9758, 'PNG-3322', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MABINI', 'TAGUDIN', 2008, 16.08624360, '16° 5\' 10.476960\"', 119.95709240, '119° 57\' 25.532640\"', 'PNG-3322 From Mabini Welcome Arc travel westward, just follow the provincial road about 5 minutes travel time. The mark is located at Brgy. Tagudin near at the road entrance to Brgy. Villa Cuarta at the right side of the road center 20 m west of the waiting shed. Another is at the shoulder of provincial road 10 m from the centerline of the road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3322, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.08624360, '16° 5\' 10.476970\"', 119.95709240, '119° 57\' 25.532780\"', 0.0000, '0', 89.2020, 0.0000, '4', 47.6783, 816367.59640, 1780738.77000, '50', 16.08786591, '16° 5\' 16.317260\"', 119.95576670, '119° 57\' 20.760050\"', 52.5680, 1779451.01100, 388278.88500, '3', 816227.43000, 1780807.90000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9759, 'PNG-3323', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MABINI', 'SAN PEDRO', 2008, 16.01757341, '16° 1\' 3.264276\"', 119.92357190, '119° 55\' 24.858840\"', 'PNG-3323 From Burgos Public Market travel northward going to Mabini, turn right at the intersection going to San Pascual, Burgos, turn left at the next intersection road going to Barlo, Mabini. To reach Brgy. San Pedro, the point is located inside Plaza Primitivo D. Cudal near basketball court. The station is set about 10 m SW of the entrance gate of the said plaza and 20 m W of San Pedro Brgy. hall. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3323, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.01757341, '16° 1\' 3.264290\"', 119.92357190, '119° 55\' 24.858760\"', 0.0000, '0', 86.8580, 0.0000, '4', 45.3989, 812886.08240, 1773083.30200, '50', 16.01919169, '16° 1\' 9.090080\"', 119.92224450, '119° 55\' 20.080090\"', 50.0980, 1771869.63600, 384652.49700, '3', 812745.68400, 1773152.42900, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9760, 'PNG-3324', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MABINI', 'VILLACORTA', 2008, 16.04792958, '16° 2\' 52.546488\"', 119.97857930, '119° 58\' 42.885480\"', 'PNG-3324 At Mabini town proper travel N going to Alaminos, turn right at the intersection after passing Iglesia ni Cristo, follow the road to reach Brgy. Villacorta (30-40 minutes travel and accessible only of light vehicles). The station is located near Villacorta SK Basketball court, it is about 10 m SE of the basketball fieldgoal, 30 cm SE from the centerline of the said court and 20 m SW from the SK Brgy. hall. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3324, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.04792958, '16° 2\' 52.546480\"', 119.97857930, '119° 58\' 42.885530\"', 0.0000, '0', 130.3730, 0.0000, '4', 88.4805, 818729.25370, 1776528.82200, '50', 16.04954902, '16° 2\' 58.376480\"', 119.97725270, '119° 58\' 38.109690\"', 93.5710, 1775199.26600, 390556.90100, '3', 818588.98400, 1776597.86200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9761, 'PNG-3327', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'SAN VICENTE', 2008, 16.08041654, '16° 4\' 49.499544\"', 119.86190030, '119° 51\' 42.841080\"', 'PNG-3327 From Burgos town proper travel westward going to the municipal hall, turn right at the intersection going to Burgos National High School, turn left at the next intersection going to San Vicente about 6-10 km. The station is located outside the property of Feliciano Bruto and near the barangay road. It is about 6 m E of the entrance gate of the said property and 4 m S of the centerline of the barangay road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3327, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.08041654, '16° 4\' 49.499540\"', 119.86190030, '119° 51\' 42.840950\"', 0.0000, '0', 94.4190, 0.0000, '4', 53.8932, 806184.96100, 1779949.99700, '50', 16.08204056, '16° 4\' 55.346020\"', 119.86057430, '119° 51\' 38.067330\"', 57.9980, 1778860.13300, 378089.72700, '3', 806044.71400, 1780019.40400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9762, 'PNG-3328', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'CACAYASEN', 2008, 16.06130580, '16° 3\' 40.700880\"', 119.85339630, '119° 51\' 12.226680\"', 'PNG-3328 From the municipal hall of Burgos, Pangasinan drive westward going to Brgy. Cacayasen about 10-15 minutes to reach the station located near the bridge. It is set about 40 cm E of the upper right edge of the bridge and 500 m W of the said municipal hall. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3328,PRS-92, 2008,DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.06130580, '16° 3\' 40.700870\"', 119.85339630, '119° 51\' 12.226650\"', 0.0000, '0', 114.0770, 0.0000, '4', 73.6176, 805303.70660, 1777821.23400, '50', 16.06292882, '16° 3\' 46.543740\"', 119.85206980, '119° 51\' 7.451400\"', 77.6190, 1776750.13200, 377167.97800, '3', 805163.39600, 1777890.65400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9763, 'PNG-3329', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'TAMBACAN', 2008, 16.06720423, '16° 4\' 1.935228\"', 119.88644840, '119° 53\' 11.214240\"', 'PNG-3329 From Burgos town proper travel westward going to Mabini about 3-5 km to reach Tambacan, the point is located at 20 m Madori bridge. The station is located 20 m S of welcome sign of Tambacan and 30 m SE of the welcome sign of Don Matias. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3329, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.06720423, '16° 4\' 1.935230\"', 119.88644840, '119° 53\' 11.214160\"', 0.0000, '0', 78.6080, 0.0000, '4', 37.7371, 808833.59090, 1778523.48200, '50', 16.06882690, '16° 4\' 7.776840\"', 119.88512210, '119° 53\' 6.439510\"', 42.0870, 1777383.51800, 380708.57200, '3', 808693.31900, 1778592.80800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9764, 'PNG-3330', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'SAN PASCUAL', 2008, 16.04353212, '16° 2\' 36.715632\"', 119.87999040, '119° 52\' 47.965440\"', 'PNG-3330 From Burgos town proper drive northward going to Mabini about 500 m, turn right at the intersection going to San Pascual, follow the road going to Don Antonio Bonilla Memorial Elementary School about 2 km. The station is located inside the premises of the school, and set about 50 cm W of the barbed wire fence and also 60 m E of school\'s flagpole. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3330, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.04353212, '16° 2\' 36.715640\"', 119.87999040, '119° 52\' 47.965280\"', 0.0000, '0', 131.1580, 0.0000, '4', 90.2919, 808178.59430, 1775892.53000, '50', 16.04515345, '16° 2\' 42.552430\"', 119.87866350, '119° 52\' 43.188650\"', 94.5820, 1774767.41400, 380003.24800, '3', 808038.24700, 1775961.85800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9765, 'PNG-3331', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'PAPALLASEN', 2008, 16.03964447, '16° 2\' 22.720092\"', 119.86945180, '119° 52\' 10.026480\"', 'PNG-3331 From Burgos municipal hall travel southward around 10 minutes travel time. The mark is located at Brgy. Papalasengan in front of the house of Arnel de Guzman. 3 m from the SW edge fence of their house. 10 m from the centerline of the road. About 700 m north of Papalasengan Elementary School and it is along the provincial road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3331, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.03964447, '16° 2\' 22.720080\"', 119.86945180, '119° 52\' 10.026530\"', 0.0000, '0', 128.6920, 0.0000, '4', 87.9559, 807056.05550, 1775446.37600, '50', 16.04126579, '16° 2\' 28.556830\"', 119.86812490, '119° 52\' 5.249530\"', 92.1290, 1774343.31200, 378873.01100, '3', 806915.69000, 1775515.73200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9766, 'PNG-3332', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'PAPALLASEN', 2008, 16.01824762, '16° 1\' 5.691432\"', 119.87196830, '119° 52\' 19.085880\"', 'PNG-3332 Starting at Burgos Public Market drive S going to Dasol about 6-8 km, the point is located near the municipal boundary of Burgos and Dasol. The station is located 6 m N from the centerline of provincial road, 12 m E of waiting shed and 20 m E from the welcome sign of Burgos. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3332, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.01824762, '16° 1\' 5.691420\"', 119.87196830, '119° 52\' 19.085870\"', 0.0000, '0', 99.8430, 0.0000, '4', 59.0347, 807358.35470, 1773080.76400, '50', 16.01986756, '16° 1\' 11.523210\"', 119.87064080, '119° 52\' 14.307050\"', 63.2100, 1771973.79400, 379129.39500, '3', 807217.92400, 1773150.09900, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9767, 'PNG-3333', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'SAPA PEQUEÑA', 2008, 16.03098413, '16° 1\' 51.542868\"', 119.84584110, '119° 50\' 45.027960\"', 'PNG-3333 From Burgos municipal hall travel southward until you reach the poblacion Catholic cemetery. Just follow that barangay road until you reach Brgy. Sapa Pequeña, travel time is around 10 minutes. The mark is located at Sapa Pequeña sitio Patat marker. It is 3 m south of the new marker and 0.50 m from the base of the old marker. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3333, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.03098413, '16° 1\' 51.542860\"', 119.84584110, '119° 50\' 45.028040\"', 0.0000, '0', 128.8950, 0.0000, '4', 88.4797, 804540.89650, 1774452.53400, '50', 16.03260543, '16° 1\' 57.379540\"', 119.84451390, '119° 50\' 40.250200\"', 92.3640, 1773398.84000, 376340.67100, '3', 804400.48800, 1774521.95500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9768, 'PNG-3334', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'SAPA GRANDE', 2008, 15.99611723, '15° 59\' 46.022028\"', 119.84043910, '119° 50\' 25.580760\"', 'PNG-3334 From Burgos municipal hall travel southward until you reach the poblacion catholic cemetery. Just follow that barangay road until you reach Brgy. Sapa Grande, travel time is around 20 minutes. The mark is located at Sapa Grande Sitio Maligay Basketball court and near the sun drying area. Facing north it is located at the center of the basketball court and the sun drying area. About 10 m from the southwest edge of sun drying area. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3334, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99611723, '15° 59\' 46.022040\"', 119.84043910, '119° 50\' 25.580580\"', 0.0000, '0', 92.2640, 0.0000, '4', 51.8830, 804015.24690, 1770583.76600, '50', 15.99773649, '15° 59\' 51.851380\"', 119.83911100, '119° 50\' 20.799760\"', 55.6420, 1769543.24400, 375740.81600, '3', 803874.72800, 1770653.17900, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9769, 'PNG-3335', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'CONCORDIA', 2008, 15.97502859, '15° 58\' 30.102924\"', 119.80588210, '119° 48\' 21.175560\"', 'PNG-3335 From Burgos municipal hall travel southward until you reach the poblacion catholic cemetery. Just follow that barangay road until you reach Brgy. Concordia, travel time is around 30-40 minutes. You will pass by Brgy. Sapa Grande and Sapa Pequeña. The mark is located at Brgy. Concordia plaza. At the back of their barangay hall, also in front of the church. It is outside of the concrete fence of the church left of the main entrance of the church. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3335, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.97502859, '15° 58\' 30.102920\"', 119.80588210, '119° 48\' 21.175560\"', 0.0000, '0', 82.0800, 0.0000, '4', 42.2260, 800345.55700, 1768198.37200, '50', 15.97664730, '15° 58\' 35.930280\"', 119.80455360, '119° 48\' 16.392810\"', 45.4780, 1767230.32400, 372027.98700, '3', 800204.95100, 1768267.87300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9770, 'PNG-3337', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'MAGSAYSAY', 2008, 15.99696238, '15° 59\' 49.064568\"', 119.85751610, '119° 51\' 27.057960\"', 'PNG-3337 From Dasol Public Market travel northward going to Burgos about 2-3 km, turn left at the intersection going to Brgy. Magsaysay about 20-30 minutes. The station is located at the newly build bridge. It is about 60 cm NW of the strip of the bridge and 8 m SE of an Acacia tree. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3337, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99696238, '15° 59\' 49.064560\"', 119.85751610, '119° 51\' 27.057850\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.2180, 0.0000, '4', 17.5871, 805843.02150, 1770702.43400, '50', 15.99858133, '15° 59\' 54.892770\"', 119.85618810, '119° 51\' 22.277150\"', 21.5560, 1769626.60300, 377569.43200, '3', 805702.51600, 1770771.79800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9771, 'PNG-3338', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'MAGSAYSAY', 2008, 15.99319526, '15° 59\' 35.502936\"', 119.85338380, '119° 51\' 12.181680\"', 'PNG-3338 From Dasol Public Market travel northward going to Burgos about 2-3 km, turn left at the intersection going to barangay Magsaysay about 30-40 minutes. The station is located on top of the hill near property of Dumlao and barangay road. It is about 50 m W of a waiting shed and 3 m W from the centerline of the barangay road and 300-400 m from Smart Cell site. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3338, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99319526, '15° 59\' 35.502930\"', 119.85338380, '119° 51\' 12.181730\"', 0.0000, '0', 89.6430, 0.0000, '4', 49.0692, 805406.15850, 1770279.21100, '50', 15.99481406, '15° 59\' 41.330600\"', 119.85205580, '119° 51\' 7.400710\"', 52.9800, 1769212.13300, 377124.76400, '3', 805265.63900, 1770348.58400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9772, 'PNG-3339', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'AMALBALAN', 2008, 15.97509420, '15° 58\' 30.339120\"', 119.87272390, '119° 52\' 21.806040\"', 'PNG-3339 From Dasol public market travel southward. Just follow the provincial road until you reach barangay Amalbalan which is about 10 minutes of travel time. The mark is on the right side of the provincial road. Facing south, start from km post which has a description (KM 288-D2) measure 40 m south of that km post then face west perpendicular to the road measure 15 m. The station is located on the top culvert. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3339, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.97509420, '15° 58\' 30.339110\"', 119.87272390, '119° 52\' 21.806100\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.8640, 0.0000, '4', 6.9858, 807505.36110, 1768303.36800, '50', 15.97671146, '15° 58\' 36.161240\"', 119.87139540, '119° 52\' 17.023610\"', 11.0990, 1767197.47000, 379184.23400, '3', 807364.79800, 1768372.67300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9773, 'PNG-3340', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'SAN VICENTE', 2008, 15.97745479, '15° 58\' 38.837244\"', 119.89580980, '119° 53\' 44.915280\"', 'PNG-3340 From Dasol town proper drive westward going to San Vicente about 10-25 minutes, the point is located near Tomas Bonilla Elementary School. The station is set about 40 cm N of NE portion of the concrete post of the said school and 40 m E of the entrance gate. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3340, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.97745479, '15° 58\' 38.837250\"', 119.89580980, '119° 53\' 44.915240\"', 0.0000, '0', 63.2250, 0.0000, '4', 22.0366, 809974.69610, 1768599.06000, '50', 15.97907169, '15° 58\' 44.658070\"', 119.89448140, '119° 53\' 40.133050\"', 26.4120, 1767445.39900, 381657.21100, '3', 809834.15600, 1768668.29800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9774, 'PNG-3341', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'MALIMPIN', 2008, 15.99840006, '15° 59\' 54.240216\"', 119.90785350, '119° 54\' 28.272600\"', 'PNG-3341 From Dasol town proper travel westward going to Brgy. Malimpin about 5-8 km to reach Malimpin Brgy. Hall. The station is located inside the said brgy. hall and just near the basketball court. It is set about 40 cm N of the NE edge of the basketball court and 50 m NE of the main entrance gate. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3341, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99840006, '15° 59\' 54.240200\"', 119.90785350, '119° 54\' 28.272520\"', 0.0000, '0', 92.4550, 0.0000, '4', 51.1380, 811232.37570, 1770936.45700, '50', 16.00001798, '16° 0\' 0.064730\"', 119.90652560, '119° 54\' 23.492170\"', 55.6750, 1769756.58900, 382958.83200, '3', 811091.90800, 1771005.67300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9775, 'PNG-3342', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'SAN VICENTE', 2008, 15.98154039, '15° 58\' 53.545404\"', 119.89203170, '119° 53\' 31.314120\"', 'PNG-3342 From Dasol town proper drive westward going to San Vicente about 10-25 minutes, the point is located just before Tomas Bonilla Elementary School about 500 m. The station is located beside culvert and it is about 3 m from the SE strip of the concrete culvert and 7 m SE also Ipil-Ipil tree. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3342, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.98154039, '15° 58\' 53.545410\"', 119.89203170, '119° 53\' 31.314020\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.8220, 0.0000, '4', 11.6898, 809563.69150, 1769045.84600, '50', 15.98315763, '15° 58\' 59.367450\"', 119.89070340, '119° 53\' 26.532150\"', 16.0300, 1767899.71900, 381255.15000, '3', 809423.16100, 1769115.09800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9776, 'PNG-3343', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'VIGA', 2008, 15.91673061, '15° 55\' 0.230196\"', 119.92703840, '119° 55\' 37.338240\"', 'PNG-3343 From Dasol Public market travel southward. Just follow the provincial road until you reach the Magunao bridge which is located at the Brgy. Macalang. Before that bridge enter on the road which is located at the left side of the provincial road. Enter into that road which is the only way going to Brgy. Viga. It takes around 45 m to 1 hour trave time in going their. The mark is located at Brgy. Viga bridge on the south east edge of the bridge. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3343, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.91673061, '15° 55\' 0.230190\"', 119.92703840, '119° 55\' 37.338250\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.4580, 0.0000, '4', 12.7949, 813414.42330, 1761921.45500, '50', 15.91834304, '15° 55\' 6.034960\"', 119.92570860, '119° 55\' 32.551070\"', 17.3870, 1760707.46900, 384965.71300, '3', 813273.71800, 1761990.55900, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9777, 'PNG-3344', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'TAMBAC', 2008, 15.91162535, '15° 54\' 41.851260\"', 119.91140560, '119° 54\' 41.060160\"', 'PNG-3344 From Dasol Public market travel southward enter northward road before the Magunao bridge. It takes 1 hour travel time to a rocky road going to Brgy. Tambac. The mark is located more or less 100 m before the Tambac Elementary School. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3344, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.91162535, '15° 54\' 41.851260\"', 119.91140560, '119° 54\' 41.059980\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.1280, 0.0000, '4', 16.6666, 811747.17410, 1761332.69400, '50', 15.91323781, '15° 54\' 47.656110\"', 119.91007560, '119° 54\' 36.272300\"', 21.0790, 1760151.18000, 383288.62500, '3', 811606.44300, 1761401.84000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9778, 'PNG-3345', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'PETAL', 2008, 15.95787629, '15° 57\' 28.354644\"', 119.87155210, '119° 52\' 17.587560\"', 'PNG-3345 From Dasol public market travel southward, just follow the provincial road until you reach Brgy. Petal. About 30 to 40 minutes travel time. The mark is located at the left side of the road just in front of the Lord Harvest Christian Youth Fellowship. It is 2 m south of the lamp post and 20 m east from the northern edge of the main entrance of the church. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3345, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.95787629, '15° 57\' 28.354630\"', 119.87155210, '119° 52\' 17.587710\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.4230, 0.0000, '4', 6.5435, 807406.14790, 1766395.04700, '50', 15.95949250, '15° 57\' 34.173000\"', 119.87022330, '119° 52\' 12.803760\"', 10.6090, 1765292.61400, 379048.40200, '3', 807265.53200, 1766464.34300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9779, 'PNG-3346', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'MACALANG', 2008, 15.90073764, '15° 54\' 2.655504\"', 119.88734020, '119° 53\' 14.424720\"', 'PNG-3346 From Dasol Public market travel southward until you reach Brgy. Macalang. It takes 30 minutes travel time going their. The mark is located at the left side of the bridge at the south east side of the bridge. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3346, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.90073764, '15° 54\' 2.655520\"', 119.88734020, '119° 53\' 14.424610\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.8780, 0.0000, '4', 7.7513, 809185.09530, 1760091.25200, '50', 15.90234996, '15° 54\' 8.459840\"', 119.88601000, '119° 53\' 9.635910\"', 11.8550, 1758959.87900, 380704.92700, '3', 809044.31500, 1760160.46200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
