(9794, 'PNG-3361', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'MAGSAYSAY', 2008, 16.09681751, '16° 5\' 48.543036\"', 119.79418680, '119° 47\' 39.072480\"', 'PNG-3361 From Agno municipal town proper of Agno, travel on dirt rap road uphill going to Brgy. Magsaysay, turn right on the waiting shed of Magsaysay and approximately 100 m from the W of shed and there is the barangay hall fenced by chicken wire. The GPS point is located on the N corner of the barangay hall fence. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3361, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.09681751, '16° 5\' 48.543040\"', 119.79418680, '119° 47\' 39.072560\"', 0.0000, '0', 131.2230, 0.0000, '4', 91.6825, 798911.01300, 1781666.84300, '50', 16.09844402, '16° 5\' 54.398480\"', 119.79286110, '119° 47\' 34.300060\"', 95.0150, 1780716.59400, 370854.62800, '3', 798770.77300, 1781736.46100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9795, 'PNG-3362', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'BANGAN-ODA', 2008, 16.10275509, '16° 6\' 9.918324\"', 119.81649570, '119° 48\' 59.384520\"', 'PNG-3362 From town proper of Agno, travel SE along the provincial road with a period of 4 minutes, the point si located S of a waiting shed in Sitio Sandrono, Bangan Oda, on top of the box culvert. It is about 58.80 m SE of the edge of a waiting shed and 4.60 m NE of the curve signboard.Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3362, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.10275509, '16° 6\' 9.918330\"', 119.81649570, '119° 48\' 59.384600\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.9110, 0.0000, '4', 7.0663, 801290.19220, 1782356.75400, '50', 16.10438151, '16° 6\' 15.773420\"', 119.81517020, '119° 48\' 54.612630\"', 10.6680, 1781359.86600, 373245.41600, '3', 801149.98300, 1782426.31200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9796, 'PNG-3363', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'BANGAN-ODA', 2008, 16.09749175, '16° 5\' 50.970300\"', 119.85104280, '119° 51\' 3.754080\"', 'PNG-3363 From Mabini town proper travel westward until you reach the Mabini junction, turn right going to Agno town proper. From the junction travel around 7 km going to Brgy. Bangan Oda. The mark is located along the provincial road 13.5 m N of the shed and it is 1.5 m N from 4.5 m of the provincial road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3363, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.09749175, '16° 5\' 50.970300\"', 119.85104280, '119° 51\' 3.753950\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.9550, 0.0000, '4', 7.6285, 804996.43970, 1781824.70600, '50', 16.09911708, '16° 5\' 56.821490\"', 119.84971710, '119° 50\' 58.981680\"', 11.6120, 1780756.37100, 376938.47800, '3', 804856.23700, 1781894.15800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9797, 'PNG-3364', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'CAYUNGNAN', 2008, 16.13924089, '16° 8\' 21.267204\"', 119.84005830, '119° 50\' 24.209880\"', 'PNG-3364 From the municipal hall of Bani, travel SW on the way to Agno, the first barangay to reach Cayungnan. Then pass right seeing the waiting shed and barangay road and a few meters is a DPWH km post no. 341 on the right. The point is located on the SW of the said KM post which is exactly 41.90 m on the opposite side of the road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3364, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.13924089, '16° 8\' 21.267190\"', 119.84005830, '119° 50\' 24.209991\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.9960, 0.0000, '4', 10.9480, 803756.86410, 1786431.44200, '50', 16.14086904, '16° 8\' 27.128550\"', 119.83873360, '119° 50\' 19.441120\"', 14.8050, 1785383.53600, 375789.29200, '3', 803616.78000, 1786500.95500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9798, 'PNG-3365', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'BOBOY', 2008, 16.13095343, '16° 7\' 51.432348\"', 119.79279330, '119° 47\' 34.055880\"', 'PNG-3365 From town proper of Agno drive NE on the barangay road going to Brgy. Boboy (sitio Boboy proper), you will pass the Roman Catholic Cementery; just go ahead to reach the only bridge in the place, 100 m further is Boboy Barangay Plaza. The point is located on the right edge of the bridge concrete railings, just beside the 15 cm diameter circular water pipeline. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3365, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.13095343, '16° 7\' 51.432360\"', 119.79279330, '119° 47\' 34.055740\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.8480, 0.0000, '4', 8.3966, 798710.65830, 1785444.61300, '50', 16.13258211, '16° 7\' 57.295590\"', 119.79146830, '119° 47\' 29.286050\"', 11.7470, 1784495.49900, 370727.72600, '3', 798570.52000, 1785514.26100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9799, 'PNG-3366', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'BOBOY', 2008, 16.13681069, '16° 8\' 12.518484\"', 119.78504110, '119° 47\' 6.147960\"', 'PNG-3366 From the municipal town proper of Agno travel NE on the brgy. road going to Boboy (Sitio Sabangan), you will pass the Agno Roman Catholic Cemetery and Boboy Proper Brgy. hall, just go ahead up to Juan Niño Elementary School, approximately 150 m W of the said school. The point is located SE of the pump house and it was put up on top of the drain gate of the fishpond. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m cement putty with inscription PNG-3366, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.13681069, '16° 8\' 12.518480\"', 119.78504110, '119° 47\' 6.147950\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.9390, 0.0000, '4', 8.6129, 797872.18080, 1786081.94000, '50', 16.13843990, '16° 8\' 18.383630\"', 119.78371630, '119° 47\' 1.378720\"', 11.8750, 1785148.65600, 369902.23800, '3', 797732.05500, 1786151.61500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9800, 'PNG-3367', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'BALLAG', 2008, 16.14310892, '16° 8\' 35.192112\"', 119.89478170, '119° 53\' 41.214120\"', 'PNG-3367 From Municipal hall of Bani travel eastward on the national road and turn right at Brgy. Banog Norte, Bani, Pangasinan. It is 15 minutes drive which is accesible to all light vehicles. The point is inside the Ballag Elementary School right side of the main gate. It is exactly 4.10 m S of the post of the main gate and 6.05 m W of the center of the lamp post. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3367, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.14310892, '16° 8\' 35.192100\"', 119.89478170, '119° 53\' 41.214020\"', 0.0000, '0', 77.3540, 0.0000, '4', 36.7172, 809607.94660, 1786941.32200, '50', 16.14473611, '16° 8\' 41.049990\"', 119.89345720, '119° 53\' 36.445800\"', 41.0430, 1785779.27900, 381645.53200, '3', 809467.91200, 1787010.67600, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9801, 'PNG-3368', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'QUINAOAYANAN', 2008, 16.15915443, '16° 9\' 32.955948\"', 119.84663930, '119° 50\' 47.901480\"', 'PNG-3368 From the municipal hall of Bani, Pangasinan, travel S on the way to Agno, first you will reach on the left side of the road Quinaoayanan Elementary School, just go ahead and until reaching the GPS point on the left side of the curve road. The station is exactly S of the curve signboard about 16.60 m, just beside the railings of the road and also 24.20 m E of Lomboy tree. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3368, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.15915443, '16° 9\' 32.955960\"', 119.84663930, '119° 50\' 47.901460\"', 0.0000, '0', 79.1560, 0.0000, '4', 39.1060, 804430.72280, 1788646.23800, '50', 16.16078367, '16° 9\' 38.821210\"', 119.84531510, '119° 50\' 43.134400\"', 43.0100, 1787583.48700, 376505.69300, '3', 804290.70700, 1788715.74500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9802, 'PNG-3369', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'BANOG NORTE', 2008, 16.18774265, '16° 11\' 15.873540\"', 119.90433870, '119° 54\' 15.619320\"', 'PNG-3369 From the municipal hall of Bani, Pangasinan travel eastward on the national road going to Alaminos, just go ahead after reaching the Caltex Gas station, it is located just beside DPWH km post. It is exactly 29.20 m w of the concrete welcome sign of Brgy. Banog and Garrita. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3369, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.18774265, '16° 11\' 15.873550\"', 119.90433870, '119° 54\' 15.619370\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.3440, 0.0000, '4', 4.8598, 810561.03810, 1791898.33900, '50', 16.18937241, '16° 11\' 21.740660\"', 119.90301530, '119° 54\' 10.854930\"', 9.1450, 1790713.53200, 382694.29700, '3', 810421.14600, 1791967.69600, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9803, 'PNG-3370', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'TUGUI NORTE', 2008, 16.21886602, '16° 13\' 7.917672\"', 119.87898590, '119° 52\' 44.349240\"', 'PNG-3370 From the municipal hall of Bani, Pangasinan travel north on the way to Bolinao, turn right on the intersection of Brgy. San Jose, Bani, just go ahead to Brgy. Tugui Norte. The point is located just after the bridge; it is on top of the rip rap. It is located N of the edge of the bridge exactly 36 m. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3370, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.21886602, '16° 13\' 7.917660\"', 119.87898590, '119° 52\' 44.349080\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.8280, 0.0000, '4', 5.7229, 807799.74170, 1795306.59100, '50', 16.22049825, '16° 13\' 13.793690\"', 119.87766310, '119° 52\' 39.587150\"', 9.7840, 1794172.78500, 380001.81300, '3', 807659.92800, 1795376.04300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9804, 'PNG-3371', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'TIEP', 2008, 16.24240297, '16° 14\' 32.650692\"', 119.85386090, '119° 51\' 13.899240\"', 'PNG-3371 From Bani town hall travel northward on the way to Bolinao, turn left on the intersection at Brgy. Tiep, Bani, Pangasinan. The point is located on the road center island on the way to Macabit and Calabeng, Bani. The station is exactly 18.20 m SE of Camachile tree. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3371, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.24240297, '16° 14\' 32.650700\"', 119.85386090, '119° 51\' 13.899140\"', 0.0000, '0', 173.7690, 0.0000, '4', 134.0064, 805075.35390, 1797875.32600, '50', 16.24403717, '16° 14\' 38.533820\"', 119.85253870, '119° 51\' 9.139190\"', 137.8580, 1796792.66500, 377329.83900, '3', 804935.59900, 1797944.86500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9805, 'PNG-3372', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'RANAO', 2008, 16.20660164, '16° 12\' 23.765904\"', 119.81617490, '119° 48\' 58.229640\"', 'PNG-3372 From the municipal hall of Bani drive NW on a Brgy. road which is accessible to all kinds of light vehicles. The point is located along the side of the road, it is E of Ranao Brgy. Plaza & Ranao Natioanal high school. The station is exactly 20 m E of Acacia tree in front of Brgy. hall. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3372, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.20660164, '16° 12\' 23.765900\"', 119.81617490, '119° 48\' 58.229640\"', 0.0000, '0', 185.7100, 0.0000, '4', 146.1736, 801098.46730, 1793855.19200, '50', 16.20823445, '16° 12\' 29.644010\"', 119.81485180, '119° 48\' 53.466520\"', 149.7820, 1792853.34200, 373277.51400, '3', 800958.57900, 1793924.81800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9806, 'PNG-3373', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'SAN SIMON', 2008, 16.21115687, '16° 12\' 40.164732\"', 119.79521350, '119° 47\' 42.768600\"', 'PNG-3373 From the municipal hall of Bani drive north on the way to Bolinao, turn left at Brgy. Tiep, follow the cemented road and pass Brgy. Dacap Norte, turn left at Brgy. Centro Toma and pass the Brgy. hall of Dacap Sur until reaching San Simon Elementary School and Brgy. Plaza. The point is located in an open area on the S of basketball plaza. From the third building at the back (southern side), the station was measured to be 40.10 m S of the said building. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3373, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.21115687, '16° 12\' 40.164740\"', 119.79521350, '119° 47\' 42.768460\"', 0.0000, '0', 184.6210, 0.0000, '4', 145.3406, 798848.93060, 1794328.91100, '50', 16.21279042, '16° 12\' 46.045520\"', 119.79389050, '119° 47\' 38.005640\"', 148.7570, 1793370.61100, 371038.89700, '3', 798709.04200, 1794398.60200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9807, 'PNG-3374', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'DACAP SUR', 2008, 16.23157321, '16° 13\' 53.663556\"', 119.80394840, '119° 48\' 14.214240\"', 'PNG-3374 From the municipal hall of Bani, Pangasinan, travel northward on the way to Bolinao, turn left at Brgy. Tiep, just follow the road and turn left at Brgy. Centro Toma until reaching Dacap Sur Brgy. Plaza. The station is located on the SE side of the CHB fence of the barangay lot. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3374, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.23157321, '16° 13\' 53.663570\"', 119.80394840, '119° 48\' 14.214220\"', 0.0000, '0', 195.8250, 0.0000, '4', 156.5219, 799752.52400, 1796602.35700, '50', 16.23320783, '16° 13\' 59.548190\"', 119.80262590, '119° 48\' 9.453160\"', 160.0020, 1795624.73200, 371986.22600, '3', 799612.70400, 1796672.03600, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9808, 'PNG-3375', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'MACABIT', 2008, 16.25439253, '16° 15\' 15.813108\"', 119.83442210, '119° 50\' 3.919560\"', 'PNG-3375 From the municipal hall of Bani, travel northward on the way to Bolinao, turn left at Brgy. tiep, just go ahead turn right on the way to Macabit, the point is located on the NW of the Brgy. hall, left side of the barangay road. It is exactly 25.60 m N of an old Mango tree and 13.40 m SE of Bulala tree. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3375, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.25439253, '16° 15\' 15.813100\"', 119.83442210, '119° 50\' 3.919430\"', 0.0000, '0', 169.5210, 0.0000, '4', 129.9887, 802977.52470, 1799174.05800, '50', 16.25602789, '16° 15\' 21.700420\"', 119.83310010, '119° 49\' 59.160400\"', 133.6930, 1798131.41100, 375259.06800, '3', 802837.79400, 1799243.66300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9809, 'PNG-3376', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'COLAYO', 2008, 16.27440866, '16° 16\' 27.871176\"', 119.80989930, '119° 48\' 35.637480\"', 'PNG-3376 From the municipal hall of Bani, travel for almost 20 minutes in the place, turn left at the intersection of at Brgy. Tiep, just go ahead and follow the cemented road going to Brgy. Colayo. The point is located in front of the covered court of Colayo, at the boundary of 2 agricultural lots. The station is exactly 10.30 m NE of CHB fence post of the Brgy. lot. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3376, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.27440866, '16° 16\' 27.871190\"', 119.80989930, '119° 48\' 35.637540\"', 0.0000, '0', 186.4710, 0.0000, '4', 147.3065, 800323.97550, 1801354.25400, '50', 16.27604580, '16° 16\' 33.764870\"', 119.80857780, '119° 48\' 30.880100\"', 150.7640, 1800361.90000, 372650.23600, '3', 800184.29000, 1801423.94500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9810, 'PNG-3377', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'MACALEENG', 2008, 16.24735636, '16° 14\' 50.482896\"', 120.00830540, '120° 0\' 29.899440\"', 'PNG-3377 From Anda town proper travel SE along the provincial road about 15-25 minutes going to Brgy. Sablig, just straight ahead and travel again 2-4 km, turn left to reach Brgy. Macaleeng. The station can be found near the box culvert and set about 3 m W of theSW strip of the said culvert. It is alos 26 m E of the waiting shed. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3377, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.24735636, '16° 14\' 50.482890\"', 120.00830540, '120° 0\' 29.899500\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.6590, 0.0000, '4', 13.9341, 180187.24620, 1798634.46500, '51', 16.24898753, '16° 14\' 56.355090\"', 120.00698350, '120° 0\' 25.140530\"', 18.3890, 1797254.19900, 393845.04000, '3', 180044.04700, 1798707.70100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9811, 'PNG-3378', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'SABLIG', 2008, 16.26463014, '16° 15\' 52.668504\"', 119.99020260, '119° 59\' 24.729360\"', 'PNG-3378 From Anda proper drive southward going to Brgy. Sablig about 15-25 minutes along the provincial road to reach the station. The point is located within the premises of Sablig Brgy. hall. It is SE of the entrance gate of the said barangay hall. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3378, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.26463014, '16° 15\' 52.668490\"', 119.99020260, '119° 59\' 24.729250\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.5200, 0.0000, '4', 28.0245, 819625.16120, 1800545.11700, '50', 16.26626276, '16° 15\' 58.545940\"', 119.98888100, '119° 59\' 19.971660\"', 32.3470, 1799175.42400, 391919.13700, '3', 819485.56000, 1800614.27200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9812, 'PNG-3379', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'NAMAGBAGAN', 2008, 16.29789474, '16° 17\' 52.421064\"', 119.98676750, '119° 59\' 12.363000\"', 'PNG-3379 From the municipal hall of Anda, Pangasinan travel along the barangay raod going to Brgy. San Jose about 2-3 km, turn right at the intersection going to Brgy. Namagbagan. The station is located at the left side of the barangay road from Namagbagan Brgy. Plaza near basketball court. It is 15 m W of the Eastern edge and 7 m E of the western edge of the basketball court, respectively. It is aloso N of the centerline of the said court. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3379, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.29789474, '16° 17\' 52.421050\"', 119.98676750, '119° 59\' 12.362840\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.2750, 0.0000, '4', 24.0618, 819203.80890, 1804223.63200, '50', 16.29952949, '16° 17\' 58.306170\"', 119.98544670, '119° 59\' 7.608040\"', 28.2110, 1802858.69500, 391570.27900, '3', 819064.30700, 1804292.81900, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9813, 'PNG-3380', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'ROXAS', 2008, 16.28224418, '16° 16\' 56.079048\"', 119.95802250, '119° 57\' 28.881000\"', 'PNG-3380 Starting at Anda town plaza travel approximately 1 km SE going to Brgy. Roxas. The station is located at the box culvert on it\'s right shoulder. It is also 80 m NW of the waiting shed. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3380, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.28224418, '16° 16\' 56.079050\"', 119.95802250, '119° 57\' 28.880920\"', 0.0000, '0', 65.7130, 0.0000, '4', 25.5209, 816154.55170, 1802445.64900, '50', 16.28387859, '16° 17\' 1.962940\"', 119.95670130, '119° 57\' 24.124670\"', 29.6710, 1801142.16500, 388489.00300, '3', 816014.98300, 1802514.91100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9814, 'PNG-3381', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'MAL-ONG', 2008, 16.29815971, '16° 17\' 53.374956\"', 119.94004790, '119° 56\' 24.172440\"', 'PNG-3381 From Anda town plaza travel NW going to Brgy. Mal-ong about 2-3 km along the provincial road. The station is located near the house of Mr. & Mrs. Raymundo Razote. It is 15 m SW of the said house and also 6 m SE of the electric post. It is also about 30 cm E of the concrete fence. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3381, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.29815971, '16° 17\' 53.374940\"', 119.94004790, '119° 56\' 24.172330\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.9700, 0.0000, '4', 28.9922, 814206.59230, 1804180.38200, '50', 16.29979549, '16° 17\' 59.263780\"', 119.93872700, '119° 56\' 19.417350\"', 33.0210, 1802913.52300, 386576.82800, '3', 814067.06100, 1804249.70800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9815, 'PNG-3382', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'SAN JOSE', 2008, 16.30746823, '16° 18\' 26.885628\"', 119.97597140, '119° 58\' 33.497040\"', 'PNG-3382 From the municipal town proper of Anda drive NE for about 2-3 km to reach Brgy. San Jose. The station is located at the upper right shoulder of the bridge. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3382, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.30746823, '16° 18\' 26.885640\"', 119.97597140, '119° 58\' 33.497110\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.7330, 0.0000, '4', 10.6485, 818033.65370, 1805266.96400, '50', 16.30910382, '16° 18\' 32.773750\"', 119.97465080, '119° 58\' 28.743050\"', 14.7250, 1803924.00600, 390421.70200, '3', 817894.17300, 1805336.19100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9816, 'PNG-3383', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'TONDOL', 2008, 16.31421857, '16° 18\' 51.186852\"', 120.01420000, '120° 0\' 51.120000\"', 'PNG-3383 Starting from Anda town plaza drive 2-3 km along the municipal road going to Brgy. San Jose, turn right at the intersection going to Brgy. Namagbagan straight ahead then turn left at the next intersection going to Brgy. Tondol. the station is located within the walking area of the Ecotourism Park. It is about 7 m S of the lamp post and 23 m from the lighthouse. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3383, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.31421857, '16° 18\' 51.186860\"', 120.01420000, '120° 0\' 51.119880\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.1190, 0.0000, '4', 4.9099, 180926.13620, 1806029.90100, '51', 16.31585374, '16° 18\' 57.073470\"', 120.01287960, '120° 0\' 46.366550\"', 9.0390, 1804650.82800, 394511.14400, '3', 180783.16800, 1806103.17300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9817, 'PNG-3384', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'CABUNGAN', 2008, 16.33184344, '16° 19\' 54.636384\"', 119.99249340, '119° 59\' 32.976240\"', 'PNG-3384 From the municipal town plaza of Anda drive NE along the municipal road going to Brgy. Cabungan approximately 6-8 km. The station is located at the upper right shoulder of the box culvert. It is also 200 m NE of Cabungan Water tank. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3384, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.33184344, '16° 19\' 54.636400\"', 119.99249340, '119° 59\' 32.976270\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.9810, 0.0000, '4', 5.0127, 819761.01580, 1807992.28200, '50', 16.33348018, '16° 20\' 0.528630\"', 119.99117340, '119° 59\' 28.224330\"', 9.0070, 1806612.81000, 392200.96300, '3', 819621.62000, 1808061.47600, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9818, 'PNG-3385', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'CAROT', 2008, 16.34541179, '16° 20\' 43.482444\"', 119.97980540, '119° 58\' 47.299440\"', 'PNG-3385 From the municipal town proper of Anda travel NE 2-3 km to reach Brgy. San Jose, turn left at the intersection going to Brgy. Carot straight ahead for about 3-5 km to reach the station. The said station is located on the open ground of Carot Elementary School. It is exactly 27.70 m W of the school\'s stage. Station mark is the hed of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3385, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.34541179, '16° 20\' 43.482460\"', 119.97980540, '119° 58\' 47.299550\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.4830, 0.0000, '4', 4.6858, 818382.20740, 1809475.00300, '50', 16.34704964, '16° 20\' 49.378690\"', 119.97848580, '119° 58\' 42.548700\"', 8.5810, 1808121.23700, 390852.62200, '3', 818242.84500, 1809544.24400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9819, 'PNG-3386', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'AWAG', 2008, 16.30848236, '16° 18\' 30.536496\"', 119.94636960, '119° 56\' 46.930560\"', 'PNG-3386 From Anda town proper drive NW about 2-3 km to reach Brgy. Awag along the national road. The point is located along the dirty road 8 m NE of Welcome Arch of Awag. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3386, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.30848236, '16° 18\' 30.536500\"', 119.94636960, '119° 56\' 46.930440\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.4550, 0.0000, '4', 5.5243, 814866.18750, 1805333.28600, '50', 16.31011866, '16° 18\' 36.427160\"', 119.94504900, '119° 56\' 42.176330\"', 9.5210, 1804052.44500, 387258.45400, '3', 814726.69100, 1805402.60100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9820, 'PNG-3387', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'ZARAGOZA', 2008, 16.25357175, '16° 15\' 12.858300\"', 119.88784810, '119° 53\' 16.253160\"', 'PNG-3387 From Bani town proper travel northward about 20 minutes to reach Brgy. Zaragoza. From provincial road turn right to reach the said Brgy. and is about 400 m going to the station. The mark is located 15 m W of the northern ring post and located inside the barangay auditorium. It is also 20 cm E of the concrete fence. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3387, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.25357175, '16° 15\' 12.858310\"', 119.88784810, '119° 53\' 16.253310\"', 0.0000, '0', 144.3790, 0.0000, '4', 104.4046, 808693.70570, 1799163.11500, '50', 16.25520591, '16° 15\' 18.741270\"', 119.88652620, '119° 53\' 11.494410\"', 108.4200, 1798008.62100, 380970.42000, '3', 808554.00600, 1799232.56200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9821, 'PNG-3388', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'CATUNGI', 2008, 16.27322560, '16° 16\' 23.612160\"', 119.89016190, '119° 53\' 24.582840\"', 'PNG-3388 From Bani town proper just travel 10-15 minutes drives along provincial road northward then turn right to reach Barangay Catungi. The station is located along the barangay road approximately 20 m NE of the culvert and 2 m N of the barangay road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3388, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.27322560, '16° 16\' 23.612160\"', 119.89016190, '119° 53\' 24.582880\"', 0.0000, '0', 115.1200, 0.0000, '4', 75.2577, 808910.44000, 1801343.01300, '50', 16.27486093, '16° 16\' 29.499330\"', 119.88884050, '119° 53\' 19.825620\"', 79.2150, 1800182.44700, 381229.65200, '3', 808770.80100, 1801412.46700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9822, 'PNG-3389', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'LUCIENTE 2.0', 2008, 16.35366012, '16° 21\' 13.176432\"', 119.91598030, '119° 54\' 57.529080\"', 'PNG-3389 From town proper travel along the national highway going to Alaminos turn left at barangay Cabuyao going to Barangay Luciente II, it will pass the barangay hall and few meters will reach Luciente II Elementary School. The GPS point is located at the corner of the road SW of the CHB fence post of the school and N of the main gate. It is about 3.20 m SW of the post of the said school and 14.50 m N of the post of the main gate. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3389, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.35366012, '16° 21\' 13.176420\"', 119.91598030, '119° 54\' 57.529010\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.3570, 0.0000, '4', 35.9375, 811544.56340, 1810289.51300, '50', 16.35529985, '16° 21\' 19.079460\"', 119.91466070, '119° 54\' 52.778600\"', 39.6350, 1809069.56600, 384037.20600, '3', 811405.18600, 1810358.94700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9823, 'PNG-3391', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'TARA', 2008, 16.28353869, '16° 17\' 0.739284\"', 119.88838750, '119° 53\' 18.195000\"', 'PNG-3391 From Bani town proper drive N along the provincial road about 5-10 minutes to reach Brgy. Tara. The station is located along the provincial road and beside basketball court 1.5 m E from the western edge and approximately 13 m W from the center of the provincial road. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3391, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.28353869, '16° 17\' 0.739280\"', 119.88838750, '119° 53\' 18.194830\"', 0.0000, '0', 123.5430, 0.0000, '4', 83.7589, 808704.49170, 1802482.36600, '50', 16.28517469, '16° 17\' 6.628880\"', 119.88706620, '119° 53\' 13.438440\"', 87.6730, 1801324.87900, 381046.20400, '3', 808564.88300, 1802551.83200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9824, 'PNG-3392', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'TUPA', 2008, 16.32538042, '16° 19\' 31.369512\"', 119.84940840, '119° 50\' 57.870240\"', 'PNG-3392 From the municipal town proper of Bolinao travel southward on the national road and turn right at Barangay Samang Norte then pass through an uphill dirt road going to the place. It takes 30 minutes drive on the way passing the Samang Norte Barangay Hall and next is the Tupa Elementary School just go ahead and reach Iglesia ni Cristo Church, straight ahead uphill for about 150 m on an open ground on the right side of the road. The station is located approximately 20 m NE of an electric post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3392, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.32538042, '16° 19\' 31.369510\"', 119.84940840, '119° 50\' 57.870080\"', 0.0000, '0', 146.8920, 0.0000, '4', 107.6970, 804470.81460, 1807057.07400, '50', 16.32701984, '16° 19\' 37.271430\"', 119.84808810, '119° 50\' 53.117070\"', 111.2450, 1805978.94400, 376905.77400, '3', 804331.31000, 1807126.68300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9825, 'PNG-3393', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'PATAR', 2008, 16.34141062, '16° 20\' 29.078232\"', 119.79650580, '119° 47\' 47.420880\"', 'PNG-3393 From the municipal hall of Bolinao travel SW along the coastal road which is accessible to all kinds of vehicle passing to Brgy. Stanza and Ilog-Malino. The point is located in front of Don Genaro Almogela Auditorium near the corner of the provincial barangay road. The point measures 5 m SW of the electric post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3393, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.34141062, '16° 20\' 29.078220\"', 119.79650580, '119° 47\' 47.420840\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.7000, 0.0000, '4', 8.0969, 798789.73600, 1808753.68600, '50', 16.34305219, '16° 20\' 34.987890\"', 119.79518580, '119° 47\' 42.668890\"', 11.2280, 1807785.95800, 371262.39900, '3', 798650.24400, 1808823.46300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9826, 'PNG-3394', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'ESTANZA', 2008, 16.36023756, '16° 21\' 36.855216\"', 119.84567860, '119° 50\' 44.442960\"', 'PNG-3394 From the municipal town plaza of Bolinao, travel SW along the provincial road, it will pass Barangay Balingasay, the boundary of Balingasay and Stanza is the center of the bridge wherein before reaching the place it will turn right go ahead for 1 km. The point is located in an open area, it was placed on top of breakwater concrete dike just 25 m NW of an electric post. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3394, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.36023756, '16° 21\' 36.855210\"', 119.84567860, '119° 50\' 44.442870\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.1050, 0.0000, '4', 5.2129, 804018.00650, 1810911.35700, '50', 16.36187924, '16° 21\' 42.765250\"', 119.84435910, '119° 50\' 39.692690\"', 8.5730, 1809839.08000, 376529.14500, '3', 803878.60300, 1810981.00400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9827, 'PNG-3395', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'LUCIENTE 1.0', 2008, 16.38879155, '16° 23\' 19.649580\"', 119.90421650, '119° 54\' 15.179400\"', 'PNG-3395 From the municipal town proper of Bolinao travel eastward going to Brgy. Luciente I for about 2 minutes accessible to all kinds of vehicle, turn left downward before Luciente I Barangay Hall and follow the pathway (breakwater cement dike). The point is located NE of the waiting shed. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3395, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.38879155, '16° 23\' 19.649580\"', 119.90421650, '119° 54\' 15.179430\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.2300, 0.0000, '4', 6.1826, 810231.17280, 1814161.92000, '50', 16.39043371, '16° 23\' 25.561360\"', 119.90289780, '119° 54\' 10.431910\"', 9.6440, 1812964.50600, 382801.25400, '3', 810091.89500, 1814231.41300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9828, 'PNG-3396', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'CONCORDIA', 2008, 16.38925229, '16° 23\' 21.308244\"', 119.89046210, '119° 53\' 25.663560\"', 'PNG-3396 From the municipal town hall travel W for about 3 minutes going to Concordia Brgy. plaza. The station is located W of Bgy Hall and Day Care Center and N of Barangay Stage. It is exactly 11.60 m of a concrete post of day care center. Station is mark by the head of a 4\" copper nail on a 0.40 m x 0.40 m concrete monument with inscription PNG-3396, PRS-92, 2008, DENR-LMS R-1.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.38925229, '16° 23\' 21.308230\"', 119.89046210, '119° 53\' 25.663380\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.9440, 0.0000, '4', 4.9838, 808760.12390, 1814191.94400, '50', 16.39089478, '16° 23\' 27.221190\"', 119.88914330, '119° 53\' 20.915840\"', 8.3920, 1813023.52200, 381332.04800, '3', 808620.83800, 1814261.47800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9829, 'PNG-34', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN FABIAN', 'POBLACION', 1996, 16.12195424, '16° 7\' 19.035264\"', 120.40294250, '120° 24\' 10.593000\"', 'PNG-34 Is situated at Poblacion, San Fabian, Pangasinan. It is within the vicinity compound of San Fabian Auditorium. It is located 2.31 m E of Jose Rizal Shrine 2.45 m W of the corner edge of the flooring of the said monument. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded and set flush on cement putty with inscription \"PNG-34 1996 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.12195424, '16° 7\' 19.035260\"', 120.40294250, '120° 24\' 10.592820\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.4014, 0.0000, '3', 5.7725, 222224.89240, 1784174.33400, '51', 16.12356902, '16° 7\' 24.848470\"', 120.40161810, '120° 24\' 5.825020\"', 9.7954, 1783212.17300, 435993.39800, '3', 222081.58500, 1784246.17700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9830, 'PNG-35', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN FABIAN', 'POBLACION', 1996, 16.12133504, '16° 7\' 16.806144\"', 120.40232210, '120° 24\' 8.359560\"', 'PNG-35 Is situated at Poblacion, San Fabian, Pangasinan. It is fronting the San Fabian Church at Mc Arthur Highway and San Fabian Municipal Hall and Philippine National Police Station at Caballero St. The station is within the vicinity of the town plaza. It is about 85 m. NE of the main gate of San Fabian Church and 75 m. NW of the Municipal Hall. Station mark is the head of a 1/2 in. dia. brass rod embedded and centered in a cast place monument 15 in. square solid formed concrete with inscription mark \"BLLM-2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.12133504, '16° 7\' 16.806160\"', 120.40232210, '120° 24\' 8.359420\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.7041, 0.0000, '3', 5.0719, 222157.63470, 1784106.61800, '51', 16.12294980, '16° 7\' 22.619280\"', 120.40099770, '120° 24\' 3.591560\"', 9.0977, 1783143.84700, 435926.83500, '3', 222014.32500, 1784178.46300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9831, 'PNG-3501', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'BINABALIAN', 2008, 16.40809886, '16° 24\' 29.155896\"', 119.92702400, '119° 55\' 37.286400\"', 'PNG-3501 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. of Binabalian (Island of Santiago). To reach the station, travel from Bolinao Town Proper to Santiago Island by pump boat for about 15 mins. until reaching the Binabalian Loob Pier, then continue travel by motorcycle for about 10 mins. to Sibarbar junction. Station is located at the intersection of the road going to Brgy. Binabalian, Goyoden, Salud and Brgy. Lucero. about 3 m NE of Sibarbar junction marker, and about 30 m N of Brgy. Lucero Sports Complex. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on a concrete pavement of road with inscriptions, \"PNG-3501, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.40809886, '16° 24\' 29.155910\"', 119.92702400, '119° 55\' 37.286430\"', 0.0000, '0', 60.7480, 0.0000, '4', 21.7440, 812638.41490, 1816335.06500, '50', 16.40974171, '16° 24\' 35.070160\"', 119.92570570, '119° 55\' 32.540640\"', 25.1660, 1815088.24700, 385249.29100, '3', 812499.21100, 1816404.50300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9832, 'PNG-3502', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'BINABALIAN', 2008, 16.40172246, '16° 24\' 6.200856\"', 119.92716560, '119° 55\' 37.796160\"', 'PNG-3502 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. of Binabalian (Island of Santiago). To reach the station, travel from Bolinao Town Proper to Santiago Island by pump boat for about 15 mins. until reaching the Binabalian Loob Pier, then continue travel by motorcycle for about 10 mins. to Sibarbar junctiion, then turn left follow the road going to Brgy. Binabalian Proper. Station mark is located 2.5 m S of Km. post 3 or 1 Km. to Sibarbar Binabalian. About 15 m SE corner of Mahogany and Mango plantation. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on a concrete road with inscriptions, PNG-3502, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.40172246, '16° 24\' 6.200870\"', 119.92716560, '119° 55\' 37.796280\"', 0.0000, '0', 67.5480, 0.0000, '4', 28.4867, 812663.75060, 1815629.15500, '50', 16.40336491, '16° 24\' 12.113690\"', 119.92584720, '119° 55\' 33.049960\"', 31.9450, 1814382.46100, 385260.66700, '3', 812524.52700, 1815698.58800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9833, 'PNG-3503', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'ARNEDO', 2008, 16.38249470, '16° 22\' 56.980920\"', 119.88092130, '119° 52\' 51.316680\"', 'PNG-3503 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. of Arnedo. To reach the station, travel SW direction towards the School of Fisheries until reaching Arnedo Elem. School, turn right follow the Brgy. Road until reaching the first rice fields area going to Bolinao School of Fisheries. Station mark is located on top of the small hill at the center of the rice field. It is about 80 m left side or W of the asphalt road, about 80 m W of concrete bongalow house E of rice field. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface with inscriptions, \"PNG-3503, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.38249470, '16° 22\' 56.980910\"', 119.88092130, '119° 52\' 51.316500\"', 0.0000, '0', 43.3300, 0.0000, '4', 4.3675, 807750.86780, 1813429.12400, '50', 16.38413698, '16° 23\' 2.893120\"', 119.87960230, '119° 52\' 46.568340\"', 7.7810, 1812281.24500, 380308.59200, '3', 807611.55500, 1813498.68100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9834, 'PNG-3504', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'ARNEDO', 2008, 16.38405426, '16° 23\' 2.595336\"', 119.88107410, '119° 52\' 51.866760\"', 'PNG-3504 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. of Arnedo. to reach the station, travel SW direction to the School of Fisheries until reaching Arnedo Elem. School, turn right follow the Brgy. road until reaching the first rice field are going to Bolinao School of Fisheries. Station mark is located at the center of the rice field. It is about 50 m left side of the asphalt road, about 800 m NE of Arnedo Elem. School. Station Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrte monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3504, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.38405426, '16° 23\' 2.595350\"', 119.88107410, '119° 52\' 51.866650\"', 0.0000, '0', 42.7450, 0.0000, '4', 3.7954, 807764.75270, 1813602.05700, '50', 16.38569664, '16° 23\' 8.507890\"', 119.87975520, '119° 52\' 47.118620\"', 7.2000, 1812453.76100, 380325.87500, '3', 807625.44500, 1813671.61500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9835, 'PNG-3505', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'LIWA-LIWA', 2008, 16.36769305, '16° 22\' 3.694980\"', 119.88906130, '119° 53\' 20.620680\"', 'PNG-3505 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. of Liwa-liwa. To reach the station, from Bani Town Proper, travel N direction towards Bolinao Town Proper until reaching Liwa-liwa Elem. School. About 340 m from the school turn left follow the concrete road. Station mark is located at the end of the concrete road about 100 W of Provincial Road and about 350 m NE of Liwa-liwa Elem. School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. cipper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3505, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.36769305, '16° 22\' 3.694980\"', 119.88906130, '119° 53\' 20.620770\"', 0.0000, '0', 95.3840, 0.0000, '4', 56.2448, 808644.36530, 1811802.39500, '50', 16.36933423, '16° 22\' 9.603220\"', 119.88774210, '119° 53\' 15.871440\"', 59.7690, 1810638.26500, 381169.28100, '3', 808505.01400, 1811871.91700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9836, 'PNG-3506', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'LIWA-LIWA', 2008, 16.36694156, '16° 22\' 0.989616\"', 119.89082560, '119° 53\' 26.972160\"', 'PNG-3506 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. of Liwa-liwa. To reach the station, from Bani Town Proper, travel N direction to Bolinao Town Proper until reaching Liwa-liwa Elem. School. Continue trave about 340 m from the shcool. Station mark is located at the vacan lot right side of the Provincial Road for about 30 m, about 340 m NE of Liwa-liwa Elem. School and about 25 m SE of \"right thinking leads to right living\" sign board. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3506, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.36694156, '16° 22\' 0.989620\"', 119.89082560, '119° 53\' 26.972200\"', 0.0000, '0', 92.9620, 0.0000, '4', 53.8058, 808834.16720, 1811721.86000, '50', 16.36858266, '16° 22\' 6.897560\"', 119.88950630, '119° 53\' 22.222810\"', 57.3410, 1810554.05800, 381357.33700, '3', 808694.81500, 1811791.37700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
