(9837, 'PNG-3507', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'ILOGMALINO', 2008, 16.34791691, '16° 20\' 52.500876\"', 119.81867610, '119° 49\' 7.233960\"', 'PNG-3507 From Bolinao Town Proper, travel SW direction to Ilogmolino Elem. School. and Puerto Del Sol Beach Resort for about 10 Km. turn right at Estanza-Ilogmolino junction. Upon reaching the school site, turn left travel for about 1.2 Km. follow the unpaved road, turn left at the first Y road intersection. Station mark is located in Mun. of Bolino, Brgy. of Ilogmolino, Sitio Mawi. It is located on the open ground at the center of the rice field about 100 m SW of residential are. Station mark is intervisible to PNG-82. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3507, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.34791691, '16° 20\' 52.500870\"', 119.81867610, '119° 49\' 7.233800\"', 0.0000, '0', 74.4850, 0.0000, '4', 35.7244, 801150.12570, 1809506.84500, '50', 16.34955841, '16° 20\' 58.410260\"', 119.81735630, '119° 49\' 2.482500\"', 38.9800, 1808492.11300, 373635.84200, '3', 801010.66800, 1809576.56200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9838, 'PNG-3508', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'ESTANZA', 2008, 16.34371704, '16° 20\' 37.381344\"', 119.84294510, '119° 50\' 34.602360\"', 'PNG-3508 From Bolinao Town Proper, travel SW direction to Estanza Elem. School for about 10 Km. turn left at Estanza-Ilogmolino junction until reaching the Brgy. Proper. Station mark is located in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. of Estanza. It is located 10 m left side of SE of the Brgy. Road going to Brgy. Tupa, about 20 m E of Roman Catholic Brgy. Chapel. About 100 m E of Estanza Elem. School and about 40 m SE of Brgy. Sports Complex. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3508, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.34371704, '16° 20\' 37.381340\"', 119.84294510, '119° 50\' 34.602220\"', 0.0000, '0', 99.9740, 0.0000, '4', 60.9708, 803751.34540, 1809077.89200, '50', 16.34535774, '16° 20\' 43.287880\"', 119.84162520, '119° 50\' 29.850690\"', 64.3980, 1808012.31000, 376226.60800, '3', 803611.89100, 1809147.53400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
