(9840, 'PNG-3510', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'LUNA', 2008, 16.33101282, '16° 19\' 51.646152\"', 119.89477830, '119° 53\' 41.201880\"', 'PNG-3510 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. Luna. To reach the station, from Bani Town Proper, travel to Bolino Town Proper until reaching Brgy. Luna. It is located at the center of the farm lot owned by Mr. Nestor Carranza. 50 m E of Provincial Road to Bolinao Town Proper, about 180 m N of Brgy. Hall, about 160 m N of basketball court and 30 m SE fo the 3 storey newly construct residential house no. 068. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3510, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.33101282, '16° 19\' 51.646160\"', 119.89477830, '119° 53\' 41.201780\"', 0.0000, '0', 96.3780, 0.0000, '4', 56.9006, 809313.37640, 1807749.21000, '50', 16.33265162, '16° 19\' 57.545820\"', 119.89345820, '119° 53\' 36.449390\"', 60.6370, 1806575.33300, 381757.96400, '3', 809173.91700, 1807818.69000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9841, 'PNG-3511', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'CATUDAY', 2008, 16.30242902, '16° 18\' 8.744472\"', 119.83355770, '119° 50\' 0.807720\"', 'PNG-3511 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. of Catuday. It is located 20 m NW or right side of Brgy. Road going to Brgy. Proper. 5 m E of a house. About 200 m SW of Brgy. Welcome Marker and about 3.5 Km. NE of Brgy. Proper. Station is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with aprojection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3511, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.30242902, '16° 18\' 8.744460\"', 119.83355770, '119° 50\' 0.807720\"', 0.0000, '0', 164.7310, 0.0000, '4', 125.4980, 802811.26900, 1804491.96200, '50', 16.30406737, '16° 18\' 14.642520\"', 119.83223690, '119° 49\' 56.052730\"', 129.0520, 1803448.44000, 375197.15800, '3', 802671.68400, 1804561.60200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9842, 'PNG-3512', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'CATUDAY', 2008, 16.30282554, '16° 18\' 10.171944\"', 119.83687520, '119° 50\' 12.750720\"', 'PNG-3512 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. Catuday. It is located on top of the hill, left side or about 200 m SE of unpaved Brgy. Road. 5 m E of a house. About 200 m SW of Brgy. Welcome Marker and about 3.5 Km. NE of Brgy. Proper. Station mark is intervisible to PNG-3511. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3512, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.30282554, '16° 18\' 10.171950\"', 119.83687520, '119° 50\' 12.750550\"', 0.0000, '0', 148.9720, 0.0000, '4', 109.7150, 803165.42700, 1804540.80200, '50', 16.30446385, '16° 18\' 16.069850\"', 119.83555430, '119° 50\' 7.995590\"', 113.2860, 1803490.29200, 375551.99800, '3', 803025.84500, 1804610.43300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9843, 'PNG-3513', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'TUPA', 2008, 16.30644068, '16° 18\' 23.186448\"', 119.85814290, '119° 51\' 29.314440\"', 'PNG-3513 Station mark is in Mun. of Bolinao, Brgy. to Tupa and Sitio Malumanat. It is located N or left side of the unpaved Brgy. Road going to Brgy. Samang Norte. About 40 M SW of Mango Tree, 50 m W of the rice field. 100 m NW of 3 houses. Station Mark is intervisible to PNG-3514. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3513, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.30644068, '16° 18\' 23.186450\"', 119.85814290, '119° 51\' 29.314500\"', 0.0000, '0', 117.8220, 0.0000, '4', 78.4191, 805434.20930, 1804972.87900, '50', 16.30807875, '16° 18\' 29.083510\"', 119.85682220, '119° 51\' 24.559910\"', 82.0950, 1803877.49600, 377827.46200, '3', 805294.65200, 1805042.45100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
