(9847, 'PNG-3517', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'TARA', 2007, 16.29300402, '16° 17\' 34.814472\"', 119.91358320, '119° 54\' 48.899520\"', 'PNG-3517 Station mark is in Mun. of Anda, Brgy. Catubig. To reach the station travel from Bani Town Proper to Brgy. Catubig at the Bolinao-Anda junction, turn right then continue travel until reaching the Brgy. Proper, then turn left follow the newly construct concrete road going to the \"Little Sister of the Poor\" (St. Joseph Home for Elderly). Station mark is located at the right side of ascending concrete road about 12 m E of about 6 m high riprap S of the school bldg. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3517, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.29300402, '16° 17\' 34.814470\"', 119.91358320, '119° 54\' 48.899510\"', 0.0000, '0', 61.3570, 0.0000, '4', 21.4793, 811384.35590, 1803568.83600, '50', 16.29464007, '16° 17\' 40.704250\"', 119.91226220, '119° 54\' 44.143980\"', 25.4560, 1802357.87800, 383745.08500, '3', 811244.79200, 1803638.23700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
