(9859, 'PNG-3529', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'RANAO', 2008, 16.18644217, '16° 11\' 11.191812\"', 119.81350210, '119° 48\' 48.607560\"', 'PNG-3529 Station mark is in Mun. of Bani, Brgy. of Ranao, Sitio of Quitdalen. To reach the station, travel from Bani Town Proper to Sitio Mangga junction or to the road intersection going to Brgy. of Patar Mun. of Agno. Then turn right, continue travel SW direction follow the unpaved road, upon approaching the second road intersection at the E of waiting shed and rice mill, turn left until reaching Sitio Quitdalen. Station mark is located at the right side end of RCPC along the road going to Brgy. Patar, Agno. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3529, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.18644217, '16° 11\' 11.191810\"', 119.81350210, '119° 48\' 48.607390\"', 0.0000, '0', 182.3250, 0.0000, '4', 142.7573, 800843.09780, 1791619.01200, '50', 16.18807379, '16° 11\' 17.065650\"', 119.81217850, '119° 48\' 43.842560\"', 146.3420, 1790623.82900, 372978.72800, '3', 800703.14600, 1791688.63200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9860, 'PNG-3530', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'RANAO', 2008, 16.18639472, '16° 11\' 11.020992\"', 119.81669020, '119° 49\' 0.084720\"', 'PNG-3530 Station mark is in Mun. of Bani, Brgy. of Ranao, Sitio of Quitdalen. To reach the station, travel from Bani Town proper to Sitio Mangga junction or to the road intersection going to Brgy. of Patar Mun. of Agno. Then turn right, continue travel SW direction follow the unpaved road, upon approaching the second road intersection at the E of waiting shed and rice mill, turn left until reaching Sitio Quitdalen. Station mark is located E of Brgy. Road going to Brgy. Patar, and at the center of the uncultivated farm lot about NW of the house of Antonio de Guzman. About 40 m E of 3 Lomboy Tree. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3530, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.18639472, '16° 11\' 11.021000\"', 119.81669020, '119° 49\' 0.084690\"', 0.0000, '0', 182.2980, 0.0000, '4', 142.6919, 801184.30560, 1791618.43400, '50', 16.18802627, '16° 11\' 16.894580\"', 119.81536660, '119° 48\' 55.319870\"', 146.3070, 1790616.60200, 373319.66700, '3', 801044.35500, 1791688.04500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9861, 'PNG-3531', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'RANAO', 2008, 16.21238109, '16° 12\' 44.571924\"', 119.82351560, '119° 49\' 24.656160\"', 'PNG-3531 Station mark is in Mun. of Bani, Brgy. of Ranao Sitio of Mangga. To reach the station, travel from Bani Town Proper to Brgy. Ranao, Sitio of Mangga until reaching the second road junction, then turn right continue travel NE direction for about 600 m. Station is located at the side of the road intersection going to Brgy. Calabeng. It is located about 100 m W of concrete bongalow house. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3531, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.21238109, '16° 12\' 44.571940\"', 119.82351560, '119° 49\' 24.656150\"', 0.0000, '0', 177.8430, 0.0000, '4', 138.2445, 801875.04500, 1794505.95300, '50', 16.21401410, '16° 12\' 50.450770\"', 119.82219270, '119° 49\' 19.893550\"', 141.9150, 1793488.45200, 374066.20200, '3', 801735.17900, 1794575.56200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
