(9863, 'PNG-3533', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'TIEP', 2008, 16.23559040, '16° 14\' 8.125440\"', 119.86278260, '119° 51\' 46.017360\"', 'PNG-3533 Station mark is in Mun. of Bani, Brgy. of Tiep. It is located inside the compound of Tiep Nat\'l High School about 100 m from Bani-Bolinao Provincial Road, about 100 m E of Tiep Sports Complex. 10 m W of the main entrance of the school, and 3 m N of the second bldg. Station mark is intervisible to PNG-3540. Station is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3533, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.23559040, '16° 14\' 8.125430\"', 119.86278260, '119° 51\' 46.017300\"', 0.0000, '0', 165.4320, 0.0000, '4', 125.5564, 806040.29990, 1797134.26900, '50', 16.23722399, '16° 14\' 14.006350\"', 119.86146020, '119° 51\' 41.256800\"', 129.4790, 1796033.33900, 378279.52000, '3', 805900.53000, 1797203.77800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9864, 'PNG-3534', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'SAN MIGUEL', 2008, 16.20874296, '16° 12\' 31.474656\"', 119.93269570, '119° 55\' 57.704520\"', 'PNG-3534 From Alaminos City travel NW direction to Mun. of Bani until reaching Brgy. San Miguel, then turn right and continue travel to Brgy. Proper until the end of Brgy. Road for about 3 Km. then turn left and follow the rough road towards the center of rice fileds. Station mark is located 30 m E of a small pump house of the rice field. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3534, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.20874296, '16° 12\' 31.474650\"', 119.93269570, '119° 55\' 57.704680\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.6250, 0.0000, '4', 4.0523, 813562.26160, 1794267.03700, '50', 16.21037339, '16° 12\' 37.344210\"', 119.93137280, '119° 55\' 52.942130\"', 8.4210, 1793021.63500, 385739.10100, '3', 813422.45200, 1794336.32500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9865, 'PNG-3535', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'LUCAP', 2008, 16.19275734, '16° 11\' 33.926424\"', 120.00398320, '120° 0\' 14.339520\"', 'PNG-3535 Station mark is in the City of Alaminos, Brgy. of Lucap. From the City Proper travel NE direction towards Hundred Island Resort. Station mark is located NE corner of retaining wall. 10 m NE of \"Parola\" light house. About 40 m of boat dispatchers and the passenger waiting or loading area. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and set on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on top of retainaining wall with inscriptions, \"PNG-3535, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.19275734, '16° 11\' 33.926410\"', 120.00398320, '120° 0\' 14.339580\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.2230, 0.0000, '4', 5.0810, 179636.44590, 1792594.64600, '51', 16.19438522, '16° 11\' 39.786800\"', 120.00266000, '120° 0\' 9.575980\"', 9.7980, 1791213.95900, 393353.42800, '3', 179493.05700, 1792667.85100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
