(9867, 'PNG-3537', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'POGO', 2008, 16.16585454, '16° 9\' 57.076344\"', 119.95580030, '119° 57\' 20.881080\"', 'PNG-3537 Station mark is in the City of Alaminos, Brgy. of Pogo. From the City Proper travel NW direction to Brgy. of Pogo until reaching the school site. Station mark is located on the intersection or concrete walk way of the school 2 m N of Pogo Elem. School flag pole and about 60 m S of Alaminos-Bani Provincial Road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on a concrete of footing of flag pole. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3537, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.16585454, '16° 9\' 57.076340\"', 119.95580030, '119° 57\' 20.880910\"', 0.0000, '0', 61.6020, 0.0000, '4', 20.5678, 816102.80680, 1789552.99700, '50', 16.16748181, '16° 10\' 2.934520\"', 119.95447640, '119° 57\' 16.114860\"', 25.2120, 1788262.32700, 388185.48600, '3', 815962.88200, 1789622.18600, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
