(9872, 'PNG-3542', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'VIGA', 2008, 16.12710123, '16° 7\' 37.564428\"', 119.86915220, '119° 52\' 8.947920\"', 'PNG-3542 Station mark is in Mun. of Agno, Brgy. of Viga Sitio of Pangaw. To reach the station from Mabini Town Proper travel to the junction going to Bani then turn right follow asphalt road until reaching Brgy. Cabanatan Mun. of Mabini. At Cabanatan Brgy. Hall, turn left and follow Brgy. Road to Sitio Pangaw. Station mark is located at the right side of the road going to the Brgy. Proper for about 1 Km. and about 150 m SW of the residential area of Sitio Pangaw. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3542, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.12710123, '16° 7\' 37.564410\"', 119.86915220, '119° 52\' 8.947890\"', 0.0000, '0', 118.4680, 0.0000, '4', 78.0246, 806889.50580, 1785130.33100, '50', 16.12872798, '16° 7\' 43.420720\"', 119.86782730, '119° 52\' 4.178250\"', 82.1710, 1784022.60500, 378894.16000, '3', 806749.40700, 1785199.74800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9873, 'PNG-3543', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'DULACAC', 2008, 16.14051440, '16° 8\' 25.851840\"', 119.92421750, '119° 55\' 27.183000\"', 'PNG-3543 Station mark is in the City of Alaminos, Brgy. Dulacac. To reach the station from the City Proper travel SW direction towards Mabini, then turn right at the road junction going to Brgy. Dulacac. Then continue travel passing through Brgy. Amandiego and Brgy. Bisocol until reaching Brgy. Proper of Dulacac. Station mark is located inside the compound of Dulacac Elem. School. 5 m N of the school bldg. with \"Dulacac Elem. School\" sign board. About 25 m of Brgy. Hall. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3543, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.14051440, '16° 8\' 25.851830\"', 119.92421750, '119° 55\' 27.182890\"', 0.0000, '0', 66.1470, 0.0000, '4', 25.2147, 812762.61280, 1786698.53000, '50', 16.14214079, '16° 8\' 31.706830\"', 119.92289290, '119° 55\' 22.414570\"', 29.7570, 1785475.38000, 384792.76400, '3', 812622.59000, 1786767.79500, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9874, 'PNG-3544', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'DULACAC', 2008, 16.14176593, '16° 8\' 30.357348\"', 119.92442250, '119° 55\' 27.921000\"', 'PNG-3544 Station mark is in the City of Alaminos, Brgy. of Dulacac. To reach the station from the City Proper travel SW direction towards Mabini, then turn right at the road junction going to Brgy. Dulacac. Then continue travel passing through Brgy. Amandiego and Brgy. Bisocol until reaching Brgy. Proper of Dulacac. Station mark is located att he center of open ground about 100 m NE of Brgy. Hall 50 m N of the sharp curve Brgy. Road 30 m NE of abandoned rice mill and 5 m of the concrete pavement. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3544, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.14176593, '16° 8\' 30.357340\"', 119.92442250, '119° 55\' 27.921060\"', 0.0000, '0', 65.0750, 0.0000, '4', 24.1483, 812782.59180, 1786837.43500, '50', 16.14339239, '16° 8\' 36.212610\"', 119.92309800, '119° 55\' 23.152850\"', 28.6880, 1785613.77500, 384815.42500, '3', 812642.57300, 1786906.70000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9875, 'PNG-3545', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'TANAYTAY', 2008, 16.14487991, '16° 8\' 41.567676\"', 119.98799380, '119° 59\' 16.777680\"', 'PNG-3545 Station mark is in the City of Alaminos, Brgy. of Tanaytay. From the City Proper travel E direction towards Mun. of Sual until reaching Brgy. Tanytay. Station mark is located between the alignment of concrete road railings and left side of the diversion road going to Mun. of Mabini, 6 m E of the road center line 20 m N of the 10 m side creek. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3545, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.14487991, '16° 8\' 41.567660\"', 119.98799380, '119° 59\' 16.777610\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.6420, 0.0000, '4', 10.2492, 819582.06360, 1787279.98300, '50', 16.14650518, '16° 8\' 47.418630\"', 119.98666940, '119° 59\' 12.009920\"', 15.1100, 1785923.75300, 391617.28900, '3', 819442.09500, 1787349.06300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9876, 'PNG-3546', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'BOLANEY', 2008, 16.11776627, '16° 7\' 3.958572\"', 119.97917100, '119° 58\' 45.015600\"', 'PNG-3546 Station mark is in the City of Alaminos, Brgy. of Bolaney. To reach the station from the City Proper travel SW direction towards Mabini until reaching the Brgy. Proper then turn left follow the Brgy. Road going to the NIA Irrigation Canal. Station mark is located along the Brgy. Road, right side of the existing irrigation canal. 10 m left or W of two nipa hut. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3546, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.11776627, '16° 7\' 3.958570\"', 119.97917100, '119° 58\' 45.015440\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.8220, 0.0000, '4', 15.3135, 818681.10790, 1784263.64500, '50', 16.11939005, '16° 7\' 9.804180\"', 119.97784600, '119° 58\' 40.245430\"', 20.2290, 1782927.76400, 390658.59700, '3', 818541.05100, 1784332.73300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
