(9877, 'PNG-3547', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'BOLANEY', 2008, 16.11743972, '16° 7\' 2.782992\"', 119.97591910, '119° 58\' 33.308760\"', 'PNG-3547 Station mark is in the City of Alaminos, Brgy. of Bolaney. To reach the station from the City Proper travel SW direction towards Mabini until reaching the Brgy. Proper then turn left follow the Brgy. Road going to the NIA Irrigation Canal. about 50 m after the bridge turn left follow the road E direction until the dead end of the rough road. Station mark is located along the curve of irrigation canal, 6 m N of the dead end of the rough road. 6 m SW of electric post. About 50 m NE of the residential area. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3547, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.11743972, '16° 7\' 2.782990\"', 119.97591910, '119° 58\' 33.308710\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.1030, 0.0000, '4', 15.6161, 818333.51170, 1784222.45500, '50', 16.11906355, '16° 7\' 8.628790\"', 119.97459410, '119° 58\' 28.538660\"', 20.5180, 1782893.35900, 390310.52700, '3', 818193.45200, 1784291.55300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9878, 'PNG-3548', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'CAOAYAN', 2008, 16.08386244, '16° 5\' 1.904784\"', 120.05516480, '120° 3\' 18.593280\"', 'PNG-3548 Station mark is in Mun. of Sual, Brgy. of Cauayan. To reach the station, from Sual Town Proper travel NW direction towards Alaminos City until reaching Brgy. Cauayan. About 430 m before reaching the 500 Kilovolts Transco Transmission crossing the Provincial Road then turn right follow the foot trail until reaching 3 hills. Station mark is located on top of a hill SW and SE of another hill. About 100 m NE of residential area. And about 300 m NW of Sual to Alaminos City Provincial Road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3548, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.08386244, '16° 5\' 1.904790\"', 120.05516480, '120° 3\' 18.593220\"', 0.0000, '0', 132.3840, 0.0000, '4', 90.1870, 184940.98300, 1780456.33500, '51', 16.08548244, '16° 5\' 7.736780\"', 120.05383910, '120° 3\' 13.820730\"', 95.5050, 1779136.74100, 398771.16800, '3', 184797.26900, 1780529.27800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9879, 'PNG-3549', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'PAITAN EAST', 2008, 16.08404488, '16° 5\' 2.561568\"', 120.02784580, '120° 1\' 40.244880\"', 'PNG-3549 Station mark is in Mun. of Sual, Brgy. of Paitan East. To reach the station from Sual Town Proper travel NW direction towards Alaminos City for about 10 mins. until reaching Brgy. Paitan East. Station mark is located 8 m S of Provincial Road to Alaminos City. About 50 m SE of Paitan Bridge. Station is intervisible to PNG-71. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3549, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.08404488, '16° 5\' 2.561560\"', 120.02784580, '120° 1\' 40.244810\"', 0.0000, '0', 76.2350, 0.0000, '4', 34.1881, 182016.27200, 1780518.41900, '51', 16.08566550, '16° 5\' 8.395790\"', 120.02652010, '120° 1\' 35.472180\"', 39.4230, 1779170.56800, 395848.18900, '3', 181872.53500, 1780591.45300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9880, 'PNG-3550', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MABINI', 'POBLACION', 2008, 16.06907727, '16° 4\' 8.678172\"', 119.94138000, '119° 56\' 28.968000\"', 'PNG-3550 Station mark is in Mun. of Mabini, Brgy. of Poblacion. It is located at the roof top of Twinklers Day Care Center of Mabini. NW of Poblacion Brgy. Hall, SE of Mabini Public Market and NW of Roman Catholic Church. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on concrete roof top of waiting shed with inscriptions, \"PNG-3550, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.06907727, '16° 4\' 8.678170\"', 119.94138000, '119° 56\' 28.968140\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.8450, 0.0000, '4', 27.3897, 814712.37800, 1778813.76200, '50', 16.07069886, '16° 4\' 14.515880\"', 119.94005390, '119° 56\' 24.193880\"', 32.1970, 1777559.79300, 386587.89300, '3', 814572.14800, 1778882.92800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9881, 'PNG-3551', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'TAMBACAN', 2008, 16.07461415, '16° 4\' 28.610940\"', 119.89456930, '119° 53\' 40.449480\"', 'PNG-3551 Station mark is in Mun. of Burgos, Brgy. of Tambacan. From the Town Proper travel NE direction towards Mabini until reaching Brgy. Tambacan. Station mark is located at the Mun. Boundary arc, left side of Tambacan bridge with \"station 301+380\". About 600 m SW of the road junction going to Mabini and Agno-Bani. Station mark is the head of a 4 in.copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on a concrete deck of bridge. with inscriptions, \"PNG-3551, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07461415, '16° 4\' 28.610950\"', 119.89456930, '119° 53\' 40.449470\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.2180, 0.0000, '4', 14.2768, 809691.62720, 1779356.17500, '50', 16.07623711, '16° 4\' 34.453590\"', 119.89324320, '119° 53\' 35.675470\"', 18.7010, 1778198.90800, 381582.00400, '3', 809551.38300, 1779425.48300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9882, 'PNG-3552', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'SAN VICENTE', 2008, 16.06357492, '16° 3\' 48.869712\"', 119.86536700, '119° 51\' 55.321200\"', 'PNG-3552 Station mark is in Mun. of Burgos, Brgy. of San Vicente. To reach the station from the Town Proper travel N direction ot Brgy. Proper passing through Burgos Nat\'l High School. Then turn left follow the rough road until Brgy. San Vicente. Station mark is located N of the rice field, inside the farm lot of \"Nelee Braka\" 40 m SE of a single house, 50 m S of bamboo cluster and about 150 m NW of school site. Station mark is intervisible to PNG-80. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3552, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.06357492, '16° 3\' 48.869720\"', 119.86536700, '119° 51\' 55.321360\"', 0.0000, '0', 121.7750, 0.0000, '4', 81.1582, 806581.96530, 1778090.21400, '50', 16.06519782, '16° 3\' 54.712140\"', 119.86404070, '119° 51\' 50.546350\"', 85.2950, 1776994.16800, 378450.41400, '3', 806441.67000, 1778159.59900, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9883, 'PNG-3553', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'BANGAN-ODA', 2008, 16.10284697, '16° 6\' 10.249092\"', 119.83894240, '119° 50\' 20.192640\"', 'PNG-3553 Station mark is in Mun. of Agno, Brgy. of Labang. To reach the station, from Mabini Town Proper travel SW direction for about6.7 Km. until reaching the road junction or intersection going to Mun. of Agno, then turn right follow the road leading to Agno for about 7 Km. until reaching Brgy. Labang. Station mark is located at the right side of Provincial Road, 8 m from the center line of the road, SE of sharp curve sign board. About 200 m SE of the sharp curve and about 860 m SW of Bangan-Oda High School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on top of a RCPC with inscriptions, \"PNG-3553, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.10284697, '16° 6\' 10.249100\"', 119.83894240, '119° 50\' 20.192680\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.2430, 0.0000, '4', 7.0887, 803692.91900, 1782399.84700, '50', 16.10447290, '16° 6\' 16.102440\"', 119.83761690, '119° 50\' 15.420820\"', 10.9460, 1781356.33300, 375647.13400, '3', 803552.72500, 1782469.33900, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9884, 'PNG-3554', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'BANGAN-ODA', 2008, 16.10678851, '16° 6\' 24.438636\"', 119.83198700, '119° 49\' 55.153200\"', 'PNG-3554 Station mark is in Mun. of Agno, Brgy. of Labang. To reach the station, from Mabini Town Proper travel SW direction for about 6.7 Km. until reaching the road junction or intersection going to Mun. of Agno, then turn right follow the road leading to Agno for about 7.5 Km. until reaching Brgy. Labang. Station mark is located at the right side of first approach of Basaten Bridge. 168 m SE of Bangan-Oda High School and about 250 m SE of Agno-Bani road junction. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on a concrete deck of bridge. with inscriptions, \"PNG-3554, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.10678851, '16° 6\' 24.438630\"', 119.83198700, '119° 49\' 55.153140\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.5150, 0.0000, '4', 8.4626, 802942.36340, 1782826.06700, '50', 16.10841483, '16° 6\' 30.293390\"', 119.83066160, '119° 49\' 50.381580\"', 12.2460, 1781796.77900, 374905.42700, '3', 802802.17700, 1782895.58300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9885, 'PNG-3555', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'TUPA', 2008, 16.07258808, '16° 4\' 21.317088\"', 119.78689740, '119° 47\' 12.830640\"', 'PNG-3555 Station mark is in Mun. of Agno, Brgy. of Tupa, to reach the station, from the Town Proper travel to Brgy. Tupa reaching Brgy. Health Center, then turn right leading to Brgy. Proper or to Tupa Elem. School. Station mark is located inside the property of \"Ruel Notche\" approx. 150 m NE of Tupa Elem. School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in.copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3555, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07258808, '16° 4\' 21.317080\"', 119.78689740, '119° 47\' 12.830790\"', 0.0000, '0', 70.1590, 0.0000, '4', 30.6899, 798166.88310, 1778973.44700, '50', 16.07421326, '16° 4\' 27.167740\"', 119.78557120, '119° 47\' 8.056170\"', 33.8960, 1778039.56800, 370058.86200, '3', 798026.56200, 1779043.07200, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9886, 'PNG-3556', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'GAYUSAN', 2008, 16.05695443, '16° 3\' 25.035948\"', 119.78504640, '119° 47\' 6.167040\"', 'PNG-3556 Station mark is in Mun. of Agno, Brgy. of Gayusan. To reach the station from the Town Proper travel SW direction for about 7.7 Km. to Brgy. Gayusan passing through the road junction to Brgy. Tupa-Gayusan and Namatucan. Station mark is located 6 m right side of the concrete road going to Gayusan Brgy. Proper, about 280 m N of \"Don Guillermo O. Orbos Sports Complex\" and Gayusan Elem. School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3556, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.05695443, '16° 3\' 25.035930\"', 119.78504640, '119° 47\' 6.167190\"', 0.0000, '0', 78.1460, 0.0000, '4', 38.6874, 797992.01700, 1777239.71600, '50', 16.05857868, '16° 3\' 30.883250\"', 119.78371980, '119° 47\' 1.391250\"', 41.8400, 1776310.46900, 369850.57800, '3', 797851.64700, 1777309.33600, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9887, 'PNG-3557', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'SAPA GRANDE', 2008, 15.99476685, '15° 59\' 41.160660\"', 119.83342540, '119° 50\' 0.331440\"', 'PNG-3557 Station mark is in Mun. of Burgos, Brgy. of Sapa Grande. To reach the station from the Town Proper travel SW direction for about 8.5 Km. until reaching Brgy. Sapa Grande then turn right leading the school site. Station mark is located at the open ground NW of Sapa Grande Elem. School, about 85 m NW of school stage. It is intervisible to PNG-3037. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3557, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99476685, '15° 59\' 41.160660\"', 119.83342540, '119° 50\' 0.331540\"', 0.0000, '0', 82.4940, 0.0000, '4', 42.2149, 803266.08750, 1770423.97900, '50', 15.99638618, '15° 59\' 46.990260\"', 119.83209740, '119° 49\' 55.550570\"', 45.8840, 1769398.01500, 374989.15900, '3', 803125.56000, 1770493.41300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
