(9894, 'PNG-3564', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'ULI', 2008, 15.96096439, '15° 57\' 39.471804\"', 119.81816520, '119° 49\' 5.394720\"', 'PNG-3564 Station mark is in Mun. of Dasol, Brgy. of Uli. From the Town Proper of Dasol, travel NW along Nat\'l Highway towards Burgos until reaching the road junction going to Brgy. Bobonot, turn left follow the road until reaching Y road intersection then turn left until reaching Brgy. Uli Proper. Station mark is located on top of small hill N of the rice field area. 40 m NE of concrete bongalow house. 100 m N of Roman Catholic Chapel or N of Brgy. Road. About 220 m NW of Uli Elem. School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3564, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.96096439, '15° 57\' 39.471810\"', 119.81816520, '119° 49\' 5.394810\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.0910, 0.0000, '4', 8.0310, 801682.35330, 1766658.85100, '50', 15.96258197, '15° 57\' 45.295090\"', 119.81683640, '119° 49\' 0.610900\"', 11.4160, 1765666.24400, 373334.17200, '3', 801541.71100, 1766728.30700, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9895, 'PNG-3565', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'ULI', 2008, 15.95480249, '15° 57\' 17.288964\"', 119.86710530, '119° 52\' 1.579080\"', 'PNG-3565 Station mark is in Mun. of Dasol, Brgy. of Amalbalan, to reach the station from the Town Proper travel SW direction for about 3.8 Km. until reaching the salt production area of Brgy. Amalbalan or about 40 m before the road junction going to the Mun. Sanitary Landfill then turn right follow the road until reaching the rock salt stock house. Station mark is located 6 m NE of roack salt stock house. 10 m SE of house. It is located inside the roack salt production owned by Formerly Mayor Espinosa. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.95480249, '15° 57\' 17.288960\"', 119.86710530, '119° 52\' 1.579190\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.4530, 0.0000, '4', 4.6383, 806934.45310, 1766048.11300, '50', 15.95641861, '15° 57\' 23.106990\"', 119.86577640, '119° 51\' 56.794960\"', 8.6410, 1764955.02800, 378570.42200, '3', 806793.82400, 1766117.42000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
