(9904, 'PNG-3574', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LABRADOR', 'UYONG', 2008, 16.05009613, '16° 3\' 0.346068\"', 120.12215080, '120° 7\' 19.742880\"', 'PNG-3574 Station mark is in Mun. of Labrador, Brgy. Uyong. To reach the station from the Town Proper travel NW direction to Brgy. Uyong for about 3.7 Km. until reaching the school site. Station mark is located inside the compound of Uyong Elem. School, bet. the Sen. Alberto Romulo Bdlg. and the concrete pavement. 9 m NE of the concrete pavement. About 30 m SW of the Lingayen Gulf. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3574, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.05009613, '16° 3\' 0.346070\"', 120.12215080, '120° 7\' 19.742950\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.2880, 0.0000, '4', 5.6506, 192060.79090, 1776616.20300, '51', 16.05171258, '16° 3\' 6.165300\"', 120.12082440, '120° 7\' 14.967850\"', 11.1450, 1775368.17300, 405922.48600, '3', 191917.01500, 1776688.90000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
