(9906, 'PNG-3576', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LABRADOR', 'DULIG', 2008, 16.00204830, '16° 0\' 7.373880\"', 120.17063340, '120° 10\' 14.280240\"', 'PNG-3576 Station mark is in Mun. of Labrador, Brgy. of Santiago. From the Town Proper travel SE direction to the road junction to Bugallon and Lingayen for about 2.6 Km., turn left until reaching the steel waiting shed of Brgy. Santiago then turn left towards the fish pond area. Station mark is located at the middle corner of the L shape fish pond, 20 m N of the residential area, and about 150 m N of the Nat\'l Road to Lingayen Proper. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3576, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.00204830, '16° 0\' 7.373880\"', 120.17063340, '120° 10\' 14.280170\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.4010, 0.0000, '4', 4.4958, 197179.61760, 1771224.32700, '51', 16.00366071, '16° 0\' 13.178540\"', 120.16930590, '120° 10\' 9.501240\"', 9.9960, 1770029.47800, 411089.35400, '3', 197035.71900, 1771296.82600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9907, 'PNG-3577', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LABRADOR', 'DULIG', 2008, 15.99991396, '15° 59\' 59.690256\"', 120.18002940, '120° 10\' 48.105840\"', 'PNG-3577 Station mark is in Mun. of Labrador, Brgy. of Santiago. From the Town Proper travel sE direction to the road junction to Bugallon and Lingyen for about 2.6 Km., then turn left continue travel until reaching the sharp curve going left direction until reaching the Estanza Bridge. Station mark is located at the NW corner of Estanza Bridge S of the sign board. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on a concrete deck of bridge with inscriptions, \"PNG-3577, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99991396, '15° 59\' 59.690250\"', 120.18002940, '120° 10\' 48.105890\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.9050, 0.0000, '4', 9.0025, 198182.73830, 1770974.30600, '51', 16.00152602, '16° 0\' 5.493680\"', 120.17870190, '120° 10\' 43.326820\"', 14.4700, 1769789.26300, 412094.14900, '3', 198038.84000, 1771046.77200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
