(9915, 'PNG-3585', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'NIÑOY', 2008, 15.85982153, '15° 51\' 35.357508\"', 120.24638410, '120° 14\' 46.982760\"', 'PNG-3585 Station mark is in Mun. of Aguilar, Brgy. of Banaybayan. From the Town Proper travel S direction for about 2.8 Km. towards Mangataren until reaching the road intersection to Brgy. Banaybayan then trun right continue travel for about 400. Station mark is located left side or E of the road between the concrete railings, about 350 m SW of the road intersection to Brgy. Sagor. Station mark is the head of a 4 in.copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on top of lower level of a concrete railings with inscription, \"PNG-3585, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.85982153, '15° 51\' 35.357510\"', 120.24638410, '120° 14\' 46.982880\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.7380, 0.0000, '4', 15.2641, 205084.54670, 1755367.49900, '51', 15.86142340, '15° 51\' 41.124240\"', 120.24505340, '120° 14\' 42.192290\"', 20.7210, 1754259.34200, 419140.23300, '3', 204940.23000, 1755439.62800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
