(9916, 'PNG-3586', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'BOCACLIW', 2008, 15.85561203, '15° 51\' 20.203308\"', 120.25361710, '120° 15\' 13.021560\"', 'PNG-3586 Station mark is in Mun. of Aguilar, Brgy. Bocacliw. From the Town Proper travel S direction towards Mangatarem until reaching Brgy. Bocacliw. Station mark is located along the Nat\'l Road to Mangatarem at SW corner of the bridge. About 600 m NW of Bocacliw Elem. School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flusdhed on a concrete birdge with inscription, \"PNG-3586, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.85561203, '15° 51\' 20.203320\"', 120.25361710, '120° 15\' 13.021600\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.0510, 0.0000, '4', 10.5776, 205853.60640, 1754891.24000, '51', 15.85721348, '15° 51\' 25.968530\"', 120.25228630, '120° 15\' 8.230690\"', 16.0040, 1753790.72300, 419913.29900, '3', 205709.28100, 1754963.34200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9917, 'PNG-3587', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'BAYAOAS', 2008, 15.84186399, '15° 50\' 30.710364\"', 120.26041480, '120° 15\' 37.493280\"', 'PNG-3587 Station mark is in Mun. of Mangatarem, Brgy. of Bayaoas, from the Town Proper travel N direction towards Aguilar for about 7 Km. until reaching Brgy. Bayaoas then continue travel until reaching Bayaoas Bridge with station 183+780. Station mark is located along the Nat\'l Road to Aguilar in between the Eucalyptus Tree. About 700 m N of Bayaoas Bridge and about 300 m NW of the Gasoline Station. It is intervisible to PNG-3030. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3587, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.84186399, '15° 50\' 30.710350\"', 120.26041480, '120° 15\' 37.493210\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.1460, 0.0000, '4', 14.6297, 206562.24190, 1753359.50200, '51', 15.84346443, '15° 50\' 36.471930\"', 120.25908370, '120° 15\' 32.701160\"', 20.0420, 1752266.75800, 420636.01700, '3', 206417.87600, 1753431.57000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9918, 'PNG-3588', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'POGON-LOMBOY', 2008, 15.78813061, '15° 47\' 17.270196\"', 120.30087290, '120° 18\' 3.142440\"', 'PNG-3588 Station mark is in Mun. of Mangatarem, Brgy. of Pogonlomboy. From the Town Proper travel S direction towards San Clemente Tarlac for about 600 m until reaching the Mystical Rose College of Science and Technology. Then turn left continue travel for about 350 m. Station mark is located right side of concrete Brgy. Road to Brgy. Pogonlomboy, 8 m S or from the centerline. About 900 m SE of the Mun. Hall of Mangatarem. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered ona 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3588, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.78813061, '15° 47\' 17.270210\"', 120.30087290, '120° 18\' 3.142440\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.7100, 0.0000, '4', 15.0544, 210822.05240, 1747354.03600, '51', 15.78972680, '15° 47\' 23.016480\"', 120.29954060, '120° 17\' 58.346050\"', 20.3460, 1746305.68800, 424949.97500, '3', 210677.53900, 1747425.92600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9919, 'PNG-3589', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'BOGTONG BOLO', 2008, 15.74823658, '15° 44\' 53.651688\"', 120.32783070, '120° 19\' 40.190520\"', 'PNG-3589 Station mark is in Mun. of Mangatarem, Brgy. of Bogtong Bolo. From Mangatarem Town Proper travel S direction towards San Clemente Province of Tarlac for about 5.7 Km. until reaching Godoy Bridge. Station mark is located along the Nat\'l Road at the NE corner of Godoy Bridge. About 500 m S of Bañaga bridge and about 800 m S of the school site. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on a concrete deck of bridge with inscriptions, \"PNG-3589, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.74823658, '15° 44\' 53.651680\"', 120.32783070, '120° 19\' 40.190350\"', 0.0000, '0', 60.6560, 0.0000, '4', 16.8822, 213656.02660, 1742900.26900, '51', 15.74982967, '15° 44\' 59.386820\"', 120.32649740, '120° 19\' 35.390710\"', 22.1080, 1741881.59900, 427824.25200, '3', 213511.40100, 1742972.03700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9920, 'PNG-3590', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'OLO CAGARLITAN', 2008, 15.77661481, '15° 46\' 35.813316\"', 120.33724190, '120° 20\' 14.070840\"', 'PNG-3590 Station mark is in Mun. of Mangatarem, Brgy. of Cagarlitan. From the Town Proper travel SE direction until reaching \"Olo Elem. School\", then turn left towards Brgy. Cacamposan and Olo Cagarlitan until reaching the Brgy. Proper. Continue travel to Olo Cagarlitan Brgy. Hall. Turn left continue travel E direction for about 1.5 Km. Station mark is located 100 m S of a NIA Irrigation Canal Culvert about 1.5 Km. W of Brgy. Hall. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3590, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.77661481, '15° 46\' 35.813330\"', 120.33724190, '120° 20\' 14.070670\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.1870, 0.0000, '4', 12.6462, 214704.82920, 1746029.39300, '51', 15.77820948, '15° 46\' 41.554130\"', 120.33590930, '120° 20\' 9.273470\"', 17.7010, 1745018.65600, 428842.80100, '3', 214560.30700, 1746101.15500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9921, 'PNG-3591', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'OLO CAGARLITAN', 2008, 15.77800878, '15° 46\' 40.831608\"', 120.33735230, '120° 20\' 14.468280\"', 'PNG-3591 Station mark is in Mun. of Mangatarem, Brgy. Olo Cagarlitan. To reach the station from the Town Proper travel SE direction towards Brgy. Proper until reaching Old Cagarlitan Elem. School. Intersection, then turn left towards Brgy. Old Cagarlitan and Cacamposan until reaching boundary welcome arc of Brgy. Cacamposan then continue travel until Old Cagarlitan Brgy. Hall. Then from Brgy. Hall travel E direction for about 1.5 Km. Station mark is located at the S corner of a culvert and W of the road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty flushed on top of a box culvert with inscriptions, \"PNG-3591, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.77800878, '15° 46\' 40.831590\"', 120.33735230, '120° 20\' 14.468420\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.6790, 0.0000, '4', 12.1474, 214718.62590, 1746183.57600, '51', 15.77960353, '15° 46\' 46.572690\"', 120.33601980, '120° 20\' 9.671330\"', 17.1970, 1745172.87100, 428855.13000, '3', 214574.10800, 1746255.33800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9922, 'PNG-3592', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BAYAMBANG', 'MALIOER', 2008, 15.78497643, '15° 47\' 5.915148\"', 120.38069350, '120° 22\' 50.496600\"', 'PNG-3592 Station mark is in Mun. of Bayambang, Brgy. of Malioer. To reach the station, from the Town Proper of Urbiztondo travel towards Brgy. Galarin for about 5.3 Km. until reaching the road junction fronting Brgy. Hall, take the middle road and continue travel for about 3 Km. to reach the Brgy. Malioer. Station mark is located at the NE corner of a fish pond. About 100 m SW of Caturay-Pangdel Brgy. Road. About 500 m NW of PNG-3024. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3592, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.78497643, '15° 47\' 5.915160\"', 120.38069350, '120° 22\' 50.496450\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.6580, 0.0000, '4', 11.4575, 219374.67610, 1746896.69700, '51', 15.78657067, '15° 47\' 11.654400\"', 120.37936120, '120° 22\' 45.700150\"', 16.0920, 1745929.62900, 433501.54700, '3', 219230.21800, 1746968.32400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9923, 'PNG-3593', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'URBIZTONDO', 'POBLACION', 2008, 15.82448134, '15° 49\' 28.132824\"', 120.32747560, '120° 19\' 38.912160\"', 'PNG-3593 Station mark is in Mun. of Urbiztondo, Brgy. of Poblacion. It is located along Velasquez Street. About 230 m N of Paaralang Central ng Urbiztondo. About 210 m N of PNG-3028. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3593, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.82448134, '15° 49\' 28.132840\"', 120.32747560, '120° 19\' 38.912070\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.8520, 0.0000, '4', 10.5262, 213725.15190, 1751342.23100, '51', 15.82607922, '15° 49\' 33.885200\"', 120.32614410, '120° 19\' 34.118860\"', 15.5320, 1750318.83900, 427813.38900, '3', 213580.78300, 1751414.06500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9924, 'PNG-3594', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'BUNLALACAO', 2008, 15.82604881, '15° 49\' 33.775716\"', 120.28958870, '120° 17\' 22.519320\"', 'PNG-3594 Station mark is in Mun. of Mangatarem, Brgy. of Bunlalacao. From the Town Proper travel NW direction towards Mun. of Aguilar until reaching the road junction or M-HI refuelling station. Turn right continue travel towards Brgy. Bunlalacao for about 2 Km. Station mark is located along the Brgy. Road, 7 m from the road centerline about 75 m E of the waiting shed. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3594, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.82604881, '15° 49\' 33.775720\"', 120.28958870, '120° 17\' 22.519190\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.9690, 0.0000, '4', 9.4747, 209666.45440, 1751567.83700, '51', 15.82764762, '15° 49\' 39.531430\"', 120.28825720, '120° 17\' 17.725940\"', 14.7460, 1750505.77100, 423755.17800, '3', 209522.05900, 1751639.79600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9925, 'PNG-3595', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'BUNLALACAO', 2008, 15.82165364, '15° 49\' 17.953104\"', 120.29110890, '120° 17\' 27.992040\"', 'PNG-3595 Station mark is in Mun. of Mangatarem, Brgy. of Bunlalacao. From the Town Proper travel NW direction towards Mun. of Aguilar until reaching the road junction or M-HI refueling station. Turn right continue travel towards Brgy. Bunlalacao for about 2 Km. until reaching the waiting shed. Turn right travel S direction for about 250 m. Station mark is located along the road on top of the SE corner of a culvert. About 250 m S of waiting shed. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and drilled on a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty fushed on top of a box culvert with inscriptions, \"PNG-3595, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.82165364, '15° 49\' 17.953090\"', 120.29110890, '120° 17\' 27.991930\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.9920, 0.0000, '4', 9.4789, 209823.12130, 1751079.10600, '51', 15.82325214, '15° 49\' 23.707700\"', 120.28977730, '120° 17\' 23.198310\"', 14.7530, 1750018.84900, 423916.38000, '3', 209678.71200, 1751151.05700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9926, 'PNG-3596', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'GUELEW', 2008, 15.86348382, '15° 51\' 48.541752\"', 120.29747160, '120° 17\' 50.897760\"', 'PNG-3596 Station mark is in Mun. of san Carlos. Begy. of Guelew. From the town Proper travel S direction going to Mun. of Urbiztondo, until reaching the road intersection to Brgy. Guelew, turn right then travel W direction until reaching the Guelew Elem. School, then contine travel about 200 m until reaching the dike, turn right then travel about 500 m N direction until reaching the waiting shed. Station mark is located at the levee of confield. Station mark is the head of a 4 in.copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3596, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.86348382, '15° 51\' 48.541740\"', 120.29747160, '120° 17\' 50.897860\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.8020, 0.0000, '4', 9.5299, 210564.81620, 1755701.68500, '51', 15.86508479, '15° 51\' 54.305260\"', 120.29614110, '120° 17\' 46.107800\"', 14.6720, 1754645.44500, 424613.66100, '3', 210420.55300, 1755773.65100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9927, 'PNG-3598', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'CAOAYAN-KILING', 2008, 15.85565453, '15° 51\' 20.356308\"', 120.32465690, '120° 19\' 28.764840\"', 'PNG-3598 Station mark is in the City of San Carlos, Brgy. of Caoayan-kiling from the City Hall of San Carlos, travel along the Nat\'l Road towards Mun. of Urbiztondo, until reacing the Brgy. Plaza of Caoayan-kiling. Station mark is located at the levee of rice field and about 150 m E of Brgy. Caoayan-kiling Plaza. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3598, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.85565453, '15° 51\' 20.356320\"', 120.32465690, '120° 19\' 28.764880\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.7530, 0.0000, '4', 8.5713, 213467.05570, 1754797.45400, '51', 15.85725442, '15° 51\' 26.115920\"', 120.32332620, '120° 19\' 23.974280\"', 13.5340, 1753769.40700, 427522.62800, '3', 213322.78900, 1754869.32500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9928, 'PNG-3599', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'APONIT', 2008, 15.89264091, '15° 53\' 33.507276\"', 120.28440080, '120° 17\' 3.842880\"', 'PNG-3599 Station mark is in the City of San Carlos, Brgy. of Aponit. From the Town Proper travel W direction for about 2.7 Km. towards Mun. of Urbiztondo, until reaching the Heave Bound Bible Baptist Church, turn right then travel W direction until reaching the road intersection going to Brgy. Tamayo, turn left then travel about 30 m S direction. Station mark is located at the E side on top of a culvert and about 30 m S of waiting shed. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a culvert with inscriptions, \"PNG-3599, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89264091, '15° 53\' 33.507280\"', 120.28440080, '120° 17\' 3.843030\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.2140, 0.0000, '4', 7.0300, 209205.95980, 1758948.06400, '51', 15.89424400, '15° 53\' 39.278400\"', 120.28307090, '120° 16\' 59.055370\"', 12.2040, 1757876.75000, 423224.78000, '3', 209061.78400, 1759020.09800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9929, 'PNG-36', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGALDAN', 'EMBARCADERO', 1996, 16.07249709, '16° 4\' 20.989524\"', 120.41962760, '120° 25\' 10.659360\"', 'PNG-36 Is situated at Brgy. Embarcadero, Mangaldan, Pangasinan. It is located on top of the S sidewalk of Malong Bridge, about 270 m. SW of station PNG-37 at the N portion cast in place concrete structure leading to San Jacinto, Pangasinan. Station mark is the head of 4\" copper nail embedded in a drilled hole with inscription on the cement putty \"PNG-36 1996 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07249709, '16° 4\' 20.989530\"', 120.41962760, '120° 25\' 10.659400\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.4168, 0.0000, '3', 13.6959, 223942.10920, 1778676.46200, '51', 16.07410843, '16° 4\' 26.790350\"', 120.41830210, '120° 25\' 5.887510\"', 17.6207, 1777734.11100, 437762.66800, '3', 223798.64900, 1778748.21000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9930, 'PNG-3600', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'SALINAP', 2008, 15.89081167, '15° 53\' 26.922012\"', 120.28056080, '120° 16\' 50.018880\"', 'PNG-3600 Station mark is in the City of San Carlos, Brgy. San Carlos, Brgy. of Salinap. From the City Proper travel W direction for about 2.7 Km. to Mun. of Urbiztondo until reaching the Heave Bound Bible Baptist Church, turn right then travel W direction until reaching the Brgy. Salinap Boundary Welcome Arc, continue travel until reaching the road intersection, turn left then continue travel for about 100 m. Station mark is located about 80 m S of waiting shed and about 300 m SW of Brgy. Salinap Boundary Welcome Arc. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument with a projection of 20 cm above the ground surface with inscriptions,\"PNG-3600, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89081167, '15° 53\' 26.922020\"', 120.28056080, '120° 16\' 50.018820\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.5180, 0.0000, '4', 7.3116, 208791.85720, 1758750.87900, '51', 15.89241473, '15° 53\' 32.693030\"', 120.27923080, '120° 16\' 45.231000\"', 12.5110, 1757675.74800, 422812.83200, '3', 208647.67300, 1758822.92400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
