(9952, 'PNG-3627', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BASISTA', 'DUMPAY', 2008, 15.88722654, '15° 53\' 14.015544\"', 120.38655610, '120° 23\' 11.601960\"', 'PNG-3627 Station mark is in Mun. of Basista, Brgy. of Dumpay. From Town Proper travel NW direction to San Carlos City until reaching the Dumpay National High School, then continue travel of about 1 Km. until reaching the T intersection, turn right then travel about 200 m. Station mark is located at the levee of rice field about 20 m N of rough road and about 200 m NE of Nat\'l Road intersection. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail cenetered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3627, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.88722654, '15° 53\' 14.015560\"', 120.38655610, '120° 23\' 11.601940\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.0560, 0.0000, '4', 10.4064, 220144.16200, 1758209.13800, '51', 15.88882705, '15° 53\' 19.777380\"', 120.38522620, '120° 23\' 6.814310\"', 14.7820, 1757242.53700, 434163.11400, '3', 220000.05300, 1758280.83400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9953, 'PNG-3628', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'DON PEDRO', 2008, 15.88282511, '15° 52\' 58.170396\"', 120.43030360, '120° 25\' 49.092960\"', 'PNG-3628 Station mark is in Mun. of Malsiqui, Brgy. of Don Pedro. From Town Proper take the road leading to Mun. of Bayambang and travel S for about 3 Km. to Brgy. Don Pedro. Station mark is located at the land property of Emiteria De Guzman and about 140 M SW of San Antonio De Padua Chapel. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3628, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.88282511, '15° 52\' 58.170400\"', 120.43030360, '120° 25\' 49.093030\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.3000, 0.0000, '4', 12.9446, 224825.51130, 1757663.78400, '51', 15.88442438, '15° 53\' 3.927760\"', 120.42897370, '120° 25\' 44.305220\"', 16.9070, 1756742.10500, 438846.89400, '3', 224681.42300, 1757735.33300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9954, 'PNG-3629', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'BALITE SUR', 2008, 15.87405888, '15° 52\' 26.611968\"', 120.35883900, '120° 21\' 31.820400\"', 'PNG-3629 Station mark is in City of San Carlos, Brgy. of Balite Sur. From City Proper travel about 5.5 Km. E direction to Mun. of Basista until reaching the Basista boundary welcome arc, turn right then travel about 250 m S direction until reaching the welcome arc of Brgy. Mapolopolo, turn right then travel about 2.3 Km. W direction to brgy. Balite Sur, until reaching the Balite Sur Bridge. Station mark is located at the Balite Sur Bridge and approx. 20 m NW of waiting shed. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and set on a center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a bridge. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3629, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.87405888, '15° 52\' 26.611980\"', 120.35883900, '120° 21\' 31.820420\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.2280, 0.0000, '4', 10.3341, 217155.93630, 1756788.60100, '51', 15.87565917, '15° 52\' 32.373020\"', 120.35750880, '120° 21\' 27.031540\"', 14.9820, 1755794.40500, 431190.24300, '3', 217011.76000, 1756860.37600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
