(9987, 'PNG-3662', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'CALBUEG', 2008, 15.93981649, '15° 56\' 23.339364\"', 120.46076670, '120° 27\' 38.760120\"', 'PNG-3662 Station mark is in Mun. of Malasiqui, Brgy. of Calbueg, Sitio of Dapitilog. To reach the station, from Urdaneta City Proper travel W direction to Sta. Barbara until reaching Brgy. Minien East, turn left passing through Brgy. Asin East and West until reaching Brgy. Calbueg boundary welcome arc, then turn left follow access road to Sitio Irrigation, upon approaching residential area, turn right follow the trail to Sitio Dapitilog. station mark is located along the trail to Sitio Dapitilog, 30 m NE of residential house with piggery, 25 m E of two Bamboo Tree, and about 40 m NE of single Anahaw Tree. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3662, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.93981649, '15° 56\' 23.339350\"', 120.46076670, '120° 27\' 38.760150\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.2980, 0.0000, '4', 14.3646, 228166.18090, 1763933.24800, '51', 15.94141864, '15° 56\' 29.107120\"', 120.45943810, '120° 27\' 33.977300\"', 18.0020, 1763039.87700, 442125.83300, '3', 228022.30900, 1764004.74700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9988, 'PNG-3663', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'CALBUEG', 2008, 15.94065921, '15° 56\' 26.373156\"', 120.46359380, '120° 27\' 48.937680\"', 'PNG-3663 Station mark is in Mun. of Malasiqui, Brgy. of Calbueg, Sitio of Irrigation. To reach the station, from Urdaneta City Proper travel W direction upon reaching Brgy. Minien East turn left then continue travel to Brgy. Calbueg, passing through Brgy. Asin East and West until reaching the Calbueg boundary welcome arc then turn left follow the access road of NIA lateral canal irrigation until reaching Sitio Irrigation. Station mark is located at the left embankment of downstream canal, about 80 m NE of residential area and about 250 m E of residential area of Sitio Dapitilog. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3663, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.94065921, '15° 56\' 26.373160\"', 120.46359380, '120° 27\' 48.937630\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.9440, 0.0000, '4', 16.0279, 228470.13360, 1764022.85700, '51', 15.94226136, '15° 56\' 32.140900\"', 120.46226520, '120° 27\' 44.154870\"', 19.6440, 1763132.34200, 442428.75900, '3', 228326.26700, 1764094.34800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9989, 'PNG-3664', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA BARBARA', 'MINIEN EAST', 2008, 15.96757602, '15° 58\' 3.273672\"', 120.48777220, '120° 29\' 15.979920\"', 'png-3664 Station mark is in Mun. of Sta. Barbara, Brgy. of Minien East. To reach the station, from Urdaneta City travel to Sta. Barbara until reaching the road intersection to Brgy. Lunec Malasiqui, continue travel until reaching Y road intersection going to Brgy. Lunec and Asin, then turn right. Station mark is located about 30 m S of the road to Brgy. Asin and 100 m W of Y intersection, about 200 m NW of Brgy. Lunec boundary Lunec welcome arc. station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3664, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.96757602, '15° 58\' 3.273680\"', 120.48777220, '120° 29\' 15.980020\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.4450, 0.0000, '4', 27.7212, 231095.86940, 1766971.32200, '51', 15.96917932, '15° 58\' 9.045550\"', 120.48644430, '120° 29\' 11.199650\"', 31.1670, 1766104.30000, 445024.83500, '3', 230952.11400, 1767042.75700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9990, 'PNG-3665', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'POTIOCAN', 2008, 15.95531040, '15° 57\' 19.117440\"', 120.42950630, '120° 25\' 46.222680\"', 'PNG-3665 Station mark is in Mun. of Malasiqui, Brgy. of Potiocan. It is located along the boundary of farm lot of Mr. Pabling Samson and Mr. Cabatbat, about 300 m SE of Brgy. Potiocan Proper and about 800 m SW of Brgy. Cablong, Sta. Barbara, and 1 Km. N of 500 KV Transco Transmission Line. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3665, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.95531040, '15° 57\' 19.117430\"', 120.42950630, '120° 25\' 46.222580\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.7800, 0.0000, '4', 10.7151, 224838.89200, 1765689.59700, '51', 15.95691421, '15° 57\' 24.891160\"', 120.42817800, '120° 25\' 41.440890\"', 14.6060, 1764763.40400, 438783.64200, '3', 224695.04700, 1765761.21200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9991, 'PNG-3666', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MALASIQUI', 'POTIOCAN', 2008, 15.95705146, '15° 57\' 25.385256\"', 120.42801920, '120° 25\' 40.869120\"', 'PNG-3666 Station amrk is in Mun. of Malasiqui, Brgy. of Potiocan. It is located at ricefield, 150 m E of Brgy. Proper, 30 m SE of local cooperative electric line. 50 m E of zigzag road going to Cablong Sta. Barbara. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3666, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.95705146, '15° 57\' 25.385240\"', 120.42801920, '120° 25\' 40.869030\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.8610, 0.0000, '4', 10.7942, 224681.99300, 1765884.31400, '51', 15.95865541, '15° 57\' 31.159470\"', 120.42669100, '120° 25\' 36.087480\"', 14.6970, 1764956.50700, 438624.97100, '3', 224538.15300, 1765955.93500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(9992, 'PNG-3667', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA BARBARA', 'CARUSOCAN', 2008, 15.98003231, '15° 58\' 48.116316\"', 120.44783930, '120° 26\' 52.221480\"', 'PNG-3667 Station mark is in Mun. of Sta. Barbara, Brgy. of Carusocan. To reach the station, from Town Proper travel E direction to Brgy. Matic-matic then turn right to Brgy Carusocan. Station mark is located on the left side 4 m of the road centerline, 4 m N corner of the 12 m concrete bridge, and about 50 m S of Brgy. Carusocan boundary welcome arc. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and set on the center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a concrete pavement. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3667, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.98003231, '15° 58\' 48.116310\"', 120.44783930, '120° 26\' 52.221590\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.5850, 0.0000, '4', 14.7097, 226836.04610, 1768402.36200, '51', 15.98163726, '15° 58\' 53.894140\"', 120.44651170, '120° 26\' 47.442080\"', 18.4420, 1767493.73800, 440753.67500, '3', 226692.29900, 1768473.93800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
