(9995, 'PNG-3670', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA BARBARA', 'MANINGDING', 2008, 15.99242644, '15° 59\' 32.735184\"', 120.40977860, '120° 24\' 35.202960\"', 'PNG-3670 Station mark is in Mun. of Sta. Barbara, Brgy. of Maningding, Sitio of Sapang, from Town Proper travel E direction to the road junction going to Calasiao and Urdaneta City, about 300 m before approaching the junction, turn right at the Sitio Abalatin waiting shed infront of Jesus Christ Church, follow the road then turn left and continue travel until reaching Sitio Sapang. Station mark is located at the intersection of concrete farm ditch 50 m E of the end of the rough road and about 150 m W of the 230 KV transco transmission line. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3670, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99242644, '15° 59\' 32.735190\"', 120.40977860, '120° 24\' 35.202800\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.5000, 0.0000, '4', 9.4633, 222777.05150, 1769824.92000, '51', 15.99403300, '15° 59\' 38.518810\"', 120.40845120, '120° 24\' 30.424150\"', 13.4860, 1768876.56000, 436683.39200, '3', 222633.31500, 1769896.63000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
