(9997, 'PNG-3672', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGALDAN', 'ALITAYA', 2008, 16.02862331, '16° 1\' 43.043916\"', 120.40216590, '120° 24\' 7.797240\"', 'PNG-3672 Station mark is in. Mun. of Mangaldan, Brgy. of Alitaya Melag. From Town Proper travel about 4.5 Km. S direction until reaching the intersection going to Brgy. Alitaya Melag, turn right to Brgy. Alitaya Melag then travel about 1 Km. W direction until reaching the ricemill, turn right and follow the road about 600 m NW direction until reaching the NIA Irrigation then turn right and travel about 50 m. Station mark is located about 15 m E of residential house of Saturnino Fabia and 1 m of concrete dump irrigation. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. ocpper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3672, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.02862331, '16° 1\' 43.043920\"', 120.40216590, '120° 24\' 7.797390\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.1950, 0.0000, '4', 7.2528, 222011.97230, 1773842.51000, '51', 16.03023229, '16° 1\' 48.836260\"', 120.40083940, '120° 24\' 3.021750\"', 11.3080, 1772884.42800, 435880.19200, '3', 221868.35100, 1773914.27600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
