(10005, 'PNG-3681', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SISON', 'AGAT', 2008, 16.20761446, '16° 12\' 27.412056\"', 120.51129730, '120° 30\' 40.670280\"', 'PNG-3681 Station mark is in Mun. of Sison, Brgy. of Agat. From Town Proper travel N and NW direction towards the Province of La Union until reaching Brgy. Agat or approaching the long bridge. Station mark is located along the road, 12 m SE of long boundary bridge of La Union and Pangasinan, 12 m NE of giant billboard of digetel and purina. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3681, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.20761446, '16° 12\' 27.412060\"', 120.51129730, '120° 30\' 40.670450\"', 0.0000, '0', 184.7100, 0.0000, '4', 142.7112, 233935.36510, 1793514.34300, '51', 16.20923215, '16° 12\' 33.235740\"', 120.50997510, '120° 30\' 35.910530\"', 147.1020, 1792660.41300, 447606.77600, '3', 233792.43800, 1793585.90200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10006, 'PNG-3682', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SISON', 'ASAN NORTE', 2008, 16.17764462, '16° 10\' 39.520632\"', 120.52208280, '120° 31\' 19.498080\"', 'PNG-3682 Station mark is in Mun. of Sison, Brgy. of Asan Norte. From the Town Proper travel to Brgy. Asan Norte follow Brgy. Road up to Brgy. Proper, turn right follow the trail to the center of the ricefield. Station mark is located at the intersection of levee of ricefield, 80 m SE of two concrete bongalow house, 80 m W of another two concrete bongalow houses. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3682, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.17764462, '16° 10\' 39.520630\"', 120.52208280, '120° 31\' 19.497930\"', 0.0000, '0', 140.9430, 0.0000, '4', 99.0072, 235048.99540, 1790182.58400, '51', 16.17926023, '16° 10\' 45.336810\"', 120.52075990, '120° 31\' 14.735500\"', 103.2170, 1789341.22600, 448752.15900, '3', 234905.97500, 1790254.08400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
