(10008, 'PNG-3684', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SISON', 'CAMANGAAN', 2008, 16.15805698, '16° 9\' 29.005128\"', 120.49213940, '120° 29\' 31.701840\"', 'PNG-3684 Station mark is in Mun. of Sison, Brgy. of Camangaan. To reach the station travel W direction towards Brgy. Amagbagan upon approaching the Brgy., turn left until reaching the Brgy. Camangaan Proper, about 150 m after the Brgy. Plaza turn right and travel about 100 m to Brgy. Purok V. Station mark is located along the asphalt road, 45 m W of the asphalt road dead end, and about 30 m NW of concrete blue bongalow residential house. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. coppernail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3684, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.15805698, '16° 9\' 29.005110\"', 120.49213940, '120° 29\' 31.701850\"', 0.0000, '0', 127.5150, 0.0000, '4', 85.8167, 231819.13030, 1788052.96500, '51', 16.15967202, '16° 9\' 34.819280\"', 120.49081600, '120° 29\' 26.937620\"', 89.8030, 1787181.43900, 445544.66000, '3', 231676.02000, 1788124.54600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'mara', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10009, 'PNG-3685', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SISON', 'CAMANGAAN', 2008, 16.16073053, '16° 9\' 38.629908\"', 120.49403460, '120° 29\' 38.524560\"', 'PNG-3685 Station mark is in Mun. of Sison, Brgy. of Camangaan. To reach the station travel W direction to Brgy. Amagbagan upon approaching Brgy. Proper turn left to Brgy. Camangaan until reaching the Brgy. Proper and Purok II Road Junction. Station mark is located 10 m W of the sharp ascending curve and 30 m W of bamboo area, and about 50 m W of Purok II and Brgy. Proper Road Junction. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3685, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.16073053, '16° 9\' 38.629900\"', 120.49403460, '120° 29\' 38.524650\"', 0.0000, '0', 122.5780, 0.0000, '4', 80.8671, 232025.51320, 1788346.47300, '51', 16.16234570, '16° 9\' 44.444520\"', 120.49271130, '120° 29\' 33.760650\"', 84.8690, 1787476.78800, 445748.08800, '3', 231882.41300, 1788418.05100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10010, 'PNG-3686', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN FABIAN', 'BINDAY', 2008, 16.12379659, '16° 7\' 25.667724\"', 120.45203040, '120° 27\' 7.309440\"', 'PNG-3686 Station mark is in Mun. of San Fabian, Brgy. of Binday. From Town Proper travel N direction going Rosario, La Union, until reaching Petron Gas Station, turn right to Brgy. Angio then travel about 2 Km. E direction until reaching the intersection going to Brgy. Aramal and Binday, turn left then travel about 4 Km. passing through the Brgy. Aramal, until reaching the junction, turn right and travel about 600 m E direction until reaching the Gordoño Street, turn right then travel about 100 m. Station mark is located about 100 m S of waiting shed and 2 m W of irrigation canal. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3686, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.12379659, '16° 7\' 25.667740\"', 120.45203040, '120° 27\' 7.309280\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.4170, 0.0000, '4', 27.8384, 227480.71470, 1784312.75800, '51', 16.12541040, '16° 7\' 31.477450\"', 120.45070610, '120° 27\' 2.541920\"', 31.6970, 1783401.32200, 441244.84000, '3', 227337.45500, 1784384.44200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10011, 'PNG-3687', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SISON', 'PALDIT', 2008, 16.16024186, '16° 9\' 36.870696\"', 120.53878640, '120° 32\' 19.631040\"', 'PNG-3687 Station mark is in. Mun. of Sison, Brgy. of Paldit and Sitio of Gorgordion. To reach the station, from the NCC entrance marker along Nat\'l Road, travel E direction towards NCC Plant until reaching Sitio Gorgordion, Brgy. of Paldit. Station mark is located 10 m N of road and at the start of ascending zigzag road and 25 m E of waiting shed. Station mark is intervisible to PNG-52, 2007, NAMRIA\". Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3687, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.16024186, '16° 9\' 36.870710\"', 120.53878640, '120° 32\' 19.630900\"', 0.0000, '0', 130.1720, 0.0000, '4', 88.2263, 236812.90390, 1788234.57300, '51', 16.16185603, '16° 9\' 42.681690\"', 120.53746310, '120° 32\' 14.867070\"', 92.3530, 1787411.32900, 450534.03100, '3', 236669.83800, 1788306.00400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10012, 'PNG-3688', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'POZZORUBIO', 'INOMAN', 2008, 16.14101674, '16° 8\' 27.660264\"', 120.54249670, '120° 32\' 32.988120\"', 'PNG-3688 Station mark is in Mun. of Pozzorubio, Brgy. of Inoman. From highway junction of Brgy. Bobonan follow the road going E up to the curve going left at about 1.2 Km. and follow the road going N for about 970 m to reach the junction of Purok V and turn right and travel 180 m for the curve going right and 90 m E until reaching Brgy. Inoman Hall. Station mark is located infront of Brgy. Hall Bldg. about 10 m N Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3688, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.14101674, '16° 8\' 27.660270\"', 120.54249670, '120° 32\' 32.987990\"', 0.0000, '0', 110.3720, 0.0000, '4', 68.5077, 237184.46020, 1786101.55600, '51', 16.14262963, '16° 8\' 33.466680\"', 120.54117290, '120° 32\' 28.222540\"', 72.4860, 1785283.00900, 450926.04900, '3', 237041.33200, 1786172.96000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10013, 'PNG-3689', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'POZZORUBIO', 'VILLEGAS', 2008, 16.12693835, '16° 7\' 36.978060\"', 120.55740240, '120° 33\' 26.648640\"', 'PNG-3689Station mark is in. Mun. of Pozzorubio, Brgy. of Villegas. From highway junction follow the Brgy. Road of Imbalbalatong going E and travel about 800 m until reaching the Daycare Center Bldg. and continue follow the curve road going SW and travel about 1 Km. until reaching the Brgy. Villegas boundary welcome arc. Station mark is located 30 m S of Brgy. Villegas boundary welcome arc and 10 m N of welcome sign land mark. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3689, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.12693835, '16° 7\' 36.978070\"', 120.55740240, '120° 33\' 26.648750\"', 0.0000, '0', 118.0940, 0.0000, '4', 76.2230, 238760.89480, 1784524.08700, '51', 16.12855004, '16° 7\' 42.780140\"', 120.55607840, '120° 33\' 21.882190\"', 80.1290, 1783721.59200, 452516.93800, '3', 238617.73200, 1784595.43000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Edil', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10014, 'PNG-3690', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'POZZORUBIO', 'AMAGBAGAN', 2008, 16.09809596, '16° 5\' 53.145456\"', 120.53382300, '120° 32\' 1.762800\"', 'PNG-3690 Station mark is in Mun. of Pozzorubio, Brgy. of Amagbagan. From the Town Proper travel SW direction towards Manaoag, until reaching Brgy. Amagbagan, about 100 m approaching Brgy. Hall, turn right follow the road to the ricefield area, then turn right follow the road for about 100 m then turn left about 100 m. Station mark is located at the right side of the road, about 500 m NW of Brgy. Hall, 400 m SW of chicken poultry area. station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3690, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.09809596, '16° 5\' 53.145470\"', 120.53382300, '120° 32\' 1.762880\"', 0.0000, '0', 83.5830, 0.0000, '4', 41.9233, 236199.56030, 1781361.19200, '51', 16.09970638, '16° 5\' 58.942970\"', 120.53249830, '120° 31\' 56.993760\"', 45.5880, 1780535.57500, 449987.47000, '3', 236056.28100, 1781432.58800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
