(10017, 'PNG-3693', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LAOAC', 'TURKO', 2008, 16.07298111, '16° 4\' 22.731996\"', 120.53821860, '120° 32\' 17.586960\"', 'PNG-3693 Station mark is in Mun. of Laoac, Brgy of Turko. From Town Proper travel SW direction towards Manaoag, upon reaching Maraboc Brgy. Hall turn right follow the road to Brgy. Turko upon approaching Brgy. Proper turn left follow the rough road to Sitio Cabuan. Station mark is located 15 m right side of E of the rough road, and 40 m W of the cluster of tree\'s NW of Brgy. Proper. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3693, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07298111, '16° 4\' 22.732000\"', 120.53821860, '120° 32\' 17.586990\"', 0.0000, '0', 76.2550, 0.0000, '4', 34.6551, 236636.87210, 1778575.30500, '51', 16.07458987, '16° 4\' 28.523530\"', 120.53689330, '120° 32\' 12.815760\"', 38.1730, 1777755.34900, 450451.42400, '3', 236493.51200, 1778646.66600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Edil', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10018, 'PNG-3694', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LAOAC', 'TURKO', 2008, 16.07324678, '16° 4\' 23.688408\"', 120.53523840, '120° 32\' 6.858240\"', 'PNG-3694 Station mark is in Mun. of Laoac, Brgy. of Turko. To reach the station from the Town Proper travel SW direction towards Mun. of Manaoag until reaching Brgy. Maraboc. Upon approaching Brgy. Hall of Maraboc, turn right then continue travel NE direction until reaching Brgy. Proper of Turco. about 120 m SW of Brgy. Hall or the Turco Elem. School turn left towards Sitio Cabuan. Station mark is located 20 m E of the tree with 0.35 m diameter and about 250 m SW of the residential area of Sitio Cabuan and W of PNG-3693. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3694, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07324678, '16° 4\' 23.688400\"', 120.53523840, '120° 32\' 6.858390\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.5640, 0.0000, '4', 33.9659, 236318.23470, 1778608.51400, '51', 16.07485562, '16° 4\' 29.480230\"', 120.53391310, '120° 32\' 2.087170\"', 37.4900, 1777785.47100, 450132.63100, '3', 236174.87300, 1778679.88500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10019, 'PNG-3695', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LAOAC', 'CASANESTEBANAN', 2008, 16.03944664, '16° 2\' 22.007904\"', 120.52559630, '120° 31\' 32.146680\"', 'PNG-3695 Station mark is in Mun. of Laoac, Brgy. of Casanestebanan. To reach the station, from the Town Proper travel W direction towards Manaoag until reaching the Brgy. Talodtod, upon arriving Brgy. Talodtod boundary welcome arc turn left continue travel to Brgy. Casanestebanan, passing through Brgy. Inanduyan. Station mark is located 20 m W of Brgy. Road and 24 m W of the Brgy. Hall and 24 m NW of waiting shed. Station mark si the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3695, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.03944664, '16° 2\' 22.007920\"', 120.52559630, '120° 31\' 32.146640\"', 0.0000, '0', 65.6490, 0.0000, '4', 24.0933, 235241.44300, 1774879.06200, '51', 16.04105359, '16° 2\' 27.792940\"', 120.52427010, '120° 31\' 27.372520\"', 27.4960, 1774047.59500, 449092.30500, '3', 235097.96000, 1774950.43500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
