(10021, 'PNG-3697', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINALONAN', 'SANTIAGO', 2008, 16.03065069, '16° 1\' 50.342484\"', 120.57014520, '120° 34\' 12.522720\"', 'PNG-3697 Station mark is in Mun. of Binalonan, Brgy. of Santiago. From Binalonan-Laoac junction, travel S direction towards Urdaneta City, about 400 m after the Bimeg plant at NIA lateral irrigation canal, turn right W direction follow the rough access road of NIA lateral irrigation canal until reaching Brgy. Santiago, until the NIA irrigation canal and Brgy. Road intersection then turn left S direction for about 150 m. Station mark is located along the road 60 m S of concrete waithing shed along the intersection of Brgy. Road, and 50 m W of the gate of Fuster Garden Subdivision. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3697, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.03065069, '16° 1\' 50.342500\"', 120.57014520, '120° 34\' 12.522870\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.2590, 0.0000, '4', 33.6668, 239999.18050, 1773848.92200, '51', 16.03225612, '16° 1\' 56.122020\"', 120.56881900, '120° 34\' 7.748230\"', 36.9720, 1773063.72700, 453857.51600, '3', 239855.70400, 1773920.14400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10022, 'PNG-3698', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINALONAN', 'SANTIAGO', 2008, 16.03257241, '16° 1\' 57.260676\"', 120.57010500, '120° 34\' 12.378000\"', 'PNG-3698 Station mark is in Mun. of Binalonan, Brgy. of Santiago. From Binalonan-Laoac junction, travel S direction towards Urdaneta City, about 400 m after the Bimeg plant at NIA lateral irrigation canal, turn right W direction follow the rough access road of lateral canal until reaching Brgy. Santiago. Station mark is located along the road or NW corner of the Brgy. Road and NIA lateral irrigation canal, 70 m N of concrete waiting shed along the sharp curve and intersection of Brgy. Road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3698, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.03257241, '16° 1\' 57.260670\"', 120.57010500, '120° 34\' 12.377910\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.7230, 0.0000, '4', 34.1288, 239997.36280, 1774061.70600, '51', 16.03417795, '16° 2\' 3.040620\"', 120.56877870, '120° 34\' 7.603430\"', 37.4420, 1773276.38700, 453853.65300, '3', 239853.89300, 1774132.92900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10023, 'PNG-3699 (OBSTRUCTED)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'ANONAS', 2008, 16.00103808, '16° 0\' 3.737088\"', 120.57158930, '120° 34\' 17.721480\"', 'PNG-3699 Station mark is in City of Urdaneta, Brgy. of Anonas. From City Proper travel N direction towards the new City Hall, until reaching Brgy. Anonas, turn left towards Brgy. Proper, follow the road W direction until the office of the CENRO, at exactly infront of the gate, turn right and follow the Alley Road for about 100 m until the creek embankment. station mark is located N embankment of the creek, 40 m NW of foot bridge and 15 m NW of Camachili Tree, S of ricefield. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3699, 2008, NAMRIA\". OBSTRUCTED (LOCATED INSIDE THE HOUSE) REPORTED BY: ARMAN ADEVA', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.00103808, '16° 0\' 3.737080\"', 120.57158930, '120° 34\' 17.721640\"', 0.0000, '0', 70.4680, 0.0000, '4', 28.9059, 240115.42540, 1770569.01100, '51', 16.00264162, '16° 0\' 9.509840\"', 120.57026240, '120° 34\' 12.944500\"', 32.0880, 1769786.56700, 454005.20200, '3', 239971.85100, 1770640.20300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10024, 'PNG-37', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGALDAN', 'EMBARCADERO', 1996, 16.07288140, '16° 4\' 22.373040\"', 120.42181170, '120° 25\' 18.522120\"', 'PNG-37 Is situated at Brgy. Embarcadero, Mangaldan, Pangasinan. It is set on the N portion of a 0.35 m. x 3.85 m. concrete structure about 270 m. NE of station PNG-36 at the S sidewalk of Malong Bridge leading to Mangaldan town proper. The station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail cemented in a drilled hole with ìinscription on the cement putty \"PNG-37 1996 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07288140, '16° 4\' 22.373050\"', 120.42181170, '120° 25\' 18.522210\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.4244, 0.0000, '3', 9.7103, 224176.43880, 1778716.09400, '51', 16.07449272, '16° 4\' 28.173780\"', 120.42048620, '120° 25\' 13.750360\"', 13.6241, 1777775.97700, 437996.47900, '3', 224032.98200, 1778787.83400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10025, 'PNG-3700', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANAOAG', 'LELEMAAN', 2008, 16.00943703, '16° 0\' 33.973308\"', 120.52133700, '120° 31\' 16.813200\"', 'PNG-3700 Station mark is in Mun. of Manaoag, Brgy. of Lelemaan. From Urdaneta City travel NW direction to Manaoag until reaching Brgy. Lelemaan, at Km. post 189 approaching box culvert, turn left follow the road to Brgy. Proper until reaching sharp curve road and the intersection of NIA lateral irrigation canal a the intersection continue travel W direction follow NIA main farm ditch canal for about 250 m. Station mark is located at the left side or S of the main farm ditch embankment, about 200 m SW of first cell site antena and about 300 m S of pyramid compound of Manaoag. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3700, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.00943703, '16° 0\' 33.973310\"', 120.52133700, '120° 31\' 16.813050\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.1770, 0.0000, '4', 22.6075, 234745.75830, 1771562.35500, '51', 16.01104220, '16° 0\' 39.751930\"', 120.52001010, '120° 31\' 12.036370\"', 25.9440, 1770727.86700, 448628.75000, '3', 234602.17100, 1771633.71700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
