(10028, 'PNG-3703', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MAPANDAN', 'PRIMICIAS', 2008, 16.01190357, '16° 0\' 42.852852\"', 120.48430340, '120° 29\' 3.492240\"', 'PNG-3703 Station mark is in Mun. of Mapandan, Brgy. of Parian. From the Town Proper travel SE direction to the City of Urdaneta until reaching the Mapandan Police Station, turn left to Brgy. Parian Boundary Welcome Arch then travel about 1.5 Km. E direction until reaching the residential house of Mr. Jaime Cervas. Station mark is located at the levee of ricefield and about 150 m NW of residential house of Mr. Jaime Cervas. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a 0.20 m projection above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3703, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.01190357, '16° 0\' 42.852850\"', 120.48430340, '120° 29\' 3.492250\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.5000, 0.0000, '4', 22.8519, 230783.76130, 1771883.10900, '51', 16.01350971, '16° 0\' 48.634950\"', 120.48297660, '120° 28\' 58.715610\"', 26.3640, 1771010.41100, 444665.80100, '3', 230640.15200, 1771954.59400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10029, 'PNG-3706', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'DILAN PAURIDO', 2008, 15.96784780, '15° 58\' 4.252080\"', 120.58858430, '120° 35\' 18.903480\"', 'PNG-3706 Station mark is in the City of Urdaneta, Brgy. of Dilan. From the City Proper travel E direction towards Asingan until reaching Brgy. Dilan for about 2 Km. at Brgy. Dilan or just after the bridge, turn right at the waiting shed with Yakult billboard on top, follow the Dilan-Paurido Brgy. Road until reaching the cluster of Acacia Tree or the ricefield area, turn left follow the rough road. Station mark is located at the right side or S of the center of the ricefield, about 300 m E of Dilan-Paurido concrete Brgy. Road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a 0.20 m projection above the grond surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3706, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.96784780, '15° 58\' 4.252070\"', 120.58858430, '120° 35\' 18.903500\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.4640, 0.0000, '4', 29.8980, 241892.51130, 1766873.71600, '51', 15.96944890, '15° 58\' 10.016030\"', 120.58725660, '120° 35\' 14.123650\"', 32.9430, 1766110.12800, 455816.83200, '3', 241748.84000, 1766944.82400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10030, 'PNG-3707', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'DILAN PAURIDO', 2008, 15.96848948, '15° 58\' 6.562128\"', 120.58545080, '120° 35\' 7.622880\"', 'PNG-3707 Station mark is in the City of Urdaneta, Brgy. of Dilan. From the City Proper travel E direction towards Asingan until reaching Brgy. Dilan for about 2 Km. at Brgy. Dilan just after the bridge turn right at the waiting shed with Yakult billboard on top, follow the Dilan-Paurido Brgy. Road for approx. 800 m until reaching the ricefield area. Station mark is located left side of the road or 6 m E from the center line, about 30 m S of the rough road going to the center of the ricefield area. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a 0.20 m projection above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3707, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.96848948, '15° 58\' 6.562140\"', 120.58545080, '120° 35\' 7.622950\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.4240, 0.0000, '4', 29.8651, 241557.77100, 1766948.63900, '51', 15.97009069, '15° 58\' 12.326490\"', 120.58412310, '120° 35\' 2.843130\"', 32.9120, 1766181.80900, 455481.53700, '3', 241414.09900, 1767019.75800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Dexter Alamar', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10031, 'PNG-3708', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'VILLASIS', 'PIAZ', 2008, 15.94487921, '15° 56\' 41.565156\"', 120.62401930, '120° 37\' 26.469480\"', 'PNG-3708 Station mark is in Mun. of Villasis, Brgy. of Carusukan Sur. From the junction of the highway with Jorge St. sign board, follow the Brgy. Road to Brgy. Macalong for about 200 m N to culvert of NIA Irrigation Canal. Station mark is located at the edge of the box culvert of NIA Canal and 4 m W of the concrete. Station mark is the head of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a 0.20 m projection above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3708, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.94487921, '15° 56\' 41.565170\"', 120.62401930, '120° 37\' 26.469300\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.8900, 0.0000, '4', 34.2677, 246958.48150, 1874987.08900, '51', 15.94647810, '15° 56\' 47.321160\"', 120.62269100, '120° 37\' 21.687690\"', 37.2140, 1763561.24500, 459605.45000, '3', 245514.46500, 1764358.53700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
