(10032, 'PNG-3709', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'VILLASIS', 'CARAMUTAN', 2008, 15.94245823, '15° 56\' 32.849628\"', 120.61789070, '120° 37\' 4.406520\"', 'PNG-3709 Station mark is in Mun. of Villasis, Brgy. of Carusukan Sur. From highway junction going N to approaching NIA Canal and turn left 200 m W up to the Brgy. Road about 250 m N approaching box culavert of NIA Canal. Station mark is located at stock file of NIA Canal and 10 m E of box culvert. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a 0.20 m projection above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3709, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.94245823, '15° 56\' 32.849640\"', 120.61789070, '120° 37\' 4.406510\"', 0.0000, '0', 74.1550, 0.0000, '4', 32.5455, 244998.75560, 1764027.06300, '51', 15.94405710, '15° 56\' 38.605570\"', 120.61656240, '120° 36\' 59.624660\"', 35.4860, 1763294.56200, 458948.82200, '3', 244855.02300, 1764098.05400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10033, 'PNG-3710', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'VILLASIS', 'BACAG', 2008, 15.93049135, '15° 55\' 49.768860\"', 120.58156830, '120° 34\' 53.645880\"', 'PNG-3710 Station mark is in Mun. of Villasis, Brgy. of Bacag Centro. To reach the station from the Town Proper travel N direction towards City of Urdaneta until reaching the Bacag Elem. School, turn right then travel about 50 m until reaching the Don Ramon Costales Memorial Nat\'l High School. Station mark is located at Don Ramon Costales Memorial Nat\'l High School Annes at the S corner portion of school plaza and 5 m S of the stage. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and set on a center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a concrete pavement. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3710, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.93049135, '15° 55\' 49.768870\"', 120.58156830, '120° 34\' 53.645760\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.1760, 0.0000, '4', 27.6212, 241093.17200, 1762747.14300, '51', 15.93209027, '15° 55\' 55.524980\"', 120.58023960, '120° 34\' 48.862710\"', 30.5590, 1761977.93300, 455057.35300, '3', 240949.36900, 1762818.24100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'JHO', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10034, 'PNG-3711', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'LABIT PROPER', 2008, 15.95330775, '15° 57\' 11.907900\"', 120.52936480, '120° 31\' 45.713280\"', 'PNG-3711 Station mark is in the City of Urdaneta, Brgy. of Labit. To reach the station, from the City Proper travel S direction to Brgy. Nancayasan, about 300 m before reching Isuzu Motors, turn right follow the alternative route to Dagupan City passing through Brgy. Palina E and W. Continue travel to Brgy. Labit until reaching T intersection of the road, then turn left. Station mark is located at the dead end of a riprap 5 m SE of the concrete centerline of the road, about 200 m SW of T road intersection and about 140 m SW of weak bridge. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3711, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.95330775, '15° 57\' 11.907900\"', 120.52936480, '120° 31\' 45.713360\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.7210, 0.0000, '4', 23.1096, 235531.49990, 1765338.47900, '51', 15.95490924, '15° 57\' 17.673270\"', 120.52803670, '120° 31\' 40.931980\"', 26.2990, 1764514.78300, 449473.72700, '3', 235387.73000, 1765409.76700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10035, 'PNG-3712', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'LABIT PROPER', 2008, 15.94936924, '15° 56\' 57.729264\"', 120.52745690, '120° 31\' 38.844840\"', 'PNG-3712 Station mark is in City of Urdaneta, Brgy. of Labit. To reach the station, from the City Proper travel S direction to Brgy. Nancayasan, about 300 m before reaching the Isuzu Motors, turn right follow the alternative route to Dagupan City passing through Brgy. Palina East and West, continue travel to Brgy. Labit until reaching the T road intersection, then turn left. Station mark is located 12 m NW of the Welcome Arc of Brgy. Cabaruan, 10 m N of concrete road centerline, 500 m SW of Labit Brgy. Proper and about 500 m NE of Cabaruan Brgy. Proper. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3712, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.94936924, '15° 56\' 57.729260\"', 120.52745690, '120° 31\' 38.844920\"', 0.0000, '0', 65.2560, 0.0000, '4', 23.6321, 235321.98680, 1764904.90200, '51', 15.95097053, '15° 57\' 3.493900\"', 120.52612870, '120° 31\' 34.063200\"', 26.8270, 1764079.42900, 449268.47100, '3', 235178.20200, 1764976.19300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10036, 'PNG-3713', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTO TOMAS', 'POBLACION EAST', 2008, 15.87775192, '15° 52\' 39.906912\"', 120.58430850, '120° 35\' 3.510600\"', 'PNG-3713 Station mark is in Mun. of Sto. Tomas, Brgy. of Poblacion. It is located inside the compound of Sto. Tomas Central School, bet. the two school bldg. beside the school nursery about 35 m SE of the flag pole and about 30 m S of the Provincial Road to Mun. of Alcala. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3713, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.87775192, '15° 52\' 39.906900\"', 120.58430850, '120° 35\' 3.510540\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.0710, 0.0000, '4', 27.4778, 241319.18490, 1756905.61300, '51', 15.87934748, '15° 52\' 45.650920\"', 120.58297860, '120° 34\' 58.723060\"', 30.2890, 1756141.43100, 455338.97200, '3', 241175.20700, 1756976.65800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10037, 'PNG-3714', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ROSALES', 'ZONE I', 2008, 15.89356458, '15° 53\' 36.832488\"', 120.63206890, '120° 37\' 55.448040\"', 'PNG-3714 Station mark is in Mun. of Rosales, Brgy. of Poblacion. It is located at the SE corner of Rizal Monument Foundation about 25 m E of the road intersection to Mun. of Sta. Maria and Balungao. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and set on a center of 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a concrete pavement. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3714, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89356458, '15° 53\' 36.832470\"', 120.63206890, '120° 37\' 55.448100\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.1530, 0.0000, '4', 33.5355, 246455.87190, 1758597.50900, '51', 15.89516008, '15° 53\' 42.576270\"', 120.63073950, '120° 37\' 50.662190\"', 36.3030, 1757881.45700, 460457.08800, '3', 246311.98700, 1758668.41100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10038, 'PNG-3715', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ROSALES', 'ACOP', 2008, 15.86859726, '15° 52\' 6.950136\"', 120.64741390, '120° 38\' 50.690040\"', 'PNG-3715 Station mark is in Mun. of Rosales, Brgy. of Acop. From the highway junction of Brgy. Bakit-bakit travel about 2.2 Km. S direction going to Brgy. Acop until reaching Acop Elem. School, about 200 m S before the box culvert, turn right and follow the cart road for about 250 m S of the box culvert. Station mark is located beside the box culvert and old rail road around 150 m and SW of the box culvert along Brgy. Road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3715, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.86859726, '15° 52\' 6.950120\"', 120.64741390, '120° 38\' 50.690150\"', 0.0000, '0', 79.5010, 0.0000, '4', 37.8405, 248068.64830, 1755815.24400, '51', 15.87019086, '15° 52\' 12.687080\"', 120.64608390, '120° 38\' 45.902210\"', 40.5390, 1755115.83300, 462095.62400, '3', 247924.69300, 1755886.07600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10039, 'PNG-3716', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'ESMERALDA', 2008, 15.86652549, '15° 51\' 59.491764\"', 120.71259350, '120° 42\' 45.336600\"', 'PNG-3716 Station mark is in Mun. of Balungao, Brgy. of Esmeralda. From highway junction of Brgy. Rajal travel about 2.6 Km. S direction going to Brgy. Esmeralda, until reaching box culvert and lot property of Mr. Celso Hernandez. About 200 m berofe PNG-3016 or the box culvert, turn right by walking about 300 m W direction to reach the station. Station mark is located at the land property of Mr. Celso Hernandez and 300 m W of the box culvert and 250 m W of the house of Mr. Anaclito Sotto. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions. \"PNG-3716, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.86652549, '15° 51\' 59.491760\"', 120.71259350, '120° 42\' 45.336660\"', 0.0000, '0', 106.6300, 0.0000, '4', 64.6609, 255049.25030, 1755508.56600, '51', 15.86811752, '15° 52\' 5.223070\"', 120.71126360, '120° 42\' 40.548880\"', 67.5030, 1754875.71900, 469076.09600, '3', 254905.34200, 1755579.18400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10040, 'PNG-3717', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'PUGARO', 2008, 15.87341479, '15° 52\' 24.293244\"', 120.68054030, '120° 40\' 49.945080\"', 'PNG-3717 Station mark is in Mun. of Balungao, Brgy. of Pugaro. From junction of the highway follow the Brgy. Road going South direction and travel about 2.7 Km.. To reach the junction, turn right follow the cart road about 250 m to the location of the station. Station mark is located in Brgy. Pugaro along the cart road and 300 m SW of garbage area and 15 m E of tree. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3717, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.87341479, '15° 52\' 24.293250\"', 120.68054030, '120° 40\' 49.945090\"', 0.0000, '0', 145.9530, 0.0000, '4', 104.1625, 251623.63000, 1756308.91300, '51', 15.87500795, '15° 52\' 30.028620\"', 120.67921050, '120° 40\' 45.157770\"', 106.9250, 1755643.11800, 465644.32300, '3', 251479.71900, 1756379.64000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10041, 'PNG-3718', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'PUGARO', 2008, 15.87573495, '15° 52\' 32.645820\"', 120.68169610, '120° 40\' 54.105960\"', 'PNG-3718 Station mark is in Mun. of Balungao, Brgy. of Pugaro. From the junction of the highway going S direction and follow Brgy. Road and travel about 2.7 Km.. To reach the junction, turn right and follow the cart road until reaching the garbage area. Station mark is located about 25 m S of garbage area. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3718, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.87573495, '15° 52\' 32.645830\"', 120.68169610, '120° 40\' 54.105830\"', 0.0000, '0', 117.6410, 0.0000, '4', 75.8427, 251750.29500, 1756564.36200, '51', 15.87732824, '15° 52\' 38.381650\"', 120.68036630, '120° 40\' 49.318690\"', 78.6170, 1755899.66200, 465768.50000, '3', 251606.39200, 1756635.08700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10042, 'PNG-3719', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'UMINGAN', 'SAN ANDRES', 2008, 15.89596546, '15° 53\' 45.475656\"', 120.74021260, '120° 44\' 24.765360\"', 'PNG-3719 Station mark is in Mun. of Umingan, Brgy. of San Andres. From the highway junction of Brgy. San Andres travel S direction follow the Brgy. Road going to Sta. Rosa for about 1 Km. upon reaching the crossing of NIA Irrigation Canal, turn right continue travel follow the NIA Access road for about 180 m until reaching NIA box culvert. Station mark is located beside the edge of NIA box culvert. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3719, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89596546, '15° 53\' 45.475660\"', 120.74021260, '120° 44\' 24.765310\"', 0.0000, '0', 103.0210, 0.0000, '4', 60.8126, 258043.39390, 1758735.06600, '51', 15.89755873, '15° 53\' 51.211430\"', 120.73888340, '120° 44\' 19.980160\"', 63.9160, 1758129.41300, 472038.28000, '3', 257899.60700, 1758805.62000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
