(10044, 'PNG-3721', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'SAN AURELIO 2ND', 2008, 15.89806674, '15° 53\' 53.040264\"', 120.69330650, '120° 41\' 35.903400\"', 'PNG-3721 Station mark is in Mun. of Balungao, Brgy. of San Aurelio II. From the Town Proper travel about 2.4 Km. until reaching the San Aurelio II Bridge, about 30 m before the location of the station. Station mark is located beside the round post of steel railings and 15 m W from sign board and 30 m NW of San Aurelio II Bridge and 10 m E of Acacia Tree. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3721, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89806674, '15° 53\' 53.040270\"', 120.69330650, '120° 41\' 35.903240\"', 0.0000, '0', 88.4920, 0.0000, '4', 46.6019, 253021.39780, 1759022.52800, '51', 15.89966118, '15° 53\' 58.780230\"', 120.69197720, '120° 41\' 31.118020\"', 49.5060, 1758368.87700, 467015.63100, '3', 252877.57900, 1759093.23600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10045, 'PNG-3722', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'CAPULAAN', 2008, 15.90906478, '15° 54\' 32.633208\"', 120.67595370, '120° 40\' 33.433320\"', 'PNG-3722 Station mark is in Mun. of Balungao, Brgy. of Capulaan. From the Town Proper travel about 400 m E direction towards Mun. of Mapandan until reaching the junction going to Brgy. Capulaan, turn left follow the Brgy. Road about 800 m N until reaching the bridge and the road junction, then turn left about 30 m to reach the landmark sign. Station mark is located beside the Brgy. Official Landmark and about 30 m SW of new Brgy. Hall and 35 m W of Casaka Dam. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3722, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.90906478, '15° 54\' 32.633210\"', 120.67595370, '120° 40\' 33.433210\"', 0.0000, '0', 83.0510, 0.0000, '4', 41.2509, 251176.09780, 1760260.50300, '51', 15.91066028, '15° 54\' 38.377020\"', 120.67462470, '120° 40\' 28.648830\"', 44.1410, 1759588.71500, 465159.32500, '3', 251032.30100, 1760331.27700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10046, 'PNG-3723', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'CAPULAAN', 2008, 15.91056262, '15° 54\' 38.025432\"', 120.67012290, '120° 40\' 12.442440\"', 'PNG-3723 Station mark is in Mun. of Bulangao, Brgy. of Capulaan. From the Town Proper travel towards Mun. of Umingan for about 400 m until reaching the road junction to Brgy. Capulaan then proceed to junction to Brgy. Capulaan and Brgy. Pugaro then travel NE direction about 800 m. To reach the junction, turn left then travel about 35 m W to reach junction bet. new Capulaan Brgy. Hall, turn left then travel about 500 m NW to reach the new Capulaan Brgy. Hall at the left side and continue travel about 120 m NW direction until reaching the land property of Jose Polante Jr. or before the end of concrete road by walking for about 25 m E. Station mark is located bet. the lot of Amado Dela Cruz and Jose Polante Jr. and about 120 m NW of Capulaan Elem. School. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3723, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.91056262, '15° 54\' 38.025440\"', 120.67012290, '120° 40\' 12.442510\"', 0.0000, '0', 80.9930, 0.0000, '4', 39.2261, 250553.38400, 1760433.25900, '51', 15.91215835, '15° 54\' 43.770060\"', 120.66879400, '120° 40\' 7.658220\"', 42.1020, 1759755.45300, 464535.23700, '3', 250409.58700, 1760504.05300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
