(10048, 'PNG-3725', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'SAN JOAQUIN', 2008, 15.93441720, '15° 56\' 3.901920\"', 120.69457620, '120° 41\' 40.474320\"', 'PNG-3725 Station mark is in Mun. of Balungao, Brgy. of San Juaquin. From the highway junction to Brgy. Pugaro, travel about 2.2 Km. N direction to Brgy. Capulaan junction, turn right then travel about 3.5 Km. NE direction follow the Brgy. Road until reaching San Juaquin Elem. School compound. Station mark is located inside San Juaquin Elem. School compound, beside the S portion of basketball court plaza and edge of the concrete pavement. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3725, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.93441720, '15° 56\' 3.901910\"', 120.69457620, '120° 41\' 40.474240\"', 0.0000, '0', 81.9140, 0.0000, '4', 39.9603, 253201.83280, 1763044.66600, '51', 15.93601388, '15° 56\' 9.649960\"', 120.69324780, '120° 41\' 35.692090\"', 43.0350, 1762391.01300, 467157.59700, '3', 253058.13600, 1763115.40200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10049, 'PNG-3726', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'SAN JOAQUIN', 2008, 15.92983589, '15° 55\' 47.409204\"', 120.69722660, '120° 41\' 50.015760\"', 'PNG-3726 Station mark is in Mun. of Balungao, Brgy. of San Juaquin. From the highway junction to Brgy. Pugaro, travel about 2.2 Km. N direction until reaching the road junction of Brgy. Capulaan, turn right then travel about 3.5 Km. NE direction and follow the Brgy. until reaching the road junctiom going to Sitio Cabanglesan then turn right and follow the road about 350 m going E to reach the junction of Sitio Kasilagan, turn right and follow the road about 30 m. Station mark is located inside the property of Mr. Dionisio Domingo. 30 m SW of junction bet. Sitio Cabanglesan and Kasilagan. 35 m SW of the box culvert. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3726, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.92983589, '15° 55\' 47.409200\"', 120.69722660, '120° 41\' 50.015910\"', 0.0000, '0', 81.9490, 0.0000, '4', 39.9878, 253480.10100, 1762534.42500, '51', 15.93143223, '15° 55\' 53.156010\"', 120.69589820, '120° 41\' 45.233390\"', 43.0500, 1761883.64900, 467440.62100, '3', 253336.39200, 1762605.14800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
