(10059, 'PNG-3736', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ASINGAN', 'CALEPAAN', 2008, 16.01259695, '16° 0\' 45.349020\"', 120.61786530, '120° 37\' 4.315080\"', 'PNG-3736 Station mark is in Mun. of Asingan, Brgy of Calepaan. From the Town Proper travel NW towards Binalonan then turn left until reaching road junction to Brgy. Calepaan, continue travel until NIA Irrigation main canal crossing the road to Urdaneta City then turn left. Station mark is located along the access road of NIA main canal or S embankment, about 170 m E of Brgy. Road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of a 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3736, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.01259695, '16° 0\' 45.349010\"', 120.61786530, '120° 37\' 4.314990\"', 0.0000, '0', 81.9420, 0.0000, '4', 40.2294, 245084.93890, 1771791.16200, '51', 16.01420019, '16° 0\' 51.120700\"', 120.61653860, '120° 36\' 59.539060\"', 43.4840, 1771055.82400, 458960.57600, '3', 244941.44100, 1771862.21300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10060, 'PNG-3737', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ASINGAN', 'POBLACION EAST', 2008, 16.00355155, '16° 0\' 12.785580\"', 120.66970420, '120° 40\' 10.935120\"', 'PNG-3737 Station mark is in Mun. of Asingan, Brgy. of Poblacion East. It is located infront of Mun. Town Hall going to City of Urdaneta at the E end of concrete island of the road, 15 m W of the fountain. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and set on a center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a concrete pavement. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3737, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.00355155, '16° 0\' 12.785580\"', 120.66970420, '120° 40\' 10.935020\"', 0.0000, '0', 89.2760, 0.0000, '4', 47.3174, 250623.68460, 1770726.90900, '51', 16.00515309, '16° 0\' 18.551140\"', 120.66837740, '120° 40\' 6.158590\"', 50.6660, 1770045.22300, 464507.00600, '3', 250480.19900, 1770797.78400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10061, 'PNG-3738', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ASINGAN', 'SAN VICENTE WESTE', 2008, 16.02662311, '16° 1\' 35.843196\"', 120.65263050, '120° 39\' 9.469800\"', 'PNG-3738 Station mark is in Mun. of Asingan, Brgy. of San Vicente West. From the Town Proper going to Binalonan travel around 2.8 Km. to reach the intersection of NIA Irrigation and turn right follow the NIA Access road going E direction about 1 Km. to reach the NIA box culvert at Brgy. San Vicente West and junction of Brgy. Road going to San Vicente E, turn left follow the NIA road going to Brgy. Holdit and travel about 930 m going W to the NIA box culvert. Station mark is located along the NIA Irrigation Canal outlet of the box culvert and 2 m S of concrete. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscription, \"PNG-3738, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.02662311, '16° 1\' 35.843200\"', 120.65263050, '120° 39\' 9.469790\"', 0.0000, '0', 89.8840, 0.0000, '4', 47.9464, 248824.56070, 1773301.37300, '51', 16.02822647, '16° 1\' 41.615290\"', 120.65130420, '120° 39\' 4.695220\"', 51.3850, 1772601.25900, 462683.96400, '3', 248681.13900, 1773372.32300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10062, 'PNG-3739', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ASINGAN', 'COLDIT', 2008, 16.03509294, '16° 2\' 6.334584\"', 120.65179360, '120° 39\' 6.456960\"', 'PNG-3739 Station mark is in Mun. of Asingan, Brgy. of Holdit. From the Town Proper going to Binalonan travel about 2.8 Km. to reach the intersection of NIA Irrigation, then turn right follow NIA Acess road and travel about 1.9 Km. to reach the intersection of Brgy. Road. Station mark is located along the NIA Irrigation Canal beside of NIA Road and about 10 m S of NIA box culvert. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3739, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.03509294, '16° 2\' 6.334570\"', 120.65179360, '120° 39\' 6.456830\"', 0.0000, '0', 93.5080, 0.0000, '4', 51.5480, 248745.58090, 1774239.94600, '51', 16.03669684, '16° 2\' 12.108630\"', 120.65046750, '120° 39\' 1.682970\"', 55.0370, 1773538.64900, 462595.99800, '3', 248602.18700, 1774310.90600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10063, 'PNG-3740', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINALONAN', 'MORENO', 2008, 16.07454541, '16° 4\' 28.363476\"', 120.59240840, '120° 35\' 32.670240\"', 'PNG-3740 Station mark is in Mun. of Binalonan, Brgy of Moreno. From the Town Proper travel NW towards Pozorrubio about 400 m just after the Luzon Bible College of Assembly of God, turn right to Brgy. Moreno continue travel for about 300 m until the NIA gate valve. Station mark is located 5 m S of the concrete birdge, 2.5 m W of the waiting shed and 15 m W of NIA main canal gate valve. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3740, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07454541, '16° 4\' 28.363490\"', 120.59240840, '120° 35\' 32.670110\"', 0.0000, '0', 90.5530, 0.0000, '4', 48.7677, 242439.08850, 1778680.19100, '51', 16.07615308, '16° 4\' 34.151090\"', 120.59108310, '120° 35\' 27.899280\"', 52.3440, 1777916.10200, 456249.72100, '3', 242295.77800, 1778751.37700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10064, 'PNG-3741', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINALONAN', 'MORENO', 2008, 16.07578187, '16° 4\' 32.814732\"', 120.59141480, '120° 35\' 29.093280\"', 'PNG-3741 Station mark is in Mun. of Binalonan, Brgy. of Moreno. From the Town Proper tarvel N direction towards Pozorrubio about 400 m after the Luzon Bible College turn right follow the road going to Brgy Moreno Brgy. Proper until reaching the brgy. welcome marker. Station mark is locted at the center of the ricefield area, 20 m NE of single nipa hut and about 400 m NW of Brgy. Moreno welcome marker. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3741, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07578187, '16° 4\' 32.814740\"', 120.59141480, '120° 35\' 29.093340\"', 0.0000, '0', 88.7780, 0.0000, '4', 46.9937, 242334.34100, 1778818.30400, '51', 16.07738964, '16° 4\' 38.602700\"', 120.59008960, '120° 35\' 24.322620\"', 50.5760, 1778053.13800, 456143.69300, '3', 242191.03400, 1778889.49400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10065, 'PNG-3742', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BINALONAN', 'STA. CATALINA', 2008, 16.08928028, '16° 5\' 21.409008\"', 120.61043190, '120° 36\' 37.554840\"', 'PNG-3742 Station mark is in Mun. of Binalonan, Brgy. of Sta. Catalina. From the highway junction follow the Brgy. Road going E direction towards Brgy. Moreno and travel about 400 m to reach the junction and NIA drop box, turn right then travel about 1.2 Km. to reach junction to Sta. Catalina follow the road then turn right then travel about 570 m to reach the junction, turn right and follow the road curve about 400 m NE direction towards Sitio Binonton to reach the cart road junction, turn right about 140 m E direction until reaching the land property of Bartolome Minor. Station mark is located in the land propertty of Bartolome Minor along the cart road junction and 10 m E of the tree. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3742, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.08928028, '16° 5\' 21.409020\"', 120.61043190, '120° 36\' 37.554680\"', 0.0000, '0', 106.9120, 0.0000, '4', 64.9547, 244387.02940, 1780288.92700, '51', 16.09088847, '16° 5\' 27.198490\"', 120.60910700, '120° 36\' 32.785200\"', 68.7050, 1779542.84700, 458181.21400, '3', 244243.78300, 1780360.06700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10066, 'PNG-3743', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN MANUEL', 'STO. DOMINGO', 2008, 16.09642998, '16° 5\' 47.147928\"', 120.64053980, '120° 38\' 25.943280\"', 'PNG-3743 Station mark is in Mun. of San Manuel, Brgy. of Sto Domingo. From the highway junction follow the Brgy. Road towards Sitio Cabatuan and travel about 1.2 Km. to reach Sitio Proper then continue travel N direction about 1.8 Km. to reach Sitio Tacmen. Station mark is located at Sitio Tacmen Elem. School compound, NE corner portion of School Plaza, 7 m S of the school stage. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3743, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.09642998, '16° 5\' 47.147910\"', 120.64053980, '120° 38\' 25.943310\"', 0.0000, '0', 153.4300, 0.0000, '4', 111.2224, 247618.28900, 1781043.33500, '51', 16.09803794, '16° 5\' 52.936570\"', 120.63921520, '120° 38\' 21.174610\"', 115.1710, 1780328.07800, 461403.68600, '3', 247475.09200, 1781114.38200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10067, 'PNG-3744', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN MANUEL', 'STO. DOMINGO', 2008, 16.08954288, '16° 5\' 22.354368\"', 120.64720780, '120° 38\' 49.948080\"', 'PNG-3744 Station mark is in Mun. of San Manuel, Brgy. of Sto Domingo. From the highway junction of Brgy. Sto. Domingo travel towards Sitio Cabatuan and travel about 1.2 Km. to reach the Sitio Cabatuan, the travel about 800 m until reaching the residential house of Laudencio Tintero. Station mark is located at the upper bank of the river and 15 m N of residential house of Laudencio Tintero. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3744, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.08954288, '16° 5\' 22.354350\"', 120.64720780, '120° 38\' 49.947930\"', 0.0000, '0', 148.5080, 0.0000, '4', 106.3017, 248323.19140, 1780272.82800, '51', 16.09115026, '16° 5\' 28.140940\"', 120.64588300, '120° 38\' 45.178680\"', 110.2130, 1779564.72400, 462115.70000, '3', 248179.97700, 1780343.84800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10068, 'PNG-3745 (OBSTRUCTED)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN MANUEL', 'GUISET NORTE', 2008, 16.06369310, '16° 3\' 49.295160\"', 120.66903020, '120° 40\' 8.508720\"', 'PNG-3745 Station mark is in Mun. of San Manuel, Brgy. of Poblacion. It is located at the Mun. Auditorium 4 m SE of the fountain, 15 m NE of Guiset Brgy. Hall. about 200 m SW of Mun. Bldg. of San Manuel. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3745, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.06369310, '16° 3\' 49.295170\"', 120.66903020, '120° 40\' 8.508680\"', 0.0000, '0', 107.1120, 0.0000, '4', 64.8997, 250626.37200, 1777384.96200, '51', 16.06529841, '16° 3\' 55.074280\"', 120.66770480, '120° 40\' 3.737330\"', 68.6850, 1776700.35600, 464445.68300, '3', 250483.08800, 1777455.89000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10069, 'PNG-3746', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'SAN FELIPE WEST', 2008, 16.11797665, '16° 7\' 4.715940\"', 120.70046940, '120° 42\' 1.689840\"', 'PNG-3746 Station mark in in Mun. of San Nicolas, Brgy. of San Felipe West. From the Town Proper follow the road going N towards Brgy. San Felipe West and travel about 5.2 Km. to reach the Brgy. Hall of San Felipe East then continue travel NW follow the road going to San Manuel Dam Site and travelabout 3.2 Km. to reach the Dom Cristobal Elem. School at Sitio Paculang, Brgy. San Felipe West. Station mark is located at Sitio Paculang, Brgy San Felipe West, about 120 m S of Con Cristobal Elem. School Bldg. and W of boundary of the school compound. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3746, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.11797665, '16° 7\' 4.715940\"', 120.70046940, '120° 42\' 1.689790\"', 0.0000, '0', 179.5600, 0.0000, '4', 136.7134, 254058.25080, 1783356.03300, '51', 16.11958463, '16° 7\' 10.504680\"', 120.69914530, '120° 41\' 56.923230\"', 141.2210, 1782701.94400, 467818.47000, '3', 253915.17600, 1783426.90300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Dexter Alamar', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10070, 'PNG-3747', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'SAN FELIPE EAST', 2008, 16.10715985, '16° 6\' 25.775460\"', 120.72482640, '120° 43\' 29.375040\"', 'PNG-3747 Station mark is in Mun. of San Nicolas, Brgy. of San Felipe East. From the Town Proper follow the road going N towards Brgy. San Felipe and travel about 2.1 Km. to reach the junction going to San Soro and going to San Felipe, turn right going to San Felipe and travel about 2.9 Km. to reach the junction. Station mark is located about 10 m N of the road junction of Brgy. San Felipe West and Brgy. Agpay and 20 m N of waiting shed. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3747, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.10715985, '16° 6\' 25.775470\"', 120.72482640, '120° 43\' 29.375150\"', 0.0000, '0', 136.3240, 0.0000, '4', 93.3382, 256651.28100, 1782129.82200, '51', 16.10876664, '16° 6\' 31.559900\"', 120.72350220, '120° 43\' 24.607770\"', 97.8930, 1781501.29500, 470422.26100, '3', 256508.18900, 1782200.60600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
