(10071, 'PNG-3748', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'CABULOAN', 2008, 16.07824356, '16° 4\' 41.676816\"', 120.73295460, '120° 43\' 58.636560\"', 'PNG-3748 Station mark is in Mun. of San Nicolas, Brgy. of Caboloan, from the juction of the highway at Brgy. Camangaan going W travel 1.7 Km. to reach the creek and turn left then continue travel about 700 m and follow the road curve going W direction about 300 m to reach the juction and turn let going to Brgy. Caboloan about 540 m. Station mark is located along the drop box and about 30 m W of the end of the Brgy. Road from Camangaan. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3748, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07824356, '16° 4\' 41.676830\"', 120.73295460, '120° 43\' 58.636590\"', 0.0000, '0', 113.7800, 0.0000, '4', 70.9349, 257485.92100, 1778919.53200, '51', 16.07984838, '16° 4\' 47.454160\"', 120.73162970, '120° 43\' 53.866790\"', 75.2430, 1778300.37100, 471287.53300, '3', 257342.73800, 1778990.26500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10072, 'PNG-3749', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'CABULOAN', 2008, 16.07686354, '16° 4\' 36.708744\"', 120.73403560, '120° 44\' 2.528160\"', 'PNG-3749 Station mark is in the Mun. of San Nicolas, Brgy. of Caboloan. From the junction of the highway in Camangaan going W direction travel about 1.7 Km. to reach the creek and turn left then continue travel about 700 m and follow the road curve going W direction at about 300 m to reach the juction turn left going to Brgy. Caboloan and 200 m to reach the land property of Mr. Alexander Pascua. Station mark is located at the land property of Mr. Alexander Pascua and about 200 m S of creek and curve of the Brgy. Road. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3749, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07686354, '16° 4\' 36.708760\"', 120.73403560, '120° 44\' 2.527990\"', 0.0000, '0', 113.0980, 0.0000, '4', 70.2516, 257599.93100, 1778765.51100, '51', 16.07846825, '16° 4\' 42.485690\"', 120.73271060, '120° 43\' 57.758080\"', 74.5530, 1778147.51100, 471402.98200, '3', 257456.74400, 1778836.23900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10073, 'PNG-3750', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'CASARATAN', 2008, 16.06933792, '16° 4\' 9.616512\"', 120.75615790, '120° 45\' 22.168440\"', 'PNG-3750 Station mark is in Mun. of San Nicolas, Brgy. of Casaratan. From the Town Proper going NW and follow the road towards San Manuel and travel about 800 m to reach the San Nicolas Bridge, turn left follow the Brgy. Road SE about 250 m until reaching the Solar Dryer Plaza. Station mark is located at the NE corner 250 of the Solar Dryer Plaza and about 250 m W of the S portion of San Nicolas Bridge. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3750, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.06933792, '16° 4\' 9.616520\"', 120.75615790, '120° 45\' 22.168410\"', 0.0000, '0', 125.3290, 0.0000, '4', 82.3112, 259958.45380, 1777906.70200, '51', 16.07094167, '16° 4\' 15.390010\"', 120.75483280, '120° 45\' 17.397980\"', 86.7080, 1777311.77400, 473768.83900, '3', 259815.26000, 1777977.35200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10074, 'PNG-3751', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'NATIVIDAD', 'POBLACION EAST', 2008, 16.04407347, '16° 2\' 38.664492\"', 120.79575090, '120° 47\' 44.703240\"', 'PNG-3751 Station mark is in Mun. of Natividad, Brgy. of Poblacion. From Mun. Hall follow the road infront of Mun. Hall going N about 50 M to reach the Natividad Central Elem. School. Station mark is located inside the compound of Natividad Central School along the concrete side walk and 12 m W of the school flag pole. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m abovethe ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3751, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.04407347, '16° 2\' 38.664500\"', 120.79575090, '120° 47\' 44.703260\"', 0.0000, '0', 132.4480, 0.0000, '4', 89.1531, 264166.05900, 1775064.75800, '51', 16.04567477, '16° 2\' 44.429180\"', 120.79442530, '120° 47\' 39.930910\"', 93.6550, 1774511.42300, 478002.19700, '3', 264022.81400, 1775135.25900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10075, 'PNG-3752', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'TAYUG', 'BARANGAY A', 2008, 16.02805246, '16° 1\' 40.988856\"', 120.74358350, '120° 44\' 36.900600\"', 'PNG-3752 Station mark is in Mun. of Tayug, Brgy of Poblacion. From Mun. Hall about 100 m NW to the location of Auditorium. Station mark is located at the concrete sidewalk of the N portion of Auditorium and 27 m W of the N gate. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and set on a center of 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a concrete pavement. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3752, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.02805246, '16° 1\' 40.988860\"', 120.74358350, '120° 44\' 36.900450\"', 0.0000, '0', 104.5630, 0.0000, '4', 61.9272, 258562.89680, 1773351.52900, '51', 16.02965391, '16° 1\' 46.754080\"', 120.74225740, '120° 44\' 32.126470\"', 65.8480, 1772744.98000, 472417.66800, '3', 258419.55500, 1773422.18500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10076, 'PNG-3753', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ASINGAN', 'ARISTON ESTE', 2008, 16.01779480, '16° 1\' 4.061280\"', 120.70189470, '120° 42\' 6.820920\"', 'PNG-3753 Station mark is in Mun. of Asingan, Brgy. of Ariston East. From Brgy. Bantog intersection travel E direction and follow the road to San Manuel and travel about 2.2 Km. to reach the Brgy. Health Center at Brgy. Ariston East. Station mark is located about 15 m E of Brgy. Health Center and the edge of basketball court plaza, beside the concrete landmark. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and set on a center of a 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a concrete pavement. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3753, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.01779480, '16° 1\' 4.061290\"', 120.70189470, '120° 42\' 6.821070\"', 0.0000, '0', 94.3520, 0.0000, '4', 52.1148, 254087.59400, 1772265.10300, '51', 16.01939653, '16° 1\' 9.827510\"', 120.70056830, '120° 42\' 2.046010\"', 55.7060, 1771616.00500, 467954.64800, '3', 253944.18300, 1772335.88500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10077, 'PNG-3754', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ASINGAN', 'ARISTON ESTE', 2008, 16.01855098, '16° 1\' 6.783528\"', 120.69837020, '120° 41\' 54.132720\"', 'PNG-3754 Station mark is in Mun. of Asingan, Brgy. of Ariston East. From Brgy. Bantog intersection travel East direction and follow the road then travel about 2 Km. to reach the junction, about 200 m before Brgy. Health Center turn left and follow the Brgy. road and continue travel about 350 m. Station mark is located about 350 m N of Brgy. Health Center along Brgy. road going to Sitio Pao and 15 m E of bamboo tree. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3754, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.01855098, '16° 1\' 6.783520\"', 120.69837020, '120° 41\' 54.132880\"', 0.0000, '0', 93.0250, 0.0000, '4', 50.8095, 253711.20480, 1772352.98600, '51', 16.02015283, '16° 1\' 12.550190\"', 120.69704380, '120° 41\' 49.357850\"', 54.3910, 1771700.23600, 467577.57400, '3', 253567.79300, 1772423.78100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10078, 'PNG-3755', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'TAYUG', 'BARANGOBONG', 2008, 15.99384185, '15° 59\' 37.830660\"', 120.72144060, '120° 43\' 17.186160\"', 'PNG-3755 Station mark is in MUn. of Tayug, Brgy. of Barangubong. From Sta. Maria Town Proper travel about 3.5 Km. towards Mun. of Tayug until reaching the Brgy. Barangubong. Station mark is located at the edge of the round steel post guard of the road and about 10 m E of the street light and 35 m NE of the house. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3755, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99384185, '15° 59\' 37.830670\"', 120.72144060, '120° 43\' 17.186060\"', 0.0000, '0', 91.5950, 0.0000, '4', 49.3000, 256150.98310, 1769590.69700, '51', 15.99544166, '15° 59\' 43.589970\"', 120.72011360, '120° 43\' 12.409070\"', 52.8300, 1768962.52300, 470042.84100, '3', 256007.50800, 1769661.39600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10079, 'PNG-3756', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'TAYUG', 'BARANGOBONG', 2008, 15.99768085, '15° 59\' 51.651060\"', 120.72601390, '120° 43\' 33.650040\"', 'PNG-3756 Station mark is in Mun. of Tayug, Brgy. of Barangubong. From Sta. Maria Town Proper travel about 4.2 Km. towards Mun. of Tayug until reaching the waiting shed of Brgy. Barangubong. Station mark is located infront of waiting shed about 35 m NE and 4 m E of Mahogany Tree. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3756, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.99768085, '15° 59\' 51.651070\"', 120.72601390, '120° 43\' 33.649990\"', 0.0000, '0', 93.2760, 0.0000, '4', 50.9317, 256645.28390, 1770010.26900, '51', 15.99928079, '15° 59\' 57.410860\"', 120.72468700, '120° 43\' 28.873340\"', 54.5120, 1769386.66300, 470532.91400, '3', 256501.82500, 1770080.95600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10080, 'PNG-3757', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN QUINTIN', 'LAGASIT', 2008, 16.00142309, '16° 0\' 5.123124\"', 120.78010530, '120° 46\' 48.379080\"', 'PNG-3757 Station mark is in Mun. of San Quintin, Brgy. of Lagasit. From Tayug Town Proper travel towards San Quintin until reaching welcome arc sign, turn left and follow the trail going E about 370 m unitl reaching the land property of Mr. Sonny Magana. Station mark is located at the land property of Mr. Sanny Magana and about 370 m W of San Quintin boundary welcome arc and 20 m N of the resthouse of Mr. Sonny Magana. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3757, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.00142309, '16° 0\' 5.123140\"', 120.78010530, '120° 46\' 48.379050\"', 0.0000, '0', 114.9650, 0.0000, '4', 72.0967, 262440.90250, 1770361.85600, '51', 16.00302208, '16° 0\' 10.879490\"', 120.77877860, '120° 46\' 43.603010\"', 76.0810, 1769793.71300, 476322.87000, '3', 262297.50100, 1770432.37100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10081, 'PNG-3758', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN QUINTIN', 'BOLINTAGUEN', 2008, 15.97005469, '15° 58\' 12.196884\"', 120.77661040, '120° 46\' 35.797440\"', 'PNG-3758 Station mark is in Mun. of San Quintin, Brgy. of Bolintaguen. Fromt he Town Proper follow the road towards Sta. Maria and travel about 2.7 Km. towards Brgy. Bolintaguen until reaching Bolintaguen Elem. School. Station mark is located inside the compound of Bolintaguen Elem. School, bet. the flagpole and the school bldg. 12 m W of the flagpole and beside of sidewalk. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and set on a center 0.20 m x 0.20 m cement putty flushed on a concrete pavement. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3758, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.97005469, '15° 58\' 12.196870\"', 120.77661040, '120° 46\' 35.797350\"', 0.0000, '0', 112.8270, 0.0000, '4', 70.1233, 262029.61410, 1766893.83100, '51', 15.97165179, '15° 58\' 17.946430\"', 120.77528300, '120° 46\' 31.018650\"', 73.8560, 1766323.06600, 475944.98200, '3', 261886.10600, 1766964.33100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10082, 'PNG-3759', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'UMINGAN', 'SINABAAN', 2008, 15.93394188, '15° 56\' 2.190768\"', 120.76653610, '120° 45\' 59.529960\"', 'PNG-3759 Station mark is in Mun. of Umingan, Brgy. of Sinabaan. From the highway junction of Brgy. Flores follow the Brgy. Road N direction and travel about 2.2 Km. to reach the intersection and turn left going to Brgy. Sinabaan and travel about 1.2 Km. to reach the Sinabaan Brgy. Hall, then travel about 210 m. Station mark is located about 210 m W of Sinabaan Brgy. Hall and 10 m E of NIA Irrigation Canal. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3759, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.93394188, '15° 56\' 2.190760\"', 120.76653610, '120° 45\' 59.530080\"', 0.0000, '0', 106.5240, 0.0000, '4', 64.0253, 260908.05280, 1762908.20600, '51', 15.93553694, '15° 56\' 7.933000\"', 120.76520790, '120° 45\' 54.748270\"', 67.4700, 1762328.24500, 474861.97800, '3', 260764.41500, 1762978.70700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10083, 'PNG-3760', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'UMINGAN', 'SINABAAN', 2008, 15.93950298, '15° 56\' 22.210728\"', 120.76920860, '120° 46\' 9.150960\"', 'PNG-3760 Station mark is in Mun. of Umingan, Brgy of Sinabaan. From the highway junction of Brgy. Flores follow the Brgy. Road N direction and travel about 2.2 Km. to reach the intersection in Brgy. Buenavest, turn right going to Brgy. Sinabaan and travel about 1.2 Km. to reach the Sinabaan Brgy. Hall and continue travel about 30 m to reach junction, turn right and follow the road going N and travel about 500 m to reach the canal, turn right by walking about 300 m E until reaching the creek. Station mark is located about 10 m S of creek and 15 m S of Acacia Tree. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3760, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.93950298, '15° 56\' 22.210720\"', 120.76920860, '120° 46\' 9.150920\"', 0.0000, '0', 106.0410, 0.0000, '4', 63.5039, 261200.84620, 1763520.67600, '51', 15.94109833, '15° 56\' 27.954000\"', 120.76788040, '120° 46\' 4.369590\"', 66.9970, 1762943.27700, 475148.80500, '3', 261057.22900, 1763591.17400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10084, 'PNG-3761', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'UMINGAN', 'GONZALES', 2008, 15.91704483, '15° 55\' 1.361388\"', 120.76299190, '120° 45\' 46.770840\"', 'PNG-3761 Station mark is in Mun. of Umingan, Brgy. of Ganzales. From the highway at Carayugan Bridge going N and down to the ricefield by walking about 450 m to reach the land property of Ms. Myra Dela Piña. Station mark is located at the land property of Ms. Myra Dela Peña and about 40 m E of the house. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 0.20 m x 0.20 m concrete monument with a projection of 0.20 m above the ground surface. Inscriptions, \"PNG-3761, 2008, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.91704483, '15° 55\' 1.361380\"', 120.76299190, '120° 45\' 46.771010\"', 0.0000, '0', 106.4540, 0.0000, '4', 64.0293, 260508.43720, 1761042.00900, '51', 15.91863891, '15° 55\' 7.100090\"', 120.76166330, '120° 45\' 41.987760\"', 67.3570, 1760458.95700, 474480.34100, '3', 260364.74000, 1761112.50800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
