(10092, 'PNG-3769 (BLLM-1)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'POBLACION WEST', 2013, 15.98031738, '15° 58\' 49.142568\"', 120.69852760, '120° 41\' 54.699360\"', 'PNG-3769 (BLLM-1) Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay Poblacion West. From Tayug, Pangasinan travel South West Towards Pobalcion West, Sta Maria, Pangasinan, until reaching the plaza, then travel North West until reaching the market. BLLM No. 1 is located about 200m. NW of the east side of the plaza, about 170m. SE of the Welcome Arc of San Patricio and about 150 m. SE of BLLM No. 2. Mark is the head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.25 m. .25m. x 120 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions \"STA. MARIA PNG, BLLM NO.1, CAD-487-D, DENR LMS-R1, 2013\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.98031738, '15° 58\' 49.142550\"', 120.69852760, '120° 41\' 54.699410\"', 0.0000, '0', 88.5020, 0.0000, '2', 46.4172, 253681.17080, 1768120.69700, '51', 15.98191684, '15° 58\' 54.900610\"', 120.69720030, '120° 41\' 49.921160\"', 49.7520, 1767469.46200, 467588.15700, '3', 253537.63100, 1768191.45800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
