(10181, 'PNG-4', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ROSALES', 'CARMAY EAST', 1989, 15.91126435, '15° 54\' 40.551660\"', 120.64172020, '120° 38\' 30.192720\"', 'PNG-4 Station was set on top W irrigation canal headwall; about 3 kms. E of Rosales town proper; 500 m. NW of Brgy. Carmay East and 10 km. W of Sta. Maria. It is accessible for all types of vehicles. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set on top center of W irrigation canal headwall with cement patty and inscribed on top \"PNG-004 1989 NAMRIA\". Reference marks (RM) is 4, RMs are 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods set in drilled holes with cement patty and inscribed with RM numbers.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.91126435, '15° 54\' 40.551650\"', 120.64172020, '120° 38\' 30.192580\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.7477, 0.0000, '1', 34.0914, 247511.87960, 1760545.07600, '51', 15.91286074, '15° 54\' 46.298660\"', 120.64039120, '120° 38\' 25.408210\"', 36.9270, 1759838.19800, 461494.03500, '3', 247368.06200, 1760615.96300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10182, 'PNG-40', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANAOAG', 'POBLACION', 1996, 16.04460009, '16° 2\' 40.560324\"', 120.48990320, '120° 29\' 23.651520\"', 'PNG-40 Is in Manaoag, Pangasinan at Brgy. Poblacion. It is located 1 m. SE of the pedestrian passage of the main gate of the Manaoag Central School and is about 8 m. N of the centerline of the provincial road leading to the municipality of Binalonan. Mark is the center of the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on a 25 ìcm. x 25 cm. concrete monument. The monument is 0.7 m. deep and is 4 cm. above ground. Inscription on the surface read \"PNG-40, 1996, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.04460009, '16° 2\' 40.560330\"', 120.48990320, '120° 29\' 23.651610\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.7984, 0.0000, '3', 28.2086, 231427.16480, 1775495.53000, '51', 16.04620815, '16° 2\' 46.349340\"', 120.48857710, '120° 29\' 18.877710\"', 31.7477, 1774627.04500, 445274.13300, '3', 231283.66800, 1775567.02500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10183, 'PNG-4000', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'ANGAYAN NORTE', 2009, 15.90199564, '15° 54\' 7.184304\"', 120.70033100, '120° 42\' 1.191600\"', 'PNG-4000 Station mark is located in the Municipality of Balungao, Brgy of Angayan Norte. from Balungao Municipal Hall. travel east along the National Highway towards the Municipality of Umingan for about 3.2 km. until reaching Kay-Chinette Eatery on the right. Station mark is located inside the well-fenced residential lot in front (other side of the road) of the eatery. The station is located 6 meters to the left (west) of the main concrete house. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set in a drilled hole and cemented flushed at he top 20 m x 20 cms. concrete monument set 0.20 m above the ground with Inscriptions, \"PNG 4000;2009 DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.90199564, '15° 54\' 7.184300\"', 120.70033100, '120° 42\' 1.191680\"', 0.0000, '0', 86.2810, 0.0000, '4', 44.3450, 253778.65170, 1759449.12600, '51', 15.90359016, '15° 54\' 12.924590\"', 120.69900190, '120° 41\' 56.406820\"', 47.2900, 1758802.51300, 467768.49400, '3', 253634.85200, 1759519.81400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10184, 'PNG-4001', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'POBLACION', 2009, 15.89731271, '15° 53\' 50.325756\"', 120.67195590, '120° 40\' 19.041240\"', 'PNG-4001 From the intersection in Carmen, Rosales (Mc. Donald\'s), travel east towards the Municipality of Balungao for about 10 km. until you reach Balungao Municipal Hall. The station is on the east side of the min road entrance leading to the Municipal hall. it is about 1.50 m. south of the concrete fence surrounding the municipal hall complex and 1.50 m. north from the edge of the national highway. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set in a drilled hole and cemented flushed at he top 40 m x 40 cms. concrete monument set 0.20 m above the ground with Inscriptions, \"BLLM 1;PNG 4001;2009 DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89731271, '15° 53\' 50.325750\"', 120.67195590, '120° 40\' 19.041140\"', 0.0000, '0', 87.0310, 0.0000, '4', 45.2661, 250733.38100, 1758964.41600, '51', 15.89890756, '15° 53\' 56.067230\"', 120.67062660, '120° 40\' 14.255750\"', 48.0950, 1758288.97500, 464729.16400, '3', 250589.54200, 1759035.19200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10185, 'PNG-4002', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'POBLACION', 2009, 15.89612261, '15° 53\' 46.041396\"', 120.66850610, '120° 40\' 6.621960\"', 'PNG-4002 From Bulangao Municipal Hall travel west towards the Municipality of Rosales for about 400 m. The station is on the right (north) side of the concrete road about 2m. from its edge. The station is about 1m. beyond the steel railing aligned to one its concrete posts. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set in a drilled hole and cemented flushed at he top 40 m x 40 cms. concrete monument set 0.20 m above the ground with Inscriptions, \"BLLM 2;PNG 4002;2009 DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89612261, '15° 53\' 46.041390\"', 120.66850610, '120° 40\' 6.621980\"', 0.0000, '0', 82.2510, 0.0000, '4', 40.5073, 250362.36670, 1758836.80000, '51', 15.89771747, '15° 53\' 51.782880\"', 120.66717680, '120° 40\' 1.836460\"', 43.3200, 1758157.87900, 464359.53000, '3', 250218.52000, 1758907.58600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10186, 'PNG-4003', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'KITA-KITA', 2009, 15.89386510, '15° 53\' 37.914360\"', 120.66466800, '120° 39\' 52.804800\"', 'PNG-4003 From Balungao Municipal Hall, travel west towards the Municipality of Rosales for about 850 m. until reaching the Iglesia ni Cristo Church. The station is on the left (south) side of the concrete road about 2m. from its edge set above a rubble masonry. The station is about 1m. south-west of a road signage and about 2m. north of a private concrete fence alignment. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set in a drilled hole and cemented flushed at he top 20 m x 20 cms. cement putty 1cm. thick with Inscriptions, \"PNG 4003;2009 DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89386510, '15° 53\' 37.914370\"', 120.66466800, '120° 39\' 52.804960\"', 0.0000, '0', 81.9380, 0.0000, '4', 40.2136, 249948.43230, 1758591.50000, '51', 15.89545990, '15° 53\' 43.655650\"', 120.66333870, '120° 39\' 48.019240\"', 43.0100, 1757908.74300, 463948.11800, '3', 249804.57600, 1758662.29800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10187, 'PNG-4004', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'KITA-KITA', 2009, 15.89324159, '15° 53\' 35.669724\"', 120.66152740, '120° 39\' 41.498640\"', 'PNG-4004 From Balungao Municipal Hall, travel west towards the Municipality of Rosales for about 1.20 km. until reaching the welcome arc. separating Brgy. Kita-kita and the Municipality of Rosales. The station is on the left (south) side of the concrete road about 1.50 m. from its edge. The station is about 1m. east of an unused concrete pedestal 1x1x1.50 m. and about 0.50m. north of the base of a street light. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set in a drilled hole and cemented flushed at he top 20 m x 20 cms. concrete monument set 0.20 m above the ground with Inscriptions, \"PNG 4004;2009 DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89324159, '15° 53\' 35.669730\"', 120.66152740, '120° 39\' 41.498760\"', 0.0000, '0', 82.3610, 0.0000, '4', 40.6474, 249611.22530, 1758526.24300, '51', 15.89483642, '15° 53\' 41.411120\"', 120.66019800, '120° 39\' 36.712970\"', 43.4380, 1757840.30000, 463611.68400, '3', 249467.36400, 1758597.05000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10188, 'PNG-4005', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'ANGAYAN SUR', 2009, 15.89416786, '15° 53\' 39.004296\"', 120.69728870, '120° 41\' 50.239320\"', 'PNG-4005 From Balungao Municipal Hall, travel east along the National Highway towards the Municipality of Umingan for about 2.0 km. until reaching the brgy. road leading to Angayan Sur. Turn right ad follow the road until reaching the Welcome Arc of Angayan Sur (about 1 km.) Station mark is located inside a private property about 25 m. right (west) of the welcome arc and about 1m. away from a barbed wire fence. Station mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set in a drilled hole and cemented flushed at he top 20 m x 20 cms. concrete monument set 0.20 m above the ground with Inscriptions, \"PNG 4005;2009 DENR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.89416786, '15° 53\' 39.004310\"', 120.69728870, '120° 41\' 50.239180\"', 0.0000, '0', 86.8180, 0.0000, '4', 44.9096, 253443.21760, 1758586.25900, '51', 15.89576197, '15° 53\' 44.743080\"', 120.69595930, '120° 41\' 45.453650\"', 47.8110, 1757936.81600, 467441.43000, '3', 253299.38900, 1758656.95100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
