(10255, 'PNG-41', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANAOAG', 'CALAOCAN', 1996, 16.04449663, '16° 2\' 40.187868\"', 120.49151230, '120° 29\' 29.444280\"', 'PNG-41 Is in Manaoag, Pangasinan at Brgy. Calaocan. It is on top of the rip-rap on the S side of the provincial road leading to the municipality of Binalonan. Station is about 25 m. SE of the E corner of the fence of Manaoag Central School and about 12 m. SW of the entrance of Viron Transit Manaoag Ofc. Mark is the center of the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on a drilled hole and cemented flush to the top surface of the rip-rap. Inscription read \"PNG-41, 1996, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.04449663, '16° 2\' 40.187860\"', 120.49151230, '120° 29\' 29.444440\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.9260, 0.0000, '3', 30.3398, 231599.29090, 1775481.99000, '51', 16.04610464, '16° 2\' 45.976720\"', 120.49018630, '120° 29\' 24.670540\"', 33.8711, 1774615.16800, 445446.29500, '3', 231455.79600, 1775553.47900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
