(10285, 'PNG-4698A', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'SAN VICENTE', 2013, 15.98678760, '15° 59\' 12.435360\"', 120.70800910, '120° 42\' 28.832760\"', 'PNG-4698 A Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria, Barangay San Vicente. From Tayug, Pangasinan travel West towards San Vicente, Sta Maria, Pangasinan until reaching San Vicente Elementary School. PNG-4698 is located about 30m. SW of San Vicente Elementary School gate and about 250m. West of PNG-4713 inside the residence of Geodetic Engr. Damian. Mark is the head of a 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.30m x 0.30 m. x 1.20 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscription \"PNG-4698 2013 DENR LMS R-1', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.98678760, '15° 59\' 12.435350\"', 120.70800910, '120° 42\' 28.832640\"', 0.0000, '0', 89.6720, 0.0000, '2', 47.5068, 254704.29530, 1768825.67500, '51', 15.98838726, '15° 59\' 18.194120\"', 120.70668190, '120° 42\' 24.054980\"', 50.9190, 1768183.94800, 468604.09200, '3', 254560.78500, 1768896.41100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
