(10301, 'PNG-4713', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'SAN VICENTE', 2013, 15.98768584, '15° 59\' 15.669024\"', 120.70949920, '120° 42\' 34.197120\"', 'PNG-4713 The station is located at Barangay San Vicente, Sta. Maria, Pangasinan inside the residence of Geodetic Engineer Damian about 250 meters East of PNG-4698 and 150 meters West of PNG-3681. Station mark is the head of 5\" copper nail centered on a 0.30 x 0.30 x 1.20m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscriptions PNG-4713, 2013, 3RD ORDER, DENR/LMS-1.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.98768584, '15° 59\' 15.669030\"', 120.70949920, '120° 42\' 34.196970\"', 0.0000, '0', 89.5390, 0.0000, '3', 47.3596, 254864.93730, 1768923.34300, '51', 15.98928553, '15° 59\' 21.427890\"', 120.70817210, '120° 42\' 29.419390\"', 50.7840, 1768283.11500, 468763.73000, '3', 254721.43200, 1768994.07600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10302, 'PNG-4713A', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTA MARIA', 'SAN VICENTE', 2013, 15.98768573, '15° 59\' 15.668628\"', 120.70949900, '120° 42\' 34.196400\"', 'PNG-4713 A Station is located in the Province of Pangasinan, municipality of Sta. Maria,Barangay San Vicente. From Tayug Pangasinan travel West towards San Vicente, Sta.Maria, Pangasinan until reaching the residence of Geodetic Engr. Damian. PNG-4713 is located inside the residence of Geodetic Engr. Damian about 250 m. East of PNG-4698 and about 150m. West of PNG-3681. Mark is the head of a 5 copper nail centered on a 0.30 m x 0.30 m. x 1.20 m. concrete monument embedded in the ground with inscription \" PNG-4713 2013 DENR LMS R-1\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.98768573, '15° 59\' 15.668610\"', 120.70949900, '120° 42\' 34.196320\"', 0.0000, '0', 89.4730, 0.0000, '2', 47.2936, 254864.91780, 1768923.33000, '51', 15.98928541, '15° 59\' 21.427470\"', 120.70817190, '120° 42\' 29.418740\"', 50.7180, 1768283.10300, 468763.71000, '3', 254721.41200, 1768994.06300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10303, 'PNG-49', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'UMINGAN', 'GONZALES', 2007, 15.91355128, '15° 54\' 48.784608\"', 120.76545950, '120° 45\' 55.654200\"', 'PNG-49 From Umingan Town Hall, travel for about 9 km. S going to Capas, Tarlac until reaching Carayungan Bridge (Km. 192 + 144). Station is located on the NE end of the said bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embbedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-49 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.91355128, '15° 54\' 48.784620\"', 120.76545950, '120° 45\' 55.654350\"', 0.0000, '0', 104.6310, 0.0000, '2', 62.1926, 260768.59220, 1760652.49500, '51', 15.91514510, '15° 54\' 54.522370\"', 120.76413080, '120° 45\' 50.870770\"', 65.5174, 1760072.07800, 474744.11100, '3', 260624.88400, 1760722.98300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10304, 'PNG-5 (NAMBERSIAN-1905)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGUILAR', 'NIÑOY', 1993, 15.86763425, '15° 52\' 3.483300\"', 120.25368770, '120° 15\' 13.275720\"', 'PNG-5 = NAMBERSIAN To reach the station from the catholic church in Aguilar town ìproper to Brgy. Ninoy proper, approx. 2.8 km. SE, turn left at ìthe intersection of the national road and dirt road going to the ìbarrio proper of San Jose. Travel on the dirt road passing by ìseveral houses. For about 800 m. from the road intersection in ìBrgy. Ninoy, there is a foot trail near the last house at the ìfoot of the hill that leads to the station. The station is in the ìcenter top of the rock but not the highest part. Two ladders were ìused to scale the rock. Station mark is original drilled hole ìfound, 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in drilled hole with ìcement patty and inscribed with station name. Reference mark (RM) ìis 4, RMs are 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods set in drilled ìholes on top of a big rock, 4 m. x 5 m. x 12 m. dia. and ìinscribed with RM numbers. Original drilled holes of RM-1, RM-2 ìand RM-3 were recovered.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.86763425, '15° 52\' 3.483310\"', 120.25368770, '120° 15\' 13.275680\"', 0.0000, '0', 141.7439, 0.0000, '1', 98.3295, 205878.62260, 1756222.26400, '51', 15.86923643, '15° 52\' 9.251140\"', 120.25235720, '120° 15\' 8.485840\"', 103.7330, 1755121.07900, 419925.63600, '3', 205734.34000, 1756294.37300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10305, 'PNG-50', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ASINGAN', 'POBLACION EAST', 2007, 16.00429940, '16° 0\' 15.477840\"', 120.66922540, '120° 40\' 9.211440\"', 'PNG-50 Is located at the center of Asingan Mun. Auditorium, about 30 m. N of the mun. hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-50 NAMRIA 2007.\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.00429940, '16° 0\' 15.477840\"', 120.66922540, '120° 40\' 9.211600\"', 0.0000, '0', 88.6680, 0.0000, '2', 46.7099, 250573.35840, 1770810.26500, '51', 16.00590101, '16° 0\' 21.243630\"', 120.66789870, '120° 40\' 4.435190\"', 50.0611, 1770128.06100, 464455.90100, '3', 250429.87400, 1770881.14300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10306, 'PNG-52', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SISON', 'ASAN SUR', 2007, 16.15914741, '16° 9\' 32.930676\"', 120.53643880, '120° 32\' 11.179680\"', 'PNG-52 From San Fabian, travel towards San Fernando, La Union until reaching the junction road going to Sison Mun. Hall. From there, travel along the nat\'l. highway until reaching the intersection road, which measures about 2.5 km. Then proceed towards the Northern Cement Corp. until reaching the third bridge (10 m. in length). Station is located 0.7 m. from the SW corner of the said bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 m. concrete monument protruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-52 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.15914741, '16° 9\' 32.930670\"', 120.53643880, '120° 32\' 11.179620\"', 0.0000, '0', 124.5640, 0.0000, '2', 82.6369, 236560.28600, 1788116.42000, '51', 16.16076156, '16° 9\' 38.741620\"', 120.53511550, '120° 32\' 6.415650\"', 86.7476, 1787290.79000, 450282.68700, '3', 236417.21400, 1788187.85900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10307, 'PNG-53', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'POZZORUBIO', 'AMAGBAGAN', 2007, 16.09528458, '16° 5\' 43.024488\"', 120.53324190, '120° 31\' 59.670840\"', 'PNG-53 Is located in Brgy. Amagbagan, Pozorrubio. It is situated along the farm-to-market road, which is between Amagbagan Brgy. Hall and Ama-Talo Elem. School. It is 50 m. N of the intersection of the provincial road and the farm-to-market road, 0.4 m. W of the road and 0.5 m. N of the irrigation canal. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embbedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument protruding 0.2 m. above the ground, with inscriptions \"PNG-53 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.09528458, '16° 5\' 43.024490\"', 120.53324190, '120° 31\' 59.670920\"', 0.0000, '0', 82.7540, 0.0000, '2', 41.1045, 236133.65140, 1781050.70700, '51', 16.09689484, '16° 5\' 48.821430\"', 120.53191710, '120° 31\' 54.901520\"', 44.7516, 1780224.61600, 449924.59100, '3', 235990.36100, 1781122.10300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10308, 'PNG-54', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'ANONAS', 2007, 16.00363318, '16° 0\' 13.079448\"', 120.57619470, '120° 34\' 34.300920\"', 'PNG-54 Is located inside the new Urdaneta City Hall Complex in Brgy. Anonas. It is 2.5 m. SE of the flagpole and about 20 m. S of the fountain. mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"PNG-54 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.00363318, '16° 0\' 13.079460\"', 120.57619470, '120° 34\' 34.300990\"', 0.0000, '0', 74.9790, 0.0000, '2', 33.4101, 240611.88880, 1770850.52800, '51', 16.00523679, '16° 0\' 18.852460\"', 120.57486780, '120° 34\' 29.524060\"', 36.5955, 1770072.70800, 454498.71600, '3', 240468.32600, 1770921.70700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10309, 'PNG-55', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BALUNGAO', 'ESMERALDA', 2007, 15.86449527, '15° 51\' 52.182972\"', 120.71438370, '120° 42\' 51.781320\"', 'PNG-55 From Urdaneta town proper, travel towards Balungao. From Balungao town proper, travel E for about 4 km. until reaching the intersection then turn right and continue traveling for about 4.8 km. towards Brgy. Esmeralda. Station is located on top of the bridge sidewalk, at the NW edge. Mark is a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-55 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.86449527, '15° 51\' 52.182980\"', 120.71438370, '120° 42\' 51.781170\"', 0.0000, '0', 102.0730, 0.0000, '2', 60.0932, 255238.58570, 1755281.75000, '51', 15.86608714, '15° 51\' 57.913720\"', 120.71305370, '120° 42\' 46.993190\"', 62.9357, 1754650.80100, 469267.51000, '3', 255094.67100, 1755352.36200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10310, 'PNG-56', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SANTO TOMAS', 'SALVACION', 2007, 15.87803539, '15° 52\' 40.927404\"', 120.58321830, '120° 34\' 59.585880\"', 'PNG-56 From Urdaneta, travel S until reaching Villasis then pass the Carmen Bridge. Then turn right until reaching Sto. Tomas Mun. Hall, about 2 km. from the intersection of Brgy. Carmen. Station is located in the town plaza fronting the mun. hall. It is situated 8.6 m. from the NE column of the waiting shed and 8.2 m. from the S entrance road. Mark is a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 m. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"PNG-56 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.87803539, '15° 52\' 40.927420\"', 120.58321830, '120° 34\' 59.585870\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.1340, 0.0000, '2', 27.5408, 241202.74700, 1756938.34200, '51', 15.87963101, '15° 52\' 46.671620\"', 120.58188840, '120° 34\' 54.798360\"', 30.3554, 1756173.03600, 455222.27900, '3', 241058.76800, 1757009.39100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10311, 'PNG-57 (ARI-15)', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ALCALA', 'LAOAC', 2005, 15.83237003, '15° 49\' 56.532108\"', 120.49668650, '120° 29\' 48.071400\"', 'PNG-57 (ARI-15) Is located just about the SE foot of Hector mendoza Bridge going to Alcala. It is about 3 m. from the Phil-JICA Agno River Control Project marker. Mark is a cross cut on top of a 2 cm. brass rod centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. monument protruding about 2 cm. from the ground, with inscriptions \"ARI-15 2005 DPWH\". Reported by: HON. Surveying June 2016', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.83237003, '15° 49\' 56.532100\"', 120.49668650, '120° 29\' 48.071270\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.2580, 0.0000, '2', 27.1910, 231871.27830, 1751992.00400, '51', 15.83396495, '15° 50\' 2.273830\"', 120.49535540, '120° 29\' 43.279530\"', 30.5520, 1751140.54300, 445942.66500, '3', 231727.07600, 1752063.32500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10312, 'PNG-60', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN JACINTO', 'LOBONG', 2007, 16.07751237, '16° 4\' 39.044532\"', 120.45495240, '120° 27\' 17.828640\"', 'PNG-60 From San Jacinto Mun. Hall, travel along the provincial road going to Brgy. Lobong for about 2 km. until reaching the welcome sign of the said brgy. Station is located on the NW end of Gonogong Bridge, about 10 m. NW of the welcome sign and about 4 m. NE from the centerline of the road. It is also situated on the concrete sidewalk of the said bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-60 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07751237, '16° 4\' 39.044530\"', 120.45495240, '120° 27\' 17.828490\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.6990, 0.0000, '2', 15.0799, 227730.25030, 1779184.83900, '51', 16.07912324, '16° 4\' 44.843680\"', 120.45362700, '120° 27\' 13.057190\"', 18.8324, 1778278.70800, 441543.73600, '3', 227586.83600, 1779256.47600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10313, 'PNG-62', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BASISTA', 'PALMA', 2007, 15.86460515, '15° 51\' 52.578540\"', 120.39622940, '120° 23\' 46.425840\"', 'PNG-62 From Basista Mun. Hall, travel 300 m. N until reaching Palma Bridge. Station is located at the SW end of the said bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-62 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.86460515, '15° 51\' 52.578540\"', 120.39622940, '120° 23\' 46.425770\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.8270, 0.0000, '2', 14.1410, 221149.46390, 1755691.77400, '51', 15.86620403, '15° 51\' 58.334520\"', 120.39489900, '120° 23\' 41.636230\"', 18.4614, 1754736.25700, 435191.78100, '3', 221005.28500, 1755763.42000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10314, 'PNG-63', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'POGON-LOMBOY', 2007, 15.78977746, '15° 47\' 23.198856\"', 120.30156730, '120° 18\' 5.642280\"', 'PNG-63 From Mangatarem town proper, travel SE along the road until reaching the Mystical Rose College of Science and Technology intersection. The said school is 0.9 km. away from the Mangatarem Mun. Hall. From the intersection, turn left and travel for about 0.55 km. Station is located at the concrete road shoulder, which is 5.56 m. SW of the SW corner of the adjacent CHB fence. Mark is a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 1 m. concrete monument, with inscriptions \"PNG-63 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.78977746, '15° 47\' 23.198850\"', 120.30156730, '120° 18\' 5.642400\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.2080, 0.0000, '4', 14.5669, 210898.83780, 1747535.41600, '51', 15.79137374, '15° 47\' 28.945460\"', 120.30023500, '120° 18\' 0.846100\"', 19.8480, 1746487.67800, 425024.99000, '3', 210754.32900, 1747607.30500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10315, 'PNG-64', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MANGATAREM', 'BARACBAC', 2007, 15.72448184, '15° 43\' 28.134624\"', 120.34261840, '120° 20\' 33.426240\"', 'PNG-64 From Mangatarem town proper, travel towards San Clemente until reaching Baracbac Bridge, which is about 200 m. from the Andangin Cemetery. Station is located at the top of the concrete shoulder/approach of the bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embbedded in a cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-64 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.72448184, '15° 43\' 28.134610\"', 120.34261840, '120° 20\' 33.426410\"', 0.0000, '0', 65.4440, 0.0000, '2', 21.6068, 215208.52730, 1740250.25800, '51', 15.72607312, '15° 43\' 33.863230\"', 120.34128470, '120° 20\' 28.624790\"', 26.7894, 1739247.92100, 429400.78700, '3', 215063.83300, 1740321.95700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10316, 'PNG-65', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'CAOAYAN-KILING', 2008, 15.85553565, '15° 51\' 19.928340\"', 120.32320840, '120° 19\' 23.550240\"', 'PNG-65 From San Carlos Mun. Hall, travel along the nat\'l. highway going to Urbiztondo until reaching the Caoayn-Kiling Plaza. Station is located inside the public plaza, situated along the E corner of the concrete pavement about 2.5 m. NW of the SE wall and approx. 8 m. NNE of the second gate. It is beside the concrete bench nearest to the said gate. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-65 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.85553565, '15° 51\' 19.928350\"', 120.32320840, '120° 19\' 23.550060\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.7580, 0.0000, '2', 9.5689, 213311.64800, 1754786.27500, '51', 15.85713558, '15° 51\' 25.688070\"', 120.32187760, '120° 19\' 18.759410\"', 14.5423, 1753756.75800, 427367.42500, '3', 213167.37800, 1754858.15100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10317, 'PNG-66', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'CALOMBOYAN', 2007, 15.94486786, '15° 56\' 41.524296\"', 120.30050300, '120° 18\' 1.810800\"', 'PNG-66 From San Carlos Mun. Hall, travel along the highway going to Binmaley. Then turn left to the brgy. road going to Brgy. Pangalangan. Station is located inside the compound of Calomboyan Elem. School. It is situated along and beside the SE side of the concrete base of the flagpole, which is about 20 m. NW of the gate. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. ìabove ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-66 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.94486786, '15° 56\' 41.524300\"', 120.30050300, '120° 18\' 1.810810\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.4390, 0.0000, '2', 5.5774, 211006.10030, 1764708.21900, '51', 15.94647386, '15° 56\' 47.305900\"', 120.29917430, '120° 17\' 57.027600\"', 10.5465, 1763650.31100, 424968.74300, '3', 210862.11300, 1764780.24600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10318, 'PNG-67', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'LINGAYEN', 'LIBSONG WEST', 2007, 16.03316033, '16° 1\' 59.377188\"', 120.23679930, '120° 14\' 12.477480\"', 'PNG-67 Is located in Brgy. Libsong West, Lingayaen, inside the compound of the Air Transportation Office (ATO) - Lingayen Airport. It is ìsituated 15 m. N of the flagpole, 5 m. E of the bounding wire ìfence and about 150 m. SW of the runway. Mark is the head of a 4 ìin. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 ìcm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-67 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.03316033, '16° 1\' 59.377200\"', 120.23679930, '120° 14\' 12.477650\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.4110, 0.0000, '2', 4.7866, 204311.82590, 1774573.77400, '51', 16.03477323, '16° 2\' 5.183630\"', 120.23547270, '120° 14\' 7.701590\"', 9.9389, 1773445.07100, 418184.35100, '3', 204168.08400, 1774646.08400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10319, 'PNG-68', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BUGALLON', 'POLONG', 2007, 15.97742866, '15° 58\' 38.743176\"', 120.20329890, '120° 12\' 11.876040\"', 'PNG-68 From Bugallon Mun. Hall, travel N along the nat\'l. road until reaching the Alaminos-Lingayen Crossing. Then turn left to the road going to Alaminos until reaching Polong Elem. School. Station is located inside the said school compound, approx. 20 m. NE from the flagpole, about 5 m. W from the third pillar (starting from the N end of the gate) of the wall, about 6 m. N from the plant box and approx. 0.2 m. SE from the SE corner of the court. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"PNG-68 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.97742866, '15° 58\' 38.743190\"', 120.20329890, '120° 12\' 11.876040\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.1940, 0.0000, '2', 5.2124, 200641.43120, 1768450.88100, '51', 15.97903883, '15° 58\' 44.539770\"', 120.20197090, '120° 12\' 7.095130\"', 10.6351, 1767291.21500, 414575.28500, '3', 200497.47400, 1768523.25300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10320, 'PNG-7', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF DAGUPAN', 'BONUAN GUESET', 1991, 16.07280142, '16° 4\' 22.085112\"', 120.33554840, '120° 20\' 7.974240\"', 'PNG-7 Is in the Island of Luzon, Province of Pangasinan, City of Dagupan. It is on the last top step of the Bonuan Guesset Lighthouse where the Coast Guard Detachment is also loacated. It is about 10 min. drive from Dagupan City proper and at the back of Bonuan Guesset High School. Station mark is 4\" copper nail embedded on a cement patty.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.07280142, '16° 4\' 22.085100\"', 120.33554840, '120° 20\' 7.974240\"', 0.0000, '0', 61.1066, 0.0000, '1', 19.0366, 214941.99380, 1778824.28800, '51', 16.07441460, '16° 4\' 27.892570\"', 120.33422280, '120° 20\' 3.202020\"', 23.5150, 1777795.10700, 428766.59600, '3', 214798.46700, 1778896.30800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10321, 'PNG-70', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'POBLACION', 2007, 16.06562598, '16° 3\' 56.253528\"', 120.09547870, '120° 5\' 43.723320\"', 'PNG-70 IS LOCATED ON THE ROOFTOP OF SUAL MUN. HALL, AT THE CENTER OF THE S WING OF THE SAID ROOFTOP. MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4 IN. COPPER NAIL CENTERED AND EMBEDDED IN A 30 CM. X 30 CM. CEMENT PUTTY, WITH INSCRIPTIONS \"PNG-70 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.06562598, '16° 3\' 56.253540\"', 120.09547870, '120° 5\' 43.723240\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.5170, 0.0000, '2', 14.0426, 189228.84470, 1778375.80100, '51', 16.06724399, '16° 4\' 2.078370\"', 120.09415260, '120° 5\' 38.949300\"', 19.4854, 1777099.16500, 403075.74500, '3', 189085.09900, 1778448.60000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10322, 'PNG-71', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SUAL', 'PAITAN EAST', 2007, 16.08411329, '16° 5\' 2.807844\"', 120.02724570, '120° 1\' 38.084520\"', 'PNG-71 Is located on the E approach of the old bridge connecting Brgys. Paitan East and Paitan West. It is about 10 m. N of the centerline of the new bridge and 1 m. E of the edge of the approach. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 20 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-71 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.08411329, '16° 5\' 2.807830\"', 120.02724570, '120° 1\' 38.084630\"', 0.0000, '0', 75.9220, 0.0000, '2', 33.8793, 181952.13400, 1780526.91900, '51', 16.08573393, '16° 5\' 8.642150\"', 120.02592000, '120° 1\' 33.311960\"', 39.1116, 1779178.44300, 395784.02000, '3', 181808.39500, 1780599.95600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10323, 'PNG-72', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'TORITORI', 2007, 16.23398537, '16° 14\' 2.347332\"', 119.99593380, '119° 59\' 45.361680\"', 'PNG-72 From Alaminos proper, travel N for about 29 km. then turn right and travel for about 6 km. up to Anda proper. Then travel for about 12 km. to Brgy. Toritori. Station is located along the N side of the concrete brgy. road going to Sitio Mangasen. It is about 120 m. SE of the brgy. plaza, about 65 m. E of the Kingdom Hall of Jehova\'s Witnesses, about 55 m. E of a waiting shed, about 30 m. SW of an unfinished concrete house and 0.9 m. N of the N side of the road. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 20 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-72 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 14 2.35458 E 119 59 45.37526 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 55.565 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.23398537, '16° 14\' 2.347340\"', 119.99593380, '119° 59\' 45.361540\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.7800, 0.0000, '2', 15.0080, 820287.94780, 1797160.32500, '50', 16.23561599, '16° 14\' 8.217560\"', 119.99461150, '119° 59\' 40.601350\"', 19.4995, 1795780.90600, 392515.07800, '3', 820148.25500, 1797229.44400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10324, 'PNG-73', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'ANDA', 'POBLACION', 2007, 16.28609418, '16° 17\' 9.939048\"', 119.95371180, '119° 57\' 13.362480\"', 'PNG-73 From Alaminos proper, travel N for about 35 km. to Anda proper. Station is located about 300 m. SE of the mun. hall. It is situated inside the nursery compound, about 10 m. SW of the W corner of the Material Recovery Facility (MRF) Bldg. of Anda. It is also on the SSW side of the pit. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 20 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-73 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 17 9.94540 E 119 57 13.37692 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 67.745 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.28609418, '16° 17\' 9.939030\"', 119.95371180, '119° 57\' 13.362300\"', 0.0000, '0', 67.9940, 0.0000, '2', 27.8538, 815687.30420, 1802865.33100, '50', 16.28772893, '16° 17\' 15.824140\"', 119.95239060, '119° 57\' 8.606320\"', 31.9742, 1801570.62300, 388030.40900, '3', 815547.74300, 1802934.60800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10325, 'PNG-74', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF ALAMINOS', 'TANAYTAY', 2007, 16.14487351, '16° 8\' 41.544636\"', 119.98958110, '119° 59\' 22.491960\"', 'PNG-74 Is located on the N end of the Alaminos-Mabini By-Pass Rd. in Brgy. Tanaytay, Alaminos. It is situated on the elongated road island, 2.5 m. S of ALA-30A and 1.5 m. S of the island marker. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-74 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.14487351, '16° 8\' 41.544650\"', 119.98958110, '119° 59\' 22.491990\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.1680, 0.0000, '4', 10.7643, 819751.97820, 1787281.74200, '50', 16.14649876, '16° 8\' 47.395520\"', 119.98825670, '119° 59\' 17.724260\"', 15.6326, 1785922.20800, 391787.07500, '3', 819612.00900, 1787350.81800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10326, 'PNG-75', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'MABINI', 'POBLACION', 2007, 16.06941349, '16° 4\' 9.888564\"', 119.94103650, '119° 56\' 27.731400\"', 'PNG-75 Is located on top of the waiting shed, about 2.5 m. high, in the main entrance of Mabini Town Hall compound. It is situated 1 m. N of the S edge of the said rooftop. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 20 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-75 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.06941349, '16° 4\' 9.888550\"', 119.94103650, '119° 56\' 27.731410\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.0020, 0.0000, '4', 26.5515, 814675.06440, 1778850.47200, '50', 16.07103511, '16° 4\' 15.726390\"', 119.93971030, '119° 56\' 22.957130\"', 31.3561, 1777597.19200, 386551.32200, '3', 814534.83400, 1778919.64000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10327, 'PNG-76', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'CITY OF URDANETA', 'CATABLAN', 2007, 15.96598686, '15° 57\' 57.552696\"', 120.48871880, '120° 29\' 19.387680\"', 'PNG-76 From Urdaneta City, travel 30 km. W to Pauling then go 250 m. S until reaching the boundary of Brgys. Catablan (Sitio Nambacuran) and Lunec. Station is located NE of the arc of Brgy. Lunec, 12 m. E of the road and at the SW corner of Mr. Ferdinand Frianeza\'s residence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 0.3 m. x 0.3 m. x 1 m. concrete monument flushed on the ground, with inscriptions \"PNG-76 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.96598686, '15° 57\' 57.552710\"', 120.48871880, '120° 29\' 19.387680\"', 0.0000, '0', 65.5980, 0.0000, '2', 23.8750, 231195.12170, 1766794.17100, '51', 15.96759005, '15° 58\' 3.324170\"', 120.48739090, '120° 29\' 14.607140\"', 27.3129, 1765928.19700, 445125.72800, '3', 231051.36000, 1766865.60300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10328, 'PNG-77', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'INFANTA', 'MAYA', 2007, 15.82062398, '15° 49\' 14.246328\"', 119.92998360, '119° 55\' 47.940960\"', 'PNG-77 From Infanta Mun. Hall, travel along the nat\'l. road going to Dasol for about 100 m. until reaching the Y-road. Turn right to ìthe brgy. road going to Brgy. Maya until reaching the 10 m. high water tank, about 8 m. S from the centerline of the road. Station is located on top of the water tank, approx. 1.7 m. NW from the SW corner and about 1 m. from both sides of the tank. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-77 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 49 14.26054 E 119 55 47.95527 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 89.378 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.82062398, '15° 49\' 14.246340\"', 119.92998360, '119° 55\' 47.940880\"', 0.0000, '0', 89.7870, 0.0000, '4', 48.1119, 813878.95940, 1751283.32200, '50', 15.82223036, '15° 49\' 20.029290\"', 119.92865160, '119° 55\' 43.145580\"', 52.4207, 1750069.80500, 385226.47800, '3', 813737.96200, 1751352.35000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10329, 'PNG-78', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'EGUIA', 2007, 15.90766103, '15° 54\' 27.579708\"', 119.88328430, '119° 52\' 59.823480\"', 'PNG-78 From dasol Mun. Hall, travel for 15 mins. along the nat\'l. highway going to Infanta until reaching Eguia Elem. School. Station is located inside the school compound. It is situated at the backyard of the said school about 30 m. S of the water tank, approx. 6 m. NE of the small rectangular concrete plant box. It is also about 80 m. W of the E wall, along the imaginary line connecting the cellular network antenna and the plant box. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-78 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 54 27.59247 E 119 52 59.83858 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 46.102 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.90766103, '15° 54\' 27.579720\"', 119.88328430, '119° 52\' 59.823380\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.5420, 0.0000, '2', 5.4708, 808739.88250, 1760851.90000, '50', 15.90927387, '15° 54\' 33.385940\"', 119.88195420, '119° 52\' 55.035200\"', 9.5494, 1759728.42700, 380274.65500, '3', 808599.11900, 1760921.12800, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10330, 'PNG-79', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'POBLACION', 2007, 15.98859047, '15° 59\' 18.925692\"', 119.87620930, '119° 52\' 34.353480\"', 'PNG-79 From Dasol Crossing, travel S along the nat\'l. road going to Infanta for about 60 m. Turn left to the road going to Dasol Public Market until reaching the 7 m. high water tank, approx. 10 m. E of the said market. Station is located on top of the water tank, approx. 1.2 m. SE from the NW corner of the tank and about 0.8 m. from both sides of the tank. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"PNG-79 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 59 18.93704 E 119 52 34.36900 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 53.637 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.98859047, '15° 59\' 18.925690\"', 119.87620930, '119° 52\' 34.353560\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.0650, 0.0000, '4', 13.1521, 807858.04370, 1769803.01600, '50', 15.99020849, '15° 59\' 24.750580\"', 119.87488120, '119° 52\' 29.572180\"', 17.3326, 1768689.10000, 379565.49500, '3', 807717.52300, 1769872.32000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10331, 'PNG-80', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BURGOS', 'DON MATIAS', 2007, 16.06435996, '16° 3\' 51.695856\"', 119.86729650, '119° 52\' 2.267400\"', 'PNG-80 Is located on the open ground W of the academics compound of Burgos Nat\'l. High School. It is situated 15 m. S of a Mango tree, which is 125 m. W of BBM No. 14. The boundary marker is about 150 m. N of the cemented brgy. road of Don Matias bounding the E side of the said school. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-80 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.06435996, '16° 3\' 51.695850\"', 119.86729650, '119° 52\' 2.267550\"', 0.0000, '0', 124.8820, 0.0000, '2', 84.2411, 806787.35540, 1778180.00600, '50', 16.06598287, '16° 3\' 57.538320\"', 119.86597020, '119° 51\' 57.492580\"', 88.3996, 1777079.91400, 378657.37400, '3', 806647.06200, 1778249.38600, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10332, 'PNG-81', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'ARWAS', 2007, 16.19713792, '16° 11\' 49.696512\"', 119.86289980, '119° 51\' 46.439280\"', 'PNG-81 Is located in Brgy. Arwas, Bani, on a dike of the rice paddies 20 m. E of the Materials Recovery Facility compound, about 300 m. W of the road leading to Bolinao and 25 m. NW of a water pump. Mark ìis the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-81 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 11 49.70440 E 119 51 46.45525 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 50.680 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.19713792, '16° 11\' 49.696520\"', 119.86289980, '119° 51\' 46.439290\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.0550, 0.0000, '4', 10.9918, 806112.30650, 1792876.44400, '50', 16.19876917, '16° 11\' 55.569000\"', 119.86157650, '119° 51\' 41.675430\"', 14.9848, 1791777.55700, 378268.33400, '3', 805972.41500, 1792945.93100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10333, 'PNG-82', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'SAMPALOC', 2007, 16.26489508, '16° 15\' 53.622288\"', 119.87655490, '119° 52\' 35.597640\"', 'PNG-82 From Bani proper, travel N going to Bolinao for about 11 km. to reach the station. It is about 14 km. from Bolinao proper. Station is located at the SE corner of the culvert along the road to Sampaloc Nat\'l. High School. It is about 50 m. E of the said school and about 25 m. W of the nat\'l. highway. Mark is the head ìof a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-82 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 15 53.62903 E 119 52 35.61359 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 135.131 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.26489508, '16° 15\' 53.622300\"', 119.87655490, '119° 52\' 35.597740\"', 0.0000, '0', 135.4700, 0.0000, '4', 95.6436, 807468.02510, 1800399.98700, '50', 16.26653019, '16° 15\' 59.508700\"', 119.87523330, '119° 52\' 30.839700\"', 99.5726, 1799268.45700, 379769.96700, '3', 807328.35100, 1800469.47600, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `hgcp_stations_new` (`id`, `station_name`, `island_group`, `region`, `province`, `city_or_municipality`, `barangay`, `year_established`, `latitude`, `latitude_dms`, `longitude`, `longitude_dms`, `description`, `year_surveyed`, `project`, `epoch`, `latitude_wgs84`, `latitude_wgs84_dms`, `longitude_wgs84`, `longitude_wgs84_dms`, `error_ellipse`, `accuracy_class`, `ellipsoidal_ht_wgs84`, `height_error`, `order_of_accuracy_wgs84`, `egm2008_elevation`, `utm_x_wgs84`, `utm_y_wgs84`, `utm_zone_wgs84`, `latitude_prs92`, `latitude_prs92_dms`, `longitude_prs92`, `longitude_prs92_dms`, `ellipsoidal_ht_prs92`, `northing_ptm`, `easting_ptm`, `ptm_zone`, `utm_x_prs92`, `utm_y_prs92`, `utm_zone_prs92`, `latitude_itrf`, `latitude_itrf_dms`, `longitude_itrf`, `longitude_itrf_dms`, `error_ellipse_itrf`, `ellipsoidal_ht_itrf`, `height_error_itrf`, `year_computed`, `encoder`, `date_updated`, `reference_file`) VALUES
(10334, 'PNG-83', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BOLINAO', 'ILOGMALINO', 2007, 16.34832367, '16° 20\' 53.965212\"', 119.81734070, '119° 49\' 2.426520\"', 'PNG-83 From Bolinao town proper, travel SW going to Ilog-Malino Elem. ìSchool and Puerto Del Sol Beach Resort for about 10 km. or 15 ìmins. turning right at Brgy. Estanza marker. Upon reaching the ìschool, turn left or E on the S side of the school and travel for ìabout 1.2 km. or 5 mins. Going from the school to the station, ìturn left or E at the first Y-intersection. Then at the second ìY-intersection, both can be accessed either E or S. From the ìintersection going E, where the vehicles normally pass, travle ìfor about 25 m. and follow the trail going S passing by a ìSampaloc tree for about 43 m. to reach the station. Station is ìlocated on the lot owned by a certain Mr. Alejo Nicolas, about ì250 m. NW of his house and about 25 m. S of the Sampaloc tree. ìMark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in ìa 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block protruding 20 cm. above ground ìsurface, with inscriptions \"PNG-83 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 20 53.97056 E 119 49 2.44345 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 72.022 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.34832367, '16° 20\' 53.965210\"', 119.81734070, '119° 49\' 2.426490\"', 0.0000, '0', 72.4060, 0.0000, '4', 33.6607, 801006.73280, 1809549.90800, '50', 16.34996523, '16° 20\' 59.874830\"', 119.81602090, '119° 48\' 57.675180\"', 36.9060, 1808537.96600, 373493.40400, '3', 800867.27500, 1809619.63000, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10335, 'PNG-84', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'BANI', 'DACAP SUR', 2007, 16.23124744, '16° 13\' 52.490784\"', 119.80049700, '119° 48\' 1.789200\"', 'PNG-84 From Bani proper, travel N for about 7 km. to Brgy. Tiep Elem. ìSchool. Then travel W going to Brgy. Dacap Sur for about 9 km. ìuntil reaching the brgy. hall and the basketball court. Station ìis located inside the lot of a certain Mr. Edgar Asañas and ìtenanted by a certain Jun and Cresing Quiñola. It is situated ìabout 300 m. W of the brgy. hall, about 11 m. N of the road, 13 ìm. SE of the SE corner of an unfinished concrete house, about 11 ìm. E of a concrete pavement inside the lot and about 10 m. S of ìthe well. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and ìembedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 20 cm. concrete block, with ìinscriptions \"PNG-84 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 13 52.49811 E 119 48 1.80647 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 193.665 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.23124744, '16° 13\' 52.490800\"', 119.80049700, '119° 48\' 1.789320\"', 0.0000, '0', 194.0970, 0.0000, '4', 154.8308, 799383.80410, 1796561.23400, '50', 16.23288212, '16° 13\' 58.375640\"', 119.79917450, '119° 47\' 57.028180\"', 158.2816, 1795590.84500, 371616.97500, '3', 799243.98000, 1796630.92300, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10336, 'PNG-85', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'POBLACION WEST', 2007, 16.11949520, '16° 7\' 10.182720\"', 119.79678290, '119° 47\' 48.418440\"', 'PNG-85 Is located at the grounds of Agno Nat\'l. High School, about 400 ìm. N of Agno Mun. Hall. It is situated 150 m. E of the basketball ìcourt and 100 m. NE of the wall separating the siad school from ìthe Agno Central School compound. Mark is the head of a 4 in. ìcopper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete ìblock, with inscriptions \"PNG-85 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 7 10.19189 E 119 47 48.43521 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 43.853 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.11949520, '16° 7\' 10.182720\"', 119.79678290, '119° 47\' 48.418260\"', 0.0000, '0', 44.3280, 0.0000, '4', 4.7972, 799154.87830, 1784181.65700, '50', 16.12112309, '16° 7\' 16.043110\"', 119.79545770, '119° 47\' 43.647580\"', 8.1828, 1783224.84100, 371147.09500, '3', 799014.70600, 1784251.28600, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10337, 'PNG-86', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'AGNO', 'GAYUSAN', 2007, 16.05373063, '16° 3\' 13.430268\"', 119.78467880, '119° 47\' 4.843680\"', 'PNG-86 Is located on the open backyard of Gayusan Elem. School. It is ìsituated about 25 m. E of the cemented pathway leading to the ìBoy\'s CR of the said school. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper ìnail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete block, ìwith inscriptions \"PNG-86 2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 16 3 13.44051 E 119 47 4.86059 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 75.977 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.05373063, '16° 3\' 13.430250\"', 119.78467880, '119° 47\' 4.843570\"', 0.0000, '0', 76.4870, 0.0000, '4', 37.0305, 797957.45260, 1776882.22700, '50', 16.05535469, '16° 3\' 19.276900\"', 119.78335200, '119° 47\' 0.067320\"', 40.1727, 1775953.90500, 369809.12400, '3', 797817.07200, 1776951.84600, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Vanessa', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10338, 'PNG-87', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'DASOL', 'ULI', 2007, 15.96011995, '15° 57\' 36.431820\"', 119.82045360, '119° 49\' 13.632960\"', 'PNG-87 From Dasol Mun. Hall, travel along the nat\'l. highway going to ìBurgos until reaching the brgy. road going to Brgy. Bobonot. Turn ìleft to the said road until reaching the Y-road. Turn right until ìreaching Uli Elem. School. Station is located inside the school ìcompound, about 1.3 m. S from the N wall and approx. 8 m. E of ìthe E end of the gate. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail ìcentered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. concrete monument ìprotruding 20 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"PNG-87 ì2007 NAMRIA\". WGS84 COORDINATES: N 15 57 36.44368 E 119 49 13.64919 ELLIPSOIDAL HT. : 44.913 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.96011995, '15° 57\' 36.431820\"', 119.82045360, '119° 49\' 13.632910\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.4090, 0.0000, '4', 5.3115, 801928.75630, 1766568.66700, '50', 15.96173743, '15° 57\' 42.254750\"', 119.81912470, '119° 49\' 8.848890\"', 8.7262, 1765571.39100, 373578.65300, '3', 801788.11200, 1766638.11600, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10339, 'PNG-89', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'SAN FELIPE WEST', 2007, 16.11868199, '16° 7\' 7.255164\"', 120.69925680, '120° 41\' 57.324480\"', 'PNG-89 To locate the station, cross the bridge for about 1 km. N of San Roque Power Corp. office and choose the dirt road that leads to the \"Spillway Power Intake\". On the second Y-intersection, choose the road that forks to the right, which leads all the way up to Sitio Moging. About 150 m. before reaching Cristobal Rodrigo Elem. School of Sitio Pakulang, turn right on a trail entering a deadend. A small trail that branches to the left leads to the ricefield. Follow the trail for about 50 m. Station is located on a ricefield dike maintained by a certain Mr. Ludivico Pacetes of Sitio Moging, Brgy. San Felipe West. It is situated 5 m. off the trail. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered and embedded in a 30 cm. x 30 cm. x 10 cm. concrete block, with inscriptions \"PNG-89 2007 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 16.11868199, '16° 7\' 7.255180\"', 120.69925680, '120° 41\' 57.324520\"', 0.0000, '0', 181.2610, 0.0000, '2', 138.4190, 253929.37380, 1783435.55500, '51', 16.12029005, '16° 7\' 13.044190\"', 120.69793280, '120° 41\' 52.557980\"', 142.9277, 1782780.18800, 467688.87800, '3', 253786.29900, 1783506.43100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10340, 'ZBS-3019', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'INFANTA', 'DOLIMAN', 2008, 15.81338764, '15° 48\' 48.195504\"', 119.97496440, '119° 58\' 29.871840\"', 'ZBS-3019 Station is located in Brgy. Doliman, Infanta, Pangasinan. It is situated on the NE corner of the concrete base of an old basketball court, S of the road heading to Doliman Elem. School. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, set in a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty flushed to the ground, with inscription, \"ZBS-3019, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.81338764, '15° 48\' 48.195490\"', 119.97496440, '119° 58\' 29.871820\"', 0.0000, '0', 58.6210, 0.0000, '4', 16.3747, 818712.63320, 1750549.77300, '50', 15.81499258, '15° 48\' 53.973280\"', 119.97363220, '119° 58\' 25.076080\"', 21.1239, 1749244.81300, 390041.79800, '3', 818571.64300, 1750618.66400, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'ysn', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10341, 'ZBS-3020', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'INFANTA', 'POTOL', 2008, 15.81307512, '15° 48\' 47.070432\"', 119.97961020, '119° 58\' 46.596720\"', 'ZBS-3020 Station is located in Brgy. Doliman, Infanta, Zambales. It is situated inside the compound of Doliman Elem. School, beside the school\'s basketball court. It is on the NE corner of the court, 20 m E of the main school bldg. and 50 m N of the school\'s flagpole. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, set in a 25 cm x 25 cm cement putty flushed to the ground, with inscription, \"ZBS-3020, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.81307512, '15° 48\' 47.070440\"', 119.97961020, '119° 58\' 46.596580\"', 0.0000, '0', 61.8990, 0.0000, '4', 19.5971, 819211.21680, 1750522.22500, '50', 15.81467994, '15° 48\' 52.847790\"', 119.97827800, '119° 58\' 41.800830\"', 24.3897, 1749207.79200, 390539.39200, '3', 819070.22900, 1750591.10100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'ysn', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10342, 'ZBS-3025', 'LUZON', 'REGION I', 'PANGASINAN', 'INFANTA', 'POTOL', 2008, 15.81094421, '15° 48\' 39.399156\"', 119.95282200, '119° 57\' 10.159200\"', 'ZBS-3025 Station is located in Brgy. Potol, Infanta, Zambales. It is situated on the open space in front of the Iglesia ni Cristo of Brgy. Potol. It is on the N bank of the Nayom River. It is about 7 Km. from Sta. Cruz town proper, and 4.5 Km. from the highway. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail, set in a 25 cm x 25 cm concrete monument, set flush to the ground, with inscriptions, \"ZBS-3025, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 15.81094421, '15° 48\' 39.399160\"', 119.95282200, '119° 57\' 10.159080\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.1620, 0.0000, '4', 9.1863, 816342.47590, 1750245.69700, '50', 15.81254949, '15° 48\' 45.178160\"', 119.95148970, '119° 57\' 5.363030\"', 13.7113, 1748986.16700, 387668.02400, '3', 816201.46300, 1750314.65100, '50', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'ysn', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
