(10347, 'MCRP-7', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PARAÑAQUE', 'LA HUERTA', 2014, 14.50171340, '14° 30\' 6.168229\"', 120.98979750, '120° 59\' 23.271113\"', 'MCRP-07 IS IN THE ISLAND OF LUZON, NATIONAL CAPITAL REGION (NCR) METRO MANILA, MUNICIPALITY OF PARAÑAQUE, BRGY. LA HUERTA. IT IS SITUATED ON THE MANILA-CAVITE COASTAL ROAD IN THE CENTER ISLAND ABOUT 15.0 M. FROM THE S APPROACH OF PARAÑAQUE BRIDGE AND OPPOSITE OF FISHERMAN\'S WHARF MARKET. STATION IS A 25 CM. X 25 CM. CONCRETE MONUMENT AND MARK IS THE HEAD OF A NAIL.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.50171340, '14° 30\' 6.168229\"', 120.98979750, '120° 59\' 23.271113\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.7542, 0.0000, '3', 9.4739, 283356.76010, 1604166.42200, '51', 14.50321219, '14° 30\' 11.563870\"', 120.98843580, '120° 59\' 18.368870\"', 8.9666, 1603842.96100, 498753.48500, '3', 283208.54300, 1604234.89500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10348, 'MCRP-8', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PARAÑAQUE', 'SAN DIONISIO', 2014, 14.49302510, '14° 29\' 34.890360\"', 120.98630170, '120° 59\' 10.685980\"', 'MCRP-08 IS IN THE ISLAND OF LUZON, NATIONAL CAPITAL REGION (NCR) METRO MANILA, MUNICIPALITY OF PARAÑAQUE, BRGY. KABIHASNAN. IT IS SITUATED ON THE MANILA-CAVITE COASTAL ROAD ON ITS W SIDE. IT IS ABOUT 625.0 M. FROM THE S APPROACH OF PARAÑAQUE BRIDGE AND 195.0 M. S 35° W FROM THE W CORNER SIDE OF OVERPASS BRIDGE. STATION IS A 25 CM. X 25 CM. CONCRETE MONUMENT AND MARK IS A 10 MM. DIA. STEEL POINT.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.49302510, '14° 29\' 34.890360\"', 120.98630170, '120° 59\' 10.685980\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.2700, 0.0000, '3', 5.0044, 282971.40460, 1603208.29200, '51', 14.49452354, '14° 29\' 40.284750\"', 120.98493970, '120° 59\' 5.782870\"', 4.4660, 1602881.74000, 498376.57300, '3', 282823.15300, 1603276.78400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10349, 'MCRP-9', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF LAS PIÑAS', 'DANIEL FAJARDO', 2014, 14.48191362, '14° 28\' 54.889030\"', 120.97774880, '120° 58\' 39.895760\"', 'MCRP-09 Is in the Island of Luzon, National Capital Region (NCR) Metro Manila, municipality of Las Piñas, Brgy. Daniel Fajardo. It is situated on Manila-Cavite Coastal Road on its W side. It is about 850.0 m. SW from the Coastal Road Toll Gate and it is oppositely located infront of Metro Manila South Garbage Transfer Station. MCRP-9 is a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument and mark is a 10 mm. dia. steel point.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.48191362, '14° 28\' 54.889030\"', 120.97774880, '120° 58\' 39.895760\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.0570, 0.0000, '3', 4.8412, 282038.41480, 1601986.82400, '51', 14.48341153, '14° 29\' 0.281520\"', 120.97638660, '120° 58\' 34.991660\"', 4.2428, 1601652.47400, 497454.46400, '3', 281890.11800, 1602055.33300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10350, 'MMA-100', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'NORTH FAIRVIEW', 2014, 14.71802180, '14° 43\' 4.878490\"', 121.04855630, '121° 2\' 54.802540\"', 'The station is approximately 500 m SW from the intersectiion of MIndanao and Commonwealth Avenues. It is drilled tot he concrete pavement of the road of the Northeastern tip of the 3rd island SW from the intersection. Mark is N 50 deg E from the concrete signboard containing \"Cresta Verde Executive Village\". It is also N 65 deg E from the intersection of Cresta Verde Avenue and Mindanao Avenue, about 30 m. Station mark is the center of a hexagonal stainless steel bolt located at the Northeastern tip of a road island.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.71802180, '14° 43\' 4.878490\"', 121.04855630, '121° 2\' 54.802540\"', 0.0000, '0', 96.6150, 0.0000, '3', 52.7474, 289897.20020, 1628047.61700, '51', 14.71953337, '14° 43\' 10.320140\"', 121.04719970, '121° 2\' 49.918990\"', 53.3012, 1627775.75700, 505082.72300, '3', 289749.75300, 1628116.11700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10351, 'MMA-100 (NF-03)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'NORTH FAIRVIEW', 1902, 14.71802131, '14° 43\' 4.876730\"', 121.04855780, '121° 2\' 54.808200\"', 'MMA-100 (NF-03) The station is approximately 500 m SW from the intersection of Mindanao and Commonwealth Avenues. It is drilled to the concrete pavement of the road of the Northeastern tip of the 3rd island SW from the intersection. Mark is N 50° E from the concrete signboard containing \"Cresta Verde Executive Village\". It is also N 65° E from the intersection of Cresta Verde Ave. and Mindanao Ave., about 30 m. Station mark is the center of a hexagonal stainless steel bolt located at the Northeastern tip of a road island.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.71802131, '14° 43\' 4.876730\"', 121.04855780, '121° 2\' 54.808200\"', 0.0000, '0', 97.0260, 0.0000, '3', 53.1584, 289897.36900, 1628047.56100, '51', 14.71953276, '14° 43\' 10.317936\"', 121.04720130, '121° 2\' 49.924677\"', 53.7117, 1627775.68900, 505082.89300, '3', 289749.92300, 1628116.04800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'TIM', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10352, 'MMA-105', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'TANDANG SORA', 1902, 14.67372450, '14° 40\' 25.408210\"', 121.04349430, '121° 2\' 36.579400\"', 'MMA-105 (TS-01) The station is located at the 1st island S from the intersection of Tandang Sora Ave. and Visayas Ave. From the Elliptical road it is approximately 2.30 km. It is S 75° E from the main gate of Far East Asia Village and N 5° W from the Visayas Ave. Market Wet and Dry. Station mark is the center of the head of a stainless steel bolt drilled to the gutter of the road island.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.67372450, '14° 40\' 25.408210\"', 121.04349430, '121° 2\' 36.579400\"', 0.0000, '0', 83.6500, 0.0000, '3', 39.8554, 289309.53390, 1623150.48700, '51', 14.67523333, '14° 40\' 30.840000\"', 121.04213670, '121° 2\' 31.692030\"', 40.2217, 1622874.55800, 504538.42100, '3', 289161.93500, 1623218.96300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10353, 'MMA-109 (WF-04)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'FAIRVIEW', 1902, 14.69733144, '14° 41\' 50.393170\"', 121.07620370, '121° 4\' 34.333360\"', 'MMA-109 (WF-04) Along Commonwealth Ave., enter through the main gate of Ideal Subdivision at the southern side of the highway. Travel around 650 m S through Doña Carmen Ave. until reaching Don Ernestito St., then follow this street traveling 500 m W. Turn southward along Lyszt street about 250 m. At this point a mini dam or a water control structure is located just after Abelardo St. From the center of the road, it is approximately 5 m W or 2 m E from the edge of the structure. The mark is about 10 m S from the northern base of the mini dam. Mark is the center of a hexagonal stainless steel bolt drilled at the western side of a mini dam.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.69733144, '14° 41\' 50.393170\"', 121.07620370, '121° 4\' 34.333360\"', 0.0000, '0', 104.4330, 0.0000, '3', 60.2973, 292855.33470, 1625732.50300, '51', 14.69884093, '14° 41\' 55.827336\"', 121.07484670, '121° 4\' 29.448227\"', 60.9924, 1625487.28400, 508060.66300, '3', 292707.84500, 1625800.88100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10354, 'MMA-110', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MUNTINLUPA', 'PUTATAN', 1904, 14.39085287, '14° 23\' 27.070340\"', 121.04474940, '121° 2\' 41.097900\"', 'MMA-110 Is located at the SW corner of the roofdeck of Muntinlupa Cosmopolitan School located along the national road, Brgy. Putatan, Muntinlupa City. The school is beside a creek which serves as the boundary of Brgys. Poblacion and Putatan. It is about 100 m. S of Muntinlupa City Hall. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered and set on top of a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscription \"MMA-110, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.39085287, '14° 23\' 27.070340\"', 121.04474940, '121° 2\' 41.097900\"', 0.0000, '0', 66.6420, 0.0000, '2', 22.7148, 289176.60160, 1591847.68800, '51', 14.39234336, '14° 23\' 32.436110\"', 121.04338510, '121° 2\' 36.186420\"', 22.4070, 1591577.77500, 504678.83400, '3', 289028.06500, 1591915.89300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2018-01-01', 'Erwin Del Rosario', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10355, 'MMA-111', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PARAÑAQUE', 'LA HUERTA', 1904, 14.49323701, '14° 29\' 35.653220\"', 120.99237540, '120° 59\' 32.551400\"', 'MMA-111 Is located along A. Santos Ave., on top of a 1.2 m. x 0.7 m. x 1.5 m. concrete post of the perimeter fence of Amvel Properties that serves as the gathering area of El Shaddai members. It is about 60 m. N of Airport Citimall, about 50 m. E from the station is the gate of Amvel, on the NE is a creek of about 20 m. wide and on 30 m. SW is the seafood market. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered and set on top of a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscription \"MMA-111, 2004, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.49323701, '14° 29\' 35.653220\"', 120.99237540, '120° 59\' 32.551400\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.7010, 0.0000, '2', 6.3856, 283626.44950, 1603225.98800, '51', 14.49473532, '14° 29\' 41.047140\"', 120.99101340, '120° 59\' 27.648370\"', 5.8840, 1602905.13500, 499031.29400, '3', 283478.20500, 1603294.45900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10356, 'MMA-112', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF LAS PIÑAS CITY', 'PAMPLONA TRES', 1904, 14.44623409, '14° 26\' 46.442730\"', 120.99382420, '120° 59\' 37.767030\"', 'NOTE: GCP was DISTURBED reported by Gravity Section December 2021 MMA-112 Is located at the W side of the fountain inside the compound of Emapalico Terminal. It is about 15 m. W of D. Aguilar Ave., Brgy. Pamplona III and 20 m. W from the gate of Emapalico Homes. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail centered and set on top of a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty, with inscription \"MMA-112, 2004, NAMRIA\". Reported by Certeza (MMA-12 Destroyed due to destruction of the fountain mentioned in the description where the point is located).', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.44623409, '14° 26\' 46.442730\"', 120.99382420, '120° 59\' 37.767030\"', 0.0000, '0', 63.2850, 0.0000, '2', 19.8688, 283737.12490, 1598023.31600, '51', 14.44772932, '14° 26\' 51.825560\"', 120.99246110, '120° 59\' 32.860010\"', 19.3305, 1597704.77100, 499187.17400, '3', 283588.72600, 1598091.73800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10357, 'MMA-118', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'BARANGAY 282', 2014, 14.59815532, '14° 35\' 53.359150\"', 120.97304230, '120° 58\' 22.952290\"', 'MMA-118 Is located on the gutter of the rooftop of the old Coast and Geodetic Survey Bldg., situated at the corner of Urbiztondo and Barraca Sts. It is adjacent to the W wall of the building abd about 0.7 m. N of the S wall of the building. Mark is a 3 in. copper nail flushed in a 15 cm. x 15 cm. cement putty, with inscriptions \"MMA-118, 2006, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.59815532, '14° 35\' 53.359150\"', 120.97304230, '120° 58\' 22.952290\"', 0.0000, '0', 63.8286, 0.0000, '2', 20.7594, 281645.24890, 1614854.72800, '51', 14.59966085, '14° 35\' 58.779060\"', 120.97168280, '120° 58\' 18.058130\"', 20.3563, 1614513.48400, 496948.99300, '3', 281497.33600, 1614923.36100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10358, 'MMA-123 (MMA-3002)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PASIG', 'KAPASIGAN', 2014, 14.56022231, '14° 33\' 36.800330\"', 121.07932980, '121° 4\' 45.587170\"', 'MMA-123 (MMA-3002) Is located at Brgy. Kapasigan, Pasig City, along the elevated center island of Caruncho Ave. It is also situated at about 2 m. from an electrical light post near the pedestrian lane, about 15 m. NE of the entrance gate of La Immaculada Concepcion School. Mark is the head of a 3 in. copper nail embedded and centered on a 25 cm. x 25 cm. concrete monument, with inscription \"MMA-3002\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.56022231, '14° 33\' 36.800330\"', 121.07932980, '121° 4\' 45.587170\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.4340, 0.0000, '2', 6.3281, 293063.54710, 1610557.76100, '51', 14.56172301, '14° 33\' 42.202840\"', 121.07796950, '121° 4\' 40.690280\"', 6.5945, 1610317.56000, 508402.18900, '3', 292915.60300, 1610626.01500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10359, 'MMA-124 (MMA-3003)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF TAGUIG', 'USUSAN', 2014, 14.53169743, '14° 31\' 54.110730\"', 121.06835330, '121° 4\' 6.071830\"', 'MMA-124 (MMA-3003) IS LOCATED AT THE N SIDE, W END OF COMMANDO BRIDGE APPROX. 400 M. GOING N FROM THE TAGUIG TOWN HALL LEADING TO BASES CONVERSION DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY (BCDA) OR C-5. THE BRIDGE IS ALONG C. P. GARCIA AVE. AND CAN BE REACHED WHEN GOING N ALONG GEN. LUNA ST. FROM THE TAGUIG TOWN HALL. MARK IS THE HEAD OF A 4 IN. COPPER NAIL EMBEDDED ON A 25 CM. X 25 CM. CEMENT PUTTY, WITH INSCRIPTIONS \"MMA-3003, 2005, LMS-NCR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.53169743, '14° 31\' 54.110730\"', 121.06835330, '121° 4\' 6.071830\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.4360, 0.0000, '2', 7.4408, 291853.79100, 1607411.32900, '51', 14.53319652, '14° 31\' 59.507480\"', 121.06699230, '121° 4\' 1.172450\"', 7.5421, 1607161.22400, 507220.18800, '3', 291705.74200, 1607479.59200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10360, 'MMA-126 (MMA-3005) (BLLM-1)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF NAVOTAS', 'SIPAC-ALMACEN', 2014, 14.65808017, '14° 39\' 29.088610\"', 120.94750310, '120° 56\' 51.011180\"', 'MMA-126 (MMA-3005/BLLM-1) Is located along the ENE side of Naval St. and is also situated at about 5 m. from the road centerline and about 20 m. NW of Navotas City Hall. Eastward of the station, across the road are establishments such as Dunkin Donuts, Mercury Drug, PS Bank and Jollibee.Mark is one end of a steel rod embedded and centered on the pavement of a square hole, with inscription \"BLLM-1\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.65808017, '14° 39\' 29.088610\"', 120.94750310, '120° 56\' 51.011180\"', 0.0000, '0', 45.6110, 0.0000, '2', 2.7773, 278953.02160, 1621510.91100, '51', 14.65959015, '14° 39\' 34.524550\"', 120.94614500, '120° 56\' 46.121950\"', 2.3719, 1621144.16200, 494199.01800, '3', 278805.28300, 1621579.68300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2018-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
