(10362, 'MMA-127 (MMA-3006) (BLLM-2)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF NAVOTAS', 'SIPAC-ALMACEN', 2014, 14.65720471, '14° 39\' 25.936970\"', 120.94790560, '120° 56\' 52.460270\"', 'MMA-127 (MMA-3006/BLLM-2) Is located inside the compound of Navotas Post Office and is also situated at about 10 m. SSW of the Post Office Bldg., near the concrete benches and coconut trees. Mark is one end of a steel rod embedded and centered on the pavement, with inscription \"BLLM-2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.65720471, '14° 39\' 25.936970\"', 120.94790560, '120° 56\' 52.460270\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.4650, 0.0000, '3', 3.6278, 278995.51010, 1621413.63700, '51', 14.65871463, '14° 39\' 31.372660\"', 120.94654750, '120° 56\' 47.571010\"', 3.2230, 1621047.29000, 494242.35100, '3', 278847.77000, 1621482.40700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10363, 'MMA-128', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PASIG', 'ROSARIO', 2014, 14.58949453, '14° 35\' 22.180290\"', 121.09239380, '121° 5\' 32.617790\"', 'MMA-128 (MMA-3007) Is located at Brgy. Rosario, Pasig City. It is situated at approx. 0.50 M from the chicken wire fence and about 15 M from Ortigas Bridge ( S of the bridge). Mark is the head of a 4 “ copper nail centered on a 30 CM x 30 CM cement putty protruding 20 CM above ground surface, with inscriptions, “MMA-3007 2006 LMS-NCR”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.58949453, '14° 35\' 22.180290\"', 121.09239380, '121° 5\' 32.617790\"', 0.0000, '0', 53.0340, 0.0000, '3', 8.7926, 294498.69970, 1613785.02600, '51', 14.59099682, '14° 35\' 27.588560\"', 121.09103430, '121° 5\' 27.723470\"', 9.2460, 1613556.73000, 509808.78800, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
