(10365, 'MMA-129 (MMA-3008)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PASIG', 'SANTA LUCIA', 2014, 14.58902103, '14° 35\' 20.475710\"', 121.09355890, '121° 5\' 36.811900\"', 'MMA-129 (MMA-3008) Is located at Brgy. Sta. Lucia, Pasig City. It is situated at approx. 0.5 m. from the third lamp post and 15 m. from the second lamp post. It is also about 0.7 m. from the centerline of the road and is about 35 m. from Ortigas Bridge. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail centered on a 30 cm. x 30 cm. cement putty protruding 2 cm. above ground surface, with inscriptions \"MMA-3008 2006 LMS-NCR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.58902103, '14° 35\' 20.475710\"', 121.09355890, '121° 5\' 36.811900\"', 0.0000, '0', 54.1100, 0.0000, '3', 9.8575, 294623.80680, 1613731.57900, '51', 14.59052326, '14° 35\' 25.883750\"', 121.09219930, '121° 5\' 31.917590\"', 10.3180, 1613504.39000, 509934.33800, '3', 294475.97300, 1613799.81400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
