(10373, 'MMA-15', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF NAVOTAS', 'NORTH BAY BOULEVARD NORTH', 2014, 14.63803323, '14° 38\' 16.919610\"', 120.94793190, '120° 56\' 52.554890\"', 'MMA-15 Station is the center of a drilled hole on top center of a 2 m. concrete flooring of an abandoned/ruined concrete light station (cylindrical-shaped and 2 m. above the breakwater surface level). It is near the SW most tip of the breakwater running in the NW-SE direction. (see chart 4236A).', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.63803323, '14° 38\' 16.919610\"', 120.94793190, '120° 56\' 52.554890\"', 0.0000, '0', 49.8120, 0.0000, '3', 6.9776, 278979.11880, 1619292.02900, '51', 14.63954191, '14° 38\' 22.350860\"', 120.94657330, '120° 56\' 47.663960\"', 6.5140, 1618926.14200, 494244.63300, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1993-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10374, 'MMA-16', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'TONDO I/II', 'BARANGAY 20', 2014, 14.60608525, '14° 36\' 21.906890\"', 120.93372070, '120° 56\' 1.394690\"', 'MMA-16 Station mark is the center of a dot (painted white) inscribed in a triangle also in white paint with inscription PPA/WB. It is along the centerline of the breakwater on top of a flat boulder (1.5 mt.) at the elbow of the L-shaped bend of the breakwater and about 100 mts. E of the north entrance light leading to the Manila International Container Port Terminal. (see chart 4236A)', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.60608525, '14° 36\' 21.906890\"', 120.93372070, '120° 56\' 1.394690\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.8250, 0.0000, '3', 4.1115, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.60759218, '14° 36\' 27.331860\"', 120.93236140, '120° 55\' 56.500960\"', 3.4711, 1615391.84700, 492712.60300, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1993-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10375, 'MMA-18', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'TONDO I/II', 'BARANGAY 20', 2014, 14.60904959, '14° 36\' 32.578530\"', 120.95021180, '120° 57\' 0.762350\"', 'MMA-18 Station mark is the center of a 1 cm steel bar set flush on a flat rock 2 mts. and inscribed in a triangle. It is almost halfway of the entire lenght of the North breakwater. (see Chart 4236A)', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.60904959, '14° 36\' 32.578530\"', 120.95021180, '120° 57\' 0.762350\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.6150, 0.0000, '3', 5.7585, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.61055635, '14° 36\' 38.002860\"', 120.94885250, '120° 56\' 55.868960\"', 5.2290, 1615719.31700, 494489.43300, '3', 279047.88400, 1616151.10800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1993-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10376, 'MMA-201 (MMSP-12)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BAGONG PAG-ASA', 1999, 14.65691446, '14° 39\' 24.892070\"', 121.03586050, '121° 2\' 9.097820\"', 'MMA-201 (MMSP-12) ACCESS: From SM North Edsa, travel Eastward along North Avenue for about 500 meters until reaching the road intersection of Mindanao and North Avenue. Travel 200 meters along Mindanao Ave. where the station is situated in front of Daewoo Trucks building and Motolite shop, about 80 meters SE of Automax Wheels Hub and approximately 230m NE of Hotel Sogo Mindanao. The station is established near the waiting shed and about 10m near the electric post going to Congressional Ave. STATION MARK: Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded and centered in a 20cm x 20cm cement putty with inscriptions “MMSP-12 JDT”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.65691446, '14° 39\' 24.892070\"', 121.03586050, '121° 2\' 9.097820\"', 0.0000, '0', 82.2540, 0.0000, '2', 38.5452, 288471.04220, 1621297.44700, '51', 14.65842238, '14° 39\' 30.320570\"', 121.03450250, '121° 2\' 4.208980\"', 38.7963, 1621014.56100, 503716.44900, '3', 288323.38100, 1621365.93200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10377, 'MMA-202 (MMSP-13)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'TANDANG SORA', 1999, 14.67493072, '14° 40\' 29.750600\"', 121.03220690, '121° 1\' 55.944970\"', 'MMSP-13 ACCESS: From Dr. Montano Ramos Genral Hospital, travel N along Mindanao ave. for about 430 meters until reaching the CHP Marketing Corp. The station is situated along the road between the center island and U-turn slot beside Shell. It is about 100m SW of Petron and Jollibee. STATION MARK: Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded and centred in a 20cm x 20cm cement putty with inscriptions “MMSP-13 JDT”.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.67493072, '14° 40\' 29.750600\"', 121.03220690, '121° 1\' 55.944970\"', 0.0000, '0', 79.8170, 0.0000, '2', 36.1357, 288094.77610, 1623294.51800, '51', 14.67643988, '14° 40\' 35.183580\"', 121.03084930, '121° 1\' 51.057640\"', 36.4197, 1623007.84700, 503322.67700, '3', 287947.17100, 1623363.03100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
