(10384, 'MMA-23', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'TONDO I/II', 'BARANGAY 30', 2014, 14.60191333, '14° 36\' 6.888000\"', 120.95831250, '120° 57\' 29.925000\"', 'MMA-23 Station mark is the center of a drilled hole about 4 cm. W of the steel base plate of a bollard at the SW corner of Pier 4 (Aboitiz Shipping Corp.) The hole is painted with a red cross mark. (see chart 4236A)', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.60191333, '14° 36\' 6.888000\"', 120.95831250, '120° 57\' 29.925000\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.5920, 0.0000, '3', 4.6636, 280061.62440, 1615284.81000, '51', 14.60341945, '14° 36\' 12.310010\"', 120.95695310, '120° 57\' 25.031040\"', 4.1663, 1614929.55900, 495362.02900, '3', 279913.70900, 1615353.49500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1993-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10385, 'MMA-27', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'MALATE', 'BARANGAY 699', 1993, 14.56468114, '14° 33\' 52.852102\"', 120.96205030, '120° 57\' 43.381140\"', 'MMA-27 (FAR SOUTH LT.) From the mouth of Pasig River, travel southward for about 4 km. up to the southern tip of the breakwater southwest of Quirino Grandstand aboard a motorized banca. A light as near as possible to the Far South Light where the station was established. Station mark is a head of a 4\" copper nail imbedded on the center of a 7 inch square cement putty, on the northwest portion of Far South Light concrete base, about 107 cm. from the edge of the lighthouse wall, with inscription, thus \"MMA-27, 1993, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.56468114, '14° 33\' 52.852102\"', 120.96205030, '120° 57\' 43.381140\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.1832, 0.0000, '3', 4.2046, 280427.51030, 1611161.00500, '51', 14.56618468, '14° 33\' 58.264840\"', 120.96069000, '120° 57\' 38.484090\"', 3.6422, 1610810.10400, 495763.94300, '3', 280279.47600, 1611229.63300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1993-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10386, 'MMA-28', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'MALATE', 'BARANGAY 699', 1993, 14.57089775, '14° 34\' 15.231892\"', 120.95695300, '120° 57\' 25.030740\"', 'MMA-28 From the mouth of the Pasig river, travel southward for about 3 kilometers up to the southern tip of the breakwater about 2 kilometers south of the South Port. The station is intervisible with station is intervisible with stations MMA-27 and MMA-29. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 7-inch square cement putty, on the north portion of the South Entrance Light concrete base about 3.5 meters from the lighthouse with inscription, thus, \"MMA-28, 1993, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.57089775, '14° 34\' 15.231892\"', 120.95695300, '120° 57\' 25.030740\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.7068, 0.0000, '3', 3.7780, 279884.28230, 1611853.87000, '51', 14.57240180, '14° 34\' 20.646490\"', 120.95559280, '120° 57\' 20.134000\"', 3.1960, 1611498.02200, 495214.80200, '3', 279736.25900, 1611922.52100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1998-01-01', 'Floren C. Madrilejo', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10387, 'MMA-29', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'MALATE', 'BARANGAY 699', 1993, 14.57248588, '14° 34\' 20.949169\"', 120.95564930, '120° 57\' 20.337321\"', 'MMA-29 From the mouth of the Pasig River, travel southward for about 3 kilometers up to the southern tip of the breakwater about 2 kilometers south of the South Port. Station mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 7\" square cement putty, on the south portion of the North Entrance Light concrete base about 3.5 meters from the lighthouse with inscription, thus MMA-29, 1993, NAMRIA\". The station is intervisible with stations MMA-27 and MMA-28.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.57248588, '14° 34\' 20.949169\"', 120.95564930, '120° 57\' 20.337321\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.5622, 0.0000, '3', 3.6454, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.57399007, '14° 34\' 26.364240\"', 120.95428910, '120° 57\' 15.440900\"', 3.0590, 1611673.76400, 495074.35500, '3', 279597.33200, 1612099.53500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1998-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10388, 'MMA-3', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF TAGUIG', 'FORT BONIFACIO', 2014, 14.53501543, '14° 32\' 6.055560\"', 121.04028510, '121° 2\' 25.026370\"', 'MMA-3 From the south super highway/E. de los Santos interchange, travel northeast for 1 kilometer towards Nichols/Fort Bonifacio gate, (Gate 3). Then turn left to enter the gate of Fort Bonifacio. Continue travelling on northwest direction for 2 kilometers up to the National Mapping and Resource Information Authority building; (NAMRIA). Station is located at the sidewalk about 10 meters north of the western gate and approximately 10 meters from the guard house. Station mark is 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. in diameter brass rod centered in a 0.25 m. x 0.25 m. x 0.65 m concrete block, flush level with the ground surface with inscription \"MMA-3 1989 NAMRIA\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.53501543, '14° 32\' 6.055560\"', 121.04028510, '121° 2\' 25.026370\"', 0.0000, '0', 71.5740, 0.0000, '2', 27.8560, 288831.40230, 1607804.28000, '51', 14.53651537, '14° 32\' 11.455340\"', 121.03892420, '121° 2\' 20.127140\"', 27.7580, 1607527.69500, 504195.04400, '3', 288683.34000, 1607872.63600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Dexter Alamar', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10389, 'MMA-30 (OGD-1)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'PAYATAS', 1995, 14.72040962, '14° 43\' 13.474620\"', 121.11798610, '121° 7\' 4.749942\"', 'MMA-30 = OGD-1 Station is in the National Capital Region, city of Quezon, inside Violago Homes Parkwoods Subdivision. It is about 200 meters E from the centerline of the concrete road and about 220 meters from the two-storey yellow house on block 13. Mark is the head of a 5 mm. dia. steel bar, 0.60 m. long set flush on top center of a 5\" square concrete monument with inscription OGD-1, 1995. ACCESS: From Rodriguez bridge in Rodriguez, Rizal (formerly, Montalban, Rizal) travel W to SW along the road using a 4-wheel drive vehicle and passed Solid Aggreagate Co. Inc.. Crushing plant until you reach the entrance gate of Violago Parkwoods Homes Subdivision. Distance 2.5 kms. Turn left and enter the subdivision, travel south until you reach the dead end of the road, stop in front of the yellow house on block 13 and walk for about 200 m. in the E direction following the footrail.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.72040962, '14° 43\' 13.474620\"', 121.11798610, '121° 7\' 4.749942\"', 0.0000, '0', 123.7375, 0.0000, '3', 79.1756, 297376.99220, 1628248.26100, '51', 14.72191978, '14° 43\' 18.911200\"', 121.11662970, '121° 6\' 59.866980\"', 80.2614, 1628042.49100, 512559.19300, '3', 297229.61700, 1628316.53800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
