(10416, 'MMA-3045', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF NAVOTAS', 'NBBS PROPER', 2014, 14.64121256, '14° 38\' 28.365220\"', 120.95830000, '120° 57\' 29.879860\"', 'MMA-3045 From Luneta going to Navotas/Caloocan take Road 10 Highway then turn to C3 Road going to Caloocan go to the U-turn Slot where the GCP of LMS-NCR is located. Station is located on the center island of a U-turn slot facing the route going to Caloocan Area. The station is about 50 to 60 cm. higher above the ground. Station is marked with a head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded on the center of a 0.25 m x 0.25 cm x 30 cm cement putty with inscriptions, \"MMA-3045, 2007, LMS-NCR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.64121256, '14° 38\' 28.365220\"', 120.95830000, '120° 57\' 29.879860\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.4560, 0.0000, '4', 5.5273, 280099.41020, 1619633.77300, '51', 14.64272121, '14° 38\' 33.796340\"', 120.95694150, '120° 57\' 24.989290\"', 5.1420, 1619277.64200, 495361.60400, '3', 279951.62700, 1619702.49400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'mara', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10417, 'MMA-3046', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF NAVOTAS', 'NBBS PROPER', 2014, 14.64298029, '14° 38\' 34.729040\"', 120.96047890, '120° 57\' 37.724040\"', 'MMA-3046 FROM LUNETA GOING TO NAVOTAS/CALOOCAN TAKE ROAD 10 HIGHWAY THEN TURN TO C3 ROAD GOING TO CALOOCAN WHERE THE CGP OF LMS-NCR IS LOCATED. STATION IS LOCATED BESIDE THE CORNER OF THE BRIDGE AT THE RIGHT SIDE GOING TO CALOOCAN AREA. STATION IS ABOUT 2 IN. HIGHER ABOVE THE GROUND. STATION IS MARKED WITH A HEAD OF A 4 IN. COPPER NAIL EMBEDDED ON THE CENTER OF A 0.25 M X 0.25 M X 30 CM CEMENT PUTTY WITH INSCRIPTIONS, \"MMA-3046, 2007, LMS-NCR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.64298029, '14° 38\' 34.729040\"', 120.96047890, '120° 57\' 37.724040\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.6460, 0.0000, '4', 7.6954, 280335.94010, 1619827.28000, '51', 14.64448900, '14° 38\' 40.160400\"', 120.95912050, '120° 57\' 32.833630\"', 7.3320, 1619473.17600, 495596.36600, '3', 280188.16400, 1619895.99600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10418, 'MMA-3047', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF VALENZUELA', 'MALINTA', 2014, 14.69256069, '14° 41\' 33.218480\"', 120.96907110, '120° 58\' 8.655870\"', 'MMA-3047 TAKE NLEX EXIT VALENZUELA/MALINTA TURN LEFT TO MAYSAN ROAD GOING TO MC ARTHUR HIGHWAY LOOK FOR THE NEW BLDG. OF VALENZUELA CITY HALL WHERE THE GCP OF LMS-NCR IS LOCATED. STATION IS LOCATED INFRONT OF VALENZUELA CITY HALL ABOUT 2 IN. HIGHER ABOVE THE GROUND. STATION IS MARKED WITH A HEAD OF A 4 IN. COPPER NAIL EMBEDDED ON THE CENTER OF A 0.25 M X 0.25 M X 100 CM CEMENT BLOCK WITH INSCRIPTIONS, \"MMA-3047, 2007, LMS-NCR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.69256069, '14° 41\' 33.218480\"', 120.96907110, '120° 58\' 8.655870\"', 0.0000, '0', 56.7290, 0.0000, '4', 13.6784, 281310.95740, 1625305.64300, '51', 14.69407240, '14° 41\' 38.660650\"', 120.96771380, '120° 58\' 3.769740\"', 13.5350, 1624958.62300, 496522.84500, '3', 281163.35500, 1625374.37700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Melchor Degollado Jr', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10419, 'MMA-3049', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'SANTA ANA', 'BARANGAY 888', 2014, 14.58584929, '14° 35\' 9.057460\"', 121.01914850, '121° 1\' 8.934560\"', 'MMA-3049 From Taft-Manila get straight to Pedro Gil up to Sta. Ana church, then turn left and turn right bounding to New Panaderos then go to Lambingan Bridge where the GCP of LMS-NCR is locted. Station is located in the endpoint of a U-turn slot of Lambingan Bridge about 2 in. higher above the ground. Station is marked with a head of a 4 in. copper nail embedded on the center of a 0.25 m x 0.25 m x 100 cm cement block with inscriptions, \"MMA-3049, 2007, LMS-NCR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.58584929, '14° 35\' 9.057460\"', 121.01914850, '121° 1\' 8.934560\"', 0.0000, '0', 50.0990, 0.0000, '4', 6.5889, 286601.94860, 1613449.14400, '51', 14.58735300, '14° 35\' 14.470810\"', 121.01778880, '121° 1\' 4.039540\"', 6.4792, 1613151.71500, 501916.73900, '3', 286454.03500, 1613517.61700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10420, 'MMA-3053', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MUNTINLUPA', 'ALABANG', 2014, 14.42360324, '14° 25\' 24.971650\"', 121.03693250, '121° 2\' 12.957060\"', 'From Muntinlupa Town proper in the Province of Metro Manila, start to travel towrds NE direction at the intersection at the Commerce Avenue. Continue travel towards NE direction for about 330 meters until reaching Alabang Zapote Road. From the intersection travel towards NE going to North gate Avenue for about 200 meters until reaching the station. Mark is the center of a brass rod with cross-cut on top set flush at the center of a 20 x 20 x 120 cm. concrete monument with inscription \"MMA-3053, 2008, NAMRIA\". The station is located at the side of the road along northgate avenue, about 20 m. SE of Caltex station , about 6 meters SW of guard house , about 3 m. NE of concrete Electrical Post and about 2.5 M. S of the centerline of the road.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.42360324, '14° 25\' 24.971650\"', 121.03693250, '121° 2\' 12.957060\"', 0.0000, '0', 61.7010, 0.0000, '4', 17.8930, 288364.36620, 1595478.88300, '51', 14.42509603, '14° 25\' 30.345700\"', 121.03556900, '121° 2\' 8.048330\"', 17.5770, 1595201.09900, 503835.34800, '3', 288215.93100, 1595547.14400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10421, 'MMA-3053 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MUNTINLUPA', 'BAYANAN', 1999, 14.41005424, '14° 24\' 36.195280\"', 121.05230950, '121° 3\' 8.314290\"', 'From Alabang Terminal / Market go straight to Brgy. Bayanan via National Road turn left at Bautista street going to Bayanan Baywalk. The sttaion is located opposite the corner of school compound fronting Laguna Lake. The station was marked with a head of a copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA3054, 2008 LMS-NCR\". The sttaion is located near the corner of Bautista St. and Bayanan Baywalk.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.41005424, '14° 24\' 36.195280\"', 121.05230950, '121° 3\' 8.314290\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.8850, 0.0000, '4', 4.9348, 290010.01190, 1593965.51300, '51', 14.41154581, '14° 24\' 41.564930\"', 121.05094570, '121° 3\' 3.404470\"', 4.6850, 1593702.33300, 505493.72800, '3', 289861.54500, 1594033.71200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2018-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10422, 'MMA-3054', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MUNTINLUPA', 'ALABANG', 2014, 14.42581782, '14° 25\' 32.944150\"', 121.03727550, '121° 2\' 14.191960\"', 'From Muntinlupa Town Proper in the Province of Metro Manila, start to travel towards NE direction at the intersection going to Filinvest Avenue for about 800 meters to reach the intersection at Commercial Avenue. Continue travel towards NE direction for about 330 meters until reaching the station. Mark is center of a bras rod with cross cut on top set flush at the center of a 20 x 20 x 120 centimeter concrete monument with inscription \"MMA-3054, 2008, NAMRIA\". The station is located at the side of the road beside the manhole, about 5 meters NW of a concrete Electrical Post and about 3 meters NE of the Centerline of the rod.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.42581782, '14° 25\' 32.944150\"', 121.03727550, '121° 2\' 14.191960\"', 0.0000, '0', 60.4370, 0.0000, '4', 16.6299, 288403.45230, 1595723.62400, '51', 14.42731075, '14° 25\' 38.318690\"', 121.03591210, '121° 2\' 9.283420\"', 16.3190, 1595446.12200, 503872.30500, '3', 288255.02500, 1595791.88700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
