(10423, 'MMA-3054 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MUNTINLUPA', 'BAYANAN', 1999, 14.41225089, '14° 24\' 44.103220\"', 121.05244680, '121° 3\' 8.808370\"', 'From Albanang Terminal / Market go straight to Brgy. Bayanan via National Road, turn left at Bautista street going to Bayanan Baywalk. Going north along the Baywalk look for the GCP LMS-NCR near Bayanan Elementary School annex compound. The station was marked with a head of a copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA3054, 2008 LMS-NCR\". The sttaion is located at Bayanan Baywalk near Bayanan Elementary School Annex.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.41225089, '14° 24\' 44.103220\"', 121.05244680, '121° 3\' 8.808370\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.6590, 0.0000, '4', 4.7115, 290026.87110, 1594208.45800, '51', 14.41374260, '14° 24\' 49.473370\"', 121.05108300, '121° 3\' 3.898740\"', 4.4650, 1593945.36900, 505508.48000, '3', 289878.41300, 1594276.65900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2018-01-01', 'Mara', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10424, 'MMA-3055', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PARAÑAQUE', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2014, 14.46169390, '14° 27\' 42.098040\"', 121.02527350, '121° 1\' 30.984730\"', 'From Paranaque City in the Province of Metro Manila, trvel along Dr. Abad Santos Avenue formerly known as Sucat Road, until reaching the intersection of Sampaguita Avenue where the station is established. Mark is the center of a brass rod with cross-cut on top set flush at the center of a 20 x 20 centimeter cement putty with inscription \"MMA-3055, 2008, NAMRIA\". The station is located on the road gutter about 5 meters from the signboard of Manila Memorial Park & La Funeraria Paz-Sucat.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.46169390, '14° 27\' 42.098040\"', 121.02527350, '121° 1\' 30.984730\"', 0.0000, '0', 66.5940, 0.0000, '4', 22.9462, 287143.23670, 1599704.65000, '51', 14.46318943, '14° 27\' 47.481930\"', 121.02391090, '121° 1\' 26.079200\"', 22.6060, 1599415.26800, 502577.83600, '3', 286994.91800, 1599772.98500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10425, 'MMA-3055 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MANDALUYONG', 'POBLACION', 1999, 14.57802853, '14° 34\' 40.902700\"', 121.03441970, '121° 2\' 3.910750\"', 'MMA-3055 From EDSA take Boni Ave. to Mandaluyong City Hall. Turn right at the round about & enter the Entrance gate of the City Hall opposite M. Martinez Ave. look for the GCP of LMS-NCR just beside the Gate. The station was marked with a head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA-3055, 2008 LMS-NCR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.57802853, '14° 34\' 40.902700\"', 121.03441970, '121° 2\' 3.910750\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.8590, 0.0000, '4', 5.2000, 288240.21010, 1612569.43700, '51', 14.57953138, '14° 34\' 46.312980\"', 121.03305980, '121° 1\' 59.015180\"', 5.1800, 1612286.57100, 503562.31600, '3', 288092.28600, 1612637.85300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2018-01-01', 'Edmir Licad', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10426, 'MMA-3056', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PARAÑAQUE', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2014, 14.46173250, '14° 27\' 42.237010\"', 121.02805470, '121° 1\' 40.997030\"', 'From Paranaquein the province of Metro Manila, travel along Dr. Abad Santos Avenue, and from Sampaguita Avenue travel towards SE direction for about 300 meters until reaching Fourth State Subdivision then turn left and continue to travel about 100 meters until reaching Diosdado Macpagal Statue where the station is stablished. Mark is the center of a brass rod with cross-cut on top set flush at the center of a 20 x 20 x 120 centimeter concrete monument with inscription \"MMA-3056, 2008, NAMRIA\". The station is located at the island at the side of the road, about 5 meters SW of Diosdado Macapagal Statue and about 3 meters NE of the centerline of the road.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.46173250, '14° 27\' 42.237010\"', 121.02805470, '121° 1\' 40.997030\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.7010, 0.0000, '4', 25.0294, 287443.16420, 1599706.34200, '51', 14.46322797, '14° 27\' 47.620680\"', 121.02669210, '121° 1\' 36.091520\"', 24.7070, 1599419.56500, 502877.67700, '3', 287294.84800, 1599774.66800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10427, 'MMA-3057 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF VALENZUELA', 'MALANDAY', 1999, 14.72098487, '14° 43\' 15.545530\"', 120.95858930, '120° 57\' 30.921330\"', 'From Valenzuela City proper take Mc Arthur Highway going to Brgy. Malanday alight in front of the VCSA Cockpit Arena & look for the GCP of LMS-NCR at the foot of the culvert near the entrance gate of the cockpit. The station was marked with a head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA-3057, 2008 LMS-NCR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.72098487, '14° 43\' 15.545530\"', 120.95858930, '120° 57\' 30.921330\"', 0.0000, '0', 46.9320, 0.0000, '4', 3.9785, 280210.32890, 1628461.33500, '51', 14.72249866, '14° 43\' 20.995160\"', 120.95723270, '120° 57\' 26.037560\"', 3.8460, 1628103.72400, 495394.64100, '3', 280062.81000, 1628530.13000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2018-01-01', 'Mara', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10428, 'MMA-3058 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF VALENZUELA', 'MALANDAY', 1999, 14.71811673, '14° 43\' 5.220210\"', 120.95706900, '120° 57\' 25.448460\"', 'From Valenzuela City proper take Mc Arthur Highway going to Brgy. Malanday alight at M. H Del Pilar St. and look for the GCP of LMS-NCR just beside the streets corner. The station was marked with a head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 x 25 cm cement putty with inscriptions that read \"MMA-3058, 2008 LMS-NCR\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.71811673, '14° 43\' 5.220210\"', 120.95706900, '120° 57\' 25.448460\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.7170, 0.0000, '4', 4.7785, 280043.71360, 1628145.42000, '51', 14.71963036, '14° 43\' 10.669290\"', 120.95571230, '120° 57\' 20.564440\"', 4.6270, 1627786.42400, 495230.86500, '3', 279896.18400, 1628214.21800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2018-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10429, 'MMA-3059', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MALABON', 'DAMPALIT', 2014, 14.68297935, '14° 40\' 58.725670\"', 120.94213240, '120° 56\' 31.676680\"', 'from Malabon Town Proper in the province of Metro Manila travel towards NE direction for about 1 kilometer until reaching Brgy. Dampalit where the station is established. Mark is the center of a brass rod with cross-cut on top set flush at the center of a 20 x 20 120 cm concrete monument with inscription \"MMA-3059, 2008, NAMRIA\". The station is located at north east end of Dampalit Bridge at KM 14+057 m. away from MMA-3060 and about 35 east of the centerline of the road.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.68297935, '14° 40\' 58.725670\"', 120.94213240, '120° 56\' 31.676680\"', 0.0000, '0', 48.6730, 0.0000, '4', 5.8821, 278399.47300, 1624271.60600, '51', 14.68449106, '14° 41\' 4.167810\"', 120.94077490, '120° 56\' 26.789580\"', 5.5180, 1623899.18800, 493621.29900, '3', 278251.81400, 1624340.41900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'mara', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
