(10463, 'MMA-31 (OGD-2)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'PAYATAS', 1995, 14.72534507, '14° 43\' 31.242255\"', 121.12085300, '121° 7\' 15.070651\"', 'MMA-31 = OGD-2 Station is in the National Capital Region, city of Quezon near the boundary of Rodriguez, Rizal and Quezon city, barangay Payatas. It is set on top of a small hill traversing in the SE direction and overlooking the municipality of Rodriguez (Montalban), Rizal and San Mateo, Rizal beside an uphill and winding rough road linking Quezon city and Rizal. It is about 25 m. SW of the centerline of the dirt road and about 15 m. above the road surface. Mark is the top of a 5mm. dia. steel bar, 0.60 m. long set flush on top center of a 5 inch. square concrete monument levelled with the ground with inscription OGD-2, 1995. ACCESS: From Rodgriguez Bridge crossing Marikina River in Rodriguez, Rizal, travel W to SW along the road passing Litex Textile mills and solid Aggreagate Co. Inc. crushing plant (dist. 1.20 kms.) Continue travelling towards the uphill and winding dirt rough road going to Quezon city. A small barangay is situated near the hill, then walk SE on a footrail beside the group of houses leading to the small hill. Approx. distance 150 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.72534507, '14° 43\' 31.242255\"', 121.12085300, '121° 7\' 15.070651\"', 0.0000, '0', 121.8326, 0.0000, '3', 77.2391, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.72685543, '14° 43\' 36.679536\"', 121.11949670, '121° 7\' 10.188193\"', 78.3636, 1628588.70600, 512867.63500, '3', 297542.94300, 1628860.07800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2015-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(10464, 'MMA-3100 (LMS)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF VALENZUELA', 'UGONG', 1999, 14.69307032, '14° 41\' 35.053140\"', 121.02236300, '121° 1\' 20.506710\"', 'STA MARK : The station was marked with the head of a 4\" copper nail embedded on the center of a 25 x 25 cm x 100 cm concrete Monument with inscription that read \" MMA 3100; 2008;LMS-NCR\".The station is located at the Center Island of Mindanao Avenue extension. ACCESS : From north Avenue travel straight along Mindanao avenue after 178 meters from Tullahan bridge stop and look for the GCP of LMS-NCR at the Center Island.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.69307032, '14° 41\' 35.053140\"', 121.02236300, '121° 1\' 20.506710\"', 0.0000, '0', 66.9010, 0.0000, '4', 23.3113, 287051.91340, 1625311.08500, '51', 14.69458087, '14° 41\' 40.491120\"', 121.02100580, '121° 1\' 15.620910\"', 23.5800, 1625014.73300, 502262.27500, '3', 286904.35900, 1625379.64700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2018-01-01', 'mara', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
