(11067, 'MMA-41 (LRT-2=GPS-5)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PASIG', 'SANTOLAN', 1995, 14.61897333, '14° 37\' 8.304000\"', 121.08974250, '121° 5\' 23.073000\"', 'MMA-41 (LRT-2 GPS 5) From Manila proceed directly to Marcos highway going to Marikina. The station is located on the island along the Marcos highway. It is about 36 m. SE of the NW end of the island. about 60 m. SW of the gate of Dona Juana Subdivision 3, 120 m. NW of Barrio Fiesta, 120 m. SE of Petron Gas Station & 50 m. SW of twin water tank of ASIA LENS. Station mark is a 3 in umbrella nail centered in a cylindrical concrete, 0.205 m dia. and 0.40 m. deep, protruding 0.02 m. above ground surface with inscription, LRT 2, GPS 5.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.61897333, '14° 37\' 8.304000\"', 121.08974250, '121° 5\' 23.073000\"', 0.0000, '0', 57.4010, 0.0000, '3', 13.1732, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.62047746, '14° 37\' 13.718850\"', 121.08838370, '121° 5\' 18.181290\"', 13.7030, 1616818.17000, 509521.91800, '3', 294092.68200, 1617117.65400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1995-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
