(11546, 'MMA-5321 (EMF-1)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PASIG', 'SANTOLAN', 1999, 14.61685744, '14° 37\' 0.686770\"', 121.07917290, '121° 4\' 45.022510\"', 'From the West of LRT-A Line 2 - Pasig Depot in Pasig City, travel West along the highway of Evangelista Avenuefor 834 meters up to Pasig Squre Cockpit Arena up to Santolan Dike Road. The station of EMF-01 is located near the MArikina River along San tolan Dike Road. Head of 4\" copper nail marked on the concrete pavement with inscriptions \"WMCI, EMF-01, 2021\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.61685744, '14° 37\' 0.686770\"', 121.07917290, '121° 4\' 45.022510\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.8280, 0.0000, '4', 8.7062, 293099.58110, 1616824.87100, '51', 14.61836180, '14° 37\' 6.102480\"', 121.07781400, '121° 4\' 40.130460\"', 9.1503, 1616583.67600, 508383.28800, '3', 292951.82500, 1616893.17900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11547, 'MMA-5322 (EMF-2)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PASIG', 'SANTOLAN', 1999, 14.61556886, '14° 36\' 56.047890\"', 121.07898950, '121° 4\' 44.362150\"', 'The distance from the station of EMF-01 up to station of EMF-02 is 144.02 meters. The station of EMF02 is located along the Santolan Dike Road near thr Marikina River. Head of 4\" copper nail marked on the concrete pavement with inscriptions \"WMCI, EMF-02, 2021\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.61556886, '14° 36\' 56.047890\"', 121.07898950, '121° 4\' 44.362150\"', 0.0000, '0', 52.8180, 0.0000, '4', 8.6985, 293078.60940, 1616682.45000, '51', 14.61707314, '14° 37\' 1.463310\"', 121.07763060, '121° 4\' 39.469990\"', 9.1371, 1616441.10000, 508363.57100, '3', 292930.84900, 1616750.75800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Mara Chua', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11548, 'MMA-5400 (MM-135)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 1999, 14.68697529, '14° 41\' 13.111040\"', 121.08741800, '121° 5\' 14.704680\"', 'MM-135 Benchmark is located on the NE corner of the gutter of the Batasan Underpass, Quezon City. It is about 10 m. SW of Sandigan bayan. Mark is the head of a 1/4 x 3 in copper nail, centered and embedded on 15 x 15 cm cement putty with inscription \"MM-135, 2010, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.68697529, '14° 41\' 13.111040\"', 121.08741800, '121° 5\' 14.704680\"', 0.0000, '0', 134.7680, 0.0000, '4', 90.5265, 294053.51810, 1624576.27500, '51', 14.68848398, '14° 41\' 18.542310\"', 121.08606080, '121° 5\' 9.818710\"', 91.2707, 1624341.87000, 509268.80200, '3', 293906.00400, 1624644.61900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2021-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11549, 'MMA-55', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MUNTINLUPA', 'POBLACION', 1997, 14.39165352, '14° 23\' 29.952680\"', 121.04976190, '121° 2\' 59.142660\"', 'MMA-55 Station mark was located in the NW corner of Mayaman and Amparo streets, Poblacion, Muntinlupa City. Station mark is a hole, 1 cm in diameter, drilled in 1 1/2 cm. deep, centered on a circular concrete block and protruding about 1 cm. above the ground surface with station name inscribe, \"Muntinlupa Estate 1907\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.39165352, '14° 23\' 29.952680\"', 121.04976190, '121° 2\' 59.142660\"', 0.0000, '0', 51.4800, 0.0000, '3', 7.5176, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.39314396, '14° 23\' 35.318250\"', 121.04839760, '121° 2\' 54.231220\"', 7.2350, 1591666.45300, 505219.37900, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1998-01-01', 'admin', '1999-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11550, 'MMA-56', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - FOURTH DISTRICT', 'CITY OF MUNTINLUPA', 'POBLACION', 1997, 14.37312449, '14° 22\' 23.248150\"', 121.01688230, '121° 1\' 0.776260\"', 'MMA-56 Is located inside the NAMRIA Magnetic Observatory compound, approx. 100 m. N of the Sensor House Bldg. and 50 m. NW from the Absolute Bldg. Mark is a USC&GS bronze disk levelled on the ground surface, with inscribed station name \"MAG-1\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.37312449, '14° 22\' 23.248150\"', 121.01688230, '121° 1\' 0.776260\"', 0.0000, '0', 109.3440, 0.0000, '3', 65.5801, 286153.92650, 1589911.60200, '51', 14.37461445, '14° 22\' 28.612020\"', 121.01551750, '121° 0\' 55.863110\"', 65.1270, 1589616.02400, 501673.60800, '3', 286005.30600, 1589979.88000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1998-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11551, 'MMA-58', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'HOLY SPIRIT', 1902, 14.68458689, '14° 41\' 4.512800\"', 121.07632960, '121° 4\' 34.786720\"', 'MMA-58 From Quezon City Memorial Circle, travel northward along Commomwealth Ave. until reaching intersection near Ever Gotesco Commonwealth. Turn left and proceed along Holy Spirit Drive, at approximately 1.5 km. from Commonwealth Ave. is Civil Executive Service Office (CESO) building. The station is located at the top of the water tank of CESO building. Station mark is the head of a 12 mm dia. steel bar on a cement putty with inscription \"NAMRIA 2001 MMA-58\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.68458689, '14° 41\' 4.512800\"', 121.07632960, '121° 4\' 34.786720\"', 0.0000, '0', 126.5290, 0.0000, '3', 82.3993, 292856.88660, 1624322.12500, '51', 14.68609555, '14° 41\' 9.943973\"', 121.07497240, '121° 4\' 29.900460\"', 83.0520, 1624077.21700, 508074.66100, '3', 292709.35400, 1624390.50400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Mary', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11552, 'MMA-59', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 1902, 14.68647659, '14° 41\' 11.315710\"', 121.08885740, '121° 5\' 19.886530\"', 'MMA-59 From Quezon City Memorial Circle, travel NE along Commonwealth Ave. until reaching the Sandiganbayan Bldg. at Constitutional Rd., Brgy. Batasan Hills. The station is established at the center island of Constitutional Rd., specifically at the gutter of a plant box which is constructed at the mouth of an underpass near Sandiganbayan Bldg. Station mark is the head of a 12 mm dia. steel bar on a cement putty with inscription \"NAMRIA 2001 MMA-59\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.68647659, '14° 41\' 11.315710\"', 121.08885740, '121° 5\' 19.886530\"', 0.0000, '0', 136.0360, 0.0000, '3', 91.7806, 294208.09630, 1624519.77800, '51', 14.68798509, '14° 41\' 16.746306\"', 121.08750020, '121° 5\' 15.000564\"', 92.5339, 1624286.73500, 509423.84900, '3', 294060.58300, 1624588.10400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11553, 'MMA-6 (ORACCA)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'SAN NICOLAS', 'BARANGAY 282', 1947, 14.59826054, '14° 35\' 53.737930\"', 120.97309480, '120° 58\' 23.141420\"', 'MMA-6 = ORACCA Station is located on the roof top of the COAST & GEODETIC SURVEY building, situated at the corner of Urbiztondo and Barraca Streets. It is about 1.52 m. and 6.61 m. from the inner side of the E and S parameters respectively. It can be reached for about 7 to 10 minutes walk, on SW direction from Santisimo Rosario church (Binondo Church); passing by Plaza Lorenzo Ruiz and crossing San Fernando bridge. Station mark is the center of the cross cut on top of a 3/4 in. dia. brass rod wedged in a drill hole on the concrete roof of the building.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.59826054, '14° 35\' 53.737930\"', 120.97309480, '120° 58\' 23.141420\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.2282, 0.0000, '1', 21.1585, 281651.01430, 1614866.32100, '51', 14.59976607, '14° 35\' 59.157860\"', 120.97173540, '120° 58\' 18.247280\"', 20.7560, 1614525.12500, 496954.65500, '3', 281503.10200, 1614934.95300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '');
