(11554, 'MMA-61', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 1902, 14.68657120, '14° 41\' 11.656330\"', 121.08668050, '121° 5\' 12.049880\"', 'MMA-61 From Ever Gotesco Commonwealth, travel northward along Commonwealth Ave. until reaching the Sandiganbayan Bldg. The station is located on the other side of the highway, about 600 m SW of Sandiganbayan building. It is on top of concrete curb of retaining wall of the underpass on Commonwealth Ave. It is 100 m SE from the entry point of BF Road. The western side of the station is a sidewalk market and its eastern side is the Commonwealth Ave. S bound. Station mark is the head of a 12 mm dia. stainless bolt on a cement putty with inscription \"NAMRIA 2001 MMA-61\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.68657120, '14° 41\' 11.656330\"', 121.08668050, '121° 5\' 12.049880\"', 0.0000, '0', 132.8800, 0.0000, '3', 88.6459, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.68807976, '14° 41\' 17.087128\"', 121.08532330, '121° 5\' 7.163906\"', 89.3829, 1624297.13300, 509189.39500, '3', 293826.19000, 1624600.56600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Mara Odtohan', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11555, 'MMA-62', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'PASONG TAMO', 2014, 14.68629978, '14° 41\' 10.679210\"', 121.06478530, '121° 3\' 53.227150\"', 'MMA-62 From Quezon City Memorial Circle, travel northward along Commonwealth Ave. until reaching intersection near Ever Gotesco Commonwealth. Turn left and proceed along Holy Spirit Drive, at approximately 1.7 km. distance turn left at Sampaguita Ave. then proceed until reaching the gate of Far Eastern University (FEU) QC Campus. The station is located at the bridge outside the gate of the University. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt on the location of the station,\"MMA-62, 2000\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.68629978, '14° 41\' 10.679210\"', 121.06478530, '121° 3\' 53.227150\"', 0.0000, '0', 98.1650, 0.0000, '3', 54.1503, 291614.98990, 1624522.28800, '51', 14.68780882, '14° 41\' 16.111744\"', 121.06342810, '121° 3\' 48.341015\"', 54.7205, 1624266.38100, 506831.26500, '3', 291467.45300, 1624590.69200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Mary', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11556, 'MMA-63 (MM-8)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'FAIRVIEW', 2014, 14.71499463, '14° 42\' 53.980650\"', 121.05714690, '121° 3\' 25.728920\"', 'MMA-63 Is in Fairview Park Subdivision, Quezon City along Commonwealth Avenue. Mark is situated on the S abutment of a bridge near the intersection of Commonwealth Avenue., and Yakal St. It is 16 m SW of the centerline of Commonwealth Avenue., and 363 m from the S end of the abutment. Mark is the top of a concrete nail set flush in a triangular cement putty with inscription PCGS MM-8 1983.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.71499463, '14° 42\' 53.980650\"', 121.05714690, '121° 3\' 25.728920\"', 0.0000, '0', 94.5360, 0.0000, '2', 50.5829, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.71650568, '14° 42\' 59.420465\"', 121.05579030, '121° 3\' 20.845179\"', 51.1926, 1627441.01600, 506007.88900, '3', 290672.09300, 1627773.10100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'JHO', '2017-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11557, 'MMA-64', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 2014, 14.70987198, '14° 42\' 35.539110\"', 121.11010190, '121° 6\' 36.366900\"', 'MMA-64 From Ever Gotesco Commonwealth, travel N and turn right near Sandiganbayan Bldg. and proceed along Constitutional Road reaching Batasang Pambansa Complex. Infront of the N gate of the said complex is an access road bound to Violago Homes and Brgy. Bagong Silangan. Proceed along the road until reaching two opposite guard posts of Filinvest II. Take the left post leading to Vicente St., and turn right on an uphill drive to the entry point to Filinvest Heights. Straight ahead, right at Matthew St., and left at the entrance gate of Spring Heights and Spring Country. Straight up until reaching a mini-elliptical road on Spring Country. Approx. 500 m., from this point, downhill, is a bridge where the station is marked. It is on the footway, W end of the bridge, few meters from the second post from that end. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the said location of the station,with inscription \"MMA-64 2002 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.70987198, '14° 42\' 35.539110\"', 121.11010190, '121° 6\' 36.366900\"', 0.0000, '0', 73.0761, 0.0000, '2', 28.5987, 296518.11620, 1627089.32800, '51', 14.71138164, '14° 42\' 40.973920\"', 121.10874530, '121° 6\' 31.482960\"', 29.5870, 1626876.18700, 511710.72200, '3', 296370.69700, 1627157.62200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11558, 'MMA-65', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'HOLY SPIRIT', 2014, 14.72924320, '14° 43\' 45.275510\"', 121.06112680, '121° 3\' 40.056580\"', 'MMA-65 From Q.C. Memorial Circle, travel N along Commonwealth Ave. until reaching Regalado Ave. in Fairview. Turn left at Regalado Ave. then proceed to the direction of SM City Fairview. A road intersecting Regalado Ave. before reaching SM is Mindanao St., in which the station is located at the SW corner of the intersection. It is established at the concrete curb of the sidewalk . It is approximately 40m from U-A Island Plaza. Mark is the head of a hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station with inscription \"MMA-65 2002 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.72924320, '14° 43\' 45.275510\"', 121.06112680, '121° 3\' 40.056580\"', 0.0000, '0', 117.4297, 0.0000, '2', 73.4287, 291261.75250, 1629277.66400, '51', 14.73075507, '14° 43\' 50.718240\"', 121.05977060, '121° 3\' 35.174170\"', 74.1172, 1629017.58200, 506436.09500, '3', 291114.35800, 1629346.11900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11559, 'MMA-66 (BM-1)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF CALOOCAN', 'BARANGAY 78', 2014, 14.65707347, '14° 39\' 25.464490\"', 120.98408570, '120° 59\' 2.708610\"', 'MMA-66 (BM RI-3) Location is in Caloocan City, at the intersection of Rizal Ave. Ext. and EDSA. It is situated on the East side of Bonifacio Monument, at the SE corner of the pool.Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded in a cement putty with inscription \"BM-1 DPWH\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.65707347, '14° 39\' 25.464490\"', 120.98408570, '120° 59\' 2.708610\"', 0.0000, '0', 62.0970, 0.0000, '2', 18.9073, 282893.29430, 1621364.08400, '51', 14.65858256, '14° 39\' 30.897210\"', 120.98272770, '120° 58\' 57.819540\"', 18.7660, 1621032.07000, 498139.50400, '3', 282745.58700, 1621432.73600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11560, 'MMA-69', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'HOLY SPIRIT', 2014, 14.69238988, '14° 41\' 32.603550\"', 121.02386180, '121° 1\' 25.902390\"', 'MMA-69 To reach the station coming from EDSA Northbound, turn right st North Ave. until reaching Mindanao Ave. before turning left. Travel N along the direction of Mindanao Ave. which is connected to C5 Road, trek for about 5 km. to reach Tullahan River, Brgy. Talipapa. The station is located at the right side of Tullahan Bridge. It is marked with the head of a hexagonal bolt embedded at the N end of the bridge. Station mark is the head of a hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.69238988, '14° 41\' 32.603550\"', 121.02386180, '121° 1\' 25.902390\"', 0.0000, '0', 65.2308, 0.0000, '2', 21.6262, 287212.69850, 1625234.37400, '51', 14.69390035, '14° 41\' 38.041270\"', 121.02250460, '121° 1\' 21.016500\"', 21.9038, 1624939.46000, 502423.69900, '3', 287065.14400, 1625302.93100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'RCG', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
