(11564, 'MMA-70 (BH-1)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 1902, 14.69295832, '14° 41\' 34.649950\"', 121.09629770, '121° 5\' 46.671830\"', 'MMA-70 (BH01) To reach the station from Philcoa, Quezon City travel NEward along general direction of Commonwealth Avenue. Turn right at Constitutional Road towards Batasang Pambansa Complex. The station is located in front of Civil Service Commision entrance gate, about 45m W. It is situated at the center island of the road, 40cm S from the curb. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.69295832, '14° 41\' 34.649950\"', 121.09629770, '121° 5\' 46.671830\"', 0.0000, '0', 144.4810, 0.0000, '3', 100.1487, 295015.57930, 1625230.24800, '51', 14.69446707, '14° 41\' 40.081439\"', 121.09494070, '121° 5\' 41.786463\"', 100.9794, 1625004.20000, 510224.89900, '3', 294868.09400, 1625298.55500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11565, 'MMA-71 (BH-2)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 1902, 14.68583166, '14° 41\' 8.993960\"', 121.10261000, '121° 6\' 9.395950\"', 'MMA-71 (BH02) To reach the station from Philcoa, Quezon City travel NEward along general direction of Commonwealth Avenue. Turn right at Constitutional Road and travel for about 1 km, afterwards turn right again at the direction of San Mateo-Marikina Road. The station is located at the NW side of that road, in front of Sunny Side Subdivision and situated 50 cm S of the center island of the subdivision. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station. NOTE: Refurbished MMA-71 (2002) monument reported by Geodesy Personnel December 2021', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.68583166, '14° 41\' 8.993960\"', 121.10261000, '121° 6\' 9.395950\"', 0.0000, '0', 83.0940, 0.0000, '3', 38.7036, 295688.85600, 1624435.92700, '51', 14.68733982, '14° 41\' 14.423340\"', 121.10125280, '121° 6\' 4.509955\"', 39.5563, 1624215.96500, 510905.05100, '3', 295541.35200, 1624504.20900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11566, 'MMA-73 (BH-4)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 1902, 14.67509367, '14° 40\' 30.337200\"', 121.09736280, '121° 5\' 50.505930\"', 'MMA-73 (BH04) To reach the station from Ever Gotesco Commonwealth travel Eward along Capitol Homes Drive for about 500 m. Turn right at Vista Real Ave. on Vista Real Subdivision, upon reaching the E end of Vista Real Ave. turn left to reach Vienna Street. The station is located at the S side of the street and situated along the bridge. It is at 15 m E from the corner of Vienna-Tokyo Sts. Mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station. NOTE: Refurbished MMA-73 (2002) monument reported by Geodesy Personnel December 2021', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.67509367, '14° 40\' 30.337200\"', 121.09736280, '121° 5\' 50.505930\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.8710, 0.0000, '3', 25.5383, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.67660125, '14° 40\' 35.764514\"', 121.09600530, '121° 5\' 45.618989\"', 26.3149, 1623027.68200, 510340.39100, '3', 294966.10200, 1623320.77200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11567, 'MMA-75', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 1902, 14.68269991, '14° 40\' 57.719680\"', 121.09565590, '121° 5\' 44.361390\"', 'MMA-75 (BH06) To reach the station from Philcoa, Quezon City travel NEward along general direction of Commonwealth Avenue. Turn right at Constitutional Road before reaching Sandiganbayan Hall and turn right again at Filinvest Drive. Upon entering Filinvest 1 subdivision turn left at Fairweather St. to reach the subdivision\'s Clubhouse. The station is located at the sidewalk, corner of Mt. Bolivar and Mt. Elgor Sts. situated at the back of clubhouse. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.68269991, '14° 40\' 57.719680\"', 121.09565590, '121° 5\' 44.361390\"', 0.0000, '0', 115.7490, 0.0000, '3', 71.4288, 294936.88140, 1624095.68600, '51', 14.68420814, '14° 41\' 3.149310\"', 121.09429860, '121° 5\' 39.475090\"', 72.2193, 1623869.17100, 510156.22600, '3', 294789.36000, 1624164.00100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11568, 'MMA-78 (BH-9)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 1902, 14.69127988, '14° 41\' 28.607570\"', 121.10202540, '121° 6\' 7.291510\"', 'MMA-78 (BH09) To reach the station from Batasan Complex travel at the direction of San Mateo-Marikina Road. After travelling for about 500m on that road, turn left along Doña Francesca to enter Filinvest 2 Subdivision. The station is located along Doña Francesca St., corner of Adler St., and about 70m from the entrance gate of the subdivision. It is specifically located 1m W from the street sign of Adler Street. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station. NOTE: Refurbished MMA-78 (2002) monument reported by Geodesy Personnel December 2021', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.69127988, '14° 41\' 28.607570\"', 121.10202540, '121° 6\' 7.291510\"', 0.0000, '0', 110.4300, 0.0000, '3', 66.0423, 295630.95530, 1625039.32700, '51', 14.69278840, '14° 41\' 34.038242\"', 121.10066830, '121° 6\' 2.405998\"', 66.9097, 1624818.74900, 510841.83700, '3', 295483.46900, 1625107.61600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2018-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11569, 'MMA-79 (BH-10)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 1902, 14.70169555, '14° 42\' 6.103980\"', 121.10634400, '121° 6\' 22.838460\"', 'MMA-79 (BH10) In front of the northernmost gate of Batasang Pambansa Complex is an access road bound to Violago Homes. Proceed along this road until reaching two opposite guard posts of Filinvest II. Take the left post leading to Vicente St. and turn right to the entry point of Filinvest Heights. Right after the guard post, turn right at Jericho St. The station is located at the eastern side of basketball court (on this street) at Filinvest Height\'s Clubhouse. It is within the northern halfcourt and is about 5m, W of concrete bench. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.70169555, '14° 42\' 6.103980\"', 121.10634400, '121° 6\' 22.838460\"', 0.0000, '0', 70.3690, 0.0000, '3', 25.9332, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.70320465, '14° 42\' 11.536753\"', 121.10498720, '121° 6\' 17.953835\"', 26.8676, 1625971.35400, 511306.43500, '3', 295958.33900, 1626256.24900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Mara Odtohan', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11570, 'MMA-80 (BH-11)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 1902, 14.70324828, '14° 42\' 11.693810\"', 121.11141800, '121° 6\' 41.104780\"', 'MMA-80 (BH11) In front of the northernmost gate of Batasang Pambansa Complex is an access road bound to Violago Homes. Proceed along this road until reaching two opposite guard posts of Filinvest II. Take the left post leading to Vicente St. and turn right to the entry point of Filinvest Heights. Straight ahead then right at Matthew Street. The station is on the sidewalk SW along Matthew st. It is approximately 5m NW of \"Matthew/Peter\" signboard. Mark is the head of a copper nail embedded in a cement putty with inscription \"MMA-80 2002 NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.70324828, '14° 42\' 11.693810\"', 121.11141800, '121° 6\' 41.104780\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.7880, 0.0000, '3', 24.3015, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.70475737, '14° 42\' 17.126530\"', 121.11006120, '121° 6\' 36.220307\"', 25.2787, 1626143.39800, 511852.79100, '3', 296506.28600, 1626423.47100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Mara Odtohan', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11571, 'MMA-81 (BH-12)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 1902, 14.70851951, '14° 42\' 30.670230\"', 121.10088660, '121° 6\' 3.191620\"', 'MMA-81 (BH12) In front of the northernmost gate of Batasang Pambansa Complex is an access road bound to Viologo Homes. Proceed along this road until reaching two opposite guard post of Filinvest II. Take the left post leading to Vicente St. and proceed along until reaching Mountain View Subdivision. The station is marked on the entrance to the clubhouse SE along Imacon St. It is on the S corner of semi-circle man-made landform in front of the clubhouse. It is about 15m E of \"Imacon/Iriga\" signboard. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.70851951, '14° 42\' 30.670230\"', 121.10088660, '121° 6\' 3.191620\"', 0.0000, '0', 91.0870, 0.0000, '3', 46.7009, 295524.33770, 1626948.00700, '51', 14.71002917, '14° 42\' 36.105012\"', 121.09952990, '121° 5\' 58.307556\"', 47.6184, 1626726.11300, 510718.38600, '3', 295376.90700, 1627016.31600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11572, 'MMA-83 (HS-1)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'HOLY SPIRIT', 1902, 14.69062408, '14° 41\' 26.246680\"', 121.07033590, '121° 4\' 13.209210\"', 'MMA-83 (HS01) To reach the station coming from Holy Spirit High School at brgy. Holy Spirit, Quezon City. Travel N along Chioco St. then turn left after 30m to reach the gate of Granwood Executive Village. The station is located at the basketball court of the village\'s clubhouse. It is situated at the southern half of the basketball court 2m SW from the goal. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.69062408, '14° 41\' 26.246680\"', 121.07033590, '121° 4\' 13.209210\"', 0.0000, '0', 110.6050, 0.0000, '3', 66.5321, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.69213326, '14° 41\' 31.679751\"', 121.06897870, '121° 4\' 8.323478\"', 67.1593, 1624744.98800, 507428.93300, '3', 292069.44800, 1625064.07500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Mara Odtohan', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11573, 'MMA-84 (HS-2)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'HOLY SPIRIT', 1902, 14.69097502, '14° 41\' 27.510060\"', 121.07244500, '121° 4\' 20.801980\"', 'MMA-84 (HS02) To reach the station coming from Holy Spirit High School at brgy. Holy Spirit, Quezon City. Travel N along Chioco St. then turn left after 30m to reach the gate of Granwood Executive Village. The station is located at the Guard post at the entrance gate of the village. The bolt is situated 2m E from the guard post on top of the curb. Mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the staion.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.69097502, '14° 41\' 27.510060\"', 121.07244500, '121° 4\' 20.801980\"', 0.0000, '0', 108.4210, 0.0000, '3', 64.3267, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.69248418, '14° 41\' 32.943044\"', 121.07108790, '121° 4\' 15.916285\"', 64.9717, 1624783.88100, 507656.07000, '3', 292296.96300, 1625100.96200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Mara Odtohan', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11574, 'MMA-85', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'HOLY SPIRIT', 1902, 14.69221014, '14° 41\' 31.956510\"', 121.07573400, '121° 4\' 32.642470\"', 'MMA-85 (HS03) To reach the station coming from Holy Spirit High School at Brgy. Holy Spirit, Quezon City. Travel N along Chioco St. and turn right on Paredes St. which is intersecting Chioco. From that intersection, travel Eastward to reach Ortega St. fronting the Brgy\'s Landscape Project. The station is located at the SE corner of Ortega and Paredes Sts. and specifically located 30cm from the inlet of the drainage canal. Mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.69221014, '14° 41\' 31.956510\"', 121.07573400, '121° 4\' 32.642470\"', 0.0000, '0', 108.7590, 0.0000, '3', 64.6310, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.69371931, '14° 41\' 37.389519\"', 121.07437690, '121° 4\' 27.756896\"', 65.3049, 1624920.64200, 508010.25300, '3', 292652.40700, 1625234.60600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Mara Odtohan', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11575, 'MMA-86', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'HOLY SPIRIT', 2014, 14.67596289, '14° 40\' 33.466410\"', 121.07825990, '121° 4\' 41.735460\"', 'MMA-86 (HS04) To reach the station coming from Fairview, Quezon City, travel along SW direction of Commonwealth Ave. then turn right on Samonte St. after reaching Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co. (PLDT) office. Travel for more than 1km until reaching the 7th Day Adventist Church. The station is located along the sidewalk and about 5m N from the gate of the church. Mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.67596289, '14° 40\' 33.466410\"', 121.07825990, '121° 4\' 41.735460\"', 0.0000, '0', 120.9030, 0.0000, '3', 76.7590, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.67747095, '14° 40\' 38.895432\"', 121.07690240, '121° 4\' 36.848524\"', 77.3964, 1623123.11300, 508282.85100, '3', 292909.12900, 1623434.41000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Mara', '2016-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11576, 'MMA-87 (PY-1)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'PAYATAS', 1902, 14.72332035, '14° 43\' 23.953250\"', 121.11717980, '121° 7\' 1.847220\"', 'MMA-87 (PY01) From Sandiganbayan building, travel northward along Commonwealth Ave. and turn right at Litex Road (road bound to Payatas). Proceed along this road and travel for about 5km until reaching Viologo Homes Parkwoods. The station is located on the eastern side of the church inside this subdivision. It is situated on top of a protruding rock which is approximately 50 m, 65° NE from the corner of the church. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.72332035, '14° 43\' 23.953250\"', 121.11717980, '121° 7\' 1.847220\"', 0.0000, '0', 142.5790, 0.0000, '3', 98.0230, 297292.84570, 1628571.07000, '51', 14.72483071, '14° 43\' 29.390550\"', 121.11582350, '121° 6\' 56.964510\"', 99.1133, 1628364.49600, 512472.20800, '3', 297145.47900, 1628639.35200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11577, 'MMA-89 (PY-3)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'PAYATAS', 1902, 14.70773409, '14° 42\' 27.842710\"', 121.08984840, '121° 5\' 23.454260\"', 'MMA-89 (PY03) From Sandiganbayan building, travel northward along Commonwealth Ave. and turn right at Litex Road (road bound to Payatas). Proceed along this road and travel for about 1.5 km. until reaching Payatas bridge. The station is located NW of the bridge. It is on the NE end along the footway. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.70773409, '14° 42\' 27.842710\"', 121.08984840, '121° 5\' 23.454260\"', 0.0000, '0', 98.3780, 0.0000, '3', 54.1006, 294334.74940, 1626871.13400, '51', 14.70924407, '14° 42\' 33.278640\"', 121.08849170, '121° 5\' 18.570050\"', 54.9341, 1626638.74500, 509529.71500, '3', 294187.30600, 1626939.49100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11578, 'MMA-90 (BS-1)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BAGONG SILANGAN', 1902, 14.69751060, '14° 41\' 51.038160\"', 121.11167560, '121° 6\' 42.032020\"', 'MMA-90 (BS01) From Bagong Silangan Brgy. Hall, proceed along Gen. Geronimo St. reaching Humanity Village. Turn right (road at the back of barangay hall) and left at Saturn St. The station is located at the SE end corner of basketball court on the said st. It is approximately 3 m W of perimeter fence of Humanity Village. Station mark is the head of hexagonal stainless bolt drilled on the location of the station.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.69751060, '14° 41\' 51.038160\"', 121.11167560, '121° 6\' 42.032020\"', 0.0000, '0', 59.7730, 0.0000, '3', 15.2871, 296676.15490, 1625720.06900, '51', 14.69901944, '14° 41\' 56.469980\"', 121.11031860, '121° 6\' 37.147020\"', 16.2466, 1625508.58700, 511880.82400, '3', 296528.69600, 1625788.34700, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11579, 'MMA-91 (AM-01)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - THIRD DISTRICT', 'CITY OF CALOOCAN', 'BARANGAY 183', 1902, 14.75558884, '14° 45\' 20.119840\"', 121.08500850, '121° 5\' 6.030690\"', 'MMA-91 (AM-01) Station is located 10 m S 50° E from the southern post of the welcome arc of the main entrance of Guadanoville. It is 6m S 60° W from a streetboard/sign of Guadanoville. It is also S 5° E of the Iglesia ni Cristo Church along Quirino Highway. The entrance of Guadanoville is 1.5 km S from the Holy Cross Parish. Station mark is the center of the head of a stainless steel bolt.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.75558884, '14° 45\' 20.119840\"', 121.08500850, '121° 5\' 6.030690\"', 0.0000, '0', 146.0670, 0.0000, '3', 101.8056, 293858.49520, 1632170.97100, '51', 14.75710188, '14° 45\' 25.566781\"', 121.08365290, '121° 5\' 1.150598\"', 102.7716, 1631933.28200, 509006.66200, '3', 293711.20800, 1632239.37300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11580, 'MMA-92 (BH-14)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'BATASAN HILLS', 1902, 14.67790313, '14° 40\' 40.451270\"', 121.08286360, '121° 4\' 58.308940\"', 'MMA-92 (BH-14) The station is approximately 4.3 kms. along Commonwealth Ave. from the Elliptical Road. The triangular island is located SE of a Petron Service Station, SW of Ever Gotesco Mall-Commonwealth and NE of a BPI Bank. It is also N of the Batasan Hills Police Station (CPD)-Community Precint 5. The bolt is 1 m SE from the western vertex of the triangle and about 10 mm from the southwestern edge. Station mark is the center of the head of a stainless steel bolt drilled to the pavement of a triangular road island at the intersection of Don Antonio Road with Commonwealth Ave.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.67790313, '14° 40\' 40.451270\"', 121.08286360, '121° 4\' 58.308940\"', 0.0000, '0', 118.9910, 0.0000, '3', 74.7997, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.67941122, '14° 40\' 45.880374\"', 121.08150620, '121° 4\' 53.422194\"', 75.4788, 1623337.94600, 508778.63100, '3', 293406.87900, 1623644.88400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'Mara Odtohan', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11581, 'MMA-94', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'CULIAT', 2014, 14.66148982, '14° 39\' 41.363340\"', 121.04472350, '121° 2\' 41.004430\"', 'Station is approximately 850 m from the Eliptical Road trough Visayas Avenue. It is located at a bridge E of Visayas Ave. about 25 cm from the road. The road through the bridge connects to Commonwealth by passing through Iglesia ni Cristo at the N side of UP Asian Institute of Tourism. The bolt is drlled approximately at the midline or 0.5 m from the edges of the sidewalk of the bridge. Mark is the center of the head of a hexagonal bolt (stainless steel) placed at the southern side at the western foot of the bridge crossing the Culiat river.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.66148982, '14° 39\' 41.363340\"', 121.04472350, '121° 2\' 41.004430\"', 0.0000, '0', 84.3650, 0.0000, '2', 40.5647, 289430.24190, 1621795.47900, '51', 14.66299771, '14° 39\' 46.791743\"', 121.04336560, '121° 2\' 36.116061\"', 40.8987, 1621520.92300, 504671.04100, '3', 289282.60500, 1621863.92500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11582, 'MMA-96 (EF-1)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'COMMONWEALTH', 1902, 14.70503289, '14° 42\' 18.118420\"', 121.08177060, '121° 4\' 54.374040\"', 'MMA-96 (EF-01) The bolt is drilled at the concrete pavement of the road island at the intersection of Doña Carmen and Commonwealth Avenue. The intersection is approximately 7.6 km from the Elliptical Road or the Quezon Memorial Circle. The mark is about 1 m W of the tip of the western island of the intersection. It is 5 m E of a steel lamp and N 50° E of the Fairview Market. It is located E of the pedestrian crossing. Station mark is the center of the head of a stainless steel bolt.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.70503289, '14° 42\' 18.118420\"', 121.08177060, '121° 4\' 54.374040\"', 0.0000, '0', 111.8810, 0.0000, '3', 67.6848, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.70654276, '14° 42\' 23.553920\"', 121.08041380, '121° 4\' 49.489598\"', 68.4489, 1626339.56200, 508659.90700, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'admin', '1999-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11583, 'MMA-98', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'NORTH FAIRVIEW', 2014, 14.71079366, '14° 42\' 38.857180\"', 121.06087310, '121° 3\' 39.143070\"', 'The station is located at the road island immediately offer (NW) of the intersection of commonwealth and Regalado Avenues. It is drilled to an old concrete pavement. The mark is 20 m. NW from the southern end of the island and 0.80 m. SW from the northern edge of the island Mark is the center of a hexagonal stainless steel bolt drilled to a concrete pavement at the road island along Commonwealth Avenue.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.71079366, '14° 42\' 38.857180\"', 121.06087310, '121° 3\' 39.143070\"', 0.0000, '0', 95.8710, 0.0000, '3', 51.8823, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.71230437, '14° 42\' 44.295717\"', 121.05951640, '121° 3\' 34.258997\"', 52.5062, 1626976.29500, 506409.26000, '3', 291069.40200, 1627304.76400, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'JHO', '2017-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11584, 'MMA-98 (NF-1)', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'NORTH FAIRVIEW', 1902, 14.71079366, '14° 42\' 38.857180\"', 121.06087310, '121° 3\' 39.143070\"', 'MMA-98 (NF-01) The station is located at the road island immediately offer (NW) of the intersection of Commonwealth and Regalado Avenues. It is drilled to an old concrete pavement. The marks is 20 m NW from the southern end of the island and 0.80 m SW from the northern edge of the island. Mark is the center of a hexagonal stainless steel bolt drilled to a concrete pavement at the road island along Commonwealth Avenue. ELEVATION : 49.4420 m.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.71079366, '14° 42\' 38.857180\"', 121.06087310, '121° 3\' 39.143070\"', 0.0000, '0', 95.8710, 0.0000, '3', 51.8823, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 14.71230437, '14° 42\' 44.295717\"', 121.05951640, '121° 3\' 34.258997\"', 52.5062, 1626976.29500, 506409.26000, '3', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'admin', '1999-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11585, 'MMA-99', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'QUEZON CITY', 'NORTH FAIRVIEW', 1902, 14.72153523, '14° 43\' 17.526830\"', 121.05221700, '121° 3\' 7.981130\"', 'MMA-99 (NF-02) Station is located at the Northwestern sidewalk of Mindanao Ave. It is 6 m NE from the intersection or junction of the sidewalks of Commonwealth and Mindanao Avenues. It is 0.50 m NW from the edge of the road gutter. The mark is also 255 (S 75° W) from a transmission tower located at the eastern side of the intersection. Station mark is the center of a hexagonal stainless steel bolt drilled at the pavement of the sidewalk along Mindanao Avenue.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.72153523, '14° 43\' 17.526830\"', 121.05221700, '121° 3\' 7.981130\"', 0.0000, '0', 98.4710, 0.0000, '3', 54.5646, 290294.82560, 1628432.99500, '51', 14.72304682, '14° 43\' 22.968551\"', 121.05086050, '121° 3\' 3.097927\"', 55.1581, 1628164.55000, 505476.85200, '3', 290147.39500, 1628501.47300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1903-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11586, 'PIER-8', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - MANILA, FIRST DISTRICT', 'TONDO I/II', 'BARANGAY 39', 1900, 14.60612098, '14° 36\' 22.035510\"', 120.95816230, '120° 57\' 29.384250\"', 'PIER-8 Station is in the vicinity of Manila Harbor, inside Pier No.8 and about 170 meters behind Solid Shipping lines Building. The station is about 54.76 meters from the north side, 23.12 meters from the west end, and about 22.20 meters from the south side of the pier. Mark is the center of a 5 mm dia. drilled hole centered on a 8\" x 8\" square concrete monument set flushed on the concrete pier with inscription thus \"PIER-8,00,NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.60612098, '14° 36\' 22.035510\"', 120.95816230, '120° 57\' 29.384250\"', 0.0000, '0', 47.2180, 0.0000, '3', 4.2914, 280049.62300, 1615750.58300, '51', 14.60762736, '14° 36\' 27.458510\"', 120.95680300, '120° 57\' 24.490650\"', 3.8050, 1615395.09700, 495345.94400, '3', 279901.72200, 1615819.27200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1900-01-01', 'mara', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11587, 'RZL-4438', 'LUZON', 'NCR', 'NCR - SECOND DISTRICT', 'CITY OF PASIG', 'MAYBUNGA', 2014, 14.57576776, '14° 34\' 32.763930\"', 121.09904350, '121° 5\' 56.556600\"', 'RZL-4438 From Eulogio Rodriguez Jr. Avenue (C-5 Road) going to Taguig City, turn left to Ortigas Avenue. Travel for about 1.5 km E direction along Ortigas Ave., then turn right and travel 1.6 km SE direction along E. Bank Road, then turn right at Javier Bridge and continue to travel 300 meters SW direction to reach Brgy. May Bunga, Pasig City where the station is established. The station is located at Brgy. May Bunga, Pasig City, along the left top sidewalk F. Legaspi Road going to Rosario, Pasig. Located for about 30 meters E of a police station and between 2 steel post. Mark is the center of a brass rod with cross-cut on top set flush on the center of a 20x20 centimeter cement putty with inscriptions \"RZL-4438,2010, DENR IV-A\"', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 14.57576776, '14° 34\' 32.763930\"', 121.09904350, '121° 5\' 56.556600\"', 0.0000, '0', 55.1560, 0.0000, '4', 10.8550, 295202.58940, 1612260.10400, '51', 14.57726901, '14° 34\' 38.168440\"', 121.09768370, '121° 5\' 51.661180\"', 11.3130, 1612038.27800, 510525.89800, '3', 295054.71600, 1612328.30800, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2025-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11588, 'NGW-1', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF CADIZ', 'BARANGAY 6 POB.', 1989, 10.95571506, '10° 57\' 20.574220\"', 123.31283050, '123° 18\' 46.189630\"', 'NGW-1 From Bacolod City, travel N along the national highway towards Cadiz City for 61.3 km. up to Cadiz crossing. Then turn left and travel for 2.8 km. up to Cadiz City proper. Upon reaching the city proper of Cadiz, from the city hall, travel along Cabahug St. for 300 m. and turn left on Arellano St. or travel up to the Local Water District compound. The station is located on top of the 24.1 m. high and 6 m. dia. water tank, inside the compound of Cadiz City Water District. Station mark is a cross cut on top of a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod, set in a drill hole, centered on a cement patty on top center of a water tank; 0.01 m. above surface and inscribed with station name. Sub-surface mark; none. Reference mark; none. Reported Lost by Reuel Pintor June 15 2010', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.95571506, '10° 57\' 20.574220\"', 123.31283050, '123° 18\' 46.189630\"', 0.0000, '0', 87.3572, 0.0000, '1', 26.1597, 534180.05050, 1211100.56800, '51', 10.95692060, '10° 57\' 24.914170\"', 123.31138740, '123° 18\' 40.994510\"', 28.5790, 1211582.01700, 534034.56700, '4', 534022.65400, 1211157.94200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'ysn', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11589, 'NGW-100', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF HIMAMAYLAN', 'NABALI-AN', 2007, 10.16232678, '10° 9\' 44.376390\"', 122.87375550, '122° 52\' 25.519930\"', 'NGW-100 From Bacolod-Kabankalan road turn left leading to Barangay Bambanan. It is about 1.2 kms. from the junction. The station is located on the SW tip of the headwall. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete headwall with inscriptions \"NGW-100; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.16232678, '10° 9\' 44.376390\"', 122.87375550, '122° 52\' 25.519930\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.6570, 0.0000, '2', 2.7435, 486171.08540, 1123362.68700, '51', 10.16348697, '10° 9\' 48.553090\"', 122.87229210, '122° 52\' 20.251400\"', 5.1050, 1123813.89700, 486005.75800, '4', 486010.65600, 1123420.54200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aries Zafra', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11590, 'NGW-101', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF HIMAMAYLAN', 'CARABALAN', 2007, 10.10358384, '10° 6\' 12.901830\"', 122.90324750, '122° 54\' 11.691130\"', 'NGW-101 The station is located on the NW corner of the bridge. The station is made level with the sidewalk. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete pavement of the bridge windwall with inscriptions \"NGW-101; 2007; NAMRIA\". From Kabankalan-Bacolod road turn right leading to Barangay Carabalan.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.10358384, '10° 6\' 12.901830\"', 122.90324750, '122° 54\' 11.691130\"', 0.0000, '0', 82.0950, 0.0000, '2', 19.7282, 489399.73530, 1116866.69100, '51', 10.10473916, '10° 6\' 17.060970\"', 122.90178270, '122° 54\' 6.417600\"', 22.3360, 1117315.46400, 489235.38400, '4', 489239.15200, 1116924.38500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
