(11621, 'NGW-134', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF KABANKALAN', 'PINAGUINPINAN', 2007, 9.77275550, '9° 46\' 21.919810\"', 122.85070170, '122° 51\' 2.526180\"', 'NGW-134 It is located in the Province of Negros Occidental, City of Kabankalan, Barangay Pinaguinpinan along the barangay road. The station is a concrete monument located on the top of the ground, beside the basketball court and 18 m from the stage. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 25 cm x 25 cm protruding 25 cm above the ground with inscriptions \"NGW-134; 2007; NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 9.77275550, '9° 46\' 21.919810\"', 122.85070170, '122° 51\' 2.526180\"', 0.0000, '0', 228.8220, 0.0000, '2', 165.3279, 483626.32050, 1080291.33000, '51', 9.77388856, '9° 46\' 25.998820\"', 122.84922860, '122° 50\' 57.222940\"', 168.4480, 1080727.07300, 483458.83000, '4', 483464.62000, 1080348.80000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Dexter Alamar', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11622, 'NGW-14', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF BACOLOD', 'TANGUB', 1993, 10.62327896, '10° 37\' 23.804250\"', 122.92877300, '122° 55\' 43.582720\"', 'NGW-14 (BM NC-7) From Bacolod city plaza travel south along the Araneta St. for about 5.5 km. The station is on top center of SW end post, 1.0 m. above the ground of the bridge 40 m. N of Km. Post 7. Mark is a PC&GS standard brass rod embedded and set flush with top of end post of the bridge, unstamped.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.62327896, '10° 37\' 23.804250\"', 122.92877300, '122° 55\' 43.582720\"', 0.0000, '0', 66.7160, 0.0000, '3', 6.0137, 492209.17130, 1174326.61400, '51', 10.62447041, '10° 37\' 28.093470\"', 122.92732100, '122° 55\' 38.355430\"', 8.0960, 1174796.03000, 492047.49900, '4', 492050.28300, 1174384.83100, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1993-01-01', 'TIM', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11623, 'NGW-18', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF BAGO', 'POBLACION', 1993, 10.53750618, '10° 32\' 15.022230\"', 122.83594680, '122° 50\' 9.408370\"', 'NGW-18 Station is in the province of Negros Occidental, city of Bago, at the town proper in front of General Araneta monument. Station mark is a 4\" copper nail at the base of monument. No inscription. Note: Station is intervisible with NGW-17.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.53750618, '10° 32\' 15.022230\"', 122.83594680, '122° 50\' 9.408370\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.5746, 0.0000, '3', 3.8559, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 10.53869378, '10° 32\' 19.297610\"', 122.83449240, '122° 50\' 4.172790\"', 5.9830, 1165313.02900, 481885.20400, '4', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1993-01-01', 'admin', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11624, 'NGW-2 (SILAY)', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF SILAY', 'BARANGAY I', 1989, 10.80227976, '10° 48\' 8.207150\"', 122.97601140, '122° 58\' 33.640990\"', 'NGW-2 (SILAY 1950) From Bacolod Provincial Capitol Building travel N towards Silay City for 14.6 km. Upon reaching the city proper travel for 100m, then turn right and travel for another 100m. Turn right again and travel for 50m up to the water tank inside the compound of Silay Water District. The station is located on top of a 24.23m high water tank, 200m W of Silay Public Market and 150m NW of Silay Municipal Bldg. and Silay Church.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.80227976, '10° 48\' 8.207150\"', 122.97601140, '122° 58\' 33.640990\"', 0.0000, '0', 90.1837, 0.0000, '1', 30.0577, 497377.66060, 1194117.65800, '51', 10.80348260, '10° 48\' 12.537370\"', 122.97456390, '122° 58\' 28.429860\"', 31.8700, 1194594.05200, 497218.42500, '4', 497219.39900, 1194175.92300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11625, 'NGW-24', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'MURCIA', 'BLUMENTRITT', 1993, 10.61893740, '10° 37\' 8.174630\"', 123.01985350, '123° 1\' 11.472630\"', 'NGW-24 To reach the station, from Bacolod provincial capitol building travel south along Lacson St. for about 1.5 km. left at Libertad St. and travel for about 4.5 kms. up to the Bacolod-Murcia road intersection; turn left again and travel east for about 6 km. The station is located on top a stone and cement culvert 7.0 m. N of the centerline of the road and about 200 m. E of 1st Negros Occidental Highway Engineering District marker. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set on a drilled hole and flushed to a cement putty. Inscription reads \"NGW-24, 1993, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.61893740, '10° 37\' 8.174630\"', 123.01985350, '123° 1\' 11.472630\"', 0.0000, '0', 150.8448, 0.0000, '3', 89.6131, 502171.61170, 1173845.75400, '51', 10.62012629, '10° 37\' 12.454660\"', 123.01840160, '123° 1\' 6.245630\"', 91.9900, 1174314.70100, 502013.51700, '4', 502012.81200, 1173903.67000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1993-01-01', 'TIM', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11626, 'NGW-29', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF SIPALAY', 'NABULAO', 1996, 9.67698618, '9° 40\' 37.150250\"', 122.53410030, '122° 32\' 2.760910\"', 'NGW-29 Station is located inside the Bulawan Philex Mine Site at Sitio Vista Alegre, Brgy. Nabulao, Sipalay, Negros Occidental. It is 3.94 meters SSE of the E corner of tennis court which is adjacent to the basketball court and lies near the keymen\'s building where employees are housed. Situated about 14 meters N of the N corner of the mine site\'s clubhouse. From Sipalay town proper travel along the municipal road in the direction of Bacolod City. At the first junction take the road leading to Hinobaan and travel foe about 17 km. up to the intersection which is properly known as South Bend at Brgy. Talacagay. From this bend turn left and head towards Philex Mine site for about 16 km. Mark is the top center of a 20 mm. dia. corrugated iron bar protruding 1 in. from a 6 in. dia. cylindrical monument 5 in. in height which was built on a 0.5 m. x 0.5 m. concrete base. No inscription as of the date of observation, July 1996.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 9.67698618, '9° 40\' 37.150250\"', 122.53410030, '122° 32\' 2.760910\"', 0.0000, '0', 374.8308, 0.0000, '3', 312.6714, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 9.67812004, '9° 40\' 41.232140\"', 122.53262420, '122° 31\' 57.447120\"', 315.0270, 1070167.15000, 448709.00000, '4', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'Joana Marie T. Panes', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11627, 'NGW-3', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF KABANKALAN', 'BARANGAY 5', 1989, 9.98921974, '9° 59\' 21.191050\"', 122.81477480, '122° 48\' 53.189400\"', 'NGW-3 From Bacolod City, travel south towards Kabankalan town proper for 98.7 km. or 1.5 hours drive. Upon reaching the town proper of Kabankalan, proceed to Kabankalan church, which is 200 meters southeast of Kabankalan municipal building; northeast of the town plaza and northwest of the Kabankalan Central School. The station is located on top of the southeast church bell tower, 13.64 meters high. Station mark is cross cut on top of a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. diameter brass rod set on a drill hole, centered on a .30 m x .30 m. cement patty on top of the southeast church bell tower of Kabankalan church. Sub-surface mark; none. Reference mark; none.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 9.98921974, '9° 59\' 21.191050\"', 122.81477480, '122° 48\' 53.189400\"', 0.0000, '0', 84.0383, 0.0000, '1', 21.4814, 479699.45150, 1104226.28000, '51', 9.99036908, '9° 59\' 25.328700\"', 122.81330700, '122° 48\' 47.905080\"', 24.2390, 1104670.77400, 479531.23600, '4', 479538.40000, 1104284.12000, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11628, 'NGW-3001', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF CADIZ', 'BARANGAY 3 POB.', 2007, 10.95663235, '10° 57\' 23.876460\"', 123.31002490, '123° 18\' 36.089680\"', 'NGW-3001 Station is located at the intersection of Cabahug St. and Villa Beach St., NW of Cadiz East Elem. School, and NE of Seaoil gasoline station. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled at the center of a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty embedded on top of the concrete gutter with inscriptions, \"NGW-3001, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.95663235, '10° 57\' 23.876460\"', 123.31002490, '123° 18\' 36.089680\"', 0.0000, '0', 63.8430, 0.0000, '4', 2.6509, 533873.40810, 1211201.67700, '51', 10.95783803, '10° 57\' 28.216910\"', 123.30858180, '123° 18\' 30.894610\"', 5.0740, 1211683.17300, 533727.81600, '4', 533716.01000, 1211259.06300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Christian Samin', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11629, 'NGW-3002', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF CADIZ', 'SICABA', 2007, 10.99004973, '10° 59\' 24.179030\"', 123.22760910, '123° 13\' 39.392720\"', 'NGW-3002 From Cadiz City proper travel NW then turn right to Brgy. Burgos passing Cadiz Viejo, the station is about 18.9 Km. from Cadiz City proper. Station is located 16 m NW of the NE corner of cemetery concrete fence. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail at the center of a 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm concrete monument casted on the road shoulder with inscriptions, \"NGW-3002, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.99004973, '10° 59\' 24.179030\"', 123.22760910, '123° 13\' 39.392720\"', 0.0000, '0', 70.7040, 0.0000, '4', 9.7494, 524865.78610, 1214888.64300, '51', 10.99125973, '10° 59\' 28.535010\"', 123.22616670, '123° 13\' 34.199940\"', 12.2180, 1215371.72800, 524717.05500, '4', 524708.40400, 1214946.32600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Dexter Alamar', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11630, 'NGW-3003', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF CADIZ', 'SICABA', 2007, 10.98842870, '10° 59\' 18.343330\"', 123.22452020, '123° 13\' 28.272790\"', 'NGW-3003 Station is about 18.5 Km. from City Hall of Cadiz. Station is located on the SW end of the headwall. It is about 14 m NE of Gemilina tree, 23 m SE of Eucalyptus tree and 7 m S of Camatchile tree. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled at the center of 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty embedded on top of the RCPC headwall with inscriptions, \"NGW-3003, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.98842870, '10° 59\' 18.343330\"', 123.22452020, '123° 13\' 28.272790\"', 0.0000, '0', 64.8970, 0.0000, '4', 3.9490, 524528.46620, 1214709.15100, '51', 10.98963866, '10° 59\' 22.699170\"', 123.22307770, '123° 13\' 23.079840\"', 6.4150, 1215192.18000, 524379.60800, '4', 524371.07500, 1214766.84200, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Jay Cepe', '2019-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11631, 'NGW-3004', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'MANAPLA', 'CHAMBERY', 2007, 10.96752379, '10° 58\' 3.085640\"', 123.16976560, '123° 10\' 11.156330\"', 'NGW-3004 Station is located on the side of the road going to brgy. proper, it is at the SE of Coconut tree. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail flushed at the center of a 20 cm x 20 cm x 100 cm cement block casted on the ground with inscriptions, \"NGW-3004, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.96752379, '10° 58\' 3.085640\"', 123.16976560, '123° 10\' 11.156330\"', 0.0000, '0', 69.4520, 0.0000, '4', 8.6426, 518547.90420, 1212393.75500, '51', 10.96873359, '10° 58\' 7.440920\"', 123.16832250, '123° 10\' 5.961140\"', 11.0547, 1212876.12300, 518396.82500, '4', 518390.38600, 1212451.59500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2024-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(11632, 'NGW-3005', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'MANAPLA', 'CHAMBERY', 2007, 10.96397694, '10° 57\' 50.316980\"', 123.17029260, '123° 10\' 13.053500\"', 'NGW-3005 STA. MARK: Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 20x20x100 cm cement blocked casted on the ground with inscriptions \"NGW-3005,2007,NAMRIA\". ACCESS: The station is located at Brgy. Chambery, Municipality of Manapla, Province of Negros Occidental. Situated at the soutwest side of the barangay road, northeast of canal and northwest of RCPC headwall', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.96397694, '10° 57\' 50.316980\"', 123.17029260, '123° 10\' 13.053500\"', 0.0000, '0', 68.7530, 0.0000, '4', 7.9385, 518605.70300, 1212001.61000, '51', 10.96518648, '10° 57\' 54.671320\"', 123.16884940, '123° 10\' 7.858000\"', 10.3459, 1212483.83500, 518454.63300, '4', 518448.17400, 1212059.44500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '2008-01-01', 'jay Cepe', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
