(11707, 'NGW-31', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'HINOBA-AN', 'CULIPAPA', 1996, 9.47232761, '9° 28\' 20.379380\"', 122.56108120, '122° 33\' 39.892220\"', 'NGW-31 Station is located inside the compound of Culipapa Elementary School at Brgy. Culipapa, Hinoba-an, Negros Occidental. On the top of the school\'s concrete water tank about 5 meters in height and is SW of the nearby catholic church and NW of Brgy. hall. From Hinoba-an Municipal Hall travel south in the direction of Basay Town for about 17 km. Upon reaching the bridge at Brgy. Culipapa turn right at the first junction and head towards the school which is about 175 meters. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set flush and centered on a cement putty with inscription \"NGW-31, NAMRIA, 1996\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 9.47232761, '9° 28\' 20.379380\"', 122.56108120, '122° 33\' 39.892220\"', 0.0000, '0', 70.1367, 0.0000, '3', 9.0289, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 9.47344635, '9° 28\' 24.406860\"', 122.55960000, '122° 33\' 34.560010\"', 9.8158, 1047527.14500, 451640.50600, '4', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1996-01-01', 'admin', '2012-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
