(11728, 'NGW-3131', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'PONTEVEDRA', 'DON SALVADOR BENEDICTO', 2007, 10.37925078, '10° 22\' 45.302800\"', 122.93664890, '122° 56\' 11.936150\"', 'NGW-3131 Station is located on the left side of the Pontevedra-La Castellana Highway and about 12.1 Km. from La Castellana City proper. Station is 400 m E of Km. post 52, 7.5 m nE of mark with nail on riprap, R1, 6 m SW of mark with nail on riprap R2 and 9 m NE of mark with nail on riprap R3. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of a 20 cm x 20 cm cement putty embedded on NW of headwall (RCPC) with inscriptions, \"NGW-3131, 2007, NAMRIA\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.37925078, '10° 22\' 45.302800\"', 122.93664890, '122° 56\' 11.936150\"', 0.0000, '0', 87.8680, 0.0000, '4', 26.2661, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 10.38042479, '10° 22\' 49.529250\"', 122.93519090, '122° 56\' 6.687290\"', 28.6600, 1147804.62400, 492903.06100, '4', 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Christian Samin', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
