(12058, 'NGW-49', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF VICTORIAS', 'BARANGAY XIV', 2007, 10.87734926, '10° 52\' 38.457320\"', 123.11877420, '123° 7\' 7.587030\"', 'NGW-49 The station is located on the middle NW side of the concrete basketball court. The station is west of Brgy. Capt. Fudillo\'s house. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at the center of a 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete flooring of the court with inscriptions \"NGW-49; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is about 5.1 km from Victoria\'s City proper.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.87734926, '10° 52\' 38.457320\"', 123.11877420, '123° 7\' 7.587030\"', 0.0000, '0', 121.3220, 0.0000, '2', 60.5402, 0.00000, 0.00000, '0', 10.87855394, '10° 52\' 42.794200\"', 123.11732880, '123° 7\' 2.383550\"', 62.8350, 1202899.41100, 512827.31800, '4', 512822.82800, 1202478.37500, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2016-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
(12059, 'NGW-5', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CALATRAVA', 'LO-OK', 1989, 10.58889150, '10° 35\' 20.009390\"', 123.48365840, '123° 29\' 1.170060\"', 'NGW-5 Station can be reached from Bacolod City to Calatrava for 130.01 km., about 2.5 hrs. travel passing through the towns of Talisay, Enriquez, Victorias, Manapala, Aboso and Brgys. Tigbao and Lemery. Upon reaching the town proper of Calatrava, from the municipal building, travel S for 100 m., then turn left and travel for another 450 m. up to the shoreline. It is located on top of the concrete gutter of the jetty; approx. 200 m. S of its approach (in land). Accessible by 2-wheel drive vehicle up to the station. Mark is a cross cut on top of a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rod set in a drill hole centered on a cement patty on top of a 0.20 m. x 0.30 m. concrete gutter of the pier. Inscribed with station name and number. Sub-surface mark; none. Reference marks (RM); RM\'s 1, 2 and 3 are cross cuts on top of a 0.15 m. x 0.01 m. dia. brass rods set in drill holes, centered on cement patties on top of the concrete gutter.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.58889150, '10° 35\' 20.009390\"', 123.48365840, '123° 29\' 1.170060\"', 0.0000, '0', 63.4576, 0.0000, '2', 2.0303, 552909.15050, 1170564.61700, '51', 10.59006714, '10° 35\' 24.241690\"', 123.48220660, '123° 28\' 55.943850\"', 3.3880, 1171030.91800, 552769.24700, '4', 552750.77700, 1170621.03600, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1991-01-01', 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
