(12120, 'NGW-67 (SCC-2)', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF SAN CARLOS', 'PALAMPAS', 2007, 10.50721960, '10° 30\' 25.990550\"', 123.42636040, '123° 25\' 34.897570\"', 'NGW-67 Station is located at the NW end of Vascoña Bridge at KM 141 + 882 of C.L. Ledesma Sr. Avenue(National Highway) and is about 850 meters SE of San Carlos Bio Energy Incorporated. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail drilled and grouted at the center of existing cement putty embedded on top of the concrete side with inscriptions\"PRS-92; SCC-2\".', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.50721960, '10° 30\' 25.990550\"', 123.42636040, '123° 25\' 34.897570\"', 0.0000, '0', 67.1670, 0.0000, '2', 5.4743, 546653.30860, 1161524.99800, '51', 10.50839085, '10° 30\' 30.207050\"', 123.42490660, '123° 25\' 29.663700\"', 7.0470, 1161988.22000, 546510.89000, '4', 546494.61000, 1161581.50300, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
