(12131, 'NGW-81', 'VISAYAS', 'NIR', 'NEGROS OCCIDENTAL', 'CITY OF BAGO', 'MA-AO BARRIO', 2007, 10.47410179, '10° 28\' 26.766440\"', 123.01957110, '123° 1\' 10.455780\"', 'NGW-81 From Ma-ao barangay proper, travel about 4 kilometers to the station on the road heading to PNOC Power Plant site and to Buenas Aires Resort at Bgy. Ilijan. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail flushed at center of 30 x 30 cm. cement putty embedded on the concrete headwall with inscriptions \"NGW-81; 2007; NAMRIA\". The station is on top of the headwall inside the Bago/Ma-ao resettlement site, east of Luisiana Elementary School.', 2007, 'PRS92 Densification', 0.00, 10.47410179, '10° 28\' 26.766440\"', 123.01957110, '123° 1\' 10.455780\"', 0.0000, '0', 175.0700, 0.0000, '2', 0.0000, 502141.71710, 1157831.67800, '51', 10.47528048, '10° 28\' 31.009740\"', 123.01811560, '123° 1\' 5.215980\"', 115.8774, 1158294.85200, 501983.14800, '4', 501982.45400, 1157889.42900, '51', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.00000000, '0° 0\' 0.000000\"', 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, '1999-01-01', 'TIM', '2023-01-01 00:00:00', ''),
