(309, 'IL-305', 117.675300, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.000000, '', '2nd Order', 1995, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2022-02-09 08:26:14', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'SAN RAFAEL', 'POBLACION', 1995, 11.17928100, '11° 10\' 45.411600\"', 122.82929800, '122° 49\' 45.472800\"', 'IL-305 is in the island of Panay, province of Iloilo, municipality of San Rafael, at the town proper. Located inside the compound of San Rafael High School in the base of the school\'s flagpole, about 0.50 m W of the flagpole. Mark is the head of a 4-inch copper nail cemented flush on the concrete base with inscription \"IL-305,1995 NAMRIA\".', 2016),
(310, 'IL-326', 50.336300, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.000000, '', '1st Order', 2007, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2022-02-09 08:28:06', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'CABATUAN', 'BANGUIT', 2007, 10.86980700, '10° 52\' 11.305200\"', 122.49342500, '122° 29\' 36.330000\"', 'BM IL-326 From Iloilo City travel NW for about 22 km to Brgy. Banguit municipality of Cabatuan. The station is located on the concrete base of the Street light, 8 m NE of the road centerline. The street light is beside the driveway leading to the house with a green wall, 20 m NW of a native furniture shop, 25 m NW of a scrap shop, 200 m SE of Cabatuan Public cemetery.', 2016),
(311, 'IL-548', 5.826100, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.052222, '5-Centimeter', '1st Order', 2008, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Melchor Degollado Jr', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'ZARRAGA', 'ILAYA POBLACION ', 2008, 10.82902778, '10° 49\' 44.500000\"', 122.60911111, '122° 36\' 32.800000\"', 'Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set flushed & centered on a cement putty 15 x 15 cm with inscriptions BM IL-548 2008 NAMRIA BM IL-548 is in the Province of Iloilo,Municipality of Zarraga,Brgy Poblacion Ilaya along Iloilo-Roxas National road.the station is located atop the headwall of a box culvert ,on the right side of the road going to Roxas and about 205 meters from KM Post 42.it is also 15 meters from the junction of Zarraga-Cabilauan road.', 2016),
(312, 'IL-554', 17.801100, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.048401, '5-Centimeter', '1st Order', 2008, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Melchor Degollado Jr', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'POTOTAN', 'DAWIS', 2008, 10.87958333, '10° 52\' 46.500000\"', 122.61125000, '122° 36\' 40.500000\"', 'Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flushed & centered on a cement putty 16 x 16 cm with inscriptions BM IL-554 2008 NAMRIA. BM IL-554 is located on top of the east wing of RCPC headwall, 4.o meter east of road centerline leading to the province of Capiz 100 meters north of Dawis crossing and about 200 meters south from KM Post 22.', 2016),
(313, 'IL-569', 32.530100, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.036869, '5-Centimeter', '1st Order', 2008, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Melchor Degollado Jr', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'DINGLE', 'TABUGON', 2008, 11.02075000, '11° 1\' 14.700000\"', 122.63313889, '122° 37\' 59.300000\"', 'Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set flushed & centered on a cement putty 0.16 x 0.16 m. with inscriptions \"BM IL-569; 2008; NAMRIA\". BM IL-569 is located on the approach of a Center Island of a junction road leading to Dingle Town Proper, 5.0 m. East of road centerline leading to the Province of Capiz and about 100 m. SW from Panay Diesel Power Plant.', 2016),
(314, 'IL-572', 31.894000, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.000000, '', '1st Order', 2008, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2022-02-09 08:57:47', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'DINGLE', 'TINOCUAN', 2008, 11.04758333, '11° 2\' 51.300000\"', 122.62069444, '122° 37\' 14.499999\"', 'BM IL-572 Is located on top of a concrete block of Ulian Bridge approach 1.0 m. South from the SE pedestal of bridge railing and 3.5 m. east of road centerline leading to the Province of Capiz.Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set flshed & centered on a cement putty 0.16 x 0.16 m. with inscription \"BM IL-572 2008 NAMRIA.', 2016),
(315, 'IL-697', 56.733900, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.011441, '1-Centimeter', '1st Order', 2013, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Melchor Degollado Jr', '2019-09-09 13:02:28', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'CALINOG', 'CABAGIAO', 2013, 11.13030556, '11° 7\' 49.100000\"', 122.55352778, '122° 33\' 12.700000\"', 'BM-IL-697 is in the Province of Iloilo, Municipality of Calinog, Brgy. Cabagiao along Passi-Calinog National road. The station is located on top of a sidewalk of Baje Bridge 4 meters from the road centerline and 30 meters from the welcome monument .It is also 32 meters from thge waiting shed. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set flush on 15 cm. x 15 cm cement putty with inscriptions \"IL-697, 2013, NAMRIA\".', 2016);
