(316, 'IL-698', 73.694700, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.013630, '1-Centimeter', '1st Order', 2013, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Aila Leana Sampana', '2022-02-09 09:10:30', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'CALINOG', 'CABAGIAO', 2013, 11.13527778, '11° 8\' 7.000000\"', 122.55833333, '122° 33\' 30.000000\"', 'BM-IL-698 is in the Province of Iloilo, Municipality of Calinog, Brgy. Cabagiao along provincial road. The station is located on top of the concrete foundation of Brgy San Nicolas welcome monument ,5 meters from the road centerline and 20 meters from Ruth Beloso residence.It is also 8 meters from the wooden electric post. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set flush on 15 cm. x 15 cm cement putty with inscriptions \"IL-698, 2013, NAMRIA\".', 2016),
