(319, 'IL-701 (ILO-3970)', 75.898000, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.007683, '1-Centimeter', '1st Order', 2011, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Aila Leana Sampana', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'CALINOG', 'CARVASANA', 2011, 11.11630556, '11° 6\' 58.700000\"', 122.52741667, '122° 31\' 38.700000\"', 'BM-IL-701 is in the Province of Iloilo, Municipality of Calinog, Brgy. Carvasana along the provincial road. The station is a concrete monument located on the ground,1.50 meters from Carvasana Elementary School and 5 meters from the road centerline .It is also 4 meters from the waiting shed,5 meters from Tanod Outpost and 7 meters from the junction leading to the Brgy Hall. Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail set flush on 20 cm. x 20 cm concrete monument buried deep and protruding 0.10 meters above the ground level with inscriptions \"ILO-3970, 2011, LMS-6\".', 2016),
