(546, 'ILO-38', 2.457100, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.020368, '1-Centimeter', '2nd Order', 1996, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Joel Panes Jr.', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'CITY OF ILOILO', 'VETERANS VILLAGE', 1996, 10.68700000, '10° 41\' 13.200000\"', 122.58000000, '122° 34\' 48.000000\"', 'Mark is the head of a 4 in. copper nail placed on top of the cement putty with inscription \"ILO-38, 1996, NAMRIA\" and set flushed on the concrete jetty which is 1m from the East edge and 11.5m from the South end of the jetty. Station is located in Port San Pedro, Iloilo City. It is situated at the end of San Pedro Jetty which is approximately 150m SE of Confecor Drive and 50m SSE from the statue of Jesus Christ located at the S corner of Port San Pedro Drive-in.', 2016),
(547, 'ILO-3953', 71.728500, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.000966, '1-Centimeter', '1st Order', 2011, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Melchor Degollado Jr', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'CALINOG', 'CABUGAO', 2011, 11.14377778, '11° 8\' 37.600000\"', 122.53311111, '122° 31\' 59.200000\"', 'ILO-3953 is in the Province of Iloilo,Municipality of Calinog,Brgy. along Tapaz-Calinog the National road.The station is a concrete Monument located on the ground beside 15 tons bridge limit road sign and 15.6 meters from IL-365. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flush on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete Monument buried deep and protruding 0.10 m above the ground level with inscriptions \"ILO-3953,2011,LMS-6\".', 2016),
