(552, 'ILO-4222', 9.592300, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.015896, '2-Centimeter', '1st Order', 2011, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Dexter Alamar', '2022-09-11 10:33:09', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'BALASAN', 'QUIASAN', 2011, 11.44886111, '11° 26\' 55.900000\"', 123.08711111, '123° 5\' 13.600000\"', 'ILO-4222 is in the Province of Iloilo,Municipality of Balasan,Brgy. Quiasan along the Brgy roads.The station is a concrete Monument located on the ground beside the concreted rice drier beside the Brgy road approximately 3 kilometers to Poblacion and 25 meters northwest from Nestor Maypa residence.It is also 40 meters southeast of the mini rice mill across the Brgy road. Mark is the head of 4\" copper nail set flush on a 20 cm x 20 cm concrete monument buried deep and protruding 0.20 meters above the ground with inscriptions \"ILO-4222,2011,LMS-6\".', 2016),
