(564, 'ILO-98', 5.584800, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.006528, '1-Centimeter', '1st Order', 2007, 'Differential Leveling', 2016, 'Melchor Degollado Jr', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'ILOILO', 'SAN DIONISIO', 'BAGACAY', 2007, 11.35180556, '11° 21\' 6.500000\"', 123.10533333, '123° 6\' 19.200000\"', 'ILO-98 is in the Province of Iloilo,Municipality of San Dionisio,Brgy Bagacay along Sara-Batad National road.The station is a concrete monument located on the ground ,on the left side of the road going to Batad beside the Irrigation Canal and about 45 meters from PLDT post.It is also 300 meters from the Bagacay Market. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set flush on a 30 cm x 30 cm concrete Monument Buried deep and protruding 0.20 m above the ground level with inscriptions ILO-98,2007 NAMRIA\".', 2016),
