(852, 'AK-56', 5.902480, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Caticlan Aklan Tide Station', '2008-2010', 0.058845, '1-Decimeter', '1st Order', 2014, 'Differential Leveling', 2017, 'Dexter Alamar', '2022-10-11 09:27:29', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'AKLAN', 'KALIBO', 'POBLACION', 1959, 11.70494444, '11° 42\' 17.800000\"', 122.36475000, '122° 21\' 53.100000\"', 'BM AK-56 Station is in the Poblacion of Kalibo and located on the Gen. Castillo monument which is situated on the street junction of El Provenir and La Generacion St. It is about 400 meters west of road junction of the National Highway No. 1 and the Provincial road. Mark is embedded in a hole drilled on the SE corner of the concrete foot step of the General Castillo monument. Mark is the top center of the brass rod with an inscription around the mark thus: PC&GS AK 56, 1959.', 2017),
