(854, 'AK-66', 6.616135, 'Mean Tide Level (MTL)', 'Iloilo', '1957-1959', 0.054942, '5-Centimeter', '1st Order', 1957, 'Differential Leveling', 2017, 'Dexter Alamar', '2022-10-11 09:28:05', '', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'AKLAN', 'MAKATO', 'POBLACION', 1958, 11.71083333, '11° 42\' 39.000000\"', 122.29422222, '122° 17\' 39.200000\"', 'BM AK-66 Station is in the Poblacion of Makato and located on the concrete bridge about 0.30 km. NE of the Town Hall. Mark is embedded in a hole drilled atop the SE end of the NE bridge railing. Mark is the top center of the brass rod with an inscription around the mark thus: PC&GS AK 66, 1958.', 2017),
