(1699, 'GS-67', 4.294800, 'Mean Sea Level (MSL)', 'Buenavista Guimaras Tide Station', '2021-2023', 0.041689, '5-Centimeter', '1st Order', 2008, 'Differential Leveling', 2023, 'Dexter Alamar', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'GUIMARAS LEVEL LINES > D:\\DESKTOP\\...\\STARNET\\2017\\GUIMARAS-FERDIE\\STARNET', 'VISAYAS', 'REGION VI', 'GUIMARAS', 'NUEVA VALENCIA', 'SAN ANTONIO', 2008, 10.45784444, '10° 27\' 28.240000\"', 122.57917222, '122° 34\' 45.020000\"', 'GS-67 is in the Island of Guimaras, Province of Guimara, Municipality of Nueva Valencia, Brgy. San Antonio sitio Budhian. Station is atop the south headwall of a box culvert at KM Post 71+696 along the San Lorenzo-Nueva valencia national highway. the Box culvert is also near Electric Post 1859. Mark is the head of a 4\" copper nail set flush on a 15cmx15cm cement putty with inscriptions \"BM-GS-67,2008, NAMRIA\".', 2023);
